rulings: ['[{\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': "If you have at least one of each of the three Urza\'s lands on the battlefield, you must take the 2 mana instead of just one."}]', "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Can target itself.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'If this card takes damage from multiple sources at once (for example if it is blocked by multiple creatures in combat), it only loses one counter.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'If unpreventable damage is applied to this card, you still remove a counter even though the prevention fails.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Remove one counter each time it would be damaged. If it was going to take more than one point of damage, you prevent all the damage and still only remove one counter.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'The damage prevention ability works even if it has no counters, as long as some effect keeps its toughness above zero.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'If you have more than one of these, each effect triggers separately.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'You do your normal draw before this ability is put on the stack.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'The +0/+3 bonus is added as a triggered ability upon the casting/activating of a spell or ability which targets this card.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'The ability triggers when it attacks or block and resolves before combat damage is assigned. This gives you a chance to possibly get rid of it before it hurts you.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'The player gets the option to pay when this triggered ability resolves. This will be after the spell is announced, but before it resolves.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'You don’t have to decide whether or not you are drawing until after the player decides whether or not to pay.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'This is a triggered mana ability.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'You can’t sacrifice more than one Goblin to get a greater effect.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'Players can only respond once Goblin Grenade has been cast and all its costs have been paid. No one can try and destroy the Goblin to prevent you from casting Goblin Grenade.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'The Goblin you sacrifice to cast Goblin Grenade doesn’t have to be a creature. For example, you could sacrifice Boggart Shenanigans (a tribal enchantment with the subtype Goblin).'}]", "[{'date': '2005-06-01', 'text': 'One permanent is sacrificed each time an opponent’s source deals damage to Michiko Konda’s controller. The amount of damage doesn’t matter.'}, {'date': '2005-06-01', 'text': 'Sources that deal damage multiple times (such as creatures with double strike) will trigger Michiko Konda multiple times.'}, {'date': '2005-06-01', 'text': 'Spells that deal damage repeatedly trigger Michiko Konda’s ability each time they deal damage. For example, a Glacial Ray spliced onto another Glacial Ray triggers the ability twice (once for each “2 damage” event from the Glacial Ray).'}]", "[{'date': '2006-02-01', 'text': 'It used to make Butterfly tokens. Now it makes Insect tokens named Butterfly.'}]", "[{'date': '2006-09-25', 'text': 'If you don’t actually sacrifice the Goblin (because it was removed from the battlefield before the ability resolved, for example), no damage is dealt.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2007-10-01\', \'text\': "For the ability to trigger, the creature has to actually change from untapped to tapped. If an effect attempts to tap the creature, but it was already tapped at the time, this ability won\'t trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2007-10-01\', \'text\': "This is a triggered ability, not an activated ability. It doesn\'t allow you to tap the creature whenever you want; rather, you need some other way of tapping it, such as by attacking with the creature."}]', "[{'date': '2007-10-01', 'text': 'If a creature loses all creature types but then gains a new creature type later in the turn, it will be that new creature type.'}]", "[{'date': '2007-10-01', 'text': 'The value of X needs to be determined both when the ability triggers (so you can choose a target) and again when the ability resolves (to check if that target is still legal). If the number of Faeries you control has decreased enough in that time to make the target illegal, Spellstutter Sprite’s ability won’t resolve (and the targeted spell will resolve as normal).'}]", "[{'date': '2008-04-01', 'text': 'Since the activated ability doesn’t have a tap symbol in its cost, you can tap creatures that haven’t been under your control since your most recent turn began to pay the cost.'}, {'date': '2008-04-01', 'text': 'The ability exile the enchanted creature, but Weight of Conscience remains on the battlefield. The Aura will then be put into your graveyard as a state-based action.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2008-05-01\', \'text\': "The creature\'s controller, not Presence of Gond\'s controller, is the one who can activate the ability, so that\'s the player who will get the token."}]', "[{'date': '2008-08-01', 'text': 'A noncreature permanent that turns into a creature can attack, and its {T} abilities can be activated, only if its controller has continuously controlled that permanent since the beginning of their most recent turn. It doesn’t matter how long the permanent has been a creature.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'Activating the ability that turns it into a creature while it’s already a creature will override any effects that set its power and/or toughness to a specific number. However, any effect that raises or lowers power and/or toughness (such as the effect created by Giant Growth, Glorious Anthem, or a +1/+1 counter) will continue to apply.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-08-01', 'text': 'If permanents you control become untapped during your untap step, Wake Thresher’s ability will trigger that many times. However, since no player gets priority during the untap step, those abilities wait to be put on the stack until your upkeep starts. At that time, all your “beginning of upkeep” triggers will also trigger. You can put them and Wake Thresher’s abilities on the stack in any order.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'Cycling is an activated ability. Effects that interact with activated abilities (such as Stifle or Rings of Brighthearth) will interact with cycling. Effects that interact with spells (such as Remove Soul or Faerie Tauntings) will not.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'If one of the cards is Dryad Arbor (a creature land card), you may reveal Dryad Arbor and another land card or Dryad Arbor and another creature card.'}, {'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'You may reveal a creature card, or you may reveal a land card, or you may reveal both a creature card and a land card.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'The only difference between a colored artifact and a colorless artifact is, obviously, its color. Unlike most artifacts, a colored artifact requires colored mana to cast. Also unlike most artifacts, a colored artifact has a color in all zones. It will interact with cards that care about color. Other than that, a colored artifact behaves just like any other artifact. It will interact as normal with any card that cares about artifacts, such as Shatter or Arcbound Ravager.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': "If Adventuring Gear leaves the battlefield before its landfall ability resolves, the creature it was attached to at the time it left the battlefield gets +2/+2. If it wasn\'t attached to a creature at that time, nothing gets the bonus."}, {\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': "The landfall ability gives +2/+2 to the creature that\'s equipped by Adventuring Gear at the time that ability resolves. It doesn\'t matter what creature Adventuring Gear was attached to (if any) when it triggered. That bonus remains with that creature even if Adventuring Gear leaves the battlefield or becomes attached to a different creature later in the turn."}, {\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': "The landfall ability triggers whenever a land enters the battlefield under your control for any reason. It triggers whenever you play a land, as well as whenever a spell or ability (such as Rampant Growth) causes you to put a land onto the battlefield under your control. It will even trigger when a spell or ability causes another player to put a land onto the battlefield under your control (as can happen with Yavimaya Dryad\'s ability, for example)."}, {\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': \'When a land enters the battlefield under your control, each landfall ability of the permanents you control will trigger. You can put them on the stack in any order. The last ability you put on the stack will be the first one that resolves.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': "The landfall ability triggers whenever a land enters the battlefield under your control for any reason. It triggers whenever you play a land, as well as whenever a spell or ability (such as Rampant Growth) causes you to put a land onto the battlefield under your control. It will even trigger when a spell or ability causes another player to put a land onto the battlefield under your control (as can happen with Yavimaya Dryad\'s ability, for example)."}, {\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': \'When a land enters the battlefield under your control, each landfall ability of the permanents you control will trigger. You can put them on the stack in any order. The last ability you put on the stack will be the first one that resolves.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': "To have any effect, Merfolk Sovereign\'s activated ability must be activated before the declare blockers step begins. Once a Merfolk has become blocked, activating Merfolk Sovereign\'s ability won\'t change that."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': \'A “blocking creature” is one that has been declared as a blocker this combat, or one that was put onto the battlefield blocking this combat. Unless that creature leaves combat, it continues to be a blocking creature through the end of combat step, even if the creature or creatures it was blocking are no longer on the battlefield or have otherwise left combat.\'}, {\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': \'An “attacking creature” is one that has been declared as an attacker this combat, or one that was put onto the battlefield attacking this combat. Unless that creature leaves combat, it continues to be an attacking creature through the end of combat step, even if the player it was attacking has left the game, or the planeswalker it was attacking has left combat.\'}, {\'date\': \'2012-07-01\', \'text\': "Destroying a blocking creature won\'t cause any of the creatures it was blocking to become unblocked. They won\'t deal combat damage to the defending player or planeswalker (unless they have trample)."}]', "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'A “blocking creature” is one that has been declared as a blocker this combat, or one that was put onto the battlefield blocking this combat. Unless that creature leaves combat, it continues to be a blocking creature through the end of combat step, even if the creature or creatures it was blocking are no longer on the battlefield or have otherwise left combat.'}]", "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'A “creature card” is any card with the type creature, even if it has other types such as artifact, enchantment, or land. Older cards of type summon are also creature cards.'}]", "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'Deciding to have the targeted creature block doesn’t force you to attack with Turntimber Basilisk that turn. If Turntimber Basilisk doesn’t attack, the targeted creature is free to block whichever creature its controller chooses, or block no creatures at all.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'If Turntimber Basilisk’s landfall ability triggers multiple times during the same turn, you can have multiple creatures block it that turn if able.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'If you choose to have the targeted creature block but that creature isn’t able to block Turntimber Basilisk (for example, because the targeted creature can block only creatures with flying), the requirement to block does nothing. The targeted creature is free to block whichever creature its controller chooses, or block no creatures at all.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'Tapped creatures, creatures that can’t block as the result of an effect, creatures with unpaid costs to block (such as those from War Cadence), and creatures that aren’t controlled by the defending player are exempt from effects that would require them to block. Such creatures can be targeted by Turntimber Basilisk’s landfall ability, but the requirement to block does nothing.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'The landfall ability triggers whenever a land enters the battlefield under your control for any reason. It triggers whenever you play a land, as well as whenever a spell or ability (such as Rampant Growth) causes you to put a land onto the battlefield under your control. It will even trigger when a spell or ability causes another player to put a land onto the battlefield under your control (as can happen with Yavimaya Dryad’s ability, for example).'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'When a land enters the battlefield under your control, each landfall ability of the permanents you control will trigger. You can put them on the stack in any order. The last ability you put on the stack will be the first one that resolves.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'You decide whether to have the targeted creature block Turntimber Basilisk this turn if able at the time the landfall ability resolves, not at the time Turntimber Basilisk attacks.'}]", "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'If Mire Blight’s ability triggers, the creature it was enchanting at that time is the one that will be destroyed when the ability resolves. It doesn’t matter if Mire Blight leaves the battlefield or somehow becomes attached to another creature by that time.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'Mire Blight’s ability triggers when the enchanted creature is dealt any kind of damage, not just combat damage.'}]", "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'If the targeted creature is an illegal target by the time Feast of Blood resolves, the entire spell doesn’t resolve. You don’t gain life.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'Whether you control two or more Vampires is checked only as you try to move Feast of Blood to the stack as the first step of casting it. It doesn’t matter whether you still control two or more Vampires as you finish casting Feast of Blood (in case you somehow sacrifice one to produce mana) or as Feast of Blood resolves.'}]", "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'If the targeted permanent or player is an illegal target by the time Goblin Artillery’s ability would resolve, the entire ability doesn’t resolve. You won’t be dealt any damage.'}]", "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'The ability triggers when Angelic Protector is chosen as a target for a spell or ability. The Protectors ability will be put on the stack above that spell or ability, and so resolve first.'}]", "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'The landfall ability triggers whenever a land enters the battlefield under your control for any reason. It triggers whenever you play a land, as well as whenever a spell or ability (such as Rampant Growth) causes you to put a land onto the battlefield under your control. It will even trigger when a spell or ability causes another player to put a land onto the battlefield under your control (as can happen with Yavimaya Dryad’s ability, for example).'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'When a land enters the battlefield under your control, each landfall ability of the permanents you control will trigger. You can put them on the stack in any order. The last ability you put on the stack will be the first one that resolves.'}]", "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'You may find any land card, not just a basic land card.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2010-03-01\', \'text\': "The landfall ability triggers whenever a land enters the battlefield under your control for any reason. It triggers whenever you play a land, as well as whenever a spell or ability (such as Rampant Growth) causes you to put a land onto the battlefield under your control. It will even trigger when a spell or ability causes another player to put a land onto the battlefield under your control (as can happen with Yavimaya Dryad\'s ability, for example)."}, {\'date\': \'2010-03-01\', \'text\': \'When a land enters the battlefield under your control, each landfall ability of the permanents you control will trigger. You can put them on the stack in any order. The last ability you put on the stack will be the first one that resolves.\'}]', "[{'date': '2010-03-01', 'text': 'Having more than one land enter the battlefield under your control this turn provides no additional benefit.'}, {'date': '2010-03-01', 'text': 'Once the spell resolves, having a land enter the battlefield under your control provides no further benefit.'}, {'date': '2010-03-01', 'text': 'The effect of this spell’s landfall ability replaces its normal effect. If you had a land enter the battlefield under your control this turn, only the landfall-based effect happens.'}, {'date': '2010-03-01', 'text': 'The landfall ability checks for an action that has happened in the past. It doesn’t matter if a land that entered the battlefield under your control previously in the turn is still on the battlefield, is still under your control, or is still a land.'}, {'date': '2010-03-01', 'text': 'Whether you had a land enter the battlefield under your control this turn is checked as this spell resolves, not as you cast it.'}]", "[{'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If the targeted creature is an illegal target by the time Fleeting Distraction resolves, the spell doesn’t resolve. You won’t draw a card.'}, {'date': '2012-05-01', 'text': 'If the targeted creature is an illegal target when Fleeting Distraction tries to resolve, it won’t resolve and none of its effects will happen. You won’t draw a card.'}]", "[{'date': '2010-08-15', 'text': 'An “attacking creature” is one that has been declared as an attacker this combat, or one that was put onto the battlefield attacking this combat. Unless that creature leaves combat, it continues to be an attacking creature through the end of combat step, even if the player it was attacking has left the game, or the planeswalker it was attacking has left combat.'}]", "[{'date': '2010-08-15', 'text': 'If you choose to find only one basic land card, you put it onto the battlefield tapped.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-01-01', 'text': 'As each ability resolves, the amount of life you gain is equal to the appropriate creature’s current toughness (if it’s somehow still on the battlefield), or its toughness as it last existed on the battlefield (in all other cases).'}, {'date': '2011-01-01', 'text': 'Engulfing Slagwurm’s ability triggers and resolves during the declare blockers step. Creatures destroyed this way will not deal combat damage.'}, {'date': '2011-01-01', 'text': 'Even if the ability of an attacking Engulfing Slagwurm destroys each creature blocking it, Engulfing Slagwurm won’t deal combat damage to the player or planeswalker it’s attacking unless it somehow gains trample.'}, {'date': '2011-01-01', 'text': 'If Engulfing Slagwurm’s ability resolves and the other creature is not destroyed (perhaps because it has already left the battlefield or it regenerates), you’ll still gain life equal to that creature’s toughness.'}, {'date': '2011-01-01', 'text': 'If your Engulfing Slagwurm blocks or becomes blocked by multiple creatures, its ability triggers that many times. Each trigger will be associated with a specific creature. You choose which order to have the abilities resolve.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-01-01', 'text': 'If the equipped creature becomes blocked by multiple creatures, Infiltration Lens’s ability triggers that many times.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-01-01', 'text': 'Players can lose more life than they have. For example, say you’re playing a multiplayer game in which one of your opponents has 3 life and your other opponent has 10 life. If you cast Exsanguinate with X of 4, your opponents will wind up at -1 life and 6 life, respectively. You’ll gain 8 life.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'Check the sacrificed creature’s toughness as it last existed on the battlefield to determine how many Wolves you put onto the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'You choose whether to sacrifice a nontoken creature and which creature to sacrifice when Feed the Pack’s ability resolves.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'Gravecrawler’s ability doesn’t change when you could cast it.'}, {'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'Once you’ve cast Gravecrawler and it’s on the stack, it doesn’t matter if you lose control of the other Zombie.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'The creatures can’t block any creatures that turn, not just Markov Warlord.'}, {'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'You may target zero, one, or two creatures with Markov Warlord’s enters-the-battlefield triggered ability.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-06-01', 'text': 'Forced Worship’s activated ability may only be activated if Forced Worship is on the battlefield. If it’s no longer on the battlefield when the ability resolves, the ability has no effect.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-06-01', 'text': 'If an effect causes you to draw multiple cards, Psychosis Crawler will trigger that many times.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-06-01', 'text': 'If multiple sources deal damage to Nested Ghoul simultaneously (because it was blocked by multiple creatures, for example), the ability will trigger for each source dealing damage to Nested Ghoul.'}, {'date': '2011-06-01', 'text': 'Nested Ghoul’s ability will trigger if a source with infect deals damage to it.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2011-09-22\', \'text\': "If you control fewer than two Zombies, you won\'t get any tokens."}, {\'date\': \'2011-09-22\', \'text\': \'The number of Zombies you control is counted when the ability resolves. If you control multiple Endless Ranks of the Dead, the tokens you get when the first ability resolves will count for the subsequent abilities (if the tokens are still under your control at that time).\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2011-09-22\', \'text\': \'Although the tokens are attacking, they were never declared as attacking creatures (for purposes of abilities that trigger whenever a creature attacks, for example).\'}, {\'date\': \'2011-09-22\', \'text\': \'You count the number of creature cards in your graveyard when the triggered ability resolves.\'}, {\'date\': \'2011-09-22\', \'text\': "You declare which player or planeswalker each token is attacking as you put it onto the battlefield. It doesn\'t have to be the same player or planeswalker Kessig Cagebreakers is attacking."}]', "[{'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'Consider only the number of +1/+1 counters on Primordial Hydra when determining if it has trample, not its power and toughness. For example, a Primordial Hydra with six +1/+1 counters on it that’s been the target of Titanic Growth (giving it +4/+4) would not have trample.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'The Spirit card must already be in your graveyard when the ability triggers at the beginning of your upkeep. If there is no Spirit card in your graveyard when your upkeep begins, the ability will be removed from the stack with no effect.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'The morbid ability is mandatory. If you control the only non-Demon creature when the ability triggers, you must choose it as the target.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2012-05-01\', \'text\': "The creature that entered the battlefield will also get +1/+1 until end of turn if it\'s still on the battlefield when the ability resolves."}]', "[{'date': '2012-05-01', 'text': 'Cards that are put into your graveyard can be returned to your hand by the emblem’s ability even if they were never in your hand.'}, {'date': '2012-05-01', 'text': 'If you activate Tamiyo’s third ability when she has eight loyalty counters on her, she’ll be put into your graveyard before the emblem is created. She won’t return to your hand.'}, {'date': '2012-05-01', 'text': 'Tamiyo’s first ability tracks the permanent, but not its controller. If the permanent changes controllers before its first controller’s next untap step has come around, then it won’t untap during its new controller’s next untap step.'}, {'date': '2012-05-01', 'text': 'Tamiyo’s third ability creates one emblem with two abilities.'}, {'date': '2012-05-01', 'text': 'The number of tapped creatures the player controls is determined when Tamiyo’s second ability resolves.'}, {'date': '2013-07-01', 'text': 'The ability can target a tapped permanent. If the targeted permanent is already tapped when it resolves, that permanent just remains tapped and doesn’t untap during its controller’s next untap step.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-05-01', 'text': 'Dread Slaver will return if it somehow dealt damage to itself and then dies.'}, {'date': '2012-05-01', 'text': 'Each time a creature dies, check whether Dread Slaver had dealt any damage to it at any time during that turn. If so, Dread Slaver’s ability will trigger. It doesn’t matter who controlled the creature or whose graveyard it was put into.'}, {'date': '2012-05-01', 'text': 'If Dread Slaver and a creature it was blocking or blocked by both die in combat, Dread Slaver’s ability will trigger.'}, {'date': '2012-05-01', 'text': 'The card will return to the battlefield under your control only if it’s still in the graveyard when the ability resolves. If it’s not (perhaps because an ability like undying has already returned it to the battlefield), nothing happens.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-05-01', 'text': 'If the creature is an Angel only on the battlefield (perhaps because it’s a non-Angel creature card and Xenograft is on the battlefield), it will get the +1/+1 counters.'}, {'date': '2012-05-01', 'text': 'No player can cast spells or activate abilities between returning the creature card to the battlefield and checking whether it’s an Angel.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-05-01', 'text': 'The comparison of power is performed only when blockers are declared. Increasing the power of a blocking creature (or decreasing the power of Howlgeist) after this point won’t cause any creature to stop blocking or become unblocked.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2012-07-01\', \'text\': "Discarding a card is part of the cost to activate Rummaging Goblin\'s ability. If you don\'t have a card in your hand, you can\'t pay this part of the cost and you can\'t activate the ability."}]', "[{'date': '2012-07-01', 'text': 'The ability counts each Goblin you control, including Krenko itself, not just the tokens it creates.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-07-01', 'text': 'You can sacrifice Arms Dealer to activate its own ability.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-07-01', 'text': 'You divide the damage as you cast Flames of the Firebrand, not as it resolves. Each target must be assigned at least 1 damage. (In other words, as you put the spell on the stack, you choose whether to have it deal 3 damage to a single target, 2 damage to one target and 1 damage to another target, or 1 damage to each of three targets.)'}]", "[{'date': '2013-01-24', 'text': 'All Rats you control have deathtouch while Ogre Slumlord is on the battlefield, not just the ones created by Ogre Slumlord.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-01-24', 'text': 'Gideon, Champion of Justice’s power and toughness are set to the number of loyalty counters on him when his second ability resolves. They won’t change later in the turn if the number of loyalty counters on him changes.'}, {'date': '2013-01-24', 'text': 'Gideon, Champion of Justice’s second ability causes him to become a creature with the creature types Human and Soldier. He remains a planeswalker with the planeswalker type Gideon. (He also retains any other card types or subtypes he may have had.) Each subtype is correlated to the proper card type: Gideon is just a planeswalker type (not a creature type), and Human and Soldier are just creature types (not planeswalker types).'}, {'date': '2013-01-24', 'text': 'If Gideon, Champion of Justice becomes a creature due to his second ability, that doesn’t count as having a creature enter the battlefield. Gideon was already on the battlefield; he only changed his types. Abilities that trigger whenever a creature enters the battlefield won’t trigger.'}, {'date': '2013-01-24', 'text': 'If Gideon, Champion of Justice becomes a creature the same turn he enters the battlefield, you can’t attack with him or use any of his {T} abilities (if he gains any).'}, {'date': '2013-01-24', 'text': 'If the first ability doesn’t resolve (perhaps because the target opponent is an illegal target when the ability tries to resolve), you won’t put any additional loyalty counters on Gideon, although the loyalty counter you put on him to activate the ability will remain.'}, {'date': '2013-01-24', 'text': 'Say you activate Gideon, Champion of Justice’s second ability, and then an opponent gains control of him before combat. You may have any of your creatures attack Gideon, Champion of Justice (since he’s still a planeswalker). Then Gideon, Champion of Justice may block (since he’s a creature). He may block any eligible attacking creature, including one that’s attacking him! During combat, he behaves as an attacked planeswalker and/or a blocking creature, as appropriate. For example, he deals combat damage to any creatures he’s blocking, but he doesn’t deal combat damage to any unblocked creatures that are attacking him.'}, {'date': '2013-01-24', 'text': 'You put a loyalty counter on Gideon, Champion of Justice as part of the cost of activating the first ability. When that ability resolves, you count the number of creatures controlled by the target opponent and put that many additional loyalty counters on Gideon.'}, {'date': '2013-07-01', 'text': 'If damage that can’t be prevented is dealt to Gideon, Champion of Justice after his second ability has resolved, that damage will have all applicable results: specifically, the damage is marked on Gideon (since he’s a creature) and that damage causes that many loyalty counters to be removed from him (since he’s a planeswalker). Even though he has indestructible, if Gideon, Champion of Justice has no loyalty counters on him, he’s put into his owner’s graveyard as a state-based action.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-01-24', 'text': 'If another player gains control of either Murder Investigation or the enchanted creature (but not both), Murder Investigation will be enchanting an illegal permanent. The Aura will be put into its owner’s graveyard as a state-based action.'}, {'date': '2013-01-24', 'text': 'To determine how many Soldier tokens are created, use the power of the enchanted creature as it last existed on the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'Exiling the creature card with scavenge is part of the cost of activating the scavenge ability. Once the ability is activated and the cost is paid, it’s too late to stop the ability from being activated by trying to remove the creature card from the graveyard.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'If you cast this as normal during your main phase, it will enter the battlefield and you’ll receive priority. If no abilities trigger because of this, you can activate its ability immediately, before any other player has a chance to remove it from the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'Players can only respond once this spell has been cast and all its costs have been paid. No one can try to destroy the creature you sacrificed to prevent you from casting this spell.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'You must sacrifice exactly one creature to cast this spell; you cannot cast it without sacrificing a creature, and you cannot sacrifice additional creatures.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-07-01', 'text': 'Shadowborn Demon’s enters-the-battlefield ability is mandatory. If you control the only non-Demon creature, you must choose it as the target.'}, {'date': '2013-07-01', 'text': 'The last ability checks whether you have fewer than six creature cards in your graveyard when it would trigger. If you have six or more, it won’t trigger at all. The ability will check again when it tries to resolve. If at that time you have six or more, the ability won’t do anything.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2013-09-15\', \'text\': \'If you sacrifice the Ordeal in some other way, its last ability will trigger.\'}, {\'date\': \'2013-09-15\', \'text\': \'The +1/+1 counter is put on the creature before blockers are declared and before combat damage is dealt.\'}, {\'date\': \'2013-09-15\', \'text\': "The check of whether the enchanted creature has three or more +1/+1 counters on it happens as part of the resolution of the attack triggered ability. If the third +1/+1 counter is put on the enchanted creature any other way, you won\'t sacrifice the Ordeal until the next time the creature attacks."}]', "[{'date': '2013-10-17', 'text': 'If the ability does trigger, but you control a Snake when it tries to resolve, the ability will do nothing. No Snake token will be created.'}, {'date': '2013-10-17', 'text': 'Ophiomancer’s ability checks if you control a Snake at the beginning of each upkeep. If you do, the ability won’t trigger.'}, {'date': '2013-10-17', 'text': 'Ophiomancer’s ability considers any creature you control with the creature type Snake, not just the tokens Ophiomancer creates.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "Eidolon of Rhetoric will look at the entire turn to see if a player has cast a spell yet that turn, even if Eidolon of Rhetoric wasn\'t on the battlefield when that spell was cast. Specifically, you can\'t cast Eidolon of Rhetoric and then cast another spell that turn."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2014-07-18\', \'text\': "Any cards you don\'t play will remain exiled."}, {\'date\': \'2014-07-18\', \'text\': \'Playing a card this way follows the normal rules for playing the card. You must pay its costs, and you must follow all applicable timing rules. For example, if one of the cards is a creature card, you can cast that card only during your main phase while the stack is empty.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-07-18\', \'text\': \'The cards are exiled face up.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-07-18\', \'text\': "Under normal circumstances, you can play a land card exiled with Act on Impulse only if you haven\'t played a land yet that turn."}]', "[{'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'Although Goblin Rabblemaster doesn’t force itself to attack, if you control two of them, they’ll force each other to attack if able.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'If, during your declare attackers step, a creature that must attack if able is tapped, is affected by a spell or ability that says it can’t attack, or hasn’t been under your control continuously since the turn began (and doesn’t have haste), then it doesn’t attack. If there’s a cost associated with having a creature attack, you’re not forced to pay that cost, so it doesn’t have to attack in that case either.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'The number of attacking Goblins is counted as the last ability resolves, and the bonus is locked in at that time.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'Because convoke isn’t an alternative cost, it can be used in conjunction with alternative costs.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'Convoke doesn’t change a spell’s mana cost or converted mana cost.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'If a creature you control has a mana ability with {T} in the cost, activating that ability while casting a spell with convoke will result in the creature being tapped when you pay the spell’s costs. You won’t be able to tap it again for convoke. Similarly, if you sacrifice a creature to activate a mana ability while casting a spell with convoke, that creature won’t be on the battlefield when you pay the spell’s costs, so you won’t be able to tap it for convoke.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'Tapping a multicolored creature using convoke will pay for {1} or one mana of your choice of any of that creature’s colors.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'The rules for convoke have changed slightly since it last appeared in an expansion. Previously, convoke reduced the cost to cast a spell. Under current rules, you tap creatures at the same time you pay the spell’s costs. Tapping a creature this way is simply another way to pay.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'When calculating a spell’s total cost, include any alternative costs, additional costs, or anything else that increases or reduces the cost to cast the spell. Convoke applies after the total cost is calculated.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'When using convoke to cast a spell with {X} in its mana cost, first choose the value for X. That choice, plus any cost increases or decreases, will determine the spell’s total cost. Then you can tap creatures you control to help pay that cost. For example, if you cast Chord of Calling (a spell with convoke and mana cost {X}{G}{G}{G}) and choose X to be 3, the total cost is {3}{G}{G}{G}. If you tap two green creatures and two red creatures, you’ll have to pay {1}{G}.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'Damage dealt to an opponent causes that player to lose that much life.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'Feast on the Fallen checks only if an opponent lost life during the turn, not whether that player’s life total decreased over the course of the turn. For example, if an opponent lost 2 life and then gained 8 life last turn, Feast on the Fallen’s ability will trigger.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'Feast on the Fallen looks at the entire previous turn to determine whether its ability triggers or not. It doesn’t matter whether Feast on the Fallen was on the battlefield when the opponent lost life.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'Only one +1/+1 counter will be put on the target creature no matter how much life was lost.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'Each of the three targets must be different. If there aren’t three different legal targets available, you can’t cast the spell.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'If one or two of Cone of Flame’s targets are illegal when it resolves, you can’t change how much damage will be dealt to the remaining legal targets.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'Once the ability triggers, it doesn’t matter how many creatures are still attacking when the ability resolves.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'The creatures don’t have to be attacking the same player or planeswalker.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2014-07-18\', \'text\': \'The declare blockers step is the last chance to cast Devouring Light before creatures deal their combat damage. However, a creature remains an attacking or blocking creature during the combat damage step and end of combat step. Devouring Light may be cast targeting such a creature during those steps, after the creature has dealt combat damage.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-07-18\', \'text\': "You can tap untapped attacking or blocking creatures you control to help cast Devouring Light. This doesn\'t remove those creatures from combat."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If a creature you control has a mana ability with {T} in the cost, activating that ability while casting a spell with convoke will result in the creature being tapped before you pay the spell\'s costs. You won\'t be able to tap it again for convoke. Similarly, if you sacrifice a creature to activate a mana ability while casting a spell with convoke, that creature won\'t be on the battlefield when you pay the spell\'s costs, so you won\'t be able to tap it for convoke."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "When calculating a spell\'s total cost, include any alternative costs, additional costs, or anything else that increases or reduces the cost to cast the spell. Convoke applies after the total cost is calculated. Convoke doesn\'t change a spell\'s mana cost or mana value."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "You can tap any untapped creature you control to convoke a spell, even one you haven\'t controlled continuously since the beginning of your most recent turn."}]', "[{'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'You can remove any +1/+1 counters from Cruel Sadist to activate its second ability, not just those put on Cruel Sadist by its first ability.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Any loyalty counters on Sarkhan when his first ability resolves will remain on him while he’s a creature. Because he’s not a planeswalker at this time, damage dealt to him won’t cause those counters to be removed.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'If Sarkhan, the Dragonspeaker becomes a creature due to his first ability, that doesn’t count as having a creature enter the battlefield. Sarkhan was already on the battlefield; he only changed his types. Abilities that trigger whenever a creature enters the battlefield won’t trigger.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'If a permanent enters the battlefield as a copy of Sarkhan after his first ability has resolved, the copy will be a Sarkhan planeswalker. It will enter the battlefield with four loyalty counters, no matter how many loyalty counters are on the original Sarkhan. You’ll then find yourself in the same situation described above.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Assuming the ferocious ability applies, if just the creature you control is an illegal target when Savage Punch tries to resolve, it won’t get +2/+2 until end of turn. If the creature you control is a legal target but the creature you don’t control isn’t, the creature you control will get +2/+2 until end of turn.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Ferocious abilities of instants and sorceries that don’t use the word “instead” will provide an additional effect if you control a creature with power 4 or greater as they resolve.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'If either target is an illegal target when Savage Punch tries to resolve, neither creature will deal or be dealt damage.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Some ferocious abilities that appear on instants and sorceries use the word “instead.” These spells have an upgraded effect if you control a creature with power 4 or greater as they resolve. For these, you only get the upgraded effect, not both effects.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'You can’t cast Savage Punch unless you target both a creature you control and a creature you don’t control.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Because delve isn’t an alternative cost, it can be used in conjunction with alternative costs.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Delve doesn’t change a spell’s mana cost or converted mana cost. For example, Dead Drop’s converted mana cost is 10 even if you exiled three cards to cast it.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'The rules for delve have changed slightly since it was last in an expansion. Previously, delve reduced the cost to cast a spell. Under the current rules, you exile cards from your graveyard at the same time you pay the spell’s cost. Exiling a card this way is simply another way to pay that cost.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'You can’t exile cards to pay for the colored mana requirements of a spell with delve.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'You can’t exile more cards than the generic mana requirement of a spell with delve. For example, you can’t exile more than nine cards from your graveyard to cast Dead Drop.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Ferocious abilities of instants and sorceries that don’t use the word “instead” will provide an additional effect if you control a creature with power 4 or greater as they resolve.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'If, during the declare blockers step, a creature is tapped or is affected by a spell or ability that says it can’t block, then it doesn’t block. If there’s a cost associated with having that creature block, its controller isn’t forced to pay that cost. If the player doesn’t, the creature doesn’t block in that case either.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Roar of Challenge doesn’t give any creatures the ability to block the target creature. It just forces those creatures that are already able to block the creature to do so.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Some ferocious abilities that appear on instants and sorceries use the word “instead.” These spells have an upgraded effect if you control a creature with power 4 or greater as they resolve. For these, you only get the upgraded effect, not both effects.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'If either target is an illegal target when Swift Kick tries to resolve, neither creature will deal or be dealt damage.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'If just the creature you control is an illegal target when Swift Kick tries to resolve, it won’t get +1/+0 until end of turn. If the creature you control is a legal target but the creature you don’t control isn’t, the creature you control will get +1/+0 until end of turn.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'You can’t cast Swift Kick unless you target both a creature you control and a creature you don’t control.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Once a creature legally blocks War-Name Aspirant, changing that creature’s power to 1 or less won’t change or undo that block.'}, {'date': '2018-01-19', 'text': 'Raid abilities care only that you attacked with a creature. It doesn’t matter how many creatures you attacked with, or which opponent or planeswalker controlled by an opponent those creatures attacked.'}, {'date': '2018-01-19', 'text': 'Raid abilities evaluate the entire turn to see if you attacked with a creature. That creature doesn’t have to still be on the battlefield. Similarly, the player or planeswalker it attacked doesn’t have to still be in the game or on the battlefield, respectively.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-11-07', 'text': 'Effects that modify the target creature’s power and/or toughness, such as the effect of Giant Growth or Glorious Anthem, will apply to the creature no matter when they started applying. The same is true for counters that affect the target creature’s power and toughness and effects that switch its power and toughness.'}, {'date': '2014-11-07', 'text': 'The activated ability overwrites all previous effects that set the target creature’s base power and/or toughness to specific values. Other effects that set its base power and/or toughness that start to apply after Creeperhulk’s ability resolves will overwrite Creeperhulk’s effect.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2014-11-24\', \'text\': "An Aura doesn\'t necessarily need the enchant creature ability for the abilities of Sage\'s Reverie to count it. For example, an Aura with enchant permanent that\'s attached to a creature will count."}, {\'date\': \'2014-11-24\', \'text\': "Count the number of Auras you control attached to creatures as the enters-the-battlefield ability resolves to determine how many cards to draw. This will include Sage\'s Reverie as long as it\'s still on the battlefield at that time."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2014-11-24\', \'text\': "The triggered ability will trigger when one of the Gods from Theros block enters the battlefield only if your devotion is high enough that it\'s a creature when it enters. If Hero\'s Blade is attached to a God that stops being a creature (or any creature that stops being a creature), it will become unattached."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If the legendary creature that entered the battlefield leaves the battlefield before Hero\'s Blade becomes attached, Hero\'s Blade stays as it was. If it\'s already attached to another creature, it remains attached to that creature."}]', "[{'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'Frontier Mastodon’s ferocious ability checks if you control a creature with power 4 or greater as Frontier Mastodon enters the battlefield. Because Frontier Mastodon isn’t on the battlefield at this time, it won’t count itself.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'If a creature was dealt damage but regenerated (which removes all damage from it), it will still be a legal target for the second mode of the triggered ability.'}, {'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'If a mode requires a target and there are no legal targets available, you must choose the mode that adds a +1/+1 counter.'}, {'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'You choose which mode you’re using as you put the ability on the stack, after the creature has entered the battlefield. Once you’ve chosen a mode, you can’t change that mode even if the creature leaves the battlefield in response to that ability.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2015-02-25\', \'text\': "Deathbringer Regent\'s last ability destroys all creatures except Deathbringer Regent, including the five other creatures required for the ability to have an effect."}, {\'date\': \'2015-02-25\', \'text\': \'If you cast a creature spell that enters the battlefield as a copy of Deathbringer Regent, the enters-the-battlefield ability will trigger (assuming the “five or more other creatures” requirement is also met).\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2015-02-25\', \'text\': "Dragonlord\'s Servant can\'t reduce the colored mana requirement of a Dragon spell you cast."}, {\'date\': \'2015-02-25\', \'text\': "If there are any additional costs to cast a Dragon spell, apply those before applying Dragonlord\'s Servant and any other cost reductions."}, {\'date\': \'2015-02-25\', \'text\': \'The ability can apply to alternative costs to cast a Dragon spell.\'}]', "[{'date': '2015-02-25', 'text': 'Sarkhan’s Rage checks whether you control a Dragon as it resolves.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2015-06-22\', \'text\': "Activating the second ability of Whirler Rogue after a creature has become blocked won\'t cause it to become unblocked."}, {\'date\': \'2015-06-22\', \'text\': "You may tap any two untapped artifacts you control, including artifact creatures that haven\'t been under your control continuously since the beginning of your most recent turn."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2015-06-22\', \'text\': "It doesn\'t matter who controlled the permanent when it was put into a graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2015-06-22\', \'text\': "The triggered ability is mandatory. You can\'t decline to draw the card and lose life, even if you want to."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2015-06-22\', \'text\': "The last ability will trigger, at most, once per combat damage step per player. However, if at least one artifact creature you control has first strike and others don\'t, or if an artifact creature you control has double strike, the ability could trigger twice per combat: once in each combat damage step."}, {\'date\': \'2015-06-22\', \'text\': "Thopter Spy Network\'s first ability has an “intervening ‘if\' clause.” That means (1) the ability won\'t trigger at all unless you control an artifact as your upkeep begins, and (2) the ability will do nothing if you don\'t control an artifact as it resolves."}]', "[{'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'Activating the last ability of Alchemist’s Vial targeting a creature that’s already attacking or blocking won’t cause that creature to stop attacking or blocking. It will prevent that creature from attacking or blocking in any additional combat phases the turn may have (although this is unusual).'}]", "[{'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'Blessed Spirits’s ability will resolve before the enchantment spell that caused it to trigger.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'Count the number of creature cards in your graveyard as the ability resolves to determine how much life is lost. Notably, this could include any other creature you owned that died in combat, and perhaps even Graveblade Marauder itself.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'If enough -1/-1 counters are put on Hangarback Walker at the same time to make its toughness 0 or less, the number of +1/+1 counters on it before it got any -1/-1 counters will be used to determine how many Thopter tokens you get. For example, if there are three +1/+1 counters on Hangarback Walker and it gets four -1/-1 counters, you’ll get three Thopter tokens. That’s because Hangarback Walker’s triggered ability checks the creature’s existence just before it leaves the battlefield, and it still has all those counters on it at that point.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'The value of each X in Hangarback Walker’s mana cost must be equal. For example, if X is 2, you’ll pay {4} to cast Hangarback Walker and it will enter the battlefield with two +1/+1 counters on it.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'If you control at least one artifact as Artificer’s Epiphany resolves, you can’t discard a card, even if you want to.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'A card with devoid is just colorless. It’s not colorless and the colors of mana in its mana cost.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Cards with devoid use frames that are variations of the transparent frame traditionally used for Eldrazi. The top part of the card features some color over a background based on the texture of the hedrons that once imprisoned the Eldrazi. This coloration is intended to aid deckbuilding and game play.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Devoid works in all zones, not just on the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Eldrazi Scions are similar to Eldrazi Spawn, seen in the Zendikar block. Note that Eldrazi Scions are 1/1, not 0/1.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Eldrazi and Scion are each separate creature types. Anything that affects Eldrazi will affect these tokens, for example.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'If a card loses devoid, it will still be colorless. This is because effects that change an object’s color (like the one created by devoid) are considered before the object loses devoid.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Other cards and abilities can give a card with devoid color. If that happens, it’s just the new color, not that color and colorless.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Sacrificing an Eldrazi Scion creature token to add {C} to your mana pool is a mana ability. It doesn’t use the stack and can’t be responded to.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Some instants and sorceries that create Eldrazi Scions require targets. If all targets for such a spell have become illegal by the time that spell tries to resolve, the spell won’t resolve and none of its effects will happen. You won’t get any Eldrazi Scions.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'A card with devoid is just colorless. It’s not colorless and the colors of mana in its mana cost.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Cards with devoid use frames that are variations of the transparent frame traditionally used for Eldrazi. The top part of the card features some color over a background based on the texture of the hedrons that once imprisoned the Eldrazi. This coloration is intended to aid deckbuilding and game play.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Devoid works in all zones, not just on the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'If a card loses devoid, it will still be colorless. This is because effects that change an object’s color (like the one created by devoid) are considered before the object loses devoid.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'If the creature an opponent controls survives the fight but would die later in the turn for another reason, it will be exiled instead, whether your creature dealt it damage or not.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'If the creature you control becomes an illegal target (perhaps due to being destroyed by another spell or ability), Unnatural Aggression will resolve, but the target creature an opponent controls will neither deal nor receive any damage. If that creature would die later in the turn for another reason, it will be exiled instead.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Other cards and abilities can give a card with devoid color. If that happens, it’s just the new color, not that color and colorless.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'A creature with lifelink dealing combat damage is a single life-gaining event. For example, if two creatures you control with lifelink deal combat damage at the same time, the ability will trigger twice. However, if a single creature with lifelink deals combat damage to multiple creatures, players, and/or planeswalkers at the same time (perhaps because it has trample or was blocked by more than one creature), the ability will trigger only once.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'In a Two-Headed Giant game, life gained by your teammate won’t cause the ability to trigger, even though it causes your team’s life total to increase.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'The ability triggers just once for each life-gaining event, whether it’s 1 life from Drana’s Emissary or 7 life from Nissa’s Renewal.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'A landfall ability triggers whenever a land enters the battlefield under your control for any reason. It triggers whenever you play a land, as well as whenever a spell or ability puts a land onto the battlefield under your control.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'If the ability has an additional or replacement effect that depends on the land having a certain basic land type, the ability will check that land’s type as the ability resolves. If, at that time, the land that entered the battlefield is no longer on the battlefield, use its types when it left the battlefield to determine what happens.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'When a land enters the battlefield under your control, each landfall ability of the permanents you control will trigger. You can put them on the stack in any order. The last ability you put on the stack will be the first one to resolve.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Check the target creature’s power as Titan’s Presence resolves to see if it’s less than or equal to revealed creature card’s power. If it’s greater, Titan’s Presence will finish resolving with no effect.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'The colorless creature card stays revealed until Titan’s Presence leaves the stack.'}, {'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'The colorless creature card you reveal doesn’t have to still be in your hand as Titan’s Presence resolves. If it’s not, use its power as it last existed in your hand.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-08-25', 'text': 'Count the number of creatures you control as Outnumber resolves to determine how much damage Outnumber deals.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-11-04', 'text': 'Any enters-the-battlefield abilities of the copied creature will trigger when Gigantoplasm enters the battlefield. Any “as [this creature] enters the battlefield” or “[this creature] enters the battlefield with” abilities of the chosen creature will also work.'}, {'date': '2015-11-04', 'text': 'Effects that modify Gigantoplasm’s power and/or toughness, such as the effect of Giant Growth or Glorious Anthem, will apply to Gigantoplasm no matter when they started applying. The same is true for counters that affect its power and/or toughness and effects that switch its power and toughness.'}, {'date': '2015-11-04', 'text': 'Gigantoplasm copies exactly what was printed on the original creature and nothing more (unless that creature is copying something else or is a token; see below). It doesn’t copy whether that creature is tapped or untapped, whether it has any counters on it or Auras attached to it, or any non-copy effects that have changed its power, toughness, types, color, etc.'}, {'date': '2015-11-04', 'text': 'However, the effect of that ability isn’t copiable. That is, if Gigantoplasm is a copy of a creature with base power and toughness 2/2 and you activate its ability making it a 4/4 creature, another creature that becomes a copy of Gigantoplasm will have base power and toughness 2/2.'}, {'date': '2015-11-04', 'text': 'If Gigantoplasm isn’t a creature (perhaps because it copied a land that had temporarily become a creature), you can still activate the ability “{X}: This creature has base power and toughness X/X.” However, this ability won’t have any effect, and it won’t turn Gigantoplasm into a creature.'}, {'date': '2015-11-04', 'text': 'If Gigantoplasm somehow enters the battlefield at the same time as another creature, it can’t become a copy of that creature. You may choose only a creature that’s already on the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2015-11-04', 'text': 'If the chosen creature has {X} in its mana cost, X is 0. The ability that Gigantoplasm gives itself doesn’t affect an {X} in its mana cost.'}, {'date': '2015-11-04', 'text': 'If the chosen creature is a token, Gigantoplasm copies the original characteristics of that token as stated by the effect that put the token onto the battlefield. Gigantoplasm isn’t a token, even if it’s copying one.'}, {'date': '2015-11-04', 'text': 'If the chosen creature is copying something else (for example, if the chosen creature is another Gigantoplasm), then Gigantoplasm enters the battlefield as whatever the chosen creature was copying (plus any abilities it gained as part of the copy process, if applicable).'}, {'date': '2015-11-04', 'text': 'The activated ability Gigantoplasm gives itself becomes part of its copiable values. Unless the ability is overwritten by another copy effect, a creature that’s a copy of Gigantoplasm will have that ability.'}, {'date': '2015-11-04', 'text': 'The activated ability overwrites all previous effects that set Gigantoplasm’s base power and/or toughness to specific values. Other effects that set its base power and/or toughness that start to apply after the ability resolves (including ones created by subsequent activations of the ability) will overwrite the effect of the ability.'}, {'date': '2015-11-04', 'text': 'You can choose not to copy anything. In that case, Gigantoplasm enters the battlefield as a 0/0 Shapeshifter creature, and is probably put into the graveyard immediately.'}]", "[{'date': '2016-01-22', 'text': 'Activating the second activated ability after a creature has legally been declared as an attacker or blocker won’t change or undo that attack or block.'}, {'date': '2016-01-22', 'text': 'Endbringer untaps at the same time as the active player’s permanents. You can’t choose to not untap it at that time.'}, {'date': '2016-01-22', 'text': 'If an effect states that Endbringer doesn’t untap during your untap step, that effect won’t apply during another player’s untap step.'}]", "[{'date': '2016-01-22', 'text': 'Vampire Envoy’s last ability will trigger if it becomes tapped for any reason, including attacking. However, if it enters the battlefield tapped for some reason, the ability won’t trigger.'}]", "[{'date': '2016-01-22', 'text': 'You can activate the last ability only if World Breaker is in your graveyard.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2016-04-08\', \'text\': "If multiple land cards are put into your graveyard at once, Crawling Sensation\'s last ability triggers only once. This could happen because an effect (such as that of Crawling Sensation\'s first ability) put them there from your library at once, or because they were destroyed at the same time (such as two land creatures that were dealt lethal combat damage)."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-04-08\', \'text\': "If you sacrifice a Clue for another card\'s cost or effect, such as that of Angelic Purge or Tamiyo\'s Journal, you can\'t also pay {2} and sacrifice it to draw a card."}, {\'date\': \'2016-04-08\', \'text\': "The token is named Clue Token and has the artifact subtype Clue. Clue isn\'t a creature type."}, {\'date\': \'2016-04-08\', \'text\': \'The tokens are normal artifacts. For example, they can be sacrificed to cast Angelic Purge or targeted by Root Out.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-04-08\', \'text\': "If you sacrifice a Clue for another card\'s cost or effect, such as that of Angelic Purge or Tamiyo\'s Journal, you can\'t also pay {2} and sacrifice it to draw a card."}, {\'date\': \'2016-04-08\', \'text\': "The token is named Clue and has the artifact subtype Clue. Clue isn\'t a creature type."}, {\'date\': \'2016-04-08\', \'text\': \'The tokens are normal artifacts. For example, they can be sacrificed to cast Angelic Purge or targeted by Root Out.\'}]', "[{'date': '2016-04-08', 'text': 'If you sacrifice a Clue for another card’s cost or effect, such as that of Angelic Purge or Tamiyo’s Journal, you can’t also pay {2} and sacrifice it to draw a card.'}, {'date': '2016-04-08', 'text': 'The token is named Clue and has the artifact subtype Clue. Clue isn’t a creature type.'}, {'date': '2016-04-08', 'text': 'The tokens are normal artifacts. For example, they can be sacrificed to cast Angelic Purge or targeted by Root Out.'}, {'date': '2016-04-08', 'text': 'You can’t cast a spell without choosing legal targets. If all of those targets become illegal, the spell doesn’t resolve and you won’t investigate.'}]", "[{'date': '2016-04-08', 'text': 'If you sacrifice a Clue for another card’s cost or effect, such as that of Angelic Purge or Tamiyo’s Journal, you can’t also pay {2} and sacrifice it to draw a card.'}, {'date': '2016-04-08', 'text': 'The token is named Clue and has the artifact subtype Clue. Clue isn’t a creature type.'}, {'date': '2016-04-08', 'text': 'The tokens are normal artifacts. For example, they can be sacrificed to cast Angelic Purge or targeted by Root Out.'}]", "[{'date': '2016-04-08', 'text': 'You choose whether to put the target card on the top or bottom of its owner’s library as Not Forgotten resolves.'}, {'date': '2016-04-08', 'text': 'You get the Spirit token, not the owner of the target card.'}]", "[{'date': '2016-04-08', 'text': 'multiple instances of lifelink on the same creature are redundant.'}]", "[{'date': '2016-06-08', 'text': 'Activated abilities contain a colon. They’re generally written “[Cost]: [Effect].” Some keywords are activated abilities and will have colons in their reminder text.'}]", "[{'date': '2016-06-08', 'text': 'Battle Squadron’s last ability applies in all zones. While it’s on the battlefield, it counts itself, so it’ll be at least 1/1.'}]", "[{'date': '2016-06-08', 'text': 'If Blood Artist and one or more other creatures die at the same time, its ability will trigger for each of those creatures.'}]", "[{'date': '2016-06-08', 'text': 'Lys Alana Huntmaster’s ability will resolve before the Elf spell that caused it to trigger.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2016-07-13\', \'text\': "The set of creatures affected by Selfless Spirit\'s last ability is determined as the ability resolves. Creatures you begin to control later in the turn won\'t gain indestructible."}]', "[{'date': '2016-07-13', 'text': 'Any toughness-modifying effects, counters, Auras, or Equipment will apply after its toughness is set to the player’s former life total. For example, say Tree of Perdition is equipped with Cultist’s Staff (which makes it 2/15) and the player’s life total is 7. After the exchange, Tree of Perdition would be a 2/9 creature (its toughness became 7, which was then modified by Cultist’s Staff) and the player’s life total would be 15.'}, {'date': '2016-07-13', 'text': 'If Tree of Perdition isn’t on the battlefield when the ability resolves, the exchange can’t happen and the ability will have no effect. Notably, activating the ability and giving Tree of Perdition -13/-13 in response won’t cause your opponent to lose the game.'}, {'date': '2016-07-13', 'text': 'When the ability resolves, Tree of Perdition’s toughness becomes the targeted opponent’s former life total and that player gains or loses an amount of life necessary so that their life total equals Tree of Perdition’s former toughness. Other effects that interact with life gain or life loss will interact with this effect accordingly.'}]", "[{'date': '2016-07-13', 'text': 'Discarding a card and sacrificing a creature are both part of Ruthless Disposal’s cost. You can’t discard or sacrifice more to target more creatures, and you can’t cast Ruthless Disposal at all if you don’t have any other cards in hand or if you control no creatures.'}, {'date': '2016-07-13', 'text': 'If one targeted creature becomes an illegal target, the other will still get -13/-13 until end of turn.'}, {'date': '2016-07-13', 'text': 'Once you begin to cast Ruthless Disposal, no player may take actions until you’re done. Notably, opponents can’t try to remove the creature you wish to sacrifice.'}, {'date': '2016-07-13', 'text': 'There’s no way to discard a creature card with madness, cast it, and sacrifice it to pay for both of Ruthless Disposal’s additional costs.'}, {'date': '2016-07-13', 'text': 'You can’t target one creature twice to give it -26/-26.'}, {'date': '2016-07-13', 'text': 'You must target exactly two creatures to cast Ruthless Disposal. However, one of the targets can be the creature you intend to sacrifice to pay Ruthless Disposal’s cost.'}]", "[{'date': '2016-07-13', 'text': 'If Gavony Unhallowed and another creature you control die simultaneously (perhaps because they were both attacking or blocking), Gavony Unhallowed won’t be on the battlefield as its triggered ability resolves. It can’t be saved by the +1/+1 counter that would have been put on it.'}]", "[{'date': '2016-07-13', 'text': 'If Skirsdag Supplicant’s ability causes each player’s life total to become 0 or less, the game ends in a draw.'}, {'date': '2016-07-13', 'text': 'In a Two-Headed Giant game, Skirsdag Supplicant’s ability causes each player to lose 2 life, so each team loses a total of 4 life.'}]", "[{'date': '2016-07-13', 'text': 'If the creature becomes an illegal target for Certain Death, no player gains or loses life. If it’s a legal target but isn’t destroyed, most likely due to having indestructible, its controller still loses 2 life and you gain 2 life.'}, {'date': '2016-07-13', 'text': 'The targeted creature will have already left the battlefield before its controller loses 2 life and you gain 2 life. If it has any abilities that care about gaining or losing life, they won’t apply.'}]", "[{'date': '2016-07-13', 'text': 'If the targeted creature becomes an illegal target before Drag Under resolves, you won’t draw a card.'}]", "[{'date': '2016-07-13', 'text': 'If you target a Zombie card in your graveyard, drawing a card is an additional bonus. It doesn’t replace returning the Zombie card to your hand.'}]", "[{'date': '2016-07-13', 'text': 'The ability applies only while Liliana’s Elite is on the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2016-08-23', 'text': 'Once Sinuous Vermin has been legally blocked by one creature, activating the monstrosity ability to give it menace won’t change or undo that block.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "After the creature returns to the battlefield, it will be a new object with no connection to the creature that was exiled. It won\'t be in combat or have any additional abilities it may have had before it was exiled. Any +1/+1 counters on it or Auras attached to it are removed, and any Equipment will no longer be attached."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "If a creature token is exiled this way, it will cease to exist and won\'t return to the battlefield."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "Auras attached to the exiled creature will be put into their owners\' graveyards. Equipment attached to the exiled creature will become unattached and remain on the battlefield. Any counters on the exiled creature will cease to exist."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "If a creature token is exiled this way, it will cease to exist and won\'t return to the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "Wispweaver Angel\'s triggered ability can target another Wispweaver Angel. If so, the two Angels can loop in and out of exile as many times as you\'d like before you choose to target another creature or not to use the triggered ability."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "Gearseeker Serpent\'s first ability can\'t reduce the total cost to cast the spell below {U}{U}."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "Once Gearseeker Serpent has been blocked, activating its last ability won\'t cause it to become unblocked."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "Once a player has announced that they are casting Gearseeker Serpent, no player may take actions to try to change the number of artifacts its controller controls before the spell\'s cost is locked in."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': \'The total cost to cast Gearseeker Serpent is locked in before you pay that cost. For example, if you control three artifacts, including one you can sacrifice to add {C} to your mana pool, the total cost of Gearseeker Serpent is {2}{U}{U}. Then you can sacrifice the artifact when you activate mana abilities just before paying the cost.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "In a Two-Headed Giant game, Reckless Fireweaver\'s ability causes 2 damage total to be dealt to the opposing team."}]', "[{'date': '2016-09-20', 'text': 'An artifact creature gains indestructible in addition to getting +2/+2, not instead of it.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': \'If a card in exile has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': \'If a land card is exiled this way, you can play that land card until end of turn if you have any available land plays.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "Spark of Creativity doesn\'t change when you can play the exiled card. For example, if you exile a creature card without flash, you can cast it only during your main phase when the stack is empty."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "You can\'t cast Spark of Creativity without targeting a creature. If the creature becomes an illegal target for Spark of Creativity, none of its effects happen. You don\'t exile the top card of your library."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': \'You must pay all costs to play the exiled card. You may pay alternative or additional costs. If the card has any mandatory additional costs, you must pay those.\'}]', "[{'date': '2016-09-20', 'text': 'Kujar Seedsculptor can be the target of its own triggered ability.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "All eight of the permanents sharing a name must be artifacts. If you control only seven artifacts with the same name and a nonartifact permanent with that same name, you won\'t win the game."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "Any abilities that trigger on the token being created won\'t resolve until after Mechanized Production\'s triggered ability has finished resolving entirely and performed its check for eight artifacts with the same name."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': \'Any enters-the-battlefield abilities of the copied artifact trigger when the artifact token enters the battlefield. The artifact token also has any "this enters the battlefield with" or "as this enters the battlefield" abilities that the copied artifact has.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "If Mechanized Production and the enchanted artifact leave the battlefield simultaneously in response to the triggered ability, then the effect creates a token that\'s a copy of the artifact as it last existed on the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': \'If the copied artifact has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be zero.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "If the copied artifact is a token, the token that\'s created copies the original characteristics of that token as stated by the effect that created it."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': \'If the copied artifact is copying something else (for example, if the copied artifact is a Sculpting Steel), then the token enters the battlefield as whatever that artifact copied.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "If the enchanted artifact leaves the battlefield in response to Mechanized Production\'s triggered ability but Mechanized Production does not, Mechanized Production is put into its owner\'s graveyard as a state-based action with no enchanted artifact. The triggered ability creates no token, but you can still win the game if you control enough artifacts with the same name."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "If you control eight or more artifacts that share a name while you control Mechanized Production, you won\'t win the game yet. You\'ll win the game while resolving its triggered ability during your upkeep."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "The eight artifacts with the same name don\'t have to have the same name as the enchanted artifact. For example, you win the game if you control eight Thopter artifact creature tokens as Mechanized Production\'s ability resolves, even if Mechanized Production isn\'t attached to a Thopter."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "The token copies exactly what was printed on the original artifact and nothing else (unless that artifact is copying something else or is a token; see below). It doesn\'t copy whether that artifact is tapped or untapped, whether it has any counters on it or Auras attached to it, or any non-copy effects that have changed its types, color, or so on."}]', "[{'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'After the enchanted creature is exiled, Caught in the Brights is put into its owner’s graveyard.'}, {'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'If Caught in the Brights leaves the battlefield in response to its triggered ability, the resolving ability will exile the creature Caught in the Brights was enchanting as it left the battlefield.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': \'Although Ragavan is attacking, it was never declared as an attacking creature (for the purposes of abilities that trigger whenever a creature attacks, for example).\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': \'The delayed triggered ability that exiles Ragavan triggers at end of combat even if Kari Zev is no longer on the battlefield.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "You choose which opponent or opposing planeswalker Ragavan is attacking as you create the token. It doesn\'t have to be the same player or planeswalker Kari Zev is attacking."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': \'Any enters-the-battlefield abilities of the copied artifact will trigger when the token enters the battlefield. Any “as [this artifact] enters the battlefield” or “[this artifact] enters the battlefield with” abilities of the chosen artifact will also work.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': \'If the copied artifact has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': \'If the copied artifact is a token, the token created with Cogwork Assembler copies the original characteristics of that token as stated by the effect that that created that token.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': \'If the copied artifact is copying something else (for example, if the copied artifact is a Sculpting Steel), then the token enters the battlefield as whatever that artifact copied.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "The token copies exactly what was printed on the original artifact and nothing else (unless that artifact is copying something else or is a token; see below). It doesn\'t copy whether that artifact is tapped or untapped, whether it has any counters on it or Auras and Equipment attached to it, or any non-copy effects that have changed its power, toughness, types, color, or so on."}]', "[{'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'If Aerial Modification becomes unattached from a Vehicle that’s attacking or blocking, that Vehicle will be removed from combat unless another effect (such as its crew ability) is also making it a creature.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'If the target permanent becomes an illegal target, Leave in the Dust doesn’t resolve and none of its effects happen. You won’t draw a card.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-02-09', 'text': 'You can’t cast Hungry Flames unless you target both a creature and a player. If one target is illegal as Hungry Flames resolves, the spell deals damage to the remaining legal target.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2017-03-14\', \'text\': "If Falkenrath Noble and another creature die at the same time, Falkenrath Noble\'s triggered ability will trigger for each of them."}]', "[{'date': '2017-03-14', 'text': 'Crippling Chill can target a creature that’s already tapped. It still won’t untap during its controller’s next untap step.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': "A creature that is a Zombie and has other types, such as a Zombie Jackal, isn\'t a non-Zombie creature."}]', "[{'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'A spell or ability that counters spells can still target a creature spell you control. When that spell or ability resolves, the creature spell won’t be countered, but any additional effects of that spell or ability will still happen.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'A split card only counts once for Cryptic Serpent’s ability, even if it’s both an instant and a sorcery.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Cryptic Serpent’s ability can’t reduce its cost to less than {U}{U}.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Cryptic Serpent’s ability doesn’t change its mana cost or converted mana cost. It just reduces the cost to cast the spell.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Activated abilities contain a colon. They’re generally written “[Cost]: [Effect].” Some keyword abilities are activated abilities and will have colons in their reminder text. Triggered abilities (starting with “when,” “whenever,” or “at”) are unaffected by the last ability of Edifice of Authority. Notably, exerting a creature isn’t an activated ability.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Edifice of Authority can’t be used to undo an attack or block once it has been declared. Its abilities must be activated no later than the beginning of combat step to stop a creature from attacking, and no later than the declare attackers step to stop a creature from blocking.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Once a player has announced that they are activating the ability of a creature, Edifice of Authority can’t be used to undo it. Its last ability must be activated before the player activates that creature’s ability. The player may respond to Edifice of Authority’s ability with the target creature’s ability if able.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'All other Cats you control get +1/+1 and have lifelink, not just those created by Regal Caracal’s last ability.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'multiple instances of lifelink on the same creature are redundant.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'An ability that triggers whenever you discard a card doesn’t give you permission to discard cards. You’ll need another effect that instructs or allows you to discard them.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'An ability that triggers whenever you “cycle or discard” a card triggers only once if you cycle a card. The ability “Whenever you discard a card” is functionally identical to this ability; cycling is mentioned for clarity.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If a player discards a card during their cleanup step due to having too many cards in hand, any appropriate abilities that trigger on discarding that card trigger. If this happens, those triggered abilities are put onto the stack and players receive priority in that cleanup step to cast spells or activate abilities (normally, no players may take actions during a cleanup step). Another cleanup step is created following that one.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Some cards have an ability that triggers whenever you cycle any card. These triggered abilities resolve before you draw from the cycling ability.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Any change to a land’s type or abilities gained by a land can affect the types of mana a land can produce.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Naga Vitalist checks the effects of all mana-producing abilities of lands you control, but it doesn’t check their costs or legality. For example, Spire of Industry says “{T}, Pay 1 life: Add one mana of any color to your mana pool. Activate this ability only if you control an artifact.” If you control Spire of Industry and Naga Vitalist, you can tap Naga Vitalist for any color of mana. It doesn’t matter whether you control an artifact, whether you can pay 1 life, or whether Spire of Industry is untapped.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Naga Vitalist doesn’t care about any restrictions or riders your lands put on the mana they produce, such as the one Cavern of Souls has. It just cares about types of mana.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'The types of mana are white, blue, black, red, green, and colorless.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Desert is a land subtype with no special meaning. It doesn’t grant the land an intrinsic mana ability. Other cards may care about which lands are Deserts.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Gaining control of a creature doesn’t cause you to gain control of any Auras or Equipment attached to it. They’ll remain attached, but an Aura’s effect that affects “you” still affects its controller rather than you, the controller of an Equipment can move it during their next main phase, and so on.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Once Rhonas has attacked or blocked, it will remain in combat even if you no longer control another creature with power 4 or greater.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'You don’t have to attack with another creature with power 4 or greater for Rhonas to be able to attack. The same is true of blocking.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Some cards with cycling have an ability that triggers when you cycle them. These triggered abilities resolve before you draw from the cycling ability.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Triggered abilities from cycling a card and the cycling ability itself aren’t spells. Effects that interact with spells (such as that of Cancel) won’t affect them.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'You can cycle a card even if it has a triggered ability from cycling that won’t have a legal target. This is because the cycling ability and the triggered ability are separate. This also means that if either ability doesn’t resolve (due to being countered with Disallow, for example, or if the triggered ability’s targets have become illegal), the other ability will still resolve.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'Quarry Beetle’s ability doesn’t count as playing a land. It can return a land card to the battlefield even if you’ve already played as many lands as able this turn.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'The other Zombie doesn’t have to block.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'Whether you control another Zombie is checked only as you declare blockers. Marauding Boneslasher won’t stop blocking if you don’t control one later.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'You don’t choose which land to return to its owner’s hand or whether to discard a card instead until you see the two cards you draw.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2017-08-25\', \'text\': \'"Artifact" isn\\\'t a creature type.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-08-25\', \'text\': "Compare the revealed cards to the creature as it last existed before it died, not to the creature card as it exists in its owner\'s graveyard, to determine which one you put into your hand."}, {\'date\': \'2017-08-25\', \'text\': \'If Heirloom Blade leaves the battlefield at the same time that the equipped creature dies, its triggered ability triggers.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-08-25\', \'text\': \'If the equipped creature has no creature type, no card can share a creature type with it.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-08-25\', \'text\': "If you don\'t reveal a creature card that shares a type with the creature that died, you\'ll just reveal and randomize your library."}, {\'date\': \'2017-08-25\', \'text\': "You\'ll reveal cards until you find one that shares at least one creature type with the creature that died. For example, if a Cat Wizard dies, you\'ll stop if you reveal a Human Wizard or Cat Soldier."}]', "[{'date': '2017-08-25', 'text': 'Balan’s activated ability has no timing restriction. You can activate it any time you have priority.'}, {'date': '2017-08-25', 'text': 'If Balan deals first-strike damage and then gains double strike (most likely because it picked up some Equipment with its activated ability after first-strike damage was dealt), it will also deal regular combat damage.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2017-09-29\', \'text\': "Captain Lannery Storm\'s last ability triggers whenever you sacrifice a Treasure for any reason, not just to activate a Treasure\'s mana ability."}, {\'date\': \'2017-09-29\', \'text\': "If you sacrifice Treasures to cast Captain Lannery Storm, its last ability won\'t trigger for those Treasures."}, {\'date\': \'2017-09-29\', \'text\': \'You can activate the mana ability of a Treasure even if you have nothing to spend that mana on.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-09-29\', \'text\': \'Any untapped creature you control can be tapped to pay a crew cost, even one that just came under your control.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-09-29\', \'text\': "Creatures that crew a Vehicle aren\'t attached to it or related in any other way. Effects that affect the Vehicle, such as by destroying it or giving it a +1/+1 counter, don\'t affect the creatures that crewed it."}, {\'date\': \'2017-09-29\', \'text\': "Each Vehicle is printed with a power and toughness, but it\'s not a creature. If it becomes a creature (most likely through its crew ability), it will have that power and toughness."}, {\'date\': \'2017-09-29\', \'text\': \'For a Vehicle to be able to attack, it must be a creature as the declare attackers step begins, so the latest you can activate its crew ability to attack with it is during the beginning of combat step. For a Vehicle to be able to block, it must be a creature as the declare blockers step begins, so the latest you can activate its crew ability to block with it is during the declare attackers step. In either case, players may take actions after the crew ability resolves but before the Vehicle has been declared as an attacking or blocking creature.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-09-29\', \'text\': "If a permanent becomes a copy of a Vehicle, the copy won\'t be a creature, even if the Vehicle it\'s copying has become an artifact creature."}, {\'date\': \'2017-09-29\', \'text\': "If an effect causes a Vehicle to become an artifact creature with a specified power and toughness, that effect overwrites the Vehicle\'s printed power and toughness."}, {\'date\': \'2017-09-29\', \'text\': "Once a Vehicle becomes a creature, it behaves exactly like any other artifact creature. It can\'t attack unless you\'ve controlled it continuously since your turn began, it can block if it\'s untapped, it can be tapped to pay a Vehicle\'s crew cost, and so on."}, {\'date\': \'2017-09-29\', \'text\': "Once a player announces that they are activating a crew ability, no player may take other actions until the ability has been paid for. Notably, players can\'t try to stop the ability by changing a creature\'s power or by removing or tapping a creature."}, {\'date\': \'2017-09-29\', \'text\': "Vehicle is an artifact type, not a creature type. A Vehicle that\'s crewed won\'t normally have any creature type."}, {\'date\': \'2017-09-29\', \'text\': "When a Vehicle becomes a creature, that doesn\'t count as having a creature enter the battlefield. The permanent was already on the battlefield; it only changed its types. Abilities that trigger whenever a creature enters the battlefield won\'t trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2017-09-29\', \'text\': "You may activate a crew ability of a Vehicle even if it\'s already an artifact creature. Doing so has no effect on the Vehicle. It doesn\'t change its power and toughness."}, {\'date\': \'2017-09-29\', \'text\': \'You may tap more creatures than necessary to activate a crew ability.\'}]', "[{'date': '2017-09-29', 'text': 'Each opponent only has to attack you or a planeswalker you control with one creature total, not one creature for you and one for each planeswalker you control. Other creatures are free to attack other players or other planeswalkers, or to not attack at all.'}, {'date': '2017-09-29', 'text': 'If a creature isn’t able to attack you or a planeswalker you control for any reason (such as being tapped as its controller’s declare attackers step begins or being affected by “summoning sickness”), that creature doesn’t have to attack. If no creatures a player controls are able to attack you or a planeswalker you control, Trove of Temptation’s requirement has no effect during that combat. If there’s a cost associated with having a creature attack, its controller isn’t forced to pay that cost, so it doesn’t have to attack in that case either.'}, {'date': '2017-09-29', 'text': 'In a Two-Headed Giant game, each of your two opponents must attack you or a planeswalker you control with at least one creature if able. Attacking your teammate or a planeswalker your teammate controls doesn’t satisfy Trove of Temptation’s requirement.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-09-29', 'text': 'If a permanent has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0.'}, {'date': '2017-09-29', 'text': 'If the target permanent is an illegal target by the time Perilous Voyage resolves, the entire spell doesn’t resolve. You won’t scry.'}, {'date': '2017-09-29', 'text': 'Use the permanent’s converted mana cost as it existed on the battlefield to determine whether you scry.'}, {'date': '2018-01-19', 'text': 'There are many important moments in the story, but the most crucial—called “story spotlights”—are shown on cards. These cards have the Planeswalker symbol in their text box; this symbol has no effect on gameplay. You can read more about these events in the official Magic fiction at http://www.mtgstory.com.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-09-29', 'text': 'If either or both targets are illegal when Pounce tries to resolve, no creature will deal or be dealt damage.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-09-29', 'text': 'Once you announce that you’re casting Lookout’s Dispersal, no player may take other actions until the spell’s been paid for. Notably, players can’t try to raise the spell’s cost by removing your Pirates.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-09-29', 'text': 'Storm Sculptor’s last ability doesn’t target the creature you’ll return to hand. You choose one as the ability resolves. No player may take actions between the time you choose a creature to return and the time you do so.'}, {'date': '2017-09-29', 'text': 'Storm Sculptor’s last ability isn’t optional. If Storm Sculptor is the only creature you control when the ability resolves, you’ll have to return it to its owner’s hand.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-09-29', 'text': 'Watertrap Weaver’s ability can target a creature that’s already tapped. That creature won’t untap during its controller’s next untap step.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'A creature dealt damage by Pillar of Flame that dies this turn will be exiled even if it wasn’t the target of Pillar of Flame (because the damage was redirected somehow). If the target creature isn’t dealt damage (most likely because the damage was prevented), it won’t be exiled if it dies that turn.'}, {'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'A creature dealt damage by Pillar of Flame will be exiled no matter why the creature would die that turn. It could have its toughness reduced to 0 or less or be destroyed by another spell or ability.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'The loss of life isn’t a cost. If the target creature is an illegal target when Ulcerate tries to resolve, it won’t resolve and none of its effects will happen. You won’t lose any life.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'You must be able to target another spell to cast Condescend. Condescend can’t target itself.'}, {'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'You scry 2 even if the spell’s controller pays {X}.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2018-01-19\', \'text\': "If Seafloor Oracle is dealt lethal damage at the same time a Merfolk you control deals combat damage to a player, you\'ll draw a card."}]', "[{'date': '2018-01-19', 'text': 'Activating the last ability of Aquatic Incursion after a Merfolk has become blocked won’t cause it to become unblocked.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2018-01-19\', \'text\': \'Casting Oathsworn Vampire from your graveyard follows the normal rules for casting that card. You must pay its costs, and you must follow all applicable timing rules.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-01-19\', \'text\': "Oathsworn Vampire\'s last ability cares only whether you gained life in the turn, even if Oathsworn Vampire wasn\'t in your graveyard when that happened. It doesn\'t care how much you gained, whether you also lost life, or even whether you lost more life than you gained."}]', "[{'date': '2018-01-19', 'text': 'If the target creature is an illegal target by the time Crashing Tide tries to resolve, the spell doesn’t resolve. You won’t draw a card.'}, {'date': '2018-01-19', 'text': 'Once you announce that you’re casting Crashing Tide, players can’t try to remove your Merfolk to make it lose flash until you’re done casting it. If it loses flash after it’s been cast, it will still resolve if able.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-01-19', 'text': 'If the target creature is an illegal target by the time Moment of Craving tries to resolve, the spell doesn’t resolve. You won’t gain 2 life.'}, {'date': '2018-01-19', 'text': 'The target creature will still be on the battlefield when you gain life, even if its toughness has been reduced to 0 or less. Any abilities it has that interact with gaining life do so as appropriate. If any abilities trigger on you gaining life, the creature will be put into its owner’s graveyard after that ability triggers but before it resolves.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-01-19', 'text': 'If the target creature is an illegal target by the time Moment of Triumph tries to resolve, the spell doesn’t resolve. You won’t gain 2 life.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-01-19', 'text': 'Raid abilities care only that you attacked with a creature. It doesn’t matter how many creatures you attacked with, or which opponent or planeswalker controlled by an opponent those creatures attacked.'}, {'date': '2018-01-19', 'text': 'Raid abilities evaluate the entire turn to see if you attacked with a creature. That creature doesn’t have to still be on the battlefield. Similarly, the player or planeswalker it attacked doesn’t have to still be in the game or on the battlefield, respectively.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': "All Wolves you control are tapped as part of the activated ability\'s effect, not as a cost. Players may respond by attempting to tap or untap Wolves, or to create or remove them."}, {\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': "If the target creature is an illegal target by the time Master of the Wild Hunt\'s ability tries to resolve, the ability doesn\'t resolve. You won\'t tap your Wolves, and nothing will deal or be dealt damage."}, {\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': "Only a Wolf creature tapped as part of the ability\'s effect can be dealt damage by the target creature."}, {\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': "The controller of the target creature doesn\'t divide that creature\'s damage as the ability is activated (since the Wolves that will receive that damage aren\'t targeted), so that player does so as the ability resolves. There is no time to react between the time a Wolf is chosen, the time damage is dealt to it, and the time it\'s destroyed for having been dealt lethal damage. If you want to put a regeneration shield on one of those Wolves, or target it with a damage-prevention spell, or anything else, you must do so before the ability resolves (and before you know which Wolves will be chosen and how much damage will be dealt to them)."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': "Assembly-Worker\'s ability can target any creature with the Assembly-Worker subtype, not only creatures named Assembly-Worker."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': "Frenzied Goblin\'s ability has only one target. You can\'t pay {R} multiple times to stop multiple creatures from blocking."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': "If each player has 13 life as Triskaidekaphobia\'s ability resolves, the game ends in a draw."}, {\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': "If you choose Triskaidekaphobia\'s second mode and begin to resolve it while an opponent\'s life total is 13 and your life total is 1, that opponent will lose the game before you lose 1 life."}, {\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': "In a Two-Headed Giant game, each team with 13 life loses the game, then each player on each team gains or loses 1 life, causing the team\'s life total to go up or down by 2."}, {\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': \'You can choose a mode even if no player will lose the game. Players will still gain or lose life as appropriate.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': "Self-Assembler\'s ability can find any creature card with the Assembly-Worker subtype, not only creature cards named Assembly-Worker. Notably, it can\'t find Mishra\'s Factory."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': \'A mana cost of {X}{X} means that you pay twice X. If you want X to be 3, you pay {8}{W}{W} to cast Decree of Justice.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-12-08\', \'text\': "The cycling ability and the triggered ability are separate. If the triggered ability doesn\'t resolve (because, for example, it has been countered, or all of its targets have become illegal), the cycling ability will still resolve, and you\'ll draw a card."}, {\'date\': \'2022-12-08\', \'text\': \'When you cycle this card, first the cycling ability goes on the stack, then the triggered ability goes on the stack on top of it. The triggered ability will resolve before you draw a card from the cycling ability.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-04-27\', \'text\': "A creature with first strike and double strike deals combat damage the same as a creature with double strike. It doesn\'t deal damage three times or before other creatures with first strike."}, {\'date\': \'2018-04-27\', \'text\': "If a creature loses double strike after first strike damage is dealt, it won\'t deal normal combat damage."}, {\'date\': \'2018-04-27\', \'text\': \'If a creature you control gains first strike after Kwende has entered the battlefield, that creature also gains double strike.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-04-27\', \'text\': "If you control more than one Wizard, Academy Journeymage\'s cost is reduced by only {1}."}, {\'date\': \'2018-04-27\', \'text\': "Once you announce that you\'re casting Academy Journeymage, no player may take other actions until the spell\'s been paid for. Notably, players can\'t try to raise the spell\'s cost by removing your Wizards."}]', "[{'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'As Warcry Phoenix returns to the battlefield because of its triggered ability, you choose which opponent or opposing planeswalker it’s attacking. It doesn’t have to attack the same opponent or opposing planeswalker as your other attacking creatures.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'If Warcry Phoenix enters the battlefield attacking, it wasn’t declared as an attacking creature that turn. Abilities that trigger when a creature attacks won’t trigger.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'Broken Bond’s effect doesn’t count as playing a land. It can put a land card onto the battlefield even if you’ve already played your land for the turn.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'If the target artifact or enchantment is an illegal target by the time Broken Bond tries to resolve, the spell doesn’t resolve. You won’t put a land card onto the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'You can’t cast Broken Bond unless you choose an artifact or enchantment as a target.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'Goblin Warchief’s effect reduces only generic mana in the cost of Goblin spells you cast. For example, it doesn’t reduce the cost of Skirk Prospector below {R}.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'If each creature the defending player controls can’t block for any reason (such as being tapped), then Gaea’s Protector isn’t blocked. If there’s a cost associated with blocking Gaea’s Protector, the defending player isn’t forced to pay that cost, so it doesn’t have to be blocked in that case either.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'Only one creature is required to block Gaea’s Protector. Other creatures may also block it, and are free to block other creatures or not block at all.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'The defending player, not you, chooses which creature blocks Gaea’s Protector.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'If the target creature is an illegal target by the time Fungal Infection tries to resolve, the spell doesn’t resolve. You won’t create a Saproling token.'}, {'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'The target creature will be on the battlefield when you create the Saproling token, even if it’s about to die for having 0 toughness or lethal damage. Its abilities may affect the token’s creation or trigger when the token enters the battlefield. Abilities that trigger this way will resolve after the target creature has died.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-06-08', 'text': 'Inner Demon’s triggered ability affects only non-Demon creatures on the battlefield at the time it resolves. Creatures that enter the battlefield later in the turn won’t get -2/-2. Unless Inner Demon leaves the battlefield before that ability resolves, the enchanted creature won’t get -2/-2.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "Goreclaw\'s last ability affects only creatures you control with the appropriate power at the time it resolves. Creatures you begin to control later in the turn won\'t get either bonus, and a creature you control whose power decreases later in the turn won\'t lose either bonus."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "If another creature has an ability that changes its power when it attacks, such as Brawl-Bash Ogre, you may have that ability resolve before Goreclaw\'s last ability."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "If you cast a creature spell that will enter the battlefield with a number of +1/+1 counters, such as Hungering Hydra, those counters aren\'t considered when determining whether Goreclaw reduces that spell\'s cost. Similarly, effects that will raise the creature\'s power once it has entered the battlefield won\'t apply."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "If enough -1/-1 counters are put on Bloodtracker at the same time to make its toughness 0 or less, the number of +1/+1 counters on it before it got any -1/-1 counters will be used to determine how many cards you draw. For example, if there are three +1/+1 counters on Bloodtracker and it gets six -1/-1 counters, you\'ll draw three cards. That\'s because Bloodtracker\'s triggered ability checks the creature\'s existence just before it leaves the battlefield, and it still has all those counters on it at that point."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "If you don\'t control a creature with power 4 or greater as Colossal Majesty\'s ability resolves, you won\'t draw a card."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "If you don\'t control a creature with power 4 or greater as your upkeep begins, Colossal Majesty\'s ability won\'t trigger. You can\'t take any actions during your turn before your upkeep begins."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "The creature with power 4 or greater that you control as Colossal Majesty\'s ability resolves doesn\'t have to be the same creature with power 4 or greater that was under your control as the ability triggered."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': \'You draw only one card, no matter how many creatures with power 4 or greater you control.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "Once a creature with power 2 or less has blocked a creature, activating Ghirapur Guide\'s ability won\'t change or undo that block."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "Once a creature with power 3 or greater has blocked the target creature, changing the power of the blocking creature won\'t change or undo that block."}]', "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Although the tokens are attacking, they were never declared as attacking creatures (for the purposes of abilities that trigger whenever a creature attacks, for example).'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'You choose which players or planeswalkers the two tokens are attacking. They don’t have to be attacking the same player or planeswalker that Leonin Warleader is attacking, and they can each be attacking different players and/or planeswalkers.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Any enters-the-battlefield abilities of the copied creature will trigger when Mirror Image enters the battlefield. Any “as [this creature] enters the battlefield” or “[this creature] enters the battlefield with” abilities of the chosen creature will also work.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If Mirror Image somehow enters the battlefield at the same time as another creature, it can’t become a copy of that creature. You may choose only a creature that’s already on the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If the chosen creature is a token, Mirror Image copies the original characteristics of that token as stated by the effect that put the token onto the battlefield. Mirror Image doesn’t become a token in this case.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If the chosen creature is copying something else (for example, if the chosen creature is another Mirror Image), then Mirror Image enters the battlefield as whatever the chosen creature copied.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If the copied creature has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Mirror Image copies exactly what was printed on the original creature (unless that creature is copying something else or is a token; see below). It doesn’t copy whether that creature is tapped or untapped, whether it as any counters on it or any Auras and Equipment attached to it, or any non-copy effects that have changed its power, toughness, types, color, or so on.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Banefire can be targeted by spells that try to counter it regardless of what the value of X is. If X is 5 or more, those spells will still resolve, but the part of their effect that would counter Banefire won’t do anything. Any other effects those spells have will work as normal.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If its target is illegal by the time Banefire tries to resolve, the spell isn’t countered, but it doesn’t resolve. The target won’t be dealt damage.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'To determine whether it can be countered and its damage can be prevented, Banefire checks the number you chose for X, not the amount of mana you actually spent or the amount of damage it will actually deal.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If a creature the defending player controls can’t block the target creature for any reason (such as being tapped), then it doesn’t block that creature. If there’s a cost associated with having a creature block the attacking creature, the defending player isn’t forced to pay that cost, so it doesn’t have to block in that case either.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If a spell has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it without paying its mana cost.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If the revealed card is a land, you can play it only if it’s your turn and you haven’t yet played a land this turn.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If you cast a spell “without paying its mana cost,” you can’t choose to cast it for any alternative costs. You can, however, pay additional costs, such as kicker costs. If the card has any mandatory additional costs, such as that of Tormenting Voice, those must be paid to cast the card.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If you wish to play the exiled card, you must play it while the last ability of Djinn of Wishes is resolving. You can’t play it later in the turn. A spell cast this way may be cast at a time you normally wouldn’t be able to cast a spell of that type, but other restrictions (such as “Cast this spell only during combat”) are enforced.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If you put a permanent onto the battlefield with Tezzeret’s emblem’s ability, any triggered abilities of that permanent that trigger during your end step won’t trigger during that same end step.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Players can respond only after Demon of Catastrophes has been cast and all its costs have been paid. No one can try to destroy the creature you sacrificed to prevent you from casting this spell.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'You must sacrifice exactly one creature to cast Demon of Catastrophes; you can’t cast it without sacrificing a creature, and you can’t sacrifice additional creatures.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'The number of Goblins you control is counted only as Volley Veteran’s ability resolves. If Volley Veteran is still on the battlefield, it will count itself.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'You must discard exactly one card to cast Tormenting Voice; you can’t cast it without discarding a card, and you can’t discard additional cards.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2018-10-05\', \'text\': "As Plaguecrafter\'s ability resolves, first the player whose turn it is chooses a creature or planeswalker they control, then each other player in turn order does the same, knowing the choices made before them. Then all the chosen permanents are sacrificed at the same time. Next, each player in the same order who couldn\'t sacrifice a permanent chooses a card in hand without revealing it, then the chosen cards are discarded at the same time."}, {\'date\': \'2018-10-05\', \'text\': "Each player chooses a permanent to sacrifice from among the creatures and planeswalkers they control. You don\'t choose which type of permanent any other player has to sacrifice."}, {\'date\': \'2018-10-05\', \'text\': "Plaguecrafter can be the creature its controller sacrifices for its own ability. Don\'t be like Plaguecrafter; always wear personal protective equipment when performing dangerous work."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-10-05\', \'text\': "Dawn of Hope\'s first ability triggers just once for each life-gaining event, whether it\'s 1 life from Vicious Rumors or 3 life from Creeping Chill."}, {\'date\': \'2018-10-05\', \'text\': "Each creature with lifelink dealing combat damage causes a separate life-gaining event. For example, if two creatures you control with lifelink deal combat damage at the same time, Dawn of Hope\'s ability will trigger twice. However, if a single creature you control with lifelink deals combat damage to multiple creatures, players, and/or planeswalkers at the same time (perhaps because it has trample or was blocked by more than one creature), the ability will trigger only once."}, {\'date\': \'2018-10-05\', \'text\': \'If you gain an amount of life "for each" of something, that life is gained as one event and Dawn of Hope\\\'s first ability triggers only once.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-10-05\', \'text\': "In a Two-Headed Giant game, life gained by your teammate won\'t cause the ability to trigger, even though it caused your team\'s life total to increase."}, {\'date\': \'2018-10-05\', \'text\': "You can\'t pay {2} multiple times to draw more than one card each time you resolve Dawn of Hope\'s triggered ability."}]', "[{'date': '2018-10-05', 'text': 'Because tokens aren’t cards, they never count for undergrowth abilities.'}, {'date': '2018-10-05', 'text': 'Creature cards with other types, such as artifact creature cards, count for undergrowth abilities.'}, {'date': '2018-10-05', 'text': 'If there are no creature cards in your graveyard, the target creature just gains menace until end of turn.'}, {'date': '2018-10-05', 'text': 'The value of X is determined only as the undergrowth ability resolves. If the number of creature cards in your graveyard changes later in the turn, the target creature is unaffected.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-10-05', 'text': 'Because tokens aren’t cards, they never count for undergrowth abilities.'}, {'date': '2018-10-05', 'text': 'Creature cards with other types, such as artifact creature cards, count for undergrowth abilities.'}, {'date': '2018-10-05', 'text': 'If you choose a target and the target creature is an illegal target when Kraul Harpooner’s ability tries to resolve, the ability doesn’t resolve and Kraul Harpooner doesn’t get +X/+0. If the target creature is legal but Kraul Harpooner is no longer on the battlefield, the target creature won’t deal or be dealt damage.'}, {'date': '2018-10-05', 'text': 'If you don’t choose a target creature, Kraul Harpooner simply gets +X/+0 until end of turn.'}, {'date': '2018-10-05', 'text': 'The value of X is determined only as the undergrowth ability resolves. If the number of creature cards in your graveyard changes later in the turn, Kraul Harpooner is unaffected.'}, {'date': '2018-10-05', 'text': 'You choose the target of the triggered ability (or that it has no target) as it goes on the stack, but you choose whether the creatures fight as that ability resolves.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-10-05', 'text': 'Because tokens aren’t cards, they never count for undergrowth abilities.'}, {'date': '2018-10-05', 'text': 'Creature cards with other types, such as artifact creature cards, count for undergrowth abilities.'}, {'date': '2018-10-05', 'text': 'If you have no creature cards in your graveyard, the target creature gets -0/-0, and it will still be exiled if it would die this turn.'}, {'date': '2018-10-05', 'text': 'Necrotic Wound’s replacement effect will exile the target creature if it would die this turn for any reason, not just immediately after Necrotic Wound resolves.'}, {'date': '2018-10-05', 'text': 'The value of X is determined only as the undergrowth ability resolves. If the number of creature cards in your graveyard changes later in the turn, the target creature is unaffected.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-10-05', 'text': 'Because tokens aren’t cards, they never count for undergrowth abilities.'}, {'date': '2018-10-05', 'text': 'Creature cards with other types, such as artifact creature cards, count for undergrowth abilities.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-10-05', 'text': 'You may choose Ironshell Beetle as the target of its own ability.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2018-12-07\', \'text\': "In a Two-Headed Giant game, Thermo-Alchemist\'s activated ability causes the opposing team to lose 2 life."}, {\'date\': \'2018-12-07\', \'text\': "Thermo-Alchemist\'s triggered ability resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger. It resolves even if that spell is countered. Players can cast spells and activate abilities (such as Thermo-Alchemist\'s own activated ability) after the triggered ability resolves but before the spell that caused it to trigger does."}]', "[{'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'For Emancipation Angel’s triggered ability, the permanent to return is chosen as the ability resolves. No player may take actions between the time you choose the permanent and the time it’s returned to its owner’s hand.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'If Emancipation Angel is still on the battlefield as its triggered ability resolves, you may return Emancipation Angel itself.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'If either target is an illegal target as Prey Upon resolves, no creature will deal or be dealt damage.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'No player may take actions between the time the creature returns to the battlefield and the time you put a +1/+1 counter on it.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'The creature returns to the battlefield without a +1/+1 counter on it. Any abilities that trigger when a creature enters the battlefield will trigger or not as appropriate before it receives the +1/+1 counter and resolve after it has received that counter.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-01-25', 'text': 'If a token is exiled this way, it will cease to exist and won’t return to the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2019-01-25', 'text': 'Once the exiled creature returns, it’s considered a new object with no relation to the object that it was. Auras attached to the exiled creature will be put into their owners’ graveyards. Equipment attached to the exiled creature will become unattached and remain on the battlefield. Any counters on the exiled creature will cease to exist.'}, {'date': '2019-01-25', 'text': 'The creature returns untapped unless another effect causes it to enter the battlefield tapped.'}, {'date': '2019-01-25', 'text': 'The returned card won’t be the target of any spells or abilities that targeted it before. Spells that don’t target, such as Kaya’s Wrath, may still affect it.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-01-25', 'text': 'If either target is an illegal target as Titanic Brawl resolves, neither creature will deal or be dealt damage.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-01-25', 'text': 'If the target creature is an illegal target by the time Consign to the Pit tries to resolve, the spell doesn’t resolve. No player is dealt damage. If the target is legal but not destroyed (most likely because it has indestructible), its controller is dealt damage.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-01-25', 'text': 'In a Two-Headed Giant game, Ill-Gotten Inheritance’s first ability causes the opposing team to lose 2 life and you gain 1 life.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-01-25', 'text': 'In a Two-Headed Giant game, Spear Spewer’s ability causes each team to lose 2 life.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2019-05-03\', \'text\': "If Chandra\'s Pyrohelix targets two creatures and one becomes an illegal target, the remaining target is dealt 1 damage, not 2."}, {\'date\': \'2019-05-03\', \'text\': "You divide the damage as you cast Chandra\'s Pyrohelix, not as it resolves. Each target must be assigned at least 1 damage. In other words, as you cast Chandra\'s Pyrohelix, you choose whether to have it deal 2 damage to a single target, or deal 1 damage to each of two targets."}]', "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'A creature or planeswalker spell that can’t be countered is a legal target for No Escape. The spell won’t be countered when No Escape resolves, but you’ll still scry 1.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'A creature that’s a Wolf or Werewolf enters the battlefield with one +1/+1 counter if it would otherwise enter with no +1/+1 counters.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'A creature that’s both a Wolf and a Werewolf receives only one additional +1/+1 counter from Arlinn’s ability.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If Arlinn leaves the battlefield before her last ability resolves, most likely because she only had 2 loyalty when you activated the ability, the Wolf token won’t enter the battlefield with a +1/+1 counter.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'A split card that’s both an instant and a sorcery is counted only once for Cyclops Electromancer’s ability.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'The number of instant and sorcery cards in your graveyard is counted only as Cyclops Electromancer’s ability resolves.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Challenger Troll’s ability affects itself as long as its power remains 4 or greater.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If a creature you control with power 4 or greater has menace, it can’t be blocked by only one creature and it can’t be blocked by more than one creature, so it simply can’t be blocked.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Once a creature you control with power 3 or less has become blocked by two or more creatures, changing its power won’t cause either blocking creature to stop blocking it.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If Ob Nixilis leaves the battlefield before his last ability resolves, most likely because he only had 2 loyalty when you activated the ability, his first ability won’t exist to trigger when the creature’s controller draws two cards.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If the target creature is an illegal target by the time Ob Nixilis’s last ability tries to resolve, the ability doesn’t resolve. No player draws two cards. If the target is legal but not destroyed (most likely because it has indestructible), its controller does draw two cards.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If a permanent has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Tokens that aren’t a copy of something else don’t have a mana cost. Anything without a mana cost normally has a converted mana cost of 0.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If a spell or ability causes you to put cards into your hand without specifically using the word “draw,” it’s not a card drawn.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If an effect instructs you to draw multiple cards, Jace’s first ability triggers after you draw whichever is the second one for the turn (if any). You choose a target for the ability after you’ve drawn all of the cards.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Jace’s first ability can trigger only once each turn. It doesn’t matter whether Jace was on the battlefield when the first card was drawn.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Once Jace’s last ability has resolved, its effect applies even if Jace has left the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If one of the two target creatures you control is an illegal target as Band Together resolves, the other will still deal damage equal to its power.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If the last target creature is an illegal target as Band Together resolves, or if both of the first targets are illegal targets, no creature deals or is dealt damage.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'Spells that target more than one creature and/or planeswalker you control cost only {2} more to cast.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'To determine the total cost of an opponent’s spell that targets a creature or planeswalker you control, start with the mana cost or alternative cost that player is paying, add any cost increases (such as that of Kasmina’s effect), then apply any cost reductions. The converted mana cost of the spell remains unchanged, no matter what the total cost to cast it was.'}, {'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'You can’t do anything in between drawing a card and discarding a card, including casting the card you drew.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'The replacement effect from Ob Nixilis’s Cruelty will exile the target creature if it would die this turn for any reason, not just immediately after Ob Nixilis’s Cruelty resolves.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2019-06-14\', \'text\': "If Undead Augur dies at the same time as one or more other Zombies you control, Undead Augur\'s ability triggers for each of them."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-06-14\', \'text\': "If an effect modifies how many +1/+1 counters you put on Nantuko Cultivator, the number of cards you draw isn\'t modified. Likewise, if an effect modifies how many cards you draw, the number of +1/+1 counters you put on Nantuko Cultivator won\'t be modified."}, {\'date\': \'2019-06-14\', \'text\': "You discard, put counters, and draw all while Nantuko Cultivator\'s ability is resolving. Nothing can happen between the three, and no player may choose to take actions."}]', "[{'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'Bogardan Dragonheart doesn’t lose any abilities when it becomes a Dragon.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'Bogardan Dragonheart’s ability overwrites all previous effects that set its creature types, power, and/or toughness to specific values. Other effects that set these characteristics to specific values that start to apply after the ability resolves will overwrite that part of this effect.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'Effects that modify Bogardan Dragonheart’s power or toughness (such as the effects of Force of Virtue or Giant Growth) will apply no matter when they started to take effect. The same is true for counters that change its power or toughness (such as +1/+1 counters).'}]", "[{'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'Chillerpillar gaining flying after it becomes blocked won’t remove the blocking creature from combat or cause Chillerpillar to become unblocked.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'Monstrous isn’t an ability that a creature has. It’s just something true about that creature. If the creature stops being a creature, loses its abilities, or loses its +1/+1 counters, it will continue to be monstrous.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'Once a creature becomes monstrous, it can’t become monstrous again. If the creature is already monstrous when the monstrosity ability resolves, nothing happens.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'Eyekite’s effect applies even if you drew two or more cards only before Eyekite entered the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'If a spell or ability causes you to put cards into your hand without specifically using the word “draw,” Eyekite’s effect doesn’t count them.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'If Marit Lage’s Slumber leaves the battlefield before its last ability resolves, you won’t be able to sacrifice it, so you won’t create Marit Lage.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'If you don’t control ten or more snow permanents as your upkeep begins, the last ability won’t trigger. No player may take any actions during a turn before the turn’s upkeep begins.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'If you don’t control ten snow permanents as the last ability resolves, you can’t sacrifice Marit Lage’s Slumber.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'If Winter’s Rest is destroyed while its enters-the-battlefield triggered ability is on the stack, the creature that it enchanted is tapped as that ability resolves.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'If the creature this Aura would enchant is an illegal target by the time Winter’s Rest resolves, the entire spell doesn’t resolve. It won’t enter the battlefield, so its ability won’t trigger.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'If you lose control of all of your other snow permanents, then control a new one, the effect of Winter’s Rest will apply to the enchanted creature again.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'If a spell or ability causes you to put cards into your hand without specifically using the word “draw,” Oneirophage’s ability won’t trigger.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'If a token you control is exiled this way, it will cease to exist and won’t return to the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'Once the exiled creature you control returns, it’s considered a new object with no relation to the object that it was. Auras attached to the exiled creatures will be put into their owners’ graveyards. Equipment attached to the exiled creatures will become unattached and remain on the battlefield. Any counters on the exiled creatures will cease to exist.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'If you control any tapped lands as Martyr’s Soul enters the battlefield, its last ability doesn’t trigger at all. If you control any tapped lands as the ability resolves, you won’t put two +1/+1 counters on Martyr’s Soul.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If a creature you control has a mana ability with {T} in the cost, activating that ability while casting a spell with convoke will result in the creature being tapped before you pay the spell’s costs. You won’t be able to tap it again for convoke. Similarly, if you sacrifice a creature to activate a mana ability while casting a spell with convoke, that creature won’t be on the battlefield when you pay the spell’s costs, so you won’t be able to tap it for convoke.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'When calculating a spell’s total cost, include any alternative costs, additional costs, or anything else that increases or reduces the cost to cast the spell. Convoke applies after the total cost is calculated. Convoke doesn’t change a spell’s mana cost or mana value.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'You can tap any untapped creature you control to convoke a spell, even one you haven’t controlled continuously since the beginning of your most recent turn.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'You can sacrifice any Goblin you control to activate Sling-Gang Lieutenant’s activated ability, not just the ones its triggered ability creates. You can even sacrifice Sling-Gang Lieutenant itself.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2019-07-12\', \'text\': "If Bag of Holding is moved to exile when you sacrifice it (most likely due to Leyline of the Void\'s effect), it remains in exile. It won\'t be returned to your hand."}, {\'date\': \'2019-07-12\', \'text\': "If Bag of Holding leaves the battlefield, the items it contained are exiled forever (and, perhaps, scattered throughout the Astral Plane). If the same Bag of Holding card returns to the battlefield, it\'s considered a new object without access to the cards stored by the old object."}, {\'date\': \'2019-07-12\', \'text\': "If you control more than one Bag of Holding, you choose which one will hold the discarded card. Other Bags of Holding can\'t return that card."}, {\'date\': \'2019-07-12\', \'text\': "If you discard a card but that card is not in your graveyard as Bag of Holding\'s first ability resolves, that card remains wherever it has moved."}, {\'date\': \'2019-07-12\', \'text\': "You both draw and discard while Bag of Holding\'s second ability is resolving. No player may take any action—nor can anything else happen—until you\'ve both drawn and discarded."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-07-12\', \'text\': "Steel Overseer\'s ability puts a +1/+1 counter on each artifact creature you control, including Steel Overseer."}]', "[{'date': '2019-07-12', 'text': 'A Swamp is a land with the subtype Swamp, not any land with a mana ability that produces black mana.'}, {'date': '2019-07-12', 'text': 'If you choose the second mode and the chosen target is an illegal target by the time Dread Presence’s triggered ability tries to resolve, the ability doesn’t resolve. You won’t gain 2 life, and the ability won’t change to the first mode.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-07-12', 'text': 'A creature that’s both a Wolf and a Werewolf gets only +1/+1 from Nightpack Ambusher’s ability.'}, {'date': '2019-07-12', 'text': 'Because damage remains marked on a creature until it’s removed as the turn ends, nonlethal damage dealt to other Wolves and Werewolves you control may become lethal if Nightpack Ambusher leaves the battlefield during that turn.'}, {'date': '2019-07-12', 'text': 'If you cast a spell that was countered, Nightpack Ambusher’s last ability doesn’t trigger.'}, {'date': '2019-07-12', 'text': 'Nightpack Ambusher looks at the entire turn to see if you have cast a spell, even if Nightpack Ambusher wasn’t on the battlefield when that spell was cast. Notably, you won’t get a Wolf token during your end step if you cast Nightpack Ambusher during your turn.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-07-12', 'text': 'Activated abilities contain a colon. They’re generally written “[Cost]: [Effect].” Some keyword abilities, such as equip, are activated abilities and will have colons in their reminder text. You can’t spend mana added by this ability to pay costs of triggered abilities of artifacts such as the first ability of Chandra’s Regulator.'}, {'date': '2019-07-12', 'text': 'The mana generated by Renowned Weaponsmith’s first ability can’t be spent to activate abilities of artifact sources that aren’t on the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-07-12', 'text': 'Brineborn Cutthroat must be on the battlefield for its last ability to function. Notably, the ability won’t trigger as you cast Brineborn Cutthroat during an opponent’s turn.'}, {'date': '2019-07-12', 'text': 'Brineborn Cutthroat’s ability resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger. It resolves even if that spell is countered.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-07-12', 'text': 'Chandra’s last ability targets the player, not their creatures. A creature with hexproof may be dealt damage this way.'}, {'date': '2019-07-12', 'text': 'If the target creature is an illegal target by the time Chandra’s second ability resolves, the ability doesn’t resolve. No player is dealt damage. Similarly, if the target player is an illegal target by the time Chandra’s last ability resolves, no creatures are dealt damage.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-07-12', 'text': 'Combat damage is the damage that’s dealt automatically by attacking and blocking creatures. Any other damage is noncombat damage, even if it’s dealt during a combat phase by an attacking or blocking creature.'}, {'date': '2019-07-12', 'text': 'In a multiplayer game, if a source deals damage to multiple opponents at the same time, the last ability of Chandra’s Spitfire will trigger as many times as there are opponents who were dealt damage.'}, {'date': '2019-07-12', 'text': 'The last ability of Chandra’s Spitfire triggers just once for each event in which an opponent is dealt noncombat damage, regardless of how much damage that player is dealt.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-07-12', 'text': 'Combat damage is the damage that’s dealt automatically by attacking and blocking creatures. Any other damage is noncombat damage, even if it’s dealt during a combat phase by an attacking or blocking creature.'}, {'date': '2019-07-12', 'text': 'In a multiplayer game, if a source deals damage to multiple opponents at the same time, the last ability of Wildfire Elemental will trigger that many times.'}, {'date': '2019-07-12', 'text': 'The last ability of Wildfire Elemental triggers once for each event in which an opponent is dealt noncombat damage, regardless of how much damage that player is dealt.'}, {'date': '2019-07-12', 'text': 'Wildfire Elemental’s triggered ability affects only creatures you control at the time it resolves. Creatures you begin to control later in the turn won’t get +1/+0.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-07-12', 'text': 'Each creature with lifelink dealing combat damage causes a separate life-gaining event. For example, if two creatures you control with lifelink deal combat damage at the same time, Ajani’s Pridemate’s ability will trigger twice. However, if a single creature you control with lifelink deals combat damage to multiple creatures, players, and/or planeswalkers at the same time (perhaps because it has trample or was blocked by more than one creature), the ability will trigger only once.'}, {'date': '2019-07-12', 'text': 'If Ajani’s Pridemate is dealt lethal damage at the same time that you gain life, it won’t receive a counter from its ability in time to save it.'}, {'date': '2019-07-12', 'text': 'If a planeswalker you control is also a creature (most likely because it’s Gideon), it will be counted twice as Ajani’s first ability resolves.'}, {'date': '2019-07-12', 'text': 'In a Two-Headed Giant game, Ajani’s last ability exiles permanents as long as your team’s life total is greater than your team’s starting life total by 15 or more life.'}, {'date': '2019-07-12', 'text': 'In a Two-Headed Giant game, life gained by your teammate won’t cause Ajani’s Pridemate’s ability to trigger, even though it will cause your team’s life total to increase.'}, {'date': '2019-07-12', 'text': 'The ability of Ajani’s Pridemate triggers just once for each life-gaining event, whether it’s 1 life from Impassioned Orator or 4 life from Dawning Angel. If you gain an amount of life “for each” of something or “equal to the number” of something, that life is gained as one event and the ability of Ajani’s Pridemate triggers only once.'}, {'date': '2019-07-12', 'text': 'The tokens created by Ajani’s second ability are similar to the card Ajani’s Pridemate, but they have no mana cost and their mana value is 0.'}, {'date': '2019-07-12', 'text': 'Whether you have at least 15 life more than your starting life total is determined as Ajani’s last ability resolves.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-07-12', 'text': 'Each creature with lifelink dealing combat damage causes a separate life-gaining event. For example, if two creatures you control with lifelink deal combat damage at the same time, Bloodthirsty Aerialist’s ability will trigger twice. However, if a single creature you control with lifelink deals combat damage to multiple creatures, players, and/or planeswalkers at the same time (perhaps because it has trample or was blocked by more than one creature), the ability will trigger only once.'}, {'date': '2019-07-12', 'text': 'If Bloodthirsty Aerialist is dealt lethal damage at the same time that you gain life, it won’t receive a counter from its ability in time to save it.'}, {'date': '2019-07-12', 'text': 'In a Two-Headed Giant game, life gained by your teammate won’t cause the ability to trigger, even though it caused your team’s life total to increase.'}, {'date': '2019-07-12', 'text': 'The ability of Bloodthirsty Aerialist triggers just once for each life-gaining event, whether it’s 1 life from Impassioned Orator or 4 life from Dawning Angel. If you gain an amount of life “for each” of something or “equal to the number” of something, that life is gained as one event and the ability of Bloodthirsty Aerialist triggers only once.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-07-12', 'text': 'Each creature with lifelink dealing combat damage causes a separate life-gaining event. For example, if two creatures you control with lifelink deal combat damage at the same time, Epicure of Blood’s ability will trigger twice. However, if a single creature you control with lifelink deals combat damage to multiple creatures, players, and/or planeswalkers at the same time (perhaps because it has trample or was blocked by more than one creature), the ability will trigger only once.'}, {'date': '2019-07-12', 'text': 'In a Two-Headed Giant game, Epicure of Blood’s ability causes the opposing team to lose 1 life twice.'}, {'date': '2019-07-12', 'text': 'In a Two-Headed Giant game, life gained by your teammate won’t cause the ability to trigger, even though it caused your team’s life total to increase.'}, {'date': '2019-07-12', 'text': 'The ability of Epicure of Blood triggers just once for each life-gaining event, whether it’s 1 life from Impassioned Orator or 4 life from Dawning Angel. If you gain an amount of life “for each” of something or “equal to the number” of something, that life is gained as one event and the ability of Epicure of Blood triggers only once.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-07-12', 'text': 'Heart-Piercer Bow (not the equipped creature) is the source of the triggered ability and the source of the damage. This means that a creature with protection from green may be targeted even if Heart-Piercer Bow is equipped to a green creature, but a creature with protection from artifacts may not.'}, {'date': '2019-07-12', 'text': 'If a creature is attacking a planeswalker, the controller of that planeswalker is the defending player.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-07-12', 'text': 'If a player has fewer than seven cards in their library, that player loses the game after Dragon Mage’s triggered ability resolves. If each player loses the game this way, the game’s a draw.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-07-12', 'text': 'If the target creature is an illegal target by the time Wolfkin Bond tries to resolve, the spell doesn’t resolve. It won’t enter the battlefield, so its ability won’t trigger.'}, {'date': '2019-07-12', 'text': 'You need a creature for Wolfkin Bond to target as you cast it. It can’t enter the battlefield attached to the Wolf token it will create.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-07-12', 'text': 'In a Two-Headed Giant game, Glint-Horn Buccaneer’s triggered ability causes the opposing team to be dealt 1 damage twice.'}, {'date': '2019-07-12', 'text': 'The middle ability of Glint-Horn Buccaneer is a triggered ability, not an activated ability. It doesn’t allow you to discard a card whenever you want; rather, you need some other way of discarding a card, such as by activating its last ability.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-07-12', 'text': 'Overcome affects only creatures you control at the time it resolves. Creatures you begin to control later in the turn won’t get +2/+2 or gain trample.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2019-08-23\', \'text\': \'If a spell has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it without paying its mana cost.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-08-23\', \'text\': \'If you cast Ignite the Future from a zone other than a graveyard, you must pay the mana cost or an alternative cost for each spell cast this way. If you cast Ignite the Future from a graveyard, you may choose to cast each spell for its mana cost, an alternative cost, or without paying its mana cost.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-08-23\', \'text\': "If you cast a card “without paying its mana cost,” you can\'t choose to cast it for any alternative costs and not pay that cost. You can, however, pay additional costs. If the card has any mandatory additional costs, such as that of Momentous Fall, you must pay those to cast the card."}, {\'date\': \'2019-08-23\', \'text\': "If you don\'t play some or all of the exiled cards, those cards remain in exile."}, {\'date\': \'2019-08-23\', \'text\': "Ignite the Future doesn\'t change when you can play the exiled cards. For example, if you exile a sorcery card, you can cast it only during your main phase when the stack is empty. If you exile a land card, you can play it only during your main phase and only if you have an available land play remaining."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'A spell cast using flashback will always be exiled afterward, whether it resolves, is countered, or leaves the stack in some other way.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If a card with flashback is put into your graveyard during your turn, you can cast it if it\'s legal to do so before any other player can take any actions."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost (such as a flashback cost) you\'re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell is determined only by its mana cost, no matter what the total cost to cast the spell was."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'You can cast a spell using flashback even if it was somehow put into your graveyard without having been cast.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions, including those based on the card\'s type. For instance, you can cast a sorcery using flashback only when you could normally cast a sorcery."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'“Flashback [cost]” means “You may cast this card from your graveyard by paying [cost] rather than paying its mana cost” and “If the flashback cost was paid, exile this card instead of putting it anywhere else any time it would leave the stack.”\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "A permanent that\'s both an artifact and an enchantment is only counted once."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "As long as Shambling Suit is on the battlefield, its ability will count itself, so it\'ll be at least 1/3."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "The ability that defines Shambling Suit\'s power works in all zones, not just the battlefield."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Food is an artifact type. Even though it appears on some creatures (such as Gingerbrute), it\'s never a creature type."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Whatever you do, don\'t eat the delicious cards."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "You can\'t sacrifice a Food token to pay multiple costs. For example, you can\'t sacrifice a Food token to activate its own ability and also to activate the ability of Tempting Witch."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Gaining vigilance any time after the moment you choose to attack with a creature won\'t cause it to become untapped."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': \'If there are no Knights to attach Shining Armor to when it enters the battlefield, it simply remains unattached.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If Weapon Rack has left the battlefield or has no +1/+1 counters on it by the time its activated ability resolves, you won\'t put a +1/+1 counter on the target creature. If the creature becomes an illegal target or can\'t have a +1/+1 counter put onto it for some other reason, you won\'t remove a +1/+1 counter from Weapon Rack."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Once Weapon Rack runs out of +1/+1 counters, it remains on the battlefield. You can activate its last ability, but it won\'t do anything."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "The +1/+1 counters on Weapon Rack won\'t affect it unless it somehow becomes a creature."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If a spell or ability causes you to put cards into your hand without specifically using the word “draw,” it\'s not a card drawn."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If an effect instructs you to draw multiple cards, the ability triggers after you draw whichever is the second one for the turn. You choose a target (if any) for the ability after you\'ve drawn and looked at all of the cards and finished resolving the spell or ability that caused you to draw them."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If the target creature is an illegal target by the time Mantle of Tides\'s triggered ability tries to resolve, the ability won\'t resolve. Mantle of Tides remains attached to what it was attached to or remains unattached if it wasn\'t attached."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "The triggered ability can trigger only once each turn. It doesn\'t matter whether the permanent with that ability was on the battlefield when the first card was drawn. If it\'s not on the battlefield when the second card is drawn, the ability can\'t trigger at all that turn. It won\'t trigger when the third or fourth card is drawn."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "The triggered ability of Mantle of Tides can target the creature it\'s already attached to."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If a spell or ability causes you to put cards into your hand without specifically using the word “draw,” it\'s not a card drawn."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If an effect instructs you to draw multiple cards, the ability triggers after you draw whichever is the second one for the turn. You choose a target (if any) for the ability after you\'ve drawn and looked at all of the cards and finished resolving the spell or ability that caused you to draw them."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "The triggered ability can trigger only once each turn. It doesn\'t matter whether the permanent with that ability was on the battlefield when the first card was drawn. If it\'s not on the battlefield when the second card is drawn, the ability can\'t trigger at all that turn. It won\'t trigger when the third or fourth card is drawn."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If more than one non-Human creature enters the battlefield at the same time, Sage of the Falls\'s ability triggers that many times. You\'ll resolve the abilities one at a time—you won\'t draw that many cards at once and then discard that many cards."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "You draw a card and discard a card all while Sage of the Falls\'s ability is resolving. Nothing can happen between the two, and no player may choose to take actions."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If you pay {X} while Wildborn Preserver\'s triggered ability is resolving, the reflexive triggered ability triggers and will resolve separately. This is different from effects that say “If you do . . .” in that players may take actions after you\'ve paid mana but before the creature gets +1/+1 counters."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Once you announce that you\'re casting a spell, no player may take actions until the spell has been paid for. Notably, opponents can\'t try to change by how much a relic\'s cost is reduced."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "The Circle of Loyalty\'s triggered ability resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger. It resolves even if that spell is countered."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "The Circle of Loyalty\'s triggered ability won\'t trigger when you cast it because it\'s not on the battlefield yet."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "The cost reduction ability reduces only the generic mana in the relic\'s cost. The colored mana must still be paid."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost you\'re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell remains unchanged, no matter what the total cost to cast it was."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Scorching Dragonfire\'s replacement effect will exile the target creature or planeswalker if it would die this turn for any reason, not just due to lethal damage. It applies to the target creature or planeswalker even if Scorching Dragonfire deals no damage to it (most likely due to a prevention effect)."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Scorching Dragonfire\'s replacement effect will exile the target creature or planeswalker if it would die this turn for any reason, not just due to lethal damage."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "So Tiny continuously checks the enchanted creature\'s controller\'s graveyard to determine just how tiny the enchanted creature is."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "The ability that defines Syr Elenora\'s power works in all zones, not just the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of an opponent\'s spell that targets Syr Elenora, start with the mana cost or alternative cost that player is paying, add any cost increases (such as that of Syr Elenora\'s effect), then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell remains unchanged, no matter what the total cost to cast it was."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "You can activate Locthwain Gargoyle\'s ability multiple times during one turn, even if it already has flying."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "You scry 2 once after each opponent has moved the top cards of their library. You don\'t scry 2 for each opponent."}]', "[{'date': '2019-10-04', 'text': 'If Bloodhaze Wolverine gains first strike after first-strike combat damage has been dealt, it will just deal regular combat damage.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': \'If Wicked Guardian leaves the battlefield before its triggered ability resolves, you may still have it deal 2 damage to another creature you control and draw a card.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': \'If the damage Wicked Guardian deals is prevented (perhaps because you chose for it to deal 2 damage to a creature with protection from black), you still draw a card.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': \'No player may take actions between the time you choose which creature (if any) is dealt damage and the time you draw a card if you chose one.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "While resolving Wicked Guardian\'s triggered ability, you can\'t have it deal 2 damage multiple times or to multiple creatures to draw more cards."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': \'If a creature on the battlefield has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If the target creature is an illegal target by the time Stolen by the Fae tries to resolve, the spell won\'t resolve. You won\'t create any Faerie tokens."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': \'If an effect refers to a Food, it means any Food artifact, not just a Food artifact token. For example, you can sacrifice Gingerbrute to activate the last ability of Tempting Witch.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If the target creature is an illegal target when Wicked Wolf\'s first ability tries to resolve, the ability doesn\'t resolve. If Wicked Wolf is no longer on the battlefield, the target creature won\'t deal or be dealt damage."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "You can activate Wicked Wolf\'s last ability any number of times while its first ability is on the stack."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "You can activate Wicked Wolf\'s last ability even if it\'s already tapped."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': \'If one or more creatures die at the same time as Syr Konrad, its first ability triggers for each of those creatures.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "In a Two-Headed Giant game, Syr Konrad\'s first ability causes it to deal 1 damage twice."}]', "[{'date': '2019-10-04', 'text': 'If there are no creatures to attach Rosethorn Halberd to when it enters the battlefield, it simply remains unattached.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': \'A constellation ability triggers whenever an enchantment enters the battlefield under your control for any reason. Enchantments with other card types, such as enchantment creatures, will also cause constellation abilities to trigger.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "An Aura spell that has an illegal target when it tries to resolve doesn\'t resolve and is instead put into its owner\'s graveyard. It doesn\'t enter the battlefield, so constellation abilities don\'t trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': \'Multiple instances of lifelink on the same creature are redundant.\'}]', "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'A constellation ability triggers whenever an enchantment enters the battlefield under your control for any reason. Enchantments with other card types, such as enchantment creatures, will also cause constellation abilities to trigger.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'An Aura spell that has an illegal target when it tries to resolve doesn’t resolve and is instead put into its owner’s graveyard. It doesn’t enter the battlefield, so constellation abilities don’t trigger.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If an enchantment creature enters the battlefield under your control, Pious Wayfarer’s ability can target it.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'A constellation ability triggers whenever an enchantment enters the battlefield under your control for any reason. Enchantments with other card types, such as enchantment creatures, will also cause constellation abilities to trigger.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'An Aura spell that has an illegal target when it tries to resolve doesn’t resolve and is instead put into its owner’s graveyard. It doesn’t enter the battlefield, so constellation abilities don’t trigger.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Multiple instances of double strike on the same creature are redundant.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'A constellation ability triggers whenever an enchantment enters the battlefield under your control for any reason. Enchantments with other card types, such as enchantment creatures, will also cause constellation abilities to trigger.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'An Aura spell that has an illegal target when it tries to resolve doesn’t resolve and is instead put into its owner’s graveyard. It doesn’t enter the battlefield, so constellation abilities don’t trigger.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'An ability that triggers when you cast a spell resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger. It resolves even if that spell is countered.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If you have more than one opponent, this ability can trigger once during each of those opponents’ turns.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'In a Two-Headed Giant game, this ability triggers no more than once during each opposing team’s turn.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'This ability triggers only on your very first spell during an opponent’s turn, not the first spell after the card is on the battlefield. If you cast a spell before it’s on the battlefield (including if you cast this card somehow during an opponent’s turn), the ability won’t trigger.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Any effects that modify the target creature’s power and/or toughness without setting them to a specific number or value will apply after its base power and toughness are set, regardless of the order in which those effects were created. The same is true of counters that modify its power and toughness.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Taranika’s triggered ability can target a creature that’s already untapped. It still becomes 4/4 and gains indestructible.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Taranika’s triggered ability isn’t optional. If your only other creatures are bigger than 4/4, you’ll have to shrink one for the turn.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Untapping an attacking creature doesn’t remove it from combat.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Blood Aspirant can be sacrificed to pay for the cost of its own last ability.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Blood Aspirant’s first ability is a triggered ability, not an activated ability. It doesn’t allow you to sacrifice a permanent whenever you want; rather, you need some other way of sacrificing permanents, such as its second ability.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If the target creature is an illegal target by the time Blood Aspirant’s last ability tries to resolve, the ability won’t resolve. The creature can block as normal. If the target is legal but not dealt damage (most likely because of a prevention effect), it can’t block this turn.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If you sacrifice a permanent as part of casting a spell or activating an ability, Blood Aspirant’s first ability will resolve before that spell or ability.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If Dreadful Apathy leaves the battlefield while its last ability is on the stack, the permanent that’s exiled is the one Dreadful Apathy enchanted before leaving the battlefield, even if that permanent is no longer a creature.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'The creature that’s exiled is the creature Dreadful Apathy enchants as its last ability resolves.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If Hydra’s Growth leaves the battlefield before its enters-the-battlefield triggered ability resolves, the creature it last enchanted before it left gets the +1/+1 counter.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'To double the number of +1/+1 counters on a creature, put a number of +1/+1 counters on it equal to the number it already has. Other cards that interact with putting counters on it will interact with this effect accordingly.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If a token is exiled this way, it will cease to exist and won’t return to the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If an Aura is put onto the battlefield without being cast, the Aura’s controller-to-be chooses what it will enchant as it comes back onto the battlefield. An Aura put onto the battlefield this way doesn’t target anything (so it could be attached to an opponent’s permanent with hexproof, for example), but the Aura’s enchant ability restricts what it can be attached to. If the Aura can’t legally be attached to anything, it remains in its current zone.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Once the exiled permanent returns, it’s considered a new object with no relation to the object that it was. Auras attached to the exiled permanent will be put into their owners’ graveyards. Equipment attached to the exiled permanent will become unattached and remain on the battlefield. Any counters on the exiled permanent will cease to exist.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If the enchanted creature can’t attack for any reason (such as being tapped or having come under that player’s control that turn), then it doesn’t attack. If there’s a cost associated with having it attack, the player isn’t forced to pay that cost, so it doesn’t have to attack in that case either.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If the target creature is an illegal target by the time Phalanx Tactics tries to resolve, the spell won’t resolve. No creatures get +1/+1.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If you don’t control a creature with power 4 or greater as your combat phase begins, Nessian Hornbeetle’s ability doesn’t trigger. If you don’t control one as the ability resolves, it has no effect. It doesn’t have to be the same creature at both times, however.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Nessian Hornbeetle’s ability only gives it one +1/+1 counter, no matter how many creatures with power 4 or greater you control beyond the first.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'Ilysian Caryatid’s activated ability is a mana ability. It doesn’t use the stack and can’t be responded to.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'While resolving Relentless Pursuit, you could put no cards, a creature card, a land card, or a creature card and a land card into your hand.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "Once you announce that you\'re activating the last ability of Bonders\' Enclave, no player may take actions until you\'ve finished activating it. Notably, opponents can\'t try to change whether you control a creature with power 4 or greater."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "Once you\'ve activated the last ability of Bonders\' Enclave, it doesn\'t check again at any point whether you control a creature with power 4 or greater."}]', "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'An ability that triggers when a player casts a spell resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger. It resolves even if that spell is countered.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'In a Two-Headed Giant game, Blisterspit Gremlin’s first ability causes the opposing team to lose 2 life.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Players can cast spells and activate abilities after the triggered ability resolves but before the spell that caused it to trigger does.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Because damage remains marked on a creature until the damage is removed as the turn ends, nonlethal damage dealt to the target creature may become lethal once its base toughness becomes 4.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Effects that modify the affected creature’s power or toughness without setting it will apply no matter when they started to take effect. The same is true for counters that change the creature’s power or toughness.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Startling Development overwrites all previous effects that set the affected creatures’ color, creature types, power, and/or toughness to specific values. Other effects that set these characteristics to specific values that start to apply after Startling Development resolves will overwrite that part of the effect.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'The affected creature doesn’t lose any abilities when it becomes a Serpent.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Excess damage caused by a spell or ability is similar to how combat damage from a creature with trample is handled. Start with the amount of damage being dealt to the creature and determine what is “lethal.” This is the creature’s toughness minus the amount of damage that it already has marked on it, but ignoring any replacement or prevention effects that will modify this damage. Also ignore whether the creature has an ability such as indestructible that will result in it not being destroyed by this damage.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If either creature is an illegal target as Ram Through tries to resolve, the creature you control won’t deal damage to any creature or player.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If the target creature you control has deathtouch, 1 damage from it is lethal.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Once you’ve determined how much damage is excess, the creature you control simultaneously deals damage to the creature and to its controller. This damage may be modified by replacement or prevention effects.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If Bristling Boar gains menace, it can’t be blocked at all.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If either target is an illegal target as Go for Blood resolves, no creature will deal or be dealt damage.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If you cycle Yidaro but it isn’t in your graveyard as the triggered ability resolves, you can’t put it onto the battlefield or shuffle it into your library. You’ll still shuffle your library if you haven’t cycled Yidaro four times this game.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Some cards with cycling have an ability that triggers when you cycle them, and some cards have an ability that triggers whenever you cycle any card. These triggered abilities resolve before you draw from the cycling ability.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Triggered abilities from cycling a card and the cycling ability itself aren’t spells. Effects that interact with spells (such as that of Cancel) won’t affect them.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'You can cycle a card even if it has a triggered ability from cycling that won’t have a legal target. This is because the cycling ability and the triggered ability are separate. This also means that if either ability is countered (with Disallow, for example), the other ability will still resolve.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'You don’t have to cycle the same physical card four times for Yidaro to get tired of being cycled and stomp onto the battlefield. Any cards named Yidaro, Wandering Monster will count.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If you don’t play the exiled card, it remains exiled.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Rooting Moloch gives you permission to play the card as a land or cast it as a spell. You can’t cycle the exiled card.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'You must follow the normal timing permissions and restrictions for the exiled card. If it’s a land, you can’t play it unless you have land plays available.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'You’ll still pay all costs for a spell cast this way, including additional costs. You may also pay alternative costs if any are available.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'In a Two-Headed Giant game, Drannith Stinger’s first ability causes the opposing team to lose 2 life.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Some cards with cycling have an ability that triggers when you cycle them, and some cards have an ability that triggers whenever you cycle any card. These triggered abilities resolve before you draw from the cycling ability.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Triggered abilities from cycling a card and the cycling ability itself aren’t spells. Effects that interact with spells (such as that of Cancel) won’t affect them.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'You can cycle a card even if it has a triggered ability from cycling that won’t have a legal target. This is because the cycling ability and the triggered ability are separate. This also means that if either ability is countered (with Disallow, for example), the other ability will still resolve.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Some cards with cycling have an ability that triggers when you cycle them, and some cards have an ability that triggers whenever you cycle any card. These triggered abilities resolve before you draw from the cycling ability.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Triggered abilities from cycling a card and the cycling ability itself aren’t spells. Effects that interact with spells (such as that of Cancel) won’t affect them.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'You can cycle a card even if it has a triggered ability from cycling that won’t have a legal target. This is because the cycling ability and the triggered ability are separate. This also means that if either ability is countered (with Disallow, for example), the other ability will still resolve.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Barrin\'s last ability checks the entire turn, even before Barrin was on the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "If a permanent wasn\'t put into your hand from the battlefield before your end step begins, Barrin\'s ability doesn\'t trigger at all."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "If a token is returned to your hand, it\'s put there before it ceases to exist."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "The permanent that was returned to your hand doesn\'t have to still be there."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': \'You draw only one card, no matter how many permanents were put into your hand from the battlefield during that turn.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Because Vito\'s first ability doesn\'t deal damage, you won\'t gain life when it resolves if Vito has lifelink."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Each creature with lifelink dealing combat damage causes a separate life-gaining event. For example, if two creatures you control with lifelink deal combat damage at the same time, Vito\'s first ability will trigger twice and you may choose a different opponent for each trigger. However, if a single creature you control with lifelink deals combat damage to multiple creatures, players, and/or planeswalkers at the same time (perhaps because it has trample or was blocked by more than one creature), the ability will trigger only once."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': \'If an ability triggers whenever an opponent loses life and causes you to gain life, such as the ability of Exquisite Blood, this will loop until either you win the game or a player takes an action to break the loop.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "If you gain an amount of life “for each” of something, that life is gained as one event and Vito\'s first ability triggers only once."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "In a Two-Headed Giant game, life gained by your teammate won\'t cause the ability to trigger, even though it caused your team\'s life total to increase."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Because the effect of Destructive Tampering\'s second mode doesn\'t change the characteristics of any permanents, the set of creatures affected by it is constantly updated. Creatures without flying that enter the battlefield later in the turn won\'t be able to block."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Combat damage is the damage that\'s dealt automatically by attacking and blocking creatures. Any other damage is noncombat damage, even if it\'s dealt during a combat phase by an attacking or blocking creature."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "The ability of Chandra\'s Pyreling triggers just once per event for each opponent who is dealt noncombat damage by a source you control, regardless of how much damage that player is dealt. For example, if a sorcery you control deals 2 damage to each opponent in a four-player game, the ability will trigger three times."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Gadrak\'s last ability counts creatures that died during the entire turn, even ones that died before Gadrak entered the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': \'Once Gadrak has attacked, it will remain an attacking creature even if you no longer control four or more artifacts.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "If Drowsing Tyrannodon\'s power is raised to 4 or greater, it will allow itself to attack."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': \'Once Drowsing Tyrannodon has attacked, it will remain an attacking creature even if you no longer control a creature with power 4 or greater.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "If Ornery Dilophosaur\'s power is raised to 4 or greater, its ability triggers when it attacks."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "If you don\'t control a creature with power 4 or greater immediately after Ornery Dilophosaur attacks, its ability doesn\'t trigger. If you don\'t control one as the ability resolves, it has no effect. It doesn\'t have to be the same creature at both times, however."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Once Ornery Dilophosaur\'s ability has resolved, it keeps +2/+2 for the rest of the turn even if you no longer control a creature with power 4 or greater."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': \'Ornery Dilophosaur gets just +2/+2, no matter how many creatures you control with power 4 or greater.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "If a creature an opponent controls dies at the same time as Massacre Wurm, Massacre Wurm\'s last ability triggers for that creature."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "If your life total is brought to 0 or less at the same time that a creature an opponent controls is dealt lethal damage, you lose the game before Massacre Wurm\'s last ability goes on the stack."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Massacre Wurm\'s first ability affects only creatures your opponents control at the time it resolves. Creatures they begin to control later in the turn won\'t get -2/-2."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Massacre Wurm\'s triggered ability triggers if a creature an opponent controls dies for any reason, including from its first ability reducing its toughness to 0, as long as Massacre Wurm remains on the battlefield."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "If a spell or ability causes you to put a card into your hand without specifically using the word “draw,” it\'s not a card drawn."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "The triggered ability can trigger only once each turn. It doesn\'t matter Mystic Skyfish was on the battlefield when the first card was drawn. If it\'s not on the battlefield when the second card is drawn, the ability can\'t trigger at all that turn. It won\'t trigger when the third or fourth card is drawn."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "If a spell or ability causes you to put a card into your hand without specifically using the word “draw,” it\'s not a card drawn."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "While resolving Tolarian Kraken\'s ability, you can\'t pay more than {1} to tap or untap more than one creature."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "If either creature is an illegal target as Hunter\'s Edge tries to resolve, the creature you control won\'t deal damage."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "If the creature you don\'t control is an illegal target as Hunter\'s Edge tries to resolve but the creature you control is a legal target, you just put a +1/+1 counter on the creature you control."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "You can\'t cast Hunter\'s Edge unless you choose both a creature you control and a creature you don\'t control as targets."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Once Tome Anima has become blocked, it won\'t become unblocked if you draw a second card."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "You can\'t target the same creature twice with the triggered ability of Basri\'s Acolyte to give it two +1/+1 counters."}]', "[{'date': '2020-06-23', 'text': 'An ability that triggers when a player casts a spell resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger. It resolves even if that spell is countered.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-06-23', 'text': 'Brightmare’s ability can target a tapped creature. If the target creature is already tapped when the ability resolves, that creature just remains tapped and you gain life equal to its power.'}, {'date': '2020-06-23', 'text': 'If the target creature is an illegal target by the time Brightmare’s ability tries to resolve, the ability won’t resolve. You won’t gain any life.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-06-23', 'text': 'Combat damage is the damage that’s dealt automatically by attacking and blocking creatures. Any other damage is noncombat damage, even if it’s dealt during a combat phase by an attacking or blocking creature.'}, {'date': '2020-06-23', 'text': 'Effects that cause you to lose life aren’t prevented.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-06-23', 'text': 'Emiel’s second ability triggers whenever any creature other than itself enters the battlefield under your control, including those returned by its first ability.'}, {'date': '2020-06-23', 'text': 'If a token is exiled this way, it will cease to exist and won’t return to the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2020-06-23', 'text': 'If the entering creature is a Unicorn, you still have to pay {G/W} to put two +1/+1 counters on it.'}, {'date': '2020-06-23', 'text': 'When the card returns to the battlefield, it will be a new object with no connection to the card that was exiled. Auras attached to the exiled creature will be put into their owners’ graveyards. Any Equipment will become unattached and remain on the battlefield. Any counters on the exiled creature will cease to exist.'}, {'date': '2020-06-23', 'text': 'While resolving Emiel’s triggered ability, you can’t pay {G/W} more than once to put more counters on the creature.'}, {'date': '2020-06-23', 'text': 'You choose whether to pay for Emiel’s triggered ability while it’s resolving. If you do, no player may take other actions between the time you pay and the time the creature has one or two +1/+1 counters on it.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-06-23', 'text': 'If a card in a player’s library has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0.'}, {'date': '2020-06-23', 'text': 'The bonus Muxus gets is determined only as its last ability resolves. Once that happens, the bonus won’t change later in the turn even if the number of Goblins you control changes.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-06-23', 'text': 'If another creature dies at the same time as Spiteful Prankster, Spiteful Prankster’s last ability triggers for that creature.'}, {'date': '2020-06-23', 'text': 'If your life total is brought to 0 or less at the same time that a creature is dealt lethal damage, you lose the game before Spiteful Prankster’s ability goes on the stack.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': \'Pridemalkin can be the target of its own first ability.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Pridemalkin\'s second ability applies to Pridemalkin as long as it has a +1/+1 counter on it."}]', "[{'date': '2020-06-23', 'text': 'You draw a card and discard a card all while the ability is resolving. Nothing can happen between the two, and no player may choose to take actions.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-06-23', 'text': 'You may cast spells and activate abilities after the card has been drawn but before blockers are declared.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "A game that restarts immediately ends the preceding game. The players in that game then immediately begin a new game. No player wins, loses, or draws the original game as a result of Karn\'s ability."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "After the pregame procedure is complete but before the new game\'s first turn, Karn\'s ability finishes resolving and the cards left in exile are put onto the battlefield. If this causes any triggered abilities to trigger, those abilities are put onto the stack at the beginning of the first upkeep step."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "Any permanents put onto the battlefield with Karn\'s ability that entered the battlefield tapped will untap during their controller\'s first untap step."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "If a player leaves the game, all cards that player owns leave as well. If you leave the game, the permanents you control from Karn\'s ability are exiled."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "In a Commander game, each player puts their commander into the command zone before shuffling their deck, unless it was exiled with Karn. In that case, the commander remains in exile and will be put onto the battlefield when Karn\'s ability finishes resolving."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "In a multiplayer game, any player who left the game before it was restarted with Karn\'s ability won\'t be involved in the new game."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "Karn\'s first and third abilities are linked. Similarly, Karn\'s second and third abilities are linked. Only non-Aura permanent cards exiled by either of Karn\'s first two abilities will remain in exile when the game restarts."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "No actions taken in the game that was restarted apply to the new game. For example, if you were dealt damage by Stigma Lasher in the original game, the effect that states you can\'t gain life doesn\'t carry over to the new game."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "Permanents put onto the battlefield due to Karn\'s ability will have been under the starting controller\'s control continuously since the beginning of that player\'s first turn. Creatures among them can attack and their activated abilities with {T} in the cost can be activated."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "Players can\'t move cards between their deck and sideboard before the new game."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "Players won\'t have any counters or emblems they had in the original game."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': \'The number of times a player has cast their commander from the command zone resets to zero. The amount of combat damage dealt to players by each commander is reset to 0.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "The player who controlled the ability that restarted the game is the starting player in the new game. The new game starts like a game normally does: Each player shuffles their deck (except the cards left in exile by Karn\'s ability). Each player\'s life total becomes 20 (or the starting life total for whatever format you\'re playing). Players draw a hand of seven cards. Players may take mulligans. Players may take actions based on cards in their opening hands, such as those of Leylines."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "If each creature the defending player controls can\'t block for any reason (such as being tapped), then the affected creature isn\'t blocked. If there\'s a cost associated with blocking the affected creature, the defending player isn\'t forced to pay that cost, so it doesn\'t have to be blocked in that case either."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': \'Only one creature is required to block the affected creature. Other creatures may also block it and are free to block other creatures or not block at all.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "If some of the targets become illegal for Kuldotha Flamefiend\'s ability, the original division of damage still applies, but the damage that would have been dealt to illegal targets isn\'t dealt at all. If all of the targets become illegal, you can\'t sacrifice an artifact."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "You divide the damage as Kuldotha Flamefiend\'s triggered ability is put onto the stack, not as it resolves. Each target must be assigned at least 1 damage. You can\'t choose more than 4 targets and assign 0 damage to a target."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "You don\'t choose whether to sacrifice an artifact or which artifact you\'re sacrificing until the ability resolves. Once you decide to sacrifice an artifact (or not), it\'s too late for players to respond."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': \'You may choose zero targets. If you do, Kuldotha Flamefiend deals no damage, but you may sacrifice an artifact.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "In a multiplayer game, a player may lose the game at the same time that their creatures die. If so, Bone Picker\'s cost reduction applies."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "Unlike Skirsdag High Priest itself, the two other creatures you tap to activate its ability aren\'t required to have been under your control continuously since the beginning of your most recent turn."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "Valor in Akros\'s ability affects only creatures you control at the time the ability resolves, including the creature that caused it to trigger. Creatures you begin to control later in the turn won\'t get +1/+1."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': \'A casting cost of {X}{X} means that you pay twice X. If you want X to be 3, you pay {6} to cast Walking Ballista.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "If Walking Ballista has been dealt damage or had its toughness reduced by an effect, this limits how many times you\'ll be able to remove +1/+1 counters from it in a single turn. For example, if it has three +1/+1 counters on it and has been dealt 1 damage this turn, it will be destroyed immediately after you activate the ability a second time and you won\'t be able to activate it a third time."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': \'Golem Artisan can be the target of its own abilities.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "You don\'t choose whether the target artifact creature gains flying, trample, or haste until Golem Artisan\'s second ability resolves."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': \'If there are no other creatures on the battlefield when the morbid ability triggers, the ability must target Morkrut Banshee itself.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "Morkrut Banshee\'s morbid ability triggers only once, not once for each creature that has died this turn. If no creatures have died by the time it enters the battlefield, its ability won\'t trigger at all."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': \'If you target a creature you control with Might of the Masses, remember to count that creature when determining the amount of the bonus.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "The size of the bonus is determined as Might of the Masses resolves; it won\'t change if the number of creatures you control changes later in the turn."}]', "[{'date': '2020-08-07', 'text': 'Iron Bully can be the target of its own ability.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-08-07', 'text': 'The number of +1/+1 counters you put on Woodland Champion is the number of tokens that entered the battlefield under your control, even if some or all of them leave the battlefield before the triggered ability resolves.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2020-09-25\', \'text\': "A landfall ability doesn\'t trigger if a permanent already on the battlefield becomes a land."}, {\'date\': \'2020-09-25\', \'text\': \'A landfall ability triggers whenever a land enters the battlefield under your control for any reason. It triggers whenever you play a land, as well as whenever a spell or ability puts a land onto the battlefield under your control.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-09-25\', \'text\': "Felidar Retreat\'s second mode affects only creatures you control at the time the ability resolves, including creatures you control but that for some reason didn\'t get a +1/+1 counter. Creatures you begin to control later in the turn won\'t gain vigilance or get a +1/+1 counter."}, {\'date\': \'2020-09-25\', \'text\': \'Whenever a land enters the battlefield under your control, each landfall ability of the permanents you control will trigger. You can put them on the stack in any order. The last ability you put on the stack will be the first one to resolve.\'}]', "[{'date': '2020-09-25', 'text': 'A landfall ability doesn’t trigger if a permanent already on the battlefield becomes a land.'}, {'date': '2020-09-25', 'text': 'A landfall ability triggers whenever a land enters the battlefield under your control for any reason. It triggers whenever you play a land, as well as whenever a spell or ability puts a land onto the battlefield under your control.'}, {'date': '2020-09-25', 'text': 'Whenever a land enters the battlefield under your control, each landfall ability of the permanents you control will trigger. You can put them on the stack in any order. The last ability you put on the stack will be the first one to resolve.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-09-25', 'text': 'An ability that triggers when a creature becomes the target of a spell resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger. It resolves even if that spell is countered.'}, {'date': '2020-09-25', 'text': 'If a creature without a +1/+1 counter on it becomes the target of a spell an opponent controls, putting a +1/+1 counter on it after that won’t cause Swarm Shambler’s middle ability to trigger.'}, {'date': '2020-09-25', 'text': 'If a spell targets a creature you control with a +1/+1 counter on it more than once, Swarm Shambler’s ability triggers only once.'}, {'date': '2020-09-25', 'text': 'You create just one Insect token, no matter how many +1/+1 counters the target creature has on it.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-09-25', 'text': 'An ability that triggers whenever you gain life “for the first time each turn” won’t trigger if you gain life during a turn before the permanent with that ability is on the battlefield, even if you gain life again later in the turn.'}, {'date': '2020-09-25', 'text': 'An ability that triggers “whenever you gain life” triggers just once for each life-gaining event, no matter how much life you gain.'}, {'date': '2020-09-25', 'text': 'Each creature with lifelink dealing combat damage causes a separate life-gaining event. For example, if two creatures you control with lifelink deal combat damage at the same time, a “whenever you gain life” ability will trigger twice. However, if a single creature you control with lifelink deals combat damage to multiple creatures, players, and/or planeswalkers at the same time (perhaps because it has trample or was blocked by more than one creature), the ability will trigger only once.'}, {'date': '2020-09-25', 'text': 'If you gain an amount of life “for each” of something, that life is gained as one event and the ability will trigger only once.'}, {'date': '2020-09-25', 'text': 'In a Two-Headed Giant game, life gained by your teammate won’t cause the ability to trigger, even though it caused your team’s life total to increase.'}, {'date': '2020-09-25', 'text': 'Multiple instances of lifelink on the same creature are redundant.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-09-25', 'text': 'An ability that triggers “whenever you gain life” triggers just once for each life-gaining event, no matter how much life you gain.'}, {'date': '2020-09-25', 'text': 'Each creature with lifelink dealing combat damage causes a separate life-gaining event. For example, if two creatures you control with lifelink deal combat damage at the same time, a “whenever you gain life” ability will trigger twice. However, if a single creature you control with lifelink deals combat damage to multiple creatures, players, and/or planeswalkers at the same time (perhaps because it has trample or was blocked by more than one creature), the ability will trigger only once.'}, {'date': '2020-09-25', 'text': 'If you gain an amount of life “for each” of something, that life is gained as one event and the ability will trigger only once.'}, {'date': '2020-09-25', 'text': 'In a Two-Headed Giant game, Marauding Blight-Priest’s ability causes the opposing team to lose 2 life.'}, {'date': '2020-09-25', 'text': 'In a Two-Headed Giant game, life gained by your teammate won’t cause the ability to trigger, even though it caused your team’s life total to increase.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-09-25', 'text': 'If Iridescent Hornbeetle leaves the battlefield before your end step, its ability won’t trigger at all. You won’t create any tokens.'}, {'date': '2020-09-25', 'text': 'If a creature enters the battlefield under your control with +1/+1 counters on it, Iridescent Hornbeetle’s ability counts those counters.'}, {'date': '2020-09-25', 'text': 'Iridescent Hornbeetle’s ability counts the number of +1/+1 counters you’ve put on your creatures, even if that happened before Iridescent Hornbeetle was on the battlefield, and even if those creatures are no longer on the battlefield or under your control (and, in some rare cases, even if those creatures aren’t creatures anymore).'}]", "[{'date': '2020-09-25', 'text': 'If the target creature is an illegal target by the time Chilling Trap tries to resolve, the spell doesn’t resolve. You don’t draw a card if you control a Wizard.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-09-25', 'text': 'If you choose a target creature and it’s an illegal target by the time Scale the Heights tries to resolve, the spell doesn’t resolve. You don’t gain life, draw a card, or get to play an additional land.'}, {'date': '2020-09-25', 'text': 'The permission to play lands is cumulative with other effects that allow you to play additional lands, such as that of Nahiri’s Lithoforming.'}, {'date': '2020-09-25', 'text': 'You don’t play a land as Scale the Heights resolves; Scale the Heights fully resolves first and you draw a card, perhaps including a land you’ll play later. If it’s not your turn, you won’t be able to play a land this turn at all.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-09-25', 'text': 'If you don’t play the exiled card you chose, it remains exiled. The card you didn’t choose remains exiled whether you play the chosen card or not.'}, {'date': '2020-09-25', 'text': 'Magmatic Channeler gets just +3/+1 from its first ability, no matter how many instant and sorcery cards are in your graveyard beyond the fourth.'}, {'date': '2020-09-25', 'text': 'You choose which card you’ll be allowed to play this turn while Magmatic Channeler’s ability is resolving, but you must follow the normal timing permissions and restrictions for the card when you play it. If it’s a land, you can’t play it unless you have land plays available.'}, {'date': '2020-09-25', 'text': 'You’ll still pay all costs for a spell cast this way, including additional costs. You may also pay alternative costs if any are available.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-09-25', 'text': 'If you don’t play the exiled card, it remains exiled.'}, {'date': '2020-09-25', 'text': 'You must follow the normal timing permissions and restrictions for the exiled card. If it’s a land, you can’t play it unless you have land plays available.'}, {'date': '2020-09-25', 'text': 'You’ll still pay all costs for a spell cast this way, including additional costs. You may also pay alternative costs if any are available.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "Although the targeted player doesn\'t need to find a basic land card if they don\'t want to, that player must shuffle their library."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "Anointer of Valor\'s triggered ability triggers when any creature attacks any player or planeswalker."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'If you choose to pay {3}, a second triggered ability triggers. Players may respond to that reflexive triggered ability before the +1/+1 counter is put on the creature.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "You can\'t pay {3} more than once to put more than one +1/+1 counter on the attacking creature."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "Because Corpse Churn doesn\'t target the creature card in your graveyard, you may choose one of the three cards you put there from your library if applicable."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "Effects that modify a creature\'s power and/or toughness, such as the ones created by Titanic Growth or a +/1+1 counter, will apply to the creature no matter when they started to take effect. The same is true for any counters that change its power and/or toughness and effects that switch power and toughness."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If an Equipment becomes an artifact creature, it usually can\'t be attached to another creature. If it was attached to a creature, it becomes unattached."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If the artifact was already a creature, its base power and toughness will each become 5. This overwrites any previous effects that set the creature\'s base power and toughness to specific values. Any power- or toughness-setting effects that start to apply after Skilled Animator\'s ability resolves will overwrite this effect."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "Skilled Animator doesn\'t remove any abilities the target artifact has."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'The artifact retains any types, subtypes, or supertypes it has.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "The resulting artifact creature will be able to attack on your turn if it\'s been under your control continuously since the turn began. That is, it doesn\'t matter how long it\'s been a creature, just how long it\'s been on the battlefield."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If Ninth Bridge Patrol is dealt lethal damage at the same time as another creature you control, it won\'t receive a counter from its ability in time to save it."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "Ninth Bridge Patrol\'s ability doesn\'t care where the creature went or whether it\'s a creature in its new zone. It may have died, been exiled, returned to your hand, and so on. It won\'t trigger if an object remains on the battlefield but ceases to be a creature. It won\'t trigger if a creature phases out."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If a card in a player\'s library has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If you reveal a card with mana value 0, such as a land card, you won\'t draw any cards. Otherwise, the card you revealed will be the first card you draw."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "The ability to return Cage of Hands to its owner\'s hand can only be activated if Cage of Hands is on the battlefield. If Cage of Hands is no longer on the battlefield when the ability resolves, Cage of Hands remains in its new zone and isn\'t returned to its owner\'s hand."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "The triggered ability triggers both when Crow of Dark Tidings enters the battlefield and when it dies. You don\'t have to choose only one."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'Activated abilities contain a colon. They\\\'re generally written "[Cost]: [Effect]." Some keywords (such as equip) are activated abilities and will have colons in their reminder text. Loyalty abilities of planeswalkers are activated abilities.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "Faith\'s Fetters doesn\'t stop static abilities, triggered abilities, or mana abilities from working. A mana ability is an ability that produces mana, not an ability that costs mana."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If the target permanent is an illegal target by the time Faith\'s Fetters tries to resolve, it doesn\'t resolve. It won\'t enter the battlefield, so its enters-the-battlefield ability won\'t trigger."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'As long as Revenant is in your graveyard, its ability will count itself.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If Revenant is dealt lethal damage at the same time as another creature you control, both die at the same time. The other creature won\'t die in time to raise Revenant\'s toughness."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "The ability that defines Revenant\'s power and toughness applies in all zones, not just the battlefield."}]', "[{'date': '2020-11-10', 'text': 'Because damage remains marked on a creature until the damage is removed as the turn ends, nonlethal damage dealt to Elves you control may become lethal if Imperious Perfect leaves the battlefield during that turn.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-11-10', 'text': 'If you control zero artifacts, Welding Sparks deals 3 damage to the target creature.'}, {'date': '2020-11-10', 'text': 'The number of artifacts you control is counted only as Welding Sparks resolves.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'If you sacrifice Ordeal of Nylea in some other way, its last ability will trigger.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'The +1/+1 counter is put on the creature before blockers are declared and before combat damage is dealt.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "The check of whether the enchanted creature has three or more +1/+1 counters on it happens as part of the resolution of the attack triggered ability. If the third +1/+1 counter is put on the enchanted creature any other way, you won\'t sacrifice Ordeal of Nylea until the next time the creature attacks."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'Ivy Lane Denizen can be chosen as the target of its own ability.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "The green creature that entered the battlefield can be chosen as the target of Ivy Lane Denizen\'s ability."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'Sparktongue Dragon\\\'s triggered ability goes on the stack without a target. While that ability is resolving, you may pay {2}{R}. If you do, a second ability triggers and you pick a target that will be dealt damage. This is different from abilities that say "If you do . . ." in that players may cast spells and activate abilities after mana is paid but before damage is dealt.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "While resolving the triggered ability of Sparktongue Dragon, you can\'t pay {2}{R} multiple times to have it deal more than 3 damage."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'To move a counter from one creature to another, the counter is removed from the first creature and put onto the second. Any abilities that care about a counter being removed from or placed on a creature will apply.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "You choose a target creature as Scrounging Bandar\'s triggered ability is put onto the stack. You choose how many counters to move (if any) as that ability resolves. If that creature becomes an illegal target or if Scrounging Bandar has left the battlefield, you can\'t move any counters."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-02-05\', \'text\': "It doesn\'t matter how many Elves enter the battlefield under your control. The ability creates only one Elf Warrior creature token."}, {\'date\': \'2021-02-05\', \'text\': "Once the triggered ability has triggered once during a turn, it can\'t trigger again, even if the triggered ability is still on the stack, has been countered, or has otherwise left the stack."}, {\'date\': \'2021-02-05\', \'text\': "The activated ability affects only Elves you control as the ability resolves. Elves you begin to control later in the turn won\'t get the bonuses. Creatures you control that become Elves later in the turn won\'t get the bonuses, and Elves you control that got the bonuses that stop being Elves later in the turn won\'t lose them."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-02-05\', \'text\': "You must sacrifice exactly one creature to cast this spell; you can\'t cast it without sacrificing a creature, and you can\'t sacrifice additional creatures."}]', "[{'date': '2021-02-05', 'text': 'A land that becomes a creature because of Avalanche Caller’s activated ability will retain any other supertypes, card types, subtypes, and abilities it had. In particular, it will be a snow creature land.'}, {'date': '2021-02-05', 'text': 'In most cases, the land that becomes a creature will remain colorless. If another effect caused the land to have one or more colors, the resulting creature land will retain those colors.'}, {'date': '2021-02-05', 'text': 'Snow is a supertype, not a card type. It has no rules meaning or function by itself, but spells and abilities may refer to it.'}, {'date': '2021-02-05', 'text': 'Snow isn’t a type of mana. If an effect says you may spend mana as though it were any type, you can’t pay for {S} using mana that wasn’t produced by a snow source.'}, {'date': '2021-02-05', 'text': 'Some cards have additional effects for each {S} spent to cast them. You can cast these spells even if you don’t spend any snow mana to cast them; their additional effects simply won’t do anything.'}, {'date': '2021-02-05', 'text': 'The Kaldheim set doesn’t have any cards with mana costs that include {S}, but some previous sets do. If an effect says such a spell costs {1} less to cast, that reduction doesn’t apply to any {S} costs. This is also true for activated abilities that include {S} in their activation costs and effects that reduce those costs.'}, {'date': '2021-02-05', 'text': 'The activated ability doesn’t cause the target snow land to become tapped or untapped.'}, {'date': '2021-02-05', 'text': 'The {S} symbol is a generic mana symbol. It represents a cost that can be paid by one mana that was produced by a snow source. That mana can be any color or colorless.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-02-05', 'text': 'Activating Frostpeak Yeti’s ability after it’s already been blocked won’t cause it to become unblocked.'}, {'date': '2021-02-05', 'text': 'Snow is a supertype, not a card type. It has no rules meaning or function by itself, but spells and abilities may refer to it.'}, {'date': '2021-02-05', 'text': 'Snow isn’t a type of mana. If an effect says you may spend mana as though it were any type, you can’t pay for {S} using mana that wasn’t produced by a snow source.'}, {'date': '2021-02-05', 'text': 'Some cards have additional effects for each {S} spent to cast them. You can cast these spells even if you don’t spend any snow mana to cast them; their additional effects simply won’t do anything.'}, {'date': '2021-02-05', 'text': 'The Kaldheim set doesn’t have any cards with mana costs that include {S}, but some previous sets do. If an effect says such a spell costs {1} less to cast, that reduction doesn’t apply to any {S} costs. This is also true for activated abilities that include {S} in their activation costs and effects that reduce those costs.'}, {'date': '2021-02-05', 'text': 'The {S} symbol is a generic mana symbol. It represents a cost that can be paid by one mana that was produced by a snow source. That mana can be any color or colorless.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-02-05', 'text': 'Although players may respond to the activated ability, they can’t respond to the paying of its activation cost. The creature card will already be exiled by the time anyone can respond.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-02-05', 'text': 'An Angel spell is a creature spell with the creature type Angel. Instant, sorcery, and enchantment cards that may create Angel tokens are not Angel spells.'}, {'date': '2021-02-05', 'text': 'The cost reduction applies only to generic mana in the costs of Angel spells you cast. It can’t reduce requirements of specific colors of mana.'}, {'date': '2021-02-05', 'text': 'To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost you’re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions (such as that of Starnheim Aspirant). The converted mana cost of the spell is determined only by its mana cost, no matter what the total cost to cast the spell was.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-02-05', 'text': 'An ability that triggers when a creature becomes the target of a spell resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger. Such an ability resolves even if that spell is countered.'}, {'date': '2021-02-05', 'text': 'If a spell targets Goldspan Dragon more than once, the triggered ability will trigger only once.'}, {'date': '2021-02-05', 'text': 'Players can cast spells and activate abilities after the triggered ability resolves but before the spell that caused it to trigger does.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-02-05', 'text': 'Because damage remains marked on creatures until the damage is removed as the turn ends, nonlethal damage dealt to creatures you control may become lethal if Righteous Valkyrie leaves the battlefield that turn.'}, {'date': '2021-02-05', 'text': 'The amount of life you gain is equal to the Angel or Cleric’s toughness as the triggered ability resolves. If the Angel or Cleric is no longer on the battlefield at that time, use its toughness from when it was last on the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-02-05', 'text': 'Casting Stalwart Valkyrie for its alternative cost doesn’t change when you can cast it.'}, {'date': '2021-02-05', 'text': 'Once you announce that you’re casting Stalwart Valkyrie using its alternative cost, no player may take other actions until the spell’s been paid for. Notably, players can’t try to remove creature cards from your graveyard to stop you from casting the spell.'}, {'date': '2021-02-05', 'text': 'Stalwart Valkyrie has converted mana cost 4, no matter what you actually paid to cast it.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2021-02-05\', \'text\': \'Changeling is a characteristic-defining ability. It functions in all zones, not only while a card that has it is on the battlefield.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-02-05\', \'text\': "If Bloodline Pretender enters the battlefield at the same time as another creature, you can choose one of that creature\'s creature types and have Bloodline Pretender\'s last ability trigger for that other creature."}, {\'date\': \'2021-02-05\', \'text\': "If Bloodline Pretender is somehow on the battlefield without a chosen creature type, its last ability can\'t trigger, even if a creature with no creature types enters the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2021-02-05\', \'text\': \'If an effect causes a creature with changeling to become a new creature type, it will be only that new creature type. It will still have changeling; the effect making it all creature types will simply be overwritten.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-02-05\', \'text\': \'If an effect causes a creature with changeling to lose all abilities, it will remain all creature types, even though it will no longer have changeling. This is because changeling applies before the effect that removes it.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-02-05\', \'text\': \'The subtype Shapeshifter that appears on the type line is mostly there to reinforce the flavor. A creature card with changeling is just as much an Elf, a Dwarf, a Sliver, a Goat, a Coward, and a Zombie as it is a Shapeshifter.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-02-05\', \'text\': "You must choose an existing creature type, such as Vampire or Druid. You can\'t choose card types (e.g., artifact) or supertypes (e.g., snow)."}]', "[{'date': '2021-02-05', 'text': 'Changeling is a characteristic-defining ability. It functions in all zones, not only while a card that has it is on the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2021-02-05', 'text': 'If an effect causes a creature with changeling to become a new creature type, it will be only that new creature type. It will still have changeling; the effect making it all creature types will simply be overwritten.'}, {'date': '2021-02-05', 'text': 'If an effect causes a creature with changeling to lose all abilities, it will remain all creature types, even though it will no longer have changeling. This is because changeling applies before the effect that removes it.'}, {'date': '2021-02-05', 'text': 'If you don’t control three or more creatures that share a creature type immediately after Littjara Kinseekers enters the battlefield, its ability doesn’t trigger. If you don’t control three or more as the ability resolves, you won’t put a +1/+1 counter on Littjara Kinseekers or scry 1. The three shared-type creatures you control when the ability resolves don’t have to be the same three you controlled when the ability triggered.'}, {'date': '2021-02-05', 'text': 'The subtype Shapeshifter that appears on the type line is mostly there to reinforce the flavor. A creature card with changeling is just as much an Elf, a Dwarf, a Sliver, a Goat, a Coward, and a Zombie as it is a Shapeshifter.'}, {'date': '2021-02-05', 'text': 'Three creatures share a creature type if there’s at least one creature type all three have, no matter what other creature types they have. For example, Littjara Kinseekers (which has all creature types), an Elf Warrior, and an Elf Wizard share a creature type because they’re all Elves.'}, {'date': '2021-02-05', 'text': 'You put just one +1/+1 counter on Littjara Kinseekers and scry 1, no matter how many extra trios of creatures that share a creature type you control.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-02-05', 'text': 'Changeling is a characteristic-defining ability. It functions in all zones, not only while a card that has it is on the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2021-02-05', 'text': 'If an effect causes a creature with changeling to become a new creature type, it will be only that new creature type. It will still have changeling; the effect making it all creature types will simply be overwritten.'}, {'date': '2021-02-05', 'text': 'If an effect causes a creature with changeling to lose all abilities, it will remain all creature types, even though it will no longer have changeling. This is because changeling applies before the effect that removes it.'}, {'date': '2021-02-05', 'text': 'The subtype Shapeshifter that appears on the type line is mostly there to reinforce the flavor. A creature card with changeling is just as much an Elf, a Dwarf, a Sliver, a Goat, a Coward, and a Zombie as it is a Shapeshifter.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-02-05', 'text': 'Crewing a Vehicle doesn’t cause Giant Ox’s power or toughness to change.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-02-05', 'text': 'If Berg Strider enters the battlefield without being cast, no mana was spent to cast it. The enters-the-battlefield ability may still tap the target, but that permanent won’t be stopped from untapping during its controller’s next untap step.'}, {'date': '2021-02-05', 'text': 'Similarly, if an effect copies the creature spell that becomes Berg Strider, no mana was spent to cast the copy. The target won’t be stopped from untapping during its controller’s next untap step.'}, {'date': '2021-02-05', 'text': 'Snow is a supertype, not a card type. It has no rules meaning or function by itself, but spells and abilities may refer to it.'}, {'date': '2021-02-05', 'text': 'Snow isn’t a type of mana. If an effect says you may spend mana as though it were any type, you can’t pay for {S} using mana that wasn’t produced by a snow source.'}, {'date': '2021-02-05', 'text': 'Some cards have additional effects for each {S} spent to cast them. You can cast these spells even if you don’t spend any snow mana to cast them; their additional effects simply won’t do anything.'}, {'date': '2021-02-05', 'text': 'Spending more than one snow mana to cast Berg Strider won’t cause the artifact or creature to remain tapped for additional turns.'}, {'date': '2021-02-05', 'text': 'The Kaldheim set doesn’t have any cards with mana costs that include {S}, but some previous sets do. If an effect says such a spell costs {1} less to cast, that reduction doesn’t apply to any {S} costs. This is also true for activated abilities that include {S} in their activation costs and effects that reduce those costs.'}, {'date': '2021-02-05', 'text': 'The enters-the-battlefield ability can target an artifact or creature an opponent controls that’s already tapped. If snow mana was spent to cast Berg Strider, the target won’t untap during its controller’s next untap step.'}, {'date': '2021-02-05', 'text': 'The {S} symbol is a generic mana symbol. It represents a cost that can be paid by one mana that was produced by a snow source. That mana can be any color or colorless.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-02-05', 'text': 'If there’s a land card or Elf card in your graveyard, you must return one. You can’t choose not to in order to draw a card.'}, {'date': '2021-02-05', 'text': 'Roots of Wisdom doesn’t target any cards in graveyards. You may return a land card or an Elf card that was just milled or one that was already there.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-02-05', 'text': 'If you haven’t gained 4 life by the time an end step begins, Valkyrie Harbinger’s ability won’t trigger at all.'}, {'date': '2021-02-05', 'text': 'Valkyrie Harbinger’s ability looks at how much life you’ve gained in the turn, even if it wasn’t on the battlefield when you gained life. It doesn’t care if you also lost life, even if you lost more life than you gained.'}, {'date': '2021-02-05', 'text': 'You create just one Angel token, no matter how much life you’ve gained past 4 life.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-02-05', 'text': 'In a Limited event (usually Booster Draft or Sealed Deck), you can’t add basic snow lands to your card pool as you would other basic lands. You can play with basic snow lands only if you open them in your sealed deck or draft them.'}, {'date': '2021-02-05', 'text': 'Snow is a supertype, not a card type. It has no rules meaning or function by itself, but spells and abilities may refer to it.'}, {'date': '2021-02-05', 'text': 'Snow isn’t a type of mana. If an effect says you may spend mana as though it were any type, you can’t pay for {S} using mana that wasn’t produced by a snow source.'}, {'date': '2021-02-05', 'text': 'Some cards have additional effects for each {S} spent to cast them. You can cast these spells even if you don’t spend any snow mana to cast them; their additional effects simply won’t do anything.'}, {'date': '2021-02-05', 'text': 'The Kaldheim set doesn’t have any cards with mana costs that include {S}, but some previous sets do. If an effect says such a spell costs {1} less to cast, that reduction doesn’t apply to any {S} costs. This is also true for activated abilities that include {S} in their activation costs and effects that reduce those costs.'}, {'date': '2021-02-05', 'text': 'The {S} symbol is a generic mana symbol. It represents a cost that can be paid by one mana that was produced by a snow source. That mana can be any color or colorless.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-02-05', 'text': 'Once you announce that you’re activating the activated ability, no player may take actions until the ability has been paid for. Notably, opponents can’t try to remove one of your creature cards to stop you from exiling it.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-02-05', 'text': 'Snow is a supertype, not a card type. It has no rules meaning or function by itself, but spells and abilities may refer to it.'}, {'date': '2021-02-05', 'text': 'Snow isn’t a type of mana. If an effect says you may spend mana as though it were any type, you can’t pay for {S} using mana that wasn’t produced by a snow source.'}, {'date': '2021-02-05', 'text': 'Some cards have additional effects for each {S} spent to cast them. You can cast these spells even if you don’t spend any snow mana to cast them; their additional effects simply won’t do anything.'}, {'date': '2021-02-05', 'text': 'The Kaldheim set doesn’t have any cards with mana costs that include {S}, but some previous sets do. If an effect says such a spell costs {1} less to cast, that reduction doesn’t apply to any {S} costs. This is also true for activated abilities that include {S} in their activation costs and effects that reduce those costs.'}, {'date': '2021-02-05', 'text': 'The {S} symbol is a generic mana symbol. It represents a cost that can be paid by one mana that was produced by a snow source. That mana can be any color or colorless.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-02-05', 'text': 'The Elf Warrior creature token enters the battlefield as a 1/1 creature. Any abilities that trigger when a creature with a certain power or toughness enters the battlefield will see the token enter as a 1/1 creature.'}, {'date': '2021-02-05', 'text': 'You decide whether to pay {2} as the enters-the-battlefield ability resolves. If you do, you immediately create the Elf Warrior creature token and attach Elven Bow to it. No players may respond to your decision to pay or not, and no player may take actions during this process.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-02-05', 'text': 'The reanimating effect of Demonic Gifts works only once. Once the creature dies and returns to the battlefield, it’s a new object with no relation to the creature it was. If that new creature dies, it won’t come back.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-02-05', 'text': 'Use the toughness of the creature as the last ability resolves to determine how much life you gain. If the Elf is no longer on the battlefield at that time, use its toughness from when it was last on the battlefield.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "Courser of Kruphix doesn\'t change when you can play lands. You can do so only during your main phase when you have priority and the stack is empty."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If the top card of your library changes while you\'re casting a spell, playing a land, or activating an ability, you don\'t reveal the new top card until you finish doing so. This means that if you play a land from the top of your library, you can\'t look at the next one until you\'ve handled any replacement effects that modify that land entering the battlefield, such as that of Vesuva."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "Playing a land from the top of your library counts as your land play for the turn. Once you play a land during your turn, you won\'t be able to play an additional land from the top of your library unless another effect (such as that of Azusa, Lost but Seeking) allows you to."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'While playing with the top card of your library revealed, if you draw multiple cards, reveal each one before you draw it. If you put multiple cards on top of your library at once, reveal only the one new top card.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If a token is exiled this way, it will cease to exist and won\'t return to the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "Once the exiled creature returns, it\'s considered a new object with no relation to the object that it was. Auras attached to the exiled creature will be put into their owners\' graveyards. Equipment attached to the exiled creature will become unattached and remain on the battlefield. Any counters on the exiled creature will cease to exist."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "When an effect returns the exiled card “under your control,” you control it indefinitely after that. If you had temporarily gained control of a creature, it won\'t return to its previous controller. In a multiplayer game, if a player leaves the game, all cards that player owns leave as well. If you leave the game, a creature you took with Restoration Angel\'s effect is exiled."}]', "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'A spell cast using flashback will always be exiled afterward, whether it resolves, is countered, or leaves the stack in some other way.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If a card with flashback is put into your graveyard during your turn, you can cast it if it’s legal to do so before any other player can take any actions.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost (such as a flashback cost) you’re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell is determined only by its mana cost, no matter what the total cost to cast the spell was.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'You can cast a spell using flashback even if it was somehow put into your graveyard without having been cast.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions, including those based on the card’s type. For instance, you can cast a sorcery using flashback only when you could normally cast a sorcery.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': '“Flashback [cost]” means “You may cast this card from your graveyard by paying [cost] rather than paying its mana cost” and “If the flashback cost was paid, exile this card instead of putting it anywhere else any time it would leave the stack.”'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'Abilities that apply "as [this artifact or creature] enters the battlefield," such as choosing a color with Gauntlet of Power, are also unaffected.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'If a triggered ability is linked to a second ability, additional instances of that triggered ability are also linked to that second ability. If the second ability refers to "the exiled card," it refers to all cards exiled by instances of the triggered ability.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'If an artifact or creature entering the battlefield at the same time as Panharmonicon (including Panharmonicon itself) causes a triggered ability of a permanent you control to trigger, that ability triggers an additional time.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'If you control two Panharmonicons, an artifact or creature entering the battlefield causes abilities to trigger three times, not four. A third Panharmonicon causes abilities to trigger four times, a fourth causes abilities to trigger five times, and so on.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'In some cases involving linked abilities, an ability requires information about "the exiled card." When this happens, the ability gets multiple answers. If these answers are being used to determine the value of a variable, the sum is used. For example, if Elite Arcanist\\\'s enters-the-battlefield ability triggers twice, two cards are exiled. The value of X in the activation cost of Elite Arcanist\\\'s other ability is the sum of the two cards\\\' mana values. As the ability resolves, you create copies of both cards and can cast none, one, or both of the copies in any order.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'Panharmonicon affects a permanent\\\'s own enters-the-battlefield triggered abilities as well as other triggered abilities that trigger when that permanent enters the battlefield. Such triggered abilities start with "when" or "whenever."\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "Panharmonicon\'s effect doesn\'t copy the triggered ability; it just causes the ability to trigger twice. Any choices made as you put the ability onto the stack, such as modes and targets, are made separately for each instance of the ability. Any choices made on resolution, such as whether to put counters on a permanent, are also made individually."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "Replacement effects are unaffected by Panharmonicon\'s ability. For example, a creature that enters the battlefield with one +1/+1 counter on it won\'t receive an additional +1/+1 counter."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "You don\'t need to control the permanent entering the battlefield, only the permanent that has the triggered ability."}]', "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'An ability that triggers when a player casts a spell resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger, but after targets have been chosen for that spell. It resolves even if that spell is countered.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Because it’s not on the battlefield yet, casting Sigil of the Empty Throne won’t cause its own ability to trigger.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'An ability that triggers when a player casts a spell resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger, but after targets have been chosen for that spell. It resolves even if that spell is countered.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Any enters-the-battlefield abilities of the copied creature will trigger when the token enters the battlefield. Any “as [this permanent] enters the battlefield” or “[this permanent] enters the battlefield with” abilities of the copied creature card will also work.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If Kiki-Jiki’s ability creates multiple tokens due to a replacement effect (such as the one Doubling Season creates), you’ll sacrifice each of them.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If a copied creature is a token that isn’t a copy of something else, the copy copies the original characteristics of that token as stated by the effect that created it.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If a copied creature is copying something else, the token you create will use the copiable values of the target creature. In most cases, it will just be a copy of whatever that creature is copying.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If another creature becomes a copy of, or enters the battlefield as a copy of, the token, that creature will copy the creature card the token is copying, except it will also have haste. However, you won’t sacrifice the new copy at the beginning of the next end step.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If the copied creature has {X} in its mana cost, X is 0.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'The token copies exactly what was printed on the original creature (except that the copy also has haste) and nothing else (unless it’s copying a creature that’s a token or that’s copying something else; see below). It doesn’t copy whether the creature is tapped or untapped, whether it has any counters on it or Auras and/or Equipment attached to it, or any non-copy effects that changed its power, toughness, types, color, and so on. Most notably, if the target creature isn’t normally a creature, the copy won’t be a creature.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Because Wastes is a basic land, you can include as many of them as you like in your Constructed decks.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'In Limited events (including Sealed Deck and Booster Draft), Wastes must be in your card pool to be included in your deck. You can’t add Wastes to your card pool in the same way that you can add other basic lands.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Wastes is not a land type. If something asks you to name a land type, you can’t choose Wastes.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Each creature with lifelink dealing combat damage causes a separate life-gaining event. For example, if two creatures you control with lifelink deal combat damage at the same time, Ajani’s Pridemate’s ability will trigger twice. However, if a single creature you control with lifelink deals combat damage to multiple creatures, players, and/or planeswalkers at the same time (perhaps because it has trample or was blocked by more than one creature), the ability will trigger only once.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If Ajani’s Pridemate is dealt lethal damage at the same time that you gain life, it won’t receive a counter from its ability in time to save it.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If you gain an amount of life “for each” of something, that life is gained as one event and the ability of Ajani’s Pridemate triggers only once.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'In a Two-Headed Giant game, life gained by your teammate won’t cause the ability to trigger, even though it caused your team’s life total to increase.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'The ability of Ajani’s Pridemate triggers just once for each life-gaining event, whether it’s 1 life from Paradise Plume or 2 life from Mycologist.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If Clockwork Hydra leaves the battlefield while its trigger is on the stack, you can’t remove a +1/+1 counter from it, so it won’t deal damage.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If the chosen target is an illegal target by the time Clockwork Hydra’s triggered ability tries to resolve, the ability doesn’t resolve. You don’t remove a counter from Clockwork Hydra.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Objects with no mana cost, including lands that could produce colored mana, are colorless by default.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'The mana value of Lightning Axe is 1, no matter which additional cost you paid.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Urza’s is a land subtype that has no inherent rules meaning. Other effects may refer to it.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'Effects that increase or decrease costs are applied after you choose the value of X, and will not impact the results of the spell.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If an effect allows you to cast Multiple Choice without paying its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X. Cheating on tests is frowned upon.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'Multiple Choice doesn’t have any targets.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'You can choose 0 as the value of X as you cast Multiple Choice, but it will have no effect when it resolves.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If a creature’s power is less than 0 when it’s doubled, instead that creature gets -X/-0, where X is how much less than 0 its power is. For example, if an effect has given Reckless Amplimancer -4/-0 so that it’s a -2/2 creature, doubling its power and toughness gives it -2/+2, and it becomes a -4/4 creature.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If an effect instructs you to “double” a creature’s power, that creature gets +X/+0, where X is its power as that effect begins to apply. The same is true for toughness.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'If the target creature’s controller has zero cards left in their library when Bury in Books resolves, that creature becomes the top card of their library.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'Tivash’s ability counts the total amount of life gained without considering any life you lost during that turn. For example, if you lost 3 life and gained 4 life earlier in the turn, you may pay 4 life to create a 4/4 Demon.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'You can’t pay less life than the amount of life you gained to create a smaller but less harmful Demon.'}, {'date': '2021-04-16', 'text': 'You need to gain life before the end step begins for the last ability to trigger.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "The ability that defines Filigree Attendant\'s power works in all zones, not just the battlefield."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "The token is named Clue and has the artifact subtype Clue. Clue isn\'t a creature type."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "You can\'t sacrifice a Clue to activate its own ability and also to activate another ability that requires sacrificing a Clue (or any artifact) as a cost, such as that of Lonis, Cryptozoologist."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'Damage dealt to creatures remains on those creatures until the cleanup step or until an effect removes that damage. If you control Svyelun of Sea and Sky with at least 4 damage and two other Merfolk and one of those Merfolk leaves the battlefield (or stops being a Merfolk), Svyelun will be destroyed.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "If a player casts a spell that targets multiple permanents their opponent controls with ward, each of those ward abilities will trigger. If that player doesn\'t pay for all of them, the spell will be countered."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'"Flashback [cost]" means "You may cast this card from your graveyard by paying [cost] rather than paying its mana cost" and "If the flashback cost was paid, exile this card instead of putting it anywhere else any time it would leave the stack."\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'A spell cast using flashback will always be exiled afterward, whether it resolves, is countered, or leaves the stack in some other way.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "If a card with flashback is put into your graveyard during your turn, you can cast it if it\'s legal to do so before any other player can take any actions."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "If you cast Seize the Storm with no instant or sorcery cards in your graveyard and no cards with flashback in exile, the Elemental will start as a 0/0 creature. However, state-based actions won\'t be checked until after Seize the Storm has finished resolving. The Elemental will then be a 1/1 creature and survive because Seize the Storm will either be in your graveyard or in exile."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'The power and toughness of the Elemental token will change as the number of instant and sorcery cards in your graveyard and the number of cards with flashback you own in exile change.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost (such as a flashback cost) you\'re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell is determined only by its mana cost, no matter what the total cost to cast the spell was."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "While a spell is on the stack, it is neither in your graveyard nor in exile, so it won\'t contribute to the Elemental\'s power and toughness. For example, with Seize the Storm in your graveyard and no cards in exile, the 1/1 Elemental in the above scenario will become 0/0 and die if you cast Seize the Storm from your graveyard using flashback."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'You can cast a spell using flashback even if it was somehow put into your graveyard without having been cast.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions, including those based on the card\'s type. For instance, you can cast a sorcery using flashback only when you could normally cast a sorcery."}]', "[{'date': '2021-09-24', 'text': 'If you cast Electric Revelation using flashback, you must still pay its additional cost of discarding a card.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-11-19', 'text': 'Moldgraf Millipede gets a +1/+1 counter for every creature card in your graveyard, including any creature cards that were already there before you milled three cards.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-11-19', 'text': 'Packsong Pup gets only one +1/+1 counter as its first ability resolves, no matter how many other Wolf or Werewolf creatures you control.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \'Even when it is on a creature, Treasure is an artifact type and not a creature type. Similarly, Dog is always a creature type and not an artifact type.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \'If an effect refers to a Treasure, it means any Treasure artifact, not just a Treasure artifact token.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "Since Goldhound is a creature, its {T} ability can\'t be activated the turn that it enters the battlefield or the turn a player gains control of it unless it has haste."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-12-02\', \'text\': "The first triggered ability can trigger only once each turn. It doesn\'t matter whether Alandra, Sky Dreamer was on the battlefield when the first card was drawn. If it\'s not on the battlefield when the second card is drawn, the ability can\'t trigger at all that turn. It won\'t trigger when the third or fourth card is drawn."}, {\'date\': \'2022-12-02\', \'text\': \'The same is true for the last ability and the fifth card drawn.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-12-02\', \'text\': "The value of X is locked in as the last ability resolves. The bonus it grants won\'t change after that point, even if the number of cards in your hand does."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-12-08\', \'text\': "A noncreature permanent that becomes a creature can attack, and its {T} abilities can be activated, only if its controller has continuously controlled that permanent since the beginning of their most recent turn. It doesn\'t matter how long the permanent has been a creature. Notably, if you turn Mishra\'s Factory into a creature on the turn it entered the battlefield, you won\'t be able to then activate its first or last abilities."}, {\'date\': \'2022-12-08\', \'text\': "After it becomes a creature, Mishra\'s Factory will still have all its abilities."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-12-08\', \'text\': "If Juggernaut can\'t attack for any reason (such as being tapped or having come under your control that turn), then it doesn\'t attack. If there\'s a cost associated with having it attack, you\'re not forced to pay that cost, so it doesn\'t have to attack in that case either."}]', "[{'date': '2022-12-08', 'text': 'Because damage remains marked on a creature until it’s removed as the turn ends, nonlethal damage dealt to an Angel you control may become lethal if Lyra leaves the battlefield during that turn.'}, {'date': '2022-12-08', 'text': 'Multiple instances of lifelink on the same creature are redundant.'}]", "[{'date': '2022-12-08', 'text': 'Oversold Cemetery’s ability will check your graveyard as your upkeep begins, before any player has the opportunity to take any actions. If you have fewer than four creature cards in your graveyard at that time, the ability won’t trigger at all. If the ability does trigger, it will check again as it tries to resolve. If you have fewer than four creature cards in your graveyard at that point, the ability won’t have any effect.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': "You must discard exactly one card to cast Thrill of Possibility; you can\'t cast it without discarding a card, and you can\'t discard additional cards."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2024-01-12\', \'text\': "Because convoke isn\'t an alternative cost, it can be used in conjunction with alternative costs."}, {\'date\': \'2024-01-12\', \'text\': "If a creature you control has a mana ability with {T} in the cost, activating that ability while casting a spell with convoke will result in the creature being tapped before you pay the spell\'s costs. You won\'t be able to tap it again for convoke. Similarly, if you sacrifice a creature to activate a mana ability while casting a spell with convoke, that creature won\'t be on the battlefield when you pay the spell\'s costs, so you won\'t be able to tap it for convoke."}, {\'date\': \'2024-01-12\', \'text\': "Tapping a multicolored creature using convoke will pay for {1} or one mana of your choice of any of that creature\'s colors."}, {\'date\': \'2024-01-12\', \'text\': "Tapping an untapped creature that\'s attacking or blocking to convoke a spell won\'t cause that creature to stop attacking or blocking."}, {\'date\': \'2024-01-12\', \'text\': "When calculating a spell\'s total cost, include any alternative costs, additional costs, or anything else that increases or reduces the cost to cast the spell. Convoke applies after the total cost is calculated. Convoke doesn\'t change a spell\'s mana cost or mana value."}, {\'date\': \'2024-01-12\', \'text\': "You can tap any untapped creature you control to convoke a spell, even one you haven\'t controlled continuously since the beginning of your most recent turn."}]']
foreign_names: ['[{\'name\': "Ob Nixilis\' Grausamkeit", \'text\': \'Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält -5/-5 bis zum Ende des Zuges. Falls die Kreatur in diesem Zug sterben würde, schicke sie stattdessen ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Ob Nixilis war auf Ravnica gefangen und hasste beide Seiten gleichermaßen. Also begnügte er sich mit wahlloser Folter.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594108&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'965db7a6-be64-47a4-b64f-2618b1504c34\', \'multiverseId\': 594108}, \'multiverseid\': 594108}, {\'name\': \'Crueldad de Ob Nixilis\', \'text\': \'La criatura objetivo obtiene -5/-5 hasta el final del turno. Si esa criatura fuera a morir este turno, en vez de eso, exíliala.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Atrapado en Rávnica y sin afinidad por ningún bando, Ob Nixilis buscó gratificación en el tormento aleatorio.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594225&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ac31b826-7d5f-402c-8698-e945770d4dc6\', \'multiverseId\': 594225}, \'multiverseid\': 594225}, {\'name\': "Cruauté d\'Ob Nixilis", \'text\': "Une créature ciblée gagne -5/-5 jusqu\'à la fin du tour. Si cette créature devait mourir ce tour-ci, exilez-la à la place.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "Coincé sur Ravnica sans préférence pour l\'un des deux camps, Ob Nixilis passa le temps à opérer divers actes de torture.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594342&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'63c54679-4f50-4023-914f-5dcac5c730f9\', \'multiverseId\': 594342}, \'multiverseid\': 594342}, {\'name\': \'Crudeltà di Ob Nixilis\', \'text\': \'Una creatura bersaglio prende -5/-5 fino alla fine del turno. Se quella creatura sta per morire in questo turno, invece esiliala.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'Intrappolato su Ravnica senza affinità per alcuna delle due fazioni, Ob Nixilis cercava di compiacersi con atti di tortura casuali.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594459&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b677948d-d7d9-44bc-83da-ab575b67c01b\', \'multiverseId\': 594459}, \'multiverseid\': 594459}, {\'name\': \'オブ・ニクシリスの残虐\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは－５/－５の修整を受ける。このターン、そのクリーチャーが死亡するなら、代わりにそれを追放する。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'ラヴニカに捕らわれたままどちらにも関わりのないオブ・ニクシリスは、気晴らしとして気紛れに残虐行為を行っていた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594576&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f7117f55-1bec-431f-8d30-c1dda483680e\', \'multiverseId\': 594576}, \'multiverseid\': 594576}, {\'name\': \'欧尼希兹的酷行\', \'text\': \'目标生物得-5/-5直到回合结束。如果本回合中该生物将死去，则改为将它放逐。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'受困拉尼卡后，无意加入任一方的欧尼希兹只能从恣意折磨中寻得慰藉。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594927&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'44e413e6-18ff-466e-b115-b01b4088dff9\', \'multiverseId\': 594927}, \'multiverseid\': 594927}]', '[{\'name\': \'Abenteuerlust\', \'text\': \'Schaue dir die obersten drei Karten deiner Bibliothek an. Du kannst davon eine Kreaturen- oder Länderkarte offen vorzeigen und auf deine Hand nehmen. Lege den Rest in beliebiger Reihenfolge unter deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Ein Abenteuer ohne Gefährten ist kaum ein richtiges Abenteuer.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592826&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'98a9e77b-b9cb-41a4-a68a-7e93a9391879\', \'multiverseId\': 592826}, \'multiverseid\': 592826}, {\'name\': \'Impulso aventurero\', \'text\': \'Mira las tres primeras cartas de tu biblioteca. Puedes mostrar una carta de criatura o de tierra de entre ellas y ponerla en tu mano. Pon el resto en el fondo de tu biblioteca en cualquier orden.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Una aventura sin un compañero no se puede considerar una aventura.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592947&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6fb4e102-3bcf-4a4c-b3e2-b98c499acac4\', \'multiverseId\': 592947}, \'multiverseid\': 592947}, {\'name\': \'Impulsion audacieuse\', \'text\': "Regardez les trois cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Vous pouvez révéler une carte de créature ou de terrain parmi elles et la mettre dans votre main. Mettez le reste au-dessous de votre bibliothèque, dans l\'ordre de votre choix.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Une aventure sans compagnon n\'est pas vraiment une aventure.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593068&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3f89bf09-599b-4a2b-9a72-0456ca71a10e\', \'multiverseId\': 593068}, \'multiverseid\': 593068}, {\'name\': \'Impulso Avventuroso\', \'text\': \'Guarda le prime tre carte del tuo grimorio. Puoi rivelare una carta creatura o terra scelta tra esse e aggiungerla alla tua mano. Metti le altre in fondo al tuo grimorio in qualsiasi ordine.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': "Un\'avventura senza un compagno non è degna di questo nome.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593189&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'64b21767-9eff-4ba1-be09-3b996728d938\', \'multiverseId\': 593189}, \'multiverseid\': 593189}, {\'name\': \'冒険の衝動\', \'text\': \'あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード３枚を見る。あなたは「その中からクリーチャーや土地であるカード１枚を公開し、あなたの手札に加える。」を選んでもよい。残りをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に望む順番で置く。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'相棒のいない冒険は、冒険とは言い難い。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593310&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dd172414-fca0-4f64-a2bb-1d2552bc11d2\', \'multiverseId\': 593310}, \'multiverseid\': 593310}, {\'name\': \'冒险冲动\', \'text\': \'检视你牌库顶的三张牌。你可以展示其中一张生物或地牌并置于你手上。将其余的牌以任意顺序置于你牌库底。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'没有行侣的冒险，就根本不能称为冒险。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593673&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1502fd42-9ca2-4a9a-bdc2-0889edf13ffb\', \'multiverseId\': 593673}, \'multiverseid\': 593673}]', '[{\'name\': \'Abenteurer-Ausstattung\', \'text\': \'Landung — Immer wenn ein Land unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, erhält die ausgerüstete Kreatur +2/+2 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\\nAusrüsten {1} ({1}: Lege diese Karte an eine Kreatur deiner Wahl an, die du kontrollierst. Spiele Ausrüsten wie eine Hexerei.)\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Ausrüstung\', \'flavor\': \'Alles, was ein Erforscher in einer wilden Welt benötigt.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596255&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'056af612-a57c-4aa1-b8f2-59a2b6391300\', \'multiverseId\': 596255}, \'multiverseid\': 596255}, {\'name\': \'Atavío de aventurero\', \'text\': \'Aterrizaje — Siempre que una tierra entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, la criatura equipada obtiene +2/+2 hasta el final del turno.\\nEquipar {1}. ({1}: Anexa este Equipo a la criatura objetivo que controlas. Activa la habilidad de equipar como un conjuro.)\', \'type\': \'Artefacto — Equipo\', \'flavor\': \'Lo básico para un explorador de viaje.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596342&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8f7499a6-a901-4236-90c9-7a50e51eae2b\', \'multiverseId\': 596342}, \'multiverseid\': 596342}, {\'name\': "Attirail d\'aventure", \'text\': "Toucheterre — À chaque fois qu\'un terrain arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, la créature équipée gagne +2/+2 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.\\nÉquipement {1} ({1} : Attachez à une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez. N\'attachez l\'équipement que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.)", \'type\': \'Artefact : équipement\', \'flavor\': "Les outils de l\'explorateur dans un monde sauvage.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596429&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3139f7dd-1c6f-476d-8ea8-e68aed59bd5d\', \'multiverseId\': 596429}, \'multiverseid\': 596429}, {\'name\': "Dotazione dell\'Avventuriero", \'text\': \'Terraferma — Ogniqualvolta una terra entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, la creatura equipaggiata prende +2/+2 fino alla fine del turno.\\nEquipaggiare {1} ({1}: Assegna a una creatura bersaglio che controlli. Equipaggia solo come una stregoneria.)\', \'type\': \'Artefatto — Equipaggiamento\', \'flavor\': \'Lo stretto indispensabile a un esploratore nelle zone selvagge.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596516&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f158fd11-a741-41cd-aa29-0e46847c8497\', \'multiverseId\': 596516}, \'multiverseid\': 596516}, {\'name\': \'冒険者の装具\', \'text\': \'上陸 ― 土地１つがあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、ターン終了時まで、装備しているクリーチャーは＋２/＋２の修整を受ける。\\n装備{1}（{1}：あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。これをそれにつける。装備はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。）\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 装備品\', \'flavor\': \'野蛮な世界での探検家の必需品。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596603&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'15ffe510-e6dc-468c-b585-b611b3f1db1d\', \'multiverseId\': 596603}, \'multiverseid\': 596603}, {\'name\': \'历险配备\', \'text\': \'地落～每当一个地在你的操控下进战场时，佩带此武具的生物得+2/+2直到回合结束。\\n佩带{1}（{1}：贴附在目标由你操控的生物上。只能于法术时机佩带。）\', \'type\': \'神器 ～武具\', \'flavor\': \'探险家在蛮荒世界的基本用具。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596864&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'11c46c2e-8b81-4b86-95ea-3e4ef91e879b\', \'multiverseId\': 596864}, \'multiverseid\': 596864}]', '[{\'name\': \'Abfaulen\', \'text\': \'Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält -3/-3 bis zum Ende des Zuges. Du verlierst 3 Lebenspunkte.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Allein dass es tödlich ist, würde schon reichen. Die Kunst aber besteht darin, das dadurch verursachte Leiden zu maximieren."\\n—Liliana Vess\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594138&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9b747e7a-2891-4829-9e34-9f4f44ac9377\', \'multiverseId\': 594138}, \'multiverseid\': 594138}, {\'name\': \'Ulcerar\', \'text\': \'La criatura objetivo obtiene -3/-3 hasta el final del turno. Pierdes 3 vidas.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Si solo fuera mortal, sería suficiente. Sin embargo, el arte consiste en maximizar el sufrimiento que provoca".\\n—Liliana Vess\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594255&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c0d9a73a-5f5f-4422-bdb4-2dc9c13df931\', \'multiverseId\': 594255}, \'multiverseid\': 594255}, {\'name\': \'Ulcération\', \'text\': "Une créature ciblée gagne -3/-3 jusqu\'à la fin du tour. Vous perdez 3 points de vie.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Si elle était simplement mortelle, cela suffirait. Optimiser la souffrance qu\'elle cause, cependant, est un véritable art. »\\n—Liliana Vess", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594372&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a1a8e4c2-0654-4da5-b0f2-d7706a75d45a\', \'multiverseId\': 594372}, \'multiverseid\': 594372}, {\'name\': \'Ulcerare\', \'text\': \'Una creatura bersaglio prende -3/-3 fino alla fine del turno. Perdi 3 punti vita.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Se fosse semplicemente letale, sarebbe sufficiente. La vera arte, tuttavia, sta nel portare all\\\'estremo la sofferenza che provoca."\\n—Liliana Vess\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594489&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0651e7d7-8e13-4bb4-9748-d0e0f45a9a8d\', \'multiverseId\': 594489}, \'multiverseid\': 594489}, {\'name\': \'潰瘍化\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、そのクリーチャーは－３/－３の修整を受ける。あなたは３点のライフを失う。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「単に致命的であるのなら、それだけで充分事足りるわ。それが与える苦しみを最大化する事こそが、美学なの。」\\n――リリアナ・ヴェス\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594606&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e01417ef-e992-4efe-b6f6-10718819068b\', \'multiverseId\': 594606}, \'multiverseid\': 594606}, {\'name\': \'溃烂\', \'text\': \'目标生物得-3/-3直到回合结束。你失去3点生命。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「如果目的仅在于致命，这就够了。但这门技艺是要使它造成的痛苦达到最大。」\\n～莉莲娜维斯\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594957&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f5afd5f0-f7a9-4abb-a803-275a167ac82d\', \'multiverseId\': 594957}, \'multiverseid\': 594957}]', '[{\'name\': \'Abgeklärte Vögtin\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du Lebenspunkte dazuerhältst, kannst du {W} bezahlen. Falls du dies tust, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf eine Kreatur deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Kleriker, Verbündeter\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich kann dir Stärke verleihen, aber Mut musst du selbst mitbringen."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591647&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'962bb9ae-f581-459c-bba7-0a9534beecbd\', \'multiverseId\': 591647}, \'multiverseid\': 591647}, {\'name\': \'Protectora serena\', \'text\': \'Siempre que ganes vidas, puedes pagar {W}. Si lo haces, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre la criatura objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Clérigo humano aliado\', \'flavor\': \'"Yo puedo darte fuerza, pero el valor tendrás que ponerlo tú".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591776&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4ec271ef-46d3-40ce-b696-ec4686b65edf\', \'multiverseId\': 591776}, \'multiverseid\': 591776}, {\'name\': \'Intendante sereine\', \'text\': \'À chaque fois que vous gagnez des points de vie, vous pouvez payer {W}. Si vous faites ainsi, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur une créature ciblée.\', \'type\': \'Créature : humain et clerc et allié\', \'flavor\': \'« Je peux vous rendre plus fort, mais le courage ne peut venir que de vous. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591905&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'719be2dd-8d53-4fdf-b673-f4f87ed61f18\', \'multiverseId\': 591905}, \'multiverseid\': 591905}, {\'name\': \'Guardiana Serena\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta guadagni punti vita, puoi pagare {W}. Se lo fai, metti un segnalino +1/+1 su una creatura bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Alleato Chierico Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Posso donarvi la forza, ma il coraggio dovrete procurarvelo da soli."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592034&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'34184f4a-2dcb-4b72-8fed-bcd8bd7982bd\', \'multiverseId\': 592034}, \'multiverseid\': 592034}, {\'name\': \'物静かな使用人\', \'text\': \'あなたがライフを得るたび、クリーチャー１体を対象とする。あなたは{W}を支払ってもよい。そうしたなら、それの上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・クレリック・同盟者\', \'flavor\': \'「体力は私が面倒みる。勇気は自分でなんとかしてね。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592163&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5403a38b-90f5-49b8-8ca0-85f809c9b92f\', \'multiverseId\': 592163}, \'multiverseid\': 592163}, {\'name\': \'安详监管人\', \'text\': \'每当你获得生命时，你可以支付{W}。若你如此作，则在目标生物上放置一个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／僧侣／伙伴\', \'flavor\': \'「我能赋予你力量，但你得具备勇气。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592550&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'754c3b81-eed0-41d1-9ce6-ebfa54f9fd5d\', \'multiverseId\': 592550}, \'multiverseid\': 592550}]', '[{\'name\': \'Abnagender Zombie\', \'text\': \'{1}{B}, opfere eine Kreatur: Ein Spieler deiner Wahl verliert 1 Lebenspunkt und du erhältst 1 Lebenspunkt dazu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Zombie\', \'flavor\': \'In stillen Nächten kann man hören, wie seine verfaulten Zähne unermüdlich erbeutete Knochen zermalmen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594076&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'89d0c27a-e554-44a9-abc1-e8169725633b\', \'multiverseId\': 594076}, \'multiverseid\': 594076}, {\'name\': \'Zombie mordiente\', \'text\': \'{1}{B}, sacrificar una criatura: El jugador objetivo pierde 1 vida y tú ganas 1 vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Zombie\', \'flavor\': \'En noches silenciosas, se puede oír cómo sus pútridos dientes roen sin cesar los huesos carroñados.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594193&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'658d911c-b96d-4658-b0e7-ea71309facf9\', \'multiverseId\': 594193}, \'multiverseid\': 594193}, {\'name\': \'Zombie rongeur\', \'text\': \'{1}{B}, sacrifiez une créature : Un joueur ciblé perd 1 point de vie et vous gagnez 1 point de vie.\', \'type\': \'Créature : zombie\', \'flavor\': "Quand la nuit est calme, on entend ses chicots grincer pendant des heures sur les os qu\'il a déterrés.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594310&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'674d6867-c0c7-47b2-bc14-2001ef83551a\', \'multiverseId\': 594310}, \'multiverseid\': 594310}, {\'name\': \'Zombie Rosicante\', \'text\': \'{1}{B}, Sacrifica una creatura: Un giocatore bersaglio perde 1 punto vita e tu guadagni 1 punto vita.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Zombie\', \'flavor\': \'Nelle notti serene puoi sentire i suoi denti marci che macinano senza sosta sulle ossa che ha raccattato.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594427&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1e11dccd-a9d0-4fad-9ed6-2e6852f767a8\', \'multiverseId\': 594427}, \'multiverseid\': 594427}, {\'name\': \'かじりつくゾンビ\', \'text\': \'{1}{B},クリーチャー１体を生け贄に捧げる：プレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーは１点のライフを失い、あなたは１点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ゾンビ\', \'flavor\': \'静かな夜には、腐りかけたそいつの歯が骨にゴリゴリとかじりつく音が聴こえてくる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594544&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'39a56d84-6f4f-4394-991b-e0aa324feebb\', \'multiverseId\': 594544}, \'multiverseid\': 594544}, {\'name\': \'啃食灵俑\', \'text\': \'{1}{B}，牺牲一个生物：目标牌手失去1点生命且你获得1点生命。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～灵俑\', \'flavor\': \'在寂静的夜晚，你能听到它腐烂的牙齿不知疲倦地磨着捡来的骨头。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594895&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6ed2ec8c-04a0-4c7d-b487-e06456b8000a\', \'multiverseId\': 594895}, \'multiverseid\': 594895}]', '[{\'name\': \'Abtrünniger Dämon\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Dämon\', \'flavor\': \'Gefangen im Immersturm, tränkt er seine Klinge nicht für Ideale, Territorien oder Macht mit Blut, sondern einfach zum Zeitvertreib.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597533&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6011bddc-e01a-4103-a2b5-67f3d0b38587\', \'multiverseId\': 597533}, \'multiverseid\': 597533}, {\'name\': \'Demonio renegado\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Demonio\', \'flavor\': \'Atrapado en Immersturm, no mancha su hoja de sangre por ideales ni territorios ni poder, sino para pasar el rato.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597558&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b5ce4998-760f-4c35-aca0-bfcff1dc903f\', \'multiverseId\': 597558}, \'multiverseid\': 597558}, {\'name\': \'Démon renégat\', \'type\': \'Créature : démon\', \'flavor\': "Prisonnier de l\'Immersturm, il n\'ensanglante pas sa lame pour ses idéaux, ni pour un territoire ou du pouvoir, mais simplement pour passer le temps.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597583&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e7803f11-1935-4220-b969-32d70ae63325\', \'multiverseId\': 597583}, \'multiverseid\': 597583}, {\'name\': \'Demone Rinnegato\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Demone\', \'flavor\': \'Intrappolato in Immersturm, sporca di sangue la sua lama non per gli ideali, il dominio o il potere, ma solo per passare il tempo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597608&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9bd66576-54af-478b-9479-b8da9a96bfa2\', \'multiverseId\': 597608}, \'multiverseid\': 597608}, {\'name\': \'反逆の悪魔\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — デーモン\', \'flavor\': \'イマースタームに幽閉され、理想や縄張りや権力のためではなく、ただただ時間を潰すために刃を血に染める。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597633&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'160e61c0-64b9-4786-9766-b1d7ab266900\', \'multiverseId\': 597633}, \'multiverseid\': 597633}, {\'name\': \'反叛恶魔\', \'type\': \'生物 ～恶魔\', \'flavor\': \'它受困无尽风暴境域中，不断用鲜血染红刀刃～不为理想，不为领土，也不为力量，只是为了打发时间。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597708&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2cb59e15-7040-4aae-a26f-5458b6782c84\', \'multiverseId\': 597708}, \'multiverseid\': 597708}]', '[{\'name\': \'Adliger von Falkenrath\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nImmer wenn der Adlige von Falkenrath oder eine andere Kreatur stirbt, verliert ein Spieler deiner Wahl 1 Lebenspunkt, und du erhältst 1 Lebenspunkt dazu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vampir, Adliger\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich denke oft darüber nach, wie aufregend es sein muss, von mir als Beute ausgewählt zu werden."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594071&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4dd56087-2707-4261-be49-a29a7ffd99b6\', \'multiverseId\': 594071}, \'multiverseid\': 594071}, {\'name\': \'Noble Falkenrath\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nSiempre que el Noble Falkenrath u otra criatura muera, el jugador objetivo pierde 1 vida y tú ganas 1 vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Noble vampiro\', \'flavor\': \'"A veces pienso en lo felices que deben sentirse de ser elegidos como mi presa".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594188&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8638f104-97ff-4b09-8914-378b3cb6813a\', \'multiverseId\': 594188}, \'multiverseid\': 594188}, {\'name\': \'Noble Falkenrath\', \'text\': \'Vol\\nÀ chaque fois que le Noble Falkenrath ou une autre créature meurt, un joueur ciblé perd 1 point de vie et vous gagnez 1 point de vie.\', \'type\': \'Créature : vampire et noble\', \'flavor\': "« Souvent, je me dis qu\'ils doivent être si excités d\'avoir été choisis par moi pour proie. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594305&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d280064b-74e9-4efe-b752-207f451c94bb\', \'multiverseId\': 594305}, \'multiverseid\': 594305}, {\'name\': \'Nobile Falkenrath\', \'text\': "Volare\\nOgniqualvolta il Nobile Falkenrath o un\'altra creatura muore, un giocatore bersaglio perde 1 punto vita e tu guadagni 1 punto vita.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Nobile Vampiro\', \'flavor\': \'"Penso spesso a quanto debbano essere emozionate per esser state scelte come mie prede."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594422&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'34bffddc-68ec-4ea1-a0d1-0ccf61ac0fe7\', \'multiverseId\': 594422}, \'multiverseid\': 594422}, {\'name\': \'ファルケンラスの貴族\', \'text\': \'飛行\\nファルケンラスの貴族やこれでないクリーチャー１体が死亡するたび、プレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーは１点のライフを失い、あなたは１点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 吸血鬼・貴族\', \'flavor\': \'「私は常々考えるのだ。私の餌食に選ばれたことで、奴らがどれだけ喜ぶべきなのかということを。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594539&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a1a34056-b66b-40de-8328-b1c4e4802e1d\', \'multiverseId\': 594539}, \'multiverseid\': 594539}, {\'name\': \'伐肯纳贵族\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n每当伐肯纳贵族或另一个生物死去时，目标牌手失去1点生命且你获得1点生命。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～吸血鬼／贵族\', \'flavor\': \'「我经常在想，被选为我的猎物者会感到多么刺激。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594890&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5af41692-91ad-44f6-8587-f6b274fdb381\', \'multiverseId\': 594890}, \'multiverseid\': 594890}]', '[{\'name\': \'Adrenalinschub\', \'text\': \'Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält +2/+1 und verursacht Trampelschaden bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Manchmal bedarf es mehr als einer Vogelscheuche, um jemandem klarzumachen,\\ndass er sich fernhalten soll.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590300&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8d9f9144-b717-4ef5-9323-7fca9b554e05\', \'multiverseId\': 590300}, \'multiverseid\': 590300}, {\'name\': \'Torrente de adrenalina\', \'text\': \'La criatura objetivo obtiene +2/+1 y gana la habilidad de arrollar hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Los espantapájaros solo transmiten hasta cierto punto\\nel mensaje de no acercarse.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590435&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5fde81d1-54dc-4605-9af7-2930684d47d3\', \'multiverseId\': 590435}, \'multiverseid\': 590435}, {\'name\': "Afflux d\'adrénaline", \'text\': "Une créature ciblée gagne +2/+1 et acquiert le piétinement jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'Les épouvantails ne peuvent pas empêcher tout le\\nmonde de passer.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590570&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'20fafce0-7dd8-4aec-9b48-db30d9832f84\', \'multiverseId\': 590570}, \'multiverseid\': 590570}, {\'name\': \'Ondata di Adrenalina\', \'text\': \'Una creatura bersaglio prende +2/+1 e ha travolgere fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'Non sempre gli spaventapasseri riescono\\na tenere alla larga gli intrusi.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590705&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3f0ff097-b1f8-4a2f-b1f1-53ed03f305dc\', \'multiverseId\': 590705}, \'multiverseid\': 590705}, {\'name\': \'アドレナリン作用\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは＋２/＋１の修整を受けトランプルを得る。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'カカシができる仕事は近づくなというメッセージを送ることだけだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590840&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7050238e-892d-4011-8674-59a7d147be47\', \'multiverseId\': 590840}, \'multiverseid\': 590840}, {\'name\': \'应激冲动\', \'text\': \'直到回合结束，目标生物得+2/+1且获得践踏异能。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'稻草人最多只能警示\\n「请速离」。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591245&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9130de19-b6a2-4334-ad6b-4cd668a6ec53\', \'multiverseId\': 591245}, \'multiverseid\': 591245}]', "[{'name': 'Affenkäfig', 'text': 'Wenn eine Kreatur ins Spiel kommt, opfere den Affenkäfig und erzeuge X 2/2 grüne Affe-Kreaturenspielsteine, wobei X gleich dem Manabetrag jener Kreatur ist.', 'type': 'Artefakt', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596291&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f0fa4be6-1ccc-4c9f-a235-3044e4fd6c24', 'multiverseId': 596291}, 'multiverseid': 596291}, {'name': 'Jaula para simios', 'text': 'Cuando una criatura entre al campo de batalla, sacrifica la Jaula para simios y crea X fichas de criatura Primate verdes 2/2, donde X es el valor de maná de esa criatura.', 'type': 'Artefacto', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596378&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4b96a6b2-ca05-4a2c-95d6-bcd42a7301fe', 'multiverseId': 596378}, 'multiverseid': 596378}, {'name': 'Cage de singes', 'text': 'Quand une créature arrive sur le champ de bataille, sacrifiez la Cage de singes et créez X jetons de créature 2/2 verte Singe, X étant la valeur de mana de cette créature.', 'type': 'Artefact', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596465&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd33d90cb-732c-4a17-95f3-83c32b371b93', 'multiverseId': 596465}, 'multiverseid': 596465}, {'name': 'Gabbia della Scimmia', 'text': 'Quando una creatura entra nel campo di battaglia, sacrifica la Gabbia della Scimmia e crea X pedine creatura Scimmia 2/2 verdi, dove X è il valore di mana di quella creatura.', 'type': 'Artefatto', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596552&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6b4695dd-de60-40e7-afa7-99eb62054275', 'multiverseId': 596552}, 'multiverseid': 596552}, {'name': '猿の檻', 'text': 'クリーチャーが戦場に出たとき、猿の檻を生け贄に捧げ、緑の２/２の猿・クリーチャー・トークンＸ体を生成する。Ｘはそのクリーチャーのマナ総量に等しい。', 'type': 'アーティファクト', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596639&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '35bd33eb-c1eb-4738-a10b-e62c078c562b', 'multiverseId': 596639}, 'multiverseid': 596639}, {'name': '猴槛', 'text': '当一个生物进战场时，牺牲猴槛并派出X个2/2绿色的猴衍生生物，X为该生物的法术力值。', 'type': '神器', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596900&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ca89be28-e526-4fc0-a09c-d641986762e7', 'multiverseId': 596900}, 'multiverseid': 596900}]", '[{\'name\': \'Affenraufbold\', \'text\': \'Wirf eine Länderkarte ab: Der Affenraufbold erhält +1/+1 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Menschenaffe, Krieger\', \'flavor\': \'„Es ist seltsam, wenn die Affen Bäume ausreißen, um damit ihren Wald zu verteidigen."\\n—Taaveti von Kelsinko, Elfischer Jäger\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592928&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'161ef01d-5680-44c1-9dc0-4491e7331775\', \'multiverseId\': 592928}, \'multiverseid\': 592928}, {\'name\': \'Pendenciero simiesco\', \'text\': \'Descartar una carta de tierra: El Pendenciero simiesco obtiene +1/+1 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero simio\', \'flavor\': \'"Es raro ver a los simios arrancando árboles para usarlos en defensa de sus bosques".\\n—Taaveti de Kelsinko, cazador élfico\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593049&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'12163a44-dd5c-4796-bb39-7265d317019d\', \'multiverseId\': 593049}, \'multiverseid\': 593049}, {\'name\': \'Bagarreur simiesque\', \'text\': "Défaussez-vous d\'une carte de terrain : Le Bagarreur simiesque gagne +1/+1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : grand singe et guerrier\', \'flavor\': "« C\'est si étrange de voir des singes arracher des arbres pour s\'armer et défendre leurs forêts. »\\n—Taaveti le Kelsinkois, chasseur elfe", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593170&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aa6492c4-7b06-4937-86e7-2360d6726325\', \'multiverseId\': 593170}, \'multiverseid\': 593170}, {\'name\': \'Primate Lottatore\', \'text\': \'Scarta una carta terra: Il Primate Lottatore prende +1/+1 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Scimpanzé\', \'flavor\': \'"È strano vedere gli scimpanzé tirare giù alberi per armarsi e difendere le loro foreste."\\n—Taaveti di Kelsinko, cacciatore elfico\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593291&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'63960829-2686-40c2-8e5d-3e5b74eb06b7\', \'multiverseId\': 593291}, \'multiverseid\': 593291}, {\'name\': \'猿人の喧嘩屋\', \'text\': \'土地・カード１枚を捨てる：ターン終了時まで、猿人の喧嘩屋は＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 類人猿・戦士\', \'flavor\': \'「猿が自分達の森を守るために、樹を倒して武器にするってのは奇妙な話だな。」\\n――エルフの狩人、ケルシンコのタヴェティー\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593412&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3b7dc146-66b0-4bd3-8770-2d8896064230\', \'multiverseId\': 593412}, \'multiverseid\': 593412}, {\'name\': \'猿猴喧哗兵\', \'text\': \'弃一张地牌：猿猴喧哗兵得+1/+1直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～猿猴／战士\', \'flavor\': \'「猩猩把树弄倒，当成武器来守卫家园的景象，看来真是古怪。」\\n～凯辛柯妖精猎手塔维堤\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593775&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1dd535c0-4f70-4db0-a8b6-1c552b768c43\', \'multiverseId\': 593775}, \'multiverseid\': 593775}]', '[{\'name\': \'Agrus Kos, Ewiger Soldat\', \'text\': \'Wachsamkeit\\nImmer wenn Agrus Kos, Ewiger Soldat, das Ziel einer Fähigkeit wird, die nur ihn als Ziel hat, kannst du {1}{R/W} bezahlen. Falls du dies tust, kopiere die Fähigkeit für jede andere Kreatur, die du kontrollierst und die das Ziel der Fähigkeit sein könnte. Jede Kopie hat eine unterschiedliche jener Kreaturen als Ziel. ({R/W} kann entweder mit {R} oder mit {W} bezahlt werden.)\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Geist, Soldat\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589606&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'92373ad4-c9e1-4766-bf8d-a64ca6496a9e\', \'multiverseId\': 589606}, \'multiverseid\': 589606}, {\'name\': \'Agrus Kos, soldado eterno\', \'text\': \'Vigilancia.\\nSiempre que Agrus Kos, soldado eterno sea objetivo de una habilidad que solo lo haga objetivo a él, puedes pagar {1}{R/W}. Si lo haces, copia esa habilidad por cada otra criatura que controlas a la que esa habilidad pudiera hacer objetivo. Cada copia hace objetivo a una criatura distinta entre esas criaturas. ({R/W} puede pagarse con {R} o con {W}.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Soldado espíritu\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589657&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d2a927a8-a64c-4569-9645-90007ac597e0\', \'multiverseId\': 589657}, \'multiverseid\': 589657}, {\'name\': \'Agrus Kos, soldat éternel\', \'text\': "Vigilance\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'Agrus Kos, soldat éternel devient la cible d\'une capacité qui ne cible que lui, vous pouvez payer {1}{R/W}. Si vous faites ainsi, copiez cette capacité pour chaque autre créature que vous contrôlez que cette capacité pourrait cibler. Chaque copie cible une créature différente parmi elles. ({R/W} peut être payé au choix avec {R} ou {W}.)", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : esprit et soldat\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589708&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'54cd9f89-1ac8-40a3-98d5-55af6396684f\', \'multiverseId\': 589708}, \'multiverseid\': 589708}, {\'name\': \'Agrus Kos, Soldato Eterno\', \'text\': "Cautela\\nOgniqualvolta Agrus Kos, Soldato Eterno diventa bersaglio di un\'abilità che non ha altri bersagli, puoi pagare {1}{R/W}. Se lo fai, copia quell\'abilità per ogni altra creatura che controlli che potrebbe essere bersaglio di quell\'abilità. Ogni copia bersaglia una creatura diversa fra queste. ({R/W} può essere pagato con {R} o {W}.)", \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Soldato Spirito\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589759&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'416de0b4-f56f-4e24-982b-ebf21312c7b4\', \'multiverseId\': 589759}, \'multiverseid\': 589759}, {\'name\': \'永遠の兵士、アグルス・コス\', \'text\': \'警戒\\n永遠の兵士、アグルス・コスが、これのみを対象とする能力の対象となるたび、あなたは{1}{R/W}を支払ってもよい。そうしたなら、その能力が対象にできてあなたがコントロールしていてこれでないクリーチャー１体につき１回、その能力をコピーする。各コピーは、それらのクリーチャーのうち別々のものを対象とする。（{R/W}は{R}でも{W}でも支払うことができる。）\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — スピリット・兵士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589810&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f05af702-39cc-4416-8e10-4c54fec354c4\', \'multiverseId\': 589810}, \'multiverseid\': 589810}, {\'name\': \'不朽士兵阿固寇斯\', \'text\': \'警戒\\n每当不朽士兵阿固寇斯成为异能的目标，且该异能仅以它为目标时，你可以支付{1}{R/W}。若你如此作，则该异能每能以一个由你操控的其他生物为目标，便将该异能复制一次。每个复制品都要以这些生物之一为目标，且不能重复选择。（{R/W}可用{R}或{W}来支付。）\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～精怪／士兵\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589963&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'04e78688-a707-46e1-a5c6-4107c9157963\', \'multiverseId\': 589963}, \'multiverseid\': 589963}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ajani, Stärke des Rudels\', \'text\': \'+1: Du erhältst Lebenspunkte in Höhe der Anzahl an Kreaturen und Planeswalkern, die du kontrollierst, dazu.\\n−2: Erzeuge einen 2/2 weißen Katze-Soldat-Kreaturenspielstein namens Ajanis Rudelmitglied mit „Immer wenn du Lebenspunkte dazuerhältst, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf Ajanis Rudelmitglied."\\n0: Falls du mindestens 15 Lebenspunkte mehr als deine Startlebenspunktezahl hast, schicke Ajani, Stärke des Rudels, und alle Artefakte und Kreaturen, die deine Gegner kontrollieren, ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Legendärer Planeswalker — Ajani\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591547&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b9ba5ddf-f573-4d09-a79b-e3cd2768c6ea\', \'multiverseId\': 591547}, \'multiverseid\': 591547}, {\'name\': \'Ajani, la fuerza de la manada\', \'text\': \'+1: Ganas una cantidad de vidas igual a las criaturas que controlas más los planeswalkers que controlas.\\n−2: Crea una ficha de criatura Soldado Felino blanca 2/2 llamada Compañero de manada de Ajani con "Siempre que ganes vidas, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre el Compañero de manada de Ajani".\\n0: Si tienes al menos 15 vidas más que tu total de vidas inicial, exilia a Ajani, la fuerza de la manada y cada artefacto y criatura que controlan tus oponentes.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker legendario — Ajani\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591676&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e2c6142d-3a29-43c1-913f-1ced7f40a840\', \'multiverseId\': 591676}, \'multiverseid\': 591676}, {\'name\': \'Ajani, force de la bande\', \'text\': "+1 : Vous gagnez un nombre de points de vie égal au nombre de créatures que vous contrôlez plus le nombre de planeswalkers que vous contrôlez.\\n-2 : Créez un jeton de créature 2/2 blanche Chat et Soldat appelé Frère de bande d\'Ajani avec « À chaque fois que vous gagnez des points de vie, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur le Frère de bande d\'Ajani. »\\n0 : Si vous avez au moins 15 points de vie de plus que votre total de points de vie de départ, exilez Ajani, force de la bande et chaque artefact et créature que vos adversaires contrôlent.", \'type\': \'Planeswalker légendaire : Ajani\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591805&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e5868cc3-5e9d-48aa-a2f8-85328dda57b5\', \'multiverseId\': 591805}, \'multiverseid\': 591805}, {\'name\': \'Ajani, Forza del Branco\', \'text\': \'+1: Guadagni punti vita pari al numero di creature che controlli più il numero di planeswalker che controlli.\\n−2: Crea una pedina creatura Soldato Felino 2/2 bianca chiamata Compagno di Ajani con "Ogniqualvolta guadagni punti vita, metti un segnalino +1/+1 sul Compagno di Ajani".\\n0: Se hai almeno 15 punti vita in più rispetto ai tuoi punti vita iniziali, esilia Ajani, Forza del Branco e ogni artefatto e creatura controllati dai tuoi avversari.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker Leggendario — Ajani\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591934&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'934c2ce4-6719-48cc-8ea5-cdcf6ffad89e\', \'multiverseId\': 591934}, \'multiverseid\': 591934}, {\'name\': \'群れの力、アジャニ\', \'text\': \'+1：あなたは、あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャーの数とあなたがコントロールしているプレインズウォーカーの数の合計に等しい点数のライフを得る。\\n-2：「アジャニの群れ仲間」という名前で「あなたがライフを得るたび、アジャニの群れ仲間の上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。」を持つ白の２/２の猫・兵士・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\\n0：あなたのライフ総量が、あなたの初期ライフ総量よりも15点以上多いなら、群れの力、アジャニと、アーティファクトやクリーチャーのうち対戦相手がコントロールしているすべてを追放する。\', \'type\': \'伝説のプレインズウォーカー — アジャニ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592063&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e70696ba-5919-4bf1-a53f-bd9d328cbe17\', \'multiverseId\': 592063}, \'multiverseid\': 592063}, {\'name\': \'狮群之力阿耶尼\', \'text\': \'+1：你获得若干生命，其数量等同于由你操控的生物数量与由你操控的鹏洛客数量之总和。\\n−2：派出一个2/2白色，名称为阿耶尼的群伴之猫／士兵衍生生物，且具有「每当你获得生命时，在阿耶尼的群伴上放置一个+1/+1指示物。」\\n0：如果你的总生命比你的起始总生命至少多15点，则放逐狮群之力阿耶尼和所有由对手操控的神器与生物。\', \'type\': \'传奇鹏洛客 ～阿耶尼\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592450&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'541648ff-64d5-4795-a3c7-d5ac3049c66d\', \'multiverseId\': 592450}, \'multiverseid\': 592450}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ajanis Rudelmitglied\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du Lebenspunkte dazuerhältst, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf Ajanis Rudelmitglied.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Katze, Soldat\', \'flavor\': \'„Wenn einer von uns Erfolg hat, gilt dies für das gesamte Rudel."\\n—Jazal Goldmähne\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591548&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c2845874-208b-4c0e-8f8b-624c9b5a12fd\', \'multiverseId\': 591548}, \'multiverseid\': 591548}, {\'name\': \'Compañero de manada de Ajani\', \'text\': \'Siempre que ganes vidas, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre el Compañero de manada de Ajani.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado felino\', \'flavor\': \'"Cuando uno de nosotros mejora, la manada mejora".\\n—Jazal Melena Dorada\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591677&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f0dcf3da-4755-4e78-b313-2c3363aac3af\', \'multiverseId\': 591677}, \'multiverseid\': 591677}, {\'name\': "Frère de bande d\'Ajani", \'text\': "À chaque fois que vous gagnez des points de vie, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur le Frère de bande d\'Ajani.", \'type\': \'Créature : chat et soldat\', \'flavor\': "« Quand l\'un de nous prospère, c\'est toute la bande qui prospère. »\\n—Jazal Crinièredor", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591806&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fc93fc6f-ecdc-4d6f-885f-a6d4c664ece9\', \'multiverseId\': 591806}, \'multiverseid\': 591806}, {\'name\': \'Compagno di Ajani\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta guadagni punti vita, metti un segnalino +1/+1 sul Compagno di Ajani.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Soldato Felino\', \'flavor\': \'"Quando uno di noi ha successo, l\\\'intero branco ha successo."\\n—Jazal Criniera D\\\'Oro\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591935&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'52bcdffb-28e2-4b94-8dfd-1e39ac340ef3\', \'multiverseId\': 591935}, \'multiverseid\': 591935}, {\'name\': \'アジャニの群れ仲間\', \'text\': \'あなたがライフを得るたび、アジャニの群れ仲間の上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 猫・兵士\', \'flavor\': \'「我らのうちいずれかが繁栄する時、群れも繁栄する。」\\n――黄金のたてがみのジャザル\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592064&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'96eab0c2-d491-439f-adda-e39c31878a7f\', \'multiverseId\': 592064}, \'multiverseid\': 592064}, {\'name\': \'阿耶尼的群伴\', \'text\': \'每当你获得生命时，在阿耶尼的群伴上放置一个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～猫／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'「只要一个享福，整群都能享福。」\\n～金鬃贾佐\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592451&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'815370c0-5d64-4224-ab94-51d4886ecbd2\', \'multiverseId\': 592451}, \'multiverseid\': 592451}]', '[{\'name\': \'Akrobatisches Manöver\', \'text\': \'Schicke eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst, ins Exil und bringe sie dann unter der Kontrolle ihres Besitzers ins Spiel zurück.\\nZiehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Die Renegaten finden immer ausgefallenere Wege, die Ätherbestimmungen des Konsulats zu umgehen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591544&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a8948d3d-7580-479a-8015-434134adb0e1\', \'multiverseId\': 591544}, \'multiverseid\': 591544}, {\'name\': \'Maniobra acrobática\', \'text\': \'Exilia la criatura objetivo que controlas, luego regresa esa carta al campo de batalla bajo el control de su propietario.\\nRoba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Los renegados encuentran formas cada vez más creativas de esquivar las regulaciones del Consulado respecto al éter.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591673&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1a1bb83e-7ccb-4cbd-b47b-5bb1561be971\', \'multiverseId\': 591673}, \'multiverseid\': 591673}, {\'name\': \'Manœuvre acrobatique\', \'text\': \'Exilez une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez, puis renvoyez cette carte sur le champ de bataille sous le contrôle de son propriétaire.\\nPiochez une carte.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "Les renégats trouvent toujours de nouveaux moyens de contourner les réglementations concernant l\'Éther du Consulat.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591802&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9af4d48b-c8a9-4870-90ab-f872dcaeea20\', \'multiverseId\': 591802}, \'multiverseid\': 591802}, {\'name\': \'Manovra Acrobatica\', \'text\': \'Esilia una creatura bersaglio che controlli, poi rimetti quella carta sul campo di battaglia sotto il controllo del suo proprietario.\\nPesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': "I rinnegati escogitano stratagemmi sempre più originali per aggirare le restrizioni consolari sull\'etere.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591931&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'65fadf16-0dfa-4f53-ba04-7785aee587ef\', \'multiverseId\': 591931}, \'multiverseid\': 591931}, {\'name\': \'軽業の妙技\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。それを追放し、その後、そのカードをオーナーのコントロール下で戦場に戻す。\\nあなたはカード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'改革派は領事府の霊気規制を出し抜く独創的な方法を発見した。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592060&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'423cfa3f-0dcf-41b7-959c-5c6fdfa92105\', \'multiverseId\': 592060}, \'multiverseid\': 592060}, {\'name\': \'杂耍计略\', \'text\': \'放逐目标由你操控的生物，然后将该牌在其拥有者的操控下移回战场。\\n抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'乱匠迭出奇招以规避执政院的乙太法规。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592447&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9c632d7f-d16b-4c67-bc78-97158e069920\', \'multiverseId\': 592447}, \'multiverseid\': 592447}]', '[{\'name\': \'Alandra, Himmelsträumerin\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du deine zweite Karte innerhalb desselben Zuges ziehst, erzeuge einen 2/2 blauen Sceada-Kreaturenspielstein mit Flugfähigkeit.\\nImmer wenn du deine fünfte Karte innerhalb desselben Zuges ziehst, erhalten Alandra, Himmelsträumerin, und Sceadas, die du kontrollierst, bis zum Ende des Zuges jeweils +X/+X, wobei X gleich der Anzahl an Karten auf deiner Hand ist.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Meervolk, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589614&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e533142c-6ac7-468c-b40a-6934f7cd79fa\', \'multiverseId\': 589614}, \'multiverseid\': 589614}, {\'name\': \'Alandra, soñadora celeste\', \'text\': \'Siempre que robes tu segunda carta cada turno, crea una ficha de criatura Draco azul 2/2 con la habilidad de volar.\\nSiempre que robes tu quinta carta cada turno, Alandra, soñadora celeste y los Dracos que controlas obtienen +X/+X cada uno hasta el final del turno, donde X es la cantidad de cartas en tu mano.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Hechicero tritón\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589665&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'98ef2132-150d-4844-871b-cb8343eec731\', \'multiverseId\': 589665}, \'multiverseid\': 589665}, {\'name\': \'Alandra, rêveuse céleste\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que vous piochez votre deuxième carte à chaque tour, créez un jeton de créature 2/2 bleue Drakôn avec le vol.\\nÀ chaque fois que vous piochez votre cinquième carte à chaque tour, Alandra, rêveuse céleste et les drakôns que vous contrôlez gagnent chacun +X/+X jusqu\'à la fin du tour, X étant le nombre de cartes dans votre main.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : ondin et sorcier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589716&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d3ed7426-4fc6-4046-a7b6-3b04226d2d7f\', \'multiverseId\': 589716}, \'multiverseid\': 589716}, {\'name\': \'Alandra, Sognatrice del Cielo\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta peschi la tua seconda carta in ogni turno, crea una pedina creatura Draghetto 2/2 blu con volare.\\nOgniqualvolta peschi la tua quinta carta in ogni turno, Alandra, Sognatrice del Cielo e i Draghetti che controlli prendono +X/+X fino alla fine del turno, dove X è il numero di carte nella tua mano.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Mago Tritone\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589767&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0fff17ed-3352-400c-b488-cd42aad0f264\', \'multiverseId\': 589767}, \'multiverseid\': 589767}, {\'name\': \'空夢想士、アランドラ\', \'text\': \'あなたが各ターン内のあなたの２枚目のカードを引くたび、飛行を持つ青の２/２のドレイク・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\\nあなたが各ターン内のあなたの５枚目のカードを引くたび、ターン終了時まで、空夢想士、アランドラとあなたがコントロールしているすべてのドレイクは＋Ｘ/＋Ｘの修整を受ける。Ｘはあなたの手札にあるカードの枚数に等しい。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — マーフォーク・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589818&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a1c17d4b-5f7e-45dc-9d92-0af751ced46b\', \'multiverseId\': 589818}, \'multiverseid\': 589818}, {\'name\': \'空梦师雅岚卓\', \'text\': \'每当你抓每回合中你的第二张牌时，派出一个2/2蓝色，具飞行异能的龙兽衍生生物。\\n每当你抓每回合中你的第五张牌时，空梦师雅岚卓和由你操控的龙兽各得+X/+X直到回合结束，X为你的手牌数量。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～人鱼／法术师\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589971&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e9ba61bf-1918-4d03-851d-5f5e0b4353ae\', \'multiverseId\': 589971}, \'multiverseid\': 589971}]', '[{\'name\': \'Alphatier des Dornenrudels\', \'text\': \'Aufblitzen\\nWenn das Alphatier des Dornenrudels ins Spiel kommt, erhält eine Kreatur deiner Wahl +2/+2 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Wolf\', \'flavor\': \'„Die Wölfe kamen auf uns zu, und mich überkam ein Frösteln. Das Rudel hatte einen neuen Anführer."\\n—Alena, Fallenstellerin aus Kessig\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592833&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ba14b69d-ce6c-4847-9542-5f091bc40782\', \'multiverseId\': 592833}, \'multiverseid\': 592833}, {\'name\': \'Alfa de la Manada del Brezo\', \'text\': \'Destello.\\nCuando el Alfa de la Manada del Brezo entre al campo de batalla, la criatura objetivo obtiene +2/+2 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Lobo\', \'flavor\': \'"Los lobos se volvieron contra nosotros y un escalofrío me recorrió el cuerpo. La manada tenía un nuevo líder".\\n—Alena, trampera de Kessig\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592954&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0b2a4152-9b41-4d83-a809-44b75aa76d4b\', \'multiverseId\': 592954}, \'multiverseid\': 592954}, {\'name\': \'Alpha de la meute de bruyère\', \'text\': "Flash\\nQuand l\'Alpha de la meute de bruyère arrive sur le champ de bataille, une créature ciblée gagne +2/+2 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : loup\', \'flavor\': \'« Les loups se sont soudain retournés contre nous et un frisson me parcourut. La meute avait un nouveau chef. »\\n—Alena, trappeur de Kessig\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593075&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8ea2be5d-93f9-46e3-9c7c-edda93907acd\', \'multiverseId\': 593075}, \'multiverseid\': 593075}, {\'name\': \'Rovobranco Alfa\', \'text\': \'Lampo\\nQuando il Rovobranco Alfa entra nel campo di battaglia, una creatura bersaglio prende +2/+2 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Lupo\', \'flavor\': \'"I lupi si rivoltarono contro di noi e un brivido mi gelò il sangue. Il branco aveva un nuovo capo."\\n—Alena, trappolatrice di Kessig\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593196&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'93379404-0d27-4a07-aae8-b86868fe6b4b\', \'multiverseId\': 593196}, \'multiverseid\': 593196}, {\'name\': \'茨群れの頭目\', \'text\': \'瞬速\\n茨群れの頭目が戦場に出たとき、クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは＋２/＋２の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 狼\', \'flavor\': \'「狼がこっち向いた時、全身に寒気が走ったわ。群れの頭が新しくなっていたのよ。」\\n――ケッシグの罠師、アレイナ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593317&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ac90b603-e2d3-4bb7-9c1c-13c46b4a75ed\', \'multiverseId\': 593317}, \'multiverseid\': 593317}, {\'name\': \'荆群首领\', \'text\': \'闪现\\n当荆群首领进战场时，目标生物得+2/+2直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～狼\', \'flavor\': \'「狼群掉头过来，让我打了冷颤。这群有了新的领袖。」\\n～凯锡革布陷人阿雷娜\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593680&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8d3dfff2-e053-4816-a8a0-dc4a3f4c0067\', \'multiverseId\': 593680}, \'multiverseid\': 593680}]', '[{\'name\': \'Als würdig erachten\', \'text\': \'Als würdig erachten fügt einer Kreatur deiner Wahl 7 Schadenspunkte zu.\\nUmwandlung {3}{R} ({3}{R}, wirf diese Karte ab: Ziehe eine Karte.)\\nWenn du Als würdig erachten umwandelst, kannst du es einer Kreatur deiner Wahl 2 Schadenspunkte zufügen lassen.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590228&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9e203cb4-d763-4ab1-ba80-81192b89fb3f\', \'multiverseId\': 590228}, \'multiverseid\': 590228}, {\'name\': \'Estimar como digno\', \'text\': \'Estimar como digno hace 7 puntos de daño a la criatura objetivo.\\nCiclo {3}{R}. ({3}{R}, descartar esta carta: Roba una carta.)\\nCuando actives la habilidad de ciclo de Estimar como digno, puedes elegir que haga 2 puntos de daño a la criatura objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590363&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cb5bc652-4cc9-4c7e-8d08-abf0eceae394\', \'multiverseId\': 590363}, \'multiverseid\': 590363}, {\'name\': \'Jugé valeureux\', \'text\': "Jugé valeureux inflige 7 blessures à une créature ciblée.\\nRecyclage {3}{R} ({3}{R}, défaussez-vous de cette carte : Piochez une carte.)\\nQuand vous recyclez Jugé valeureux, vous pouvez faire qu\'il inflige 2 blessures à une créature ciblée.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590498&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'09ad7a88-34b2-44f8-b61a-6bffd9c0baaa\', \'multiverseId\': 590498}, \'multiverseid\': 590498}, {\'name\': \'Ammettere tra i Prescelti\', \'text\': \'Ammettere tra i Prescelti infligge 7 danni a una creatura bersaglio.\\nCiclo {3}{R} ({3}{R}, Scarta questa carta: Pesca una carta.)\\nQuando cicli Ammettere tra i Prescelti, puoi fargli infliggere 2 danni a una creatura bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590633&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b33b3357-0ebb-4649-b158-6452f0a5e7dc\', \'multiverseId\': 590633}, \'multiverseid\': 590633}, {\'name\': \'蓋世の誉れ\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。蓋世の誉れはそれに７点のダメージを与える。\\nサイクリング{3}{R}（{3}{R}, このカードを捨てる：カード１枚を引く。）\\nあなたが蓋世の誉れをサイクリングしたとき、クリーチャー１体を対象とする。あなたは「蓋世の誉れはそれに２点のダメージを与える。」を選んでもよい。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590768&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ec708b6e-6f51-4845-98b5-e9645c41e127\', \'multiverseId\': 590768}, \'multiverseid\': 590768}, {\'name\': \'豪英裁定\', \'text\': \'豪英裁定对目标生物造成7点伤害。\\n循环{3}{R}（{3}{R}，弃掉此牌：抓一张牌。）\\n当你循环豪英裁定时，你可以使它对目标生物造成2点伤害。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591173&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'684b334e-7378-42dc-b38c-8d25d4c251d8\', \'multiverseId\': 591173}, \'multiverseid\': 591173}]', '[{\'name\': \'Alseide der Lebensfülle\', \'text\': \'Lebensverknüpfung\\n{1}, opfere den Alseiden der Lebensfülle: Eine Kreatur oder eine Verzauberung deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst, erhält bis zum Ende des Zuges Schutz vor einer Farbe, die du bestimmst.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberungskreatur — Nymphe\', \'flavor\': \'„Von der Morgenröte geküsst, nährt er das goldene Korn."\\n—Psemilla, meletische Poetin\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591549&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c2e72266-136e-45ac-8be5-84659479a0a1\', \'multiverseId\': 591549}, \'multiverseid\': 591549}, {\'name\': \'Alseide de la riqueza vital\', \'text\': \'Vínculo vital.\\n{1}, sacrificar el Alseide de la riqueza vital: La criatura o encantamiento objetivo que controlas gana protección contra el color de tu elección hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura encantamiento — Ninfa\', \'flavor\': \'"Por el amanecer besado / nutre el grano dorado".\\n—Psemila, poeta meletiana\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591678&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ca0eb156-e95d-4bf6-8ed8-5f40e363104a\', \'multiverseId\': 591678}, \'multiverseid\': 591678}, {\'name\': \'Alséide du don de vie\', \'text\': "Lien de vie\\n{1}, sacrifiez l\'Alséide du don de vie : Une cible que vous contrôlez, créature ou enchantement, acquiert la protection contre la couleur de votre choix jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature-enchantement : nymphe\', \'flavor\': "« Embrassé par l\'aurore, il fait pousser le blé doré. »\\n—Psémilla, poétesse mélétisienne", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591807&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'911d3cf7-61e1-471e-b0b1-a67a93e7c92f\', \'multiverseId\': 591807}, \'multiverseid\': 591807}, {\'name\': "Alseide dell\'Abbondanza Vitale", \'text\': "Legame vitale\\n{1}, Sacrifica l\'Alseide dell\'Abbondanza Vitale: Una creatura o un incantesimo bersaglio che controlli ha protezione da un colore a tua scelta fino alla fine del turno.", \'type\': \'Creatura Incantesimo — Ninfa\', \'flavor\': \'"Baciato dall\\\'alba, nutre il grano dorato."\\n—Psemilla, poetessa di Meletis\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591936&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8ac84dc0-3464-4ed4-8b21-a5dda9d62c31\', \'multiverseId\': 591936}, \'multiverseid\': 591936}, {\'name\': \'命の恵みのアルセイド\', \'text\': \'絆魂\\n{1}, 命の恵みのアルセイドを生け贄に捧げる：クリーチャーやエンチャントのうちあなたがコントロールしている１つを対象とする。色１色を選ぶ。ターン終了時まで、それはプロテクション（その選ばれた色）を得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー・エンチャント — ニンフ\', \'flavor\': \'「暁の口付ける者、彼は黄金の穂を滋養する。」\\n――メレティスの詩人、プセミラ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592065&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'430f4427-6c7b-4db7-a3cf-5e2dc70b4060\', \'multiverseId\': 592065}, \'multiverseid\': 592065}, {\'name\': \'丰穰蔻灵\', \'text\': \'系命\\n{1}，牺牲丰穰蔻灵：选择一种颜色。目标由你操控的生物或结界获得反该色保护异能直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'结界生物 ～宁芙\', \'flavor\': \'「他挥洒晨光，滋养世间谷物。」\\n～迈勒提斯诗人普塞弥拉\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592452&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'727cd03b-4360-42b6-8f36-7b8c073259c7\', \'multiverseId\': 592452}, \'multiverseid\': 592452}]', '[{\'name\': \'Amöboider Wandelwicht\', \'text\': \'Wandelwicht (Diese Karte hat alle Kreaturentypen.)\\n{T}: Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält alle Kreaturentypen bis zum Ende des Zuges.\\n{T}: Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl verliert alle Kreaturentypen bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Gestaltwandler\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595195&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'34801292-c581-4f9d-b311-387f663011c9\', \'multiverseId\': 595195}, \'multiverseid\': 595195}, {\'name\': \'Cambiaformas ameboide\', \'text\': \'Cambiaformas. (Esta carta es de todos los tipos de criatura.)\\n{T}: La criatura objetivo gana todos los tipos de criatura hasta el final del turno.\\n{T}: La criatura objetivo pierde todos los tipos de criatura hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Metamorfo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595303&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b7b2d022-942a-4783-91f9-826429fe4633\', \'multiverseId\': 595303}, \'multiverseid\': 595303}, {\'name\': \'Changelin amiboïde\', \'text\': "Changelin (Cette carte a tous les types de créature.)\\n{T} : Une créature ciblée acquiert tous les types de créature jusqu\'à la fin du tour.\\n{T} : Une créature ciblée perd tous les types de créature jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : changeforme\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595411&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6cccb3b4-d61c-49a2-9d38-11a1e77b44e5\', \'multiverseId\': 595411}, \'multiverseid\': 595411}, {\'name\': \'Cangiante Ameboide\', \'text\': \'Cangiante (Questa carta ha tutti i tipi di creatura.)\\n{T}: Una creatura bersaglio ha tutti i tipi di creatura fino alla fine del turno.\\n{T}: Una creatura bersaglio perde tutti i tipi di creatura fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Polimorfo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595519&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e798e91f-bef6-4aec-bb0d-befef3719ce8\', \'multiverseId\': 595519}, \'multiverseid\': 595519}, {\'name\': \'アメーバの変わり身\', \'text\': \'多相（このカードはすべてのクリーチャー・タイプである。）\\n{T}：クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それはすべてのクリーチャー・タイプを得る。\\n{T}：クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それはすべてのクリーチャー・タイプを失う。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 多相の戦士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595627&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'15523adf-fbe5-4570-b802-a024fb6a1e0d\', \'multiverseId\': 595627}, \'multiverseid\': 595627}, {\'name\': \'阿米巴化形\', \'text\': \'化形（此牌是所有生物类别。）\\n{T}：目标生物获得所有生物类别直到回合结束。\\n{T}：目标生物失去所有生物类别直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～变形兽\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595951&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cd396cfa-d786-4b09-ad55-8d5d3d015542\', \'multiverseId\': 595951}, \'multiverseid\': 595951}]', '[{\'name\': \'Angesehene Beschwörerin\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn eine andere Kreatur unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, erhältst du 1 Lebenspunkt dazu.\\n{4}{W}, {T}: Schicke eine andere Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst, ins Exil und bringe sie dann unter der Kontrolle ihres Besitzers ins Spiel zurück.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589609&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'93931b78-6345-42c2-bbbd-01ba551ce253\', \'multiverseId\': 589609}, \'multiverseid\': 589609}, {\'name\': \'Conjuradora distinguida\', \'text\': \'Siempre que otra criatura entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, ganas 1 vida.\\n{4}{W}, {T}: Exilia otra criatura objetivo que controlas, luego regrésala al campo de batalla bajo el control de su propietario.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589660&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b26f6ab4-ef9b-4302-a6a3-00d1bdbc737d\', \'multiverseId\': 589660}, \'multiverseid\': 589660}, {\'name\': \'Invocatrice distinguée\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'une autre créature arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, vous gagnez 1 point de vie.\\n{4}{W}, {T} : Exilez une autre créature ciblée que vous contrôlez, puis renvoyez-la sur le champ de bataille sous le contrôle de son propriétaire.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et sorcier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589711&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bbd21d3d-fd1d-4560-929a-e6278f9414b4\', \'multiverseId\': 589711}, \'multiverseid\': 589711}, {\'name\': \'Evocatrice Rinomata\', \'text\': "Ogniqualvolta un\'altra creatura entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, guadagni 1 punto vita.\\n{4}{W}, {T}: Esilia un\'altra creatura bersaglio che controlli, poi rimettila sul campo di battaglia sotto il controllo del suo proprietario.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Mago Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589762&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8f622354-d35d-410c-a633-d33e12d0a88c\', \'multiverseId\': 589762}, \'multiverseid\': 589762}, {\'name\': \'著名な妖術師\', \'text\': \'これでないクリーチャー１体があなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、あなたは１点のライフを得る。\\n{4}{W},{T}：あなたがコントロールしていてこれでないクリーチャー１体を対象とする。それを追放し、その後、オーナーのコントロール下で戦場に戻す。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589813&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'103828ac-4fb3-49b0-a4d6-b65b39878aec\', \'multiverseId\': 589813}, \'multiverseid\': 589813}, {\'name\': \'杰出咒法师\', \'text\': \'每当另一个生物在你的操控下进战场时，你获得1点生命。\\n{4}{W}，{T}：放逐另一个目标由你操控的生物，然后将它在其拥有者的操控下移回战场。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／法术师\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589966&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fbce8331-640d-451f-bda9-d23cf254c193\', \'multiverseId\': 589966}, \'multiverseid\': 589966}]', '[{\'name\': \'Angesehener Waffenschmied\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}{C}. Gib dieses Mana nur aus, um Artefaktzauber zu wirken oder Fähigkeiten von Artefakten zu aktivieren.\\n{U}, {T}: Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Karte namens Herzstecherbogen oder Phiole mit Drachenfeuer, zeige sie offen vor, nimm sie auf deine Hand und mische danach.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Handwerker\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595264&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4f3253fb-8e00-4ef4-843b-608afb9b8614\', \'multiverseId\': 595264}, \'multiverseid\': 595264}, {\'name\': \'Armero insigne\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {C}{C}. Usa este maná solo para lanzar hechizos de artefacto o activar habilidades de artefactos.\\n{U}, {T}: Busca en tu biblioteca una carta llamada Arco perforacorazones o Frasco de fuegodragón, muéstrala, ponla en tu mano y luego baraja.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Artífice humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595372&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0fee9784-d255-4e22-87e0-0515d25935f0\', \'multiverseId\': 595372}, \'multiverseid\': 595372}, {\'name\': "Forgeur d\'armes réputé", \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez {C}{C}. Ne dépensez ce mana que pour lancer des sorts d\'artefact ou activer des capacités d\'artefact.\\n{U}, {T} : Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte appelée Arc du perce-cœur ou Fiole de feu des dragons, révélez-la, mettez-la dans votre main, puis mélangez.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et artificier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595480&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c97c5be3-38cb-41f1-a12e-846760822fe0\', \'multiverseId\': 595480}, \'multiverseid\': 595480}, {\'name\': \'Armaiolo Rinomato\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {C}{C}. Spendi questo mana solo per lanciare magie artefatto o attivare abilità di artefatti.\\n{U}, {T}: Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta chiamata Arco Trafiggicuore o Fiala di Fuoco Draconico, rivelala e aggiungila alla tua mano, poi rimescola.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Artefice Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595588&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d3a1fdbe-5940-406f-9cb0-eba03cb0edb1\', \'multiverseId\': 595588}, \'multiverseid\': 595588}, {\'name\': \'名高い武器職人\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}{C}を加える。このマナは、アーティファクト・呪文を唱えるためか、アーティファクトの能力を起動するためにしか支払えない。\\n{U}, {T}：あなたのライブラリーから「心臓貫きの弓」や「龍火の薬瓶」という名前のカード１枚を探し、公開し、あなたの手札に加える。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・工匠\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595696&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'34f90774-6c2e-42cb-a366-b3c62a986d73\', \'multiverseId\': 595696}, \'multiverseid\': 595696}, {\'name\': \'享誉兵匠\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{C}{C}。此法术力只能用来施放神器咒语，或是起动神器的异能。\\n{U}，{T}：从你牌库中搜寻一张名称为穿心弓或龙炎瓶的牌，展示该牌，将它置于你手上，然后洗牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／神器师\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596020&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b77b8f1c-ae2b-401e-8c5a-97092a615314\', \'multiverseId\': 596020}, \'multiverseid\': 596020}]', '[{\'name\': \'Angriffsschwadron\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nStärke und Widerstandskraft der Angriffsschwadron sind gleich der Anzahl an Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Goblin\', \'flavor\': \'Die Goblins nahmen mit militärischer Präzision Stellung als wilder Haufen ein.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590205&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'83f935e4-35a8-4fc2-a0c2-c95974cb1cd7\', \'multiverseId\': 590205}, \'multiverseid\': 590205}, {\'name\': \'Escuadrón de batalla\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nTanto la fuerza como la resistencia del Escuadrón de batalla son iguales a la cantidad de criaturas que controlas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Trasgo\', \'flavor\': \'Con precisión militar, los trasgos se amontonaron desordenadamente.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590340&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ca8c10db-a84d-493c-b07b-12c967b7fb34\', \'multiverseId\': 590340}, \'multiverseid\': 590340}, {\'name\': \'Escadre de bataille\', \'text\': "Vol\\nLa force et l\'endurance de l\'Escadre de bataille sont chacune égales au nombre de créatures que vous contrôlez.", \'type\': \'Créature : gobelin\', \'flavor\': \'Avec une précision toute militaire, les gobelins se mirent en désordre.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590475&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'32407b2b-5165-46d7-8cad-dd3d8a9f3489\', \'multiverseId\': 590475}, \'multiverseid\': 590475}, {\'name\': \'Squadrone di Battaglia\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nLa forza e la costituzione dello Squadrone di Battaglia sono pari al numero di creature che controlli.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Goblin\', \'flavor\': \'I goblin riescono a formare una pila disordinata con precisione militare.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590610&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ee01d992-fb38-4808-915c-6c8bb3437be6\', \'multiverseId\': 590610}, \'multiverseid\': 590610}, {\'name\': \'戦闘飛翔艇隊\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n戦闘飛翔艇隊のパワーとタフネスはそれぞれ、あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャーの数に等しい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ゴブリン\', \'flavor\': \'ゴブリンたちは、軍隊式の正確さでめちゃくちゃに重なりあった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590745&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0549b916-b088-4fa0-9402-4b9d8cd6d562\', \'multiverseId\': 590745}, \'multiverseid\': 590745}, {\'name\': \'战斗航空队\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n战斗航空队的力量和防御力各等同于由你操控的生物数量。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～鬼怪\', \'flavor\': \'鬼怪们依军事用途造出一团乱七八糟的东西。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591150&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'86f22da7-b027-4ac9-a8d5-df0b1d3eb0d0\', \'multiverseId\': 591150}, \'multiverseid\': 591150}]', '[{\'name\': \'Angsteinflößende Apathie\', \'text\': \'Verzaubert eine Kreatur\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur kann nicht angreifen oder blocken.\\n{2}{W}: Schicke die verzauberte Kreatur ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Diejenigen, deren Leben uninspiriert war, sind im Tode zur elenden Eintönigkeit von Phylias verdammt.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591585&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6232f07a-7a20-4e7b-8132-8c90aa74c023\', \'multiverseId\': 591585}, \'multiverseid\': 591585}, {\'name\': \'Apatía terrorífica\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura.\\nLa criatura encantada no puede atacar ni bloquear.\\n{2}{W}: Exilia la criatura encantada.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Aquellos cuyas vidas fueron poco inspiradas están condenados al tedio miserable de Fylias en su muerte.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591714&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'16fc91e7-f069-45dd-906c-dc87e2e2c9cd\', \'multiverseId\': 591714}, \'multiverseid\': 591714}, {\'name\': \'Apathie effroyable\', \'text\': \'Enchanter : créature\\nLa créature enchantée ne peut ni attaquer ni bloquer.\\n{2}{W} : Exilez la créature enchantée.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': "À leur mort, ceux dont la vie avait été dénuée d\'inspiration sont condamnés à la misérable monotonie de Phylias.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591843&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bb34f258-4ca1-40df-8d68-ee66eb93efa6\', \'multiverseId\': 591843}, \'multiverseid\': 591843}, {\'name\': \'Apatia Terrificante\', \'text\': \'Incanta creatura\\nLa creatura incantata non può attaccare o bloccare.\\n{2}{W}: Esilia la creatura incantata.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Coloro che in vita furono mediocri sono condannati al miserabile tedio di Fylias nella morte.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591972&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a7c5dae6-1be3-4198-a560-b12595987dc2\', \'multiverseId\': 591972}, \'multiverseid\': 591972}, {\'name\': \'凄絶な無気力\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\nエンチャントしているクリーチャーでは攻撃もブロックもできない。\\n{2}{W}：エンチャントしているクリーチャーを追放する。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': \'前向きでない一生を送った者は、死後にピュリアスの悲惨な退屈に送られる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592101&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'59daac2f-9739-41ac-8a30-910ad5aa65e6\', \'multiverseId\': 592101}, \'multiverseid\': 592101}, {\'name\': \'可怖漠然\', \'text\': \'结附于生物\\n所结附的生物不能进行攻击或阻挡。\\n{2}{W}：放逐所结附的生物。\', \'type\': \'结界 ～灵气\', \'flavor\': \'活着虚度光阴的人，死后必会坠入虚妄境费拉司继续蹉跎岁月。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592488&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fc97fa2d-e38a-455a-859f-ccfcfeb8edd9\', \'multiverseId\': 592488}, \'multiverseid\': 592488}]', "[{'name': 'Anspruch erheben', 'text': 'Verzaubert eine bleibende Karte\\nDu kontrollierst die verzauberte bleibende Karte.\\nUmwandlung {2} ({2}, wirf diese Karte ab: Ziehe eine Karte.)', 'type': 'Verzauberung — Aura', 'flavor': 'Die Geweihten konzentrieren sich voll und ganz auf die Prüfungen. Alles andere liegt in der Hand der Götter.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595238&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2f4811ca-ded5-4c3f-a540-b98c45059842', 'multiverseId': 595238}, 'multiverseid': 595238}, {'name': 'Reclamar', 'text': 'Encantar permanente.\\nTú controlas el permanente encantado.\\nCiclo {2}. ({2}, descartar esta carta: Roba una carta.)', 'type': 'Encantamiento — Aura', 'flavor': 'Los iniciados solo deben preocuparse de sus pruebas. Todo lo demás está en manos de los dioses.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595346&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fb16c79c-2146-4744-9be8-65e38977786b', 'multiverseId': 595346}, 'multiverseid': 595346}, {'name': 'Revendiquer', 'text': 'Enchanter : permanent\\nVous contrôlez le permanent enchanté.\\nRecyclage {2} ({2}, défaussez-vous de cette carte : Piochez une carte.)', 'type': 'Enchantement : aura', 'flavor': 'Les adeptes ne doivent se préoccuper que des épreuves. Tout le reste est entre les mains des dieux.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595454&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fccf295d-d3a4-41d3-ba00-a605660ad1c6', 'multiverseId': 595454}, 'multiverseid': 595454}, {'name': 'Avanzare Pretese', 'text': 'Incanta permanente\\nControlli il permanente incantato.\\nCiclo {2} ({2}, Scarta questa carta: Pesca una carta.)', 'type': 'Incantesimo — Aura', 'flavor': 'Gli iniziati devono concentrarsi solo sulle ordalie. Tutto il resto è nelle mani delle divinità.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595562&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8ef3ac1a-9f01-4551-a8a4-991ffe92268a', 'multiverseId': 595562}, 'multiverseid': 595562}, {'name': '主張', 'text': 'エンチャント（パーマネント）\\nあなたはエンチャントしているパーマネントをコントロールする。\\nサイクリング{2}（{2},このカードを捨てる：カード１枚を引く。）', 'type': 'エンチャント — オーラ', 'flavor': '修練者は試練のみを気にすればよい。それ以外はすべて神々の手にある。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595670&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e0bd391e-81f0-4960-bf6d-fd2abe02b54c', 'multiverseId': 595670}, 'multiverseid': 595670}, {'name': '宣示主权', 'text': '结附于永久物\\n你操控所结附的永久物。\\n循环{2}（{2}，弃掉此牌：抓一张牌。）', 'type': '结界 ～灵气', 'flavor': '祀徒只需专注祀炼。其余尽在神明的掌握之中。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595994&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '54d846bb-527e-4603-8f09-6a4f4aadf8a7', 'multiverseId': 595994}, 'multiverseid': 595994}]", "[{'name': 'Apothekergeist', 'text': 'Fliegend\\nWenn der Apothekergeist ins Spiel kommt und falls du einen anderen Geist kontrollierst, erhältst du 3 Lebenspunkte dazu.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Geist', 'flavor': 'Für besondere Kunden hat die alte Apotheke immer noch geöffnet.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591555&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '04f90ce8-9e6a-49f3-8a58-2620c792c272', 'multiverseId': 591555}, 'multiverseid': 591555}, {'name': 'Geist boticario', 'text': 'Vuela.\\nCuando el Geist boticario entre al campo de batalla, si controlas otro Espíritu, ganas 3 vidas.', 'type': 'Criatura — Espíritu', 'flavor': 'Para algunos clientes, la vieja botica aún abre sus puertas.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591684&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c895376c-b2a1-49b5-acaa-2794e046e231', 'multiverseId': 591684}, 'multiverseid': 591684}, {'name': 'Geist apothicaire', 'text': 'Vol\\nQuand le Geist apothicaire arrive sur le champ de bataille, si vous contrôlez un autre esprit, vous gagnez 3 points de vie.', 'type': 'Créature : esprit', 'flavor': 'Pour certains clients, la porte de la vieille apothicairerie est toujours ouverte.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591813&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a05798da-8e39-4f86-81ec-dd642c5f37a1', 'multiverseId': 591813}, 'multiverseid': 591813}, {'name': 'Geist Speziale', 'text': 'Volare\\nQuando il Geist Speziale entra nel campo di battaglia, se controlli un altro Spirito, guadagni 3 punti vita.', 'type': 'Creatura — Spirito', 'flavor': 'Per alcuni clienti, la vecchia officina dello speziale apre ancora le sue porte.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591942&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6d92e49a-5497-4520-9b89-510fb68f29e6', 'multiverseId': 591942}, 'multiverseid': 591942}, {'name': '薬剤師の霊', 'text': '飛行\\n薬剤師の霊が戦場に出たとき、あなたがこれでないスピリットをコントロールしている場合、あなたは３点のライフを得る。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — スピリット', 'flavor': 'その古い薬剤師の店は、今でも客を迎え入れることがある。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592071&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f22fedb4-e8c0-49dc-a6a1-0d47dbc4eb75', 'multiverseId': 592071}, 'multiverseid': 592071}, {'name': '药剂师游魂', 'text': '飞行\\n当药剂师游魂进战场时，若你操控另一个精怪，则你获得3点生命。', 'type': '生物 ～精怪', 'flavor': '对一些顾客来说，这间古旧药房仍旧开门迎客。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592458&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3d8ade41-5af4-4c61-a22f-3ab271ab2328', 'multiverseId': 592458}, 'multiverseid': 592458}]", '[{\'name\': \'Aradara-Express\', \'text\': \'Bedrohlich (Diese Kreatur kann nicht geblockt werden, außer von zwei oder mehr Kreaturen.)\\nBemannen 4 (Tappe eine beliebige Anzahl an Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst und die zusammen Stärke 4 oder mehr haben: Dieses Fahrzeug wird bis zum Ende des Zuges zu einer Artefaktkreatur.)\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Fahrzeug\', \'flavor\': \'Er gleitet durch die Stadt, eine erhabene Kombination aus Eleganz und Nutzen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596258&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aa0878a7-8c01-4739-84fe-6c32b856c1bf\', \'multiverseId\': 596258}, \'multiverseid\': 596258}, {\'name\': \'Exprés de Aradara\', \'text\': \'Amenaza. (Esta criatura no puede ser bloqueada excepto por dos o más criaturas.)\\nTripular 4. (Girar cualquier cantidad de criaturas que controlas con una fuerza total de 4 o más: Este Vehículo se convierte en una criatura artefacto hasta el final del turno.)\', \'type\': \'Artefacto — Vehículo\', \'flavor\': \'Se desliza por toda la ciudad en una combinación sublime de elegancia y utilidad.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596345&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5cfa2503-dcc2-4d7a-acd9-949ce972ed8f\', \'multiverseId\': 596345}, \'multiverseid\': 596345}, {\'name\': "Express d\'Aradara", \'text\': "Menace (Cette créature ne peut pas être bloquée excepté par deux créatures ou plus.)\\nPilotage 4 (Engagez n\'importe quel nombre de créatures que vous contrôlez dont la force totale est supérieure ou égale à 4 : Ce véhicule devient une créature-artefact jusqu\'à la fin du tour.)", \'type\': \'Artefact : véhicule\', \'flavor\': \'Il parcourt la ville, alliant merveilleusement élégance et praticité.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596432&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'59d78aaf-72b4-4ed4-a88e-cb88132267b8\', \'multiverseId\': 596432}, \'multiverseid\': 596432}, {\'name\': \'Espresso di Aradara\', \'text\': \'Minacciare (Questa creatura non può essere bloccata tranne che da due o più creature.)\\nManovrare 4 (TAPpa un qualsiasi numero di creature che controlli con forza totale pari o superiore a 4: Questo Veicolo diventa una creatura artefatto fino alla fine del turno.)\', \'type\': \'Artefatto — Veicolo\', \'flavor\': \'Scivola sinuoso intorno alla città, sublime combinazione di eleganza e funzionalità.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596519&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'24e1bea4-ccc5-451e-82c6-efe4027ffef3\', \'multiverseId\': 596519}, \'multiverseid\': 596519}, {\'name\': \'アラダラ急行\', \'text\': \'威迫（このクリーチャーは２体以上のクリーチャーにしかブロックされない。）\\n搭乗４（あなたがコントロールしている望む数のクリーチャーを、パワーの合計が４以上になるように選んでタップする：ターン終了時まで、この機体はアーティファクト・クリーチャーになる。）\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 機体\', \'flavor\': \'市内を滑るように走る。気品と利便性の見事な融合である。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596606&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'977fed7c-baf4-461a-8f6a-c185dd578cd8\', \'multiverseId\': 596606}, \'multiverseid\': 596606}, {\'name\': \'厄勒德拉特快\', \'text\': \'威慑（此生物只能被两个或更多生物阻挡。）\\n搭载4（横置任意数量由你操控且力量总和等于或大于4的生物：此载具成为神器生物直到回合结束。）\', \'type\': \'神器 ～载具\', \'flavor\': \'特快列车在城市中飞速穿行，华美车身典雅外观与实用设计兼具。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596867&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a35a9bb4-6e44-47ef-bab7-6d84f5be74b3\', \'multiverseId\': 596867}, \'multiverseid\': 596867}]', '[{\'name\': \'Archon der Gerechtigkeit\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nWenn der Archon der Gerechtigkeit stirbt, schicke eine bleibende Karte deiner Wahl ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Archon\', \'flavor\': \'In dunklen Zeiten ist auch die Wahrheit bewaffnet.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591556&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b4f055f3-7c79-4cd2-8a1b-60dc2c7cdd5b\', \'multiverseId\': 591556}, \'multiverseid\': 591556}, {\'name\': \'Arconte de justicia\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nCuando el Arconte de justicia muera, exilia el permanente objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Arconte\', \'flavor\': \'En tiempos oscuros, la Verdad blande una espada.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591685&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d9bc249f-4af7-460f-8afa-48e0552e3660\', \'multiverseId\': 591685}, \'multiverseid\': 591685}, {\'name\': \'Archonte de la justice\', \'text\': "Vol\\nQuand l\'Archonte de la justice meurt, exilez un permanent ciblé.", \'type\': \'Créature : archonte\', \'flavor\': \'Dans les périodes les plus noires, la Vérité doit être tranchante.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591814&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'248319b4-524e-4c0f-87fb-0f031025e8dd\', \'multiverseId\': 591814}, \'multiverseid\': 591814}, {\'name\': \'Arconte della Giustizia\', \'text\': "Volare\\nQuando l\'Arconte della Giustizia muore, esilia un permanente bersaglio.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Arconte\', \'flavor\': \'Nei periodi più oscuri, la Verità brandisce una lama.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591943&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fd78f808-d38b-4494-a0a8-f5b842ef740e\', \'multiverseId\': 591943}, \'multiverseid\': 591943}, {\'name\': \'正義の執政官\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n正義の執政官が死亡したとき、パーマネント１つを対象とする。それを追放する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 執政官\', \'flavor\': \'暗黒の時代には、真実は刃を帯びる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592072&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'daaa96c2-2c4e-4a79-9e8b-ec8222bce75c\', \'multiverseId\': 592072}, \'multiverseid\': 592072}, {\'name\': \'正义统领\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n当正义统领死去时，放逐目标永久物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～统领\', \'flavor\': \'在黑暗时代，真理得配剑出巡。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592459&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'116f7626-5113-4993-912e-9bbb1171d057\', \'multiverseId\': 592459}, \'multiverseid\': 592459}]', '[{\'name\': \'Archon der Sonnengnade\', \'text\': \'Fliegend, Lebensverknüpfung\\nPegasus-Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, haben Lebensverknüpfung.\\nKonstellation — Immer wenn eine Verzauberung unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, erzeuge einen 2/2 weißen Pegasus-Kreaturenspielstein mit Flugfähigkeit.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Archon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591557&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e670cc2f-7b63-4795-b887-b4b3466ca818\', \'multiverseId\': 591557}, \'multiverseid\': 591557}, {\'name\': \'Arconte de la gracia solar\', \'text\': \'Vuela, vínculo vital.\\nLas criaturas Pegaso que controlas tienen la habilidad de vínculo vital.\\nConstelación — Siempre que un encantamiento entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, crea una ficha de criatura Pegaso blanca 2/2 con la habilidad de volar.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Arconte\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591686&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'45ef9903-e2a5-43db-be3f-8f87afbeb785\', \'multiverseId\': 591686}, \'multiverseid\': 591686}, {\'name\': \'Archonte de la grâce solaire\', \'text\': "Vol, lien de vie\\nLes créatures Pégase que vous contrôlez ont le lien de vie.\\nConstellation — À chaque fois qu\'un enchantement arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, créez un jeton de créature 2/2 blanche Pégase avec le vol.", \'type\': \'Créature : archonte\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591815&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'78cc5e29-8ac7-48bb-9cf5-62cbe365e9ef\', \'multiverseId\': 591815}, \'multiverseid\': 591815}, {\'name\': \'Arconte della Grazia Solare\', \'text\': \'Volare, legame vitale\\nLe creature Pegaso che controlli hanno legame vitale.\\nCostellazione — Ogniqualvolta un incantesimo entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, crea una pedina creatura Pegaso 2/2 bianca con volare.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Arconte\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591944&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c3ebb2f3-1d06-4336-a456-01677e6bde77\', \'multiverseId\': 591944}, \'multiverseid\': 591944}, {\'name\': \'太陽の恵みの執政官\', \'text\': \'飛行、絆魂\\nあなたがコントロールしているすべてのペガサス・クリーチャーは絆魂を持つ。\\n星座 ― エンチャント１つがあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、飛行を持つ白の２/２のペガサス・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 執政官\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592073&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5c2f011a-d077-4325-b1d6-7725b6ee70cb\', \'multiverseId\': 592073}, \'multiverseid\': 592073}, {\'name\': \'阳华统领\', \'text\': \'飞行，系命\\n由你操控的飞马生物具有系命异能。\\n星彩～每当一个结界在你的操控下进战场时，派出一个2/2白色，具飞行异能的飞马衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～统领\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592460&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5bce9664-f711-4369-9fcc-a4e3914ffe81\', \'multiverseId\': 592460}, \'multiverseid\': 592460}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ardoz die Kriegsschmiedin\', \'text\': \'Eile\\nImmer wenn Ardoz die Kriegsschmiedin oder eine andere Kreatur unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, erhält die Kreatur +2/+0 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\\n{3}{R}: Erzeuge einen 1/1 roten Goblin-Kreaturenspielstein mit Eile. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit wie eine Hexerei.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Goblin, Schamane\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589634&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fb65d9e5-a287-41ea-ab9a-a2a0eee04125\', \'multiverseId\': 589634}, \'multiverseid\': 589634}, {\'name\': \'Ardoz, zapatera bélica\', \'text\': \'Prisa.\\nSiempre que Ardoz, zapatera bélica u otra criatura entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, esa criatura obtiene +2/+0 hasta el final del turno.\\n{3}{R}: Crea una ficha de criatura Trasgo roja 1/1 con la habilidad de prisa. Activa esto solo como un conjuro.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Chamán trasgo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589685&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4d275843-7694-405d-9978-0d7bf4d7f3f4\', \'multiverseId\': 589685}, \'multiverseid\': 589685}, {\'name\': \'Ardoz, cordonnière de guerre\', \'text\': "Célérité\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'Ardoz, cordonnière de guerre ou une autre créature arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, cette créature gagne +2/+0 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.\\n{3}{R} : Créez un jeton de créature 1/1 rouge Gobelin avec la célérité. N\'activez que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : gobelin et shamane\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589736&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2aabc40a-9cbf-409e-b4a8-8ef1425edd81\', \'multiverseId\': 589736}, \'multiverseid\': 589736}, {\'name\': \'Ardoz, Calzolaia da Guerra\', \'text\': "Rapidità\\nOgniqualvolta Ardoz, Calzolaia da Guerra o un\'altra creatura entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, quella creatura prende +2/+0 fino alla fine del turno.\\n{3}{R}: Crea una pedina creatura Goblin 1/1 rossa con rapidità. Attiva solo come una stregoneria.", \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Sciamano Goblin\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589787&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'11df3697-2129-4d0d-a7e0-c9d1e965ae81\', \'multiverseId\': 589787}, \'multiverseid\': 589787}, {\'name\': \'戦争の靴職人、アルドース\', \'text\': \'速攻\\n戦争の靴職人、アルドースやこれでないクリーチャー１体があなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、ターン終了時まで、そのクリーチャーは＋２/＋０の修整を受ける。\\n{3}{R}：速攻を持つ赤の１/１のゴブリン・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。起動はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — ゴブリン・シャーマン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589838&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c0c6aaeb-83fa-49a3-8f40-007539feea1e\', \'multiverseId\': 589838}, \'multiverseid\': 589838}, {\'name\': \'兴战补匠阿朵兹\', \'text\': \'敏捷\\n每当兴战补匠阿朵兹或另一个生物在你操控下进战场时，该生物得+2/+0直到回合结束。\\n{3}{R}：派出一个1/1红色，具敏捷异能的鬼怪衍生生物。只能于法术时机起动。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～鬼怪／祭师\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589991&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0d2018ae-3c07-43d8-9aed-61291bd363e9\', \'multiverseId\': 589991}, \'multiverseid\': 589991}]', "[{'name': 'Arlinn, Stimme des Rudels', 'text': 'Jede Kreatur, die du kontrollierst und die ein Wolf oder Werwolf ist, kommt mit einer zusätzlichen +1/+1-Marke ins Spiel.\\n−2: Erzeuge einen 2/2 grünen Wolf-Kreaturenspielstein.', 'type': 'Legendärer Planeswalker — Arlinn', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597114&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a00d9c36-2ba8-4efc-abfd-8dba56c75cbd', 'multiverseId': 597114}, 'multiverseid': 597114}, {'name': 'Arlinn, la Voz de la Manada', 'text': 'Cada criatura que controlas que sea un Lobo o un Licántropo entra al campo de batalla con un contador +1/+1 adicional sobre ella.\\n−2: Crea una ficha de criatura Lobo verde 2/2.', 'type': 'Planeswalker legendario — Arlinn', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597160&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '866d1f06-82c9-4808-94f3-b33e81680723', 'multiverseId': 597160}, 'multiverseid': 597160}, {'name': 'Arlinn, voix de la meute', 'text': 'Chaque créature que vous contrôlez qui est un loup ou un loup-garou arrive sur le champ de bataille avec un marqueur +1/+1 supplémentaire sur elle.\\n-2 : Créez un jeton de créature 2/2 verte Loup.', 'type': 'Planeswalker légendaire : Arlinn', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597206&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8a9bad33-dbd5-45c3-b9e3-ba6bc0b8cf6b', 'multiverseId': 597206}, 'multiverseid': 597206}, {'name': 'Arlinn, Voce del Branco', 'text': 'Ogni creatura che controlli che è un Lupo o un Mannaro entra nel campo di battaglia con un segnalino +1/+1 addizionale.\\n−2: Crea una pedina creatura Lupo 2/2 verde.', 'type': 'Planeswalker Leggendario — Arlinn', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597252&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4588ab25-2a89-4e2c-a2fb-1567f749c234', 'multiverseId': 597252}, 'multiverseid': 597252}, {'name': '群れの声、アーリン', 'text': 'あなたがコントロールしていて狼や狼男であるすべてのクリーチャーは、追加で＋１/＋１カウンター１個が置かれた状態で戦場に出る。\\n-2：緑の２/２の狼・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。', 'type': '伝説のプレインズウォーカー — アーリン', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597298&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '67852a34-7c25-48a0-929f-dac24d8270db', 'multiverseId': 597298}, 'multiverseid': 597298}, {'name': '狼群之声雅琳', 'text': '由你操控且为狼或狼人的生物进战场时上面额外有一个+1/+1指示物。\\n−2：派出一个2/2绿色的狼衍生生物。', 'type': '传奇鹏洛客 ～雅琳', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597436&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c91a18be-e33b-4f45-9a43-cfdbaa7d422f', 'multiverseId': 597436}, 'multiverseid': 597436}]", "[{'name': 'Aschenödnis', 'text': '{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\nStandardlandumwandlung {1} ({1}, wirf diese Karte ab: Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Standardland-Karte, zeige sie offen vor, nimm sie auf deine Hand und mische danach.)', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596313&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '64dc49ff-d21b-452f-8cff-c40a58ca2f76', 'multiverseId': 596313}, 'multiverseid': 596313}, {'name': 'Yermos humeantes', 'text': '{T}: Agrega {C}.\\nCiclo de tierras básicas {1}. ({1}, descartar esta carta: Busca en tu biblioteca una carta de tierra básica, muéstrala, ponla en tu mano y luego baraja.)', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596400&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1901731d-b664-4f96-950a-8765a4ebc2a2', 'multiverseId': 596400}, 'multiverseid': 596400}, {'name': 'Landes cendreuses', 'text': '{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\nRecyclage de terrain de base {1} ({1}, défaussez-vous de cette carte : Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte de terrain de base, révélez-la, mettez-la dans votre main, puis mélangez.)', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596487&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c5c46245-5ec9-4450-b065-21edfff7d462', 'multiverseId': 596487}, 'multiverseid': 596487}, {'name': 'Distese di Polvere', 'text': '{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\nCicloterra base {1} ({1}, Scarta questa carta: Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta terra base, rivelala e aggiungila alla tua mano, poi rimescola.)', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596574&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f2fa932a-544a-4fe1-b64d-9f5970ac6af4', 'multiverseId': 596574}, 'multiverseid': 596574}, {'name': '灰のやせ地', 'text': '{T}：{C}を加える。\\n基本土地サイクリング{1}（{1},このカードを捨てる：あなたのライブラリーから基本土地・カード１枚を探し、公開し、あなたの手札に加える。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。）', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596661&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '29d34010-94c5-4f0b-9061-009308e22e66', 'multiverseId': 596661}, 'multiverseid': 596661}, {'name': '灰烬瘠地', 'text': '{T}：加{C}。\\n循环基本地{1}（{1}，弃掉此牌：从你牌库中搜寻一张基本地牌，展示该牌，将它置于你手上，然后洗牌。）', 'type': '地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596922&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '60d978ec-a6bf-4159-909e-a9d04a558108', 'multiverseId': 596922}, 'multiverseid': 596922}]", '[{\'name\': \'Aschpelz vom Schattenschwarm\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn Aschpelz vom Schattenschwarm angreift oder blockt, erhält jede andere Ratten, die du kontrollierst, bis zum Ende des Zuges +X/+X, wobei X gleich der Anzahl an Ratten ist, die du kontrollierst.\\nZu Beginn deines Endsegments kannst du vier Karten millen. Falls du dies tust, bringe bis zu zwei Ratte-Kreaturenkarten aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurück. (Um eine Karte zu millen, lege die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek auf deinen Friedhof.)\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Ratte, Hexenmeister\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589624&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'59175101-6d40-46de-847c-b86e3f586f8c\', \'multiverseId\': 589624}, \'multiverseid\': 589624}, {\'name\': \'Mantocenizo de la plaga sombría\', \'text\': \'Siempre que Mantocenizo de la plaga sombría ataque o bloquee, las otras Ratas que controlas obtienen +X/+X hasta el final del turno, donde X es la cantidad de Ratas que controlas.\\nAl comienzo de tu paso final, puedes moler cuatro cartas. Si lo haces, regresa hasta dos cartas de criatura Rata de tu cementerio a tu mano. (Para moler una carta, pon la primera carta de tu biblioteca en tu cementerio.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Brujo rata\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589675&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bbcad338-49bf-4b00-8dae-90f6414a0b5d\', \'multiverseId\': 589675}, \'multiverseid\': 589675}, {\'name\': \'Cendrepoil de la Meute des ombres\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que Cendrepoil de la Meute des ombres attaque ou bloque, les autres rats que vous contrôlez gagnent +X/+X jusqu\'à la fin du tour, X étant le nombre de rats que vous contrôlez.\\nAu début de votre étape de fin, vous pouvez meuler quatre cartes. Si vous faites ainsi, renvoyez jusqu\'à deux cartes de créature Rat depuis votre cimetière dans votre main. (Pour meuler une carte, mettez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque dans votre cimetière.)", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : rat et psychagogue\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589726&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3b43cfbe-e1ba-4ffb-9760-027cb2587b9b\', \'multiverseId\': 589726}, \'multiverseid\': 589726}, {\'name\': "Manto Cinerino dello Sciame d\'Ombra", \'text\': "Ogniqualvolta Manto Cinerino dello Sciame d\'Ombra attacca o blocca, gli altri Ratti che controlli prendono +X/+X fino alla fine del turno, dove X è il numero di Ratti che controlli.\\nAll\'inizio della tua sottofase finale, puoi macinare quattro carte. Se lo fai, riprendi in mano fino a due carte creatura Ratto dal tuo cimitero. (Per macinare una carta, metti nel tuo cimitero la prima carta del tuo grimorio.)", \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Warlock Ratto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589777&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'26b34ab7-2639-49f1-aa0d-6c3077e7f7ca\', \'multiverseId\': 589777}, \'multiverseid\': 589777}, {\'name\': \'影の群れの灰毛\', \'text\': \'影の群れの灰毛が攻撃するかブロックするたび、ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールしていてこれでないすべてのネズミは＋Ｘ/＋Ｘの修整を受ける。Ｘはあなたがコントロールしているネズミの数に等しい。\\nあなたの終了ステップの開始時に、あなたはカード４枚を切削してもよい。そうしたなら、あなたの墓地にあるネズミ・クリーチャー・カード最大２枚をあなたの手札に戻す。（カードを切削するとは、あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカードをあなたの墓地に置くことである。）\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — ネズミ・邪術師\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589828&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4c6696c7-dc5e-4a35-bf6e-291dcd0e8733\', \'multiverseId\': 589828}, \'multiverseid\': 589828}, {\'name\': \'影群灰衣\', \'text\': \'每当影群灰衣攻击或阻挡时，由你操控的其他老鼠得+X/+X直到回合结束，X为由你操控的老鼠数量。\\n在你的结束步骤开始时，你可以磨四张牌。若你如此作，则将至多两张老鼠生物牌从你的坟墓场移回你手上。（磨一张牌的流程是将你牌库顶的牌置入你的坟墓场。）\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～老鼠／邪术师\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589981&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'de443366-edd6-4039-822b-6ffe3e9f4acd\', \'multiverseId\': 589981}, \'multiverseid\': 589981}]', '[{\'name\': \'Atlas der Welten\', \'text\': \'Der Atlas der Welten kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nWenn der Atlas der Welten ins Spiel kommt, kannst du dir die obersten vier Karten deiner Bibliothek anschauen. Falls du dies tust, zeige davon bis zu eine Länderkarte offen vor, lege sie oben auf deine Bibliothek und den Rest in zufälliger Reihenfolge unter die Bibliothek.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589656&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f5f63517-de63-4e96-a54b-8a5421fb6d64\', \'multiverseId\': 589656}, \'multiverseid\': 589656}, {\'name\': \'Atlas planar\', \'text\': \'El Atlas planar entra al campo de batalla girado.\\nCuando el Atlas planar entre al campo de batalla, puedes mirar las cuatro primeras cartas de tu biblioteca. Si lo haces, muestra hasta una carta de tierra de entre ellas, luego pon esa carta en la parte superior de tu biblioteca y el resto en el fondo en un orden aleatorio.\\n{T}: Agrega {C}.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589707&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'95509226-001c-4573-b3f7-7efa54beb3fa\', \'multiverseId\': 589707}, \'multiverseid\': 589707}, {\'name\': \'Atlas planaire\', \'text\': "L\'Atlas planaire arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\nQuand l\'Atlas planaire arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez regarder les quatre cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Si vous faites ainsi, révélez jusqu\'à une carte de terrain parmi elles, puis mettez cette carte au-dessus de votre bibliothèque et le reste au-dessous de votre bibliothèque dans un ordre aléatoire.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {C}.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589758&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6f1bf465-b328-4bb3-bbea-f274fa56f35e\', \'multiverseId\': 589758}, \'multiverseid\': 589758}, {\'name\': \'Atlante Planare\', \'text\': "L\'Atlante Planare entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\nQuando l\'Atlante Planare entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi guardare le prime quattro carte del tuo grimorio. Se lo fai, rivela fino a una carta terra scelta tra esse, poi metti quella carta in cima al tuo grimorio e le altre in fondo in ordine casuale.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {C}.", \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589809&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1807c4bd-eceb-4a06-8a1e-68f50d6b979e\', \'multiverseId\': 589809}, \'multiverseid\': 589809}, {\'name\': \'次元の大地図\', \'text\': \'次元の大地図はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n次元の大地図が戦場に出たとき、あなたはあなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード４枚を見てもよい。そうしたなら、その中から土地・カード最大１枚を公開し、そのカードをあなたのライブラリーの一番上に、残りを一番下に無作為の順番で置く。\\n{T}：{C}を加える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589860&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'95fefd6f-5009-4c49-90af-5fcb39c6a4b9\', \'multiverseId\': 589860}, \'multiverseid\': 589860}, {\'name\': \'时空图集\', \'text\': \'时空图集须横置进战场。\\n当时空图集进战场时，你可以检视你牌库顶的四张牌。若你如此作，则展示其中至多一张地牌，然后将该牌置于你的牌库顶，其余则以随机顺序置于你牌库底。\\n{T}：加{C}。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590013&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'78b12f39-ccac-4354-8753-2b7f347c5334\', \'multiverseId\': 590013}, \'multiverseid\': 590013}]', '[{\'name\': \'Auf Antworten drängen\', \'text\': \'Tappe eine Kreatur deiner Wahl. Sie enttappt nicht während des nächsten Enttappsegments ihres Beherrschers.\\nStelle Nachforschungen an. (Erzeuge einen Hinweis-Spielstein. Er ist ein Artefakt mit „{2}, opfere dieses Artefakt: Ziehe eine Karte.")\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595263&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dbe57651-8380-421b-a6bf-7fc182d73ad7\', \'multiverseId\': 595263}, \'multiverseid\': 595263}, {\'name\': \'Exigir respuestas\', \'text\': \'Gira la criatura objetivo. No se endereza durante el próximo paso de enderezar de su controlador.\\nInvestiga. (Crea una ficha de Pista. Es un artefacto con "{2}, sacrificar este artefacto: Roba una carta".)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595371&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b17cbe2a-8f17-42f5-9335-581115ecae12\', \'multiverseId\': 595371}, \'multiverseid\': 595371}, {\'name\': \'Exhortation inquisitoire\', \'text\': "Engagez une créature ciblée. Elle ne se dégage pas pendant la prochaine étape de dégagement de son contrôleur.\\nEnquêtez. (Créez un jeton Indice. C\'est un artefact avec « {2}, sacrifiez cet artefact : Piochez une carte. »)", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595479&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a3db5248-e43c-4188-bdd4-aa633104748e\', \'multiverseId\': 595479}, \'multiverseid\': 595479}, {\'name\': \'Esigere le Risposte\', \'text\': \'TAPpa una creatura bersaglio. Quella creatura non STAPpa durante il prossimo STAP del suo controllore.\\nIndaga. (Crea una pedina Indizio. È un artefatto con "{2}, Sacrifica questo artefatto: Pesca una carta".)\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595587&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fd961046-dc53-4b8a-8694-8f2bcc228ccf\', \'multiverseId\': 595587}, \'multiverseid\': 595587}, {\'name\': \'回答の強要\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それをタップする。それは次のそれのコントローラーのアンタップ・ステップにアンタップしない。\\n調査を行う。（手掛かり・トークン１つを生成する。それは、「{2},このアーティファクトを生け贄に捧げる：カード１枚を引く。」を持つアーティファクトである。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595695&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'32c71660-fc29-4d25-afb0-48ebd90a9fa6\', \'multiverseId\': 595695}, \'multiverseid\': 595695}, {\'name\': \'强求解答\', \'text\': \'横置目标生物。它于其操控者的下一个重置步骤中不能重置。\\n探查。（派出一个线索衍生物。它是具有「{2}，牺牲此神器：抓一张牌」的神器。）\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596019&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'01a25220-f67f-441b-9828-61a1966d5a38\', \'multiverseId\': 596019}, \'multiverseid\': 596019}]', '[{\'name\': \'Auf die Beute stürzen\', \'text\': \'Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst, kämpft gegen eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du nicht kontrollierst. (Jede fügt der anderen Schadenspunkte in Höhe ihrer Stärke zu.)\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Dinosaurier werden bei der Jagd nur von ihren Instinkten getrieben. Es gilt also, diese in die richtigen Bahnen zu lenken.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592906&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8a8474a7-4abf-466e-91b9-a596a0186e2d\', \'multiverseId\': 592906}, \'multiverseid\': 592906}, {\'name\': \'Abalanzarse\', \'text\': \'La criatura objetivo que controlas lucha contra la criatura objetivo que no controlas. (Cada una hace un daño igual a su fuerza a la otra.)\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'El impulso de cazar y alimentarse es un instinto básico de los dinosaurios. El truco consiste en canalizarlo en la dirección apropiada.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593027&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ed5e95e2-9648-4867-bf9d-f51cfe5a1b1a\', \'multiverseId\': 593027}, \'multiverseid\': 593027}, {\'name\': \'Bondissement\', \'text\': "Une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez se bat contre une créature ciblée que vous ne contrôlez pas. (Chacune inflige un nombre de blessures égal à sa force à l\'autre.)", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "L\'instinct des dinosaures les pousse à chasser et se nourrir. L\'astuce consiste à canaliser ces instincts dans la bonne direction.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593148&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'42ab276f-06d4-4978-9552-06be7be03bbe\', \'multiverseId\': 593148}, \'multiverseid\': 593148}, {\'name\': \'Avventarsi\', \'text\': "Una creatura bersaglio che controlli lotta con una creatura bersaglio che non controlli. (Ogni creatura infligge all\'altra danno pari alla propria forza.)", \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': "Per i dinosauri, l\'impulso a cacciare e nutrirsi è un istinto selvaggio. Il trucco sta nell\'incanalarlo nella direzione giusta.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593269&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'532553ec-e48c-4ba9-8853-310597fe4aa5\', \'multiverseId\': 593269}, \'multiverseid\': 593269}, {\'name\': \'襲撃\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体とあなたがコントロールしていないクリーチャー１体を対象とする。その前者はその後者と格闘を行う。（それぞれはもう一方に自身のパワーに等しい点数のダメージを与える。）\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'狩りと採餌の欲求は恐竜の本能である。それを適切な方向に導けばいいのだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593390&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7ef4b151-f34a-4a73-bf1d-8ccaa5a33e76\', \'multiverseId\': 593390}, \'multiverseid\': 593390}, {\'name\': \'猛扑\', \'text\': \'目标由你操控的生物与目标不由你操控的生物互斗。（它们各向对方造成等同于本身力量的伤害。）\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'恐龙捕猎进食乃是纯粹本能。诀窍在于指引它扑向正确的方向。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593753&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'183384fe-d90a-4069-8dea-1530cfe6c887\', \'multiverseId\': 593753}, \'multiverseid\': 593753}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aufflackern des Schicksals\', \'text\': \'Schicke eine Kreatur oder eine Verzauberung deiner Wahl ins Exil und bringe sie dann unter der Kontrolle ihres Besitzers ins Spiel zurück.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Sicher, ich habe neun Leben, aber das heißt nicht, dass ich jetzt eines verschwenden will."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597085&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6e9cd514-2c76-409f-a82d-5e973abd3ed2\', \'multiverseId\': 597085}, \'multiverseid\': 597085}, {\'name\': \'Instante del destino\', \'text\': \'Exilia la criatura o encantamiento objetivo, luego regrésalo al campo de batalla bajo el control de su propietario.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Que tenga siete vidas no significa que me apetezca gastar una ahora".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597131&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5a19c6c7-2614-44d7-b302-bb02afbcf1d8\', \'multiverseId\': 597131}, \'multiverseid\': 597131}, {\'name\': \'Vacillement du destin\', \'text\': \'Exilez une cible, créature ou enchantement, puis renvoyez-la sur le champ de bataille sous le contrôle de son propriétaire.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Certes, j\'ai neuf vies, mais ça ne veut pas dire que j\'ai envie d\'en gâcher une tout de suite. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597177&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9882af32-9dd3-48ba-87da-c2dbbaaeab08\', \'multiverseId\': 597177}, \'multiverseid\': 597177}, {\'name\': \'Fremito del Fato\', \'text\': \'Esilia una creatura o un incantesimo bersaglio, poi rimetti quel permanente sul campo di battaglia sotto il controllo del suo proprietario.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Oh sì, ho sette vite... ma questo non significa che sono disposta a sprecarne una adesso."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597223&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bb710ae5-1cee-4cb3-88a6-9757fcddf31d\', \'multiverseId\': 597223}, \'multiverseid\': 597223}, {\'name\': \'運命のちらつき\', \'text\': \'クリーチャーやエンチャントのうち１つを対象とする。それを追放し、その後、オーナーのコントロール下で戦場に戻す。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「確かに命は九つあるけど、ここでひとつ無駄にしようとは思ってないよ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597269&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'74af87c7-a903-4f44-bac8-ac8f437c26dc\', \'multiverseId\': 597269}, \'multiverseid\': 597269}, {\'name\': \'明灭命运\', \'text\': \'放逐目标生物或结界，然后将它在其拥有者的操控下移回战场。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「没错，我是有九条命，但我现在不是很想浪费一条。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597407&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'172d5c1a-2bad-446b-be1b-8d7b25d8e5be\', \'multiverseId\': 597407}, \'multiverseid\': 597407}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aufleuchten der Hieroglyphen\', \'text\': \'Ziehe zwei Karten.\\nUmwandlung {U} ({U}, wirf diese Karte ab: Ziehe eine Karte.)\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Die Antworten sind da. Man muss nur die Augen öffnen."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595233&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'50fd0993-cd4b-4db2-8d08-d6247748d8ea\', \'multiverseId\': 595233}, \'multiverseid\': 595233}, {\'name\': \'Iluminación jeroglífica\', \'text\': \'Roba dos cartas.\\nCiclo {U}. ({U}, descartar esta carta: Roba una carta.)\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Las respuestas están aquí. Esta es la forma de superar la prueba".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595341&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f92af4fe-c240-4564-83b8-30a7fb452bcb\', \'multiverseId\': 595341}, \'multiverseid\': 595341}, {\'name\': \'Illumination hiéroglyphique\', \'text\': \'Piochez deux cartes.\\nRecyclage {U} ({U}, défaussez-vous de cette carte : Piochez une carte.)\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« Toutes les réponses sont ici. Voici comment surmonter les épreuves. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595449&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7a400c62-e7aa-4c3c-bfba-2140b43751c7\', \'multiverseId\': 595449}, \'multiverseid\': 595449}, {\'name\': \'Rivelazione Geroglifica\', \'text\': \'Pesca due carte.\\nCiclo {U} ({U}, Scarta questa carta: Pesca una carta.)\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Le risposte si trovano qui. Questo è il cammino per superare l\\\'ordalia."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595557&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f04d4854-76af-430c-b8c4-2ef7beae66e1\', \'multiverseId\': 595557}, \'multiverseid\': 595557}, {\'name\': \'ヒエログリフの輝き\', \'text\': \'カード２枚を引く。\\nサイクリング{U}（{U}, このカードを捨てる：カード１枚を引く。）\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「答えがここにある。試練を抜ける道だ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595665&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'309ab203-de2c-4ea4-9e27-f42da907c711\', \'multiverseId\': 595665}, \'multiverseid\': 595665}, {\'name\': \'图符幽光\', \'text\': \'抓两张牌。\\n循环{U}（{U}，弃掉此牌：抓一张牌。）\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「这就是答案。这就是通过祀炼的方法。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595989&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6b296c48-df8e-4d3a-9ce6-fdc5f504dc95\', \'multiverseId\': 595989}, \'multiverseid\': 595989}]', '[{\'name\': \'Auflodern\', \'text\': \'Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +2/+0 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Die grenzenlose Wut der ersten Gruul wurde durch ein riesiges Feuer am Anbeginn der Zeit gespeist. Dieselbe Flamme brennt auch in dir."\\n—Kroshkar, Gruul-Schamane\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590216&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'36679d2c-fe05-4ff0-a36f-4cc96ba6ddb8\', \'multiverseId\': 590216}, \'multiverseid\': 590216}, {\'name\': \'Arder de rabia\', \'text\': \'Las criaturas que controlas obtienen +2/+0 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"En una gran hoguera en el albor de los tiempos, los primeros gruul encendieron su ira. La misma llama arde en ti".\\n—Kroshkar, chamán gruul\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590351&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8c4b0f3a-c245-4041-84da-c16a3d7cdd79\', \'multiverseId\': 590351}, \'multiverseid\': 590351}, {\'name\': \'Pleins feux\', \'text\': "Les créatures que vous contrôlez gagnent +2/+0 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« À l\'aube des temps, le premier Gruul a attisé sa rage dans un grand feu de joie. Cette même flamme brûle en vous. »\\n—Kroshkar, shamane gruul", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590486&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7e1a5940-f343-45dd-a95f-a4aeef4e6f9a\', \'multiverseId\': 590486}, \'multiverseid\': 590486}, {\'name\': \'Avvampare\', \'text\': \'Le creature che controlli prendono +2/+0 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Da un grande rogo all\\\'alba dei tempi, i primi Gruul accesero la loro furia. La stessa fiamma brucia dentro di te."\\n—Kroshkar, sciamano Gruul\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590621&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7c0a8788-ce4c-40b2-aace-f6ccd3626f75\', \'multiverseId\': 590621}, \'multiverseid\': 590621}, {\'name\': \'燃えさかる炎\', \'text\': \'ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールしているすべてのクリーチャーは＋２/＋０の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「太古の昔の大かがり火で、最初のグルールは怒りを燃え立たせた。お前の中には同じ炎が燃えている。」\\n――グルールのシャーマン、クロシュカー\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590756&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'18d7417b-11e1-4935-b923-f079a65f7373\', \'multiverseId\': 590756}, \'multiverseid\': 590756}, {\'name\': \'怒火冲天\', \'text\': \'由你操控的生物得+2/+0直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「古鲁人血液中的怒火，从先人在创世之初升起第一簇盛大篝火起就开始燃烧，一直延续至今。这股怒火同样也在你的体内燃烧。」\\n～古鲁祭师克许卡\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591161&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'476f5b2b-91e2-40c6-a3a4-4d9d4eb8737f\', \'multiverseId\': 591161}, \'multiverseid\': 591161}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aufseher aus Stahl\', \'text\': \'{T}: Lege auf jede Artefaktkreatur, die du kontrollierst, eine +1/+1-Marke.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Konstrukt\', \'flavor\': \'„Die Welt wird jetzt schon von unterschiedlichsten Maschinen regiert. Eines Tages werden sie es uns spüren lassen."\\n—Sargis Haz, Tüftler\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596302&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'367112ee-8cad-4aa7-9b44-4e79421c2bb9\', \'multiverseId\': 596302}, \'multiverseid\': 596302}, {\'name\': \'Capataz de acero\', \'text\': \'{T}: Pon un contador +1/+1 sobre cada criatura artefacto que controlas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Constructo\', \'flavor\': \'"El mundo ya está dirigido por todo tipo de máquinas. Un día, nos recordarán ese hecho".\\n—Sargis Haz, artífice\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596389&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b34cf7bb-d801-4676-b084-631e42a2d78c\', \'multiverseId\': 596389}, \'multiverseid\': 596389}, {\'name\': "Brigadier d\'acier", \'text\': \'{T} : Mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur chaque créature-artefact que vous contrôlez.\', \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : construction\', \'flavor\': \'« Le monde est déjà dirigé par toutes sortes de machines. Un jour, elles nous le rappelleront. »\\n—Sargis Haz, artificier\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596476&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'97621cc4-5891-41b2-aaef-847c57e4e381\', \'multiverseId\': 596476}, \'multiverseid\': 596476}, {\'name\': "Sorvegliante d\'Acciaio", \'text\': \'{T}: Metti un segnalino +1/+1 su ogni creatura artefatto che controlli.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Costrutto\', \'flavor\': \'"Il mondo ormai è gestito da macchine di ogni genere. Un giorno, ci ricorderanno questo fatto."\\n—Sargis Haz, artefice\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596563&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'efcd0797-d593-497e-bdf1-dcf14c7386cb\', \'multiverseId\': 596563}, \'multiverseid\': 596563}, {\'name\': \'鋼の監視者\', \'text\': \'{T}：あなたがコントロールしている各アーティファクト・クリーチャーの上にそれぞれ、＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 構築物\', \'flavor\': \'「世界は既に機械の方式で動いているのよ。いつか、その事実を向こうに思い知らされるんでしょうね。」\\n――工匠、サルギス・ハズ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596650&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a8e122e0-5a4f-418e-bef9-d86d8f50cd9c\', \'multiverseId\': 596650}, \'multiverseid\': 596650}, {\'name\': \'钢铁督军\', \'text\': \'{T}：在每个由你操控的神器生物上各放置一个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～组构体\', \'flavor\': \'「这世界已经靠各种机械来运作着。有一天，它们会提醒我们这事实。」\\n～神器师莎琪亥\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596911&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c30a05c8-ac5c-4409-97e5-969d32f50883\', \'multiverseId\': 596911}, \'multiverseid\': 596911}]', '[{\'name\': \'Auge der Pilger\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nWenn das Auge der Pilger ins Spiel kommt, kannst du deine Bibliothek nach einer Standardland-Karte durchsuchen, sie offen vorzeigen, auf deine Hand nehmen und danach mischen.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Thopter\', \'flavor\': \'Die Kor schicken ihre Thopter vor, um zu schauen, ob das Land gerade gute Laune hat.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596295&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6b87d49d-7fb6-4054-831b-801de7a20ef6\', \'multiverseId\': 596295}, \'multiverseid\': 596295}, {\'name\': \'Ojo del peregrino\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nCuando el Ojo del peregrino entre al campo de batalla, puedes buscar en tu biblioteca una carta de tierra básica, mostrarla, ponerla en tu mano y luego barajar.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Tóptero\', \'flavor\': \'Los kor envían a sus tópteros cometa para ver si la tierra está de humor para una visita.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596382&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6725c4f0-f122-4a83-a6ec-c8e0833db166\', \'multiverseId\': 596382}, \'multiverseid\': 596382}, {\'name\': \'Œil du pèlerin\', \'text\': "Vol\\nQuand l\'Œil du pèlerin arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez chercher dans votre bibliothèque une carte de terrain de base, la révéler, la mettre dans votre main, puis mélanger.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : mécanoptère\', \'flavor\': "Les kor envoient leurs voiles mécanoptères en éclaireur pour déterminer si la terre est d\'humeur accueillante.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596469&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e051c534-7b37-4ac0-a07e-282ff9e72a97\', \'multiverseId\': 596469}, \'multiverseid\': 596469}, {\'name\': \'Occhio del Pellegrino\', \'text\': "Volare\\nQuando l\'Occhio del Pellegrino entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi passare in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta terra base, rivelarla e aggiungerla alla tua mano, poi rimescolare.", \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Tottero\', \'flavor\': \'I kor spediscono sempre i loro alianti totteri per verificare se la terra è di buonumore o meno.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596556&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2256207f-6155-4875-86ae-f6be2585ff7e\', \'multiverseId\': 596556}, \'multiverseid\': 596556}, {\'name\': \'巡礼者の目\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n巡礼者の目が戦場に出たとき、あなたは「あなたのライブラリーから基本土地・カード１枚を探し、公開し、あなたの手札に加える。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。」を選んでもよい。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 飛行機械\', \'flavor\': \'コーは飛行凧を送り込んで、地が歓迎しているかどうかを見る。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596643&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b43ec438-3a8b-4d9d-8aa8-c585d4103f4a\', \'multiverseId\': 596643}, \'multiverseid\': 596643}, {\'name\': \'朝圣客之眼\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n当朝圣客之眼进战场时，你可以从你牌库中搜寻一张基本地牌，展示该牌，将它置于你手上，然后洗牌。\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～振翼机\', \'flavor\': \'寇族派出振翼机升空，打量这块大地是否有意愿接纳他们。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596904&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'86a04a07-30c5-4e40-ba04-6acce29cd0bc\', \'multiverseId\': 596904}, \'multiverseid\': 596904}]', '[{\'name\': \'Augenblick des Triumphs\', \'text\': \'Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält +2/+2 bis zum Ende des Zuges. Du erhältst 2 Lebenspunkte dazu.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Der Augenblick der Erlösung ist zum Greifen nahe. Die Welt wird in Zwielicht getaucht und die Legion wird in Unsterblichkeit wiedergeboren!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591624&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6b741af0-e016-4421-a585-9486bab94700\', \'multiverseId\': 591624}, \'multiverseid\': 591624}, {\'name\': \'Momento de triunfo\', \'text\': \'La criatura objetivo obtiene +2/+2 hasta el final del turno. Ganas 2 vidas.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Llegó el momento de la salvación. ¡El Crepúsculo se extiende por el mundo y la Legión se alzará inmortal!".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591753&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aa25f7f3-973e-4dd8-bb50-2c8c24409e9b\', \'multiverseId\': 591753}, \'multiverseid\': 591753}, {\'name\': \'Consécration\', \'text\': "Une créature ciblée gagne +2/+2 jusqu\'à la fin du tour. Vous gagnez 2 points de vie.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« L\'heure du salut est proche. Le crépuscule s\'étend sur le monde, et la Légion va s\'éveiller, immortelle ! »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591882&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4e518355-95ec-413b-a178-7fdff098a6ea\', \'multiverseId\': 591882}, \'multiverseid\': 591882}, {\'name\': \'Momento di Trionfo\', \'text\': \'Una creatura bersaglio prende +2/+2 fino alla fine del turno. Guadagni 2 punti vita.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Il tempo della salvezza è prossimo. Il Vespro pervaderà il mondo e la Legione trionferà immortale!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592011&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'495e76e6-3563-4fe8-b599-e00659463f1d\', \'multiverseId\': 592011}, \'multiverseid\': 592011}, {\'name\': \'制覇の時\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは＋２/＋２の修整を受ける。あなたは２点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「救済の時は目前。薄暮が世界を浄化し、軍団は不滅となる！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592140&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fad7e25a-4462-4043-bf2d-e41cce3665bb\', \'multiverseId\': 592140}, \'multiverseid\': 592140}, {\'name\': \'得胜之时\', \'text\': \'目标生物得+2/+2直到回合结束。你获得2点生命。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「救赎之时就在眼前。暮影盖世，军团永存！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592527&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4794306a-bdaf-4ae7-890f-0944b7399ee3\', \'multiverseId\': 592527}, \'multiverseid\': 592527}]', '[{\'name\': \'Auraschöpfer\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Auraschöpfer ins Spiel kommt, kannst du eine Verzauberungskarte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurückbringen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': \'„In unseren Erinnerungen finden wir die besten Stärkereserven."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591559&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9d04be05-644e-42d3-8b2e-8e4f3bc3d7aa\', \'multiverseId\': 591559}, \'multiverseid\': 591559}, {\'name\': \'Auramante\', \'text\': \'Cuando la Auramante entre al campo de batalla, puedes regresar la carta de encantamiento objetivo de tu cementerio a tu mano.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero humano\', \'flavor\': \'"En los recuerdos podemos encontrar las mejores reservas de fuerza".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591688&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'686a6620-d7f0-4be8-923a-732ef8dd0c85\', \'multiverseId\': 591688}, \'multiverseid\': 591688}, {\'name\': \'Auramancienne\', \'text\': "Quand l\'Auramancienne arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez renvoyer une carte d\'enchantement ciblée depuis votre cimetière dans votre main.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et sorcier\', \'flavor\': "« C\'est dans les souvenirs que nous trouvons nos réserves de force les plus profondes. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591817&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'09031c02-8706-4e15-8b76-859216cbffb7\', \'multiverseId\': 591817}, \'multiverseid\': 591817}, {\'name\': \'Animago\', \'text\': "Quando l\'Animago entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi riprendere in mano una carta incantesimo bersaglio dal tuo cimitero.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Mago Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Nei ricordi, possiamo trovare le nostre più profonde riserve di forze."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591946&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d3bf2824-85c4-4668-921a-490a74e78a81\', \'multiverseId\': 591946}, \'multiverseid\': 591946}, {\'name\': \'オーラ術師\', \'text\': \'オーラ術師が戦場に出たとき、あなたの墓地にあるエンチャント・カード１枚を対象とする。あなたはそれをあなたの手札に戻してもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': \'「最も深くに蓄えられている力は、記憶の中にあります。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592075&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2e08b991-cba7-4c00-9d3c-2d4cd0cf9f1d\', \'multiverseId\': 592075}, \'multiverseid\': 592075}, {\'name\': \'灵气法师\', \'text\': \'当灵气法师进战场时，你可以将目标结界牌从你的坟墓场移回你手上。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／法术师\', \'flavor\': \'「在记忆中，我们能找到自己珍藏的力量。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592462&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0b80ea42-c84a-4c48-9b45-13f8017ec732\', \'multiverseId\': 592462}, \'multiverseid\': 592462}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ausbilder der Kavallerie\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Ausbilder der Kavallerie ins Spiel kommt, erhält eine Kreatur deiner Wahl +2/+0 und Erstschlag bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Ritter\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591571&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7bfcf2e6-96fc-4a29-b424-c310858fe818\', \'multiverseId\': 591571}, \'multiverseid\': 591571}, {\'name\': \'Instructor de caballería\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Instructor de caballería entre al campo de batalla, la criatura objetivo obtiene +2/+0 y gana la habilidad de dañar primero hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Caballero humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591700&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7151c1c8-d1ff-47c9-b5e9-b2b5b691e521\', \'multiverseId\': 591700}, \'multiverseid\': 591700}, {\'name\': \'Maître-recruteur de cavalerie\', \'text\': "Quand le Maître-recruteur de cavalerie arrive sur le champ de bataille, une créature ciblée gagne +2/+0 et acquiert l\'initiative jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et chevalier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591829&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'94b78bd6-c7e0-46c0-9a7e-7433fc8e3a27\', \'multiverseId\': 591829}, \'multiverseid\': 591829}, {\'name\': \'Addestratore della Cavalleria\', \'text\': "Quando l\'Addestratore della Cavalleria entra nel campo di battaglia, una creatura bersaglio prende +2/+0 e ha attacco improvviso fino alla fine del turno.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Cavaliere Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591958&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2d491a69-0deb-4512-ba2d-6843b664fed8\', \'multiverseId\': 591958}, \'multiverseid\': 591958}, {\'name\': \'騎兵隊の教練官\', \'text\': \'騎兵隊の教練官が戦場に出たとき、クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは＋２/＋０の修整を受け先制攻撃を得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・騎士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592087&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'43c021fe-596c-4260-b987-66999b54b2f8\', \'multiverseId\': 592087}, \'multiverseid\': 592087}, {\'name\': \'骑兵教官\', \'text\': \'当骑兵教官进战场时，直到回合结束，目标生物得+2/+0且获得先攻异能。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／骑士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592474&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a51463fc-5b6e-4e00-af7a-d28ac011ca75\', \'multiverseId\': 592474}, \'multiverseid\': 592474}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ausfleischen\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre eine Kreatur deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Fürchte dich ruhig vor der Dunkelheit, aber glaube auch nicht, dass du bei Tageslicht sicher bist."\\n—Josu Vess\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594069&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'19cd84e3-9b85-4835-8e6b-ca2d38a716df\', \'multiverseId\': 594069}, \'multiverseid\': 594069}, {\'name\': \'Eviscerar\', \'text\': \'Destruye la criatura objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Teme a la oscuridad, si quieres, pero no confundas la luz del sol con la seguridad".\\n—Josu Vess\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594186&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4538a55f-7bd7-4626-8d73-49ae7d516459\', \'multiverseId\': 594186}, \'multiverseid\': 594186}, {\'name\': \'Étriper\', \'text\': \'Détruisez une créature ciblée.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'« Craignez les ténèbres si vous voulez, mais ne confondez pas lumière du soleil et sécurité. »\\n—Josu Vess\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594303&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ea46a131-1f3a-4e4d-a67e-f9e696d7e575\', \'multiverseId\': 594303}, \'multiverseid\': 594303}, {\'name\': \'Eviscerare\', \'text\': \'Distruggi una creatura bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Temi l\\\'oscurità, se devi, ma non credere di essere al sicuro alla luce del sole."\\n—Josu Vess\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594420&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'694526c7-0f3a-4cd3-bbe9-b01a12893105\', \'multiverseId\': 594420}, \'multiverseid\': 594420}, {\'name\': \'臓腑抜き\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「暗闇を恐れるのはいいが、陽光を安全と勘違いしない方がいい。」\\n――ジョス・ヴェス\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594537&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aeb94c07-ddf9-4f28-8037-2223101e7207\', \'multiverseId\': 594537}, \'multiverseid\': 594537}, {\'name\': \'摘胆剜心\', \'text\': \'消灭目标生物。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「你可以畏惧黑暗，这并不代表光天化日之下必定安全。」\\n～霍苏维斯\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594888&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'64d8ac21-1d92-4c1a-8bc7-b440be4545a7\', \'multiverseId\': 594888}, \'multiverseid\': 594888}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ausgehungerter Riese\', \'text\': \'Zu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments fügt dir der Ausgehungerte Riese 1 Schadenspunkt zu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Riese\', \'flavor\': \'Die Macht einer Armee und die Zurückhaltung eines Kindes.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590293&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0752ccf8-3605-48fc-9ff9-14ee90cbca3c\', \'multiverseId\': 590293}, \'multiverseid\': 590293}, {\'name\': \'Gigante voraz\', \'text\': \'Al comienzo de tu mantenimiento, el Gigante voraz te hace 1 punto de daño.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Gigante\', \'flavor\': \'La fuerza de un ejército con la contención de un niño pequeño.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590428&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'697c32b7-2467-4db5-942e-1096569354f8\', \'multiverseId\': 590428}, \'multiverseid\': 590428}, {\'name\': \'Géant vorace\', \'text\': \'Au début de votre entretien, le Géant vorace vous inflige 1 blessure.\', \'type\': \'Créature : géant\', \'flavor\': "La puissance d\'une armée et la retenue d\'un enfant.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590563&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d6de06b3-492d-4313-81ed-ec361c9815c4\', \'multiverseId\': 590563}, \'multiverseid\': 590563}, {\'name\': \'Gigante Famelico\', \'text\': "All\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, il Gigante Famelico ti infligge 1 danno.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Gigante\', \'flavor\': \'La potenza di un esercito e il contegno di un bambino.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590698&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7e762519-80db-497e-9128-4ec717ef7b68\', \'multiverseId\': 590698}, \'multiverseid\': 590698}, {\'name\': \'貪欲な巨人\', \'text\': \'あなたのアップキープの開始時に、貪欲な巨人はあなたに１点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 巨人\', \'flavor\': \'戦力は軍隊一つぶん、自制心は子どもなみ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590833&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e0e3efb8-e33f-4b03-9bf8-6d90e2f60f0a\', \'multiverseId\': 590833}, \'multiverseid\': 590833}, {\'name\': \'贪食巨人\', \'text\': \'在你的维持开始时，贪食巨人对你造成1点伤害。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～巨人\', \'flavor\': \'军队的力量，孩童的脾气。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591238&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0c970be0-abcd-4ce5-ab6a-e0c379eb2f59\', \'multiverseId\': 591238}, \'multiverseid\': 591238}]', '[{\'name\': \'Axgard-Kavalleristin\', \'text\': \'{T}: Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält Eile bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Zwerg, Berserker\', \'flavor\': \'Die Ziege reiten\\n—Redensart der Zwerge; steht für\\n„eine törichte Heldentat"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590202&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'20208cf2-085b-4e12-a6a0-dd970965f9db\', \'multiverseId\': 590202}, \'multiverseid\': 590202}, {\'name\': \'Cabrallería de Axgard\', \'text\': \'{T}: La criatura objetivo gana la habilidad de prisa hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Berserker enano\', \'flavor\': \'Estar cabralgando.\\n—Expresión de los enanos que significa\\n"realizar un acto temerario de valentía"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590337&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1a884686-5d91-47e1-b9a8-b194d20f10ce\', \'multiverseId\': 590337}, \'multiverseid\': 590337}, {\'name\': \'Cavalerie axgardienne\', \'text\': "{T} : Une créature ciblée acquiert la célérité jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : nain et berserker\', \'flavor\': \'Monter à dos de chèvre\\n—Dicton nain signifiant\\n« un acte de bravoure inconscient »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590472&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3ff37968-fabe-45b9-a512-9447dcf759af\', \'multiverseId\': 590472}, \'multiverseid\': 590472}, {\'name\': \'Cavalleria di Axgard\', \'text\': \'{T}: Una creatura bersaglio ha rapidità fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Berserker Nano\', \'flavor\': \'Cavalcare la capra\\n—Espressione dei nani che significa:\\n"un atto di avventata temerarietà"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590607&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'87d18dd7-7ad5-4361-81dc-798ae2647a82\', \'multiverseId\': 590607}, \'multiverseid\': 590607}, {\'name\': \'アクスガルドの騎兵\', \'text\': \'{T}：クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは速攻を得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ドワーフ・狂戦士\', \'flavor\': \'羊に乗る\\n――ドワーフの言い回しで\\n「勇気はあるが無謀なことをする」の意\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590742&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b7816fcd-7fd0-499b-8c4e-70f532be1400\', \'multiverseId\': 590742}, \'multiverseid\': 590742}, {\'name\': \'艾席嘉骑兵\', \'text\': \'{T}：目标生物获得敏捷异能直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～矮人／狂战士\', \'flavor\': \'骑羊当马\\n～矮人用语，意指\\n「愚勇之举」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591147&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'94e586c4-595b-4be2-9fd4-35f7c66afd17\', \'multiverseId\': 591147}, \'multiverseid\': 591147}]', '[{\'name\': \'Balan, wandernde Ritterin\', \'text\': \'Erstschlag\\nBalan, wandernde Ritterin, hat Doppelschlag, solange mindestens zwei Ausrüstungen an sie angelegt sind.\\n{1}{W}: Lege alle Ausrüstungen, die du kontrollierst, an Balan an.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Katze, Ritter\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich bin großzügig. Ich überlasse dir die Wahl der Klinge, die dich tötet."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597082&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d324ca3e-ed82-4220-b6bf-22779b489ae2\', \'multiverseId\': 597082}, \'multiverseid\': 597082}, {\'name\': \'Balan, caballero nómada\', \'text\': \'Daña primero.\\nBalan, caballero nómada tiene la habilidad de dañar dos veces mientras haya dos o más Equipos anexados a ella.\\n{1}{W}: Anexa todos los Equipos que controlas a Balan.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Caballero felino\', \'flavor\': \'"Hoy me siento generosa, así que te dejaré elegir con qué espada quieres que te mate".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597128&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b259f663-d6f9-43c3-820b-1913e5e9d489\', \'multiverseId\': 597128}, \'multiverseid\': 597128}, {\'name\': \'Balan, chevalière errante\', \'text\': "Initiative\\nBalan, chevalière errante a la double initiative tant qu\'au moins deux équipements lui sont attachés.\\n{1}{W} : Attachez tous les équipements que vous contrôlez à Balan.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : chat et chevalier\', \'flavor\': "« Je me sens d\'humeur généreuse. Je vais vous laisser choisir la lame qui vous pourfendra. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597174&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7deb23ad-0fa1-4510-be5c-2e1bad39ca28\', \'multiverseId\': 597174}, \'multiverseid\': 597174}, {\'name\': \'Balan, Cavaliera Girovaga\', \'text\': \'Attacco improvviso\\nBalan, Cavaliera Girovaga ha doppio attacco fintanto che due o più Equipaggiamenti sono assegnati ad essa.\\n{1}{W}: Assegna tutti gli Equipaggiamenti che controlli a Balan.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Cavaliere Felino\', \'flavor\': \'"Mi sento magnanima. Lascerò che sia tu a scegliere la lama che ti trafiggerà."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597220&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dce1d574-8799-4268-93d9-2ebff3418ac7\', \'multiverseId\': 597220}, \'multiverseid\': 597220}, {\'name\': \'放浪の騎士、バーラン\', \'text\': \'先制攻撃\\n放浪の騎士、バーランに２つ以上の装備品がついているかぎり、これは二段攻撃を持つ。\\n{1}{W}：あなたがコントロールしているすべての装備品を放浪の騎士、バーランにつける。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 猫・騎士\', \'flavor\': \'「今日は気分がいいの。あなたに切り倒す刃を決めさせてあげる。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597266&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9429a794-6510-423c-b6f6-bcf341ac8065\', \'multiverseId\': 597266}, \'multiverseid\': 597266}, {\'name\': \'漂浪骑士芭澜\', \'text\': \'先攻\\n只要漂浪骑士芭澜上贴附有两个或更多武具，它便具有连击异能。\\n{1}{W}：将所有由你操控的武具贴附在芭澜上。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～猫／骑士\', \'flavor\': \'「今天我就大方一点。你来挑要死在哪柄剑下吧。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597404&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'247a7876-c2ca-4a16-a3d2-057d6cd6ae38\', \'multiverseId\': 597404}, \'multiverseid\': 597404}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bannfeuer\', \'text\': \'Das Bannfeuer fügt einem Ziel deiner Wahl X Schadenspunkte zu.\\nFalls X gleich 5 ist, kann dieser Zauberspruch nicht neutralisiert werden und der Schaden kann nicht verhindert werden.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Für Sarkhan Vol ist ein Drache der reinste Ausdruck der Herrlichkeit des wilden Lebens.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590203&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'56c966c1-ad5c-40d3-9ab8-89805c5ef3c0\', \'multiverseId\': 590203}, \'multiverseid\': 590203}, {\'name\': \'Fuego devastador\', \'text\': \'El Fuego devastador hace X puntos de daño a cualquier objetivo.\\nSi X es 5 o más, este hechizo no puede ser contrarrestado y el daño no puede ser prevenido.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Para Sarkhan Vol, el dragón es la expresión más pura del esplendor de la vida salvaje.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590338&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e17e4fca-5004-4ddb-af98-034e3a59cbde\', \'multiverseId\': 590338}, \'multiverseid\': 590338}, {\'name\': \'Pestefeu\', \'text\': "Le Pestefeu inflige X blessures à n\'importe quelle cible.\\nSi X est supérieur ou égal à 5, ce sort ne peut pas être contrecarré et les blessures ne peuvent pas être prévenues.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Pour Sarkhan Vol, le dragon est l\'expression la plus pure de la splendeur sauvage de la vie.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590473&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0ffad483-7360-4158-aba2-89983fab426e\', \'multiverseId\': 590473}, \'multiverseid\': 590473}, {\'name\': \'Fuoco di Sventura\', \'text\': \'Il Fuoco di Sventura infligge X danni a un qualsiasi bersaglio.\\nSe X è pari o superiore a 5, questa magia non può essere neutralizzata e il danno non può essere prevenuto.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'Per Sarkhan Vol, il drago è la manifestazione più pura dello splendore selvaggio insito in ogni essenza vitale.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590608&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'51680d85-cc8a-427d-96c3-70fb70f456b1\', \'multiverseId\': 590608}, \'multiverseid\': 590608}, {\'name\': \'苦悩火\', \'text\': \'クリーチャーやプレインズウォーカーやプレイヤーのうち１つを対象とする。苦悩火はそれにＸ点のダメージを与える。\\nＸが５以上であるなら、この呪文は打ち消されず、これのダメージは軽減できない。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'サルカン・ヴォルにとっては、ドラゴンは生命の野蛮な輝きの純然たる発現だ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590743&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bf70e7c5-4257-4306-9adb-03753ef45d23\', \'multiverseId\': 590743}, \'multiverseid\': 590743}, {\'name\': \'禁咒焰\', \'text\': \'禁咒焰对任意一个目标造成X点伤害。\\n如果X等于或大于5，则此咒语不能被反击，且其伤害不能被防止。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'对萨坎沃来说，巨龙是蛮勇生命的极致具现。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591148&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3903da84-77f4-4f57-ab81-ee9db51852de\', \'multiverseId\': 591148}, \'multiverseid\': 591148}]', '[{\'name\': \'Barrin, tolarianischer Erzmagier\', \'text\': \'Wenn Barrin, tolarianischer Erzmagier, ins Spiel kommt, bringe bis zu eine andere Kreatur oder einen anderen Planeswalker deiner Wahl auf die Hand ihres bzw. seines Besitzers zurück.\\nZu Beginn deines Endsegments und falls in diesem Zug eine bleibende Karte aus dem Spiel auf deine Hand gebracht wurde, ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': \'„Es gibt kein Alter, in dem man aufhört zu lernen."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595202&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ee4146e3-9dd0-4697-96f4-f16e8ea823f6\', \'multiverseId\': 595202}, \'multiverseid\': 595202}, {\'name\': \'Barrin, archimago tolariano\', \'text\': \'Cuando Barrin, archimago tolariano entre al campo de batalla, regresa hasta una otra criatura o planeswalker objetivo a la mano de su propietario.\\nAl comienzo de tu paso final, si un permanente se puso en tu mano desde el campo de batalla este turno, roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Hechicero humano\', \'flavor\': \'"No hay una edad a la cual dejas de aprender".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595310&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1141411d-9878-49d7-a3b8-6e9ec24a8764\', \'multiverseId\': 595310}, \'multiverseid\': 595310}, {\'name\': \'Barrin, archimage tolarian\', \'text\': "Quand Barrin, archimage tolarian arrive sur le champ de bataille, renvoyez jusqu\'à une autre cible, créature ou planeswalker, dans la main de son propriétaire.\\nAu début de votre étape de fin, si un permanent a été mis dans votre main depuis le champ de bataille ce tour-ci, piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et sorcier\', \'flavor\': "« Il n\'y a pas d\'âge pour apprendre. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595418&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'42f78d17-def0-49c8-a07d-282954f4acc7\', \'multiverseId\': 595418}, \'multiverseid\': 595418}, {\'name\': \'Barrin, Arcimago di Tolaria\', \'text\': "Quando Barrin, Arcimago di Tolaria entra nel campo di battaglia, fai tornare fino a un\'altra creatura o planeswalker bersaglio in mano al suo proprietario.\\nAll\'inizio della tua sottofase finale, se hai ripreso in mano un permanente dal campo di battaglia in questo turno, pesca una carta.", \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Mago Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Non esiste un\\\'età a cui si smette di imparare."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595526&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dc6af897-513a-48fe-a97d-2d5b2204b2cd\', \'multiverseId\': 595526}, \'multiverseid\': 595526}, {\'name\': \'トレイリアの大魔導師、バリン\', \'text\': \'トレイリアの大魔導師、バリンが戦場に出たとき、クリーチャーやプレインズウォーカーのうちこれでない最大１体を対象とする。それをオーナーの手札に戻す。\\nあなたの終了ステップの開始時に、このターンにパーマネントが戦場からあなたの手札に加えられていた場合、カード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': \'「学びを止める年齢など存在しない。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595634&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'53619eaf-183a-4b51-86e8-603713fe3b2c\', \'multiverseId\': 595634}, \'multiverseid\': 595634}, {\'name\': \'陶拉里亚大法师巴林\', \'text\': \'当陶拉里亚大法师巴林进战场时，将至多另一个目标生物或鹏洛客移回其拥有者手上。\\n在你的结束步骤开始时，若本回合中有永久物从战场置于你手上，则抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～人类／法术师\', \'flavor\': \'「没有老到学不动的时候。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595958&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b1837f20-05c9-4070-92d0-34bf68ff70f5\', \'multiverseId\': 595958}, \'multiverseid\': 595958}]', '[{\'name\': \'Basris Anhängerin\', \'text\': \'Lebensverknüpfung\\nWenn Basris Anhängerin ins Spiel kommt, lege je eine +1/+1-Marke auf bis zu zwei andere Kreaturen deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Katze, Kleriker\', \'flavor\': \'Basri führt das Vermächtnis seiner Göttin fort und verbreitet ihre Lehren im gesamten Multiversum.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591560&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5338ba16-0928-47dc-ac59-a816531dbe31\', \'multiverseId\': 591560}, \'multiverseid\': 591560}, {\'name\': \'Acólita de Basri\', \'text\': \'Vínculo vital.\\nCuando la Acólita de Basri entre al campo de batalla, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre cada una de hasta otras dos criaturas objetivo que controlas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Clérigo felino\', \'flavor\': \'Basri prosigue el legado de su diosa y difunde sus enseñanzas por todo el Multiverso.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591689&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'975bc5c6-b569-4334-9463-dd8411382f11\', \'multiverseId\': 591689}, \'multiverseid\': 591689}, {\'name\': \'Acolyte de Basri\', \'text\': "Lien de vie\\nQuand l\'Acolyte de Basri arrive sur le champ de bataille, ciblez jusqu\'à deux autres créatures que vous contrôlez. Mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur chacune d\'elles.", \'type\': \'Créature : chat et clerc\', \'flavor\': "Basri poursuit l\'œuvre de sa déesse et transmet ses enseignements d\'un bout à l\'autre du Multivers.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591818&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a6329a67-4df1-46b8-a677-399b79dfcdec\', \'multiverseId\': 591818}, \'multiverseid\': 591818}, {\'name\': \'Accolita di Basri\', \'text\': "Legame vitale\\nQuando l\'Accolita di Basri entra nel campo di battaglia, scegli fino a due altre creature bersaglio che controlli e metti un segnalino +1/+1 su ciascuna.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Chierico Felino\', \'flavor\': \'Basri diffonde la parola della sua dea, tramandandone gli insegnamenti in ogni angolo del Multiverso.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591947&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'84a1653b-015f-4c8a-b2e4-52d3ca557dbc\', \'multiverseId\': 591947}, \'multiverseid\': 591947}, {\'name\': \'バスリの侍祭\', \'text\': \'絆魂\\nバスリの侍祭が戦場に出たとき、あなたがコントロールしていてこれでないクリーチャー最大２体を対象とする。それらの上にそれぞれ＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 猫・クレリック\', \'flavor\': \'バスリは神の遺産を継承しており、多元宇宙に教えを広めている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592076&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9da09c85-1a6f-42cc-90f8-7becbc1f2a73\', \'multiverseId\': 592076}, \'multiverseid\': 592076}, {\'name\': \'巴席利的侍僧\', \'text\': \'系命\\n当巴席利的侍僧进战场时，在至多两个其他目标由你操控的生物上各放置一个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～猫／僧侣\', \'flavor\': \'巴席利继承他的神明遗志，继续在多重宇宙中传扬其教诲。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592463&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f2a4812f-787d-4140-a74c-80c91bd054b0\', \'multiverseId\': 592463}, \'multiverseid\': 592463}]', '[{\'name\': \'Baum der Verdammnis\', \'text\': \'Verteidiger\\n{T}: Tausche den Lebenspunktestand eines Gegners deiner Wahl mit der Widerstandskraft des Baums der Verdammnis.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Pflanze\', \'flavor\': \'„Bäume sind zu verehren und zu schützen … außer diesem einen."\\n—Marel, Morgenlicht-Hexe\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597104&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'55e9f8d6-d5bf-46d4-bb51-06dd9d484ebd\', \'multiverseId\': 597104}, \'multiverseid\': 597104}, {\'name\': \'Árbol de la perdición\', \'text\': \'Defensor.\\n{T}: Intercambia el total de vidas del oponente objetivo con la resistencia del Árbol de la perdición.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Planta\', \'flavor\': \'"Los árboles se veneran y se protegen... Todos menos ese".\\n—Marel, bruja de Ciervas del Alba\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597150&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8a44d699-c8c1-42af-ac73-324764c4f978\', \'multiverseId\': 597150}, \'multiverseid\': 597150}, {\'name\': \'Arbre de la perdition\', \'text\': "Défenseur\\n{T} : Échangez le total de points de vie d\'un adversaire ciblé contre l\'endurance de l\'Arbre de la perdition.", \'type\': \'Créature : plante\', \'flavor\': \'« Les arbres doivent être vénérés et protégés... sauf celui-là. »\\n—Marel, envoûteuse de Cerf-orient\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597196&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2561558c-8f74-4fec-bfa8-ccf600fd8e23\', \'multiverseId\': 597196}, \'multiverseid\': 597196}, {\'name\': \'Albero della Perdizione\', \'text\': "Difensore\\n{T}: Scambia i punti vita di un avversario bersaglio con la costituzione dell\'Albero della Perdizione.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Pianta\', \'flavor\': \'"Gli alberi vanno venerati e protetti... tranne quello lì."\\n—Marel, strega Albacorno\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597242&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'094a253e-b1d6-476f-82d3-6ab3614bf93c\', \'multiverseId\': 597242}, \'multiverseid\': 597242}, {\'name\': \'地獄の樹\', \'text\': \'防衛\\n{T}：対戦相手１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーのライフ総量と地獄の樹のタフネスを交換する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 植物\', \'flavor\': \'「樹は尊敬し、守らなければならないわ……この樹以外は、ね。」\\n――ドーンハルトの魔女、マレル\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597288&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b0bd8428-5224-4d5e-9afd-1a69f0d4c5a8\', \'multiverseId\': 597288}, \'multiverseid\': 597288}, {\'name\': \'浩劫之树\', \'text\': \'守军\\n{T}：将目标对手的总生命与浩劫之树的防御力交换。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～植物\', \'flavor\': \'「树木应受敬仰和保护…那一棵除外。」\\n～曙鹿集女巫玛芮尔\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597426&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'16d82a01-5f22-4727-9764-f194a640685e\', \'multiverseId\': 597426}, \'multiverseid\': 597426}]', '[{\'name\': \'Baumwipfeldorf\', \'text\': \'Das Baumwipfeldorf kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {G}.\\n{1}{G}: Das Baumwipfeldorf wird bis zum Ende des Zuges zu einer 3/3 grünen Menschenaffe-Kreatur, die Trampelschaden verursacht. Es ist immer noch ein Land.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596331&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5253bc81-7908-4371-b729-011eabf74044\', \'multiverseId\': 596331}, \'multiverseid\': 596331}, {\'name\': \'Aldea en las copas\', \'text\': \'La Aldea en las copas entra al campo de batalla girada.\\n{T}: Agrega {G}.\\n{1}{G}: La Aldea en las copas se convierte en una criatura Simio verde 3/3 con la habilidad de arrollar hasta el final del turno. Sigue siendo una tierra.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596418&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cbd6b847-7c07-463f-b150-74db88db9ff0\', \'multiverseId\': 596418}, \'multiverseid\': 596418}, {\'name\': \'Village arboricole\', \'text\': "Le Village arboricole arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {G}.\\n{1}{G} : Le Village arboricole devient une créature 3/3 verte Grand singe avec le piétinement jusqu\'à la fin du tour. C\'est toujours un terrain.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596505&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1fcf8241-e1d2-49da-bb4d-e91f3dd9bce3\', \'multiverseId\': 596505}, \'multiverseid\': 596505}, {\'name\': \'Villaggio Arboricolo\', \'text\': \'Il Villaggio Arboricolo entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {G}.\\n{1}{G}: ll Villaggio Arboricolo diventa una creatura Scimpanzé 3/3 verde con travolgere fino alla fine del turno. È ancora una terra.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596592&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c1040a3f-51c2-4949-94b6-e26b682776b6\', \'multiverseId\': 596592}, \'multiverseid\': 596592}, {\'name\': \'樹上の村\', \'text\': \'樹上の村はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{G}を加える。\\n{1}{G}：ターン終了時まで、樹上の村はトランプルを持つ緑の３/３の類人猿・クリーチャーになる。これは土地でもある。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596679&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e326f9be-1999-4798-bd4b-f75b89ddd732\', \'multiverseId\': 596679}, \'multiverseid\': 596679}, {\'name\': \'树顶村落\', \'text\': \'树顶村落须横置进战场。\\n{T}：加{G}。\\n{1}{G}：直到回合结束，树顶村落成为3/3绿色，具践踏异能的猿猴生物。它仍然是地。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596940&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'facc37a3-8c92-4f01-b52e-0b328af54215\', \'multiverseId\': 596940}, \'multiverseid\': 596940}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bauwerk der Autorität\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl kann in diesem Zug nicht angreifen. Lege eine Ziegelmarke auf das Bauwerk der Autorität.\\n{1}, {T}: Bis zu deinem nächsten Zug kann eine Kreatur deiner Wahl nicht angreifen oder blocken und ihre aktivierten Fähigkeiten können nicht aktiviert werden. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit nur, falls sich drei oder mehr Ziegelmarken auf dem Bauwerk der Autorität befinden.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596268&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9ccd25d4-0074-4ccb-a648-f29058fc062a\', \'multiverseId\': 596268}, \'multiverseid\': 596268}, {\'name\': \'Edificio de autoridad\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: La criatura objetivo no puede atacar este turno. Pon un contador de bloque sobre el Edificio de autoridad.\\n{1}, {T}: Hasta tu próximo turno, la criatura objetivo no puede atacar ni bloquear y sus habilidades activadas no pueden activarse. Activa esto solo si hay tres o más contadores de bloque sobre el Edificio de autoridad.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596355&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'46a3eef9-9d5f-4d44-bbd3-50fdc2074fac\', \'multiverseId\': 596355}, \'multiverseid\': 596355}, {\'name\': "Édifice d\'autorité", \'text\': "{1}, {T} : Une créature ciblée ne peut pas attaquer ce tour-ci. Mettez un marqueur « brique » sur l\'Édifice d\'autorité.\\n{1}, {T} : Jusqu\'à votre prochain tour, une créature ciblée ne peut ni attaquer ni bloquer et ses capacités activées ne peuvent pas être activées. N\'activez que s\'il y a au moins trois marqueurs « brique » sur l\'Édifice d\'autorité.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596442&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'915b55cc-56e8-4575-b87c-8bb4d9bb8897\', \'multiverseId\': 596442}, \'multiverseid\': 596442}, {\'name\': "Edificio dell\'Autorità", \'text\': "{1}, {T}: Una creatura bersaglio non può attaccare in questo turno. Metti un segnalino mattone sull\'Edificio dell\'Autorità.\\n{1}, {T}: Fino al tuo prossimo turno, una creatura bersaglio non può attaccare o bloccare e le sue abilità attivate non possono essere attivate. Attiva solo se ci sono tre o più segnalini mattone sull\'Edificio dell\'Autorità.", \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596529&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3c6dd56e-fe50-4fab-9cc3-f000cd5cbccc\', \'multiverseId\': 596529}, \'multiverseid\': 596529}, {\'name\': \'権威の殿堂\', \'text\': \'{1},{T}：クリーチャー１体を対象とする。このターン、それでは攻撃できない。権威の殿堂の上に石材カウンター１個を置く。\\n{1},{T}：クリーチャー１体を対象とする。次のあなたのターンまで、それでは攻撃もブロックもできず、それの起動型能力は起動できない。権威の殿堂の上に３個以上の石材カウンターがなければ起動できない。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596616&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8211bb6f-9d52-4f1c-80fc-2bf89b8f7828\', \'multiverseId\': 596616}, \'multiverseid\': 596616}, {\'name\': \'威权高塔\', \'text\': \'{1}，{T}：目标生物本回合不能攻击。在威权高塔上放置一个石砖指示物。\\n{1}，{T}：直到你的下一个回合，目标生物不能进行攻击或阻挡，其起动式异能也不能起动。只能于威权高塔上有三个或更多石砖指示物时起动。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596877&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cd4e6ad1-13f8-4a8e-94ac-83978bfc7130\', \'multiverseId\': 596877}, \'multiverseid\': 596877}]', '[{\'name\': \'Begleitete Heilerin\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du zum ersten Mal in einem Zug Lebenspunkte dazuerhältst, erzeuge einen 1/1 weißen Katze-Kreaturenspielstein.\\n{2}{W}: Ein anderer Kleriker deiner Wahl erhält Lebensverknüpfung bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Kor, Kleriker\', \'flavor\': \'„Meine Katzen haben mich mehr über das Heilige gelehrt als alles andere in irgendeiner alten Ruine."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591558&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'74185f8a-b96a-4af7-ae67-06b69dfa3e7b\', \'multiverseId\': 591558}, \'multiverseid\': 591558}, {\'name\': \'Sanadora acompañada\', \'text\': \'Siempre que ganes vidas por primera vez cada turno, crea una ficha de criatura Felino blanca 1/1.\\n{2}{W}: Otro Clérigo objetivo gana la habilidad de vínculo vital hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Clérigo kor\', \'flavor\': \'"Mis gatos me enseñaron más sobre lo sagrado que cualquier cosa en ruinas remotas".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591687&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'52fcae90-cb5f-4682-bddb-de0cff7f1b99\', \'multiverseId\': 591687}, \'multiverseid\': 591687}, {\'name\': \'Guérisseuse accompagnée\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que vous gagnez des points de vie pour la première fois à chaque tour, créez un jeton de créature 1/1 blanche Chat.\\n{2}{W} : Un autre clerc ciblé acquiert le lien de vie jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : kor et clerc\', \'flavor\': "« Mes chats m\'ont appris davantage sur le sacré que ce qu\'on peut trouver dans une vieille ruine. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591816&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4ee077a3-7919-4220-b412-38ed1a0c9d66\', \'multiverseId\': 591816}, \'multiverseid\': 591816}, {\'name\': \'Guaritrice Accompagnata\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta guadagni punti vita per la prima volta in ogni turno, crea una pedina creatura Felino 1/1 bianca.\\n{2}{W}: Un altro Chierico bersaglio ha legame vitale fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Chierico Kor\', \'flavor\': \'"I miei felini mi hanno insegnato di più su ciò che è sacro di qualsiasi cosa possiate trovare in qualche vecchia rovina."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591945&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'111f828c-2f46-4b44-8294-5c2523da7a19\', \'multiverseId\': 591945}, \'multiverseid\': 591945}, {\'name\': \'従者つきの癒し手\', \'text\': \'あなたが各ターン内で初めてライフを得るたび、白の１/１の猫・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\\n{2}{W}：これでないクレリック１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは絆魂を得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — コー・クレリック\', \'flavor\': \'「古い遺跡のどんなものよりも、私の猫が神聖とは何かを教えてくれた。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592074&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f5d72163-5fd3-4467-88a3-27a87472443b\', \'multiverseId\': 592074}, \'multiverseid\': 592074}, {\'name\': \'照护治疗师\', \'text\': \'每当你每回合首度获得生命时，派出一个1/1白色的猫衍生生物。\\n{2}{W}：另一个目标僧侣获得系命异能直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～寇族／僧侣\', \'flavor\': \'「我身旁这些猫教会我有关圣物的事情，比某些古老遗迹还要多。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592461&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ea04967d-86f8-4cba-90a5-acf9983d4a1b\', \'multiverseId\': 592461}, \'multiverseid\': 592461}]', '[{\'name\': \'Begünstigte des Iroas\', \'text\': \'Konstellation — Immer wenn eine Verzauberung unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, erhält die Begünstigte des Iroas Doppelschlag bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Soldat\', \'flavor\': \'„Die Verheißung des Sieges erfüllt mein Herz. Für Angst bleibt kein Platz."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591588&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cc0295dd-6cf4-4153-b60d-ac9fc04091c2\', \'multiverseId\': 591588}, \'multiverseid\': 591588}, {\'name\': \'Favorita de Iroas\', \'text\': \'Constelación — Siempre que un encantamiento entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, la Favorita de Iroas gana la habilidad de dañar dos veces hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado humano\', \'flavor\': \'"La promesa de la victoria llena mi corazón. La duda no tiene cabida".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591717&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'366036f6-3927-458d-9d56-9273672d3826\', \'multiverseId\': 591717}, \'multiverseid\': 591717}, {\'name\': "Protégée d\'Iroas", \'text\': "Constellation — À chaque fois qu\'un enchantement arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, la Protégée d\'Iroas acquiert la double initiative jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et soldat\', \'flavor\': "« La promesse de la victoire emplit mon cœur. Il n\'y a pas de place pour la peur. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591846&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8e8ce8b6-4166-437a-87e1-3a91a55c2671\', \'multiverseId\': 591846}, \'multiverseid\': 591846}, {\'name\': \'Favorita di Iroas\', \'text\': \'Costellazione — Ogniqualvolta un incantesimo entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, la Favorita di Iroas ha doppio attacco fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Soldato Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"La promessa della vittoria colma il mio cuore. Non c\\\'è spazio per il timore."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591975&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1b5c2cde-1cc5-489c-82b2-8832403fcb4a\', \'multiverseId\': 591975}, \'multiverseid\': 591975}, {\'name\': \'イロアスの寵児\', \'text\': \'星座 ― エンチャント１つがあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、ターン終了時まで、イロアスの寵児は二段攻撃を得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・兵士\', \'flavor\': \'「私の心は勝利の誓いで満たされている。恐れが入り込む余地などない。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592104&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bd491e3f-7cce-4231-8e15-8b228d6ff954\', \'multiverseId\': 592104}, \'multiverseid\': 592104}, {\'name\': \'伊洛安斯恩眷兵\', \'text\': \'星彩～每当一个结界在你的操控下进战场时，伊洛安斯恩眷兵获得连击异能直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'「胜利许诺充盈内心，毫无怯惧容身之地。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592491&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'143ffd8a-d66e-4cf1-8652-a5507fa68185\', \'multiverseId\': 592491}, \'multiverseid\': 592491}]', '[{\'name\': \'Beinhausratten\', \'text\': \'Wenn die Beinhausratten ins Spiel kommen, fügen sie einer Kreatur oder einem Planeswalker deiner Wahl, die bzw. den ein Gegner kontrolliert, X Schadenspunkte zu, wobei X gleich der Anzahl an Kreaturenkarten in deinem Friedhof ist.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Ratte\', \'flavor\': \'Du weißt, dass du dich zu weit vorgewagt hast, wenn die Ratten aufhören zu rennen und sich dir entgegenstellen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589629&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5b620640-6e2f-42ca-9bd4-4e3131cd0ff9\', \'multiverseId\': 589629}, \'multiverseid\': 589629}, {\'name\': \'Ratas del osario\', \'text\': \'Cuando las Ratas del osario entren al campo de batalla, hacen X puntos de daño a la criatura o planeswalker objetivo que controla un oponente, donde X es la cantidad de cartas de criatura en tu cementerio.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Rata\', \'flavor\': \'Sabes que llegaste demasiado lejos cuando las ratas dejan de correr y te plantan cara.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589680&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fc99fb6e-e64a-4ccb-b2e7-73b097a58ed3\', \'multiverseId\': 589680}, \'multiverseid\': 589680}, {\'name\': "Rats de l\'ossuaire", \'text\': "Quand les Rats de l\'ossuaire arrivent sur le champ de bataille, ils infligent X blessures à une cible, créature ou planeswalker, qu\'un adversaire contrôle, X étant le nombre de cartes de créature dans votre cimetière.", \'type\': \'Créature : rat\', \'flavor\': "On sait qu\'on est allé trop loin quand les rats cessent de fuir et campent sur leurs positions.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589731&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e5d6eada-460e-4793-a1c1-e90aa1c6c7db\', \'multiverseId\': 589731}, \'multiverseid\': 589731}, {\'name\': "Ratti dell\'Ossario", \'text\': "Quando i Ratti dell\'Ossario entrano nel campo di battaglia, infliggono X danni a una creatura o a un planeswalker bersaglio controllati da un avversario, dove X è il numero di carte creatura nel tuo cimitero.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Ratto\', \'flavor\': \'Capisci di esserti spinto troppo in profondità quando i ratti smettono di scappare e difendono la loro posizione.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589782&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b44f0111-6b8a-4966-9c9e-7a9ea716c420\', \'multiverseId\': 589782}, \'multiverseid\': 589782}, {\'name\': \'納骨堂のネズミ\', \'text\': \'納骨堂のネズミが戦場に出たとき、クリーチャーやプレインズウォーカーのうち対戦相手がコントロールしている１体を対象とする。これはそれにＸ点のダメージを与える。Ｘはあなたの墓地にあるクリーチャー・カードの枚数に等しい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ネズミ\', \'flavor\': \'ネズミが走るのをやめてじっと身構えるようになったら、深くまで探索しすぎた証である。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589833&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5958b88d-9b01-46e4-8dc4-5e757c543b13\', \'multiverseId\': 589833}, \'multiverseid\': 589833}, {\'name\': \'藏骨堂老鼠\', \'text\': \'当藏骨堂老鼠进战场时，它向目标由对手操控的生物或鹏洛客造成X点伤害，X为你坟墓场中的生物牌数量。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～老鼠\', \'flavor\': \'当老鼠不再逃窜而是站定蓄势时，你就已经追得太深。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589986&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'08e5cdc9-ff4f-486c-90d7-01f6d0088660\', \'multiverseId\': 589986}, \'multiverseid\': 589986}]', '[{\'name\': \'Beizspucker-Gremlin\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Der Beizspucker-Gremlin fügt jedem Gegner 1 Schadenspunkt zu.\\nImmer wenn du einen Nichtkreatur-Zauberspruch wirkst, enttappe den Beizspucker-Gremlin.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Gremlin\', \'flavor\': \'„Ah, ein Kritiker."\\n—Orthion, Lavagrund-Hauptmann\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590208&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2ed3d4c0-d628-4248-8de2-5c11d4d8b795\', \'multiverseId\': 590208}, \'multiverseid\': 590208}, {\'name\': \'Gremlin escupellamas\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: El Gremlin escupellamas hace 1 punto de daño a cada oponente.\\nSiempre que lances un hechizo que no sea de criatura, endereza el Gremlin escupellamas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Gremlin\', \'flavor\': \'"Mira, si tenemos aquí un crítico".\\n—Orthion, capitán de Bordelava\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590343&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1624e427-516b-47e6-8e0c-f7716b83867d\', \'multiverseId\': 590343}, \'multiverseid\': 590343}, {\'name\': \'Gremlin phlyctocracheur\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T} : Le Gremlin phlyctocracheur inflige 1 blessure à chaque adversaire.\\nÀ chaque fois que vous lancez un sort non-créature, dégagez le Gremlin phlyctocracheur.\', \'type\': \'Créature : gremlin\', \'flavor\': "« Ah, en voilà un qui n\'est pas satisfait. »\\n—Orthion, capitaine de Bourg-sur-Lave", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590478&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9374ebc4-7938-4bf3-bcaa-542a20d451b6\', \'multiverseId\': 590478}, \'multiverseid\': 590478}, {\'name\': \'Gremlin Sputabrace\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Il Gremlin Sputabrace infligge 1 danno a ogni avversario.\\nOgniqualvolta lanci una magia non creatura, STAPpa il Gremlin Sputabrace.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Gremlin\', \'flavor\': \'"Ah, abbiamo un critico."\\n—Orthion, capitano di Lavariva\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590613&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d60d4fa6-27e3-4530-b9e9-6ca2fbfdd283\', \'multiverseId\': 590613}, \'multiverseid\': 590613}, {\'name\': \'火傷吐きグレムリン\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}：火傷吐きグレムリンは各対戦相手にそれぞれ１点のダメージを与える。\\nあなたがクリーチャーでない呪文を唱えるたび、火傷吐きグレムリンをアンタップする。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — グレムリン\', \'flavor\': \'「どうやら批評家が現れたようだ。」\\n――ラバブリンクの隊長、オーシオン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590748&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'62cdf5ad-f5aa-48dd-b310-486ff08b478f\', \'multiverseId\': 590748}, \'multiverseid\': 590748}, {\'name\': \'蜇息怪灵\', \'text\': \'{1}，{T}：蜇息怪灵向每位对手各造成1点伤害。\\n每当你施放非生物咒语时，重置蜇息怪灵。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～怪灵\', \'flavor\': \'「啊，有个敢说话的。」\\n～熔缘城队长欧席因\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591153&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3a60325b-9716-46d1-90da-167711d3b1b6\', \'multiverseId\': 591153}, \'multiverseid\': 591153}]', '[{\'name\': \'Benalische Ehrengarde\', \'text\': \'Die Benalische Ehrengarde erhält +1/+0 für jede legendäre Kreatur, die du kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Ritter\', \'flavor\': \'„Man sollte Helden nicht an ihren Leistungen messen, sondern an den Personen, die sie inspirieren."\\n—*Gerrards Triumph*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591561&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bc1a9ed1-acb5-4e0a-a044-6cc952163783\', \'multiverseId\': 591561}, \'multiverseid\': 591561}, {\'name\': \'Guardia de honor benalita\', \'text\': \'La Guardia de honor benalita obtiene +1/+0 por cada criatura legendaria que controlas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Caballero humano\', \'flavor\': \'"La verdadera medida de todos los héroes no es lo que logran, sino a quién inspiran".\\n—*Triunfo de Gerrard*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591690&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'02921ce8-7a33-4a38-9983-6b603b4774a1\', \'multiverseId\': 591690}, \'multiverseid\': 591690}, {\'name\': "Garde d\'honneur bénaliane", \'text\': "La Garde d\'honneur bénaliane gagne +1/+0 pour chaque créature légendaire que vous contrôlez.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et chevalier\', \'flavor\': "« La valeur des héros ne se mesure pas à la grandeur de ce qu\'ils accomplissent, mais à ceux qu\'ils inspirent. »\\n—*Triomphe de Gerrard*", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591819&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d90dba47-ce48-4f3a-bc7e-30f09562fae1\', \'multiverseId\': 591819}, \'multiverseid\': 591819}, {\'name\': "Guardia d\'Onore di Benalia", \'text\': "La Guardia d\'Onore di Benalia prende +1/+0 per ogni creatura leggendaria che controlli.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Cavaliere Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"La vera grandezza degli eroi non si misura dalle imprese che compiono, ma dalle persone che ispirano."\\n—*Trionfo di Gerrard*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591948&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'26d09d12-dc8a-47a1-a9b3-2d58cfbd3cb4\', \'multiverseId\': 591948}, \'multiverseid\': 591948}, {\'name\': \'ベナリアの儀仗兵\', \'text\': \'ベナリアの儀仗兵は、あなたがコントロールしている伝説のクリーチャー１体につき＋１/＋０の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・騎士\', \'flavor\': \'「英雄というものの真の評価は、自らが成したことではなく、誰に影響を与えたかによって決まる。」\\n――*ジェラードの凱旋*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592077&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b43e5c84-acff-4a8b-b584-e98fbd8db828\', \'multiverseId\': 592077}, \'multiverseid\': 592077}, {\'name\': \'宾纳里亚仪队兵\', \'text\': \'你每操控一个传奇生物，宾纳里亚仪队兵便得+1/+0。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／骑士\', \'flavor\': \'「评判英雄的真正标准，并非看其成就，而是看其影响。」\\n～*《杰拉尔德凯旋志》*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592464&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'653b2cdb-d180-4ebc-9ded-b909606e2702\', \'multiverseId\': 592464}, \'multiverseid\': 592464}]', '[{\'name\': \'Beschützender Engel\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nImmer wenn der Beschützende Engel Ziel eines Zauberspruchs oder einer Fähigkeit wird, erhält er +0/+3 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Engel\', \'flavor\': \'„Meine Familie fand Zuflucht in ihrem Licht. Das Dunkel war gezwungen zu warten."\\n—Crovax\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591553&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f7ac179c-cf78-4abf-bfa8-659a4d1efc7f\', \'multiverseId\': 591553}, \'multiverseid\': 591553}, {\'name\': \'Protector angelical\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nSiempre que el Protector angelical sea objetivo de un hechizo o habilidad, el Protector angelical obtiene +0/+3 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ángel\', \'flavor\': \'"Mi familia se refugió bajo su luz mientras la oscuridad esperaba con agrado".\\n—Crovax\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591682&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'64440435-e99c-4b47-8fd3-7a2343ca7a0c\', \'multiverseId\': 591682}, \'multiverseid\': 591682}, {\'name\': \'Protectrice angélique\', \'text\': "Vol\\nÀ chaque fois que la Protectrice angélique devient la cible d\'un sort ou d\'une capacité, la Protectrice angélique gagne +0/+3 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : ange\', \'flavor\': "« Ma famille se réfugiait dans sa lumière, l\'ombre se contentait d\'attendre. »\\n—Crovax", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591811&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eabbf69f-a48b-433b-8021-2597e9b8af4a\', \'multiverseId\': 591811}, \'multiverseid\': 591811}, {\'name\': \'Protettore Angelico\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nOgniqualvolta il Protettore Angelico diventa bersaglio di una magia o abilità, il Protettore Angelico prende +0/+3 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Angelo\', \'flavor\': \'"La mia famiglia cercava riparo nella sua luce, mentre le tenebre attendevano pazientemente."\\n—Crovax\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591940&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a837a515-d4a4-4235-9b58-0a5560f7a087\', \'multiverseId\': 591940}, \'multiverseid\': 591940}, {\'name\': \'庇護の天使\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n庇護の天使が呪文や能力の対象になるたび、ターン終了時まで、庇護の天使は＋０/＋３の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 天使\', \'flavor\': \'「私の家族は彼女の光で守られていたから、危険は近づいてこようとさえしなかったよ。」\\n――クロウヴァクス\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592069&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'64a74ac5-3a40-413b-a608-95ac057c383d\', \'multiverseId\': 592069}, \'multiverseid\': 592069}, {\'name\': \'天国守护使\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n每当天国守护使成为咒语或异能的目标时，天国守护使得+0/+3直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～天使\', \'flavor\': \'「在她的光芒笼罩下，我的家人获得了庇护，而黑暗却不死心地等待着。」\\n～寇维克斯\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592456&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7685e088-478c-4588-85f4-537a83f104f6\', \'multiverseId\': 592456}, \'multiverseid\': 592456}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bevorstehendes Verhängnis\', \'text\': \'Verzaubert eine Kreatur\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur erhält +3/+3 und greift in jedem Kampf an, falls möglich.\\nWenn die verzauberte Kreatur stirbt, fügt das Bevorstehende Verhängnis dem Beherrscher der Kreatur 3 Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'„Tue dich gütlich, denn deine nächste Mahlzeit könnte deine letzte sein!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590265&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'588fff5f-374f-4090-9c47-914856b514db\', \'multiverseId\': 590265}, \'multiverseid\': 590265}, {\'name\': \'Fatalidad inminente\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura.\\nLa criatura encantada obtiene +3/+3 y ataca cada combate si puede.\\nCuando la criatura encantada muera, la Fatalidad inminente hace 3 puntos de daño al controlador de esa criatura.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'"¡Bebamos, pues esta fiesta siempre puede ser la última!".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590400&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0e5b5d54-9cba-4144-a7f4-3493e7d098b1\', \'multiverseId\': 590400}, \'multiverseid\': 590400}, {\'name\': \'Fatalité imminente\', \'text\': \'Enchanter : créature\\nLa créature enchantée gagne +3/+3 et attaque à chaque combat si possible.\\nQuand la créature enchantée meurt, la Fatalité imminente inflige 3 blessures au contrôleur de cette créature.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': \'« Festoie bien, car ton prochain repas pourrait être le dernier ! »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590535&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2ead48c6-5167-4ecb-b727-d86e8f096011\', \'multiverseId\': 590535}, \'multiverseid\': 590535}, {\'name\': \'Fato Incombente\', \'text\': \'Incanta creatura\\nLa creatura incantata prende +3/+3 e attacca in ogni combattimento, se può farlo.\\nQuando la creatura incantata muore, il Fato Incombente infligge 3 danni al controllore di quella creatura.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'"Saziatevi a volontà, perché il vostro prossimo pasto potrebbe essere l\\\'ultimo!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590670&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fceef2e5-cbc3-4d49-b947-4537bd10fdef\', \'multiverseId\': 590670}, \'multiverseid\': 590670}, {\'name\': \'さし迫った破滅\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\nエンチャントしているクリーチャーは＋３/＋３の修整を受け、各戦闘で、可能なら攻撃する。\\nエンチャントしているクリーチャーが死亡したとき、さし迫った破滅はそのクリーチャーのコントローラーに３点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': \'「腹いっぱい食おうじゃないか、これが最後の食事になるかも知れないからな！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590805&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c24ea740-db69-4b51-83e7-4b72d5dd772e\', \'multiverseId\': 590805}, \'multiverseid\': 590805}, {\'name\': \'悲剧临头\', \'text\': \'结附于生物\\n所结附的生物得+3/+3，且每次战斗若能攻击，则必须攻击。\\n当所结附的生物死去时，悲剧临头对该生物的操控者造成3点伤害。\', \'type\': \'结界 ～灵气\', \'flavor\': \'「下顿也许就是最后一顿，现在尽情吃喝吧！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591210&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'14d87f52-7b0d-4565-8c96-46f127f7dbdd\', \'multiverseId\': 591210}, \'multiverseid\': 591210}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bewohner der Efeuallee\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn eine andere grüne Kreatur unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf eine Kreatur deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elf, Krieger\', \'flavor\': \'„Himmelsritter-Ausrüstung? Nun, ich habe Handschuhe aus Sceada-Leder, geschmeidig und feuerfest. Oder einen Ceratops-Brustschild, der einen Armbrustbolzen aufhalten würde."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592879&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3c9a8132-f241-4da7-a5e0-77df04d049c4\', \'multiverseId\': 592879}, \'multiverseid\': 592879}, {\'name\': \'Habitante de la Calle Hiedra\', \'text\': \'Siempre que otra criatura verde entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre la criatura objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero elfo\', \'flavor\': \'"¿Equipamiento de caballero celeste? Bueno, tengo guanteletes de piel de draco, suaves e ignífugos. O una coraza de ceratok que detendría el disparo de una ballesta".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593000&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'89f37b9c-c14f-47d8-942f-a6eb9cc316cb\', \'multiverseId\': 593000}, \'multiverseid\': 593000}, {\'name\': "Habitant de l\'allée du Lierre", \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'une autre créature verte arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur une créature ciblée.", \'type\': \'Créature : elfe et guerrier\', \'flavor\': "« Du matériel pour chevalier céleste ? Ma foi, j\'ai des gantelets en cuir de drakôn, souples et ignifugés. Ou une cuirasse en peau de cératok qui peut arrêter un carreau d\'arbalète. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593121&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d64c5383-25c7-44c8-9088-e450026b23ab\', \'multiverseId\': 593121}, \'multiverseid\': 593121}, {\'name\': "Abitante di Strada dell\'Edera", \'text\': "Ogniqualvolta un\'altra creatura verde entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, metti un segnalino +1/+1 su una creatura bersaglio.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Elfo\', \'flavor\': \'"L\\\'equipaggiamento di un Cavaliere dei Cieli? Ho guanti di pelle di drago, flessibili e ignifughi. O una corazza di ceratok che può fermare il dardo di una balestra."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593242&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'11e922d5-0bc6-44f7-8590-12b5dd6f39fa\', \'multiverseId\': 593242}, \'multiverseid\': 593242}, {\'name\': \'キヅタ小径の住人\', \'text\': \'これでない緑のクリーチャー１体があなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それの上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルフ・戦士\', \'flavor\': \'「空騎士の装身具？そうだな、うちにあるのはしなやかで火に強いドレイク皮の篭手。あとは弩弓の矢でさえはじく角獣の胸当てだ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593363&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6397fc21-49b4-489d-862d-bbcd2d7ce60d\', \'multiverseId\': 593363}, \'multiverseid\': 593363}, {\'name\': \'长春藤巷居民\', \'text\': \'每当另一个绿色生物在你的操控下进战场时，在目标生物上放置一个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～妖精／战士\', \'flavor\': \'「空骑士的装备？我有龙兽皮护手，柔韧防火。或是一件能挡住弩箭的角龙胸甲。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593726&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e45a1b10-4fc5-44eb-9f3f-456c9b5fda3e\', \'multiverseId\': 593726}, \'multiverseid\': 593726}]', '[{\'name\': \'Biblioplex-Krake\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Biblioplex-Krake ins Spiel kommt, wende Hellsicht 3 an. (Schaue dir die obersten drei Karten deiner Bibliothek an. Du kannst eine beliebige Anzahl davon unter deine Bibliothek legen und den Rest in beliebiger Reihenfolge oben darauf.)\\nImmer wenn der Biblioplex-Krake angreift, kannst du eine andere Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, auf die Hand ihres Besitzers zurückbringen. Falls du dies tust, kann der Biblioplex-Krake in diesem Zug nicht geblockt werden.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Krake\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589615&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'00a37403-3d65-44f6-939f-c1b0b64b3fb4\', \'multiverseId\': 589615}, \'multiverseid\': 589615}, {\'name\': \'Kraken de la Biblioplex\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Kraken de la Biblioplex entre al campo de batalla, adivina 3. (Mira las tres primeras cartas de tu biblioteca, luego pon cualquier cantidad de ellas en el fondo de tu biblioteca y el resto en la parte superior en cualquier orden.)\\nSiempre que el Kraken de la Biblioplex ataque, puedes regresar otra criatura que controlas a la mano de su propietario. Si lo haces, el Kraken de la Biblioplex no puede ser bloqueado este turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Kraken\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589666&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'df62c2b0-9c41-4bdb-8dcb-a93387be2813\', \'multiverseId\': 589666}, \'multiverseid\': 589666}, {\'name\': \'Kraken du Biblioplexe\', \'text\': "Quand le Kraken du Biblioplexe arrive sur le champ de bataille, regard 3. (Regardez les trois cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Mettez n\'importe quel nombre d\'entre elles au-dessous de votre bibliothèque et le reste, au-dessus, dans n\'importe quel ordre.)\\nÀ chaque fois que le Kraken du Biblioplexe attaque, vous pouvez renvoyer une autre créature que vous contrôlez dans la main de son propriétaire. Si vous faites ainsi, le Kraken du Biblioplexe ne peut pas être bloqué ce tour-ci.", \'type\': \'Créature : kraken\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589717&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5422db50-4d09-45b6-8980-8e8e99c4cf2a\', \'multiverseId\': 589717}, \'multiverseid\': 589717}, {\'name\': \'Kraken del Biblioplex\', \'text\': "Quando il Kraken del Biblioplex entra nel campo di battaglia, profetizza 3. (Guarda le prime tre carte del tuo grimorio, poi mettine un qualsiasi numero in fondo al tuo grimorio e le altre in cima in qualsiasi ordine.)\\nOgniqualvolta il Kraken del Biblioplex attacca, puoi far tornare un\'altra creatura che controlli in mano al suo proprietario. Se lo fai, il Kraken del Biblioplex non può essere bloccato in questo turno.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Kraken\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589768&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3f46036d-4cd1-49d1-82b0-bb73b2f3f020\', \'multiverseId\': 589768}, \'multiverseid\': 589768}, {\'name\': \'大図書棟のクラーケン\', \'text\': \'大図書棟のクラーケンが戦場に出たとき、占術３を行う。（あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード３枚を見て、そのうちの望む枚数のカードを望む順番であなたのライブラリーの一番下に、残りを望む順番で一番上に置く。）\\n大図書棟のクラーケンが攻撃するたび、あなたはあなたがコントロールしていてこれでないクリーチャー１体をオーナーの手札に戻してもよい。そうしたなら、このターン、大図書棟のクラーケンはブロックされない。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — クラーケン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589819&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d3285bd5-5b86-446b-b7e4-b1a98e275312\', \'multiverseId\': 589819}, \'multiverseid\': 589819}, {\'name\': \'茂典阁巨海兽\', \'text\': \'当茂典阁巨海兽进战场时，占卜3。（检视你牌库顶的三张牌，然后将其中任意数量的牌以任意顺序置于你牌库底，其余则以任意顺序置于你牌库顶。）\\n每当茂典阁巨海兽攻击时，你可以将另一个由你操控的生物移回其拥有者手上。若你如此作，则茂典阁巨海兽本回合不能被阻挡。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～巨海兽\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589972&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bcbb0e23-bfad-4b2d-befa-8517bc1cf1b9\', \'multiverseId\': 589972}, \'multiverseid\': 589972}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blasenkokon\', \'text\': \'Fahl (Diese Karte hat keine Farbe.)\\nWenn der Blasenkokon stirbt, erzeuge einen 1/1 farblosen Eldrazi-Brut-Kreaturenspielstein. Er hat „Opfere diese Kreatur: Erzeuge {C}."\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Eldrazi, Drohne\', \'flavor\': \'Die Leiche eines Blasenkokons ist die Wiege einer Brut.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592831&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'175fd80b-525c-4d5f-a71f-1be1fca9f28c\', \'multiverseId\': 592831}, \'multiverseid\': 592831}, {\'name\': \'Portador de vástagos\', \'text\': \'Vacío. (Esta carta no tiene ningún color.)\\nCuando el Portador de vástagos muera, crea una ficha de criatura Vástago Eldrazi incolora 1/1. Tiene "Sacrificar esta criatura: Agrega {C}".\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Zángano eldrazi\', \'flavor\': \'El cadáver de un portador es la cuna de un vástago.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592952&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a82e2cd4-e062-4edf-8e3a-53a704c302f7\', \'multiverseId\': 592952}, \'multiverseid\': 592952}, {\'name\': \'Phlyctocosse\', \'text\': "Carence (Cette carte n\'a pas de couleur.)\\nQuand le Phlyctocosse meurt, créez un jeton de créature 1/1 incolore Eldrazi et Scion. Il a « Sacrifiez cette créature : Ajoutez {C}. »", \'type\': \'Créature : eldrazi et drone\', \'flavor\': "Le cadavre d\'un phlyctocosse est le berceau d\'un scion.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593073&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3767b56c-91e7-47d1-810d-4e28f5117771\', \'multiverseId\': 593073}, \'multiverseid\': 593073}, {\'name\': \'Spora Vescicolare\', \'text\': \'Vacuità (Questa carta non ha colore.)\\nQuando la Spora Vescicolare muore, crea una pedina creatura Discendente Eldrazi 1/1 incolore. Ha "Sacrifica questa creatura: Aggiungi {C}".\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Parassita Eldrazi\', \'flavor\': \'Il cadavere di una spora vescicolare è la culla per un discendente.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593194&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'546de85f-bc50-457b-b0b4-632fab5ae10d\', \'multiverseId\': 593194}, \'multiverseid\': 593194}, {\'name\': \'膨れ鞘\', \'text\': \'欠色（このカードは無色である。）\\n膨れ鞘が死亡したとき、無色の１/１のエルドラージ・末裔・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。それは「このクリーチャーを生け贄に捧げる：{C}を加える。」を持つ。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルドラージ・ドローン\', \'flavor\': \'膨れ鞘の屍骸は末裔を育む。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593315&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'885380f3-1429-4e75-8cbd-d03d565d3da2\', \'multiverseId\': 593315}, \'multiverseid\': 593315}, {\'name\': \'迅孳种\', \'text\': \'虚色（此牌没有颜色。）\\n当迅孳种死去时，派出一个1/1无色奥札奇／孽裔衍生生物。它具有「牺牲此生物：加{C}。」\', \'type\': \'生物 ～奥札奇／奴兽\', \'flavor\': \'迅孳种的尸体孕育着孽裔。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593678&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'15f84d0c-a839-4136-8aa9-43fc4a85131f\', \'multiverseId\': 593678}, \'multiverseid\': 593678}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blitzaxt\', \'text\': \'Wirf als zusätzliche Kosten, um diesen Zauberspruch zu wirken, eine Karte ab oder bezahle {5}.\\nDie Blitzaxt fügt einer Kreatur deiner Wahl 5 Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Von Ghulrufern gestörte Geister werden von niemals enden wollender Wut getrieben.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590277&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d25a946d-e164-4c72-b368-c8ff17b3df46\', \'multiverseId\': 590277}, \'multiverseid\': 590277}, {\'name\': \'Hacha de relámpagos\', \'text\': \'Como coste adicional para lanzar este hechizo, descarta una carta o paga {5}.\\nEl Hacha de relámpagos hace 5 puntos de daño a la criatura objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Los espíritus perturbados por los llamamuertos se convierten en geists conducidos por una rabia ciega.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590412&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'024a441b-e8c9-4773-891a-61412f58cfb6\', \'multiverseId\': 590412}, \'multiverseid\': 590412}, {\'name\': "Hache d\'éclairs", \'text\': "En tant que coût supplémentaire pour lancer ce sort, défaussez-vous d\'une carte ou payez {5}.\\nLa Hache d\'éclairs inflige 5 blessures à une créature ciblée.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'Les esprits dérangés par les meneurs de goule deviennent des geists mus par une colère permanente.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590547&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'81183232-a512-4355-8a9f-243500648da7\', \'multiverseId\': 590547}, \'multiverseid\': 590547}, {\'name\': \'Ascia Folgorante\', \'text\': "Come costo addizionale per lanciare questa magia, scarta una carta o paga {5}.\\nL\'Ascia Folgorante infligge 5 danni a una creatura bersaglio.", \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'Gli spiriti disturbati dagli evocaghoul diventano geist posseduti da una rabbia incessante.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590682&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'720662b1-8969-4701-9660-d0b6fa27d13a\', \'multiverseId\': 590682}, \'multiverseid\': 590682}, {\'name\': \'稲妻の斧\', \'text\': \'この呪文を唱えるための追加コストとして、カード１枚を捨てるか{5}を支払う。\\nクリーチャー１体を対象とする。稲妻の斧はそれに５点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'グール呼びに眠りを妨げられた霊は、安息なき怒りに駆られて亡霊となる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590817&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'19d5dc52-233d-4ccf-b57f-2a7f4d014730\', \'multiverseId\': 590817}, \'multiverseid\': 590817}, {\'name\': \'闪电斧\', \'text\': \'弃一张牌或支付{5}，以作为施放此咒语的额外费用。\\n闪电斧对目标生物造成5点伤害。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'受尸鬼牧者侵扰的鬼魂成为受无尽愤怒驱使的游魂。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591222&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'13583618-1d14-4996-bba1-fd33bd851981\', \'multiverseId\': 591222}, \'multiverseid\': 591222}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blitzhund\', \'text\': \'Eile\\nImmer wenn der Blitzhund angreift, erhalten andere Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, +1/+0 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elementarwesen, Hund\', \'flavor\': \'Sein Funke ist schlimmer als sein Biss.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590212&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b8b6dc5b-7b7a-41bf-816a-21799f2aee5a\', \'multiverseId\': 590212}, \'multiverseid\': 590212}, {\'name\': \'Perro relámpago\', \'text\': \'Prisa.\\nSiempre que el Perro relámpago ataque, las otras criaturas que controlas obtienen +1/+0 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Perro elemental\', \'flavor\': \'Su chispazo es peor que su mordisco.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590347&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cc0b1663-7218-458a-81df-3475c88789e7\', \'multiverseId\': 590347}, \'multiverseid\': 590347}, {\'name\': "Chien d\'éclair", \'text\': "Célérité\\nÀ chaque fois que le Chien d\'éclair attaque, les autres créatures que vous contrôlez gagnent +1/+0 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : élémental et chien\', \'flavor\': "Il crépite plus qu\'il ne mord.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590482&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c2f9810d-fb17-4004-a1d7-24280f21a6c1\', \'multiverseId\': 590482}, \'multiverseid\': 590482}, {\'name\': \'Segugio Saetta\', \'text\': \'Rapidità\\nOgniqualvolta il Segugio Saetta attacca, le altre creature che controlli prendono +1/+0 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Canide Elementale\', \'flavor\': \'La sua fiamma è ben peggiore del suo morso.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590617&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e792f096-d3a3-4309-8416-cbb6f4ca24bb\', \'multiverseId\': 590617}, \'multiverseid\': 590617}, {\'name\': \'雷光の猟犬\', \'text\': \'速攻\\n雷光の猟犬が攻撃するたび、ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールしていてこれでないすべてのクリーチャーは＋１/＋０の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エレメンタル・犬\', \'flavor\': \'咬まれるよりも火花がまずい。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590752&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f089f8ed-6827-4514-a47e-ff5a7f2e32c7\', \'multiverseId\': 590752}, \'multiverseid\': 590752}, {\'name\': \'电闪猎犬\', \'text\': \'敏捷\\n每当电闪猎犬攻击时，由你操控的其他生物得+1/+0直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～元素／狗\', \'flavor\': \'电光比利齿更为凶狠。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591157&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3c2b17c8-0aef-4d2e-841c-9aef039e86db\', \'multiverseId\': 591157}, \'multiverseid\': 591157}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blitzmaul-Drache\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nWenn der Blitzmaul-Drache ins Spiel kommt, kannst du {2}{R} bezahlen. Wenn du dies tust, fügt er einem Ziel deiner Wahl 3 Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Drache\', \'flavor\': \'Narren glauben, dass Kolaghans Brut den Blitzen folgt. Die Weisen wissen, dass es andersherum ist.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590312&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'17fdfe3c-4095-45c2-abc9-7fc43b916c9f\', \'multiverseId\': 590312}, \'multiverseid\': 590312}, {\'name\': \'Dragón lenguarrayos\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nCuando el Dragón lenguarrayos entre al campo de batalla, puedes pagar {2}{R}. Cuando lo hagas, hace 3 puntos de daño a cualquier objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Dragón\', \'flavor\': \'Los necios creen que la estirpe de Kólagan acompaña a las tormentas eléctricas. Los sabios entienden que es al revés.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590447&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2e9ce1fa-fd5c-4898-8f0a-c2117cad7870\', \'multiverseId\': 590447}, \'multiverseid\': 590447}, {\'name\': \'Dragon languefoudre\', \'text\': "Vol\\nQuand le Dragon languefoudre arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez payer {2}{R}. Quand vous faites ainsi, il inflige 3 blessures à n\'importe quelle cible.", \'type\': \'Créature : dragon\', \'flavor\': "Les imbéciles pensent que la couvée de Kolaghan suit les orages. Les sages savent que c\'est l\'inverse.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590582&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5ca90eee-20c4-40c9-9bde-0120b9533275\', \'multiverseId\': 590582}, \'multiverseid\': 590582}, {\'name\': \'Drago Sputafolgore\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nQuando il Drago Sputafolgore entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi pagare {2}{R}. Quando lo fai, infligge 3 danni a un qualsiasi bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Drago\', \'flavor\': \'Gli stolti sono convinti che la covata di Kolaghan segua le tempeste di fulmini. I saggi sanno che è piuttosto il contrario.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590717&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fea876e4-646b-4ae1-bbff-ddc09f494060\', \'multiverseId\': 590717}, \'multiverseid\': 590717}, {\'name\': \'電光吠えのドラゴン\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n電光吠えのドラゴンが戦場に出たとき、あなたは{2}{R}を支払ってもよい。そうしたとき、クリーチャーやプレインズウォーカーやプレイヤーのうち１つを対象とする。これはそれに３点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ドラゴン\', \'flavor\': \'愚か者はコラガンの血が嵐の後を追うと思い込んでいる。賢者はそれがまったくの逆だと知っている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590852&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b7bf5e18-3066-4a1c-aff6-c1cdead3c5e6\', \'multiverseId\': 590852}, \'multiverseid\': 590852}, {\'name\': \'啸电巨龙\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n当啸电巨龙进战场时，你可以支付{2}{R}。当你如此作时，它对任意一个目标造成3点伤害。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～龙\', \'flavor\': \'愚钝之人以为寇安甘一脉的龙群随闪电风暴而行。智者知道事实正相反。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591257&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'52d0b71e-e3e5-4649-b5d8-e71cb83bd04d\', \'multiverseId\': 591257}, \'multiverseid\': 591257}]', "[{'name': 'Blutaussaugen', 'text': 'Jeder Gegner verliert X Lebenspunkte. Du erhältst so viele Lebenspunkte dazu, wie auf diese Weise Lebenspunkte verloren wurden.', 'type': 'Hexerei', 'flavor': 'Vampire halten Geduld nicht für eine Tugend und Völlerei nicht für eine Sünde.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594070&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '75367759-9f0e-492b-86e6-b497e2bae2c4', 'multiverseId': 594070}, 'multiverseid': 594070}, {'name': 'Desangrar', 'text': 'Cada oponente pierde X vidas. Ganas una cantidad de vidas igual a la cantidad de vidas perdidas de esta manera.', 'type': 'Conjuro', 'flavor': 'Los vampiros no consideran que la paciencia sea una virtud, o la gula, un pecado.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594187&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bccbd3fb-067b-4ae0-bf10-77d898d8f9b9', 'multiverseId': 594187}, 'multiverseid': 594187}, {'name': 'Exsanguination', 'text': 'Chaque adversaire perd X points de vie. Vous gagnez autant de points de vie que ceux perdus de cette manière.', 'type': 'Rituel', 'flavor': 'Les vampires ne considèrent ni la patience une vertu, ni la gourmandise un péché.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594304&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8733ff1c-f808-4a11-8b45-670b4ff16778', 'multiverseId': 594304}, 'multiverseid': 594304}, {'name': 'Dissanguare', 'text': 'Ogni avversario perde X punti vita. Guadagni tanti punti vita quanti sono i punti vita persi in questo modo.', 'type': 'Stregoneria', 'flavor': 'I vampiri non considerano la pazienza una virtù né la golosità un peccato.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594421&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '443c93e9-5723-4d5d-887b-156ef80cc83b', 'multiverseId': 594421}, 'multiverseid': 594421}, {'name': '瀉血', 'text': '各対戦相手はそれぞれＸ点のライフを失う。あなたはこれにより失われたライフの合計に等しい点数のライフを得る。', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': '吸血鬼は辛抱を美徳と考えていないし、飽食を罪とも思っていない。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594538&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '51803b8b-82c4-46c1-8bc9-ff30a7a5d044', 'multiverseId': 594538}, 'multiverseid': 594538}, {'name': '放干鲜血', 'text': '每位对手各失去X点生命。你获得若干生命，其数量等同于以此法失去的生命数量。', 'type': '法术', 'flavor': '对吸血鬼来说，耐心不是美德，贪食亦非罪恶。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594889&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5e2748cd-b8c8-4aa8-bf1f-36690f923abf', 'multiverseId': 594889}, 'multiverseid': 594889}]", '[{\'name\': \'Blutbund-Vampirin\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du Lebenspunkte dazuerhältst, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf die Blutbund-Vampirin.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vampir, Schamane, Verbündeter\', \'flavor\': \'„Lasst die Vampire sich uns anschließen. In diesem Krieg haben wir nicht länger den Luxus, uns unsere Kameraden auszusuchen."\\n—Generalin Tazri, Kommandeurin der Verbündeten\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594037&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'af4f3d6d-56bf-4177-85ea-940f86d2a2af\', \'multiverseId\': 594037}, \'multiverseid\': 594037}, {\'name\': \'Vampira vínculo de sangre\', \'text\': \'Siempre que ganes vidas, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre la Vampira vínculo de sangre.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Chamán vampiro aliado\', \'flavor\': \'"Deja que los vampiros se unan a nosotros. En esta guerra, ya no podemos darnos el lujo de elegir a nuestros compañeros".\\n—General Tazri, comandante aliada\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594154&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9f86e2f0-57f9-42fe-a418-7a79f4ca52fa\', \'multiverseId\': 594154}, \'multiverseid\': 594154}, {\'name\': \'Vampire bridesang\', \'text\': \'À chaque fois que vous gagnez des points de vie, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur la Vampire bridesang.\', \'type\': \'Créature : vampire et shamane et allié\', \'flavor\': "« Laissez les vampires se joindre à nous. Dans cette guerre, nous ne pouvons plus nous permettre de choisir nos frères d\'armes. »\\n—Générale Tazri, commandante alliée", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594271&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2c225362-aae4-43cb-bdc7-55dfef514231\', \'multiverseId\': 594271}, \'multiverseid\': 594271}, {\'name\': \'Vampira dei Legami di Sangue\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta guadagni punti vita, metti un segnalino +1/+1 sulla Vampira dei Legami di Sangue.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Alleato Sciamano Vampiro\', \'flavor\': \'"Lasciate che i vampiri si uniscano a noi. In questa guerra, non possiamo più permetterci il lusso di scegliere i nostri compagni."\\n—Generale Tazri, comandante alleata\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594388&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0949ff91-258a-48a1-9a44-af804a489d44\', \'multiverseId\': 594388}, \'multiverseid\': 594388}, {\'name\': \'血の絆の吸血鬼\', \'text\': \'あなたがライフを得るたび、血の絆の吸血鬼の上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 吸血鬼・シャーマン・同盟者\', \'flavor\': \'「吸血鬼も仲間に加えよう。この戦いは、もはや同志を選べる段階ではない。」\\n――同盟の統率者、タズリ将軍\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594505&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bff52cea-c73e-4c11-b3a0-5d4367135073\', \'multiverseId\': 594505}, \'multiverseid\': 594505}, {\'name\': \'生脉吸血鬼\', \'text\': \'每当你获得生命时，在生脉吸血鬼上放置一个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～吸血鬼／祭师／伙伴\', \'flavor\': \'「让吸血鬼加入我们吧。在这场战争中，我们已经没有挑选战友的余地了。」\\n～盟军指挥官塔兹莉将军\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594856&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1cb7f272-6494-41d8-ac49-54f5355dd3a1\', \'multiverseId\': 594856}, \'multiverseid\': 594856}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blutdürstige Luftakrobatin\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nImmer wenn du Lebenspunkte dazuerhältst, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf die Blutdürstige Luftakrobatin.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vampir, Räuber\', \'flavor\': \'Ganz die Zirkusakrobatin, die sie einst war, begeistert sie ihre Opfer bis zum letzten Atemzug mit ihrer Vorstellung.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594038&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f227cb26-4899-455c-919a-0abfd61b1825\', \'multiverseId\': 594038}, \'multiverseid\': 594038}, {\'name\': \'Acróbata sedienta de sangre\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nSiempre que ganes vidas, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre la Acróbata sedienta de sangre.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bribón vampiro\', \'flavor\': \'Acróbata circense en vida, mata con tal elegancia que incluso sus víctimas se quedan asombradas con su actuación.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594155&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'200f78ee-4b9b-454d-b06f-255d135aed34\', \'multiverseId\': 594155}, \'multiverseid\': 594155}, {\'name\': \'Voltigeuse assoiffée de sang\', \'text\': \'Vol\\nÀ chaque fois que vous gagnez des points de vie, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur la Voltigeuse assoiffée de sang.\', \'type\': \'Créature : vampire et gredin\', \'flavor\': \'Acrobate dans un cirque de son vivant, elle tue avec une telle grâce que même ses victimes sont sidérées par sa performance.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594272&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'76303d7a-4901-4a98-99fa-6da0957a60a3\', \'multiverseId\': 594272}, \'multiverseid\': 594272}, {\'name\': \'Acrobata Assetata di Sangue\', \'text\': "Volare\\nOgniqualvolta guadagni punti vita, metti un segnalino +1/+1 sull\'Acrobata Assetata di Sangue.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Farabutto Vampiro\', \'flavor\': "Acrobata del circo quand\'era in vita, uccide con grazia e fluidità tali da meravigliare perfino le sue vittime con le sue esibizioni.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594389&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ca9f0382-121f-47ae-b8ba-fc190589ea69\', \'multiverseId\': 594389}, \'multiverseid\': 594389}, {\'name\': \'血に飢えた曲芸師\', \'text\': \'飛行\\nあなたがライフを得るたび、血に飢えた曲芸師の上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 吸血鬼・ならず者\', \'flavor\': \'元々はサーカスの演者だった。流れるような動きで命を奪う様に、犠牲者さえも畏敬の念を抱く。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594506&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9607e473-bf5b-495a-b19c-e87aa48a0df6\', \'multiverseId\': 594506}, \'multiverseid\': 594506}, {\'name\': \'嗜血舞空客\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n每当你获得生命时，在嗜血舞空客上放置一个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～吸血鬼／浪客\', \'flavor\': \'她生时是马戏团的杂技演员，因而练就了一身流畅华美的杀人技艺，就连遭她毒手的人也对其表演赞叹不已。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594857&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f7597e88-bcfb-4110-bf66-2124651d194a\', \'multiverseId\': 594857}, \'multiverseid\': 594857}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blutfest\', \'text\': \'Wirke diesen Zauberspruch nur, falls du zwei oder mehr Vampire kontrollierst.\\nZerstöre eine Kreatur deiner Wahl. Du erhältst 4 Lebenspunkte dazu.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Der beste Teil einer Hochzeit ist das Anschneiden der Torte, dicht gefolgt vom Anschneiden des Tortendekorateurs."\\n—Olivia Voldaren\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597525&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d9300cf0-757c-49ac-a7c1-522d7dca8828\', \'multiverseId\': 597525}, \'multiverseid\': 597525}, {\'name\': \'Festín de sangre\', \'text\': \'Lanza este hechizo solo si controlas dos o más Vampiros.\\nDestruye la criatura objetivo. Ganas 4 vidas.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Lo mejor de una boda es cortar el pastel, pero cortar al pastelero no se queda corto".\\n—Olivia Voldaren\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597550&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'18d95fbc-1798-4e24-be5b-6d754ddba8cc\', \'multiverseId\': 597550}, \'multiverseid\': 597550}, {\'name\': \'Festin de sang\', \'text\': \'Ne lancez ce sort que si vous contrôlez au moins deux vampires.\\nDétruisez une créature ciblée. Vous gagnez 4 points de vie.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« Le meilleur moment d\'un mariage, c\'est la coupe du gâteau, mais la coupe du pâtissier n\'arrive pas loin derrière. »\\n—Olivia Voldaren", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597575&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f223be88-5417-4bfe-ad3d-5e0ae964b9d6\', \'multiverseId\': 597575}, \'multiverseid\': 597575}, {\'name\': \'Banchetto di Sangue\', \'text\': \'Lancia questa magia solo se controlli due o più Vampiri.\\nDistruggi una creatura bersaglio. Guadagni 4 punti vita.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Il momento migliore di un matrimonio è il taglio della torta, seguito a ruota dal taglio del pasticcere."\\n—Olivia Voldaren\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597600&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'84ee4791-48d2-4d78-b436-b6d66fa51525\', \'multiverseId\': 597600}, \'multiverseid\': 597600}, {\'name\': \'血の饗宴\', \'text\': \'この呪文は、あなたが２体以上の吸血鬼をコントロールしていなければ唱えられない。\\nクリーチャー１体を対象とする。それを破壊する。あなたは４点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「結婚式一番の見せ場はケーキ入刀、僅差でケーキ職人入刀ね。」\\n――オリヴィア・ヴォルダーレン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597625&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2d53a799-f91b-4909-94c8-b8535fed1427\', \'multiverseId\': 597625}, \'multiverseid\': 597625}, {\'name\': \'鲜血盛宴\', \'text\': \'只能于你操控两个或更多吸血鬼时施放此咒语。\\n消灭目标生物。你获得4点生命。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「婚礼最精彩的环节非切蛋糕莫属，不过切蛋糕上的装饰也不错。」\\n～奥莉薇亚沃达连\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597700&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9c08c649-6d5e-4221-859f-56a06db63be3\', \'multiverseId\': 597700}, \'multiverseid\': 597700}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blutfliegenschwarm\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nDer Blutfliegenschwarm kommt mit zwei +1/+1-Marken ins Spiel.\\nImmer wenn eine andere Kreatur stirbt, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf den Blutfliegenschwarm.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Insekt\', \'flavor\': \'Trotz ihres Namens fressen sie auch gerne das Fleisch.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597534&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ca70041c-9785-4cbd-a2f9-cfa708acae69\', \'multiverseId\': 597534}, \'multiverseid\': 597534}, {\'name\': \'Enjambre de moscas de sangre\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nEl Enjambre de moscas de sangre entra al campo de batalla con dos contadores +1/+1 sobre él.\\nSiempre que otra criatura muera, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre el Enjambre de moscas de sangre.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Insecto\', \'flavor\': \'Al contrario de lo que pueda sugerir su nombre, no tienen ningún problema para devorar la carne.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597559&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5a1ec418-52e9-496f-9caa-a4149e10e60d\', \'multiverseId\': 597559}, \'multiverseid\': 597559}, {\'name\': "Essaim d\'hématovores", \'text\': "Vol\\nL\'Essaim d\'hématovores arrive sur le champ de bataille avec deux marqueurs +1/+1 sur lui.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'une autre créature meurt, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur l\'Essaim d\'hématovores.", \'type\': \'Créature : insecte\', \'flavor\': \'Contrairement à ce que peut laisser penser leur nom, ils dévorent aussi goulûment la chair.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597584&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4082106e-e76c-4356-9e05-a5b56bb47dac\', \'multiverseId\': 597584}, \'multiverseid\': 597584}, {\'name\': \'Sciame di Mosche Sanguinarie\', \'text\': "Volare\\nLo Sciame di Mosche Sanguinarie entra nel campo di battaglia con due segnalini +1/+1.\\nOgniqualvolta un\'altra creatura muore, metti un segnalino +1/+1 sullo Sciame di Mosche Sanguinarie.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Insetto\', \'flavor\': \'Nonostante il nome, sono prontissime a divorare anche la carne.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597609&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'99617113-8561-4e06-b520-1201544686eb\', \'multiverseId\': 597609}, \'multiverseid\': 597609}, {\'name\': \'血蠅の大群\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n血蠅の大群は＋１/＋１カウンター２個が置かれた状態で戦場に出る。\\nこれでないクリーチャー１体が死亡するたび、血蠅の大群の上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 昆虫\', \'flavor\': \'その名に反して、よろこんで肉も貪り喰う。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597634&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'71143e10-0df1-43ba-8499-b5f1de4b383e\', \'multiverseId\': 597634}, \'multiverseid\': 597634}, {\'name\': \'血蝇虫群\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n血蝇虫群进战场时上面有两个+1/+1指示物。\\n每当另一个生物死去时，在血蝇虫群上放置一个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～昆虫\', \'flavor\': \'虽然名为血蝇，但也很乐意吃肉。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597709&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'506cb26e-a826-49b1-9a9a-7cb7d5f33175\', \'multiverseId\': 597709}, \'multiverseid\': 597709}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blutkünstler\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn der Blutkünstler oder eine andere Kreatur stirbt, verliert ein Spieler deiner Wahl 1 Lebenspunkt, und du erhältst 1 Lebenspunkt dazu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vampir\', \'flavor\': \'„Nein! Alles falsch! Ich brauche mehr. Bringt mir mehr!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597524&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'39e465d1-5477-499e-b781-8f93cb6d6e84\', \'multiverseId\': 597524}, \'multiverseid\': 597524}, {\'name\': \'Artista de la sangre\', \'text\': \'Siempre que el Artista de la sangre u otra criatura muera, el jugador objetivo pierde 1 vida y tú ganas 1 vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Vampiro\', \'flavor\': \'"¡No! ¡Está todo mal! Necesito más. ¡Tráeme más!".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597549&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'42a6bfad-d486-4e17-833a-2fd7b12d4a82\', \'multiverseId\': 597549}, \'multiverseid\': 597549}, {\'name\': \'Artiste de sang\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que l\'Artiste de sang ou une autre créature meurt, un joueur ciblé perd 1 point de vie et vous gagnez 1 point de vie.", \'type\': \'Créature : vampire\', \'flavor\': "« Non ! Ça ne va pas du tout ! Il m\'en faut plus ! Apportez-m\'en plus ! »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597574&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f8ab1871-398d-4a99-8ec0-fb5174cf37eb\', \'multiverseId\': 597574}, \'multiverseid\': 597574}, {\'name\': \'Artista Sanguinario\', \'text\': "Ogniqualvolta l\'Artista Sanguinario o un\'altra creatura muore, un giocatore bersaglio perde 1 punto vita e tu guadagni 1 punto vita.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Vampiro\', \'flavor\': \'"No! È tutto sbagliato! Me ne serve altro. Portatemene ancora!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597599&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8be5d56f-4263-4de1-9353-c1bd00f62b4b\', \'multiverseId\': 597599}, \'multiverseid\': 597599}, {\'name\': \'血の芸術家\', \'text\': \'血の芸術家やこれでないクリーチャー１体が死亡するたび、プレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーは１点のライフを失い、あなたは１点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 吸血鬼\', \'flavor\': \'「ダメだ！全部ダメだ！もっとだ！もっと持って来い！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597624&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'99abc481-9666-4d2e-a660-aa4f66c27675\', \'multiverseId\': 597624}, \'multiverseid\': 597624}, {\'name\': \'鲜血画家\', \'text\': \'每当鲜血画家或另一个生物死去时，目标牌手失去1点生命且你获得1点生命。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～吸血鬼\', \'flavor\': \'「不对！全都不对！再多点。再给我多找点来！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597699&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cae92f9d-ce40-4f7c-849c-bedb78c81fdb\', \'multiverseId\': 597699}, \'multiverseid\': 597699}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blutlinien-Vortäuscher\', \'text\': \'Wandelwicht (Diese Karte hat alle Kreaturentypen.)\\nSowie der Blutlinien-Vortäuscher ins Spiel kommt, bestimme einen Kreaturentyp.\\nImmer wenn eine andere Kreatur des bestimmten Typs unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf den Blutlinien-Vortäuscher.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Gestaltwandler\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596261&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c68ca1d2-5f9a-4db0-af27-3f1f135f6689\', \'multiverseId\': 596261}, \'multiverseid\': 596261}, {\'name\': \'Farsante de linaje\', \'text\': \'Cambiaformas. (Esta carta es de todos los tipos de criatura.)\\nEn cuanto el Farsante de linaje entre al campo de batalla, elige un tipo de criatura.\\nSiempre que otra criatura del tipo elegido entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre el Farsante de linaje.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Metamorfo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596348&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fd4c64a4-3e20-490e-a760-6565f0de1d44\', \'multiverseId\': 596348}, \'multiverseid\': 596348}, {\'name\': \'Prétendant à la lignée\', \'text\': "Changelin (Cette carte a tous les types de créature.)\\nAu moment où le Prétendant à la lignée arrive sur le champ de bataille, choisissez un type de créature.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'une autre créature du type choisi arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur le Prétendant à la lignée.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : changeforme\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596435&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f2586b91-1ce3-458e-bce9-22e4230b1956\', \'multiverseId\': 596435}, \'multiverseid\': 596435}, {\'name\': \'Usurpatore della Stirpe\', \'text\': "Cangiante (Questa carta ha tutti i tipi di creatura.)\\nMentre l\'Usurpatore della Stirpe entra nel campo di battaglia, scegli un tipo di creatura.\\nOgniqualvolta un\'altra creatura del tipo scelto entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, metti un segnalino +1/+1 sull\'Usurpatore della Stirpe.", \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Polimorfo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596522&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b30a65a3-04af-40e6-9fb9-2d1510e06109\', \'multiverseId\': 596522}, \'multiverseid\': 596522}, {\'name\': \'血統詐称者\', \'text\': \'多相（このカードはすべてのクリーチャー・タイプである。）\\n血統詐称者が戦場に出るに際し、クリーチャー・タイプ１つを選ぶ。\\nその選ばれたタイプでありこれでないクリーチャー１体があなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、血統詐称者の上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 多相の戦士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596609&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5c912113-def0-48b6-b5bb-fdf411233523\', \'multiverseId\': 596609}, \'multiverseid\': 596609}, {\'name\': \'血脉顶替客\', \'text\': \'化形（此牌是所有生物类别。）\\n于血脉顶替客进战场时，选择一种生物类别。\\n每当另一个该类别之生物在你的操控下进战场时，在血脉顶替客上放置一个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～变形兽\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596870&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'13903638-7081-42e0-8923-3fe7bb0cffb3\', \'multiverseId\': 596870}, \'multiverseid\': 596870}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blutpranke, Schrecken von Qal Sisma\', \'text\': \'Kreaturenzauber mit Stärke 4 oder mehr, die du wirkst, kosten beim Wirken {2} weniger.\\nImmer wenn Blutpranke, Schrecken von Qal Sisma, angreift, erhält jede Kreatur mit Stärke 4 oder mehr, die du kontrollierst, +1/+1 und verursacht Trampelschaden bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Bär\', \'flavor\': \'Du willst nicht wissen, wie sie zu ihrem Namen gekommen ist.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592867&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b3139603-c0a0-4f15-a08e-1ce1bb567cc7\', \'multiverseId\': 592867}, \'multiverseid\': 592867}, {\'name\': \'Zarpasangrienta, Terror de Qal Sisma\', \'text\': \'Te cuesta {2} menos lanzar los hechizos de criatura con fuerza de 4 o más.\\nSiempre que Zarpasangrienta, Terror de Qal Sisma ataque, cada criatura que controlas con fuerza de 4 o más obtiene +1/+1 y gana la habilidad de arrollar hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Oso\', \'flavor\': \'No quieres saber por qué le pusieron ese nombre.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592988&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4b34d9f5-53f2-47e9-ad8b-c164b222e296\', \'multiverseId\': 592988}, \'multiverseid\': 592988}, {\'name\': \'Griffeboyaux, terreur de Qal Sisma\', \'text\': "Les sorts de créature de force supérieure ou égale à 4 que vous lancez coûtent {2} de moins à lancer.\\nÀ chaque fois que Griffeboyaux, terreur de Qal Sisma attaque, chaque créature de force supérieure ou égale à 4 que vous contrôlez gagne +1/+1 et acquiert le piétinement jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : ours\', \'flavor\': "Mieux vaut ne pas savoir d\'où lui vient ce surnom.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593109&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'692164bc-1719-4f8a-9b91-98f9181e8b8b\', \'multiverseId\': 593109}, \'multiverseid\': 593109}, {\'name\': \'Squarciagrinfia, Terrore di Qal Sisma\', \'text\': \'Le magie creatura che lanci con forza pari o superiore a 4 costano {2} in meno per essere lanciate.\\nOgniqualvolta Squarciagrinfia, Terrore di Qal Sisma attacca, ogni creatura che controlli con forza pari o superiore a 4 prende +1/+1 e ha travolgere fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Orso\', \'flavor\': \'Meglio non chiedere come abbia meritato un nome del genere.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593230&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'166ac6a5-8cb0-4ef7-a8d1-cf341837d86a\', \'multiverseId\': 593230}, \'multiverseid\': 593230}, {\'name\': \'カル・シスマの恐怖、殺し爪\', \'text\': \'あなたがパワーが４以上であるクリーチャー・呪文を唱えるためのコストは{2}少なくなる。\\nカル・シスマの恐怖、殺し爪が攻撃するたび、ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールしていてパワーが４以上であるすべてのクリーチャーは＋１/＋１の修整を受けトランプルを得る。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 熊\', \'flavor\': \'彼女の名前の由来は知らない方がいいでしょう。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593351&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'168e03dc-41ce-4358-9155-7a361c911a12\', \'multiverseId\': 593351}, \'multiverseid\': 593351}, {\'name\': \'黑山之威血爪\', \'text\': \'你施放之力量等于或大于4的生物咒语减少{2}来施放。\\n每当黑山之威血爪攻击时，直到回合结束，每个由你操控且力量等于或大于4的生物均得+1/+1且获得践踏异能。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～熊\', \'flavor\': \'你不会想知道她因何得名。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593714&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'36cf18f8-70e3-4939-8dfc-3f842d00c96b\', \'multiverseId\': 593714}, \'multiverseid\': 593714}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blutpreis\', \'text\': \'Schaue dir die obersten vier Karten deiner Bibliothek an. Nimm zwei davon auf deine Hand und lege den Rest in beliebiger Reihenfolge unter deine Bibliothek. Du verlierst 2 Lebenspunkte.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Blut ist die älteste Währung.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594036&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'44e70557-41f6-4875-9301-f7702caba8a8\', \'multiverseId\': 594036}, \'multiverseid\': 594036}, {\'name\': \'Precio sangriento\', \'text\': \'Mira las cuatro primeras cartas de tu biblioteca. Pon dos de ellas en tu mano y el resto en el fondo de tu biblioteca en cualquier orden. Pierdes 2 vidas.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'La sangre es la divisa más antigua.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594153&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d64e26b7-909f-4bf9-bfe8-9682dd9fc3d1\', \'multiverseId\': 594153}, \'multiverseid\': 594153}, {\'name\': \'Prix du sang\', \'text\': "Regardez les quatre cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Mettez deux d\'entre elles dans votre main et le reste au-dessous de votre bibliothèque, dans l\'ordre de votre choix. Vous perdez 2 points de vie.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Le sang est la monnaie d\'échange la plus ancienne.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594270&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2e12653d-8416-44dd-9450-16e493485ab7\', \'multiverseId\': 594270}, \'multiverseid\': 594270}, {\'name\': \'Prezzo di Sangue\', \'text\': \'Guarda le prime quattro carte del tuo grimorio. Aggiungine due alla tua mano e metti le altre in fondo al tuo grimorio in qualsiasi ordine. Perdi 2 punti vita.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'Il sangue è la moneta più antica.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594387&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'17e8d59a-6818-450d-9e34-cd4fa5716bea\', \'multiverseId\': 594387}, \'multiverseid\': 594387}, {\'name\': \'血の対価\', \'text\': \'あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード４枚を見る。そのうち２枚をあなたの手札に、残りをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に望む順番で置く。あなたは２点のライフを失う。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'血は最も古い通貨である。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594504&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0b5352e3-9b76-4d07-b80d-ef941b7c1d23\', \'multiverseId\': 594504}, \'multiverseid\': 594504}, {\'name\': \'鲜血代价\', \'text\': \'检视你牌库顶的四张牌。将其中两张置于你手上，其余则以任意顺序置于你的牌库底。你失去2点生命。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'鲜血是最古老的货币。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594855&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'141b8a43-7af8-4589-874a-7a56e6044531\', \'multiverseId\': 594855}, \'multiverseid\': 594855}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blutrausch-Aspirant\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du eine bleibende Karte opferst, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf den Blutrausch-Aspiranten.\\n{1}{R}, {T}, opfere eine Kreatur oder eine Verzauberung: Der Blutrausch-Aspirant fügt einer Kreatur deiner Wahl 1 Schadenspunkt zu. Die Kreatur kann in diesem Zug nicht blocken.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Satyr, Berserker\', \'flavor\': \'Vom Fest zum Blutbad ist es nur ein kleiner Schritt.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590209&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'beebe2a3-e1ac-4724-9438-921440154402\', \'multiverseId\': 590209}, \'multiverseid\': 590209}, {\'name\': \'Aspirante a la sangre\', \'text\': \'Siempre que sacrifiques un permanente, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre el Aspirante a la sangre.\\n{1}{R}, {T}, sacrificar una criatura o un encantamiento: El Aspirante a la sangre hace 1 punto de daño a la criatura objetivo. Esa criatura no puede bloquear este turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Berserker sátiro\', \'flavor\': \'De la juerga al baño de sangre solo hay un paso.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590344&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'18ba7984-8806-4776-93fc-611cee5bb086\', \'multiverseId\': 590344}, \'multiverseid\': 590344}, {\'name\': \'Aspirant de sang\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que vous sacrifiez un permanent, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur l\'Aspirant de sang.\\n{1}{R}, {T}, sacrifiez une créature ou un enchantement : L\'Aspirant de sang inflige 1 blessure à une créature ciblée. Cette créature ne peut pas bloquer ce tour-ci.", \'type\': \'Créature : satyre et berserker\', \'flavor\': "Il n\'y a qu\'un pas entre festivités et bain de sang.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590479&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0e48eef1-fb37-4693-8fe2-f22c59db2440\', \'multiverseId\': 590479}, \'multiverseid\': 590479}, {\'name\': \'Aspirante Sanguinario\', \'text\': "Ogniqualvolta sacrifichi un permanente, metti un segnalino +1/+1 sull\'Aspirante Sanguinario.\\n{1}{R}, {T}, Sacrifica una creatura o un incantesimo: L\'Aspirante Sanguinario infligge 1 danno a una creatura bersaglio. Quella creatura non può bloccare in questo turno.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Berserker Satiro\', \'flavor\': \'Da un baccanale a un bagno di sangue, il passo è breve.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590614&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e6b46d9e-c265-4fb6-9486-b1744609c550\', \'multiverseId\': 590614}, \'multiverseid\': 590614}, {\'name\': \'血の野心家\', \'text\': \'あなたがパーマネント１つを生け贄に捧げるたび、血の野心家の上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。\\n{1}{R}, {T}, クリーチャーやエンチャントのうち１つを生け贄に捧げる：クリーチャー１体を対象とする。血の野心家はそれに１点のダメージを与える。このターン、そのクリーチャーではブロックできない。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — サテュロス・狂戦士\', \'flavor\': \'悪ふざけと大虐殺は紙一重。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590749&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d13a2b09-fd6d-4614-9047-85f7f2f7a262\', \'multiverseId\': 590749}, \'multiverseid\': 590749}, {\'name\': \'鲜血求索客\', \'text\': \'每当你牺牲一个永久物时，在鲜血求索客上放置一个+1/+1指示物。\\n{1}{R}，{T}，牺牲一个生物或结界：鲜血求索客对目标生物造成1点伤害。该生物本回合不能进行阻挡。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～羊蹄人／狂战士\', \'flavor\': \'从狂欢盛宴到血色浸染不过一步之遥。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591154&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'359d5379-57ee-42cf-a517-84057b9b9810\', \'multiverseId\': 591154}, \'multiverseid\': 591154}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blutschleier-Vielfraß\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du deine zweite Karte innerhalb desselben Zuges ziehst, erhält der Blutschleier-Vielfraß +1/+1 und Erstschlag bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vielfraß\', \'flavor\': \'„Legt einen Graben an. Wenn wir Glück haben, kann er nicht schwimmen."\\n—Syr Branigan, Ritter von Ardenthal\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590210&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'474ef138-6e45-4d70-8709-227a04f08684\', \'multiverseId\': 590210}, \'multiverseid\': 590210}, {\'name\': \'Glotón sangrebruma\', \'text\': \'Siempre que robes tu segunda carta cada turno, el Glotón sangrebruma obtiene +1/+1 y gana la habilidad de dañar primero hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Glotón\', \'flavor\': \'"Construye un foso. Si tenemos suerte, no sabrá nadar".\\n—Syr Branigan, caballero del Valle de Arden\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590345&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e5d2e4d7-2432-49e6-a2d4-95351396aadd\', \'multiverseId\': 590345}, \'multiverseid\': 590345}, {\'name\': \'Glouton fièvresang\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que vous piochez votre deuxième carte à chaque tour, le Glouton fièvresang gagne +1/+1 et acquiert l\'initiative jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : glouton\', \'flavor\': "« Creusez des douves. Avec un peu de chance, il ne sait pas nager. »\\n—Syr Branigan, chevalier d\'Ardenval", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590480&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'252d5dc8-e3f7-4a3b-b5ce-e7a8cfeb762f\', \'multiverseId\': 590480}, \'multiverseid\': 590480}, {\'name\': \'Ghiottone della Bruma Sanguinaria\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta peschi la tua seconda carta in ogni turno, il Ghiottone della Bruma Sanguinaria prende +1/+1 e ha attacco improvviso fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Ghiottone\', \'flavor\': \'"Scava un fossato. Se siamo fortunati, non sa nuotare."\\n—Syr Branigan, cavaliere di Ardenvalle\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590615&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'43774304-2982-4310-b921-6e75af328ecd\', \'multiverseId\': 590615}, \'multiverseid\': 590615}, {\'name\': \'血霞のクズリ\', \'text\': \'あなたが各ターン内のあなたの２枚目のカードを引くたび、ターン終了時まで、血霞のクズリは＋１/＋１の修整を受け先制攻撃を得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — クズリ\', \'flavor\': \'「濠を作れ。ひょっとしたら、あいつは泳げないかもしれない。」\\n――アーデンベイルの騎士、ブラニガン卿\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590750&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b2272e76-7ecb-42d4-838f-f31152ac1109\', \'multiverseId\': 590750}, \'multiverseid\': 590750}, {\'name\': \'血迷狼獾\', \'text\': \'每当你抓每回合中你的第二张牌时，直到回合结束，血迷狼獾得+1/+1且获得先攻异能。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～狼獾\', \'flavor\': \'「建条护城河。如果运气好的话，它游不了泳。」\\n～雅登瓦骑士，巴尼根爵士\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591155&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b9be1f40-ce4c-432f-b761-b7095a713ea1\', \'multiverseId\': 591155}, \'multiverseid\': 591155}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blutschwelger\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du Lebenspunkte dazuerhältst, verliert jeder Gegner 1 Lebenspunkt.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vampir\', \'flavor\': \'„Fleischig mit einem Hauch von Leder. Ein guter Jahrgang."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594068&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8ec6d8c2-8486-456d-850c-949a27e99699\', \'multiverseId\': 594068}, \'multiverseid\': 594068}, {\'name\': \'Sibarita de la sangre\', \'text\': \'Siempre que ganes vidas, cada oponente pierde 1 vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Vampiro\', \'flavor\': \'"Sabor con cuerpo y suaves notas de piel. Cosecha añeja, sin duda".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594185&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7ab40a0f-99eb-4232-b5ad-28947726f107\', \'multiverseId\': 594185}, \'multiverseid\': 594185}, {\'name\': \'Épicurien du sang\', \'text\': \'À chaque fois que vous gagnez des points de vie, chaque adversaire perd 1 point de vie.\', \'type\': \'Créature : vampire\', \'flavor\': \'« Il a du corps, avec un léger bouquet de cuir. Un grand cru. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594302&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fdbda3a6-20ed-4a05-bc16-338c0a93107f\', \'multiverseId\': 594302}, \'multiverseid\': 594302}, {\'name\': \'Epicureo del Sangue\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta guadagni punti vita, ogni avversario perde 1 punto vita.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Vampiro\', \'flavor\': \'"Carnoso, con una leggera nota di cuoio. Ottima annata."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594419&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c8cc9505-9e96-4fab-969c-c01cdb00ced1\', \'multiverseId\': 594419}, \'multiverseid\': 594419}, {\'name\': \'血の美食家\', \'text\': \'あなたがライフを得るたび、各対戦相手はそれぞれ１点のライフを失う。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 吸血鬼\', \'flavor\': \'「重厚で、かすかな皮の香り。上物だ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594536&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9903f507-77a8-4fc5-baac-b794810db750\', \'multiverseId\': 594536}, \'multiverseid\': 594536}, {\'name\': \'鲜血饕客\', \'text\': \'每当你获得生命时，每位对手各失去1点生命。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～吸血鬼\', \'flavor\': \'「肉香浓郁，稍带一丝皮味。实属佳酿。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594887&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b4e9426c-e267-4bdd-9e8f-c03bc05321bb\', \'multiverseId\': 594887}, \'multiverseid\': 594887}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blutspurensucher\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\n{B}, bezahle 2 Lebenspunkte: Lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf den Blutspurensucher.\\nWenn der Blutspurensucher das Spiel verlässt, ziehe für jede +1/+1-Marke auf ihm eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vampir, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': \'„Lauf schnell davon. Je mehr du dich verausgabst, desto stärker spüre ich deinen Herzschlag."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594039&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'75144396-1e72-4d3c-8584-5fba1f7fa2cb\', \'multiverseId\': 594039}, \'multiverseid\': 594039}, {\'name\': \'Rastreasangre\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\n{B}, pagar 2 vidas: Pon un contador +1/+1 sobre el Rastreasangre.\\nCuando el Rastreasangre deje el campo de batalla, roba una carta por cada contador +1/+1 sobre él.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero vampiro\', \'flavor\': \'"Huye todo lo que quieras. Cuanto más corres, mejor se oye el latido de tu corazón".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594156&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0481ec72-5414-4937-b63d-a70c95cafa8b\', \'multiverseId\': 594156}, \'multiverseid\': 594156}, {\'name\': \'Traqueur de sang\', \'text\': \'Vol\\n{B}, payez 2 points de vie : Mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur le Traqueur de sang.\\nQuand le Traqueur de sang quitte le champ de bataille, piochez une carte pour chaque marqueur +1/+1 sur lui.\', \'type\': \'Créature : vampire et sorcier\', \'flavor\': \'« Fuyez si vous voulez. Plus vous courez, plus je sens battre votre cœur. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594273&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8030a396-9dea-4862-bf04-fb29f421c286\', \'multiverseId\': 594273}, \'multiverseid\': 594273}, {\'name\': \'Braccasangue\', \'text\': \'Volare\\n{B}, Paga 2 punti vita: Metti un segnalino +1/+1 sul Braccasangue.\\nQuando il Braccasangue lascia il campo di battaglia, pesca una carta per ogni segnalino +1/+1 su di esso.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Mago Vampiro\', \'flavor\': \'"Scappa pure... Più lontano corri, più chiaramente avverto il battito del tuo cuore."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594390&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c47f8993-1d9e-4028-b2b7-8274272854f1\', \'multiverseId\': 594390}, \'multiverseid\': 594390}, {\'name\': \'心臓追い\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n{B},２点のライフを支払う：心臓追いの上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。\\n心臓追いが戦場を離れたとき、これの上にある＋１/＋１カウンター１個につき１枚のカードを引く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 吸血鬼・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': \'「どこへなりと逃げるがいい。遠くまで走るほど、お前の鼓動をはっきり感じるからな。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594507&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1b36198a-5714-4dbb-85ea-49769aa31b13\', \'multiverseId\': 594507}, \'multiverseid\': 594507}, {\'name\': \'溯血师\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n{B}，支付2点生命：在溯血师上放置一个+1/+1指示物。\\n当溯血师离开战场时，其上每有一个+1/+1指示物，便抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～吸血鬼／法术师\', \'flavor\': \'「要逃跑就请便。你跑得越远，我就越能确切地感受到你的心跳。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594858&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c624232c-d732-4e04-94bb-932004509324\', \'multiverseId\': 594858}, \'multiverseid\': 594858}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blätterdach-Baloth\', \'text\': \'Landung — Immer wenn ein Land unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, erhält der Blätterdach-Baloth +2/+2 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Bestie\', \'flavor\': \'„Man kann fast sehen, wie er abwägt — sind wir schmackhaft genug, um den Sprung zu riskieren?"\\n—Samila aus Murasas Expeditionsgildenhaus\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592837&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'065fe639-6cbd-4ba8-9323-e7730fcb6f17\', \'multiverseId\': 592837}, \'multiverseid\': 592837}, {\'name\': \'Báloth de la enramada\', \'text\': \'Aterrizaje — Siempre que una tierra entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, el Báloth de la enramada obtiene +2/+2 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bestia\', \'flavor\': \'"Es obvio lo que está deliberando: ¿seremos lo suficientemente sabrosos como para arriesgarse a saltar?".\\n—Samila, Casa expedicionaria de Murasa\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592958&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'68b04b2e-a0da-4148-8895-aefe05454fb2\', \'multiverseId\': 592958}, \'multiverseid\': 592958}, {\'name\': \'Baloth de la canopée\', \'text\': "Toucheterre — À chaque fois qu\'un terrain arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, le Baloth de la canopée gagne +2/+2 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : bête\', \'flavor\': \'« On arrive presque à le voir réfléchir, en train de se demander si nous sommes assez bons à grignoter pour justifier ce bond risqué. »\\n—Samila, corps expéditionnaire de Murasa\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593079&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fcf9c2e2-32bf-4c24-b0a9-ffd2d596e758\', \'multiverseId\': 593079}, \'multiverseid\': 593079}, {\'name\': \'Baloth delle Frasche\', \'text\': \'Terraferma — Ogniqualvolta una terra entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, il Baloth delle Frasche prende +2/+2 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Bestia\', \'flavor\': \'"Riesco quasi a vedere che sta valutando se siamo un boccone abbastanza gustoso da rischiare il salto."\\n—Samila, Casa di Spedizioni di Murasa\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593200&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4e62a1be-53d5-4cc0-86e8-3b34ae39d36f\', \'multiverseId\': 593200}, \'multiverseid\': 593200}, {\'name\': \'梢のベイロス\', \'text\': \'上陸 ― 土地１つがあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、ターン終了時まで、梢のベイロスは＋２/＋２の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ビースト\', \'flavor\': \'「あれが迷っているのが分かるでしょう。ジャンプの危険に見合うほど私たちがおいしいかどうか考えているのよ。」\\n――ムラーサ探検協会のサミーラ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593321&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3d1b409c-75b2-433f-a511-3aeb970219b7\', \'multiverseId\': 593321}, \'multiverseid\': 593321}, {\'name\': \'林冠巴洛西\', \'text\': \'地落～每当一个地在你的操控下进战场时，林冠巴洛西得+2/+2直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～野兽\', \'flavor\': \'「你甚至能察觉到它在仔细盘算～我们是否美味到值得它冒险扑过来？」\\n～姆拉撒探险队的莎米勒\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593684&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1d5f5d8f-98ad-465c-bc5e-e7213d7a09da\', \'multiverseId\': 593684}, \'multiverseid\': 593684}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bogardanisches Drachenherz\', \'text\': \'Opfere eine andere Kreatur: Bis zum Ende des Zuges wird das Bogardanische Drachenherz zu einem Drachen mit Basis-Stärke und -Widerstandskraft 4/4, Flugfähigkeit und Eile.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Schamane\', \'flavor\': \'Sein Verlangen nach den Weiten der Lüfte muss gestillt werden.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590211&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'06d8b600-dbb7-4b64-8beb-3f7810750632\', \'multiverseId\': 590211}, \'multiverseid\': 590211}, {\'name\': \'Dracomorfo de Bogardan\', \'text\': \'Sacrificar otra criatura: Hasta el final del turno, el Dracomorfo de Bogardan se convierte en un Dragón con fuerza y resistencia base de 4/4 y las habilidades de volar y prisa.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Chamán humano\', \'flavor\': \'Tal ansia de volar debe ser colmada.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590346&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3141cde1-2eec-4e67-8eb2-50a3df9f5a33\', \'multiverseId\': 590346}, \'multiverseid\': 590346}, {\'name\': \'Cœur-dragon du Bogardân\', \'text\': "Sacrifiez une autre créature : Jusqu\'à la fin du tour, le Cœur-dragon du Bogardân devient un dragon avec une force et une endurance de base de 4/4, le vol et la célérité.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et shamane\', \'flavor\': "Une soif d\'envol doit être assouvie.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590481&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fe3bf55b-7eb6-4102-b44a-aafe7336d971\', \'multiverseId\': 590481}, \'multiverseid\': 590481}, {\'name\': \'Dragospirito di Bogardan\', \'text\': "Sacrifica un\'altra creatura: Fino alla fine del turno, il Dragospirito di Bogardan diventa un Drago con forza e costituzione base 4/4, volare e rapidità.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Sciamano Umano\', \'flavor\': \'Impossibile non soddisfare la voglia di volare.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590616&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e27a745b-f278-487d-b60a-c3c1998bbab1\', \'multiverseId\': 590616}, \'multiverseid\': 590616}, {\'name\': \'ボガーダンの龍心\', \'text\': \'これでないクリーチャー１体を生け贄に捧げる：ターン終了時まで、ボガーダンの龍心は飛行と速攻を持ち基本のパワーとタフネスが４/４のドラゴンになる。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・シャーマン\', \'flavor\': \'飛翔への渇望は満たさねばならない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590751&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bc58a054-3b3e-4234-bc7a-ed2b9b128431\', \'multiverseId\': 590751}, \'multiverseid\': 590751}, {\'name\': \'博卡登化龙师\', \'text\': \'牺牲另一个生物：直到回合结束，博卡登化龙师成为基础力量与防御力为4/4，具飞行与敏捷异能的龙。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／祭师\', \'flavor\': \'一飞冲天的渴望必须得到满足。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591156&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c3b1a180-d21d-48aa-8231-b9e8162c0071\', \'multiverseId\': 591156}, \'multiverseid\': 591156}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bombardierender Oger\', \'text\': \'{T}, opfere ein Artefakt: Der Bombardierende Oger fügt einem Ziel deiner Wahl 2 Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Oger, Krieger\', \'flavor\': \'Die Elfen hatten sich unzählige Strategien zurechtgelegt, wie sie gegen Memnarchs Kriegsmaschinen kämpfen wollten, aber sie wussten nicht, was sie tun sollten, als eine nach ihnen *geworfen* wurde.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590204&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9d4568d3-ea16-4606-af22-d589efcf0422\', \'multiverseId\': 590204}, \'multiverseid\': 590204}, {\'name\': \'Ogro de la andanada\', \'text\': \'{T}, sacrificar un artefacto: El Ogro de la andanada hace 2 puntos de daño a cualquier objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero ogro\', \'flavor\': \'Los elfos crearon infinitas estrategias para combatir las máquinas de guerra de Memnarch, pero no tenían ni idea de qué hacer cuando les *arrojaban* una.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590339&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3c892acb-05e8-468c-8ea0-e360a60ba171\', \'multiverseId\': 590339}, \'multiverseid\': 590339}, {\'name\': \'Ogre de barrage\', \'text\': "{T}, sacrifiez un artefact : L\'Ogre de barrage inflige 2 blessures à n\'importe quelle cible.", \'type\': \'Créature : ogre et guerrier\', \'flavor\': \'Les elfes avaient mis au point de multiples stratégies pour combattre les machines de guerre de Memnarch, mais ils ne savaient pas comment réagir quand on leur en *lançait* une.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590474&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'88eaf6eb-5310-4e03-832e-e51bd891600b\', \'multiverseId\': 590474}, \'multiverseid\': 590474}, {\'name\': \'Ogre di Sbarramento\', \'text\': "{T}, Sacrifica un artefatto: L\'Ogre di Sbarramento infligge 2 danni a un qualsiasi bersaglio.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Ogre\', \'flavor\': \'Gli elfi avevano escogitato innumerevoli strategie per combattere le macchine da guerra di Memnarch, ma non seppero cosa fare quando ne fu *scagliata* una contro di loro.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590609&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0c06225f-1980-4d44-b689-2d3a2d68c664\', \'multiverseId\': 590609}, \'multiverseid\': 590609}, {\'name\': \'連射のオーガ\', \'text\': \'{T}, アーティファクト１つを生け贄に捧げる：クリーチャーやプレインズウォーカーやプレイヤーのうち１つを対象とする。連射のオーガはそれに２点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — オーガ・戦士\', \'flavor\': \'エルフはメムナークの戦闘機械との戦術を数え切れないほど考案してきたが、それを投げつけられた時に何をすればいいかはまったく分からなかった。**\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590744&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'38cfe99d-dd3e-4db5-9b03-43e0fa9360b6\', \'multiverseId\': 590744}, \'multiverseid\': 590744}, {\'name\': \'猛掷食人魔\', \'text\': \'{T}，牺牲一个神器：猛掷食人魔对任意一个目标造成2点伤害。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～食人魔／战士\', \'flavor\': \'妖精发明了无数策略来对付蒙纳坷的战斗机械，但他们不知该如何应付给*丢*过来的。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591149&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fe700c26-71c7-450d-bfd5-238880f7acc4\', \'multiverseId\': 591149}, \'multiverseid\': 591149}]', '[{\'name\': \'Borstiges Wildschwein\', \'text\': \'Das Borstige Wildschwein kann nicht von mehr als einer Kreatur geblockt werden.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Wildschwein\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich kann in Zagoth alles besiegen, doch manche Beute liefert zu viel Kampf und zu wenig Fleisch."\\n—Meisterjäger Chevill\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592834&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0b3bc245-fd17-45ed-9a29-4e4f90fb2e84\', \'multiverseId\': 592834}, \'multiverseid\': 592834}, {\'name\': \'Jabalí encrespado\', \'text\': \'El Jabalí encrespado no puede ser bloqueado por más de una criatura.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Jabalí\', \'flavor\': \'"Puedo acabar con cualquier cosa de Zagoth, pero hay presas contra las que hay que luchar demasiado para la carne que se obtiene".\\n—Chevill, maestro cazador\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592955&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8abb94ed-0e02-432b-b63c-68c9de58074e\', \'multiverseId\': 592955}, \'multiverseid\': 592955}, {\'name\': \'Sanglier hérissé\', \'text\': "Le Sanglier hérissé ne peut pas être bloqué par plus d\'une créature.", \'type\': \'Créature : sanglier\', \'flavor\': "« Je peux chasser n\'importe quelle bête de Zagoth, mais certaines sont trop coriaces pour que ça en vaille la peine. »\\n—Maître chasseur Chévill", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593076&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'075ab5c1-2310-4776-bcdc-368f4a8ce996\', \'multiverseId\': 593076}, \'multiverseid\': 593076}, {\'name\': \'Cinghiale Irsuto\', \'text\': \'Il Cinghiale Irsuto non può essere bloccato da più di una creatura.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Cinghiale\', \'flavor\': \'"Posso abbattere qualsiasi creatura di Zagoth, ma per alcune prede il rapporto tra lotta e carne è troppo alto."\\n—Maestro di caccia Chevill\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593197&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0401a361-98b0-4739-9f8e-a279f471af8b\', \'multiverseId\': 593197}, \'multiverseid\': 593197}, {\'name\': \'逆毛の猪\', \'text\': \'逆毛の猪は、２体以上のクリーチャーにはブロックされない。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 猪\', \'flavor\': \'「ゼイゴスにいるものなら何だって仕留められるが、中には肉が苦労に見合わない獲物もいるんでな。」\\n――練達の狩人、チェビル\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593318&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5bb201ad-0a50-4a75-9df4-67f73bf1d882\', \'multiverseId\': 593318}, \'multiverseid\': 593318}, {\'name\': \'鬃毛野猪\', \'text\': \'鬃毛野猪不能被多于一个生物阻挡。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～野猪\', \'flavor\': \'「札苟斯境内一切怪兽都不是我对手，但有些猎物之肉量贴补不上所耗损的搏斗精力。」\\n～狩猎大师车维尔\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593681&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a618805f-ed59-44e9-9f16-7908c4cc99b9\', \'multiverseId\': 593681}, \'multiverseid\': 593681}]', '[{\'name\': \'Boshafter Schelm\', \'text\': \'Solange es dein Zug ist, hat der Boshafte Schelm Erstschlag.\\nImmer wenn eine andere Kreatur stirbt, fügt der Boshafte Schelm einem Spieler oder Planeswalker deiner Wahl 1 Schadenspunkt zu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Teufel\', \'flavor\': \'Der Teufel wusste die Ironie zu schätzen, Tauben als Munition zu verwenden. Die Stadtbewohner nicht so sehr.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590314&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4afd9b97-e27d-4be5-98e0-1d3669d10f7f\', \'multiverseId\': 590314}, \'multiverseid\': 590314}, {\'name\': \'Bromista malévolo\', \'text\': \'Mientras sea tu turno, el Bromista malévolo tiene la habilidad de dañar primero.\\nSiempre que otra criatura muera, el Bromista malévolo hace 1 punto de daño al jugador o planeswalker objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Diablo\', \'flavor\': \'Al diablo le hizo gracia la ironía de usar palomas como munición. A los ciudadanos... no tanta.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590449&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cb0f23a2-fdd9-4375-b8a4-5eda685fcb5d\', \'multiverseId\': 590449}, \'multiverseid\': 590449}, {\'name\': \'Plaisantin malveillant\', \'text\': "Tant que c\'est votre tour, le Plaisantin malveillant a l\'initiative.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'une autre créature meurt, le Plaisantin malveillant inflige 1 blessure à une cible, joueur ou planeswalker.", \'type\': \'Créature : diable\', \'flavor\': "Le diable appréciait l\'ironie de se servir de colombes comme munitions. Les villageois, beaucoup moins.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590584&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c45b6453-b79a-45e3-87b5-c500ae39706b\', \'multiverseId\': 590584}, \'multiverseid\': 590584}, {\'name\': \'Burlone Astioso\', \'text\': "Fintanto che è il tuo turno, il Burlone Astioso ha attacco improvviso.\\nOgniqualvolta un\'altra creatura muore, il Burlone Astioso infligge 1 danno a un giocatore o a un planeswalker bersaglio.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Diavolo\', \'flavor\': "Il diavolo gradì l\'ironia di usare colombe come munizioni. Gli abitanti del villaggio non lo trovarono così divertente.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590719&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9253f33e-c61c-4a8b-8fd2-c0f00ac10698\', \'multiverseId\': 590719}, \'multiverseid\': 590719}, {\'name\': \'悪意あるいたずら者\', \'text\': \'あなたのターンであるかぎり、悪意あるいたずら者は先制攻撃を持つ。\\nこれでないクリーチャー１体が死亡するたび、プレイヤーやプレインズウォーカーのうち１つを対象とする。悪意あるいたずら者はそれに１点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — デビル\', \'flavor\': \'鳩を弾に使うという皮肉を、この悪魔はことのほか気に入っていた。街の人々はそうでもなかった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590854&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7e43dadf-6a0f-4228-9789-f6fe5ae8cc22\', \'multiverseId\': 590854}, \'multiverseid\': 590854}, {\'name\': \'怨毒捣乱魔\', \'text\': \'只要是在你的回合中，怨毒捣乱魔便具有先攻异能。\\n每当另一个生物死去时，怨毒捣乱魔对目标牌手或鹏洛客造成1点伤害。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～魔鬼\', \'flavor\': \'魔鬼自认化白鸽为战火是项绝妙讽刺。但镇民就不太吃这套。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591259&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d13fb472-6b73-4d60-99e7-f8dc928ce0da\', \'multiverseId\': 591259}, \'multiverseid\': 591259}]', '[{\'name\': \'Brackgeborener Meuchler\', \'text\': \'Aufblitzen\\nImmer wenn du während des Zuges eines Gegners einen Zauberspruch wirkst, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf den Brackgeborenen Meuchler.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Meervolk, Pirat\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich greife immer von dort an, wo sie mich mit einem Fernrohr nicht sehen können."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595204&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b3da422e-2e76-4fc6-8a2a-47c38402133c\', \'multiverseId\': 595204}, \'multiverseid\': 595204}, {\'name\': \'Degollador salobre\', \'text\': \'Destello.\\nSiempre que lances un hechizo durante el turno de un oponente, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre el Degollador salobre.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Pirata tritón\', \'flavor\': \'"Siempre ataco por donde no me ven los catalejos".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595312&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'844a350f-d492-4063-992c-6e5cc2054778\', \'multiverseId\': 595312}, \'multiverseid\': 595312}, {\'name\': \'Surineur né des embruns\', \'text\': "Flash\\nÀ chaque fois que vous lancez un sort pendant le tour d\'un adversaire, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur le Surineur né des embruns.", \'type\': \'Créature : ondin et pirate\', \'flavor\': "« J\'attaque toujours par un endroit invisible à leurs longues-vues. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595420&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'97407802-9e0f-40f9-a451-6f8149459fe5\', \'multiverseId\': 595420}, \'multiverseid\': 595420}, {\'name\': \'Tagliagole Salmastride\', \'text\': \'Lampo\\nOgniqualvolta lanci una magia durante il turno di un avversario, metti un segnalino +1/+1 sul Tagliagole Salmastride.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Pirata Tritone\', \'flavor\': \'"Attacco sempre da dove i loro cannocchiali non possono vedere."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595528&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4d0a63c9-7c37-48af-b1cb-0abc25525735\', \'multiverseId\': 595528}, \'multiverseid\': 595528}, {\'name\': \'塩水生まれの殺し屋\', \'text\': \'瞬速\\n対戦相手のターン中にあなたが呪文を唱えるたび、塩水生まれの殺し屋の上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — マーフォーク・海賊\', \'flavor\': \'「望遠鏡では見えない場所から攻撃するのだ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595636&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'322b086e-69fa-4abc-9d45-2dff6a54564d\', \'multiverseId\': 595636}, \'multiverseid\': 595636}, {\'name\': \'海生割喉客\', \'text\': \'闪现\\n每当你在对手的回合中施放咒语时，在海生割喉客上放置一个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人鱼／海盗\', \'flavor\': \'「我总是从望远镜看不到的地方动手。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595960&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'db017997-67e7-4e3d-a1e9-9a2b62977e50\', \'multiverseId\': 595960}, \'multiverseid\': 595960}]', "[{'name': 'Brandende Flutwelle', 'text': 'Dieser Zauberspruch hat Aufblitzen, solange du ein Meervolk kontrollierst.\\nBringe eine Kreatur deiner Wahl auf die Hand ihres Besitzers zurück.\\nZiehe eine Karte.', 'type': 'Hexerei', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595209&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c53b1453-9531-4cdd-bb91-a494220531c0', 'multiverseId': 595209}, 'multiverseid': 595209}, {'name': 'Marea rompiente', 'text': 'Este hechizo tiene la habilidad de destello mientras controles un Tritón.\\nRegresa la criatura objetivo a la mano de su propietario.\\nRoba una carta.', 'type': 'Conjuro', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595317&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1aba7523-b363-49c0-9d56-560b68342703', 'multiverseId': 595317}, 'multiverseid': 595317}, {'name': 'Marée déferlante', 'text': 'Ce sort a le flash tant que vous contrôlez un ondin.\\nRenvoyez une créature ciblée dans la main de son propriétaire.\\nPiochez une carte.', 'type': 'Rituel', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595425&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd9f5eb1d-7b2d-4e44-9c1b-cf5acd84435d', 'multiverseId': 595425}, 'multiverseid': 595425}, {'name': 'Marea Schiacciante', 'text': 'Questa magia ha lampo fintanto che controlli un Tritone.\\nFai tornare una creatura bersaglio in mano al suo proprietario.\\nPesca una carta.', 'type': 'Stregoneria', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595533&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ba6b132c-9b0c-492b-b277-2dea30109a30', 'multiverseId': 595533}, 'multiverseid': 595533}, {'name': '粉砕する潮流', 'text': 'あなたがマーフォークをコントロールしているかぎり、この呪文は瞬速を持つ。\\nクリーチャー１体を対象とする。それをオーナーの手札に戻す。\\nカード１枚を引く。', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595641&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b46786c9-1ad6-4e5b-98db-9dd2faa4176b', 'multiverseId': 595641}, 'multiverseid': 595641}, {'name': '覆顶潮浪', 'text': '只要你操控人鱼，此咒语便具有闪现异能。\\n将目标生物移回其拥有者手上。\\n抓一张牌。', 'type': '法术', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595965&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a5b0f64b-40f4-4202-8648-e0ac0b98ba56', 'multiverseId': 595965}, 'multiverseid': 595965}]", '[{\'name\': \'Brennendes Drachenfeuer\', \'text\': \'Das Brennende Drachenfeuer fügt einer Kreatur oder einem Planeswalker deiner Wahl 3 Schadenspunkte zu. Falls die Kreatur bzw. der Planeswalker in diesem Zug sterben würde, schicke sie bzw. ihn stattdessen ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Als die Feuersbrunst auf sie zuraste, schloss Syr Ameril die Augen und stellte sich Schloss Ardenthal vor, damit ihr letzter Gedanke ihrem Zuhause galt.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590304&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'54745ac5-e33a-4100-8f83-8a6e67478570\', \'multiverseId\': 590304}, \'multiverseid\': 590304}, {\'name\': \'Fuegodragón abrasador\', \'text\': \'El Fuegodragón abrasador hace 3 puntos de daño a la criatura o planeswalker objetivo. Si esa criatura o planeswalker fuera a morir este turno, en vez de eso, exílialo.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Mientras la llamarada se acercaba, Syr Ameril cerró los ojos e imaginó el castillo del Valle de Arden para que sus últimos pensamientos regresaran a casa.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590439&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'69ed6973-acd3-4529-af13-b7b91a203f3f\', \'multiverseId\': 590439}, \'multiverseid\': 590439}, {\'name\': \'Feu du dragon dévastateur\', \'text\': \'Le Feu du dragon dévastateur inflige 3 blessures à une cible, créature ou planeswalker. Si cette créature ou ce planeswalker devait mourir ce tour-ci, exilez-le à la place.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "À l\'approche du brasier, Syr Ameril ferma les yeux et s\'imagina le château Ardenval afin que ses dernières pensées soient pour son foyer.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590574&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9a4310f7-1062-4102-b0c3-b4feabf25414\', \'multiverseId\': 590574}, \'multiverseid\': 590574}, {\'name\': \'Fuoco Draconico Ustionante\', \'text\': \'Il Fuoco Draconico Ustionante infligge 3 danni a una creatura o a un planeswalker bersaglio. Se quella creatura o quel planeswalker stanno per morire in questo turno, invece esiliali.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'Mentre le fiamme correvano verso di lei, Syr Ameril chiuse gli occhi e immaginò il Castello di Ardenvalle, perché i suoi ultimi pensieri la riportassero a casa.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590709&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f9589f92-370f-491a-b0ad-1a80999aac23\', \'multiverseId\': 590709}, \'multiverseid\': 590709}, {\'name\': \'焦熱の竜火\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体かプレインズウォーカー１体を対象とする。焦熱の竜火はそれに３点のダメージを与える。このターン、そのクリーチャーやプレインズウォーカーが死亡するなら、代わりにそれを追放する。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'炎が押し寄せてくると、アメリル卿は目を閉じてアーデンベイル城を思い浮かべた。最後の記憶が故郷となるように。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590844&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bd6a1d7d-439b-4803-99ca-24d1511bb5af\', \'multiverseId\': 590844}, \'multiverseid\': 590844}, {\'name\': \'焦热龙炎\', \'text\': \'焦热龙炎对目标生物或鹏洛客造成3点伤害。如果本回合中该生物或鹏洛客将死去，则改为将它放逐。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'眼见来袭火焰即将吞没自己，艾默莉爵士索性闭上双眼，在脑海中回想起雅登瓦堡的点点滴滴，好让家乡成为自己最后的回忆。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591249&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4e076ecf-ffed-4a31-b324-84fb1c8f2585\', \'multiverseId\': 591249}, \'multiverseid\': 591249}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bronzeviertel-Schwingenschmied\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn ein Artefakt unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, erhält der Bronzeviertel-Schwingenschmied Flugfähigkeit bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Handwerker\', \'flavor\': \'„Luftschiffe engen zu sehr ein. Wenn ich in der Luft bin, will ich den Wind in meinem Haar spüren und den Äther schmecken."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595298&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'edf46bdf-d9c3-4311-9408-137636065a3b\', \'multiverseId\': 595298}, \'multiverseid\': 595298}, {\'name\': \'Alaslabradas de Sueldafirme\', \'text\': \'Siempre que un artefacto entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, el Alaslabradas de Sueldafirme gana la habilidad de volar hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Artífice humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Las aeronaves me dan claustrofobia. Si surco el cielo, quiero sentir el viento en la cara y saborear el éter".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595406&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3fefcd83-ddbe-4279-9e79-fe8e665682ce\', \'multiverseId\': 595406}, \'multiverseid\': 595406}, {\'name\': "Forgeur d\'ailes de Vive-Soudure", \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'un artefact arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, le Forgeur d\'ailes de Vive-Soudure acquiert le vol jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et artificier\', \'flavor\': "« Les aéronefs sont trop exigus. Dans le ciel, je veux pouvoir sentir le vent dans mes cheveux et savourer le goût de l\'Éther. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595514&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'719c7327-2be9-40e8-abcc-8cc1dbdb20ec\', \'multiverseId\': 595514}, \'multiverseid\': 595514}, {\'name\': "Artefice d\'Ali della Saldapoli", \'text\': "Ogniqualvolta un artefatto entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, l\'Artefice d\'Ali della Saldapoli ha volare fino alla fine del turno.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Artefice Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Le aeronavi sono troppo claustrofobiche. Quando volo nel cielo, voglio sentire il vento tra i capelli e il sapore dell\\\'etere."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595622&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0c968f8b-b87e-4c0a-a214-af029476182b\', \'multiverseId\': 595622}, \'multiverseid\': 595622}, {\'name\': \'速接会の翼鍛冶\', \'text\': \'アーティファクト１つがあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、ターン終了時まで、速接会の翼鍛冶は飛行を得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・工匠\', \'flavor\': \'「飛行船は狭苦しいよ。空を飛ぶなら髪に風を感じて霊気を満喫したいな。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595730&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'97ff0ee4-5fe9-4329-9c45-7d292f0d05e4\', \'multiverseId\': 595730}, \'multiverseid\': 595730}, {\'name\': \'焊锢区翼匠\', \'text\': \'每当一个神器在你的操控下进战场时，焊锢区翼匠获得飞行异能直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／神器师\', \'flavor\': \'「飞船太拘束了。如果我在空中飞翔，我就要感受风吹发梢，体会乙太拂身。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596054&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fd909ac5-b2b4-4b7d-a3f5-f973391e20a1\', \'multiverseId\': 596054}, \'multiverseid\': 596054}]', '[{\'name\': \'Brut-Beschwörer\', \'text\': \'Fahl (Diese Karte hat keine Farbe.)\\nWenn der Brut-Beschwörer ins Spiel kommt, erzeuge einen 1/1 farblosen Eldrazi-Brut-Kreaturenspielstein. Er hat „Opfere diese Kreatur: Erzeuge {C}". ({C} steht für farbloses Mana.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Eldrazi, Drohne\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592924&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8ede7040-44ad-41e9-a719-fd711c100956\', \'multiverseId\': 592924}, \'multiverseid\': 592924}, {\'name\': \'Invocavástagos\', \'text\': \'Vacío. (Esta carta no tiene ningún color.)\\nCuando el Invocavástagos entre al campo de batalla, crea una ficha de criatura Vástago Eldrazi incolora 1/1. Tiene "Sacrificar esta criatura: Agrega {C}". ({C} representa maná incoloro.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Zángano eldrazi\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593045&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dcf380a8-5818-4bb4-bf2e-d0a0a6970c2f\', \'multiverseId\': 593045}, \'multiverseid\': 593045}, {\'name\': \'Invocateur de scions\', \'text\': "Carence (Cette carte n\'a pas de couleur.)\\nQuand l\'Invocateur de scions arrive sur le champ de bataille, créez un jeton de créature 1/1 incolore Eldrazi et Scion. Il a « Sacrifiez cette créature : Ajoutez {C}. » ({C} représente un mana incolore.)", \'type\': \'Créature : eldrazi et drone\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593166&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0bf1f84e-0139-440d-95e2-a12ef81586f9\', \'multiverseId\': 593166}, \'multiverseid\': 593166}, {\'name\': \'Evocatore di Discendenti\', \'text\': \'Vacuità (Questa carta non ha colore.)\\nQuando l\\\'Evocatore di Discendenti entra nel campo di battaglia, crea una pedina creatura Discendente Eldrazi 1/1 incolore. Ha "Sacrifica questa creatura: Aggiungi {C}". ({C} rappresenta mana incolore.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Parassita Eldrazi\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593287&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'16dcb872-6a2d-4860-9b65-343d6b87aedb\', \'multiverseId\': 593287}, \'multiverseid\': 593287}, {\'name\': \'末裔招き\', \'text\': \'欠色（このカードは無色である。）\\n末裔招きが戦場に出たとき、無色の１/１のエルドラージ・末裔・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。それは「このクリーチャーを生け贄に捧げる：{C}を加える。」を持つ。（{C}は無色マナを表す。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルドラージ・ドローン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593408&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7e3c4345-dbe7-43f7-a11e-37c093a74397\', \'multiverseId\': 593408}, \'multiverseid\': 593408}, {\'name\': \'孽裔召唤体\', \'text\': \'虚色（此牌没有颜色。）\\n当孽裔召唤体进战场时，派出一个1/1无色奥札奇／孽裔衍生生物。它具有「牺牲此生物：加{C}。」（{C}代表无色法术力。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～奥札奇／奴兽\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593771&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1a7eff74-b22b-4872-b7b0-7f86e70a2e19\', \'multiverseId\': 593771}, \'multiverseid\': 593771}]', '[{\'name\': \'Brutaler Fausthieb\', \'text\': \'Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst, kämpft gegen eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du nicht kontrollierst.\\nWildheit — Bevor sie kämpft, erhält die Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, +2/+2 bis zum Ende des Zuges, falls du eine Kreatur mit Stärke 4 oder mehr kontrollierst. (Jede fügt der anderen Schadenspunkte in Höhe ihrer Stärke zu.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592922&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7246345d-73bf-489a-8d45-398b34aa5736\', \'multiverseId\': 592922}, \'multiverseid\': 592922}, {\'name\': \'Puñetazo salvaje\', \'text\': \'La criatura objetivo que controlas lucha contra la criatura objetivo que no controlas.\\nFerocidad — La criatura que controlas obtiene +2/+2 hasta el final del turno antes de luchar si controlas una criatura con fuerza de 4 o más. (Cada una hace un daño igual a su fuerza a la otra.)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593043&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'655b8004-2cd2-4aa0-bb08-bc7b49aeac2e\', \'multiverseId\': 593043}, \'multiverseid\': 593043}, {\'name\': \'Coup de poing sauvage\', \'text\': "Une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez se bat contre une créature ciblée que vous ne contrôlez pas.\\nFérocité — La créature que vous contrôlez gagne +2/+2 jusqu\'à la fin du tour avant qu\'elle ne se batte si vous contrôlez une créature avec une force supérieure ou égale à 4. (Chacune inflige un nombre de blessures égal à sa force à l\'autre.)", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593164&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3c22e63c-a4d5-46a3-9898-4ee097568921\', \'multiverseId\': 593164}, \'multiverseid\': 593164}, {\'name\': \'Pugno Selvaggio\', \'text\': "Una creatura bersaglio che controlli lotta con una creatura bersaglio che non controlli.\\nFerocia — La creatura che controlli prende +2/+2 fino alla fine del turno prima di lottare se controlli una creatura con forza pari o superiore a 4. (Ogni creatura infligge all\'altra danno pari alla propria forza.)", \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593285&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d3453703-73c3-4001-8a79-57bfed656641\', \'multiverseId\': 593285}, \'multiverseid\': 593285}, {\'name\': \'凶暴な殴打\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体と、あなたがコントロールしていないクリーチャー１体を対象とする。その前者はその後者と格闘を行う。\\n獰猛 ― あなたがパワーが４以上であるクリーチャーをコントロールしているなら、格闘を行う前に、ターン終了時まで、その前者は＋２/＋２の修整を受ける。（それぞれはもう一方に自身のパワーに等しい点数のダメージを与える。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593406&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9e693650-3ac2-49dd-b49e-522a02b2579d\', \'multiverseId\': 593406}, \'multiverseid\': 593406}, {\'name\': \'蛮野殴击\', \'text\': \'目标由你操控的生物与目标不由你操控的生物互斗。\\n威猛～如果你操控力量等于或大于4的生物，则该目标由你操控的生物在互斗前得+2/+2直到回合结束。（它们各向对方造成等同于本身力量的伤害。）\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593769&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fba16a9f-5821-4a0e-b2b2-6b3a37a5f6d4\', \'multiverseId\': 593769}, \'multiverseid\': 593769}]', '[{\'name\': \'Brutüberwacher\', \'text\': \'Fahl (Diese Karte hat keine Farbe.)\\nWenn der Brutüberwacher ins Spiel kommt, erzeuge drei 1/1 farblose Eldrazi-Brut-Kreaturenspielsteine. Sie haben „Opfere diese Kreatur: Erzeuge {C}."\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Eldrazi, Drohne\', \'flavor\': \'Die Zärtlichkeit einer Mutter. Das Mitleid einer Gottesanbeterin.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592836&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d04b0c45-35e8-4abe-bcb5-325baca0faea\', \'multiverseId\': 592836}, \'multiverseid\': 592836}, {\'name\': \'Vigilante de la progenie\', \'text\': \'Vacío. (Esta carta no tiene ningún color.)\\nCuando el Vigilante de la progenie entre al campo de batalla, crea tres fichas de criatura Vástago Eldrazi incoloras 1/1. Tienen "Sacrificar esta criatura: Agrega {C}".\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Zángano eldrazi\', \'flavor\': \'La ternura de una madre. La piedad de una mantis religiosa.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592957&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9761811d-08c5-446d-a055-d9d1ac941d8c\', \'multiverseId\': 592957}, \'multiverseid\': 592957}, {\'name\': \'Surveillant de progéniture\', \'text\': "Carence (Cette carte n\'a pas de couleur.)\\nQuand le Surveillant de progéniture arrive sur le champ de bataille, créez trois jetons de créature 1/1 incolore Eldrazi et Scion. Ils ont « Sacrifiez cette créature : Ajoutez {C}. »", \'type\': \'Créature : eldrazi et drone\', \'flavor\': "La tendresse d\'une mère. La compassion d\'une mante.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593078&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'55aee707-5e21-4463-8e14-0264765968d6\', \'multiverseId\': 593078}, \'multiverseid\': 593078}, {\'name\': \'Sorvegliante della Covata\', \'text\': \'Vacuità (Questa carta non ha colore.)\\nQuando la Sorvegliante della Covata entra nel campo di battaglia, crea tre pedine creatura Discendente Eldrazi 1/1 incolori. Hanno "Sacrifica questa creatura: Aggiungi {C}".\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Parassita Eldrazi\', \'flavor\': "L\'affetto di una madre. La misericordia di una mantide.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593199&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8bff27b0-cbb2-4281-a63c-c02a1747bf05\', \'multiverseId\': 593199}, \'multiverseid\': 593199}, {\'name\': \'血統の観察者\', \'text\': \'欠色（このカードは無色である。）\\n血統の観察者が戦場に出たとき、無色の１/１のエルドラージ・末裔・クリーチャー・トークン３体を生成する。それらは「このクリーチャーを生け贄に捧げる：{C}を加える。」を持つ。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルドラージ・ドローン\', \'flavor\': \'母親の愛情。蟷螂の同情。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593320&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1d672b53-821a-4382-a79d-ccec4f1f0616\', \'multiverseId\': 593320}, \'multiverseid\': 593320}, {\'name\': \'孳巢监卫\', \'text\': \'虚色（此牌没有颜色。）\\n当孳巢监卫进战场时，派出三个1/1无色奥札奇／孽裔衍生生物。它们具有「牺牲此生物：加{C}。」\', \'type\': \'生物 ～奥札奇／奴兽\', \'flavor\': \'母性的温柔。螳螂的怜悯。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593683&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c8a42c52-37aa-4786-8f89-9874f4147756\', \'multiverseId\': 593683}, \'multiverseid\': 593683}]', "[{'name': 'Bund der Wolfssippe', 'text': 'Verzaubert eine Kreatur\\nWenn der Bund der Wolfssippe ins Spiel kommt, erzeuge einen 2/2 grünen Wolf-Kreaturenspielstein.\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur erhält +2/+2.', 'type': 'Verzauberung — Aura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592940&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'abb9b8e6-3950-40e0-afe8-50005c1b57ba', 'multiverseId': 592940}, 'multiverseid': 592940}, {'name': 'Vínculo lupino', 'text': 'Encantar criatura.\\nCuando el Vínculo lupino entre al campo de batalla, crea una ficha de criatura Lobo verde 2/2.\\nLa criatura encantada obtiene +2/+2.', 'type': 'Encantamiento — Aura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593061&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '520dbf67-9b45-4b00-864c-5ca4c2537794', 'multiverseId': 593061}, 'multiverseid': 593061}, {'name': 'Lien lupeux', 'text': 'Enchanter : créature\\nQuand le Lien lupeux arrive sur le champ de bataille, créez un jeton de créature 2/2 verte Loup.\\nLa créature enchantée gagne +2/+2.', 'type': 'Enchantement : aura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593182&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '84bf46d1-0e60-4461-8064-4a91c2f36caf', 'multiverseId': 593182}, 'multiverseid': 593182}, {'name': 'Legame Lupesco', 'text': 'Incanta creatura\\nQuando il Legame Lupesco entra nel campo di battaglia, crea una pedina creatura Lupo 2/2 verde.\\nLa creatura incantata prende +2/+2.', 'type': 'Incantesimo — Aura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593303&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6b2ebd85-6dac-43ce-8fab-94e5f7b03c10', 'multiverseId': 593303}, 'multiverseid': 593303}, {'name': '狼族の絆', 'text': 'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\n狼族の絆が戦場に出たとき、緑の２/２の狼・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\\nエンチャントしているクリーチャーは＋２/＋２の修整を受ける。', 'type': 'エンチャント — オーラ', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593424&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e111c393-b1bc-4516-bc26-af354dd83082', 'multiverseId': 593424}, 'multiverseid': 593424}, {'name': '狼族羁绊', 'text': '结附于生物\\n当狼族羁绊进战场时，派出一个2/2绿色的狼衍生生物。\\n所结附的生物得+2/+2。', 'type': '结界 ～灵气', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593787&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bcb01106-7367-45a7-ba26-0682eb5a8047', 'multiverseId': 593787}, 'multiverseid': 593787}]", '[{\'name\': \'Böse Stiefmutter\', \'text\': \'Wenn die Böse Stiefmutter ins Spiel kommt, kannst du sie einer anderen Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, 2 Schadenspunkte zufügen lassen. Falls du dies tust, ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Adliger\', \'flavor\': \'„Manche sind zu Großem geboren. Du bist dazu geboren, die Böden der Großen zu schrubben."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594146&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0a410bfd-6792-468a-ade2-60d30bead6cf\', \'multiverseId\': 594146}, \'multiverseid\': 594146}, {\'name\': \'Guardiana vil\', \'text\': \'Cuando la Guardiana vil entre al campo de batalla, puedes hacer que le haga 2 puntos de daño a otra criatura que controlas. Si lo haces, roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Noble humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Algunos venimos de alta cuna. Tú naciste para fregar los suelos de esas cunas".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594263&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3959c366-fd22-4c33-85cb-ecf6faaf33d7\', \'multiverseId\': 594263}, \'multiverseid\': 594263}, {\'name\': \'Méchante marâtre\', \'text\': "Quand la Méchante marâtre arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez faire qu\'elle inflige 2 blessures à une autre créature que vous contrôlez. Si vous faites ainsi, piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et noble\', \'flavor\': \'« Certains naissent pour connaître la grandeur. Toi tu es née pour en récurer le sol. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594380&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9ebe4445-df86-4185-9528-3005b3d433ba\', \'multiverseId\': 594380}, \'multiverseid\': 594380}, {\'name\': \'Tutrice Malvagia\', \'text\': "Quando la Tutrice Malvagia entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi farle infliggere 2 danni a un\'altra creatura che controlli. Se lo fai, pesca una carta.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Nobile Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Alcuni nascono per fare grandi cose. Tu sei nata per pulire grandi pavimenti."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594497&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c0db7585-dbf4-46ce-a8d9-7a62571f658b\', \'multiverseId\': 594497}, \'multiverseid\': 594497}, {\'name\': \'意地悪な後見人\', \'text\': \'意地悪な後見人が戦場に出たとき、あなたは「意地悪な後見人は、あなたがコントロールしていてこれでないクリーチャー１体に２点のダメージを与える。」を選んでもよい。そうしたなら、カード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・貴族\', \'flavor\': \'「生まれながらに偉大な者もいるけど、お前は生まれながらに、偉大な者の床を磨くことになっているんだよ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594614&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ecaab4cf-2481-4a17-982a-df47ff5f2af6\', \'multiverseId\': 594614}, \'multiverseid\': 594614}, {\'name\': \'邪恶守护者\', \'text\': \'当邪恶守护者进战场时，你可以使它对另一个由你操控的生物造成2点伤害。若你如此作，则抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／贵族\', \'flavor\': \'「有些人生来就是伟人。而你生来就是给伟人擦地板的。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594965&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5b203e7f-114c-42da-9f63-444ddd68b6a6\', \'multiverseId\': 594965}, \'multiverseid\': 594965}]', '[{\'name\': \'Böser Wolf\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Böse Wolf ins Spiel kommt, kämpft er gegen bis zu eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du nicht kontrollierst.\\nOpfere eine Speise: Lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf den Bösen Wolf. Er erhält Unzerstörbarkeit bis zum Ende des Zuges. Tappe ihn.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Wolf\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597541&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ec2a5777-a522-4c0d-8ad5-52a903568aaa\', \'multiverseId\': 597541}, \'multiverseid\': 597541}, {\'name\': \'Lobo feroz\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Lobo feroz entre al campo de batalla, lucha contra hasta una criatura objetivo que no controlas.\\nSacrificar una Comida: Pon un contador +1/+1 sobre el Lobo feroz. Gana la habilidad de indestructible hasta el final del turno. Gíralo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Lobo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597566&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5e8947b7-8f70-4d0c-ae78-3eb9ce9df2c6\', \'multiverseId\': 597566}, \'multiverseid\': 597566}, {\'name\': \'Méchant loup\', \'text\': "Quand le Méchant loup arrive sur le champ de bataille, il se bat contre jusqu\'à une créature ciblée que vous ne contrôlez pas.\\nSacrifiez une nourriture : Mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur le Méchant loup. Il acquiert l\'indestructible jusqu\'à la fin du tour. Engagez-le.", \'type\': \'Créature : loup\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597591&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6da7d425-bf7b-4f70-a6b2-187ca2d4cc97\', \'multiverseId\': 597591}, \'multiverseid\': 597591}, {\'name\': \'Lupo Cattivo\', \'text\': \'Quando il Lupo Cattivo entra nel campo di battaglia, lotta con fino a una creatura bersaglio che non controlli.\\nSacrifica un Cibo: Metti un segnalino +1/+1 sul Lupo Cattivo. Ha indistruttibile fino alla fine del turno. TAPpalo.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Lupo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597616&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f683115e-002c-477c-a25f-fbe4078460e2\', \'multiverseId\': 597616}, \'multiverseid\': 597616}, {\'name\': \'意地悪な狼\', \'text\': \'意地悪な狼が戦場に出たとき、あなたがコントロールしていないクリーチャー最大１体を対象とする。これはそれと格闘を行う。\\n食物１つを生け贄に捧げる：意地悪な狼の上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。ターン終了時まで、これは破壊不能を得る。これをタップする。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 狼\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597641&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'40d2e735-b312-4a1c-b994-fe7aca150d50\', \'multiverseId\': 597641}, \'multiverseid\': 597641}, {\'name\': \'恶狼\', \'text\': \'当恶狼进战场时，它与至多一个目标不由你操控的生物互斗。\\n牺牲一个食品：在恶狼上放置一个+1/+1指示物。它获得不灭异能直到回合结束。将之横置。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～狼\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597716&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'82663d59-f63f-4383-91ba-e0566738491a\', \'multiverseId\': 597716}, \'multiverseid\': 597716}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bücherdiebin\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn die Bücherdiebin angreift, ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Meervolk, Räuber\', \'flavor\': \'„Meine Spezialität sind fehlende Manuskripte, gestohlene Poesie und verlorene Briefe."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595240&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'94680a61-0496-47f5-9d2c-3601c2319cc2\', \'multiverseId\': 595240}, \'multiverseid\': 595240}, {\'name\': \'Birladora de bibliotecas\', \'text\': \'Siempre que la Birladora de bibliotecas ataque, roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bribón tritón\', \'flavor\': \'"Mis especialidades son los libros llevados, la poesía perdida y los escritos extraídos".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595348&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ac577d9c-07bb-4e53-85d3-f703efd038a5\', \'multiverseId\': 595348}, \'multiverseid\': 595348}, {\'name\': \'Voleuse de bibliothèque\', \'text\': \'À chaque fois que la Voleuse de bibliothèque attaque, piochez une carte.\', \'type\': \'Créature : ondin et gredin\', \'flavor\': \'« Je suis spécialisée en manuscrits perdus, en poèmes dérobés, et en lettres volées. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595456&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3807408f-bb2d-4e2c-ac78-ce2074b7a2ce\', \'multiverseId\': 595456}, \'multiverseid\': 595456}, {\'name\': \'Ladra delle Biblioteche\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta la Ladra delle Biblioteche attacca, pesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Farabutto Tritone\', \'flavor\': \'"Sono specializzata in manoscritti mancanti, poesie perdute ed epistole estorte."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595564&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a3c0518d-4d70-4f24-8d5d-76e9eb4856e7\', \'multiverseId\': 595564}, \'multiverseid\': 595564}, {\'name\': \'書庫泥棒\', \'text\': \'書庫泥棒が攻撃するたび、カード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — マーフォーク・ならず者\', \'flavor\': \'「失われた草稿、盗まれた詩文、届かなかった手紙。そういうもの専門です。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595672&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'26b4acc8-b35d-4a9d-beba-882af07192f7\', \'multiverseId\': 595672}, \'multiverseid\': 595672}, {\'name\': \'书库窃犯\', \'text\': \'每当书库窃犯攻击时，抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人鱼／浪客\', \'flavor\': \'「我擅长弄丢手稿，偷取诗篇，截取信件。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595996&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7449b42b-1e12-46ad-bb51-eb8419b15a6a\', \'multiverseId\': 595996}, \'multiverseid\': 595996}]', '[{\'name\': \'Campusführer\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Campusführer ins Spiel kommt, kannst du deine Bibliothek nach einer Standardland-Karte durchsuchen, sie offen vorzeigen, danach mischen und jene Karte oben darauf legen.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Golem\', \'flavor\': \'„Es gibt keinen Ort in Strixhaven, den ich nicht finden kann. Wo müsst ihr hin?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596262&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d79a4a47-9e4b-48dc-9b29-362c591ea8bf\', \'multiverseId\': 596262}, \'multiverseid\': 596262}, {\'name\': \'Guía del campus\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Guía del campus entre al campo de batalla, puedes buscar en tu biblioteca una carta de tierra básica, mostrarla y luego barajar y poner esa carta en la parte superior.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Gólem\', \'flavor\': \'"No hay sitio en Strixhaven que no pueda encontrar. ¿Dónde quieres ir?".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596349&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2788d5b5-ec41-4b17-b989-dd1506915356\', \'multiverseId\': 596349}, \'multiverseid\': 596349}, {\'name\': \'Guide du campus\', \'text\': \'Quand le Guide du campus arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez chercher dans votre bibliothèque une carte de terrain de base, la révéler, puis mélanger et mettre cette carte au-dessus de votre bibliothèque.\', \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : golem\', \'flavor\': "« Il n\'y a nulle part à Strixhaven que je ne connaisse pas. Où souhaitez-vous aller ? »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596436&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'39b70e09-4ca4-475f-9b8e-7760f09c3cc8\', \'multiverseId\': 596436}, \'multiverseid\': 596436}, {\'name\': \'Guida del Campus\', \'text\': \'Quando la Guida del Campus entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi passare in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta terra base, rivelarla, poi rimescolare e mettere quella carta in cima.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Golem\', \'flavor\': \'"Non c\\\'è luogo a Strixhaven che io non conosca. Dove devi andare?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596523&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cf45fd2a-3d2c-4804-88ca-9c4b0110ed96\', \'multiverseId\': 596523}, \'multiverseid\': 596523}, {\'name\': \'構内ガイド\', \'text\': \'構内ガイドが戦場に出たとき、あなたは「あなたのライブラリーから基本土地・カード１枚を探し、公開する。その後、ライブラリーを切り直し、そのカードを一番上に置く。」を選んでもよい。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — ゴーレム\', \'flavor\': \'「ストリクスヘイヴンには私が知らない場所はありません。どこへ行きたいのですか？」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596610&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8b560a88-1504-4c42-81c5-e6e64ce3cf7c\', \'multiverseId\': 596610}, \'multiverseid\': 596610}, {\'name\': \'校区向导\', \'text\': \'当校区向导进战场时，你可以从你牌库中搜寻一张基本地牌，展示该牌，然后洗牌，并将该牌置于牌库顶。\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～魔像\', \'flavor\': \'「斯翠海文没有我不知道的地方。你们要去哪？」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596871&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'658a5566-44e8-4091-ad50-d762492afce4\', \'multiverseId\': 596871}, \'multiverseid\': 596871}]', '[{\'name\': \'Chandra, Zorn der Flamme\', \'text\': \'+1: Chandra, Zorn der Flamme, fügt einem Ziel deiner Wahl 2 Schadenspunkte zu.\\n−2: Chandra, Zorn der Flamme, fügt einer Kreatur deiner Wahl 4 Schadenspunkte und dem Beherrscher der Kreatur 2 Schadenspunkte zu.\\n−8: Chandra, Zorn der Flamme, fügt einem Spieler deiner Wahl und jeder Kreatur, die der Spieler kontrolliert, 10 Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Legendärer Planeswalker — Chandra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590219&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'10d34435-cd7b-474c-8cf6-9c98dc2323eb\', \'multiverseId\': 590219}, \'multiverseid\': 590219}, {\'name\': \'Chandra, Furia de las Llamas\', \'text\': \'+1: Chandra, Furia de las Llamas hace 2 puntos de daño a cualquier objetivo.\\n−2: Chandra, Furia de las Llamas hace 4 puntos de daño a la criatura objetivo y 2 puntos de daño al controlador de esa criatura.\\n−8: Chandra, Furia de las Llamas hace 10 puntos de daño al jugador objetivo y a cada criatura que controla ese jugador.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker legendario — Chandra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590354&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5bdc8beb-4d19-4d58-b4a0-30520563e961\', \'multiverseId\': 590354}, \'multiverseid\': 590354}, {\'name\': \'Chandra, furie des flammes\', \'text\': "+1 : Chandra, furie des flammes inflige 2 blessures à n\'importe quelle cible.\\n-2 : Chandra, furie des flammes inflige 4 blessures à une créature ciblée et 2 blessures au contrôleur de cette créature.\\n-8 : Chandra, furie des flammes inflige 10 blessures à un joueur ciblé et à chaque créature que ce joueur contrôle.", \'type\': \'Planeswalker légendaire : Chandra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590489&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b7c3d8dd-8448-4f53-9853-d25e9a9a05fb\', \'multiverseId\': 590489}, \'multiverseid\': 590489}, {\'name\': \'Chandra, Furia delle Fiamme\', \'text\': \'+1: Chandra, Furia delle Fiamme infligge 2 danni a un qualsiasi bersaglio.\\n−2: Chandra, Furia delle Fiamme infligge 4 danni a una creatura bersaglio e 2 danni al controllore di quella creatura.\\n−8: Chandra, Furia delle Fiamme infligge 10 danni a un giocatore bersaglio e a ogni creatura controllata da quel giocatore.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker Leggendario — Chandra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590624&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'afc52fbf-abf7-4302-bdda-719b53854d9f\', \'multiverseId\': 590624}, \'multiverseid\': 590624}, {\'name\': \'炎の憤怒、チャンドラ\', \'text\': \'+1：クリーチャーやプレインズウォーカーやプレイヤーのうち１つを対象とする。炎の憤怒、チャンドラはそれに２点のダメージを与える。\\n-2：クリーチャー１体を対象とする。炎の憤怒、チャンドラはそれに４点、そのクリーチャーのコントローラーに２点のダメージを与える。\\n-8：プレイヤー１人を対象とする。炎の憤怒、チャンドラはそのプレイヤーとそのプレイヤーがコントロールしている各クリーチャーにそれぞれ10点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'伝説のプレインズウォーカー — チャンドラ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590759&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'024cdf75-6323-4ef9-9401-f96d7555d692\', \'multiverseId\': 590759}, \'multiverseid\': 590759}, {\'name\': \'盛焰怒火茜卓\', \'text\': \'+1：盛焰怒火茜卓对任意一个目标造成2点伤害。\\n−2：盛焰怒火茜卓对目标生物造成4点伤害，且对该生物的操控者造成2点伤害。\\n−8：盛焰怒火茜卓对目标牌手和每个由该牌手操控的生物各造成10点伤害。\', \'type\': \'传奇鹏洛客 ～茜卓\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591164&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9d133a18-fba6-4918-9325-f6c3fd52cbe0\', \'multiverseId\': 591164}, \'multiverseid\': 591164}]', '[{\'name\': \'Chandras Feuerbrandling\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn eine Quelle, die du kontrollierst, einem Gegner Nicht-Kampfschaden zufügt, erhält Chandras Feuerbrandling +1/+0 und Doppelschlag bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elementarwesen, Eidechse\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich denke, Chandra wollte einfach nur etwas, das sie für all die Brandflecken verantwortlich machen konnte."\\n—Jace Beleren\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590221&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'894358f3-fecd-43a8-b937-8bfea513b79e\', \'multiverseId\': 590221}, \'multiverseid\': 590221}, {\'name\': \'Piroideo de Chandra\', \'text\': \'Siempre que una fuente que controlas haga daño que no sea de combate a un oponente, el Piroideo de Chandra obtiene +1/+0 y gana la habilidad de dañar dos veces hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Lagarto elemental\', \'flavor\': \'"Creo que Chandra solo quería algo a lo que echarle la culpa por las marcas de algunas quemaduras".\\n—Jace Beleren\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590356&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5607ca00-320b-4ec0-b13a-b54761ce81dc\', \'multiverseId\': 590356}, \'multiverseid\': 590356}, {\'name\': \'Pyrolin de Chandra\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'une source que vous contrôlez inflige des blessures non-combat à un adversaire, le Pyrolin de Chandra gagne +1/+0 et acquiert la double initiative jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : élémental et lézard\', \'flavor\': \'« Je crois que Chandra cherchait juste un bouc-émissaire pour justifier les traces de brûlure. »\\n—Jace Beleren\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590491&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'099e0d6b-4e33-461f-9d18-2747ccaf56d3\', \'multiverseId\': 590491}, \'multiverseid\': 590491}, {\'name\': \'Igniforme di Chandra\', \'text\': "Ogniqualvolta una fonte che controlli infligge danno non da combattimento a un avversario, l\'Igniforme di Chandra prende +1/+0 e ha doppio attacco fino alla fine del turno.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Lucertola Elementale\', \'flavor\': \'"Ho l\\\'impressione che Chandra volesse soltanto qualcosa su cui scaricare la colpa per le bruciature occasionali."\\n—Jace Beleren\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590626&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4bdb99ae-bd95-4e74-859f-903623f964dc\', \'multiverseId\': 590626}, \'multiverseid\': 590626}, {\'name\': \'チャンドラの紅蓮獣\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしている発生源が対戦相手１人に戦闘ダメージでないダメージを与えるたび、ターン終了時まで、チャンドラの紅蓮獣は＋１/＋０の修整を受け二段攻撃を得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エレメンタル・トカゲ\', \'flavor\': \'「チャンドラは、難癖をつけて焦がし回れる何かを求めていただけじゃないかと思う。」\\n――ジェイス・ベレレン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590761&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8784813b-c4bd-4976-ac2e-b617eb318e0b\', \'multiverseId\': 590761}, \'multiverseid\': 590761}, {\'name\': \'茜卓的幼火灵\', \'text\': \'每当一个由你操控的来源向任一对手造成非战斗伤害时，直到回合结束，茜卓的幼火灵得+1/+0 且获得连击异能。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～元素／蜥蜴\', \'flavor\': \'「我觉得茜卓只是要找个东西来把胡乱烧痕怪罪上去。」\\n～杰斯贝连\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591166&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'df46bf90-1d34-4ccb-9fd6-9678ea91fe10\', \'multiverseId\': 591166}, \'multiverseid\': 591166}]', '[{\'name\': \'Chandras Feuerspucker\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nImmer wenn einem Gegner Nicht-Kampfschaden zugefügt wird, erhält Chandras Feuerspucker +3/+0 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elementarwesen\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich habe schon fast alles in Brand gesetzt: Bäume, Felsen, sogar Wasser. Jetzt sind die Wolken an der Reihe."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590223&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7eaedc8e-5dd6-4832-af86-6397012c1035\', \'multiverseId\': 590223}, \'multiverseid\': 590223}, {\'name\': \'Escupefuego de Chandra\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nSiempre que un oponente reciba daño que no sea de combate, el Escupefuego de Chandra obtiene +3/+0 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elemental\', \'flavor\': \'"He prendido fuego a cualquier cosa: árboles, rocas, incluso agua. Ahora es tiempo de encender las nubes".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590358&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4fbafa60-294f-4b32-9328-6c5b1102a7b6\', \'multiverseId\': 590358}, \'multiverseid\': 590358}, {\'name\': \'Crachefeu de Chandra\', \'text\': "Vol\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'un adversaire subit des blessures non-combat, le Crachefeu de Chandra gagne +3/+0 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : élémental\', \'flavor\': "« J\'ai mis le feu à quasiment tout — aux arbres, aux rochers, même à l\'eau. Maintenant, c\'est au tour des nuages de brûler. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590493&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8c7204d2-a3a6-470f-9b39-d58acfa161f8\', \'multiverseId\': 590493}, \'multiverseid\': 590493}, {\'name\': \'Focoso di Chandra\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nOgniqualvolta a un avversario viene inflitto danno non da combattimento, il Focoso di Chandra prende +3/+0 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Elementale\', \'flavor\': \'"Ho incendiato praticamente di tutto... alberi, rocce, perfino l\\\'acqua. È arrivato il momento di bruciare le nuvole."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590628&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4065114c-4d82-4a06-9f77-b39aefca5ef0\', \'multiverseId\': 590628}, \'multiverseid\': 590628}, {\'name\': \'チャンドラの吐火\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n対戦相手１人が戦闘ダメージでないダメージを受けるたび、ターン終了時まで、チャンドラの吐火は＋３/＋０の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エレメンタル\', \'flavor\': \'「私はほとんど何にでも火を付けてきた。木や石、水にまでも。今度は雲を燃やすわ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590763&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4ba634ad-cc91-454b-a73b-0def49912961\', \'multiverseId\': 590763}, \'multiverseid\': 590763}, {\'name\': \'茜卓的喷火灵\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n每当一位对手受到非战斗伤害时，茜卓的喷火灵得+3/+0直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～元素\', \'flavor\': \'「什么东西我几乎都放火烧过了～树，石头，甚至是水。现在该来烧烧云。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591168&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d6b2021b-d3f5-4897-b112-7264cb66e2d4\', \'multiverseId\': 591168}, \'multiverseid\': 591168}]', '[{\'name\': \'Chandras Magmaköter\', \'text\': \'{T}: Chandras Magmaköter fügt einem Spieler oder Planeswalker deiner Wahl 1 Schadenspunkt zu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elementarwesen, Hund\', \'flavor\': \'„Ist er reinrassig? Nein, aber reines Feuer."\\n—Chandra Nalaar\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590220&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ea8d45ba-66ef-4c7c-96e8-f3184992b390\', \'multiverseId\': 590220}, \'multiverseid\': 590220}, {\'name\': \'Mestizo de magma de Chandra\', \'text\': \'{T}: El Mestizo de magma de Chandra hace 1 punto de daño al jugador o planeswalker objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Perro elemental\', \'flavor\': \'"¿Que si es de raza pura? No, pero es de puro fuego".\\n—Chandra Nalaar\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590355&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'45a11e93-4fec-4407-9ee7-4be209e098f4\', \'multiverseId\': 590355}, \'multiverseid\': 590355}, {\'name\': \'Molosse de magma de Chandra\', \'text\': \'{T} : Le Molosse de magma de Chandra inflige 1 blessure à une cible, joueur ou planeswalker.\', \'type\': \'Créature : élémental et chien\', \'flavor\': "« Si c\'est un pur-sang ? Non, mais c\'est un pur-feu. »\\n—Chandra Nalaàr", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590490&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0f8ed203-61fe-40be-b364-aed682b725b8\', \'multiverseId\': 590490}, \'multiverseid\': 590490}, {\'name\': \'Magmastino di Chandra\', \'text\': \'{T}: Il Magmastino di Chandra infligge 1 danno a un giocatore o a un planeswalker bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Canide Elementale\', \'flavor\': \'"È di razza pura? No, ma è di puro fuoco."\\n—Chandra Nalaar\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590625&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0d51e35f-bc83-47a5-ad7a-627fbc097e3e\', \'multiverseId\': 590625}, \'multiverseid\': 590625}, {\'name\': \'チャンドラのマグムット\', \'text\': \'{T}：プレイヤーやプレインズウォーカーのうち１つを対象とする。チャンドラのマグムットはそれに１点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エレメンタル・犬\', \'flavor\': \'「純血かって？違うわ。だけど純粋な火ではあるわね。」\\n――チャンドラ・ナラー\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590760&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a873fa6e-55a2-4367-8327-5b7481edea3b\', \'multiverseId\': 590760}, \'multiverseid\': 590760}, {\'name\': \'茜卓的熔岩犬\', \'text\': \'{T}：茜卓的熔岩犬对目标牌手或鹏洛客造成1点伤害。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～元素／狗\', \'flavor\': \'「你问它是不是纯种？不是，但它是纯火。」\\n～茜卓纳拉\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591165&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5264d236-319f-4fe5-af1a-8fd2815b6f80\', \'multiverseId\': 591165}, \'multiverseid\': 591165}]', '[{\'name\': \'Chandras Pyrohelix\', \'text\': \'Chandras Pyrohelix fügt 2 Schadenspunkte zu, deren Aufteilung auf ein oder zwei Ziele deiner Wahl du bestimmst.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Deine lausigen Lakaien habe ich erledigt. Jetzt kann ich mich ums eigentliche Problem kümmern: dich."\\n—Chandra Nalaar zu Dovin Baan\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590222&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3fb3146b-ed05-4642-b986-78b137c62a10\', \'multiverseId\': 590222}, \'multiverseid\': 590222}, {\'name\': \'Pirohélice de Chandra\', \'text\': \'La Pirohélice de Chandra hace 2 puntos de daño divididos como elijas entre uno o dos objetivos.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Ahora que me he ocupado de tus juguetes, puedo centrarme en el verdadero problema, que eres tú".\\n—Chandra Nalaar, a Dovin Baan\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590357&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'13166efa-03d8-429b-b717-4a2b489a0b16\', \'multiverseId\': 590357}, \'multiverseid\': 590357}, {\'name\': \'Pyrohélice de Chandra\', \'text\': \'La Pyrohélice de Chandra inflige 2 blessures réparties comme vous le désirez entre une ou deux cibles.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Maintenant que je me suis débarrassée de tes petits joujoux, je vais pouvoir m\'attaquer au vrai problème : toi. »\\n—Chandra Nalaàr, à Dovin Baàn", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590492&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'efe02a12-7ba0-4f1b-b66a-bd903f167607\', \'multiverseId\': 590492}, \'multiverseid\': 590492}, {\'name\': \'Piroelica di Chandra\', \'text\': \'La Piroelica di Chandra infligge 2 danni divisi a tua scelta tra uno o due bersagli.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Ora che ho sistemato i tuoi giocattolini, posso concentrarmi sul vero problema: tu."\\n—Chandra Nalaar a Dovin Baan\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590627&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b7bfb84a-98c1-4355-9810-b856650dcbc1\', \'multiverseId\': 590627}, \'multiverseid\': 590627}, {\'name\': \'チャンドラの螺旋炎\', \'text\': \'クリーチャーやプレインズウォーカーやプレイヤーのうち１つか２つを対象とし、２点分をあなたの望むように割り振る。チャンドラの螺旋炎はそれらにその割り振った点数のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「これであんたのおもちゃは片付いたわね。やっと本当の問題に取り組めるわ。つまり、あんたよ。」\\n――チャンドラ・ナラーからドビン・バーンへ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590762&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c0a98269-e9dc-4c5d-960d-45b94f23bb98\', \'multiverseId\': 590762}, \'multiverseid\': 590762}, {\'name\': \'茜卓的旋炎咒\', \'text\': \'茜卓的旋炎咒对任意一个或两个目标造成共2点伤害，你可以任意分配。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「你的小玩具已经全部处理干净，现在能够专心来对付真正的问题了：你。」\\n～茜卓纳拉怒喝多温班恩\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591167&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bc863046-5037-4801-8091-14c085ee786c\', \'multiverseId\': 591167}, \'multiverseid\': 591167}]', '[{\'name\': \'Danitha Capashen, die Vorbildliche\', \'text\': \'Erstschlag, Wachsamkeit, Lebensverknüpfung\\nAura- und Ausrüstung-Zaubersprüche, die du wirkst, kosten beim Wirken {1} weniger.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Ritter\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich werde die Schwachen beschützen. Ich werde inbrünstig lieben. Ich werde mich der Verzweiflung stellen und weiterkämpfen. Als eine Capashen ist dies meine Pflicht."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591574&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'349b3b88-e05f-44e9-b77b-c799cdd34271\', \'multiverseId\': 591574}, \'multiverseid\': 591574}, {\'name\': \'Danitha Capashen, la ejemplar\', \'text\': \'Daña primero, vigilancia, vínculo vital.\\nTe cuesta {1} menos lanzar hechizos de Aura o de Equipo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Caballero humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Protegeré a los menos afortunados, amaré con valentía, me enfrentaré a la desesperanza y seguiré luchando. Como Capashen, no puedo hacer menos".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591703&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2d0dfd08-9ca1-4e10-a122-efce0ad749c6\', \'multiverseId\': 591703}, \'multiverseid\': 591703}, {\'name\': \'Danitha Capashen, parangon\', \'text\': "Initiative, vigilance, lien de vie\\nLes sorts d\'aura et d\'équipement que vous lancez coûtent {1} de moins à lancer.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et chevalier\', \'flavor\': "« Je protégerai les malheureux. J\'aimerai courageusement. J\'affronterai le désespoir et continuerai à me battre. Je suis une Capashen, c\'est le moins que je puisse faire. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591832&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7fe424b6-f953-4468-98b3-d8938ebc5d4e\', \'multiverseId\': 591832}, \'multiverseid\': 591832}, {\'name\': "Danitha Capashen, l\'Esemplare", \'text\': \'Attacco improvviso, cautela, legame vitale\\nLe magie Aura ed Equipaggiamento che lanci costano {1} in meno per essere lanciate.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Cavaliere Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Proteggerò i meno fortunati, amerò con coraggio, affronterò la disperazione e continuerò a combattere. Sono una Capashen, è il minimo che io possa fare."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591961&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e61ee4e7-e007-40d1-9b3d-cf34b38711d9\', \'multiverseId\': 591961}, \'multiverseid\': 591961}, {\'name\': \'模範となる者、ダニサ・キャパシェン\', \'text\': \'先制攻撃、警戒、絆魂\\nあなたがオーラや装備品である呪文を唱えるためのコストは{1}少なくなる。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・騎士\', \'flavor\': \'「不運な者を守り、勇敢に愛する。絶望に向き合い、闘い続ける。キャパシェンとして、為すべきことを為す。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592090&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6467f07d-dd6b-4de5-9043-262092e23218\', \'multiverseId\': 592090}, \'multiverseid\': 592090}, {\'name\': \'典范达妮莎卡帕轩\', \'text\': \'先攻，警戒，系命\\n你施放的灵气与武具咒语减少{1}来施放。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～人类／骑士\', \'flavor\': \'「我将保护不幸者。我愿勇敢去爱。我会面对困厄，奋战不懈。卡帕轩家训必不或忘。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592477&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2449086c-f9ef-41ad-88b1-2e31f40be664\', \'multiverseId\': 592477}, \'multiverseid\': 592477}]', '[{\'name\': \'Das Rudel füttern\', \'text\': \'Zu Beginn deines Endsegments kannst du eine Nichtspielstein-Kreatur opfern. Falls du dies tust, erzeuge X 2/2 grüne Wolf-Kreaturenspielsteine, wobei X die Widerstandskraft der geopferten Kreatur ist.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592856&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'52bcf2ac-9b1a-43ee-84db-02e1e53a3ce7\', \'multiverseId\': 592856}, \'multiverseid\': 592856}, {\'name\': \'Alimentar a la manada\', \'text\': \'Al comienzo de tu paso final, puedes sacrificar una criatura que no sea ficha. Si lo haces, crea X fichas de criatura Lobo verdes 2/2, donde X es la resistencia de la criatura sacrificada.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592977&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a7dc7d0b-e3b4-4c2a-bc92-32b26708b811\', \'multiverseId\': 592977}, \'multiverseid\': 592977}, {\'name\': \'Nourrir la meute\', \'text\': "Au début de votre étape de fin, vous pouvez sacrifier une créature non-jeton. Si vous faites ainsi, créez X jetons de créature 2/2 verte Loup, X étant l\'endurance de la créature sacrifiée.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593098&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'43a9aeb8-5bf9-4d2e-83aa-db3c816681a5\', \'multiverseId\': 593098}, \'multiverseid\': 593098}, {\'name\': \'Nutrire il Branco\', \'text\': "All\'inizio della tua sottofase finale, puoi sacrificare una creatura non pedina. Se lo fai, crea X pedine creatura Lupo 2/2 verdi, dove X è la costituzione della creatura sacrificata.", \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593219&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cf088b8c-a826-4b7e-8a8b-738139cbcce3\', \'multiverseId\': 593219}, \'multiverseid\': 593219}, {\'name\': \'群れに餌\', \'text\': \'あなたの終了ステップの開始時に、あなたはトークンでないクリーチャー１体を生け贄に捧げてもよい。そうしたなら、緑の２/２の狼・クリーチャー・トークンＸ体を生成する。Ｘは、その生け贄に捧げられたクリーチャーのタフネスに等しい。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593340&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1039ccdc-2be1-44e4-b551-07dd67f21f9b\', \'multiverseId\': 593340}, \'multiverseid\': 593340}, {\'name\': \'喂食狼群\', \'text\': \'在你的结束步骤开始时，你可以牺牲一个非衍生物的生物。若你如此作，则派出X个2/2绿色的狼衍生生物，X为所牺牲生物的防御力。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593703&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'359284bf-4672-461e-9086-5ed5b384b316\', \'multiverseId\': 593703}, \'multiverseid\': 593703}]', "[{'name': 'Dekret der Gerechtigkeit', 'text': 'Erzeuge X 4/4 weiße Engel-Kreaturenspielsteine mit Flugfähigkeit.\\nUmwandlung {2}{W} ({2}{W}, wirf diese Karte ab: Ziehe eine Karte.)\\nWenn du das Dekret der Gerechtigkeit umwandelst, kannst du {X} bezahlen. Falls du dies tust, erzeuge X 1/1 weiße Soldat-Kreaturenspielsteine.', 'type': 'Hexerei', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591579&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c10d1f85-cd18-4823-a039-2a85641f741f', 'multiverseId': 591579}, 'multiverseid': 591579}, {'name': 'Decreto de justicia', 'text': 'Crea X fichas de criatura Ángel blancas 4/4 con la habilidad de volar.\\nCiclo {2}{W}. ({2}{W}, descartar esta carta: Roba una carta.)\\nCuando actives la habilidad de ciclo del Decreto de justicia, puedes pagar {X}. Si lo haces, crea X fichas de criatura Soldado blancas 1/1.', 'type': 'Conjuro', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591708&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8fb44e51-a7b3-44a5-bf0f-00846b1857e0', 'multiverseId': 591708}, 'multiverseid': 591708}, {'name': 'Décret de justice', 'text': 'Créez X jetons de créature 4/4 blanche Ange avec le vol.\\nRecyclage {2}{W} ({2}{W}, défaussez-vous de cette carte : Piochez une carte.)\\nQuand vous recyclez le Décret de justice, vous pouvez payer {X}. Si vous faites ainsi, créez X jetons de créature 1/1 blanche Soldat.', 'type': 'Rituel', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591837&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f893d58e-9928-4bf5-acc8-37b29337d52e', 'multiverseId': 591837}, 'multiverseid': 591837}, {'name': 'Decreto della Giustizia', 'text': 'Crea X pedine creatura Angelo 4/4 bianche con volare.\\nCiclo {2}{W} ({2}{W}, Scarta questa carta: Pesca una carta.)\\nQuando cicli il Decreto della Giustizia, puoi pagare {X}. Se lo fai, crea X pedine creatura Soldato 1/1 bianche.', 'type': 'Stregoneria', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591966&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f598526c-4a56-43e2-919d-f72ff565b711', 'multiverseId': 591966}, 'multiverseid': 591966}, {'name': '正義の命令', 'text': '飛行を持つ白の４/４の天使・クリーチャー・トークンＸ体を生成する。\\nサイクリング{2}{W}（{2}{W}, このカードを捨てる：カード１枚を引く。）\\nあなたが正義の命令をサイクリングしたとき、あなたは{X}を支払ってもよい。そうしたなら、白の１/１の兵士・クリーチャー・トークンＸ体を生成する。', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592095&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '68006c77-bb03-4bb4-b283-8548e5465b53', 'multiverseId': 592095}, 'multiverseid': 592095}, {'name': '正义的宣判', 'text': '派出X个4/4白色，具飞行异能的天使衍生生物。\\n循环{2}{W}（{2}{W}，弃掉此牌：抓一张牌。）\\n当你循环正义的宣判时，你可以支付{X}。若你如此作，则派出X个1/1白色士兵衍生生物。', 'type': '法术', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592482&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b903ac46-d6a2-407e-9c40-08a627cf6288', 'multiverseId': 592482}, 'multiverseid': 592482}]", '[{\'name\': \'Dem Tod trotzen\', \'text\': \'Bringe eine Kreaturenkarte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof ins Spiel zurück. Falls sie ein Engel ist, lege zwei +1/+1-Marken auf sie.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Sela trieb den mordlustigen Dämon bei den Gräbern der toten Dorfbewohner in die Enge. „Ein passendes Ende", murmelte der Engel, als er sein Schwert erhob.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591580&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'363bb884-b7d5-4ea3-ad49-6c8f90258931\', \'multiverseId\': 591580}, \'multiverseid\': 591580}, {\'name\': \'Desafiar a la muerte\', \'text\': \'Regresa la carta de criatura objetivo de tu cementerio al campo de batalla. Si es un Ángel, pon dos contadores +1/+1 sobre ella.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Gisela acorraló al demonio asesino entre las tumbas de los aldeanos muertos. "Un final muy adecuado", murmuró mientras levantaba la espada.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591709&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e24ae164-ebe7-4d49-bcf7-cca53835c108\', \'multiverseId\': 591709}, \'multiverseid\': 591709}, {\'name\': \'Trompe-la-mort\', \'text\': "Renvoyez sur le champ de bataille une carte de créature ciblée depuis votre cimetière. Si c\'est un ange, mettez deux marqueurs +1/+1 sur elle.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'Gisela accula le démon meurtrier au milieu des tombes des villageois défunts. « Une fin appropriée » murmura-t-elle en levant son épée.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591838&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5ac7a220-4a0a-44b8-abd2-6213e8e6fd06\', \'multiverseId\': 591838}, \'multiverseid\': 591838}, {\'name\': \'Sfidare la Morte\', \'text\': \'Rimetti sul campo di battaglia una carta creatura bersaglio dal tuo cimitero. Se è un Angelo, metti due segnalini +1/+1 su di essa.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'Gisela intrappolò il demone assassino tra le tombe del villaggio. "Una fine appropriata" mormorò sollevando la spada.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591967&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e27f1b86-0b32-49d9-ac39-98847339d383\', \'multiverseId\': 591967}, \'multiverseid\': 591967}, {\'name\': \'死の超克\', \'text\': \'あなたの墓地にあるクリーチャー・カード１枚を対象とする。それを戦場に戻す。それが天使であるなら、それの上に＋１/＋１カウンター２個を置く。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'ギセラは立ち並ぶ村人の墓の間に残忍な悪魔を追い詰めた。「おまえらしい最期ね」と呟いて、彼女は剣を振りかざした。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592096&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4448731a-2206-4aa7-804b-abefeb58c588\', \'multiverseId\': 592096}, \'multiverseid\': 592096}, {\'name\': \'拒斥死亡\', \'text\': \'将目标生物牌从你的坟墓场移回战场。如果它是天使，则在其上放置两个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'姬瑟拉将凶残恶魔逼入村民墓地一隅。「该此下场。」她举剑时低声说。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592483&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6b5b79ce-825f-4cf4-8909-1abcf38bfea8\', \'multiverseId\': 592483}, \'multiverseid\': 592483}]', '[{\'name\': \'Die Höhen erklimmen\', \'text\': \'Lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf bis zu eine Kreatur deiner Wahl. Du erhältst 2 Lebenspunkte dazu. Du darfst in diesem Zug ein zusätzliches Land spielen.\\nZiehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Immer weiter, immer höher in den Himmel."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592923&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bd7009fc-18da-4e6c-8759-2d510bc1f068\', \'multiverseId\': 592923}, \'multiverseid\': 592923}, {\'name\': \'Escalar las alturas\', \'text\': \'Pon un contador +1/+1 sobre hasta una criatura objetivo. Ganas 2 vidas. Puedes jugar una tierra adicional este turno.\\nRoba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Siempre hacia adelante; siempre hacia el cielo".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593044&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'15b56c22-825a-45d5-a68d-64df31a8f216\', \'multiverseId\': 593044}, \'multiverseid\': 593044}, {\'name\': \'Gravir le sommet\', \'text\': "Ciblez jusqu\'à une créature. Mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur elle. Vous gagnez 2 points de vie. Vous pouvez jouer un terrain supplémentaire ce tour-ci.\\nPiochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'« Toujours plus loin, toujours plus haut. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593165&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9317f783-098f-4e2c-9020-c9335417f36a\', \'multiverseId\': 593165}, \'multiverseid\': 593165}, {\'name\': \'Scalare le Vette\', \'text\': \'Scegli fino a una creatura bersaglio. Metti un segnalino +1/+1 su di essa. Guadagni 2 punti vita. Puoi giocare una terra addizionale in questo turno.\\nPesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Sempre avanti, sempre in alto."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593286&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cd976d55-9c04-4a31-b321-30a9aafe4591\', \'multiverseId\': 593286}, \'multiverseid\': 593286}, {\'name\': \'高所の追求\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー最大１体を対象とする。それの上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。あなたは２点のライフを得る。このターン、あなたは追加で土地１つをプレイしてもよい。\\nカード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「常に前へ。常に空へ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593407&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'26b200ce-46d5-492b-b5ca-30e07b718a4f\', \'multiverseId\': 593407}, \'multiverseid\': 593407}, {\'name\': \'勇攀高峰\', \'text\': \'在至多一个目标生物上放置一个+1/+1指示物。你获得2点生命。本回合中，你可以额外使用一个地。\\n抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「攀高峰，登天际。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593770&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a0d0a919-fcf9-4e07-b156-460b073e4bc5\', \'multiverseId\': 593770}, \'multiverseid\': 593770}]', '[{\'name\': \'Die Macht der Massen\', \'text\': \'Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält für jede Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, +1/+1 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Es gibt nichts Mächtigeres als Herzen, die vereint für eine Sache kämpfen."\\n—Emmara\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592889&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ad0e9d82-5e2d-4f3d-8e2a-689827aaa7d3\', \'multiverseId\': 592889}, \'multiverseid\': 592889}, {\'name\': \'Poder de las masas\', \'text\': \'La criatura objetivo obtiene +1/+1 hasta el final del turno por cada criatura que controlas.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"No hay nada más poderoso que muchos corazones unidos por una misma causa".\\n—Emmara\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593010&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3d0714d6-32c3-41e7-9fe6-505b0d3803e2\', \'multiverseId\': 593010}, \'multiverseid\': 593010}, {\'name\': \'Puissance des masses\', \'text\': "Une créature ciblée gagne +1/+1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour pour chaque créature que vous contrôlez.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Il n\'existe rien de plus fort qu\'une multitude de cœurs unis pour une même cause. »\\n—Emmara", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593131&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bf05f2be-9753-4a7a-805e-6d64738c351e\', \'multiverseId\': 593131}, \'multiverseid\': 593131}, {\'name\': \'Potere delle Masse\', \'text\': \'Una creatura bersaglio prende +1/+1 fino alla fine del turno per ogni creatura che controlli.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Niente è più potente di molti cuori uniti per la stessa causa."\\n—Emmara\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593252&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'473ea002-0a4d-4aa1-922a-48c0ee4eca7f\', \'multiverseId\': 593252}, \'multiverseid\': 593252}, {\'name\': \'大群の力\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それはあなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体につき＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「一つの理由により団結した多くの心よりも強いものはない。」\\n――イマーラ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593373&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8649f259-9381-402a-8aaa-49d9d7f831c6\', \'multiverseId\': 593373}, \'multiverseid\': 593373}, {\'name\': \'众人之力\', \'text\': \'你每操控一个生物，目标生物便得+1/+1直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「众人齐心，其利断金。」\\n～艾玛拉\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593736&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0c1ec3df-3ff1-4e6d-878a-c319ca1f7ada\', \'multiverseId\': 593736}, \'multiverseid\': 593736}]', '[{\'name\': \'Die Zeichen deuten\', \'text\': \'Hellsicht 3, decke dann die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek auf. Ziehe Karten entsprechend dem Manabetrag der Karte. (Schaue dir für Hellsicht 3 die obersten drei Karten deiner Bibliothek an und lege dann eine beliebige Anzahl davon unter deine Bibliothek und den Rest in beliebiger Reihenfolge oben darauf.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595235&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'56d26ec3-b346-475b-8cc4-1858d0e3acdf\', \'multiverseId\': 595235}, \'multiverseid\': 595235}, {\'name\': \'Interpretar las señales\', \'text\': \'Adivina 3, luego muestra la primera carta de tu biblioteca. Roba una cantidad de cartas igual al valor de maná de esa carta. (Para adivinar 3, mira las tres primeras cartas de tu biblioteca, luego pon cualquier cantidad de ellas en el fondo de tu biblioteca y el resto en la parte superior en cualquier orden.)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595343&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'66254fea-6636-400e-9d22-6cfee5632d72\', \'multiverseId\': 595343}, \'multiverseid\': 595343}, {\'name\': \'Interpréter les signes\', \'text\': "Regard 3, puis révélez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Piochez un nombre de cartes égal à la valeur de mana de cette carte. (Pour appliquer regard 3, regardez les trois cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Mettez n\'importe quel nombre d\'entre elles au-dessous de votre bibliothèque et le reste au-dessus, dans l\'ordre de votre choix.)", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595451&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c364ee56-7773-4c34-9b16-f5e50487392e\', \'multiverseId\': 595451}, \'multiverseid\': 595451}, {\'name\': \'Interpretare i Segni\', \'text\': \'Profetizza 3, poi rivela la prima carta del tuo grimorio. Pesca carte pari al valore di mana di quella carta. (Per profetizzare 3, guarda le prime tre carte del tuo grimorio, poi mettine un qualsiasi numero in fondo al tuo grimorio e le altre in cima in qualsiasi ordine.)\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595559&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d5be6764-d9e8-4d4d-a250-7fa230fb6adb\', \'multiverseId\': 595559}, \'multiverseid\': 595559}, {\'name\': \'啓示の解読\', \'text\': \'占術３を行い、その後、あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード１枚を公開する。そのカードのマナ総量に等しい枚数のカードを引く。（占術３とは、あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード３枚を見て、そのうち望む枚数をあなたのライブラリーの一番下に、残りを一番上に、それぞれ望む順番で置くことである。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595667&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f6ef4119-587e-40da-880c-6b526a204bb1\', \'multiverseId\': 595667}, \'multiverseid\': 595667}, {\'name\': \'解读预兆\', \'text\': \'占卜3，然后展示你的牌库顶牌。抓若干牌，其数量等同于该牌的法术力值。（占卜3的流程是检视你牌库顶的三张牌，然后将其中任意数量的牌以任意顺序置于你牌库底，其余则以任意顺序置于你牌库顶。）\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595991&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5cb560c4-7db4-41d6-8469-853d573f7eb5\', \'multiverseId\': 595991}, \'multiverseid\': 595991}]', '[{\'name\': \'Die Zukunft entfachen\', \'text\': \'Schicke die obersten drei Karten deiner Bibliothek ins Exil. Du kannst sie bis zum Ende deines nächsten Zuges spielen. Falls dieser Zauberspruch aus einem Friedhof gewirkt wurde, kannst du Karten auf diese Weise spielen, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen.\\nRückblende {7}{R} (Du kannst diese Karte aus deinem Friedhof für ihre Rückblendekosten wirken. Schicke sie danach ins Exil.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590263&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a2cebadf-90a3-4d8d-92a9-2fd36d1f6ab6\', \'multiverseId\': 590263}, \'multiverseid\': 590263}, {\'name\': \'Avivar el futuro\', \'text\': \'Exilia las tres primeras cartas de tu biblioteca. Hasta el final de tu próximo turno, puedes jugar esas cartas. Si este hechizo fue lanzado desde un cementerio, puedes jugar cartas de esta manera sin pagar sus costes de maná.\\nRetrospectiva {7}{R}. (Puedes lanzar esta carta desde tu cementerio pagando su coste de retrospectiva. Luego exíliala.)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590398&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a25b977c-1651-41db-b86c-5fa751a3aec1\', \'multiverseId\': 590398}, \'multiverseid\': 590398}, {\'name\': "Embraser l\'avenir", \'text\': "Exilez les trois cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Jusqu\'à la fin de votre prochain tour, vous pouvez jouer ces cartes. Si ce sort a été lancé depuis un cimetière, vous pouvez jouer des cartes de cette manière sans payer leur coût de mana.\\nFlashback {7}{R} (Vous pouvez lancer cette carte depuis votre cimetière pour son coût de flashback. Exilez-la ensuite.)", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590533&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5003ba25-72d2-434f-9f95-3c4dd462a3e9\', \'multiverseId\': 590533}, \'multiverseid\': 590533}, {\'name\': \'Infiammare il Futuro\', \'text\': \'Esilia le prime tre carte del tuo grimorio. Fino alla fine del tuo prossimo turno, puoi giocare quelle carte. Se questa magia è stata lanciata da un cimitero, puoi giocare carte in questo modo senza pagare il loro costo di mana.\\nFlashback {7}{R} (Puoi lanciare questa carta dal tuo cimitero pagando il suo costo di flashback. Poi esiliala.)\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590668&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4b052cd9-5dfb-4bc5-89e8-15b2f7efcd2f\', \'multiverseId\': 590668}, \'multiverseid\': 590668}, {\'name\': \'未来を点火\', \'text\': \'あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード３枚を追放する。次のあなたのターンの終了時まで、あなたはそれらのカードをプレイしてもよい。この呪文を墓地から唱えていたなら、次のあなたのターンの終了時まで、あなたはそれらのカードをマナ・コストを支払うことなくプレイしてもよい。\\nフラッシュバック{7}{R}（あなたはあなたの墓地にあるこのカードをフラッシュバック・コストで唱えてもよい。その後、これを追放する。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590803&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0a1862b8-9d2e-46a5-bc93-9cd7d0358a81\', \'multiverseId\': 590803}, \'multiverseid\': 590803}, {\'name\': \'燃亮未来\', \'text\': \'放逐你牌库顶的三张牌。直到你下一个回合的回合结束，你可以使用这些牌。如果此咒语是从坟墓场施放，则你以此法使用这些牌时，可以不支付其法术力费用。\\n返照{7}{R}（你可以从你坟墓场中施放此牌，并支付其返照费用，然后将它放逐。）\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591208&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d1866035-fa24-4b6e-977d-399ac288c066\', \'multiverseId\': 591208}, \'multiverseid\': 591208}]', '[{\'name\': \'Diebische Ratte\', \'text\': \'Wenn die Diebische Ratte ins Spiel kommt, wirft jeder Gegner eine Karte ab.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Ratte\', \'flavor\': \'„Sogar Ratten horten ihre Schätze. Sind deine Kostbarkeiten so anders?"\\n—Izoni\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594041&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'890bd3e6-535b-441d-a307-43a3167e4af9\', \'multiverseId\': 594041}, \'multiverseid\': 594041}, {\'name\': \'Rata ladrona\', \'text\': \'Cuando la Rata ladrona entre al campo de batalla, cada oponente descarta una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Rata\', \'flavor\': \'"Incluso las ratas acumulan sus tesoros. ¿Tan distintos son tus objetos preciados?".\\n—Izoni\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594158&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dc89d65c-dbce-4c01-a90b-f31e653664ae\', \'multiverseId\': 594158}, \'multiverseid\': 594158}, {\'name\': \'Rat cambrioleur\', \'text\': "Quand le Rat cambrioleur arrive sur le champ de bataille, chaque adversaire se défausse d\'une carte.", \'type\': \'Créature : rat\', \'flavor\': \'« Même les rats accumulent des trésors. Vos objets précieux sont-ils vraiment si différents ? »\\n—Izoni\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594275&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e884a154-875c-415c-a782-edfef14357e0\', \'multiverseId\': 594275}, \'multiverseid\': 594275}, {\'name\': \'Ratto Predatore\', \'text\': \'Quando il Ratto Predatore entra nel campo di battaglia, ogni avversario scarta una carta.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Ratto\', \'flavor\': \'"Persino i ratti accatastano i loro tesori. I tuoi preziosi gingilli sono poi così diversi?"\\n—Izoni\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594392&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4092886d-9fb2-48d6-83e8-a5ad9551d92d\', \'multiverseId\': 594392}, \'multiverseid\': 594392}, {\'name\': \'泥棒ネズミ\', \'text\': \'泥棒ネズミが戦場に出たとき、各対戦相手はそれぞれカード１枚を捨てる。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ネズミ\', \'flavor\': \'「ネズミですらお宝をしまい込んでいます。あなたの大切な物というのは、それと何が違うのですか？」\\n――アイゾーニ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594509&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4d9acfe6-173a-48ed-b548-286551b85a07\', \'multiverseId\': 594509}, \'multiverseid\': 594509}, {\'name\': \'窃物鼠\', \'text\': \'当窃物鼠进战场时，每位对手各弃一张牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～老鼠\', \'flavor\': \'「连老鼠都会囤积财宝。你的珍贵宝贝又有什么特别呢？」\\n～依佐妮\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594860&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6666e35c-ffb8-4b27-8aec-4190f2f6ff7a\', \'multiverseId\': 594860}, \'multiverseid\': 594860}]', '[{\'name\': \'Diebischer Falke\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\n{S}, {T}: Ziehe eine Karte und wirf dann eine Karte ab. ({S} kann mit einem Mana von einer verschneiten Quelle bezahlt werden.)\', \'type\': \'Verschneite Kreatur — Vogel\', \'flavor\': \'„Nun, wenigstens hat er uns dafür eine Maus dagelassen. Äh … Urks … Besser gesagt: eine halbe Maus."\\n—Binhald, Beskir-Veteran\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595262&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2ee249ba-7501-4adf-bc3d-544bbf20e11e\', \'multiverseId\': 595262}, \'multiverseid\': 595262}, {\'name\': \'Halcón ladrón\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\n{S}, {T}: Roba una carta, luego descarta una carta. ({S} puede pagarse con un maná de una fuente nevada.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura nevada — Ave\', \'flavor\': \'"Bueno, al menos a cambio nos ha dado un ratón. Em... Ugh... Vale, medio ratón".\\n—Binhald, veterano beskir\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595370&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0c3ba472-b020-42df-a7a1-3eb86b10c5c2\', \'multiverseId\': 595370}, \'multiverseid\': 595370}, {\'name\': \'Faucon chapardeur\', \'text\': "Vol\\n{S}, {T} : Piochez une carte, puis défaussez-vous d\'une carte. ({S} peut être payé avec un mana d\'une source neigeuse.)", \'type\': \'Créature neigeuse : oiseau\', \'flavor\': \'« Eh bien, il nous a au moins laissé une souris en échange. Enfin... euh... plutôt une demi souris. »\\n—Binhald, vétéran beskir\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595478&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f2d2dca4-9418-4da1-ad44-72231d80c83e\', \'multiverseId\': 595478}, \'multiverseid\': 595478}, {\'name\': \'Falco Ladruncolo\', \'text\': \'Volare\\n{S}, {T}: Pesca una carta, poi scarta una carta. ({S} può essere pagato con un mana da una fonte neve.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura Neve — Uccello\', \'flavor\': \'"Beh, almeno ci ha lasciato un topo in cambio. Ehm... bleah... diciamo mezzo topo."\\n—Binhald, veterano Beskir\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595586&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c77ca831-32ac-4611-8862-30a056d96fbf\', \'multiverseId\': 595586}, \'multiverseid\': 595586}, {\'name\': \'くすねる鷹\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n{S}, {T}：カード１枚を引き、その後カード１枚を捨てる。（{S}は氷雪である発生源からのマナ１点で支払える。）\', \'type\': \'氷雪クリーチャー — 鳥\', \'flavor\': \'「とりあえずあいつは代わりにネズミを置いていった。えー、その、実際はネズミの半分、だ。」\\n――ベスキールの古参、ビンハルド\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595694&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5d5a114b-bc25-434a-922d-b4646a24c3df\', \'multiverseId\': 595694}, \'multiverseid\': 595694}, {\'name\': \'偷窃翔鹰\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n{S}，{T}：抓一张牌，然后弃一张牌。（{S}能以产自雪境来源的一点法术力来支付。）\', \'type\': \'雪境生物 ～鸟\', \'flavor\': \'「好吧，至少它还留了只老鼠当作交换。呃…呕…是半只老鼠。」\\n～贝斯奇老兵宾哈德\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596018&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ce09f1f4-5586-45e5-a73b-1a40e57eaeda\', \'multiverseId\': 596018}, \'multiverseid\': 596018}]', '[{\'name\': \'Diener der Drachenfürstin\', \'text\': \'Drache-Zaubersprüche, die du wirkst, kosten beim Wirken {1} weniger.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Goblin, Schamane\', \'flavor\': \'Atarka-Goblins schmieren sich mit dem Öl giftiger Kräuter ein, in der Hoffnung, nicht als Dessert für ihre gefräßigen Meister zu enden.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590232&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'329bad5b-e2a3-4b21-b0fa-cac9b26f784d\', \'multiverseId\': 590232}, \'multiverseid\': 590232}, {\'name\': \'Sirviente de la señora dragón\', \'text\': \'Te cuesta {1} menos lanzar los hechizos de Dragón.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Chamán trasgo\', \'flavor\': \'Los trasgos que sirven a Atarka se untan de grasa mezclada con hierbas venenosas con la esperanza de que sus voraces señores no los añadan al banquete.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590367&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'934cdb14-0e4b-47d0-a438-1243960b5d26\', \'multiverseId\': 590367}, \'multiverseid\': 590367}, {\'name\': \'Servant du seigneur-dragon\', \'text\': \'Les sorts de dragon que vous lancez coûtent {1} de moins à lancer.\', \'type\': \'Créature : gobelin et shamane\', \'flavor\': "Les gobelins servant Atarka s\'enduisent de graisse imprégnée de plantes toxiques, espérant ainsi décourager leurs maîtres voraces de les ajouter au menu.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590502&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'32da7652-5aad-45e4-8065-99a405cf38d2\', \'multiverseId\': 590502}, \'multiverseid\': 590502}, {\'name\': \'Servitore del Signore dei Draghi\', \'text\': \'Le magie Drago che lanci costano {1} in meno per essere lanciate.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Sciamano Goblin\', \'flavor\': "I goblin servitori di Atarka si spalmano il corpo di grasso infuso con erbe velenose, sperando di scoraggiare i loro famelici padroni dall\'includerli nel loro pasto.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590637&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bacb7a98-1d36-4f13-8405-2ccc10dfb002\', \'multiverseId\': 590637}, \'multiverseid\': 590637}, {\'name\': \'龍王の召使い\', \'text\': \'あなたがドラゴン・呪文を唱えるためのコストは{1}少なくなる。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ゴブリン・シャーマン\', \'flavor\': \'アタルカに仕えるゴブリンたちは、空腹なご主人様が彼らを食事のメニューに付け加えるのを思いとどまってくれることを期待して、自らの体に有害な薬草を練り込んだ油脂を塗りたくっている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590772&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'50a2c052-b0a4-49d2-9cc2-17a9289ee1e1\', \'multiverseId\': 590772}, \'multiverseid\': 590772}, {\'name\': \'龙王仆役\', \'text\': \'你施放的龙咒语减少{1}来施放。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～鬼怪／祭师\', \'flavor\': \'服侍安塔卡的鬼怪在身上涂满加了毒草的油脂，希望他们永无餍足的主人不会拿他们加菜。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591177&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a068e5f6-3b10-4cb9-83df-4313c0a5a624\', \'multiverseId\': 591177}, \'multiverseid\': 591177}]', '[{\'name\': \'Diener der Schuppe\', \'text\': \'Der Diener der Schuppe kommt mit einer +1/+1-Marke ins Spiel.\\nWenn der Diener der Schuppe stirbt, lege X +1/+1-Marken auf eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst, wobei X gleich der Anzahl an +1/+1-Marken auf dem Diener der Schuppe ist.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Soldat\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592926&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'50775b1a-7695-4124-82bf-077c537fb8ee\', \'multiverseId\': 592926}, \'multiverseid\': 592926}, {\'name\': \'Sirviente de la escama\', \'text\': \'El Sirviente de la escama entra al campo de batalla con un contador +1/+1 sobre él.\\nCuando el Sirviente de la escama muera, pon X contadores +1/+1 sobre la criatura objetivo que controlas, donde X es la cantidad de contadores +1/+1 sobre el Sirviente de la escama.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593047&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'baccd670-b129-4dc8-a2e7-8ecf4b64e572\', \'multiverseId\': 593047}, \'multiverseid\': 593047}, {\'name\': "Servant de l\'Écaille", \'text\': "Le Servant de l\'Écaille arrive sur le champ de bataille avec un marqueur +1/+1 sur lui.\\nQuand le Servant de l\'Écaille meurt, mettez X marqueurs +1/+1 sur une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez, X étant le nombre de marqueurs +1/+1 sur le Servant de l\'Écaille.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et soldat\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593168&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'91e7260c-7b4b-4565-b10f-1205620e3bc9\', \'multiverseId\': 593168}, \'multiverseid\': 593168}, {\'name\': \'Servitore della Scaglia\', \'text\': \'Il Servitore della Scaglia entra nel campo di battaglia con un segnalino +1/+1.\\nQuando il Servitore della Scaglia muore, metti X segnalini +1/+1 su una creatura bersaglio che controlli, dove X è il numero di segnalini +1/+1 sul Servitore della Scaglia.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Soldato Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593289&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'10e90e81-268e-4dc5-be2d-57e639c00915\', \'multiverseId\': 593289}, \'multiverseid\': 593289}, {\'name\': \'鱗の召使い\', \'text\': \'鱗の召使いは＋１/＋１カウンター１個が置かれた状態で戦場に出る。\\n鱗の召使いが死亡したとき、あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。それの上に＋１/＋１カウンターＸ個を置く。Ｘは鱗の召使いの上にある＋１/＋１カウンターの個数に等しい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・兵士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593410&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7dadd069-31c3-4533-8376-9d343a858823\', \'multiverseId\': 593410}, \'multiverseid\': 593410}, {\'name\': \'龙鳞仆从\', \'text\': \'龙鳞仆从进战场时上面有一个+1/+1指示物。\\n当龙鳞仆从死去时，在目标由你操控的生物上放置X个+1/+1指示物，X为龙鳞仆从上的+1/+1指示物数量。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／士兵\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593773&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'820095da-f592-477b-b4cb-a7b8903d1427\', \'multiverseId\': 593773}, \'multiverseid\': 593773}]', '[{\'name\': \'Diener des Filigranen\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nDie Stärke des Dieners des Filigranen ist gleich der Anzahl an Artefakten, die du kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Homunkulus\', \'flavor\': \'„Der perfekte Helfer ist ein reaktionsschneller und geschickter Assistent, der in der Lage ist, alle hohen Regale zu erreichen."\\n—Coruk, Esper-Handwerker\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595224&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8355eab3-8f80-4f73-ad84-a858cbff7399\', \'multiverseId\': 595224}, \'multiverseid\': 595224}, {\'name\': \'Ayudante de filigrana\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nLa fuerza del Ayudante de filigrana es igual a la cantidad de artefactos que controlas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Homúnculo\', \'flavor\': \'"El ayudante ideal es el que está atento, es hábil y puede llegar a las estanterías altas".\\n—Córuk, artífice de Esper\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595332&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1b46df17-4df3-4c50-8714-123299a1a6d4\', \'multiverseId\': 595332}, \'multiverseid\': 595332}, {\'name\': \'Suivant de filigrane\', \'text\': "Vol\\nLa force du Suivant de filigrane est égale au nombre d\'artefacts que vous contrôlez.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : homoncule\', \'flavor\': "« Le parfait assistant doit être réactif, adroit et capable d\'atteindre les étagères les plus hautes. »\\n—Coruk, artificier d\'Esper", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595440&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a6cb0458-5b2c-4818-b936-5558e976b443\', \'multiverseId\': 595440}, \'multiverseid\': 595440}, {\'name\': \'Servitore di Filigrana\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nLa forza del Servitore di Filigrana è pari al numero di artefatti che controlli.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Omuncolo\', \'flavor\': \'"L\\\'assistente perfetto deve essere reattivo, capace e in grado di raggiungere gli scaffali più alti."\\n—Coruk, artefice di Esper\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595548&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5407d8f1-11be-4245-be21-a255316bea88\', \'multiverseId\': 595548}, \'multiverseid\': 595548}, {\'name\': \'金線の従者\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n金線の従者のパワーは、あなたがコントロールしているアーティファクトの数に等しい。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — ホムンクルス\', \'flavor\': \'「完璧な助手の条件は、責任感があり、器用で、高い棚にも手が届くことだ。」\\n――エスパーの工匠、コルーク\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595656&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c534822f-f15c-415c-9fe3-c8983f62f86b\', \'multiverseId\': 595656}, \'multiverseid\': 595656}, {\'name\': \'丝金随员\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n丝金随员的力量等同于由你操控之神器数量。\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～造妖\', \'flavor\': \'「最完美的助理要反应快，手工巧，还能摸到架子最高处。」\\n～艾斯波神器师寇路\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595980&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b521071a-54e6-48fa-85cf-853c188982e5\', \'multiverseId\': 595980}, \'multiverseid\': 595980}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dirigentin der Kakofonie\', \'text\': \'Die Dirigentin der Kakofonie kommt mit zwei +1/+1-Marken ins Spiel.\\n{B}, entferne eine +1/+1-Marke von der Dirigentin der Kakofonie: Sie fügt jeder anderen Kreatur und jedem Spieler 1 Schadenspunkt zu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Dämon\', \'flavor\': \'Nur eine Nachahmung von gequälten Schreien — so behaupten die Rakdos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589625&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f5977e60-74af-4c98-9684-0873415f9cc4\', \'multiverseId\': 589625}, \'multiverseid\': 589625}, {\'name\': \'Directora de la disonancia\', \'text\': \'La Directora de la disonancia entra al campo de batalla con dos contadores +1/+1 sobre ella.\\n{B}, remover un contador +1/+1 de la Directora de la disonancia: Hace 1 punto de daño a cada otra criatura y a cada jugador.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Demonio\', \'flavor\': \'Solo es una imitación de los gritos de agonía..., o al menos eso afirman los rakdos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589676&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'893d6e26-abf3-46a5-a7aa-0d834af80cd9\', \'multiverseId\': 589676}, \'multiverseid\': 589676}, {\'name\': "Chef d\'orchestre cacophonique", \'text\': "Le Chef d\'orchestre cacophonique arrive sur le champ de bataille avec deux marqueurs +1/+1 sur lui.\\n{B}, retirez un marqueur +1/+1 du Chef d\'orchestre cacophonique : Il inflige 1 blessure à chaque autre créature et à chaque joueur.", \'type\': \'Créature : démon\', \'flavor\': "Une simple imitation de cris de torture... enfin, si l\'on en croit les Rakdos.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589727&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fd7604e3-6aac-43cb-8696-90583aa0cf86\', \'multiverseId\': 589727}, \'multiverseid\': 589727}, {\'name\': \'Direttrice della Cacofonia\', \'text\': \'La Direttrice della Cacofonia entra nel campo di battaglia con due segnalini +1/+1.\\n{B}, Rimuovi un segnalino +1/+1 dalla Direttrice della Cacofonia: Infligge 1 danno a ogni altra creatura e a ogni giocatore.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Demone\', \'flavor\': \'Una mera imitazione delle urla dei torturati, almeno secondo i Rakdos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589778&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'268e83f5-d2f7-47c8-9818-54b0a80e0ffe\', \'multiverseId\': 589778}, \'multiverseid\': 589778}, {\'name\': \'喧騒の指揮者\', \'text\': \'喧騒の指揮者は＋１/＋１カウンター２個が置かれた状態で戦場に出る。\\n{B},喧騒の指揮者の上から＋１/＋１カウンター１個を取り除く：これはこれでない各クリーチャーと各プレイヤーにそれぞれ１点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — デーモン\', \'flavor\': \'拷問中の悲鳴の真似事にすぎない。それがラクドスの言い分だ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589829&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'02e821f3-1f0d-4de9-855f-8d7e75dec737\', \'multiverseId\': 589829}, \'multiverseid\': 589829}, {\'name\': \'乱调指挥魔\', \'text\': \'乱调指挥魔进战场时上面有两个+1/+1指示物。\\n{B}，从乱调指挥魔上移去一个+1/+1指示物：它对每个其他生物和每位牌手各造成1点伤害。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～恶魔\', \'flavor\': \'曲调只不过是听起来像受虐哀号而已～至少拉铎司人是这么说的。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589982&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e239835a-3418-4271-9a85-aae5a3464f24\', \'multiverseId\': 589982}, \'multiverseid\': 589982}]', '[{\'name\': \'Domestizierte Hydra\', \'text\': \'{X}{G}{G}{G}: Monstrum X. (Falls diese Kreatur nicht monströs ist, lege X +1/+1-Marken auf sie und sie wird monströs.)\\nSolange die Domestizierte Hydra monströs ist, verursacht sie Trampelschaden.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Hydra\', \'flavor\': \'„Sitz. Hol. Verwüste."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592846&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'85310ade-ee6a-4ef9-8973-d7473e079e07\', \'multiverseId\': 592846}, \'multiverseid\': 592846}, {\'name\': \'Hidra amaestrada\', \'text\': \'{X}{G}{G}{G}: Monstruosidad X. (Si esta criatura no es monstruosa, pon X contadores +1/+1 sobre ella y se convierte en monstruosa.)\\nMientras la Hidra amaestrada sea monstruosa, tiene la habilidad de arrollar.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hidra\', \'flavor\': \'"Siéntate. La patita. Arrasa".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592967&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d1ba3bb3-cb4b-4fb0-a973-3ccbe62a1590\', \'multiverseId\': 592967}, \'multiverseid\': 592967}, {\'name\': \'Hydre apprivoisée\', \'text\': "{X}{G}{G}{G} : Monstruosité X. (Si cette créature n\'est pas monstrueuse, mettez X marqueurs +1/+1 sur elle et elle devient monstrueuse.)\\nTant que l\'Hydre apprivoisée est monstrueuse, elle a le piétinement.", \'type\': \'Créature : hydre\', \'flavor\': \'« Assis. Va chercher. Démolis. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593088&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ee46da1f-c08b-41e1-b3d9-e89311cb3082\', \'multiverseId\': 593088}, \'multiverseid\': 593088}, {\'name\': \'Idra Addomesticata\', \'text\': "{X}{G}{G}{G}: Mostruosità X. (Se questa creatura non è mostruosa, metti X segnalini +1/+1 su di essa e diventa mostruosa.)\\nFintanto che l\'Idra Addomesticata è mostruosa, ha travolgere.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Idra\', \'flavor\': \'"Seduta. Riporta. Devasta."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593209&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3ac0f2f2-b378-4910-ad08-5f6b27d93b2a\', \'multiverseId\': 593209}, \'multiverseid\': 593209}, {\'name\': \'飼い馴らされたハイドラ\', \'text\': \'{X}{G}{G}{G}：怪物化Ｘを行う。（このクリーチャーが怪物的でないなら、これの上に＋１/＋１カウンターＸ個を置く。これは怪物的になる。）\\n飼い馴らされたハイドラが怪物的であるかぎり、これはトランプルを持つ。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ハイドラ\', \'flavor\': \'「オスワリ。トッテコイ。センメツ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593330&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5ebeb487-c35b-433c-aa7e-233f9bd64823\', \'multiverseId\': 593330}, \'multiverseid\': 593330}, {\'name\': \'驯化多头龙\', \'text\': \'{X}{G}{G}{G}：蛮化X。（如果此生物未蛮化，则在其上放置X个+1/+1指示物且它已蛮化。）\\n只要驯化多头龙已蛮化，它便具有践踏异能。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～多头龙\', \'flavor\': \'「坐下。叼来。毁掉。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593693&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9d83cf02-50e9-4494-93eb-3c1526f4ffc0\', \'multiverseId\': 593693}, \'multiverseid\': 593693}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dominanzgehabe\', \'text\': \'Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält +3/+3 bis zum Ende des Zuges. Alle Kreaturen, die sie in diesem Zug blocken können, tun dies.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Wenn du dich für einen Anführer hältst, musst du auch deine Dominanz beweisen."\\n—Gar-Tun, Nebeltal-Silberrücken\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592845&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'feea1c40-af93-4215-adf6-667e90c7e79b\', \'multiverseId\': 592845}, \'multiverseid\': 592845}, {\'name\': \'Declarar autoridad\', \'text\': \'La criatura objetivo obtiene +3/+3 hasta el final del turno. Todas las criaturas que puedan bloquearla este turno lo hacen.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Si crees que eres un líder, demuestra tu poder".\\n—Gar-Tun, lomo plateado de Valleniebla\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592966&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ec75f30a-9f0c-4a46-98a5-fce2b46ac786\', \'multiverseId\': 592966}, \'multiverseid\': 592966}, {\'name\': \'Déclarer sa domination\', \'text\': "Une créature ciblée gagne +3/+3 jusqu\'à la fin du tour. Toutes les créatures capables de la bloquer ce tour-ci le font.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'« Si tu penses être un chef, alors prouve ta puissance. »\\n—Gar-Tun, gorille à dos argenté de la vallée des brumes\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593087&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c4ca541d-c956-4c63-8dd8-8cfab95d6193\', \'multiverseId\': 593087}, \'multiverseid\': 593087}, {\'name\': \'Dichiarare il Predominio\', \'text\': \'Una creatura bersaglio prende +3/+3 fino alla fine del turno. Tutte le creature in grado di bloccarla in questo turno lo fanno.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Se ti consideri un capo, dai prova del tuo valore."\\n—Gar-Tun, schienargento della Valnebbiosa\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593208&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a576dad6-8600-4aba-8aea-3d34ca0a840a\', \'multiverseId\': 593208}, \'multiverseid\': 593208}, {\'name\': \'優位宣言\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは＋３/＋３の修整を受ける。このターン、それをブロックできるすべてのクリーチャーはそれをブロックする。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「自分が長だと思うのなら、その力を証明しろ。」\\n――霧谷の銀背、ガル＝トゥン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593329&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f974fe9b-4f18-4044-b881-2189acfb2e4d\', \'multiverseId\': 593329}, \'multiverseid\': 593329}, {\'name\': \'宣示威权\', \'text\': \'目标生物得+3/+3直到回合结束。本回合中，所有能够阻挡它的生物皆须阻挡之。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「如果你自诩族长，那就证明你的力量。」\\n～雾谷银背葛顿\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593692&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8a016835-04bf-48fa-bd6e-eef1567146e8\', \'multiverseId\': 593692}, \'multiverseid\': 593692}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dorfrituale\', \'text\': \'Opfere eine Kreatur als zusätzliche Kosten, um diesen Zauberspruch zu wirken.\\nZiehe zwei Karten.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Die Skelle errichten in eroberten Dörfern Hohnpfähle: verfluchte Totems aus Holz und Knochen, die den Überlebenden ihre physische Stärke und ihren Kampfeswillen rauben.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594143&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a2880661-cc54-4af8-af3c-b3443f3f0771\', \'multiverseId\': 594143}, \'multiverseid\': 594143}, {\'name\': \'Ritos de pueblo\', \'text\': \'Como coste adicional para lanzar este hechizo, sacrifica una criatura.\\nRoba dos cartas.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'El clan Skelle construye postes del desdeño en los pueblos que conquistan. Son unos tótems de madera y huesos que agotan la fuerza física y la voluntad de resistirse de los supervivientes.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594260&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6f16fe0b-f3ec-4730-8111-edeeab0f3f8c\', \'multiverseId\': 594260}, \'multiverseid\': 594260}, {\'name\': \'Rites du village\', \'text\': \'En tant que coût supplémentaire pour lancer ce sort, sacrifiez une créature.\\nPiochez deux cartes.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "Les Skelle érigent des totems maudits dans les villages conquis : faits de bois et d\'os, ils absorbent la force physique et la volonté de combattre des survivants.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594377&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6a28ca8e-9ab5-4a82-9984-0b8f60f13b9a\', \'multiverseId\': 594377}, \'multiverseid\': 594377}, {\'name\': \'Riti del Villaggio\', \'text\': \'Come costo addizionale per lanciare questa magia, sacrifica una creatura.\\nPesca due carte.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'Nei villaggi conquistati, gli Skelle innalzano i feticci del malaugurio: totem stregati di legno e ossa che prosciugano la forza fisica e la volontà di contrattaccare dei sopravvissuti.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594494&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9031e8ee-3bfe-4216-80b2-af40734446dd\', \'multiverseId\': 594494}, \'multiverseid\': 594494}, {\'name\': \'村の儀式\', \'text\': \'この呪文を唱えるための追加コストとして、クリーチャー１体を生け贄に捧げる。\\nカード２枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'スケレは征服した村々に軽蔑の柱を立てる。それは木と骨を組み合わせた呪いの偶像で、生き残った者たちから肉体的な力と反撃する意志を奪う。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594611&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dc394e3d-28c4-4e75-86bc-7d1581a4c51b\', \'multiverseId\': 594611}, \'multiverseid\': 594611}, {\'name\': \'村民仪式\', \'text\': \'牺牲一个生物，以作为施放此咒语的额外费用。\\n抓两张牌。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'斯凯尔人每征服一处村庄，都会在当地立起兽头棒～这种利用木棒与骨头制成的诅咒图腾像能够削弱幸存者的力气和反抗意志。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594962&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'781b94ac-1ee4-43df-9e0f-9d15f13744d7\', \'multiverseId\': 594962}, \'multiverseid\': 594962}]', '[{\'name\': \'Drache der Goldbrücke\', \'text\': \'Fliegend, Eile\\nImmer wenn der Drache der Goldbrücke angreift oder das Ziel eines Zauberspruchs wird, erzeuge einen Schatz-Spielstein.\\nSchätze, die du kontrollierst, haben „{T}, opfere dieses Artefakt: Erzeuge zwei Mana genau einer beliebigen Farbe."\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Drache\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590258&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'024fe7f1-8810-4d7c-8eda-cb4e8ab42841\', \'multiverseId\': 590258}, \'multiverseid\': 590258}, {\'name\': \'Dragón del puente dorado\', \'text\': \'Vuela, prisa.\\nSiempre que el Dragón del puente dorado ataque o sea objetivo de un hechizo, crea una ficha de Tesoro.\\nLos Tesoros que controlas tienen "{T}, sacrificar este artefacto: Agrega dos manás de un color cualquiera".\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Dragón\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590393&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'77074a7f-7c6d-45a1-b42f-37c4ff83198b\', \'multiverseId\': 590393}, \'multiverseid\': 590393}, {\'name\': "Dragon d\'Orpont", \'text\': "Vol, célérité\\nÀ chaque fois que le Dragon d\'Orpont attaque ou devient la cible d\'un sort, créez un jeton Trésor.\\nLes trésors que vous contrôlez ont « {T}, sacrifiez cet artefact : Ajoutez deux manas d\'une seule couleur de votre choix. »", \'type\': \'Créature : dragon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590528&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'46826e32-c210-473f-b502-6155684977aa\', \'multiverseId\': 590528}, \'multiverseid\': 590528}, {\'name\': "Drago del Ponte d\'Oro", \'text\': \'Volare, rapidità\\nOgniqualvolta il Drago del Ponte d\\\'Oro attacca o diventa bersaglio di una magia, crea una pedina Tesoro.\\nI Tesori che controlli hanno "{T}, Sacrifica questo artefatto: Aggiungi due mana di un qualsiasi colore".\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Drago\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590663&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e81266fe-72f8-4e35-893f-01345824e108\', \'multiverseId\': 590663}, \'multiverseid\': 590663}, {\'name\': \'黄金架のドラゴン\', \'text\': \'飛行、速攻\\n黄金架のドラゴンが攻撃するか呪文の対象になるたび、宝物・トークン１つを生成する。\\nあなたがコントロールしているすべての宝物は「{T}, このアーティファクトを生け贄に捧げる：好きな色１色のマナ２点を加える。」を持つ。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ドラゴン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590798&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e05cc826-66e1-4593-b43c-64ff5550e677\', \'multiverseId\': 590798}, \'multiverseid\': 590798}, {\'name\': \'跨金桥巨龙\', \'text\': \'飞行，敏捷\\n每当跨金桥巨龙攻击或成为咒语的目标时，派出一个珍宝衍生物。\\n由你操控的珍宝具有「{T}，牺牲此神器：加两点任意颜色的单色法术力。」\', \'type\': \'生物 ～龙\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591203&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7a6e231d-c5e4-4f97-936f-477ed9afcd4b\', \'multiverseId\': 591203}, \'multiverseid\': 591203}]', "[{'name': 'Drachenblut', 'text': '{3}, {T}: Lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf eine Kreatur deiner Wahl.', 'type': 'Artefakt', 'flavor': 'Schon ein kleiner Tropfen verwandelt Haut in Schuppen und Faust in Klaue.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596266&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5f5a97fe-1a27-4404-bcba-19c23b2f7106', 'multiverseId': 596266}, 'multiverseid': 596266}, {'name': 'Sangre de dragón', 'text': '{3}, {T}: Pon un contador +1/+1 sobre la criatura objetivo.', 'type': 'Artefacto', 'flavor': 'Una sola gota cambia la piel por escamas y los puños por garras.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596353&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b22f1927-1591-4f3f-9c2c-59ea210b7bb7', 'multiverseId': 596353}, 'multiverseid': 596353}, {'name': 'Sang de dragon', 'text': '{3}, {T} : Mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur une créature ciblée.', 'type': 'Artefact', 'flavor': 'Une seule goutte suffit à faire pousser des écailles sur la peau, des griffes sur les mains.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596440&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '25093a88-b595-426b-a8c7-fb172d14b700', 'multiverseId': 596440}, 'multiverseid': 596440}, {'name': 'Sangue di Drago', 'text': '{3}, {T}: Metti un segnalino +1/+1 su una creatura bersaglio.', 'type': 'Artefatto', 'flavor': 'Una sola goccia trasforma la pelle in scaglie e le mani in artigli.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596527&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a3317266-ef1a-482b-930e-556e618f42aa', 'multiverseId': 596527}, 'multiverseid': 596527}, {'name': 'ドラゴンの血', 'text': '{3},{T}：クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それの上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。', 'type': 'アーティファクト', 'flavor': 'その一滴は、肌を鱗とし、拳を爪とする。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596614&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '35da2d61-b101-44a6-9a8d-629cd6843f2e', 'multiverseId': 596614}, 'multiverseid': 596614}, {'name': '龙血', 'text': '{3}，{T}：在目标生物上放置一个+1/+1指示物。', 'type': '神器', 'flavor': '只消一滴，便能将皮肤化作硬鳞，空拳变为利爪。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596875&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b3cf254d-4de4-435a-ac87-1006741893b9', 'multiverseId': 596875}, 'multiverseid': 596875}]", '[{\'name\': \'Drachenei\', \'text\': \'Verteidiger\\nWenn das Drachenei stirbt, erzeuge einen 2/2 roten Drache-Kreaturenspielstein mit Flugfähigkeit und „{R}: Diese Kreatur erhält +1/+0 bis zum Ende des Zuges."\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Drache, Ei\', \'flavor\': \'Die Geburtshöhlen von Drachen stecken voller Schätze, um den Drachenjungen einen Anreiz zum Schlüpfen zu bieten.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590230&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5d2f25cc-ed46-4b52-8fc4-8609b076e57a\', \'multiverseId\': 590230}, \'multiverseid\': 590230}, {\'name\': \'Huevo de dragón\', \'text\': \'Defensor.\\nCuando el Huevo de dragón muera, crea una ficha de criatura Dragón roja 2/2 con la habilidad de volar y "{R}: Esta criatura obtiene +1/+0 hasta el final del turno".\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Huevo dragón\', \'flavor\': \'Las guaridas donde los dragones anidan están llenas de tesoros para atraer a las crías y hacerlas salir de sus huevos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590365&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'44444880-9401-487b-80dd-3cea793a60bc\', \'multiverseId\': 590365}, \'multiverseid\': 590365}, {\'name\': \'Œuf de dragon\', \'text\': "Défenseur\\nQuand l\'Œuf de dragon meurt, créez un jeton de créature 2/2 rouge Dragon avec le vol et « {R} : cette créature gagne +1/+0 jusqu\'à la fin du tour. »", \'type\': \'Créature : dragon et œuf\', \'flavor\': \'Les nids de dragon sont jonchés de trésors pour inciter les petits à sortir de leur coquille.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590500&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d6eafd85-cf4a-4a74-a324-68967dc3c520\', \'multiverseId\': 590500}, \'multiverseid\': 590500}, {\'name\': \'Uovo di Drago\', \'text\': \'Difensore\\nQuando l\\\'Uovo di Drago muore, crea una pedina creatura Drago 2/2 rossa con volare e "{R}: Questa creatura prende +1/+0 fino alla fine del turno".\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Uovo Drago\', \'flavor\': "Le tane di schiusa dei draghi sono cosparse di tesori, per attirare i piccoli a uscire dall\'uovo.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590635&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'08f32b79-a2ec-473a-88d7-42557c31f2a9\', \'multiverseId\': 590635}, \'multiverseid\': 590635}, {\'name\': \'ドラゴンの卵\', \'text\': \'防衛\\nドラゴンの卵が死亡したとき、飛行と「{R}：ターン終了時まで、このクリーチャーは＋１/＋０の修整を受ける。」を持つ赤の２/２のドラゴン・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ドラゴン・卵\', \'flavor\': \'ドラゴンの巣穴には雛を卵から呼び出すための宝物が詰まっている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590770&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ec179325-61d0-41ef-9e84-30aa4c54ce22\', \'multiverseId\': 590770}, \'multiverseid\': 590770}, {\'name\': \'龙卵\', \'text\': \'守军\\n当龙卵死去时，派出一个2/2红色的龙衍生生物，且具有飞行与「{R}：此生物得+1/+0直到回合结束。」\', \'type\': \'生物 ～龙／蛋\', \'flavor\': \'巨龙出生的巢穴里散落着宝物，用以诱使幼龙破卵而出。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591175&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7e5f5bcd-36e6-4ac1-9b7d-b85b2e4321df\', \'multiverseId\': 591175}, \'multiverseid\': 591175}]', '[{\'name\': \'Drachenfutter\', \'text\': \'Erzeuge zwei 1/1 rote Goblin-Kreaturenspielsteine.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Atarka-Goblins geben ihr Leben so bereitwillig hin wie ihre Artgenossen bei den Temur … allerdings unter großen, geflügelten Schatten.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590231&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fe849817-f5a9-4775-ae3d-65bd6af1b5a5\', \'multiverseId\': 590231}, \'multiverseid\': 590231}, {\'name\': \'Carnada para dragones\', \'text\': \'Crea dos fichas de criatura Trasgo rojas 1/1.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Los trasgos de Atarka caminan hacia su destino con tanto entusiasmo como sus homólogos temur, pero normalmente bajo gigantescas sombras aladas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590366&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'91c923b9-6d77-41b0-a5d6-4f70258c8ab1\', \'multiverseId\': 590366}, \'multiverseid\': 590366}, {\'name\': \'Chair à dragon\', \'text\': \'Créez deux jetons de créature 1/1 rouge Gobelin.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "À la différence des gobelins temuriens, les gobelins d\'Atarka meurent sous de gigantesques ombres ailées.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590501&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5fbdc30f-3377-40d5-b7a5-73bef6dd9308\', \'multiverseId\': 590501}, \'multiverseid\': 590501}, {\'name\': \'Spuntino del Drago\', \'text\': \'Crea due pedine creatura Goblin 1/1 rosse.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'I goblin Atarka incontrano la loro fine tanto rapidamente quanto i loro predecessori Temur, ma di solito sotto grandi ombre alate.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590636&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c157d30b-ceac-463b-be47-002cea18670d\', \'multiverseId\': 590636}, \'multiverseid\': 590636}, {\'name\': \'ドラゴンの餌\', \'text\': \'赤の１/１のゴブリン・クリーチャー・トークン２体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'ティムールの同胞たちと同じように、アタルカのゴブリン達も積極的にその最期を迎えている。ただし、通常は大きな翼の影に覆い尽くされてからとなる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590771&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cf90e841-c5ac-40e3-a5f0-57d545d06ce1\', \'multiverseId\': 590771}, \'multiverseid\': 590771}, {\'name\': \'巨龙食粮\', \'text\': \'派出两个1/1红色鬼怪衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'安塔卡族的鬼怪和他们铁木尔的同胞一样随时准备赴死，但他们通常死在大型的有翼阴影之下。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591176&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7dcf422d-9b7a-4aa9-9002-8152d7eb4b1e\', \'multiverseId\': 591176}, \'multiverseid\': 591176}]', "[{'name': 'Drachenfutter', 'text': 'Erzeuge zwei 1/1 rote Goblin-Kreaturenspielsteine.', 'type': 'Hexerei', 'flavor': 'Gront wurde klar, dass sein genialer Plan, schneller als Kork zu sein, vielleicht doch nicht ausreichen würde.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597105&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd2ed19bb-accd-4ae9-9ae9-c2a39623d4f1', 'multiverseId': 597105}, 'multiverseid': 597105}, {'name': 'Carnada para dragones', 'text': 'Crea dos fichas de criatura Trasgo rojas 1/1.', 'type': 'Conjuro', 'flavor': 'Gront se dio cuenta de que su magnífico plan de ser más rápido que Kork tal vez no fuera suficiente.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597151&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2ec7fd89-a3cf-4a59-b231-e7ff22e69236', 'multiverseId': 597151}, 'multiverseid': 597151}, {'name': 'Chair à dragon', 'text': 'Créez deux jetons de créature 1/1 rouge Gobelin.', 'type': 'Rituel', 'flavor': 'Gront réalisa que son plan brillant pour devancer Kork ne serait peut-être pas suffisant.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597197&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd95e8418-6fbd-4cbc-b3ee-31aa2664cb02', 'multiverseId': 597197}, 'multiverseid': 597197}, {'name': 'Spuntino del Drago', 'text': 'Crea due pedine creatura Goblin 1/1 rosse.', 'type': 'Stregoneria', 'flavor': 'Gront capì che il suo brillante piano di essere più veloce di Kork non sarebbe comunque stato abbastanza.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597243&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '23a15c00-fa22-443d-9a38-ecb60b975b9f', 'multiverseId': 597243}, 'multiverseid': 597243}, {'name': 'ドラゴンの餌', 'text': '赤の１/１のゴブリン・クリーチャー・トークン２体を生成する。', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': 'グローントは、コークより速く走るという名案だけでは無理だと悟った。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597289&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '09f9f168-c258-41ad-96c7-86e701c37b39', 'multiverseId': 597289}, 'multiverseid': 597289}, {'name': '巨龙食粮', 'text': '派出两个1/1红色鬼怪衍生生物。', 'type': '法术', 'flavor': '格隆特发现自己「只要比喀罗克快就行」的绝妙计划好像还是不行。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597427&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a90b6e36-d144-4170-8839-b4e5526263fb', 'multiverseId': 597427}, 'multiverseid': 597427}]", '[{\'name\': \'Drachenmagier\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nImmer wenn der Drachenmagier einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, wirft jeder Spieler seine Hand ab und zieht dann sieben Karten.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Drache, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich habe mehr Zaubersprüche vergessen, als du je erlernen wirst."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597106&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f235e4f9-2b9e-4fe8-8b2b-30901c146a66\', \'multiverseId\': 597106}, \'multiverseid\': 597106}, {\'name\': \'Mago dragón\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nSiempre que el Mago dragón haga daño de combate a un jugador, cada jugador descarta su mano y luego roba siete cartas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero dragón\', \'flavor\': \'"He olvidado más hechizos de los que tú conocerás jamás".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597152&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ab8e2403-ecf3-46cf-a4f8-857ae2c9a789\', \'multiverseId\': 597152}, \'multiverseid\': 597152}, {\'name\': \'Dragon mage\', \'text\': \'Vol\\nÀ chaque fois que le Dragon mage inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, chaque joueur se défausse de sa main et pioche sept cartes.\', \'type\': \'Créature : dragon et sorcier\', \'flavor\': "« J\'ai oublié plus de sorts que tu n\'en apprendras jamais. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597198&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dbe429a5-2757-4adc-9468-b31162f23538\', \'multiverseId\': 597198}, \'multiverseid\': 597198}, {\'name\': \'Dracomago\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nOgniqualvolta il Dracomago infligge danno da combattimento a un giocatore, ogni giocatore scarta la propria mano, poi pesca sette carte.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Mago Drago\', \'flavor\': \'"Ho dimenticato più magie io di quante ne conoscerai tu in tutta una vita."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597244&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'16d8707d-8d6f-45c4-a8be-68ad82213b4d\', \'multiverseId\': 597244}, \'multiverseid\': 597244}, {\'name\': \'ドラゴン魔道士\', \'text\': \'飛行\\nドラゴン魔道士がプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、各プレイヤーはそれぞれ自分の手札を捨て、その後、カード７枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ドラゴン・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': \'「お前が一生をかけて覚える呪文の数よりも、私が忘れた呪文の数の方が多い。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597290&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f61c336a-6828-4180-a2d2-964803d2b93a\', \'multiverseId\': 597290}, \'multiverseid\': 597290}, {\'name\': \'巨龙法师\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n每当巨龙法师对任一牌手造成战斗伤害时，每位牌手弃掉其手牌，然后各抓七张牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～龙／法术师\', \'flavor\': \'「我忘掉的咒语比你能学会的还多。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597428&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c3022065-8c9a-4c3d-8da8-9543be21e534\', \'multiverseId\': 597428}, \'multiverseid\': 597428}]', '[{\'name\': \'Drachensprecher-Schamane\', \'text\': \'Drache-Zaubersprüche, die du wirkst, kosten beim Wirken {2} weniger.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Barbar, Schamane\', \'flavor\': \'„Wir sprechen die Sprache der Drachen, von Flammen und Zorn. Sie sprechen unsere Sprache, von Wildheit und Ehre. Zusammen werden wir eine Geschichte der Zerstörung erzählen, wie es sie noch nie gegeben hat."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590233&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a925eb01-f71a-4dc9-930f-bfacd0eca7bd\', \'multiverseId\': 590233}, \'multiverseid\': 590233}, {\'name\': \'Chamán dragonhablante\', \'text\': \'Te cuesta {2} menos lanzar los hechizos de Dragón.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Chamán bárbaro humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Hablamos el idioma de flama y de cólera de los dragones. Ellos hablan nuestro idioma de furia y de honor. Juntos tramaremos un relato de destrucción sin igual".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590368&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b890fc57-ab7a-4931-a673-43615536dff9\', \'multiverseId\': 590368}, \'multiverseid\': 590368}, {\'name\': \'Shamane languedragon\', \'text\': \'Les sorts de dragon que vous lancez coûtent {2} de moins à lancer.\', \'type\': \'Créature : humain et barbare et shamane\', \'flavor\': "« Nous parlons le langage de flamme et de rage des dragons. Ils parlent notre langue de fureur et d\'honneur. Ensemble, nous écrirons un récit de destruction sans égal. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590503&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'345c2a86-7070-46cd-8add-205208012385\', \'multiverseId\': 590503}, \'multiverseid\': 590503}, {\'name\': \'Sciamano Dracofono\', \'text\': \'Le magie Drago che lanci costano {2} in meno per essere lanciate.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Sciamano Barbaro Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Parliamo il linguaggio dei draghi, di fuoco e ira. Loro parlano il nostro, di furia e onore. Insieme porteremo un\\\'ondata di distruzione senza eguali."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590638&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'35dad6c6-e3ee-4260-a024-53d7ad28bb20\', \'multiverseId\': 590638}, \'multiverseid\': 590638}, {\'name\': \'ドラゴン語りのシャーマン\', \'text\': \'あなたがドラゴン・呪文を唱えるためのコストは{2}少なくなる。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・バーバリアン・シャーマン\', \'flavor\': \'「我々は炎と激怒からなるドラゴンの言葉を語る。ドラゴンは激情と栄誉からなる我々の言葉を語る。我らが共に紡ぎあげるは、類稀なる破壊の詩よ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590773&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2c76bef4-908d-445d-9900-876d14b684f0\', \'multiverseId\': 590773}, \'multiverseid\': 590773}, {\'name\': \'龙语祭师\', \'text\': \'你施放的龙咒语减少{2}来施放。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／野蛮人／祭师\', \'flavor\': \'「我等了解龙族的炽焰与狂愤。他们了解我等的怒火与荣耀。我们将一同编织前所未见的毁灭篇章。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591178&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1fa5e3d8-312c-4acb-b61f-6776bb644438\', \'multiverseId\': 591178}, \'multiverseid\': 591178}]', '[{\'name\': \'Drannithische Feuerstecherin\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du eine andere Karte umwandelst, fügt die Drannithische Feuerstecherin jedem Gegner 1 Schadenspunkt zu.\\nUmwandlung {1} ({1}, wirf diese Karte ab: Ziehe eine Karte.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': \'„Wenn ihr in Deckung gehen wollt, solltet ihr jetzt damit anfangen."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597107&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aa9e77f0-32ee-452d-926e-7de1d822e3a2\', \'multiverseId\': 597107}, \'multiverseid\': 597107}, {\'name\': \'Hechicera de Drannith\', \'text\': \'Siempre que actives una habilidad de ciclo de otra carta, la Hechicera de Drannith hace 1 punto de daño a cada oponente.\\nCiclo {1}. ({1}, descartar esta carta: Roba una carta.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Si pretendes ponerte a cubierto, más vale que lo hagas ya".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597153&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b5f134b9-cebb-44c5-85ef-e041a1a5ee9c\', \'multiverseId\': 597153}, \'multiverseid\': 597153}, {\'name\': \'Piqueuse de Drannith\', \'text\': \'À chaque fois que vous recyclez une autre carte, la Piqueuse de Drannith inflige 1 blessure à chaque adversaire.\\nRecyclage {1} ({1}, défaussez-vous de cette carte : Piochez une carte.)\', \'type\': \'Créature : humain et sorcier\', \'flavor\': "« Si vous voulez courir pour vous mettre à l\'abri, faites-le maintenant. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597199&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'586d7047-0eed-4c91-a525-41d8698a4d88\', \'multiverseId\': 597199}, \'multiverseid\': 597199}, {\'name\': \'Pungolatrice di Drannith\', \'text\': "Ogniqualvolta cicli un\'altra carta, la Pungolatrice di Drannith infligge 1 danno a ogni avversario.\\nCiclo {1} ({1}, Scarta questa carta: Pesca una carta.)", \'type\': \'Creatura — Mago Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Se la tua prossima mossa è correre in cerca di un riparo, ti suggerisco di iniziare adesso."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597245&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7a1ba403-84d6-4e5e-950f-860c88a2e8d3\', \'multiverseId\': 597245}, \'multiverseid\': 597245}, {\'name\': \'ドラニスの刺突者\', \'text\': \'あなたがこれでないカードをサイクリングするたび、ドラニスの刺突者は各対戦相手にそれぞれ１点のダメージを与える。\\nサイクリング{1}（{1}, このカードを捨てる：カード１枚を引く。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': \'「どこかに身を隠すなら、そろそろ動いた方がいいわよ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597291&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'baad7b32-fee5-48a7-92f3-ebf2304ba36c\', \'multiverseId\': 597291}, \'multiverseid\': 597291}, {\'name\': \'卓尼斯术击师\', \'text\': \'每当你循环另一张牌时，卓尼斯术击师向每位对手各造成1点伤害。\\n循环{1}（{1}，弃掉此牌：抓一张牌。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／法术师\', \'flavor\': \'「如果你打算找地方躲，现在就该去了。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597429&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3492432c-8438-4408-89c4-bd3190dea7f2\', \'multiverseId\': 597429}, \'multiverseid\': 597429}]', "[{'name': 'Dreifachgeister', 'text': 'Einberufen (Deine Kreaturen können dir helfen, diesen Zauberspruch zu wirken. Mit jeder Kreatur, die du tappst, während du diesen Zauberspruch wirkst, bezahlst du für {1} oder ein Mana der Farbe jener Kreatur.)\\nErzeuge drei 1/1 weiße Geist-Kreaturenspielsteine mit Flugfähigkeit.', 'type': 'Hexerei', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591664&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '88f3303e-ac40-45d9-81d2-a623954a0b38', 'multiverseId': 591664}, 'multiverseid': 591664}, {'name': 'Espíritu triplicado', 'text': 'Convocar. (Tus criaturas pueden ayudar a lanzar este hechizo. Cada criatura que gires al lanzar este hechizo cuenta como un pago de {1} o de un maná del color de esa criatura.)\\nCrea tres fichas de criatura Espíritu blancas 1/1 con la habilidad de volar.', 'type': 'Conjuro', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591793&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c340c278-6a0f-4a07-b1b4-72929c1732e6', 'multiverseId': 591793}, 'multiverseid': 591793}, {'name': 'Esprits triplets', 'text': 'Convocation (Vos créatures peuvent aider à lancer ce sort. Chaque créature que vous engagez en lançant ce sort paie {1} ou un mana de la couleur de cette créature.)\\nCréez trois jetons de créature 1/1 blanche Esprit avec le vol.', 'type': 'Rituel', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591922&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cbe752f2-7de4-4401-a8f0-4c7ee94d43d0', 'multiverseId': 591922}, 'multiverseid': 591922}, {'name': 'Triplicare gli Spiriti', 'text': 'Convocazione (Le tue creature possono aiutarti a lanciare questa magia. Ogni creatura che TAPpi mentre lanci questa magia corrisponde al pagamento di {1} o di un mana del colore di quella creatura.)\\nCrea tre pedine creatura Spirito 1/1 bianche con volare.', 'type': 'Stregoneria', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592051&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f9372e5e-c9b2-4049-b34a-35fd8e945321', 'multiverseId': 592051}, 'multiverseid': 592051}, {'name': '三つぞろいの霊魂', 'text': '召集（あなたのクリーチャーが、この呪文を唱える助けとなる。この呪文を唱える段階であなたがタップした各クリーチャーはそれぞれ{1}かそのクリーチャーの色のマナ１点を支払う。）\\n飛行を持つ白の１/１のスピリット・クリーチャー・トークン３体を生成する。', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592180&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd01350c0-2411-4aba-ad2f-2ef31c2e3439', 'multiverseId': 592180}, 'multiverseid': 592180}, {'name': '三联精怪', 'text': '召集（此咒语能用你的生物来协助施放。你于施放此咒语时每横置一个生物，就能为此咒语支付{1}或一点该生物颜色之法术力。）\\n派出三个1/1白色，具飞行异能的精怪衍生生物。', 'type': '法术', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592567&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bd527dd2-3e41-46e9-9e7e-01876fdd4b76', 'multiverseId': 592567}, 'multiverseid': 592567}]", '[{\'name\': \'Dreiste Wölfe\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn die Dreisten Wölfe angreifen, erhalten sie +2/+0 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Wolf\', \'flavor\': \'Dank immer weniger Patrouillen wurden die Landstraßen von Kessig zu ihren bevorzugten Jagdgründen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590215&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a1ff7dff-eca8-4d88-91d3-46c796e27b18\', \'multiverseId\': 590215}, \'multiverseid\': 590215}, {\'name\': \'Lobos osados\', \'text\': \'Siempre que los Lobos osados ataquen, obtienen +2/+0 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Lobo\', \'flavor\': \'Con la disminución de patrullas, los caminos de Kessig se han convertido en estupendos terrenos de caza.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590350&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d75181e5-6115-4190-80d2-40ae108a49b5\', \'multiverseId\': 590350}, \'multiverseid\': 590350}, {\'name\': \'Loups intrépides\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que les Loups intrépides attaquent, ils gagnent +2/+0 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : loup\', \'flavor\': \'Sans les patrouilles, les routes de Kessig sont devenues des terrains de chasse de premier choix.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590485&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e1610e35-e196-4096-b301-10a4ad75d171\', \'multiverseId\': 590485}, \'multiverseid\': 590485}, {\'name\': \'Lupi Audaci\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta i Lupi Audaci attaccano, prendono +2/+0 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Lupo\', \'flavor\': \'Con meno pattuglie di guardia, le strade di Kessig sono diventate eccellenti terreni di caccia.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590620&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a8d0362d-6faf-4a58-8a4e-2ca9109acebe\', \'multiverseId\': 590620}, \'multiverseid\': 590620}, {\'name\': \'猛々しい狼\', \'text\': \'猛々しい狼が攻撃するたび、ターン終了時まで、これは＋２/＋０の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 狼\', \'flavor\': \'巡回兵が少ないために、ケッシグの道々は恰好の狩場となっていた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590755&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4351be08-9d1c-4442-adc8-d601301bd085\', \'multiverseId\': 590755}, \'multiverseid\': 590755}, {\'name\': \'鲁莽狼群\', \'text\': \'每当鲁莽狼群攻击时，它得+2/+0直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～狼\', \'flavor\': \'在巡逻次数减少后，凯锡革的街道已成为极品猎食场。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591160&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e1f5a306-6125-4cda-b5ea-6238c800d970\', \'multiverseId\': 591160}, \'multiverseid\': 591160}]', "[{'name': 'Dschinn der Wünsche', 'text': 'Fliegend\\nDer Dschinn der Wünsche kommt mit drei Wunschmarken ins Spiel.\\n{2}{U}{U}, entferne eine Wunschmarke vom Dschinn der Wünsche: Decke die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek auf. Du kannst die Karte spielen, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen. Falls du dies nicht tust, schicke sie ins Exil.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Dschinn', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595213&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9a3cebe7-29fa-4079-8680-38fd03b4da35', 'multiverseId': 595213}, 'multiverseid': 595213}, {'name': 'Djinn de los deseos', 'text': 'Vuela.\\nEl Djinn de los deseos entra al campo de batalla con tres contadores de deseo sobre él.\\n{2}{U}{U}, remover un contador de deseo del Djinn de los deseos: Muestra la primera carta de tu biblioteca. Puedes jugar esa carta sin pagar su coste de maná. Si no lo haces, exíliala.', 'type': 'Criatura — Djinn', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595321&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '928a5e8c-d263-4d9d-8cb2-5ebe324bdf36', 'multiverseId': 595321}, 'multiverseid': 595321}, {'name': 'Djinn aux souhaits', 'text': 'Vol\\nLe Djinn aux souhaits arrive sur le champ de bataille avec, sur lui, trois marqueurs « souhait ».\\n{2}{U}{U}, retirez un marqueur « souhait » du Djinn aux souhaits : Révélez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Vous pouvez jouer cette carte sans payer son coût de mana. Si vous ne le faites pas, exilez-la.', 'type': 'Créature : djinn', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595429&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4fd4e4b6-b2f8-450f-b716-6b1f22276eb3', 'multiverseId': 595429}, 'multiverseid': 595429}, {'name': 'Genio dei Desideri', 'text': 'Volare\\nIl Genio dei Desideri entra nel campo di battaglia con tre segnalini desiderio.\\n{2}{U}{U}, Rimuovi un segnalino desiderio dal Genio dei Desideri: Rivela la prima carta del tuo grimorio. Puoi giocare quella carta senza pagare il suo costo di mana. Se non lo fai, esiliala.', 'type': 'Creatura — Genio', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595537&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '827c3f55-1de3-45e4-850c-378daf10193c', 'multiverseId': 595537}, 'multiverseid': 595537}, {'name': '願いのジン', 'text': '飛行\\n願いのジンは、願いカウンター３個が置かれた状態で戦場に出る。\\n{2}{U}{U}, 願いのジンの上から願いカウンター１個を取り除く：あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード１枚を公開する。あなたはそのカードをそのマナ・コストを支払うことなくプレイしてもよい。そうしないなら、それを追放する。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ジン', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595645&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f45c6a85-e0f6-45d1-8d4d-6d0a9f1b9cf0', 'multiverseId': 595645}, 'multiverseid': 595645}, {'name': '祈愿巨灵', 'text': '飞行\\n祈愿巨灵进战场时上面有三个祈愿指示物。\\n{2}{U}{U}，从祈愿巨灵上移去一个祈愿指示物：展示你的牌库顶牌。你可以使用该牌，且不需支付其法术力费用。如果你未如此作，则将它放逐。', 'type': '生物 ～巨灵', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595969&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8bc0e4ec-b6d9-48d7-860b-140f9867adbd', 'multiverseId': 595969}, 'multiverseid': 595969}]", '[{\'name\': \'Dunstschreiter\', \'text\': \'Wandelwicht (Diese Karte hat alle Kreaturentypen.)\\nFliegend\\n{1}{U}: Der Dunstschreiter erhält +1/-1 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Gestaltwandler\', \'flavor\': \'„Wenn du aus Littjara entkommen willst, folge einem Vogel."\\n—Tuskeri-Volksweisheit\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595249&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d314b4e4-de40-4dba-8c45-836a88b602f5\', \'multiverseId\': 595249}, \'multiverseid\': 595249}, {\'name\': \'Caminante de neblinas\', \'text\': \'Cambiaformas. (Esta carta es de todos los tipos de criatura.)\\nVuela.\\n{1}{U}: El Caminante de neblinas obtiene +1/-1 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Metamorfo\', \'flavor\': \'"Para escapar de Littjara, a un pájaro debes seguir".\\n—Folclore tuskeri\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595357&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9774b275-1afc-4f20-8b5c-e552ba809a71\', \'multiverseId\': 595357}, \'multiverseid\': 595357}, {\'name\': \'Marchebrume\', \'text\': "Changelin (Cette carte a tous les types de créature.)\\nVol\\n{1}{U} : Le Marchebrume gagne +1/-1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : changeforme\', \'flavor\': "« Pour s\'échapper de Littjara, il faut suivre un oiseau. »\\n—Folklore Tuskeri", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595465&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'719cd0c3-bb67-4624-99fc-118cf4d0cf45\', \'multiverseId\': 595465}, \'multiverseid\': 595465}, {\'name\': \'Calcanebbia\', \'text\': \'Cangiante (Questa carta ha tutti i tipi di creatura.)\\nVolare\\n{1}{U}: Il Calcanebbia prende +1/-1 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Polimorfo\', \'flavor\': \'"Per fuggire da Littjara, segui un uccello."\\n—Folklore dei Tuskeri\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595573&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'af5b3604-448b-4c27-8b2f-7f82fd454fbc\', \'multiverseId\': 595573}, \'multiverseid\': 595573}, {\'name\': \'煙霧歩き\', \'text\': \'多相（このカードはすべてのクリーチャー・タイプである。）\\n飛行\\n{1}{U}：ターン終了時まで、煙霧歩きは＋１/－１の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 多相の戦士\', \'flavor\': \'「リトヤラから出るには鳥の後を追え。」\\n――タスケーリの言い伝え\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595681&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4b237641-91f6-433c-a735-b5810d080954\', \'multiverseId\': 595681}, \'multiverseid\': 595681}, {\'name\': \'迷雾行者\', \'text\': \'化形（此牌是所有生物类别。）\\n飞行\\n{1}{U}：迷雾行者得+1/-1直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～变形兽\', \'flavor\': \'「要离利雅拉，务必跟鸟走。」\\n～塔科力民间传说\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596005&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b0bfa842-22ed-4112-9c7c-b11ee8885cce\', \'multiverseId\': 596005}, \'multiverseid\': 596005}]', "[{'name': 'Durchrammen', 'text': 'Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst, fügt einer Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du nicht kontrollierst, Schadenspunkte in Höhe ihrer Stärke zu. Falls die Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, Trampelschaden verursacht, wird überschüssiger Schaden stattdessen dem Beherrscher der Kreatur zugefügt.', 'type': 'Spontanzauber', 'flavor': 'Die Magier der Burg hatten wirksame Mittel gegen jede Form der Belagerung entwickelt, außer gegen Gorilla-Kriegsführung.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597120&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ba6af88c-dee0-4e65-bc76-fd8fc6062226', 'multiverseId': 597120}, 'multiverseid': 597120}, {'name': 'Arremeter', 'text': 'La criatura objetivo que controlas hace una cantidad de daño igual a su fuerza a la criatura objetivo que no controlas. Si la criatura que controlas tiene la habilidad de arrollar, en vez de eso, el daño sobrante se hace al controlador de esa criatura.', 'type': 'Instantáneo', 'flavor': 'Los magos del castillo elaboraron defensas efectivas para cualquier tipo de asedio, pero no tenían ninguna forma de enfrentarse a un ataque a mano airada.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597166&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3173821c-f0f0-4dde-9784-497569babdee', 'multiverseId': 597166}, 'multiverseid': 597166}, {'name': 'Coup de bélier', 'text': 'Une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez inflige un nombre de blessures égal à sa force à une créature ciblée que vous ne contrôlez pas. Si la créature que vous contrôlez a le piétinement, les blessures supplémentaires sont infligées au contrôleur de cette créature à la place.', 'type': 'Éphémère', 'flavor': 'Les mages du château avaient conçu des mesures efficaces contre toutes sortes de sièges, mais rien contre les coups de poing.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597212&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c7fad543-d63f-4519-a707-bf81974d15e0', 'multiverseId': 597212}, 'multiverseid': 597212}, {'name': 'Incornare', 'text': 'Una creatura bersaglio che controlli infligge danno pari alla sua forza a una creatura bersaglio che non controlli. Se la creatura che controlli ha travolgere, il danno in eccesso viene invece inflitto al controllore di quella creatura.', 'type': 'Istantaneo', 'flavor': 'I maghi del castello avevano escogitato contromisure efficaci contro ogni forma di assedio, ma si ritrovarono senza risposte contro i gorilla.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597258&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'dd26daa1-cad7-45b8-9fe2-8635ea1abb71', 'multiverseId': 597258}, 'multiverseid': 597258}, {'name': '強行突破', 'text': 'あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体と、あなたがコントロールしていないクリーチャー１体を対象とする。その前者はその後者に、自身のパワーに等しい点数のダメージを与える。その前者がトランプルを持っているなら、余剰のダメージを、代わりにそのクリーチャーのコントローラーに与える。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': '城の魔道士たちはどんな包囲戦法に対しても有効策をひねり出してきたが、ゴリラとの戦いには打つ手なしだった。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597304&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2de02a1e-02df-4654-bed2-5aaaf93b53f7', 'multiverseId': 597304}, 'multiverseid': 597304}, {'name': '轰然撞倒', 'text': '目标由你操控的生物对目标不由你操控的生物造成伤害，其数量等同于前者的力量。如果该由你操控的生物具有践踏异能，则过量伤害改为对后者生物的操控者造成之。', 'type': '瞬间', 'flavor': '城堡的法师对每种攻城方式都有完善应变之策，唯独大猩猩作战无解。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597442&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c68c8145-38c0-4a80-ac01-e4b2fd11c895', 'multiverseId': 597442}, 'multiverseid': 597442}]", '[{\'name\': \'Durchtrennte Bande\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre ein Artefakt oder eine Verzauberung deiner Wahl. Du kannst eine Länderkarte aus deiner Hand ins Spiel bringen.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich kann es nicht ertragen, eine weitere Welt zerbrechen zu sehen, solange meine eigene Heimat in Scherben liegt. Verzeiht mir, doch ich kann nicht länger Wache halten."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592835&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'08e33083-86aa-451e-a56b-3de52fc12386\', \'multiverseId\': 592835}, \'multiverseid\': 592835}, {\'name\': \'Vínculo roto\', \'text\': \'Destruye el artefacto o encantamiento objetivo. Puedes poner en el campo de batalla una carta de tierra de tu mano.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"No soporto ver otro plano hecho trizas antes de reconstruir mi propio hogar. Lo siento, pero mi guardia terminó".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592956&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0beca969-1b3c-4024-8216-ae55c5681dff\', \'multiverseId\': 592956}, \'multiverseid\': 592956}, {\'name\': \'Lien brisé\', \'text\': \'Détruisez une cible, artefact ou enchantement. Vous pouvez mettre sur le champ de bataille une carte de terrain de votre main.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« Je ne supporterai pas de voir un autre plan brisé avant que je n\'aie pu rebâtir le mien. Je suis désolée, mais j\'en ai terminé avec les Sentinelles. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593077&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'702c82f8-c87d-4e22-9f90-8d3f70e0b86e\', \'multiverseId\': 593077}, \'multiverseid\': 593077}, {\'name\': \'Legame Spezzato\', \'text\': \'Distruggi un artefatto o un incantesimo bersaglio. Puoi mettere sul campo di battaglia una carta terra dalla tua mano.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Non posso sopportare di vedere un altro piano devastato prima di aver risanato la mia terra. Mi spiace, ma devo abbandonarvi."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593198&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'997ae975-e543-4b43-8e8c-c8dc7a0d07e6\', \'multiverseId\': 593198}, \'multiverseid\': 593198}, {\'name\': \'壊れた絆\', \'text\': \'アーティファクトやエンチャントのうち１つを対象とする。それを破壊する。あなたは、あなたの手札にある土地・カード１枚を戦場に出してもよい。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「自分の故郷も再建できていないのに、別の次元が壊れていくのを気にしていられないの。申し訳ないけど、私はゲートウォッチを辞めるわ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593319&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d1053eeb-71e4-43ed-804d-cd166e001a72\', \'multiverseId\': 593319}, \'multiverseid\': 593319}, {\'name\': \'缘尽而去\', \'text\': \'消灭目标神器或结界。你可以将一张地牌从你手上放进战场。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「我还没有完全修复自己的家园，却又见到另一个时空四分五裂。我不忍再这样下去。抱歉，我的守护到此为止。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593682&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8383faa8-6028-4a17-8704-adef0e5aae8e\', \'multiverseId\': 593682}, \'multiverseid\': 593682}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dwynens Elitekrieger\', \'text\': \'Wenn Dwynens Elitekrieger ins Spiel kommen und falls du einen anderen Elfen kontrollierst, erzeuge einen 1/1 grünen Elf-Krieger-Kreaturenspielstein.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elf, Krieger\', \'flavor\': \'Wer einen ruft, ruft sie alle.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592850&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eedb1776-d4fa-42d2-b8ef-8db5d204f52f\', \'multiverseId\': 592850}, \'multiverseid\': 592850}, {\'name\': \'Élite de Dwynen\', \'text\': \'Cuando la Élite de Dwynen entre al campo de batalla, si controlas otro Elfo, crea una ficha de criatura Guerrero Elfo verde 1/1.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero elfo\', \'flavor\': \'Si llamas a uno, los llamas a todos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592971&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5fa5f116-fe6e-42e3-aea7-cd9c3401f543\', \'multiverseId\': 592971}, \'multiverseid\': 592971}, {\'name\': \'Élite de Dwynen\', \'text\': "Quand l\'Élite de Dwynen arrive sur le champ de bataille, si vous contrôlez un autre elfe, créez un jeton de créature 1/1 verte Elfe et Guerrier.", \'type\': \'Créature : elfe et guerrier\', \'flavor\': "En appeler un, c\'est les appeler tous.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593092&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d810cb1d-703a-4770-9215-9979d761a846\', \'multiverseId\': 593092}, \'multiverseid\': 593092}, {\'name\': \'Elite di Dwynen\', \'text\': "Quando l\'Elite di Dwynen entra nel campo di battaglia, se controlli un altro Elfo, crea una pedina creatura Guerriero Elfo 1/1 verde.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Elfo\', \'flavor\': \'Se ne chiami uno, li chiami tutti.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593213&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'52d62e2b-a567-4f18-8f96-6a09f0fff7d5\', \'multiverseId\': 593213}, \'multiverseid\': 593213}, {\'name\': \'ドゥイネンの精鋭\', \'text\': \'ドゥイネンの精鋭が戦場に出たとき、あなたがこれでないエルフをコントロールしている場合、緑の１/１のエルフ・戦士・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルフ・戦士\', \'flavor\': \'一人呼び、全員呼ぶ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593334&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b764ef63-ddbe-4255-bd9e-54e27f224269\', \'multiverseId\': 593334}, \'multiverseid\': 593334}, {\'name\': \'德维恩的精兵\', \'text\': \'当德维恩的精兵进战场时，若你操控另一个妖精，则派出一个1/1绿色妖精／战士衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～妖精／战士\', \'flavor\': \'一呼百应。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593697&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6d9e530a-5c40-4624-be6c-f6a770b1a97a\', \'multiverseId\': 593697}, \'multiverseid\': 593697}]', "[{'name': 'Dämmerpanzer-Krabbler', 'text': 'Wenn der Dämmerpanzer-Krabbler ins Spiel kommt, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf eine Kreatur deiner Wahl.\\nJede Kreatur, die du kontrollierst und auf der eine +1/+1-Marke liegt, verursacht Trampelschaden.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Insekt', 'flavor': 'Sie hocken oft auf Straßenlaternen und die Pfosten biegen sich unter ihrem Gewicht.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592849&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b3bda149-5df4-4302-8188-e09557f929aa', 'multiverseId': 592849}, 'multiverseid': 592849}, {'name': 'Rondador caparazón del ocaso', 'text': 'Cuando el Rondador caparazón del ocaso entre al campo de batalla, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre la criatura objetivo.\\nCada criatura que controlas con un contador +1/+1 sobre ella tiene la habilidad de arrollar.', 'type': 'Criatura — Insecto', 'flavor': 'Suelen posarse en las farolas y eso hace que los postes se doblen por el peso.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592970&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd6f3862f-3872-45e0-9b29-9a0786444483', 'multiverseId': 592970}, 'multiverseid': 592970}, {'name': 'Rampeur à carapace crépusculaire', 'text': 'Quand le Rampeur à carapace crépusculaire arrive sur le champ de bataille, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur une créature ciblée.\\nChaque créature que vous contrôlez avec un marqueur +1/+1 sur elle a le piétinement.', 'type': 'Créature : insecte', 'flavor': 'Ils se perchent souvent sur les lampadaires, faisant plier les poteaux sous leur poids.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593091&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '816b7e6c-f882-448c-8f13-723856cfb9da', 'multiverseId': 593091}, 'multiverseid': 593091}, {'name': 'Strisciante Vesproguscio', 'text': 'Quando lo Strisciante Vesproguscio entra nel campo di battaglia, metti un segnalino +1/+1 su una creatura bersaglio.\\nOgni creatura con un segnalino +1/+1 che controlli ha travolgere.', 'type': 'Creatura — Insetto', 'flavor': 'Sono soliti appollaiarsi sui lampioni, i cui pali cedono sotto il loro peso.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593212&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '941d0d0d-61e5-4c4a-8a97-d45eb1eac671', 'multiverseId': 593212}, 'multiverseid': 593212}, {'name': '薄暮殻の這うもの', 'text': '薄暮殻の這うものが戦場に出たとき、クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それの上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。\\nあなたがコントロールしていて＋１/＋１カウンターが置かれているすべてのクリーチャーはトランプルを持つ。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 昆虫', 'flavor': 'しばしば街灯の上に止まり、重みで支柱を曲げてしまう。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593333&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '06ca7084-3520-4dee-99e7-dd6cc0aa3bd9', 'multiverseId': 593333}, 'multiverseid': 593333}, {'name': '暮壳爬虫', 'text': '当暮壳爬虫进战场时，在目标生物上放置一个+1/+1指示物。\\n每个由你操控且其上有+1/+1指示物的生物均具有践踏异能。', 'type': '生物 ～昆虫', 'flavor': '它们经常在街灯上休息，其重量把灯柱都压垮了。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593696&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c408e7f1-e0f4-4993-bdf9-f6b9ffa7c574', 'multiverseId': 593696}, 'multiverseid': 593696}]", '[{\'name\': \'Dämon des Unglücks\', \'text\': \'Opfere eine Kreatur als zusätzliche Kosten, um diesen Zauberspruch zu wirken.\\nFliegend, verursacht Trampelschaden\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Dämon\', \'flavor\': \'Ein Abgrund tat sich auf, schwefliger Rauch stieg auf und eine riesige Gestalt zischte „Ich akzeptiere dieses Angebot."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594054&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6299bf77-c452-4b73-b9a0-bcba42e3cf66\', \'multiverseId\': 594054}, \'multiverseid\': 594054}, {\'name\': \'Demonio de las catástrofes\', \'text\': \'Como coste adicional para lanzar este hechizo, sacrifica una criatura.\\nVuela, arrolla.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Demonio\', \'flavor\': \'Un pozo se abrió, de él brotó una columna de humo untuoso y una forma gigantesca siseó: "Acepto la ofrenda".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594171&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ac3c25bc-304c-44ed-8a50-109e795b6e7c\', \'multiverseId\': 594171}, \'multiverseid\': 594171}, {\'name\': \'Démon des catastrophes\', \'text\': \'En tant que coût supplémentaire pour lancer ce sort, sacrifiez une créature.\\nVol, piétinement\', \'type\': \'Créature : démon\', \'flavor\': "Du gouffre béant qui s\'ouvrit s\'éleva une colonne de fumée, et une silhouette imposante siffla : « J\'accepte cette offrande. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594288&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7831efa9-13fe-4ea8-bf31-1a26adfa95ad\', \'multiverseId\': 594288}, \'multiverseid\': 594288}, {\'name\': \'Demone delle Catastrofi\', \'text\': \'Come costo addizionale per lanciare questa magia, sacrifica una creatura.\\nVolare, travolgere\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Demone\', \'flavor\': \'Un pozzo si spalancò come fauci, una colonna di fumo denso si innalzò e un\\\'apparizione imponente sibilò: "Accetto il sacrificio."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594405&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bf35f7a5-c674-4307-b108-fe2ac6b18a35\', \'multiverseId\': 594405}, \'multiverseid\': 594405}, {\'name\': \'惨劇の悪魔\', \'text\': \'この呪文を唱えるための追加コストとして、クリーチャー１体を生け贄に捧げる。\\n飛行、トランプル\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — デーモン\', \'flavor\': \'穴が大きく開き、油煙が立ち上り、そびえ立つ影が囁いた。「この生け贄を受け取ろう。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594522&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7d230336-15b2-4464-b86a-979055eff1d6\', \'multiverseId\': 594522}, \'multiverseid\': 594522}, {\'name\': \'灾变恶魔\', \'text\': \'牺牲一个生物，以作为施放此咒语的额外费用。\\n飞行，践踏\', \'type\': \'生物 ～恶魔\', \'flavor\': \'暗渊打开，污烟升起，只闻一道巨影低语：「我收下这份祭礼。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594873&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a4f67ee8-9c65-444f-b6e2-7d01a91f49e4\', \'multiverseId\': 594873}, \'multiverseid\': 594873}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dämonische Gaben\', \'text\': \'Bis zum Ende des Zuges erhält eine Kreatur deiner Wahl +2/+0 und „Wenn diese Kreatur stirbt, bringe sie unter der Kontrolle ihres Besitzers ins Spiel zurück."\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Es begann mit einem Geschmack auf der Zunge wie ein blutiges Stück gebratenes Wildschwein, aber schon bald loderte die Kraft wie eine Feuersbrunst in ihren Adern.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594055&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dc124e3f-f29d-4d45-9de4-666ae1ad8635\', \'multiverseId\': 594055}, \'multiverseid\': 594055}, {\'name\': \'Dones demoníacos\', \'text\': \'Hasta el final del turno, la criatura objetivo obtiene +2/+0 y gana "Cuando esta criatura muera, regrésala al campo de batalla bajo el control de su propietario".\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Empezó como un sabor en la lengua, como un bocado sangriento de jabalí asado. Mas enseguida el poder fue como un gran incendio en su venas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594172&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6207df1e-8b9a-4318-a5db-0d223e3891c6\', \'multiverseId\': 594172}, \'multiverseid\': 594172}, {\'name\': \'Cadeaux démoniaques\', \'text\': "Jusqu\'à la fin du tour, une créature ciblée gagne +2/+0 et acquiert « Quand cette créature meurt, renvoyez-la sur le champ de bataille sous le contrôle de son propriétaire. »", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "Tout a commencé par un goût sur la langue, comme un morceau saignant de sanglier rôti. Mais ce pouvoir s\'est rapidement transformé en une brûlure dans ses veines.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594289&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'be86050f-b580-4b04-bb13-2a5336029b78\', \'multiverseId\': 594289}, \'multiverseid\': 594289}, {\'name\': \'Doni Demoniaci\', \'text\': \'Fino alla fine del turno, una creatura bersaglio prende +2/+0 e ha "Quando questa creatura muore, rimettila sul campo di battaglia sotto il controllo del suo proprietario".\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'Iniziò sotto forma di un sapore sulla lingua, come di un boccone sanguinolento di cinghiale arrostito... ma presto il potere si manifestò con la forza di una conflagrazione nelle vene.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594406&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'43919ec1-b313-4784-b1e4-cd1efec8b4b0\', \'multiverseId\': 594406}, \'multiverseid\': 594406}, {\'name\': \'悪魔の贈り物\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは＋２/＋０の修整を受け「このクリーチャーが死亡したとき、これをオーナーのコントロール下で戦場に戻す。」を得る。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'初めは舌の上の味覚として始まった。まるで血まみれの炙り猪のように。しかしすぐに、血管に力がみなぎった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594523&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0c332826-3f27-47dc-8c7b-3f6d8c003d20\', \'multiverseId\': 594523}, \'multiverseid\': 594523}, {\'name\': \'恶魔赠礼\', \'text\': \'直到回合结束，目标生物得+2/+0且获得「当此生物死去时，将它在其拥有者的操控下移回战场。」\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'开始先是口中涌现血腥滋味，像是吃下一块渗血未熟透的烤野猪肉～但这股力量很快就烧遍周身经脉。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594874&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f9bf0997-efaf-4858-8cc6-03365df3734a\', \'multiverseId\': 594874}, \'multiverseid\': 594874}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dünenkäfer\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Insekt\', \'flavor\': \'Die Sandstürme Shefets sorgen dafür, dass sein Panzer stets glänzt, und die Horden von Verfluchten dafür, dass er niemals hungert.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594064&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5b47fd1b-da8a-4770-a224-6d68807c3e8c\', \'multiverseId\': 594064}, \'multiverseid\': 594064}, {\'name\': \'Escarabajo de las dunas\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Insecto\', \'flavor\': \'Las ásperas arenas del Shefet pulen su caparazón, y las huestes de los malditos llenan su estómago.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594181&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'52aed3a4-cbb8-4686-9d4f-efce8ce3c1bb\', \'multiverseId\': 594181}, \'multiverseid\': 594181}, {\'name\': \'Scarabée des dunes\', \'type\': \'Créature : insecte\', \'flavor\': "Les sables purificateurs de Shefet polissent sa carapace, et les troupes de damnés lui remplissent l\'estomac.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594298&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'48c4ddc7-3bda-4049-9958-6f1f43b73ddf\', \'multiverseId\': 594298}, \'multiverseid\': 594298}, {\'name\': \'Coleottero delle Dune\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Insetto\', \'flavor\': \'La sua corazza è levigata dalle sabbie corrosive di Shefet e il suo stomaco riempito da schiere di dannati.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594415&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'14c89f3f-1632-4c83-8a46-b937fbfaec16\', \'multiverseId\': 594415}, \'multiverseid\': 594415}, {\'name\': \'砂丘甲虫\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 昆虫\', \'flavor\': \'シェフェトの研磨性の砂がその甲殻を磨く。呪われた者たちがその腹を充たす。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594532&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ef13a4c5-fcc0-47e7-940e-b644a7fa3875\', \'multiverseId\': 594532}, \'multiverseid\': 594532}, {\'name\': \'沙丘甲虫\', \'type\': \'生物 ～昆虫\', \'flavor\': \'谢菲的猛烈风沙磨亮其甲壳，大群受诅者则填饱其肚子。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594883&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'880cef67-548f-4f03-a174-83c287ee73c5\', \'multiverseId\': 594883}, \'multiverseid\': 594883}]', "[{'name': 'Ebene', 'type': 'Standardland — Ebene', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597760&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fddf58f4-5581-4143-8b97-879bf79cd090', 'multiverseId': 597760}, 'multiverseid': 597760}, {'name': 'Llanura', 'type': 'Tierra básica — Llanura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597775&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ec593f16-cbc5-4315-8248-293e1451f9d8', 'multiverseId': 597775}, 'multiverseid': 597775}, {'name': 'Plaine', 'type': 'Terrain de base : plaine', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597790&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b7a43dd2-3bc7-4806-b8a8-178297dbb17d', 'multiverseId': 597790}, 'multiverseid': 597790}, {'name': 'Pianura', 'type': 'Terra Base — Pianura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597805&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '874ae837-5ef5-4cc7-bffc-226992d646a4', 'multiverseId': 597805}, 'multiverseid': 597805}, {'name': '平地', 'type': '基本土地 — 平地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597820&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '976f23b2-74cd-4251-8d63-5d74a30e25b2', 'multiverseId': 597820}, 'multiverseid': 597820}, {'name': '平原', 'type': '基本地 ～平原', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597865&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '75e91988-b7a7-4a9f-9f64-6f78a7411ed3', 'multiverseId': 597865}, 'multiverseid': 597865}]", "[{'name': 'Ebene', 'type': 'Standardland — Ebene', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597761&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7fbed058-0945-411a-ab5c-28dbba4549bb', 'multiverseId': 597761}, 'multiverseid': 597761}, {'name': 'Llanura', 'type': 'Tierra básica — Llanura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597776&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c2bbe60d-e15d-4904-b40e-d7fea236e652', 'multiverseId': 597776}, 'multiverseid': 597776}, {'name': 'Plaine', 'type': 'Terrain de base : plaine', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597791&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6e4703c6-7708-426b-8fa1-de6889242d16', 'multiverseId': 597791}, 'multiverseid': 597791}, {'name': 'Pianura', 'type': 'Terra Base — Pianura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597806&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '08015c41-d286-4c79-92fb-46c41b1d68a7', 'multiverseId': 597806}, 'multiverseid': 597806}, {'name': '平地', 'type': '基本土地 — 平地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597821&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2402e1e9-c5ff-44cf-b050-7c4750b5f964', 'multiverseId': 597821}, 'multiverseid': 597821}, {'name': '平原', 'type': '基本地 ～平原', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597866&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b888edaa-7096-4f57-a9e2-1f762ef4a565', 'multiverseId': 597866}, 'multiverseid': 597866}]", "[{'name': 'Ebene', 'type': 'Standardland — Ebene', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597762&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ab541f6a-5bb9-4edc-83c7-854bb55fdf6c', 'multiverseId': 597762}, 'multiverseid': 597762}, {'name': 'Llanura', 'type': 'Tierra básica — Llanura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597777&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a7a245e9-ac38-414b-bbb9-56a5bc3f7eaa', 'multiverseId': 597777}, 'multiverseid': 597777}, {'name': 'Plaine', 'type': 'Terrain de base : plaine', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597792&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bff3f806-30ad-4baa-9085-2a63f86bac2f', 'multiverseId': 597792}, 'multiverseid': 597792}, {'name': 'Pianura', 'type': 'Terra Base — Pianura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597807&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c23c5aa8-efce-4c3b-9cff-39e1ecb094ba', 'multiverseId': 597807}, 'multiverseid': 597807}, {'name': '平地', 'type': '基本土地 — 平地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597822&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8fee2474-7a40-4c2c-bf8a-5c9fc1d6c975', 'multiverseId': 597822}, 'multiverseid': 597822}, {'name': '平原', 'type': '基本地 ～平原', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597867&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6c063a16-8f90-4ff1-b6cf-ba6531c1fcc8', 'multiverseId': 597867}, 'multiverseid': 597867}]", '[{\'name\': \'Edikt der Engel\', \'text\': \'Schicke eine Kreatur oder eine Verzauberung deiner Wahl ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Die Boros erbauten ein Gefängnis im Himmel, wo ihr Rechtsempfinden nicht von Azorius-Statuten eingeengt werden konnte.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591551&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'07626cb3-37bf-46e1-bcae-36a7e4e086d6\', \'multiverseId\': 591551}, \'multiverseid\': 591551}, {\'name\': \'Edicto angelical\', \'text\': \'Exilia la criatura o encantamiento objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Los Boros construyeron una prisión en el cielo en la que los estatutos azorios no pudieran restringir su sentido de la justicia.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591680&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b3b481fd-7f56-4555-88c1-9a77482dce1a\', \'multiverseId\': 591680}, \'multiverseid\': 591680}, {\'name\': \'Édit angélique\', \'text\': \'Exilez une cible, créature ou enchantement.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Pour assouvir leur sens de la justice, les Boros bâtirent une prison dans le ciel, à l\'abri des décrets d\'Azorius.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591809&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3a9e521c-78d8-4466-9b1a-9e63e9afd327\', \'multiverseId\': 591809}, \'multiverseid\': 591809}, {\'name\': \'Editto Angelico\', \'text\': \'Esilia una creatura o un incantesimo bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'I Boros costruirono una prigione nel cielo dove i regolamenti Azorius non potevano limitare il loro senso della giustizia.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591938&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'169e3991-50d3-45a4-9bda-12065378649e\', \'multiverseId\': 591938}, \'multiverseid\': 591938}, {\'name\': \'天使の布告\', \'text\': \'クリーチャーやエンチャントのうち１つを対象とする。それを追放する。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'ボロス軍は自分たちの正義がアゾリウスの法令に縛られることがないよう、天空に牢獄を造った。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592067&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5125b232-4291-438b-aa47-1d422f8c33c3\', \'multiverseId\': 592067}, \'multiverseid\': 592067}, {\'name\': \'天使勒令\', \'text\': \'放逐目标生物或结界。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'波洛斯建立了一座空中牢狱，俄佐立的法规在此处无法约束其正义感。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592454&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c7e1f93e-93f3-4fd5-b375-33f87efe0d72\', \'multiverseId\': 592454}, \'multiverseid\': 592454}]', '[{\'name\': \'Egelbefallener Sumpf\', \'text\': \'({T}: Erzeuge {B}.)\\nDer Egelbefallene Sumpf kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{B}, {T}: Jeder Gegner verliert 1 Lebenspunkt. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit nur, falls du zwei oder mehr schwarze bleibende Karten kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Land — Sumpf\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597544&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fc5a94a8-fd1b-4d50-8e72-89eb7351702e\', \'multiverseId\': 597544}, \'multiverseid\': 597544}, {\'name\': \'Pantano plagado de sanguijuelas\', \'text\': \'({T}: Agrega {B}.)\\nEl Pantano plagado de sanguijuelas entra al campo de batalla girado.\\n{B}, {T}: Cada oponente pierde 1 vida. Activa esto solo si controlas dos o más permanentes negros.\', \'type\': \'Tierra — Pantano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597569&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3c3bdbf5-b9be-4c5c-ba7b-24113dbb0cb5\', \'multiverseId\': 597569}, \'multiverseid\': 597569}, {\'name\': \'Marais envahi par les sangsues\', \'text\': "({T} : Ajoutez {B}.)\\nLe Marais envahi par les sangsues arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\n{B}, {T} : Chaque adversaire perd 1 point de vie. N\'activez que si vous contrôlez au moins deux permanents noirs.", \'type\': \'Terrain : marais\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597594&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0f17e5b8-5773-4fbd-b412-01e97e9e21f6\', \'multiverseId\': 597594}, \'multiverseid\': 597594}, {\'name\': \'Palude delle Sanguisughe\', \'text\': \'({T}: Aggiungi {B}.)\\nLa Palude delle Sanguisughe entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpata.\\n{B}, {T}: Ogni avversario perde 1 punto vita. Attiva solo se controlli due o più permanenti neri.\', \'type\': \'Terra — Palude\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597619&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1aa1e147-7570-428e-85c0-8407ff7015f5\', \'multiverseId\': 597619}, \'multiverseid\': 597619}, {\'name\': \'ヒル溜りの沼\', \'text\': \'（{T}：{B}を加える。）\\nヒル溜りの沼はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{B}, {T}：各対戦相手はそれぞれ１点のライフを失う。あなたが２つ以上の黒のパーマネントをコントロールしていなければ起動できない。\', \'type\': \'土地 — 沼\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597644&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6366361e-0c24-45ec-b5d6-13b2e5afa6b3\', \'multiverseId\': 597644}, \'multiverseid\': 597644}, {\'name\': \'遍蛭沼泽\', \'text\': \'（{T}：加{B}。）\\n遍蛭沼泽须横置进战场。\\n{B}，{T}：每位对手各失去1点生命。只能于你操控两个或更多黑色永久物时起动。\', \'type\': \'地 ～沼泽\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597719&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a67f965d-2a05-4486-a5f5-863dba71f831\', \'multiverseId\': 597719}, \'multiverseid\': 597719}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ehrfurchtslose Zecher\', \'text\': \'Wenn die Ehrfurchtslosen Zecher ins Spiel kommen, bestimme eines —\\n• Zerstöre ein Artefakt deiner Wahl.\\n• Die Ehrfurchtslosen Zecher erhalten Eile bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Satyr\', \'flavor\': \'Einigen Satyrn ist nur die Blasphemie heilig.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590268&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3a22cd2c-17e5-40b0-9536-75dbefed9bb4\', \'multiverseId\': 590268}, \'multiverseid\': 590268}, {\'name\': \'Juerguistas irreverentes\', \'text\': \'Cuando los Juerguistas irreverentes entren al campo de batalla, elige uno:\\n• Destruye el artefacto objetivo.\\n• Los Juerguistas irreverentes ganan la habilidad de prisa hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Sátiro\', \'flavor\': \'Para algunos sátiros, lo único sagrado es la blasfemia.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590403&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cdbf063a-c1a5-4bf6-8b36-ca3778213f0b\', \'multiverseId\': 590403}, \'multiverseid\': 590403}, {\'name\': \'Fêtards irrévérencieux\', \'text\': "Quand les Fêtards irrévérencieux arrivent sur le champ de bataille, choisissez l\'un —\\n• Détruisez un artefact ciblé.\\n• Les Fêtards irrévérencieux acquièrent la célérité jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : satyre\', \'flavor\': \'Pour certains satyres, seul le blasphème est sacré.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590538&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ba6ab5cd-1d8a-4c1f-a13d-ee3721db0a9f\', \'multiverseId\': 590538}, \'multiverseid\': 590538}, {\'name\': \'Dissoluti Irriverenti\', \'text\': \'Quando i Dissoluti Irriverenti entrano nel campo di battaglia, scegli uno —\\n• Distruggi un artefatto bersaglio.\\n• I Dissoluti Irriverenti hanno rapidità fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Satiro\', \'flavor\': \'Per alcuni satiri, solo la blasfemia è sacra.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590673&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c7ce708e-15d0-42f0-a9e0-5518370f6aa1\', \'multiverseId\': 590673}, \'multiverseid\': 590673}, {\'name\': \'不遜な歓楽者\', \'text\': \'不遜な歓楽者が戦場に出たとき、以下から１つを選ぶ。\\n• アーティファクト１つを対象とする。それを破壊する。\\n• ターン終了時まで、不遜な歓楽者は速攻を得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — サテュロス\', \'flavor\': \'一部のサテュロスにとっては、冒涜のみが神聖である。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590808&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a975c25e-7f62-4822-b2ca-62b1086c3b49\', \'multiverseId\': 590808}, \'multiverseid\': 590808}, {\'name\': \'无拘狂欢人\', \'text\': \'当无拘狂欢人进战场时，选择一项～\\n•消灭目标神器。\\n•无拘狂欢人获得敏捷异能直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～羊蹄人\', \'flavor\': \'对部分羊蹄人而言，只有亵渎神明才是致敬。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591213&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c3f44f24-8492-4b51-aba6-0ea4d15a38fe\', \'multiverseId\': 591213}, \'multiverseid\': 591213}]', '[{\'name\': \'Eidgebundener Vampir\', \'text\': \'Der Eidgebundene Vampir kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nDu kannst den Eidgebundenen Vampir aus deinem Friedhof wirken, falls du in diesem Zug Lebenspunkte dazuerhalten hast.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vampir, Ritter\', \'flavor\': \'„Weder Zeit noch Tod konnten mich davon abhalten, unseren Pakt einzuhalten."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597099&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3937a972-fa5c-439e-9264-c4d920ce92aa\', \'multiverseId\': 597099}, \'multiverseid\': 597099}, {\'name\': \'Vampiro jurado\', \'text\': \'El Vampiro jurado entra al campo de batalla girado.\\nPuedes lanzar el Vampiro jurado desde tu cementerio si ganaste vidas este turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Caballero vampiro\', \'flavor\': \'"Ni el tiempo ni la muerte impedirán que cumpla nuestro pacto".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597145&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'920eb9e4-9837-4c9d-b257-1a5014b1db4b\', \'multiverseId\': 597145}, \'multiverseid\': 597145}, {\'name\': \'Vampire assermenté\', \'text\': \'Le Vampire assermenté arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\nVous pouvez lancer le Vampire assermenté depuis votre cimetière si vous avez gagné des points de vie ce tour-ci.\', \'type\': \'Créature : vampire et chevalier\', \'flavor\': "« Ni le temps ni la mort ne sauraient m\'empêcher d\'honorer notre pacte. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597191&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cb2eb8ec-e3c1-4f1a-9b15-5cbb95ebca96\', \'multiverseId\': 597191}, \'multiverseid\': 597191}, {\'name\': \'Vampiro Giurato\', \'text\': \'Il Vampiro Giurato entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\nPuoi lanciare il Vampiro Giurato dal tuo cimitero se hai guadagnato punti vita in questo turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Cavaliere Vampiro\', \'flavor\': \'"Né il tempo né la morte potranno mai impedirmi di onorare il nostro patto."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597237&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'026b44ab-1695-4b44-b9fc-3e7d695428ff\', \'multiverseId\': 597237}, \'multiverseid\': 597237}, {\'name\': \'誓いを立てた吸血鬼\', \'text\': \'誓いを立てた吸血鬼はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\nあなたがこのターンにライフを得ていたなら、あなたはあなたの墓地にある誓いを立てた吸血鬼を唱えてもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 吸血鬼・騎士\', \'flavor\': \'「いくら時が経ち、死が訪れても、私は契約を破ることはない。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597283&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'08e36727-1ef7-4baf-9737-c0e29fc98348\', \'multiverseId\': 597283}, \'multiverseid\': 597283}, {\'name\': \'立誓吸血鬼\', \'text\': \'立誓吸血鬼须横置进战场。\\n如果你本回合中获得过生命，则你可以从你的坟墓场中施放立誓吸血鬼。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～吸血鬼／骑士\', \'flavor\': \'「我们的契约必得履行，时间和死亡都无法阻止。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597421&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e7657ad6-9bc5-4d69-9513-d6463ba54fb5\', \'multiverseId\': 597421}, \'multiverseid\': 597421}]', '[{\'name\': \'Eidolon der Redekunst\', \'text\': \'Spieler können nicht mehr als einen Zauberspruch pro Zug wirken.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberungskreatur — Geist\', \'flavor\': \'Die menschlichen Philosophen von Theros waren deutlich im Nachteil, da sie für Dinge wie Essen oder Schlaf Pausen einlegen mussten.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597083&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c20dc1da-6842-46fe-b061-9af30c222568\', \'multiverseId\': 597083}, \'multiverseid\': 597083}, {\'name\': \'Eidolón de la retórica\', \'text\': \'Ningún jugador puede lanzar más de un hechizo cada turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura encantamiento — Espíritu\', \'flavor\': \'Los filósofos humanos de Theros estaban en una clara desventaja al tener que parar para detalles como comer o dormir.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597129&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'71916358-589c-4be8-a766-efc8032d6600\', \'multiverseId\': 597129}, \'multiverseid\': 597129}, {\'name\': \'Eidôlon de la rhétorique\', \'text\': "Aucun joueur ne peut lancer plus d\'un sort par tour.", \'type\': \'Créature-enchantement : esprit\', \'flavor\': "Les philosophes humains de Theros étaient nettement désavantagés car ils devaient s\'arrêter pour des choses aussi futiles que manger ou dormir.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597175&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'512acf6a-f917-4293-ab73-202de1f877a3\', \'multiverseId\': 597175}, \'multiverseid\': 597175}, {\'name\': \'Apparizione della Retorica\', \'text\': \'Ogni giocatore non può lanciare più di una magia per turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Incantesimo — Spirito\', \'flavor\': \'I filosofi umani di Theros avevano il considerevole svantaggio di doversi fermare per cose come dormire o mangiare.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597221&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5f416666-960c-4b84-a580-9d3bef8c134e\', \'multiverseId\': 597221}, \'multiverseid\': 597221}, {\'name\': \'弁論の幻霊\', \'text\': \'各プレイヤーは、毎ターン１つしか呪文を唱えられない。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー・エンチャント — スピリット\', \'flavor\': \'テーロスの人間の哲学者は、食事や睡眠などに時間を取られてしまう分、大いに不利であった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597267&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ed79e399-3e65-4e03-bad5-2bd3bf24dcb9\', \'multiverseId\': 597267}, \'multiverseid\': 597267}, {\'name\': \'巧辞幻灵\', \'text\': \'每位牌手每回合所施放的咒语不能多于一个。\', \'type\': \'结界生物 ～精怪\', \'flavor\': \'塞洛斯各族的哲学演绎，唯人类进展最为不彰，因为他们得耗费时间来进食入睡。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597405&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'38133dbc-f2a6-4033-a8bc-0e8986aab04c\', \'multiverseId\': 597405}, \'multiverseid\': 597405}]', '[{\'name\': \'Eingenisteter Ghul\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn eine Quelle dem Eingenisteten Ghul Schaden zufügt, erzeuge einen 2/2 schwarzen Phyrexianer-Zombie-Kreaturenspielstein.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Phyrexianer, Zombie, Krieger\', \'flavor\': \'„Der Brustkorb ist von nutzlosem Fleisch gereinigt. Ich weiß schon, was ich mit dem Platz anfangen kann."\\n—Gyed, Priester des Gewölbes\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594105&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'581d90ea-a87a-4b11-859d-481d3acfbeb0\', \'multiverseId\': 594105}, \'multiverseid\': 594105}, {\'name\': \'Necrófago anidado\', \'text\': \'Siempre que una fuente haga daño al Necrófago anidado, crea una ficha de criatura Zombie Pirexiano negra 2/2.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero zombie pirexiano\', \'flavor\': \'"La cavidad pectoral está limpia de carne inútil. Y sé exactamente qué hacer con ese hueco".\\n—Gyed, sacerdote de la bóveda\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594222&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5b738928-672a-45c3-a601-88b6f6e1ab9c\', \'multiverseId\': 594222}, \'multiverseid\': 594222}, {\'name\': \'Goule nichée\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'une source inflige des blessures à la Goule nichée, créez un jeton de créature 2/2 noire Phyrexian et Zombie.", \'type\': \'Créature : phyrexian et zombie et guerrier\', \'flavor\': \'« La cavité thoracique a été vidée de sa viande inutile. Je sais exactement quoi faire de cet espace. »\\n—Gyed, prêtre du Caveau\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594339&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fe21aee8-c3d2-4de5-b658-206734b2c3b9\', \'multiverseId\': 594339}, \'multiverseid\': 594339}, {\'name\': \'Ghoul Annidato\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta una fonte infligge danno al Ghoul Annidato, crea una pedina creatura Zombie Phyrexiano 2/2 nera.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Zombie Phyrexiano\', \'flavor\': \'"La cavità toracica è stata liberata dall\\\'inutile carne. So proprio cosa fare dello spazio vuoto."\\n—Gyed, Sacerdote della Cripta\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594456&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'67b2b160-7103-4091-b938-d6edd956c563\', \'multiverseId\': 594456}, \'multiverseid\': 594456}, {\'name\': \'入れ子のグール\', \'text\': \'発生源１つが入れ子のグールにダメージを与えるたび、黒の２/２のファイレクシアン・ゾンビ・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ファイレクシアン・ゾンビ・戦士\', \'flavor\': \'「胸の空洞の無意味な肉は取り払った。その空間で何をすべきかはわかっている。」\\n――大霊堂の僧侶、ガイェド\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594573&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'29006e20-b459-4269-9d62-ecd44151ecd5\', \'multiverseId\': 594573}, \'multiverseid\': 594573}, {\'name\': \'巢居食尸鬼\', \'text\': \'每当一个来源对巢居食尸鬼造成伤害时，派出一个2/2黑色非瑞人／灵俑衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～非瑞人／灵俑／战士\', \'flavor\': \'「胸腔的赘肉已经清空。我知道该如何安排这空间。」\\n～黯窖僧侣翟得\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594924&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'541f014b-2995-4057-a21c-2b70c36e6be0\', \'multiverseId\': 594924}, \'multiverseid\': 594924}]', '[{\'name\': \'Eingreiftruppe\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn die Eingreiftruppe das Ziel eines Zauberspruchs oder einer Fähigkeit wird, erhält sie +0/+3 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Rebell\', \'flavor\': \'Sie kümmern sich um die Sicherheit auf den Straßen des Sechsten Distrikts, ein entkommener Simic-Mutant nach dem anderen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597520&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0c760f97-7707-4512-b1db-f43806baef06\', \'multiverseId\': 597520}, \'multiverseid\': 597520}, {\'name\': \'Fuerza operante\', \'text\': \'Siempre que la Fuerza operante sea objetivo de un hechizo o habilidad, obtiene +0/+3 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Rebelde humano\', \'flavor\': \'Persiguen a un mutante simic fugado tras otro para mantener seguras las calles del Distrito Sexto.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597545&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'255acef2-8b1d-4c2d-8341-27b0ba9bb58c\', \'multiverseId\': 597545}, \'multiverseid\': 597545}, {\'name\': \'Détachement spécial\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que le Détachement spécial devient la cible d\'un sort ou d\'une capacité, il gagne +0/+3 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et rebelle\', \'flavor\': "Assurer la sûreté des rues de la Sixième circonscription, un mutant simic en fuite après l\'autre.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597570&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bc099e5b-c78f-42b3-ad34-c8fc7a6db73a\', \'multiverseId\': 597570}, \'multiverseid\': 597570}, {\'name\': \'Task Force\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta la Task Force diventa bersaglio di una magia o abilità, prende +0/+3 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Ribelle Umano\', \'flavor\': \'Mantengono sicure le strade del Sesto Distretto, un mutante Simic in fuga alla volta.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597595&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'12757f69-7500-44c9-8f91-4cf915f3a3f3\', \'multiverseId\': 597595}, \'multiverseid\': 597595}, {\'name\': \'特別工作班\', \'text\': \'特別工作班が呪文や能力の対象になるたび、ターン終了時まで、これは＋０/＋３の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・レベル\', \'flavor\': \'第６管区の街の安全を保つこと。それは逃亡するシミック連合のミュータントを一匹ずつ処理することから始まる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597620&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d74103e0-8792-4c88-b7d6-dc629051d5ea\', \'multiverseId\': 597620}, \'multiverseid\': 597620}, {\'name\': \'特遣部队\', \'text\': \'每当特遣部队成为咒语或异能的目标时，它得+0/+3直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／反抗军\', \'flavor\': \'保护第六区街道的安全，一次对付一个析米克在逃突变体。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597695&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b94616eb-c9ec-4831-8900-bfb958aa4dbe\', \'multiverseId\': 597695}, \'multiverseid\': 597695}]', '[{\'name\': \'Eins mit dem Wind\', \'text\': \'Verzaubert eine Kreatur\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur erhält +2/+2 und hat Flugfähigkeit.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'„Flüsse und Meer, Dschungel und Himmel. Das Wasser fließt frei zwischen den zwei Hälften der Welt. Wir sind Kreaturen des Wassers."\\n—Wandler Tuvasa\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595256&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3b4734aa-0b93-4c63-8632-68e84baf1fcd\', \'multiverseId\': 595256}, \'multiverseid\': 595256}, {\'name\': \'Fundirse con el viento\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura.\\nLa criatura encantada obtiene +2/+2 y tiene la habilidad de volar.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'"Mar y río, jungla y cielo. El agua fluye entre las dos mitades del mundo. Somos criaturas de agua".\\n—Moldeador Tuvasa\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595364&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c04fe5b4-08d4-456e-aa43-74992f8f3e59\', \'multiverseId\': 595364}, \'multiverseid\': 595364}, {\'name\': \'En harmonie avec le vent\', \'text\': \'Enchanter : créature\\nLa créature enchantée gagne +2/+2 et a le vol.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': "« Rivière et mer, jungle et ciel. L\'eau s\'écoule librement entre ces deux moitiés du monde. Nous sommes des créatures aquatiques. »\\n—Modeleur Tuvasa", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595472&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fbaafc4d-3f1d-49df-93ba-2c4520a87861\', \'multiverseId\': 595472}, \'multiverseid\': 595472}, {\'name\': \'Comunione con il Vento\', \'text\': \'Incanta creatura\\nLa creatura incantata prende +2/+2 e ha volare.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'"Fiume e mare, giungla e cielo: l\\\'acqua scorre libera tra le due metà del mondo, e noi siamo creature dell\\\'acqua."\\n—Tuvasa il plasmatore\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595580&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9201efbb-9d98-4e39-99a5-62d8bba5ad95\', \'multiverseId\': 595580}, \'multiverseid\': 595580}, {\'name\': \'風と共に\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\nエンチャントしているクリーチャーは、＋２/＋２の修整を受け飛行を持つ。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': \'「川と海。ジャングルと空。この世界を二つに分かつ境を、水は自由に流れてゆく。我々は、その水の民だ。」\\n――形成師のトゥヴァーサ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595688&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'333b5d3f-9003-40cc-834e-2dd7e27abac4\', \'multiverseId\': 595688}, \'multiverseid\': 595688}, {\'name\': \'御风而行\', \'text\': \'结附于生物\\n所结附的生物得+2/+2且具有飞行异能。\', \'type\': \'结界 ～灵气\', \'flavor\': \'「河流入海，丛林蔽天。水能够在世界的两半之间自由流动。我族正是依水而生。」\\n～塑形师吐瓦萨\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596012&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'264c9a3e-014c-42fe-9716-040977790942\', \'multiverseId\': 596012}, \'multiverseid\': 596012}]', '[{\'name\': \'Eisbergschreiter\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Eisbergschreiter ins Spiel kommt, tappe ein Artefakt oder eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, das bzw. die ein Gegner kontrolliert. Falls {S} ausgegeben wurde, um diesen Zauberspruch zu wirken, enttappt jene bleibende Karte nicht während des nächsten Enttappsegments ihres Beherrschers. ({S} ist Mana von einer verschneiten Quelle.)\', \'type\': \'Verschneite Kreatur — Riese, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595203&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a0282f28-8184-433b-b464-306cf59c6c76\', \'multiverseId\': 595203}, \'multiverseid\': 595203}, {\'name\': \'Montaraz de berg\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Montaraz de berg entre al campo de batalla, gira el artefacto o criatura objetivo que controla un oponente. Si se usó {S} para lanzar este hechizo, ese permanente no se endereza durante el próximo paso de enderezar de su controlador. ({S} es maná de una fuente nevada.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura nevada — Hechicero gigante\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595311&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c05115ee-4933-441f-b519-85f214887065\', \'multiverseId\': 595311}, \'multiverseid\': 595311}, {\'name\': \'Enjambeur de berg\', \'text\': "Quand l\'Enjambeur de berg arrive sur le champ de bataille, engagez une cible, artefact ou créature, qu\'un adversaire contrôle. Si {S} a été dépensé pour lancer ce sort, ce permanent ne se dégage pas pendant la prochaine étape de dégagement de son contrôleur. ({S} est le mana d\'une source neigeuse.)", \'type\': \'Créature neigeuse : géant et sorcier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595419&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a9477f2b-0c36-400e-b567-637e6f04bb5a\', \'multiverseId\': 595419}, \'multiverseid\': 595419}, {\'name\': \'Ramingo degli Iceberg\', \'text\': \'Quando il Ramingo degli Iceberg entra nel campo di battaglia, TAPpa un artefatto o una creatura bersaglio controllati da un avversario. Se è stato speso {S} per lanciare questa magia, quel permanente non STAPpa durante il prossimo STAP del suo controllore. ({S} è mana da una fonte neve.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura Neve — Mago Gigante\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595527&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e81d6ffe-d4a9-4571-8282-8475651b3fdf\', \'multiverseId\': 595527}, \'multiverseid\': 595527}, {\'name\': \'氷山の徘徊者\', \'text\': \'氷山の徘徊者が戦場に出たとき、アーティファクトやクリーチャーのうち対戦相手がコントロールしている１つを対象とする。それをタップする。この呪文を唱えるために{S}が支払われていたなら、そのパーマネントは次のそれのコントローラーのアンタップ・ステップにアンタップしない。（{S}は氷雪である発生源からのマナを意味する。）\', \'type\': \'氷雪クリーチャー — 巨人・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595635&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5e403c2b-1d08-4dc6-8370-9b2dbeba05a5\', \'multiverseId\': 595635}, \'multiverseid\': 595635}, {\'name\': \'冰山神行客\', \'text\': \'当冰山神行客进战场时，横置目标由对手操控的神器或生物。如果施放此咒语时支付过{S}，则该永久物于其操控者的下一个重置步骤中不能重置。（{S}为产自雪境来源的法术力。）\', \'type\': \'雪境生物 ～巨人／法术师\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595959&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'80d753d1-2cfe-45d2-be6c-08a626da8d27\', \'multiverseId\': 595959}, \'multiverseid\': 595959}]', '[{\'name\': \'Eisenfels-Pyromagierin\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du deine zweite Karte innerhalb desselben Zuges ziehst, fügt die Eisenfels-Pyromagierin einem Ziel deiner Wahl 3 Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': \'„Angst vor dem Feuer ist ein sinnvoller Instinkt. Wenn ich du wäre, würde ich vor Furcht erstarren."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590267&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c713deed-5929-4a83-aeaa-1c16ca5be3a8\', \'multiverseId\': 590267}, \'multiverseid\': 590267}, {\'name\': \'Piromante de Ferrorrisco\', \'text\': \'Siempre que robes tu segunda carta cada turno, la Piromante de Ferrorrisco hace 3 puntos de daño a cualquier objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Temer el fuego es un instinto muy sensato. Si yo fuera tú, estaría aterrorizada".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590402&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f27155b4-9abd-43ba-b9c0-b963a8f39e3b\', \'multiverseId\': 590402}, \'multiverseid\': 590402}, {\'name\': \'Pyromancienne de Culmefer\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que vous piochez votre deuxième carte à chaque tour, la Pyromancienne de Culmefer inflige 3 blessures à n\'importe quelle cible.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et sorcier\', \'flavor\': \'« La peur du feu est un instinct raisonnable. À votre place, je serais terrifiée. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590537&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'62801466-d7ad-4219-92d8-93a00d47c863\', \'multiverseId\': 590537}, \'multiverseid\': 590537}, {\'name\': \'Piromante del Ferropicco\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta peschi la tua seconda carta in ogni turno, la Piromante del Ferropicco infligge 3 danni a un qualsiasi bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Mago Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"La paura del fuoco è un istinto ragionevole. Se fossi in te, sarei terrorizzata."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590672&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'83ecb31a-6b0d-4b7c-8c53-a368993f3cb7\', \'multiverseId\': 590672}, \'multiverseid\': 590672}, {\'name\': \'アイレンクラッグの紅蓮術師\', \'text\': \'あなたが各ターン内のあなたの２枚目のカードを引くたび、クリーチャーやプレインズウォーカーやプレイヤーのうち１つを対象とする。アイレンクラッグの紅蓮術師はそれに３点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': \'「炎を恐れることは当然の本能よ。私があなたなら恐怖に怯えているわ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590807&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9c847c66-7d7d-41ec-bb97-598addf590f5\', \'multiverseId\': 590807}, \'multiverseid\': 590807}, {\'name\': \'伊雷岩烈焰术士\', \'text\': \'每当你抓每回合中你的第二张牌时，伊雷岩烈焰术士对任意一个目标造成3点伤害。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／法术师\', \'flavor\': \'「恐惧火焰是可以理解的本能反应。如果我是你的话，早该吓坏了。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591212&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'02873ff5-c10a-48c1-a9b9-af12c6955e5e\', \'multiverseId\': 591212}, \'multiverseid\': 591212}]', '[{\'name\': \'Eisenhaut-Käfer\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Eisenhaut-Käfer ins Spiel kommt, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf eine Kreatur deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Insekt\', \'flavor\': \'„Bitte nicht die Käfer füttern."\\n—Gildenweg-Warnschild\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592878&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ce489b8c-3bad-4148-869a-b08ec91821a5\', \'multiverseId\': 592878}, \'multiverseid\': 592878}, {\'name\': \'Escarabajo caparazón férreo\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Escarabajo caparazón férreo entre al campo de batalla, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre la criatura objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Insecto\', \'flavor\': \'"Por favor, no den de comer a los escarabajos".\\n—Señal de advertencia del paseo\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592999&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fd774088-c632-43a1-829d-7e6500015215\', \'multiverseId\': 592999}, \'multiverseid\': 592999}, {\'name\': \'Scarabée à carapace de fer\', \'text\': \'Quand le Scarabée à carapace de fer arrive sur le champ de bataille, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur une créature ciblée.\', \'type\': \'Créature : insecte\', \'flavor\': \'« Merci de ne pas nourrir les insectes. »\\n—Panneau de la Promenade\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593120&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'52370912-2d0f-44f5-bba1-9ba7422c6733\', \'multiverseId\': 593120}, \'multiverseid\': 593120}, {\'name\': \'Scarabeo Guscio di Ferro\', \'text\': \'Quando lo Scarabeo Guscio di Ferro entra nel campo di battaglia, metti un segnalino +1/+1 su una creatura bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Insetto\', \'flavor\': \'"Vietato nutrire gli scarabei."\\n—Cartello di avviso sulla Passeggiata\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593241&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6ece490b-9db3-4ca6-b337-1835cc9f0565\', \'multiverseId\': 593241}, \'multiverseid\': 593241}, {\'name\': \'鋼胴の甲虫\', \'text\': \'鋼胴の甲虫が戦場に出たとき、クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それの上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 昆虫\', \'flavor\': \'「甲虫にエサを与えないでください。」\\n――遊歩道の警告表示\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593362&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8d46acf5-e675-4bb5-a167-bd10e34afd96\', \'multiverseId\': 593362}, \'multiverseid\': 593362}, {\'name\': \'铁壳甲虫\', \'text\': \'当铁壳甲虫进战场时，在目标生物上放置一个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～昆虫\', \'flavor\': \'「禁止喂食甲虫。」\\n～步道警示牌\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593725&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aa48923a-a99c-437d-a2cf-4c432ee80050\', \'multiverseId\': 593725}, \'multiverseid\': 593725}]', '[{\'name\': \'Eiserner Raufbold\', \'text\': \'Bedrohlich (Diese Kreatur kann nicht geblockt werden, außer von zwei oder mehr Kreaturen.)\\nWenn der Eiserne Raufbold ins Spiel kommt, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf eine Kreatur deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Golem\', \'flavor\': \'„Wozu wurde dieses Ungetüm … Ach egal. Ab an die Front damit!"\\n—Kommandant Grozdan\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596282&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2ab4d432-dd48-45bb-8855-ea9b40a62bb9\', \'multiverseId\': 596282}, \'multiverseid\': 596282}, {\'name\': \'Matón de hierro\', \'text\': \'Amenaza. (Esta criatura no puede ser bloqueada excepto por dos o más criaturas.)\\nCuando el Matón de hierro entre al campo de batalla, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre la criatura objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Gólem\', \'flavor\': \'"¿Por qué construiría alguien...? Mira, da igual. ¡Envíalo a primera línea!".\\n—Comandante Grozdan\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596369&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'74b78c0b-7196-4ef7-bbd5-c82d61505ef7\', \'multiverseId\': 596369}, \'multiverseid\': 596369}, {\'name\': \'Bravache de fer\', \'text\': \'Menace (Cette créature ne peut pas être bloquée excepté par deux créatures ou plus.)\\nQuand le Bravache de fer arrive sur le champ de bataille, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur une créature ciblée.\', \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : golem\', \'flavor\': "« Pourquoi quelqu\'un aurait construit... Attendez, peu importe. Envoyez-le au front ! »\\n—Commandant Grozdan", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596456&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cacfca67-1915-42ef-9d72-b5a29ed490a9\', \'multiverseId\': 596456}, \'multiverseid\': 596456}, {\'name\': \'Bullo di Ferro\', \'text\': \'Minacciare (Questa creatura non può essere bloccata tranne che da due o più creature.)\\nQuando il Bullo di Ferro entra nel campo di battaglia, metti un segnalino +1/+1 su una creatura bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Golem\', \'flavor\': \'"Perché mai qualcuno avrebbe dovuto costruire... Lasciamo perdere. Mandatelo in prima linea!"\\n—Comandante Grozdan\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596543&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3168ba9e-6eda-41dd-abf8-cbd6fa82580e\', \'multiverseId\': 596543}, \'multiverseid\': 596543}, {\'name\': \'鉄の暴漢\', \'text\': \'威迫（このクリーチャーは２体以上のクリーチャーにしかブロックされない。）\\n鉄の暴漢が戦場に出たとき、クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それの上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — ゴーレム\', \'flavor\': \'「いったい誰がこんな物を……いや、ちょっと待てよ。これを前線に送れ！」\\n――司令官グロズダン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596630&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'32255e48-6e86-4c7b-ae6c-57cf6ef4f989\', \'multiverseId\': 596630}, \'multiverseid\': 596630}, {\'name\': \'铸铁恶霸\', \'text\': \'威慑（此生物只能被两个或更多生物阻挡。）\\n当铸铁恶霸进战场时，在目标生物上放置一个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～魔像\', \'flavor\': \'「为什么会有人造出这种…等等，没事了。把它派到前线去！」\\n～指挥官戈洛兹丹\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596891&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'16009936-f627-4246-9d3f-7b9b125fda1e\', \'multiverseId\': 596891}, \'multiverseid\': 596891}]', '[{\'name\': \'Eisfessel-Pfeiler\', \'text\': \'{S}, {T}: Tappe ein Artefakt oder eine Kreatur deiner Wahl. ({S} kann mit einem Mana von einer verschneiten Quelle bezahlt werden.)\', \'type\': \'Verschneites Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'„Oh, Valki. Ich bin enttäuscht von dir. Wie konnte der Gott der Lügen so leichtgläubig sein?"\\n—Thibalt\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595234&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'82d11272-ae43-4806-8d18-e558adf64b93\', \'multiverseId\': 595234}, \'multiverseid\': 595234}, {\'name\': \'Pilar atadura helada\', \'text\': \'{S}, {T}: Gira el artefacto o criatura objetivo. ({S} puede pagarse con un maná de una fuente nevada.)\', \'type\': \'Artefacto nevado\', \'flavor\': \'"Ay, Valki. Me decepcionas. ¿Cómo puede ser el dios de las mentiras tan ingenuo?".\\n—Tibalt\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595342&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ca2c9343-c2d8-42ae-a7c8-13b1728adec2\', \'multiverseId\': 595342}, \'multiverseid\': 595342}, {\'name\': \'Pilier prison de glace\', \'text\': "{S}, {T} : Engagez une cible, artefact ou créature. ({S} peut être payé avec un mana d\'une source neigeuse.)", \'type\': \'Artefact neigeux\', \'flavor\': \'« Oh, Valki. Tu me déçois. Comment le dieu du Mensonge peut-il être si naïf ? »\\n—Tibalt\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595450&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e8568b2d-8cf8-47d6-bc83-08b53c8627fc\', \'multiverseId\': 595450}, \'multiverseid\': 595450}, {\'name\': \'Pilastro del Gelovincolo\', \'text\': \'{S}, {T}: TAPpa un artefatto o una creatura bersaglio. ({S} può essere pagato con un mana da una fonte neve.)\', \'type\': \'Artefatto Neve\', \'flavor\': \'"Oh, Valki. Mi deludi proprio. Come può il dio delle menzogne essere così ingenuo?"\\n—Tibalt\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595558&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'50d0490e-78e5-45e8-8265-d75c819b91de\', \'multiverseId\': 595558}, \'multiverseid\': 595558}, {\'name\': \'氷縛りの柱\', \'text\': \'{S}, {T}：アーティファクトやクリーチャーのうち１つを対象とする。それをタップする。（{S}は氷雪である発生源からのマナ１点で支払える。）\', \'type\': \'氷雪アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'「ヴァルキーよ。あんたにはがっかりだ。嘘の神がどうしてそんなに騙されやすいんだ？」\\n――ティボルト\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595666&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3c2f9da6-c46d-44b6-b4e9-4b89130456ca\', \'multiverseId\': 595666}, \'multiverseid\': 595666}, {\'name\': \'冰缚石柱\', \'text\': \'{S}，{T}：横置目标神器或生物。（{S}能以产自雪境来源的一点法术力来支付。）\', \'type\': \'雪境神器\', \'flavor\': \'「噢，瓦尔基。你太令我失望了。你尊为谎言神，怎会如此容易受骗？」\\n～提勃\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595990&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'da9c3959-8cb0-4aa7-88e3-6c7e2a320de3\', \'multiverseId\': 595990}, \'multiverseid\': 595990}]', '[{\'name\': \'Eiskalte Falle\', \'text\': \'Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält -4/-0 bis zum Ende des Zuges. Falls du einen Zauberer kontrollierst, ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Geschieht dir recht, wenn du so schnell vorpreschst."\\n—Kaliea, Seetor-Fallensucherin\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595207&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d962be97-639a-4895-838d-77728645e5c1\', \'multiverseId\': 595207}, \'multiverseid\': 595207}, {\'name\': \'Trampa espeluznante\', \'text\': \'La criatura objetivo obtiene -4/-0 hasta el final del turno. Si controlas un Hechicero, roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Te lo mereces, por adelantarte".\\n—Kaliea, buscatrampas de Portal Marino\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595315&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9935a925-8862-459e-b0a9-8bad5a5ac9c2\', \'multiverseId\': 595315}, \'multiverseid\': 595315}, {\'name\': \'Piège glaçant\', \'text\': "Une créature ciblée gagne -4/-0 jusqu\'à la fin du tour. Si vous contrôlez un sorcier, piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« Ça vous apprendra à foncer tête baissée. »\\n—Kaliéa, pistrappeuse de Porte des Mers\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595423&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'77e66883-cce5-4e1d-9e74-cc1c8848cf04\', \'multiverseId\': 595423}, \'multiverseid\': 595423}, {\'name\': \'Trappola Agghiacciante\', \'text\': \'Una creatura bersaglio prende -4/-0 fino alla fine del turno. Se controlli un Mago, pesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Ti sta bene per esserti precipitato avanti."\\n—Kaliea, scopritrappole di Portale Marino\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595531&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fe47ac37-c918-4913-b098-8fba64756797\', \'multiverseId\': 595531}, \'multiverseid\': 595531}, {\'name\': \'凍える罠\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは－４/－０の修整を受ける。あなたがウィザードをコントロールしているなら、カード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「先を急ぎすぎたことへの報いね。」\\n――海門の罠探し、ケイリー\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595639&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4fe78552-03e8-44db-a526-b7dac5df4240\', \'multiverseId\': 595639}, \'multiverseid\': 595639}, {\'name\': \'冰寒陷阱\', \'text\': \'目标生物得-4/-0直到回合结束。如果你操控法术师，则抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「叫你往前冲，活该。」\\n～海户探陷人卡理耶\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595963&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'018f4a72-3596-4e81-a401-d4611b994a41\', \'multiverseId\': 595963}, \'multiverseid\': 595963}]', '[{\'name\': \'Eiterndes Übel\', \'text\': \'Zu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments fügt das Eiternde Übel jeder Kreatur und jedem Spieler 1 Schadenspunkt zu.\\n{B}{B}, opfere das Eiternde Übel: Es fügt jeder Kreatur und jedem Spieler 3 Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'Das Böse ist nie abwesend, nur verborgen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597526&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'95870a67-378f-4f95-bd96-def46bc2fdc0\', \'multiverseId\': 597526}, \'multiverseid\': 597526}, {\'name\': \'Mal infeccioso\', \'text\': \'Al comienzo de tu mantenimiento, el Mal infeccioso hace 1 punto de daño a cada criatura y a cada jugador.\\n{B}{B}, sacrificar el Mal infeccioso: Hace 3 puntos de daño a cada criatura y a cada jugador.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'El mal nunca se ausenta, tan solo se esconde.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597551&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e2244b34-0151-4005-9923-a24c461e95f1\', \'multiverseId\': 597551}, \'multiverseid\': 597551}, {\'name\': \'Mal putrescent\', \'text\': \'Au début de votre entretien, le Mal putrescent inflige 1 blessure à chaque créature et à chaque joueur.\\n{B}{B}, sacrifiez le Mal putrescent : Il inflige 3 blessures à chaque créature et à chaque joueur.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': "Le Mal n\'est jamais absent, seulement caché.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597576&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'19979ffd-ec0e-46b4-aab1-2501784b7a6f\', \'multiverseId\': 597576}, \'multiverseid\': 597576}, {\'name\': \'Malvagità Divorante\', \'text\': "All\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, la Malvagità Divorante infligge 1 danno a ogni creatura e a ogni giocatore.\\n{B}{B}, Sacrifica la Malvagità Divorante: Infligge 3 danni a ogni creatura e a ogni giocatore.", \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'Il male non è mai assente, solo celato.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597601&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3aeda70d-2849-4e7a-9138-eb3999b36de3\', \'multiverseId\': 597601}, \'multiverseid\': 597601}, {\'name\': \'悪のただれ\', \'text\': \'あなたのアップキープの開始時に、悪のただれは各クリーチャーと各プレイヤーにそれぞれ１点のダメージを与える。\\n{B}{B}, 悪のただれを生け贄に捧げる：これは、各クリーチャーと各プレイヤーにそれぞれ３点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'邪悪が消えることはない。ただ隠れているだけなのだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597626&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'36b18b3c-3353-4b06-8ed9-f2b6f19ce8c0\', \'multiverseId\': 597626}, \'multiverseid\': 597626}, {\'name\': \'邪恶溃伤\', \'text\': \'在你的维持开始时，邪恶溃伤对每个生物和每位牌手各造成1点伤害。\\n{B}{B}，牺牲邪恶溃伤：它对每个生物和每位牌手各造成3点伤害。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'邪恶永不缺席，只是暂时躲了起来。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597701&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2e754cd2-dc21-4209-a9df-d1e3d8d07137\', \'multiverseId\': 597701}, \'multiverseid\': 597701}]', '[{\'name\': \'Elderblatt-Mentor\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Elderblatt-Mentor ins Spiel kommt, erzeuge einen 1/1 grünen Elf-Krieger-Kreaturenspielstein.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elf, Krieger\', \'flavor\': \'„Unsere Vorfahren waren in ihrer Göttlichkeit selbstgefällig geworden und ließen sich von Emporkömmlingen stürzen. Nie wieder."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592851&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fc2b1e42-3e70-4b29-bd5c-e70c1fefc919\', \'multiverseId\': 592851}, \'multiverseid\': 592851}, {\'name\': \'Mentor de Bosqueanciano\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Mentor de Bosqueanciano entre al campo de batalla, crea una ficha de criatura Guerrero Elfo verde 1/1.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero elfo\', \'flavor\': \'"Nuestros ancestros estaban satisfechos con su divinidad, y permitieron que los seres inferiores los derrocasen. Nunca más".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592972&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6c157f23-7ad3-492e-ab0b-29a1af8932ba\', \'multiverseId\': 592972}, \'multiverseid\': 592972}, {\'name\': \'Mentor Feuille-ancêtre\', \'text\': \'Quand le Mentor Feuille-ancêtre arrive sur le champ de bataille, créez un jeton de créature 1/1 verte Elfe et Guerrier.\', \'type\': \'Créature : elfe et guerrier\', \'flavor\': \'« Nos ancêtres se sont laissés aller dans leur divinité, permettant ainsi à leurs inférieurs de les renverser. Ça ne se reproduira pas. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593093&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3a96c7bc-f943-4840-b0d5-9a8fd15042f6\', \'multiverseId\': 593093}, \'multiverseid\': 593093}, {\'name\': \'Mentore di Fogliantica\', \'text\': \'Quando il Mentore di Fogliantica entra nel campo di battaglia, crea una pedina creatura Guerriero Elfo 1/1 verde.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Elfo\', \'flavor\': \'"La divinità rese arroganti i nostri antenati. Per questo furono rovesciati dai loro sottoposti. Non succederà di nuovo."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593214&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9cccd51e-0c7d-4207-807a-1c426d4b78db\', \'multiverseId\': 593214}, \'multiverseid\': 593214}, {\'name\': \'古葉の導師\', \'text\': \'古葉の導師が戦場に出たとき、緑の１/１のエルフ・戦士・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルフ・戦士\', \'flavor\': \'「我々の祖先は神性によって慢心し、弱者に足元をすくわれたのだ。もう二度と、そういうことはさせない。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593335&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3c214799-782e-4397-b38b-984a1140134b\', \'multiverseId\': 593335}, \'multiverseid\': 593335}, {\'name\': \'古叶居导师\', \'text\': \'当古叶居导师进战场时，派出一个1/1绿色妖精／战士衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～妖精／战士\', \'flavor\': \'「我们的祖先高居神位却骄纵自满，让逆贼得以篡位夺势。绝不容许此事再度发生。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593698&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4b1919a1-e451-4803-9123-403986999abd\', \'multiverseId\': 593698}, \'multiverseid\': 593698}]', '[{\'name\': \'Elektrifizieren\', \'text\': \'Elektrifizieren fügt einer Kreatur deiner Wahl 4 Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Viele flohen vor dem Sturm, ich habe ihn mit jeder Faser meines Körpers willkommen geheißen."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590235&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'52c8622f-225a-4b5b-b5d8-39cd55cb338b\', \'multiverseId\': 590235}, \'multiverseid\': 590235}, {\'name\': \'Electrificar\', \'text\': \'Electrificar hace 4 puntos de daño a la criatura objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Algunos se escondieron de la tormenta. Yo la acogí y aprendí su nombre".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590370&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'de2bb02a-08b3-4dbc-9c7f-238803cf582e\', \'multiverseId\': 590370}, \'multiverseid\': 590370}, {\'name\': \'Électrifier\', \'text\': \'Électrifier inflige 4 blessures à une créature ciblée.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Certains s\'abritent de l\'orage. Moi, je l\'ai accepté dans mon giron et j\'ai appris son nom. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590505&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f3795a89-ade2-41fc-a786-b93915eef3ee\', \'multiverseId\': 590505}, \'multiverseid\': 590505}, {\'name\': \'Elettrificare\', \'text\': \'Elettrificare infligge 4 danni a una creatura bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Alcuni rifuggono la tempesta. Io ho imparato a contemplarla e dominarla."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590640&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ef8089e6-f231-4e82-8120-d3bfd1875c81\', \'multiverseId\': 590640}, \'multiverseid\': 590640}, {\'name\': \'感電\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。感電はそれに４点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「嵐から逃げた者もいたけれど、私はそれを受け入れてその名を学んだのよ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590775&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b2fb97bd-6469-4392-8a48-748bb9dd16ff\', \'multiverseId\': 590775}, \'multiverseid\': 590775}, {\'name\': \'电击\', \'text\': \'电击对目标生物造成4点伤害。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「有些人对风暴避犹不及。而我却迎风而上，将其中奥妙为己所用。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591180&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'de1c61d5-7709-4740-9c0f-3ab33ee03410\', \'multiverseId\': 591180}, \'multiverseid\': 591180}]', '[{\'name\': \'Elektrische Offenbarung\', \'text\': \'Wirf als zusätzliche Kosten, um diesen Zauberspruch zu wirken, eine Karte ab.\\nZiehe zwei Karten.\\nRückblende {3}{R} (Du kannst diese Karte aus deinem Friedhof für ihre Rückblendekosten und zusätzliche Kosten wirken. Schicke sie danach ins Exil.)\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590234&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3a13ec73-2fe7-4734-96df-da1dd1afcad5\', \'multiverseId\': 590234}, \'multiverseid\': 590234}, {\'name\': \'Revelación eléctrica\', \'text\': \'Como coste adicional para lanzar este hechizo, descarta una carta.\\nRoba dos cartas.\\nRetrospectiva {3}{R}. (Puedes lanzar esta carta desde tu cementerio pagando su coste de retrospectiva y cualquier coste adicional. Luego exíliala.)\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590369&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e517cc1a-d405-4054-9504-f05f7f703f21\', \'multiverseId\': 590369}, \'multiverseid\': 590369}, {\'name\': \'Révélation électrique\', \'text\': "En tant que coût supplémentaire pour lancer ce sort, défaussez-vous d\'une carte.\\nPiochez deux cartes.\\nFlashback {3}{R} (Vous pouvez lancer cette carte depuis votre cimetière pour son coût de flashback et ses coûts supplémentaires. Exilez-la ensuite.)", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590504&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d210472c-d23e-4d82-a7ef-020c90349b66\', \'multiverseId\': 590504}, \'multiverseid\': 590504}, {\'name\': \'Rivelazione Elettrica\', \'text\': \'Come costo addizionale per lanciare questa magia, scarta una carta.\\nPesca due carte.\\nFlashback {3}{R} (Puoi lanciare questa carta dal tuo cimitero pagando il suo costo di flashback e qualsiasi costo addizionale. Poi esiliala.)\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590639&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d5787da5-e850-4e06-94da-38143ab5d1d4\', \'multiverseId\': 590639}, \'multiverseid\': 590639}, {\'name\': \'電撃の啓示\', \'text\': \'この呪文を唱えるための追加コストとして、カード１枚を捨てる。\\nカード２枚を引く。\\nフラッシュバック{3}{R}（あなたはあなたの墓地にあるこのカードを、フラッシュバック・コストと追加コストで唱えてもよい。その後、これを追放する。）\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590774&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bc27d88f-cbea-44c8-85db-4387b58d0652\', \'multiverseId\': 590774}, \'multiverseid\': 590774}, {\'name\': \'电激启示\', \'text\': \'弃一张牌，以作为施放此咒语的额外费用。\\n抓两张牌。\\n返照{3}{R}（你可以从你坟墓场中施放此牌，并支付其返照费用及额外费用，然后将它放逐。）\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591179&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2c7fb601-bacf-48c8-b59e-69f6705b70d8\', \'multiverseId\': 591179}, \'multiverseid\': 591179}]', '[{\'name\': \'Elfen-Kriegsmeister\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn ein oder mehrere andere Elfen unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommen, erzeuge einen 1/1 grünen Elf-Krieger-Kreaturenspielstein. Diese Fähigkeit wird nur einmal pro Zug ausgelöst.\\n{5}{G}{G}: Elfen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +2/+2 und Todesberührung bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elf, Krieger\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592853&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'612344ba-16f3-42cb-bbe5-c0af741658ae\', \'multiverseId\': 592853}, \'multiverseid\': 592853}, {\'name\': \'Maestro de la guerra élfico\', \'text\': \'Siempre que uno o más otros Elfos entren al campo de batalla bajo tu control, crea una ficha de criatura Guerrero Elfo verde 1/1. Esta habilidad solo se dispara una vez por turno.\\n{5}{G}{G}: Los Elfos que controlas obtienen +2/+2 y ganan la habilidad de toque mortal hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero elfo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592974&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5fb30f98-0344-41dc-9406-6f2e00b7b971\', \'multiverseId\': 592974}, \'multiverseid\': 592974}, {\'name\': \'Maître de guerre elfe\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'au moins un autre elfe arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, créez un jeton de créature 1/1 verte Elfe et Guerrier. Cette capacité ne se déclenche qu\'une seule fois par tour.\\n{5}{G}{G} : Les elfes que vous contrôlez gagnent +2/+2 et acquièrent le contact mortel jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : elfe et guerrier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593095&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'68c0bd51-ab9b-4ef7-9b1e-caa3b98fd640\', \'multiverseId\': 593095}, \'multiverseid\': 593095}, {\'name\': \'Maestro Guerriero degli Elfi\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta uno o più altri Elfi entrano nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, crea una pedina creatura Guerriero Elfo 1/1 verde. Questa abilità si innesca solo una volta per turno.\\n{5}{G}{G}: Gli Elfi che controlli prendono +2/+2 e hanno tocco letale fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Elfo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593216&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'87efc085-7942-40a1-b5aa-faf186b45ecf\', \'multiverseId\': 593216}, \'multiverseid\': 593216}, {\'name\': \'エルフの戦練者\', \'text\': \'これでない１体以上のエルフがあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、緑の１/１のエルフ・戦士・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。この能力は、毎ターン１回しか誘発しない。\\n{5}{G}{G}：ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールしているすべてのエルフは＋２/＋２の修整を受け接死を得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルフ・戦士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593337&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2d380eca-c394-46f6-8886-78f736b8a72d\', \'multiverseId\': 593337}, \'multiverseid\': 593337}, {\'name\': \'善战妖精\', \'text\': \'每当一个或数个其他妖精在你的操控下进战场时，派出一个1/1绿色妖精／战士衍生生物。此异能每回合只会触发一次。\\n{5}{G}{G}：直到回合结束，由你操控的妖精得+2/+2且获得死触异能。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～妖精／战士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593700&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'74e20498-b042-4168-8bf6-8a33a9d0a258\', \'multiverseId\': 593700}, \'multiverseid\': 593700}]', '[{\'name\': \'Elfenbogen\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Elfenbogen ins Spiel kommt, kannst du {2} bezahlen. Falls du dies tust, erzeuge einen 1/1 grünen Elf-Krieger-Kreaturenspielstein und lege den Elfenbogen dann an ihn an.\\nDie ausgerüstete Kreatur erhält +1/+2 und hat Reichweite.\\nAusrüsten {3} ({3}: Lege diese Karte an eine Kreatur deiner Wahl an, die du kontrollierst. Spiele Ausrüsten wie eine Hexerei.)\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Ausrüstung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592852&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9ed13fc9-774c-4c2e-abdc-eb2c90e9c02c\', \'multiverseId\': 592852}, \'multiverseid\': 592852}, {\'name\': \'Arco élfico\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Arco élfico entre al campo de batalla, puedes pagar {2}. Si lo haces, crea una ficha de criatura Guerrero Elfo verde 1/1 y luego anéxale el Arco élfico.\\nLa criatura equipada obtiene +1/+2 y tiene la habilidad de alcance.\\nEquipar {3}. ({3}: Anexa este Equipo a la criatura objetivo que controlas. Activa la habilidad de equipar como un conjuro.)\', \'type\': \'Artefacto — Equipo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592973&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5d6b5020-f9b7-4bbf-a93e-3ab18a00ad1c\', \'multiverseId\': 592973}, \'multiverseid\': 592973}, {\'name\': \'Arc elfe\', \'text\': "Quand l\'Arc elfe arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez payer {2}. Si vous faites ainsi, créez un jeton de créature 1/1 verte Elfe et Guerrier, puis attachez-lui l\'Arc elfe.\\nLa créature équipée gagne +1/+2 et a la portée.\\nÉquipement {3} ({3} : Attachez à une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez. N\'attachez l\'équipement que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.)", \'type\': \'Artefact : équipement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593094&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4a559411-ea15-4519-8e70-c64db4f769e8\', \'multiverseId\': 593094}, \'multiverseid\': 593094}, {\'name\': \'Arco Elfico\', \'text\': "Quando l\'Arco Elfico entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi pagare {2}. Se lo fai, crea una pedina creatura Guerriero Elfo 1/1 verde, poi assegnale l\'Arco Elfico.\\nLa creatura equipaggiata prende +1/+2 e ha raggiungere.\\nEquipaggiare {3} ({3}: Assegna a una creatura bersaglio che controlli. Equipaggia solo come una stregoneria.)", \'type\': \'Artefatto — Equipaggiamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593215&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a47c42bc-9a1b-45fc-adb1-37ea3cdf5c66\', \'multiverseId\': 593215}, \'multiverseid\': 593215}, {\'name\': \'エルフの弓\', \'text\': \'エルフの弓が戦場に出たとき、あなたは{2}を支払ってもよい。そうしたなら、緑の１/１のエルフ・戦士・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成し、その後、エルフの弓をそれにつける。\\n装備しているクリーチャーは＋１/＋２の修整を受け到達を持つ。\\n装備{3}（{3}：あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。これをそれにつける。装備はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。）\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 装備品\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593336&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b1f3d214-26f9-4a4e-8a98-912d14331167\', \'multiverseId\': 593336}, \'multiverseid\': 593336}, {\'name\': \'妖精曲弓\', \'text\': \'当妖精曲弓进战场时，你可以支付{2}。若你如此作，则派出一个1/1绿色妖精／战士衍生生物，然后将妖精曲弓贴附于其上。\\n佩带此武具的生物得+1/+2且具有延势异能。\\n佩带{3}（{3}：贴附在目标由你操控的生物上。只能于法术时机佩带。）\', \'type\': \'神器 ～武具\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593699&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7403fc04-f508-4c91-a2e9-62d4bdd3acbe\', \'multiverseId\': 593699}, \'multiverseid\': 593699}]', '[{\'name\': \'Elfischer Verjüngerer\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Elfische Verjüngerer ins Spiel kommt, schaue dir die obersten fünf Karten deiner Bibliothek an. Du kannst davon eine Länderkarte getappt ins Spiel bringen. Lege den Rest in zufälliger Reihenfolge unter deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elf, Druide\', \'flavor\': \'„Solange seine Wurzeln noch das Erdreich erreichen, kann ich ihn heilen."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597117&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d949f62f-9fa2-4bf3-b528-323148977f51\', \'multiverseId\': 597117}, \'multiverseid\': 597117}, {\'name\': \'Elfo rejuvenecedor\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Elfo rejuvenecedor entre al campo de batalla, mira las cinco primeras cartas de tu biblioteca. Puedes poner en el campo de batalla girada una carta de tierra de entre ellas. Pon el resto en el fondo de tu biblioteca en un orden aleatorio.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Druida elfo\', \'flavor\': \'"Si sus raíces todavía tocan la tierra, puedo curarlo".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597163&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5da8d932-1e90-411e-a10e-08d9180568b2\', \'multiverseId\': 597163}, \'multiverseid\': 597163}, {\'name\': \'Rajeunisseur elfe\', \'text\': \'Quand le Rajeunisseur elfe arrive sur le champ de bataille, regardez les cinq cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Vous pouvez mettre sur le champ de bataille, engagée, une carte de terrain parmi elles. Mettez le reste au-dessous de votre bibliothèque dans un ordre aléatoire.\', \'type\': \'Créature : elfe et druide\', \'flavor\': \'« Tant que ses racines touchent encore la terre, je peux le soigner. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597209&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1e9a9705-1a90-409c-aafe-2bd7264bce86\', \'multiverseId\': 597209}, \'multiverseid\': 597209}, {\'name\': \'Rinvigoritore Elfico\', \'text\': \'Quando il Rinvigoritore Elfico entra nel campo di battaglia, guarda le prime cinque carte del tuo grimorio. Puoi mettere una carta terra scelta tra esse sul campo di battaglia TAPpata. Metti le altre in fondo al tuo grimorio in ordine casuale.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Druido Elfo\', \'flavor\': \'"Se le sue radici raggiungono ancora il terreno, posso guarirlo."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597255&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5f583116-7cfd-4d3d-90ff-f780194a7569\', \'multiverseId\': 597255}, \'multiverseid\': 597255}, {\'name\': \'エルフの再生者\', \'text\': \'エルフの再生者が戦場に出たとき、あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード５枚を見る。あなたはその中から土地・カード１枚をタップ状態で戦場に出してもよい。残りをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に無作為の順番で置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルフ・ドルイド\', \'flavor\': \'「根が土に届いている限り、手の施しようはあるわ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597301&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ce35af66-372a-4d15-a4b5-7962c4f9492b\', \'multiverseId\': 597301}, \'multiverseid\': 597301}, {\'name\': \'回春妖精\', \'text\': \'当回春妖精进战场时，检视你牌库顶的五张牌。你可以将其中一张地牌横置放进战场。将其余的牌以随机顺序置于你的牌库底。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～妖精／德鲁伊\', \'flavor\': \'「只要它的根还接着土壤，我就能治好它。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597439&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'af38b3a6-bb47-46ee-9809-968fc5c55844\', \'multiverseId\': 597439}, \'multiverseid\': 597439}]', '[{\'name\': \'Elite-Ausbilderin\', \'text\': \'Wenn die Elite-Ausbilderin ins Spiel kommt, ziehe eine Karte und wirf dann eine Karte ab.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': \'Die brillantesten Köpfe in Meletis studieren unter den Meistern an der Dekatia, einer berühmten Schule für Magie und Philosophie.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595216&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bcef0d4b-2b56-4023-81a2-6ca9ffde6207\', \'multiverseId\': 595216}, \'multiverseid\': 595216}, {\'name\': \'Instructora de élite\', \'text\': \'Cuando la Instructora de élite entre al campo de batalla, roba una carta, luego descarta una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero humano\', \'flavor\': \'Las mentes más brillantes de Meletis estudian bajo la tutela de los maestros de Dekatia, una escuela de magia y filosofía de renombre.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595324&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b7e1f282-9449-439b-b7e4-78d471d281da\', \'multiverseId\': 595324}, \'multiverseid\': 595324}, {\'name\': "Instructrice d\'élite", \'text\': "Quand l\'Instructrice d\'élite arrive sur le champ de bataille, piochez une carte, puis défaussez-vous d\'une carte.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et sorcier\', \'flavor\': \'Les esprits les plus brillants de Mélétis étudient sous la tutelle des maîtres de Dékatia, une école de magie et de philosophie renommée.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595432&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4b0232c0-3056-4bf8-8de9-6793d0f5a66d\', \'multiverseId\': 595432}, \'multiverseid\': 595432}, {\'name\': "Istruttrice d\'Elite", \'text\': "Quando l\'Istruttrice d\'Elite entra nel campo di battaglia, pesca una carta, poi scarta una carta.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Mago Umano\', \'flavor\': \'Le menti più ingegnose di Meletis studiano presso i maestri della Decazia, una rinomata accademia di magia e filosofia.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595540&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'99147902-a7a9-43f3-bd33-8c2c64aceacd\', \'multiverseId\': 595540}, \'multiverseid\': 595540}, {\'name\': \'精鋭の教官\', \'text\': \'精鋭の教官が戦場に出たとき、カード１枚を引き、その後カード１枚を捨てる。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': \'メレティスで最も優秀な者たちは高名な魔法と哲学の学院デカティアで学ぶ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595648&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f9b9ecac-5c3e-4b1a-b2d8-47d2f7f16f78\', \'multiverseId\': 595648}, \'multiverseid\': 595648}, {\'name\': \'精英讲师\', \'text\': \'当精英讲师进战场时，抓一张牌，然后弃一张牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／法术师\', \'flavor\': \'得卡提亚学院是教导魔法与哲理的知名学府，迈勒提斯最顶尖的智者都云集于此拜师深造。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595972&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6b8eb860-74b4-4a99-bb8b-9906fcb8f986\', \'multiverseId\': 595972}, \'multiverseid\': 595972}]', '[{\'name\': \'Emiel die Gesegnete\', \'text\': \'{3}: Schicke eine andere Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst, ins Exil und bringe sie dann unter der Kontrolle ihres Besitzers ins Spiel zurück.\\nImmer wenn eine andere Kreatur unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, kannst du {G/W} bezahlen. Falls du dies tust, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf sie. Falls sie ein Einhorn ist, lege stattdessen zwei +1/+1-Marken auf sie. ({G/W} kann entweder mit {G} oder mit {W} bezahlt werden.)\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Einhorn\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591586&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2ebc1cb7-dbe6-476c-af04-d9baf4b8c142\', \'multiverseId\': 591586}, \'multiverseid\': 591586}, {\'name\': \'Emiel el Bendito\', \'text\': \'{3}: Exilia otra criatura objetivo que controlas, luego regrésala al campo de batalla bajo el control de su propietario.\\nSiempre que otra criatura entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, puedes pagar {G/W}. Si lo haces, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre ella. Si es un Unicornio, en vez de eso, pon dos contadores +1/+1 sobre ella. ({G/W} puede pagarse con {G} o con {W}.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Unicornio\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591715&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'00d0f48b-b182-450c-8c3f-80a4ddea7560\', \'multiverseId\': 591715}, \'multiverseid\': 591715}, {\'name\': \'Emiel la bénie\', \'text\': "{3} : Exilez une autre créature ciblée que vous contrôlez, puis renvoyez-la sur le champ de bataille sous le contrôle de son propriétaire.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'une autre créature arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, vous pouvez payer {G/W}. Si vous faites ainsi, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur elle. Si c\'est une licorne, mettez deux marqueurs +1/+1 sur elle à la place. ({G/W} peut être payé au choix avec {G} ou {W}.)", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : licorne\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591844&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9dc6d336-f897-409e-b51d-aec1e974addc\', \'multiverseId\': 591844}, \'multiverseid\': 591844}, {\'name\': \'Emiel la Benedetta\', \'text\': "{3}: Esilia un\'altra creatura bersaglio che controlli, poi rimettila sul campo di battaglia sotto il controllo del suo proprietario.\\nOgniqualvolta un\'altra creatura entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, puoi pagare {G/W}. Se lo fai, metti un segnalino +1/+1 su di essa. Se è un Unicorno, metti invece due segnalini +1/+1 su di essa. ({G/W} può essere pagato con {G} o {W}.)", \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Unicorno\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591973&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b77599c4-093d-4cec-92e9-ad33e13951af\', \'multiverseId\': 591973}, \'multiverseid\': 591973}, {\'name\': \'祝福されたエミエル\', \'text\': \'{3}：あなたがコントロールしていてこれでないクリーチャー１体を対象とする。それを追放する。その後、それをオーナーのコントロール下で戦場に戻す。\\nこれでないクリーチャー１体があなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、あなたは{G/W}を支払ってもよい。そうしたなら、それの上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。それがユニコーンであるなら、代わりに、それの上に＋１/＋１カウンター２個を置く。（{G/W}は{G}でも{W}でも支払うことができる。）\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — ユニコーン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592102&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ee211587-62b6-44f9-8269-088a0c9c8eca\', \'multiverseId\': 592102}, \'multiverseid\': 592102}, {\'name\': \'受福的埃米尔\', \'text\': \'{3}：放逐另一个目标由你操控的生物，然后将它在其拥有者的操控下移回战场。\\n每当另一个生物在你的操控下进战场时，你可以支付{G/W}。若你如此作，则在其上放置一个+1/+1指示物。若它是独角兽，则改为在其上放置两个+1/+1指示物。（{G/W}可用{G}或{W}来支付。）\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～独角兽\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592489&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a1d5fedb-95b1-48a1-952b-b83a8621d6de\', \'multiverseId\': 592489}, \'multiverseid\': 592489}]', '[{\'name\': \'Endlose Reihen des Todes\', \'text\': \'Zu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments erzeugst du X 2/2 schwarze Zombie-Kreaturenspielsteine, wobei X gleich der Hälfte der Anzahl an Zombies ist, die du kontrollierst, abgerundet.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'Da Thrabens Armee hinter die Stadtmauern zurückgerufen worden war, mussten die umliegenden Dörfer sich selbst verteidigen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594067&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dd55a74a-0aca-4da3-8d3e-28aaf5abc202\', \'multiverseId\': 594067}, \'multiverseid\': 594067}, {\'name\': \'Filas interminables de muertos\', \'text\': \'Al comienzo de tu mantenimiento, crea X fichas de criatura Zombie negras 2/2, donde X es la mitad de la cantidad de Zombies que controlas, redondeado hacia abajo.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'Con el ejército de Thraben recluido tras sus muros, las aldeas exteriores fueron abandonadas a su suerte.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594184&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e1f2d9b7-809b-4d2f-bce7-e5cc75ad6eb1\', \'multiverseId\': 594184}, \'multiverseid\': 594184}, {\'name\': \'Interminables colonnes de morts\', \'text\': "Au début de votre entretien, créez X jetons de créature 2/2 noire Zombie, X étant la moitié du nombre de zombies que vous contrôlez, arrondie à l\'unité inférieure.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': "Quand l\'armée de Thraben fut rappelée aux fortifications, les villages alentours durent se défendre seuls.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594301&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f1c61435-e537-43be-8f0c-21d14c32dc46\', \'multiverseId\': 594301}, \'multiverseid\': 594301}, {\'name\': \'Interminabili Truppe di Morti\', \'text\': "All\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, crea X pedine creatura Zombie 2/2 nere, dove X è la metà del numero di Zombie che controlli, arrotondata per difetto.", \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': "Con l\'esercito di Thraben richiamato entro le mura della città, i villaggi più lontani furono lasciati ad arrangiarsi.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594418&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c04999f4-73d8-4b3f-bbed-e9ff14ec216a\', \'multiverseId\': 594418}, \'multiverseid\': 594418}, {\'name\': \'終わり無き死者の列\', \'text\': \'あなたのアップキープの開始時に、黒の２/２のゾンビ・クリーチャー・トークンＸ体を生成する。Ｘはあなたがコントロールしているゾンビの数の端数を切り捨てた半分に等しい。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'スレイベンの軍が都市の壁の中に呼び戻されたことで、周辺の村々は自衛せざるをえなくなった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594535&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'00ffea14-79be-4217-b250-10ad04967c80\', \'multiverseId\': 594535}, \'multiverseid\': 594535}, {\'name\': \'无尽亡者行列\', \'text\': \'在你的维持开始时，派出X个2/2黑色灵俑衍生生物，X为由你操控之灵俑数量的一半，小数点后舍去。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'瑟班军队被召回城墙附近，边陲的村庄只好自筹防务。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594886&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'634ed248-90a4-4b9a-9393-be9cf8248106\', \'multiverseId\': 594886}, \'multiverseid\': 594886}]', '[{\'name\': \'Engel der Befreiung\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nWenn der Engel der Befreiung ins Spiel kommt, bringe eine bleibende Karte, die du kontrollierst, auf die Hand ihres Besitzers zurück.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Engel\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich übernehme jetzt, Soldat."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597084&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'07048083-5ea7-4a19-bab5-df0b486fabbd\', \'multiverseId\': 597084}, \'multiverseid\': 597084}, {\'name\': \'Ángel de la emancipación\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nCuando el Ángel de la emancipación entre al campo de batalla, regresa un permanente que controlas a la mano de su propietario.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ángel\', \'flavor\': \'"Soldado, ahora me ocupo yo".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597130&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1ebd1a2c-b518-4623-80c2-38e50d093e0a\', \'multiverseId\': 597130}, \'multiverseid\': 597130}, {\'name\': "Ange de l\'émancipation", \'text\': "Vol\\nQuand l\'Ange de l\'émancipation arrive sur le champ de bataille, renvoyez un permanent que vous contrôlez dans la main de son propriétaire.", \'type\': \'Créature : ange\', \'flavor\': "« Je m\'occupe du reste, soldat. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597176&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6ba8fb72-67ca-4d7f-ac47-7359144eeced\', \'multiverseId\': 597176}, \'multiverseid\': 597176}, {\'name\': \'Angelo della Liberazione\', \'text\': "Volare\\nQuando l\'Angelo della Liberazione entra nel campo di battaglia, fai tornare un permanente che controlli in mano al suo proprietario.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Angelo\', \'flavor\': \'"Adesso lascia fare a me, soldato."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597222&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'00c3cb37-7034-492f-88f3-c351d911298e\', \'multiverseId\': 597222}, \'multiverseid\': 597222}, {\'name\': \'解放の天使\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n解放の天使が戦場に出たとき、あなたがコントロールしているパーマネント１つをオーナーの手札に戻す。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 天使\', \'flavor\': \'「ここからは私に任せて、兵士さん。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597268&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'152e9ee2-3a62-48b5-b159-fbd865a5dddc\', \'multiverseId\': 597268}, \'multiverseid\': 597268}, {\'name\': \'解放天使\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n当解放天使进战场时，将一个由你操控的永久物移回其拥有者手上。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～天使\', \'flavor\': \'「士兵，后面就交给我吧。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597406&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'59342c7e-f32e-44a6-b42b-2ac9b02bbd72\', \'multiverseId\': 597406}, \'multiverseid\': 597406}]', '[{\'name\': \'Engel der Wiederherstellung\', \'text\': \'Aufblitzen\\nFliegend\\nWenn der Engel der Wiederherstellung ins Spiel kommt, kannst du eine Nicht-Engel-Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst, ins Exil schicken und sie dann unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel zurückbringen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Engel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591639&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'90ea2f3e-e950-44e7-9526-caf4029dedd4\', \'multiverseId\': 591639}, \'multiverseid\': 591639}, {\'name\': \'Ángel de la restitución\', \'text\': \'Destello.\\nVuela.\\nCuando el Ángel de la restitución entre al campo de batalla, puedes exiliar la criatura objetivo que controlas que no sea un Ángel, luego regresa esa carta al campo de batalla bajo tu control.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ángel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591768&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9937ed66-c02b-49ff-8329-39929a031aa3\', \'multiverseId\': 591768}, \'multiverseid\': 591768}, {\'name\': \'Ange de la restauration\', \'text\': "Flash\\nVol\\nQuand l\'Ange de la restauration arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez exiler une créature non-Ange ciblée que vous contrôlez, puis renvoyer cette carte sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle.", \'type\': \'Créature : ange\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591897&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cad51547-fb71-4f68-b0fd-8c273031503e\', \'multiverseId\': 591897}, \'multiverseid\': 591897}, {\'name\': \'Angelo della Restaurazione\', \'text\': "Lampo\\nVolare\\nQuando l\'Angelo della Restaurazione entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi esiliare una creatura non Angelo bersaglio che controlli, poi rimettere quella carta sul campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Angelo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592026&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ba19ac2a-b4e8-46ee-a355-032331a9fe47\', \'multiverseId\': 592026}, \'multiverseid\': 592026}, {\'name\': \'修復の天使\', \'text\': \'瞬速\\n飛行\\n修復の天使が戦場に出たとき、あなたがコントロールしていて天使でないクリーチャー１体を対象とする。あなたは「それを追放する。その後、そのカードをあなたのコントロール下で戦場に戻す。」を選んでもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 天使\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592155&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'51c2f3ce-7186-4d3e-ae77-b28d16513733\', \'multiverseId\': 592155}, \'multiverseid\': 592155}, {\'name\': \'复归天使\', \'text\': \'闪现\\n飞行\\n当复归天使进战场时，你可以放逐目标由你操控的非天使生物，然后将该牌在你的操控下移回战场。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～天使\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592542&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cd9bc613-c896-4ec3-9e33-ac2a80c4c57a\', \'multiverseId\': 592542}, \'multiverseid\': 592542}]', '[{\'name\': \'Engel vom Alabasterschwarm\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nZu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments bringst du eine Geist-Karte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurück.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Engel\', \'flavor\': \'Er harrt ohne Avacyn aus, aber fragt im Geheimen jede Seele, die er leitet, ob diese sie gesehen hat.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591550&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8c726ae7-58ee-4eee-a651-fc1dc9654c70\', \'multiverseId\': 591550}, \'multiverseid\': 591550}, {\'name\': \'Ángel de la Legión Alabastro\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nAl comienzo de tu mantenimiento, regresa la carta de Espíritu objetivo de tu cementerio a tu mano.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ángel\', \'flavor\': \'Ella soporta la ausencia de Avacyn, pero en secreto pregunta a cada alma que guía si la ha visto.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591679&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'58c74149-fd0e-4ff3-b7a9-de1680c4d8e1\', \'multiverseId\': 591679}, \'multiverseid\': 591679}, {\'name\': "Ange du vol d\'albâtre", \'text\': "Vol\\nAu début de votre entretien, renvoyez une carte d\'esprit ciblée depuis votre cimetière dans votre main.", \'type\': \'Créature : ange\', \'flavor\': "Elle survit sans Avacyn mais secrètement, elle demande à chaque âme qu\'elle guide si elle l\'a vue.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591808&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8862dd56-3d9a-4d4b-b83e-5a53273e3205\', \'multiverseId\': 591808}, \'multiverseid\': 591808}, {\'name\': \'Angelo della Schiera Alabastro\', \'text\': "Volare\\nAll\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, riprendi in mano una carta Spirito bersaglio dal tuo cimitero.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Angelo\', \'flavor\': "Resiste anche senza Avacyn ma di nascosto chiede a ogni anima che guida se l\'ha vista.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591937&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1832e106-0f0e-4890-ab5d-1330f546bb48\', \'multiverseId\': 591937}, \'multiverseid\': 591937}, {\'name\': \'空翔ける雪花石の天使\', \'text\': \'飛行\\nあなたのアップキープの開始時に、あなたの墓地にあるスピリット・カード１枚を対象とする。それをあなたの手札に戻す。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 天使\', \'flavor\': \'彼女はアヴァシンのいない状況に耐えているが、導く魂の一つ一つに彼女を見なかったか尋ねている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592066&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'80a4d04b-06c3-4ea6-8908-54ff6164ac5a\', \'multiverseId\': 592066}, \'multiverseid\': 592066}, {\'name\': \'洁羽天使\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n在你的维持开始时，将目标精怪牌从你的坟墓场移回你手上。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～天使\', \'flavor\': \'她能撑得过艾维欣消失的现况，但依旧会私下逐一询问所引导的灵魂是否见过她。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592453&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'61e5052c-9498-4edc-9576-b0e8e9916607\', \'multiverseId\': 592453}, \'multiverseid\': 592453}]', '[{\'name\': \'Engelsgleicher Helfer\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\n{T}: Eine angreifende oder blockende Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält +1/+1 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Engel, Geist\', \'flavor\': \'Wenn nur jede Nachricht so gut wäre wie ihr Überbringer.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591552&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'be061088-3743-4a71-9b47-8ba1e46af425\', \'multiverseId\': 591552}, \'multiverseid\': 591552}, {\'name\': \'Paje angélico\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\n{T}: La criatura atacante o bloqueadora objetivo obtiene +1/+1 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Espíritu ángel\', \'flavor\': \'Ojalá todo mensaje fuera tan perfecto como su mensajero.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591681&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f2babcae-022c-4394-8429-6cc51a81fd5a\', \'multiverseId\': 591681}, \'multiverseid\': 591681}, {\'name\': \'Page angélique\', \'text\': "Vol\\n{T} : Une créature attaquante ou bloqueuse ciblée gagne +1/+1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : ange et esprit\', \'flavor\': \'Si seulement chaque message était aussi beau, aussi pur, que son porteur.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591810&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'732887a7-6e51-4f33-8e53-a6b6a6f023b8\', \'multiverseId\': 591810}, \'multiverseid\': 591810}, {\'name\': \'Paggio Angelico\', \'text\': \'Volare\\n{T}: Una creatura attaccante o bloccante bersaglio prende +1/+1 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Spirito Angelo\', \'flavor\': \'Se solo tutti i messaggi fossero perfetti come i messaggeri.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591939&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'debbe653-5d45-49b4-af7d-d1705978f34c\', \'multiverseId\': 591939}, \'multiverseid\': 591939}, {\'name\': \'天使の従者\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n{T}：攻撃クリーチャーやブロック・クリーチャーのうち１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 天使・スピリット\', \'flavor\': \'伝言がすべてそれを運んでくる使者と同じぐらいに完璧なものであったらなあ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592068&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2a8e6dc6-9e14-4c62-be70-9dc21ea99523\', \'multiverseId\': 592068}, \'multiverseid\': 592068}, {\'name\': \'天使信差\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n{T}：目标进行攻击或阻挡的生物得+1/+1直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～天使／精怪\', \'flavor\': \'但愿所有消息都如其传令般美好。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592455&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a394f966-84fa-4e57-8fed-481be0da3af1\', \'multiverseId\': 592455}, \'multiverseid\': 592455}]', '[{\'name\': \'Engelskätzchen\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn das Engelskätzchen zum ersten Mal in einem Zug das Ziel eines Zauberspruchs oder einer Fähigkeit wird, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf es.\\nSolange drei oder mehr +1/+1-Marken auf dem Engelskätzchen liegen, hat es Flugfähigkeit.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Katze, Engel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589607&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6984ee06-f38a-4429-ab3a-8c5883292acd\', \'multiverseId\': 589607}, \'multiverseid\': 589607}, {\'name\': \'Cachorro angelical\', \'text\': \'Siempre que el Cachorro angelical sea objetivo de un hechizo o habilidad por primera vez cada turno, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre él.\\nMientras el Cachorro angelical tenga tres o más contadores +1/+1 sobre él, tiene la habilidad de volar.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ángel felino\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589658&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'95b5b0c4-25bd-469e-a854-2487acc9c3ce\', \'multiverseId\': 589658}, \'multiverseid\': 589658}, {\'name\': \'Lionceau angélique\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que le Lionceau angélique devient la cible d\'un sort ou d\'une capacité pour la première fois à chaque tour, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur lui.\\nTant que le Lionceau angélique a au moins trois marqueurs +1/+1 sur lui, il a le vol.", \'type\': \'Créature : chat et ange\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589709&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'986cc802-a6be-478f-8540-25184ce82194\', \'multiverseId\': 589709}, \'multiverseid\': 589709}, {\'name\': \'Cucciolo Angelico\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta il Cucciolo Angelico diventa bersaglio di una magia o abilità per la prima volta in ogni turno, metti un segnalino +1/+1 su di esso.\\nFintanto che il Cucciolo Angelico ha tre o più segnalini +1/+1, ha volare.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Angelo Felino\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589760&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'38cbd180-fe2f-40b3-ab7b-ad370d4163d2\', \'multiverseId\': 589760}, \'multiverseid\': 589760}, {\'name\': \'天使の幼獣\', \'text\': \'天使の幼獣が各ターン内で初めて呪文や能力の対象となるたび、これの上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。\\n天使の幼獣の上に３個以上の＋１/＋１カウンターがあるかぎり、これは飛行を持つ。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 猫・天使\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589811&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2642fb89-e38f-42e5-adda-12bf1bfe002f\', \'multiverseId\': 589811}, \'multiverseid\': 589811}, {\'name\': \'幼狮天使\', \'text\': \'每当幼狮天使每回合首度成为咒语或异能的目标时，在其上放置一个+1/+1指示物。\\n只要幼狮天使上有三个或更多+1/+1指示物，它便具有飞行异能。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～猫／天使\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589964&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8c8eff3b-3775-4b28-87f1-89e61770607f\', \'multiverseId\': 589964}, \'multiverseid\': 589964}]', '[{\'name\': \'Enklave der Bynder\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{3}, {T}: Ziehe eine Karte. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit nur, falls du eine Kreatur mit Stärke 4 oder mehr kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'Es gibt einen Zufluchtsort, der sich nur denjenigen offenbart, die von *Eludha* gesegnet wurden — der mystischen Verbindung zwischen Bynder und Monster.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596315&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4415fedd-f751-4901-b920-c0f3410310e3\', \'multiverseId\': 596315}, \'multiverseid\': 596315}, {\'name\': \'Enclave de los vinculadores\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {C}.\\n{3}, {T}: Roba una carta. Activa esto solo si controlas una criatura con fuerza de 4 o más.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'Hay un santuario que solo se muestra a los agraciados por la *eludha*, la conexión mística entre vinculador y monstruo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596402&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'73e39beb-87b5-4c0e-b0dd-cbbd02db8d62\', \'multiverseId\': 596402}, \'multiverseid\': 596402}, {\'name\': \'Enclave des brideurs\', \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{3}, {T} : Piochez une carte. N\'activez que si vous contrôlez une créature de force supérieure ou égale à 4.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "Il existe un sanctuaire qui ne se dévoile qu\'à ceux touchés par la grâce de l\'*éludha* : la connexion mystique entre un brideur et un monstre.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596489&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'22405553-8a94-4548-9c34-671beceef357\', \'multiverseId\': 596489}, \'multiverseid\': 596489}, {\'name\': \'Enclave dei Vincolatori\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\n{3}, {T}: Pesca una carta. Attiva solo se controlli una creatura con forza pari o superiore a 4.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': "Esiste un santuario che si rivela solo a coloro che sono stati benedetti dall\'*eludha*: il legame mistico tra vincolatore e mostro.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596576&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f52bf7a6-17e1-45c2-ada4-17b29335bee8\', \'multiverseId\': 596576}, \'multiverseid\': 596576}, {\'name\': \'眷者の居留地\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{3},{T}：カード１枚を引く。あなたがパワーが４以上のクリーチャーをコントロールしていなければ起動できない。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'*エルーダ*に恵まれた者の前にのみ現れる聖域がある。怪物と不思議な絆を結んだ者たちの聖域だ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596663&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3174d31b-3f87-432a-922f-0f825ec98bec\', \'multiverseId\': 596663}, \'multiverseid\': 596663}, {\'name\': \'持绊人秘境\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{C}。\\n{3}，{T}：抓一张牌。只能于你操控力量等于或大于4的生物时起动。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'联系持绊人与怪兽之间的神秘纽带称作*灵绊*，而有处庇护地只向持有这类羁绊者敞开大门。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596924&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6cceb49f-d015-40d7-9fb5-1b9992c9a1eb\', \'multiverseId\': 596924}, \'multiverseid\': 596924}]', '[{\'name\': \'Erbitterter Hexenjäger\', \'text\': \'Verursacht Trampelschaden\\nWenn der Erbitterte Hexenjäger ins Spiel kommt, erzeuge einen Speise-Spielstein. (Er ist ein Artefakt mit „{2}, {T}, opfere dieses Artefakt: Du erhältst 3 Lebenspunkte dazu.")\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Wolf\', \'flavor\': \'Während das Reich seine Gesetze hat, gibt es in der Wildnis andere Wege, das Gleichgewicht der Kräfte aufrechtzuerhalten.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592860&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f244e201-b207-4bd7-9dcc-b9b95f0f6355\', \'multiverseId\': 592860}, \'multiverseid\': 592860}, {\'name\': \'Acechabrujas feroz\', \'text\': \'Arrolla.\\nCuando el Acechabrujas feroz entre al campo de batalla, crea una ficha de Comida. (Es un artefacto con "{2}, {T}, sacrificar este artefacto: Ganas 3 vidas".)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Lobo\', \'flavor\': \'El reino tiene sus leyes, pero en las tierras salvajes hay otras formas de conservar el equilibrio de poderes.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592981&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'57d1833a-91a6-433b-b024-2b6ed65ed5a8\', \'multiverseId\': 592981}, \'multiverseid\': 592981}, {\'name\': \'Pisteur de sorcière féroce\', \'text\': "Piétinement\\nQuand le Pisteur de sorcière féroce arrive sur le champ de bataille, créez un jeton Nourriture. (C\'est un artefact avec « {2}, {T}, sacrifiez cet artefact : Vous gagnez 3 points de vie. »)", \'type\': \'Créature : loup\', \'flavor\': "Si le royaume a des lois, les friches ont d\'autres moyens d\'équilibrer le pouvoir.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593102&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5101e8d8-8f1c-4dab-a7ca-c62f48c8589f\', \'multiverseId\': 593102}, \'multiverseid\': 593102}, {\'name\': \'Braccastreghe Feroce\', \'text\': \'Travolgere\\nQuando il Braccastreghe Feroce entra nel campo di battaglia, crea una pedina Cibo. (È un artefatto con "{2}, {T}, Sacrifica questo artefatto: Guadagni 3 punti vita".)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Lupo\', \'flavor\': "Il reame ha le sue leggi, ma nelle terre selvagge esistono altri metodi per mantenere l\'equilibrio dei poteri.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593223&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fde8acd6-5f89-4cdf-9e58-a72440900e4e\', \'multiverseId\': 593223}, \'multiverseid\': 593223}, {\'name\': \'獰猛な魔女跡追い\', \'text\': \'トランプル\\n獰猛な魔女跡追いが戦場に出たとき、食物・トークン１つを生成する。（それは、「{2},{T},このアーティファクトを生け贄に捧げる：あなたは３点のライフを得る。」を持つアーティファクトである。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 狼\', \'flavor\': \'王国に法があるように、僻境には力の均衡を保つ他の手段がある。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593344&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a5e8de86-2e69-4fe7-b520-1ecfa8dffb04\', \'multiverseId\': 593344}, \'multiverseid\': 593344}, {\'name\': \'凶猛猎巫狼\', \'text\': \'践踏\\n当凶猛猎巫狼进战场时，派出一个食品衍生物。（它是具有「{2}，{T}，牺牲此神器：你获得3点生命」的神器。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～狼\', \'flavor\': \'世境依靠法律均衡力量，幻野依靠的是其他办法。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593707&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d914e178-d999-48d7-b210-69f44433497d\', \'multiverseId\': 593707}, \'multiverseid\': 593707}]', '[{\'name\': \'Erdstoß-Zyklop\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Erdstoß-Zyklop ins Spiel kommt, können bis zu zwei Kreaturen deiner Wahl in diesem Zug nicht blocken.\\nUmwandlung {1}{R} ({1}{R}, wirf diese Karte ab: Ziehe eine Karte.)\\nWenn du den Erdstoß-Zyklopen umwandelst, kann eine Kreatur deiner Wahl in diesem Zug nicht blocken.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Zyklop\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590291&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'18612a64-ef03-4f72-b817-637ecf5d5276\', \'multiverseId\': 590291}, \'multiverseid\': 590291}, {\'name\': \'Cíclope pierremoto\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Cíclope pierremoto entre al campo de batalla, hasta dos criaturas objetivo no pueden bloquear este turno.\\nCiclo {1}{R}. ({1}{R}, descartar esta carta: Roba una carta.)\\nCuando actives la habilidad de ciclo del Cíclope pierremoto, la criatura objetivo no puede bloquear este turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Cíclope\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590426&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e0b33fe9-bfe5-4d68-a766-57f6100f140d\', \'multiverseId\': 590426}, \'multiverseid\': 590426}, {\'name\': \'Cyclope tellurique\', \'text\': "Quand le Cyclope tellurique arrive sur le champ de bataille, jusqu\'à deux créatures ciblées ne peuvent pas bloquer ce tour-ci.\\nRecyclage {1}{R} ({1}{R}, défaussez-vous de cette carte : Piochez une carte.)\\nQuand vous recyclez le Cyclope tellurique, une créature ciblée ne peut pas bloquer ce tour-ci.", \'type\': \'Créature : cyclope\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590561&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'18a379ea-9a29-4107-91c3-8c4396b83114\', \'multiverseId\': 590561}, \'multiverseid\': 590561}, {\'name\': \'Ciclope Piedesisma\', \'text\': \'Quando il Ciclope Piedesisma entra nel campo di battaglia, fino a due creature bersaglio non possono bloccare in questo turno.\\nCiclo {1}{R} ({1}{R}, Scarta questa carta: Pesca una carta.)\\nQuando cicli il Ciclope Piedesisma, una creatura bersaglio non può bloccare in questo turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Ciclope\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590696&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8f314d37-2b52-4150-b169-72582c6b5490\', \'multiverseId\': 590696}, \'multiverseid\': 590696}, {\'name\': \'震足サイクロプス\', \'text\': \'震足サイクロプスが戦場に出たとき、クリーチャー最大２体を対象とする。このターン、それらではブロックできない。\\nサイクリング{1}{R}（{1}{R}, このカードを捨てる：カード１枚を引く。）\\nあなたが震足サイクロプスをサイクリングしたとき、クリーチャー１体を対象とする。このターン、それではブロックできない。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — サイクロプス\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590831&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cf4a7b86-3919-4a16-a568-6a16c945360b\', \'multiverseId\': 590831}, \'multiverseid\': 590831}, {\'name\': \'撼地独眼巨人\', \'text\': \'当撼地独眼巨人进战场时，至多两个目标生物本回合不能进行阻挡。\\n循环{1}{R}（{1}{R}，弃掉此牌：抓一张牌。）\\n每当你循环撼地独眼巨人时，目标生物本回合不能进行阻挡。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～独眼巨人\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591236&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5dd19eae-d3a4-451d-9b2e-3d88c883eeb7\', \'multiverseId\': 591236}, \'multiverseid\': 591236}]', '[{\'name\': \'Erfahrener Fußsoldat\', \'text\': \'{T}: Eine angreifende Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält +1/+1 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Soldat\', \'flavor\': \'„Kameraden, zu mir! Wir müssen ihre Linie angreifen, um unsere Bogenschützen und Magier zu schützen. Niemand darf bei dieser Aufgabe versagen!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591604&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b958c671-1e0c-4647-9411-4067dc54b462\', \'multiverseId\': 591604}, \'multiverseid\': 591604}, {\'name\': \'Veterano de infantería\', \'text\': \'{T}: La criatura atacante objetivo obtiene +1/+1 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado humano\', \'flavor\': \'"¡Todos los espadachines conmigo! Debemos hacer frente a sus filas para proteger a nuestros arqueros y magos. ¡No podemos fracasar!".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591733&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8dd091d9-8197-4726-b71c-6d127c868659\', \'multiverseId\': 591733}, \'multiverseid\': 591733}, {\'name\': "Vétéran de l\'infanterie", \'text\': "{T} : Une créature attaquante ciblée gagne +1/+1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et soldat\', \'flavor\': \'« À moi, épées ! Nous devons frapper leur ligne pour protéger nos archers et nos mages. Nous avons le devoir de ne pas échouer ! »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591862&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'972bca7c-e77b-4ad0-afbd-81349c3c1a39\', \'multiverseId\': 591862}, \'multiverseid\': 591862}, {\'name\': \'Fante Veterano\', \'text\': \'{T}: Una creatura attaccante bersaglio prende +1/+1 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Soldato Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Spade, a me! Dobbiamo ingaggiare la loro linea per proteggere i nostri arcieri e maghi. Il fallimento non è un\\\'opzione!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591991&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'772a8404-062a-45a5-8af1-31a8fe11257e\', \'multiverseId\': 591991}, \'multiverseid\': 591991}, {\'name\': \'歴戦の歩兵\', \'text\': \'{T}：攻撃クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・兵士\', \'flavor\': \'「剣士らよ、俺に続け！我らの射手や魔道士を守るために、相手の戦列と交戦に入る。この任務に失敗は許されん！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592120&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3f35261c-c307-46a3-8947-36e7fd7a60ce\', \'multiverseId\': 592120}, \'multiverseid\': 592120}, {\'name\': \'资深步兵\', \'text\': \'{T}：目标进行攻击的生物得+1/+1直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'「剑兵队，跟我上！我们必须顶上前去，掩护弓手和法师。不容有失！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592507&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7a1a806e-c501-4ebe-a9e1-fb142d2ea60f\', \'multiverseId\': 592507}, \'multiverseid\': 592507}]', '[{\'name\': \'Erfindungsreicher Leonide\', \'text\': \'{3}{W}: Lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf eine andere angreifende Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst. Falls jene Kreatur eine Katze ist, erhält sie Erstschlag bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Katze, Soldat\', \'flavor\': \'Leoniden-Klauen waren bereits tödliche Waffen der natürlichen Evolution, bevor er sie verbesserte.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589610&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'262f28fa-232a-495b-942d-e1e30539e06a\', \'multiverseId\': 589610}, \'multiverseid\': 589610}, {\'name\': \'Leonino ingenioso\', \'text\': \'{3}{W}: Pon un contador +1/+1 sobre otra criatura atacante objetivo que controlas. Si esa criatura es un Felino, gana la habilidad de dañar primero hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado felino\', \'flavor\': \'Incluso antes de mejorarlas, las garras de los leoninos ya eran armas letales gracias a la evolución.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589661&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1cccd615-9440-4c4c-8dce-ad2959845037\', \'multiverseId\': 589661}, \'multiverseid\': 589661}, {\'name\': \'Léonin ingénieux\', \'text\': "{3}{W} : Mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur une autre créature attaquante ciblée que vous contrôlez. Si cette créature est un chat, elle acquiert l\'initiative jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : chat et soldat\', \'flavor\': "Les griffes du léonin étaient déjà des armes mortelles d\'évolution naturelle avant qu\'il ne les améliore.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589712&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0981dfc6-c5fb-42e6-ab9e-60122b90c0ec\', \'multiverseId\': 589712}, \'multiverseid\': 589712}, {\'name\': \'Leonid Ingegnoso\', \'text\': "{3}{W}: Metti un segnalino +1/+1 su un\'altra creatura attaccante bersaglio che controlli. Se quella creatura è un Felino, ha attacco improvviso fino alla fine del turno.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Soldato Felino\', \'flavor\': "L\'evoluzione naturale aveva già reso gli artigli dei leonid armi letali prima ancora che lui li migliorasse ulteriormente.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589763&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c1151d8f-939d-4c2c-a510-0daf1697212c\', \'multiverseId\': 589763}, \'multiverseid\': 589763}, {\'name\': \'巧妙なレオニン\', \'text\': \'{3}{W}：あなたがコントロールしていてこれでない攻撃クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それの上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。そのクリーチャーが猫であるなら、ターン終了時まで、それは先制攻撃を得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 猫・兵士\', \'flavor\': \'レオニンの爪は、さらなる改良を加える前からすでに自然進化の凶器であった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589814&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6cfe80e4-e249-4f9a-b84a-4cc18b46eecb\', \'multiverseId\': 589814}, \'multiverseid\': 589814}, {\'name\': \'狮族巧匠\', \'text\': \'{3}{W}：在另一个目标由你操控且进行攻击的生物上放置一个+1/+1指示物。如果该生物是猫，则它获得先攻异能直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～猫／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'在经他改进之前，自然进化就早已把狮族的利爪变成了致命的武器。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589967&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'397d789c-4a73-4db5-95a0-bc27d0998580\', \'multiverseId\': 589967}, \'multiverseid\': 589967}]', "[{'name': 'Ergiebigmacher', 'text': 'Der Ergiebigmacher kommt mit zwei +1/+1-Marken ins Spiel.\\n{1}{G}, entferne eine +1/+1-Marke vom Ergiebigmacher: Ein Spieler deiner Wahl durchsucht seine Bibliothek nach einer Standardland-Karte, bringt sie getappt ins Spiel und mischt danach.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Elementarwesen', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592859&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c9e99b02-4ddc-4cc0-9a09-99a7f81befbb', 'multiverseId': 592859}, 'multiverseid': 592859}, {'name': 'Fertílido', 'text': 'El Fertílido entra al campo de batalla con dos contadores +1/+1 sobre él.\\n{1}{G}, remover un contador +1/+1 del Fertílido: El jugador objetivo busca en su biblioteca una carta de tierra básica, la pone en el campo de batalla girada y luego baraja.', 'type': 'Criatura — Elemental', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592980&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0739d87d-ea14-4b31-9e66-1904fb3967be', 'multiverseId': 592980}, 'multiverseid': 592980}, {'name': 'Fertilide', 'text': 'Le Fertilide arrive sur le champ de bataille avec deux marqueurs +1/+1 sur lui.\\n{1}{G}, retirez un marqueur +1/+1 du Fertilide : Un joueur ciblé cherche dans sa bibliothèque une carte de terrain de base, la met sur le champ de bataille engagée, puis mélange.', 'type': 'Créature : élémental', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593101&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '780afa7a-5485-4300-b818-2d955400ecef', 'multiverseId': 593101}, 'multiverseid': 593101}, {'name': 'Fertilid', 'text': 'Il Fertilid entra nel campo di battaglia con due segnalini +1/+1.\\n{1}{G}, Rimuovi un segnalino +1/+1 dal Fertilid: Un giocatore bersaglio passa in rassegna il suo grimorio per una carta terra base, la mette sul campo di battaglia TAPpata, poi rimescola.', 'type': 'Creatura — Elementale', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593222&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'de1f1818-ecc0-4ac5-948e-4db8bc67bb60', 'multiverseId': 593222}, 'multiverseid': 593222}, {'name': 'ファーティリド', 'text': 'ファーティリドは、＋１/＋１カウンター２個が置かれた状態で戦場に出る。\\n{1}{G},ファーティリドの上から＋１/＋１カウンター１個を取り除く：プレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーは自分のライブラリーから基本土地・カード１枚を探し、タップ状態で戦場に出し、その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — エレメンタル', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593343&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cde9d617-c190-4570-b17f-6b2fae2af0d1', 'multiverseId': 593343}, 'multiverseid': 593343}, {'name': '沃壤灵', 'text': '沃壤灵进战场时上面有两个+1/+1指示物。\\n{1}{G}，从沃壤灵上移去一个+1/+1指示物：目标牌手从其牌库中搜寻一张基本地牌，将之横置放进战场，然后洗牌。', 'type': '生物 ～元素', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593706&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2e4d9547-4058-4c5e-8da1-5ea45df19170', 'multiverseId': 593706}, 'multiverseid': 593706}]", '[{\'name\': \'Erhabene Karakals\', \'text\': \'Andere Katzen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +1/+1 und haben Lebensverknüpfung.\\nWenn die Erhabenen Karakals ins Spiel kommen, erzeuge zwei 1/1 weiße Katze-Kreaturenspielsteine mit Lebensverknüpfung.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Katze\', \'flavor\': \'Oketras mächtigste Wesire werden oft als ihre Auserwählten bezeichnet, aber ganz andere haben diesen Titel eher verdient.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591638&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'95acd765-5137-431b-b427-8021b49079e8\', \'multiverseId\': 591638}, \'multiverseid\': 591638}, {\'name\': \'Caracal regio\', \'text\': \'Los otros Felinos que controlas obtienen +1/+1 y tienen la habilidad de vínculo vital.\\nCuando el Caracal regio entre al campo de batalla, crea dos fichas de criatura Felino blancas 1/1 con la habilidad de vínculo vital.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Felino\', \'flavor\': \'A los visires más cercanos a Oketra se los conoce como sus elegidos, pero puede que otros se merezcan más ese apelativo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591767&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b4df4dae-3de8-4a6b-a5d6-9dd2ab12bc37\', \'multiverseId\': 591767}, \'multiverseid\': 591767}, {\'name\': \'Caracal royal\', \'text\': \'Les autres chats que vous contrôlez gagnent +1/+1 et ont le lien de vie.\\nQuand le Caracal royal arrive sur le champ de bataille, créez deux jetons de créature 1/1 blanche Chat avec le lien de vie.\', \'type\': \'Créature : chat\', \'flavor\': "Les vizirs les plus proches d\'Oketra sont appelés ses élus, même si d\'autres mériteraient davantage ce surnom.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591896&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c0dc2010-4629-4814-964c-301dc39f3843\', \'multiverseId\': 591896}, \'multiverseid\': 591896}, {\'name\': \'Lince Reale\', \'text\': \'Gli altri Felini che controlli prendono +1/+1 e hanno legame vitale.\\nQuando la Lince Reale entra nel campo di battaglia, crea due pedine creatura Felino 1/1 bianche con legame vitale.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Felino\', \'flavor\': \'I visir più vicini a Oketra sono noti come gli eletti, anche se alcuni di loro non sono degni di tale appellativo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592025&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fb5c74ad-1064-4411-af59-3035905015cf\', \'multiverseId\': 592025}, \'multiverseid\': 592025}, {\'name\': \'威厳あるカラカル\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしていてこれでないすべての猫は、＋１/＋１の修整を受け絆魂を持つ。\\n威厳あるカラカルが戦場に出たとき、絆魂を持つ白の１/１の猫・クリーチャー・トークン２体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 猫\', \'flavor\': \'オケチラにもっとも近い侍臣はオケチラに選ばれし者と呼ばれるが、その名によりふさわしい者が他にいることもある。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592154&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7ffc39f1-2128-4c1b-9e49-c1e0f10fe415\', \'multiverseId\': 592154}, \'multiverseid\': 592154}, {\'name\': \'威严狞猫\', \'text\': \'由你操控的其他猫得+1/+1且具有系命异能。\\n当威严狞猫进战场时，派出两个1/1白色，具系命异能的猫衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～猫\', \'flavor\': \'欧柯塔最贴身的维齐尔被称为她的精卫，而这个别称给到其他生物或许更为贴切。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592541&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dd1461de-3083-4435-acb0-35a821708b21\', \'multiverseId\': 592541}, \'multiverseid\': 592541}]', "[{'name': 'Erhabenes Scheinbild', 'text': 'Wenn das Erhabene Scheinbild ins Spiel kommt, kannst du deine Bibliothek nach einer Standardland-Karte durchsuchen, sie getappt ins Spiel bringen und danach mischen.\\nWenn das Erhabene Scheinbild stirbt, kannst du eine Karte ziehen.', 'type': 'Artefaktkreatur — Golem', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596301&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3e0730ba-3f66-40e7-953a-c0e512b7178a', 'multiverseId': 596301}, 'multiverseid': 596301}, {'name': 'Simulacro solemne', 'text': 'Cuando el Simulacro solemne entre al campo de batalla, puedes buscar en tu biblioteca una carta de tierra básica, poner esa carta en el campo de batalla girada y luego barajar.\\nCuando el Simulacro solemne muera, puedes robar una carta.', 'type': 'Criatura artefacto — Gólem', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596388&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bb26c6f5-fdfe-4252-8c93-3d935c19b0e5', 'multiverseId': 596388}, 'multiverseid': 596388}, {'name': 'Simulacre solennel', 'text': 'Quand le Simulacre solennel arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez chercher une carte de terrain de base dans votre bibliothèque, la mettre sur le champ de bataille engagée, puis mélanger.\\nQuand le Simulacre solennel meurt, vous pouvez piocher une carte.', 'type': 'Créature-artefact : golem', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596475&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1c4117e0-00a9-4b3b-aff1-1de0ea88b2f7', 'multiverseId': 596475}, 'multiverseid': 596475}, {'name': 'Simulacro Solenne', 'text': 'Quando il Simulacro Solenne entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi passare in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta terra base, metterla sul campo di battaglia TAPpata, poi rimescolare.\\nQuando il Simulacro Solenne muore, puoi pescare una carta.', 'type': 'Creatura Artefatto — Golem', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596562&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '16fc4e28-1948-4795-a445-f7effab4f1ba', 'multiverseId': 596562}, 'multiverseid': 596562}, {'name': '真面目な身代わり', 'text': '真面目な身代わりが戦場に出たとき、あなたは「あなたのライブラリーから基本土地・カード１枚を探し、タップ状態で戦場に出す。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。」を選んでもよい。\\n真面目な身代わりが死亡したとき、あなたはカード１枚を引いてもよい。', 'type': 'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — ゴーレム', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596649&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c016f414-efba-4e1a-8d4c-df83b0591033', 'multiverseId': 596649}, 'multiverseid': 596649}, {'name': '黯色幻影', 'text': '当黯色幻影进战场时，你可以从你牌库中搜寻一张基本地牌，将该牌横置放进战场，然后洗牌。\\n当黯色幻影死去时，你可以抓一张牌。', 'type': '神器生物 ～魔像', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596910&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5cf7ae35-bd6c-4c9f-849d-b488df010723', 'multiverseId': 596910}, 'multiverseid': 596910}]", '[{\'name\': \'Erheller der Erdgänge\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nImmer wenn du zum ersten Mal in einem Zug Nachforschungen anstellst, stelle ein weiteres Mal Nachforschungen an.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Geist\', \'flavor\': \'„Wenn du nicht mehr weiterweißt, folge dem Laternengeist."\\n—Vallon, Inspektorin aus Thraben\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595217&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cb56b8fe-643c-49f1-8b25-d228f108a7e5\', \'multiverseId\': 595217}, \'multiverseid\': 595217}, {\'name\': \'Iluminador de Erdwal\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nSiempre que investigues por primera vez cada turno, investiga una vez adicional.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Espíritu\', \'flavor\': \'"Cuando todo lo demás falle, sigue la lámpara del geist".\\n—Valun, inspector de Thraben\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595325&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'741a0adf-036d-4480-acc1-de4d7e501b2f\', \'multiverseId\': 595325}, \'multiverseid\': 595325}, {\'name\': "Illuminateur de l\'Erdwal", \'text\': \'Vol\\nÀ chaque fois que vous enquêtez pour la première fois à chaque tour, enquêtez une fois de plus.\', \'type\': \'Créature : esprit\', \'flavor\': \'« Dans les ténèbres les plus noires, suivez la lanterne du geist. »\\n—Vellon, inspecteur de Thraben\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595433&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fe890516-02a5-4d5c-ab58-7589b3d630c2\', \'multiverseId\': 595433}, \'multiverseid\': 595433}, {\'name\': \'Illuminatore di Erdwal\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nOgniqualvolta indaghi per la prima volta in ogni turno, indaga una volta in più.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Spirito\', \'flavor\': \'"Quando tutto il resto non funziona, segui la lanterna del geist."\\n—Vallon, ispettore di Thraben\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595541&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8bfd825c-a2da-42b5-9be4-2e52a96444ec\', \'multiverseId\': 595541}, \'multiverseid\': 595541}, {\'name\': \'エルドワルの照光\', \'text\': \'飛行\\nあなたが各ターン内のあなたの１回目の調査を行うたび、追加で調査１回を行う。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — スピリット\', \'flavor\': \'「すべて失敗したときは、霊のランタンを追いたまえ。」\\n――スレイベンの検査官、ヴァリョン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595649&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1595c6ef-9774-47b1-bbcd-f318b8aeed02\', \'multiverseId\': 595649}, \'multiverseid\': 595649}, {\'name\': \'尔卓道燃灯灵\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n每当你每回合首度探查时，额外探查一次。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～精怪\', \'flavor\': \'「走投无路时，就跟随游魂的明灯。」\\n～瑟班巡检官瓦隆\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595973&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'000ca04d-1caa-4b8e-8eae-d9601b3e619a\', \'multiverseId\': 595973}, \'multiverseid\': 595973}]', '[{\'name\': \'Erstaunliche Erholung\', \'text\': \'Bringe eine Kreaturenkarte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof ins Spiel zurück. Lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf sie.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich bin der Fels der Polis. Der Tod verleiht mir nur mehr Kraft."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591623&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1c7a2712-c4f7-4971-8729-84ff91fad9e0\', \'multiverseId\': 591623}, \'multiverseid\': 591623}, {\'name\': \'Recuperación milagrosa\', \'text\': \'Regresa la carta de criatura objetivo de tu cementerio al campo de batalla. Pon un contador +1/+1 sobre ella.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Soy el fundamento de la polis. La muerte tan solo me hace más fuerte".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591752&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'57c196c0-cbde-4eda-b52e-79923c99173a\', \'multiverseId\': 591752}, \'multiverseid\': 591752}, {\'name\': \'Récupération miraculeuse\', \'text\': \'Renvoyez sur le champ de bataille une carte de créature ciblée depuis votre cimetière. Mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur elle.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« Je suis le roc de la polis. La mort me rend plus fort. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591881&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'95caf6c0-5bf6-408e-81f4-9d217f79dd46\', \'multiverseId\': 591881}, \'multiverseid\': 591881}, {\'name\': \'Guarigione Miracolosa\', \'text\': \'Rimetti sul campo di battaglia una carta creatura bersaglio dal tuo cimitero. Metti un segnalino +1/+1 su di essa.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Io sono la roccia della polis. La morte mi rende solo più forte."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592010&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cd139e3b-2ef6-412e-9449-5f177eec3ca0\', \'multiverseId\': 592010}, \'multiverseid\': 592010}, {\'name\': \'奇跡の復活\', \'text\': \'あなたの墓地にあるクリーチャー・カード１枚を対象とする。それを戦場に戻す。それの上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「我は都市国家の礎である。死は我を鍛えるだけに過ぎぬ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592139&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bfd288e6-6c5d-46fd-aafc-61086c2bed0f\', \'multiverseId\': 592139}, \'multiverseid\': 592139}, {\'name\': \'奇迹复生\', \'text\': \'将目标生物牌从你的坟墓场移回战场。在其上放置一个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「吾乃城邦础石。死亡只会让我变得更强。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592526&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bc14303a-bd23-4ed1-b285-522691197cd5\', \'multiverseId\': 592526}, \'multiverseid\': 592526}]', '[{\'name\': \'Erstickende Sporen\', \'text\': \'Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält -3/-3 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Stelle dir vor, wie tausend winzige Pilze deine Lungen füllen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594130&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3849b8a7-3caa-4699-9008-5c4ad11a8c2e\', \'multiverseId\': 594130}, \'multiverseid\': 594130}, {\'name\': \'Esporas asfixiantes\', \'text\': \'La criatura objetivo obtiene -3/-3 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Imagina miles de pequeños hongos creciéndote dentro de los pulmones.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594247&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ce6d6e4a-84f7-49bd-a2d0-41516d8f050e\', \'multiverseId\': 594247}, \'multiverseid\': 594247}, {\'name\': \'Spores étrangleuses\', \'text\': "Une créature ciblée gagne -3/-3 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "Imaginez un millier de champignons microscopiques s\'installant dans vos poumons.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594364&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'81331c5b-86c9-4034-9ebc-064f5d29e87b\', \'multiverseId\': 594364}, \'multiverseid\': 594364}, {\'name\': \'Spore Soffocanti\', \'text\': \'Una creatura bersaglio prende -3/-3 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'È come se nei tuoi polmoni spuntassero migliaia di minuscoli funghi.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594481&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'29ef1a87-68ba-4f11-ad8b-57b1d5cdc38c\', \'multiverseId\': 594481}, \'multiverseid\': 594481}, {\'name\': \'束縛の胞子\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは－３/－３の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'千の小さなキノコが肺の中で育つのを想像してみろ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594598&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'23e3ee91-61dd-4f3d-88fb-504efe1997b6\', \'multiverseId\': 594598}, \'multiverseid\': 594598}, {\'name\': \'窒息芽孢\', \'text\': \'目标生物得-3/-3直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'想象一下你的肺中冒出千朵蘑菇。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594949&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'53ef4eaf-3f6f-405f-ae07-02b71bc2df1e\', \'multiverseId\': 594949}, \'multiverseid\': 594949}]', '[{\'name\': \'Erzwungene Anbetung\', \'text\': \'Verzaubert eine Kreatur\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur kann nicht angreifen.\\n{2}{W}: Bringe die Erzwungene Anbetung auf die Hand ihres Besitzers zurück.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Einsperren führt zu Rachegelüsten. Beinfesseln führen zu Resignation.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591591&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'71601aba-74ee-4387-ad84-eb8f15131142\', \'multiverseId\': 591591}, \'multiverseid\': 591591}, {\'name\': \'Adoración forzosa\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura.\\nLa criatura encantada no puede atacar.\\n{2}{W}: Regresa la Adoración forzosa a la mano de su propietario.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Preso, aprendes a vengarte. Postrado, a resignarte.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591720&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a887c28d-5130-42ca-8a37-34ffbe54f51c\', \'multiverseId\': 591720}, \'multiverseid\': 591720}, {\'name\': \'Adoration forcée\', \'text\': "Enchanter : créature\\nLa créature enchantée ne peut pas attaquer.\\n{2}{W} : Renvoyez l\'Adoration forcée dans la main de son propriétaire.", \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': "L\'emprisonnement enseigne la vengeance. Les entraves enseignent la résignation.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591849&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9ac4d13d-0ce2-4d5f-996b-72487a3a6776\', \'multiverseId\': 591849}, \'multiverseid\': 591849}, {\'name\': \'Adorazione Forzata\', \'text\': "Incanta creatura\\nLa creatura incantata non può attaccare.\\n{2}{W}: Fai tornare l\'Adorazione Forzata in mano al suo proprietario.", \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'La prigionia insegna la vendetta. I ceppi insegnano la rassegnazione.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591978&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'44b071be-0f46-44ca-83bf-57e0c03b3ce9\', \'multiverseId\': 591978}, \'multiverseid\': 591978}, {\'name\': \'強制された崇拝\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\nエンチャントしているクリーチャーでは攻撃できない。\\n{2}{W}：強制された崇拝をオーナーの手札に戻す。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': \'幽閉は復讐を学ばせる。足枷は断念を学ばせる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592107&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0a90e1a7-5ca0-4e89-865a-5e11642d594f\', \'multiverseId\': 592107}, \'multiverseid\': 592107}, {\'name\': \'逼迫敬拜\', \'text\': \'结附于生物\\n所结附的生物不能攻击。\\n{2}{W}：将逼迫敬拜移回其拥有者手上。\', \'type\': \'结界 ～灵气\', \'flavor\': \'监禁教出复仇。跛行教出屈从。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592494&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ef7f3832-2695-4f03-a6c1-288c5cb63724\', \'multiverseId\': 592494}, \'multiverseid\': 592494}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ewigkeitsschlinge\', \'text\': \'Verzaubert eine Kreatur\\nWenn die Ewigkeitsschlinge ins Spiel kommt, ziehe eine Karte.\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur enttappt nicht während des Enttappsegments ihres Beherrschers.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595218&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a4dae511-1919-4b99-9977-5b4884aeb560\', \'multiverseId\': 595218}, \'multiverseid\': 595218}, {\'name\': \'Trampa de eternidad\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura.\\nCuando la Trampa de eternidad entre al campo de batalla, roba una carta.\\nLa criatura encantada no se endereza durante el paso de enderezar de su controlador.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595326&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bd6cf185-10f3-4acf-8ab4-0a986a1c5b9a\', \'multiverseId\': 595326}, \'multiverseid\': 595326}, {\'name\': "Collet d\'éternité", \'text\': "Enchanter : créature\\nQuand le Collet d\'éternité arrive sur le champ de bataille, piochez une carte.\\nLa créature enchantée ne se dégage pas pendant l\'étape de dégagement de son contrôleur.", \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595434&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a53d78c2-e40c-4f78-9a4b-49baf3220def\', \'multiverseId\': 595434}, \'multiverseid\': 595434}, {\'name\': "Calappio d\'Eternità", \'text\': "Incanta creatura\\nQuando il Calappio d\'Eternità entra nel campo di battaglia, pesca una carta.\\nLa creatura incantata non STAPpa durante lo STAP del suo controllore.", \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595542&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bed5e915-bede-4f38-b601-0f55d6131238\', \'multiverseId\': 595542}, \'multiverseid\': 595542}, {\'name\': \'永遠の罠\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\n永遠の罠が戦場に出たとき、カード１枚を引く。\\nエンチャントしているクリーチャーは、それのコントローラーのアンタップ・ステップにアンタップしない。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595650&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'de0aad6e-0e12-4a57-ab12-b2d3b3432184\', \'multiverseId\': 595650}, \'multiverseid\': 595650}, {\'name\': \'恒久绊索\', \'text\': \'结附于生物\\n当恒久绊索进战场时，抓一张牌。\\n所结附的生物于其操控者的重置步骤中不能重置。\', \'type\': \'结界 ～灵气\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595974&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a44b8e90-2e7c-4bce-b89b-4d633a694f95\', \'multiverseId\': 595974}, \'multiverseid\': 595974}]', '[{\'name\': \'Expedition zum Khalni-Herzen\', \'text\': \'Landung — Immer wenn ein Land unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, kannst du eine Quest-Marke auf die Expedition zum Khalni-Herzen legen.\\nEntferne drei Quest-Marken von der Expedition zum Khalni-Herzen und opfere sie: Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach bis zu zwei Standardland-Karten, bringe sie getappt ins Spiel und mische danach.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597119&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'76d9bc06-00ea-4035-bf40-e9338dad8ee0\', \'multiverseId\': 597119}, \'multiverseid\': 597119}, {\'name\': \'Expedición al Corazón de Khalni\', \'text\': \'Aterrizaje — Siempre que una tierra entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, puedes poner un contador de búsqueda sobre la Expedición al Corazón de Khalni.\\nRemover tres contadores de búsqueda de la Expedición al Corazón de Khalni y sacrificarla: Busca en tu biblioteca hasta dos cartas de tierra básica, ponlas en el campo de batalla giradas y luego baraja.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597165&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'39430227-9717-455a-8d2b-df4336fd0187\', \'multiverseId\': 597165}, \'multiverseid\': 597165}, {\'name\': \'Expédition du Cœur de Khalni\', \'text\': "Toucheterre — À chaque fois qu\'un terrain arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, vous pouvez mettre un marqueur « quête » sur l\'Expédition du Cœur de Khalni.\\nRetirez trois marqueurs « quête » de l\'Expédition du Cœur de Khalni et sacrifiez-la : Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque jusqu\'à deux cartes de terrain de base, mettez-les sur le champ de bataille engagées, puis mélangez.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597211&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e3fe4a0a-d8d3-49f9-b193-3d4be1d27a4e\', \'multiverseId\': 597211}, \'multiverseid\': 597211}, {\'name\': \'Spedizione al Cuore Khalni\', \'text\': \'Terraferma — Ogniqualvolta una terra entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, puoi mettere un segnalino ricerca sulla Spedizione al Cuore Khalni.\\nRimuovi tre segnalini ricerca dalla Spedizione al Cuore Khalni e sacrificala: Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per trovare fino a due carte terra base, mettile sul campo di battaglia TAPpate, poi rimescola.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597257&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'670c3272-763e-405e-8b47-9fceb4ee72d1\', \'multiverseId\': 597257}, \'multiverseid\': 597257}, {\'name\': \'カルニの心臓の探検\', \'text\': \'上陸 ― 土地１つがあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、あなたはカルニの心臓の探検の上に探索カウンター１個を置いてもよい。\\nカルニの心臓の探検の上から探索カウンター３個を取り除き、これを生け贄に捧げる：あなたのライブラリーから基本土地・カード最大２枚を探し、タップ状態で戦場に出す。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597303&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'58424a11-3286-43ea-a720-018762297c91\', \'multiverseId\': 597303}, \'multiverseid\': 597303}, {\'name\': \'坎尼之心探险\', \'text\': \'地落～每当一个地在你的操控下进战场时，你可以在坎尼之心探险上放置一个探索指示物。\\n从坎尼之心探险上移去三个探索指示物并牺牲它：从你牌库中搜寻至多两张基本地牌，将它们横置放进战场，然后洗牌。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597441&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'949a0ecb-a1f0-4423-b910-c449fde09715\', \'multiverseId\': 597441}, \'multiverseid\': 597441}]', '[{\'name\': \'Expeditionskarte\', \'text\': \'{2}, {T}, opfere die Expeditionskarte: Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Länderkarte, zeige sie offen vor, nimm sie auf deine Hand und mische danach.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich verwende Landkarten, um herauszufinden, wo schon Entdecker waren. Dann gehe ich in die andere Richtung."\\n—Javad Nasrin, Reliktsammler aus Ondu\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596269&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cc51a5ac-8d15-4806-8c06-4cd7652c3719\', \'multiverseId\': 596269}, \'multiverseid\': 596269}, {\'name\': \'Mapa de la expedición\', \'text\': \'{2}, {T}, sacrificar el Mapa de la expedición: Busca en tu biblioteca una carta de tierra, muéstrala, ponla en tu mano y luego baraja.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'"Uso mapas para saber por dónde ya han ido los exploradores. Luego voy para el otro lado".\\n—Javad Nasrin, cazadora de reliquias de Ondu\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596356&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9f6c05ba-130d-4c8e-83d4-2a22c7adbba6\', \'multiverseId\': 596356}, \'multiverseid\': 596356}, {\'name\': "Carte d\'expédition", \'text\': "{2}, {T}, sacrifiez la Carte d\'expédition : Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte de terrain, révélez-la, mettez-la dans votre main, puis mélangez.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "« J\'utilise les cartes pour déterminer où les explorateurs ont déjà été. Ensuite, je prends la direction opposée. »\\n—Javad Nasrin, chasseuse de relique du Ondou", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596443&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3e7ceaa9-e9d4-4110-8329-f52aef1eb591\', \'multiverseId\': 596443}, \'multiverseid\': 596443}, {\'name\': \'Mappa della Spedizione\', \'text\': \'{2}, {T}, Sacrifica la Mappa della Spedizione: Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta terra, rivelala e aggiungila alla tua mano, poi rimescola.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'"Uso le mappe per scoprire dove sono già stati gli esploratori. Poi vado dall\\\'altra parte."\\n—Javad Nasrin, cacciatrice di reliquie di Ondu\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596530&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dac9ee01-d7ea-471b-9cb3-9f3c280e537d\', \'multiverseId\': 596530}, \'multiverseid\': 596530}, {\'name\': \'探検の地図\', \'text\': \'{2},{T},探検の地図を生け贄に捧げる：あなたのライブラリーから土地・カード１枚を探し、公開し、あなたの手札に加える。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'「俺が地図を使うのは、探検家がどこへ行ったかを知るためだ。で、俺は違う方へ行くのさ。」\\n――オンドゥの遺物狩り、ジャヴァド・ナスリン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596617&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8ecf9039-536a-46e0-ad5e-4440f7ae9ab7\', \'multiverseId\': 596617}, \'multiverseid\': 596617}, {\'name\': \'探险地图\', \'text\': \'{2}，{T}，牺牲探险地图：从你牌库中搜寻一张地牌，展示该牌，将它置于你手上，然后洗牌。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'「我使用地图来确认探险家曾到过哪些地方。然后我就走别的路。」\\n～昂度猎宝人贾维纳金\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596878&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'75f2a046-ebde-49de-8035-5bf032a4d45c\', \'multiverseId\': 596878}, \'multiverseid\': 596878}]', '[{\'name\': \'Fackelkurier\', \'text\': \'Eile\\nOpfere den Fackelkurier: Eine andere Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält Eile bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Goblin\', \'flavor\': \'„Entzünde eine Fackel und überbringe diesen Brief", lauteten seine Anweisungen, die er leider verwechselte.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590322&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8456acf1-b259-4adf-a0a2-88cec2f07bd9\', \'multiverseId\': 590322}, \'multiverseid\': 590322}, {\'name\': \'Mensajero de la antorcha\', \'text\': \'Prisa.\\nSacrificar el Mensajero de la antorcha: Otra criatura objetivo gana la habilidad de prisa hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Trasgo\', \'flavor\': \'Sus instrucciones fueron: "Enciende una antorcha y entrega esta carta". Lamentablemente, lo hizo al revés.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590457&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dacac33f-4087-45c1-90bb-fccffa665cde\', \'multiverseId\': 590457}, \'multiverseid\': 590457}, {\'name\': \'Messager porte-torche\', \'text\': "Célérité\\nSacrifiez le Messager porte-torche : Une autre créature ciblée acquiert la célérité jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : gobelin\', \'flavor\': "Il reçut ces instructions : « Allume une torche et livre cette lettre ». Malheureusement, il fit l\'inverse.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590592&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'90a3406a-fa41-4065-92fb-95cf385e0b6e\', \'multiverseId\': 590592}, \'multiverseid\': 590592}, {\'name\': \'Corriere della Torcia\', \'text\': "Rapidità\\nSacrifica il Corriere della Torcia: Un\'altra creatura bersaglio ha rapidità fino alla fine del turno.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Goblin\', \'flavor\': \'Le sue istruzioni erano: "Accendi una torcia e consegna questa lettera". Purtroppo, ha invertito i verbi.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590727&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'44c9b4bd-e23f-4d96-9eb1-6c18ad552bc4\', \'multiverseId\': 590727}, \'multiverseid\': 590727}, {\'name\': \'松明の急使\', \'text\': \'速攻\\n松明の急使を生け贄に捧げる：これでないクリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは速攻を得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ゴブリン\', \'flavor\': \'「松明に火を付けて、この手紙を届けよ。」という指示であったが、残念ながら彼は逆をやってしまった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590862&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0ab4c9f1-4f9c-4993-a5cf-f28e2d16b07f\', \'multiverseId\': 590862}, \'multiverseid\': 590862}, {\'name\': \'火炬讯使\', \'text\': \'敏捷\\n牺牲火炬讯使：另一个目标生物获得敏捷异能直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～鬼怪\', \'flavor\': \'原本给的指示是「点火，送信」，但他弄反了。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591267&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ac0124df-ca80-443a-8a45-93df584372f5\', \'multiverseId\': 591267}, \'multiverseid\': 591267}]', '[{\'name\': \'Fanatischer Hitzkopf\', \'text\': \'Eile\\n{T}, opfere den Fanatischen Hitzkopf: Er fügt einem Ziel deiner Wahl 1 Schadenspunkt zu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Goblin, Pirat\', \'flavor\': \'„Die Tollkühne Koalition ist die Feuerkanone, die wir auf unsere Gegner richten. Und Goblins wie er sind der Funke, der die Lunte entfacht."\\n—Admiralin Beckett Tollkun\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590236&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b1e2af4d-99b6-4279-be87-b451f8e0407e\', \'multiverseId\': 590236}, \'multiverseid\': 590236}, {\'name\': \'Fanático flamígero\', \'text\': \'Prisa.\\n{T}, sacrificar el Fanático flamígero: Hace 1 punto de daño a cualquier objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Pirata trasgo\', \'flavor\': \'"La Coalición Azófar es un cañón ígneo que apunta a nuestros enemigos. Los trasgos como él son la chispa de la pólvora".\\n—Almirante Beckett Azófar\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590371&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'68c3a24f-d03d-4890-9772-2b704ee9370c\', \'multiverseId\': 590371}, \'multiverseid\': 590371}, {\'name\': \'Brandon fanatique\', \'text\': "Célérité\\n{T}, sacrifiez le Brandon fanatique : Il inflige 1 blessure à n\'importe quelle cible.", \'type\': \'Créature : gobelin et pirate\', \'flavor\': \'« La Coalition des hardis est un pyrocanon pointé sur nos ennemis. Les gobelins de son espèce mettent le feu aux poudres. »\\n—Amirale Beckett Hardiesce\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590506&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eea3c3c2-c9ef-4fb7-aa23-b77eae9c6331\', \'multiverseId\': 590506}, \'multiverseid\': 590506}, {\'name\': \'Aizzatore Fanatico\', \'text\': "Rapidità\\n{T}, Sacrifica l\'Aizzatore Fanatico: Infligge 1 danno a un qualsiasi bersaglio.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Pirata Goblin\', \'flavor\': \'"L\\\'Alleanza di Bronzo è una bocca di fuoco puntata sui nostri nemici. I goblin come lui sono la scintilla che ne innesca la miccia."\\n—Ammiraglio Beckett Cuor di Bronzo\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590641&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'91f51be9-f7cc-46c6-8c9e-045f8c5a6680\', \'multiverseId\': 590641}, \'multiverseid\': 590641}, {\'name\': \'狂信的扇動者\', \'text\': \'速攻\\n{T}, 狂信的扇動者を生け贄に捧げる：クリーチャーやプレインズウォーカーやプレイヤーのうち１つを対象とする。これはそれに１点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ゴブリン・海賊\', \'flavor\': \'「鉄面連合は敵に狙いを定めた火炎砲だ。ああいうゴブリンが、その火薬に火を付けるのさ。」\\n――鉄面提督ベケット\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590776&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7bfde9d6-43ae-473c-9956-9b1b070a1abc\', \'multiverseId\': 590776}, \'multiverseid\': 590776}, {\'name\': \'狂热惹事鬼\', \'text\': \'敏捷\\n{T}，牺牲狂热惹事鬼：它对任意一个目标造成1点伤害。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～鬼怪／海盗\', \'flavor\': \'「莽霸联盟是一门瞄准敌人的火炎炮。像他这样的鬼怪就是点燃火药的火花。」\\n～贝克蒂霸司总帅\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591181&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ce5b89fc-1f46-4ec8-9b45-46f06e7c717a\', \'multiverseId\': 591181}, \'multiverseid\': 591181}]', '[{\'name\': \'Feen-Vandale\', \'text\': \'Aufblitzen\\nFliegend\\nImmer wenn du deine zweite Karte innerhalb desselben Zuges ziehst, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf den Feen-Vandalen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Feenwesen, Räuber\', \'flavor\': \'Die Geschichte mag von den Siegern geschrieben werden, aber sie wird häufig von den Störenfrieden umgeschrieben.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595222&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eb6633ef-7c89-43db-a668-f049859658b3\', \'multiverseId\': 595222}, \'multiverseid\': 595222}, {\'name\': \'Vándalo hada\', \'text\': \'Destello.\\nVuela.\\nSiempre que robes tu segunda carta cada turno, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre el Vándalo hada.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bribón hada\', \'flavor\': \'Puede que la historia la escriban los vencedores, pero suelen reescribirla los agitadores.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595330&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3ac394ef-9c79-4589-b79f-f68209faf3d5\', \'multiverseId\': 595330}, \'multiverseid\': 595330}, {\'name\': \'Vandale faerie\', \'text\': \'Flash\\nVol\\nÀ chaque fois que vous piochez votre deuxième carte à chaque tour, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur le Vandale faerie.\', \'type\': \'Créature : peuple fée et gredin\', \'flavor\': "L\'Histoire est peut-être écrite par les vainqueurs, mais elle est souvent réécrite par les fauteurs de troubles.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595438&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a571e711-43b7-434c-858e-22bb65d7e572\', \'multiverseId\': 595438}, \'multiverseid\': 595438}, {\'name\': \'Spiritello Vandalo\', \'text\': \'Lampo\\nVolare\\nOgniqualvolta peschi la tua seconda carta in ogni turno, metti un segnalino +1/+1 sullo Spiritello Vandalo.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Farabutto Spiritello\', \'flavor\': \'La storia sarà scritta dai trionfatori, ma spesso viene riscritta dai seccatori.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595546&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3af0a614-e4dd-4d36-b92e-92fa109a861c\', \'multiverseId\': 595546}, \'multiverseid\': 595546}, {\'name\': \'フェアリーの荒らし屋\', \'text\': \'瞬速\\n飛行\\nあなたが各ターン内のあなたの２枚目のカードを引くたび、フェアリーの荒らし屋の上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — フェアリー・ならず者\', \'flavor\': \'歴史は勝者によって綴られるというが、厄介な者に書き換えられることも多い。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595654&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fcbe6393-a0a5-4532-bf98-36121c0cc206\', \'multiverseId\': 595654}, \'multiverseid\': 595654}, {\'name\': \'莽撞仙灵\', \'text\': \'闪现\\n飞行\\n每当你抓每回合中你的第二张牌时，在莽撞仙灵上放置一个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～仙灵／浪客\', \'flavor\': \'虽然历史由胜利者写就，但却经常会被捣乱者改写。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595978&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4dca7f21-1c4c-4b05-b572-9fba6ed11693\', \'multiverseId\': 595978}, \'multiverseid\': 595978}]', '[{\'name\': \'Feenformation\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\n{3}{U}: Erzeuge einen 1/1 blauen Feenwesen-Kreaturenspielstein mit Flugfähigkeit. Ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Feenwesen\', \'flavor\': \'Die Schar schwebte von Schloss zu Schloss und hinterließ eine Spur aus unglücklicher Liebe, neidischen Gerüchten und fehlenden Erbstücken.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595220&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c640c0a3-1c35-48ba-a8a9-4224096cba43\', \'multiverseId\': 595220}, \'multiverseid\': 595220}, {\'name\': \'Formación de hadas\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\n{3}{U}: Crea una ficha de criatura Hada azul 1/1 con la habilidad de volar. Roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hada\', \'flavor\': \'La multitud revoloteó de un castillo al otro, dejando a su paso un rastro de amores imposibles, rumores ponzoñosos y reliquias familiares desaparecidas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595328&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'de99debe-67ab-4f7a-9fcf-fd98e177de33\', \'multiverseId\': 595328}, \'multiverseid\': 595328}, {\'name\': \'Faeries en formation\', \'text\': \'Vol\\n{3}{U} : Créez un jeton de créature 1/1 bleue Peuple fée avec le vol. Piochez une carte.\', \'type\': \'Créature : peuple fée\', \'flavor\': "L\'essaim papillonnait d\'un château à un autre, laissant dans son sillage des amours maudites, des rumeurs préjudiciables et des héritages volatilisés.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595436&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'51c21fb0-c37c-40ac-83dc-3115eb1f394b\', \'multiverseId\': 595436}, \'multiverseid\': 595436}, {\'name\': \'Formazione di Spiritelli\', \'text\': \'Volare\\n{3}{U}: Crea una pedina creatura Spiritello 1/1 blu con volare. Pesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Spiritello\', \'flavor\': \'Lo stormo svolazzava di castello in castello, lasciandosi dietro una scia di amori sventurati, dicerie ingiuriose e cimeli scomparsi.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595544&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0721c053-2c3e-4ea4-a9be-c5a47ba9e66e\', \'multiverseId\': 595544}, \'multiverseid\': 595544}, {\'name\': \'フェアリーの陣形\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n{3}{U}：飛行を持つ青の１/１のフェアリー・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。カード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — フェアリー\', \'flavor\': \'まとまって城から城へと飛び回り、不運な愛と酷い噂と消えた家宝という痕跡を残してゆく。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595652&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6e6a305f-b330-4fbb-91e9-af97a28df820\', \'multiverseId\': 595652}, \'multiverseid\': 595652}, {\'name\': \'仙灵兵阵\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n{3}{U}：派出一个1/1蓝色，具飞行异能的仙灵衍生生物。抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～仙灵\', \'flavor\': \'这群仙灵流连于城堡之间，所经之处满是不幸爱情、中伤流言和丢失遗宝。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595976&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ed5c4433-1d10-407d-9306-5fd5a4db28ad\', \'multiverseId\': 595976}, \'multiverseid\': 595976}]', '[{\'name\': \'Felidar-Junges\', \'text\': \'Opfere das Felidar-Junge: Zerstöre eine Verzauberung deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Katze, Bestie\', \'flavor\': \'Felidar, die es durchs erste Lebensjahr schaffen, erleben meist noch einhundert weitere Jahre.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591589&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ce065b41-599c-4df7-be93-207facbae1f3\', \'multiverseId\': 591589}, \'multiverseid\': 591589}, {\'name\': \'Cachorro de felidar\', \'text\': \'Sacrificar el Cachorro de felidar: Destruye el encantamiento objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bestia felino\', \'flavor\': \'Los felidares que sobreviven a su primer año de vida pueden llegar fácilmente a centenarios.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591718&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d5ea67da-66f1-42e2-a230-8ce9e9eccc9b\', \'multiverseId\': 591718}, \'multiverseid\': 591718}, {\'name\': \'Jeune félidar\', \'text\': \'Sacrifiez le Jeune félidar : Détruisez un enchantement ciblé.\', \'type\': \'Créature : chat et bête\', \'flavor\': "Les félidars qui survivent à leur première année d\'existence vivent facilement un siècle de plus.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591847&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'42a3258e-4546-4707-9a96-624fb13bad28\', \'multiverseId\': 591847}, \'multiverseid\': 591847}, {\'name\': \'Cucciolo di Felidar\', \'text\': \'Sacrifica il Cucciolo di Felidar: Distruggi un incantesimo bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Bestia Felino\', \'flavor\': \'I felidar che superano il loro primo anno di vita possono facilmente vivere per vederne altri cento.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591976&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1f75405e-5bd0-48d1-8a3e-1491cf797dce\', \'multiverseId\': 591976}, \'multiverseid\': 591976}, {\'name\': \'フェリダーの仔\', \'text\': \'フェリダーの仔を生け贄に捧げる：エンチャント１つを対象とする。それを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 猫・ビースト\', \'flavor\': \'生まれて最初の一年間を生き延びたフェリダーは、その後の百年を難なく過ごす。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592105&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8ce21f3c-f73b-4d3e-89e0-d1d954435770\', \'multiverseId\': 592105}, \'multiverseid\': 592105}, {\'name\': \'晶角幼兽\', \'text\': \'牺牲晶角幼兽：消灭目标结界。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～猫／野兽\', \'flavor\': \'活过周岁的晶角兽可安度百年。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592492&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'db384cb8-9067-4c29-98ac-7dd91b929f99\', \'multiverseId\': 592492}, \'multiverseid\': 592492}]', '[{\'name\': \'Felidar-Zuflucht\', \'text\': \'Landung — Immer wenn ein Land unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, bestimme eines —\\n• Erzeuge einen 2/2 weißen Katze-Bestie-Kreaturenspielstein.\\n• Lege auf jede Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, eine +1/+1-Marke. Die Kreaturen erhalten Wachsamkeit bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591590&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2070e917-0937-4303-a946-b83dfd2aa98e\', \'multiverseId\': 591590}, \'multiverseid\': 591590}, {\'name\': \'Refugio de felidares\', \'text\': \'Aterrizaje — Siempre que una tierra entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, elige uno:\\n• Crea una ficha de criatura Bestia Felino blanca 2/2.\\n• Pon un contador +1/+1 sobre cada criatura que controlas. Esas criaturas ganan la habilidad de vigilancia hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591719&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4483e70a-89c5-4b31-8163-29c5b838e37e\', \'multiverseId\': 591719}, \'multiverseid\': 591719}, {\'name\': \'Refuge félidar\', \'text\': "Toucheterre — À chaque fois qu\'un terrain arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, choisissez l\'un —\\n• Créez un jeton de créature 2/2 blanche Chat et Bête.\\n• Mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur chaque créature que vous contrôlez. Ces créatures acquièrent la vigilance jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591848&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'53352ffc-f96c-4d0e-8f0f-726b99aa7d89\', \'multiverseId\': 591848}, \'multiverseid\': 591848}, {\'name\': \'Rifugio dei Felidar\', \'text\': \'Terraferma — Ogniqualvolta una terra entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, scegli uno —\\n• Crea una pedina creatura Bestia Felino 2/2 bianca.\\n• Metti un segnalino +1/+1 su ogni creatura che controlli. Quelle creature hanno cautela fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591977&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d2f82b9c-4f9b-4cca-bde6-e901c17cbfde\', \'multiverseId\': 591977}, \'multiverseid\': 591977}, {\'name\': \'フェリダーの撤退\', \'text\': \'上陸 ― 土地１つがあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、以下から１つを選ぶ。\\n• 白の２/２の猫・ビースト・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\\n• あなたがコントロールしている各クリーチャーの上に、それぞれ＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。ターン終了時まで、それらのクリーチャーは警戒を得る。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592106&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ba2b9902-67b6-4d93-9240-9b199bb95880\', \'multiverseId\': 592106}, \'multiverseid\': 592106}, {\'name\': \'晶角兽生息所\', \'text\': \'地落～每当一个地在你的操控下进战场时，选择一项～\\n•派出一个2/2白色的猫／野兽衍生生物。\\n•在每个由你操控的生物上各放置一个+1/+1指示物。这些生物获得警戒异能直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592493&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5cc147da-6abb-4fd5-b5bb-e99f9c688863\', \'multiverseId\': 592493}, \'multiverseid\': 592493}]', '[{\'name\': \'Fernglas des Erforschers\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn die ausgerüstete Kreatur angreift, schaue dir die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek an. Falls es eine Länderkarte ist, kannst du sie getappt ins Spiel bringen.\\nAusrüsten {1} ({1}: Lege diese Karte an eine Kreatur deiner Wahl an, die du kontrollierst. Spiele Ausrüsten wie eine Hexerei.)\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Ausrüstung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596270&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'da564af7-541a-4f79-9557-79e372fba3c8\', \'multiverseId\': 596270}, \'multiverseid\': 596270}, {\'name\': \'Telescopio del explorador\', \'text\': \'Siempre que la criatura equipada ataque, mira la primera carta de tu biblioteca. Si es una carta de tierra, puedes ponerla en el campo de batalla girada.\\nEquipar {1}. ({1}: Anexa este Equipo a la criatura objetivo que controlas. Activa la habilidad de equipar como un conjuro.)\', \'type\': \'Artefacto — Equipo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596357&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e0699cb9-0991-4480-b83b-37c11472150a\', \'multiverseId\': 596357}, \'multiverseid\': 596357}, {\'name\': "Longue-vue de l\'explorateur", \'text\': "À chaque fois que la créature équipée attaque, regardez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Si c\'est une carte de terrain, vous pouvez la mettre sur le champ de bataille engagée.\\nÉquipement {1} ({1} : Attachez à une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez. N\'attachez l\'équipement que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.)", \'type\': \'Artefact : équipement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596444&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d3dd3b20-a7c6-4514-900e-ef8474bb971a\', \'multiverseId\': 596444}, \'multiverseid\': 596444}, {\'name\': "Cannocchiale dell\'Esploratore", \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta la creatura equipaggiata attacca, guarda la prima carta del tuo grimorio. Se è una carta terra, puoi metterla sul campo di battaglia TAPpata.\\nEquipaggiare {1} ({1}: Assegna a una creatura bersaglio che controlli. Equipaggia solo come una stregoneria.)\', \'type\': \'Artefatto — Equipaggiamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596531&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e3c1e0e9-05d3-4455-b925-d562d982b425\', \'multiverseId\': 596531}, \'multiverseid\': 596531}, {\'name\': \'探検者の望遠鏡\', \'text\': \'装備しているクリーチャーが攻撃するたび、あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード１枚を見る。それが土地・カードであるなら、あなたはそれをタップ状態で戦場に出してもよい。\\n装備{1}（{1}：あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。これをそれにつける。装備はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。）\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 装備品\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596618&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0ed6becd-bb36-4b2a-8eb4-e8c852356efb\', \'multiverseId\': 596618}, \'multiverseid\': 596618}, {\'name\': \'探险家望远镜\', \'text\': \'每当佩带此武具的生物攻击时，检视你的牌库顶牌。若它是地牌，则你可以将之横置放进战场。\\n佩带{1}（{1}：贴附在目标由你操控的生物上。只能于法术时机佩带。）\', \'type\': \'神器 ～武具\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596879&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2e8be021-5350-4766-a3f2-b834deef0ebb\', \'multiverseId\': 596879}, \'multiverseid\': 596879}]', '[{\'name\': \'Fesseln des Glaubens\', \'text\': \'Verzaubert eine bleibende Karte\\nWenn die Fesseln des Glaubens ins Spiel kommen, erhältst du 4 Lebenspunkte dazu.\\nDie verzauberte bleibende Karte kann nicht angreifen oder blocken, und ihre aktivierten Fähigkeiten können nicht aktiviert werden, es sei denn, es sind Manafähigkeiten.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591587&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'24b6b197-f308-405c-81b5-df90d0f6447d\', \'multiverseId\': 591587}, \'multiverseid\': 591587}, {\'name\': \'Grilletes de fe\', \'text\': \'Encantar permanente.\\nCuando los Grilletes de fe entren al campo de batalla, ganas 4 vidas.\\nEl permanente encantado no puede atacar ni bloquear y no pueden activarse sus habilidades activadas, a menos que sean habilidades de maná.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591716&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5a0fb4e5-434b-4c0a-8bb8-dbc33617ba3d\', \'multiverseId\': 591716}, \'multiverseid\': 591716}, {\'name\': \'Fers de la foi\', \'text\': "Enchanter : permanent\\nQuand les Fers de la foi arrivent sur le champ de bataille, vous gagnez 4 points de vie.\\nLe permanent enchanté ne peut ni attaquer ni bloquer et ses capacités activées ne peuvent pas être activées à moins qu\'elles ne soient des capacités de mana.", \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591845&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ae786491-a05b-4a82-b204-f073ea162950\', \'multiverseId\': 591845}, \'multiverseid\': 591845}, {\'name\': \'Pastoie della Fede\', \'text\': \'Incanta permanente\\nQuando le Pastoie della Fede entrano nel campo di battaglia, guadagni 4 punti vita.\\nIl permanente incantato non può attaccare o bloccare e le sue abilità attivate non possono essere attivate a meno che non siano abilità di mana.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591974&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9df2ff9e-1ba1-4b51-9b4a-256f6769356c\', \'multiverseId\': 591974}, \'multiverseid\': 591974}, {\'name\': \'信仰の足枷\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（パーマネント）\\n信仰の足枷が戦場に出たとき、あなたは４点のライフを得る。\\nエンチャントしているパーマネントでは攻撃もブロックもできず、それの起動型能力はマナ能力でないかぎり起動できない。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592103&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5b26e33a-56cf-4b09-b6a2-837c7a779f29\', \'multiverseId\': 592103}, \'multiverseid\': 592103}, {\'name\': \'信念拘锁\', \'text\': \'结附于永久物\\n当信念拘锁进战场时，你获得4点生命。\\n所结附的永久物不能进行攻击或阻挡，且除了法术力异能之外，其起动式异能也不能起动。\', \'type\': \'结界 ～灵气\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592490&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c6f70c87-2e68-44cf-8d1a-5b6b742d872e\', \'multiverseId\': 592490}, \'multiverseid\': 592490}]', '[{\'name\': \'Festnahme\', \'text\': \'Verzaubert eine Kreatur\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur kann nicht angreifen oder blocken, und ihre aktivierten Fähigkeiten können nicht aktiviert werden.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Erwischt zu werden war schon schlimm genug, aber in die Haftanstalt gerollt zu werden, war bei weitem das Schlimmste.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597081&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'db2510a5-55b5-4810-bdea-3bb1d854186b\', \'multiverseId\': 597081}, \'multiverseid\': 597081}, {\'name\': \'Arresto\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura.\\nLa criatura encantada no puede atacar ni bloquear y no pueden activarse sus habilidades activadas.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Que te pillaran ya era malo de por sí, pero que te mandaran rodando al centro de detención era sin duda lo peor.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597127&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6c955863-185c-4f03-9596-38416d946c20\', \'multiverseId\': 597127}, \'multiverseid\': 597127}, {\'name\': \'Arrestation\', \'text\': \'Enchanter : créature\\nLa créature enchantée ne peut ni attaquer ni bloquer et ses capacités activées ne peuvent pas être activées.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': "Être arrêté était déjà humiliant en soi, mais le pire fut de se faire rouler jusqu\'au centre de détention.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597173&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9123a4b2-2209-4ab3-8fad-cd6da9e8b66a\', \'multiverseId\': 597173}, \'multiverseid\': 597173}, {\'name\': \'Arrestare\', \'text\': \'Incanta creatura\\nLa creatura incantata non può attaccare o bloccare e le sue abilità attivate non possono essere attivate.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Farsi acchiappare è già di per sé una pessima notizia, ma esser fatti rotolare fino al centro di detenzione è di sicuro la parte peggiore.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597219&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'20fd0177-cadb-41cd-9695-01fac3a3eb28\', \'multiverseId\': 597219}, \'multiverseid\': 597219}, {\'name\': \'拘引\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\nエンチャントしているクリーチャーでは攻撃もブロックもできず、それの起動型能力は起動できない。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': \'捕まる時も辛かったが、留置場まで転がされる方がもっと辛かった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597265&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'44a1ddd1-07d9-4741-b6f0-5e678f746747\', \'multiverseId\': 597265}, \'multiverseid\': 597265}, {\'name\': \'逮捕\', \'text\': \'结附于生物\\n所结附的生物不能进行攻击或阻挡，且其起动式异能都不能起动。\', \'type\': \'结界 ～灵气\', \'flavor\': \'被当场抓住已然够糟，而被滚着送去拘留所更是惨上加惨。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597403&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d4815f63-93a8-44ca-b750-4661a67abdd4\', \'multiverseId\': 597403}, \'multiverseid\': 597403}]', '[{\'name\': \'Feuerblitz\', \'text\': \'Der Feuerblitz fügt einem Ziel deiner Wahl 2 Schadenspunkte zu.\\nRückblende {4}{R} (Du kannst diese Karte aus deinem Friedhof für ihre Rückblendekosten wirken. Schicke sie danach ins Exil.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Wo das herkam gibt\\\'s noch mehr!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590240&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'10a59e99-4a94-4310-bbba-695ddc560aef\', \'multiverseId\': 590240}, \'multiverseid\': 590240}, {\'name\': \'Rayo de fuego\', \'text\': \'El Rayo de fuego hace 2 puntos de daño a cualquier objetivo.\\nRetrospectiva {4}{R}. (Puedes lanzar esta carta desde tu cementerio pagando su coste de retrospectiva. Luego exíliala.)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"¡Todavía me quedan más!".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590375&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bcc33594-c590-4b69-9ffc-de9852287200\', \'multiverseId\': 590375}, \'multiverseid\': 590375}, {\'name\': \'Coup de flamme\', \'text\': "Le Coup de flamme inflige 2 blessures à n\'importe quelle cible.\\nFlashback {4}{R} (Vous pouvez lancer cette carte depuis votre cimetière pour son coût de flashback. Exilez-la ensuite.)", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« Et j\'en ai d\'autres en réserve ! »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590510&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8070a653-aa1a-46a0-8723-8716deff2647\', \'multiverseId\': 590510}, \'multiverseid\': 590510}, {\'name\': \'Lampo di Fuoco\', \'text\': \'Il Lampo di Fuoco infligge 2 danni a un qualsiasi bersaglio.\\nFlashback {4}{R} (Puoi lanciare questa carta dal tuo cimitero pagando il suo costo di flashback. Poi esiliala.)\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Ce ne sono altri da dove è arrivato quello!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590645&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a8de64c5-a8d1-4d47-9220-8cf2c13f2ffc\', \'multiverseId\': 590645}, \'multiverseid\': 590645}, {\'name\': \'炎の稲妻\', \'text\': \'クリーチャーやプレインズウォーカーやプレイヤーのうち１つを対象とする。炎の稲妻はそれに２点のダメージを与える。\\nフラッシュバック{4}{R}（あなたはあなたの墓地にあるこのカードをフラッシュバック・コストで唱えてもよい。その後、これを追放する。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「同じ場所にもっとあるぞ！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590780&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'40ef0c26-2f7c-4361-9507-71c2be45474f\', \'multiverseId\': 590780}, \'multiverseid\': 590780}, {\'name\': \'火束\', \'text\': \'火束对任意一个目标造成2点伤害。\\n返照{4}{R}（你可以从你坟墓场中施放此牌，并支付其返照费用，然后将它放逐。）\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「这招我还多着呢！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591185&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e04e94c5-9102-47b4-a5a8-057d76b875f9\', \'multiverseId\': 591185}, \'multiverseid\': 591185}]', '[{\'name\': \'Feuerhammer-Brandstifter\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Der Feuerhammer-Brandstifter fügt einem Ziel deiner Wahl X Schadenspunkte zu, wobei X gleich der Anzahl an bleibenden Karten ist, die du in diesem Zug geopfert hast.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Viashino, Schamane\', \'flavor\': \'Alles von beschädigten Möbeln bis hin zu störenden Leichen wird zu Brennstoff für Ziatoras immer brennende Schmelze.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590290&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eddae964-3cef-402c-9e94-6a41025ca309\', \'multiverseId\': 590290}, \'multiverseid\': 590290}, {\'name\': \'Calcinador de la piromaza\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: El Calcinador de la piromaza hace X puntos de daño a cualquier objetivo, donde X es la cantidad de permanentes que sacrificaste este turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Chamán viashino\', \'flavor\': \'Desde muebles con daños hasta cadáveres que hay que eliminar: todo sirve de combustible para la fundición que nunca se apaga de Ziatora.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590425&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'47cb8bdd-ccec-4cb5-84f1-5e371104a603\', \'multiverseId\': 590425}, \'multiverseid\': 590425}, {\'name\': \'Incendiaire à la masse-bûcher\', \'text\': "{1}, {T} : L\'Incendiaire à la masse-bûcher inflige X blessures à n\'importe quelle cible, X étant le nombre de permanents que vous avez sacrifiés ce tour-ci.", \'type\': \'Créature : viashino et shamane\', \'flavor\': \'Des meubles abîmés aux cadavres gênants, tout peut servir de carburant à la fonderie de Ziatora en perpétuelle activité.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590560&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'61543098-9641-4e8c-b50e-e07d787649e1\', \'multiverseId\': 590560}, \'multiverseid\': 590560}, {\'name\': \'Piromane del Maglio Infuocato\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Il Piromane del Maglio Infuocato infligge X danni a un qualsiasi bersaglio, dove X è il numero di permanenti che hai sacrificato in questo turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Sciamano Viashino\', \'flavor\': \'Tutto, dai mobili danneggiati ai cadaveri scomodi, diventa carburante per la fonderia sempre accesa di Ziatora.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590695&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3147d4a4-c68b-496b-a03e-8b19a9487b0c\', \'multiverseId\': 590695}, \'multiverseid\': 590695}, {\'name\': \'大火槌の放火魔\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}：クリーチャーやプレインズウォーカーやプレイヤーのうち１つを対象とする。大火槌の放火魔はそれにＸ点のダメージを与える。Ｘはこのターンにあなたが生け贄に捧げたパーマネントの数に等しい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ヴィーアシーノ・シャーマン\', \'flavor\': \'傷んだ家具から不都合な死体までなんでも、火の絶えないジアトラの鋳造所の燃料になる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590830&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b1b8d0cf-ed2f-4879-83c1-74e92723c188\', \'multiverseId\': 590830}, \'multiverseid\': 590830}, {\'name\': \'葬火锤纵燃师\', \'text\': \'{1}，{T}：葬火锤纵燃师对任意一个目标造成X点伤害，X为你本回合中已牺牲的永久物数量。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～凡尔西诺／祭师\', \'flavor\': \'从损坏的家具到不该出现的尸体，一切都会成为齐朵拉不熄锻炉之燃料。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591235&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'34a9832f-59cd-4178-8db2-58991f3aa3d1\', \'multiverseId\': 591235}, \'multiverseid\': 591235}]', "[{'name': 'Feuerkanonen-Salve', 'text': 'Die Feuerkanonen-Salve fügt einer Kreatur deiner Wahl 3 Schadenspunkte zu.\\nÜberfall — Die Feuerkanonen-Salve fügt stattdessen 6 Schadenspunkte zu, falls du in diesem Zug angegriffen hast.', 'type': 'Hexerei', 'flavor': 'Ihre Furchtlosigkeit gepaart mit ihrer geringen Größe macht Goblins zu idealen Kanonieren.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590241&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '98c51b6f-1986-4f15-bdec-b311e2b2d69d', 'multiverseId': 590241}, 'multiverseid': 590241}, {'name': 'Disparo de cañón ígneo', 'text': 'El Disparo de cañón ígneo hace 3 puntos de daño a la criatura objetivo.\\nIncursión — Si atacaste este turno, en vez de eso, el Disparo de cañón ígneo hace 6 puntos de daño.', 'type': 'Conjuro', 'flavor': 'El arrojo de los trasgos y su pequeño tamaño hace que sean los artilleros perfectos.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590376&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5c12871b-d92e-41c1-9c84-c9f53217752c', 'multiverseId': 590376}, 'multiverseid': 590376}, {'name': 'Salve de pyrocanon', 'text': 'La Salve de pyrocanon inflige 3 blessures à une créature ciblée.\\nSaccage — La Salve de pyrocanon inflige 6 blessures à la place si vous avez attaqué ce tour-ci.', 'type': 'Rituel', 'flavor': 'La petite taille et le caractère intrépide des gobelins en font de parfaits canonniers.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590511&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3d6189a7-2bc1-460c-a4d1-7f3b084f8cc8', 'multiverseId': 590511}, 'multiverseid': 590511}, {'name': 'Salva delle Bocche di Fuoco', 'text': 'La Salva delle Bocche di Fuoco infligge 3 danni a una creatura bersaglio.\\nIncursione — La Salva delle Bocche di Fuoco infligge invece 6 danni se hai attaccato in questo turno.', 'type': 'Stregoneria', 'flavor': 'La temerarietà e le dimensioni ridotte dei goblin ne fanno cannonieri provetti.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590646&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2115edf6-6851-4d58-8c42-bca7af78d427', 'multiverseId': 590646}, 'multiverseid': 590646}, {'name': '火炎砲発射', 'text': 'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。火炎砲発射はそれに３点のダメージを与える。\\n強襲 ― このターンにあなたが攻撃していたなら、代わりに、火炎砲発射は６点のダメージを与える。', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': 'ゴブリンは恐れを知らず小柄である。砲手には最適だ。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590781&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd769f53f-8b4d-44fd-93a6-bf1adb63ac04', 'multiverseId': 590781}, 'multiverseid': 590781}, {'name': '火炎炮轰击', 'text': '火炎炮轰击对目标生物造成3点伤害。\\n突击～如果你本回合中攻击过，则改为火炎炮轰击造成6点伤害。', 'type': '法术', 'flavor': '鬼怪无所畏惧、身材矮小，是炮手的最佳人选。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591186&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8c9d0c2d-bf31-4271-a188-682ec81cafa8', 'multiverseId': 591186}, 'multiverseid': 591186}]", '[{\'name\': \'Feuerschleuderer\', \'text\': \'{T}: Der Feuerschleuderer fügt einem Ziel deiner Wahl 1 Schadenspunkt und dir 1 Schadenspunkt zu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': \'Die erfolgreichsten Unterhaltungskünstler in Neu-Capenna bringen ein Element mittlerer bis extremer Gefahr in ihre Auftritte ein.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597537&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e335959b-7140-4d21-ba2d-d7266c02c32a\', \'multiverseId\': 597537}, \'multiverseid\': 597537}, {\'name\': \'Mago del fuego\', \'text\': \'{T}: El Mago del fuego hace 1 punto de daño a cualquier objetivo y te hace 1 punto de daño.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero humano\', \'flavor\': \'Los artistas con más éxito de Nueva Capenna siempre incluyen en sus actuaciones un número que va de peligroso a peligrosísimo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597562&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'367d3fe5-f717-4811-abe9-276b9295848a\', \'multiverseId\': 597562}, \'multiverseid\': 597562}, {\'name\': \'Pyrofrondeur\', \'text\': "{T} : Le Pyrofrondeur inflige 1 blessure à n\'importe quelle cible et vous inflige 1 blessure.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et sorcier\', \'flavor\': \'Les amuseurs les plus en vogue sur la Nouvelle-Capenna incluent un élément de danger plus ou moins extrême dans leurs numéros.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597587&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f1159aa7-dd1d-4431-b6f4-7535c5ab8891\', \'multiverseId\': 597587}, \'multiverseid\': 597587}, {\'name\': \'Sputafuoco\', \'text\': \'{T}: Lo Sputafuoco infligge 1 danno a un qualsiasi bersaglio e 1 danno a te.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Mago Umano\', \'flavor\': \'Gli artisti più popolari di Nuova Capenna includono sempre un livello di rischio da medio a estremo nei loro spettacoli.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597612&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b731cf64-5cb1-4d93-a3f2-258fe3f38fd8\', \'multiverseId\': 597612}, \'multiverseid\': 597612}, {\'name\': \'投火師\', \'text\': \'{T}：クリーチャーやプレインズウォーカーやプレイヤーのうち１つを対象とする。投火師はそれに１点、あなたに１点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': \'ニューカペナで最も成功している大道芸人は、中級から上級までの危険要素を演技に加えている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597637&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9baf4956-a117-40df-81da-7258ed1ccc94\', \'multiverseId\': 597637}, \'multiverseid\': 597637}, {\'name\': \'掷焰手\', \'text\': \'{T}：掷焰手对任意一个目标造成1点伤害，且对你造成1点伤害。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／法术师\', \'flavor\': \'新卡佩纳最成功的演员，其表演都带有中度到极端的危险元素。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597712&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ae03867f-3e7c-468d-8f94-bfd5e2624c4b\', \'multiverseId\': 597712}, \'multiverseid\': 597712}]', '[{\'name\': \'Feurige Intervention\', \'text\': \'Bestimme eines —\\n• Die Feurige Intervention fügt einer Kreatur deiner Wahl 5 Schadenspunkte zu.\\n• Zerstöre ein Artefakt deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Etwas zu verbrennen, ist ganz einfach. Das richtige Ziel zu treffen, ist da schon schwerer.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590239&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7e48c072-4266-4784-9bc9-c65acb62fd67\', \'multiverseId\': 590239}, \'multiverseid\': 590239}, {\'name\': \'Intervención ardorosa\', \'text\': \'Elige uno:\\n• La Intervención ardorosa hace 5 puntos de daño a la criatura objetivo.\\n• Destruye el artefacto objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Quemar algo es fácil, lo difícil es elegir el objetivo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590374&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e5fac043-a073-4cec-aafc-99e599eb36c6\', \'multiverseId\': 590374}, \'multiverseid\': 590374}, {\'name\': \'Intervention ardente\', \'text\': "Choisissez l\'un —\\n• L\'Intervention ardente inflige 5 blessures à une créature ciblée.\\n• Détruisez un artefact ciblé.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Brûler quelque chose n\'est pas difficile. Choisir une cible l\'est beaucoup plus.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590509&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'423109b2-2e0d-42ed-94a4-7a73a9a8f971\', \'multiverseId\': 590509}, \'multiverseid\': 590509}, {\'name\': \'Intervento Fiammante\', \'text\': "Scegli uno —\\n• L\'Intervento Fiammante infligge 5 danni a una creatura bersaglio.\\n• Distruggi un artefatto bersaglio.", \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'Bruciare qualcosa è facile. Scegliere un bersaglio può essere molto più difficile.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590644&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8a1473ac-2d55-412f-83c2-890cc0db4673\', \'multiverseId\': 590644}, \'multiverseid\': 590644}, {\'name\': \'焦熱の介入\', \'text\': \'以下から１つを選ぶ。\\n・クリーチャー１体を対象とする。焦熱の介入はそれに５点のダメージを与える。\\n・アーティファクト１つを対象とする。それを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'燃やすこと自体は簡単だ。対象を選ぶことの方が難しい場合もある。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590779&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'99175e71-db5d-4ab6-ae97-77da9a44bfa7\', \'multiverseId\': 590779}, \'multiverseid\': 590779}, {\'name\': \'火热干预\', \'text\': \'选择一项～\\n•火热干预对目标生物造成5点伤害。\\n•消灭目标神器。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'烧东西不难；烧得准才难。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591184&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eb72e123-5335-4d1c-9815-095d66017720\', \'multiverseId\': 591184}, \'multiverseid\': 591184}]', '[{\'name\': \'Feuriges Ende\', \'text\': \'Opfere eine Kreatur als zusätzliche Kosten, um diesen Zauberspruch zu wirken.\\nFeuriges Ende fügt einer Kreatur deiner Wahl 5 Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590238&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dc036835-f9da-456f-9953-04d4a0718a42\', \'multiverseId\': 590238}, \'multiverseid\': 590238}, {\'name\': \'Conclusión ardiente\', \'text\': \'Como coste adicional para lanzar este hechizo, sacrifica una criatura.\\nLa Conclusión ardiente hace 5 puntos de daño a la criatura objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590373&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'12d6e595-729e-424b-be0c-0cff647ad21a\', \'multiverseId\': 590373}, \'multiverseid\': 590373}, {\'name\': \'Conclusion ardente\', \'text\': \'En tant que coût supplémentaire pour lancer ce sort, sacrifiez une créature.\\nLa Conclusion ardente inflige 5 blessures à une créature ciblée.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590508&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5447e57d-bb32-44aa-82aa-3228c1c74b64\', \'multiverseId\': 590508}, \'multiverseid\': 590508}, {\'name\': \'Esito Ardente\', \'text\': "Come costo addizionale per lanciare questa magia, sacrifica una creatura.\\nL\'Esito Ardente infligge 5 danni a una creatura bersaglio.", \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590643&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cec03614-3f7f-4c76-a2d4-55f9e5e79f62\', \'multiverseId\': 590643}, \'multiverseid\': 590643}, {\'name\': \'焦熱の結末\', \'text\': \'この呪文を唱えるための追加コストとして、クリーチャー１体を生け贄に捧げる。\\nクリーチャー１体を対象とする。焦熱の結末はそれに５点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590778&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a3b90404-90b4-436d-8322-7aabb2046776\', \'multiverseId\': 590778}, \'multiverseid\': 590778}, {\'name\': \'暴烈终局\', \'text\': \'牺牲一个生物，以作为施放此咒语的额外费用。\\n暴烈终局对目标生物造成5点伤害。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591183&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'55590998-73ae-4a6e-bcff-8f4321480d22\', \'multiverseId\': 591183}, \'multiverseid\': 591183}]', '[{\'name\': \'Flammen des Hitzkopfs\', \'text\': \'Die Flammen des Hitzkopfs fügen 3 Schadenspunkte zu, deren Aufteilung auf ein, zwei oder drei Ziele deiner Wahl du bestimmst.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Du hast Glück. Ich kann ein paar abgeben."\\n—Chandra Nalaar\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590243&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'29f76f73-8af3-40ea-a0ec-fa07eced9f61\', \'multiverseId\': 590243}, \'multiverseid\': 590243}, {\'name\': \'Llamas de la instigadora\', \'text\': \'Las Llamas de la instigadora hacen 3 puntos de daño divididos como elijas entre uno, dos o tres objetivos.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Tienes suerte. Traigo suficiente como para compartir".\\n—Chandra Nalaar\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590378&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9683c09a-b0c8-4e33-b208-60ce9637ffe8\', \'multiverseId\': 590378}, \'multiverseid\': 590378}, {\'name\': \'Flammes du brandon\', \'text\': \'Les Flammes du brandon infligent 3 blessures réparties comme vous le désirez entre une, deux ou trois cibles.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'« Vous avez de la chance. Je suis partageuse. »\\n—Chandra Nalaàr\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590513&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5c030290-cf40-4f74-998b-42a696cc63fe\', \'multiverseId\': 590513}, \'multiverseid\': 590513}, {\'name\': \'Fiamme del Tizzone Ardente\', \'text\': \'Le Fiamme del Tizzone Ardente infliggono 3 danni divisi a tua scelta tra uno, due o tre bersagli.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Sei fortunato. Ne ho portato abbastanza da condividere."\\n—Chandra Nalaar\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590648&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'154d7df0-4c27-443c-bc4b-a71ce7a41e0b\', \'multiverseId\': 590648}, \'multiverseid\': 590648}, {\'name\': \'炬火の炎\', \'text\': \'クリーチャーやプレインズウォーカーやプレイヤーのうち１つか２つか３つを対象とし、３点分をあなたの望むように割り振る。炬火の炎はそれらにその割り振った点数のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「あんたは幸せよ。私のものを分けてあげる。」\\n――チャンドラ・ナラー\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590783&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3e2ab259-d865-4833-8719-9588b6a9583e\', \'multiverseId\': 590783}, \'multiverseid\': 590783}, {\'name\': \'惹事人烈焰\', \'text\': \'惹事人烈焰对任意一个，两个或三个目标造成共3点伤害，你可以任意分配。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「你走好运啦。我带来的够大家享用。」\\n～茜卓纳拉\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591188&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cfa323eb-6556-4b39-906d-73ef1c344de5\', \'multiverseId\': 591188}, \'multiverseid\': 591188}]', '[{\'name\': \'Flammenkegel\', \'text\': \'Der Flammenkegel fügt einem Ziel deiner Wahl 1 Schadenspunkt, einem anderen Ziel deiner Wahl 2 Schadenspunkte und einem dritten Ziel deiner Wahl 3 Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590225&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bd77c425-9b78-484e-8fd8-6c1cdbd5c40e\', \'multiverseId\': 590225}, \'multiverseid\': 590225}, {\'name\': \'Cono de llamas\', \'text\': \'El Cono de llamas hace 1 punto de daño a cualquier objetivo, 2 puntos de daño a otro objetivo y 3 puntos de daño a un tercer objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590360&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'104dd320-4d63-4f50-805e-9e93608faf7e\', \'multiverseId\': 590360}, \'multiverseid\': 590360}, {\'name\': \'Cône de flammes\', \'text\': "Le Cône de flammes inflige 1 blessure à n\'importe quelle cible, 2 blessures à une autre cible, et 3 blessures à une troisième cible.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590495&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d264db3f-4124-469d-a59d-882350b61812\', \'multiverseId\': 590495}, \'multiverseid\': 590495}, {\'name\': \'Cono di Fiamme\', \'text\': \'Il Cono di Fiamme infligge 1 danno a un qualsiasi bersaglio, 2 danni a un altro bersaglio e 3 danni a un terzo bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590630&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'887170d5-db93-4938-b8de-a5ad68e6df6d\', \'multiverseId\': 590630}, \'multiverseid\': 590630}, {\'name\': \'火炎放射\', \'text\': \'クリーチャーやプレインズウォーカーやプレイヤーのうち１つと、それでない１つと、それらでない１つを対象とする。火炎放射はその第一者に１点、第二者に２点、第三者に３点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590765&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'79634042-b55a-4b3f-8e1a-aa96c23807d3\', \'multiverseId\': 590765}, \'multiverseid\': 590765}, {\'name\': \'火炎锥\', \'text\': \'火炎锥对任意一个目标造成1点伤害，对另一个目标造成2点伤害，对第三个目标造成3点伤害。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591170&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3987d9fb-8153-47c0-b175-299be72c6b8f\', \'multiverseId\': 591170}, \'multiverseid\': 591170}]', '[{\'name\': \'Flammenklingen-Adept\', \'text\': \'Bedrohlich (Diese Kreatur kann nicht geblockt werden, außer von zwei oder mehr Kreaturen.)\\nImmer wenn du eine Karte umwandelst oder abwirfst, erhält der Flammenklingen-Adept +1/+0 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Schakal, Krieger\', \'flavor\': \'Die Zeit der Ausbildung war vorbei. Nur noch eine letzte Prüfung stand zwischen Amin und seinem Platz unter den geehrten Toten.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597538&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0cbad6f9-9cbb-47ee-b1f3-e7fc6f8a5a1c\', \'multiverseId\': 597538}, \'multiverseid\': 597538}, {\'name\': \'Experto filollama\', \'text\': \'Amenaza. (Esta criatura no puede ser bloqueada excepto por dos o más criaturas.)\\nSiempre que actives una habilidad de ciclo o descartes una carta, el Experto filollama obtiene +1/+0 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero chacal\', \'flavor\': \'El periodo de entrenamiento había terminado. En ese momento, Amin debía superar una última prueba para ocupar su lugar entre los muertos venerados.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597563&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2599b2c1-8d92-40df-85ad-a53e71108f60\', \'multiverseId\': 597563}, \'multiverseid\': 597563}, {\'name\': \'Expert lamefeu\', \'text\': "Menace (Cette créature ne peut pas être bloquée excepté par deux créatures ou plus.)\\nÀ chaque fois que vous recyclez ou vous défaussez d\'une carte, l\'Expert lamefeu gagne +1/+0 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : chacal et guerrier\', \'flavor\': "L\'heure n\'était plus à l\'entraînement. Une dernière épreuve séparait encore Amin de sa place parmi les morts honorés.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597588&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'908bf9d2-ef1c-4de1-82d3-e7bf40f77d3c\', \'multiverseId\': 597588}, \'multiverseid\': 597588}, {\'name\': \'Esperto della Lama Infuocata\', \'text\': "Minacciare (Questa creatura non può essere bloccata tranne che da due o più creature.)\\nOgniqualvolta cicli o scarti una carta, l\'Esperto della Lama Infuocata prende +1/+0 fino alla fine del turno.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Sciacallo\', \'flavor\': "Il tempo dell\'addestramento era terminato. Solo l\'ordalia finale separava Amin dal suo posto tra i morti riveriti.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597613&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'196d8f42-5f96-41ff-899e-725dd794d7f6\', \'multiverseId\': 597613}, \'multiverseid\': 597613}, {\'name\': \'炎刃の達人\', \'text\': \'威迫（このクリーチャーは２体以上のクリーチャーにしかブロックされない。）\\nあなたがカード１枚をサイクリングするか捨てるたび、ターン終了時まで、炎刃の達人は＋１/＋０の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ジャッカル・戦士\', \'flavor\': \'訓練は終わった。名誉ある死者の一員になるための最後の試練がエイミンの前に立ちはだかる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597638&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'492133fc-dd8f-4237-96d9-9e16942750fd\', \'multiverseId\': 597638}, \'multiverseid\': 597638}, {\'name\': \'焰刃专家\', \'text\': \'威慑（此生物只能被两个或更多生物阻挡。）\\n每当你循环或弃一张牌时，焰刃专家得+1/+0直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～豺狼／战士\', \'flavor\': \'训练都已经完成。阿明只需通过最后一个祀炼就能光荣赴死。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597713&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5906fc86-3ab4-4888-a96f-cc50f1944cbb\', \'multiverseId\': 597713}, \'multiverseid\': 597713}]', '[{\'name\': \'Flammenpeitsche\', \'text\': \'Die Flammenpeitsche fügt einem Ziel deiner Wahl 4 Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich werde gerade erst warm."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590242&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2ea7dead-a84d-4aa2-a870-2656815cc473\', \'multiverseId\': 590242}, \'multiverseid\': 590242}, {\'name\': \'Latigazo ardiente\', \'text\': \'El Latigazo ardiente hace 4 puntos de daño a cualquier objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Únicamente estoy calentando".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590377&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0b5483b1-cdd6-45d2-ab51-715638200461\', \'multiverseId\': 590377}, \'multiverseid\': 590377}, {\'name\': \'Fouet de flamme\', \'text\': "Le Fouet de flamme inflige 4 blessures à n\'importe quelle cible.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« C\'est juste un échauffement. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590512&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'808111d0-62a3-4b93-b7d5-a14e7ed77386\', \'multiverseId\': 590512}, \'multiverseid\': 590512}, {\'name\': \'Sferzata di Fiamma\', \'text\': \'La Sferzata di Fiamma infligge 4 danni a un qualsiasi bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Mi sto appena scaldando."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590647&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'85b757c7-9ab2-4e3e-bdc9-3dfacd203469\', \'multiverseId\': 590647}, \'multiverseid\': 590647}, {\'name\': \'炎の鞭打ち\', \'text\': \'クリーチャーやプレインズウォーカーやプレイヤーのうち１つを対象とする。炎の鞭打ちはそれに４点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「単なるウォーミングアップに過ぎないわ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590782&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5633132f-4687-4679-ba18-2e8f90168686\', \'multiverseId\': 590782}, \'multiverseid\': 590782}, {\'name\': \'炎鞭飞舞\', \'text\': \'炎鞭飞舞对任意一个目标造成4点伤害。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「这只是热身而已。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591187&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'994c59be-2230-48f4-85eb-36f5c03726eb\', \'multiverseId\': 591187}, \'multiverseid\': 591187}]', '[{\'name\': \'Flammensäule\', \'text\': \'Die Flammensäule fügt einem Ziel deiner Wahl 2 Schadenspunkte zu. Falls eine Kreatur, der auf diese Weise Schaden zugefügt wurde, in diesem Zug sterben würde, schicke sie stattdessen ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Mögen die Würdigen eine Ewigkeit im Heiligen Schlaf verbringen. Mögen die Bösen Frieden in der Vernichtung finden."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590287&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'38c658c2-5350-43e0-9c52-1833a63b8572\', \'multiverseId\': 590287}, \'multiverseid\': 590287}, {\'name\': \'Pilar de llamas\', \'text\': \'El Pilar de llamas hace 2 puntos de daño a cualquier objetivo. Si una criatura que recibió daño de esta manera fuera a morir este turno, en vez de eso, exíliala.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Que los dignos pasen la eternidad en el Sueño Bendito. Que los malvados encuentren la paz del olvido".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590422&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'93859644-d538-4d03-b41e-7af650cc87c6\', \'multiverseId\': 590422}, \'multiverseid\': 590422}, {\'name\': \'Pilier de flammes\', \'text\': "Le Pilier de flammes inflige 2 blessures à n\'importe quelle cible. Si une créature ayant subi des blessures de cette manière devait mourir ce tour-ci, exilez-la à la place.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« Puissent les justes passer l\'éternité dans le Sommeil béni. Puissent les âmes corrompues trouver la paix dans l\'anéantissement. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590557&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5ca92396-c6fd-4971-9e49-eff4534ee163\', \'multiverseId\': 590557}, \'multiverseid\': 590557}, {\'name\': \'Pilastro di Fiamme\', \'text\': \'Il Pilastro di Fiamme infligge 2 danni a un qualsiasi bersaglio. Se una creatura a cui è stato inflitto danno in questo modo sta per morire in questo turno, invece esiliala.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Possano i valorosi riposare in eterno nel Sonno Benedetto. Possano i malvagi conoscere la pace dell\\\'oblio."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590692&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'79fec7da-d50f-4bbf-921e-84b3cdb03066\', \'multiverseId\': 590692}, \'multiverseid\': 590692}, {\'name\': \'火柱\', \'text\': \'クリーチャーやプレインズウォーカーやプレイヤーのうち１つを対象とする。火柱はそれに２点のダメージを与える。このターン、これによりダメージを受けたクリーチャーが死亡するなら、代わりにそれを追放する。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「価値ある者が祝福された眠りのうちに永遠を過ごさんことを。邪な者が忘却という平和を見出さんことを。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590827&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b65bacf2-ff53-4a86-b21b-1c20b9d086a6\', \'multiverseId\': 590827}, \'multiverseid\': 590827}, {\'name\': \'火焰柱\', \'text\': \'火焰柱对任意一个目标造成2点伤害。如果本回合中曾以此法受到伤害的生物将死去，则改为将它放逐。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「愿善人在受福安眠中得享永恒。愿恶人在湮没遗忘中获得安息。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591232&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'75fc0610-4795-487f-81f6-28c4dd8629ff\', \'multiverseId\': 591232}, \'multiverseid\': 591232}]', '[{\'name\': \'Flinker Tritt\', \'text\': \'Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst, erhält +1/+0 bis zum Ende des Zuges. Sie kämpft gegen eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du nicht kontrollierst. (Jede fügt der anderen Schadenspunkte in Höhe ihrer Stärke zu.)\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Shintan spürte die Bosheit in seinem Gegner, doch er schlug nicht zu, bis er sah, wie der Ork seine Muskeln für den Angriff anspannte.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590320&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4a9fad47-8b47-4cb8-be92-b86fae3d731b\', \'multiverseId\': 590320}, \'multiverseid\': 590320}, {\'name\': \'Patada repentina\', \'text\': \'La criatura objetivo que controlas obtiene +1/+0 hasta el final del turno. Esa criatura lucha contra la criatura objetivo que no controlas. (Cada una hace un daño igual a su fuerza a la otra.)\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Shintan presintió la malicia en su oponente, pero no atacó hasta que los músculos del orco se tensaron para prepararse a lanzar el primer puñetazo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590455&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'592b2c33-f1b0-4867-a5d9-3965d5cce24a\', \'multiverseId\': 590455}, \'multiverseid\': 590455}, {\'name\': \'Coup de pied imparable\', \'text\': "Une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez gagne +1/+0 jusqu\'à la fin du tour. Elle se bat contre une créature ciblée que vous ne contrôlez pas. (Chacune inflige un nombre de blessures égal à sa force à l\'autre.)", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "Shintan perçut la malveillance émanant de son adversaire, mais ne le frappa qu\'à l\'instant où il vit les muscles de l\'orque se contracter pour porter le premier coup.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590590&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'06be28b3-4ab3-40c6-a657-5a81a559c0e7\', \'multiverseId\': 590590}, \'multiverseid\': 590590}, {\'name\': \'Calcio Repentino\', \'text\': "Una creatura bersaglio che controlli prende +1/+0 fino alla fine del turno. Lotta con una creatura bersaglio che non controlli. (Ogni creatura infligge all\'altra danno pari alla propria forza.)", \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': "Shintan percepì l\'odio nel suo avversario, ma non colpì finché i muscoli dell\'orco non si tesero per preparare il primo pugno.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590725&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7985a41a-480e-4377-8d37-bee2aa8281cc\', \'multiverseId\': 590725}, \'multiverseid\': 590725}, {\'name\': \'素早い蹴り\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体と、あなたがコントロールしていないクリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、その前者は＋１/＋０の修整を受ける。その前者はその後者と格闘を行う。（それぞれはもう一方に自身のパワーに等しい点数のダメージを与える。）\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'シンタンは対戦相手のオークから発する邪気に気付いていたが、相手が先制のパンチを放つべくその筋肉が張り詰めるまで攻撃をするのは控えた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590860&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'81fd9183-39e6-472d-a9de-6b6cc44b02e6\', \'multiverseId\': 590860}, \'multiverseid\': 590860}, {\'name\': \'旋风腿\', \'text\': \'目标由你操控的生物得+1/+0直到回合结束。它与目标不由你操控的生物互斗。（它们各向对方造成等同于本身力量的伤害。）\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'辛坦感觉到了对手的恶意，但直到这个半兽人肌肉紧绷准备挥出第一拳时，他才发动了攻击。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591265&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4a237e26-2416-4762-8955-dc3c7a07f6f5\', \'multiverseId\': 591265}, \'multiverseid\': 591265}]', '[{\'name\': \'Flugmodifikation\', \'text\': \'Verzaubert eine Kreatur oder ein Fahrzeug\\nSolange die verzauberte bleibende Karte ein Fahrzeug ist, ist sie zusätzlich zu ihren anderen Typen eine Kreatur.\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur erhält +2/+2 und hat Flugfähigkeit.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591545&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'521aa623-d309-4eee-be82-7c06083f1dd2\', \'multiverseId\': 591545}, \'multiverseid\': 591545}, {\'name\': \'Modificación aérea\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura o Vehículo.\\nMientras el permanente encantado sea un Vehículo, es una criatura además de sus otros tipos.\\nLa criatura encantada obtiene +2/+2 y tiene la habilidad de volar.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591674&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e1682bbb-dd3b-4de5-a1de-729d5ed1495a\', \'multiverseId\': 591674}, \'multiverseid\': 591674}, {\'name\': \'Modification aérienne\', \'text\': "Enchanter : créature ou véhicule\\nTant que le permanent enchanté est un véhicule, c\'est une créature en plus de ses autres types.\\nLa créature enchantée gagne +2/+2 et a le vol.", \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591803&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bb66d388-2e52-4779-a238-891f6fa2b3c5\', \'multiverseId\': 591803}, \'multiverseid\': 591803}, {\'name\': \'Modifica Aerea\', \'text\': \'Incanta creatura o Veicolo\\nFintanto che il permanente incantato è un Veicolo, è una creatura in aggiunta ai suoi altri tipi.\\nLa creatura incantata prende +2/+2 e ha volare.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591932&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e4ef84d1-2f83-42d5-ad5c-0198d84ddb05\', \'multiverseId\': 591932}, \'multiverseid\': 591932}, {\'name\': \'浮遊化改造\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（クリーチャーや機体）\\nエンチャントしているパーマネントが機体であるかぎり、それは他のタイプに加えてクリーチャーでもある。\\nエンチャントしているクリーチャーは、＋２/＋２の修整を受け飛行を持つ。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592061&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'48765895-1a34-4701-a5c0-7864922fb578\', \'multiverseId\': 592061}, \'multiverseid\': 592061}, {\'name\': \'翔空改装\', \'text\': \'结附于生物或载具\\n只要所结附的永久物是载具，它便额外具有生物此类别。\\n所结附的生物得+2/+2且具有飞行异能。\', \'type\': \'结界 ～灵气\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592448&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7a85a8b9-2639-404e-9631-6fe91dfdacd7\', \'multiverseId\': 592448}, \'multiverseid\': 592448}]', '[{\'name\': \'Flussschleicherin\', \'text\': \'Die Flussschleicherin kann nicht geblockt werden.\\nImmer wenn ein anderes Meervolk unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, erhält die Flussschleicherin +1/+1 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Meervolk, Krieger\', \'flavor\': \'Weder Wellen noch Luftblasen warnen dich vor ihr.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595265&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'93f0c473-da0a-458e-b755-6a71d8325fe2\', \'multiverseId\': 595265}, \'multiverseid\': 595265}, {\'name\': \'Escurridiza ribereña\', \'text\': \'La Escurridiza ribereña no puede ser bloqueada.\\nSiempre que otro Tritón entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, la Escurridiza ribereña obtiene +1/+1 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero tritón\', \'flavor\': \'Sin burbujas, sin salpicaduras..., sin aviso.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595373&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7fda1fa9-adda-47dd-a048-4cdc9ec34e1b\', \'multiverseId\': 595373}, \'multiverseid\': 595373}, {\'name\': \'Rôdeuse du fleuve\', \'text\': "La Rôdeuse du fleuve ne peut pas être bloquée.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'un autre ondin arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, la Rôdeuse du fleuve gagne +1/+1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : ondin et guerrier\', \'flavor\': \'Aucun bruit, aucune éclaboussure, aucun avertissement.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595481&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b9d51095-0caa-47d6-aefe-5627dc025965\', \'multiverseId\': 595481}, \'multiverseid\': 595481}, {\'name\': \'Furtiva del Fiume\', \'text\': \'La Furtiva del Fiume non può essere bloccata.\\nOgniqualvolta un altro Tritone entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, la Furtiva del Fiume prende +1/+1 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Tritone\', \'flavor\': \'Né increspature, né spruzzi, né avvertimenti.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595589&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1d56f576-753e-4c31-9d9d-2c8dc67a3932\', \'multiverseId\': 595589}, \'multiverseid\': 595589}, {\'name\': \'川潜み\', \'text\': \'川潜みはブロックされない。\\nこれでないマーフォーク１体があなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、ターン終了時まで、川潜みは＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — マーフォーク・戦士\', \'flavor\': \'細波も立てず、飛沫も立てず、予測も立たない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595697&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'24da2b6e-1826-4a18-b1a6-aa1e0af9d188\', \'multiverseId\': 595697}, \'multiverseid\': 595697}, {\'name\': \'河流偷袭客\', \'text\': \'河流偷袭客不能被阻挡。\\n每当另一个人鱼在你的操控下进战场时，河流偷袭客得+1/+1直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人鱼／战士\', \'flavor\': \'没有涟漪，没有水花，没有警告。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596021&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8be1d5b4-a3d8-4641-bc85-b8541501eb0d\', \'multiverseId\': 596021}, \'multiverseid\': 596021}]', '[{\'name\': \'Fluthund\', \'text\': \'{3}, {T}: Stelle Nachforschungen an. (Erzeuge einen Hinweis-Spielstein. Er ist ein Artefakt mit „{2}, opfere dieses Artefakt: Ziehe eine Karte.")\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elementarwesen, Hund\', \'flavor\': \'Die Diebin wechselte mehrmals die Richtung, übergoss sich mit Parfüm, überquerte den Ozean und erwachte dennoch mit ihrem Verfolger dicht auf ihren Fersen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595226&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9ea0125b-097a-41e3-9504-12758ee0f2bc\', \'multiverseId\': 595226}, \'multiverseid\': 595226}, {\'name\': \'Hidrobueso\', \'text\': \'{3}, {T}: Investiga. (Crea una ficha de Pista. Es un artefacto con "{2}, sacrificar este artefacto: Roba una carta".)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Perro elemental\', \'flavor\': \'La ladrona volvió sobre sus pasos dos veces, se impregnó de perfume, cruzó el océano... Pero su perseguidor aún le pisaba los talones.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595334&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c83b0f62-2e97-4959-a6ab-5302d546b68d\', \'multiverseId\': 595334}, \'multiverseid\': 595334}, {\'name\': \'Flolimier\', \'text\': "{3}, {T} : Enquêtez. (Créez un jeton Indice. C\'est un artefact avec « {2}, sacrifiez cet artefact : Piochez une carte. »)", \'type\': \'Créature : élémental et chien\', \'flavor\': "La voleuse fit demi-tour deux fois, s\'aspergea de parfum, traversa l\'océan et se réveilla quand même avec le pisteur à ses trousses.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595442&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'feac56ea-bfa7-45ff-8acf-42376df2bcf1\', \'multiverseId\': 595442}, \'multiverseid\': 595442}, {\'name\': \'Segugio della Marea\', \'text\': \'{3}, {T}: Indaga. (Crea una pedina Indizio. È un artefatto con "{2}, Sacrifica questo artefatto: Pesca una carta".)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Canide Elementale\', \'flavor\': "La ladra tornò sui propri passi due volte, si innaffiò di profumo, attraversò l\'oceano, ma al suo risveglio aveva ancora il suo inseguitore alle calcagna.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595550&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fb64b456-9d57-42ee-8350-bbb6cfaa30c7\', \'multiverseId\': 595550}, \'multiverseid\': 595550}, {\'name\': \'氾濫犬\', \'text\': \'{3},{T}：調査を行う。（手掛かり・トークン１つを生成する。それは、「{2},このアーティファクトを生け贄に捧げる：カード１枚を引く。」を持つアーティファクトである。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エレメンタル・犬\', \'flavor\': \'泥棒は二度折り返して逃げ切ろうとした。全身に香水を浴びて、海を横切って。それでも目を覚ますとすぐそばまで追っ手が来ていた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595658&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'44bb6f19-a9f1-4479-9c3b-db2d6a7c7382\', \'multiverseId\': 595658}, \'multiverseid\': 595658}, {\'name\': \'寻水猎犬\', \'text\': \'{3}，{T}：探查。（派出一个线索衍生物。它是具有「{2}，牺牲此神器：抓一张牌」的神器。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～元素／狗\', \'flavor\': \'小偷两度折返迂回，香水洒满身，还横渡海洋，但醒来时追踪者依然紧随她身后。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595982&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8343a328-e58e-46ea-a4ff-fb833fa3c0e0\', \'multiverseId\': 595982}, \'multiverseid\': 595982}]', '[{\'name\': \'Flüchtige Ablenkung\', \'text\': \'Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält -1/-0 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\\nZiehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Junge Magier lernen diesen Zauberspruch als ersten, denn er hat schon oft die Leben derer gerettet, deren Hände noch kein Schwert halten können.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595225&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'24df4d22-0236-4104-9c72-08143dea98cd\', \'multiverseId\': 595225}, \'multiverseid\': 595225}, {\'name\': \'Distracción momentánea\', \'text\': \'La criatura objetivo obtiene -1/-0 hasta el final del turno.\\nRoba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Es el primer hechizo que aprenden los magos jóvenes, y ha salvado la vida a muchos cuyas manos son demasiado pequeñas para blandir una espada.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595333&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3a738dd2-a22d-435a-bc62-502e18a16c05\', \'multiverseId\': 595333}, \'multiverseid\': 595333}, {\'name\': \'Distraction fugace\', \'text\': "Une créature ciblée gagne -1/-0 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.\\nPiochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'Premier sort enseigné aux jeunes mages, il sauve bien des vies quand les mains sont trop petites pour tenir une épée.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595441&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9c9b9147-f260-4c35-9ffd-a412f2adea8a\', \'multiverseId\': 595441}, \'multiverseid\': 595441}, {\'name\': \'Distrazione Fugace\', \'text\': \'Una creatura bersaglio prende -1/-0 fino alla fine del turno.\\nPesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'Una delle prime magie insegnate ai giovani maghi, ha salvato la vita a molti le cui mani erano troppo piccole per impugnare una spada.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595549&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'109f1b0d-9489-41aa-aa72-ee089fca5429\', \'multiverseId\': 595549}, \'multiverseid\': 595549}, {\'name\': \'一瞬の散漫\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは－１/－０の修整を受ける。\\nカード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'幼い魔道士たちが教わる最初の呪文。まだ剣を握るには小さすぎる者の命を数多く救ってきた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595657&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3abc9778-c0ea-4a59-94d7-830a00a90c18\', \'multiverseId\': 595657}, \'multiverseid\': 595657}, {\'name\': \'飞掠扰神\', \'text\': \'目标生物得-1/-0直到回合结束。\\n抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'这是少年法师所学的第一个咒语，救过许多手小到握不住剑的人。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595981&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b3d82bc4-8442-469d-adfd-a666400ff312\', \'multiverseId\': 595981}, \'multiverseid\': 595981}]', '[{\'name\': \'Forstzertrampelnder Baloth\', \'text\': \'Landung — Immer wenn ein Land unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, erhält der Forstzertrampelnde Baloth +4/+4 und verursacht Trampelschaden bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Bestie\', \'flavor\': \'Sein unersättlicher Hunger sorgt dafür, dass in seiner Umgebung keine Beute übrig bleibt. Er muss immer weiterziehen, um seinen dicken Bauch zu füllen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592829&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'01989fc0-8812-4034-b6e3-df77d2a164a6\', \'multiverseId\': 592829}, \'multiverseid\': 592829}, {\'name\': \'Báloth aplastamadera\', \'text\': \'Aterrizaje — Siempre que una tierra entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, el Báloth aplastamadera obtiene +4/+4 y gana la habilidad de arrollar hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bestia\', \'flavor\': \'Su hambre insaciable rápidamente vacía una región de presas. Debe migrar de lado a lado para alimentar su inmenso cuerpo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592950&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9c67335c-736e-4633-ab30-3b3902489b89\', \'multiverseId\': 592950}, \'multiverseid\': 592950}, {\'name\': \'Baloth écrasebois\', \'text\': "Toucheterre — À chaque fois qu\'un terrain arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, le Baloth écrasebois gagne +4/+4 et acquiert le piétinement jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : bête\', \'flavor\': "Sa faim insatiable vide rapidement une région de proies. Il doit aller d\'un endroit à un autre pour nourrir son énorme masse.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593071&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6c24951b-dabc-432d-9ccf-f1810b48208b\', \'multiverseId\': 593071}, \'multiverseid\': 593071}, {\'name\': \'Baloth Schiantaboschi\', \'text\': \'Terraferma — Ogniqualvolta una terra entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, il Baloth Schiantaboschi prende +4/+4 e ha travolgere fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Bestia\', \'flavor\': "La sua fame insaziabile svuota rapidamente una regione dalle prede. Deve migrare da un posto all\'altro per nutrire la sua mole massiccia.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593192&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f7a6c0c4-279e-4ec8-a584-ffe0b4b00956\', \'multiverseId\': 593192}, \'multiverseid\': 593192}, {\'name\': \'ベイロスの林壊し\', \'text\': \'上陸 ― 土地１つがあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、ターン終了時まで、ベイロスの林壊しは＋４/＋４の修整を受けトランプルを得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ビースト\', \'flavor\': \'その飽くことの無い飢えは、あっという間に一帯の餌食を食い尽くしてしまう。それは巨体を支えるために、各地を渡っていくのだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593313&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'56201853-9bfa-4e55-a677-8595600fa88d\', \'multiverseId\': 593313}, \'multiverseid\': 593313}, {\'name\': \'闯林巴洛西\', \'text\': \'地落～每当一个地在你的操控下进战场时，直到回合结束，闯林巴洛西便得+4/+4且获得践踏异能。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～野兽\', \'flavor\': \'它无底洞般的饥饿很快就把整区的猎物一扫而空。为了喂饱其巨体，它必须在各地之间迁移。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593676&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5762e3e9-a58d-4fff-8f0b-79078c106f91\', \'multiverseId\': 593676}, \'multiverseid\': 593676}]', '[{\'name\': \'Friedensschreiter-Koloss\', \'text\': \'{1}{W}: Ein anderes Fahrzeug deiner Wahl, das du kontrollierst, wird bis zum Ende des Zuges zu einer Artefaktkreatur.\\nBemannen 4 (Tappe eine beliebige Anzahl an Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst und die zusammen Stärke 4 oder mehr haben: Dieses Fahrzeug wird bis zum Ende des Zuges zu einer Artefaktkreatur.)\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Fahrzeug\', \'flavor\': \'Eine Möglichkeit, den Frieden zu erhalten, besteht darin, den Krieg als eine wirklich schlechte Idee erscheinen zu lassen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597125&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6714780c-39c4-477b-b529-2cdd4574b42d\', \'multiverseId\': 597125}, \'multiverseid\': 597125}, {\'name\': \'Coloso pacificador\', \'text\': \'{1}{W}: Otro Vehículo objetivo que controlas se convierte en una criatura artefacto hasta el final del turno.\\nTripular 4. (Girar cualquier cantidad de criaturas que controlas con una fuerza total de 4 o más: Este Vehículo se convierte en una criatura artefacto hasta el final del turno.)\', \'type\': \'Artefacto — Vehículo\', \'flavor\': \'Una forma de conservar la paz es hacer que la guerra parezca muy mala idea.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597171&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aa7a90e3-7174-497d-bf03-1d4f7c9fcc96\', \'multiverseId\': 597171}, \'multiverseid\': 597171}, {\'name\': \'Colosse marchepaix\', \'text\': "{1}{W} : Un autre véhicule ciblé que vous contrôlez devient une créature-artefact jusqu\'à la fin du tour.\\nPilotage 4 (Engagez n\'importe quel nombre de créatures que vous contrôlez dont la force totale est supérieure ou égale à 4 : Ce véhicule devient une créature-artefact jusqu\'à la fin du tour.)", \'type\': \'Artefact : véhicule\', \'flavor\': \'Un bon moyen de préserver la paix est de montrer que la guerre est une très mauvaise idée.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597217&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'daec348b-e863-487b-ac55-80d327b4f1a5\', \'multiverseId\': 597217}, \'multiverseid\': 597217}, {\'name\': \'Colosso Pacificatore\', \'text\': \'{1}{W}: Un altro Veicolo bersaglio che controlli diventa una creatura artefatto fino alla fine del turno.\\nManovrare 4 (TAPpa un qualsiasi numero di creature che controlli con forza totale pari o superiore a 4: Questo Veicolo diventa una creatura artefatto fino alla fine del turno.)\', \'type\': \'Artefatto — Veicolo\', \'flavor\': \'Un buon metodo per mantenere la pace è far sembrare la guerra davvero una pessima idea.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597263&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f15b83c3-c85b-4ae4-91d7-0ad3579bea2d\', \'multiverseId\': 597263}, \'multiverseid\': 597263}, {\'name\': \'平和歩きの巨像\', \'text\': \'{1}{W}：あなたがコントロールしていてこれでない機体１つを対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それはアーティファクト・クリーチャーになる。\\n搭乗４（あなたがコントロールしている望む数のクリーチャーを、パワーの合計が４以上になるように選んでタップする：ターン終了時まで、この機体はアーティファクト・クリーチャーになる。）\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 機体\', \'flavor\': \'平和を維持するひとつの方法は、戦争の魅力を削ぐことである。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597309&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fe860937-502f-484c-969c-233be23ece50\', \'multiverseId\': 597309}, \'multiverseid\': 597309}, {\'name\': \'护宁巨像\', \'text\': \'{1}{W}：另一个目标由你操控的载具成为神器生物直到回合结束。\\n搭载4（横置任意数量由你操控且力量总和等于或大于4的生物：此载具成为神器生物直到回合结束。）\', \'type\': \'神器 ～载具\', \'flavor\': \'令人感觉战无可胜，也是维护和平的手段之一。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597447&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'504421a6-524a-4406-812a-c93b16015886\', \'multiverseId\': 597447}, \'multiverseid\': 597447}]', '[{\'name\': \'Friedhofsrekrutierung\', \'text\': \'Bringe eine Kreaturenkarte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurück. Falls es eine Zombie-Karte ist, ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Die Magie geht mir hier so leicht von der Hand wie auf keiner anderen Welt."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594042&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eecae9f2-ad98-42f1-960b-5de760387bad\', \'multiverseId\': 594042}, \'multiverseid\': 594042}, {\'name\': \'Leva sepulcral\', \'text\': \'Regresa la carta de criatura objetivo de tu cementerio a tu mano. Si es una carta de Zombie, roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Aquí mi magia brota con una facilidad que no he visto en ningún otro plano".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594159&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3e014f2a-7168-4864-9b68-006bd629e2f6\', \'multiverseId\': 594159}, \'multiverseid\': 594159}, {\'name\': \'Recrutement au cimetière\', \'text\': "Renvoyez une carte de créature ciblée depuis votre cimetière dans votre main. Si c\'est une carte de zombie, piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« Ici, ma magie bénéficie d\'une fluidité que je ne retrouve sur aucun autre plan. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594276&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'167dcf48-822d-45e8-874f-0c89054f2d02\', \'multiverseId\': 594276}, \'multiverseid\': 594276}, {\'name\': \'Reclutamento nel Cimitero\', \'text\': \'Riprendi in mano una carta creatura bersaglio dal tuo cimitero. Se è una carta Zombie, pesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Su nessun altro piano le mie magie si realizzano con una tale facilità."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594393&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'032bedf0-f4fc-4593-8158-fa1be4d0ae89\', \'multiverseId\': 594393}, \'multiverseid\': 594393}, {\'name\': \'墓地からの徴用\', \'text\': \'あなたの墓地にあるクリーチャー・カード１枚を対象とする。それをあなたの手札に戻す。それがゾンビ・カードであるなら、カード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「ここでは私の魔法の調子がとてもいいの。他の次元にはない感じね。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594510&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c469bbfc-9e56-41b5-ad25-e86dca1b8aa8\', \'multiverseId\': 594510}, \'multiverseid\': 594510}, {\'name\': \'墓地征召\', \'text\': \'将目标生物牌从你的坟墓场移回你手上。如果它是灵俑牌，则抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「我的魔法在这时空特别能挥洒自如。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594861&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8a873b53-4c46-48f9-952e-8df8d9a53e15\', \'multiverseId\': 594861}, \'multiverseid\': 594861}]', '[{\'name\': \'Frommer Wandersmann\', \'text\': \'Konstellation — Immer wenn eine Verzauberung unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, erhält eine Kreatur deiner Wahl +1/+1 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Späher\', \'flavor\': \'Jeder Schritt ist ein Gebet, jede Straße ein Tempel.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591633&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ce94cf7a-c93a-4595-ba84-3e47382f9bfc\', \'multiverseId\': 591633}, \'multiverseid\': 591633}, {\'name\': \'Viajero piadoso\', \'text\': \'Constelación — Siempre que un encantamiento entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, la criatura objetivo obtiene +1/+1 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Explorador humano\', \'flavor\': \'Cada paso es una plegaria, y cada camino, un templo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591762&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'27f0d539-109c-4246-80c0-6afe172e3f92\', \'multiverseId\': 591762}, \'multiverseid\': 591762}, {\'name\': \'Voyageur pieux\', \'text\': "Constellation — À chaque fois qu\'un enchantement arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, une créature ciblée gagne +1/+1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et éclaireur\', \'flavor\': \'Chaque pas est une prière, et chaque route un temple.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591891&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ae3555de-c32a-447a-ab5c-490c14fc8da1\', \'multiverseId\': 591891}, \'multiverseid\': 591891}, {\'name\': \'Viandante Devoto\', \'text\': \'Costellazione — Ogniqualvolta un incantesimo entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, una creatura bersaglio prende +1/+1 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Esploratore Umano\', \'flavor\': \'Ogni passo è una preghiera, ogni strada un tempio.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592020&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f52aee27-07c7-47e3-8a34-ecc1a46d2d73\', \'multiverseId\': 592020}, \'multiverseid\': 592020}, {\'name\': \'敬虔な旅人\', \'text\': \'星座 ― エンチャント１つがあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・スカウト\', \'flavor\': \'一歩一歩が祈りであり、すべての道が神殿である。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592149&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c5da446c-72fb-473b-8478-b8c9b8f07534\', \'multiverseId\': 592149}, \'multiverseid\': 592149}, {\'name\': \'虔敬旅人\', \'text\': \'星彩～每当一个结界在你的操控下进战场时，目标生物得+1/+1直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／斥候\', \'flavor\': \'每步一诵拜，路路皆神庙。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592536&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'893476af-df06-4536-8be5-0330915b6266\', \'multiverseId\': 592536}, \'multiverseid\': 592536}]', '[{\'name\': \'Frostgipfel-Yeti\', \'text\': \'{1}{S}: Der Frostgipfel-Yeti kann in diesem Zug nicht geblockt werden. ({S} kann mit einem Mana von einer verschneiten Quelle bezahlt werden.)\', \'type\': \'Verschneite Kreatur — Yeti\', \'flavor\': \'Manche Helden benutzen Yeti-Pelz als Futter für ihre Mäntel. Noch mehr Yetis benutzen Helden als Futter.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595227&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'41af3bec-2507-4124-8482-16048b633ed5\', \'multiverseId\': 595227}, \'multiverseid\': 595227}, {\'name\': \'Yeti de Picohelado\', \'text\': \'{1}{S}: El Yeti de Picohelado no puede ser bloqueado este turno. ({S} puede pagarse con un maná de una fuente nevada.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura nevada — Yeti\', \'flavor\': \'A algunos héroes les gusta hacerse botas con piel de yeti. Pero a los yetis les encanta ponerse las botas a base de héroes.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595335&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ef18c18b-5ff9-4161-aec3-7c7223511d83\', \'multiverseId\': 595335}, \'multiverseid\': 595335}, {\'name\': \'Yeti de Gèlemont\', \'text\': "{1}{S} : Le Yeti de Gèlemont ne peut pas être bloqué ce tour-ci. ({S} peut être payé avec un mana d\'une source neigeuse.)", \'type\': \'Créature neigeuse : yeti\', \'flavor\': \'Certains héros bourrent leur manteau avec de la fourrure de yeti. Les yetis, eux, se bourrent la panse avec des héros.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595443&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8e195901-32a0-4cc3-841c-18502d66fe27\', \'multiverseId\': 595443}, \'multiverseid\': 595443}, {\'name\': \'Yeti di Gelopicco\', \'text\': \'{1}{S}: Lo Yeti di Gelopicco non può essere bloccato in questo turno. ({S} può essere pagato con un mana da una fonte neve.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura Neve — Yeti\', \'flavor\': \'Alcuni eroi foderano i propri mantelli con pellicce di yeti. Ma sono di più gli yeti che foderano il proprio stomaco con eroi.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595551&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b3fff276-7512-470d-a8e9-a2dd934598a8\', \'multiverseId\': 595551}, \'multiverseid\': 595551}, {\'name\': \'霜峰のイエティ\', \'text\': \'{1}{S}：このターン、霜峰のイエティはブロックされない。（{S}は氷雪である発生源からのマナ１点で支払える。）\', \'type\': \'氷雪クリーチャー — イエティ\', \'flavor\': \'イエティの毛皮の外套で自尊心を満たす英雄もいるが、英雄で腹を満たすイエティの方がずっと多い。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595659&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5edada71-4aee-47cb-84a9-a40831b21493\', \'multiverseId\': 595659}, \'multiverseid\': 595659}, {\'name\': \'霜峰雪怪\', \'text\': \'{1}{S}：霜峰雪怪本回合不能被阻挡。（{S}能以产自雪境来源的一点法术力来支付。）\', \'type\': \'雪境生物 ～雪怪\', \'flavor\': \'有些英雄用雪怪皮毛填充衣物。但更多雪怪用英雄尸体填饱肚子。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595983&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'60e64ef4-cb0a-435a-987d-e268a6d6bdb2\', \'multiverseId\': 595983}, \'multiverseid\': 595983}]', '[{\'name\': \'Fundus des Nekromagiers\', \'text\': \'{1}{B}, wirf eine Kreaturenkarte ab: Ziehe eine Karte. Falls die abgeworfene Karte eine Zombie-Karte war, erzeuge einen getappten 2/2 schwarzen Zombie-Kreaturenspielstein.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'Die Experimente beschlossen, ein paar Forschungen auf eigene Faust durchzuführen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594103&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'32e2d0ea-b89f-474e-920c-d5deeeef3158\', \'multiverseId\': 594103}, \'multiverseid\': 594103}, {\'name\': \'Reservas del nigromante\', \'text\': \'{1}{B}, descartar una carta de criatura: Roba una carta. Si la carta descartada era una carta de Zombie, crea una ficha de criatura Zombie negra 2/2 girada.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'Los experimentos decidieron llevar a cabo ciertas investigaciones propias.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594220&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'866dd468-2af5-4b92-88fb-6effceb0259d\', \'multiverseId\': 594220}, \'multiverseid\': 594220}, {\'name\': \'Réserve du nécromancien\', \'text\': "{1}{B}, défaussez-vous d\'une carte de créature : Piochez une carte. Si la carte défaussée était une carte de zombie, créez un jeton de créature 2/2 noire Zombie engagé.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': "Les sujets d\'expérience décidèrent de mener leurs propres recherches.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594337&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c04fc1df-69da-4b6e-9be3-f6f1c132bcda\', \'multiverseId\': 594337}, \'multiverseid\': 594337}, {\'name\': \'Scorte del Necromante\', \'text\': \'{1}{B}, Scarta una carta creatura: Pesca una carta. Se la carta scartata era una carta Zombie, crea una pedina creatura Zombie 2/2 nera TAPpata.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'Gli esperimenti decisero di condurre a loro volta le proprie ricerche.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594454&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'44fee441-94be-4f51-8cc4-2406c5dea37a\', \'multiverseId\': 594454}, \'multiverseid\': 594454}, {\'name\': \'屍術士の備蓄品\', \'text\': \'{1}{B},クリーチャー・カード１枚を捨てる：カードを１枚引く。捨てられたカードがゾンビ・カードであるなら、黒の２/２のゾンビ・クリーチャー・トークン１体をタップ状態で生成する。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'実験体たちは独自の実験を始めようとしていた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594571&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'96ed881e-37d2-4827-bff4-acb485b9d6c7\', \'multiverseId\': 594571}, \'multiverseid\': 594571}, {\'name\': \'死灵术士备品室\', \'text\': \'{1}{B}，弃一张生物牌：抓一张牌。如果所弃之牌是灵俑牌，则派出一个已横置的2/2黑色灵俑衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'实验体决定自己开始研究。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594922&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'61a37ba0-0b4c-4134-a5fd-6ac36b6e2f9c\', \'multiverseId\': 594922}, \'multiverseid\': 594922}]', '[{\'name\': \'Funke der Kreativität\', \'text\': \'Bestimme eine Kreatur deiner Wahl. Schicke die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek ins Exil. Du kannst den Funken der Kreativität jener Kreatur Schaden in Höhe des Manabetrags der ins Exil geschickten Karte zufügen lassen. Falls du dies nicht tust, kannst du die Karte bis zum Ende des Zuges spielen.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Erfinden heißt rebellieren."\\n—Pia Nalaar\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590310&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a218d768-c598-44dc-875d-0543ecd7acdf\', \'multiverseId\': 590310}, \'multiverseid\': 590310}, {\'name\': \'Chispa de creatividad\', \'text\': \'Elige una criatura objetivo. Exilia la primera carta de tu biblioteca. Puedes hacer que la Chispa de creatividad haga una cantidad de daño a esa criatura igual al valor de maná de la carta exiliada. Si no lo haces, puedes jugar esa carta hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Inventar es rebelarse".\\n—Pia Nalaar\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590445&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'11a4a894-513a-495d-b741-669bd2b778fe\', \'multiverseId\': 590445}, \'multiverseid\': 590445}, {\'name\': \'Étincelle de créativité\', \'text\': "Choisissez une créature ciblée. Exilez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Vous pouvez faire que l\'Étincelle de créativité inflige à cette créature un nombre de blessures égal à la valeur de mana de la carte exilée. Si vous ne le faites pas, vous pouvez jouer cette carte jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« Inventer c\'est se rebeller. »\\n—Pia Nalaàr", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590580&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e1e95cdb-a9b2-4708-b872-556126c41e4c\', \'multiverseId\': 590580}, \'multiverseid\': 590580}, {\'name\': \'Scintilla di Creatività\', \'text\': \'Scegli una creatura bersaglio. Esilia la prima carta del tuo grimorio. Puoi far infliggere alla Scintilla di Creatività danno pari al valore di mana della carta esiliata a quella creatura. Se non lo fai, puoi giocare quella carta fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Ogni invenzione è una ribellione."\\n—Pia Nalaar\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590715&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ca312826-31be-413b-a6a2-3ae68d40dc61\', \'multiverseId\': 590715}, \'multiverseid\': 590715}, {\'name\': \'独創の火花\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード１枚を追放する。あなたは「独創の火花はそのクリーチャーに、その追放したカードのマナ総量に等しい点数のダメージを与える。」を選んでもよい。そうしないなら、ターン終了時まで、あなたはそのカードをプレイしてもよい。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「発明とは、覆すこと。」\\n――ピア・ナラー\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590850&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'27879725-c62d-4547-a687-5ebe41ec2ab7\', \'multiverseId\': 590850}, \'multiverseid\': 590850}, {\'name\': \'创意火花\', \'text\': \'选择目标生物。放逐你的牌库顶牌。你可以使创意火花对该生物造成伤害，其数量等同于所放逐之牌的法术力值。如果你未如此作，则直到回合结束，你可以使用该牌。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「发明即反抗。」\\n～琵雅纳拉\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591255&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e97769f3-ad0f-4966-bda6-8539b236d001\', \'multiverseId\': 591255}, \'multiverseid\': 591255}]', '[{\'name\': \'Funkenschnitter\', \'text\': \'{3}, opfere eine Kreatur oder einen Planeswalker: Du erhältst 1 Lebenspunkt dazu und ziehst eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Zombie\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich weiß, dass sie unaufhaltsame Krieger sind, die nur zur Ernte von Funken erschaffen wurden. Aber müssen sie so roh dabei sein?"\\n—Kaya\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594128&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'907568e1-900a-4786-9e0b-609131f94508\', \'multiverseId\': 594128}, \'multiverseid\': 594128}, {\'name\': \'Segador de chispas\', \'text\': \'{3}, sacrificar una criatura o planeswalker: Ganas 1 vida y robas una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Zombie\', \'flavor\': \'"Ya sé que son luchadores imparables creados para cosechar almas. ¡Pero es que lo hacen con tan poca clase!".\\n—Kaya\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594245&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'49e6cc79-9be8-4d62-b2eb-1ede953a0225\', \'multiverseId\': 594245}, \'multiverseid\': 594245}, {\'name\': "Faucheur d\'étincelle", \'text\': \'{3}, sacrifiez une créature ou un planeswalker : Vous gagnez 1 point de vie et vous piochez une carte.\', \'type\': \'Créature : zombie\', \'flavor\': \'« Je sais que ce sont des combattants implacables créés pour récolter les âmes... Mais ils pourraient être polis quand même. »\\n—Kaya\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594362&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3b4ef208-891f-4817-a4a6-ff43aded3123\', \'multiverseId\': 594362}, \'multiverseid\': 594362}, {\'name\': \'Mietitore di Scintille\', \'text\': \'{3}, Sacrifica una creatura o un planeswalker: Guadagni 1 punto vita e peschi una carta.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Zombie\', \'flavor\': \'"So che sono guerrieri inarrestabili creati per mietere anime... ma lo fanno in modo davvero rozzo."\\n—Kaya\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594479&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'85821cc4-fed5-40c1-954a-80e940ac1712\', \'multiverseId\': 594479}, \'multiverseid\': 594479}, {\'name\': \'灯を刈り取る者\', \'text\': \'{3},クリーチャーやプレインズウォーカーのうち１体を生け贄に捧げる：あなたは１点のライフを得、カード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ゾンビ\', \'flavor\': \'「あいつらが魂を収穫するために作られた無敵の戦士だってことは分かってるわ。でも、いくらなんでも無礼でしょう。」\\n――ケイヤ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594596&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0aa5bdea-16bd-4f1f-8a54-23995c69a475\', \'multiverseId\': 594596}, \'multiverseid\': 594596}, {\'name\': \'火花掠夺客\', \'text\': \'{3}，牺牲一个生物或鹏洛客：你获得1点生命且抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～灵俑\', \'flavor\': \'「我知道它们都是为收割灵魂而生的不息战士～可它们的手法未免太粗鲁了。」\\n～卡娅\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594947&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'52581f89-d0f5-49b7-9b92-fe4ef451419c\', \'multiverseId\': 594947}, \'multiverseid\': 594947}]', '[{\'name\': \'Funkenzauberlehrling\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Funkenzauberlehrling ins Spiel kommt, fügt er einem Ziel deiner Wahl 1 Schadenspunkt zu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': \'Funkenzauberer sind wahre Künstler, doch der Preis für das Zuschauen ist Schmerz.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590311&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'80ad6faf-6795-46e0-a14d-ecf29a1b32dd\', \'multiverseId\': 590311}, \'multiverseid\': 590311}, {\'name\': \'Aprendiz magochispa\', \'text\': \'Cuando la Aprendiz magochispa entre al campo de batalla, hace 1 punto de daño a cualquier objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero humano\', \'flavor\': \'Los magochispa son un tipo de artista, pero el dolor es el precio de la entrada.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590446&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'90606f8d-78e0-4852-a71b-76b6fc366d03\', \'multiverseId\': 590446}, \'multiverseid\': 590446}, {\'name\': \'Apprenti étincemage\', \'text\': "Quand l\'Apprenti étincemage arrive sur le champ de bataille, il inflige 1 blessure à n\'importe quelle cible.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et sorcier\', \'flavor\': "Les étincemages se donnent en spectacle, mais le billet d\'entrée se paie en souffrance.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590581&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c8b8c6de-30cd-424c-82da-8c05e7f20380\', \'multiverseId\': 590581}, \'multiverseid\': 590581}, {\'name\': \'Apprendista Magascintilla\', \'text\': "Quando l\'Apprendista Magascintilla entra nel campo di battaglia, infligge 1 danno a un qualsiasi bersaglio.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Mago Umano\', \'flavor\': \'I maghiscintilla sono artisti spettacolari in un certo senso, ma il dolore è il prezzo di ammissione.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590716&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eeaac3dc-8cc0-479a-854a-dc46da2e48aa\', \'multiverseId\': 590716}, \'multiverseid\': 590716}, {\'name\': \'火花魔道士の弟子\', \'text\': \'火花魔道士の弟子が戦場に出たとき、クリーチャーやプレインズウォーカーやプレイヤーのうち１つを対象とする。これはそれに１点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': \'火花魔道士は様々な芸を見せるが、苦痛がその対価となる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590851&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'09bcc027-7aed-4c40-a257-5d902f60b508\', \'multiverseId\': 590851}, \'multiverseid\': 590851}, {\'name\': \'火花法师学徒\', \'text\': \'当火花法师学徒进战场时，它对任意一个目标造成1点伤害。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／法术师\', \'flavor\': \'火花法师也算得上是表演艺术者，但入场费用是身体疼痛。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591256&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ab362746-a102-4ef9-85c1-d94a65d449a0\', \'multiverseId\': 591256}, \'multiverseid\': 591256}]', '[{\'name\': \'Fürstin der Verfluchten\', \'text\': \'Andere Zombies, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +1/+1.\\n{1}{B}, {T}: Alle Zombies erhalten Bedrohlichkeit bis zum Ende des Zuges. (Eine Kreatur mit Bedrohlichkeit kann nicht geblockt werden, außer von zwei oder mehr Kreaturen.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Zombie\', \'flavor\': \'„Für eine Sache zu sterben und ihr weiter zu dienen, ist das wahrhaftigste Zeichen von Loyalität."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597098&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d52f52b3-6985-45fb-80a2-80cd44878fec\', \'multiverseId\': 597098}, \'multiverseid\': 597098}, {\'name\': \'Señora de los malditos\', \'text\': \'Los otros Zombies que controlas obtienen +1/+1.\\n{1}{B}, {T}: Todos los Zombies ganan la habilidad de amenaza hasta el final del turno. (Una criatura con la habilidad de amenaza no puede ser bloqueada excepto por dos o más criaturas.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Zombie\', \'flavor\': \'"Morir por una causa y continuar a su servicio es la muestra de lealtad más grande que existe".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597144&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cd81e9f4-9d16-4d44-adf8-3716cabd0a3d\', \'multiverseId\': 597144}, \'multiverseid\': 597144}, {\'name\': \'Seigneuresse des maudits\', \'text\': "Les autres zombies que vous contrôlez gagnent +1/+1.\\n{1}{B}, {T} : Tous les zombies acquièrent la menace jusqu\'à la fin du tour. (Une créature avec la menace ne peut pas être bloquée excepté par deux créatures ou plus.)", \'type\': \'Créature : zombie\', \'flavor\': \'« Mourir pour une cause et continuer à la servir est le plus pur gage de loyauté. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597190&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4d5fba9f-3e9f-4f15-b295-7a0cba570266\', \'multiverseId\': 597190}, \'multiverseid\': 597190}, {\'name\': \'Signora dei Maledetti\', \'text\': \'Gli altri Zombie che controlli prendono +1/+1.\\n{1}{B}, {T}: Tutti gli Zombie hanno minacciare fino alla fine del turno. (Una creatura con minacciare non può essere bloccata tranne che da due o più creature.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Zombie\', \'flavor\': \'"Morire per una causa e continuare a servirla è la più sincera prova di fedeltà."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597236&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2d00e4fa-2273-4b4a-a972-fc0196932d49\', \'multiverseId\': 597236}, \'multiverseid\': 597236}, {\'name\': \'呪われた者の王\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしていてこれでないすべてのゾンビは＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\\n{1}{B},{T}：ターン終了時まで、すべてのゾンビは威迫を得る。（威迫を持つクリーチャーは、２体以上のクリーチャーにしかブロックされない。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ゾンビ\', \'flavor\': \'「使命に殉じてもなお仕え続けることが、真の忠誠の証です。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597282&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'875719c2-37f5-455a-9e75-87cdb44873cc\', \'multiverseId\': 597282}, \'multiverseid\': 597282}, {\'name\': \'遭诅者领主\', \'text\': \'由你操控的其他灵俑得+1/+1。\\n{1}{B}，{T}：所有灵俑获得威慑异能直到回合结束。（具威慑异能的生物只能被两个或更多生物阻挡。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～灵俑\', \'flavor\': \'「鞠躬尽瘁、死后不已，才真正算是忠诚。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597420&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2333e1ad-fa51-43ae-95c5-ccbea188ce19\', \'multiverseId\': 597420}, \'multiverseid\': 597420}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gabe der Gargantuas\', \'text\': \'Schaue dir die obersten vier Karten deiner Bibliothek an. Du kannst eine Kreaturenkarte und/oder eine Länderkarte davon offen vorzeigen und die vorgezeigten Karten auf deine Hand nehmen. Lege den Rest in beliebiger Reihenfolge unter deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592866&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0de9b7ce-958c-48e2-8dfb-7d149ac720f8\', \'multiverseId\': 592866}, \'multiverseid\': 592866}, {\'name\': \'Regalo de las gargantúas\', \'text\': \'Mira las cuatro primeras cartas de tu biblioteca. Puedes mostrar una carta de criatura y/o una carta de tierra de entre ellas y poner las cartas mostradas en tu mano. Pon el resto en el fondo de tu biblioteca en cualquier orden.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592987&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ba03596a-6b6c-41d8-9a2b-74614e5ff84f\', \'multiverseId\': 592987}, \'multiverseid\': 592987}, {\'name\': \'Don du gargantuesque\', \'text\': "Regardez les quatre cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Vous pouvez révéler une carte de créature et/ou une carte de terrain parmi elles et mettre les cartes révélées dans votre main. Mettez le reste au-dessous de votre bibliothèque, dans l\'ordre de votre choix.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593108&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5bb158e4-d251-4d90-88e9-1c22a3440230\', \'multiverseId\': 593108}, \'multiverseid\': 593108}, {\'name\': \'Dono del Mastodonte\', \'text\': \'Guarda le prime quattro carte del tuo grimorio. Puoi rivelare una carta creatura e/o una carta terra scelte tra esse e aggiungere alla tua mano le carte rivelate. Metti le altre in fondo al tuo grimorio in qualsiasi ordine.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593229&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f7c74050-ec40-46e2-92c2-6ccdc9f2513e\', \'multiverseId\': 593229}, \'multiverseid\': 593229}, {\'name\': \'ガルガンチュアンの贈り物\', \'text\': \'あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード４枚を見る。あなたは「その中からクリーチャー・カード最大１枚と土地・カード最大１枚を公開し、あなたの手札に加える。」を選んでもよい。残りをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に望む順番で置く。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593350&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'20a2e1b6-b950-42a5-af1d-c551a02c2721\', \'multiverseId\': 593350}, \'multiverseid\': 593350}, {\'name\': \'巨兽赋礼\', \'text\': \'检视你牌库顶的四张牌。你可以展示其中一张生物牌和／或一张地牌并置于你手上。将其余的牌以任意顺序置于你的牌库底。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593713&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'43e9c8bb-187b-4bae-a09b-38229139f2d3\', \'multiverseId\': 593713}, \'multiverseid\': 593713}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gadrak, Geißel der Gekrönten\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nGadrak, Geißel der Gekrönten, kann nicht angreifen, es sei denn, du kontrollierst vier oder mehr Artefakte.\\nZu Beginn deines Endsegments erzeugst du für jede Nichtspielsteinkreatur, die in diesem Zug gestorben ist, einen Schatz-Spielstein. (Er ist ein Artefakt mit „{T}, opfere dieses Artefakt: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe.")\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Drache\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590246&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e9e4ce5e-fe73-43be-9705-a4e51ab2ead5\', \'multiverseId\': 590246}, \'multiverseid\': 590246}, {\'name\': \'Gadrak, Azote a las Coronas\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nGadrak, Azote a las Coronas no puede atacar a menos que controles cuatro o más artefactos.\\nAl comienzo de tu paso final, crea una ficha de Tesoro por cada criatura que no sea ficha que murió en este turno. (Es un artefacto con "{T}, sacrificar este artefacto: Agrega un maná de cualquier color".)\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Dragón\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590381&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'da8dcc30-2c23-4bbc-b18a-a603bd160e3c\', \'multiverseId\': 590381}, \'multiverseid\': 590381}, {\'name\': \'Gadrak, le fléau des couronnes\', \'text\': "Vol\\nGadrak, le fléau des couronnes ne peut pas attaquer à moins que vous ne contrôliez au moins quatre artefacts.\\nAu début de votre étape de fin, créez un jeton Trésor pour chaque créature non-jeton qui est morte ce tour-ci. (C\'est un artefact avec « {T}, sacrifiez cet artefact : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix. »)", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : dragon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590516&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'66adb00d-83d3-4ed6-b376-c44b0e410b9f\', \'multiverseId\': 590516}, \'multiverseid\': 590516}, {\'name\': \'Gadrak, il Flagello delle Corone\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nGadrak, il Flagello delle Corone non può attaccare a meno che tu non controlli quattro o più artefatti.\\nAll\\\'inizio della tua sottofase finale, crea una pedina Tesoro per ogni creatura non pedina che è morta in questo turno. (È un artefatto con "{T}, Sacrifica questo artefatto: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore".)\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Drago\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590651&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bfc46a2c-420e-4337-b5a4-3a7eb0cf9247\', \'multiverseId\': 590651}, \'multiverseid\': 590651}, {\'name\': \'冠滅ぼしのガドラク\', \'text\': \'飛行\\nあなたが４つ以上のアーティファクトをコントロールしていないかぎり、冠滅ぼしのガドラクでは攻撃できない。\\nあなたの終了ステップの開始時に、このターンに死亡してトークンでないクリーチャー１体につき１つの宝物・トークンを生成する。（それらは、「{T}, このアーティファクトを生け贄に捧げる：好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。」を持つアーティファクトである。）\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — ドラゴン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590786&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'43603a8f-164f-4c55-8eaa-a198476e9613\', \'multiverseId\': 590786}, \'multiverseid\': 590786}, {\'name\': \'戴冠祸害加札克\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n除非你操控四个或更多神器，否则戴冠祸害加札克不能攻击。\\n在你的结束步骤开始时，本回合中每有一个非衍生物的生物死去，便派出一个珍宝衍生物。（它是具有「{T}，牺牲此神器：加一点任意颜色的法术力」的神器。）\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～龙\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591191&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e27adf76-0d97-4062-9c45-4e178e7fd500\', \'multiverseId\': 591191}, \'multiverseid\': 591191}]', "[{'name': 'Gaeas Beschützer', 'text': 'Gaeas Beschützer muss geblockt werden, falls möglich.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Elementarwesen, Krieger', 'flavor': 'Gaea transmutierte bereits vor langer Zeit die gefallenen Phyrexianer zu Elementarwesen, doch Yavimayas andere Bewohner beäugen sie immer noch mit Argwohn.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592863&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1c5ed15d-d841-4558-8f17-8163c29b3a1d', 'multiverseId': 592863}, 'multiverseid': 592863}, {'name': 'Protector de Gaia', 'text': 'El Protector de Gaia debe ser bloqueado si se puede.', 'type': 'Criatura — Guerrero elemental', 'flavor': 'Hace mucho, Gaia transformó a los pirexianos caídos en elementales, pero el resto de habitantes de Yavimaya aún desconfía de ellos.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592984&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '97772f92-76d7-4fca-8369-1736f2bc09cb', 'multiverseId': 592984}, 'multiverseid': 592984}, {'name': 'Protecteur de Gaia', 'text': 'Le Protecteur de Gaia doit être bloqué si possible.', 'type': 'Créature : élémental et guerrier', 'flavor': 'Les Phyrexians morts furent transformés en élémentaux par Gaia il y a bien longtemps, mais les autres habitants de la Yavimaya les regardent toujours avec inquiétude.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593105&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a2996373-8df4-4791-a1df-d691f5018aa9', 'multiverseId': 593105}, 'multiverseid': 593105}, {'name': 'Protettore di Gea', 'text': 'Il Protettore di Gea deve essere bloccato, se possibile.', 'type': 'Creatura — Guerriero Elementale', 'flavor': 'Gea tramutò i Phyrexiani caduti in elementali molto tempo fa, ma gli altri abitanti di Yavimaya li guardano ancora con inquietudine.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593226&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1bfb53ab-d37f-4807-a73a-e79a51d94c5c', 'multiverseId': 593226}, 'multiverseid': 593226}, {'name': 'ガイアの守護者', 'text': 'ガイアの守護者は、可能ならブロックされなければならない。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — エレメンタル・戦士', 'flavor': '堕ちたファイレクシア人は遥か昔にガイアが精霊に変えたが、ヤヴィマヤの住民は今でも不安を抱いている。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593347&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'be9d73ba-3ec2-43ac-8111-3dec8bc33196', 'multiverseId': 593347}, 'multiverseid': 593347}, {'name': '盖亚守护者', 'text': '若能阻挡盖亚守护者，则必须阻挡之。', 'type': '生物 ～元素／战士', 'flavor': '盖亚很早就已将非瑞克西亚死躯转化为可利用的元素，但亚维马雅的其他居民仍无法安心接纳。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593710&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6487ff12-4618-4da4-bf88-59a9320e3554', 'multiverseId': 593710}, 'multiverseid': 593710}]", '[{\'name\': \'Galgenwächter\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nAndere Geist-Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +0/+1.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Geist\', \'flavor\': \'Dem Geist sind die Verbrechen oder Triumphe der Toten gleich. Er beschützt sie alle unter seinem wehenden Mantel.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591593&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a62e8826-2943-44d2-8fd4-82272b0ab7d3\', \'multiverseId\': 591593}, \'multiverseid\': 591593}, {\'name\': \'Protector del cadalso\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nLas otras criaturas Espíritu que controlas obtienen +0/+1.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Espíritu\', \'flavor\': \'Al espíritu no le importan los crímenes o triunfos de los muertos. Les da cobijo a todos en su tormentoso manto.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591722&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a07dae2e-c938-4ec9-bcb5-4e8af67382f7\', \'multiverseId\': 591722}, \'multiverseid\': 591722}, {\'name\': \'Garde de la potence\', \'text\': \'Vol\\nLes autres créatures Esprit que vous contrôlez gagnent +0/+1.\', \'type\': \'Créature : esprit\', \'flavor\': "L\'esprit se moque des crimes ou des triomphes des exécutés. Il les abrite tous sous son manteau de tourmente.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591851&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a4019a8b-e725-44f8-a01b-acef484a8d89\', \'multiverseId\': 591851}, \'multiverseid\': 591851}, {\'name\': \'Custode del Patibolo\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nLe altre creature Spirito che controlli prendono +0/+1.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Spirito\', \'flavor\': \'Allo spirito non interessano i crimini o i trionfi delle vittime. Le accoglie tutte sotto il suo manto burrascoso.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591980&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9109daf1-b11e-4afa-9c9a-4d7b32e70eeb\', \'multiverseId\': 591980}, \'multiverseid\': 591980}, {\'name\': \'絞首台の守部\', \'text\': \'飛行\\nあなたがコントロールしていてこれでないすべてのスピリット・クリーチャーは＋０/＋１の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — スピリット\', \'flavor\': \'霊魂は殺された者の罪や偉業などを気にすることは無い。それは全て荒々しい外套の下に隠されている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592109&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b0be62ba-136e-4ce3-97e4-2992afc34ec0\', \'multiverseId\': 592109}, \'multiverseid\': 592109}, {\'name\': \'绞刑台护卫\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n由你操控的其他精怪生物得+0/+1。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～精怪\', \'flavor\': \'精怪并不在乎受刑者的罪行或荣耀。在它风暴笼罩下者都将受其庇护。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592496&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'84291604-cf7a-462a-a98e-37b0cd609432\', \'multiverseId\': 592496}, \'multiverseid\': 592496}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gargoyle des Heiligtums\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nWenn der Gargoyle des Heiligtums ins Spiel kommt, kannst du eine Artefaktkarte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurückbringen.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Gargoyle\', \'flavor\': \'Als ihre Ätherium-Vorräte zur Neige gingen, mussten die Mechaniker ihre Gargoylen immer weiter ausschicken, um Nachschub zu erhalten.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591642&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dd423cfd-ec66-4497-9994-8af0ddc81367\', \'multiverseId\': 591642}, \'multiverseid\': 591642}, {\'name\': \'Gárgola del santuario\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nCuando la Gárgola del santuario entre al campo de batalla, puedes regresar la carta de artefacto objetivo de tu cementerio a tu mano.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Gárgola\', \'flavor\': \'Cuando sus reservas de eterium menguaron, los mecanistas enviaron gárgolas más y más lejos para encontrar restos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591771&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1ff75c10-478d-465e-88e7-fae3823bf756\', \'multiverseId\': 591771}, \'multiverseid\': 591771}, {\'name\': \'Gargouille du sanctuaire\', \'text\': "Vol\\nQuand la Gargouille du sanctuaire arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez renvoyer une carte d\'artefact ciblée depuis votre cimetière dans votre main.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : gargouille\', \'flavor\': "Leurs réserves d\'étherium disparaissant rapidement, les mécanistes envoyèrent les gargouilles toujours plus loin pour en récupérer.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591900&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f6b4b64d-0d9f-41ce-a2e2-b18b42e1f8ae\', \'multiverseId\': 591900}, \'multiverseid\': 591900}, {\'name\': \'Gargoyle del Santuario\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nQuando il Gargoyle del Santuario entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi riprendere in mano una carta artefatto bersaglio dal tuo cimitero.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Gargoyle\', \'flavor\': \'Man mano che le loro scorte di eterium si riducevano, i meccanicisti inviavano i gargoyle sempre più lontano in cerca di materiale di recupero.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592029&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eb563475-1fc6-4726-a105-05194f4967ce\', \'multiverseId\': 592029}, \'multiverseid\': 592029}, {\'name\': \'聖域のガーゴイル\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n聖域のガーゴイルが戦場に出たとき、あなたの墓地にあるアーティファクト・カード１枚を対象とする。あなたはそれをあなたの手札に戻してもよい。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — ガーゴイル\', \'flavor\': \'エーテリウムの供給が少なくなるにつれ、商人は廃物を求めてガーゴイルをより遠くへと送り込むようになった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592158&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a9c93ca5-8ed5-461d-b8e3-d25c931d9c07\', \'multiverseId\': 592158}, \'multiverseid\': 592158}, {\'name\': \'圣所石像鬼\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n当圣所石像鬼进战场时，你可以将目标神器牌从你的坟墓场移回你手上。\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～石像鬼\', \'flavor\': \'机械师在乙金存量不足时，会派出石像鬼到遥远彼方搜寻可用材料。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592545&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b01c125f-9d74-436a-bbf3-19a778278cef\', \'multiverseId\': 592545}, \'multiverseid\': 592545}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gebaut für die Ewigkeit\', \'text\': \'Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält +2/+2 bis zum Ende des Zuges. Falls es eine Artefaktkreatur ist, erhält sie Unzerstörbarkeit bis zum Ende des Zuges. (Schaden und Effekte, die „zerstören", zerstören sie nicht.)\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Vom Konsulat hergestellte Maschinenwesen haben eine lebenslange Garantie.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591567&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5456e12c-7b56-475c-bd1f-7d6adbae4539\', \'multiverseId\': 591567}, \'multiverseid\': 591567}, {\'name\': \'Construido para perdurar\', \'text\': \'La criatura objetivo obtiene +2/+2 hasta el final del turno. Si es una criatura artefacto, gana la habilidad de indestructible hasta el final del turno. (El daño y los efectos que dicen "destruir" no la destruyen.)\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Los autómatas construidos por el Consulado vienen con garantía de por vida.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591696&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b5c0dc9c-dbd8-4306-94b4-45d9c3c293e0\', \'multiverseId\': 591696}, \'multiverseid\': 591696}, {\'name\': \'Construit pour durer\', \'text\': "Une créature ciblée gagne +2/+2 jusqu\'à la fin du tour. Si c\'est une créature-artefact, elle acquiert l\'indestructible jusqu\'à la fin du tour. (Les blessures et les effets qui disent « détruisez » ne la détruisent pas.)", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'Les automates construits par le Consulat sont garantis à vie.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591825&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'722215e7-82cd-4937-9157-379894f61293\', \'multiverseId\': 591825}, \'multiverseid\': 591825}, {\'name\': \'Costruito per Durare\', \'text\': \'Una creatura bersaglio prende +2/+2 fino alla fine del turno. Se è una creatura artefatto, ha indistruttibile fino alla fine del turno. (Il danno e gli effetti che dicono "distruggi" non la distruggono.)\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'Gli automi costruiti dal Consolato sono garantiti a vita.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591954&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'58ee6cf4-02b2-40c6-99ca-77e1654ab328\', \'multiverseId\': 591954}, \'multiverseid\': 591954}, {\'name\': \'永存確約\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは＋２/＋２の修整を受ける。それがアーティファクト・クリーチャーであるなら、ターン終了時まで、それは破壊不能を得る。（ダメージや「破壊」と書かれた効果では、それは破壊されない。）\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'領事府製の自動機械には無期限の保証がついている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592083&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d8ad4007-7dc0-4cd0-9973-4f2bce0f4a5f\', \'multiverseId\': 592083}, \'multiverseid\': 592083}, {\'name\': \'造以恒久\', \'text\': \'目标生物得+2/+2直到回合结束。如果它是神器生物，则它获得不灭异能直到回合结束。（伤害与注明「消灭」的效应不会将它消灭。）\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'执政院打造的自动机械终身保固。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592470&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0650818a-c003-4ce0-9f67-90ba33151b42\', \'multiverseId\': 592470}, \'multiverseid\': 592470}]', "[{'name': 'Gebieterischer Perfekter', 'text': 'Andere Elfen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +1/+1.\\n{G}, {T}: Erzeuge einen 1/1 grünen Elf-Krieger-Kreaturenspielstein.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Elf, Krieger', 'flavor': 'In einer Kultur der Schönheit werden die Schönsten wie Götter behandelt.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592876&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4876520d-b2ae-40cd-80a3-fcc770e616b9', 'multiverseId': 592876}, 'multiverseid': 592876}, {'name': 'Perfecta arrogante', 'text': 'Los otros Elfos que controlas obtienen +1/+1.\\n{G}, {T}: Crea una ficha de criatura Guerrero Elfo verde 1/1.', 'type': 'Criatura — Guerrero elfo', 'flavor': 'En una cultura basada en la belleza, las más bellas son adoradas como diosas.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592997&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3fddc984-3331-4079-87b8-4f747ac32650', 'multiverseId': 592997}, 'multiverseid': 592997}, {'name': 'Parfaite impérieuse', 'text': 'Les autres elfes que vous contrôlez gagnent +1/+1.\\n{G}, {T} : Créez un jeton de créature 1/1 verte Elfe et Guerrier.', 'type': 'Créature : elfe et guerrier', 'flavor': 'Dans une culture basée sur la perfection, les plus beaux sont vénérés comme des dieux.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593118&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e9c329cf-9f31-4971-859c-1bc142758562', 'multiverseId': 593118}, 'multiverseid': 593118}, {'name': 'Perfetta Autoritaria', 'text': 'Gli altri Elfi che controlli prendono +1/+1.\\n{G}, {T}: Crea una pedina creatura Guerriero Elfo 1/1 verde.', 'type': 'Creatura — Guerriero Elfo', 'flavor': 'In una cultura che venera la bellezza, i più belli sono adorati come divinità.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593239&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7c4972f4-6f67-4caa-ab37-c79915505b80', 'multiverseId': 593239}, 'multiverseid': 593239}, {'name': '傲慢な完全者', 'text': 'あなたがコントロールしていてこれでないすべてのエルフは＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\\n{G},{T}：緑の１/１のエルフ・戦士・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — エルフ・戦士', 'flavor': '美が基準の文明では、最も美しいものは神と崇められる。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593360&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b1e54ec2-8447-4b5b-a7ed-ba410c4a8561', 'multiverseId': 593360}, 'multiverseid': 593360}, {'name': '骄傲至美', 'text': '由你操控的其他妖精得+1/+1。\\n{G}，{T}：派出一个1/1绿色妖精／战士衍生生物。', 'type': '生物 ～妖精／战士', 'flavor': '在美感的文化中，会将最美丽者崇敬如神。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593723&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd2e9939f-e107-426e-8d5a-8d8bf2f06b7b', 'multiverseId': 593723}, 'multiverseid': 593723}]", "[{'name': 'Gebirge', 'type': 'Standardland — Gebirge', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597769&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'de0f6c46-699e-4314-b470-510119095f0a', 'multiverseId': 597769}, 'multiverseid': 597769}, {'name': 'Montaña', 'type': 'Tierra básica — Montaña', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597784&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fde7e166-cbf2-4e4f-b779-72fdfa0b9f45', 'multiverseId': 597784}, 'multiverseid': 597784}, {'name': 'Montagne', 'type': 'Terrain de base : montagne', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597799&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '71dc6534-875d-4e35-b635-c9da8996f064', 'multiverseId': 597799}, 'multiverseid': 597799}, {'name': 'Montagna', 'type': 'Terra Base — Montagna', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597814&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5098768d-845f-40e7-b3eb-b938aaac22da', 'multiverseId': 597814}, 'multiverseid': 597814}, {'name': '山', 'type': '基本土地 — 山', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597829&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f631e8e0-e023-4902-93c3-156a423cf6b3', 'multiverseId': 597829}, 'multiverseid': 597829}, {'name': '山脉', 'type': '基本地 ～山脉', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597874&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd5e8da23-7292-48e9-bea9-2a73ff094251', 'multiverseId': 597874}, 'multiverseid': 597874}]", "[{'name': 'Gebirge', 'type': 'Standardland — Gebirge', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597770&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7d0d000b-0c19-4d82-970c-da01398269a3', 'multiverseId': 597770}, 'multiverseid': 597770}, {'name': 'Montaña', 'type': 'Tierra básica — Montaña', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597785&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '17a0dfc0-d032-4d14-9c8c-d488b0d2fc06', 'multiverseId': 597785}, 'multiverseid': 597785}, {'name': 'Montagne', 'type': 'Terrain de base : montagne', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597800&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a1341560-9338-45fa-8086-608db8a04a35', 'multiverseId': 597800}, 'multiverseid': 597800}, {'name': 'Montagna', 'type': 'Terra Base — Montagna', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597815&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '607f0aca-39d4-4474-b46a-79c6031e63da', 'multiverseId': 597815}, 'multiverseid': 597815}, {'name': '山', 'type': '基本土地 — 山', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597830&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '70694f6d-98b2-445a-8170-afd349a22225', 'multiverseId': 597830}, 'multiverseid': 597830}, {'name': '山脉', 'type': '基本地 ～山脉', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597875&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4146f735-fc48-4181-936a-2a23470c972e', 'multiverseId': 597875}, 'multiverseid': 597875}]", "[{'name': 'Gebirge', 'type': 'Standardland — Gebirge', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597771&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5841ace6-b679-4187-bd80-34a0ff171dde', 'multiverseId': 597771}, 'multiverseid': 597771}, {'name': 'Montaña', 'type': 'Tierra básica — Montaña', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597786&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '794b104a-fea6-4791-befc-1e5236c13880', 'multiverseId': 597786}, 'multiverseid': 597786}, {'name': 'Montagne', 'type': 'Terrain de base : montagne', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597801&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e401ed68-1110-4874-9ad4-261dd6bc486c', 'multiverseId': 597801}, 'multiverseid': 597801}, {'name': 'Montagna', 'type': 'Terra Base — Montagna', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597816&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8b41be65-f846-41c6-82ad-f96471cb4b2f', 'multiverseId': 597816}, 'multiverseid': 597816}, {'name': '山', 'type': '基本土地 — 山', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597831&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7a3236d7-7cbd-4611-8797-b79c84e3a419', 'multiverseId': 597831}, 'multiverseid': 597831}, {'name': '山脉', 'type': '基本地 ～山脉', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597876&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '806b63b2-1dea-4660-b9b1-604df9f61fc1', 'multiverseId': 597876}, 'multiverseid': 597876}]", '[{\'name\': \'Geblendet vom Scheinwerferlicht\', \'text\': \'Verzaubert eine Kreatur\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur kann nicht angreifen oder blocken.\\nWenn ein Fahrzeug, das du kontrollierst, angreift, schicke die verzauberte Kreatur ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Auf der Jagd nach Äther ignoriert ein Gremlin gerne alle anderen Reize, auch wenn sie eine Gefahr für sein Leben bedeuten.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591570&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3ffe707a-23ca-4520-8cc5-9998b22e00a1\', \'multiverseId\': 591570}, \'multiverseid\': 591570}, {\'name\': \'Deslumbrado por los faros\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura.\\nLa criatura encantada no puede atacar ni bloquear.\\nCuando un Vehículo que controlas ataque, exilia la criatura encantada.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Mientras buscan éter, los gremlins pueden ignorar otros estímulos, incluso los que ponen en peligro sus vidas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591699&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0b604ede-26f8-4ee8-9032-3a77174eb1ff\', \'multiverseId\': 591699}, \'multiverseid\': 591699}, {\'name\': \'Pris dans la lumière\', \'text\': \'Enchanter : créature\\nLa créature enchantée ne peut ni attaquer ni bloquer.\\nQuand un véhicule que vous contrôlez attaque, exilez la créature enchantée.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': "Lorsqu\'il chasse l\'Éther, un gremlin peut ignorer d\'autres stimuli, y compris les menaces sur sa vie.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591828&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'74c317e0-eec8-417f-b668-2ede3334022c\', \'multiverseId\': 591828}, \'multiverseid\': 591828}, {\'name\': \'Colto in Flagrante\', \'text\': \'Incanta creatura\\nLa creatura incantata non può attaccare o bloccare.\\nQuando un Veicolo che controlli attacca, esilia la creatura incantata.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Quando è in cerca di etere, un gremlin può arrivare a ignorare altri stimoli, comprese minacce alla sua stessa vita.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591957&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b6036611-f13f-4354-ab47-8f03ad5901c6\', \'multiverseId\': 591957}, \'multiverseid\': 591957}, {\'name\': \'光に目が眩む\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\nエンチャントしているクリーチャーでは攻撃もブロックもできない。\\nあなたがコントロールしている機体１つが攻撃したとき、エンチャントしているクリーチャーを追放する。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': \'霊気を追っているグレムリンは、他の一切が目に入らないようだ。それが自身の生存に係わることであっても。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592086&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b56a1531-74c5-4c22-b67d-97ec0ca8cb5d\', \'multiverseId\': 592086}, \'multiverseid\': 592086}, {\'name\': \'束手就擒\', \'text\': \'结附于生物\\n所结附的生物不能进行攻击或阻挡。\\n当一个由你操控的载具攻击时，放逐所结附的生物。\', \'type\': \'结界 ～灵气\', \'flavor\': \'怪灵在觅夺乙太时往往眼中无他，就连可能危及生命的东西都能视而不见。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592473&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eb670ac4-67a8-4f03-95f9-4770f1f2b39b\', \'multiverseId\': 592473}, \'multiverseid\': 592473}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gedeihende Felsklippe\', \'text\': \'Die Gedeihende Felsklippe kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nSowie die Gedeihende Felsklippe ins Spiel kommt, bestimme eine Farbe außer Rot.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {R} oder ein Mana der bestimmten Farbe.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'Im Laufe der Äonen wurde der Fels abgetragen, sodass die satten Farben im Herzen des Gebirges sichtbar wurden.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596326&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cf0c39fa-6d7a-45a5-86be-a755bed1f4d3\', \'multiverseId\': 596326}, \'multiverseid\': 596326}, {\'name\': \'Risco floreciente\', \'text\': \'El Risco floreciente entra al campo de batalla girado.\\nEn cuanto el Risco floreciente entre al campo de batalla, elige un color que no sea rojo.\\n{T}: Agrega {R} o un maná del color elegido.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'A medida que pasaban los siglos, la roca se iba erosionando, revelando así los bellos colores del corazón de la montaña.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596413&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'77c3f268-51b7-4dee-a82e-a0928ea8ea9e\', \'multiverseId\': 596413}, \'multiverseid\': 596413}, {\'name\': \'Promontoire prospère\', \'text\': \'Le Promontoire prospère arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\nAu moment où le Promontoire prospère arrive sur le champ de bataille, choisissez une couleur autre que le rouge.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {R} ou un mana de la couleur choisie.\', \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "Au fil des éons, la pierre s\'est érodée, révélant les couleurs vives du cœur de la montagne.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596500&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6227203b-4c0d-466e-a18b-29dd4c083efc\', \'multiverseId\': 596500}, \'multiverseid\': 596500}, {\'name\': \'Falesia Florida\', \'text\': \'La Falesia Florida entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpata.\\nMentre la Falesia Florida entra nel campo di battaglia, scegli un colore diverso dal rosso.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {R} o un mana del colore scelto.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'Col passare delle ere, la pietra si erose, rivelando i brillanti colori nel cuore della montagna.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596587&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0d772712-96a4-47cd-8b6c-a410609896e7\', \'multiverseId\': 596587}, \'multiverseid\': 596587}, {\'name\': \'興隆する絶壁\', \'text\': \'興隆する絶壁はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n興隆する絶壁が戦場に出るに際し、赤でない色１色を選ぶ。\\n{T}：{R} か、その選ばれた色のマナ１点を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'悠久の時を経て岩肌は削られ、山の中心の豊かな色彩が露わになった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596674&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ad13daae-33d7-422a-9681-56b0203442d7\', \'multiverseId\': 596674}, \'multiverseid\': 596674}, {\'name\': \'兴旺绝壁\', \'text\': \'兴旺绝壁须横置进战场。\\n于兴旺绝壁进战场时，选择一种红色以外的颜色。\\n{T}：加{R}或一点所选颜色的法术力。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'无数世代过去，石头磨损，显露出高山核心处的丰富颜色。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596935&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'23c75049-d488-4008-8e12-abac30d07e8a\', \'multiverseId\': 596935}, \'multiverseid\': 596935}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gedeihende Heide\', \'text\': \'Die Gedeihende Heide kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nSowie die Gedeihende Heide ins Spiel kommt, bestimme eine Farbe außer Weiß.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {W} oder ein Mana der bestimmten Farbe.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'Die Blüte der Wildblumen richtet sich hier nicht nach den Jahreszeiten, sondern nach den Gezeiten der Magie.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596328&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'08f3970a-2643-409e-bf95-6e55f2e5b41d\', \'multiverseId\': 596328}, \'multiverseid\': 596328}, {\'name\': \'Brezal floreciente\', \'text\': \'El Brezal floreciente entra al campo de batalla girado.\\nEn cuanto el Brezal floreciente entre al campo de batalla, elige un color que no sea blanco.\\n{T}: Agrega {W} o un maná del color elegido.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'Las flores salvajes de aquí no florecen según las estaciones, sino según los altibajos y el flujo de la magia.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596415&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'22a7f352-acab-4326-bf4c-1251b689e12d\', \'multiverseId\': 596415}, \'multiverseid\': 596415}, {\'name\': \'Prairie prospère\', \'text\': \'La Prairie prospère arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée.\\nAu moment où la Prairie prospère arrive sur le champ de bataille, choisissez une couleur autre que le blanc.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {W} ou un mana de la couleur choisie.\', \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "Ici, les fleurs sauvages s\'épanouissent non pas au gré des saisons mais au gré des flux de magie.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596502&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a9ccbe15-1362-4a6c-b452-a4afc5940af9\', \'multiverseId\': 596502}, \'multiverseid\': 596502}, {\'name\': \'Brughiera Florida\', \'text\': \'La Brughiera Florida entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpata.\\nMentre la Brughiera Florida entra nel campo di battaglia, scegli un colore diverso dal bianco.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {W} o un mana del colore scelto.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'I fiori selvatici qui non sbocciano in base alle stagioni, ma seguendo il fluire della magia.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596589&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2da38f37-174d-4361-ada9-a36bf95f208a\', \'multiverseId\': 596589}, \'multiverseid\': 596589}, {\'name\': \'興隆する荒野\', \'text\': \'興隆する荒野はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n興隆する荒野が戦場に出るに際し、白でない色１色を選ぶ。\\n{T}：{W}か、その選ばれた色のマナ１点を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'季節ではなく魔法の干満に従って野生の花が咲く。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596676&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d185fa85-2a01-4df0-9d1f-0336c0ec805e\', \'multiverseId\': 596676}, \'multiverseid\': 596676}, {\'name\': \'兴旺荒地\', \'text\': \'兴旺荒地须横置进战场。\\n于兴旺荒地进战场时，选择一种白色以外的颜色。\\n{T}：加{W}或一点所选颜色的法术力。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'驱使这片野花绽放的，并非季节更替，而是魔力起伏。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596937&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'475e4f69-7145-45f7-819a-a06e9bc95e6b\', \'multiverseId\': 596937}, \'multiverseid\': 596937}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gedeihende Insel\', \'text\': \'Die Gedeihende Insel kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nSowie die Gedeihende Insel ins Spiel kommt, bestimme eine Farbe außer Blau.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {U} oder ein Mana der bestimmten Farbe.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'Alle Wunder der natürlichen Welt in einem einzigen atemberaubenden Mikrokosmos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596329&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'af1481ac-7724-428f-864d-fa48c7892436\', \'multiverseId\': 596329}, \'multiverseid\': 596329}, {\'name\': \'Islote floreciente\', \'text\': \'El Islote floreciente entra al campo de batalla girada.\\nEn cuanto el Islote floreciente entre al campo de batalla, elige un color que no sea azul.\\n{T}: Agrega {U} o un maná del color elegido.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'Todas las maravillas del mundo natural en un microcosmos asombroso.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596416&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8f5e4239-6951-4856-a673-914bf9028735\', \'multiverseId\': 596416}, \'multiverseid\': 596416}, {\'name\': \'Île prospère\', \'text\': "L\'Île prospère arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée.\\nAu moment où l\'Île prospère arrive sur le champ de bataille, choisissez une couleur autre que le bleu.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {U} ou un mana de la couleur choisie.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': \'Toutes les merveilles de la nature dans un microcosme à couper le souffle.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596503&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5d99d2fe-531b-4cff-83b6-865579ac69c6\', \'multiverseId\': 596503}, \'multiverseid\': 596503}, {\'name\': \'Isola Florida\', \'text\': "L\'Isola Florida entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpata.\\nMentre l\'Isola Florida entra nel campo di battaglia, scegli un colore diverso dal blu.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {U} o un mana del colore scelto.", \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'Tutte le meraviglie della natura in un microcosmo mozzafiato.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596590&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e34973c5-77e6-4ca5-8a7f-940448e0340d\', \'multiverseId\': 596590}, \'multiverseid\': 596590}, {\'name\': \'興隆する島嶼\', \'text\': \'興隆する島嶼はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n興隆する島嶼が戦場に出るに際し、青でない色１色を選ぶ。\\n{T}：{U}か、その選ばれた色のマナ１点を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'自然界のあらゆる驚異がこの美しく小さな世界に詰まっている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596677&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d9028b06-83bf-49f7-a511-7604f3620d70\', \'multiverseId\': 596677}, \'multiverseid\': 596677}, {\'name\': \'兴旺岛屿\', \'text\': \'兴旺岛屿须横置进战场。\\n于兴旺岛屿进战场时，选择一种蓝色以外的颜色。\\n{T}：加{U}或一点所选颜色的法术力。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'于精妙微观世界中，尽览自然伟大奇迹。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596938&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'12468397-9aea-4935-8c32-54f1295cb150\', \'multiverseId\': 596938}, \'multiverseid\': 596938}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gedeihender Hain\', \'text\': \'Der Gedeihende Hain kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nSowie der Gedeihende Hain ins Spiel kommt, bestimme eine Farbe außer Grün.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {G} oder ein Mana der bestimmten Farbe.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'Menschlichen Blicken entzogen, schwirren Vögel in einem verborgenen Paradies zwischen farbenfrohen Blüten umher.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596327&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b705b5d7-da18-49c2-af9d-62bcbbdf203c\', \'multiverseId\': 596327}, \'multiverseid\': 596327}, {\'name\': \'Arboleda floreciente\', \'text\': \'La Arboleda floreciente entra al campo de batalla girada.\\nEn cuanto la Arboleda floreciente entre al campo de batalla, elige un color que no sea verde.\\n{T}: Agrega {G} o un maná del color elegido.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'Lejos de la mirada de los humanos, los pájaros revolotean entre flores en un paraíso oculto.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596414&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ee0a8e22-9dab-419e-8944-e6a3fb38d11f\', \'multiverseId\': 596414}, \'multiverseid\': 596414}, {\'name\': \'Bosquet prospère\', \'text\': \'Le Bosquet prospère arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\nAu moment où le Bosquet prospère arrive sur le champ de bataille, choisissez une couleur autre que le vert.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {G} ou un mana de la couleur choisie.\', \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "À l\'abri des regards humains, les oiseaux papillonnent entre les fleurs luxuriantes d\'un paradis caché.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596501&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ccebd86b-0ada-421a-bf46-51d4174ad784\', \'multiverseId\': 596501}, \'multiverseid\': 596501}, {\'name\': \'Boschetto Florido\', \'text\': \'Il Boschetto Florido entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\nMentre il Boschetto Florido entra nel campo di battaglia, scegli un colore diverso dal verde.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {G} o un mana del colore scelto.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'Al riparo da occhi umani, gli uccellini guizzano tra boccioli dai colori vivaci in un paradiso nascosto.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596588&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'63cfc4a4-4cd0-4f11-b0d8-1417212fc903\', \'multiverseId\': 596588}, \'multiverseid\': 596588}, {\'name\': \'興隆する木立\', \'text\': \'興隆する木立はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n興隆する木立が戦場に出るに際し、緑でない色１色を選ぶ。\\n{T}：{G}か、その選ばれた色１色のマナ１点を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'人の目に触れないこの知られざる楽園で、鳥たちは鮮やかな花々の間を飛び交っている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596675&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'36eff7e5-edd6-4a7d-8d87-9d5e0204edd3\', \'multiverseId\': 596675}, \'multiverseid\': 596675}, {\'name\': \'兴旺树丛\', \'text\': \'兴旺树丛须横置进战场。\\n于兴旺树丛进战场时，选择一种绿色以外的颜色。\\n{T}：加{G}或一点所选颜色的法术力。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'人类视界之外还有一片隐蔽乐土，此处鸟语花香，绿意盎然。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596936&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'882deb48-9baf-4827-b5c6-64303fb03e31\', \'multiverseId\': 596936}, \'multiverseid\': 596936}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gedeihender Jäger\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Gedeihende Jäger ins Spiel kommt, erhältst du Lebenspunkte in Höhe der höchsten Widerstandskraft unter den anderen Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, dazu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Wolf, Geist\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich würde ihn mit Ehre in meinem Rudel willkommen heißen."\\n—Arlinn Kord\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592861&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e74003af-51cc-4ba0-bcb1-d83ba44f6c97\', \'multiverseId\': 592861}, \'multiverseid\': 592861}, {\'name\': \'Cazadora floreciente\', \'text\': \'Cuando la Cazadora floreciente entre al campo de batalla, ganas una cantidad de vidas igual a la mayor resistencia entre las otras criaturas que controlas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Espíritu lobo\', \'flavor\': \'"Sería un honor aceptarla en mi manada".\\n—Arlinn Kord\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592982&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5c744820-3b33-488e-b6d0-9a40383df208\', \'multiverseId\': 592982}, \'multiverseid\': 592982}, {\'name\': \'Chasseur florissant\', \'text\': "Quand le Chasseur florissant arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous gagnez un nombre de points de vie égal à l\'endurance la plus élevée parmi les autres créatures que vous contrôlez.", \'type\': \'Créature : loup et esprit\', \'flavor\': "« Ce serait un honneur pour moi de l\'accueillir dans ma meute. »\\n—Arlinn Kord", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593103&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'abe7edf2-dde8-4b14-8852-12c370f3c02e\', \'multiverseId\': 593103}, \'multiverseid\': 593103}, {\'name\': \'Cacciatore Florido\', \'text\': \'Quando il Cacciatore Florido entra nel campo di battaglia, guadagni punti vita pari alla costituzione maggiore tra le altre creature che controlli.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Spirito Lupo\', \'flavor\': \'"Sarei onorata di accoglierlo nel mio branco."\\n—Arlinn Kord\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593224&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'01388b3a-89d6-4d9b-b22f-15b948ee8fe1\', \'multiverseId\': 593224}, \'multiverseid\': 593224}, {\'name\': \'繁茂の狩り手\', \'text\': \'繁茂の狩り手が戦場に出たとき、あなたは、あなたがコントロールしていてこれでないクリーチャーのタフネスの中の最大値に等しい点数のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 狼・スピリット\', \'flavor\': \'「彼女を名誉をもって私の群れに歓迎するわ。」\\n――アーリン・コード\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593345&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1e3c76d3-7e20-4e0c-87a6-70dc2843b0be\', \'multiverseId\': 593345}, \'multiverseid\': 593345}, {\'name\': \'滋养猎狼\', \'text\': \'当滋养猎狼进战场时，你获得若干生命，其数量等同于由你操控之其他生物中的最大防御力。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～狼／精怪\', \'flavor\': \'「她倘愿加入我的狼群，便是我莫大荣耀。」\\n～雅琳珂德\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593708&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a4385358-6fb3-48e1-b559-4fdc289ccabf\', \'multiverseId\': 593708}, \'multiverseid\': 593708}]', "[{'name': 'Gedeihendes Moor', 'text': 'Das Gedeihende Moor kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nSowie das Gedeihende Moor ins Spiel kommt, bestimme eine Farbe außer Schwarz.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {B} oder ein Mana der bestimmten Farbe.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': 'Schönheit zeigt sich denen, die sie erkennen können, an merkwürdigen Orten.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596330&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '488d4a50-2cdb-45d6-86dc-18c063a782f8', 'multiverseId': 596330}, 'multiverseid': 596330}, {'name': 'Páramo floreciente', 'text': 'El Páramo floreciente entra al campo de batalla girado.\\nEn cuanto el Páramo floreciente entre al campo de batalla, elige un color que no sea negro.\\n{T}: Agrega {B} o un maná del color elegido.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': 'Los que ven la belleza son capaces de vislumbrarla en lugares extraños.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596417&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '67945bd5-5809-4de5-af58-00b2b27de04b', 'multiverseId': 596417}, 'multiverseid': 596417}, {'name': 'Lande prospère', 'text': 'La Lande prospère arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée.\\nAu moment où la Lande prospère arrive sur le champ de bataille, choisissez une couleur autre que le noir.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {B} ou un mana de la couleur choisie.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': 'La beauté perle dans des endroits étranges pour ceux qui peuvent la voir.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596504&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '268c5510-aeec-4390-ac8d-5491ee5f6233', 'multiverseId': 596504}, 'multiverseid': 596504}, {'name': 'Landa Florida', 'text': 'La Landa Florida entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpata.\\nMentre la Landa Florida entra nel campo di battaglia, scegli un colore diverso dal nero.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {B} o un mana del colore scelto.', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': 'La bellezza si manifesta in luoghi insoliti per chi ha occhi per vederla.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596591&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '00dd159c-00af-48b3-8152-df5cbd462dc6', 'multiverseId': 596591}, 'multiverseid': 596591}, {'name': '興隆する湿地帯', 'text': '興隆する湿地帯はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n興隆する湿地帯が戦場に出るに際し、黒でない色１色を選ぶ。\\n{T}：{B}か、その選ばれた色のマナ１点を加える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': '奇妙な場所にも美は存在し、見る目を持つものを楽しませる。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596678&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3d22d8a9-a792-4e90-92a0-a07ff176c6a2', 'multiverseId': 596678}, 'multiverseid': 596678}, {'name': '兴旺湿地', 'text': '兴旺湿地须横置进战场。\\n于兴旺湿地进战场时，选择一种黑色以外的颜色。\\n{T}：加{B}或一点所选颜色的法术力。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': '此地美景尽藏奇异之处，唯眼光独到者方能得见。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596939&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1b8302dd-6a7e-418c-9e0c-6569acf96a23', 'multiverseId': 596939}, 'multiverseid': 596939}]", "[{'name': 'Gedenkstätte der Genialität', 'text': 'Die Gedenkstätte der Genialität kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {U}.\\n{4}{U}, {T}, opfere die Gedenkstätte der Genialität: Ziehe zwei Karten.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596319&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e1e62050-c7a8-4ca3-921d-aed4dd6c9f7c', 'multiverseId': 596319}, 'multiverseid': 596319}, {'name': 'Monumento al ingenio', 'text': 'El Monumento al ingenio entra al campo de batalla girado.\\n{T}: Agrega {U}.\\n{4}{U}, {T}, sacrificar el Monumento al ingenio: Roba dos cartas.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596406&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ea528d52-9fec-4cb8-9a1e-429fa713e42d', 'multiverseId': 596406}, 'multiverseid': 596406}, {'name': 'Mémorial au génie', 'text': 'Le Mémorial au génie arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {U}.\\n{4}{U}, {T}, sacrifiez le Mémorial au génie : Piochez deux cartes.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596493&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'db05df79-b5e9-46a0-8779-e3eb69f035a0', 'multiverseId': 596493}, 'multiverseid': 596493}, {'name': 'Monumento al Genio', 'text': 'Il Monumento al Genio entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {U}.\\n{4}{U}, {T}, Sacrifica il Monumento al Genio: Pesca due carte.', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596580&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd2d814da-452a-4352-ad11-9d9394b3e81d', 'multiverseId': 596580}, 'multiverseid': 596580}, {'name': '天才の記念像', 'text': '天才の記念像はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{U}を加える。\\n{4}{U},{T},天才の記念像を生け贄に捧げる：カード２枚を引く。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596667&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4869ad6e-01e1-4a7a-b06c-e5492e2ae10f', 'multiverseId': 596667}, 'multiverseid': 596667}, {'name': '智行纪念碑', 'text': '智行纪念碑须横置进战场。\\n{T}：加{U}。\\n{4}{U}，{T}，牺牲智行纪念碑：抓两张牌。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596928&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd8d0967d-bb2f-4be9-abca-11344ac85eb2', 'multiverseId': 596928}, 'multiverseid': 596928}]", '[{\'name\': \'Gefährliche Reise\', \'text\': \'Bringe eine bleibende Karte deiner Wahl, die kein Land ist und die du nicht kontrollierst, auf die Hand ihres Besitzers zurück. Falls ihr Manabetrag 2 oder weniger war, wende Hellsicht 2 an. (Schaue dir die obersten zwei Karten deiner Bibliothek an. Du kannst eine beliebige Anzahl davon unter deine Bibliothek legen und den Rest in beliebiger Reihenfolge oben darauf.)\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Zum ersten Mal in ihrem Leben versuchte Vraska, einen Tod zu verhindern.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595260&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f304a974-0a67-4026-a6d1-1bba8130eded\', \'multiverseId\': 595260}, \'multiverseid\': 595260}, {\'name\': \'Travesía peligrosa\', \'text\': \'Regresa el permanente objetivo que no sea tierra que no controles a la mano de su propietario. Si su valor de maná era de 2 o menos, adivina 2. (Mira las dos primeras cartas de tu biblioteca, luego pon cualquier cantidad de ellas en el fondo de tu biblioteca y el resto en la parte superior en cualquier orden.)\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Por primera vez en su vida, Vraska intentó evitar la muerte.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595368&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'372dd20f-a696-4920-9b1b-1b07be9e5579\', \'multiverseId\': 595368}, \'multiverseid\': 595368}, {\'name\': \'Voyage périlleux\', \'text\': "Renvoyez un permanent non-terrain ciblé que vous ne contrôlez pas dans la main de son propriétaire. Si sa valeur de mana était inférieure ou égale à 2, regard 2. (Regardez les deux cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Mettez n\'importe quel nombre d\'entre elles au-dessous de votre bibliothèque et le reste, au-dessus, dans l\'ordre de votre choix.)", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "Pour la première fois de sa vie, Vraska tenta d\'empêcher un décès.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595476&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'175ac1b7-04d0-4a38-8637-864635ffaa43\', \'multiverseId\': 595476}, \'multiverseid\': 595476}, {\'name\': \'Viaggio Pericoloso\', \'text\': \'Fai tornare un permanente non terra bersaglio che non controlli in mano al suo proprietario. Se il suo valore di mana era pari o inferiore a 2, profetizza 2. (Guarda le prime due carte del tuo grimorio, poi mettine un qualsiasi numero in fondo al tuo grimorio e le altre in cima in qualsiasi ordine.)\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'Per la prima volta nella sua vita, Vraska cercò di impedire la morte di qualcuno.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595584&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ab521fca-157f-4f7f-925a-f2a096bcbfb6\', \'multiverseId\': 595584}, \'multiverseid\': 595584}, {\'name\': \'危険な航海\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしておらず土地でもないパーマネント１つを対象とする。それをオーナーの手札に戻す。それのマナ総量が２以下なら、占術２を行う。（あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード２枚を見て、そのうちの望む枚数をあなたのライブラリーの一番下に、残りを一番上に、それぞれ望む順番で置く。）\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'生まれて初めて、ヴラスカは死を阻もうとした。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595692&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e6de802b-2a7e-4c8a-8620-a560fc40f46e\', \'multiverseId\': 595692}, \'multiverseid\': 595692}, {\'name\': \'险恶旅程\', \'text\': \'将目标不由你操控的非地永久物移回其拥有者手上。如果其法术力值等于或小于2，则占卜2。（检视你牌库顶的两张牌，然后将其中任意数量的牌以任意顺序置于你牌库底，其余则以任意顺序置于你牌库顶。）\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'这是瓦丝卡有生以来第一次想要救人活命。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596016&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'658d6ef8-a357-4bc4-9218-423715e0918d\', \'multiverseId\': 596016}, \'multiverseid\': 596016}]', '[{\'name\': \'Geheul der Jagd\', \'text\': \'Aufblitzen\\nVerzaubert eine Kreatur\\nWenn das Geheul der Jagd ins Spiel kommt und falls die verzauberte Kreatur ein Wolf oder Werwolf ist, enttappe die Kreatur.\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur erhält +2/+2 und hat Wachsamkeit.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592871&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cf9f0a5b-fe42-40d3-8eaf-0b64bc3e9d82\', \'multiverseId\': 592871}, \'multiverseid\': 592871}, {\'name\': \'Aullido de la caza\', \'text\': \'Destello.\\nEncantar criatura.\\nCuando el Aullido de la caza entre al campo de batalla, si la criatura encantada es un Lobo o Licántropo, endereza esa criatura.\\nLa criatura encantada obtiene +2/+2 y tiene la habilidad de vigilancia.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592992&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'516f701b-663b-47ba-aac9-95e61c7ebf77\', \'multiverseId\': 592992}, \'multiverseid\': 592992}, {\'name\': \'Hurlement de la chasse\', \'text\': \'Flash\\nEnchanter : créature\\nQuand le Hurlement de la chasse arrive sur le champ de bataille, si la créature enchantée est un loup ou un loup-garou, dégagez cette créature.\\nLa créature enchantée gagne +2/+2 et a la vigilance.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593113&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2fae5576-0698-40ac-942c-fef9e5265950\', \'multiverseId\': 593113}, \'multiverseid\': 593113}, {\'name\': \'Ululato di Caccia\', \'text\': "Lampo\\nIncanta creatura\\nQuando l\'Ululato di Caccia entra nel campo di battaglia, se la creatura incantata è un Lupo o un Mannaro, STAPpa quella creatura.\\nLa creatura incantata prende +2/+2 e ha cautela.", \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593234&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c5ba043d-c94b-4e46-ad21-25abd3bec937\', \'multiverseId\': 593234}, \'multiverseid\': 593234}, {\'name\': \'狩りの遠吠え\', \'text\': \'瞬速\\nエンチャント（クリーチャー）\\n狩りの遠吠えが戦場に出たとき、エンチャントしているクリーチャーが狼や狼男である場合、そのクリーチャーをアンタップする。\\nエンチャントしているクリーチャーは＋２/＋２の修整を受け警戒を持つ。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593355&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8587b3fd-f109-418c-806c-2bf9706363f5\', \'multiverseId\': 593355}, \'multiverseid\': 593355}, {\'name\': \'狩猎威嚎\', \'text\': \'闪现\\n结附于生物\\n当狩猎威嚎进战场时，若所结附的生物是狼或狼人，则重置该生物。\\n所结附的生物得+2/+2且具有警戒异能。\', \'type\': \'结界 ～灵气\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593718&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ece398db-71ef-4649-8919-96a4f7a924cb\', \'multiverseId\': 593718}, \'multiverseid\': 593718}]', '[{\'name\': \'Geheul des Raubtiers\', \'text\': \'Erzeuge einen 2/2 grünen Wolf-Kreaturenspielstein.\\nMorbide — Erzeuge stattdessen drei 2/2 grüne Wolf-Kreaturenspielsteine, falls in diesem Zug eine Kreatur gestorben ist.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Und Muzzio behauptet, meine Argumente haben keinen Biss."\\n—Selvala, Waldläuferin des Tieflandes\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592907&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'21ea1435-240b-4b1b-bfb0-4db0a29ed6d4\', \'multiverseId\': 592907}, \'multiverseid\': 592907}, {\'name\': \'Aullido del depredador\', \'text\': \'Crea una ficha de criatura Lobo verde 2/2.\\nNecrario — Si una criatura murió este turno, en vez de eso, crea tres fichas de criatura Lobo verdes 2/2.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Y dice Muzzio que no hace falta armarse hasta los dientes".\\n—Selvala, exploradora de las tierras bajas\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593028&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9173f155-e3a1-4989-8fa1-b93e47353cbb\', \'multiverseId\': 593028}, \'multiverseid\': 593028}, {\'name\': \'Hurlement du prédateur\', \'text\': \'Créez un jeton de créature 2/2 verte Loup.\\nMorbidité — Créez trois jetons de créature 2/2 verte Loup à la place si une créature est morte ce tour-ci.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« Et Muzzio ose dire que mes arguments manquent de mordant. »\\n—Selvala, ranger des Basses-terres\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593149&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2fffa28f-34c1-46f3-aa20-48ce7ef1d002\', \'multiverseId\': 593149}, \'multiverseid\': 593149}, {\'name\': \'Ululato del Predatore\', \'text\': \'Crea una pedina creatura Lupo 2/2 verde.\\nMorboso — Crea invece tre pedine creatura Lupo 2/2 verdi se è morta una creatura in questo turno.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"E Muzzio dice che i miei argomenti mancano di mordente."\\n—Selvala, ranger dei Bassopiani\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593270&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a0a232eb-e42a-4b3e-b042-d5090612dbc0\', \'multiverseId\': 593270}, \'multiverseid\': 593270}, {\'name\': \'捕食者の雄叫び\', \'text\': \'緑の２/２の狼・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\\n陰鬱 ― このターンにクリーチャーが死亡していたなら、代わりに緑の２/２の狼・クリーチャー・トークン３体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「ムッツィオに言わせれば、私の主張には実効性が無いらしい。」\\n――下層地のレインジャー、セルヴァラ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593391&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'da91fa4d-a9e5-4747-bef7-47da78bcc7a4\', \'multiverseId\': 593391}, \'multiverseid\': 593391}, {\'name\': \'掠食者嚎叫\', \'text\': \'派出一个2/2绿色的狼衍生生物。\\n丧心～如果本回合中有生物死去，则改为派出三个2/2绿色的狼衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「穆奇奥竟说我的论据还不够尖锐。」\\n～下城护林者塞瓦拉\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593754&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fc335165-c0ca-4399-8409-4606403f3f7e\', \'multiverseId\': 593754}, \'multiverseid\': 593754}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gehärtete Veteranin\', \'text\': \'{W}, {T}: Lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, auf der mindestens eine +1/+1-Marke liegt.\\n{4}{W}{W}, {T}: Lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf eine Kreatur deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Ritter\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich trage mein Schwert bereits länger als du lebst. Ich würde meinen Eid für keinen Frieden oder Komfort in der Welt aufgeben."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591660&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'545ff986-51de-4353-b8f5-4213c15e50c8\', \'multiverseId\': 591660}, \'multiverseid\': 591660}, {\'name\': \'Veterana templada\', \'text\': \'{W}, {T}: Pon un contador +1/+1 sobre la criatura objetivo con un contador +1/+1 sobre ella.\\n{4}{W}{W}, {T}: Pon un contador +1/+1 sobre la criatura objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Caballero humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Llevo blandiendo una espada desde antes de que nacieras. No rompería mi juramento ni por toda la paz y consuelo del mundo".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591789&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'df3d08ec-bdf4-4b28-8e3e-20707e5a06ea\', \'multiverseId\': 591789}, \'multiverseid\': 591789}, {\'name\': \'Vétérane irascible\', \'text\': \'{W}, {T} : Mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur une créature ciblée avec un marqueur +1/+1 sur elle.\\n{4}{W}{W}, {T} : Mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur une créature ciblée.\', \'type\': \'Créature : humain et chevalier\', \'flavor\': \'« Je portais déjà une épée avant ta naissance. Je ne romprais mon serment pour rien au monde, pas même pour la paix et le confort. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591918&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dd40e4d6-a013-42f0-8ba8-ab8a7aa4e525\', \'multiverseId\': 591918}, \'multiverseid\': 591918}, {\'name\': \'Veterana Temprata\', \'text\': \'{W}, {T}: Metti un segnalino +1/+1 su una creatura bersaglio con un segnalino +1/+1.\\n{4}{W}{W}, {T}: Metti un segnalino +1/+1 su una creatura bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Cavaliere Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Brandisco la spada da ben prima della tua nascita. Non rinuncerei al mio giuramento nemmeno per tutta la serenità e il benessere del mondo."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592047&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cef4a571-7734-4b4b-b527-345934ab156c\', \'multiverseId\': 592047}, \'multiverseid\': 592047}, {\'name\': \'鍛え抜かれた古参兵\', \'text\': \'{W}, {T}：＋１/＋１カウンターが置かれているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。それの上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。\\n{4}{W}{W}, {T}：クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それの上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・騎士\', \'flavor\': \'「こっちはね、あんたが生まれる前からずっと剣を持ち歩いてるのよ。世界に平和と安心をもたらすと誓ったからには諦めないわ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592176&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8c0a1ca5-c525-48ea-be6a-e9b7ec5ab0a9\', \'multiverseId\': 592176}, \'multiverseid\': 592176}, {\'name\': \'蓄势老兵\', \'text\': \'{W}，{T}：在目标其上有+1/+1指示物的生物上放置一个+1/+1指示物。\\n{4}{W}{W}，{T}：在目标生物上放置一个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／骑士\', \'flavor\': \'「在你出世之前，我已佩剑征战四方。就算你拿全世界最安逸的生活来引诱我，我也不会背弃誓言。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592563&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8b12a422-9dbf-4d87-a42c-de497b45aaae\', \'multiverseId\': 592563}, \'multiverseid\': 592563}]', '[{\'name\': \'Geist der Toten\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nStärke und Widerstandskraft des Geists der Toten sind gleich der Anzahl an Kreaturenkarten in deinem Friedhof.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Geist\', \'flavor\': \'„Nicht schon wieder."\\n—Hans\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594118&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0b074baa-3c12-48d2-8412-1ae09e8bd838\', \'multiverseId\': 594118}, \'multiverseid\': 594118}, {\'name\': \'Aparecido\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nTanto la fuerza como la resistencia del Aparecido son iguales a la cantidad de cartas de criatura que haya en tu cementerio.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Espíritu\', \'flavor\': \'"Otra vez no".\\n—Hans\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594235&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'10768e0b-3a08-49cb-a159-4a0a424ea8cd\', \'multiverseId\': 594235}, \'multiverseid\': 594235}, {\'name\': \'Revenant\', \'text\': "Vol\\nLa force et l\'endurance du Revenant sont chacune égales au nombre de cartes de créature dans votre cimetière.", \'type\': \'Créature : esprit\', \'flavor\': \'« Pas encore. »\\n—Hans\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594352&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'83f64beb-50fc-49dc-a93c-d0adb5896674\', \'multiverseId\': 594352}, \'multiverseid\': 594352}, {\'name\': \'Redivivo\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nLa forza e la costituzione del Redivivo sono pari al numero di carte creatura nel tuo cimitero.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Spirito\', \'flavor\': \'"Non di nuovo."\\n—Hans\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594469&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f06a3c53-9c3e-4ffa-94a6-f1dc15eb51c2\', \'multiverseId\': 594469}, \'multiverseid\': 594469}, {\'name\': \'黄泉からの帰還者\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n黄泉からの帰還者のパワーとタフネスはそれぞれ、あなたの墓地にあるクリーチャー・カードの枚数に等しい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — スピリット\', \'flavor\': \'「えっ、またか。」\\n――ハンス\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594586&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c5a2f2ac-e8fd-4e65-9337-25c1c4c89879\', \'multiverseId\': 594586}, \'multiverseid\': 594586}, {\'name\': \'复仇者\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n复仇者的力量和防御力各等同于你坟墓场中的生物牌数量。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～精怪\', \'flavor\': \'「别又来了。」\\n～汉斯\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594937&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aeba5f6d-5a6b-449c-ae4d-09cf85b8b780\', \'multiverseId\': 594937}, \'multiverseid\': 594937}]', '[{\'name\': \'Geistesblitz des Handwerkers\', \'text\': \'Ziehe zwei Karten. Falls du kein Artefakt kontrollierst, wirf eine Karte ab.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Die Handwerker von Kaladesh streben unablässig nach Perfektion, Fortschritt und der ultimativen Darstellung von Eleganz.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595198&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9f6343d8-0163-49b9-9397-9283692cfdb3\', \'multiverseId\': 595198}, \'multiverseid\': 595198}, {\'name\': \'Epifanía del artífice\', \'text\': \'Roba dos cartas. Si no controlas ningún artefacto, descarta una carta.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Los artífices de Kaladesh buscan sin descanso la perfección, el progreso y la expresión definitiva de la elegancia.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595306&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'56a2e4bd-012d-4104-886d-13cf6bc4793f\', \'multiverseId\': 595306}, \'multiverseid\': 595306}, {\'name\': "Révélation de l\'artificier", \'text\': "Piochez deux cartes. Si vous ne contrôlez aucun artefact, défaussez-vous d\'une carte.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "Les artificiers de Kaladesh aspirent sans relâche à la perfection, au progrès et à l\'expression ultime de l\'élégance.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595414&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a3b56da7-9767-4794-8e5b-74a9d55b1cfc\', \'multiverseId\': 595414}, \'multiverseid\': 595414}, {\'name\': "Rivelazione dell\'Artefice", \'text\': \'Pesca due carte. Se non controlli artefatti, scarta una carta.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': "Gli artefici di Kaladesh aspirano incessantemente alla perfezione, al progresso e all\'espressione suprema dell\'eleganza.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595522&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4fe55042-efd9-44bf-a2b8-eee48ebefdd3\', \'multiverseId\': 595522}, \'multiverseid\': 595522}, {\'name\': \'工匠の天啓\', \'text\': \'カード２枚を引く。あなたがアーティファクトをコントロールしていないなら、カード１枚を捨てる。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'カラデシュの工匠たちは進歩と完璧さ、そして究極の優雅さの表現を求めて絶え間ない努力を惜しまない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595630&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8f429470-9fed-4ebb-8d54-71cf4f22344d\', \'multiverseId\': 595630}, \'multiverseid\': 595630}, {\'name\': \'神器师的顿悟\', \'text\': \'抓两张牌。如果你未操控神器，则弃一张牌。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'卡拉德许神器师为求完美、创新、至上典雅而不断钻研求精。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595954&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'09ef805a-8457-4387-9f02-14ba22503ec2\', \'multiverseId\': 595954}, \'multiverseid\': 595954}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gequälte Seele\', \'text\': \'Die Gequälte Seele kann nicht blocken und nicht geblockt werden.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Geist\', \'flavor\': \'Diejenigen, die im Leben am bitterlichsten über die Welt klagten, müssen den Tod in den Zwischenwelten verbringen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594134&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'63fc5668-a307-4d9b-a74b-e5da51187da7\', \'multiverseId\': 594134}, \'multiverseid\': 594134}, {\'name\': \'Alma atormentada\', \'text\': \'El Alma atormentada no puede bloquear y no puede ser bloqueada.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Espíritu\', \'flavor\': \'Quienes en vida estaban consumidos por la amargura y la ira son condenados a vagar por los reinos del submundo tras su muerte.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594251&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6810dfa3-bcac-4838-ae65-8e72cdb94b45\', \'multiverseId\': 594251}, \'multiverseid\': 594251}, {\'name\': \'Âme tourmentée\', \'text\': "L\'Âme tourmentée ne peut pas bloquer et ne peut pas être bloquée.", \'type\': \'Créature : esprit\', \'flavor\': \'Les plus amèrement furieux envers le monde quand ils étaient en vie sont condamnés à hanter les royaumes souterrains dans la mort.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594368&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a7b53bdb-5c11-4e88-b263-4e1579b79e5d\', \'multiverseId\': 594368}, \'multiverseid\': 594368}, {\'name\': \'Anima Tormentata\', \'text\': "L\'Anima Tormentata non può bloccare e non può essere bloccata.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Spirito\', \'flavor\': \'Coloro che hanno inveito con più astio contro il mondo in vita sono condannati a vagare negli inferi da morti.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594485&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a96a6419-200d-46ff-9b02-9263f4387851\', \'multiverseId\': 594485}, \'multiverseid\': 594485}, {\'name\': \'苛まれし魂\', \'text\': \'苛まれし魂ではブロックできず、苛まれし魂はブロックされない。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — スピリット\', \'flavor\': \'世界に対して命がけで最も辛辣に怒りをぶつけた者は、冥界を死してさまよう呪いを受ける。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594602&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6a0c4b23-9b9f-487c-aa1e-f275684f11f3\', \'multiverseId\': 594602}, \'multiverseid\': 594602}, {\'name\': \'受虐灵魂\', \'text\': \'受虐灵魂不能进行阻挡，也不能被阻挡。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～精怪\', \'flavor\': \'生时愤恨这世界的人，受诅要在死后游荡阴间。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594953&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a729c454-8fc9-4121-873b-a69593e3432b\', \'multiverseId\': 594953}, \'multiverseid\': 594953}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gesegnete Geister\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nImmer wenn du einen Verzauberungszauber wirkst, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf die Gesegneten Geister.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Geist\', \'flavor\': \'Nicht alle Helden sterben in einer Rüstung.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591564&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a989220a-5d8a-47d1-b56e-fab950db3439\', \'multiverseId\': 591564}, \'multiverseid\': 591564}, {\'name\': \'Espíritus bienaventurados\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nSiempre que lances un hechizo de encantamiento, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre los Espíritus bienaventurados.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Espíritu\', \'flavor\': \'No todos los héroes mueren con armadura.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591693&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'be32898a-ef07-4b09-b72f-ce7a9dff9adc\', \'multiverseId\': 591693}, \'multiverseid\': 591693}, {\'name\': \'Esprits bénis\', \'text\': "Vol\\nÀ chaque fois que vous lancez un sort d\'enchantement, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur les Esprits bénis.", \'type\': \'Créature : esprit\', \'flavor\': \'Les héros ne meurent pas tous en armure.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591822&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7d634f77-07f8-4215-b950-4f6090c715bb\', \'multiverseId\': 591822}, \'multiverseid\': 591822}, {\'name\': \'Spiriti Benedetti\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nOgniqualvolta lanci una magia incantesimo, metti un segnalino +1/+1 sugli Spiriti Benedetti.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Spirito\', \'flavor\': "Non tutti gli eroi muoiono indossando un\'armatura.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591951&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'528c2a23-407b-4678-9dd6-360c66f6244f\', \'multiverseId\': 591951}, \'multiverseid\': 591951}, {\'name\': \'祝福された霊魂\', \'text\': \'飛行\\nあなたがエンチャント・呪文を唱えるたび、祝福された霊魂の上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — スピリット\', \'flavor\': \'すべての英雄が鎧を着て死ぬとはかぎらない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592080&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8fe4b1b0-b279-4b5c-bd5f-a0890259a7c7\', \'multiverseId\': 592080}, \'multiverseid\': 592080}, {\'name\': \'福佑精怪\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n每当你施放结界咒语时，在福佑精怪上放置一个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～精怪\', \'flavor\': \'不是所有英雄都披甲而亡。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592467&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'357054e9-f6c6-46e4-ae25-1276d841f0e7\', \'multiverseId\': 592467}, \'multiverseid\': 592467}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gesegnete Zuflucht\', \'text\': \'Verhindere allen Nicht-Kampfschaden, der dir und Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, zugefügt würde.\\nImmer wenn eine Nichtspielsteinkreatur unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, erzeuge einen 2/2 weißen Einhorn-Kreaturenspielstein.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591563&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0a3ddf6e-cf6c-45dd-99eb-df5f7327c209\', \'multiverseId\': 591563}, \'multiverseid\': 591563}, {\'name\': \'Santuario bendito\', \'text\': \'Prevén todo el daño que no sea de combate que se te fuera a hacer a ti y a las criaturas que controlas.\\nSiempre que una criatura que no sea ficha entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, crea una ficha de criatura Unicornio blanca 2/2.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591692&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'05aef8a4-0da5-4965-a8d0-a555a461d340\', \'multiverseId\': 591692}, \'multiverseid\': 591692}, {\'name\': \'Sanctuaire béni\', \'text\': "Prévenez toutes les blessures non-combat qui devraient être infligées à vous et aux créatures que vous contrôlez.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'une créature non-jeton arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, créez un jeton de créature 2/2 blanche Licorne.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591821&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'21b7c9ff-af03-42e3-81f9-f85e54d3bf48\', \'multiverseId\': 591821}, \'multiverseid\': 591821}, {\'name\': \'Santuario Benedetto\', \'text\': \'Previeni tutto il danno non da combattimento che verrebbe inflitto a te e alle creature che controlli.\\nOgniqualvolta una creatura non pedina entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, crea una pedina creatura Unicorno 2/2 bianca.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591950&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6c1ce81b-e6b8-487d-99d3-3a25b5139242\', \'multiverseId\': 591950}, \'multiverseid\': 591950}, {\'name\': \'祝福された聖域\', \'text\': \'あなたやあなたがコントロールしているクリーチャーが受ける、戦闘ダメージでないすべてのダメージを軽減する。\\nトークンでないクリーチャー１体があなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、白の２/２のユニコーン・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592079&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1f3cdfbf-6b82-48e0-bd16-5357de5e9fcc\', \'multiverseId\': 592079}, \'multiverseid\': 592079}, {\'name\': \'受福圣殿\', \'text\': \'防止将对你和由你操控之生物造成的所有非战斗伤害。\\n每当一个非衍生物的生物在你的操控下进战场时，派出一个2/2白色独角兽衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592466&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'61179211-1e47-4e6a-97f0-255e147bd0c7\', \'multiverseId\': 592466}, \'multiverseid\': 592466}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gesegneter Widerstand\', \'text\': \'Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst, erhält +2/+0 und Lebensverknüpfung bis zum Ende des Zuges. Wenn die Kreatur in diesem Zug stirbt, erzeuge einen 1/1 weißen Geist-Kreaturenspielstein mit Flugfähigkeit.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Wenn ich gehen muss, nehme ich dich mit!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591562&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2e74f532-daec-49f0-9828-441d3937e7c7\', \'multiverseId\': 591562}, \'multiverseid\': 591562}, {\'name\': \'Desafío bendito\', \'text\': \'La criatura objetivo que controlas obtiene +2/+0 y gana la habilidad de vínculo vital hasta el final del turno. Cuando esa criatura muera este turno, crea una ficha de criatura Espíritu blanca 1/1 con la habilidad de volar.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"¡Si este es mi fin, morirán conmigo!".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591691&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a53c6a9b-f30e-435c-8852-ca1b44eb2688\', \'multiverseId\': 591691}, \'multiverseid\': 591691}, {\'name\': \'Défiance bénie\', \'text\': "Une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez gagne +2/+0 et acquiert le lien de vie jusqu\'à la fin du tour. Quand cette créature meurt ce tour-ci, créez un jeton de créature 1/1 blanche Esprit avec le vol.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« Si je dois mourir, je vous emporterai avec moi ! »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591820&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b560573e-2600-4a9f-a473-1fd5c46c46c9\', \'multiverseId\': 591820}, \'multiverseid\': 591820}, {\'name\': \'Audacia Benedetta\', \'text\': \'Una creatura bersaglio che controlli prende +2/+0 e ha legame vitale fino alla fine del turno. Quando quella creatura muore in questo turno, crea una pedina creatura Spirito 1/1 bianca con volare.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Se io cado, vi porterò con me!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591949&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'29fb26c4-7cfa-445f-9481-0de2420b70e9\', \'multiverseId\': 591949}, \'multiverseid\': 591949}, {\'name\': \'祝福された反抗\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは＋２/＋０の修整を受け絆魂を得る。このターンにそのクリーチャーが死亡したとき、飛行を持つ白の１/１のスピリット・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「どうせ逝くなら、お前らも道連れだ！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592078&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7608f24b-7666-4ec9-b804-316e7fe35bab\', \'multiverseId\': 592078}, \'multiverseid\': 592078}, {\'name\': \'受福反抗\', \'text\': \'直到回合结束，目标由你操控的生物得+2/+0且获得系命异能。本回合中，当该生物死去时，派出一个1/1白色，具飞行异能的精怪衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「如果我活不了，就带你一起走！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592465&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b9327753-4f87-4a49-98d0-ef7ffa16b855\', \'multiverseId\': 592465}, \'multiverseid\': 592465}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gesetzesrunen-Vollstrecker\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Tappe eine Kreatur deiner Wahl mit Manabetrag 2 oder mehr.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Soldat\', \'flavor\': \'„Sorgt dafür, dass heute niemand Neu-Prahv betritt oder verlässt. Und informiert mich sofort über alle Planeswalker-Aktivitäten."\\n—Dovin Baan\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591612&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'63bb39de-ed1e-492b-9841-577637712bbc\', \'multiverseId\': 591612}, \'multiverseid\': 591612}, {\'name\': \'Ejecutor de runas de la ley\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Gira la criatura objetivo con valor de maná de 2 o más.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Vigila que nadie entre o salga hoy de Nueva Prahv. Y avísame enseguida de cualquier movimiento de los planeswalkers".\\n—Dovin Baan\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591741&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'126c14b7-9126-4a91-aae7-df22772545e8\', \'multiverseId\': 591741}, \'multiverseid\': 591741}, {\'name\': \'Argousin à la runeloi\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T} : Engagez une créature avec une valeur de mana supérieure ou égale à 2 ciblée.\', \'type\': \'Créature : humain et soldat\', \'flavor\': "« Assurez-vous que personne n\'entre ou ne sorte du Nouveau Prahv aujourd\'hui. Et signalez-moi immédiatement toutes les activités des Planeswalkers. »\\n—Dovin Baàn", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591870&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3a9b92fa-3d9d-4ab1-a74f-a7fd789a9e37\', \'multiverseId\': 591870}, \'multiverseid\': 591870}, {\'name\': \'Esecutore delle Legirune\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: TAPpa una creatura bersaglio con valore di mana pari o superiore a 2.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Soldato Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Controlla che oggi nessuno entri o esca dal Nuovo Prahv. E avvisami immediatamente di qualsiasi attività dei Planeswalker."\\n—Dovin Baan\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591999&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'34cd6b5e-86a6-44a1-a8ab-5130bcb0c6d6\', \'multiverseId\': 591999}, \'multiverseid\': 591999}, {\'name\': \'法ルーンの執行官\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}：マナ総量が２以上であるクリーチャー１体を対象とする。それをタップする。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・兵士\', \'flavor\': \'「今日は新プラーフへ誰も出入りできないよう見張れ。プレインズウォーカーの動きに気付いたら私に知らせろ。」\\n――ドビン・バーン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592128&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'24771cf2-fd93-42ff-9ecf-bbab11db17db\', \'multiverseId\': 592128}, \'multiverseid\': 592128}, {\'name\': \'律印执法官\', \'text\': \'{1}，{T}：横置目标法术力值等于或大于2的生物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'「牢牢守好新布拉夫，今天谁都不许进出。若发现任何鹏洛客活动，立即通知我。」\\n～多温班恩\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592515&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0a57dcd1-6f4d-45b5-a871-e92670ce143d\', \'multiverseId\': 592515}, \'multiverseid\': 592515}]', '[{\'name\': \'Getreue Walküre\', \'text\': \'Du kannst {1}{W} bezahlen und eine Kreaturenkarte aus deinem Friedhof ins Exil schicken, anstatt die Manakosten dieses Zauberspruchs zu bezahlen.\\nFliegend\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Engel, Krieger\', \'flavor\': \'„Nur die Würdigen dürfen passieren."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591655&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'88c6b287-5d24-4813-83f5-e7c30ea74056\', \'multiverseId\': 591655}, \'multiverseid\': 591655}, {\'name\': \'Valkiria denodada\', \'text\': \'Puedes pagar {1}{W} y exiliar una carta de criatura de tu cementerio en vez de pagar el coste de maná de este hechizo.\\nVuela.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero ángel\', \'flavor\': \'"Solo los dignos pueden pasar".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591784&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'23e44a3d-87cd-4953-bc30-414ab991a7e6\', \'multiverseId\': 591784}, \'multiverseid\': 591784}, {\'name\': \'Valkyrie vaillante\', \'text\': \'Vous pouvez payer {1}{W} et exiler une carte de créature de votre cimetière à la place de payer le coût de mana de ce sort.\\nVol\', \'type\': \'Créature : ange et guerrier\', \'flavor\': \'« Seuls les dignes pourront passer. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591913&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d2a35883-5b09-493c-bc73-dcf28b6fdffe\', \'multiverseId\': 591913}, \'multiverseid\': 591913}, {\'name\': \'Valchiria Intrepida\', \'text\': \'Puoi pagare {1}{W} ed esiliare una carta creatura dal tuo cimitero invece di pagare il costo di mana di questa magia.\\nVolare\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Angelo\', \'flavor\': \'"Solo chi ne è degno potrà passare."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592042&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'15801119-720a-493d-996d-1891dcb0002b\', \'multiverseId\': 592042}, \'multiverseid\': 592042}, {\'name\': \'確固たる戦乙女\', \'text\': \'あなたは、この呪文のマナ・コストを支払うのではなく、「{1}{W}を支払い、あなたの墓地にあるクリーチャー・カード１枚を追放する。」を選んでもよい。\\n飛行\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 天使・戦士\', \'flavor\': \'「ここを通れるのは傑士のみ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592171&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6123553f-1b91-41c8-a14a-bc227900546c\', \'multiverseId\': 592171}, \'multiverseid\': 592171}, {\'name\': \'忠贞女武神\', \'text\': \'你可以支付{1}{W}并从你的坟墓场放逐一张生物牌，而不支付此咒语的法术力费用。\\n飞行\', \'type\': \'生物 ～天使／战士\', \'flavor\': \'「唯有英灵方能通过此地。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592558&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'626061d2-9d24-43a2-9bed-005832343e3d\', \'multiverseId\': 592558}, \'multiverseid\': 592558}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gewicht des Gewissens\', \'text\': \'Verzaubert eine Kreatur\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur kann nicht angreifen.\\nTappe zwei ungetappte Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst und die einen Kreaturentyp gemeinsam haben: Schicke die verzauberte Kreatur ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Manchmal ist es wörtlich zu nehmen, wenn das Gewicht der Welt einem auf den Schultern lastet.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591671&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'23ce409c-8cfb-4bbe-8ade-c08a9c9eb21d\', \'multiverseId\': 591671}, \'multiverseid\': 591671}, {\'name\': \'Peso de la conciencia\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura.\\nLa criatura encantada no puede atacar.\\nGirar dos criaturas enderezadas que controlas que compartan un tipo de criatura: Exilia la criatura encantada.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'A veces "el peso del mundo sobre tus hombros" es literal.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591800&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a2a4f85c-14a4-440c-afc6-bd27e4a3e6d0\', \'multiverseId\': 591800}, \'multiverseid\': 591800}, {\'name\': \'Poids de la conscience\', \'text\': \'Enchanter : créature\\nLa créature enchantée ne peut pas attaquer.\\nEngagez deux créatures dégagées que vous contrôlez qui partagent un type de créature : Exilez la créature enchantée.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': "Parfois, avoir le poids du monde sur vos épaules n\'est pas qu\'un sentiment.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591929&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'421f7b6f-e4e6-48db-b580-0d98edd5bb46\', \'multiverseId\': 591929}, \'multiverseid\': 591929}, {\'name\': \'Peso della Coscienza\', \'text\': \'Incanta creatura\\nLa creatura incantata non può attaccare.\\nTAPpa due creature STAPpate che controlli e che condividono un tipo di creatura: Esilia la creatura incantata.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'A volte avere il peso del mondo sulle tue spalle non è solo una metafora.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592058&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7478faad-467b-4b93-9d0a-986ef381cc20\', \'multiverseId\': 592058}, \'multiverseid\': 592058}, {\'name\': \'良心の呵責\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\nエンチャントしているクリーチャーでは攻撃できない。\\nあなたがコントロールしているアンタップ状態のクリーチャー２体を共通のクリーチャー・タイプ１つを持つように選んでタップする：エンチャントしているクリーチャーを追放する。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': \'時には、肩にかかる責任の重さが文字通りの意味になることもある。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592187&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a6023f20-d993-4ddc-9547-69a0da57a4be\', \'multiverseId\': 592187}, \'multiverseid\': 592187}, {\'name\': \'良知重荷\', \'text\': \'结附于生物\\n所结附的生物不能攻击。\\n横置两个由你操控且具共通生物类别的未横置生物：放逐所结附的生物。\', \'type\': \'结界 ～灵气\', \'flavor\': \'有时「双肩如荷世界之重」不只是夸饰法。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592574&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c2aec4fd-7cdf-406f-ad41-cbd2a56a6633\', \'multiverseId\': 592574}, \'multiverseid\': 592574}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gezähmtes Caracal\', \'text\': \'Lebensverknüpfung\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Katze\', \'flavor\': \'Manche Ravnicaner halten es für unter ihrer Würde, ein Schwert zu tragen, und ziehen stattdessen eine mit Zähnen und Klauen bewaffnete Eskorte vor.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591662&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'42563263-b376-4364-8a67-b366ae34b891\', \'multiverseId\': 591662}, \'multiverseid\': 591662}, {\'name\': \'Lince adiestrado\', \'text\': \'Vínculo vital.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Felino\', \'flavor\': \'Algunos habitantes de Rávnica se consideran demasiado dignos para llevar una espada, por lo que en su lugar prefieren una escolta con colmillos y dientes.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591791&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ed7c25f6-04fb-4d33-aaa6-c0c75725a5dc\', \'multiverseId\': 591791}, \'multiverseid\': 591791}, {\'name\': \'Caracal dressé\', \'text\': \'Lien de vie\', \'type\': \'Créature : chat\', \'flavor\': "Certains Ravnicans considèrent comme infamant de porter l\'épée et lui préfèrent une escorte griffue.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591920&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'50575f3c-5662-44f8-afca-365e179f2932\', \'multiverseId\': 591920}, \'multiverseid\': 591920}, {\'name\': \'Lince Addestrata\', \'text\': \'Legame vitale\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Felino\', \'flavor\': \'Certi abitanti di Ravnica considerano umiliante portare la spada e preferiscono una scorta fornita di denti e artigli.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592049&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1ff8cac6-6861-4fda-be16-063939446a94\', \'multiverseId\': 592049}, \'multiverseid\': 592049}, {\'name\': \'訓練されたカラカル\', \'text\': \'絆魂\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 猫\', \'flavor\': \'一部のラヴニカ人は、剣を佩くのは品位に欠けると考えており、牙と爪をもった従者のほうを好んでいる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592178&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2fec84c3-c2f9-4cf2-9f23-4a38db787fb2\', \'multiverseId\': 592178}, \'multiverseid\': 592178}, {\'name\': \'驯良狞猫\', \'text\': \'系命\', \'type\': \'生物 ～猫\', \'flavor\': \'有些拉尼卡的子民认为配剑有失身份，宁愿带着獠牙利爪的护卫。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592565&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'525dea1a-2dac-43fa-9375-cbf6c54aee73\', \'multiverseId\': 592565}, \'multiverseid\': 592565}]', "[{'name': 'Ghirapur-Führer', 'text': '{2}{G}: Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst, kann in diesem Zug von Kreaturen mit Stärke 2 oder weniger nicht geblockt werden.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Elf, Späher', 'flavor': 'Messebesucher waren hocherfreut, dass Ghirapur auch außerhalb des Messegeländes Wunder zu bieten hatte.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592864&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '508f27b4-2434-4947-8404-8b4aee384724', 'multiverseId': 592864}, 'multiverseid': 592864}, {'name': 'Guía de Ghirapur', 'text': '{2}{G}: La criatura objetivo que controlas no puede ser bloqueada por criaturas con fuerza de 2 o menos este turno.', 'type': 'Criatura — Explorador elfo', 'flavor': 'A los visitantes de la feria les gustó descubrir que, incluso fuera de sus terrenos, Ghirapur era una ciudad llena de maravillas.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592985&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'eebe2b82-7b02-4a18-9c00-f27389c54b1a', 'multiverseId': 592985}, 'multiverseid': 592985}, {'name': 'Guide de Ghirapur', 'text': '{2}{G} : Une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez ne peut pas être bloquée par des créatures de force inférieure ou égale à 2 ce tour-ci.', 'type': 'Créature : elfe et éclaireur', 'flavor': 'Les visiteurs furent ravis de découvrir que même en dehors du champ de foire, Ghirapur était une cité merveilleuse.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593106&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '86bef681-d2da-4901-be69-b177552f66ab', 'multiverseId': 593106}, 'multiverseid': 593106}, {'name': 'Guida di Ghirapur', 'text': '{2}{G}: Una creatura bersaglio che controlli non può essere bloccata da creature con forza pari o inferiore a 2 in questo turno.', 'type': 'Creatura — Esploratore Elfo', 'flavor': 'I visitatori furono lieti di scoprire che le meraviglie di Ghirapur non erano confinate tra i banchi della fiera.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593227&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'de8f3b30-f15b-4ee6-b949-20be4a6d5816', 'multiverseId': 593227}, 'multiverseid': 593227}, {'name': 'ギラプールの案内人', 'text': '{2}{G}：あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。このターン、それはパワーが２以下であるクリーチャーにはブロックされない。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — エルフ・スカウト', 'flavor': '博覧会を訪れる人々は、会場外も含めてギラプール全体に満ち溢れる驚きを満喫した。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593348&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ac59aa65-f070-401c-902f-f2b57434b43d', 'multiverseId': 593348}, 'multiverseid': 593348}, {'name': '吉拉波向导', 'text': '{2}{G}：目标由你操控的生物本回合不能被力量等于或小于2的生物阻挡。', 'type': '生物 ～妖精／斥候', 'flavor': '观展的人们惊喜地发现，即便是出了展区，吉拉波这座城市也处处充满神奇。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593711&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ac639e31-a177-4297-9c5b-b7508441775f', 'multiverseId': 593711}, 'multiverseid': 593711}]", '[{\'name\': \'Ghulholer\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Ghulholer ins Spiel kommt, bringe eine per Zufall bestimmte Zombie-Karte aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurück.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Zombie\', \'flavor\': \'„Komm vorbei. Bring deine Brüder mit. Heute Nacht gibt es Frischfleisch."\\n—Jadar, Ghulrufer aus Nefalen\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594075&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'87eec648-741b-41c5-aa48-8006e5beb8f5\', \'multiverseId\': 594075}, \'multiverseid\': 594075}, {\'name\': \'Levantamuertos\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Levantamuertos entre al campo de batalla, regresa una carta de Zombie al azar de tu cementerio a tu mano.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Zombie\', \'flavor\': \'"Ven. Trae a tus hermanos. Esta noche habrá un festín de carne viva".\\n—Jadar, llamamuertos de Nephalia\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594192&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cd8ea309-7b1e-42fb-93df-1ce9ffb6a5c8\', \'multiverseId\': 594192}, \'multiverseid\': 594192}, {\'name\': \'Leveur de goule\', \'text\': \'Quand le Leveur de goule arrive sur le champ de bataille, renvoyez une carte de zombie au hasard depuis votre cimetière dans votre main.\', \'type\': \'Créature : zombie\', \'flavor\': \'« Venez. Invitez vos frères. Ce soir, vous mangerez de la chair fraîche. »\\n—Jadar, meneur de goule de Néphalie\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594309&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9d866ccf-770e-49a0-bf44-ea5581b5e74b\', \'multiverseId\': 594309}, \'multiverseid\': 594309}, {\'name\': \'Radunaghoul\', \'text\': \'Quando il Radunaghoul entra nel campo di battaglia, riprendi in mano una carta Zombie a caso dal tuo cimitero.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Zombie\', \'flavor\': \'"Vieni. Porta i tuoi fratelli. Stanotte, banchetterai con carne fresca."\\n—Jadar, evocaghoul di Nephalia\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594426&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bdbcce97-da1d-4608-8bad-46de7e4a451f\', \'multiverseId\': 594426}, \'multiverseid\': 594426}, {\'name\': \'グール起こし\', \'text\': \'グール起こしが戦場に出たとき、あなたの墓地にあるゾンビ・カード１枚を無作為に選んであなたの手札に戻す。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ゾンビ\', \'flavor\': \'「来たれ。同胞を連れてこい。今宵、お前は生者の肉を楽しむであろう。」\\n――ネファリアのグール呼び、ジャダー\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594543&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5b7108ae-37d7-4bfc-8bd6-9bfed8e7c431\', \'multiverseId\': 594543}, \'multiverseid\': 594543}, {\'name\': \'呼伴食尸鬼\', \'text\': \'当呼伴食尸鬼进战场时，随机将一张灵俑牌从你的坟墓场移回你手上。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～灵俑\', \'flavor\': \'「来。带着你的兄弟。今晚，你可以尝活人的肉。」\\n～涅非利亚尸鬼牧者贾达\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594894&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b0232785-3a32-465a-aa2e-889b3e460add\', \'multiverseId\': 594894}, \'multiverseid\': 594894}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gideon, Champion des Rechts\', \'text\': \'+1: Lege für jede Kreatur, die ein Gegner deiner Wahl kontrolliert, eine Loyalitätsmarke auf Gideon, Champion des Rechts.\\n0: Bis zum Ende des Zuges wird Gideon, Champion des Rechts, eine Mensch-Soldat-Kreatur mit Stärke und Widerstandskraft gleich der Anzahl an Loyalitätsmarken auf ihm und er erhält Unzerstörbarkeit. Er ist immer noch ein Planeswalker. Verhindere allen Schaden, der ihm in diesem Zug zugefügt würde.\\n−15: Schicke alle anderen bleibenden Karten ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Legendärer Planeswalker — Gideon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591595&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9a70c759-ac04-42b8-903c-f2fd18f0664b\', \'multiverseId\': 591595}, \'multiverseid\': 591595}, {\'name\': \'Gideon, campeón de la justicia\', \'text\': \'+1: Pon un contador de lealtad sobre Gideon, campeón de la justicia por cada criatura que controla el oponente objetivo.\\n0: Hasta el final del turno, Gideon, campeón de la justicia se convierte en una criatura Soldado Humano con fuerza y resistencia iguales a la cantidad de contadores de lealtad sobre él y gana la habilidad de indestructible. Sigue siendo un planeswalker. Prevén todo el daño que se le fuera a hacer este turno.\\n−15: Exilia todos los demás permanentes.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker legendario — Gideon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591724&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b6a8aa25-f60b-44b8-8e62-6ff077373f91\', \'multiverseId\': 591724}, \'multiverseid\': 591724}, {\'name\': \'Gideon, Champion de la justice\', \'text\': "+1 : Mettez un marqueur « loyauté » sur Gideon, Champion de la justice pour chaque créature contrôlée par un adversaire ciblé.\\n0 : Jusqu\'à la fin du tour, Gideon, Champion de la justice devient une créature Humain et Soldat dont la force et l\'endurance sont chacune égales au nombre de marqueurs « loyauté » sur lui et il acquiert l\'indestructible. Il est toujours un planeswalker. Prévenez toutes les blessures qui devraient lui être infligées ce tour-ci.\\n-15 : Exilez tous les autres permanents.", \'type\': \'Planeswalker légendaire : Gideon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591853&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9fc720b9-8d2d-43b1-bd92-d29c811e785c\', \'multiverseId\': 591853}, \'multiverseid\': 591853}, {\'name\': \'Gideon, Campione di Giustizia\', \'text\': \'+1: Metti un segnalino fedeltà su Gideon, Campione di Giustizia per ogni creatura controllata da un avversario bersaglio.\\n0: Fino alla fine del turno, Gideon, Campione di Giustizia diventa una creatura Soldato Umano con forza e costituzione pari al numero di segnalini fedeltà su di esso e ha indistruttibile. È ancora un planeswalker. Previeni tutto il danno che gli verrebbe inflitto in questo turno.\\n−15: Esilia tutti gli altri permanenti.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker Leggendario — Gideon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591982&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e60decad-022c-41c4-820a-83e025e9664e\', \'multiverseId\': 591982}, \'multiverseid\': 591982}, {\'name\': \'正義の勇者ギデオン\', \'text\': \'+1：対戦相手１人を対象とする。正義の勇者ギデオンの上に、そのプレイヤーがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体につき１個の忠誠カウンターを置く。\\n0：ターン終了時まで、正義の勇者ギデオンは、パワーとタフネスがそれぞれこれの上にある忠誠カウンターの個数に等しい人間・兵士・クリーチャーになり、破壊不能を得る。これはプレインズウォーカーでもある。このターン、これが受けるすべてのダメージを軽減する。\\n-15：これでないすべてのパーマネントを追放する。\', \'type\': \'伝説のプレインズウォーカー — ギデオン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592111&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'093fe75d-95e3-4260-82bb-1df650d607f9\', \'multiverseId\': 592111}, \'multiverseid\': 592111}, {\'name\': \'正义斗士基定\', \'text\': \'+1：目标对手每操控一个生物，便在正义斗士基定上放置一个忠诚指示物。\\n0：直到回合结束，正义斗士基定成为人类／士兵生物，其力量和防御力各等同于其上的忠诚指示物数量，且获得不灭异能。他仍是鹏洛客。防止本回合中将对他造成的所有伤害。\\n−15：放逐所有其他永久物。\', \'type\': \'传奇鹏洛客 ～基定\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592498&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1297f3a0-3a6c-4e47-b958-ed62a3983599\', \'multiverseId\': 592498}, \'multiverseid\': 592498}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gideons Ordnungshüter\', \'text\': \'{W}, {T}: Tappe eine Kreatur deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Soldat\', \'flavor\': \'„Die Grundlage einer gesetzestreuen Gesellschaft ist sofortige Abschreckung."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591596&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a2609e79-c696-4b8e-b42f-d4bb2119f0b7\', \'multiverseId\': 591596}, \'multiverseid\': 591596}, {\'name\': \'Protector de la ley de Gideon\', \'text\': \'{W}, {T}: Gira la criatura objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado humano\', \'flavor\': \'"La disuasión eficaz es esencial para una sociedad con leyes".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591725&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'752804f5-18dc-40ac-8281-d5c066e8f20a\', \'multiverseId\': 591725}, \'multiverseid\': 591725}, {\'name\': \'Gardeloi de Gideon\', \'text\': \'{W}, {T} : Engagez une créature ciblée.\', \'type\': \'Créature : humain et soldat\', \'flavor\': "« L\'essence d\'une société respectueuse des lois est une prompte dissuasion. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591854&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5efb1009-9541-454e-9591-791293859539\', \'multiverseId\': 591854}, \'multiverseid\': 591854}, {\'name\': \'Disciplinato di Gideon\', \'text\': \'{W}, {T}: TAPpa una creatura bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Soldato Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"L\\\'essenza di una società rispettosa delle leggi è una rapida dissuasione."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591983&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'39188779-83b9-45a8-a6d6-5e69547f51bb\', \'multiverseId\': 591983}, \'multiverseid\': 591983}, {\'name\': \'ギデオンの法の番人\', \'text\': \'{W}, {T}：クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それをタップする。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・兵士\', \'flavor\': \'「善良なる社会の本質は、素早い抑止力だ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592112&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'23033a17-779d-4c0e-818f-9590a89b7e5c\', \'multiverseId\': 592112}, \'multiverseid\': 592112}, {\'name\': \'基定维安兵\', \'text\': \'{W}，{T}：横置目标生物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'「法治社会的精髓就是迅速吓阻。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592499&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'077f4621-83ee-49c8-9808-58fe5253caa8\', \'multiverseId\': 592499}, \'multiverseid\': 592499}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gier nach Blut\', \'text\': \'Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst, kämpft gegen eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du nicht kontrollierst. (Jede fügt der anderen Schadenspunkte in Höhe ihrer Stärke zu.)\\nUmwandlung {1} ({1}, wirf diese Karte ab: Ziehe eine Karte.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Lukkas Gefährtenschaft bot nicht nur Freundschaft, sondern auch die mächtigste Waffe in seinem Arsenal.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590248&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'baee50ee-c5da-459a-8213-4c074237d19a\', \'multiverseId\': 590248}, \'multiverseid\': 590248}, {\'name\': \'A por sangre\', \'text\': \'La criatura objetivo que controlas lucha contra la criatura objetivo que no controlas. (Cada una hace un daño igual a su fuerza a la otra.)\\nCiclo {1}. ({1}, descartar esta carta: Roba una carta.)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'El vínculo de Lukka no solo le proporcionó amistad, sino también el arma más poderosa de su arsenal.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590383&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3adead06-94a7-42e1-a805-6a0e3b00f4e2\', \'multiverseId\': 590383}, \'multiverseid\': 590383}, {\'name\': \'Choix du sang\', \'text\': "Une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez se bat contre une créature ciblée que vous ne contrôlez pas. (Chacune inflige un nombre de blessures égal à sa force à l\'autre.)\\nRecyclage {1} ({1}, défaussez-vous de cette carte : Piochez une carte.)", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Le lien de Lukka lui apportait à la fois un ami et l\'arme la plus puissante de son arsenal.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590518&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a4132613-fc58-42dd-8fe6-a6f693af06cf\', \'multiverseId\': 590518}, \'multiverseid\': 590518}, {\'name\': \'Bramare il Sangue\', \'text\': "Una creatura bersaglio che controlli lotta con una creatura bersaglio che non controlli. (Ogni creatura infligge all\'altra danno pari alla propria forza.)\\nCiclo {1} ({1}, Scarta questa carta: Pesca una carta.)", \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': "Il vincolo di Lukka gli garantiva non solo amicizia, ma anche l\'arma più potente nel suo arsenale.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590653&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6f3484f3-9869-4059-a1eb-49c00bcda6ce\', \'multiverseId\': 590653}, \'multiverseid\': 590653}, {\'name\': \'血の希求\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体とあなたがコントロールしていないクリーチャー１体を対象とする。その前者はその後者と格闘を行う。（それぞれはもう一方に自身のパワーに等しい点数のダメージを与える。）\\nサイクリング{1}（{1}, このカードを捨てる：カード１枚を引く。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'ルーカの絆は、友情だけでなく最強の武器をももたらした。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590788&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'043a6d27-14fc-4078-afc6-3e0dc6135f1c\', \'multiverseId\': 590788}, \'multiverseid\': 590788}, {\'name\': \'直扑活物\', \'text\': \'目标由你操控的生物与目标不由你操控的生物互斗。（它们各向对方造成等同于本身力量的伤害。）\\n循环{1}（{1}，弃掉此牌：抓一张牌。）\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'卢卡的羁绊不仅让他与野兽结下深厚友谊，还让他手中多了一把强大武器。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591193&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'752493ae-0ea1-432d-9a26-e71abab49f0e\', \'multiverseId\': 591193}, \'multiverseid\': 591193}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gigantischer Gibbon\', \'text\': \'Reichweite\\nDie Stärke des Gigantischen Gibbons ist gleich dem höchsten Manabetrag unter den Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Menschenaffe\', \'flavor\': \'„Keine Sorge, Leute. Wir sind hier absolut sicher. Das ist eine Bananenverarbeitungsfabrik."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589651&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'92d354c5-d67b-46be-8f33-aeb25ffa94ce\', \'multiverseId\': 589651}, \'multiverseid\': 589651}, {\'name\': \'Gibón colosal\', \'text\': \'Alcance.\\nLa fuerza del Gibón colosal es igual al mayor valor de maná entre las criaturas que controlas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Simio\', \'flavor\': \'"No se preocupen, estamos a salvo. Está aquí por la planta de procesamiento de plátanos".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589702&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6d9c7bb8-ab07-4f17-830a-96519453e2b1\', \'multiverseId\': 589702}, \'multiverseid\': 589702}, {\'name\': \'Gibbon imposant\', \'text\': \'Portée\\nLa force du Gibbon imposant est égale à la valeur de mana la plus élevée parmi les créatures que vous contrôlez.\', \'type\': \'Créature : grand singe\', \'flavor\': "« Ne vous inquiétez pas. Nous sommes parfaitement en sécurité ici. C\'est une usine de transformation de bananes. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589753&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b14b3797-e586-4e73-b837-885a4e85eed3\', \'multiverseId\': 589753}, \'multiverseid\': 589753}, {\'name\': \'Gibbone Torreggiante\', \'text\': \'Raggiungere\\nLa forza del Gibbone Torreggiante è pari al valore di mana maggiore tra le creature che controlli.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Scimpanzé\', \'flavor\': \'"Non preoccupatevi, gente. Siamo perfettamente al sicuro qui. Quello è un impianto di lavorazione delle banane."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589804&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'12946642-c196-490b-8b9b-18cad8a025ad\', \'multiverseId\': 589804}, \'multiverseid\': 589804}, {\'name\': \'そびえ立つテナガザル\', \'text\': \'到達\\nそびえ立つテナガザルのパワーは、あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャーのマナ総量の中の最大値に等しい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 類人猿\', \'flavor\': \'「皆さん、ご安心ください。ここは安全です。あれはバナナの加工場です。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589855&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'580185db-4b47-45b8-8311-b0527a7598d9\', \'multiverseId\': 589855}, \'multiverseid\': 589855}, {\'name\': \'雄立长臂猿\', \'text\': \'延势\\n雄立长臂猿的力量等同于由你操控之生物中的最大法术力值。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～猿猴\', \'flavor\': \'「大家放心吧。这里绝对安全。那是一座香蕉加工厂。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590008&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8d0392e7-cffe-4dec-8978-7ff8d4581a50\', \'multiverseId\': 590008}, \'multiverseid\': 590008}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gigantoplasma\', \'text\': \'Du kannst das Gigantoplasma als Kopie einer beliebigen Kreatur im Spiel ins Spiel kommen lassen, außer dass es „{X}: Diese Kreatur hat Basis-Stärke und -Widerstandskraft X/X" hat.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Gestaltwandler\', \'flavor\': \'„Mir gefallen Dinge, die alle Erwartungen übertreffen."\\n—Mizzix\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595230&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4533d79d-6d15-4e25-8939-dcf55552aef9\', \'multiverseId\': 595230}, \'multiverseid\': 595230}, {\'name\': \'Gigantoplasma\', \'text\': \'Puedes hacer que el Gigantoplasma entre al campo de batalla como una copia de cualquier criatura en el campo de batalla, excepto que tiene "{X}: Esta criatura tiene una fuerza y resistencia base de X/X".\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Metamorfo\', \'flavor\': \'"Me gustan las cosas que superan las expectativas".\\n—Mízzix\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595338&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'25f25ee0-4de6-43f2-9ff4-e1d6b5c7040e\', \'multiverseId\': 595338}, \'multiverseid\': 595338}, {\'name\': \'Gigantoplasme\', \'text\': "Vous pouvez faire que le Gigantoplasme arrive sur le champ de bataille comme une copie de n\'importe quelle créature sur le champ de bataille, excepté qu\'il a « {X} : Cette créature a une force et une endurance de base de X/X. »", \'type\': \'Créature : changeforme\', \'flavor\': "« J\'aime ce qui va au-delà des attentes. »\\n—Mizzix", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595446&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'397ae0d9-81db-4942-a040-3503894d241b\', \'multiverseId\': 595446}, \'multiverseid\': 595446}, {\'name\': \'Gigantoplasma\', \'text\': \'Puoi far entrare il Gigantoplasma nel campo di battaglia come una copia di qualsiasi creatura sul campo di battaglia, tranne che ha "{X}: Questa creatura ha forza e costituzione base X/X".\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Polimorfo\', \'flavor\': \'"Apprezzo ciò che supera le aspettative."\\n—Mizzix\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595554&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c50ad22c-3602-4ec2-b6b5-68a5bb50637b\', \'multiverseId\': 595554}, \'multiverseid\': 595554}, {\'name\': \'巨体原形質\', \'text\': \'あなたは巨体原形質を、これが「{X}：このクリーチャーは基本のパワーとタフネスがＸ/Ｘになる。」を持つことを除き、戦場に出ているクリーチャー１体のコピーとして戦場に出してもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 多相の戦士\', \'flavor\': \'「こちらの期待を超えるものは、ありがたいわね。」\\n――ミジックス\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595662&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'52c7bc58-d0bf-442f-a329-dbe2af449c92\', \'multiverseId\': 595662}, \'multiverseid\': 595662}, {\'name\': \'庞巨原生质\', \'text\': \'你可以使庞巨原生质当成战场上任一生物的复制品来进入战场，但它具有「{X}：此生物的基础力量与防御力为X/X。」\', \'type\': \'生物 ～变形兽\', \'flavor\': \'「我喜欢远超期望的东西。」\\n～米捷兹\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595986&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b39eaea1-3276-4e2d-9e47-3bcbf7924b0c\', \'multiverseId\': 595986}, \'multiverseid\': 595986}]', '[{\'name\': \'Glimmerhorn-Seeräuber\', \'text\': \'Eile\\nImmer wenn du eine Karte abwirfst, fügt der Glimmerhorn-Seeräuber jedem Gegner 1 Schadenspunkt zu.\\n{1}{R}, wirf eine Karte ab: Ziehe eine Karte. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit nur, falls der Glimmerhorn-Seeräuber angreift.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Minotaurus, Pirat\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590247&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fe9f5bf2-ddd6-44a0-9c38-882eb5d13be4\', \'multiverseId\': 590247}, \'multiverseid\': 590247}, {\'name\': \'Bucanero centelleasta\', \'text\': \'Prisa.\\nSiempre que descartes una carta, el Bucanero centelleasta hace 1 punto de daño a cada oponente.\\n{1}{R}, descartar una carta: Roba una carta. Activa esto solo si el Bucanero centelleasta está atacando.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Pirata minotauro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590382&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7f616d8e-66db-4d16-beda-b900bca6c336\', \'multiverseId\': 590382}, \'multiverseid\': 590382}, {\'name\': \'Boucanier aux cornes rutilantes\', \'text\': "Célérité\\nÀ chaque fois que vous vous défaussez d\'une carte, le Boucanier aux cornes rutilantes inflige 1 blessure à chaque adversaire.\\n{1}{R}, défaussez-vous d\'une carte : Piochez une carte. N\'activez que si le Boucanier aux cornes rutilantes attaque.", \'type\': \'Créature : minotaure et pirate\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590517&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'24074529-4018-4430-b89d-774e5ff955a4\', \'multiverseId\': 590517}, \'multiverseid\': 590517}, {\'name\': \'Bucaniere Cornolucente\', \'text\': \'Rapidità\\nOgniqualvolta scarti una carta, il Bucaniere Cornolucente infligge 1 danno a ogni avversario.\\n{1}{R}, Scarta una carta: Pesca una carta. Attiva solo se il Bucaniere Cornolucente sta attaccando.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Pirata Minotauro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590652&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9831b050-195d-4fb2-89c0-fc76d5cba5c5\', \'multiverseId\': 590652}, \'multiverseid\': 590652}, {\'name\': \'光り角の海賊\', \'text\': \'速攻\\nあなたがカード１枚を捨てるたび、光り角の海賊は各対戦相手にそれぞれ１点のダメージを与える。\\n{1}{R}, カード１枚を捨てる：カード１枚を引く。光り角の海賊が攻撃していなければ起動できない。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ミノタウルス・海賊\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590787&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e467c2bc-63dc-4408-89fd-db0baf7528ca\', \'multiverseId\': 590787}, \'multiverseid\': 590787}, {\'name\': \'烁角海贼\', \'text\': \'敏捷\\n每当你弃一张牌时，烁角海贼向每位对手各造成1点伤害。\\n{1}{R}，弃一张牌：抓一张牌。只能于烁角海贼进行攻击时起动。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～牛头怪／海盗\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591192&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4d4258a0-a252-45e2-9764-b201be301d9b\', \'multiverseId\': 591192}, \'multiverseid\': 591192}]', '[{\'name\': \'Glupschaugensceada\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nDer Glupschaugensceada erhält +2/+0, solange du in diesem Zug zwei oder mehr Karten gezogen hast.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Sceada\', \'flavor\': \'„Der hier braucht jemanden, dem er folgen kann. Schließlich ist jedes seiner Augen größer als sein Gehirn."\\n—Cyla, Fürstin der Lüfte\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595219&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c9853456-25cc-4a7b-9555-a2554c013ff0\', \'multiverseId\': 595219}, \'multiverseid\': 595219}, {\'name\': \'Engendro tarsio\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nEl Engendro tarsio obtiene +2/+0 mientras hayas robado dos o más cartas este turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Draco\', \'flavor\': \'"Este necesita supervisión. Después de todo, sus ojos son más grandes que su cerebro".\\n—Cyla, señora del Nido\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595327&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'26b5f777-bc20-4125-9c73-96f6203cb7d5\', \'multiverseId\': 595327}, \'multiverseid\': 595327}, {\'name\': \'Escouflœil\', \'text\': "Vol\\nL\'Escouflœil gagne +2/+0 tant que vous avez pioché au moins deux cartes ce tour-ci.", \'type\': \'Créature : drakôn\', \'flavor\': "« Celui-ci devra être guidé. Après tout, chacun de ses yeux est plus gros que son cerveau. »\\n—Cyla, seigneuresse de l\'Aérain", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595435&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b0d75a1a-90f9-46cc-8b35-2ad768e43bfa\', \'multiverseId\': 595435}, \'multiverseid\': 595435}, {\'name\': \'Oculonibbio\', \'text\': "Volare\\nL\'Oculonibbio prende +2/+0 se hai pescato due o più carte in questo turno.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Draghetto\', \'flavor\': \'"Questo andrà guidato. Dopotutto, ciascuno dei suoi occhi è più grande del suo cervello."\\n—Cyla, Signora del Nido\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595543&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a162954b-a5bc-4a28-9d3e-62cd3be42c3b\', \'multiverseId\': 595543}, \'multiverseid\': 595543}, {\'name\': \'ミルカイト\', \'text\': \'飛行\\nこのターンにあなたが２枚以上のカードを引いているかぎり、ミルカイトは＋２/＋０の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ドレイク\', \'flavor\': \'「目標を示してやる必要があるな。なんと言っても、こいつの脳は目玉よりも小さいんだから。」\\n――エアリーの長、サイラ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595651&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'56716ff3-90cf-4285-8262-57d0f08e3a29\', \'multiverseId\': 595651}, \'multiverseid\': 595651}, {\'name\': \'巨眼兽\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n只要你本回合已抓两张或更多牌，巨眼兽便得+2/+0。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～龙兽\', \'flavor\': \'「这小家伙需要你为它指往哪边飞。毕竟它的脑子比任何一只眼睛都要小。」\\n～羽巢之王塞拉\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595975&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'417866f5-3fd9-410b-99e1-2076f435375f\', \'multiverseId\': 595975}, \'multiverseid\': 595975}]', '[{\'name\': \'Glänzende Barriere\', \'text\': \'Verteidiger\\nWenn die Glänzende Barriere stirbt, erzeuge einen Schatz-Spielstein. (Er ist ein Artefakt mit „{T}, opfere dieses Artefakt: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe.")\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Mauer\', \'flavor\': \'„Wenn du Gold hast, aber keine Freiheit, ist es nicht mehr wert als Blei."\\n—Angrath\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596272&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a360c5b4-89e9-480e-b6e6-7041e152ce75\', \'multiverseId\': 596272}, \'multiverseid\': 596272}, {\'name\': \'Barrera centelleante\', \'text\': \'Defensor.\\nCuando la Barrera centelleante muera, crea una ficha de Tesoro. (Es un artefacto con "{T}, sacrificar este artefacto: Agrega un maná de cualquier color".)\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Muro\', \'flavor\': \'"El oro sin libertad pesa tanto como el plomo".\\n—Angrath\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596359&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'afb52aeb-1e87-45a2-9e47-1b5396c2fbd7\', \'multiverseId\': 596359}, \'multiverseid\': 596359}, {\'name\': \'Barrière étincelante\', \'text\': "Défenseur\\nQuand la Barrière étincelante meurt, créez un jeton Trésor. (C\'est un artefact avec « {T}, sacrifiez cet artefact : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix. »)", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : mur\', \'flavor\': "« Sans liberté, l\'or est aussi lourd que le plomb. »\\n—Angrath", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596446&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b0f6c04c-1b77-46be-a741-8de776c97493\', \'multiverseId\': 596446}, \'multiverseid\': 596446}, {\'name\': \'Barriera Lucente\', \'text\': \'Difensore\\nQuando la Barriera Lucente muore, crea una pedina Tesoro. (È un artefatto con "{T}, Sacrifica questo artefatto: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore".)\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Muro\', \'flavor\': \'"L\\\'oro senza libertà è come piombo."\\n—Angrath\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596533&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'244bd47d-4c42-4648-8789-df024e5022fa\', \'multiverseId\': 596533}, \'multiverseid\': 596533}, {\'name\': \'煌めく障壁\', \'text\': \'防衛\\n煌めく障壁が死亡したとき、宝物・トークン１つを生成する。（それは、「{T},このアーティファクトを生け贄に捧げる：好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。」を持つアーティファクトである。）\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 壁\', \'flavor\': \'「自由のない黄金よりは鉛の方がましだ。」\\n――アングラス\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596620&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8153925a-c4b0-4ec9-a8a7-cbe2198abd5c\', \'multiverseId\': 596620}, \'multiverseid\': 596620}, {\'name\': \'金光屏障\', \'text\': \'守军\\n当金光屏障死去时，派出一个珍宝衍生物。（它是具有「{T}，牺牲此神器：加一点任意颜色的法术力」的神器。）\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～墙\', \'flavor\': \'「不能自由搬运的黄金，便连铅块都不如。」\\n～安戈斯\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596881&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'117895f9-1c13-4a53-900f-8ba4bfeef073\', \'multiverseId\': 596881}, \'multiverseid\': 596881}]', '[{\'name\': \'Glänzende Rüstung\', \'text\': \'Aufblitzen\\nWenn die Glänzende Rüstung ins Spiel kommt, lege sie an einen Ritter deiner Wahl an, den du kontrollierst.\\nDie ausgerüstete Kreatur erhält +0/+2 und hat Wachsamkeit.\\nAusrüsten {3} ({3}: Lege diese Karte an eine Kreatur deiner Wahl an, die du kontrollierst. Spiele Ausrüsten wie eine Hexerei.)\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Ausrüstung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591649&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'800a3e2a-9cd2-407b-a8db-4fee8b1c8a25\', \'multiverseId\': 591649}, \'multiverseid\': 591649}, {\'name\': \'Armadura brillante\', \'text\': \'Destello.\\nCuando la Armadura brillante entre al campo de batalla, anéxala al Caballero objetivo que controlas.\\nLa criatura equipada obtiene +0/+2 y tiene la habilidad de vigilancia.\\nEquipar {3}. ({3}: Anexa este Equipo a la criatura objetivo que controlas. Activa la habilidad de equipar como un conjuro.)\', \'type\': \'Artefacto — Equipo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591778&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'37618a2c-a601-424f-9760-420db5074a32\', \'multiverseId\': 591778}, \'multiverseid\': 591778}, {\'name\': \'Armure étincelante\', \'text\': "Flash\\nQuand l\'Armure étincelante arrive sur le champ de bataille, attachez-la à un chevalier ciblé que vous contrôlez.\\nLa créature équipée gagne +0/+2 et a la vigilance.\\nÉquipement {3} ({3} : Attachez à une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez. N\'attachez l\'équipement que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.)", \'type\': \'Artefact : équipement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591907&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5bba3ce4-f2ea-4e0b-b929-3ed2b8239b58\', \'multiverseId\': 591907}, \'multiverseid\': 591907}, {\'name\': \'Armatura Lucente\', \'text\': "Lampo\\nQuando l\'Armatura Lucente entra nel campo di battaglia, assegnala a un Cavaliere bersaglio che controlli.\\nLa creatura equipaggiata prende +0/+2 e ha cautela.\\nEquipaggiare {3} ({3}: Assegna a una creatura bersaglio che controlli. Equipaggia solo come una stregoneria.)", \'type\': \'Artefatto — Equipaggiamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592036&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0ce22692-8062-4a68-9a26-9f71beceab92\', \'multiverseId\': 592036}, \'multiverseid\': 592036}, {\'name\': \'輝く鎧\', \'text\': \'瞬速\\n輝く鎧が戦場に出たとき、あなたがコントロールしている騎士１体を対象とする。これをそれにつける。\\n装備しているクリーチャーは＋０/＋２の修整を受け警戒を持つ。\\n装備{3}（{3}：あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。これをそれにつける。装備はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。）\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 装備品\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592165&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1fc01ee8-2a38-46a2-af16-c6f033ab5064\', \'multiverseId\': 592165}, \'multiverseid\': 592165}, {\'name\': \'闪光盔甲\', \'text\': \'闪现\\n当闪光盔甲进战场时，将它贴附在目标由你操控的骑士上。\\n佩带此武具的生物得+0/+2且具有警戒异能。\\n佩带{3}（{3}：贴附在目标由你操控的生物上。只能于法术时机佩带。）\', \'type\': \'神器 ～武具\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592552&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'69a83b14-519c-4973-b7b8-88ea0bbd0d99\', \'multiverseId\': 592552}, \'multiverseid\': 592552}]', '[{\'name\': \'Glühender Ifrit\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Glühende Ifrit stirbt, fügt er dir 2 Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Ifrit, Mönch\', \'flavor\': \'Ifrite fühlen sich zu den Kaisham-Wanderern hingezogen, einer lose organisierten Jeskai-Schule, in der Streiche und Gaunereien dazu dienen, die Glaubenssysteme anderer zu erschüttern.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590308&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ed407fb9-9fdf-4862-b9d4-6cc067f4583a\', \'multiverseId\': 590308}, \'multiverseid\': 590308}, {\'name\': \'Efrit ardiente\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Efrit ardiente muera, te hace 2 puntos de daño.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Monje efrit\', \'flavor\': \'Los efrit suelen unirse a los Errantes Kaisham, una escuela jeskai poco organizada que emplea argucias para desafiar el statu quo y trastocar los sistemas de creencias ajenos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590443&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'02e7d643-5565-485c-b194-323a1dd3709c\', \'multiverseId\': 590443}, \'multiverseid\': 590443}, {\'name\': \'Éfrit incandescent\', \'text\': "Quand l\'Éfrit incandescent meurt, il vous inflige 2 blessures.", \'type\': \'Créature : éfrit et moine\', \'flavor\': "Les éfrits sont attirés par les Pérégrins de Kaïsham, une école jeskaï indépendante où tous les moyens sont bons pour défier le statu quo et bouleverser les systèmes de croyance d\'autrui.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590578&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'66ba90e6-8c44-40f2-acea-8886efc2dc57\', \'multiverseId\': 590578}, \'multiverseid\': 590578}, {\'name\': \'Efreet Rovente\', \'text\': "Quando l\'Efreet Rovente muore, ti infligge 2 danni.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Monaco Efreet\', \'flavor\': "Gli efreet sono attratti dai Girovaghi Kaisham, una scuola Jeskai senza una gerarchia rigida, in cui viene insegnato l\'inganno allo scopo di sfidare lo status quo e sconvolgere i sistemi di credenze.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590713&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'06c65f59-7621-4c46-810d-7f421c601069\', \'multiverseId\': 590713}, \'multiverseid\': 590713}, {\'name\': \'くすぶるイフリート\', \'text\': \'くすぶるイフリートが死亡したとき、これはあなたに２点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — イフリート・モンク\', \'flavor\': \'イフリートたちは、ジェスカイの教えの流れを汲む緩やかな組織であるケイシャム放浪団に惹かれていった。ここでは策略を用いることで現体制に挑み、他の信仰体系の転覆を図っている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590848&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1ad2716e-ae9c-482b-b04a-4e84b91d3582\', \'multiverseId\': 590848}, \'multiverseid\': 590848}, {\'name\': \'闷燃魔神\', \'text\': \'当闷燃魔神死去时，它对你造成2点伤害。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～魔神／修行僧\', \'flavor\': \'洁斯凯灵宗内有一派松散的组织，名唤楷善浪迹者。这一派常用诡计改变现状或颠倒是非，由此也吸引诸多魔神纷纷加入。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591253&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'19234c49-9ae3-4525-8f41-b15005755117\', \'multiverseId\': 591253}, \'multiverseid\': 591253}]', '[{\'name\': \'Goblin-Artillerie\', \'text\': \'{T}: Die Goblin-Artillerie fügt einem Ziel deiner Wahl 2 Schadenspunkte und dir 3 Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Goblin, Krieger\', \'flavor\': \'Die meisten Goblins dürfen einmal das Katapult abfeuern, aber nur wenige erreichen den begehrten Rang des Munitionsfesthalters.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590249&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'abc55802-8955-4918-a095-f3c104b557f7\', \'multiverseId\': 590249}, \'multiverseid\': 590249}, {\'name\': \'Artillería trasga\', \'text\': \'{T}: La Artillería trasga hace 2 puntos de daño a cualquier objetivo y te hace 3 puntos de daño.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero trasgo\', \'flavor\': \'La mayoría de los trasgos pasan por disparar la catapulta, pero pocos logran el preciado título de Sujetador de Munición.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590384&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'340992be-9ade-4c1b-8127-35e1f3d4d14f\', \'multiverseId\': 590384}, \'multiverseid\': 590384}, {\'name\': \'Artillerie gobeline\', \'text\': "{T} : L\'Artillerie gobeline inflige 2 blessures à n\'importe quelle cible et vous inflige 3 blessures.", \'type\': \'Créature : gobelin et guerrier\', \'flavor\': \'La plupart des gobelins tirent chacun leur tour avec la catapulte, mais peu sont ceux qui parviennent au grade de porte-munition.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590519&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9fa2ec1e-bd2f-43f0-99d9-2fd3b470aa4e\', \'multiverseId\': 590519}, \'multiverseid\': 590519}, {\'name\': \'Artiglieria Goblin\', \'text\': "{T}: L\'Artiglieria Goblin infligge 2 danni a un qualsiasi bersaglio e 3 danni a te.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Goblin\', \'flavor\': "Molti goblin fanno a turno per sparare con la catapulta, ma ben pochi ottengono l\'ambito titolo di Portatore di Munizioni.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590654&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'780a2ee6-a82c-4d99-8212-157d1ff60dc5\', \'multiverseId\': 590654}, \'multiverseid\': 590654}, {\'name\': \'ゴブリン弩弓隊\', \'text\': \'{T}：クリーチャーやプレインズウォーカーやプレイヤーのうち１つを対象とする。ゴブリン弩弓隊はそれに２点、あなたに３点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ゴブリン・戦士\', \'flavor\': \'投石器を発射する役はほとんどのゴブリンが順番にやるが、誰もがやりたがる弾薬係をやれるのはほとんどいない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590789&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1815b8c9-144f-411f-aea4-acb6775ea165\', \'multiverseId\': 590789}, \'multiverseid\': 590789}, {\'name\': \'鬼怪大炮\', \'text\': \'{T}：鬼怪大炮对任意一个目标造成2点伤害，且对你造成3点伤害。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～鬼怪／战士\', \'flavor\': \'大多数鬼怪都轮得到发射的机会，但只有少数能拥有人人渴望的抱弹人称号。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591194&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fde96eff-19ac-41ed-bff1-7b96be7d6048\', \'multiverseId\': 591194}, \'multiverseid\': 591194}]', '[{\'name\': \'Goblin-Kriegshäuptling\', \'text\': \'Goblin-Zaubersprüche, die du wirkst, kosten beim Wirken {1} weniger.\\nGoblins, die du kontrollierst, haben Eile.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Goblin, Krieger\', \'flavor\': "Seit Pashalik Mons\' Tagen waren die Rundvelt-Goblins nicht mehr so vereint und effektiv.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590256&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1012452d-1463-44a8-a44f-98b5f985dfe4\', \'multiverseId\': 590256}, \'multiverseid\': 590256}, {\'name\': \'Jefe de guerra trasgo\', \'text\': \'Te cuesta {1} menos lanzar los hechizos de Trasgo.\\nLos Trasgos que controlas tienen la habilidad de prisa.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero trasgo\', \'flavor\': \'Los trasgos de Rundvelt no habían estado tan unidos ni habían sido tan efectivos desde los días de Pashalik Mons.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590391&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ec15bee3-62c2-4b4e-856e-fabc7828a114\', \'multiverseId\': 590391}, \'multiverseid\': 590391}, {\'name\': \'Chef de guerre gobelin\', \'text\': \'Les sorts de gobelin que vous lancez coûtent {1} de moins à lancer.\\nLes gobelins que vous contrôlez ont la célérité.\', \'type\': \'Créature : gobelin et guerrier\', \'flavor\': "Les gobelins de Rundvelt n\'ont jamais été aussi unis et efficaces que du temps de Pashalik Mons.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590526&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'88cb33b6-c37c-40e0-a5d3-fd91ce1b11c0\', \'multiverseId\': 590526}, \'multiverseid\': 590526}, {\'name\': \'Condottiero Goblin\', \'text\': \'Le magie Goblin che lanci costano {1} in meno per essere lanciate.\\nI Goblin che controlli hanno rapidità.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Goblin\', \'flavor\': \'Era dai tempi di Pashalik Mons che i goblin di Rundvelt non erano così uniti ed efficienti.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590661&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'04233c29-3bd0-4ca8-b424-2e2e36e28f43\', \'multiverseId\': 590661}, \'multiverseid\': 590661}, {\'name\': \'ゴブリンの戦長\', \'text\': \'あなたがゴブリン・呪文を唱えるためのコストは{1}少なくなる。\\nあなたがコントロールしているすべてのゴブリンは速攻を持つ。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ゴブリン・戦士\', \'flavor\': \'パシャリク・モンスの時代以降、ランドヴェルト・ゴブリンがこれほど団結し有能であったことはない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590796&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'676c2233-5168-4151-9f0e-bc8517050c95\', \'multiverseId\': 590796}, \'multiverseid\': 590796}, {\'name\': \'鬼怪战酋长\', \'text\': \'你施放的鬼怪咒语减少{1}来施放。\\n由你操控的鬼怪具有敏捷异能。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～鬼怪／战士\', \'flavor\': \'自帕沙力克将军芒氏的时代之后，温德汶的鬼怪首次变得如此团结有效率。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591201&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'082bbd5e-d0cc-46cc-856b-ebaf36cb0153\', \'multiverseId\': 591201}, \'multiverseid\': 591201}]', '[{\'name\': \'Goblin-Pionier\', \'text\': \'Bedrohlich (Diese Kreatur kann nicht geblockt werden, außer von zwei oder mehr Kreaturen.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Goblin, Pirat\', \'flavor\': \'„Warum folgen wir eigentlich dem Goblin? Kann er überhaupt Karten lesen?"\\n—Daphne Vail, erste Maatin der *Schreckensbringer*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590255&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'05cd80b9-f833-4f14-a516-0c53f231a49e\', \'multiverseId\': 590255}, \'multiverseid\': 590255}, {\'name\': \'Trasgo pionero\', \'text\': \'Amenaza. (Esta criatura no puede ser bloqueada excepto por dos o más criaturas.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Pirata trasgo\', \'flavor\': \'"¿Por qué estamos siguiendo al trasgo? ¿Sabe siquiera leer ese mapa?".\\n—Daphne Vail, contramaestre del *Arrasador*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590390&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5a28fd8e-0e3a-4b37-a190-59d465994f91\', \'multiverseId\': 590390}, \'multiverseid\': 590390}, {\'name\': \'Pionnier gobelin\', \'text\': \'Menace (Cette créature ne peut pas être bloquée excepté par deux créatures ou plus.)\', \'type\': \'Créature : gobelin et pirate\', \'flavor\': "« Pourquoi suivons-nous ce gobelin ? Sait-il seulement lire une carte ? »\\n—Daphné Vail, second de *L\'Inexorable*", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590525&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'400c237b-9948-4c12-9068-51284292b132\', \'multiverseId\': 590525}, \'multiverseid\': 590525}, {\'name\': \'Goblin Scopripista\', \'text\': \'Minacciare (Questa creatura non può essere bloccata tranne che da due o più creature.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Pirata Goblin\', \'flavor\': \'"Perché seguiamo il goblin? Sa almeno leggere la mappa?"\\n—Daphne Vail, primo ufficiale della *Funesta II*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590660&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9d71372d-47fb-495f-af61-fd5c94e060c8\', \'multiverseId\': 590660}, \'multiverseid\': 590660}, {\'name\': \'ゴブリンの先駆者\', \'text\': \'威迫（このクリーチャーは２体以上のクリーチャーにしかブロックされない。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ゴブリン・海賊\', \'flavor\': \'「なんでアタシたち、ゴブリンに付いて行かなきゃいけないのよ？そもそもアイツ、地図読めてるの？」\\n――*凶兆号*一等航海士、ダフネ・ヴェイル\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590795&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'08ed75cb-a197-4eea-a072-a541a3679f0e\', \'multiverseId\': 590795}, \'multiverseid\': 590795}, {\'name\': \'领路鬼怪\', \'text\': \'威慑（此生物只能被两个或更多生物阻挡。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～鬼怪／海盗\', \'flavor\': \'「我们为什么要跟着鬼怪走？他真能看懂那张地图吗？」\\n～*焦炬号*大副达芙妮魏尔\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591200&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f8e5a5c6-6a41-4fa4-b79e-0ea7a70f36a1\', \'multiverseId\': 591200}, \'multiverseid\': 591200}]', '[{\'name\': \'Goblin-Psychopath\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn der Goblin-Psychopath angreift oder blockt, wirf eine Münze. Falls du den Münzwurf verlierst, fügt er das nächste Mal, dass er in diesem Zug Kampfschaden zufügen würde, den Schaden stattdessen dir zu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Goblin, Mutant\', \'flavor\': \'Er verschwendet keine Energie darauf, zwischen Freund und Feind zu unterscheiden.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590252&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'af3daeb2-5bc2-4e79-9961-5c8b546f10a3\', \'multiverseId\': 590252}, \'multiverseid\': 590252}, {\'name\': \'Psicópata trasgo\', \'text\': \'Siempre que el Psicópata trasgo ataque o bloquee, lanza una moneda a cara o cruz. Si pierdes el lanzamiento, la próxima vez que fuese a hacer daño de combate este turno, en vez de eso, te hace daño a ti.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Trasgo mutante\', \'flavor\': \'No gasta ni un ápice de energía en distinguir entre amigos y enemigos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590387&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cd9b1734-3ae0-4642-9a01-559f21db841d\', \'multiverseId\': 590387}, \'multiverseid\': 590387}, {\'name\': \'Psychopathe gobelin\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que le Psychopathe gobelin attaque ou bloque, jouez à pile ou face. Si vous perdez, la prochaine fois qu\'il devrait infliger des blessures de combat ce tour-ci, il vous inflige ces blessures à la place.", \'type\': \'Créature : gobelin et mutant\', \'flavor\': \'Il ne gaspille pas son énergie à distinguer les amis des ennemis.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590522&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5ad4b2bf-8e3f-40f0-b48b-298951574a4c\', \'multiverseId\': 590522}, \'multiverseid\': 590522}, {\'name\': \'Goblin Psicopatico\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta il Goblin Psicopatico attacca o blocca, lancia una moneta. Se perdi il lancio, la prossima volta che sta per infliggere danno da combattimento in questo turno, invece infligge a te quel danno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Mutante Goblin\', \'flavor\': \'Non spreca mai energie per distinguere tra amici e nemici.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590657&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'11cf4c24-0587-4be6-aa04-8648eb376c9d\', \'multiverseId\': 590657}, \'multiverseid\': 590657}, {\'name\': \'ゴブリンの人格崩壊者\', \'text\': \'ゴブリンの人格崩壊者が攻撃するかブロックするたび、コイン投げを行う。\\nあなたがそのコイン投げに負けたなら、このターン、次にゴブリンの人格崩壊者が戦闘ダメージを与えるなら、代わりにこれはあなたにそのダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ゴブリン・ミュータント\', \'flavor\': \'こいつは、敵味方を区別するなんてことに無駄なエネルギーを使わない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590792&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8572e034-1c91-4b03-aa48-0066bab6d212\', \'multiverseId\': 590792}, \'multiverseid\': 590792}, {\'name\': \'病态鬼怪\', \'text\': \'每当病态鬼怪进行攻击或阻挡时，掷一枚硬币。若你猜错此掷，则本回合中，它下一次将造成的战斗伤害改为对你造成之。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～鬼怪／突变体\', \'flavor\': \'他从不浪费精力分辨敌我。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591197&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'87765b3e-cd2a-4516-84b6-fab5c8b084ad\', \'multiverseId\': 591197}, \'multiverseid\': 591197}]', '[{\'name\': \'Goblin-Pöbeltreiber\', \'text\': \'Andere Goblin-Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, greifen in jedem Kampf an, falls möglich.\\nZu Beginn des Kampfes in deinem Zug erzeugst du einen 1/1 roten Goblin-Kreaturenspielstein mit Eile.\\nImmer wenn der Goblin-Pöbeltreiber angreift, erhält er für jeden anderen angreifenden Goblin +1/+0 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Goblin, Krieger\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590253&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'031fec02-b6f5-49ce-b65c-17b7872faed3\', \'multiverseId\': 590253}, \'multiverseid\': 590253}, {\'name\': \'Agitador trasgo\', \'text\': \'Las otras criaturas Trasgo que controlas atacan cada combate si pueden.\\nAl comienzo del combate en tu turno, crea una ficha de criatura Trasgo roja 1/1 con la habilidad de prisa.\\nSiempre que el Agitador trasgo ataque, obtiene +1/+0 hasta el final del turno por cada otro Trasgo atacante.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero trasgo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590388&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'41e3de3c-ab00-4701-8972-4ae4e6907b3b\', \'multiverseId\': 590388}, \'multiverseid\': 590388}, {\'name\': \'Maître plébéien gobelin\', \'text\': "Les autres créatures Gobelin que vous contrôlez attaquent à chaque combat si possible.\\nAu début du combat pendant votre tour, créez un jeton de créature 1/1 rouge Gobelin avec la célérité.\\nÀ chaque fois que le Maître plébéien gobelin attaque, il gagne +1/+0 jusqu\'à la fin du tour pour chaque autre gobelin attaquant.", \'type\': \'Créature : gobelin et guerrier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590523&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a6a28a4a-cf61-493d-b2fa-e773bd1ab2c8\', \'multiverseId\': 590523}, \'multiverseid\': 590523}, {\'name\': \'Goblin Trascinatore di Folle\', \'text\': "Le altre creature Goblin che controlli attaccano in ogni combattimento, se possono farlo.\\nAll\'inizio del combattimento nel tuo turno, crea una pedina creatura Goblin 1/1 rossa con rapidità.\\nOgniqualvolta il Goblin Trascinatore di Folle attacca, prende +1/+0 fino alla fine del turno per ogni altro Goblin che attacca.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Goblin\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590658&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9dd2e305-c108-4d00-8ce7-74b73b40589f\', \'multiverseId\': 590658}, \'multiverseid\': 590658}, {\'name\': \'ゴブリンの熟練扇動者\', \'text\': \'各戦闘で、あなたがコントロールしていてこれでないすべてのゴブリン・クリーチャーは可能なら攻撃する。\\nあなたのターンの戦闘の開始時に、速攻を持つ赤の１/１のゴブリン・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\\nゴブリンの熟練扇動者が攻撃するたび、ターン終了時まで、これは攻撃していてこれでないゴブリン１体につき＋１/＋０の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ゴブリン・戦士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590793&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b3981e76-350b-471c-b07a-02380df31784\', \'multiverseId\': 590793}, \'multiverseid\': 590793}, {\'name\': \'鬼怪闹事头\', \'text\': \'由你操控的其他鬼怪生物每次战斗若能攻击，则必须攻击。\\n在你回合的战斗开始时，派出一个1/1红色，具敏捷异能的鬼怪衍生生物。\\n每当鬼怪闹事头攻击时，每有一个进行攻击的其他鬼怪，它便得+1/+0直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～鬼怪／战士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591198&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f97fe5a0-4841-4af3-9c88-ac9db69d50ae\', \'multiverseId\': 591198}, \'multiverseid\': 591198}]', '[{\'name\': \'Goblin-Truppentreff\', \'text\': \'Erzeuge vier 1/1 rote Goblin-Kreaturenspielsteine.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Goblins heuert man nicht an, man setzt ihnen Ideen in den Kopf.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590254&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4626a030-fea7-4a2d-9bba-d18515f9fa0f\', \'multiverseId\': 590254}, \'multiverseid\': 590254}, {\'name\': \'Agrupar a los trasgos\', \'text\': \'Crea cuatro fichas de criatura Trasgo rojas 1/1.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'A los trasgos no se les contrata, sino que se les meten ideas en la cabeza.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590389&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'255614e9-510e-4fda-802f-3a5cb86bdb93\', \'multiverseId\': 590389}, \'multiverseid\': 590389}, {\'name\': \'Ralliement des gobelins\', \'text\': \'Créez quatre jetons de créature 1/1 rouge Gobelin.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "On n\'engage pas les gobelins : on leur met des idées dans la tête.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590524&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'abab7088-a36e-4100-9191-bdef3360c631\', \'multiverseId\': 590524}, \'multiverseid\': 590524}, {\'name\': \'Adunata Goblin\', \'text\': \'Crea quattro pedine creatura Goblin 1/1 rosse.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'Più che assoldare i Goblin, si tratta di metter loro in testa delle idee.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590659&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8bd6d1ac-6855-43ad-9cc2-f915c6e0c99c\', \'multiverseId\': 590659}, \'multiverseid\': 590659}, {\'name\': \'ゴブリンの結集\', \'text\': \'赤の１/１のゴブリン・クリーチャー・トークン４体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'ゴブリンとの契約は雇用というより入れ知恵に近い。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590794&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'33f30b46-d69e-4f52-91e2-9cc985240305\', \'multiverseId\': 590794}, \'multiverseid\': 590794}, {\'name\': \'鬼怪动员\', \'text\': \'派出四个1/1红色鬼怪衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'你雇用鬼怪不是为了要教育他们的。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591199&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a87c6adb-bbb3-49e8-983b-7cc41a5b9362\', \'multiverseId\': 591199}, \'multiverseid\': 591199}]', '[{\'name\': \'Goblinforscher\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Goblinforscher ins Spiel kommt, schicke die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek ins Exil. Während eines beliebigen Zuges, in dem du mit dem Goblinforscher angegriffen hast, kannst du die Karte spielen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Goblin, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': \'Slonk wurde siebenundzwanzig Mal vom Blitz getroffen, bevor er auf die Idee kam. Weitere dreiundvierzig Treffer und er hatte es perfektioniert.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589639&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'23acefd0-2f49-4a9f-a4a9-a73d98802b84\', \'multiverseId\': 589639}, \'multiverseid\': 589639}, {\'name\': \'Investigador trasgo\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Investigador trasgo entre al campo de batalla, exilia la primera carta de tu biblioteca. Durante cualquier turno en el que atacaste con el Investigador trasgo, puedes jugar esa carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero trasgo\', \'flavor\': \'A Slonk le cayeron veintisiete rayos encima antes de que se le ocurriese una idea. Cuarenta y tres rayos más tarde, la perfeccionó.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589690&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a18ffab6-a2b7-4ccf-a09d-7e37b36daae1\', \'multiverseId\': 589690}, \'multiverseid\': 589690}, {\'name\': \'Chercheur gobelin\', \'text\': \'Quand le Chercheur gobelin arrive sur le champ de bataille, exilez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Pendant chaque tour où vous avez attaqué avec le Chercheur gobelin, vous pouvez jouer cette carte.\', \'type\': \'Créature : gobelin et sorcier\', \'flavor\': "Slonk avait été frappé par la foudre vingt-sept fois avant d\'avoir l\'idée. Encore quarante-trois fois, et il l\'avait perfectionnée.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589741&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ca240518-37e8-46d6-93f9-8cd03fd3e505\', \'multiverseId\': 589741}, \'multiverseid\': 589741}, {\'name\': \'Goblin Ricercatore\', \'text\': \'Quando il Goblin Ricercatore entra nel campo di battaglia, esilia la prima carta del tuo grimorio. Durante qualsiasi turno in cui hai attaccato con il Goblin Ricercatore, puoi giocare quella carta.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Mago Goblin\', \'flavor\': "Slonk fu colpito ventisette volte da un fulmine prima che gli venisse l\'idea. Dopo altre quarantatré saette, l\'aveva perfezionata.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589792&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dd7f36fa-4fbe-4926-b5e9-f133595007d5\', \'multiverseId\': 589792}, \'multiverseid\': 589792}, {\'name\': \'ゴブリンの研究者\', \'text\': \'ゴブリンの研究者が戦場に出たとき、あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード１枚を追放する。あなたがゴブリンの研究者で攻撃したターンの間、あなたはそのカードをプレイしてもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ゴブリン・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': \'スロンクはひらめくまでの間に二十七回も雷に打たれた。あと四十三回打たれれば、完璧に仕上げるだろう。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589843&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e934bfe4-2f6f-4c90-b7a6-4d12751727d2\', \'multiverseId\': 589843}, \'multiverseid\': 589843}, {\'name\': \'鬼怪学究\', \'text\': \'当鬼怪学究进战场时，放逐你的牌库顶牌。于你以鬼怪学究攻击过的回合中，你可以使用该牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～鬼怪／法术师\', \'flavor\': \'司隆克在被闪电劈中二十七次后，终于有个想法。再被劈中四十三次后，他才把这想法完善成形。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589996&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2969718c-aee2-491a-8dcf-5c6e37f1afe3\', \'multiverseId\': 589996}, \'multiverseid\': 589996}]', '[{\'name\': \'Goblingranate\', \'text\': \'Opfere einen Goblin als zusätzliche Kosten, um diesen Zauberspruch zu wirken.\\nDie Goblingranate fügt einem Ziel deiner Wahl 5 Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Unterschätze niemals die aerodynamischen Eigenschaften eines ganz normalen Goblins.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590250&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'59ee8b98-2b7b-46ae-ae5d-ebd3a7f10b2a\', \'multiverseId\': 590250}, \'multiverseid\': 590250}, {\'name\': \'Granada trasgo\', \'text\': \'Como coste adicional para lanzar este hechizo, sacrifica un Trasgo.\\nLa Granada trasgo hace 5 puntos de daño a cualquier objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'No subestimes las cualidades aerodinámicas de un trasgo común.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590385&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'54c119f4-6691-487e-8fca-b3282474276e\', \'multiverseId\': 590385}, \'multiverseid\': 590385}, {\'name\': \'Grenade gobeline\', \'text\': "En tant que coût supplémentaire pour lancer ce sort, sacrifiez un gobelin.\\nLa Grenade gobeline inflige 5 blessures à n\'importe quelle cible.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'Ne sous-estimez pas les qualités aérodynamiques du gobelin de base.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590520&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d660940c-ee5d-441a-8ae9-b9062debc4d7\', \'multiverseId\': 590520}, \'multiverseid\': 590520}, {\'name\': \'Granata Goblin\', \'text\': \'Come costo addizionale per lanciare questa magia, sacrifica un Goblin.\\nLa Granata Goblin infligge 5 danni a un qualsiasi bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'Non sottovalutare le qualità aerodinamiche del goblin comune.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590655&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d58b55c4-efc1-4893-88b5-3015d050c9e3\', \'multiverseId\': 590655}, \'multiverseid\': 590655}, {\'name\': \'ゴブリンの手投げ弾\', \'text\': \'この呪文を唱えるための追加コストとして、ゴブリン１体を生け贄に捧げる。\\nクリーチャーやプレインズウォーカーやプレイヤーのうち１つを対象とする。ゴブリンの手投げ弾はそれに５点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'一般的なゴブリンの空力性能を馬鹿にするもんじゃない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590790&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'29a51ed1-b111-4097-80dc-bbeb21489438\', \'multiverseId\': 590790}, \'multiverseid\': 590790}, {\'name\': \'鬼怪手榴弹\', \'text\': \'牺牲一个鬼怪，以作为施放此咒语的额外费用。\\n鬼怪手榴弹对任意一个目标造成5点伤害。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'别小看了一般鬼怪的空气动力学品质。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591195&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f9da1d18-55bd-4c2c-8b02-b928b4b30713\', \'multiverseId\': 591195}, \'multiverseid\': 591195}]', '[{\'name\': \'Goldader-Spitzhacke\', \'text\': \'Die ausgerüstete Kreatur erhält +1/+1.\\nImmer wenn die ausgerüstete Kreatur einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, erzeuge einen Schatz-Spielstein. (Er ist ein Artefakt mit „{T}, opfere dieses Artefakt: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe.")\\nAusrüsten {1} ({1}: Lege diese Karte an eine Kreatur deiner Wahl an, die du kontrollierst. Spiele Ausrüsten wie eine Hexerei.)\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Ausrüstung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596273&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'235b0ffc-5255-447f-9124-4a39413db3e5\', \'multiverseId\': 596273}, \'multiverseid\': 596273}, {\'name\': \'Pico filondorado\', \'text\': \'La criatura equipada obtiene +1/+1.\\nSiempre que la criatura equipada haga daño de combate a un jugador, crea una ficha de Tesoro. (Es un artefacto con "{T}, sacrificar este artefacto: Agrega un maná de cualquier color".)\\nEquipar {1}. ({1}: Anexa este Equipo a la criatura objetivo que controlas. Activa la habilidad de equipar como un conjuro.)\', \'type\': \'Artefacto — Equipo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596360&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a20d5e60-0bae-44c8-85b4-c42197a8e0ec\', \'multiverseId\': 596360}, \'multiverseid\': 596360}, {\'name\': \'Pioche de Veinedor\', \'text\': "La créature équipée gagne +1/+1.\\nÀ chaque fois que la créature équipée inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, créez un jeton Trésor. (C\'est un artefact avec « {T}, sacrifiez cet artefact : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix. »)\\nÉquipement {1} ({1} : Attachez à une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez. N\'attachez l\'équipement que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.)", \'type\': \'Artefact : équipement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596447&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'42ca1711-af2e-47fa-b2c7-46f03687ebd4\', \'multiverseId\': 596447}, \'multiverseid\': 596447}, {\'name\': "Piccone della Vena d\'Oro", \'text\': \'La creatura equipaggiata prende +1/+1.\\nOgniqualvolta la creatura equipaggiata infligge danno da combattimento a un giocatore, crea una pedina Tesoro. (È un artefatto con "{T}, Sacrifica questo artefatto: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore".)\\nEquipaggiare {1} ({1}: Assegna a una creatura bersaglio che controlli. Equipaggia solo come una stregoneria.)\', \'type\': \'Artefatto — Equipaggiamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596534&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f9f39457-af88-4d07-90ba-a3bb6beff111\', \'multiverseId\': 596534}, \'multiverseid\': 596534}, {\'name\': \'金脈のつるはし\', \'text\': \'装備しているクリーチャーは＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\\n装備しているクリーチャーがプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、宝物・トークン１つを生成する。（それは、「{T},このアーティファクトを生け贄に捧げる：好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。」を持つアーティファクトである。）\\n装備{1}（{1}：あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。これをそれにつける。装備はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。）\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 装備品\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596621&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bccf460f-7fb0-4be2-8aa1-0bdbed9ef048\', \'multiverseId\': 596621}, \'multiverseid\': 596621}, {\'name\': \'金脉镐\', \'text\': \'佩带此武具的生物得+1/+1。\\n每当佩带此武具的生物对任一牌手造成战斗伤害时，派出一个珍宝衍生物。（它是具有「{T}，牺牲此神器：加一点任意颜色的法术力」的神器。）\\n佩带{1}（{1}：贴附在目标由你操控的生物上。只能于法术时机佩带。）\', \'type\': \'神器 ～武具\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596882&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3b133f6c-6deb-4730-b643-df3c2040dd14\', \'multiverseId\': 596882}, \'multiverseid\': 596882}]', '[{\'name\': \'Goldhund\', \'text\': \'Erstschlag\\nBedrohlich (Diese Kreatur kann nicht geblockt werden, außer von zwei oder mehr Kreaturen.)\\n{T}, opfere den Goldhund: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Schatz, Hund\', \'flavor\': \'Das Stakkato seiner Metallkrallen auf dem Straßenpflaster ist unverkennbar.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590257&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7a079e83-bd10-42a0-ac0a-4006a934207d\', \'multiverseId\': 590257}, \'multiverseid\': 590257}, {\'name\': \'Perro dorado\', \'text\': \'Daña primero.\\nAmenaza. (Esta criatura no puede ser bloqueada excepto por dos o más criaturas.)\\n{T}, sacrificar el Perro dorado: Agrega un maná de cualquier color.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Perro tesoro\', \'flavor\': \'Ese sonido staccato de sus garras metálicas sobre el suelo es inconfundible.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590392&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c24186d9-e5d1-4e77-80d2-73edc24778d5\', \'multiverseId\': 590392}, \'multiverseid\': 590392}, {\'name\': "Chien d\'or", \'text\': "Initiative\\nMenace (Cette créature ne peut pas être bloquée excepté par deux créatures ou plus.)\\n{T}, sacrifiez le Chien d\'or : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : trésor et chien\', \'flavor\': \'Le cliquetis staccato de ses pattes de métal sur les pavés est facilement reconnaissable.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590527&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c727ab54-8aff-4d20-8bf9-a55d450fdbcd\', \'multiverseId\': 590527}, \'multiverseid\': 590527}, {\'name\': \'Segugio Aureo\', \'text\': \'Attacco improvviso\\nMinacciare (Questa creatura non può essere bloccata tranne che da due o più creature.)\\n{T}, Sacrifica il Segugio Aureo: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Canide Tesoro\', \'flavor\': \'Lo sferragliare intermittente dei suoi artigli metallici sul selciato è inconfondibile.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590662&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3260c55f-bea4-4f57-8252-55277c58027b\', \'multiverseId\': 590662}, \'multiverseid\': 590662}, {\'name\': \'黄金犬\', \'text\': \'先制攻撃\\n威迫（このクリーチャーは２体以上のクリーチャーにしかブロックされない。）\\n{T}, 黄金犬を生け贄に捧げる：好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 宝物・犬\', \'flavor\': \'舗道を通る金属の爪の、コツコツと鳴るスタッカート音は間違えようがない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590797&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c5e7ad01-bde7-4134-b5ee-3452a115d723\', \'multiverseId\': 590797}, \'multiverseid\': 590797}, {\'name\': \'金辉猎犬\', \'text\': \'先攻\\n威慑（此生物只能被两个或更多生物阻挡。）\\n{T}，牺牲金辉猎犬：加一点任意颜色的法术力。\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～珍宝／狗\', \'flavor\': \'它铁爪摩擦地面刮出的刺耳声响，绝对没人会听错。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591202&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f79e51c0-5c05-4e7e-a0e7-e216457ede9d\', \'multiverseId\': 591202}, \'multiverseid\': 591202}]', '[{\'name\': \'Goldnacht-Kommandant\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn eine andere Kreatur unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, erhalten Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, +1/+1 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Kleriker, Soldat\', \'flavor\': \'„Ein gemeinsamer Glaube und viele Hände brachten den Sieg."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591598&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7c46bda3-ab47-4c06-9fc1-0d1139a4acbc\', \'multiverseId\': 591598}, \'multiverseid\': 591598}, {\'name\': \'Comandante de la Noche Dorada\', \'text\': \'Siempre que otra criatura entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, las criaturas que controlas obtienen +1/+1 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado clérigo humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Una sola fe, pero muchas posibilidades de vencer".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591727&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'96641af6-7821-47ef-ba1d-b6bc5d3272cc\', \'multiverseId\': 591727}, \'multiverseid\': 591727}, {\'name\': "Commandant d\'Ornuit", \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'une autre créature arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, les créatures que vous contrôlez gagnent +1/+1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et clerc et soldat\', \'flavor\': \'« Une foi unique, mais une victoire partagée. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591856&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9f1a0c85-4310-4951-9846-d8cdca8f3ef6\', \'multiverseId\': 591856}, \'multiverseid\': 591856}, {\'name\': \'Comandante della Notte Dorata\', \'text\': "Ogniqualvolta un\'altra creatura entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, le creature che controlli prendono +1/+1 fino alla fine del turno.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Soldato Chierico Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Una sola fede, ma molte mani a contribuire alla vittoria."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591985&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1359d9b4-77e4-42f6-b2cf-199e29217287\', \'multiverseId\': 591985}, \'multiverseid\': 591985}, {\'name\': \'黄金夜の指揮官\', \'text\': \'これでないクリーチャー１体があなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールしているすべてのクリーチャーは＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・クレリック・兵士\', \'flavor\': \'「勝利の裏には一つの信仰、そして大勢の力がある。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592114&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d182acb2-effd-4de4-a073-5ac2303e70b6\', \'multiverseId\': 592114}, \'multiverseid\': 592114}, {\'name\': \'金夜指挥官\', \'text\': \'每当另一个生物在你的操控下进战场时，由你操控的生物得+1/+1直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／僧侣／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'「万人一心，众志成城。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592501&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d447f799-c3c9-4bb5-a664-7dff61cd7e0e\', \'multiverseId\': 592501}, \'multiverseid\': 592501}]', '[{\'name\': \'Golem-Handwerker\', \'text\': \'{2}: Eine Artefaktkreatur deiner Wahl erhält +1/+1 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\\n{2}: Eine Artefaktkreatur deiner Wahl erhält bis zum Ende des Zuges entweder Flugfähigkeit, Eile oder verursacht Trampelschaden (du entscheidest).\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Golem\', \'flavor\': \'Schöneres Leben durch Metallkunde.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596274&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0294b36a-3ec9-4590-939a-fd1688cb6f14\', \'multiverseId\': 596274}, \'multiverseid\': 596274}, {\'name\': \'Gólem artesano\', \'text\': \'{2}: La criatura artefacto objetivo obtiene +1/+1 hasta el final del turno.\\n{2}: La criatura artefacto objetivo gana la habilidad de volar, arrollar o prisa, a tu elección, hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Gólem\', \'flavor\': \'Vivir mejor gracias a la metalurgia.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596361&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4a2ed8fb-db6e-42f0-9500-9adf99084245\', \'multiverseId\': 596361}, \'multiverseid\': 596361}, {\'name\': \'Artisan golem\', \'text\': "{2} : Une créature-artefact ciblée gagne +1/+1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.\\n{2} : Une créature-artefact ciblée acquiert, selon votre choix, le vol, le piétinement ou la célérité jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : golem\', \'flavor\': \'Une vie meilleure grâce à la métallurgie.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596448&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0a7eca74-8d9a-42e1-8c11-e47e68a8a415\', \'multiverseId\': 596448}, \'multiverseid\': 596448}, {\'name\': \'Golem Artigiano\', \'text\': \'{2}: Una creatura artefatto bersaglio prende +1/+1 fino alla fine del turno.\\n{2}: Una creatura artefatto bersaglio ha a tua scelta volare, travolgere o rapidità fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Golem\', \'flavor\': \'Meglio vivere grazie alla metallurgia.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596535&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0ccdfabb-e616-4b9e-a3b1-71233ece06b5\', \'multiverseId\': 596535}, \'multiverseid\': 596535}, {\'name\': \'ゴーレムの職工\', \'text\': \'{2}：アーティファクト・クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\\n{2}：アーティファクト・クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは飛行かトランプルか速攻のうちあなたが選んだ１つを得る。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — ゴーレム\', \'flavor\': \'冶金でより良い生活を。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596622&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a6361ae9-ce82-42d4-abfd-c70d90dc4106\', \'multiverseId\': 596622}, \'multiverseid\': 596622}, {\'name\': \'魔像工匠\', \'text\': \'{2}：目标神器生物得+1/+1直到回合结束。\\n{2}：选择飞行，践踏或敏捷。目标神器生物获得该异能直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～魔像\', \'flavor\': \'藉由冶金改善生活。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596883&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'901713a2-ccca-44c5-9b95-b4e8dd5c9f15\', \'multiverseId\': 596883}, \'multiverseid\': 596883}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gonds Ausstrahlung\', \'text\': \'Verzaubert eine Kreatur\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur hat „{T}: Erzeuge einen 1/1 grünen Elf-Krieger-Kreaturenspielstein."\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'„Hier liegt Gond, der Held der Trutzburg Taldwen. Möge seine Kraft immer bei uns sein."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592908&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2554c389-6f11-4670-91b4-0916c7fac316\', \'multiverseId\': 592908}, \'multiverseid\': 592908}, {\'name\': \'Presencia de Gond\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura.\\nLa criatura encantada tiene "{T}: Crea una ficha de criatura Guerrero Elfo verde 1/1".\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'"Aquí yace Gond, héroe del refugio seguro Taldwen. Que siempre guíe nuestra búsqueda".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593029&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5450a190-af90-44d3-b78c-eb7b3b651943\', \'multiverseId\': 593029}, \'multiverseid\': 593029}, {\'name\': \'Présence de Gond\', \'text\': \'Enchanter : créature\\nLa créature enchantée a « {T} : Créez un jeton de créature 1/1 verte Elfe et Guerrier. ».\', \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': \'« Ci-gît Gond, héros de la Ferté Taldwen. Puisse-t-il nous guider un jour dans notre quête. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593150&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'45a4b2c0-ea45-46d8-a73b-570ebea04368\', \'multiverseId\': 593150}, \'multiverseid\': 593150}, {\'name\': \'Presenza di Gond\', \'text\': \'Incanta creatura\\nLa creatura incantata ha "{T}: Crea una pedina creatura Guerriero Elfo 1/1 verde".\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'"Qui giace Gond, eroe del Fortincanto Taldwen. Possa egli guidare sempre la nostra missione."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593271&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'71245662-84dc-4bec-a84d-7537f1b1b62c\', \'multiverseId\': 593271}, \'multiverseid\': 593271}, {\'name\': \'ゴンドの存在\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\nエンチャントしているクリーチャーは「{T}：緑の１/１のエルフ・戦士・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。」を持つ。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': \'「トールドウェン安寧砦の英雄ゴンド、ここに眠る。我等の試練に彼の守りあらんことを。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593392&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2b415712-4d5c-4ec1-8bb5-15a4aa375f71\', \'multiverseId\': 593392}, \'multiverseid\': 593392}, {\'name\': \'刚德现身\', \'text\': \'结附于生物\\n所结附的生物具有「{T}：派出一个1/1绿色妖精／战士衍生生物。」\', \'type\': \'结界 ～灵气\', \'flavor\': \'「刚德，塔德温华域的英雄，在此长眠。愿他永远领导我们的探索。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593755&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6cfafefd-b2a9-4181-8239-0d714a2f5ccf\', \'multiverseId\': 593755}, \'multiverseid\': 593755}]', "[{'name': 'Grabernte', 'text': 'Zombies, die du kontrollierst, haben Bedrohlichkeit. (Sie können nicht geblockt werden, außer von zwei oder mehr Kreaturen.)\\n{3}{B}, schicke eine Kreaturenkarte aus deinem Friedhof ins Exil: Erzeuge einen 2/2 schwarzen Zombie-Kreaturenspielstein.', 'type': 'Verzauberung', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594078&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8f0fcd80-fbc9-4f22-84f6-0cfb09dbf02f', 'multiverseId': 594078}, 'multiverseid': 594078}, {'name': 'Cosecha de la tumba', 'text': 'Los Zombies que controlas tienen la habilidad de amenaza. (No pueden ser bloqueados excepto por dos o más criaturas.)\\n{3}{B}, exiliar una carta de criatura de tu cementerio: Crea una ficha de criatura Zombie negra 2/2.', 'type': 'Encantamiento', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594195&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9f48e383-4259-4266-9d90-09d331c041fb', 'multiverseId': 594195}, 'multiverseid': 594195}, {'name': 'Moisson au graf', 'text': 'Les zombies que vous contrôlez ont la menace. (Ils ne peuvent pas être bloqués excepté par deux créatures ou plus.)\\n{3}{B}, exilez une carte de créature depuis votre cimetière : Créez un jeton de créature 2/2 noire Zombie.', 'type': 'Enchantement', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594312&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd8b48eee-d97e-4ba9-96f0-a2d68a64c988', 'multiverseId': 594312}, 'multiverseid': 594312}, {'name': 'Raccolto del Cimitero', 'text': 'Gli Zombie che controlli hanno minacciare. (Non possono essere bloccati tranne che da due o più creature.)\\n{3}{B}, Esilia una carta creatura dal tuo cimitero: Crea una pedina creatura Zombie 2/2 nera.', 'type': 'Incantesimo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594429&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6f229bc2-b8a7-417b-9027-4dce65e44eb4', 'multiverseId': 594429}, 'multiverseid': 594429}, {'name': '墓の収穫', 'text': 'あなたがコントロールしているすべてのゾンビは威迫を持つ。（それらは２体以上のクリーチャーにしかブロックされない。）\\n{3}{B},あなたの墓地にあるクリーチャー・カード１枚を追放する：黒の２/２のゾンビ・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。', 'type': 'エンチャント', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594546&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0a28581d-6f22-4510-b6bf-c4a23395c42a', 'multiverseId': 594546}, 'multiverseid': 594546}, {'name': '战墓收成', 'text': '由你操控的灵俑具有威慑异能。（它们只能被两个或更多生物阻挡。）\\n{3}{B}，从你的坟墓场放逐一张生物牌：派出一个2/2黑色灵俑衍生生物。', 'type': '结界', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594897&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e977be11-d9bd-4ebe-85e6-09f685cc9999', 'multiverseId': 594897}, 'multiverseid': 594897}]", "[{'name': 'Grabklingenmarodeur', 'text': 'Todesberührung\\nImmer wenn der Grabklingenmarodeur einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, verliert der Spieler Lebenspunkte in Höhe der Anzahl an Kreaturenkarten in deinem Friedhof.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Mensch, Krieger', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594079&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '40b1d416-db33-4c2f-8c39-af37faaa2fbe', 'multiverseId': 594079}, 'multiverseid': 594079}, {'name': 'Merodeador filotumba', 'text': 'Toque mortal.\\nSiempre que el Merodeador filotumba haga daño de combate a un jugador, ese jugador pierde una cantidad de vidas igual a la cantidad de cartas de criatura en tu cementerio.', 'type': 'Criatura — Guerrero humano', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594196&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '349823b5-e08d-4d28-9d3f-37c7699c40ee', 'multiverseId': 594196}, 'multiverseid': 594196}, {'name': 'Maraudeur à lame sépulcrale', 'text': 'Contact mortel\\nÀ chaque fois que le Maraudeur à lame sépulcrale inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, ce joueur perd un nombre de points de vie égal au nombre de cartes de créature dans votre cimetière.', 'type': 'Créature : humain et guerrier', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594313&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b9204a95-459f-452b-a2b4-971ac412d922', 'multiverseId': 594313}, 'multiverseid': 594313}, {'name': 'Predatore della Lama Funerea', 'text': 'Tocco letale\\nOgniqualvolta il Predatore della Lama Funerea infligge danno da combattimento a un giocatore, quel giocatore perde punti vita pari al numero di carte creatura nel tuo cimitero.', 'type': 'Creatura — Guerriero Umano', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594430&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f870ba6e-005e-4288-97f5-25d1b5a50b40', 'multiverseId': 594430}, 'multiverseid': 594430}, {'name': '墓刃の匪賊', 'text': '接死\\n墓刃の匪賊がプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、そのプレイヤーはあなたの墓地にあるクリーチャー・カードの枚数に等しい点数のライフを失う。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 人間・戦士', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594547&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e405b29a-1fef-4f6d-b152-8f199726afb5', 'multiverseId': 594547}, 'multiverseid': 594547}, {'name': '墓刃劫掠者', 'text': '死触\\n每当墓刃劫掠者对任一牌手造成战斗伤害时，该牌手失去等同于你坟墓场中生物牌数量的生命。', 'type': '生物 ～人类／战士', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594898&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e0cbe597-2390-409b-b87a-793801dece41', 'multiverseId': 594898}, 'multiverseid': 594898}]", '[{\'name\': \'Grabkriecher\', \'text\': \'Der Grabkriecher kann nicht blocken.\\nDu kannst den Grabkriecher aus deinem Friedhof wirken, solange du einen Zombie kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Zombie\', \'flavor\': \'„Die Ghulrufer von Innistrad sind schon äußerst talentiert, aber ich zeige dir gerne, was jemand mit richtiger Macht alles erzeugen kann."\\n—Liliana Vess\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594080&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'934800a0-f26d-4011-a698-77fe98592f08\', \'multiverseId\': 594080}, \'multiverseid\': 594080}, {\'name\': \'Acechatumbas\', \'text\': \'El Acechatumbas no puede bloquear.\\nPuedes lanzar el Acechatumbas desde tu cementerio mientras controles un Zombie.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Zombie\', \'flavor\': \'"Los llamamuertos de Innistrad tienen talento, pero déjame mostrarte lo que alguien con verdadero poder puede crear".\\n—Liliana Vess\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594197&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f04c0755-f0e3-4956-a805-362c72376d17\', \'multiverseId\': 594197}, \'multiverseid\': 594197}, {\'name\': \'Rampeur des tombes\', \'text\': \'Le Rampeur des tombes ne peut pas bloquer.\\nVous pouvez lancer le Rampeur des tombes depuis votre cimetière tant que vous contrôlez un zombie.\', \'type\': \'Créature : zombie\', \'flavor\': "« Les meneurs de goules d\'Innistrad sont certes doués, mais laissez-moi vous montrer ce que quelqu\'un de vraiment puissant peut créer. »\\n—Liliana Vess", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594314&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8dc61323-53eb-4f3a-8b38-d6ea95fd1c93\', \'multiverseId\': 594314}, \'multiverseid\': 594314}, {\'name\': \'Strisciante del Sepolcro\', \'text\': \'Lo Strisciante del Sepolcro non può bloccare.\\nPuoi lanciare lo Strisciante del Sepolcro dal tuo cimitero fintanto che controlli uno Zombie.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Zombie\', \'flavor\': \'"Gli evocaghoul di Innistrad possiedono un certo talento, ma permettimi di mostrarti cosa può creare chi ha un vero potere."\\n—Liliana Vess\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594431&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c483e8e2-c3a2-4c9b-a069-6d739aee0a8e\', \'multiverseId\': 594431}, \'multiverseid\': 594431}, {\'name\': \'墓所這い\', \'text\': \'墓所這いではブロックできない。\\nあなたは、あなたがゾンビをコントロールしているかぎり、あなたの墓地にある墓所這いを唱えてもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ゾンビ\', \'flavor\': \'「イニストラードのグール呼びにも才能はあるけど、本当の力を持った者が生み出すものを見せてあげるわ。」\\n――リリアナ・ヴェス\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594548&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'832b50ca-7725-49af-8723-8abf7f6849da\', \'multiverseId\': 594548}, \'multiverseid\': 594548}, {\'name\': \'墓场匍尸\', \'text\': \'墓场匍尸不能进行阻挡。\\n只要你操控灵俑，你便可以从你的坟墓场中施放墓场匍尸。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～灵俑\', \'flavor\': \'「依尼翠的尸鬼牧者算是有点天分，但我要你瞧瞧拥有真正力量者能造出什么来。」\\n～莉莲娜维斯\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594899&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d2b3ea44-23d4-48b7-98e3-619378b4477c\', \'multiverseId\': 594899}, \'multiverseid\': 594899}]', '[{\'name\': \'Grauenhafte Präsenz\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn ein Sumpf unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, bestimme eines —\\n• Du ziehst eine Karte und verlierst 1 Lebenspunkt.\\n• Die Grauenhafte Präsenz fügt einem Ziel deiner Wahl 2 Schadenspunkte zu und du erhältst 2 Lebenspunkte dazu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Nachtmahr\', \'flavor\': \'Wartend in der Dunkelheit winkt sie dir still zu.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594060&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bd259765-a799-4d8e-a711-07064be088e8\', \'multiverseId\': 594060}, \'multiverseid\': 594060}, {\'name\': \'Presencia terrorífica\', \'text\': \'Siempre que un Pantano entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, elige uno:\\n• Robas una carta y pierdes 1 vida.\\n• La Presencia terrorífica hace 2 puntos de daño a cualquier objetivo y tú ganas 2 vidas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Pesadilla\', \'flavor\': \'Hace señas en silencio, esperando en la oscuridad.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594177&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'23e511b7-f5d3-469b-97de-13910b3f42a1\', \'multiverseId\': 594177}, \'multiverseid\': 594177}, {\'name\': \'Présence effroyable\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'un marais arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, choisissez l\'un —\\n• Vous piochez une carte et vous perdez 1 point de vie.\\n• La Présence effroyable inflige 2 blessures à n\'importe quelle cible et vous gagnez 2 points de vie.", \'type\': \'Créature : cauchemar\', \'flavor\': \'Elle vous appelle en silence, patiemment dans les ténèbres.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594294&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bb05c526-66b8-4862-8039-bb3cd8bd5645\', \'multiverseId\': 594294}, \'multiverseid\': 594294}, {\'name\': \'Presenza Terrificante\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta una Palude entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, scegli uno —\\n• Pesca una carta e perdi 1 punto vita.\\n• La Presenza Terrificante infligge 2 danni a un qualsiasi bersaglio e tu guadagni 2 punti vita.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Incubo\', \'flavor\': "Lancia richiami silenziosi, restando in attesa nell\'oscurità.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594411&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c6307949-69de-444f-b7ce-b05d8373fbea\', \'multiverseId\': 594411}, \'multiverseid\': 594411}, {\'name\': \'戦慄の存在\', \'text\': \'沼１つがあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、以下から１つを選ぶ。\\n・あなたはカード１枚を引き、１点のライフを失う。\\n・クリーチャーやプレインズウォーカーやプレイヤーのうち１つを対象とする。戦慄の存在はそれに２点のダメージを与え、あなたは２点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ナイトメア\', \'flavor\': \'無言で合図し、闇の中で待つ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594528&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'632af89f-0657-4fd9-97ae-3907381ed63e\', \'multiverseId\': 594528}, \'multiverseid\': 594528}, {\'name\': \'颤栗鬼影\', \'text\': \'每当一个沼泽在你的操控下进战场时，选择一项～\\n•你抓一张牌且失去1点生命。\\n•颤栗鬼影对任意一个目标造成2点伤害且你获得2点生命。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～梦魇\', \'flavor\': \'它在黑暗之中静静等待，悄然回应。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594879&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b7cf1abb-c288-4edf-8a4b-54e5bf700f0a\', \'multiverseId\': 594879}, \'multiverseid\': 594879}]', '[{\'name\': \'Grauenhafter Versklaver\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn eine Kreatur, der in diesem Zug vom Grauenhaften Versklaver Schaden zugefügt wurde, stirbt, bringe sie unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel zurück. Die Kreatur ist zusätzlich zu ihren anderen Farben und Typen ein schwarzer Zombie.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Zombie, Schrecken\', \'flavor\': \'Ein halbes Gehirn beherrscht die Hirnlosen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594062&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c4eb6e84-97b7-4f11-ac5c-c0ea5720c214\', \'multiverseId\': 594062}, \'multiverseid\': 594062}, {\'name\': \'Esclavista pavoroso\', \'text\': \'Siempre que una criatura que haya recibido daño del Esclavista pavoroso este turno muera, regresa esa carta al campo de batalla bajo tu control. Esa criatura es un Zombie negro además de sus otros colores y tipos.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Horror zombie\', \'flavor\': \'Basta medio cerebro para dirigir a los necios.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594179&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b094cd0c-34c3-4c37-bb38-e15d042e46f4\', \'multiverseId\': 594179}, \'multiverseid\': 594179}, {\'name\': "Esclavagiste de l\'effroi", \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'une créature blessée ce tour-ci par l\'Esclavagiste de l\'effroi meurt, renvoyez-la sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle. Cette créature est un zombie noir en plus de ses autres couleurs et de ses autres types.", \'type\': \'Créature : zombie et horreur\', \'flavor\': \'Au royaume des décérébrés, le trépané est roi.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594296&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'17fe1c42-487e-4ed1-943d-5efdb4b3c0b2\', \'multiverseId\': 594296}, \'multiverseid\': 594296}, {\'name\': \'Schiavista del Terrore\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta muore una creatura a cui è stato inflitto danno dallo Schiavista del Terrore in questo turno, rimettila sul campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo. Quella creatura è uno Zombie nero in aggiunta ai suoi altri tipi e colori.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Orrore Zombie\', \'flavor\': \'Nella terra degli sciocchi, chi ha mezzo cervello è re.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594413&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3bab3f4a-4c5e-4130-9b00-44bd6c062317\', \'multiverseId\': 594413}, \'multiverseid\': 594413}, {\'name\': \'戦慄の奴隷商人\', \'text\': \'このターンに戦慄の奴隷商人からダメージを受けたクリーチャー１体が死亡するたび、それをあなたのコントロール下で戦場に戻す。そのクリーチャーは、それの他の色やタイプに加えて黒のゾンビでもある。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ゾンビ・ホラー\', \'flavor\': \'脳足りんでも脳なしを支配できる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594530&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dc0d0e10-7208-494a-a5d7-38bb8d484347\', \'multiverseId\': 594530}, \'multiverseid\': 594530}, {\'name\': \'可怖奴隶主\', \'text\': \'每当本回合中受过可怖奴隶主伤害的生物死去时，将它在你的操控下移回战场。该生物是黑色灵俑，且仍具有原本颜色与类别。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～灵俑／惊惧兽\', \'flavor\': \'统治无知者仅需半边脑。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594881&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c1f01b5f-bc27-46b7-984d-77c48a69be50\', \'multiverseId\': 594881}, \'multiverseid\': 594881}]', "[{'name': 'Grausame Sadistin', 'text': '{B}, {T}, bezahle 1 Lebenspunkt: Lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf die Grausame Sadistin.\\n{2}{B}, {T}, entferne X +1/+1-Marken von der Grausamen Sadistin: Sie fügt einer Kreatur deiner Wahl X Schadenspunkte zu.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Mensch, Assassine', 'flavor': 'Antlitz der Unschuld. Hand des Todes.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594048&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1cd23f14-6e31-4779-8c72-97f4127d5533', 'multiverseId': 594048}, 'multiverseid': 594048}, {'name': 'Sádica cruel', 'text': '{B}, {T}, pagar 1 vida: Pon un contador +1/+1 sobre la Sádica cruel.\\n{2}{B}, {T}, remover X contadores +1/+1 de la Sádica cruel: Hace X puntos de daño a la criatura objetivo.', 'type': 'Criatura — Asesino humano', 'flavor': 'Rostro inocente. Mano mortal.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594165&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2e99920a-a33b-47d9-b596-0303898edafc', 'multiverseId': 594165}, 'multiverseid': 594165}, {'name': 'Cruelle sadique', 'text': '{B}, {T}, payez 1 point de vie : Mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur la Cruelle sadique.\\n{2}{B}, {T}, retirez X marqueurs +1/+1 de la Cruelle sadique : Elle inflige X blessures à une créature ciblée.', 'type': 'Créature : humain et assassin', 'flavor': 'Un visage innocent. Une main meurtrière.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594282&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '387654f4-3c62-4eca-8e56-3a0cb7648141', 'multiverseId': 594282}, 'multiverseid': 594282}, {'name': 'Sadica Crudele', 'text': '{B}, {T}, Paga 1 punto vita: Metti un segnalino +1/+1 sulla Sadica Crudele.\\n{2}{B}, {T}, Rimuovi X segnalini +1/+1 dalla Sadica Crudele: Infligge X danni a una creatura bersaglio.', 'type': 'Creatura — Assassino Umano', 'flavor': 'Viso innocente, mano letale.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594399&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5c5a2bc2-3279-406d-a539-0083578365be', 'multiverseId': 594399}, 'multiverseid': 594399}, {'name': '残酷なサディスト', 'text': '{B},{T},１点のライフを支払う：残酷なサディストの上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。\\n{2}{B},{T},残酷なサディストの上から＋１/＋１カウンターＸ個を取り除く：クリーチャー１体を対象とする。残酷なサディストはそれにＸ点のダメージを与える。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 人間・暗殺者', 'flavor': '天使の顔。死神の手。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594516&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9a644a9a-9008-48e9-98c0-4b3f2d004848', 'multiverseId': 594516}, 'multiverseid': 594516}, {'name': '残酷凌虐狂', 'text': '{B}，{T}，支付1点生命：在残酷凌虐狂上放置一个+1/+1指示物。\\n{2}{B}，{T}，从残酷凌虐狂上移去X个+1/+1指示物：它对目标生物造成X点伤害。', 'type': '生物 ～人类／杀手', 'flavor': '天真无邪的脸。挥舞死亡的手。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594867&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd897a239-47c6-47a8-a802-e6b711f39872', 'multiverseId': 594867}, 'multiverseid': 594867}]", '[{\'name\': \'Grenzland-Marodeurin\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn die Grenzland-Marodeurin angreift, erhält sie +2/+0 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Krieger\', \'flavor\': \'Auch wenn sie zu Recht gefürchtet wird, gibt es kaum Geschichten über ihr Kampfgeschick, denn die wenigsten überleben ihre Überfälle.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590213&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1684203d-8370-4344-bc94-3f2efb5c102d\', \'multiverseId\': 590213}, \'multiverseid\': 590213}, {\'name\': \'Merodeadora fronteriza\', \'text\': \'Siempre que la Merodeadora fronteriza ataque, obtiene +2/+0 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero humano\', \'flavor\': \'Aunque es temida —y con razón—, no abundan las historias de sus hazañas en batalla, ya que pocos sobreviven a sus incursiones.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590348&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9f8418be-ec0f-4faa-8262-753e516a302b\', \'multiverseId\': 590348}, \'multiverseid\': 590348}, {\'name\': \'Maraudeuse des frontières\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que la Maraudeuse des frontières attaque, elle gagne +2/+0 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et guerrier\', \'flavor\': "Elle inspire une crainte justifiée mais n\'apparaît guère dans les récits des bardes : ses raids laissent trop peu de témoins.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590483&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a42888a6-22f4-4362-919d-a88760730672\', \'multiverseId\': 590483}, \'multiverseid\': 590483}, {\'name\': \'Predatrice delle Terre di Confine\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta la Predatrice delle Terre di Confine attacca, prende +2/+0 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Umano\', \'flavor\': \'Per quanto sia giustamente temuta, i resoconti delle sue imprese in battaglia sono rari, poiché sono in pochi a sopravvivere alle sue razzie.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590618&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ad3467e7-ad12-4ac9-b5be-167746ec7f97\', \'multiverseId\': 590618}, \'multiverseid\': 590618}, {\'name\': \'国境地帯の匪賊\', \'text\': \'国境地帯の匪賊が攻撃するたび、ターン終了時まで、これは＋２/＋０の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・戦士\', \'flavor\': \'彼女は確かに恐れられているものの、実は戦いでの活躍を物語る逸話はあまり多くない。それは彼女の襲撃を生き延びることができた者がほとんどいないからである。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590753&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'850c0189-60ec-4ece-9067-8829852c3eba\', \'multiverseId\': 590753}, \'multiverseid\': 590753}, {\'name\': \'边境劫掠者\', \'text\': \'每当边境劫掠者攻击时，它得+2/+0直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／战士\', \'flavor\': \'虽然她确实令人畏惧，但其战斗事迹却鲜有流传，因为没人能活过她的突袭。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591158&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dc24fcaf-2138-4341-ab9d-b7917370317c\', \'multiverseId\': 591158}, \'multiverseid\': 591158}]', '[{\'name\': \'Grenzland-Mastodon\', \'text\': \'Wildheit — Das Grenzland-Mastodon kommt mit einer +1/+1-Marke ins Spiel, falls du eine Kreatur mit Stärke 4 oder mehr kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elefant\', \'flavor\': \'Jede Bronze-Lamelle an seinem Zaumzeug ist eine Gabe eines jungen Temur-Jägers — ein Zeichen des Respekts für die Geister der Wildnis.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592862&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c222ac87-533a-4e56-bace-41d99d7f7f43\', \'multiverseId\': 592862}, \'multiverseid\': 592862}, {\'name\': \'Mastodonte fronterizo\', \'text\': \'Ferocidad — El Mastodonte fronterizo entra al campo de batalla con un contador +1/+1 sobre él si controlas una criatura con fuerza de 4 o más.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elefante\', \'flavor\': \'Cada disco de bronce que pende de su arnés es una ofrenda de un joven cazador temur, en señal de respeto a los espíritus salvajes.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592983&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1d8282ed-facb-475f-bf6f-74f7d27f7f8f\', \'multiverseId\': 592983}, \'multiverseid\': 592983}, {\'name\': \'Mastodonte des frontières\', \'text\': \'Férocité — Le Mastodonte des frontières arrive sur le champ de bataille avec un marqueur +1/+1 sur lui si vous contrôlez une créature de force supérieure ou égale à 4.\', \'type\': \'Créature : éléphant\', \'flavor\': "Chaque disque de bronze qu\'il porte à son harnachement est une offrande d\'un jeune chasseur temurien, un gage de respect envers les esprits de la nature.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593104&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0fcef2ae-42ff-4c76-a4f3-b148ee06020f\', \'multiverseId\': 593104}, \'multiverseid\': 593104}, {\'name\': \'Mastodonte di Frontiera\', \'text\': \'Ferocia — Il Mastodonte di Frontiera entra nel campo di battaglia con un segnalino +1/+1 se controlli una creatura con forza pari o superiore a 4.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Elefante\', \'flavor\': "Ogni disco di bronzo sulla sua bardatura è un\'offerta da parte di un giovane cacciatore Temur, un segno di rispetto verso gli spiriti delle terre selvagge.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593225&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'49e55e8c-506c-4c44-9ef5-4d53c5868fb2\', \'multiverseId\': 593225}, \'multiverseid\': 593225}, {\'name\': \'開拓地のマストドン\', \'text\': \'獰猛 ― あなたがパワーが４以上であるクリーチャーをコントロールしているなら、開拓地のマストドンは＋１/＋１カウンター１個が置かれた状態で戦場に出る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 象\', \'flavor\': \'その装着帯に付いている青銅製の円盤の一つ一つは、若きティムールの狩人からの捧げ物であり、野生の精霊に対しての畏敬の念の表れである。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593346&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'55a12faa-ee0c-452a-8387-8cef991f7af9\', \'multiverseId\': 593346}, \'multiverseid\': 593346}, {\'name\': \'锋疆乳齿象\', \'text\': \'威猛～如果你操控力量等于或大于4的生物，则锋疆乳齿象进战场时上面有一个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～象\', \'flavor\': \'铁木尔年轻猎人将铜碟悬挂在乳齿象的挽具上，以此贡品敬拜荒野之灵。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593709&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d9fccf5d-efbe-479c-9bf7-038c31c21322\', \'multiverseId\': 593709}, \'multiverseid\': 593709}]', '[{\'name\': \'Grotag-Nachtstürmer\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn der Grotag-Nachtstürmer einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, schicke die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek ins Exil. Du kannst sie in diesem Zug spielen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Goblin, Räuber\', \'flavor\': \'Goblins sind von Natur aus wissbegierig und anpassungsfähig. Als Räuber können sie ihre kleine Statur zu ihrem Vorteil nutzen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590259&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'62116c30-3a68-4fec-b829-f49459fb10e5\', \'multiverseId\': 590259}, \'multiverseid\': 590259}, {\'name\': \'Corredor nocturno grotag\', \'text\': \'Siempre que el Corredor nocturno grotag haga daño de combate a un jugador, exilia la primera carta de tu biblioteca. Puedes jugar esa carta este turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bribón trasgo\', \'flavor\': \'Curiosos y flexibles por naturaleza. Los trasgos bribones son capaces de sacar provecho a su baja estatura.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590394&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d7b5d2f0-47e4-4715-b860-f2718fbc9c6f\', \'multiverseId\': 590394}, \'multiverseid\': 590394}, {\'name\': \'Coureur de nuit grotag\', \'text\': \'À chaque fois que le Coureur de nuit grotag inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, exilez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Vous pouvez jouer cette carte ce tour-ci.\', \'type\': \'Créature : gobelin et gredin\', \'flavor\': "Naturellement curieux et capables de s\'adapter, les gobelins peuvent mettre leur petite taille à profit en devenant de parfaits gredins.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590529&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8bac7a5d-d924-4747-a388-9e38c5e8c650\', \'multiverseId\': 590529}, \'multiverseid\': 590529}, {\'name\': \'Corridore Notturno Grotag\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta il Corridore Notturno Grotag infligge danno da combattimento a un giocatore, esilia la prima carta del tuo grimorio. Puoi giocare quella carta in questo turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Farabutto Goblin\', \'flavor\': \'Curiosi e adattabili per natura, i goblin possono sfruttare la loro statura ridotta a proprio vantaggio come furfanti.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590664&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'067372e0-4f40-4cd4-ab65-76e677ece09e\', \'multiverseId\': 590664}, \'multiverseid\': 590664}, {\'name\': \'グロータグの夜走り\', \'text\': \'グロータグの夜走りがプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード１枚を追放する。このターン、あなたはそのカードをプレイしてもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ゴブリン・ならず者\', \'flavor\': \'生まれつき詮索好きで適応力もあるゴブリンは、低身長を盗みの利点に変えられる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590799&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7fdab3d3-0e38-42ba-9609-03038310f069\', \'multiverseId\': 590799}, \'multiverseid\': 590799}, {\'name\': \'葛塔夜奔客\', \'text\': \'每当葛塔夜奔客对任一牌手造成战斗伤害时，放逐你的牌库顶牌。本回合中，你可以使用该牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～鬼怪／浪客\', \'flavor\': \'鬼怪天生好奇心旺盛，又极易适应周遭环境，当起浪客来更能将自己个头矮小的优势发挥得淋漓尽致。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591204&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d305bb4a-c423-46e5-9127-1f8946dadeec\', \'multiverseId\': 591204}, \'multiverseid\': 591204}]', '[{\'name\': \'Groteske Mutation\', \'text\': \'Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält +3/+1 und Lebensverknüpfung bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594082&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8863fc5a-b4ea-4f5b-8450-9518f7d2b226\', \'multiverseId\': 594082}, \'multiverseid\': 594082}, {\'name\': \'Mutación grotesca\', \'text\': \'La criatura objetivo obtiene +3/+1 y gana la habilidad de vínculo vital hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594199&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3f8538cb-cdbb-4969-b861-550e3882e108\', \'multiverseId\': 594199}, \'multiverseid\': 594199}, {\'name\': \'Mutation grotesque\', \'text\': "Une créature ciblée gagne +3/+1 et acquiert le lien de vie jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594316&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'92f3e451-2cab-4827-a758-278411f18889\', \'multiverseId\': 594316}, \'multiverseid\': 594316}, {\'name\': \'Mutazione Grottesca\', \'text\': \'Una creatura bersaglio prende +3/+1 e ha legame vitale fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594433&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e0aa5610-e917-4682-8fee-267a213dd5d9\', \'multiverseId\': 594433}, \'multiverseid\': 594433}, {\'name\': \'奇怪な突然変異\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは＋３/＋１の修整を受け絆魂を得る。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594550&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'676622dd-05da-49fa-806d-e7bfa2b85f76\', \'multiverseId\': 594550}, \'multiverseid\': 594550}, {\'name\': \'怪诞变异\', \'text\': \'直到回合结束，目标生物得+3/+1且获得系命异能。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594901&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'07f7ee24-dafd-4253-aab6-b95f0f5882be\', \'multiverseId\': 594901}, \'multiverseid\': 594901}]', '[{\'name\': \'Großer Coup\', \'text\': \'Wirf als zusätzliche Kosten, um diesen Zauberspruch zu wirken, eine Karte ab.\\nZiehe zwei Karten und erzeuge zwei Schatz-Spielsteine. (Sie sind Artefakte mit „{T}, opfere dieses Artefakt: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe.")\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Unvorstellbare Reichtümer? Ich kann dir versichern, ich habe eine *lebhafte* Vorstellungskraft."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590206&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c361435d-f9ac-443a-aef8-a49946e2fd12\', \'multiverseId\': 590206}, \'multiverseid\': 590206}, {\'name\': \'Hacerse de oro\', \'text\': \'Como coste adicional para lanzar este hechizo, descarta una carta.\\nRoba dos cartas y crea dos fichas de Tesoro. (Son artefactos con "{T}, sacrificar este artefacto: Agrega un maná de cualquier color".)\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"¿Riquezas inimaginables? Te aseguro que tengo una imaginación desbordante**".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590341&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9b5e703a-4153-4eba-bc2b-6fb6b6a5f432\', \'multiverseId\': 590341}, \'multiverseid\': 590341}, {\'name\': \'Le pactole\', \'text\': "En tant que coût supplémentaire pour lancer ce sort, défaussez-vous d\'une carte.\\nPiochez deux cartes et créez deux jetons Trésor. (Ce sont des artefacts avec « {T}, sacrifiez cet artefact : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix. »)", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Des richesses inimaginables ? Je peux vous assurer que j\'ai une imagination *débordante*. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590476&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'36fb753a-cbf6-4ac2-b3ae-ef20f2f43e13\', \'multiverseId\': 590476}, \'multiverseid\': 590476}, {\'name\': \'Colpo Grosso\', \'text\': \'Come costo addizionale per lanciare questa magia, scarta una carta.\\nPesca due carte e crea due pedine Tesoro. (Sono artefatti con "{T}, Sacrifica questo artefatto: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore".)\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Ricchezze inimmaginabili? Ti assicuro che ho un\\\'immaginazione molto *vivida*."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590611&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1e335af7-da2d-4984-91b1-fb13998a9892\', \'multiverseId\': 590611}, \'multiverseid\': 590611}, {\'name\': \'大勝ち\', \'text\': \'この呪文を唱えるための追加コストとして、カード１枚を捨てる。\\nカード２枚を引き、宝物・トークン２つを生成する。（それらは、「{T}, このアーティファクトを生け贄に捧げる：好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。」を持つアーティファクトである。）\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「想像を絶する富？大丈夫、*鮮明に*想像できるわ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590746&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5f2f4e8e-dbe3-4089-9525-d4e18cef2775\', \'multiverseId\': 590746}, \'multiverseid\': 590746}, {\'name\': \'大干一票\', \'text\': \'弃一张牌，以作为施放此咒语的额外费用。\\n抓两张牌并派出两个珍宝衍生物。（它们是具有「{T}，牺牲此神器：加一点任意颜色的法术力」的神器。）\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「有钱到难以想象？我向你保证，我有*丰富*的想象力。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591151&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3d3d9f2c-3eac-4f7f-839b-e3342cd8e8ec\', \'multiverseId\': 591151}, \'multiverseid\': 591151}]', '[{\'name\': \'Großzügige Magistratin\', \'text\': \'Die Großzügige Magistratin kommt mit fünf Galgenfristmarken ins Spiel.\\nImmer wenn eine andere Nichtspielsteinkreatur, die du kontrollierst, stirbt, und falls ihr Manabetrag 1 oder mehr war, kannst du entsprechend viele Galgenfristmarken von der Großzügigen Magistratin entfernen. Falls du dies tust, bringe jene Karte unter der Kontrolle ihres Besitzers ins Spiel zurück.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Berater\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589612&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'da73e439-1816-4286-8e11-2a67f1ebe0d4\', \'multiverseId\': 589612}, \'multiverseid\': 589612}, {\'name\': \'Magistrada magnánima\', \'text\': \'La Magistrada magnánima entra al campo de batalla con cinco contadores de prórroga sobre ella.\\nSiempre que otra criatura que no sea ficha que controlas muera, si su valor de maná era de 1 o más, puedes remover esa misma cantidad de contadores de prórroga de la Magistrada magnánima. Si lo haces, regresa esa carta al campo de batalla bajo el control de su propietario.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Consejero humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589663&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a57568c8-648a-4731-ab22-980561662a70\', \'multiverseId\': 589663}, \'multiverseid\': 589663}, {\'name\': \'Magistrate magnanime\', \'text\': "La Magistrate magnanime arrive sur le champ de bataille avec cinq marqueurs « répit » sur elle.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'une autre créature non-jeton que vous contrôlez meurt, si sa valeur de mana était supérieure ou égale à 1, vous pouvez retirer autant de marqueurs « répit » de la Magistrate magnanime. Si vous faites ainsi, renvoyez cette carte sur le champ de bataille sous le contrôle de son propriétaire.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et conseiller\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589714&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1a417944-8f8d-4540-a820-e73bdb37fa8f\', \'multiverseId\': 589714}, \'multiverseid\': 589714}, {\'name\': \'Magistrata Magnanima\', \'text\': "La Magistrata Magnanima entra nel campo di battaglia con cinque segnalini clemenza.\\nOgniqualvolta un\'altra creatura non pedina che controlli muore, se il suo valore di mana era pari o superiore a 1, puoi rimuovere altrettanti segnalini clemenza dalla Magistrata Magnanima. Se lo fai, rimetti quella carta sul campo di battaglia sotto il controllo del suo proprietario.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Consigliere Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589765&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c020c801-b678-4403-963d-e3d73a45cc76\', \'multiverseId\': 589765}, \'multiverseid\': 589765}, {\'name\': \'寛大な判事\', \'text\': \'寛大な判事は猶予カウンター５個が置かれた状態で戦場に出る。\\nあなたがコントロールしていてトークンでもこれでもないクリーチャー１体が死亡するたび、そのマナ総量が１以上であった場合、あなたはその数に等しい個数の猶予カウンターを寛大な判事の上から取り除いてもよい。そうしたなら、そのカードをオーナーのコントロール下で戦場に戻す。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・アドバイザー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589816&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'20fff991-ad86-458b-8245-69b77b905add\', \'multiverseId\': 589816}, \'multiverseid\': 589816}, {\'name\': \'宽宏执政官\', \'text\': \'宽宏执政官进战场时上面有五个免难指示物。\\n每当另一个由你操控且非衍生物的生物死去时，若它的法术力值等于或大于1，则你可以从宽宏执政官上移去等量的免难指示物。若你如此作，则将该牌在其拥有者的操控下移回战场。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／参谋\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589969&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8b71416d-22f8-4794-b505-3b4edabc4901\', \'multiverseId\': 589969}, \'multiverseid\': 589969}]', '[{\'name\': \'Grubenhüter\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Grubenhüter ins Spiel kommt und falls sich vier oder mehr Kreaturenkarten in deinem Friedhof befinden, kannst du eine Kreaturenkarte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurückbringen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': \'„Die Untoten wurden nicht erweckt. Sie werden rausgeworfen, wenn in der Grube kein Platz mehr für neue Leichen ist."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594112&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6e894517-d28c-44bc-b978-f6bd7f211aa7\', \'multiverseId\': 594112}, \'multiverseid\': 594112}, {\'name\': \'Guardián del abismo\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Guardián del abismo entre al campo de batalla, si tienes cuatro o más cartas de criatura en tu cementerio, puedes regresar la carta de criatura objetivo de tu cementerio a tu mano.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Los muertos vivientes no son \\\'despertados\\\'. Son desalojados cuando ya no hay más lugar en el abismo para más cuerpos".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594229&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'282905d4-ff21-437c-909c-b140ef501225\', \'multiverseId\': 594229}, \'multiverseid\': 594229}, {\'name\': \'Gardien de la fosse\', \'text\': \'Quand le Gardien de la fosse arrive sur le champ de bataille, si vous avez au moins quatre cartes de créature dans votre cimetière, vous pouvez renvoyer une carte de créature ciblée depuis votre cimetière dans votre main.\', \'type\': \'Créature : humain et sorcier\', \'flavor\': "« Les morts-vivants ne sont pas \'ramenés à la vie.\' Ils sont expulsés de la fosse quand il n\'y a plus de place pour des cadavres. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594346&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e7726092-3959-47e3-9499-359d07d1f05b\', \'multiverseId\': 594346}, \'multiverseid\': 594346}, {\'name\': "Custode dell\'Abisso", \'text\': "Quando il Custode dell\'Abisso entra nel campo di battaglia, se hai quattro o più carte creatura nel tuo cimitero, puoi riprendere in mano una carta creatura bersaglio dal tuo cimitero.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Mago Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"I non morti non sono \\\'risvegliati\\\'. Vengono sfrattati quando non rimane più posto per altri corpi nell\\\'abisso."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594463&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8de6b63c-28ad-41ee-af7c-beb3137aedf0\', \'multiverseId\': 594463}, \'multiverseid\': 594463}, {\'name\': \'奈落の守り手\', \'text\': \'奈落の守り手が戦場に出たとき、あなたの墓地に４枚以上のクリーチャー・カードがある場合、あなたの墓地にあるクリーチャー・カード１枚を対象とする。あなたはそれをあなたの手札に戻してもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': \'「アンデッドは『目覚めさせられた』わけではない。奈落に死体が増えすぎて、居場所が無くなり追い出されたのだ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594580&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'029d2b8e-20c3-491b-9fc3-2d5fabf88236\', \'multiverseId\': 594580}, \'multiverseid\': 594580}, {\'name\': \'暗渊门卫\', \'text\': \'当暗渊门卫进战场时，若你坟墓场中有四张或更多生物牌，则你可以将目标生物牌从你的坟墓场移回你手上。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／法术师\', \'flavor\': \'「不死生物并非给『唤醒』。它们是因暗渊挤不下新尸体而被赶出来的。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594931&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6b0dcfb5-1685-4602-a2b3-1df97e0232bb\', \'multiverseId\': 594931}, \'multiverseid\': 594931}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gruftratten\', \'text\': \'{X}: Die Gruftratten fügen jeder Kreatur und jedem Spieler X Schadenspunkte zu. Gib für X nur schwarzes Mana aus.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Ratte\', \'flavor\': \'„Ksch! Verschwindet, ihr kleinen Wurmschwänze. Meine Leichen sind nicht euer Abendessen!"\\n—Gisa die Ghulruferin\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594049&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3a7bbb5c-189e-42a6-81db-f7103142982e\', \'multiverseId\': 594049}, \'multiverseid\': 594049}, {\'name\': \'Ratas de la cripta\', \'text\': \'{X}: Las Ratas de la cripta hacen X puntos de daño a cada criatura y a cada jugador. Usa solo maná negro para pagar X.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Rata\', \'flavor\': \'"¡Fuera, colitas de gusano! ¡Largo de aquí! ¡Mis cadáveres no son vuestra cena!".\\n—Gisa, la llamamuertos\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594166&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'317f9fcc-b933-494d-ab9f-398ae99918fd\', \'multiverseId\': 594166}, \'multiverseid\': 594166}, {\'name\': \'Rats des cryptes\', \'text\': \'{X} : Les Rats des cryptes infligent X blessures à chaque créature et à chaque joueur. Ne dépensez que du mana noir pour X.\', \'type\': \'Créature : rat\', \'flavor\': \'« Pschttt, misérables vermines ! Allez-vous-en ! Mes cadavres ne sont pas pour vous ! »\\n—Gisa, meneuse de goule\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594283&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ac9a8ca2-8329-4843-9152-58129a2c8994\', \'multiverseId\': 594283}, \'multiverseid\': 594283}, {\'name\': \'Ratti della Cripta\', \'text\': \'{X}: I Ratti della Cripta infliggono X danni a ogni creatura e a ogni giocatore. Spendi solo mana nero per X.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Ratto\', \'flavor\': \'"Sciò, piccole code di verme, andate via! I miei cadaveri non sono la vostra cena!"\\n—Gisa l\\\'evocaghoul\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594400&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'216c739c-df81-4c2c-a5b9-b9b1e2ea08f4\', \'multiverseId\': 594400}, \'multiverseid\': 594400}, {\'name\': \'墓所のネズミ\', \'text\': \'{X}：墓所のネズミは各クリーチャーと各プレイヤーにそれぞれＸ点のダメージを与える。Ｘは黒マナでしか支払えない。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ネズミ\', \'flavor\': \'「シッ、このチビどもめ。あっちへ行け！この死体はお前らのエサじゃない！」\\n――グール呼びのギサ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594517&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ed632892-7694-4e45-8527-42d7ff355ff6\', \'multiverseId\': 594517}, \'multiverseid\': 594517}, {\'name\': \'墓穴老鼠\', \'text\': \'{X}：墓穴老鼠对每个生物和每位牌手各造成X点伤害。只能将黑色法术力用于X。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～老鼠\', \'flavor\': \'「去，你们这些死耗子～一边去！我的那些尸体可不是你们的晚餐！」\\n～尸鬼牧者基沙\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594868&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d22589dc-efeb-432f-8579-568023feab8c\', \'multiverseId\': 594868}, \'multiverseid\': 594868}]', '[{\'name\': \'Grufträuber\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}, schicke eine Kreaturenkarte aus deinem Friedhof ins Exil: Erzeuge einen Schatz-Spielstein. (Er ist ein Artefakt mit „{T}, opfere dieses Artefakt: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe.")\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Zwerg, Räuber\', \'flavor\': \'Die Zwerge glauben, Kunstwerke sollten von Generation zu Generation weitergegeben werden, nicht mit den Toten begraben.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590325&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dcf8d2f3-c152-4ccc-bff2-e795b060b84e\', \'multiverseId\': 590325}, \'multiverseid\': 590325}, {\'name\': \'Ladrón de la cripta\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}, exiliar una carta de criatura de tu cementerio: Crea una ficha de Tesoro. (Es un artefacto con "{T}, sacrificar este artefacto: Agrega un maná de cualquier color".)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bribón enano\', \'flavor\': \'Los enanos creen que las obras de arte deberían pasar de generación en generación y no estar enterradas con los muertos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590460&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'050a74f6-ed46-4ef3-bcb7-ea7dd57e562a\', \'multiverseId\': 590460}, \'multiverseid\': 590460}, {\'name\': \'Voleur de caveau\', \'text\': "{1}, {T}, exilez une carte de créature depuis votre cimetière : Créez un jeton Trésor. (C\'est un artefact avec « {T}, sacrifiez cet artefact : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix. »)", \'type\': \'Créature : nain et gredin\', \'flavor\': "Les nains estiment que les œuvres d\'art doivent être transmises de génération en génération, pas enterrées avec les morts.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590595&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9fb7b025-de64-4a19-a872-1b494b743acf\', \'multiverseId\': 590595}, \'multiverseid\': 590595}, {\'name\': \'Ladro della Cripta\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}, Esilia una carta creatura dal tuo cimitero: Crea una pedina Tesoro. (È un artefatto con "{T}, Sacrifica questo artefatto: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore".)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Farabutto Nano\', \'flavor\': "I nani credono che le opere d\'arte vadano trasmesse di generazione in generazione, piuttosto che seppellite insieme ai morti.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590730&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e9c353af-cbec-43c8-b147-eb8dd21eab09\', \'multiverseId\': 590730}, \'multiverseid\': 590730}, {\'name\': \'玄室荒らし\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}, あなたの墓地にあるクリーチャー・カード１枚を追放する：宝物・トークン１つを生成する。（それは、「{T}, このアーティファクトを生け贄に捧げる：好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。」を持つアーティファクトである。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ドワーフ・ならず者\', \'flavor\': \'ドワーフたちの考えによれば、芸術品は世代を越えて継承されるもので、死体と一緒に埋葬するべきではない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590865&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f7c76f5b-11e9-4648-9c9d-fb7633a52a1d\', \'multiverseId\': 590865}, \'multiverseid\': 590865}, {\'name\': \'墓穴劫匪\', \'text\': \'{1}，{T}，从你的坟墓场放逐一张生物牌：派出一个珍宝衍生物。（它是具有「{T}，牺牲此神器：加一点任意颜色的法术力」的神器。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～矮人／浪客\', \'flavor\': \'矮人觉得工艺品应该代代相传，而不是和死人埋在一起。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591270&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cb34398a-2750-4320-a32a-5ccde83880f8\', \'multiverseId\': 591270}, \'multiverseid\': 591270}]', '[{\'name\': \'Größer machen\', \'text\': \'Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält +7/+7 und verursacht Trampelschaden bis zum Ende des Zuges. Sie muss in diesem Zug geblockt werden, falls möglich.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Für Miezi war es nur ein weiterer Tag am Strand.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592855&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9d9df2e5-b563-47b8-bbb8-4b70862928c4\', \'multiverseId\': 592855}, \'multiverseid\': 592855}, {\'name\': \'Agrandar\', \'text\': \'La criatura objetivo obtiene +7/+7 y gana la habilidad de arrollar hasta el final del turno. Debe ser bloqueada este turno si se puede.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Para el señor Bigotes, fue un día de playa cualquiera.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592976&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'60ff38ed-b00b-4cfa-90bd-41a7d20b9ec7\', \'multiverseId\': 592976}, \'multiverseid\': 592976}, {\'name\': \'Agrandir\', \'text\': "Une créature ciblée gagne +7/+7 et acquiert le piétinement jusqu\'à la fin du tour. Elle doit être bloquée ce tour-ci si possible.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Pour Mistigri, ce n\'était qu\'une journée ordinaire à la plage.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593097&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'51628dfb-b192-4f8d-8597-a25f3a13a8bc\', \'multiverseId\': 593097}, \'multiverseid\': 593097}, {\'name\': \'Allargare\', \'text\': \'Una creatura bersaglio prende +7/+7 e ha travolgere fino alla fine del turno. Deve essere bloccata in questo turno, se possibile.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': "Per Fiocco era solo un\'altra giornata al mare.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593218&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5b125365-a255-4dc3-8163-14644b52f5ad\', \'multiverseId\': 593218}, \'multiverseid\': 593218}, {\'name\': \'大型化\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは＋７/＋７の修整を受けトランプルを得る。このターン、それは可能ならブロックされなければならない。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'猫にとっては普段通りの浜辺での一日に過ぎなかった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593339&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'db443f1f-4442-4319-b4b3-a2eb775502a6\', \'multiverseId\': 593339}, \'multiverseid\': 593339}, {\'name\': \'增大\', \'text\': \'直到回合结束，目标生物得+7/+7且获得践踏异能。它本回合若能被阻挡，则须如此作。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'在小绒爪看来，只不过又是海滩上稀松平常的一天。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593702&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1850785d-a751-4435-93cb-1e745d894397\', \'multiverseId\': 593702}, \'multiverseid\': 593702}]', '[{\'name\': \'Göttlicher Pfeil\', \'text\': \'Der Göttliche Pfeil fügt einer angreifenden oder blockenden Kreatur deiner Wahl 4 Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Außerhalb der Mauern von Drannith, wo Kollateralschaden keine Rolle spielt, dürfen die Kupferjacken auch wirksamere Methoden anwenden.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591582&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'255b7214-3daf-4ec8-b1a1-b481efadbf6a\', \'multiverseId\': 591582}, \'multiverseid\': 591582}, {\'name\': \'Flecha divina\', \'text\': \'La Flecha divina hace 4 puntos de daño a la criatura atacante o bloqueadora objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Fuera de los muros de Drannith, donde a nadie preocupan los daños colaterales, las Capas de Cobre tienen libertad para emplear métodos más contundentes.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591711&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a4b759b2-50ab-4f32-85e7-0f7195ea9f3b\', \'multiverseId\': 591711}, \'multiverseid\': 591711}, {\'name\': \'Flèche divine\', \'text\': \'La Flèche divine inflige 4 blessures à une créature attaquante ou bloqueuse ciblée.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "À l\'extérieur des murailles de Drannith, là où les dommages collatéraux importent peu, les Capes de cuivre sont libres d\'appliquer des méthodes plus radicales.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591840&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'77d17d39-00fb-4bd7-866e-7fa3dc1f5a8b\', \'multiverseId\': 591840}, \'multiverseid\': 591840}, {\'name\': \'Freccia Divina\', \'text\': \'La Freccia Divina infligge 4 danni a una creatura attaccante o bloccante bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'Fuori dalle mura di Drannith, dove i danni collaterali non sono un problema, le Giubbe Ramate sono libere di usare metodi più potenti.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591969&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5c5eb715-53ea-4e9b-a0c7-d1fcf9ee76ef\', \'multiverseId\': 591969}, \'multiverseid\': 591969}, {\'name\': \'神聖なる矢\', \'text\': \'攻撃クリーチャーやブロック・クリーチャーのうち１体を対象とする。神聖なる矢はそれに４点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'ドラニスの壁の外では巻き添えの心配がないので、銅纏いも強力な手段が使える。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592098&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2fe20488-aca8-4168-a475-e1fc39271363\', \'multiverseId\': 592098}, \'multiverseid\': 592098}, {\'name\': \'神箭穿心\', \'text\': \'神箭穿心对目标进行攻击或阻挡的生物造成4点伤害。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'在卓尼斯的高墙之外不用担心误伤无辜，紫铜军可以自由运用更加有效的制敌手段。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592485&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'db480d42-1266-461b-a83c-fc4653e0fe65\', \'multiverseId\': 592485}, \'multiverseid\': 592485}]', '[{\'name\': \'Göttliches Verdikt\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre eine angreifende oder blockende Kreatur deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Riesen und Grubengezücht versuchten, die Säulen der Kathedrale umzuwerfen. Der Staub, der von ihnen übrig geblieben ist, weht immer noch durch die Straßen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591583&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'27333532-eaf2-4f5c-ab19-58a0bebebe24\', \'multiverseId\': 591583}, \'multiverseid\': 591583}, {\'name\': \'Veredicto divino\', \'text\': \'Destruye la criatura atacante o bloqueadora objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Gigantes y demonios intentaron derrumbar los pilares de la catedral. La delgada capa de sus restos aún se arremolina con la brisa allí afuera.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591712&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1b4c7226-47b8-48f6-a17f-170e2c152b12\', \'multiverseId\': 591712}, \'multiverseid\': 591712}, {\'name\': \'Verdict divin\', \'text\': \'Détruisez une créature attaquante ou bloqueuse ciblée.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "Les géants et l\'engeance de l\'Abîme essayèrent de renverser les piliers de la cathédrale. La poussière fine de leurs cendres tourbillonne encore dans la brise.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591841&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6afed987-54ee-4af9-93fb-5b3234e3dbda\', \'multiverseId\': 591841}, \'multiverseid\': 591841}, {\'name\': \'Verdetto Divino\', \'text\': \'Distruggi una creatura attaccante o bloccante bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': "I giganti e le progenie dell\'abisso tentarono di far crollare i pilastri della cattedrale. La polvere fine dei loro resti continua a turbinare nella brezza all\'esterno.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591970&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0d2f1061-d24c-47aa-955e-ec500145c38a\', \'multiverseId\': 591970}, \'multiverseid\': 591970}, {\'name\': \'神聖なる評決\', \'text\': \'攻撃クリーチャーやブロック・クリーチャーのうち１体を対象とする。それを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'巨人や奈落の落とし子たちは、聖堂の柱を倒そうとしていた。彼らの残骸の塵は、いまだに外の風に舞っている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592099&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1464b5f0-010a-4dac-aa5b-b531e955b586\', \'multiverseId\': 592099}, \'multiverseid\': 592099}, {\'name\': \'明圣裁定\', \'text\': \'消灭目标进行攻击或阻挡的生物。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'巨人与暗渊魔裔曾试图弄垮教堂础柱。他们遗体所化的尘埃至今仍随着门外微风打转。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592486&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1670bb70-8a0c-41d7-8201-b8b083e6a743\', \'multiverseId\': 592486}, \'multiverseid\': 592486}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gütige Hydra\', \'text\': \'Die Gütige Hydra kommt mit X +1/+1-Marken ins Spiel.\\nFalls eine oder mehrere +1/+1-Marken auf eine andere Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, gelegt würden, werden stattdessen so viele plus eine +1/+1-Marken auf sie gelegt.\\n{T}, entferne eine +1/+1-Marke von der Gütigen Hydra: Lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf eine andere Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Hydra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589643&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7c0a50b6-c147-45e7-a3b0-41ffbd3a5d3c\', \'multiverseId\': 589643}, \'multiverseid\': 589643}, {\'name\': \'Hidra benévola\', \'text\': \'La Hidra benévola entra al campo de batalla con X contadores +1/+1 sobre ella.\\nSi fueran a ponerse uno o más contadores +1/+1 sobre otra criatura que controlas, en vez de eso, se pone esa misma cantidad de contadores +1/+1 más uno sobre ella.\\n{T}, remover un contador +1/+1 de la Hidra benévola: Pon un contador +1/+1 sobre otra criatura objetivo que controlas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hidra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589694&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c7d61952-18fb-4161-8383-e3a0fd11cbb4\', \'multiverseId\': 589694}, \'multiverseid\': 589694}, {\'name\': \'Hydre bienveillante\', \'text\': "L\'Hydre bienveillante arrive sur le champ de bataille avec X marqueurs +1/+1 sur elle.\\nSi au moins un marqueur +1/+1 devait être mis sur une autre créature que vous contrôlez, autant de marqueurs +1/+1 plus un sont mis sur elle à la place.\\n{T}, retirez un marqueur +1/+1 de l\'Hydre bienveillante : Mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur une autre créature ciblée que vous contrôlez.", \'type\': \'Créature : hydre\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589745&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4c7fe09c-8686-4f7f-a00a-982f6670dcfe\', \'multiverseId\': 589745}, \'multiverseid\': 589745}, {\'name\': \'Idra Benevola\', \'text\': "L\'Idra Benevola entra nel campo di battaglia con X segnalini +1/+1.\\nSe uno o più segnalini +1/+1 stanno per essere messi su un\'altra creatura che controlli, mettine invece uno in più.\\n{T}, Rimuovi un segnalino +1/+1 dall\'Idra Benevola: Metti un segnalino +1/+1 su un\'altra creatura bersaglio che controlli.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Idra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589796&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d451bf1e-ba01-4252-a5b7-8a84622d46b5\', \'multiverseId\': 589796}, \'multiverseid\': 589796}, {\'name\': \'心優しきハイドラ\', \'text\': \'心優しきハイドラは＋１/＋１カウンターＸ個が置かれた状態で戦場に出る。\\nあなたがコントロールしていてこれでないクリーチャー１体の上に１個以上の＋１/＋１カウンターが置かれるなら、代わりにそれの上にその個数に１を足した個数の＋１/＋１カウンターを置く。\\n{T},心優しきハイドラの上から＋１/＋１カウンター１個を取り除く：あなたがコントロールしていてこれでないクリーチャー１体を対象とする。それの上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ハイドラ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589847&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8f7a0afe-a032-4b4b-8ffa-9b3bfb7ace68\', \'multiverseId\': 589847}, \'multiverseid\': 589847}, {\'name\': \'善心多头龙\', \'text\': \'善心多头龙进战场时上面有X个+1/+1指示物。\\n如果将在另一个由你操控的生物上放置一个或数个+1/+1指示物，则改为在其上放置该数量加一的+1/+1指示物。\\n{T}，从善心多头龙上移去一个+1/+1指示物：在另一个目标由你操控的生物上放置一个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～多头龙\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590000&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5839c3c8-39f2-4176-8552-c7e5bbd89762\', \'multiverseId\': 590000}, \'multiverseid\': 590000}]', '[{\'name\': \'Hammer des Verderbens\', \'text\': \'Die ausgerüstete Kreatur erhält +2/+0.\\nImmer wenn die ausgerüstete Kreatur einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, kannst du eine Ausrüstung deiner Wahl, die der Spieler kontrolliert, zerstören.\\nAusrüsten {2} ({2}: Lege diese Karte an eine Kreatur deiner Wahl an, die du kontrollierst. Spiele Ausrüsten wie eine Hexerei.)\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Ausrüstung\', \'flavor\': \'Von einem Hammer geschmiedet und von einem Hammer verschrottet.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596275&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'903d9889-e30a-4e96-8c74-544dce747aaa\', \'multiverseId\': 596275}, \'multiverseid\': 596275}, {\'name\': \'Martillo de destrucción\', \'text\': \'La criatura equipada obtiene +2/+0.\\nSiempre que la criatura equipada haga daño de combate a un jugador, puedes destruir el equipo objetivo que controla ese jugador.\\nEquipar {2}. ({2}: Anexa este Equipo a la criatura objetivo que controlas. Activa la habilidad de equipar como un conjuro.)\', \'type\': \'Artefacto — Equipo\', \'flavor\': \'Forjado por un martillo, destruido por un martillo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596362&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'63f69e79-c4b5-4d47-a3a1-5108da0511c7\', \'multiverseId\': 596362}, \'multiverseid\': 596362}, {\'name\': \'Marteau de ruine\', \'text\': "La créature équipée gagne +2/+0.\\nÀ chaque fois que la créature équipée inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, vous pouvez détruire un équipement ciblé que ce joueur contrôle.\\nÉquipement {2} ({2} : Attachez à une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez. N\'attachez l\'équipement que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.)", \'type\': \'Artefact : équipement\', \'flavor\': \'Forgé au marteau, détruit au marteau.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596449&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3f256f2b-b965-4c09-baf3-8f04a86aab12\', \'multiverseId\': 596449}, \'multiverseid\': 596449}, {\'name\': \'Martello delle Rovine\', \'text\': \'La creatura equipaggiata prende +2/+0.\\nOgniqualvolta la creatura equipaggiata infligge danno da combattimento a un giocatore, puoi distruggere un Equipaggiamento bersaglio controllato da quel giocatore.\\nEquipaggiare {2} ({2}: Assegna a una creatura bersaglio che controlli. Equipaggia solo come una stregoneria.)\', \'type\': \'Artefatto — Equipaggiamento\', \'flavor\': \'Dal martello forgiato, dal martello distrutto.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596536&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c6d4dfa7-1fcf-4d43-81d8-5c65f94b2649\', \'multiverseId\': 596536}, \'multiverseid\': 596536}, {\'name\': \'破滅の槌\', \'text\': \'装備しているクリーチャーは＋２/＋０の修整を受ける。\\n装備しているクリーチャーがプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、そのプレイヤーがコントロールしている装備品１つを対象とする。あなたはそれを破壊してもよい。\\n装備{2}（{2}：あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。これをそれにつける。装備はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。）\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 装備品\', \'flavor\': \'槌によって鋳られ、槌によって失われる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596623&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4d0f73b2-ada4-4348-9306-d7ac0556a880\', \'multiverseId\': 596623}, \'multiverseid\': 596623}, {\'name\': \'崩坏锤\', \'text\': \'佩带此武具的生物得+2/+0。\\n每当佩带此武具的生物对任一牌手造成战斗伤害时，你可以消灭目标由该牌手操控的武具。\\n佩带{2}（{2}：贴附在目标由你操控的生物上。只能于法术时机佩带。）\', \'type\': \'神器 ～武具\', \'flavor\': \'由锤铸造，由锤崩毁。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596884&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b051e2b2-669c-4c1c-86b4-61a7ffd96918\', \'multiverseId\': 596884}, \'multiverseid\': 596884}]', '[{\'name\': \'Hangar-Schreiter\', \'text\': \'Der Hangar-Schreiter kommt mit X +1/+1-Marken ins Spiel.\\nWenn der Hangar-Schreiter stirbt, erzeuge für jede +1/+1-Marke auf dem Hangar-Schreiter einen 1/1 farblosen Thopter-Artefaktkreaturenspielstein mit Flugfähigkeit.\\n{1}, {T}: Lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf den Hangar-Schreiter.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Konstrukt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596276&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1456521d-8b5e-45bc-8558-39228cd528da\', \'multiverseId\': 596276}, \'multiverseid\': 596276}, {\'name\': \'Caminante lomohangar\', \'text\': \'El Caminante lomohangar entra al campo de batalla con X contadores +1/+1 sobre él.\\nCuando el Caminante lomohangar muera, crea una ficha de criatura artefacto Tóptero incolora 1/1 con la habilidad de volar por cada contador +1/+1 sobre el Caminante lomohangar.\\n{1}, {T}: Pon un contador +1/+1 sobre el Caminante lomohangar.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Constructo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596363&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'df9e6e1f-cbea-4541-a6e2-a4ce09a098a2\', \'multiverseId\': 596363}, \'multiverseid\': 596363}, {\'name\': \'Marcheur porte-hangars\', \'text\': \'Le Marcheur porte-hangars arrive sur le champ de bataille avec X marqueurs +1/+1 sur lui.\\nQuand le Marcheur porte-hangars meurt, créez un jeton de créature-artefact 1/1 incolore Mécanoptère avec le vol pour chaque marqueur +1/+1 sur le Marcheur porte-hangars.\\n{1}, {T} : Mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur le Marcheur porte-hangars.\', \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : construction\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596450&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'58b07fd1-4763-4e34-ae07-400fbf9e753c\', \'multiverseId\': 596450}, \'multiverseid\': 596450}, {\'name\': \'Errante Portaturbinanti\', \'text\': "L\'Errante Portaturbinanti entra nel campo di battaglia con X segnalini +1/+1.\\nQuando l\'Errante Portaturbinanti muore, crea una pedina creatura artefatto Tottero 1/1 incolore con volare per ogni segnalino +1/+1 sull\'Errante Portaturbinanti.\\n{1}, {T}: Metti un segnalino +1/+1 sull\'Errante Portaturbinanti.", \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Costrutto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596537&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'456f09be-8daa-456b-ac01-e32ee96c6e2a\', \'multiverseId\': 596537}, \'multiverseid\': 596537}, {\'name\': \'搭載歩行機械\', \'text\': \'搭載歩行機械は、＋１/＋１カウンターＸ個が置かれた状態で戦場に出る。\\n搭載歩行機械が死亡したとき、これの上に置かれている＋１/＋１カウンター１個につき１体の、飛行を持つ無色の１/１の飛行機械・アーティファクト・クリーチャー・トークンを生成する。\\n{1},{T}：搭載歩行機械の上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 構築物\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596624&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b4679763-013e-4883-b59d-6f94d1d3eba4\', \'multiverseId\': 596624}, \'multiverseid\': 596624}, {\'name\': \'行走机库\', \'text\': \'行走机库进战场时上面有X个+1/+1指示物。\\n当行走机库死去时，其上每有一个+1/+1指示物，便派出一个1/1无色，具飞行异能的振翼机衍生神器生物。\\n{1}，{T}：在行走机库上放置一个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～组构体\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596885&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8836aa76-4ffa-44b0-986d-6eaf5ddfed3b\', \'multiverseId\': 596885}, \'multiverseid\': 596885}]', '[{\'name\': \'Havenwood-Wurm\', \'text\': \'Aufblitzen\\nVerursacht Trampelschaden\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Wurm\', \'flavor\': \'Durch Risse im Zeitgefüge geraten immer wieder grabende Bestien aus alten Zeiten in die harte und trockene Erde der Gegenwart. Die meisten bleiben stecken und sterben, aber einige arbeiten sich bis an die Oberfläche vor.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592869&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'52268439-5f0a-4803-a200-7c499739d2fa\', \'multiverseId\': 592869}, \'multiverseid\': 592869}, {\'name\': \'Sierpe de Havenwood\', \'text\': \'Destello.\\nArrolla.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Sierpe\', \'flavor\': \'Las brechas temporales trajeron bestias de túneles de antaño a la dura y seca tierra del presente. La mayoría murió allí, atrapada, pero las más poderosas se abrieron paso a la superficie.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592990&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b7fdf196-1c04-4137-9f91-568702baf7e9\', \'multiverseId\': 592990}, \'multiverseid\': 592990}, {\'name\': "Guivre d\'Havrebois", \'text\': \'Flash\\nPiétinement\', \'type\': \'Créature : guivre\', \'flavor\': "Les failles temporelles déposent les créatures fouisseuses d\'hier dans la terre dure et desséchée du présent. La plupart y meurent, prises au piège, mais les plus puissantes jaillissent à la surface.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593111&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'28fcdf3f-52e8-4c6e-8a41-fbacb93178a9\', \'multiverseId\': 593111}, \'multiverseid\': 593111}, {\'name\': \'Wurm di Havenwood\', \'text\': \'Lampo\\nTravolgere\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Wurm\', \'flavor\': \'Gli squarci temporali portano bestie antiche a scavare tunnel nella dura terra riarsa del presente. Molti muoiono lì, intrappolati, ma i più potenti irrompono in superficie.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593232&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'566e4b98-5607-48bf-aa3e-fb7dd4af278e\', \'multiverseId\': 593232}, \'multiverseid\': 593232}, {\'name\': \'ヘイヴンウッドのワーム\', \'text\': \'瞬速\\nトランプル\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ワーム\', \'flavor\': \'時の裂け目は、かつての穴掘りの猛獣を、現在の固く乾いた地へと導いた。ほとんどはそこを抜け出せず死んだが、最強のものは地表をぶち破っていった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593353&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8801fb39-3e25-4f57-9f4a-497498b78aa4\', \'multiverseId\': 593353}, \'multiverseid\': 593353}, {\'name\': \'海温森亚龙\', \'text\': \'闪现\\n践踏\', \'type\': \'生物 ～亚龙\', \'flavor\': \'时间裂缝将古代野兽拉到现代的硬厚枯干土壤中。大多数不是死掉便是受困其间，只有最强力的才得以破土而出。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593716&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7c2f9e01-fb9e-4d93-b9a9-9990e6706c15\', \'multiverseId\': 593716}, \'multiverseid\': 593716}]', '[{\'name\': \'Heiße Glut\', \'text\': \'Die Heiße Glut fügt einem Ziel deiner Wahl X Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Das Feuer stirbt nie alleine.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590207&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c5412218-936e-4d43-8a86-e336ee5f6788\', \'multiverseId\': 590207}, \'multiverseid\': 590207}, {\'name\': \'Llamarada\', \'text\': \'La Llamarada hace X puntos de daño a cualquier objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'El fuego nunca muere solo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590342&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'705df9af-9419-40aa-8836-446b291d1de4\', \'multiverseId\': 590342}, \'multiverseid\': 590342}, {\'name\': \'Brasier\', \'text\': "Le Brasier inflige X blessures à n\'importe quelle cible.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'Le feu ne meurt jamais seul.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590477&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'60fdc1c5-60a5-4b59-81a1-a8ff1ef5946e\', \'multiverseId\': 590477}, \'multiverseid\': 590477}, {\'name\': \'Fiammata\', \'text\': \'La Fiammata infligge X danni a un qualsiasi bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'Il fuoco non muore mai da solo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590612&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2abd720d-3801-4866-bff7-9ac2bdd92082\', \'multiverseId\': 590612}, \'multiverseid\': 590612}, {\'name\': \'猛火\', \'text\': \'クリーチャーやプレインズウォーカーやプレイヤーのうち１つを対象とする。猛火はそれにＸ点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'炎が、それだけで燃え尽きることはない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590747&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'62d7200f-0066-49be-91b4-ead97696f7f6\', \'multiverseId\': 590747}, \'multiverseid\': 590747}, {\'name\': \'焰球\', \'text\': \'焰球对任意一个目标造成X点伤害。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'火焰永不会独自熄灭。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591152&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'35587106-8b22-4974-ad41-6fd4a1a5402c\', \'multiverseId\': 591152}, \'multiverseid\': 591152}]', '[{\'name\': \'Herablassen\', \'text\': \'Neutralisiere einen Zauberspruch deiner Wahl, es sei denn, sein Beherrscher bezahlt {X}. Hellsicht 2. (Schaue dir die obersten zwei Karten deiner Bibliothek an. Du kannst eine beliebige Anzahl davon unter deine Bibliothek legen und den Rest in beliebiger Reihenfolge oben darauf.)\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Schade, dass wir nie erfahren werden, worum da so ein Gewese gemacht wurde."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595208&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ab552435-bd94-4302-978b-02c8d4d55493\', \'multiverseId\': 595208}, \'multiverseid\': 595208}, {\'name\': \'Condescender\', \'text\': \'Contrarresta el hechizo objetivo a menos que su controlador pague {X}. Adivina 2. (Mira las dos primeras cartas de tu biblioteca, luego pon cualquier cantidad de ellas en el fondo de tu biblioteca y el resto en la parte superior en cualquier orden.)\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Qué lástima, nunca sabremos a qué venía todo esto".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595316&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2b67762c-97ee-4827-b7a1-873b2a2f5263\', \'multiverseId\': 595316}, \'multiverseid\': 595316}, {\'name\': \'Condescendance\', \'text\': "Contrecarrez un sort ciblé à moins que son contrôleur ne paie {X}. Regard 2. (Regardez les deux cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Mettez n\'importe quel nombre d\'entre elles au-dessous de votre bibliothèque et le reste, au-dessus, dans l\'ordre de votre choix.)", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Dommage qu\'on ne verra jamais de quoi il s\'agissait. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595424&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d11139db-15ed-419c-a931-50d82e31fd70\', \'multiverseId\': 595424}, \'multiverseid\': 595424}, {\'name\': \'Acconsentire\', \'text\': \'Neutralizza una magia bersaglio a meno che il suo controllore non paghi {X}. Profetizza 2. (Guarda le prime due carte del tuo grimorio, poi mettine un qualsiasi numero in fondo al tuo grimorio e le altre in cima in qualsiasi ordine.)\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"È un peccato che non sapremo mai quale fosse il problema."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595532&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c30f66c7-512f-41ee-9878-d046cefb2ccd\', \'multiverseId\': 595532}, \'multiverseid\': 595532}, {\'name\': \'卑下\', \'text\': \'呪文１つを対象とする。それのコントローラーが{X}を支払わないかぎり、それを打ち消す。占術２を行う。（あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード２枚を見て、そのうちの望む枚数をあなたのライブラリーの一番下に、残りを一番上に、それぞれ望む順番で置く。）\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「あの騒ぎが何だったのか分からないのは残念だ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595640&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'327411ed-acc3-4eaf-9a6a-fb13a9771b9e\', \'multiverseId\': 595640}, \'multiverseid\': 595640}, {\'name\': \'睥睨\', \'text\': \'除非目标咒语的操控者支付{X}，否则反击之。占卜2。（检视你牌库顶的两张牌，然后将其中任意数量的牌以任意顺序置于你牌库底，其余则以任意顺序置于你牌库顶。）\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「可惜我们再也看不到会有什么花样了。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595964&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ee220aed-df85-4cbb-b3f9-223f31961238\', \'multiverseId\': 595964}, \'multiverseid\': 595964}]', '[{\'name\': \'Herausforderndes Gebrüll\', \'text\': \'Alle Kreaturen, die eine Kreatur deiner Wahl in diesem Zug blocken können, tun dies.\\nWildheit — Die Kreatur erhält Unzerstörbarkeit bis zum Ende des Zuges, falls du eine Kreatur mit Stärke 4 oder mehr kontrollierst. (Schaden und Effekte, die „zerstören", zerstören sie nicht.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592919&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1b843102-1cff-40d9-9b32-eef2bc3ca331\', \'multiverseId\': 592919}, \'multiverseid\': 592919}, {\'name\': \'Rugido de desafío\', \'text\': \'Todas las criaturas que puedan bloquear a la criatura objetivo este turno lo hacen.\\nFerocidad — Esa criatura gana la habilidad de indestructible hasta el final del turno si controlas una criatura con fuerza de 4 o más. (El daño y los efectos que dicen "destruir" no la destruyen.)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593040&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3e999959-49eb-4655-a93c-7dd504c84e01\', \'multiverseId\': 593040}, \'multiverseid\': 593040}, {\'name\': \'Rugissement de défi\', \'text\': "Toutes les créatures capables de bloquer une créature ciblée ce tour-ci le font.\\nFérocité — Cette créature acquiert l\'indestructible jusqu\'à la fin du tour si vous contrôlez une créature de force supérieure ou égale à 4. (Les blessures et les effets qui disent « détruisez » ne la détruisent pas.)", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593161&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1c89787b-79a4-49b0-899c-e2582e9b991c\', \'multiverseId\': 593161}, \'multiverseid\': 593161}, {\'name\': \'Ruggito di Sfida\', \'text\': \'Tutte le creature in grado di bloccare una creatura bersaglio in questo turno lo fanno.\\nFerocia — Quella creatura ha indistruttibile fino alla fine del turno se controlli una creatura con forza pari o superiore a 4. (Il danno e gli effetti che dicono "distruggi" non la distruggono.)\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593282&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'93ba3340-a1f1-47cd-9540-d530c120faf7\', \'multiverseId\': 593282}, \'multiverseid\': 593282}, {\'name\': \'挑発の咆哮\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。このターン、それをブロックできるすべてのクリーチャーは、それをブロックする。\\n獰猛 ― あなたがパワーが４以上であるクリーチャーをコントロールしているなら、ターン終了時まで、その対象としたクリーチャーは破壊不能を得る。（ダメージや「破壊」と書かれた効果では、それは破壊されない。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593403&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2b9d417e-3335-4fe3-b66a-5e984b460ea4\', \'multiverseId\': 593403}, \'multiverseid\': 593403}, {\'name\': \'挑战之吼\', \'text\': \'本回合中，所有能阻挡目标生物的生物皆须阻挡之。\\n威猛～如果你操控力量等于或大于4的生物，则该目标生物获得不灭异能直到回合结束。（伤害与注明「消灭」的效应不会将它消灭。）\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593766&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'289e87f2-4425-4113-b288-f5227bcfac52\', \'multiverseId\': 593766}, \'multiverseid\': 593766}]', '[{\'name\': \'Herr der Wilden Jagd\', \'text\': \'Zu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments erzeugst du einen 2/2 grünen Wolf-Kreaturenspielstein.\\n{T}: Tappe alle ungetappten Wolf-Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst. Jeder auf diese Weise getappte Wolf fügt einer Kreatur deiner Wahl Schadenspunkte in Höhe seiner Stärke zu. Die Kreatur fügt einer beliebigen Anzahl jener Wölfe Schadenspunkte in Höhe ihrer Stärke zu, wobei ihr Beherrscher die Aufteilung bestimmt.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Schamane\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592887&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0d4349b8-6416-46d0-b791-6470ccd32eb0\', \'multiverseId\': 592887}, \'multiverseid\': 592887}, {\'name\': \'Maestro de la caza salvaje\', \'text\': \'Al comienzo de tu mantenimiento, crea una ficha de criatura Lobo verde 2/2.\\n{T}: Gira todas las criaturas Lobo enderezadas que controlas. Cada Lobo girado de esta manera hace una cantidad de daño igual a su fuerza a la criatura objetivo. Esa criatura hace una cantidad de daño igual a su fuerza dividido como elija su controlador entre cualquier cantidad de esos Lobos.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Chamán humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593008&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'da3c1b7f-bac3-45d5-811f-4d43f3b9f98a\', \'multiverseId\': 593008}, \'multiverseid\': 593008}, {\'name\': \'Maître de la vénerie sauvage\', \'text\': \'Au début de votre entretien, créez un jeton de créature 2/2 verte Loup.\\n{T} : Engagez toutes les créatures Loup dégagées que vous contrôlez. Chaque loup engagé de cette manière inflige un nombre de blessures égal à sa force à une créature ciblée. Cette créature inflige un nombre de blessures égal à sa force, réparties de la manière que son contrôleur le choisit entre un nombre quelconque de ces loups.\', \'type\': \'Créature : humain et shamane\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593129&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'65cd84ee-8ea1-449c-9e61-3bd961010e7d\', \'multiverseId\': 593129}, \'multiverseid\': 593129}, {\'name\': \'Maestro della Caccia Selvaggia\', \'text\': "All\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, crea una pedina creatura Lupo 2/2 verde.\\n{T}: TAPpa tutte le creature Lupo STAPpate che controlli. Ogni Lupo TAPpato in questo modo infligge danno pari alla propria forza a una creatura bersaglio. Quella creatura infligge danno pari alla sua forza diviso a scelta del suo controllore tra un qualsiasi numero di quei Lupi.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Sciamano Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593250&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ae263d72-159b-4e1c-8555-d55e01b50ff2\', \'multiverseId\': 593250}, \'multiverseid\': 593250}, {\'name\': \'野生の狩りの達人\', \'text\': \'あなたのアップキープの開始時に、緑の２/２の狼・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\\n{T}：クリーチャー１体を対象とする。あなたがコントロールしているアンタップ状態のすべての狼・クリーチャーをタップする。これによりタップされた各狼はそれぞれ、その対象としたクリーチャーに、自身のパワーに等しい点数のダメージを与える。そのクリーチャーはそれらの狼に、自身のパワーに等しい点数のダメージを、自身のコントローラーの望むように分割して与える。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・シャーマン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593371&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'49742180-e7c3-406d-b47a-9836df9de574\', \'multiverseId\': 593371}, \'multiverseid\': 593371}, {\'name\': \'幽猎领袖\', \'text\': \'在你的维持开始时，派出一个2/2绿色的狼衍生生物。\\n{T}：横置所有由你操控且未横置的狼生物。每个以此法横置的狼各对目标生物造成等同于前者力量的伤害。该生物对这些狼中的任意数量造成总共等同于该生物力量的伤害，其操控者可以任意分配。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／祭师\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593734&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'53c60187-cee1-4535-aff7-abfb98ba70fc\', \'multiverseId\': 593734}, \'multiverseid\': 593734}]', '[{\'name\': \'Herz aus kaltem Stahl\', \'text\': \'Das Herz aus kaltem Stahl kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nSowie das Herz aus kaltem Stahl ins Spiel kommt, bestimme eine Farbe.\\n{T}: Erzeuge ein Mana der bestimmten Farbe.\', \'type\': \'Verschneites Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'„In der Kälte des Winters steckt genauso viel Kraft wie in der Wärme des Sommers."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597123&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e3314b44-40f5-4793-a8cb-6b8d4fd2418d\', \'multiverseId\': 597123}, \'multiverseid\': 597123}, {\'name\': \'Corazón de acero frío\', \'text\': \'El Corazón de acero frío entra al campo de batalla girado.\\nEn cuanto el Corazón de acero frío entre al campo de batalla, elige un color.\\n{T}: Agrega un maná del color elegido.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto nevado\', \'flavor\': \'"El frío invernal tiene tanto poder como el calor veraniego".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597169&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'01ba820f-7d97-48cf-bdba-f4975795b147\', \'multiverseId\': 597169}, \'multiverseid\': 597169}, {\'name\': \'Cœur de froidacier\', \'text\': \'Le Cœur de froidacier arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\nAu moment où le Cœur de froidacier arrive sur le champ de bataille, choisissez une couleur.\\n{T} : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur choisie.\', \'type\': \'Artefact neigeux\', \'flavor\': "« Il y a autant de force dans le froid de l\'hiver que dans la chaleur de l\'été. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597215&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a5b65b39-acd9-4d51-b274-4068c0912407\', \'multiverseId\': 597215}, \'multiverseid\': 597215}, {\'name\': \'Cuore di Gelacciaio\', \'text\': \'Il Cuore di Gelacciaio entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\nMentre il Cuore di Gelacciaio entra nel campo di battaglia, scegli un colore.\\n{T}: Aggiungi un mana del colore scelto.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto Neve\', \'flavor\': \'"Lo stesso potere racchiuso nel calore estivo può essere sprigionato dal gelo invernale."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597261&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6880218b-6b77-453b-847e-26d9f6022c86\', \'multiverseId\': 597261}, \'multiverseid\': 597261}, {\'name\': \'冷鉄の心臓\', \'text\': \'冷鉄の心臓はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n冷鉄の心臓が戦場に出るに際し、色１色を選ぶ。\\n{T}：その選ばれた色のマナ１点を加える。\', \'type\': \'氷雪アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'「冬の寒さには、夏の暑さと同等の力があるの。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597307&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ec4f355e-11af-4f17-83a1-2698378e0520\', \'multiverseId\': 597307}, \'multiverseid\': 597307}, {\'name\': \'寒钢核心\', \'text\': \'寒钢核心须横置进战场。\\n于寒钢核心进战场时，选择一种颜色。\\n{T}：加一点该色的法术力。\', \'type\': \'雪境神器\', \'flavor\': \'「冬天寒气蕴含之力和夏日温暖里的一样多。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597445&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'53886b39-9fe0-4631-ae97-c9a7aa686979\', \'multiverseId\': 597445}, \'multiverseid\': 597445}]', '[{\'name\': \'Herzstecherbogen\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn die ausgerüstete Kreatur angreift, fügt der Herzstecherbogen einer Kreatur deiner Wahl, die der verteidigende Spieler kontrolliert, 1 Schadenspunkt zu.\\nAusrüsten {1} ({1}: Lege diese Karte an eine Kreatur deiner Wahl an, die du kontrollierst. Spiele Ausrüsten wie eine Hexerei.)\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Ausrüstung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596277&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6cbac13a-5db7-4984-b09b-e13cb6f7e23d\', \'multiverseId\': 596277}, \'multiverseid\': 596277}, {\'name\': \'Arco perforacorazones\', \'text\': \'Siempre que la criatura equipada ataque, el Arco perforacorazones hace 1 punto de daño a la criatura objetivo que controla el jugador defensor.\\nEquipar {1}. ({1}: Anexa este Equipo a la criatura objetivo que controlas. Activa la habilidad de equipar como un conjuro.)\', \'type\': \'Artefacto — Equipo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596364&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'56caea56-b8dd-462c-9b32-bb0308af92d4\', \'multiverseId\': 596364}, \'multiverseid\': 596364}, {\'name\': \'Arc du perce-cœur\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que la créature équipée attaque, l\'Arc du perce-cœur inflige 1 blessure à une créature ciblée que le joueur défenseur contrôle.\\nÉquipement {1} ({1} : Attachez à une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez. N\'attachez l\'équipement que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.)", \'type\': \'Artefact : équipement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596451&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9a57edd9-54a5-42e2-bb54-c1b97c8c477a\', \'multiverseId\': 596451}, \'multiverseid\': 596451}, {\'name\': \'Arco Trafiggicuore\', \'text\': "Ogniqualvolta la creatura equipaggiata attacca, l\'Arco Trafiggicuore infligge 1 danno a una creatura bersaglio controllata dal giocatore in difesa.\\nEquipaggiare {1} ({1}: Assegna a una creatura bersaglio che controlli. Equipaggia solo come una stregoneria.)", \'type\': \'Artefatto — Equipaggiamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596538&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'360943b6-ab5d-4128-aabd-d03728fadaaf\', \'multiverseId\': 596538}, \'multiverseid\': 596538}, {\'name\': \'心臓貫きの弓\', \'text\': \'装備しているクリーチャーが攻撃するたび、防御プレイヤーがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。心臓貫きの弓はそれに１点のダメージを与える。\\n装備{1}（{1}：あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。これをそれにつける。装備はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。）\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 装備品\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596625&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fa4753a7-d924-4692-8eac-aed48c603d26\', \'multiverseId\': 596625}, \'multiverseid\': 596625}, {\'name\': \'穿心弓\', \'text\': \'每当佩带此武具的生物攻击时，穿心弓对目标由防御牌手操控的生物造成1点伤害。\\n佩带{1}（{1}：贴附在目标由你操控的生物上。只能于法术时机佩带。）\', \'type\': \'神器 ～武具\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596886&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d79c9e15-9aaa-4c3a-aa7e-b0cab1b4bfab\', \'multiverseId\': 596886}, \'multiverseid\': 596886}]', '[{\'name\': \'Heulgeist\', \'text\': \'Kreaturen, deren Stärke kleiner ist als die des Heulgeists, können ihn nicht blocken.\\nUnverwüstlich (Wenn diese Kreatur stirbt und falls keine +1/+1-Marke auf ihr lag, bringe sie mit einer +1/+1-Marke unter der Kontrolle ihres Besitzers ins Spiel zurück.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Geist, Wolf\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592872&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'926419ee-8a88-46bb-98c0-c22b232fc260\', \'multiverseId\': 592872}, \'multiverseid\': 592872}, {\'name\': \'Geist aullador\', \'text\': \'Las criaturas con fuerza menor que la fuerza del Geist aullador no pueden bloquearlo.\\nResiliencia. (Cuando esta criatura muera, si no tenía contadores +1/+1 sobre ella, regrésala al campo de batalla bajo el control de su propietario con un contador +1/+1.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Espíritu lobo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592993&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3a0deb5e-5950-4b37-94f5-d239a9c5601c\', \'multiverseId\': 592993}, \'multiverseid\': 592993}, {\'name\': \'Hurlegeist\', \'text\': "Les créatures dont la force est inférieure à celle du Hurlegeist ne peuvent pas le bloquer.\\nSurvivance (Quand cette créature meurt, si elle n\'avait pas de marqueurs +1/+1 sur elle, renvoyez-la sur le champ de bataille sous le contrôle de son propriétaire avec un marqueur +1/+1 sur elle.)", \'type\': \'Créature : esprit et loup\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593114&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'896687a9-007a-4f2a-94bb-28e7e30691bb\', \'multiverseId\': 593114}, \'multiverseid\': 593114}, {\'name\': \'Ululageist\', \'text\': "Le creature con forza inferiore a quella dell\'Ululageist non possono bloccarlo.\\nImmortale (Quando questa creatura muore, se non aveva segnalini +1/+1, rimettila sul campo di battaglia sotto il controllo del suo proprietario con un segnalino +1/+1.)", \'type\': \'Creatura — Lupo Spirito\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593235&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'60234d7e-20cf-4028-b079-03507876e554\', \'multiverseId\': 593235}, \'multiverseid\': 593235}, {\'name\': \'吠え霊\', \'text\': \'吠え霊よりもパワーの小さいクリーチャーでは、これをブロックできない。\\n不死（このクリーチャーが死亡したとき、これの上に＋１/＋１カウンターがなかった場合、これを＋１/＋１カウンター１個が置かれた状態でオーナーのコントロール下で戦場に戻す。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — スピリット・狼\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593356&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'394bf062-c7d2-487a-9aa7-b5c2acfe4bd5\', \'multiverseId\': 593356}, \'multiverseid\': 593356}, {\'name\': \'长嚎游魂\', \'text\': \'力量小于长嚎游魂的生物不能阻挡它。\\n不息（当此生物死去时，若其上没有+1/+1指示物，则将它在其拥有者的操控下移回战场，且其上有一个+1/+1指示物。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～精怪／狼\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593719&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cf6f0648-51a6-4de8-b587-0d5fccdd2bc7\', \'multiverseId\': 593719}, \'multiverseid\': 593719}]', '[{\'name\': \'Hexenkessel\', \'text\': \'{1}{B}, {T}, opfere eine Kreatur: Du erhältst 1 Lebenspunkt dazu und ziehst eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Die besten Rezepte erfordern verlässliches Kochgeschirr.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594147&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'92d7355a-b49c-49f2-96d6-3ad18b765992\', \'multiverseId\': 594147}, \'multiverseid\': 594147}, {\'name\': \'Caldero de la bruja\', \'text\': \'{1}{B}, {T}, sacrificar una criatura: Ganas 1 vida y robas una carta.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'Las mejores recetas se empiezan con buenos utensilios de cocina.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594264&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3ce05f5c-e438-4a39-81cb-3bd72bafc67a\', \'multiverseId\': 594264}, \'multiverseid\': 594264}, {\'name\': "Chaudron d\'envoûteuse", \'text\': \'{1}{B}, {T}, sacrifiez une créature : Vous gagnez 1 point de vie et vous piochez une carte.\', \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': \'Les meilleures recettes nécessitent des ustensiles fiables.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594381&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b2c3130e-b985-4bfe-a880-ea1baffc99cc\', \'multiverseId\': 594381}, \'multiverseid\': 594381}, {\'name\': \'Calderone della Strega\', \'text\': \'{1}{B}, {T}, Sacrifica una creatura: Guadagni 1 punto vita e peschi una carta.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'Le migliori ricette iniziano con utensili da cucina affidabili.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594498&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'50d0f433-11d9-4f12-90a5-b10031870fcd\', \'multiverseId\': 594498}, \'multiverseid\': 594498}, {\'name\': \'魔女の大釜\', \'text\': \'{1}{B},{T},クリーチャー１体を生け贄に捧げる：あなたは１点のライフを得、カード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'最高の調理法には良質な調理器具が必要だ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594615&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6582ba4a-8c5f-4619-8c2b-c5a73545cdfb\', \'multiverseId\': 594615}, \'multiverseid\': 594615}, {\'name\': \'巫婆鼎镬\', \'text\': \'{1}{B}，{T}，牺牲一个生物：你获得1点生命且抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'美味食谱始于可靠炉具。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594966&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b79d3ea7-4fdd-41cb-b860-151727e06fb9\', \'multiverseId\': 594966}, \'multiverseid\': 594966}]', '[{\'name\': \'Himmeljäger-Patrouille\', \'text\': \'Fliegend, Erstschlag\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Katze, Ritter\', \'flavor\': \'„Wir Leoniden haben die Herrschaft über die Ebenen errungen, indem wir die Lüfte erobert haben."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591651&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2935ac90-909e-4343-b1c7-c0176ebf6263\', \'multiverseId\': 591651}, \'multiverseid\': 591651}, {\'name\': \'Patrulla cazacielo\', \'text\': \'Vuela, daña primero.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Caballero felino\', \'flavor\': \'"Los leoninos hemos logrado dominar las llanuras llegando a los cielos".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591780&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e3ff5dbb-039a-4c17-8ec6-79183004eb74\', \'multiverseId\': 591780}, \'multiverseid\': 591780}, {\'name\': \'Patrouille chasseciel\', \'text\': \'Vol, initiative\', \'type\': \'Créature : chat et chevalier\', \'flavor\': \'« Les léonins sont parvenus à régner sur les plaines en dominant les cieux. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591909&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4ff70aab-537d-4ef4-b46d-54fa73d5fe0d\', \'multiverseId\': 591909}, \'multiverseid\': 591909}, {\'name\': \'Pattuglia di Solcacielo\', \'text\': \'Volare, attacco improvviso\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Cavaliere Felino\', \'flavor\': \'"Noi leonid siamo riusciti a governare le pianure ritirandoci in cielo."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592038&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1a3f35a0-3a6a-4653-a19c-ca5c8b8c3019\', \'multiverseId\': 592038}, \'multiverseid\': 592038}, {\'name\': \'空狩人の巡回兵\', \'text\': \'飛行、先制攻撃\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 猫・騎士\', \'flavor\': \'「我々レオニンは、空を飛ぶことで平原を制圧してきた。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592167&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eabccb95-f930-4191-8775-0cb27840ea9a\', \'multiverseId\': 592167}, \'multiverseid\': 592167}, {\'name\': \'巡防空猎者\', \'text\': \'飞行，先攻\', \'type\': \'生物 ～猫／骑士\', \'flavor\': \'「我们狮族飞入长空，藉以统治无尽平原。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592554&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'225b1611-22b1-4a75-9d40-c464f4bc0147\', \'multiverseId\': 592554}, \'multiverseid\': 592554}]', "[{'name': 'Himmeljäger-Streife', 'text': 'Fliegend, Wachsamkeit', 'type': 'Kreatur — Katze, Ritter', 'flavor': 'Da sie so wenig ermüden wie ihre Reittiere, dauert die Schicht eines Himmeljägers oft mehrere Tage.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591652&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4f30b9cb-fd38-4a91-90bc-9c6c789573a3', 'multiverseId': 591652}, 'multiverseid': 591652}, {'name': 'Rondadora cazacielos', 'text': 'Vuela, vigilancia.', 'type': 'Criatura — Caballero felino', 'flavor': 'Incansable como su montura, la vigilia de una cazacielos se mide en días.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591781&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '344e14bb-4d0a-4433-8ac7-4e1facda70c6', 'multiverseId': 591781}, 'multiverseid': 591781}, {'name': 'Rôdeuse chasseciel', 'text': 'Vol, vigilance', 'type': 'Créature : chat et chevalier', 'flavor': 'Le chasseciel est aussi infatigable que sa monture. Sa garde peut durer pendant des jours.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591910&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a8b1ddc9-a89d-462f-acae-1bbd698532cf', 'multiverseId': 591910}, 'multiverseid': 591910}, {'name': 'Predatore Solcacielo', 'text': 'Volare, cautela', 'type': 'Creatura — Cavaliere Felino', 'flavor': 'Essendo instancabile come la sua cavalcatura, la veglia di un solcacielo viene misurata in giorni.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592039&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd15c80a8-0b36-47d9-9322-9f82ba8d29b1', 'multiverseId': 592039}, 'multiverseid': 592039}, {'name': 'うろつく空狩人', 'text': '飛行、警戒', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 猫・騎士', 'flavor': 'その乗騎ともども疲れを知らぬ空狩人の見張りは、日単位で巡視している。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592168&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '784d5e72-a5fd-4004-93a7-264ef43f5651', 'multiverseId': 592168}, 'multiverseid': 592168}, {'name': '游掠空猎者', 'text': '飞行，警戒', 'type': '生物 ～猫／骑士', 'flavor': '空猎者与其座骑都不知疲累为何，一趟警戒总以日为单位。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592555&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c5221d66-b340-4830-b326-86fa4eedf86b', 'multiverseId': 592555}, 'multiverseid': 592555}]", '[{\'name\': \'Hinreißendes Einhorn\', \'text\': \'Konstellation — Immer wenn eine Verzauberung unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, tappe eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die ein Gegner kontrolliert.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Einhorn\', \'flavor\': \'„Beim Betrachten des Einhorns fühlte ich mich der Herrlichkeit von Nyx näher als je zuvor."\\n—Oineus, fahrender Händler\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591569&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e2f683b2-2ad6-4591-8a3a-18497c847804\', \'multiverseId\': 591569}, \'multiverseid\': 591569}, {\'name\': \'Unicornio cautivador\', \'text\': \'Constelación — Siempre que un encantamiento entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, gira la criatura objetivo que controla un oponente.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Unicornio\', \'flavor\': \'"Mientras admiraba el unicornio, me sentí más próximo que nunca a la majestuosidad de Nyx".\\n—Oineas, mercader ambulante\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591698&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'93aced70-19d6-45cd-bc48-4891ccbd9efd\', \'multiverseId\': 591698}, \'multiverseid\': 591698}, {\'name\': \'Licorne captivante\', \'text\': "Constellation — À chaque fois qu\'un enchantement arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, engagez une créature ciblée qu\'un adversaire contrôle.", \'type\': \'Créature : licorne\', \'flavor\': \'« En contemplant la licorne, je me sentis plus proche de la majesté de Nyx que jamais auparavant. »\\n—Oïnéus, marchand itinérant\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591827&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a48ce02f-b6ed-4ca5-9196-ed83aebfa61b\', \'multiverseId\': 591827}, \'multiverseid\': 591827}, {\'name\': \'Unicorno Incantevole\', \'text\': \'Costellazione — Ogniqualvolta un incantesimo entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, TAPpa una creatura bersaglio controllata da un avversario.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Unicorno\', \'flavor\': \'"Ammirando l\\\'unicorno, mi sentii più vicino che mai alla magnificenza di Nyx."\\n—Oineus, mercante itinerante\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591956&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9e3db51a-40ad-4212-8f54-904894475e4d\', \'multiverseId\': 591956}, \'multiverseid\': 591956}, {\'name\': \'蠱惑的なユニコーン\', \'text\': \'星座 ― エンチャント１つがあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、対戦相手がコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。それをタップする。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ユニコーン\', \'flavor\': \'「そのユニコーンを見ていると、かつてなかったほどニクスの威厳に近付いたように感じた。」\\n――旅の商人、オイネイウス\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592085&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8bf9fc57-9ed8-4c7e-b3e9-85be69005238\', \'multiverseId\': 592085}, \'multiverseid\': 592085}, {\'name\': \'魅力独角兽\', \'text\': \'星彩～每当一个结界在你的操控下进战场时，横置目标由对手操控的生物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～独角兽\', \'flavor\': \'「我与独角兽对视时，感觉自己从未与尼兹神域如此接近。」\\n～云游商人俄涅乌斯\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592472&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b8c1df2d-7504-4816-bc6b-ca262b2b2d45\', \'multiverseId\': 592472}, \'multiverseid\': 592472}]', "[{'name': 'Hinter sich lassen', 'text': 'Bringe eine bleibende Karte deiner Wahl, die kein Land ist, auf die Hand ihres Besitzers zurück.\\nZiehe eine Karte.', 'type': 'Spontanzauber', 'flavor': 'Die draufgängerischen Fahrer der Rasenden Krähen standen schon lange mit dem Konsulat im Konflikt und schlossen sich den Renegaten sofort zur offenen Revolte an.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595239&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ab7a0162-b46a-43b7-a643-55dfdaddb944', 'multiverseId': 595239}, 'multiverseid': 595239}, {'name': 'Ahuecar el ala', 'text': 'Regresa el permanente objetivo que no sea tierra a la mano de su propietario.\\nRoba una carta.', 'type': 'Instantáneo', 'flavor': 'Los temerarios conductores de los Cuervos de Carreras, enemigos del Consulado desde hace tiempo, no tardaron en sumarse a la revuelta abierta de los renegados.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595347&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ee370db1-5900-4602-899b-ffb14182d9fb', 'multiverseId': 595347}, 'multiverseid': 595347}, {'name': 'Départ poussiéreux', 'text': 'Renvoyez un permanent non-terrain ciblé dans la main de son propriétaire.\\nPiochez une carte.', 'type': 'Éphémère', 'flavor': 'Opposés au Consulat depuis des lustres, les pilotes casse-cou des Charognards de la course se sont rapidement joints à la révolte des renégats.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595455&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '24d681b4-ac4d-4954-973d-e102e0cf3bd2', 'multiverseId': 595455}, 'multiverseid': 595455}, {'name': 'Lasciare nella Polvere', 'text': 'Fai tornare un permanente non terra bersaglio in mano al suo proprietario.\\nPesca una carta.', 'type': 'Istantaneo', 'flavor': 'I temerari piloti dei Corvi da Gara, da tempo in contrasto con il Consolato, non hanno perso tempo a unirsi alla rivolta dei rinnegati.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595563&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '41296b02-194d-40bb-b4d0-a1bb94fffccf', 'multiverseId': 595563}, 'multiverseid': 595563}, {'name': '置き去り', 'text': '土地でないパーマネント１つを対象とする。それをオーナーの手札に戻す。\\nカード１枚を引く。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': '競烏会は以前から領事府と折り合いが悪く、紛争が公然のものになるとすぐに無謀な競走者たちが改革派に加わった。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595671&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c3358f05-2bba-4dc7-ae81-31e275519e30', 'multiverseId': 595671}, 'multiverseid': 595671}, {'name': '扬尘而去', 'text': '将目标非地永久物移回其拥有者手上。\\n抓一张牌。', 'type': '瞬间', 'flavor': '迅鸦会的玩命赛手素与执政院不睦，如今更果断加入乱匠公开叛乱。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595995&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '968d2540-b7c1-4ef6-92ab-40f8830baa72', 'multiverseId': 595995}, 'multiverseid': 595995}]", '[{\'name\': \'Hinunterziehen\', \'text\': \'Bringe eine Kreatur deiner Wahl auf die Hand ihres Besitzers zurück.\\nZiehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Einige versuchten, dem Albtraum in ihren Booten zu entkommen. Die Überreste ihrer Kähne säumen nun die Strände von Nefalen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595214&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a9a187a3-2016-47ac-b8ff-44d2eeed1371\', \'multiverseId\': 595214}, \'multiverseid\': 595214}, {\'name\': \'Arrastrar al fondo\', \'text\': \'Regresa la criatura objetivo a la mano de su propietario.\\nRoba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Algunos se hicieron a la mar para escapar de la pesadilla desatada. Los restos de sus navíos están esparcidos por las costas de Nephalia.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595322&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'32af7565-f111-4144-ba97-4cd4571e8379\', \'multiverseId\': 595322}, \'multiverseid\': 595322}, {\'name\': \'Engloutir\', \'text\': \'Renvoyez une créature ciblée dans la main de son propriétaire.\\nPiochez une carte.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Certains prirent leurs bateaux pour fuir ce cauchemar. Les épaves reposent aujourd\'hui le long des côtes de Néphalie.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595430&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'de26e1af-eb81-45a0-be34-64e56fe5ca5e\', \'multiverseId\': 595430}, \'multiverseid\': 595430}, {\'name\': \'Inabissare\', \'text\': \'Fai tornare una creatura bersaglio in mano al suo proprietario.\\nPesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': "Alcuni ricorsero alle imbarcazioni per sfuggire all\'incubo dilagante. Ora le coste di Nephalia sono disseminate dei loro resti.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595538&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'69b0990c-2583-4e5d-9522-baa344d7ccab\', \'multiverseId\': 595538}, \'multiverseid\': 595538}, {\'name\': \'引きずり込み\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それをオーナーの手札に戻す。\\nカード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'次々と起きる悪夢から小舟で逃げ出そうとする者もいた。今では、それらの船の残骸がネファリアの岸を覆っている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595646&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'db99b902-16b8-4eae-8b92-4e97fb2227c5\', \'multiverseId\': 595646}, \'multiverseid\': 595646}, {\'name\': \'拖入汪洋\', \'text\': \'将目标生物移回其拥有者手上。\\n抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'有些人驾船逃离日愈加剧的噩梦。那些船的残骸如今散落在涅非利亚海岸边。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595970&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'78b67636-ab68-4c7c-a1c3-bda2c9d2c28d\', \'multiverseId\': 595970}, \'multiverseid\': 595970}]', '[{\'name\': \'Hoffnungsschimmer\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du Lebenspunkte dazuerhältst, kannst du {2} bezahlen. Falls du dies tust, ziehe eine Karte.\\n{3}{W}: Erzeuge einen 1/1 weißen Soldat-Kreaturenspielstein mit Lebensverknüpfung.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„Um in den Krieg zu ziehen, benötigst du inneren Frieden."\\n—Emmara\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591575&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a99a9e5c-de01-4191-8077-3043c223de78\', \'multiverseId\': 591575}, \'multiverseid\': 591575}, {\'name\': \'Alba de esperanza\', \'text\': \'Siempre que ganes vidas, puedes pagar {2}. Si lo haces, roba una carta.\\n{3}{W}: Crea una ficha de criatura Soldado blanca 1/1 con la habilidad de vínculo vital.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'"Para librar una guerra, primero debes asegurar la paz en tu interior".\\n—Emmara\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591704&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f61296f3-0e3f-44ab-812f-3291648e880f\', \'multiverseId\': 591704}, \'multiverseid\': 591704}, {\'name\': "Aube de l\'espoir", \'text\': \'À chaque fois que vous gagnez des points de vie, vous pouvez payer {2}. Si vous faites ainsi, piochez une carte.\\n{3}{W} : Créez un jeton de créature 1/1 blanche Soldat avec le lien de vie.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': \'« Pour faire la guerre, il faut être en paix avec soi-même. »\\n—Emmara\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591833&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'42359f5f-b423-4cb4-a594-70f611bbf91e\', \'multiverseId\': 591833}, \'multiverseid\': 591833}, {\'name\': \'Alba di Speranza\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta guadagni punti vita, puoi pagare {2}. Se lo fai, pesca una carta.\\n{3}{W}: Crea una pedina creatura Soldato 1/1 bianca con legame vitale.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'"Se vuoi scendere in guerra, porta la pace nel tuo cuore."\\n—Emmara\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591962&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fcddcd06-1051-49a9-add3-5a5d568bfc86\', \'multiverseId\': 591962}, \'multiverseid\': 591962}, {\'name\': \'希望の夜明け\', \'text\': \'あなたがライフを得るたび、あなたは{2}を支払ってもよい。そうしたなら、カード１枚を引く。\\n{3}{W}：絆魂を持つ白の１/１の兵士・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'「戦争を始めるには、心の平和を確保する必要がある。」\\n――イマーラ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592091&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'58a320d7-789d-4b87-83cc-b7833e3b82a2\', \'multiverseId\': 592091}, \'multiverseid\': 592091}, {\'name\': \'希望曙光\', \'text\': \'每当你获得生命时，你可以支付{2}。若你如此作，则抓一张牌。\\n{3}{W}：派出一个1/1白色，具系命异能的士兵衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'「若要兴战，须先保证心境祥和。」\\n～艾玛拉\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592478&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'10baf723-c4bb-496e-8a2d-3251215449e9\', \'multiverseId\': 592478}, \'multiverseid\': 592478}]', '[{\'name\': \'Hordling-Ansturm\', \'text\': \'Erzeuge drei 1/1 rote Goblin-Kreaturenspielsteine.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Hinterlasse keine Abfälle, auf dass du keine Schädlinge anziehst."\\n—Mardu-Drohung\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590260&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c217dc3d-aaff-4715-9f8f-93a8d34284e0\', \'multiverseId\': 590260}, \'multiverseid\': 590260}, {\'name\': \'Ataque de minihorda\', \'text\': \'Crea tres fichas de criatura Trasgo rojas 1/1.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Que no queden restos, no sea que atraigan bichos".\\n—Amenaza mardu\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590395&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'78c99ca5-2164-4695-9ad6-acf84cd20296\', \'multiverseId\': 590395}, \'multiverseid\': 590395}, {\'name\': \'Surgissement de hordelins\', \'text\': \'Créez trois jetons de créature 1/1 rouge Gobelin.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'« Ne laissez aucun lambeau, vous attireriez les parasites. »\\n—Menace marduenne\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590530&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9990e687-9e2e-4adc-9bfb-133cc89c4740\', \'multiverseId\': 590530}, \'multiverseid\': 590530}, {\'name\': "Slancio dei Cuccioli dell\'Orda", \'text\': \'Crea tre pedine creatura Goblin 1/1 rosse.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Non lasciare resti o attirerai parassiti."\\n—Minaccia Mardu\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590665&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'85cbaf6b-ff91-4191-9b63-ceaac9d88428\', \'multiverseId\': 590665}, \'multiverseid\': 590665}, {\'name\': \'軍族童の突発\', \'text\': \'赤の１/１のゴブリン・クリーチャー・トークン３体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「肉片は残すな。害虫を寄せつけることになるかもしれぬ。」\\n――マルドゥの脅し\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590800&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b57bd220-c18d-4b9b-853c-b27a745afa15\', \'multiverseId\': 590800}, \'multiverseid\': 590800}, {\'name\': \'族人爆发\', \'text\': \'派出三个1/1红色鬼怪衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「别剩饭，以免招来讨厌鬼。」\\n～玛尔都警语\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591205&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'612626a4-c435-436a-bbf1-c173009452eb\', \'multiverseId\': 591205}, \'multiverseid\': 591205}]', '[{\'name\': \'Horrorhund\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Horrorhund ins Spiel kommt, millst du drei Karten. (Lege die obersten drei Karten deiner Bibliothek auf deinen Friedhof.)\\nImmer wenn eine Kreatur stirbt oder eine Kreaturenkarte aus einer Bibliothek auf einen Friedhof gelegt wird, verliert jeder Gegner 1 Lebenspunkt.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Dämon, Hund\', \'flavor\': \'Er treibt Seelen zu ewiger Qual.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594063&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8001a2e9-e611-4ba1-8500-0156c9b723a0\', \'multiverseId\': 594063}, \'multiverseid\': 594063}, {\'name\': \'Sabueso del terror\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Sabueso del terror entre al campo de batalla, muele tres cartas. (Pon las tres primeras cartas de tu biblioteca en tu cementerio.)\\nSiempre que una criatura muera o una carta de criatura vaya a un cementerio desde una biblioteca, cada oponente pierde 1 vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Perro demonio\', \'flavor\': \'Arrea a las almas hacia el tormento eterno.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594180&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c4d77a88-5944-4980-99c2-968d2a0b9956\', \'multiverseId\': 594180}, \'multiverseid\': 594180}, {\'name\': "Chien de l\'effroi", \'text\': "Quand le Chien de l\'effroi arrive sur le champ de bataille, meulez trois cartes. (Mettez les trois cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque dans votre cimetière.)\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'une créature meurt ou qu\'une carte de créature est mise dans un cimetière depuis une bibliothèque, chaque adversaire perd 1 point de vie.", \'type\': \'Créature : démon et chien\', \'flavor\': \'Il rassemble les âmes pour les conduire à leur tourment éternel.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594297&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fed91b4f-872a-4c2f-8ba4-c3949491776b\', \'multiverseId\': 594297}, \'multiverseid\': 594297}, {\'name\': \'Mastino Terrificante\', \'text\': \'Quando il Mastino Terrificante entra nel campo di battaglia, macina tre carte. (Metti nel tuo cimitero le prime tre carte del tuo grimorio.)\\nOgniqualvolta una creatura muore o una carta creatura viene messa in un cimitero da un grimorio, ogni avversario perde 1 punto vita.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Canide Demone\', \'flavor\': \'Accompagna le anime verso il tormento eterno.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594414&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c1787c82-9879-4817-b9a6-b48b658e0e00\', \'multiverseId\': 594414}, \'multiverseid\': 594414}, {\'name\': \'戦慄の猟犬\', \'text\': \'戦慄の猟犬が戦場に出たとき、カード３枚を切削する。（あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード３枚をあなたの墓地に置く。）\\nクリーチャー１体が死亡するか、クリーチャー・カード１枚がライブラリーから墓地に置かれるたび、各対戦相手はそれぞれ１点のライフを失う。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — デーモン・犬\', \'flavor\': \'それは魂の群れを永遠なる苦悩へと追い込むのだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594531&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'213c9e2a-771e-4546-b996-942ec598b31f\', \'multiverseId\': 594531}, \'multiverseid\': 594531}, {\'name\': \'恐惧猎犬\', \'text\': \'当恐惧猎犬进战场时，磨三张牌。（将你牌库顶的三张牌置入你的坟墓场。）\\n每当一个生物死去或一张生物牌从牌库进入坟墓场时，每位对手各失去1点生命。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～恶魔／狗\', \'flavor\': \'它把灵魂赶向无限苦难。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594882&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8817c160-d4d0-4eec-b24a-b5c4ba4ca00f\', \'multiverseId\': 594882}, \'multiverseid\': 594882}]', '[{\'name\': \'Hort des Drachen\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn ein Drache unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, lege eine Goldmarke auf den Hort des Drachen.\\n{T}, entferne eine Goldmarke vom Hort des Drachen: Ziehe eine Karte.\\n{T}: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596267&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b0644d2a-76d6-4eb4-8927-2b9dc17e39df\', \'multiverseId\': 596267}, \'multiverseid\': 596267}, {\'name\': \'Botín del dragón\', \'text\': \'Siempre que un Dragón entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, pon un contador de oro sobre el Botín del dragón.\\n{T}, remover un contador de oro del Botín del dragón: Roba una carta.\\n{T}: Agrega un maná de cualquier color.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596354&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'305eb31f-31e4-4f3d-90a3-1672ebf22dc4\', \'multiverseId\': 596354}, \'multiverseid\': 596354}, {\'name\': \'Butin du dragon\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'un dragon arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, mettez un marqueur « or » sur le Butin du dragon.\\n{T}, retirez un marqueur « or » du Butin du dragon : Piochez une carte.\\n{T} : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596441&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'87c2cabe-1272-4808-b4d8-44406cbce5a6\', \'multiverseId\': 596441}, \'multiverseid\': 596441}, {\'name\': \'Bottino del Drago\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta un Drago entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, metti un segnalino oro sul Bottino del Drago.\\n{T}, Rimuovi un segnalino oro dal Bottino del Drago: Pesca una carta.\\n{T}: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596528&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3ab9bff5-6dad-4496-9e27-92ddb1662972\', \'multiverseId\': 596528}, \'multiverseid\': 596528}, {\'name\': \'ドラゴンの財宝\', \'text\': \'ドラゴン１体があなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、ドラゴンの財宝の上に黄金カウンター１個を置く。\\n{T},ドラゴンの財宝の上から黄金カウンター１個を取り除く：カード１枚を引く。\\n{T}：好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596615&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'db5cb607-6f92-4f24-8154-2339191ab0bb\', \'multiverseId\': 596615}, \'multiverseid\': 596615}, {\'name\': \'巨龙宝库\', \'text\': \'每当一个龙在你的操控下进战场时，在巨龙宝库上放置一个黄金指示物。\\n{T}，从巨龙宝库上移去一个黄金指示物：抓一张牌。\\n{T}：加一点任意颜色的法术力。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596876&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7228679a-eef8-48fd-869e-91f4fe58f39e\', \'multiverseId\': 596876}, \'multiverseid\': 596876}]', '[{\'name\': \'Hunger des Heulerrudels\', \'text\': \'Lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf eine Kreatur deiner Wahl.\\nMorbide — Lege stattdessen drei +1/+1-Marken auf diese Kreatur, falls in diesem Zug eine Kreatur gestorben ist.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Werwölfe sind eine unheilige Mischung aus den Instinkten der Raubtiere und dem Hass der Menschen."\\n—Alena, Fallenstellerin aus Kessig\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592873&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a56b4008-16b5-480c-afc3-ffb37f9dcff6\', \'multiverseId\': 592873}, \'multiverseid\': 592873}, {\'name\': \'Hambre de la jauría aullante\', \'text\': \'Pon un contador +1/+1 sobre la criatura objetivo.\\nNecrario — En vez de eso, pon tres contadores +1/+1 sobre esa criatura si una criatura murió este turno.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Los licántropos son una mezcla maldita de los instintos de un depredador y el odio de un humano".\\n—Alena, trampera de Kessig\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592994&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8a5dc405-fd81-4a06-89c4-ec30367fe7b2\', \'multiverseId\': 592994}, \'multiverseid\': 592994}, {\'name\': \'Faim de la hurlemeute\', \'text\': \'Mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur une créature ciblée.\\nMorbidité — Mettez trois marqueurs +1/+1 sur cette créature à la place si une créature est morte ce tour-ci.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Les loups-garous sont un mélange malsain d\'instinct de prédateur et de haine humaine. »\\n—Alena, trappeur de Kessig", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593115&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2929a87b-2ed3-4572-a02b-93f49ab739c5\', \'multiverseId\': 593115}, \'multiverseid\': 593115}, {\'name\': "Fame dell\'Ulubranco", \'text\': \'Metti un segnalino +1/+1 su una creatura bersaglio.\\nMorboso — Metti invece tre segnalini +1/+1 su quella creatura se è morta una creatura in questo turno.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"I lupi mannari sono un miscuglio sacrilego dell\\\'istinto di un predatore e dell\\\'odio di un umano."\\n—Alena, trappolatrice di Kessig\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593236&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'355445a0-2e6e-4c59-9a00-d6f600e18f0f\', \'multiverseId\': 593236}, \'multiverseid\': 593236}, {\'name\': \'吠え群れの飢え\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それの上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。\\n陰鬱 ― このターンにクリーチャーが死亡していたなら、代わりにそれの上に＋１/＋１カウンター３個を置く。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「人狼ってのは、捕食者の本能と人間の憎悪の邪悪な合いの子ね。」\\n――ケッシグの罠師、アレイナ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593357&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bf5753ac-6f5b-4256-8f89-da9aecbc5633\', \'multiverseId\': 593357}, \'multiverseid\': 593357}, {\'name\': \'嚎群饥欲\', \'text\': \'在目标生物上放置一个+1/+1指示物。\\n丧心～如果本回合中有生物死去，则改为在该生物上放置三个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「狼人是掠食者本能与人类恨意的邪恶混合。」\\n～凯锡革布陷人阿雷娜\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593720&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'192b3487-70f6-438d-80ba-6002b28b9fd6\', \'multiverseId\': 593720}, \'multiverseid\': 593720}]', "[{'name': 'Hungrige Flammen', 'text': 'Die Hungrigen Flammen fügen einer Kreatur deiner Wahl 3 Schadenspunkte und einem Spieler oder Planeswalker deiner Wahl 2 Schadenspunkte zu.', 'type': 'Spontanzauber', 'flavor': 'Im Frachtraum der *Herz des Kiran* erwiderte Chandra Dovin Baans Sabotage auf explosive Weise.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590261&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bc6bc612-cb77-4b5f-b3a0-871dd021abbf', 'multiverseId': 590261}, 'multiverseid': 590261}, {'name': 'Llamas hambrientas', 'text': 'Las Llamas hambrientas hacen 3 puntos de daño a la criatura objetivo y 2 puntos de daño al jugador o planeswalker objetivo.', 'type': 'Instantáneo', 'flavor': 'En el centro del Corazón de Kiran**, Chandra correspondió al sabotaje de Dovin Baan con una respuesta explosiva.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590396&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b00f3e42-daa5-413b-9093-ad316ce0fafc', 'multiverseId': 590396}, 'multiverseid': 590396}, {'name': 'Flammes voraces', 'text': 'Les Flammes voraces infligent 3 blessures à une créature ciblée et 2 blessures à une cible, créature ou planeswalker.', 'type': 'Éphémère', 'flavor': 'Dans la cale du *Cœur de Kiran*, Chandra apporta une réponse explosive au sabotage de Dovin Baàn.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590531&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e0a95bb3-1c0b-4b5a-afb4-6c836058c6b0', 'multiverseId': 590531}, 'multiverseid': 590531}, {'name': 'Fiamme Fameliche', 'text': 'Le Fiamme Fameliche infliggono 3 danni a una creatura bersaglio e 2 danni a un giocatore o a un planeswalker bersaglio.', 'type': 'Istantaneo', 'flavor': 'Nella stiva del *Cuore di Kiran*, Chandra reagì al sabotaggio di Dovin Baan con una replica esplosiva.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590666&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd392a4e8-aa9b-4cbc-ac35-c344a420daba', 'multiverseId': 590666}, 'multiverseid': 590666}, {'name': '飲み込む炎', 'text': 'クリーチャー１体と、プレイヤーやプレインズウォーカーのうち１つを対象とする。飲み込む炎は前者に３点、後者に２点のダメージを与える。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': '*キランの真意*号の船倉で、チャンドラはドビン・バーンの妨害に爆炎で応えた。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590801&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e04743d2-703b-454a-8b07-c18a169cd735', 'multiverseId': 590801}, 'multiverseid': 590801}, {'name': '贪婪烈焰', 'text': '贪婪烈焰对目标生物造成3点伤害，且对目标牌手或鹏洛客造成2点伤害。', 'type': '瞬间', 'flavor': '面对在*基岚之心号*舱内意图下手破坏的多温班恩，茜卓还以火爆回击。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591206&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '59fc400d-4181-4a05-a7f1-26c5a88bba7c', 'multiverseId': 591206}, 'multiverseid': 591206}]", '[{\'name\': \'Hydra-Wachstum\', \'text\': \'Verzaubert eine Kreatur\\nWenn das Hydra-Wachstum ins Spiel kommt, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf die verzauberte Kreatur.\\nZu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments verdoppelst du die Anzahl an +1/+1-Marken auf der verzauberten Kreatur.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597118&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'96dffa45-63c6-4d17-9358-efb6fce4a534\', \'multiverseId\': 597118}, \'multiverseid\': 597118}, {\'name\': \'Crecimiento de hidra\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura.\\nCuando el Crecimiento de hidra entre al campo de batalla, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre la criatura encantada.\\nAl comienzo de tu mantenimiento, duplica la cantidad de contadores +1/+1 sobre la criatura encantada.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597164&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b51e22c1-88bf-469d-b0d0-e0fe72159449\', \'multiverseId\': 597164}, \'multiverseid\': 597164}, {\'name\': "Croissance de l\'hydre", \'text\': "Enchanter : créature\\nQuand la Croissance de l\'hydre arrive sur le champ de bataille, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur la créature enchantée.\\nAu début de votre entretien, doublez le nombre de marqueurs +1/+1 sur la créature enchantée.", \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597210&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'13433101-b51d-4abb-9f2e-cc4aa8a4f223\', \'multiverseId\': 597210}, \'multiverseid\': 597210}, {\'name\': "Crescita dell\'Idra", \'text\': "Incanta creatura\\nQuando la Crescita dell\'Idra entra nel campo di battaglia, metti un segnalino +1/+1 sulla creatura incantata.\\nAll\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, raddoppia il numero di segnalini +1/+1 sulla creatura incantata.", \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597256&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e3700ca2-ccce-4b36-96a7-d049a1fe0adc\', \'multiverseId\': 597256}, \'multiverseid\': 597256}, {\'name\': \'ハイドラの成長\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\nハイドラの成長が戦場に出たとき、エンチャントしているクリーチャーの上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。\\nあなたのアップキープの開始時に、エンチャントしているクリーチャーの上にある＋１/＋１カウンターの個数を２倍にする。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597302&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9c7014f8-e896-4637-8da0-cc184d1d51ec\', \'multiverseId\': 597302}, \'multiverseid\': 597302}, {\'name\': \'多头龙式生长\', \'text\': \'结附于生物\\n当多头龙式生长进战场时，在所结附的生物上放置一个+1/+1指示物。\\n在你的维持开始时，将所结附的生物上之+1/+1指示物数量加倍。\', \'type\': \'结界 ～灵气\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597440&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f1a2e2e1-f89a-41ed-aae2-52fe83fcd83c\', \'multiverseId\': 597440}, \'multiverseid\': 597440}]', '[{\'name\': \'Höllisches Abbild\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {B}.\\n{1}{B}{B}, {T}, opfere das Höllische Abbild: Du ziehst zwei Karten und verlierst 2 Lebenspunkte.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'„Der Tod der Botin war bedauerlich, aber sie wurde davor gewarnt, es zu berühren."\\n—Fürst Xander\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589654&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2787bb82-f660-4e20-bc07-b3d1ecbf0e8d\', \'multiverseId\': 589654}, \'multiverseid\': 589654}, {\'name\': \'Ídolo infernal\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {B}.\\n{1}{B}{B}, {T}, sacrificar el Ídolo infernal: Robas dos cartas y pierdes 2 vidas.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'"Una lástima que la mensajera muriese, pero le dijeron que no debía tocarlo".\\n—Don Xander\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589705&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ba45e1bf-68ee-44d0-8aca-f2d4eb700b19\', \'multiverseId\': 589705}, \'multiverseid\': 589705}, {\'name\': \'Idole infernale\', \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez {B}.\\n{1}{B}{B}, {T}, sacrifiez l\'Idole infernale : Vous piochez deux cartes et vous perdez 2 points de vie.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': \'« La mort de la messagère est regrettable, mais elle avait été prévenue de ne pas y toucher. »\\n—Seigneur Xander\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589756&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'063eab6a-e23b-412a-b492-b518f93972ff\', \'multiverseId\': 589756}, \'multiverseid\': 589756}, {\'name\': \'Idolo Infernale\', \'text\': "{T}: Aggiungi {B}.\\n{1}{B}{B}, {T}, Sacrifica l\'Idolo Infernale: Peschi due carte e perdi 2 punti vita.", \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'"La morte della corriera è stata un disgraziato incidente; d\\\'altro canto, era stata avvertita di non toccarlo."\\n—Lord Xander\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589807&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6018eb75-8ff4-44aa-9e1e-93bb3d740718\', \'multiverseId\': 589807}, \'multiverseid\': 589807}, {\'name\': \'冥府の偶像\', \'text\': \'{T}：{B}を加える。\\n{1}{B}{B},{T},冥府の偶像を生け贄に捧げる：あなたはカード２枚を引き、２点のライフを失う。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'「急使の死は誠に残念だ。しかし、彼女には触らないよう警告していたのだが。」\\n――ザンダー卿\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589858&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9f5cf806-6294-445b-b30d-752029501aef\', \'multiverseId\': 589858}, \'multiverseid\': 589858}, {\'name\': \'炼狱雕像\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{B}。\\n{1}{B}{B}，{T}，牺牲炼狱雕像：你抓两张牌且失去2点生命。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'「讯使不幸身故，在下深表惋悼。然她明已受诫不应触碰雕像却执意为之，亦属不妥。」\\n～尚夺尔勋爵\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590011&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'562c7d3e-a728-48ed-a6a2-351d37e55f79\', \'multiverseId\': 590011}, \'multiverseid\': 590011}]', '[{\'name\': \'Hüter der Fäulnis\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\n{7}{B}, {T}, opfere den Hüter der Fäulnis: Ein Gegner deiner Wahl verliert 4 Lebenspunkte und du erhältst 4 Lebenspunkte dazu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Fledermaus, Bold\', \'flavor\': \'Ob Früchte oder Fleisch, bei seinen Mahlzeiten ist er nicht wählerisch.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594035&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'388bf5d4-c816-4a34-84ad-f693c3931496\', \'multiverseId\': 594035}, \'multiverseid\': 594035}, {\'name\': \'Guardián de la miseria\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\n{7}{B}, {T}, sacrificar al Guardián de la miseria: El oponente objetivo pierde 4 vidas y tú ganas 4 vidas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Diablillo murciélago\', \'flavor\': \'Pudre la fruta y la carne por igual.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594152&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0784548f-d4b7-47d6-8828-6defe76a2bd5\', \'multiverseId\': 594152}, \'multiverseid\': 594152}, {\'name\': \'Gardien du fléau\', \'text\': \'Vol\\n{7}{B}, {T}, sacrifiez le Gardien du fléau : Un adversaire ciblé perd 4 points de vie et vous gagnez 4 points de vie.\', \'type\': \'Créature : chauve-souris et diablotin\', \'flavor\': \'Il flétrit aussi bien le fruit que la chair.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594269&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'67cf3bac-41dc-400c-bf14-966644c38fcb\', \'multiverseId\': 594269}, \'multiverseid\': 594269}, {\'name\': "Guardiano dell\'Avvizzimento", \'text\': "Volare\\n{7}{B}, {T}, Sacrifica il Guardiano dell\'Avvizzimento: Un avversario bersaglio perde 4 punti vita e tu guadagni 4 punti vita.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Imp Pipistrello\', \'flavor\': \'La sua consunzione colpisce la carne al pari della frutta.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594386&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7eb272b0-213f-4b09-8610-4098021d461a\', \'multiverseId\': 594386}, \'multiverseid\': 594386}, {\'name\': \'立ち枯れの守り手\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n{7}{B},{T},立ち枯れの守り手を生け贄に捧げる：対戦相手１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーは４点のライフを失い、あなたは４点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — コウモリ・インプ\', \'flavor\': \'果実も肉体も同様に枯れる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594503&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eb8344d6-759b-4933-b97b-bafbc5458128\', \'multiverseId\': 594503}, \'multiverseid\': 594503}, {\'name\': \'萎荒守卫\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n{7}{B}，{T}，牺牲萎荒守卫：目标对手失去4点生命且你获得4点生命。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～蝙蝠／小恶魔\', \'flavor\': \'它能让花果凋零，也能让肉身凋落。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594854&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'934bcf6c-6369-4032-a0b5-021f6b42d257\', \'multiverseId\': 594854}, \'multiverseid\': 594854}]', '[{\'name\': \'Hüter der Geometrie\', \'text\': \'Wachsamkeit\\n{T}: Erzeuge {C}. ({C} steht für farbloses Mana.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Eldrazi, Drohne\', \'flavor\': \'In der Ödnis verlieren selbst die erfahrensten Späher die Orientierung … und werden zu einer leichten Beute für Kozileks Drohnen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596254&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'67cc5f65-a790-4293-b4f9-b8112284dde5\', \'multiverseId\': 596254}, \'multiverseid\': 596254}, {\'name\': \'Protector de geometrías\', \'text\': \'Vigilancia.\\n{T}: Agrega {C}. ({C} representa maná incoloro.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Zángano eldrazi\', \'flavor\': \'Los terrenos arrasados desorientan incluso a los exploradores con más experiencia, lo que los convierte en presas fáciles de los zánganos de Kozilek.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596341&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5e73b98d-40a6-4270-a28b-78d31bf936b9\', \'multiverseId\': 596341}, \'multiverseid\': 596341}, {\'name\': \'Garde des géométries\', \'text\': \'Vigilance\\n{T} : Ajoutez {C}. ({C} représente un mana incolore.)\', \'type\': \'Créature : eldrazi et drone\', \'flavor\': "Les terres dévastées désorientent même les éclaireurs les plus expérimentés, faisant d\'eux des proies faciles pour les drones de Kozilek.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596428&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'21ad3f7a-685d-4d79-892c-f5a50fb646df\', \'multiverseId\': 596428}, \'multiverseid\': 596428}, {\'name\': \'Custode delle Geometrie\', \'text\': \'Cautela\\n{T}: Aggiungi {C}. ({C} rappresenta mana incolore.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Parassita Eldrazi\', \'flavor\': \'Le terre desolate disorientano anche gli esploratori più esperti, rendendoli facile preda per i parassiti di Kozilek.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596515&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5df52eac-6f00-4bcd-9e64-8aacb8483bfc\', \'multiverseId\': 596515}, \'multiverseid\': 596515}, {\'name\': \'形状の管理人\', \'text\': \'警戒\\n{T}：{C}を加える。（{C}は無色マナを表す。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルドラージ・ドローン\', \'flavor\': \'経験豊富な斥候すら荒地では道を見失い、コジレックのドローンの恰好の餌食となる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596602&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'076624bb-2735-469e-97fd-7cbada6b3029\', \'multiverseId\': 596602}, \'multiverseid\': 596602}, {\'name\': \'地界护卫\', \'text\': \'警戒\\n{T}：加{C}。（{C}代表无色法术力。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～奥札奇／奴兽\', \'flavor\': \'即使是经验最丰富的斥候也会在荒野中迷途，成为寇基雷奴兽的囊中之物。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596863&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'672153c1-d801-4b9e-b286-98dc40c3dc85\', \'multiverseId\': 596863}, \'multiverseid\': 596863}]', '[{\'name\': \'Hüter des Hortes\', \'text\': \'Wachsamkeit\\nLandung — Immer wenn ein Land unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, schicke eine bleibende Karte deiner Wahl mit Manabetrag 3 oder weniger aus deinem Friedhof ins Exil.\\nWenn der Hüter des Hortes stirbt, bringe alle von ihm ins Exil geschickten bleibenden Karten unter der Kontrolle ihrer Besitzer ins Spiel.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Katze, Bestie\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591665&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'be8fa415-a77d-426c-9ddc-f14b01fe9685\', \'multiverseId\': 591665}, \'multiverseid\': 591665}, {\'name\': \'Guardatesoros\', \'text\': \'Vigilancia.\\nAterrizaje — Siempre que una tierra entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, exilia la carta de permanente objetivo con valor de maná de 3 o menos de tu cementerio.\\nCuando el Guardatesoros muera, pon cada carta de permanente exiliada con él en el campo de batalla bajo el control del propietario de esa carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bestia felino\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591794&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6ab9a578-2ed1-4015-ac9f-ccf042756f83\', \'multiverseId\': 591794}, \'multiverseid\': 591794}, {\'name\': \'Garde des trésors\', \'text\': "Vigilance\\nToucheterre — À chaque fois qu\'un terrain arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, exilez une carte de permanent avec une valeur de mana inférieure ou égale à 3 ciblée depuis votre cimetière.\\nQuand le Garde des trésors meurt, mettez sur le champ de bataille chaque carte de permanent qu\'il a exilée, sous le contrôle du propriétaire de cette carte.", \'type\': \'Créature : chat et bête\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591923&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'84e2d90b-8da3-4560-99ff-92cce88af25b\', \'multiverseId\': 591923}, \'multiverseid\': 591923}, {\'name\': \'Sentinella dei Tesori\', \'text\': \'Cautela\\nTerraferma — Ogniqualvolta una terra entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, esilia una carta permanente bersaglio con valore di mana pari o inferiore a 3 dal tuo cimitero.\\nQuando la Sentinella dei Tesori muore, metti ogni carta permanente esiliata con essa sul campo di battaglia sotto il controllo del proprietario di quella carta.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Bestia Felino\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592052&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ef5af0af-6e76-42ff-9678-624ea874dad5\', \'multiverseId\': 592052}, \'multiverseid\': 592052}, {\'name\': \'宝物の守部\', \'text\': \'警戒\\n上陸 ― 土地１つがあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、あなたの墓地にありマナ総量が３以下であるパーマネント・カード１枚を対象とする。それを追放する。\\n宝物の守部が死亡したとき、これによって追放されている各パーマネント・カードをそれぞれ、オーナーのコントロール下で戦場に出す。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 猫・ビースト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592181&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'43f0e845-edd0-4c62-b47b-bec8ca7eee9f\', \'multiverseId\': 592181}, \'multiverseid\': 592181}, {\'name\': \'宝库护卫\', \'text\': \'警戒\\n地落～每当一个地在你的操控下进战场时，将目标法术力值等于或小于3的永久物牌从你的坟墓场放逐。\\n当宝库护卫死去时，将所有以其放逐的永久物牌在各自拥有者的操控下放进战场。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～猫／野兽\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592568&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4136d038-e75f-436b-9d60-b6fa45b6ed97\', \'multiverseId\': 592568}, \'multiverseid\': 592568}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ib Halbherz, Goblin-Taktiker\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn ein anderer Goblin, den du kontrollierst, geblockt wird, opfere ihn. Falls du dies tust, fügt er jeder Kreatur, die ihn blockt, 4 Schadenspunkte zu.\\nOpfere zwei Gebirge: Erzeuge zwei 1/1 rote Goblin-Kreaturenspielsteine.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Goblin, Berater\', \'flavor\': \'„Alle außer mir Sturmangriff!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590262&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3fbaa678-b683-4353-b6b0-6394f21a060c\', \'multiverseId\': 590262}, \'multiverseid\': 590262}, {\'name\': \'Ib Corazón de Ratón, estratega trasgo\', \'text\': \'Siempre que otro Trasgo que controlas sea bloqueado, sacrifícalo. Si lo haces, le hace 4 puntos de daño a cada criatura que lo bloquea.\\nSacrificar dos Montañas: Crea dos fichas de criatura Trasgo rojas 1/1.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Consejero trasgo\', \'flavor\': \'"Todos salvo yo, ¡A LA CARGA!".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590397&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4b2c2a3f-486c-470f-9b67-fe381e3778bd\', \'multiverseId\': 590397}, \'multiverseid\': 590397}, {\'name\': \'Ib Micœur, tacticien gobelin\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'un autre gobelin que vous contrôlez devient bloqué, sacrifiez-le. Si vous faites ainsi, il inflige 4 blessures à chaque créature qui le bloque.\\nSacrifiez deux montagnes : Créez deux jetons de créature 1/1 rouge Gobelin.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : gobelin et conseiller\', \'flavor\': \'« Tout le monde excepté moi — CHARGEZ ! »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590532&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4884d0de-748f-4126-8fd3-79611f926b79\', \'multiverseId\': 590532}, \'multiverseid\': 590532}, {\'name\': \'Ib Mezzocuore, Stratega Goblin\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta un altro Goblin che controlli viene bloccato, sacrificalo. Se lo fai, esso infligge 4 danni a ogni creatura che lo blocca.\\nSacrifica due Montagne: Crea due pedine creatura Goblin 1/1 rosse.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Consigliere Goblin\', \'flavor\': \'"Tutti tranne me—CARICA!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590667&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8558c62e-1d9e-4f3d-af81-0f0ed6a644a5\', \'multiverseId\': 590667}, \'multiverseid\': 590667}, {\'name\': \'ゴブリンの戦術家、半心臓のイッブ\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしていてこれでないゴブリン１体がブロックされた状態になるたび、それを生け贄に捧げる。そうしたなら、それはそれをブロックしている各クリーチャーにそれぞれ４点のダメージを与える。\\n山２つを生け贄に捧げる：赤の１/１のゴブリン・クリーチャー・トークン２体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — ゴブリン・アドバイザー\', \'flavor\': \'「俺以外の全員――突撃！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590802&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4d32aa5b-359e-4d9b-beee-7feac754995f\', \'multiverseId\': 590802}, \'multiverseid\': 590802}, {\'name\': \'鬼怪战术家依部哈夫哈特\', \'text\': \'每当另一个由你操控的鬼怪被阻挡时，将它牺牲。若你如此作，则它对每个阻挡它的生物各造成4点伤害。\\n牺牲两个山脉：派出两个1/1红色鬼怪衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～鬼怪／参谋\', \'flavor\': \'「全体听令，除我之外～冲锋！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591207&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9226a823-033a-4181-a110-3bb0e52bbfce\', \'multiverseId\': 591207}, \'multiverseid\': 591207}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ilysischer Karyatide\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe. Falls du eine Kreatur mit Stärke 4 oder mehr kontrollierst, erzeuge stattdessen zwei Mana genau einer beliebigen Farbe.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Pflanze\', \'flavor\': \'Diejenigen, die als Helden sterben, dürfen in Ilysia wohnen, einem geschützten Reich der Unterwelt, das so ruhig und lebendig ist wie der Rest trostlos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592875&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7ae73b00-988d-4a18-9230-8848480c992f\', \'multiverseId\': 592875}, \'multiverseid\': 592875}, {\'name\': \'Cariátide ilysea\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega un maná de cualquier color. Si controlas una criatura con fuerza de 4 o más, en vez de eso, agrega dos manás de un color cualquiera.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Planta\', \'flavor\': \'A aquellos que mueren como héroes se les permite residir en Ilysea, una región protegida del Inframundo, tan tranquila y alegre como lúgubres son el resto de sitios.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592996&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'41f2f493-5182-477d-822b-2b17e1e11d64\', \'multiverseId\': 592996}, \'multiverseid\': 592996}, {\'name\': \'Cariatide ilyséenne\', \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix. Si vous contrôlez une créature de force supérieure ou égale à 4, ajoutez deux manas d\'une même couleur de votre choix à la place.", \'type\': \'Créature : plante\', \'flavor\': "Ceux qui meurent en héros ont le droit de demeurer dans l\'Ilysée, un royaume protégé du Monde souterrain aussi tranquille et vivant que le reste est désolé.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593117&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9e14ee1b-19bf-4f3b-8f65-fa2a14d7b5e9\', \'multiverseId\': 593117}, \'multiverseid\': 593117}, {\'name\': \'Cariatide di Ilysia\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore. Se controlli una creatura con forza pari o superiore a 4, aggiungi invece due mana di un qualsiasi colore.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Pianta\', \'flavor\': "A coloro che muoiono da eroi è consentito risiedere a Ilysia, un reame protetto dell\'Ade, sereno e fiorente quanto il resto è tetro e angosciante.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593238&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f17b341a-1958-4547-9a9d-f8f46754613a\', \'multiverseId\': 593238}, \'multiverseid\': 593238}, {\'name\': \'イリーシアの女像樹\', \'text\': \'{T}：好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。あなたがパワーが４以上であるクリーチャーをコントロールしているなら、代わりに好きな色１色のマナ２点を加える。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 植物\', \'flavor\': \'英雄として死んだ者はイリーシアで暮らすことが許される。ここは死の国の中にある保護された地域で、荒涼とした他の場所に比べると静穏で明るい。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593359&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1976ca42-172e-4ce8-b81a-a070948823be\', \'multiverseId\': 593359}, \'multiverseid\': 593359}, {\'name\': \'依吕夏女像柱\', \'text\': \'{T}：加一点任意颜色的法术力。如果你操控力量等于或大于4的生物，则改为加两点任意颜色的单色法术力。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～植物\', \'flavor\': \'被尊为英雄者死后可进入安宁兴盛的依吕夏境内。此处为少有的安全境域，与冥界他处的黑暗阴沉形成鲜明对比。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593722&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'40e48241-a04f-4c05-9c99-65e94f7fd940\', \'multiverseId\': 593722}, \'multiverseid\': 593722}]', '[{\'name\': \'Im Jenseits abrechnen\', \'text\': \'Bestimme eines oder beides —\\n• Schicke eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du nicht kontrollierst, ins Exil.\\n• Schicke eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst, ins Exil und bringe sie dann unter der Kontrolle ihres Besitzers ins Spiel zurück.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Zwei verschwanden, einer kehrte zurück.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591648&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6aabc091-a480-4f08-a913-9e111996a0bd\', \'multiverseId\': 591648}, \'multiverseid\': 591648}, {\'name\': \'Solucionar más allá de la realidad\', \'text\': \'Elige uno o ambos:\\n• Exilia la criatura objetivo que no controlas.\\n• Exilia la criatura objetivo que controlas, luego regrésala al campo de batalla bajo el control de su propietario.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Se llevaron a dos, juzgaron a dos, pero solo una regresó.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591777&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'284b2b6d-6bb7-464c-ac18-3bb36055ee69\', \'multiverseId\': 591777}, \'multiverseid\': 591777}, {\'name\': \'Résolution hors réalité\', \'text\': "Choisissez l\'un ou les deux —\\n• Exilez une créature ciblée que vous ne contrôlez pas.\\n• Exilez une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez, puis renvoyez-la sur le champ de bataille sous le contrôle de son propriétaire.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'Deux furent choisis, deux furent jugés, un seul revint.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591906&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0b50e803-8c53-46d6-a001-ed75f827d13c\', \'multiverseId\': 591906}, \'multiverseid\': 591906}, {\'name\': \'Resa dei Conti Surreale\', \'text\': \'Scegli uno o entrambi —\\n• Esilia una creatura bersaglio che non controlli.\\n• Esilia una creatura bersaglio che controlli, poi rimettila sul campo di battaglia sotto il controllo del suo proprietario.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'Due furono presi, due furono giudicati, uno fece ritorno.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592035&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8aaf63d5-d0bd-4fea-8b4d-3fb3cfa0f5f8\', \'multiverseId\': 592035}, \'multiverseid\': 592035}, {\'name\': \'超現実的決着\', \'text\': \'以下から１つまたは両方を選ぶ。\\n• あなたがコントロールしていないクリーチャー１体を対象とする。それを追放する。\\n• あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。それを追放し、その後、オーナーのコントロール下で戦場に戻す。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'二人が消え、二人が裁かれ、一人が戻った。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592164&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e1a434c8-16cd-4558-ac5c-8b9c8a541a79\', \'multiverseId\': 592164}, \'multiverseid\': 592164}, {\'name\': \'超凡安生\', \'text\': \'选择一项或都选～\\n•放逐目标不由你操控的生物。\\n•放逐目标由你操控的生物，然后将它在其拥有者的操控下移回战场。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'羁押两人，审判两人，返回一人。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592551&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9345f69b-9dfc-4293-b207-c1e8e610b0f7\', \'multiverseId\': 592551}, \'multiverseid\': 592551}]', '[{\'name\': \'Im Äther verankern\', \'text\': \'Lege eine Kreatur deiner Wahl oben auf die Bibliothek ihres Besitzers. Hellsicht 1. (Schaue dir die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek an. Du kannst sie unter deine Bibliothek legen.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595196&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a83d0ad2-893a-43b9-a347-85f804c90a2a\', \'multiverseId\': 595196}, \'multiverseid\': 595196}, {\'name\': \'Anclado al éter\', \'text\': \'Pon la criatura objetivo en la parte superior de la biblioteca de su propietario. Adivina 1. (Mira la primera carta de tu biblioteca. Puedes poner esa carta en el fondo de tu biblioteca.)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595304&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'37b00ab1-5cd4-4315-b1ec-fd99914744a0\', \'multiverseId\': 595304}, \'multiverseid\': 595304}, {\'name\': "Ancrer à l\'Éther", \'text\': \'Mettez une créature ciblée au-dessus de la bibliothèque de son propriétaire. Regard 1. (Regardez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Vous pouvez la mettre au-dessous de votre bibliothèque.)\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595412&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1594f0f9-1d47-4ab4-ba13-40fa9efc17e9\', \'multiverseId\': 595412}, \'multiverseid\': 595412}, {\'name\': "Ancorare all\'Etere", \'text\': \'Metti una creatura bersaglio in cima al grimorio del suo proprietario. Profetizza 1. (Guarda la prima carta del tuo grimorio. Puoi mettere quella carta in fondo al tuo grimorio.)\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595520&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a7835b7d-7004-4251-8c72-76b06371f6d9\', \'multiverseId\': 595520}, \'multiverseid\': 595520}, {\'name\': \'霊気への抑留\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それをオーナーのライブラリーの一番上に置く。占術１を行う。（あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード１枚を見る。あなたはそのカードをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に置いてもよい。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595628&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f5cf2cd3-cec0-4f5f-8052-f3e21c9ef14c\', \'multiverseId\': 595628}, \'multiverseid\': 595628}, {\'name\': \'钉入乙太\', \'text\': \'将目标生物置于其拥有者的牌库顶。占卜1。（检视你牌库顶的牌。你可以将该牌置于你的牌库底。）\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595952&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aac6cb78-bdc8-4bb4-8f8b-b70f1b760f75\', \'multiverseId\': 595952}, \'multiverseid\': 595952}]', '[{\'name\': \'Immersturm-Plünderer\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Immersturm-Plünderer ins Spiel kommt, kannst du eine Karte abwerfen. Falls du dies tust, ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Dämon, Berserker\', \'flavor\': \'Die Dämonen machten weder Gefangene noch Beute, sie wollten nur zerstören.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590264&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'248a9913-6578-4db6-8426-8e79ae6f03af\', \'multiverseId\': 590264}, \'multiverseid\': 590264}, {\'name\': \'Incursor de Immersturm\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Incursor de Immersturm entre al campo de batalla, puedes descartar una carta. Si lo haces, roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Berserker demonio\', \'flavor\': \'Los demonios no se llevaron a nadie cautivo ni saquearon los botines; solo querían destruir.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590399&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f5ea0a07-62fa-4779-a991-fe0aa0d7568c\', \'multiverseId\': 590399}, \'multiverseid\': 590399}, {\'name\': "Pillard de l\'Immersturm", \'text\': "Quand le Pillard de l\'Immersturm arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez vous défausser d\'une carte. Si vous faites ainsi, piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Créature : démon et berserker\', \'flavor\': "Les démons n\'ont fait aucun prisonnier et n\'ont pris aucun butin ; ils ne cherchaient que la destruction.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590534&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7797df15-affc-43fc-9cd4-8b1bedc927df\', \'multiverseId\': 590534}, \'multiverseid\': 590534}, {\'name\': \'Assaltatore di Immersturm\', \'text\': "Quando l\'Assaltatore di Immersturm entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi scartare una carta. Se lo fai, pesca una carta.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Berserker Demone\', \'flavor\': \'I demoni non fecero prigionieri e non reclamarono alcun bottino: il loro unico obiettivo era distruggere.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590669&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'90ea69a6-f75c-4cd3-97eb-bb869e4c1021\', \'multiverseId\': 590669}, \'multiverseid\': 590669}, {\'name\': \'イマースタームの略奪者\', \'text\': \'イマースタームの略奪者が戦場に出たとき、あなたはカード１枚を捨ててもよい。そうしたなら、カード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — デーモン・狂戦士\', \'flavor\': \'悪魔は捕虜を取らず略奪も行わない。ただ破壊だけを求める。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590804&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e8b8a170-4e39-425a-8d73-46ef5db3b22f\', \'multiverseId\': 590804}, \'multiverseid\': 590804}, {\'name\': \'无尽风暴劫掠者\', \'text\': \'当无尽风暴劫掠者进战场时，你可以弃一张牌。若你如此作，则抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～恶魔／狂战士\', \'flavor\': \'恶魔不留俘虏，不取财物；他们只求破坏。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591209&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9dc72133-9811-4abb-a51c-dfe7c215aced\', \'multiverseId\': 591209}, \'multiverseid\': 591209}]', '[{\'name\': \'Imperialer Aerosaurus\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nWenn der Imperiale Aerosaurus ins Spiel kommt, erhält eine andere Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst, +1/+1 und Flugfähigkeit bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Dinosaurier\', \'flavor\': \'Man ruft ihn zur Hilfe und kommt sich dann nicht selten wie schnöde Beute vor.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591602&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d4cfe6d3-2900-40fa-8b59-45fdae90ea3e\', \'multiverseId\': 591602}, \'multiverseid\': 591602}, {\'name\': \'Aerosaurio imperial\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nCuando el Aerosaurio imperial entre al campo de batalla, otra criatura objetivo que controlas obtiene +1/+1 y gana la habilidad de volar hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Dinosaurio\', \'flavor\': \'Su ayuda es inquietantemente parecida a su técnica de caza.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591731&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b28d7274-9f0e-4241-a7e4-929359e55150\', \'multiverseId\': 591731}, \'multiverseid\': 591731}, {\'name\': \'Aérosaure impérial\', \'text\': "Vol\\nQuand l\'Aérosaure impérial arrive sur le champ de bataille, une autre créature ciblée que vous contrôlez gagne +1/+1 et acquiert le vol jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : dinosaure\', \'flavor\': "Sa méthode d\'assistance ressemble de manière troublante à sa méthode de chasse.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591860&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fe941839-474d-412b-98d0-49064b06f7ff\', \'multiverseId\': 591860}, \'multiverseid\': 591860}, {\'name\': \'Aerosauro Imperiale\', \'text\': "Volare\\nQuando l\'Aerosauro Imperiale entra nel campo di battaglia, un\'altra creatura bersaglio che controlli prende +1/+1 e ha volare fino alla fine del turno.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Dinosauro\', \'flavor\': \'Il suo sostegno in battaglia somiglia in modo inquietante alla sua strategia di caccia.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591989&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'80b0f840-d152-4641-a75e-32d1939fb427\', \'multiverseId\': 591989}, \'multiverseid\': 591989}, {\'name\': \'帝国のエアロサウルス\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n帝国のエアロサウルスが戦場に出たとき、あなたがコントロールしていてこれでないクリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは＋１/＋１の修整を受け飛行を得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 恐竜\', \'flavor\': \'その支援は、嫌になるほど狩りに似ている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592118&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6b39a55a-25bb-48df-a5a1-fd480a204003\', \'multiverseId\': 592118}, \'multiverseid\': 592118}, {\'name\': \'帝国翔翼龙\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n当帝国翔翼龙进战场时，直到回合结束，另一个目标由你操控的生物得+1/+1且获得飞行异能。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～恐龙\', \'flavor\': \'它引人升空的姿势与狩猎时毫无二致，因此总让人胆战心惊。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592505&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8ab6a219-9613-4326-8ceb-fdd7f8133bcc\', \'multiverseId\': 592505}, \'multiverseid\': 592505}]', '[{\'name\': \'Improvisierte Bewaffnung\', \'text\': \'Die Improvisierte Bewaffnung fügt einem Ziel deiner Wahl 2 Schadenspunkte zu. Erzeuge einen Schatz-Spielstein. (Er ist ein Artefakt mit „{T}, opfere dieses Artefakt: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe.")\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Alles kann eine Waffe sein, wenn du damit nur hart genug zuschlägst.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590266&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'09892b2a-6fef-4723-b3f9-2fdfe2ad0953\', \'multiverseId\': 590266}, \'multiverseid\': 590266}, {\'name\': \'Armamento improvisado\', \'text\': \'El Armamento improvisado hace 2 puntos de daño a cualquier objetivo. Crea una ficha de Tesoro. (Es un artefacto con "{T}, sacrificar este artefacto: Agrega un maná de cualquier color".)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Todo puede ser un arma si lo sacudes bien fuerte.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590401&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7221a7f1-0496-44c2-ae40-61b233a07de7\', \'multiverseId\': 590401}, \'multiverseid\': 590401}, {\'name\': \'Arsenal improvisé\', \'text\': "L\'Arsenal improvisé inflige 2 blessures à n\'importe quelle cible. Créez un jeton Trésor. (C\'est un artefact avec « {T}, sacrifiez cet artefact : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix. »)", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'Tout peut devenir une arme si vous frappez suffisamment fort avec.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590536&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'caa5617c-87cb-4eab-8ed0-063a5b1db73b\', \'multiverseId\': 590536}, \'multiverseid\': 590536}, {\'name\': \'Armi Improvvisate\', \'text\': \'Le Armi Improvvisate infliggono 2 danni a un qualsiasi bersaglio. Crea una pedina Tesoro. (È un artefatto con "{T}, Sacrifica questo artefatto: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore".)\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': "Qualsiasi oggetto può essere un\'arma, se brandito con forza sufficiente.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590671&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d7eb521e-5cfb-44bc-93ce-a676bedf9a20\', \'multiverseId\': 590671}, \'multiverseid\': 590671}, {\'name\': \'間に合わせの武器\', \'text\': \'クリーチャーやプレインズウォーカーやプレイヤーのうち１つを対象とする。間に合わせの武器はそれに２点のダメージを与える。宝物・トークン１つを生成する。（それは、「{T}, このアーティファクトを生け贄に捧げる：好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。」を持つアーティファクトである。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'思いっきり振れば何だって武器になる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590806&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'86711f9a-0207-490a-ab64-618eb40ec03c\', \'multiverseId\': 590806}, \'multiverseid\': 590806}, {\'name\': \'临时武器\', \'text\': \'临时武器对任意一个目标造成2点伤害。派出一个珍宝衍生物。（它是具有「{T}，牺牲此神器：加一点任意颜色的法术力」的神器。）\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'只要够用力挥，什么东西都能当武器。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591211&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a1c9f28d-0339-4b03-b4b3-2f9d96b3abe3\', \'multiverseId\': 591211}, \'multiverseid\': 591211}]', '[{\'name\': \'Impulsives Handeln\', \'text\': \'Schicke die obersten drei Karten deiner Bibliothek ins Exil. Du kannst sie bis zum Ende des Zuges spielen. (Falls du auf diese Weise einen Zauberspruch wirkst, bezahlst du immer noch seine Kosten. Du kannst auf diese Weise nur ein Land spielen, falls du in diesem Zug noch eines spielen darfst.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Du willst nicht wissen, was geschieht, wenn ich die Schutzbrille aufgesetzt habe."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590200&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f1aa1dcc-cd0e-42b1-b121-bef1085c9b30\', \'multiverseId\': 590200}, \'multiverseid\': 590200}, {\'name\': \'Actuar por impulso\', \'text\': \'Exilia las tres primeras cartas de tu biblioteca. Hasta el final del turno, puedes jugar esas cartas. (Si lanzas un hechizo de esta manera, sigues pagando sus costes. Puedes jugar una tierra de esta manera solo si te queda una jugada de tierra disponible.)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"No te conviene saber lo que ocurre una vez que me pongo las gafas".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590335&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f498fed1-358a-4a69-8de2-99bb63209251\', \'multiverseId\': 590335}, \'multiverseid\': 590335}, {\'name\': \'Agir par impulsion\', \'text\': "Exilez les trois cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Jusqu\'à la fin du tour, vous pouvez jouer ces cartes. (Si vous lancez un sort de cette manière, vous payez toujours ses coûts. Vous ne pouvez jouer un terrain de cette manière que s\'il vous reste une mise en jeu de terrain disponible.)", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'« Jetons un voile pudique sur ce qui se passe une fois mes lunettes chaussées. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590470&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f2cfd6c8-de31-4d82-be52-68cc081bab2b\', \'multiverseId\': 590470}, \'multiverseid\': 590470}, {\'name\': "Agire d\'Impulso", \'text\': \'Esilia le prime tre carte del tuo grimorio. Fino alla fine del turno, puoi giocare quelle carte. (Se lanci una magia in questo modo, paghi comunque i suoi costi. Puoi giocare una terra in questo modo solo se potresti giocarne una normalmente.)\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Non vuoi sapere cosa succede quando mi metto gli occhialoni."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590605&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'580aab50-099c-4156-9c35-80c555facc8b\', \'multiverseId\': 590605}, \'multiverseid\': 590605}, {\'name\': \'衝動的な行動\', \'text\': \'あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード３枚を追放する。ターン終了時まで、あなたはそれらのカードをプレイしてもよい。（これにより呪文を唱えるなら、その呪文のコストを支払う必要がある。これにより土地をプレイするには、あなたは土地プレイを残している必要がある。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「私がゴーグルをつけたら何が起こるかなんて、知らないほうが身のためよ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590740&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'64676690-49ae-4b9a-9839-9674e3782130\', \'multiverseId\': 590740}, \'multiverseid\': 590740}, {\'name\': \'逞性妄为\', \'text\': \'放逐你牌库顶的三张牌。直到回合结束，你可以使用这些牌。（如果你以此法施放咒语，你依旧要支付其费用。你只能于你仍有可使用地数的时候，才能以此法使用地。）\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「你不会想知道我戴上防护镜之后会发生什么。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591145&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2f80fcac-047d-49f5-b7f9-11e0340e256b\', \'multiverseId\': 591145}, \'multiverseid\': 591145}]', '[{\'name\': \'In die Grube werfen\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre eine Kreatur deiner Wahl. In die Grube werfen fügt dem Beherrscher der Kreatur 2 Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Erst siehst du dein ganzes Leben im Zeitraffer. Dann hast du reichlich Zeit, während des Sturzes jeden deiner Fehltritte zu bereuen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594045&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'18b15147-50cc-4f1d-b389-3054b626dba5\', \'multiverseId\': 594045}, \'multiverseid\': 594045}, {\'name\': \'Mandar al foso\', \'text\': \'Destruye la criatura objetivo. Mandar al foso hace 2 puntos de daño al controlador de esa criatura.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Primero, tu vida entera pasa ante tus ojos. Luego, tienes tiempo de sobra para reflexionar sobre todo lo que te arrepientes mientras caes y caes.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594162&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8098f956-5616-4fe2-ab14-429eba2c4cdf\', \'multiverseId\': 594162}, \'multiverseid\': 594162}, {\'name\': \'Consigner à la fosse\', \'text\': \'Détruisez une créature ciblée. Consigner à la fosse inflige 2 blessures au contrôleur de cette créature.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "D\'abord, votre vie défile devant vos yeux. Puis vous avez suffisamment de temps pour réfléchir à chacun de vos regrets pendant votre chute.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594279&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'87d4c951-26f9-4dd1-867e-0b85ea5cf678\', \'multiverseId\': 594279}, \'multiverseid\': 594279}, {\'name\': "Relegare nell\'Abisso", \'text\': "Distruggi una creatura bersaglio. Relegare nell\'Abisso infligge 2 danni al controllore di quella creatura.", \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': "All\'inizio tutta la vita ti scorre di fronte agli occhi, dopodiché ti resta una notevole quantità di tempo per riflettere su tutti i tuoi rimpianti mentre precipiti.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594396&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4aefcda5-231b-4449-99cd-66d66d8df4be\', \'multiverseId\': 594396}, \'multiverseid\': 594396}, {\'name\': \'奈落への放逐\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それを破壊する。奈落への放逐はそのクリーチャーのコントローラーに２点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'まず、お前の一生が目の前を駆け巡る。その後、真っ逆さまに落ちながら、すべての後悔を振り返るのに十分な長い時間が与えられる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594513&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6808cdc1-d748-40a1-b886-784dae2293e5\', \'multiverseId\': 594513}, \'multiverseid\': 594513}, {\'name\': \'坠入深渊\', \'text\': \'消灭目标生物。坠入深渊对该生物的操控者造成2点伤害。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'一开始，你的眼前会浮现此生往事。随后，你有足够的时间在下坠过程中反思每一丝悔恨。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594864&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ea90a1ce-d6b7-4936-b863-6b5e66db4556\', \'multiverseId\': 594864}, \'multiverseid\': 594864}]', '[{\'name\': \'Inbrünstiger Hieb\', \'text\': \'Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält +1/+0, Erstschlag und Eile bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Die Flamme formt einen Kreis am Himmel und verwandelt sich dann in einen alles durchdringenden Funken. Der Feind geht zu Boden und der Rauch des Sieges steigt auf."\\n—„Legenden der Feuertänzerin"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590237&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d119bd9c-f616-4df1-bb80-b3342b252d65\', \'multiverseId\': 590237}, \'multiverseid\': 590237}, {\'name\': \'Golpe ferviente\', \'text\': \'La criatura objetivo obtiene +1/+0 y gana las habilidades de dañar primero y prisa hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"La llama traza una curva brillante en el cielo y se transforma en una chispa perforadora. Cae el enemigo; se alza el humo de la victoria".\\n—"Leyendas del baile ígneo"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590372&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'08d9c528-b7a3-4786-9151-0f65dd560bce\', \'multiverseId\': 590372}, \'multiverseid\': 590372}, {\'name\': \'Frappe fervente\', \'text\': "Une créature ciblée gagne +1/+0 et acquiert l\'initiative et la célérité jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« La flamme dessine une roue lumineuse dans le ciel, puis s\'abat telle une étincelle foudroyante. L\'ennemi tombe ; la fumée de la victoire s\'élève. »\\n—« Légendes de la dansefeu »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590507&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5eaf2cc2-9c3c-4552-a299-e5ca61e070f0\', \'multiverseId\': 590507}, \'multiverseid\': 590507}, {\'name\': \'Colpo Fervente\', \'text\': \'Una creatura bersaglio prende +1/+0 e ha attacco improvviso e rapidità fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"La fiamma disegna una ruota luminosa in cielo, poi si tramuta in una scintilla pungente. Mentre il nemico cade, s\\\'innalza il fumo della vittoria."\\n—"Leggende della Danzafuoco"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590642&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2b4dd3f4-274a-4d20-ba29-40254f778d77\', \'multiverseId\': 590642}, \'multiverseid\': 590642}, {\'name\': \'白熱の一撃\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは＋１/＋０の修整を受け先制攻撃と速攻を得る。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「炎は天空に鮮やかな輪を描くと、突き通す閃光へと変わった。敵は滅びた。昇る煙が勝利を告げていた。」\\n――「火踊りの伝説」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590777&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7519562e-f858-4bdf-b5e1-7ff71500cbe4\', \'multiverseId\': 590777}, \'multiverseid\': 590777}, {\'name\': \'激昂一击\', \'text\': \'直到回合结束，目标生物得+1/+0且获得先攻与敏捷异能。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「源火在空中划出明亮火轮，随后变换成锐利火花。敌人倒下；胜利之烟升起。」\\n～「火舞传承」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591182&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aac22668-a576-40a7-9472-8d7a6259aebc\', \'multiverseId\': 591182}, \'multiverseid\': 591182}]', '[{\'name\': \'Infiltrationslinse\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn die ausgerüstete Kreatur von einer Kreatur geblockt wird, kannst du zwei Karten ziehen.\\nAusrüsten {1} ({1}: Lege diese Karte an eine Kreatur deiner Wahl an, die du kontrollierst. Spiele Ausrüsten wie eine Hexerei.)\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Ausrüstung\', \'flavor\': \'Neurokspione tragen Geräte mit sich herum, mit denen sie wenige Augenblicke in die Zukunft schauen können, was ihnen einen untrüglichen Vorteil gibt.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596281&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'efa62bfc-2f64-4ece-8780-b2c653f2d85a\', \'multiverseId\': 596281}, \'multiverseid\': 596281}, {\'name\': \'Lente espía\', \'text\': \'Siempre que la criatura equipada sea bloqueada por una criatura, puedes robar dos cartas.\\nEquipar {1}. ({1}: Anexa este Equipo a la criatura objetivo que controlas. Activa la habilidad de equipar como un conjuro.)\', \'type\': \'Artefacto — Equipo\', \'flavor\': \'Los espías néurok llevan aparatos que les permiten ver algunos instantes del futuro, lo que les da una ventaja insalvable.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596368&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2ea8cc12-181c-471b-861f-591629814752\', \'multiverseId\': 596368}, \'multiverseid\': 596368}, {\'name\': "Lentille d\'infiltration", \'text\': "À chaque fois que la créature équipée devient bloquée par une créature, vous pouvez piocher deux cartes.\\nÉquipement {1} ({1} : Attachez à une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez. N\'attachez l\'équipement que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.)", \'type\': \'Artefact : équipement\', \'flavor\': "Les espions neuroks possèdent des instruments qui leur permettent de voir quelques instants de l\'avenir, ce qui leur donne un avantage presque insurmontable.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596455&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'71018106-13f8-4a51-a61c-6f7b168fd3ac\', \'multiverseId\': 596455}, \'multiverseid\': 596455}, {\'name\': \'Lenti da Infiltrazione\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta la creatura equipaggiata viene bloccata da una creatura, puoi pescare due carte.\\nEquipaggiare {1} ({1}: Assegna a una creatura bersaglio che controlli. Equipaggia solo come una stregoneria.)\', \'type\': \'Artefatto — Equipaggiamento\', \'flavor\': \'Le spie Neurok trasportano dispositivi che permettono loro di vedere per qualche istante nel futuro, fornendo loro un vantaggio quasi insormontabile.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596542&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'08389cfd-9fb8-4419-baab-ce2b255ae8ff\', \'multiverseId\': 596542}, \'multiverseid\': 596542}, {\'name\': \'浸透のレンズ\', \'text\': \'装備しているクリーチャーがクリーチャー１体にブロックされた状態になるたび、あなたはカード２枚を引いてもよい。\\n装備{1}（{1}：あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。これをそれにつける。装備はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。）\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 装備品\', \'flavor\': \'ニューロックのスパイは未来を垣間見る道具を携帯している。これがあれば、戦闘でまずひっくり返せないほどの優位が稼げるのだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596629&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1af45775-dbc8-4d00-ab9e-fd10b017d04a\', \'multiverseId\': 596629}, \'multiverseid\': 596629}, {\'name\': \'渗透镜\', \'text\': \'每当佩带此武具的生物被一个生物阻挡时，你可以抓两张牌。\\n佩带{1}（{1}：贴附在目标由你操控的生物上。只能于法术时机佩带。）\', \'type\': \'神器 ～武具\', \'flavor\': \'纽若克间谍携带的装置能够预见未来少许时刻，让他们握有几乎绝对的优势。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596890&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2c299aa3-e575-402f-9843-01a1f7d0c5c1\', \'multiverseId\': 596890}, \'multiverseid\': 596890}]', '[{\'name\': \'Informatorische Befragung\', \'text\': \'Verzaubert eine Kreatur oder einen Planeswalker\\nWenn die Informatorische Befragung ins Spiel kommt, tappe die verzauberte bleibende Karte und stelle Nachforschungen an. (Erzeuge einen Hinweis-Spielstein. Er ist ein Artefakt mit „{2}, opfere dieses Artefakt: Ziehe eine Karte.")\\nDie verzauberte bleibende Karte enttappt nicht während des Enttappsegments ihres Beherrschers, und ihre aktivierten Fähigkeiten können nicht aktiviert werden.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589616&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'81b7f704-7ef5-408c-941c-9893b56c8d90\', \'multiverseId\': 589616}, \'multiverseid\': 589616}, {\'name\': \'Someter a interrogatorio\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura o planeswalker.\\nCuando Someter a interrogatorio entre al campo de batalla, gira el permanente encantado e investiga. (Crea una ficha de Pista. Es un artefacto con "{2}, sacrificar este artefacto: Roba una carta".)\\nEl permanente encantado no se endereza durante el paso de enderezar de su controlador y no pueden activarse sus habilidades activadas.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589667&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0c332f98-e0b6-4a4e-a367-83230dd765cb\', \'multiverseId\': 589667}, \'multiverseid\': 589667}, {\'name\': \'Interrogatoire\', \'text\': "Enchanter : créature ou planeswalker\\nQuand l\'Interrogatoire arrive sur le champ de bataille, engagez le permanent enchanté et enquêtez. (Créez un jeton Indice. C\'est un artefact avec « {2}, sacrifiez cet artefact : Piochez une carte. »)\\nLe permanent enchanté ne se dégage pas pendant l\'étape de dégagement de son contrôleur et ses capacités activées ne peuvent pas être activées.", \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589718&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'606b4ada-508c-47fd-9fb6-ad7525900ec8\', \'multiverseId\': 589718}, \'multiverseid\': 589718}, {\'name\': \'Sottoporre a Interrogatorio\', \'text\': \'Incanta creatura o planeswalker\\nQuando Sottoporre a Interrogatorio entra nel campo di battaglia, TAPpa il permanente incantato e indaga. (Crea una pedina Indizio. È un artefatto con "{2}, Sacrifica questo artefatto: Pesca una carta".)\\nIl permanente incantato non STAPpa durante lo STAP del suo controllore e le sue abilità attivate non possono essere attivate.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589769&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'39dd4eb1-cec2-4cbc-a14e-5a7156eb5dfc\', \'multiverseId\': 589769}, \'multiverseid\': 589769}, {\'name\': \'尋問の引き留め\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（クリーチャーやプレインズウォーカー）\\n尋問の引き留めが戦場に出たとき、エンチャントしているパーマネントをタップし、調査を行う。（手掛かり・トークン１つを生成する。（それは、「{2},このアーティファクトを生け贄に捧げる：カード１枚を引く。」を持つアーティファクトである。）\\nエンチャントしているパーマネントはコントローラーのアンタップ・ステップにアンタップせず、それの起動型能力は起動できない。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589820&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bdcb41f2-842d-4202-acce-b5e87addec8f\', \'multiverseId\': 589820}, \'multiverseid\': 589820}, {\'name\': \'扣押讯问\', \'text\': \'结附于生物或鹏洛客\\n当扣押讯问进战场时，横置所结附的永久物并探查。（派出一个线索衍生物。它是具有「{2}，牺牲此神器：抓一张牌」的神器。）\\n所结附的永久物于其操控者的重置步骤中不能重置，且其起动式异能都不能起动。\', \'type\': \'结界 ～灵气\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589973&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a5ab7b20-60ff-4cb5-bfac-355cb326aa2a\', \'multiverseId\': 589973}, \'multiverseid\': 589973}]', '[{\'name\': \'Innerer Dämon\', \'text\': \'Verzaubert eine Kreatur\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur erhält +2/+2, hat Flugfähigkeit und ist zusätzlich zu ihren anderen Typen ein Dämon.\\nWenn der Innere Dämon ins Spiel kommt, erhält jede Nicht-Dämon-Kreatur -2/-2 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594085&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fcaa985a-d853-4b7b-933e-1f510199280c\', \'multiverseId\': 594085}, \'multiverseid\': 594085}, {\'name\': \'Demonio interior\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura.\\nLa criatura encantada obtiene +2/+2, tiene la habilidad de volar y es un Demonio además de sus otros tipos.\\nCuando el Demonio interior entre al campo de batalla, todas las criaturas que no sean Demonio obtienen -2/-2 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594202&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ae400081-5414-458e-b97a-e7ead7f62794\', \'multiverseId\': 594202}, \'multiverseid\': 594202}, {\'name\': \'Démon intérieur\', \'text\': "Enchanter : créature\\nLa créature enchantée gagne +2/+2, a le vol et est un démon en plus de ses autres types.\\nQuand le Démon intérieur arrive sur le champ de bataille, toutes les créatures non-Démon gagnent -2/-2 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594319&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0f5ee30d-6a66-47e1-867d-b7859388aea8\', \'multiverseId\': 594319}, \'multiverseid\': 594319}, {\'name\': \'Demone Interiore\', \'text\': \'Incanta creatura\\nLa creatura incantata prende +2/+2, ha volare ed è un Demone in aggiunta ai suoi altri tipi.\\nQuando il Demone Interiore entra nel campo di battaglia, tutte le creature non Demone prendono -2/-2 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594436&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2d37c712-59b1-4e8a-b53e-b4db34b18c1a\', \'multiverseId\': 594436}, \'multiverseid\': 594436}, {\'name\': \'内なる悪魔\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\nエンチャントしているクリーチャーは、＋２/＋２の修整を受け飛行を持ち、それの他のタイプに加えてデーモンでもある。\\n内なる悪魔が戦場に出たとき、ターン終了時まで、デーモンでないすべてのクリーチャーは－２/－２の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594553&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'edd5d617-9233-42d0-ac88-659abe8ae15f\', \'multiverseId\': 594553}, \'multiverseid\': 594553}, {\'name\': \'潜伏魔性\', \'text\': \'结附于生物\\n所结附的生物得+2/+2，具有飞行异能，且额外具有恶魔此类别。\\n当潜伏魔性进战场时，所有非恶魔生物得-2/-2直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'结界 ～灵气\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594904&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'22702213-f2c8-4159-bf51-3242867fa28b\', \'multiverseId\': 594904}, \'multiverseid\': 594904}]', "[{'name': 'Insel', 'type': 'Standardland — Insel', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597763&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '640d8304-2020-4b8f-a0f4-6479a85e4440', 'multiverseId': 597763}, 'multiverseid': 597763}, {'name': 'Isla', 'type': 'Tierra básica — Isla', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597778&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '65e3d302-c959-49ff-a82a-4124e875bbc3', 'multiverseId': 597778}, 'multiverseid': 597778}, {'name': 'Île', 'type': 'Terrain de base : île', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597793&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bb5dfa8e-7792-47b2-a8da-72514c51e537', 'multiverseId': 597793}, 'multiverseid': 597793}, {'name': 'Isola', 'type': 'Terra Base — Isola', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597808&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a4ce59dd-50a2-4759-9c14-751e6461d45e', 'multiverseId': 597808}, 'multiverseid': 597808}, {'name': '島', 'type': '基本土地 — 島', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597823&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '62c2d14a-ee13-488e-b4c0-6bc1ac5bd4c9', 'multiverseId': 597823}, 'multiverseid': 597823}, {'name': '海岛', 'type': '基本地 ～海岛', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597868&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9227c574-95ff-4949-b1c5-dabc0a6ea0ed', 'multiverseId': 597868}, 'multiverseid': 597868}]", "[{'name': 'Insel', 'type': 'Standardland — Insel', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597764&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bad23494-1ca7-48f8-b817-3fac56aaeb34', 'multiverseId': 597764}, 'multiverseid': 597764}, {'name': 'Isla', 'type': 'Tierra básica — Isla', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597779&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '67c33b53-6f62-4752-83c9-9c598c24a161', 'multiverseId': 597779}, 'multiverseid': 597779}, {'name': 'Île', 'type': 'Terrain de base : île', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597794&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '14dde69b-4d36-4e6f-8da3-e2092d622f04', 'multiverseId': 597794}, 'multiverseid': 597794}, {'name': 'Isola', 'type': 'Terra Base — Isola', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597809&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f23a2b66-d5b7-4970-8bbe-88a33cf2dff8', 'multiverseId': 597809}, 'multiverseid': 597809}, {'name': '島', 'type': '基本土地 — 島', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597824&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6e70a56a-851c-4e09-a365-a8d873598f8a', 'multiverseId': 597824}, 'multiverseid': 597824}, {'name': '海岛', 'type': '基本地 ～海岛', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597869&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0e253b1f-aa5d-4a5f-a2ce-66cbd61a939b', 'multiverseId': 597869}, 'multiverseid': 597869}]", "[{'name': 'Insel', 'type': 'Standardland — Insel', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597765&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8a72d89f-97e7-4bc5-bd3b-1c6e0271350f', 'multiverseId': 597765}, 'multiverseid': 597765}, {'name': 'Isla', 'type': 'Tierra básica — Isla', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597780&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b66091cc-7ff3-4225-9aaa-d37e59baafe2', 'multiverseId': 597780}, 'multiverseid': 597780}, {'name': 'Île', 'type': 'Terrain de base : île', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597795&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4059da4a-693b-4b84-a747-bb3e3000e662', 'multiverseId': 597795}, 'multiverseid': 597795}, {'name': 'Isola', 'type': 'Terra Base — Isola', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597810&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '35cd3b76-9e21-4bcc-9bf6-90ead166acd6', 'multiverseId': 597810}, 'multiverseid': 597810}, {'name': '島', 'type': '基本土地 — 島', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597825&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b6fe2148-8f76-49ec-8977-a959d2313009', 'multiverseId': 597825}, 'multiverseid': 597825}, {'name': '海岛', 'type': '基本地 ～海岛', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597870&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f0cdc362-8a31-4a60-9ee3-badc8ed3821b', 'multiverseId': 597870}, 'multiverseid': 597870}]", '[{\'name\': \'Inspektorin aus Thraben\', \'text\': \'Wenn die Inspektorin aus Thraben ins Spiel kommt, stelle Nachforschungen an. (Erzeuge einen Hinweis-Spielstein. Er ist ein Artefakt mit „{2}, opfere dieses Artefakt: Ziehe eine Karte.")\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Soldat\', \'flavor\': \'„Wenn du das so lange machst wie ich, kann dich nichts mehr überraschen. Das bleibt zumindest zu hoffen."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591661&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b655d7b1-800b-48e7-8b80-507fac9b1180\', \'multiverseId\': 591661}, \'multiverseid\': 591661}, {\'name\': \'Inspectora de Thraben\', \'text\': \'Cuando la Inspectora de Thraben entre al campo de batalla, investiga. (Crea una ficha de Pista. Es un artefacto con "{2}, sacrificar este artefacto: Roba una carta".)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Si llevas en esto tanto tiempo como yo, nada puede sorprenderte. O al menos, eso esperas".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591790&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3b706730-4cad-4e2f-ac20-c4badf00e90d\', \'multiverseId\': 591790}, \'multiverseid\': 591790}, {\'name\': \'Inspectrice de Thraben\', \'text\': "Quand l\'Inspectrice de Thraben arrive sur le champ de bataille, enquêtez. (Créez un jeton Indice. C\'est un artefact avec « {2}, sacrifiez cet artefact : Piochez une carte. »)", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et soldat\', \'flavor\': "« Quand on fait ce que je fais depuis aussi longtemps, plus rien ne peut nous surprendre. C\'est ce qu\'on espère en tout cas. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591919&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eb9586f9-6ad5-4581-8df5-bbb9105ebc1a\', \'multiverseId\': 591919}, \'multiverseid\': 591919}, {\'name\': \'Ispettrice di Thraben\', \'text\': \'Quando l\\\'Ispettrice di Thraben entra nel campo di battaglia, indaga. (Crea una pedina Indizio. È un artefatto con "{2}, Sacrifica questo artefatto: Pesca una carta".)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Soldato Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Dopo tanti anni di servizio, niente può sorprenderti. O almeno si spera."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592048&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3ced1300-f81e-4340-882c-6c6515ff212e\', \'multiverseId\': 592048}, \'multiverseid\': 592048}, {\'name\': \'スレイベンの検査官\', \'text\': \'スレイベンの検査官が戦場に出たとき、調査を行う。（手掛かり・トークン１つを生成する。それは、「{2},このアーティファクトを生け贄に捧げる：カード１枚を引く。」を持つアーティファクトである。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・兵士\', \'flavor\': \'「あなたが私と同じくらいこれをしているのなら、いまさら驚くようなことはないでしょう。少なくとも、そう願いたいわね。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592177&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'41ca32af-2f72-4776-a9ca-a0df42ad7fd0\', \'multiverseId\': 592177}, \'multiverseid\': 592177}, {\'name\': \'瑟班巡检官\', \'text\': \'当瑟班巡检官进战场时，探查。（派出一个线索衍生物。它是具有「{2}，牺牲此神器：抓一张牌」的神器。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'「如果你也和我一样在这行干了这么多年，那应该没东西能吓到你了。至少这也算是希望吧。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592564&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7d83fce4-65bb-49b7-9565-b5fee8084ce5\', \'multiverseId\': 592564}, \'multiverseid\': 592564}]', '[{\'name\': \'Inspirierende Klerikerin\', \'text\': \'Wenn die Inspirierende Klerikerin ins Spiel kommt, erhältst du 4 Lebenspunkte dazu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vampir, Kleriker\', \'flavor\': \'„Die Immerwährende Sonne wird die beharrlichen Schatten des Unlebens vertreiben und uns wahrhaft ewiges Leben bringen."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591605&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3cc11782-a0b7-4354-b503-0d5f43992045\', \'multiverseId\': 591605}, \'multiverseid\': 591605}, {\'name\': \'Clériga inspiradora\', \'text\': \'Cuando la Clériga inspiradora entre al campo de batalla, ganas 4 vidas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Clérigo vampiro\', \'flavor\': \'"El Sol Inmortal nos traerá la auténtica vida eterna, que pondrá fin a la sombra perpetua de la muerte viviente".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591734&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ca9f224c-70a7-4180-8e0b-8f0befaed443\', \'multiverseId\': 591734}, \'multiverseid\': 591734}, {\'name\': \'Clerc inspiratrice\', \'text\': \'Quand la Clerc inspiratrice arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous gagnez 4 points de vie.\', \'type\': \'Créature : vampire et clerc\', \'flavor\': "« Le Soleil immortel nous apportera la véritable vie éternelle, loin de l\'ombre permanente qui nous maintient entre la vie et la mort. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591863&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2d8433e8-ae51-479b-9e14-39f0fd553aef\', \'multiverseId\': 591863}, \'multiverseid\': 591863}, {\'name\': \'Chierica Ispiratrice\', \'text\': \'Quando la Chierica Ispiratrice entra nel campo di battaglia, guadagni 4 punti vita.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Chierico Vampiro\', \'flavor\': \'"Il Sole Immortale ci donerà la vera vita eterna, che sostituirà le tenebre perenni della non morte."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591992&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'45d57d85-4769-4ac6-af26-74e15782b1cb\', \'multiverseId\': 591992}, \'multiverseid\': 591992}, {\'name\': \'駆り立てる僧侶\', \'text\': \'駆り立てる僧侶が戦場に出たとき、あなたは４点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 吸血鬼・クレリック\', \'flavor\': \'「不滅の太陽があれば、真の意味での永遠の命が得られるでしょう。終わりのない不死の影など必要なくなるのです。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592121&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'41747315-3c5c-485a-9738-a3acabf7dcff\', \'multiverseId\': 592121}, \'multiverseid\': 592121}, {\'name\': \'励志僧侣\', \'text\': \'当励志僧侣进战场时，你获得4点生命。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～吸血鬼／僧侣\', \'flavor\': \'「永生圣阳能为吾人带来真正不老之身，不再笼罩在死气沉沉的黑影当中。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592508&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8ae85fe1-29d9-49a3-a642-3614f3450841\', \'multiverseId\': 592508}, \'multiverseid\': 592508}]', '[{\'name\': \'Inspirierender Aufseher\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nWenn der Inspirierende Aufseher ins Spiel kommt, erhältst du 1 Lebenspunkt dazu und ziehst eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Engel, Kleriker\', \'flavor\': \'„Diese Stadt könnte gewiss ein bisschen mehr göttliches Eingreifen gebrauchen."\\n—Inspektor Jillard\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591606&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'71eb24fa-79f2-4224-a3b7-f4afdffa38cb\', \'multiverseId\': 591606}, \'multiverseid\': 591606}, {\'name\': \'Supervisor motivante\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nCuando el Supervisor motivante entre al campo de batalla, ganas 1 vida y robas una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Clérigo ángel\', \'flavor\': \'"A esta ciudad le vendría bien un poco más de intervención divina".\\n—Inspectora Jillard\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591735&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f38fa41f-b687-4886-89b3-d25dc0eae7f4\', \'multiverseId\': 591735}, \'multiverseid\': 591735}, {\'name\': \'Brigadier inspirateur\', \'text\': \'Vol\\nQuand le Brigadier inspirateur arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous gagnez 1 point de vie et vous piochez une carte.\', \'type\': \'Créature : ange et clerc\', \'flavor\': "« Un peu plus d\'interventions divines ne feraient pas de mal à cette ville. »\\n—Inspecteur Jillard", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591864&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1d2296e4-d4c8-4512-857d-1aaeadee2235\', \'multiverseId\': 591864}, \'multiverseid\': 591864}, {\'name\': \'Sorvegliante Ispiratore\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nQuando il Sorvegliante Ispiratore entra nel campo di battaglia, guadagni 1 punto vita e peschi una carta.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Chierico Angelo\', \'flavor\': \'"A questa città farebbe di certo molto comodo un po\\\' più di intervento divino."\\n—Ispettrice Jillard\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591993&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bc42d69b-fdb0-4dff-97af-066652fd9150\', \'multiverseId\': 591993}, \'multiverseid\': 591993}, {\'name\': \'鼓舞する監視者\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n鼓舞する監視者が戦場に出たとき、あなたは１点のライフを得、カード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 天使・クレリック\', \'flavor\': \'「確かに、この都市にはもうほんの少しだけ神による介入が必要かもしれない。」\\n――ジラード検察官\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592122&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e7500cb5-7c8c-4863-92db-7b69b0b3fc55\', \'multiverseId\': 592122}, \'multiverseid\': 592122}, {\'name\': \'励志监管使\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n当励志监管使进战场时，你获得1点生命且抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～天使／僧侣\', \'flavor\': \'「这座城市确实需要更多神力相助。」\\n～巡检员吉勒德\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592509&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'056208f3-6231-47e4-98a8-ef37c9626b30\', \'multiverseId\': 592509}, \'multiverseid\': 592509}]', "[{'name': 'Instrumente des Krieges', 'text': 'Aufblitzen\\nSowie die Instrumente des Krieges ins Spiel kommen, bestimme einen Kreaturentyp.\\nKreaturen des bestimmten Typs, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +1/+1.', 'type': 'Artefakt', 'flavor': 'Perfekt, um bei einer Schlacht oder einem Ball im Takt zu bleiben.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589655&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd12b4738-80c8-4e53-96dc-94443ee2c94c', 'multiverseId': 589655}, 'multiverseid': 589655}, {'name': 'Instrumentos de guerra', 'text': 'Destello.\\nEn cuanto los Instrumentos de guerra entren al campo de batalla, elige un tipo de criatura.\\nLas criaturas que controlas del tipo elegido obtienen +1/+1.', 'type': 'Artefacto', 'flavor': 'Son perfectos para marcar el ritmo tanto en una batalla como en un baile.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589706&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '089c49e8-6648-4377-869e-494d15e14fdb', 'multiverseId': 589706}, 'multiverseid': 589706}, {'name': 'Instruments de guerre', 'text': 'Flash\\nAu moment où les Instruments de guerre arrivent sur le champ de bataille, choisissez un type de créature.\\nLes créatures du type choisi que vous contrôlez gagnent +1/+1.', 'type': 'Artefact', 'flavor': 'Rien de mieux pour battre la mesure au combat ou au bal.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589757&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '46705f0a-b044-4920-93a4-dce4e50300bc', 'multiverseId': 589757}, 'multiverseid': 589757}, {'name': 'Strumenti da Guerra', 'text': 'Lampo\\nMentre gli Strumenti da Guerra entrano nel campo di battaglia, scegli un tipo di creatura.\\nLe creature che controlli del tipo scelto prendono +1/+1.', 'type': 'Artefatto', 'flavor': 'Perfetti per tenere il tempo in battaglia o in un ballo.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589808&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '476120ee-9af8-43a5-9e5d-6a30bedcdd51', 'multiverseId': 589808}, 'multiverseid': 589808}, {'name': '戦楽器', 'text': '瞬速\\n戦楽器が戦場に出るに際し、クリーチャー・タイプ１つを選ぶ。\\nあなたがコントロールしていてその選ばれたタイプであるすべてのクリーチャーは＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。', 'type': 'アーティファクト', 'flavor': '戦争でも舞踏会でも、調子を保つのに便利。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589859&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '40faa509-b9b2-43ec-ba73-d730cda1757b', 'multiverseId': 589859}, 'multiverseid': 589859}, {'name': '战事用具', 'text': '闪现\\n于战事用具进战场时，选择一种生物类别。\\n由你操控的该类别生物得+1/+1。', 'type': '神器', 'flavor': '无论战场还是舞池，都是计时好道具。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590012&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5f42069f-5a4c-45aa-81c4-ae752581e787', 'multiverseId': 590012}, 'multiverseid': 590012}]", '[{\'name\': \'Isamaru, Kondas Jagdhund\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Hund\', \'flavor\': \'Der Hund schnüffelte in der Luft herum und knurrte leise. General Takeno betrachtete den treuen Isamaru und beruhigte ihn mit einer leichten Berührung.\\n„Alarmiert die Truppen. Die Kami kommen."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591607&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7e28067f-1bbd-4228-83b7-1971c4afbc81\', \'multiverseId\': 591607}, \'multiverseid\': 591607}, {\'name\': \'Isamaru, mastín de Konda\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Perro\', \'flavor\': \'El mastín olisqueó el aire y lanzó un gruñido. El General Takeno miró al fiel Isamaru y lo calmó con palmadas. "Alerta a los hombres. Vienen los kami".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591736&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a28bc244-d96f-4953-9b07-5324d4fd4ec8\', \'multiverseId\': 591736}, \'multiverseid\': 591736}, {\'name\': \'Isamaru, chien de Konda\', \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : chien\', \'flavor\': "Le chien renifla l\'air et se mit à gronder. Le général Takeno baissa les yeux sur le fidèle Isamaru et le calma d\'une caresse. « Alertez les hommes. Les kami arrivent. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591865&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9e4a88c0-e5e0-4f65-bc36-b27e7c8af944\', \'multiverseId\': 591865}, \'multiverseid\': 591865}, {\'name\': \'Isamaru, Segugio di Konda\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Canide\', \'flavor\': \'Il segugio annusò l\\\'aria ed emise un sordo ringhio. Il Generale Takeno posò lo sguardo sul fedele Isamaru e lo calmò con una carezza. "Avvertite gli uomini. I kami stanno arrivando."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591994&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a89e1dc0-3441-497b-8d32-724da82df21e\', \'multiverseId\': 591994}, \'multiverseid\': 591994}, {\'name\': \'今田家の猟犬、勇丸\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 犬\', \'flavor\': \'その猟犬は空気に鼻をひくつかせ、低いうなり声をあげた。武野御大将は忠実な勇丸を見下ろし、なでて落ち着かせた。「兵を準備せよ。神が来るぞ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592123&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4aa56124-9407-425e-a003-6f9edcf0cedb\', \'multiverseId\': 592123}, \'multiverseid\': 592123}, {\'name\': \'今田猎犬勇丸\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～狗\', \'flavor\': \'勇丸闻闻气味，喉间发出低吼。武野将军低头瞧着勇丸，轻抚其身以令其冷静。「叫部队留意。神明来了。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592510&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'83e54554-61d5-47f1-a8ef-c159e16a1c3a\', \'multiverseId\': 592510}, \'multiverseid\': 592510}]', '[{\'name\': \'Isu der Abscheuliche\', \'text\': \'Du kannst dir zu jedem Zeitpunkt die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek anschauen.\\nDu kannst oben von deiner Bibliothek verschneite Länder spielen und verschneite Zaubersprüche wirken.\\nImmer wenn eine andere verschneite bleibende Karte unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, kannst du {G}, {W} oder {U} bezahlen. Falls du dies tust, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf Isu den Abscheulichen.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre verschneite Kreatur — Yeti\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589617&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c7c6f52a-75b0-4eac-b4e4-7b96a70037b1\', \'multiverseId\': 589617}, \'multiverseid\': 589617}, {\'name\': \'Isu, el Abominable\', \'text\': \'Puedes mirar la primera carta de tu biblioteca en cualquier momento.\\nPuedes jugar tierras nevadas y lanzar hechizos nevados desde la parte superior de tu biblioteca.\\nSiempre que otro permanente nevado entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, puedes pagar {G}, {W} o {U}. Si lo haces, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre Isu, el Abominable.\', \'type\': \'Criatura nevada legendaria — Yeti\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589668&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9a7f34a2-b9d8-4e2a-9b4a-0beb13560233\', \'multiverseId\': 589668}, \'multiverseid\': 589668}, {\'name\': "Isu l\'abominable", \'text\': "Vous pouvez regarder la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque à tout moment.\\nVous pouvez jouer les terrains neigeux et lancer les sorts neigeux depuis le dessus de votre bibliothèque.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'un autre permanent neigeux arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, vous pouvez payer {G}, {W} ou {U}. Si vous faites ainsi, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur Isu l\'abominable.", \'type\': \'Créature neigeuse légendaire : yeti\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589719&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9644b0c5-eb21-43a2-bdd9-8dad4f88e5f1\', \'multiverseId\': 589719}, \'multiverseid\': 589719}, {\'name\': "Isu l\'Abominevole", \'text\': "Puoi guardare la prima carta del tuo grimorio in qualsiasi momento.\\nPuoi giocare terre neve e lanciare magie neve dalla cima del tuo grimorio.\\nOgniqualvolta un altro permanente neve entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, puoi pagare {G}, {W} o {U}. Se lo fai, metti un segnalino +1/+1 su Isu l\'Abominevole.", \'type\': \'Creatura Neve Leggendaria — Yeti\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589770&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'74b93539-28e5-410a-a90e-0b7cdf3ef764\', \'multiverseId\': 589770}, \'multiverseid\': 589770}, {\'name\': \'忌まわしきもの、アイスー\', \'text\': \'あなたはいつでもあなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード１枚を見てもよい。\\nあなたはあなたのライブラリーの一番上から氷雪・土地をプレイしたり氷雪・呪文を唱えたりしてもよい。\\nこれでない氷雪・パーマネント１つがあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、あなたは{G}か{W}か{U}を支払ってもよい。そうしたなら、忌まわしきもの、アイスーの上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。\', \'type\': \'伝説の氷雪クリーチャー — イエティ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589821&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8acc26e8-cdd7-43dc-a94c-ed9f6de3ee18\', \'multiverseId\': 589821}, \'multiverseid\': 589821}, {\'name\': \'雪宝伊须\', \'text\': \'你可以随时检视你的牌库顶牌。\\n你可以从你的牌库顶使用雪境地和施放雪境咒语。\\n每当另一个雪境永久物在你的操控下进战场时，你可以支付{G}，{W}或{U}。若你如此作，则在雪宝伊须上放置一个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'传奇雪境生物 ～雪怪\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589974&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'974407af-3c3d-482a-8c98-fa5d4cb3e70a\', \'multiverseId\': 589974}, \'multiverseid\': 589974}]', "[{'name': 'Jace, arkaner Stratege', 'text': 'Immer wenn du deine zweite Karte innerhalb desselben Zuges ziehst, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst.\\n+1: Ziehe eine Karte.\\n−7: Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, können in diesem Zug nicht geblockt werden.', 'type': 'Legendärer Planeswalker — Jace', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595236&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0c9ace40-a927-4ac0-b8d5-8e15a94c9fba', 'multiverseId': 595236}, 'multiverseid': 595236}, {'name': 'Jace, estratega arcano', 'text': 'Siempre que robes tu segunda carta cada turno, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre la criatura objetivo que controlas.\\n+1: Roba una carta.\\n−7: Las criaturas que controlas no pueden ser bloqueadas este turno.', 'type': 'Planeswalker legendario — Jace', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595344&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8effaf91-7932-46c7-85cf-91422be964a5', 'multiverseId': 595344}, 'multiverseid': 595344}, {'name': 'Jace, stratège ésotérique', 'text': 'À chaque fois que vous piochez votre deuxième carte à chaque tour, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez.\\n+1: Piochez une carte.\\n-7 : Les créatures que vous contrôlez ne peuvent pas être bloquées ce tour-ci.', 'type': 'Planeswalker légendaire : Jace', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595452&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ea38a2d2-59b5-4520-8f76-faa022ede018', 'multiverseId': 595452}, 'multiverseid': 595452}, {'name': 'Jace, Stratega Arcano', 'text': 'Ogniqualvolta peschi la tua seconda carta in ogni turno, metti un segnalino +1/+1 su una creatura bersaglio che controlli.\\n+1: Pesca una carta.\\n−7: Le creature che controlli non possono essere bloccate in questo turno.', 'type': 'Planeswalker Leggendario — Jace', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595560&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0613dbea-2ba3-4eb8-9cad-ff3beb201301', 'multiverseId': 595560}, 'multiverseid': 595560}, {'name': '秘儀の策士、ジェイス', 'text': 'あなたが各ターン内のあなたの２枚目のカードを引くたび、あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。それの上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。\\n+1：カード１枚を引く。\\n-7：このターン、あなたがコントロールしている各クリーチャーはそれぞれブロックされない。', 'type': '伝説のプレインズウォーカー — ジェイス', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595668&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd2fea2fc-6f08-4e5b-bef5-6ade5a85a5da', 'multiverseId': 595668}, 'multiverseid': 595668}, {'name': '奥术策士杰斯', 'text': '每当你抓每回合中你的第二张牌时，在目标由你操控的生物上放置一个+1/+1指示物。\\n+1：抓一张牌。\\n−7：由你操控的生物本回合不能被阻挡。', 'type': '传奇鹏洛客 ～杰斯', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595992&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '257b6428-04e9-4a6f-8054-c123a9bf15cc', 'multiverseId': 595992}, 'multiverseid': 595992}]", '[{\'name\': \'Jaces prüfender Blick\', \'text\': \'Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält -4/-0 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\\nStelle Nachforschungen an. (Erzeuge einen Hinweis-Spielstein. Er ist ein Artefakt mit „{2}, opfere dieses Artefakt: Ziehe eine Karte.")\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Nur eine Collage aus Bildern: Kryptolithen, die See, ein Haufen Schiffswracks."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595237&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0e44a305-41b1-40c3-abdf-2eea7cde1e62\', \'multiverseId\': 595237}, \'multiverseid\': 595237}, {\'name\': \'Escrutinio de Jace\', \'text\': \'La criatura objetivo obtiene -4/-0 hasta el final del turno.\\nInvestiga. (Crea una ficha de Pista. Es un artefacto con "{2}, sacrificar este artefacto: Roba una carta".)\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Tan solo un collage de imágenes: criptolitos, el mar y una maraña de barcos hundidos".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595345&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9a044e3b-67a3-423f-9d4d-030fb439615a\', \'multiverseId\': 595345}, \'multiverseid\': 595345}, {\'name\': \'Examen de Jace\', \'text\': "Une créature ciblée gagne -4/-0 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.\\nEnquêtez. (Créez un jeton Indice. C\'est un artefact avec « {2}, sacrifiez cet artefact : Piochez une carte. »)", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Un assemblage d\'images : des cryptolithes, la mer, des épaves. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595453&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'37e8f6a7-25bc-43ee-9d1d-faaa9b672c11\', \'multiverseId\': 595453}, \'multiverseid\': 595453}, {\'name\': \'Esame di Jace\', \'text\': \'Una creatura bersaglio prende -4/-0 fino alla fine del turno.\\nIndaga. (Crea una pedina Indizio. È un artefatto con "{2}, Sacrifica questo artefatto: Pesca una carta".)\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Solo un susseguirsi di immagini: criptoliti, il mare, un groviglio di relitti."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595561&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d40728d6-deec-4844-b73f-80416e2bc064\', \'multiverseId\': 595561}, \'multiverseid\': 595561}, {\'name\': \'ジェイスの精査\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは－４/－０の修整を受ける。\\n調査を行う。（手掛かり・トークン１つを生成する。それは、「{2},このアーティファクトを生け贄に捧げる：カード１枚を引く。」を持つアーティファクトである。）\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「雑多な映像の羅列だ。謎の石、海、難破した船の残骸。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595669&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e0698a65-6ec5-45a1-905e-065b8ea0396a\', \'multiverseId\': 595669}, \'multiverseid\': 595669}, {\'name\': \'杰斯的洞察\', \'text\': \'目标生物得-4/-0直到回合结束。\\n探查。（派出一个线索衍生物。它是具有「{2}，牺牲此神器：抓一张牌」的神器。）\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「不过是一系列的杂乱景象：秘石，大海，沉船杂物。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595993&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b9f08c05-2e95-4dfd-ba3c-d88567016663\', \'multiverseId\': 595993}, \'multiverseid\': 595993}]', "[{'name': 'Jagd bei Mondschein', 'text': 'Bestimme eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du nicht kontrollierst. Jede Kreatur, die du kontrollierst und die ein Wolf oder Werwolf ist, fügt dieser Kreatur Schadenspunkte in Höhe ihrer Stärke zu.', 'type': 'Spontanzauber', 'flavor': 'Durch Tapferkeit alleine wirst du nicht überleben.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592891&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'daeb9082-ec34-4075-80b2-eee7c793607a', 'multiverseId': 592891}, 'multiverseid': 592891}, {'name': 'Caza nocturna', 'text': 'Elige una criatura objetivo que no controlas. Cada criatura que controlas que es un Lobo o un Licántropo hace una cantidad de daño igual a su fuerza a esa criatura.', 'type': 'Instantáneo', 'flavor': 'No seguirás con vida únicamente con valor.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593012&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e57e5439-034d-4a87-b0f8-ef5333c4b46a', 'multiverseId': 593012}, 'multiverseid': 593012}, {'name': 'Chasse au clair de lune', 'text': 'Choisissez une créature ciblée que vous ne contrôlez pas. Chaque créature que vous contrôlez qui est un loup ou un loup-garou inflige un nombre de blessures égal à sa force à cette créature.', 'type': 'Éphémère', 'flavor': 'Le courage seul ne vous aidera pas à rester en vie.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593133&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7df27c1a-dd6e-402f-95bc-033804cf26a4', 'multiverseId': 593133}, 'multiverseid': 593133}, {'name': 'Caccia al Chiaro di Luna', 'text': 'Scegli una creatura bersaglio che non controlli. Ogni creatura Lupo o Mannaro che controlli infligge danno pari alla sua forza a quella creatura.', 'type': 'Istantaneo', 'flavor': 'Il coraggio non basterà a tenerti in vita.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593254&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2bf67890-f025-40ef-9d57-74719a0cf8f9', 'multiverseId': 593254}, 'multiverseid': 593254}, {'name': '月夜の狩り', 'text': 'あなたがコントロールしていないクリーチャー１体を対象とする。あなたがコントロールしていて狼や狼男である各クリーチャーはそれぞれ、自身のパワーに等しい点数のダメージをそのクリーチャーに与える。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': '度胸だけでは生き残れない。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593375&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0f404f34-3342-4e2a-8b74-16289dfcd67c', 'multiverseId': 593375}, 'multiverseid': 593375}, {'name': '月光猎杀', 'text': '选择目标不由你操控的生物。每个由你操控且为狼或狼人的生物各依本身力量对该生物造成伤害。', 'type': '瞬间', 'flavor': '单凭勇气无法保命。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593738&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '34209f80-90df-4dbe-9730-a1d2d452235f', 'multiverseId': 593738}, 'multiverseid': 593738}]", '[{\'name\': \'Jagd machen\', \'text\': \'Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst, kämpft gegen eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du nicht kontrollierst. (Jede fügt der anderen Schadenspunkte in Höhe ihrer Stärke zu.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Werwolfjäger werden selten alt."\\n—Paulin, Fallensteller im Dämmerwald\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592909&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'88d9ab05-93bf-4882-93a3-db2a1ae321e6\', \'multiverseId\': 592909}, \'multiverseid\': 592909}, {\'name\': \'Cazar la presa\', \'text\': \'La criatura objetivo que controlas lucha contra la criatura objetivo que no controlas. (Cada una hace un daño igual a su fuerza a la otra.)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"No encontrarás muchos viejos cazadores de licántropos".\\n—Paulin, trampero de Somberwald\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593030&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3cbef5a2-47cb-46fa-a59b-e74619bb0778\', \'multiverseId\': 593030}, \'multiverseid\': 593030}, {\'name\': \'Chasseur chassé\', \'text\': "Une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez se bat contre une créature ciblée que vous ne contrôlez pas. (Chacune inflige un nombre de blessures égal à sa force à l\'autre.)", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'« Les vieux chasseurs de loups-garous se font rares. »\\n—Paulin, trappeur de Somberwald\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593151&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e9d3cf5b-027f-4ada-b26a-4531cbd074e8\', \'multiverseId\': 593151}, \'multiverseid\': 593151}, {\'name\': \'Predare\', \'text\': "Una creatura bersaglio che controlli lotta con una creatura bersaglio che non controlli. (Ogni creatura infligge all\'altra danno pari alla propria forza.)", \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Non vedi invecchiare molti cacciatori di lupi mannari."\\n—Paulin, trappolatore di Somberwald\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593272&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'08165e93-d019-42ad-9022-f7b40495b6f5\', \'multiverseId\': 593272}, \'multiverseid\': 593272}, {\'name\': \'捕食\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体とあなたがコントロールしていないクリーチャー１体を対象とする。その前者はその後者と格闘を行う。（それぞれはもう一方に自身のパワーに等しい点数のダメージを与える。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「年取った人狼狩りはほとんどいないよ。」\\n――ソンバーワルドの罠師、パーリン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593393&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c1c9f3d7-5b41-4023-8104-df949e13c269\', \'multiverseId\': 593393}, \'multiverseid\': 593393}, {\'name\': \'捕食\', \'text\': \'目标由你操控的生物与目标不由你操控的生物互斗。（它们各向对方造成等同于本身力量的伤害。）\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「你不会见到太多年老的狼人猎手。」\\n～松柏森布陷人堡霖\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593756&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'982244ad-6523-4aeb-bb6a-5b0c5f7ea0dc\', \'multiverseId\': 593756}, \'multiverseid\': 593756}]', '[{\'name\': \'Jagdführer von Lys Alana\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du einen Elf-Zauberspruch wirkst, kannst du einen 1/1 grünen Elf-Krieger-Kreaturenspielstein erzeugen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elf, Krieger\', \'flavor\': \'Von den obersten Stockwerken des Morgenlichtpalastes bis in die tiefsten Schatten des Zaunkönigreviers: Die silbrigen Klänge des Horns schimmern in der Luft, und wer es hören kann, fühlt sich davon angezogen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592885&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6f9b5507-88a6-42e0-a54c-eb2878988f41\', \'multiverseId\': 592885}, \'multiverseid\': 592885}, {\'name\': \'Maestro de caza de Lys Alana\', \'text\': \'Siempre que lances un hechizo de Elfo, puedes crear una ficha de criatura Guerrero Elfo verde 1/1.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero elfo\', \'flavor\': \'Desde las filas más altas del Palacio Luz del Amanecer hasta la sombra más profunda de Coto de Reyezuelos, las notas plateadas del cuerno brillan en el aire, y todos aquellos que las escuchan sienten su atracción.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593006&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'95cd6bf8-c181-4ac4-8ca6-2a6a99d6b4f0\', \'multiverseId\': 593006}, \'multiverseid\': 593006}, {\'name\': \'Maître-chasseur de Lys Alana\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que vous lancez un sort d\'elfe, vous pouvez créer un jeton de créature 1/1 verte Elfe et Guerrier.", \'type\': \'Créature : elfe et guerrier\', \'flavor\': "Des hauteurs du Palais de Lumière d\'aurore aux ombres les plus noires de la Garenne du Roitelet, le doux son argenté de la corne résonne dans les airs, et chacun ressent son appel.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593127&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c514ef96-8d66-423c-90ba-82f930f19490\', \'multiverseId\': 593127}, \'multiverseid\': 593127}, {\'name\': \'Capocaccia di Lys Alana\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta lanci una magia Elfo, puoi creare una pedina creatura Guerriero Elfo 1/1 verde.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Elfo\', \'flavor\': "Dai più alti ordini del Palazzo Luce dell\'Aurora alle ombre più profonde di Volo dello Scricciolo, le note argentee del suo corno luccicano nell\'aria e chi le ode se ne sente attirato.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593248&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7cf2a88b-046b-4697-876d-d51fcf68147f\', \'multiverseId\': 593248}, \'multiverseid\': 593248}, {\'name\': \'リス・アラナの狩りの達人\', \'text\': \'あなたがエルフ・呪文を唱えるたび、あなたは緑の１/１のエルフ・戦士・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成してもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルフ・戦士\', \'flavor\': \'曙光の宮殿の最上位からレンの地の最も暗い影まで、角笛の銀の音色は響き渡り、それを耳にした誰もが引きつけられていく。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593369&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e1b392c0-040f-4d04-9bfc-bfce1f38a387\', \'multiverseId\': 593369}, \'multiverseid\': 593369}, {\'name\': \'黎撒拉那领猎人\', \'text\': \'每当你施放妖精咒语时，你可以派出一个1/1绿色妖精／战士衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～妖精／战士\', \'flavor\': \'从晓明殿最高的一层，直到蒙鸠地最暗的阴影，此号角的银色音符在空气中闪烁，让听闻者都为之牵动。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593732&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b6cfc134-536c-4316-9edc-01b565cf511e\', \'multiverseId\': 593732}, \'multiverseid\': 593732}]', '[{\'name\': \'Juggernaut\', \'text\': \'Der Juggernaut greift in jedem Kampf an, falls möglich.\\nDer Juggernaut kann von Mauern nicht geblockt werden.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Juggernaut\', \'flavor\': \'So manche belagerte Stadt hat kapituliert, sowie sie das unverkennbare Grollen des Juggernauten vernahm.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596284&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'be13a301-5968-4419-906d-4824647152ce\', \'multiverseId\': 596284}, \'multiverseid\': 596284}, {\'name\': \'Destructor\', \'text\': \'El Destructor ataca cada combate si puede.\\nEl Destructor no puede ser bloqueado por Muros.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Destructor\', \'flavor\': \'Gran cantidad de ciudades sitiadas se han rendido al oír el retumbar distintivo del destructor.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596371&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'626b74fd-b070-4387-95d1-9e00db51801d\', \'multiverseId\': 596371}, \'multiverseid\': 596371}, {\'name\': \'Djaggernaut\', \'text\': \'Le Djaggernaut attaque à chaque combat si possible.\\nLe Djaggernaut ne peut pas être bloqué par les murs.\', \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : djaggernaut\', \'flavor\': "Plus d\'une ville assiégée s\'est rendue aux premiers grincements, reconnaissables entre tous, du djaggernaut.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596458&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a19630de-0c60-4d42-b7b7-a31614c5e969\', \'multiverseId\': 596458}, \'multiverseid\': 596458}, {\'name\': \'Juggernaut\', \'text\': \'Il Juggernaut attacca in ogni combattimento, se può farlo.\\nIl Juggernaut non può essere bloccato dai Muri.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Juggernaut\', \'flavor\': \'Molte città sotto assedio si sono arrese dopo aver udito il rombo caratteristico del juggernaut.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596545&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4f4828cd-8f2d-4055-8ec9-8a94ab2d52c5\', \'multiverseId\': 596545}, \'multiverseid\': 596545}, {\'name\': \'巨大戦車\', \'text\': \'各戦闘で、巨大戦車は可能なら攻撃する。\\n巨大戦車は壁にはブロックされない。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 巨大戦車\', \'flavor\': \'包囲された都市が、巨大戦車の発する特有の轟音を聞くなり降伏を申し出た事例は数知れず。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596632&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'10217eba-1723-4882-9ab2-b0ac13e688cd\', \'multiverseId\': 596632}, \'multiverseid\': 596632}, {\'name\': \'攻城巨车\', \'text\': \'攻城巨车每次战斗若能攻击，则必须攻击。\\n攻城巨车不能被墙阻挡。\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～攻城巨车\', \'flavor\': \'许多被围攻的城市一听到攻城巨车那独特的轰鸣声便缴械投降。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596893&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1285c97d-0a2b-4930-aadf-f25f0661a45d\', \'multiverseId\': 596893}, \'multiverseid\': 596893}]', '[{\'name\': \'Junger Pyromagier\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du einen Spontanzauber oder eine Hexerei wirkst, erzeuge einen 1/1 roten Elementarwesen-Kreaturenspielstein.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Schamane\', \'flavor\': \'Verbrennungen sind die aufrichtigste Form der Schmeichelei.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590334&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9af51ada-0575-4bd6-9f62-55b775f62213\', \'multiverseId\': 590334}, \'multiverseid\': 590334}, {\'name\': \'Piromante joven\', \'text\': \'Siempre que lances un hechizo de instantáneo o de conjuro, crea una ficha de criatura Elemental roja 1/1.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Chamán humano\', \'flavor\': \'La inmolación es la forma más sincera de adulación.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590469&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e4cea576-57b6-4560-ae4d-26eeea5953b9\', \'multiverseId\': 590469}, \'multiverseid\': 590469}, {\'name\': \'Jeune pyromancien\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que vous lancez un sort d\'éphémère ou de rituel, créez un jeton de créature 1/1 rouge Élémental.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et shamane\', \'flavor\': "L\'immolation est la forme de flatterie la plus sincère.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590604&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c08a8dc2-602c-45fb-9dec-e45346ae8781\', \'multiverseId\': 590604}, \'multiverseid\': 590604}, {\'name\': \'Giovane Piromante\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta lanci una magia istantaneo o stregoneria, crea una pedina creatura Elementale 1/1 rossa.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Sciamano Umano\', \'flavor\': "L\'immolazione è la forma di adulazione più sincera.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590739&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f1a3ffcf-1663-4015-bacd-a899bc5a2bae\', \'multiverseId\': 590739}, \'multiverseid\': 590739}, {\'name\': \'若き紅蓮術士\', \'text\': \'あなたがインスタントやソーサリーである呪文を唱えるたび、赤の１/１のエレメンタル・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・シャーマン\', \'flavor\': \'焼身は最も誠実な追従である。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590874&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3da82eb8-1b3a-47af-90db-a5b73c4f35e2\', \'multiverseId\': 590874}, \'multiverseid\': 590874}, {\'name\': \'年轻烈焰术士\', \'text\': \'每当你施放瞬间或法术咒语时，派出一个1/1红色元素衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／祭师\', \'flavor\': \'献祭是最真诚的奉承形式。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591279&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f44c9adf-1876-4666-9581-bdd6cfdeca3c\', \'multiverseId\': 591279}, \'multiverseid\': 591279}]', '[{\'name\': \'Jungwolf\', \'text\': \'Unverwüstlich (Wenn diese Kreatur stirbt und falls keine +1/+1-Marke auf ihr lag, bringe sie mit einer +1/+1-Marke unter der Kontrolle ihres Besitzers ins Spiel zurück.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Wolf\', \'flavor\': \'Im Ulvenwald gibt es keine Ausnahmen für Nachwuchs. Entweder bist du bald ein Jäger oder bald ein Gejagter.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592945&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'282c31ff-51ab-48d8-8e32-c17d0321b246\', \'multiverseId\': 592945}, \'multiverseid\': 592945}, {\'name\': \'Lobo joven\', \'text\': \'Resiliencia. (Cuando esta criatura muera, si no tenía contadores +1/+1 sobre ella, regrésala al campo de batalla bajo el control de su propietario con un contador +1/+1.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Lobo\', \'flavor\': \'En Ulvenwald no hay concesiones a los jóvenes. Los cachorros de hoy son los cazadores o el almuerzo de mañana.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593066&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6df9735c-ce3a-4d37-91ba-97ccccdb6398\', \'multiverseId\': 593066}, \'multiverseid\': 593066}, {\'name\': \'Louveteau\', \'text\': "Survivance (Quand cette créature meurt, si elle n\'avait pas de marqueurs +1/+1 sur elle, renvoyez-la sur le champ de bataille sous le contrôle de son propriétaire avec un marqueur +1/+1 sur elle.)", \'type\': \'Créature : loup\', \'flavor\': "L\'Ulvenwald ne fait aucun cas de la jeunesse. Le nouveau-né d\'aujourd\'hui sera le chasseur ou le dîner de demain.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593187&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'03da70c1-c95a-4d7d-b408-e8f375befb6d\', \'multiverseId\': 593187}, \'multiverseid\': 593187}, {\'name\': \'Giovane Lupo\', \'text\': \'Immortale (Quando questa creatura muore, se non aveva segnalini +1/+1, rimettila sul campo di battaglia sotto il controllo del suo proprietario con un segnalino +1/+1.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Lupo\', \'flavor\': "L\'Ulvenwald non si dimostra indulgente con i giovani. Un neonato di oggi è un cacciatore di domani o il pasto di domani.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593308&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a2f27ffb-3deb-4d90-b21f-5495dade3967\', \'multiverseId\': 593308}, \'multiverseid\': 593308}, {\'name\': \'若き狼\', \'text\': \'不死（このクリーチャーが死亡したとき、これの上に＋１/＋１カウンターが置かれていなかった場合、これを＋１/＋１カウンター１個が置かれた状態でオーナーのコントロール下で戦場に戻す。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 狼\', \'flavor\': \'ウルヴェンワルドは若者に容赦しない。今日では、新たに生まれたものは、次の日には狩人か昼飯かのどちらかになる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593429&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'28ffb311-540d-4981-b1aa-02945649272c\', \'multiverseId\': 593429}, \'multiverseid\': 593429}, {\'name\': \'幼狼\', \'text\': \'不息（当此生物死去时，若其上没有+1/+1指示物，则将它在其拥有者的操控下移回战场，且其上有一个+1/+1指示物。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～狼\', \'flavor\': \'沃文森没有幼小者容身之地。今日的新生儿若非明日的猎人，就是明日的午餐。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593792&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1fda1c88-7952-42c5-bc27-962d72308dda\', \'multiverseId\': 593792}, \'multiverseid\': 593792}]', '[{\'name\': \'Justiziar-Portal\', \'text\': \'Schicke eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst, ins Exil und bringe sie dann unter der Kontrolle ihres Besitzers ins Spiel zurück. Sie erhält Erstschlag bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Dank der Innovationen des neuen Gildenmeisters können die Ordnungshüter nun schon kurz vor dem Vergehen am Tatort erscheinen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591608&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0f90b5f0-49d0-492c-b483-c061a9a6eb17\', \'multiverseId\': 591608}, \'multiverseid\': 591608}, {\'name\': \'Portal de los justiciares\', \'text\': \'Exilia la criatura objetivo que controlas, luego regresa esa carta al campo de batalla bajo el control de su propietario. Gana la habilidad de dañar primero hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Con las innovaciones del nuevo maestro del gremio, los guardias pueden llegar al lugar antes incluso de que se cometa el crimen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591737&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'636a6fbd-5faf-41b5-a811-d5558dd9b889\', \'multiverseId\': 591737}, \'multiverseid\': 591737}, {\'name\': \'Portail du justicier\', \'text\': "Exilez une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez, puis renvoyez cette carte sur le champ de bataille sous le contrôle de son propriétaire. Elle acquiert l\'initiative jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "Grâce aux innovations du nouveau maître de guilde, les courtiers peuvent arriver sur les lieux d\'un crime quelques instants avant qu\'il ne soit commis.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591866&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'307d0b50-0519-4c91-a774-3c8d520af6cf\', \'multiverseId\': 591866}, \'multiverseid\': 591866}, {\'name\': \'Portale del Magistrato\', \'text\': \'Esilia una creatura bersaglio che controlli, poi rimetti quella carta sul campo di battaglia sotto il controllo del suo proprietario. Ha attacco improvviso fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'Grazie alle innovazioni del nuovo capo della gilda, gli agenti di polizia possono raggiungere la scena del crimine subito prima che sia commesso.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591995&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bc5d83d2-1f77-4b9e-ad9e-f7a54af931b5\', \'multiverseId\': 591995}, \'multiverseid\': 591995}, {\'name\': \'大司法官の扉\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。それを追放する。その後、そのカードをオーナーのコントロール下で戦場に戻す。ターン終了時まで、それは先制攻撃を得る。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'新しいギルドマスターの行った革新により、拘引者たちは犯罪が起きるより早く現場に行けるようになった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592124&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'033b055e-07fb-4bec-8dc3-d66256683dc2\', \'multiverseId\': 592124}, \'multiverseid\': 592124}, {\'name\': \'大司法通道\', \'text\': \'放逐目标由你操控的生物，然后将该牌在其拥有者的操控下移回战场。它获得先攻异能直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'自从有了新公会首领的发明之后，逮捕人现可在罪行刚要发生之时赶到现场。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592511&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a93f1602-ce8a-46e0-a4b2-3e8a8db11c01\', \'multiverseId\': 592511}, \'multiverseid\': 592511}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kaiserliche Bergungseinheit\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn die Kaiserliche Bergungseinheit angreift, bringe eine Kreaturen- oder Fahrzeug-Karte deiner Wahl mit Manabetrag 2 oder weniger aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurück.\\nBemannen 2 (Tappe eine beliebige Anzahl an Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst und die zusammen Stärke 2 oder mehr haben: Dieses Fahrzeug wird bis zum Ende des Zuges zu einer Artefaktkreatur.)\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Fahrzeug\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591603&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9f9e78f5-645c-466e-b3b3-2fecbd81d467\', \'multiverseId\': 591603}, \'multiverseid\': 591603}, {\'name\': \'Unidad de recuperación imperial\', \'text\': \'Siempre que la Unidad de recuperación imperial ataque, regresa la carta de criatura o Vehículo objetivo con valor de maná de 2 o menos de tu cementerio a tu mano.\\nTripular 2. (Girar cualquier cantidad de criaturas que controlas con una fuerza total de 2 o más: Este Vehículo se convierte en una criatura artefacto hasta el final del turno.)\', \'type\': \'Artefacto — Vehículo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591732&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e252e677-d1b7-4408-895d-e0afc865732a\', \'multiverseId\': 591732}, \'multiverseid\': 591732}, {\'name\': "Unité d\'assistance impériale", \'text\': "À chaque fois que l\'Unité d\'assistance impériale attaque, renvoyez dans votre main une carte de créature ou de véhicule ciblée avec une valeur de mana inférieure ou égale à 2 depuis votre cimetière.\\nPilotage 2 (Engagez n\'importe quel nombre de créatures que vous contrôlez dont la force totale est supérieure ou égale à 2 : Ce véhicule devient une créature-artefact jusqu\'à la fin du tour.)", \'type\': \'Artefact : véhicule\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591861&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9fa301da-7bd4-4d8a-bc66-54850f968296\', \'multiverseId\': 591861}, \'multiverseid\': 591861}, {\'name\': \'Unità di Recupero Imperiale\', \'text\': "Ogniqualvolta l\'Unità di Recupero Imperiale attacca, riprendi in mano dal tuo cimitero una carta creatura o Veicolo bersaglio con valore di mana pari o inferiore a 2.\\nManovrare 2 (TAPpa un qualsiasi numero di creature che controlli con forza totale pari o superiore a 2: Questo Veicolo diventa una creatura artefatto fino alla fine del turno.)", \'type\': \'Artefatto — Veicolo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591990&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'941e1d23-5efa-4b11-9917-f9b85b61608f\', \'multiverseId\': 591990}, \'multiverseid\': 591990}, {\'name\': \'皇国の修復機\', \'text\': \'皇国の修復機が攻撃するたび、あなたの墓地にありマナ総量が２以下でありクリーチャーや機体であるカード１枚を対象とする。それをあなたの手札に戻す。\\n搭乗２（あなたがコントロールしている望む数のクリーチャーを、パワーの合計が２以上になるように選んでタップする：ターン終了時まで、この機体はアーティファクト・クリーチャーになる。）\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 機体\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592119&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ab583d70-d6a8-4011-b503-a0b261f1a996\', \'multiverseId\': 592119}, \'multiverseid\': 592119}, {\'name\': \'皇室搜救机\', \'text\': \'每当皇室搜救机攻击时，将目标法术力值等于或小于2的生物或载具牌从你坟墓场移回你手上。\\n搭载2（横置任意数量由你操控且力量总和等于或大于2的生物：此载具成为神器生物直到回合结束。）\', \'type\': \'神器 ～载具\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592506&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c5aae98a-3d99-4b02-9033-6f39c4167d53\', \'multiverseId\': 592506}, \'multiverseid\': 592506}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kalastria-Nachtwache\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du Lebenspunkte dazuerhältst, erhält die Kalastria-Nachtwache Flugfähigkeit bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vampir, Krieger, Verbündeter\', \'flavor\': \'„Kalitas mag in die Knechtschaft der Eldrazi zurückgekehrt sein, aber wir sagen ‚Nie wieder!\\\'"\\n—Drana, Bluthäuptling der Kalastria\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594086&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'663aba8d-72ac-4cb9-b782-c914ae543327\', \'multiverseId\': 594086}, \'multiverseid\': 594086}, {\'name\': \'Guardia nocturna de Kalastria\', \'text\': \'Siempre que ganes vidas, la Guardia nocturna de Kalastria gana la habilidad de volar hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero vampiro aliado\', \'flavor\': \'"Puede que Kalitas haya regresado a su servidumbre insensata bajo el yugo de los Eldrazi, pero nosotros decimos: nunca jamás".\\n—Drana, jefe de sangre Kalastria\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594203&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'76c25ff3-8d0e-40ae-8aa1-3c7fc2c660d7\', \'multiverseId\': 594203}, \'multiverseid\': 594203}, {\'name\': \'Garde de nuit des Kalastria\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que vous gagnez des points de vie, la Garde de nuit des Kalastria acquiert le vol jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : vampire et guerrier et allié\', \'flavor\': \'« Kalitas est peut-être redevenu un esclave stupide au service des Eldrazi, mais nous ne voulons plus jamais ça. »\\n—Drana, chef de sang des Kalastria\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594320&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1e5a3bdb-74cd-4c26-8b03-00259ecb08c9\', \'multiverseId\': 594320}, \'multiverseid\': 594320}, {\'name\': \'Guardia Notturna di Kalastria\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta guadagni punti vita, la Guardia Notturna di Kalastria ha volare fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Alleato Guerriero Vampiro\', \'flavor\': \'"Kalitas sarà anche tornato all\\\'incosciente schiavitù sotto gli Eldrazi, ma noi diciamo: mai più."\\n—Drana, capo sanguinario Kalastria\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594437&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'081c00bc-ac15-472d-8aa8-724f0f9f053a\', \'multiverseId\': 594437}, \'multiverseid\': 594437}, {\'name\': \'カラストリアの夜警\', \'text\': \'あなたがライフを得るたび、ターン終了時まで、カラストリアの夜警は飛行を得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 吸血鬼・戦士・同盟者\', \'flavor\': \'「カリタスはエルドラージの操り人形に成り果てたが、そのようなことは二度とさせぬ。」\\n――カラストリアの血の長、ドラーナ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594554&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'23f60dbf-b254-4958-8b43-a8f2dd078ff4\', \'multiverseId\': 594554}, \'multiverseid\': 594554}, {\'name\': \'卡列奇夜巡卫\', \'text\': \'每当你获得生命时，卡列奇夜巡卫获得飞行异能直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～吸血鬼／战士／伙伴\', \'flavor\': \'「卡力塔或已成为奥札奇手下毫无思想的奴隶，但我们不会让这类事情再次发生。」\\n～卡列奇血侯哲娜\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594905&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c28c5585-4418-4741-9c38-3b09320ea619\', \'multiverseId\': 594905}, \'multiverseid\': 594905}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kami des uralten Gesetzes\', \'text\': \'Opfere den Kami des uralten Gesetzes: Zerstöre eine Verzauberung deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Geist\', \'flavor\': \'„Pflicht und Gesetz sind das Fundament, auf dem Zivilisation aufgebaut ist. Sie dürfen nicht nachgeben, denn wenn sie es tun, fällt alles mit ihnen."\\n—Fürst Konda\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591609&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'672a6a99-edc0-4c9a-b373-7c7cabbf7fe6\', \'multiverseId\': 591609}, \'multiverseid\': 591609}, {\'name\': \'Kami de la ley antigua\', \'text\': \'Sacrificar el Kami de la ley antigua: Destruye el encantamiento objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Espíritu\', \'flavor\': \'"La ley y el deber son la base de la civilización. No deben caer porque, si lo hacen, arrastrarán todo el resto".\\n—Señor Konda\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591738&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4cb193e1-f4bc-4fc8-a0f6-46e6f49fc9d7\', \'multiverseId\': 591738}, \'multiverseid\': 591738}, {\'name\': \'Kami de la loi ancienne\', \'text\': \'Sacrifiez le Kami de la loi ancienne : Détruisez un enchantement ciblé.\', \'type\': \'Créature : esprit\', \'flavor\': "« La loi et le devoir sont les fondations de toute civilisation. S\'ils tombent, tout s\'écroule avec eux. »\\n—Seigneur Konda", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591867&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7083ce0c-6122-4f21-94bf-2e01046a4129\', \'multiverseId\': 591867}, \'multiverseid\': 591867}, {\'name\': "Kami dell\'Antica Legge", \'text\': "Sacrifica il Kami dell\'Antica Legge: Distruggi un incantesimo bersaglio.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Spirito\', \'flavor\': \'"Il dovere e la legge sono le fondamenta su cui poggia la civiltà. Non possono venire meno, poiché se dovesse succedere trascinerebbero ogni cosa nell\\\'oblio."\\n—Lord Konda\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591996&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6bff12fc-2f26-48ac-a266-50bb66d95de8\', \'multiverseId\': 591996}, \'multiverseid\': 591996}, {\'name\': \'古の法の神\', \'text\': \'古の法の神を生け贄に捧げる：エンチャント１つを対象とする。それを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — スピリット\', \'flavor\': \'「義務と法は文明の基礎なり。それは崩さるべからざるものにして、崩さるればすべてを巻き込むものなり。」\\n――君主今田\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592125&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'230180e3-4b52-4157-b44f-40ba5184d543\', \'multiverseId\': 592125}, \'multiverseid\': 592125}, {\'name\': \'古律神\', \'text\': \'牺牲古律神：消灭目标结界。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～精怪\', \'flavor\': \'「责任与律法是文明的基础，必得保持下去。一旦倾颓，必定全盘崩坏。」\\n～今田城主\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592512&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3b796870-7c57-43fc-881f-cda2fa78924c\', \'multiverseId\': 592512}, \'multiverseid\': 592512}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kampf der Titanen\', \'text\': \'Dieser Zauberspruch kostet beim Wirken {1} weniger, falls er eine Kreatur als Ziel hat, die du kontrollierst und auf der eine +1/+1-Marke liegt.\\nEine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst, kämpft gegen eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du nicht kontrollierst. (Jede der Kreaturen fügt der anderen Schadenspunkte in Höhe ihrer Stärke zu.)\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Egal wer gewinnt: Die Nachbarschaft leidet.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592934&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f39423e4-28e3-481c-9353-7bf1d0bf609d\', \'multiverseId\': 592934}, \'multiverseid\': 592934}, {\'name\': \'Lucha titánica\', \'text\': \'Te cuesta {1} menos lanzar este hechizo si hace objetivo a una criatura que controlas con un contador +1/+1 sobre ella.\\nLa criatura objetivo que controlas lucha contra la criatura objetivo que no controlas. (Cada una hace un daño igual a su fuerza a la otra.)\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Gane quien gane, el vecindario pierde.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593055&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c3113695-adfa-4911-8b50-fdac8bdffa2a\', \'multiverseId\': 593055}, \'multiverseid\': 593055}, {\'name\': \'Combat titanesque\', \'text\': "Ce sort coûte {1} de moins à lancer s\'il cible une créature que vous contrôlez avec un marqueur +1/+1 sur elle.\\nUne créature ciblée que vous contrôlez se bat contre une créature ciblée que vous ne contrôlez pas. (Chacune inflige un nombre de blessures égal à sa force à l\'autre.)", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« Quel que soit le vainqueur, le voisinage perdra. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593176&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'59b19a39-0372-4916-9ecf-9aeee4644e59\', \'multiverseId\': 593176}, \'multiverseid\': 593176}, {\'name\': \'Rissa Titanica\', \'text\': "Questa magia costa {1} in meno per essere lanciata se bersaglia una creatura con un segnalino +1/+1 che controlli.\\nUna creatura bersaglio che controlli lotta con una creatura bersaglio che non controlli. (Ogni creatura infligge all\'altra danno pari alla propria forza.)", \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'Chiunque ne esca vincitore, sarà una sconfitta per il quartiere.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593297&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a7615bb6-b289-4143-b925-5096410adf65\', \'multiverseId\': 593297}, \'multiverseid\': 593297}, {\'name\': \'剛力の殴り合い\', \'text\': \'この呪文が、あなたがコントロールしていて＋１/＋１カウンターが置かれているクリーチャーを対象とするなら、これを唱えるためのコストは{1}少なくなる。\\nあなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体とあなたがコントロールしていないクリーチャー１体を対象とする。その前者はその後者と格闘を行う。（それぞれはもう一方に自身のパワーに等しい点数のダメージを与える。）\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'誰が勝利を得ても、失われるのはその周り。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593418&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'03f1903f-b1c4-42c6-aab6-ad50d5ee61ac\', \'multiverseId\': 593418}, \'multiverseid\': 593418}, {\'name\': \'巨身争斗\', \'text\': \'如果此咒语以由你操控且其上有+1/+1指示物的生物为目标，则它减少{1}来施放。\\n目标由你操控的生物与目标不由你操控的生物互斗。（它们各向对方造成等同于本身力量的伤害。）\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'无论谁赢，邻里遭殃。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593781&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1a393c0a-0986-4506-98b7-c6ce6e686fd5\', \'multiverseId\': 593781}, \'multiverseid\': 593781}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kapitänin Lannery Storm\', \'text\': \'Eile\\nImmer wenn Kapitänin Lannery Storm angreift, erzeuge einen Schatz-Spielstein. (Er ist ein Artefakt mit „{T}, opfere dieses Artefakt: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe.")\\nImmer wenn du einen Schatz opferst, erhält Kapitänin Lannery Storm +1/+0 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Pirat\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590217&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'147fb33f-674b-4df0-9164-715343b4cafc\', \'multiverseId\': 590217}, \'multiverseid\': 590217}, {\'name\': \'Capitana Lannery Tempestad\', \'text\': \'Prisa.\\nSiempre que la Capitana Lannery Tempestad ataque, crea una ficha de Tesoro. (Es un artefacto con "{T}, sacrificar este artefacto: Agrega un maná de cualquier color".)\\nSiempre que sacrifiques un Tesoro, la Capitana Lannery Tempestad obtiene +1/+0 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Pirata humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590352&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5a258cab-91f9-48bf-b7c9-1214b6686f74\', \'multiverseId\': 590352}, \'multiverseid\': 590352}, {\'name\': \'Capitaine Lanneray Tempeste\', \'text\': "Célérité\\nÀ chaque fois que la Capitaine Lanneray Tempeste attaque, créez un jeton Trésor. (C\'est un artefact avec « {T}, sacrifiez cet artefact : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix. »)\\nÀ chaque fois que vous sacrifiez un trésor, la Capitaine Lanneray Tempeste gagne +1/+0 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et pirate\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590487&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'edec9053-7cc9-489c-84c2-c0656f93842e\', \'multiverseId\': 590487}, \'multiverseid\': 590487}, {\'name\': \'Capitana Lannery Fendiburrasca\', \'text\': \'Rapidità\\nOgniqualvolta la Capitana Lannery Fendiburrasca attacca, crea una pedina Tesoro. (È un artefatto con "{T}, Sacrifica questo artefatto: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore".)\\nOgniqualvolta sacrifichi un Tesoro, la Capitana Lannery Fendiburrasca prende +1/+0 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Pirata Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590622&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'97417aed-0c60-4048-8d38-95ff651961f8\', \'multiverseId\': 590622}, \'multiverseid\': 590622}, {\'name\': \'風雲船長ラネリー\', \'text\': \'速攻\\n風雲船長ラネリーが攻撃するたび、宝物・トークン１つを生成する。（それは、「{T}, このアーティファクトを生け贄に捧げる：好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。」を持つアーティファクトである。）\\nあなたが宝物１つを生け贄に捧げるたび、ターン終了時まで、風雲船長ラネリーは＋１/＋０の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・海賊\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590757&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'56bd4c6f-d13e-4e33-82cc-f84c47f801fd\', \'multiverseId\': 590757}, \'multiverseid\': 590757}, {\'name\': \'兰娜莉速腾船长\', \'text\': \'敏捷\\n每当兰娜莉速腾船长攻击时，派出一个珍宝衍生物。（它是具有「{T}，牺牲此神器：加一点任意颜色的法术力」的神器。）\\n每当你牺牲一个珍宝时，兰娜莉速腾船长得+1/+0直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～人类／海盗\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591162&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b0014ec9-e7c3-4f91-bd93-31307aa193ed\', \'multiverseId\': 591162}, \'multiverseid\': 591162}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kaplanin der Morgendämmerung\', \'text\': \'Lebensverknüpfung\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Kleriker\', \'flavor\': \'„Möge das Licht durch mich scheinen und den Verlorenen den Weg weisen."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591577&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d316ea04-2f72-40e1-aa78-8f2ff6ef1090\', \'multiverseId\': 591577}, \'multiverseid\': 591577}, {\'name\': \'Capellana del amanecer\', \'text\': \'Vínculo vital.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Clérigo humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Que la luz resplandezca a través de mí y guíe a aquellos que se perdieron".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591706&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ba21993b-e51b-4b11-becc-03a67e7e151a\', \'multiverseId\': 591706}, \'multiverseid\': 591706}, {\'name\': \'Aumônière du point du jour\', \'text\': \'Lien de vie\', \'type\': \'Créature : humain et clerc\', \'flavor\': \'« Puisse la lumière éclairer à travers moi ceux qui se sont égarés. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591835&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7aa3343e-6275-4ded-bc3c-56dc00d5c4cb\', \'multiverseId\': 591835}, \'multiverseid\': 591835}, {\'name\': "Cappellana dell\'Aurora", \'text\': \'Legame vitale\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Chierico Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Che la luce possa splendere attraverso di me per guidare chi è perduto."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591964&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'747b1672-7198-489e-99fd-ee0264757827\', \'multiverseId\': 591964}, \'multiverseid\': 591964}, {\'name\': \'夜明けの司祭\', \'text\': \'絆魂\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・クレリック\', \'flavor\': \'「私の発する光が迷える者を導かんことを。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592093&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6478ef74-3246-45f0-8999-93549fff2221\', \'multiverseId\': 592093}, \'multiverseid\': 592093}, {\'name\': \'破晓教士\', \'text\': \'系命\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／僧侣\', \'flavor\': \'「愿明光照我身，引领迷途之人。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592480&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e35d35e5-4193-4888-baf5-ced50b2ae7c1\', \'multiverseId\': 592480}, \'multiverseid\': 592480}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kargische Drachenreiterin\', \'text\': \'Solange du einen Drachen kontrollierst, hat die Kargische Drachenreiterin Flugfähigkeit.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Krieger\', \'flavor\': \'„Nur diejenigen, die den Drachen den gebührenden Respekt entgegenbringen, dürfen mit uns reiten."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590269&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0aaf4dc7-7870-4dcf-88de-bbb37fa7d141\', \'multiverseId\': 590269}, \'multiverseid\': 590269}, {\'name\': \'Jinete de dragones kargana\', \'text\': \'Mientras controles un Dragón, la Jinete de dragones kargana tiene la habilidad de volar.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Solo los que respetan a los dragones como se merecen son dignos de llevar este título".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590404&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'edf2c99a-864f-41df-bfec-f711130d98b9\', \'multiverseId\': 590404}, \'multiverseid\': 590404}, {\'name\': \'Cavalier-dragon kargan\', \'text\': \'Tant que vous contrôlez un dragon, le Cavalier-dragon kargan a le vol.\', \'type\': \'Créature : humain et guerrier\', \'flavor\': \'« Seuls ceux qui accordent aux dragons le respect qui leur est dû peuvent porter notre titre. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590539&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5d291684-8614-4a17-843c-f2630e4dd0be\', \'multiverseId\': 590539}, \'multiverseid\': 590539}, {\'name\': \'Cavalcadraghi di Karga\', \'text\': \'Fintanto che controlli un Drago, la Cavalcadraghi di Karga ha volare.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Solo coloro che trattano i draghi con il dovuto rispetto possono fregiarsi del nostro titolo."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590674&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d77aa1ff-5296-4ff1-b413-9b893794af5a\', \'multiverseId\': 590674}, \'multiverseid\': 590674}, {\'name\': \'カルガの竜騎兵\', \'text\': \'あなたがドラゴンをコントロールしているかぎり、カルガの竜騎兵は飛行を持つ。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・戦士\', \'flavor\': \'「ドラゴンに敬意を払う者のみが、この称号を受けるに値する。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590809&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'06f11600-d587-4a2a-8a21-cd3d6a0878f0\', \'multiverseId\': 590809}, \'multiverseid\': 590809}, {\'name\': \'卡加龙骑士\', \'text\': \'只要你操控龙，卡加龙骑士便具有飞行异能。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／战士\', \'flavor\': \'「给予龙应有的尊重者，才配冠上我们的称号。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591214&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1df78abe-a6d2-400f-a7c1-2c938d58baa5\', \'multiverseId\': 591214}, \'multiverseid\': 591214}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kari Zev, Freibeuterin der Lüfte\', \'text\': \'Erstschlag, Bedrohlich\\nImmer wenn Kari Zev, Freibeuterin der Lüfte, angreift, erzeuge Ragavan, einen legendären 2/1 roten Affe-Kreaturenspielstein. Ragavan kommt getappt und angreifend ins Spiel. Schicke ihn am Ende des Kampfes ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Pirat\', \'flavor\': \'An Bord ihres Schiffes, der *Lächeln des Drachen*, folgt Kari nur ihren eigenen Regeln.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590270&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'152884a4-8aed-4297-b0e9-63337412689f\', \'multiverseId\': 590270}, \'multiverseid\': 590270}, {\'name\': \'Kari Zev, pirata de aeronaves\', \'text\': \'Daña primero, amenaza.\\nSiempre que Kari Zev, pirata de aeronaves ataque, crea a Ragavan, una ficha de criatura legendaria Primate roja 2/1. Ragavan entra al campo de batalla girado y atacando. Exilia esa ficha al final del combate.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Pirata humano\', \'flavor\': \'A bordo de su nave, la Sonrisa del Dragón**, Kari solo sigue sus propias reglas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590405&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5f08567c-3cd2-4f76-a4f0-6c0a1ffb8b5b\', \'multiverseId\': 590405}, \'multiverseid\': 590405}, {\'name\': \'Kari Zev, pillarde de vaisseau volant\', \'text\': \'Initiative, menace\\nÀ chaque fois que Kari Zev, pillarde de vaisseau volant attaque, créez Ragavan, un jeton de créature légendaire 2/1 rouge Singe. Ragavan arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé et attaquant. Exilez ce jeton à la fin du combat.\', \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et pirate\', \'flavor\': "À bord de son navire, le *Sourire du dragon*, Kari n\'obéit qu\'à ses propres règles.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590540&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'80ca61e3-24ed-4ebe-a303-f458a2a4a80c\', \'multiverseId\': 590540}, \'multiverseid\': 590540}, {\'name\': \'Kari Zev, Predona di Avionavi\', \'text\': \'Attacco improvviso, minacciare\\nOgniqualvolta Kari Zev, Predona di Avionavi attacca, crea Ragavan, una pedina creatura leggendaria Scimmia 2/1 rossa. Ragavan entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato e attaccante. Esilia quella pedina alla fine del combattimento.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Pirata Umano\', \'flavor\': \'Sulla sua nave, la *Sorriso del Drago*, Kari non segue altre regole che le proprie.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590675&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'148a2a5d-74f5-44a4-a82c-d25b3dd6e04b\', \'multiverseId\': 590675}, \'multiverseid\': 590675}, {\'name\': \'航空船を強襲する者、カーリ・ゼヴ\', \'text\': \'先制攻撃、威迫\\n航空船を強襲する者、カーリ・ゼヴが攻撃するたび、「ラガバン」という名前の赤の２/１の伝説の猿・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。ラガバンはタップ状態かつ攻撃している状態で戦場に出る。戦闘終了時に、そのトークンを追放する。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・海賊\', \'flavor\': \'自身の船である*ドラゴンの笑み*号の上では、カーリは自分以外誰の規則にも縛られない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590810&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'05d8bf7b-79d1-4010-9c66-4e457e08836a\', \'multiverseId\': 590810}, \'multiverseid\': 590810}, {\'name\': \'飞船大盗卡丽泽夫\', \'text\': \'先攻，威慑\\n每当飞船大盗卡丽泽夫攻击时，派出传奇衍生生物勒格文，其为2/1红色的猴。勒格文须横置进战场，且正进行攻击。在战斗结束时，放逐该衍生物。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～人类／海盗\', \'flavor\': \'上了*龙笑号*飞船后，卡丽泽夫就只会遵守自己订下的规矩。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591215&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fc9ec1fb-6fd7-4afe-8e7d-817f7c537d52\', \'multiverseId\': 591215}, \'multiverseid\': 591215}]', "[{'name': 'Karn der Befreite', 'text': '+4: Ein Spieler deiner Wahl schickt eine Karte aus seiner Hand ins Exil.\\n−3: Schicke eine bleibende Karte deiner Wahl ins Exil.\\n−14: Starte die Partie neu, lasse dabei aber alle von Karn dem Befreiten ins Exil geschickten bleibenden Karten, die keine Auren sind, im Exil. Bringe jene Karten dann unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel.', 'type': 'Legendärer Planeswalker — Karn', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597126&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '02512fcb-277c-44d0-9b17-14fcd0605852', 'multiverseId': 597126}, 'multiverseid': 597126}, {'name': 'Karn liberado', 'text': '+4: El jugador objetivo exilia una carta de su mano.\\n−3: Exilia el permanente objetivo.\\n−14: Reinicia el juego, dejando en el exilio todas las cartas de permanente que no sean Auras exiliadas con Karn liberado. Luego pon esas cartas en el campo de batalla bajo tu control.', 'type': 'Planeswalker legendario — Karn', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597172&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0acdb067-2d0c-42da-b2f6-1dddea909592', 'multiverseId': 597172}, 'multiverseid': 597172}, {'name': 'Karn libéré', 'text': '+4: Un joueur ciblé exile une carte de sa main.\\n-3: Exilez un permanent ciblé.\\n-14: Recommencez la partie en laissant en exil toutes les cartes de permanent non-Aura exilées par Karn libéré. Mettez ensuite ces cartes sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle.', 'type': 'Planeswalker légendaire : Karn', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597218&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b119f54e-374b-41c6-8bac-268e7bd363d7', 'multiverseId': 597218}, 'multiverseid': 597218}, {'name': 'Karn Liberato', 'text': '+4: Un giocatore bersaglio esilia una carta dalla sua mano.\\n−3: Esilia un permanente bersaglio.\\n−14: Ricomincia la partita, lasciando in esilio tutte le carte permanente non Aura esiliate con Karn Liberato. Poi metti quelle carte sul campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo.', 'type': 'Planeswalker Leggendario — Karn', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597264&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3969cdbb-9f72-4ba7-90d6-5d4a39433a8c', 'multiverseId': 597264}, 'multiverseid': 597264}, {'name': '解放された者、カーン', 'text': '+4：プレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーは自分の手札にあるカード１枚を追放する。\\n-3：パーマネント１つを対象とする。それを追放する。\\n-14：解放された者、カーンにより追放されていてオーラでないすべてのパーマネント・カードを追放したまま、ゲームを再び開始する。その後、それらのカードをあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出す。', 'type': '伝説のプレインズウォーカー — カーン', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597310&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5d675170-8e90-4127-a43f-93bc8a49dc81', 'multiverseId': 597310}, 'multiverseid': 597310}, {'name': '重获自由的卡恩', 'text': '+4：目标牌手从其手上放逐一张牌。\\n−3：放逐目标永久物。\\n−14：重新开始游戏，但将所有以重获自由的卡恩放逐之非灵气永久物牌留在放逐区。然后将这些牌在你的操控下放进战场。', 'type': '传奇鹏洛客 ～卡恩', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597448&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'db4e21b2-50a8-4b80-887a-78ccf68a54d4', 'multiverseId': 597448}, 'multiverseid': 597448}]", '[{\'name\': \'Karve der Plünderer\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn die Karve der Plünderer angreift, schaue dir die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek an. Falls es eine Länderkarte ist, kannst du sie getappt ins Spiel bringen.\\nBemannen 3 (Tappe eine beliebige Anzahl an Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst und die zusammen Stärke 3 oder mehr haben: Dieses Fahrzeug wird bis zum Ende des Zuges zu einer Artefaktkreatur.)\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Fahrzeug\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596297&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7ea05bf0-6505-4f41-b12d-b08d00ff2ab1\', \'multiverseId\': 596297}, \'multiverseid\': 596297}, {\'name\': \'Karve de los incursores\', \'text\': \'Siempre que el Karve de los incursores ataque, mira la primera carta de tu biblioteca. Si es una carta de tierra, puedes ponerla en el campo de batalla girada.\\nTripular 3. (Girar cualquier cantidad de criaturas que controlas con una fuerza total de 3 o más: Este Vehículo se convierte en una criatura artefacto hasta el final del turno.)\', \'type\': \'Artefacto — Vehículo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596384&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c77e6c0f-906f-4f70-a437-03881522e8c9\', \'multiverseId\': 596384}, \'multiverseid\': 596384}, {\'name\': \'Karve des pillards\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que le Karve des pillards attaque, regardez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Si c\'est une carte de terrain, vous pouvez la mettre sur le champ de bataille engagée.\\nPilotage 3 (Engagez n\'importe quel nombre de créatures que vous contrôlez dont la force totale est supérieure ou égale à 3 : Ce véhicule devient une créature-artefact jusqu\'à la fin du tour.)", \'type\': \'Artefact : véhicule\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596471&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7282f265-e3c3-4269-b457-3767cb21a8c8\', \'multiverseId\': 596471}, \'multiverseid\': 596471}, {\'name\': \'Karve dei Predoni\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta la Karve dei Predoni attacca, guarda la prima carta del tuo grimorio. Se è una carta terra, puoi metterla sul campo di battaglia TAPpata.\\nManovrare 3 (TAPpa un qualsiasi numero di creature che controlli con forza totale pari o superiore a 3: Questo Veicolo diventa una creatura artefatto fino alla fine del turno.)\', \'type\': \'Artefatto — Veicolo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596558&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2c2c3feb-72d5-47c5-bafb-32ae083edc31\', \'multiverseId\': 596558}, \'multiverseid\': 596558}, {\'name\': \'略奪者のカルフ\', \'text\': \'略奪者のカルフが攻撃するたび、あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード１枚を見る。それが土地・カードであるなら、あなたはそれをタップ状態で戦場に出してもよい。\\n搭乗３（あなたがコントロールしている望む数のクリーチャーを、パワーの合計が３以上になるように選んでタップする：ターン終了時まで、この機体はアーティファクト・クリーチャーになる。）\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 機体\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596645&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aa589bca-a0d7-47d5-81cf-75fe641dc48d\', \'multiverseId\': 596645}, \'multiverseid\': 596645}, {\'name\': \'劫掠者卡筏\', \'text\': \'每当劫掠者卡筏攻击时，检视你的牌库顶牌。若它是地牌，则你可以将之横置放进战场。\\n搭载3（横置任意数量由你操控且力量总和等于或大于3的生物：此载具成为神器生物直到回合结束。）\', \'type\': \'神器 ～载具\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596906&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c75f8c43-fb32-4a42-bf94-031efe449679\', \'multiverseId\': 596906}, \'multiverseid\': 596906}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kasmina, rätselhafte Mentorin\', \'text\': \'Zaubersprüche, die deine Gegner wirken und die eine Kreatur oder einen Planeswalker, die bzw. den du kontrollierst, als Ziel haben, kosten beim Wirken {2} mehr.\\n−2: Erzeuge einen 2/2 blauen Zauberer-Kreaturenspielstein. Ziehe eine Karte und wirf dann eine Karte ab.\', \'type\': \'Legendärer Planeswalker — Kasmina\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597089&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f37f3988-fc0a-49cd-beec-4cddeee70f72\', \'multiverseId\': 597089}, \'multiverseid\': 597089}, {\'name\': \'Kasmina, mentora enigmática\', \'text\': \'A tus oponentes les cuesta {2} más lanzar los hechizos que hagan objetivo a una criatura o planeswalker que controlas.\\n−2: Crea una ficha de criatura Hechicero azul 2/2. Roba una carta, luego descarta una carta.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker legendario — Kasmina\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597135&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6db9f270-e9f4-4d89-9364-7aeb296c37f7\', \'multiverseId\': 597135}, \'multiverseid\': 597135}, {\'name\': \'Kasmina, mentor énigmatique\', \'text\': "Les sorts que vos adversaires lancent qui ciblent une créature ou un planeswalker que vous contrôlez coûtent {2} de plus à lancer.\\n-2 : Créez un jeton de créature 2/2 bleue Sorcier. Piochez une carte, puis défaussez-vous d\'une carte.", \'type\': \'Planeswalker légendaire : Kasmina\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597181&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c36585bb-2f9c-4b5c-931f-b87150b0a49e\', \'multiverseId\': 597181}, \'multiverseid\': 597181}, {\'name\': \'Kasmina, Maestra Enigmatica\', \'text\': \'Le magie che i tuoi avversari lanciano e che bersagliano una creatura o un planeswalker che controlli costano {2} in più per essere lanciate.\\n−2: Crea una pedina creatura Mago 2/2 blu. Pesca una carta, poi scarta una carta.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker Leggendario — Kasmina\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597227&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'daacf1cc-b7e6-4e60-9f5d-1ca06c851fe2\', \'multiverseId\': 597227}, \'multiverseid\': 597227}, {\'name\': \'謎めいた指導者、カズミナ\', \'text\': \'対戦相手が、クリーチャーやプレインズウォーカーのうちあなたがコントロールしている１つを対象とする呪文を唱えるコストは{2}多くなる。\\n-2：青の２/２のウィザード・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。カード１枚を引き、その後、カード１枚を捨てる。\', \'type\': \'伝説のプレインズウォーカー — カズミナ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597273&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'feb94fed-5f3e-494a-9a3c-49e50a1d8061\', \'multiverseId\': 597273}, \'multiverseid\': 597273}, {\'name\': \'莫测导师克蜜娜\', \'text\': \'对手施放且以由你操控之生物或鹏洛客为目标的咒语增加{2}来施放。\\n−2：派出一个2/2蓝色法术师衍生生物。抓一张牌，然后弃一张牌。\', \'type\': \'传奇鹏洛客 ～克蜜娜\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597411&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'314a81fc-1c32-4edf-9bac-0b96144d71df\', \'multiverseId\': 597411}, \'multiverseid\': 597411}]', '[{\'name\': \'Katalysierendes Elementarwesen\', \'text\': \'Opfere das Katalysierende Elementarwesen: Erzeuge {R}{R}.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elementarwesen\', \'flavor\': \'Als der Hypersturm-Generator den roten Bereich erreichte, stieg ein Wesen aus dem Lichtbogen empor.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590218&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'08d1c18f-0169-4e3c-bc47-057c7cb2698e\', \'multiverseId\': 590218}, \'multiverseid\': 590218}, {\'name\': \'Elemental catalizador\', \'text\': \'Sacrificar el Elemental catalizador: Agrega {R}{R}.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elemental\', \'flavor\': \'Justo cuando el generador de hiperrayo traspasó la línea roja, un ser emergió del arco brillante.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590353&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cf03324e-723e-44d7-8b9c-b8feeb7fbc70\', \'multiverseId\': 590353}, \'multiverseid\': 590353}, {\'name\': \'Élémental catalytique\', \'text\': "Sacrifiez l\'Élémental catalytique : Ajoutez {R}{R}.", \'type\': \'Créature : élémental\', \'flavor\': "Alors que le générateur hyperélectrique passait dans le rouge, un être surgit de l\'arc.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590488&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'91b36146-4013-4b94-81a8-02c08b72508c\', \'multiverseId\': 590488}, \'multiverseid\': 590488}, {\'name\': \'Elementale Catalizzatore\', \'text\': "Sacrifica l\'Elementale Catalizzatore: Aggiungi {R}{R}.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Elementale\', \'flavor\': \'Il generatore di ipertempeste superò la soglia critica e dalla scarica emerse una forma di vita.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590623&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4e671929-6bff-4ad1-8c46-3151c0ac0499\', \'multiverseId\': 590623}, \'multiverseid\': 590623}, {\'name\': \'触媒の精霊\', \'text\': \'触媒の精霊を生け贄に捧げる：{R}{R}を加える。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エレメンタル\', \'flavor\': \'超嵐力発電機がじわじわと臨界を超えると、放電の中から何かが姿を現した。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590758&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b8bad1e5-9c5c-4180-bd8b-4acd962bbf62\', \'multiverseId\': 590758}, \'multiverseid\': 590758}, {\'name\': \'触媒元素\', \'text\': \'牺牲触媒元素：加{R}{R}。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～元素\', \'flavor\': \'超风暴发生器一过临界值，电弧中便冒出一个生物。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591163&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d78b6f48-a415-4ff5-af18-fa99b898df72\', \'multiverseId\': 591163}, \'multiverseid\': 591163}]', "[{'name': 'Kein Entrinnen', 'text': 'Neutralisiere einen Kreaturen- oder Planeswalkerzauber deiner Wahl. Falls der Zauberspruch auf diese Weise neutralisiert wird, schicke ihn ins Exil, anstatt ihn auf den Friedhof seines Besitzers zu legen.\\nHellsicht 1. (Schaue dir die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek an. Du kannst sie unter deine Bibliothek legen.)', 'type': 'Spontanzauber', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595254&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '54370685-4fd0-4adf-b2cf-8413a0234efb', 'multiverseId': 595254}, 'multiverseid': 595254}, {'name': 'Sin escapatoria', 'text': 'Contrarresta el hechizo de criatura o de planeswalker objetivo. Si ese hechizo es contrarrestado de esta manera, exílialo en vez de ponerlo en el cementerio de su propietario.\\nAdivina 1. (Mira la primera carta de tu biblioteca. Puedes poner esa carta en el fondo de tu biblioteca.)', 'type': 'Instantáneo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595362&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2c6a131a-1e29-4458-b824-6704cda3aa96', 'multiverseId': 595362}, 'multiverseid': 595362}, {'name': 'Sans échappatoire', 'text': 'Contrecarrez un sort de créature ou de planeswalker ciblé. Si ce sort est contrecarré de cette manière, exilez-le à la place de le mettre dans le cimetière de son propriétaire.\\nRegard 1. (Regardez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Vous pouvez la mettre au-dessous de votre bibliothèque.)', 'type': 'Éphémère', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595470&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bb21eed5-b17b-4801-b915-6bc81e876541', 'multiverseId': 595470}, 'multiverseid': 595470}, {'name': 'Senza Scampo', 'text': 'Neutralizza una magia creatura o planeswalker bersaglio. Se quella magia è neutralizzata in questo modo, esiliala invece di metterla nel cimitero del suo proprietario.\\nProfetizza 1. (Guarda la prima carta del tuo grimorio. Puoi mettere quella carta in fondo al tuo grimorio.)', 'type': 'Istantaneo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595578&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f94d07cf-99c0-4bee-85a1-fd572580029b', 'multiverseId': 595578}, 'multiverseid': 595578}, {'name': '退路無し', 'text': 'クリーチャーやプレインズウォーカーである呪文１つを対象とする。それを打ち消す。これによりその呪文が打ち消されたなら、それをオーナーの墓地に置く代わりに追放する。\\n占術１を行う。（あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード１枚を見る。あなたはそのカードをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に置いてもよい。）', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595686&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5adcde64-b5be-4fb5-ad0c-8a07899fc304', 'multiverseId': 595686}, 'multiverseid': 595686}, {'name': '无路可逃', 'text': '反击目标生物或鹏洛客咒语。如果以此法反击该咒语，则改为将它放逐，而非置入其拥有者的坟墓场。\\n占卜1。（检视你牌库顶的牌。你可以将该牌置于你的牌库底。）', 'type': '瞬间', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596010&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c4792e53-80fd-4bb2-bba2-5c93afc2aed8', 'multiverseId': 596010}, 'multiverseid': 596010}]", '[{\'name\': \'Keldonische Plünderin\', \'text\': \'Wenn die Keldonische Plünderin ins Spiel kommt, kannst du eine Karte abwerfen. Falls du dies tust, ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Krieger\', \'flavor\': \'Keldonische Plünderer beschränken ihre Beute auf das, was ihre Colos tragen können. Egal wie wertvoll der Rest sein mag, er geht in Flammen auf.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590271&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0854a869-98c6-48e8-a394-379c4cb883f0\', \'multiverseId\': 590271}, \'multiverseid\': 590271}, {\'name\': \'Incursora keldon\', \'text\': \'Cuando la Incursora keldon entre al campo de batalla, puedes descartar una carta. Si lo haces, roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero humano\', \'flavor\': \'Los botines de los incursores keldon se limitan a aquello que pueden transportar sus colos. El resto lo consume el fuego, sea cual sea su valor.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590406&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5cd20f84-c9c1-4a94-8784-4c869f167145\', \'multiverseId\': 590406}, \'multiverseid\': 590406}, {\'name\': \'Pillarde kelde\', \'text\': "Quand la Pillarde kelde arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez vous défausser d\'une carte. Si vous faites ainsi, piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et guerrier\', \'flavor\': \'Le butin des pillards keldes se limite à ce que peuvent porter leurs caprinodons. Quelle que soit sa valeur, le reste part en fumée.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590541&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'afb4bf45-e0d3-41c4-8517-0be109cd33c3\', \'multiverseId\': 590541}, \'multiverseid\': 590541}, {\'name\': \'Assaltatrice di Keld\', \'text\': "Quando l\'Assaltatrice di Keld entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi scartare una carta. Se lo fai, pesca una carta.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Umano\', \'flavor\': \'Il bottino degli assaltatori di Keld si limita a ciò che i loro colos possono trasportare. Per quanto prezioso, il resto va in fumo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590676&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b5168971-f2e8-4bb9-9efd-36ab5e7f8504\', \'multiverseId\': 590676}, \'multiverseid\': 590676}, {\'name\': \'ケルドの略奪者\', \'text\': \'ケルドの略奪者が戦場に出たとき、あなたはカード１枚を捨ててもよい。そうしたなら、カード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・戦士\', \'flavor\': \'ケルドでは、略奪者の戦利品はコロスで運べる量に制約される。価値にかかわらず、残りは燃えて煙となる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590811&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'75effbd5-9b18-4fc1-8c48-f44e441217bd\', \'multiverseId\': 590811}, \'multiverseid\': 590811}, {\'name\': \'凯尔顿突击兵\', \'text\': \'当凯尔顿突击兵进战场时，你可以弃一张牌。若你如此作，则抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／战士\', \'flavor\': \'凯尔顿的突击兵只带走寇骡能驮走的战利品。剩下的无论价值高低，都会化作黑烟飘向空中。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591216&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8d12bc3e-c816-499e-9604-9424e5d9cfd3\', \'multiverseId\': 591216}, \'multiverseid\': 591216}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kellertür\', \'text\': \'{3}, {T}: Ein Spieler deiner Wahl legt die unterste Karte seiner Bibliothek auf seinen Friedhof. Falls es eine Kreaturenkarte ist, erzeugst du einen 2/2 schwarzen Zombie-Kreaturenspielstein.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Als ob man noch einen zusätzlichen Grund bräuchte, dunkle muffige Keller zu meiden.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596263&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'91533f4d-1957-477c-887a-e824b0afa34e\', \'multiverseId\': 596263}, \'multiverseid\': 596263}, {\'name\': \'Puerta del sótano\', \'text\': \'{3}, {T}: El jugador objetivo pone la última carta de su biblioteca en su cementerio. Si es una carta de criatura, crea una ficha de criatura Zombie negra 2/2.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'Como si alguien todavía necesitara razones para evitar los sótanos oscuros y húmedos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596350&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9faf522b-46c6-445c-b66d-a2255d6bab2e\', \'multiverseId\': 596350}, \'multiverseid\': 596350}, {\'name\': \'Porte de cellier\', \'text\': "{3}, {T} : Un joueur ciblé met la carte du dessous de sa bibliothèque dans son cimetière. Si c\'est une carte de créature, vous créez un jeton de créature 2/2 noire Zombie.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "Comme s\'il n\'y avait pas suffisamment de raisons pour éviter les celliers sombres et humides.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596437&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a7a35ac2-0453-4589-8e12-e57bc228aa3a\', \'multiverseId\': 596437}, \'multiverseid\': 596437}, {\'name\': \'Porta della Cantina\', \'text\': "{3}, {T}: Un giocatore bersaglio mette nel suo cimitero l\'ultima carta del suo grimorio. Se è una carta creatura, crei una pedina creatura Zombie 2/2 nera.", \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'Come se ci fosse bisogno di un altro motivo per evitare le cantine buie e umide.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596524&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9f968708-4f91-4c90-aa4a-7f1c0c7c8284\', \'multiverseId\': 596524}, \'multiverseid\': 596524}, {\'name\': \'地下室の扉\', \'text\': \'{3},{T}：プレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーは、自分のライブラリーの一番下にあるカード１枚を自分の墓地に置く。それがクリーチャー・カードであるなら、黒の２/２のゾンビ・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'暗く湿った地下室を避ける他の理由が必要かのような。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596611&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c02c5d45-cb7b-4ba2-a103-7c0a20fc439d\', \'multiverseId\': 596611}, \'multiverseid\': 596611}, {\'name\': \'地窖门\', \'text\': \'{3}，{T}：目标牌手将其牌库底牌置入其坟墓场。如果它是生物牌，则你派出一个2/2黑色灵俑衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'就好像还有人需要理由来避开黑暗、潮湿的地窖。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596872&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5e8c4d70-b402-4b6c-a837-cf7b3080b1b8\', \'multiverseId\': 596872}, \'multiverseid\': 596872}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kenessos, Priester der Thassa\', \'text\': \'Falls du dir mit Hellsicht eine Anzahl an Karten ansehen würdest, schaue dir stattdessen entsprechend viele Karten plus eine an.\\n{3}{G/U}: Schaue dir die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek an. Falls es eine Krake-, Leviathan-, Oktopus- oder Schlange-Kreaturenkarte ist, kannst du sie ins Spiel bringen. Falls du die Karte nicht ins Spiel bringst, kannst du sie unter deine Bibliothek legen.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Meervolk, Kleriker\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589618&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'72c0e270-2f4c-40b4-8793-8c61439cc9c7\', \'multiverseId\': 589618}, \'multiverseid\': 589618}, {\'name\': \'Kenessos, sacerdote de Tassa\', \'text\': \'Si fueras a adivinar una cantidad de cartas, en vez de eso, adivina esa misma cantidad más una.\\n{3}{G/U}: Mira la primera carta de tu biblioteca. Si es una carta de criatura Kraken, Leviatán, Pulpo o Serpiente, puedes ponerla en el campo de batalla. Si no la pones en el campo de batalla, puedes ponerla en el fondo de tu biblioteca.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Clérigo tritón\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589669&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1a9a9e78-b7fa-4e62-9f31-68afaa0686a5\', \'multiverseId\': 589669}, \'multiverseid\': 589669}, {\'name\': \'Kénessos, prêtre de Thassa\', \'text\': "Si vous deviez appliquer le regard à un certain nombre de cartes, appliquez le regard à autant de cartes plus une à la place.\\n{3}{G/U} : Regardez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Si c\'est une carte de créature Kraken, Léviathan, Pieuvre ou Grand serpent, vous pouvez la mettre sur le champ de bataille. Si vous ne mettez pas la carte sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez la mettre au-dessous de votre bibliothèque.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : ondin et clerc\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589720&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3294868f-af44-4883-9e21-6a6dda400d50\', \'multiverseId\': 589720}, \'multiverseid\': 589720}, {\'name\': \'Kenessos, Sacerdote di Thassa\', \'text\': \'Se stai per profetizzare un numero di carte, profetizza invece altrettante carte più una.\\n{3}{G/U}: Guarda la prima carta del tuo grimorio. Se è una carta creatura Kraken, Leviatano, Piovra o Serpe, puoi metterla sul campo di battaglia. Se non la metti sul campo di battaglia, puoi metterla in fondo al tuo grimorio.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Chierico Tritone\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589771&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8e5bfc43-5857-4009-8452-c14595f73825\', \'multiverseId\': 589771}, \'multiverseid\': 589771}, {\'name\': \'タッサの神官、ケネッソス\', \'text\': \'あなたが占術を行うなら、代わりにその枚数に１を足した枚数の占術を行う。\\n{3}{G/U}：あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード１枚を見る。それが海蛇やクラーケンやタコやリバイアサンであるクリーチャー・カードであるなら、あなたはそれを戦場に出してもよい。それを戦場に出さないなら、あなたはそれをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に置いてもよい。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — マーフォーク・クレリック\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589822&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fb8f9ece-5c5d-49bb-a44a-71437f943613\', \'multiverseId\': 589822}, \'multiverseid\': 589822}, {\'name\': \'塔萨僧侣克涅索斯\', \'text\': \'如果你将占卜若干牌，则改为占卜该数量加一的牌。\\n{3}{G/U}：检视你的牌库顶牌。如果它是巨海兽，海怪，章鱼或巨蛇生物牌，则你可以将之放进战场。若你未将该牌放进战场，则你可以将它置于你的牌库底。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～人鱼／僧侣\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589975&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'34b42f07-362b-4e81-af56-c8e9e0ac05eb\', \'multiverseId\': 589975}, \'multiverseid\': 589975}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ketten der Obhut\', \'text\': \'Verzaubert eine Kreatur, die du kontrollierst\\nWenn die Ketten der Obhut ins Spiel kommen, schicke eine bleibende Karte deiner Wahl, die kein Land ist und die ein Gegner kontrolliert, ins Exil, bis die Ketten der Obhut das Spiel verlassen.\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur hat Abwehr {2}. (Immer wenn sie das Ziel eines Zauberspruchs oder einer Fähigkeit wird, den bzw. die ein Gegner kontrolliert, neutralisiere ihn bzw. sie, es sei denn, jener Spieler bezahlt {2}.)\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589608&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a1ecae6f-37f3-4315-8054-1ed81ef8b6c2\', \'multiverseId\': 589608}, \'multiverseid\': 589608}, {\'name\': \'Cadenas de custodia\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura que controlas.\\nCuando las Cadenas de custodia entren al campo de batalla, exilia el permanente objetivo que no sea tierra que controla un oponente hasta que las Cadenas de custodia dejen el campo de batalla.\\nLa criatura encantada tiene la habilidad de rebatir {2}. (Siempre que sea objetivo de un hechizo o habilidad que controla un oponente, contrarréstalo a menos que ese jugador pague {2}.)\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589659&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b6a7d1ba-5c5d-4540-a781-73417967e99c\', \'multiverseId\': 589659}, \'multiverseid\': 589659}, {\'name\': \'Chaînes de détention\', \'text\': "Enchanter : une créature que vous contrôlez\\nQuand les Chaînes de détention arrivent sur le champ de bataille, exilez un permanent non-terrain ciblé qu\'un adversaire contrôle jusqu\'à ce que les Chaînes de détention quittent le champ de bataille.\\nLa créature enchantée a parade {2}. (À chaque fois qu\'elle devient la cible d\'un sort ou d\'une capacité qu\'un adversaire contrôle, contrecarrez ce sort ou cette capacité à moins que ce joueur ne paie {2}.)", \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589710&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3589a8fc-b47b-4a40-873b-69418a091078\', \'multiverseId\': 589710}, \'multiverseid\': 589710}, {\'name\': \'Catene di Custodia\', \'text\': \'Incanta creatura che controlli\\nQuando le Catene di Custodia entrano nel campo di battaglia, esilia un permanente non terra bersaglio controllato da un avversario finché le Catene di Custodia non lasciano il campo di battaglia.\\nLa creatura incantata ha egida {2}. (Ogniqualvolta diventa bersaglio di una magia o abilità controllata da un avversario, neutralizza quella magia o abilità a meno che quel giocatore non paghi {2}.)\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589761&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c8b9c032-0344-4af7-832c-8b53f95f13d8\', \'multiverseId\': 589761}, \'multiverseid\': 589761}, {\'name\': \'拘束の鎖\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー）\\n拘束の鎖が戦場に出たとき、対戦相手がコントロールしていて土地でないパーマネント１つを対象とする。それを拘束の鎖が戦場を離れるまで追放する。\\nエンチャントしているクリーチャーは護法{2}を持つ。（それが対戦相手がコントロールしている呪文や能力の対象になるたび、そのプレイヤーが{2}を支払わないかぎり、その呪文や能力を打ち消す。）\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589812&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'95c520c9-7d7d-4e29-841a-21b921128d1a\', \'multiverseId\': 589812}, \'multiverseid\': 589812}, {\'name\': \'监护锁链\', \'text\': \'结附于由你操控的生物\\n当监护锁链进战场时，放逐目标由对手操控的非地永久物，直到监护锁链离开战场为止。\\n所结附的生物具有守护{2}。（每当它成为由对手操控之咒语或异能的目标时，除非该牌手支付{2}，否则反击之。）\', \'type\': \'结界 ～灵气\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589965&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7c316fb3-38bd-4215-ba32-234f15e2299d\', \'multiverseId\': 589965}, \'multiverseid\': 589965}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kibo, Uktabi-Prinz\', \'text\': \'{T}: Jeder Spieler erzeugt einen farblosen Artefaktspielstein namens Banane mit „{T}, opfere dieses Artefakt: Erzeuge {R} oder {G}. Du erhältst 2 Lebenspunkte dazu."\\nImmer wenn ein Artefakt, das ein Gegner kontrolliert, aus dem Spiel auf einen Friedhof gelegt wird, lege auf jede Menschenaffe- oder Affe-Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, eine +1/+1-Marke.\\nImmer wenn Kibo angreift, opfert der verteidigende Spieler ein Artefakt.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Affe, Adliger\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589645&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'31c05ca4-2244-41f2-915b-5da52b4a0667\', \'multiverseId\': 589645}, \'multiverseid\': 589645}, {\'name\': \'Kibo, príncipe de Uktabi\', \'text\': \'{T}: Cada jugador crea una ficha de artefacto incolora llamada Plátano con "{T}, sacrificar este artefacto: Agrega {R} o {G}. Ganas 2 vidas".\\nSiempre que un artefacto que controla un oponente vaya a un cementerio desde el campo de batalla, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre cada criatura que controlas que sea un Simio o un Primate.\\nSiempre que Kibo ataque, el jugador defensor sacrifica un artefacto.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Noble primate\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589696&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fef2b74e-27ec-4953-8cb7-7ec866d5a34f\', \'multiverseId\': 589696}, \'multiverseid\': 589696}, {\'name\': "Kibo, prince de l\'Ouktabi", \'text\': "{T} : Chaque joueur crée un jeton d\'artefact incolore appelé Banane avec « {T}, sacrifiez cet artefact : Ajoutez {R} ou {G}. Vous gagnez 2 points de vie. »\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'un artefact qu\'un adversaire contrôle est mis dans un cimetière depuis le champ de bataille, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur chaque créature que vous contrôlez qui est un grand singe ou un singe.\\nÀ chaque fois que Kibo attaque, le joueur défenseur sacrifie un artefact.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : singe et noble\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589747&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e2a626f3-277f-45d5-a4d2-14424ae4017d\', \'multiverseId\': 589747}, \'multiverseid\': 589747}, {\'name\': \'Kibo, Principe di Uktabi\', \'text\': \'{T}: Ogni giocatore crea una pedina artefatto incolore chiamata Banana con "{T}, Sacrifica questo artefatto: Aggiungi {R} o {G}. Guadagni 2 punti vita".\\nOgniqualvolta un artefatto controllato da un avversario viene messo in un cimitero dal campo di battaglia, metti un segnalino +1/+1 su ogni creatura che controlli che è uno Scimpanzé o una Scimmia.\\nOgniqualvolta Kibo attacca, il giocatore in difesa sacrifica un artefatto.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Nobile Scimmia\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589798&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a201f468-8f6b-4164-8250-dbbd8e1fa404\', \'multiverseId\': 589798}, \'multiverseid\': 589798}, {\'name\': \'ウークタビーの王子、キーボ\', \'text\': \'{T}：各プレイヤーはそれぞれ、「バナナ」という名前で「{T},このアーティファクトを生け贄に捧げる：{R}か{G}を加える。あなたは２点のライフを得る。」を持つ無色のアーティファクト・トークン１つを生成する。\\n対戦相手がコントロールしているアーティファクト１つが戦場から墓地に置かれるたび、あなたがコントロールしていて類人猿や猿である各クリーチャーの上にそれぞれ＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。\\nウークタビーの王子、キーボが攻撃するたび、防御プレイヤーはアーティファクト１つを生け贄に捧げる。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 猿・貴族\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589849&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1b22d162-e6c7-4002-a999-f41982b81f2e\', \'multiverseId\': 589849}, \'multiverseid\': 589849}, {\'name\': \'乌克塔比王子奇博\', \'text\': \'{T}：每位牌手各派出一个无色，名称为香蕉的衍生神器，且具有「{T}，牺牲此神器：加{R}或{G}。你获得2点生命。」\\n每当一个由对手操控的神器从战场进入坟墓场时，在每个由你操控且为猿猴或猴的生物上各放置一个+1/+1指示物。\\n每当奇博攻击时，防御牌手牺牲一个神器。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～猴／贵族\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590002&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c22444bd-480b-4569-b05d-80ab4c0d67d8\', \'multiverseId\': 590002}, \'multiverseid\': 590002}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kibo, Uktabi-Prinz\', \'text\': \'{T}: Jeder Spieler erzeugt einen farblosen Artefaktspielstein namens Banane mit „{T}, opfere dieses Artefakt: Erzeuge {R} oder {G}. Du erhältst 2 Lebenspunkte dazu."\\nImmer wenn ein Artefakt, das ein Gegner kontrolliert, aus dem Spiel auf einen Friedhof gelegt wird, lege auf jede Menschenaffe- oder Affe-Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, eine +1/+1-Marke.\\nImmer wenn Kibo angreift, opfert der verteidigende Spieler ein Artefakt.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Affe, Adliger\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597896&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'67ab81cc-9213-4c23-8a91-5bfb2b57ed63\', \'multiverseId\': 597896}, \'multiverseid\': 597896}, {\'name\': \'Kibo, príncipe de Uktabi\', \'text\': \'{T}: Cada jugador crea una ficha de artefacto incolora llamada Plátano con "{T}, sacrificar este artefacto: Agrega {R} o {G}. Ganas 2 vidas".\\nSiempre que un artefacto que controla un oponente vaya a un cementerio desde el campo de batalla, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre cada criatura que controlas que sea un Simio o un Primate.\\nSiempre que Kibo ataque, el jugador defensor sacrifica un artefacto.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Noble primate\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597897&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0b8e71fa-72a1-46cc-8103-e91bb02850e1\', \'multiverseId\': 597897}, \'multiverseid\': 597897}, {\'name\': "Kibo, prince de l\'Ouktabi", \'text\': "{T} : Chaque joueur crée un jeton d\'artefact incolore appelé Banane avec « {T}, sacrifiez cet artefact : Ajoutez {R} ou {G}. Vous gagnez 2 points de vie. »\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'un artefact qu\'un adversaire contrôle est mis dans un cimetière depuis le champ de bataille, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur chaque créature que vous contrôlez qui est un grand singe ou un singe.\\nÀ chaque fois que Kibo attaque, le joueur défenseur sacrifie un artefact.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : singe et noble\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597898&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aaf9292c-1044-4f15-9e52-ee4d15d40878\', \'multiverseId\': 597898}, \'multiverseid\': 597898}, {\'name\': \'Kibo, Principe di Uktabi\', \'text\': \'{T}: Ogni giocatore crea una pedina artefatto incolore chiamata Banana con "{T}, Sacrifica questo artefatto: Aggiungi {R} o {G}. Guadagni 2 punti vita".\\nOgniqualvolta un artefatto controllato da un avversario viene messo in un cimitero dal campo di battaglia, metti un segnalino +1/+1 su ogni creatura che controlli che è uno Scimpanzé o una Scimmia.\\nOgniqualvolta Kibo attacca, il giocatore in difesa sacrifica un artefatto.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Nobile Scimmia\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597899&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1d134bef-692e-4644-8ada-9945d6e0de87\', \'multiverseId\': 597899}, \'multiverseid\': 597899}, {\'name\': \'ウークタビーの王子、キーボ\', \'text\': \'{T}：各プレイヤーはそれぞれ、「バナナ」という名前で「{T},このアーティファクトを生け贄に捧げる：{R}か{G}を加える。あなたは２点のライフを得る。」を持つ無色のアーティファクト・トークン１つを生成する。\\n対戦相手がコントロールしているアーティファクト１つが戦場から墓地に置かれるたび、あなたがコントロールしていて類人猿や猿である各クリーチャーの上にそれぞれ＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。\\nウークタビーの王子、キーボが攻撃するたび、防御プレイヤーはアーティファクト１つを生け贄に捧げる。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 猿・貴族\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597900&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'83a05063-4e8f-4525-8ad9-eb869ec265cf\', \'multiverseId\': 597900}, \'multiverseid\': 597900}, {\'name\': \'乌克塔比王子奇博\', \'text\': \'{T}：每位牌手各派出一个无色，名称为香蕉的衍生神器，且具有「{T}，牺牲此神器：加{R}或{G}。你获得2点生命。」\\n每当一个由对手操控的神器从战场进入坟墓场时，在每个由你操控且为猿猴或猴的生物上各放置一个+1/+1指示物。\\n每当奇博攻击时，防御牌手牺牲一个神器。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～猴／贵族\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597903&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9d4a4abf-b9ac-46d4-a1de-bcd99b763c83\', \'multiverseId\': 597903}, \'multiverseid\': 597903}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kiki-Jiki, Spiegelzerbrecher\', \'text\': \'Eile\\n{T}: Erzeuge einen Spielstein, der eine Kopie einer nichtlegendären Kreatur deiner Wahl ist, die du kontrollierst, außer dass er Eile hat. Opfere ihn zu Beginn des nächsten Endsegments.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Goblin, Schamane\', \'flavor\': \'„Willst du einen tollen Trick sehen?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597108&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'483cd23c-e6ae-4088-b051-28e4d1be517f\', \'multiverseId\': 597108}, \'multiverseid\': 597108}, {\'name\': \'Kiki-Jiki, el rompe espejos\', \'text\': \'Prisa.\\n{T}: Crea una ficha que es una copia de la criatura objetivo que no sea legendaria que controlas, excepto que tiene la habilidad de prisa. Sacrifícala al comienzo del próximo paso final.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Chamán trasgo\', \'flavor\': \'"¿Quieres ver un truco de los buenos?".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597154&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7f406022-4425-4569-a15a-b1a2dda0f779\', \'multiverseId\': 597154}, \'multiverseid\': 597154}, {\'name\': \'Kiki-Jiki, brise-miroir\', \'text\': "Célérité\\n{T} : Créez un jeton qui est une copie d\'une créature non-légendaire ciblée que vous contrôlez, excepté qu\'il a la célérité. Sacrifiez-le au début de la prochaine étape de fin.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : gobelin et shamane\', \'flavor\': \'« Vous voulez voir un tour de passe-passe ? »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597200&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0943bee2-a121-4a48-afd8-132ae40bc66a\', \'multiverseId\': 597200}, \'multiverseid\': 597200}, {\'name\': \'Kiki-Jiki, Spaccaspecchi\', \'text\': "Rapidità\\n{T}: Crea una pedina che è una copia di una creatura non leggendaria bersaglio che controlli, tranne che ha rapidità. Sacrificala all\'inizio della prossima sottofase finale.", \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Sciamano Goblin\', \'flavor\': \'"Vuoi vedere un trucchetto ingegnoso?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597246&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'69d20a20-496f-48c3-af50-0c0719101be9\', \'multiverseId\': 597246}, \'multiverseid\': 597246}, {\'name\': \'鏡割りのキキジキ\', \'text\': \'速攻\\n{T}：あなたがコントロールしていて伝説でないクリーチャー１体を対象とする。それが速攻を持つことを除きそれのコピーであるトークン１つを生成する。次の終了ステップの開始時に、そのトークンを生け贄に捧げる。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — ゴブリン・シャーマン\', \'flavor\': \'「面白いものを見せてあげようか？」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597292&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a14b24f6-0075-44e8-8a08-f0e796f409b6\', \'multiverseId\': 597292}, \'multiverseid\': 597292}, {\'name\': \'裂镜奇奇几奇\', \'text\': \'敏捷\\n{T}：派出一个衍生物，此衍生物为目标由你操控且非传奇的生物之复制品，但它具有敏捷异能。在下一个结束步骤开始时，将它牺牲。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～鬼怪／祭师\', \'flavor\': \'「想不想看个妙招？」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597430&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5febd3f2-02c4-4ed8-b6a2-45178e646143\', \'multiverseId\': 597430}, \'multiverseid\': 597430}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kitsune-Pilot\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn ein Fahrzeug, das du kontrollierst, angreift, bestimme eines —\\n• Das Fahrzeug erhält Erstschlag bis zum Ende des Zuges.\\n• Enttappe den Kitsune-Piloten.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Fuchs, Pilot\', \'flavor\': \'„Oh, Entschuldigung — war das ein Rennen?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591610&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'758175f9-d68a-41e3-b1ff-9a95ef1cf083\', \'multiverseId\': 591610}, \'multiverseid\': 591610}, {\'name\': \'As kitsune\', \'text\': \'Siempre que un Vehículo que controlas ataque, elige uno:\\n• Ese Vehículo gana la habilidad de dañar primero hasta el final del turno.\\n• Endereza el As kitsune.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Piloto zorro\', \'flavor\': \'"Ah, perdón. ¿Era una carrera?".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591739&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f593ab70-0b9a-4cf9-8d8c-a292763aa5d8\', \'multiverseId\': 591739}, \'multiverseid\': 591739}, {\'name\': \'As kitsune\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'un véhicule que vous contrôlez attaque, choisissez l\'un —\\n• Ce véhicule acquiert l\'initiative jusqu\'à la fin du tour.\\n• Dégagez l\'As kitsune.", \'type\': \'Créature : renard et pilote\', \'flavor\': \'« Oh, désolé... Nous faisions la course ? »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591868&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'82801787-c09a-4eac-b573-588da4655992\', \'multiverseId\': 591868}, \'multiverseid\': 591868}, {\'name\': \'Asso Kitsune\', \'text\': "Ogniqualvolta un Veicolo che controlli attacca, scegli uno —\\n• Quel Veicolo ha attacco improvviso fino alla fine del turno.\\n• STAPpa l\'Asso Kitsune.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Pilota Volpe\', \'flavor\': \'"Oh, scusa, stavi gareggiando con me?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591997&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6af0d57d-248a-4bfe-bbd9-768266f4a771\', \'multiverseId\': 591997}, \'multiverseid\': 591997}, {\'name\': \'狐の腕利き\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしている機体１体が攻撃するたび、以下から１つを選ぶ。\\n・ターン終了時まで、その機体は先制攻撃を得る。\\n・狐の腕利きをアンタップする。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 狐・操縦士\', \'flavor\': \'「おっと失礼、競争してたって？」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592126&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1cda8154-e3bb-4de1-9ca0-5d33c322683a\', \'multiverseId\': 592126}, \'multiverseid\': 592126}, {\'name\': \'狐族高手\', \'text\': \'每当一个由你操控的载具攻击时，选择一项～\\n•该载具获得先攻异能直到回合结束。\\n•重置狐族高手。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～狐／驾手\', \'flavor\': \'「啊，抱歉～我们是在比赛？」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592513&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7c3a9c9e-f538-4700-ac38-b40ceb6c1fe4\', \'multiverseId\': 592513}, \'multiverseid\': 592513}]', '[{\'name\': \'Klagender Ghul\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Klagende Ghul ins Spiel kommt, millst du zwei Karten. (Lege die obersten zwei Karten deiner Bibliothek auf deinen Friedhof.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Zombie\', \'flavor\': \'„Verzage nicht, geliebter Bruder. Hilfe ist unterwegs."\\n—Gisa die Ghulruferin\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594145&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'456c07d1-35f1-4215-b6af-582d2eb57f48\', \'multiverseId\': 594145}, \'multiverseid\': 594145}, {\'name\': \'Necrófago quejumbroso\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Necrófago quejumbroso entre al campo de batalla, muele dos cartas. (Pon las dos primeras cartas de tu biblioteca en tu cementerio.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Zombie\', \'flavor\': \'"No te preocupes, hermanito. Ya vienen a ayudarte".\\n—Gisa, la llamamuertos\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594262&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'964400b7-8d8c-4f34-b389-7f32e760ac65\', \'multiverseId\': 594262}, \'multiverseid\': 594262}, {\'name\': \'Goule geignarde\', \'text\': \'Quand la Goule geignarde arrive sur le champ de bataille, meulez deux cartes. (Mettez les deux cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque dans votre cimetière.)\', \'type\': \'Créature : zombie\', \'flavor\': "« Ne t\'inquiète pas, mon frère. Les renforts sont en route. »\\n—Gisa, meneuse de goule", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594379&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d92c687d-1c6f-4cd8-85a3-49897c70eb75\', \'multiverseId\': 594379}, \'multiverseid\': 594379}, {\'name\': \'Ghoul Gemente\', \'text\': \'Quando il Ghoul Gemente entra nel campo di battaglia, macina due carte. (Metti nel tuo cimitero le prime due carte del tuo grimorio.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Zombie\', \'flavor\': \'"Non preoccuparti, caro fratello. Stanno arrivando i soccorsi."\\n—Gisa l\\\'evocaghoul\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594496&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aaa85500-519a-4e89-8425-dd307c6424fc\', \'multiverseId\': 594496}, \'multiverseid\': 594496}, {\'name\': \'嘆きのグール\', \'text\': \'嘆きのグールが戦場に出たとき、カード２枚を切削する。（あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード２枚をあなたの墓地に置く。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ゾンビ\', \'flavor\': \'「心配ないわよ、ゲラルフ。助けならすぐに来るわ。」\\n――グール呼びのギサ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594613&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5280f879-2660-48ef-b5dd-4a94b7d81e45\', \'multiverseId\': 594613}, \'multiverseid\': 594613}, {\'name\': \'悲号食尸鬼\', \'text\': \'当悲号食尸鬼进战场时，磨两张牌。（将你牌库顶的两张牌置入你的坟墓场。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～灵俑\', \'flavor\': \'「别担心，亲爱的弟弟。帮手马上就来了。」\\n～尸鬼牧者基沙\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594964&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e9b2616a-a210-4a36-bb3f-5f9efc1034a3\', \'multiverseId\': 594964}, \'multiverseid\': 594964}]', '[{\'name\': \'Klaue des Schmerzes\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn eine Quelle außer der Klaue des Schmerzes, die du kontrollierst, einem Gegner Schaden zufügt, lege eine Ladungsmarke auf die Klaue des Schmerzes.\\n{X}, {T}, entferne X Ladungsmarken von der Klaue des Schmerzes: Sie fügt einem Ziel deiner Wahl X Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596303&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1c3521a1-16fe-4f7d-9018-98cffd48059f\', \'multiverseId\': 596303}, \'multiverseid\': 596303}, {\'name\': \'Garra del dolor\', \'text\': \'Siempre que una fuente que controlas que no sea la Garra del dolor haga daño a un oponente, pon un contador de carga sobre la Garra del dolor.\\n{X}, {T}, remover X contadores de carga de la Garra del dolor: Hace X puntos de daño a cualquier objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596390&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6c712eff-1d8b-4777-965d-75144c20c78f\', \'multiverseId\': 596390}, \'multiverseid\': 596390}, {\'name\': \'Ergot de souffrance\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'une source que vous contrôlez, autre que l\'Ergot de souffrance, inflige des blessures à un adversaire, mettez un marqueur « charge » sur l\'Ergot de souffrance.\\n{X}, {T}, retirez X marqueurs « charge » de l\'Ergot de souffrance : Il inflige X blessures à n\'importe quelle cible.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596477&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0a417bb8-968b-4317-ad79-013def17cf6a\', \'multiverseId\': 596477}, \'multiverseid\': 596477}, {\'name\': \'Artiglio del Dolore\', \'text\': "Ogniqualvolta una fonte che controlli diversa dall\'Artiglio del Dolore infligge danno a un avversario, metti un segnalino carica sull\'Artiglio del Dolore.\\n{X}, {T}, Rimuovi X segnalini carica dall\'Artiglio del Dolore: Infligge X danni a un qualsiasi bersaglio.", \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596564&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4c7cf316-2f17-4a2a-9449-fbde9f3bfba5\', \'multiverseId\': 596564}, \'multiverseid\': 596564}, {\'name\': \'苦痛の鉤爪\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしていて苦痛の鉤爪でない発生源１つが対戦相手にダメージを与えるたび、苦痛の鉤爪の上に蓄積カウンター１個を置く。\\n{X},{T},苦痛の鉤爪の上から蓄積カウンターＸ個を取り除く：クリーチャーやプレインズウォーカーやプレイヤーのうち１つを対象とする。これはそれにＸ点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596651&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bef16417-eb00-4983-8404-590caed03acf\', \'multiverseId\': 596651}, \'multiverseid\': 596651}, {\'name\': \'苦楚秘爪\', \'text\': \'每当一个苦楚秘爪以外由你操控的来源向任一对手造成伤害时，在苦楚秘爪上放置一个充电指示物。\\n{X}，{T}，从苦楚秘爪上移去X个充电指示物：它对任意一个目标造成X点伤害。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596912&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5c9e51e4-ef3f-4430-b89a-03d848129d7a\', \'multiverseId\': 596912}, \'multiverseid\': 596912}]', '[{\'name\': \'Klinge des Helden\', \'text\': \'Die ausgerüstete Kreatur erhält +3/+2.\\nImmer wenn eine legendäre Kreatur unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, kannst du die Klinge des Helden an sie anlegen.\\nAusrüsten {4} ({4}: Lege diese Karte an eine Kreatur deiner Wahl an, die du kontrollierst. Spiele Ausrüsten wie eine Hexerei.)\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Ausrüstung\', \'flavor\': \'Die besten Schwerter werden mit Drachenfeuer geschmiedet.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596280&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'26a7bb30-ca30-4cba-8f85-b3e235ea45f3\', \'multiverseId\': 596280}, \'multiverseid\': 596280}, {\'name\': \'Acero del héroe\', \'text\': \'La criatura equipada obtiene +3/+2.\\nSiempre que una criatura legendaria entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, puedes anexarle el Acero del héroe.\\nEquipar {4}. ({4}: Anexa este Equipo a la criatura objetivo que controlas. Activa la habilidad de equipar como un conjuro.)\', \'type\': \'Artefacto — Equipo\', \'flavor\': \'Las mejores espadas están forjadas con fuegodragón.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596367&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a009a623-ef1d-4941-9469-1973f2eb775a\', \'multiverseId\': 596367}, \'multiverseid\': 596367}, {\'name\': \'Lame du héros\', \'text\': "La créature équipée gagne +3/+2.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'une créature légendaire arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, vous pouvez lui attacher la Lame du héros.\\nÉquipement {4} ({4} : Attachez à une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez. N\'attachez l\'équipement que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.)", \'type\': \'Artefact : équipement\', \'flavor\': \'Les meilleures épées sont forgées dans le feu des dragons.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596454&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'033a79de-e73c-4fe1-8e2b-5c7c2ed3ff43\', \'multiverseId\': 596454}, \'multiverseid\': 596454}, {\'name\': "Lama dell\'Eroe", \'text\': "La creatura equipaggiata prende +3/+2.\\nOgniqualvolta una creatura leggendaria entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, puoi assegnarle la Lama dell\'Eroe.\\nEquipaggiare {4} ({4}: Assegna a una creatura bersaglio che controlli. Equipaggia solo come una stregoneria.)", \'type\': \'Artefatto — Equipaggiamento\', \'flavor\': \'Le spade migliori sono forgiate con fuoco draconico.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596541&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bc95c20a-bd75-4c0b-8979-1500079b7b44\', \'multiverseId\': 596541}, \'multiverseid\': 596541}, {\'name\': \'英雄の刃\', \'text\': \'装備しているクリーチャーは＋３/＋２の修整を受ける。\\n伝説のクリーチャー１体があなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、あなたは英雄の刃をそれにつけてもよい。\\n装備{4}（{4}：あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。これをそれにつける。装備はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。）\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 装備品\', \'flavor\': \'最高の剣は龍火によって鍛えられる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596628&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c1dc70fc-b103-4da0-9d96-6c480e7060d5\', \'multiverseId\': 596628}, \'multiverseid\': 596628}, {\'name\': \'英雄宝刃\', \'text\': \'佩带此武具的生物得+3/+2。\\n每当一个传奇生物在你的操控下进战场时，你可以将英雄宝刃贴附在其上。\\n佩带{4}（{4}：贴附在目标由你操控的生物上。只能于法术时机佩带。）\', \'type\': \'神器 ～武具\', \'flavor\': \'最好的剑刃乃是经龙炎锤炼而成。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596889&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'18fc399d-b0b9-400e-9860-d530b35ec374\', \'multiverseId\': 596889}, \'multiverseid\': 596889}]', '[{\'name\': \'Klippenstadt-Retterin\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nWenn die Klippenstadt-Retterin ins Spiel kommt, bringe eine Kreaturenkarte deiner Wahl mit Manabetrag 3 oder weniger aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurück.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Geist, Kleriker\', \'flavor\': \'Sanfte Hände aus Stein retten die Unvorsichtigen aus den zerfallenden Ruinen von Klippenstadt.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591632&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'15ff9a8e-53be-4da2-b106-73d7a19cc82b\', \'multiverseId\': 591632}, \'multiverseid\': 591632}, {\'name\': \'Rescatadora de Barrancolumna\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nCuando la Rescatadora de Barrancolumna entre al campo de batalla, regresa la carta de criatura objetivo con valor de maná de 3 o menos de tu cementerio a tu mano.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Clérigo espíritu\', \'flavor\': \'Unas cálidas manos de piedra socorren a los descuidados de las ruinas de Barrancolumna.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591761&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ac57d378-666b-4ed2-be4e-63a985f58225\', \'multiverseId\': 591761}, \'multiverseid\': 591761}, {\'name\': \'Sauveteur de Piliescarpe\', \'text\': \'Vol\\nQuand le Sauveteur de Piliescarpe arrive sur le champ de bataille, renvoyez une carte de créature ciblée avec une valeur de mana inférieure ou égale à 3 depuis votre cimetière dans votre main.\', \'type\': \'Créature : esprit et clerc\', \'flavor\': "Des mains de pierre délicates rattrapent les imprudents s\'aventurant dans les ruines croulantes de Piliescarpe.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591890&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3144d921-1ade-4d43-8e82-9346948d8c21\', \'multiverseId\': 591890}, \'multiverseid\': 591890}, {\'name\': \'Soccorso di Piccorupe\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nQuando il Soccorso di Piccorupe entra nel campo di battaglia, riprendi in mano dal tuo cimitero una carta creatura bersaglio con valore di mana pari o inferiore a 3.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Chierico Spirito\', \'flavor\': \'Gentili mani di pietra portano in salvo gli incauti dalle rovine pericolanti di Piccorupe.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592019&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2bac3213-3079-4930-b9b2-aab40a47d976\', \'multiverseId\': 592019}, \'multiverseid\': 592019}, {\'name\': \'柱落としの救助者\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n柱落としの救助者が戦場に出たとき、あなたの墓地にありマナ総量が３以下であるクリーチャー・カード１枚を対象とする。それをあなたの手札に戻す。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — スピリット・クレリック\', \'flavor\': \'崩れる柱落としの遺跡から優しい石の手がうっかり者を素早く運び出した。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592148&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'84cad068-8b1e-4ccf-ba0b-003d3dba0655\', \'multiverseId\': 592148}, \'multiverseid\': 592148}, {\'name\': \'避柱救援灵\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n当避柱救援灵进战场时，将目标法术力值等于或小于3的生物牌从你坟墓场移回你手上。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～精怪／僧侣\', \'flavor\': \'石头伸出手臂，轻巧而迅速地将粗心者带离摇摇欲坠的避柱遗迹。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592535&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'021d0852-32c7-4477-9761-5770207f1474\', \'multiverseId\': 592535}, \'multiverseid\': 592535}]', '[{\'name\': \'Knochenpicker\', \'text\': \'Dieser Zauberspruch kostet beim Wirken {3} weniger, falls in diesem Zug eine Kreatur gestorben ist.\\nFliegend, Todesberührung\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vogel\', \'flavor\': \'Sie sind das Begrüßungskomitee, das jeden Abtrünnigen auf seinem Weg ins Exil empfängt.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594040&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'494b3f2d-16c8-431c-afde-2e9b4ece5d21\', \'multiverseId\': 594040}, \'multiverseid\': 594040}, {\'name\': \'Buscadespojos\', \'text\': \'Te cuesta {3} menos lanzar este hechizo si una criatura murió este turno.\\nVuela, toque mortal.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ave\', \'flavor\': \'Son los primeros en dar la bienvenida a los disidentes en su camino al exilio.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594157&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'22d25fbf-f07f-4a44-a53f-acdb9cd7dea8\', \'multiverseId\': 594157}, \'multiverseid\': 594157}, {\'name\': "Glaneur d\'os", \'text\': \'Ce sort coûte {3} de moins à lancer si une créature est morte ce tour-ci.\\nVol, contact mortel\', \'type\': \'Créature : oiseau\', \'flavor\': "Ils sont les premiers à accueillir les dissidents sur la route de l\'exil.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594274&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ae4f09c5-7db9-4bd9-acb5-248d53d9768b\', \'multiverseId\': 594274}, \'multiverseid\': 594274}, {\'name\': \'Spolpaossa\', \'text\': \'Questa magia costa {3} in meno per essere lanciata se è morta una creatura in questo turno.\\nVolare, tocco letale\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Uccello\', \'flavor\': "Sono i primi ad accogliere i dissenzienti in viaggio verso l\'esilio.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594391&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1390decd-0e3e-49cf-afee-f6b72c5c72f6\', \'multiverseId\': 594391}, \'multiverseid\': 594391}, {\'name\': \'ホネツツキ\', \'text\': \'このターンにクリーチャーが死亡していたなら、この呪文を唱えるためのコストは{3}少なくなる。\\n飛行、接死\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 鳥\', \'flavor\': \'流刑地への旅で造反者を最初に出迎えるのはホネツツキだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594508&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d1334962-18f3-4da1-aa9a-18616644feab\', \'multiverseId\': 594508}, \'multiverseid\': 594508}, {\'name\': \'食骨鸟\', \'text\': \'如果本回合中有生物死去，则此咒语减少{3}来施放。\\n飞行，死触\', \'type\': \'生物 ～鸟\', \'flavor\': \'它们是逆徒在流放路途中的首批访客。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594859&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5be39c78-1d0c-4507-aef8-450921c00f32\', \'multiverseId\': 594859}, \'multiverseid\': 594859}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kohlegeborenes Wesen\', \'text\': \'{2}{R}: Das Kohlegeborene Wesen fügt einem Kreaturenspielstein, Spieler oder Planeswalker deiner Wahl 1 Schadenspunkt zu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elementarwesen\', \'flavor\': \'Der Schmied vergaß, die Esse zu füttern, also fütterte die Esse sich selbst.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589637&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9659b8f2-c4dd-4c2e-aa6c-eb43cf95b457\', \'multiverseId\': 589637}, \'multiverseid\': 589637}, {\'name\': \'Ente nacido de las ascuas\', \'text\': \'{2}{R}: El Ente nacido de las ascuas hace 1 punto de daño a la ficha de criatura, jugador o planeswalker objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elemental\', \'flavor\': \'El herrero se olvidó de avivar la forja, así que la forja se avivó a sí misma.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589688&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'93effaaa-6091-4bfc-a541-41da7f4ef2e0\', \'multiverseId\': 589688}, \'multiverseid\': 589688}, {\'name\': \'Entité née du charbon\', \'text\': "{2}{R} : L\'Entité née du charbon inflige 1 blessure à une cible, jeton de créature, joueur ou planeswalker.", \'type\': \'Créature : élémental\', \'flavor\': "Le forgeron oublia d\'alimenter la forge, alors la forge s\'alimenta seule.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589739&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7b5192d1-3a01-45fd-ba68-4d966b945ac1\', \'multiverseId\': 589739}, \'multiverseid\': 589739}, {\'name\': \'Entità Bracigena\', \'text\': "{2}{R}: L\'Entità Bracigena infligge 1 danno a una pedina creatura, a un giocatore o a un planeswalker bersaglio.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Elementale\', \'flavor\': \'Il fabbro dimenticò di alimentare la fucina, così si alimentò da sola.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589790&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c289d65f-4e51-47dd-a40e-adad4d53ee17\', \'multiverseId\': 589790}, \'multiverseid\': 589790}, {\'name\': \'石炭生まれの精体\', \'text\': \'{2}{R}：クリーチャー・トークンやプレイヤーやプレインズウォーカーのうち１つを対象とする。石炭生まれの精体はそれに１点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エレメンタル\', \'flavor\': \'鍛冶屋が炉に燃料を足し忘れたので、炉は自ら燃料を貪った。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589841&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0026c3b6-4d41-44c7-8858-f80bff1a69e6\', \'multiverseId\': 589841}, \'multiverseid\': 589841}, {\'name\': \'煤火灵\', \'text\': \'{2}{R}：煤火灵对目标衍生生物，牌手或鹏洛客造成1点伤害。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～元素\', \'flavor\': \'铁匠忘了给锻炉加火，锻炉便自己生火。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589994&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'41f8ac6d-6cb5-4dc9-a9f4-e2d692e7a6a8\', \'multiverseId\': 589994}, \'multiverseid\': 589994}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kohlenschlepp-Schwein\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn dem Kohlenschlepp-Schwein Schaden zugefügt wird, fügt es jedem Spieler entsprechend viele Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Wildschwein, Bestie\', \'flavor\': \'Nichts kann die Industrien Ravnicas stoppen — und erst Recht die Sicherheit ihrer Arbeiter nicht.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590224&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9eee8bc7-35b2-4709-baf5-7b51488703fb\', \'multiverseId\': 590224}, \'multiverseid\': 590224}, {\'name\': \'Puerco cargador de carbón\', \'text\': \'Siempre que el Puerco cargador de carbón reciba daño, hace esa misma cantidad de daño a cada jugador.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bestia jabalí\', \'flavor\': \'Nada detiene a la industria en Rávnica… y menos aún la seguridad de los trabajadores.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590359&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9a15c0b5-05db-4b9f-bcf6-15557be7f142\', \'multiverseId\': 590359}, \'multiverseid\': 590359}, {\'name\': \'Cochon tirecharbon\', \'text\': \'À chaque fois que le Cochon tirecharbon subit des blessures, il inflige autant de blessures à chaque joueur.\', \'type\': \'Créature : sanglier et bête\', \'flavor\': "Rien n\'arrête l\'industrie dans Ravnica — et certainement pas la sécurité de ses ouvriers.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590494&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a4c4f7de-52ba-4ec3-9437-dbaa5c08d6d5\', \'multiverseId\': 590494}, \'multiverseid\': 590494}, {\'name\': \'Verro Scagliacarbone\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta viene inflitto danno al Verro Scagliacarbone, esso infligge altrettanti danni a ogni giocatore.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Bestia Cinghiale\', \'flavor\': \'Niente può rallentare le fabbriche di Ravnica; di sicuro non la sicurezza dei suoi operai.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590629&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'036e5f5d-ac20-4bae-88e0-1c90c64c5993\', \'multiverseId\': 590629}, \'multiverseid\': 590629}, {\'name\': \'石炭運びの豚\', \'text\': \'石炭運びの豚がダメージを受けるたび、これは各プレイヤーにその点数に等しい点数のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 猪・ビースト\', \'flavor\': \'何ものもラヴニカの工業をとめることはできない――労働者の安全などもってのほかだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590764&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9f413c04-64f4-4234-afa7-dda6b5e07d2b\', \'multiverseId\': 590764}, \'multiverseid\': 590764}, {\'name\': \'负煤猪\', \'text\': \'每当负煤猪受到伤害时，它对每位牌手各造成等量的伤害。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～野猪／野兽\', \'flavor\': \'什么都挡不住拉尼卡的工业进展～更别说其工人的安全问题。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591169&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b9f41761-8594-44c0-ba6a-49e0d0b0f199\', \'multiverseId\': 591169}, \'multiverseid\': 591169}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kolossale Erhabenheit\', \'text\': \'Zu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments und falls du eine Kreatur mit Stärke 4 oder mehr kontrollierst, ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„Wow, es ist sogar *noch größer*, als ich dachte! Beeindruckend!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597116&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'85dc23f4-d660-4928-9a89-90fff0ebea89\', \'multiverseId\': 597116}, \'multiverseid\': 597116}, {\'name\': \'Majestad colosal\', \'text\': \'Al comienzo de tu mantenimiento, si controlas una criatura con fuerza de 4 o más, roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'"¡Es incluso más grande de lo que pensaba!** ¡Genial!".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597162&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'817ffc05-0a5d-4a64-9e5b-4a24d70113cd\', \'multiverseId\': 597162}, \'multiverseid\': 597162}, {\'name\': \'Majesté colossale\', \'text\': \'Au début de votre entretien, si vous contrôlez une créature de force supérieure ou égale à 4, piochez une carte.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': \'« Il est encore *plus grand* que ce que je pensais ! Génial ! »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597208&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2bb38b3a-c5ee-4cf9-adf0-9cc15c54c452\', \'multiverseId\': 597208}, \'multiverseid\': 597208}, {\'name\': \'Maestà Colossale\', \'text\': "All\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, se controlli una creatura con forza pari o superiore a 4, pesca una carta.", \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'"Wow, è persino *più gigantesco* di quanto pensassi! Fantastico!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597254&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'df7f0c4e-a6c9-485a-9300-11aba8705562\', \'multiverseId\': 597254}, \'multiverseid\': 597254}, {\'name\': \'巨大な威厳\', \'text\': \'あなたのアップキープの開始時に、あなたがパワーが４以上であるクリーチャーをコントロールしている場合、カード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'「わあ！ 想像してたより*ずっと*大きい！すごい！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597300&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a4653751-3263-4272-aed4-522027413cef\', \'multiverseId\': 597300}, \'multiverseid\': 597300}, {\'name\': \'巨兽扬威\', \'text\': \'在你的维持开始时，若你操控力量等于或大于4的生物，则抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'「哇，它比我想的*大多了*！真棒！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597438&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d6353aeb-b313-4f81-8e27-1c73a87c7fa6\', \'multiverseId\': 597438}, \'multiverseid\': 597438}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kolossales Schreckensmaul\', \'text\': \'Verursacht Trampelschaden\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Dinosaurier\', \'flavor\': \'Wenn die Erde bebt, lauf. Wenn du sein Gebrüll vernimmst, flieh. Wenn du in sein Maul starrst, zu spät …\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592839&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7a932167-9cbe-4c15-a915-b3a8f401b221\', \'multiverseId\': 592839}, \'multiverseid\': 592839}, {\'name\': \'Fauces pavorosas colosal\', \'text\': \'Arrolla.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Dinosaurio\', \'flavor\': \'Si sientes que la tierra se mueve, corre. Si escuchas su rugido, huye. Si le ves los dientes... ya es demasiado tarde.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592960&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e040a05d-9fb5-4c8f-9b70-9b5c5d49870c\', \'multiverseId\': 592960}, \'multiverseid\': 592960}, {\'name\': \'Gueuleffroi colossal\', \'text\': \'Piétinement\', \'type\': \'Créature : dinosaure\', \'flavor\': "Si vous sentez la terre trembler, courez. Si vous entendez son cri, fuyez. Si vous voyez ses dents, c\'est qu\'il est déjà trop tard.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593081&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'39fda490-53d5-439a-89d1-870fb439c4da\', \'multiverseId\': 593081}, \'multiverseid\': 593081}, {\'name\': \'Fauce del Terrore Colossale\', \'text\': \'Travolgere\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Dinosauro\', \'flavor\': \'Se avverti il terreno tremare, corri. Se senti il suo ruggito, scappa. Se ne vedi i denti, è troppo tardi.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593202&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e9c3ec77-1f7b-46f9-a205-e60afa3af548\', \'multiverseId\': 593202}, \'multiverseid\': 593202}, {\'name\': \'巨大な戦慄大口\', \'text\': \'トランプル\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 恐竜\', \'flavor\': \'大地の揺れを感じたら、逃げろ。鳴き声が聞こえたら、とにかく逃げろ。歯が見えたら、手遅れだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593323&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4dcc7c4f-d023-4d2b-b17f-9814ff53aaf5\', \'multiverseId\': 593323}, \'multiverseid\': 593323}, {\'name\': \'庞巨血口龙\', \'text\': \'践踏\', \'type\': \'生物 ～恐龙\', \'flavor\': \'如果你感到大地震颤，快跑。如果你听到吼声咆哮，快逃。如果你看到利齿现形，晚了。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593686&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7b0b860e-8605-47a9-a19d-cefd094fb71a\', \'multiverseId\': 593686}, \'multiverseid\': 593686}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kothophed der Seelensammler\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nImmer wenn eine bleibende Karte, die ein anderer Spieler besitzt, aus dem Spiel auf einen Friedhof gelegt wird, ziehst du eine Karte und verlierst 1 Lebenspunkt.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Dämon\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich werde dein kritischster Lehrmeister sein, Liliana. Doch ich habe Großes mit dir vor."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594088&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'496980bf-3ad4-4f0e-90f3-6cca07201796\', \'multiverseId\': 594088}, \'multiverseid\': 594088}, {\'name\': \'Kothophed, acaparador de almas\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nSiempre que un permanente propiedad de otro jugador vaya a un cementerio desde el campo de batalla, robas una carta y pierdes 1 vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Demonio\', \'flavor\': \'"Seré el más exigente de tus maestros, Liliana, pero tengo grandes cosas en mente para ti".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594205&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b7549147-b72a-4e82-b240-9c71ae811f0d\', \'multiverseId\': 594205}, \'multiverseid\': 594205}, {\'name\': "Kothophed, thésauriseur d\'âmes", \'text\': "Vol\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'un permanent possédé par un autre joueur est mis dans un cimetière depuis le champ de bataille, vous piochez une carte et vous perdez 1 point de vie.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : démon\', \'flavor\': "« Je serai un maître des plus exigeants, Liliana. Mais j\'ai de grands projets pour toi. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594322&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0d3044b4-14bc-44fb-b116-0984deff6ea0\', \'multiverseId\': 594322}, \'multiverseid\': 594322}, {\'name\': \'Kothophed, Accaparratore di Anime\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nOgniqualvolta un permanente posseduto da un altro giocatore viene messo in un cimitero dal campo di battaglia, peschi una carta e perdi 1 punto vita.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Demone\', \'flavor\': \'"Sarò il tuo maestro più esigente, Liliana, ma ho in mente grandi progetti per te."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594439&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8abf6d95-1dde-4043-bc43-289b7f295e6e\', \'multiverseId\': 594439}, \'multiverseid\': 594439}, {\'name\': \'魂の貯蔵者、コソフェッド\', \'text\': \'飛行\\nあなた以外のプレイヤーがオーナーであるパーマネント１つが戦場から墓地に置かれるたび、あなたはカード１枚を引き、１点のライフを失う。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — デーモン\', \'flavor\': \'「リリアナよ、我はお前にとって厳しい主人となるであろう。だが、我が考えているお前の前途は非常に有望でもある。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594556&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ece3fbcd-7ea0-4bf4-93c8-bc6651aab4b2\', \'multiverseId\': 594556}, \'multiverseid\': 594556}, {\'name\': \'贮魂恶魔柯索非\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n每当一个由其他牌手拥有的永久物从战场进入坟墓场时，你抓一张牌且失去1点生命。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～恶魔\', \'flavor\': \'「我会是你最苛刻的主人，莉莲娜。但我对你有很高的期望。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594907&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'69693ad1-9d29-4bac-b04b-85214b9cd084\', \'multiverseId\': 594907}, \'multiverseid\': 594907}]', "[{'name': 'Kraul-Beutegreifer', 'text': 'Totenwelt — Wenn die Kraul-Beutegreifer ins Spiel kommen, erhältst du für jede Kreaturenkarte in deinem Friedhof 1 Lebenspunkt dazu.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Insekt, Späher', 'flavor': 'Ernähre dich von Verrottung, dann wirst du nie verrotten.\\n—Kraul-Sprichwort', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592881&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'dbe99297-d852-4097-8d81-a09e9f3956c8', 'multiverseId': 592881}, 'multiverseid': 592881}, {'name': 'Recolectores kraul', 'text': 'Despojos — Cuando los Recolectores kraul entren al campo de batalla, ganas 1 vida por cada carta de criatura en tu cementerio.', 'type': 'Criatura — Explorador insecto', 'flavor': 'Si te alimentas de comida, al final te pudrirás. Si te alimentas de podredumbre, vivirás para siempre.\\n—Refrán kraul', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593002&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fe034da4-aed1-405a-8739-0864bee2e6fe', 'multiverseId': 593002}, 'multiverseid': 593002}, {'name': 'Butineurs krauls', 'text': 'Maquis — Quand les Butineurs krauls arrivent sur le champ de bataille, vous gagnez 1 point de vie pour chaque carte de créature dans votre cimetière.', 'type': 'Créature : insecte et éclaireur', 'flavor': 'Mangez de la nourriture, et vous finirez par pourrir. Mangez de la pourriture, et vous vivrez pour toujours.\\n—Dicton kraul', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593123&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6cf0c00f-afb7-4f2b-8318-1b400d83c78a', 'multiverseId': 593123}, 'multiverseid': 593123}, {'name': 'Foraggieri Kraul', 'text': 'Crescita sotterranea — Quando i Foraggieri Kraul entrano nel campo di battaglia, guadagni 1 punto vita per ogni carta creatura nel tuo cimitero.', 'type': 'Creatura — Esploratore Insetto', 'flavor': 'Nutriti di cibo e un giorno marcirai. Nutriti di marciume e vivrai per sempre.\\n—Detto dei Kraul', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593244&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '80ceee3b-22dd-4b5a-90e6-d48882fd9e52', 'multiverseId': 593244}, 'multiverseid': 593244}, {'name': 'クロールの食料隊', 'text': '宿根 ― クロールの食料隊が戦場に出たとき、あなたはあなたの墓地にあるクリーチャー・カード１枚につき１点のライフを得る。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 昆虫・スカウト', 'flavor': '食べ物で生きれば、いずれは腐る。腐り物で生きれば、いのちは永遠。\\n――クロールの諺', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593365&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '071a49bb-2933-493b-a483-0677bd152a29', 'multiverseId': 593365}, 'multiverseid': 593365}, {'name': '刻洛搜粮群', 'text': '朽力～当刻洛搜粮群进战场时，你坟墓场中每有一张生物牌，便获得1点生命。', 'type': '生物 ～昆虫／斥候', 'flavor': '以粮为食，终成腐尸。以腐为食，必得永生。\\n～刻洛谚语', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593728&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '48bdbe7c-252c-4f6b-a4ed-8652574308bd', 'multiverseId': 593728}, 'multiverseid': 593728}]", '[{\'name\': \'Kraul-Harpunier\', \'text\': \'Reichweite\\nTotenwelt — Wenn der Kraul-Harpunier ins Spiel kommt, bestimme bis zu eine Kreatur deiner Wahl mit Flugfähigkeit, die du nicht kontrollierst. Der Kraul-Harpunier erhält bis zum Ende des Zuges +X/+0, wobei X gleich der Anzahl an Kreaturenkarten in deinem Friedhof ist. Dann kannst du den Kraul-Harpunier gegen die bestimmte Kreatur kämpfen lassen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Insekt, Krieger\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592882&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'423e384f-7d28-428f-9792-cc547c343b6e\', \'multiverseId\': 592882}, \'multiverseid\': 592882}, {\'name\': \'Arponeador kraul\', \'text\': \'Alcance.\\nDespojos — Cuando el Arponeador kraul entre al campo de batalla, elige hasta una criatura objetivo con la habilidad de volar que no controlas. El Arponeador kraul obtiene +X/+0 hasta el final del turno, donde X es la cantidad de cartas de criatura en tu cementerio. Luego, puedes hacer que el Arponeador kraul luche contra esa criatura.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero insecto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593003&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'37fbd870-32f5-4111-829e-04f48d77737b\', \'multiverseId\': 593003}, \'multiverseid\': 593003}, {\'name\': \'Harponneur kraul\', \'text\': "Portée\\nMaquis — Quand le Harponneur kraul arrive sur le champ de bataille, choisissez jusqu\'à une créature avec le vol ciblée que vous ne contrôlez pas. Le Harponneur kraul gagne +X/+0 jusqu\'à la fin du tour, X étant le nombre de cartes de créature dans votre cimetière, puis vous pouvez faire que le Harponneur kraul se batte contre cette créature.", \'type\': \'Créature : insecte et guerrier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593124&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'300f866f-f17e-4b2c-a1af-ae30428a64af\', \'multiverseId\': 593124}, \'multiverseid\': 593124}, {\'name\': \'Fiociniere Kraul\', \'text\': \'Raggiungere\\nCrescita sotterranea — Quando il Fiociniere Kraul entra nel campo di battaglia, scegli fino a una creatura bersaglio con volare che non controlli. Il Fiociniere Kraul prende +X/+0 fino alla fine del turno, dove X è il numero di carte creatura nel tuo cimitero, poi puoi far lottare il Fiociniere Kraul con quella creatura.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Insetto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593245&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2d872dfb-5a67-4ac8-900d-a202d76fdeca\', \'multiverseId\': 593245}, \'multiverseid\': 593245}, {\'name\': \'クロールの銛撃ち\', \'text\': \'到達\\n宿根 ― クロールの銛撃ちが戦場に出たとき、あなたがコントロールしておらず飛行を持つクリーチャー最大１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、クロールの銛撃ちは＋Ｘ/＋０の修整を受ける。Ｘはあなたの墓地にあるクリーチャー・カードの枚数に等しい。その後、あなたは「クロールの銛撃ちはそのクリーチャーと格闘を行う。」を選んでもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 昆虫・戦士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593366&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'259070dd-cbae-4bd8-a6a9-d47d6612d651\', \'multiverseId\': 593366}, \'multiverseid\': 593366}, {\'name\': \'刻洛鱼叉手\', \'text\': \'延势\\n朽力～当刻洛鱼叉手进战场时，选择至多一个目标不由你操控且具飞行异能的生物。刻洛鱼叉手得+X/+0直到回合结束，X为你坟墓场中的生物牌数量，然后你可以使刻洛鱼叉手与该生物互斗。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～昆虫／战士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593729&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f1e602a3-6a10-4d1d-ac98-3450f7c3ef2d\', \'multiverseId\': 593729}, \'multiverseid\': 593729}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kraul-Krieger\', \'text\': \'{5}{G}: Der Kraul-Krieger erhält +3/+3 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Insekt, Krieger\', \'flavor\': \'Die insektenartigen Kraul lauern in den Tunneln unter den Straßen. Viele sind dem Golgari-Schwarm ergeben, andere dagegen folgen ihrem eigenen esoterischen Kastensystem.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592883&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d6489674-5dcf-4bb3-a0b3-9cea490caea4\', \'multiverseId\': 592883}, \'multiverseid\': 592883}, {\'name\': \'Guerrero kraul\', \'text\': \'{5}{G}: El Guerrero kraul obtiene +3/+3 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero insecto\', \'flavor\': \'Los insectoides kraul acechan en los túneles bajo las calles. Muchos son leales al Enjambre Golgari, pero otros siguen su propio sistema esotérico de castas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593004&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4fcea351-fa0f-428d-86b4-f59ab3e0b4e8\', \'multiverseId\': 593004}, \'multiverseid\': 593004}, {\'name\': \'Guerrier kraul\', \'text\': "{5}{G} : Le Guerrier kraul gagne +3/+3 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : insecte et guerrier\', \'flavor\': "Les krauls insectoïdes rôdent dans le réseau de galeries qui court sous les rues. Si la plupart ont rallié l\'Essaim de Golgari, certains sont restés fidèles à leur système ésotérique de castes.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593125&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e12a0810-e06e-4ce6-8157-2a5c2cbb48d4\', \'multiverseId\': 593125}, \'multiverseid\': 593125}, {\'name\': \'Guerriero Kraul\', \'text\': \'{5}{G}: Il Guerriero Kraul prende +3/+3 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Insetto\', \'flavor\': \'I kraul insettoidi si annidano nei tunnel sotto il livello della strada. Molti sono fedeli allo Sciame Golgari, ma altri seguono il proprio esoterico sistema delle caste.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593246&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2e03bf52-b8aa-4fd9-82e8-a55b9f2493fb\', \'multiverseId\': 593246}, \'multiverseid\': 593246}, {\'name\': \'クロールの戦士\', \'text\': \'{5}{G}：ターン終了時まで、クロールの戦士は＋３/＋３の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 昆虫・戦士\', \'flavor\': \'昆虫型生物であるクロールは地下のトンネルに潜んでいる。多くはゴルガリ団に忠誠を誓っているが、なかには独自の神秘的な階級体系に従う者もいる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593367&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'43bce671-17ca-46a6-99f1-53660d5944bc\', \'multiverseId\': 593367}, \'multiverseid\': 593367}, {\'name\': \'刻洛战士\', \'text\': \'{5}{G}：刻洛战士得+3/+3直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～昆虫／战士\', \'flavor\': \'虫型的刻洛族潜伏在街道下的隧道。许多都效忠葛加理群落，其他则按照自己的神秘阶级制度过活。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593730&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c1d91fd7-ebbd-48d9-8491-2a732fd7d6ba\', \'multiverseId\': 593730}, \'multiverseid\': 593730}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kraul-Schwarm\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\n{2}{B}, wirf eine Kreaturenkarte ab: Bringe den Kraul-Schwarm aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurück.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Insekt, Krieger\', \'flavor\': \'Der Schwarm hat ein langes Gedächtnis. Er weiß genau, wie jedes Mitglied starb und wem sie deshalb grollen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594089&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5ee531f2-cf21-4314-ab89-c76a443e8af1\', \'multiverseId\': 594089}, \'multiverseid\': 594089}, {\'name\': \'Enjambre kraul\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\n{2}{B}, descartar una carta de criatura: Regresa el Enjambre kraul de tu cementerio a tu mano.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero insecto\', \'flavor\': \'La colmena tiene mucha memoria. Sabe cómo murió cada miembro y a quién debe guardarle rencor.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594206&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'25ef0d9a-692b-415c-afc4-a1076faa8fe4\', \'multiverseId\': 594206}, \'multiverseid\': 594206}, {\'name\': \'Essaim de krauls\', \'text\': "Vol\\n{2}{B}, défaussez-vous d\'une carte de créature : Renvoyez l\'Essaim de krauls depuis votre cimetière dans votre main.", \'type\': \'Créature : insecte et guerrier\', \'flavor\': "L\'essaim a la mémoire longue. Il sait comment chacun de ses anciens membres est mort, et à qui en garder rancune.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594323&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'97d5a366-10f3-4914-87a2-f14108acdb46\', \'multiverseId\': 594323}, \'multiverseid\': 594323}, {\'name\': \'Sciame di Kraul\', \'text\': \'Volare\\n{2}{B}, Scarta una carta creatura: Riprendi in mano lo Sciame di Kraul dal tuo cimitero.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Insetto\', \'flavor\': "L\'alveare ha una memoria indelebile. Sa com\'è morto ognuno dei suoi membri e a chi deve serbare rancore.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594440&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'da7d1662-1085-44f6-adf8-ff24ea0ee877\', \'multiverseId\': 594440}, \'multiverseid\': 594440}, {\'name\': \'クロールの群れ\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n{2}{B},クリーチャー・カード１枚を捨てる：あなたの墓地にあるクロールの群れをあなたの手札に戻す。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 昆虫・戦士\', \'flavor\': \'巣には長い記憶がある。誰がどのように死んだのか、その仇を誰に返せばいいのか、そういうことを巣は知っているのだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594557&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8c5add03-4f1f-433b-9862-1e4d341af8ee\', \'multiverseId\': 594557}, \'multiverseid\': 594557}, {\'name\': \'刻洛虫群\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n{2}{B}，弃一张生物牌：将刻洛虫群从你的坟墓场移回你手上。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～昆虫／战士\', \'flavor\': \'母巢的记性极佳。它清楚每一位成员的死因，以及要寻仇的对象。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594908&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d0930b4d-a7f8-4662-8084-94d4a6a6adf2\', \'multiverseId\': 594908}, \'multiverseid\': 594908}]', "[{'name': 'Kreis der Loyalität', 'text': 'Dieser Zauberspruch kostet beim Wirken für jeden Ritter, den du kontrollierst, {1} weniger.\\nKreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +1/+1.\\nImmer wenn du einen legendären Zauberspruch wirkst, erzeuge einen 2/2 weißen Ritter-Kreaturenspielstein mit Wachsamkeit.\\n{3}{W}, {T}: Erzeuge einen 2/2 weißen Ritter-Kreaturenspielstein mit Wachsamkeit.', 'type': 'Legendäres Artefakt', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591572&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4faeeef5-82ea-4fd4-973e-4298fad2ab7a', 'multiverseId': 591572}, 'multiverseid': 591572}, {'name': 'El Círculo de la Lealtad', 'text': 'Te cuesta {1} menos lanzar este hechizo por cada Caballero que controlas.\\nLas criaturas que controlas obtienen +1/+1.\\nSiempre que lances un hechizo legendario, crea una ficha de criatura Caballero blanca 2/2 con la habilidad de vigilancia.\\n{3}{W}, {T}: Crea una ficha de criatura Caballero blanca 2/2 con la habilidad de vigilancia.', 'type': 'Artefacto legendario', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591701&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4de0569e-2626-41bb-971e-5b16bc1c3a79', 'multiverseId': 591701}, 'multiverseid': 591701}, {'name': 'Le Cercle de Loyauté', 'text': 'Ce sort coûte {1} de moins à lancer pour chaque chevalier que vous contrôlez.\\nLes créatures que vous contrôlez gagnent +1/+1.\\nÀ chaque fois que vous lancez un sort légendaire, créez un jeton de créature 2/2 blanche Chevalier avec la vigilance.\\n{3}{W}, {T} : Créez un jeton de créature 2/2 blanche Chevalier avec la vigilance.', 'type': 'Artefact légendaire', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591830&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e5c69edc-3ca8-4ee0-91ab-d18953499600', 'multiverseId': 591830}, 'multiverseid': 591830}, {'name': 'Il Circolo della Lealtà', 'text': 'Questa magia costa {1} in meno per essere lanciata per ogni Cavaliere che controlli.\\nLe creature che controlli prendono +1/+1.\\nOgniqualvolta lanci una magia leggendaria, crea una pedina creatura Cavaliere 2/2 bianca con cautela.\\n{3}{W}, {T}: Crea una pedina creatura Cavaliere 2/2 bianca con cautela.', 'type': 'Artefatto Leggendario', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591959&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5c1d151a-f564-4160-966f-bc5e2df52c03', 'multiverseId': 591959}, 'multiverseid': 591959}, {'name': '忠誠の円環', 'text': 'この呪文を唱えるためのコストは、あなたがコントロールしている騎士１体につき{1}少なくなる。\\nあなたがコントロールしているすべてのクリーチャーは＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\\nあなたが伝説の呪文を唱えるたび、警戒を持つ白の２/２の騎士・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\\n{3}{W}, {T}：警戒を持つ白の２/２の騎士・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。', 'type': '伝説のアーティファクト', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592088&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bad04ae2-54c3-42d4-966c-cd2a3c6a3bf9', 'multiverseId': 592088}, 'multiverseid': 592088}, {'name': '忠诚焰圈', 'text': '你每操控一个骑士，此咒语便减少{1}来施放。\\n由你操控的生物得+1/+1。\\n每当你施放传奇咒语时，派出一个2/2白色，具警戒异能的骑士衍生生物。\\n{3}{W}，{T}：派出一个2/2白色，具警戒异能的骑士衍生生物。', 'type': '传奇神器', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592475&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8d4b3911-4c87-4627-8d47-c71a69d4e35f', 'multiverseId': 592475}, 'multiverseid': 592475}]", "[{'name': 'Kreischende Mandrille', 'text': 'Wühlen (Mit jeder Karte, die du aus deinem Friedhof ins Exil schickst, während du diesen Zauberspruch wirkst, bezahlst du {1} seiner Kosten.)\\nVerursacht Trampelschaden', 'type': 'Kreatur — Menschenaffe', 'flavor': 'Wer in das Gebiet der Sultai eindringt, endet meist als Krokodilimbiss oder Pavianköder.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592870&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a4e9b890-c159-4547-a8b8-78f6970b8419', 'multiverseId': 592870}, 'multiverseid': 592870}, {'name': 'Mandriles vociferantes', 'text': 'Excavar. (Cada carta que exilies de tu cementerio al lanzar este hechizo cuenta como un pago de {1}.)\\nArrolla.', 'type': 'Criatura — Simio', 'flavor': 'Los que penetran en territorio sultai suelen acabar como merienda de cocodrilos o como cebo para babuinos.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592991&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '98aab9eb-d0fa-46a3-a8f5-cf77f7f76500', 'multiverseId': 592991}, 'multiverseid': 592991}, {'name': 'Mandrills hurleurs', 'text': 'Fouille (Chaque carte que vous exilez depuis votre cimetière en lançant ce sort paie {1}.)\\nPiétinement', 'type': 'Créature : grand singe', 'flavor': 'Les intrus découverts en territoire Sultaï finissent généralement en nourriture pour crocodile ou en appât à babouin.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593112&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5c8bfad4-75b8-4599-b95c-076cb8dd0181', 'multiverseId': 593112}, 'multiverseid': 593112}, {'name': 'Mandrilli Strillanti', 'text': 'Esumare (Ogni carta che esili dal tuo cimitero mentre lanci questa magia corrisponde al pagamento di {1}.)\\nTravolgere', 'type': 'Creatura — Scimpanzé', 'flavor': 'Gli intrusi nelle terre dei Sultai normalmente diventano cibo per coccodrilli o esche per babbuini.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593233&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3c014c93-2dda-4017-8704-eaa9962c15be', 'multiverseId': 593233}, 'multiverseid': 593233}, {'name': 'わめき騒ぐマンドリル', 'text': '探査（この呪文を唱える段階であなたがあなたの墓地から追放した各カードはそれぞれ{1}を支払う。）\\nトランプル', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 類人猿', 'flavor': 'スゥルタイ領土へ侵入した侵入者たちの多くは、クロコダイルのエサかヒヒたちのおもちゃのいずれかの末路を迎える。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593354&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ea2f823e-719f-4135-bdc8-3d43b879bd21', 'multiverseId': 593354}, 'multiverseid': 593354}, {'name': '高叫山魈', 'text': '掘穴（你于施放此咒语时每从你坟墓场中放逐一张牌，就能为此咒语支付{1}。）\\n践踏', 'type': '生物 ～猿猴', 'flavor': '擅闯苏勒台领地者，最终往往会被拿去喂鳄鱼或逗狒狒。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593717&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5fb2ec75-4d66-46d0-b4c7-f0918477e8f3', 'multiverseId': 593717}, 'multiverseid': 593717}]", '[{\'name\': \'Krenko der Boss\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge X 1/1 rote Goblin-Kreaturenspielsteine, wobei X gleich der Anzahl an Goblins ist, die du kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Goblin, Krieger\', \'flavor\': \'„Er verfügt über ein perverses Charisma, das von Gier geprägt ist. Äußerst gefährlich. Empfehle Zivilmaßnahmen."\\n—Agmand Sarv, Azorius-Husar\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590272&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1fa69bbf-cb01-4484-814d-b24ba19237ed\', \'multiverseId\': 590272}, \'multiverseid\': 590272}, {\'name\': \'Krenko, jefe de turba\', \'text\': \'{T}: Crea X fichas de criatura Trasgo rojas 1/1, donde X es la cantidad de Trasgos que controlas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Guerrero trasgo\', \'flavor\': \'"Muestra un carisma perverso alimentado por la avaricia. Muy peligroso. Se recomiendan sanciones civiles".\\n—Agmand Sarv, húsar azorio\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590407&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3cce099b-486f-4d05-bf85-866cc9032a6d\', \'multiverseId\': 590407}, \'multiverseid\': 590407}, {\'name\': \'Krenko le caïd\', \'text\': \'{T} : Créez X jetons de créature 1/1 rouge Gobelin, X étant le nombre de gobelins que vous contrôlez.\', \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : gobelin et guerrier\', \'flavor\': "« Il projette un charisme pervers brûlant d\'avarice. Très dangereux. Je recommande des sanctions civiles. »\\n—Agmand Sarv, hussard d\'Azorius", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590542&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8042aefa-02c8-4d6a-b79c-3941376e3c88\', \'multiverseId\': 590542}, \'multiverseid\': 590542}, {\'name\': \'Krenko, Capocosca\', \'text\': \'{T}: Crea X pedine creatura Goblin 1/1 rosse, dove X è il numero di Goblin che controlli.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Guerriero Goblin\', \'flavor\': \'"Dimostra un perverso carisma alimentato dall\\\'avarizia. Molto pericoloso. Consigliamo sanzioni civili."\\n—Agmand Sarv, ussaro di Azorius\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590677&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'265ef30e-34a6-42a3-bda3-7a972a56e697\', \'multiverseId\': 590677}, \'multiverseid\': 590677}, {\'name\': \'群衆の親分、クレンコ\', \'text\': \'{T}：赤の１/１のゴブリン・クリーチャー・トークンＸ体を生成する。Ｘは、あなたがコントロールしているゴブリンの数に等しい。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — ゴブリン・戦士\', \'flavor\': \'「彼は強欲のままにねじくれた魅力を放っています。本当に危険です。民事制裁すべきです。」\\n――アゾリウスの騎兵、アグマンド・サーヴ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590812&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f00acf34-d231-468a-9861-8a316ac8ff3e\', \'multiverseId\': 590812}, \'multiverseid\': 590812}, {\'name\': \'暴民头目克仑可\', \'text\': \'{T}：派出X个1/1红色鬼怪衍生生物，X为由你操控的鬼怪数量。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～鬼怪／战士\', \'flavor\': \'「他展现出贪欲加持的堕落魅力。非常危险。建议采民事制裁。」\\n～俄佐立轻骑兵艾门塞夫\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591217&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a280516d-3920-477f-bc39-1ca33727a665\', \'multiverseId\': 591217}, \'multiverseid\': 591217}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kribbeln\', \'text\': \'Zu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments kannst du zwei Karten millen. (Du kannst die obersten zwei Karten deiner Bibliothek auf deinen Friedhof legen.)\\nImmer wenn zum ersten Mal in einem Zug eine oder mehrere Länderkarten von irgendwoher auf deinen Friedhof gelegt werden, erzeuge einen 1/1 grünen Insekten-Kreaturenspielstein.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592841&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6662cc2f-0f34-4557-b749-f6f0e9704d61\', \'multiverseId\': 592841}, \'multiverseid\': 592841}, {\'name\': \'Sensación hormigueante\', \'text\': \'Al comienzo de tu mantenimiento, puedes moler dos cartas. (Puedes poner las dos primeras cartas de tu biblioteca en tu cementerio.)\\nSiempre que una o más cartas de tierra vayan a tu cementerio desde cualquier parte por primera vez cada turno, crea una ficha de criatura Insecto verde 1/1.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592962&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'217fdcc7-afb5-41f0-a7a4-35db0d38b549\', \'multiverseId\': 592962}, \'multiverseid\': 592962}, {\'name\': \'Sensation rampante\', \'text\': "Au début de votre entretien, vous pouvez meuler deux cartes. (Vous pouvez mettre les deux cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque dans votre cimetière.)\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'au moins une carte de terrain est mise dans votre cimetière d\'où qu\'elle vienne pour la première fois à chaque tour, créez un jeton de créature 1/1 verte Insecte.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593083&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cd43604b-8856-4b28-9a56-1a41feeeaf09\', \'multiverseId\': 593083}, \'multiverseid\': 593083}, {\'name\': \'Sensazione Strisciante\', \'text\': "All\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, puoi macinare due carte. (Puoi mettere nel tuo cimitero le prime due carte del tuo grimorio.)\\nOgniqualvolta una o più carte terra vengono messe nel tuo cimitero da qualsiasi zona per la prima volta in ogni turno, crea una pedina creatura Insetto 1/1 verde.", \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593204&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'60ab0355-ff41-49a7-985c-8aedb64a6342\', \'multiverseId\': 593204}, \'multiverseid\': 593204}, {\'name\': \'蟻走感\', \'text\': \'あなたのアップキープの開始時に、あなたはカード２枚を切削してもよい。（あなたのライブラリーの一番にあるカード２枚をあなたの墓地に置いてもよい。）\\n各ターン内で初めて１枚以上の土地・カードがいずこかからあなたの墓地に置かれるたび、緑の１/１の昆虫・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593325&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a83e072c-0d10-48a3-a168-99de458ada09\', \'multiverseId\': 593325}, \'multiverseid\': 593325}, {\'name\': \'蠕爬异感\', \'text\': \'在你的维持开始时，你可以磨两张牌。（你可以将你牌库顶的两张牌置入你的坟墓场。）\\n每当每回合首度有一张或数张地牌从任何区域进入你的坟墓场时，派出一个1/1绿色昆虫衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593688&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5479f769-68b9-4781-87ea-74a7d0397066\', \'multiverseId\': 593688}, \'multiverseid\': 593688}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kriegsnamen-Anwärterin\', \'text\': \'Überfall — Die Kriegsnamen-Anwärterin kommt mit einer +1/+1-Marke ins Spiel, falls du in diesem Zug angegriffen hast.\\nDie Kriegsnamen-Anwärterin kann von Kreaturen mit Stärke 1 oder weniger nicht geblockt werden.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Krieger\', \'flavor\': \'Kein Kampf bedeutet einer Mardu-Kriegerin mehr als der, in dem sie sich ihren Kriegsnamen verdient.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590328&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f79b49dd-054b-448d-8bc6-f38bcaf5cd8a\', \'multiverseId\': 590328}, \'multiverseid\': 590328}, {\'name\': \'Aspirante a nombre bélico\', \'text\': \'Incursión — La Aspirante a nombre bélico entra al campo de batalla con un contador +1/+1 sobre ella si atacaste este turno.\\nLa Aspirante a nombre bélico no puede ser bloqueada por criaturas con fuerza de 1 o menos.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero humano\', \'flavor\': \'No hay batalla que signifique tanto para una guerrera mardu como la que le otorga su nombre bélico.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590463&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'85feb3bf-4793-4012-bbbc-bfe959720e7b\', \'multiverseId\': 590463}, \'multiverseid\': 590463}, {\'name\': \'Aspirante à un nom-de-guerre\', \'text\': "Saccage — L\'Aspirante à un nom-de-guerre arrive sur le champ de bataille avec un marqueur +1/+1 sur elle si vous avez attaqué ce tour-ci.\\nL\'Aspirante à un nom-de-guerre ne peut pas être bloquée par les créatures avec une force inférieure ou égale à 1.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et guerrier\', \'flavor\': "Aucune bataille n\'est plus importante pour une Mardu que celle qui lui confère son nom-de-guerre.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590598&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eea2ec16-a14e-4377-96e1-277fac060a6b\', \'multiverseId\': 590598}, \'multiverseid\': 590598}, {\'name\': \'Aspirante al Nome di Guerra\', \'text\': "Incursione — L\'Aspirante al Nome di Guerra entra nel campo di battaglia con un segnalino +1/+1 se hai attaccato in questo turno.\\nL\'Aspirante al Nome di Guerra non può essere bloccata da creature con forza pari o inferiore a 1.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Umano\', \'flavor\': \'Nessuna battaglia è più importante per una guerriera Mardu di quella in cui conquista il proprio nome di guerra.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590733&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e9f54fd3-32ae-4cb6-8958-2ecabacad95d\', \'multiverseId\': 590733}, \'multiverseid\': 590733}, {\'name\': \'戦名を望む者\', \'text\': \'強襲 ― このターンにあなたが攻撃していたなら、戦名を望む者は＋１/＋１カウンター１個が置かれた状態で戦場に出る。\\n戦名を望む者は、パワーが１以下であるクリーチャーにはブロックされない。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・戦士\', \'flavor\': \'マルドゥの戦士にとって、戦名を与えられる戦い以上に意味を持つ戦いはない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590868&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3fb72c5e-f44a-487e-be3b-9e9abf39981c\', \'multiverseId\': 590868}, \'multiverseid\': 590868}, {\'name\': \'战名求索客\', \'text\': \'突击～如果你本回合中攻击过，则战名求索客进战场时上面有一个+1/+1指示物。\\n战名求索客不能被力量等于或小于1的生物阻挡。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／战士\', \'flavor\': \'对玛尔都战士而言，为其赢得战名的战斗最为难忘。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591273&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c6b0a474-ae28-4ad1-9780-af9d90ab9b40\', \'multiverseId\': 591273}, \'multiverseid\': 591273}]', "[{'name': 'Kriegsschrei-Phoenix', 'text': 'Fliegend, Eile\\nImmer wenn du mit drei oder mehr Kreaturen angreifst, kannst du {2}{R} bezahlen. Falls du dies tust, bringe den Kriegsschrei-Phoenix aus deinem Friedhof getappt und angreifend ins Spiel zurück.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Phoenix', 'flavor': 'Ein einziger Funke kann einen Krieg entzünden.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590329&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '53f91fd4-4f5e-4c9b-a665-cb1be1734877', 'multiverseId': 590329}, 'multiverseid': 590329}, {'name': 'Fénix grito de guerra', 'text': 'Vuela, prisa.\\nSiempre que ataques con tres o más criaturas, puedes pagar {2}{R}. Si lo haces, regresa el Fénix grito de guerra de tu cementerio al campo de batalla girado y atacando.', 'type': 'Criatura — Fénix', 'flavor': 'La guerra comienza con una sola ascua roja.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590464&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '952c8623-b619-4ebf-ba6d-a359f049c09d', 'multiverseId': 590464}, 'multiverseid': 590464}, {'name': 'Phénix au cri de guerre', 'text': 'Vol, célérité\\nÀ chaque fois que vous attaquez avec au moins trois créatures, vous pouvez payer {2}{R}. Si vous faites ainsi, renvoyez le Phénix au cri de guerre sur le champ de bataille, engagé et attaquant, depuis votre cimetière.', 'type': 'Créature : phénix', 'flavor': 'La guerre commence avec un charbon ardent.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590599&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4e903753-0435-4456-804d-71f35d394981', 'multiverseId': 590599}, 'multiverseid': 590599}, {'name': 'Fenice del Grido di Guerra', 'text': 'Volare, rapidità\\nOgniqualvolta attacchi con tre o più creature, puoi pagare {2}{R}. Se lo fai, rimetti sul campo di battaglia la Fenice del Grido di Guerra TAPpata e attaccante dal tuo cimitero.', 'type': 'Creatura — Fenice', 'flavor': 'La guerra divampa con un tizzone ardente.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590734&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ab26579f-980a-457b-aeb3-d49f6a61fec0', 'multiverseId': 590734}, 'multiverseid': 590734}, {'name': '喊声のフェニックス', 'text': '飛行、速攻\\nあなたが３体以上のクリーチャーで攻撃するたび、あなたは{2}{R}を支払ってもよい。そうしたなら、あなたの墓地にある喊声のフェニックスをタップ状態かつ攻撃している状態で戦場に戻す。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — フェニックス', 'flavor': '戦争は一つの赤い燃えさしから始まる。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590869&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bd55d71e-c855-4ef3-8f15-aa3e3a283f99', 'multiverseId': 590869}, 'multiverseid': 590869}, {'name': '战嚎凤凰', 'text': '飞行，敏捷\\n每当你以三个或更多生物攻击时，你可以支付{2}{R}。若你如此作，则将战嚎凤凰从你的坟墓场横置移回战场且正进行攻击。', 'type': '生物 ～凤凰', 'flavor': '一处红色烬火点燃了战争。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591274&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2c303ea6-9331-484f-8e85-25a880f57d4e', 'multiverseId': 591274}, 'multiverseid': 591274}]", '[{\'name\': \'Kryptische Schlange\', \'text\': \'Dieser Zauberspruch kostet beim Wirken für jede Spontanzauber- und Hexereikarte in deinem Friedhof {1} weniger.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Schlange\', \'flavor\': \'Sie schlängelt sich durch die Sinne, umschlingt das Unterbewusstsein und vergiftet den Verstand.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595211&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d16b94d8-f164-4674-94f0-165117d89d3b\', \'multiverseId\': 595211}, \'multiverseid\': 595211}, {\'name\': \'Serpiente críptica\', \'text\': \'Te cuesta {1} menos lanzar este hechizo por cada carta de instantáneo y de conjuro en tu cementerio.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Serpiente\', \'flavor\': \'Se desliza por los sentidos, corrompiendo la conciencia y envenenando la percepción.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595319&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b41aea30-6922-4c04-8837-f7ad7c95beff\', \'multiverseId\': 595319}, \'multiverseid\': 595319}, {\'name\': \'Serpent cryptique\', \'text\': "Ce sort coûte {1} de moins à lancer pour chaque carte d\'éphémère et de rituel dans votre cimetière.", \'type\': \'Créature : grand serpent\', \'flavor\': \'Il ondule dans votre esprit, entravant votre conscience et empoisonnant vos sens.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595427&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a1e31a51-4cc8-4f34-857d-f301950e5078\', \'multiverseId\': 595427}, \'multiverseid\': 595427}, {\'name\': \'Serpe Criptica\', \'text\': \'Questa magia costa {1} in meno per essere lanciata per ogni carta istantaneo e stregoneria nel tuo cimitero.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Serpe\', \'flavor\': \'Inibisce i sensi sinuosamente, soffocando la consapevolezza e avvelenando la percezione.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595535&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a9d6eb53-9053-4bf0-affc-bbb13f83bc42\', \'multiverseId\': 595535}, \'multiverseid\': 595535}, {\'name\': \'謎めいた海蛇\', \'text\': \'この呪文を唱えるためのコストは、あなたの墓地にありインスタントやソーサリーであるカード１枚につき{1}少なくなる。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 海蛇\', \'flavor\': \'そいつは感覚を這い進み、意識を押さえつけ知覚を毒す。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595643&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9f666c10-ee30-4441-92c9-66c146ed9419\', \'multiverseId\': 595643}, \'multiverseid\': 595643}, {\'name\': \'隐密巨蛇\', \'text\': \'你坟墓场中每有一张瞬间与法术牌，此咒语便减少{1}来施放。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～巨蛇\', \'flavor\': \'它能绕过感官，束缩感觉并毒害感知。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595967&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'85deaea5-88b3-466f-aa26-cdd33e35c5a0\', \'multiverseId\': 595967}, \'multiverseid\': 595967}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kujar-Saatformerin\', \'text\': \'Wenn die Kujar-Saatformerin ins Spiel kommt, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elf, Druide\', \'flavor\': \'Jedes Gebäude, jeder Baum und jedes Blatt in Kujar ist so ausgerichtet, dass entsprechend der elfischen Philosophie der Großen Verbindung die größtmögliche Harmonie erzielt wird.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592884&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f86e411b-450d-4bcd-82ef-8359ad408cb8\', \'multiverseId\': 592884}, \'multiverseid\': 592884}, {\'name\': \'Esculpesemillas de Kujar\', \'text\': \'Cuando la Esculpesemillas de Kujar entre al campo de batalla, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre la criatura objetivo que controlas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Druida elfo\', \'flavor\': \'Cada hoja, árbol y edificio de Kujar están colocados para infundir la máxima armonía, de acuerdo con la filosofía élfica conocida como la Panconexión.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593005&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7dc046ed-bac7-4eb8-896c-52829d1dc0e8\', \'multiverseId\': 593005}, \'multiverseid\': 593005}, {\'name\': \'Entailleuse de graine de Kujar\', \'text\': "Quand l\'Entailleuse de graine de Kujar arrive sur le champ de bataille, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez.", \'type\': \'Créature : elfe et druide\', \'flavor\': "L\'emplacement de chaque feuille, chaque arbre et chaque édifice de Kujar a été choisi pour atteindre l\'harmonie parfaite décrite dans la philosophie elfe du Grand conduit.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593126&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6976d1cd-35f4-46be-b8f3-99ca7f44b54f\', \'multiverseId\': 593126}, \'multiverseid\': 593126}, {\'name\': \'Plasmasemi di Kujar\', \'text\': \'Quando la Plasmasemi di Kujar entra nel campo di battaglia, metti un segnalino +1/+1 su una creatura bersaglio che controlli.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Druido Elfo\', \'flavor\': "Le foglie, gli alberi e gli edifici di Kujar sono tutti stati collocati per favorire l\'armonia, in base ai dettami della filosofia elfica del Grande Flusso.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593247&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d2ae0ade-af69-4c3a-9313-abb657920764\', \'multiverseId\': 593247}, \'multiverseid\': 593247}, {\'name\': \'クジャールの種子彫刻家\', \'text\': \'クジャールの種子彫刻家が戦場に出たとき、あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。それの上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルフ・ドルイド\', \'flavor\': \'クジャールでは、木々も葉も建物も最大の調和をもたらすように、大導路と呼ばれるエルフの哲学に基づいて配置されている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593368&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'05f349f1-6c97-4491-813f-f67cabde1ad3\', \'multiverseId\': 593368}, \'multiverseid\': 593368}, {\'name\': \'库贾塑碧匠\', \'text\': \'当库贾塑碧匠进战场时，在目标由你操控的生物上放置一个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～妖精／德鲁伊\', \'flavor\': \'库贾的每片叶子，每棵树和每栋建筑都依称为大通联的妖精哲学安排，达到完美和谐。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593731&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'261adff6-ff47-4efe-b495-be213abbb677\', \'multiverseId\': 593731}, \'multiverseid\': 593731}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kuldothas Feuerunhold\', \'text\': \'Wenn Kuldothas Feuerunhold ins Spiel kommt, kannst du ein Artefakt opfern. Falls du dies tust, fügt Kuldothas Feuerunhold 4 Schadenspunkte zu, deren Aufteilung auf eine beliebige Anzahl an Zielen deiner Wahl du bestimmst.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elementarwesen\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590273&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7953f7f3-b954-44dc-bd71-7042295c9c4a\', \'multiverseId\': 590273}, \'multiverseid\': 590273}, {\'name\': \'Demonio flameante de Kuldotha\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Demonio flameante de Kuldotha entre al campo de batalla, puedes sacrificar un artefacto. Si lo haces, el Demonio flameante de Kuldotha hace 4 puntos de daño divididos como elijas entre cualquier cantidad de objetivos.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elemental\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590408&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aaa98f4d-2b1f-4c89-9c33-8f15b16840ff\', \'multiverseId\': 590408}, \'multiverseid\': 590408}, {\'name\': \'Fiellefeu de Kuldotha\', \'text\': "Quand le Fiellefeu de Kuldotha arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez sacrifier un artefact. Si vous faites ainsi, le Fiellefeu de Kuldotha inflige 4 blessures réparties comme vous le désirez entre n\'importe quel nombre de cibles.", \'type\': \'Créature : élémental\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590543&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9eb61d42-8990-425c-bd22-a8eb64f51501\', \'multiverseId\': 590543}, \'multiverseid\': 590543}, {\'name\': \'Demone di Fiamme di Kuldotha\', \'text\': \'Quando il Demone di Fiamme di Kuldotha entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi sacrificare un artefatto. Se lo fai, il Demone di Fiamme di Kuldotha infligge 4 danni divisi a tua scelta tra un qualsiasi numero di bersagli.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Elementale\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590678&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d81a44c2-2948-4e2b-a10f-0fa2dc980a5d\', \'multiverseId\': 590678}, \'multiverseid\': 590678}, {\'name\': \'カルドーサの炎魔\', \'text\': \'カルドーサの炎魔が戦場に出たとき、クリーチャーやプレインズウォーカーやプレイヤーのうち望む数を対象とし、４点分をあなたの望むように割り振る。あなたはアーティファクト１つを生け贄に捧げてもよい。そうしたなら、カルドーサの炎魔はそれらにその割り振った点数のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エレメンタル\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590813&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d373c23b-1c26-47d6-bcfa-215d8d638671\', \'multiverseId\': 590813}, \'multiverseid\': 590813}, {\'name\': \'库度沙炎魔\', \'text\': \'当库度沙炎魔进战场时，你可以牺牲一个神器。若你如此作，则库度沙炎魔对任意数量的目标造成共4点伤害，你可以任意分配。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～元素\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591218&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cda77aed-6a1f-4370-9337-2aa15a79ca9f\', \'multiverseId\': 591218}, \'multiverseid\': 591218}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kultivieren\', \'text\': \'Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach bis zu zwei Standardland-Karten, zeige sie offen vor, bringe eine davon getappt ins Spiel, nimm die andere auf deine Hand und mische danach.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Alle Samen haben eine Verbindung zueinander, die durch die Unendlichkeit hindurch reicht.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592843&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'449d5ea9-2875-4c6f-8ad0-a59758fce02e\', \'multiverseId\': 592843}, \'multiverseid\': 592843}, {\'name\': \'Cultivar\', \'text\': \'Busca en tu biblioteca hasta dos cartas de tierra básica, muéstralas, pon una de ellas en el campo de batalla girada y la otra en tu mano. Luego baraja.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Todas las semillas comparten un lazo, llamándose entre ellas a través del infinito.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592964&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'59515f50-466a-497c-a3e9-b0b9e0b46263\', \'multiverseId\': 592964}, \'multiverseid\': 592964}, {\'name\': \'Culture\', \'text\': "Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque jusqu\'à deux cartes de terrain de base, révélez ces cartes, mettez-en une sur le champ de bataille engagée et l\'autre dans votre main, puis mélangez.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Toutes les graines partagent un lien les reliant à travers l\'infini.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593085&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fa05c33d-ea65-4d7b-8b9c-594bdcc4bd07\', \'multiverseId\': 593085}, \'multiverseid\': 593085}, {\'name\': \'Coltivare\', \'text\': "Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per trovare fino a due carte terra base, rivelale, mettine una sul campo di battaglia TAPpata e aggiungi l\'altra alla tua mano, poi rimescola.", \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': "Tutti i semi condividono un legame comune, chiamandosi l\'un l\'altro nello spazio infinito.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593206&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'09ed1988-219f-444a-8b42-425c3ad338bf\', \'multiverseId\': 593206}, \'multiverseid\': 593206}, {\'name\': \'耕作\', \'text\': \'あなたのライブラリーから基本土地・カード最大２枚を探し、公開し、そのうち１枚をタップ状態で戦場に、もう１枚をあなたの手札に加える。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'全ての種には繋がりがあり、互いを無限の彼方から呼び合う。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593327&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'380bb0c1-74c1-4cfc-8c29-fb5f9dc8bd9e\', \'multiverseId\': 593327}, \'multiverseid\': 593327}, {\'name\': \'栽培\', \'text\': \'从你牌库中搜寻至多两张基本地牌，展示这些牌，将一张横置放进战场，另一张则置于你手上，然后洗牌。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'所有种子都互相连结成一体，永远地彼此呼唤着。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593690&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a8b59d88-68b9-45c8-a811-8df5efaac54a\', \'multiverseId\': 593690}, \'multiverseid\': 593690}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kundiger der Gasse der Weisen\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Kundige der Gasse der Weisen ins Spiel kommt, wende Hellsicht 2 an. (Schaue dir die obersten zwei Karten deiner Bibliothek an. Du kannst eine beliebige Anzahl davon unter deine Bibliothek legen und den Rest in beliebiger Reihenfolge oben darauf.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vedalken, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': \'Ravnicas Straßen sind voller ehemaliger Gildenmitglieder, die ihre Fähigkeiten zum persönlichen Vorteil nutzen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595267&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a2b6e0c8-bab3-49da-b0fc-0afc8c935347\', \'multiverseId\': 595267}, \'multiverseid\': 595267}, {\'name\': \'Espabilado de la Calle del Sabio\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Espabilado de la Calle del Sabio entre al campo de batalla, adivina 2. (Mira las dos primeras cartas de tu biblioteca, luego pon cualquier cantidad de ellas en el fondo de tu biblioteca y el resto en la parte superior en cualquier orden.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero vedalken\', \'flavor\': \'Las calles de Rávnica están llenas de antiguos miembros de gremios que ahora utilizan sus habilidades institucionales en beneficio propio.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595375&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'afa31094-7387-452c-a973-9d5a7fef61ea\', \'multiverseId\': 595375}, \'multiverseid\': 595375}, {\'name\': \'Savant du rang du Sage\', \'text\': "Quand le Savant du rang du Sage arrive sur le champ de bataille, regard 2. (Regardez les deux cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Mettez n\'importe quel nombre d\'entre elles au-dessous de votre bibliothèque et le reste, au-dessus, dans l\'ordre de votre choix.)", \'type\': \'Créature : vedalken et sorcier\', \'flavor\': "Les rues de Ravnica regorgent d\'anciens membres de guildes qui utilisent désormais leurs connaissances institutionnelles à des fins personnelles.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595483&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0720e60f-eb8a-441e-8a7e-4daf3a7d6b71\', \'multiverseId\': 595483}, \'multiverseid\': 595483}, {\'name\': \'Erudito di Viale della Saggezza\', \'text\': "Quando l\'Erudito di Viale della Saggezza entra nel campo di battaglia, profetizza 2. (Guarda le prime due carte del tuo grimorio, poi mettine un qualsiasi numero in fondo al tuo grimorio e le altre in cima in qualsiasi ordine.)", \'type\': \'Creatura — Mago Vedalken\', \'flavor\': \'Le strade di Ravnica pullulano di ex membri delle gilde che impiegano i loro talenti istituzionali per profitto personale.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595591&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b8dbe148-cdb2-493b-824b-2e3e5cfbbb6f\', \'multiverseId\': 595591}, \'multiverseid\': 595591}, {\'name\': \'賢者街の学者\', \'text\': \'賢者街の学者が戦場に出たとき、占術２を行う。（あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード２枚を見て、そのうちの望む枚数をあなたのライブラリーの一番下に、残りを一番上に、それぞれ望む順番で置く。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ヴィダルケン・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': \'ラヴニカの通りは、仕事で覚えた能力を私利私欲のために使う元ギルド構成員で溢れている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595699&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c370e140-a031-4767-9cdc-eed29a733c69\', \'multiverseId\': 595699}, \'multiverseid\': 595699}, {\'name\': \'智者街学者\', \'text\': \'当智者街学者进战场时，占卜2。（检视你牌库顶的两张牌，然后将其中任意数量的牌以任意顺序置于你牌库底，其余则以任意顺序置于你牌库顶。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～维多肯／法术师\', \'flavor\': \'如今拉尼卡大街小巷到处都是公会离脱成员，滥用专业技能牟取私利。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596023&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'529572c1-8573-4d85-a4d9-7cf0b8c66359\', \'multiverseId\': 596023}, \'multiverseid\': 596023}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kwende, Stolz der Femeref\', \'text\': \'Doppelschlag\\nKreaturen mit Erstschlag, die du kontrollierst, haben Doppelschlag.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Ritter\', \'flavor\': \'Nachkomme eines ausgelöschten Landes, Schüler eines vergessenen Generals und Meister über Klingen, die kein Schmied je kopieren könnte. Er ehrt seine Vergangenheit, indem er ein heldenhaftes Leben führt.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591611&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f3ff0631-e9f8-42bd-a78b-90ddf2e07761\', \'multiverseId\': 591611}, \'multiverseid\': 591611}, {\'name\': \'Kwende, orgullo de Femeref\', \'text\': \'Daña dos veces.\\nLas criaturas que controlas con la habilidad de dañar primero tienen la habilidad de dañar dos veces.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Caballero humano\', \'flavor\': \'Hijo de una tierra desaparecida, aprendiz de un general olvidado y experto espadachín de unas armas que ningún herrero podría volver a forjar. Él les rinde pleitesía a todos viviendo una vida digna de canción.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591740&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1ddbcd2b-bd70-4fdb-9f49-8dd2ce835603\', \'multiverseId\': 591740}, \'multiverseid\': 591740}, {\'name\': \'Kwende, fierté de Fémeiref\', \'text\': "Double initiative\\nLes créatures avec l\'initiative que vous contrôlez ont la double initiative.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et chevalier\', \'flavor\': "Descendant d\'une terre disparue, élève d\'un général oublié, maître d\'armes qu\'aucun forgeron ne pouvait reforger. Il les honore en menant une vie digne d\'être chantée.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591869&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a2ac88b8-ff26-4671-93cb-6cd99d04fbf4\', \'multiverseId\': 591869}, \'multiverseid\': 591869}, {\'name\': \'Kwende, Orgoglio di Femeref\', \'text\': \'Doppio attacco\\nLe creature con attacco improvviso che controlli hanno doppio attacco.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Cavaliere Umano\', \'flavor\': \'Discendente di una terra scomparsa, allievo di un generale dimenticato e maestro di lame che nessun fabbro potrebbe mai riforgiare, onora il suo passato vivendo una vita degna di un cantico.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591998&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'103b2758-1b9e-4b8d-a3c7-48d0eb00bbf0\', \'multiverseId\': 591998}, \'multiverseid\': 591998}, {\'name\': \'フェメレフの誇り、クェンデ\', \'text\': \'二段攻撃\\nあなたがコントロールしていて先制攻撃を持つすべてのクリーチャーは二段攻撃を持つ。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・騎士\', \'flavor\': \'消滅した土地の子孫。忘れられた武将の弟子。現代の鍛冶には作れぬ刃の達人。これらの称号はすべて歌われるに値する生涯で彼が手に入れたものである。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592127&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ead48d60-2ea8-42f3-8017-49f1e8235f54\', \'multiverseId\': 592127}, \'multiverseid\': 592127}, {\'name\': \'费米瑞甫之傲桂恩岱\', \'text\': \'连击\\n由你操控且具先攻异能的生物具有连击异能。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～人类／骑士\', \'flavor\': \'他出身消逝之地，师从遗世之将，善使无可重铸之绝世利刃。留下一世英名为此增光添彩。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592514&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'75781236-4ef4-4f43-8933-84a4d80aee7a\', \'multiverseId\': 592514}, \'multiverseid\': 592514}]', "[{'name': 'Käfig aus Händen', 'text': 'Verzaubert eine Kreatur\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur kann nicht angreifen oder blocken.\\n{1}{W}: Bringe den Käfig aus Händen auf die Hand seines Besitzers zurück.', 'type': 'Verzauberung — Aura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591568&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5c339448-2707-4bf2-980a-58943d52264f', 'multiverseId': 591568}, 'multiverseid': 591568}, {'name': 'Jaula de manos', 'text': 'Encantar criatura.\\nLa criatura encantada no puede atacar ni bloquear.\\n{1}{W}: Regresa la Jaula de manos a la mano de su propietario.', 'type': 'Encantamiento — Aura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591697&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '74dbc690-6fa5-4874-b2b2-925d800e6ac1', 'multiverseId': 591697}, 'multiverseid': 591697}, {'name': 'Cage de mains', 'text': 'Enchanter : créature\\nLa créature enchantée ne peut ni attaquer ni bloquer.\\n{1}{W} : Renvoyez la Cage de mains dans la main de son propriétaire.', 'type': 'Enchantement : aura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591826&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f808a072-0d92-493a-91c8-3b6c351ad55f', 'multiverseId': 591826}, 'multiverseid': 591826}, {'name': 'Gabbia di Mani', 'text': 'Incanta creatura\\nLa creatura incantata non può attaccare o bloccare.\\n{1}{W}: Fai tornare la Gabbia di Mani in mano al suo proprietario.', 'type': 'Incantesimo — Aura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591955&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0c9fc827-288c-4d3c-9028-f39a74fef765', 'multiverseId': 591955}, 'multiverseid': 591955}, {'name': '手の檻', 'text': 'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\nエンチャントしているクリーチャーでは攻撃もブロックもできない。\\n{1}{W}：手の檻をオーナーの手札に戻す。', 'type': 'エンチャント — オーラ', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592084&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9bc9a963-bb42-49eb-8483-eb44df80598c', 'multiverseId': 592084}, 'multiverseid': 592084}, {'name': '千手槛', 'text': '结附于生物\\n所结附的生物不能进行攻击或阻挡。\\n{1}{W}：将千手槛移回其拥有者手上。', 'type': '结界 ～灵气', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592471&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7a97c5d1-e248-4a6c-9819-a7d78ed39e07', 'multiverseId': 592471}, 'multiverseid': 592471}]", '[{\'name\': \'Käfigknacker aus Kessig\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn die Käfigknacker aus Kessig angreifen, erzeuge für jede Kreaturenkarte in deinem Friedhof einen getappten und angreifenden 2/2 grünen Wolf-Kreaturenspielstein.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Räuber\', \'flavor\': \'„Sie stecken diese edlen Bestien hinter Gitter und wundern sich dann, warum Werwölfe unsere Städte angreifen."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592880&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a424a4b8-6c4c-40ed-9559-3443ca5f5337\', \'multiverseId\': 592880}, \'multiverseid\': 592880}, {\'name\': \'Rompeceldas de Kessig\', \'text\': \'Siempre que los Rompeceldas de Kessig ataquen, crea una ficha de criatura Lobo verde 2/2 que está girada y atacando por cada carta de criatura en tu cementerio.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bribón humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Ponen tras barrotes a estas nobles bestias y luego se preguntan por qué los licántropos atacan nuestras ciudades".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593001&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1d044751-a453-4776-9916-b0f968648f9e\', \'multiverseId\': 593001}, \'multiverseid\': 593001}, {\'name\': \'Brisecages de Kessig\', \'text\': \'À chaque fois que les Brisecages de Kessig attaquent, créez un jeton de créature 2/2 verte Loup, engagé et attaquant, pour chaque carte de créature dans votre cimetière.\', \'type\': \'Créature : humain et gredin\', \'flavor\': \'« Ils mettent ces nobles bêtes derrière les barreaux et se demandent ensuite pourquoi les loups-garous attaquent nos villes. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593122&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6c05da39-6a31-4dbf-afb4-da6daebcc8a9\', \'multiverseId\': 593122}, \'multiverseid\': 593122}, {\'name\': \'Spezzagabbie di Kessig\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta gli Spezzagabbie di Kessig attaccano, crea una pedina creatura Lupo 2/2 verde TAPpata e attaccante per ogni carta creatura nel tuo cimitero.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Farabutto Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Mettono dietro le sbarre queste nobili bestie e poi si domandano perché i lupi mannari prendono di mira le nostre città."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593243&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4ac7f376-803f-47c2-94ca-52a9c4e4c681\', \'multiverseId\': 593243}, \'multiverseid\': 593243}, {\'name\': \'ケッシグの檻破り\', \'text\': \'ケッシグの檻破りが攻撃するたび、あなたの墓地にあるクリーチャー・カード１枚につき１体の、緑の２/２の狼・クリーチャー・トークンをタップ状態かつ攻撃している状態で生成する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・ならず者\', \'flavor\': \'「奴らはこの高貴な獣を檻に捕らえておきながら、人狼がこの町を目標にする理由がわからないのか。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593364&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'af4ef4b8-dc2b-403f-88e8-eaf652e7df04\', \'multiverseId\': 593364}, \'multiverseid\': 593364}, {\'name\': \'凯锡革破栅客\', \'text\': \'每当凯锡革破栅客攻击时，你坟墓场中每有一张生物牌，便派出一个2/2绿色的狼衍生生物，其为横置且正进行攻击。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／浪客\', \'flavor\': \'「他们用栅栏囚禁这些高贵野兽，却不晓得为何狼人要针对我们的城镇攻击。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593727&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3437a1d6-956a-4267-80fb-b5a4932130d0\', \'multiverseId\': 593727}, \'multiverseid\': 593727}]', '[{\'name\': \'König des Rudels\', \'text\': \'Andere Katzen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +2/+1.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Katze\', \'flavor\': \'Seine Art wurde einst bis zur völligen Ausrottung gejagt. Jetzt, unter seinem Schutz, beherrschen sie die Savanne.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597086&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e3210153-cfd1-4e3c-9617-8b410eb5eaf7\', \'multiverseId\': 597086}, \'multiverseid\': 597086}, {\'name\': \'Rey de la manada\', \'text\': \'Los otros Felinos que controlas obtienen +2/+1.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Felino\', \'flavor\': \'Antaño, la caza estuvo a punto de aniquilar su especie, pero ahora domina la sabana bajo su protección.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597132&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c24b3189-ad62-432e-a084-896d0f688c1b\', \'multiverseId\': 597132}, \'multiverseid\': 597132}, {\'name\': \'Roi de la bande\', \'text\': \'Les autres chats que vous contrôlez gagnent +2/+1.\', \'type\': \'Créature : chat\', \'flavor\': "Les siens furent autrefois chassés, presque jusqu\'à l\'extinction. Désormais, sous sa protection, ils règnent sur la savane.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597178&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'45ebf558-7f23-425b-b581-a90a920ef18e\', \'multiverseId\': 597178}, \'multiverseid\': 597178}, {\'name\': \'Re del Branco\', \'text\': \'Gli altri Felini che controlli prendono +2/+1.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Felino\', \'flavor\': "Un tempo la sua specie fu braccata fino a trovarsi sull\'orlo dell\'estinzione. Ora, sotto la sua protezione, regna sulla savana.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597224&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fdfaade4-49a0-4d56-a721-e84bffea6ce4\', \'multiverseId\': 597224}, \'multiverseid\': 597224}, {\'name\': \'群れの王\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしていてこれでないすべての猫は＋２/＋１の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 猫\', \'flavor\': \'彼の種族は一時は絶滅寸前まで狩られていた。今は彼の庇護のもと、彼らがサバンナを統治している。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597270&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6d9beeba-ce3b-4899-b723-91762a147871\', \'multiverseId\': 597270}, \'multiverseid\': 597270}, {\'name\': \'狮群之王\', \'text\': \'由你操控的其他猫得+2/+1。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～猫\', \'flavor\': \'他的族类曾经饱受追猎，几近灭亡。如今在他庇护之下，狮群已然统治草原。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597408&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'17c0221a-e449-4b28-9df1-aa2db9cc0f11\', \'multiverseId\': 597408}, \'multiverseid\': 597408}]', '[{\'name\': \'Laichgrube\', \'text\': \'Opfere eine Kreatur: Lege eine Ladungsmarke auf die Laichgrube.\\n{1}, entferne zwei Ladungsmarken von der Laichgrube: Erzeuge einen 2/2 farblosen Ausgeburt-Artefaktkreaturenspielstein.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'In Neu-Phyrexia wird nichts verschwendet.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597543&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'499ddea6-bb78-4d24-b383-a9d81d065152\', \'multiverseId\': 597543}, \'multiverseid\': 597543}, {\'name\': \'Pozo de desove\', \'text\': \'Sacrificar una criatura: Pon un contador de carga sobre el Pozo de desove.\\n{1}, remover dos contadores de carga del Pozo de desove: Crea una ficha de criatura artefacto Engendro incolora 2/2.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'En Nueva Phyrexia no se desperdicia nada.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597568&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1506aae6-8f14-469d-b4b8-6b0e8dfacc85\', \'multiverseId\': 597568}, \'multiverseid\': 597568}, {\'name\': "Fosse de l\'engeance", \'text\': "Sacrifiez une créature : Mettez un marqueur « charge » sur la Fosse de l\'engeance.\\n{1}, retirez deux marqueurs « charge » de la Fosse de l\'engeance : Créez un jeton de créature-artefact 2/2 incolore Engeance.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': \'Rien ne se perd sur la Nouvelle Phyrexia.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597593&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4304efee-7df5-498a-925c-f492883b0a39\', \'multiverseId\': 597593}, \'multiverseid\': 597593}, {\'name\': \'Pozza della Procreazione\', \'text\': \'Sacrifica una creatura: Metti un segnalino carica sulla Pozza della Procreazione.\\n{1}, Rimuovi due segnalini carica dalla Pozza della Procreazione: Crea una pedina creatura artefatto Progenie 2/2 incolore.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'Niente va sprecato a Nuova Phyrexia.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597618&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fec13487-8081-4820-8ca3-fb9ff0561a4a\', \'multiverseId\': 597618}, \'multiverseid\': 597618}, {\'name\': \'落とし子の穴\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を生け贄に捧げる：落とし子の穴の上に蓄積カウンター１個を置く。\\n{1}, 落とし子の穴の上から蓄積カウンター２個を取り除く：無色の２/２の落とし子・アーティファクト・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'新ファイレクシアでは何も無駄にされない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597643&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'20f08aef-0d36-4d54-b9ae-2e387a400009\', \'multiverseId\': 597643}, \'multiverseid\': 597643}, {\'name\': \'孳虫尸坑\', \'text\': \'牺牲一个生物：在孳虫尸坑上放置一个充电指示物。\\n{1}，从孳虫尸坑上移去两个充电指示物：派出一个2/2无色后裔衍生神器生物。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'在新非瑞克西亚，什么都不会浪费。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597718&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8fe9a13e-716b-4be0-bf4b-916b1b31dcf6\', \'multiverseId\': 597718}, \'multiverseid\': 597718}]', '[{\'name\': \'Landhebung\', \'text\': \'Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält +2/+2 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\\nLandung — Falls in diesem Zug ein Land unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel gekommen ist, erhält die Kreatur stattdessen +4/+4 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Diese Welt wird sich nicht zähmen lassen."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592868&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4885a5b4-9ac6-438f-a581-d31738b5e0fe\', \'multiverseId\': 592868}, \'multiverseid\': 592868}, {\'name\': \'Suelo de fondo\', \'text\': \'La criatura objetivo obtiene +2/+2 hasta el final del turno.\\nAterrizaje — Si una tierra entró al campo de batalla bajo tu control este turno, en vez de eso, esa criatura obtiene +4/+4 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Este mundo no será domesticado".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592989&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'526ee2d5-718e-45e1-8627-9df9b1d55ab8\', \'multiverseId\': 592989}, \'multiverseid\': 592989}, {\'name\': \'Lame de fond\', \'text\': "Une créature ciblée gagne +2/+2 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.\\nToucheterre — Si vous avez fait arriver un terrain sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle ce tour-ci, cette créature gagne +4/+4 jusqu\'à la fin du tour à la place.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« Ce monde ne sera jamais dompté. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593110&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ef5c9e36-c1f2-4ccc-bae3-72100fcd1a06\', \'multiverseId\': 593110}, \'multiverseid\': 593110}, {\'name\': \'Terreno Ondoso\', \'text\': \'Una creatura bersaglio prende +2/+2 fino alla fine del turno.\\nTerraferma — Se hai fatto entrare nel campo di battaglia una terra sotto il tuo controllo in questo turno, quella creatura prende invece +4/+4 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Questo mondo non sarà mai domato."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593231&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'23b95fc0-8925-461d-bd38-b7e9e432ce11\', \'multiverseId\': 593231}, \'multiverseid\': 593231}, {\'name\': \'地うねり\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは＋２/＋２の修整を受ける。\\n上陸 ― このターンにあなたのコントロール下で土地が戦場に出たことがあるなら、代わりに、ターン終了時まで、そのクリーチャーは＋４/＋４の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「この世界は飼いならしようが無い。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593352&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a33106f3-c461-4adc-82c5-65a792475046\', \'multiverseId\': 593352}, \'multiverseid\': 593352}, {\'name\': \'土地暴涌\', \'text\': \'目标生物得+2/+2直到回合结束。\\n地落～如果本回合中有地在你的操控下进战场，则改为该生物得+4/+4直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「这世界绝不会驯服。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593715&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'33e9530a-d771-4faf-b323-3fc9273541d7\', \'multiverseId\': 593715}, \'multiverseid\': 593715}]', '[{\'name\': \'Lathliss, Königin der Drachen\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nImmer wenn ein anderer Nichtspielstein-Drache unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, erzeuge einen 5/5 roten Drache-Kreaturenspielstein mit Flugfähigkeit.\\n{1}{R}: Drachen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +1/+0 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Drache\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590274&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9652917f-92ba-4301-be56-3b2ccc9adc24\', \'multiverseId\': 590274}, \'multiverseid\': 590274}, {\'name\': \'Lathliss, reina dragón\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nSiempre que otro Dragón que no sea ficha entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, crea una ficha de criatura Dragón roja 5/5 con la habilidad de volar.\\n{1}{R}: Los Dragones que controlas obtienen +1/+0 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Dragón\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590409&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f8ddace4-a6c6-49c7-ab80-631b6ce4987a\', \'multiverseId\': 590409}, \'multiverseid\': 590409}, {\'name\': \'Lathliss, reine des dragons\', \'text\': "Vol\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'un autre dragon non-jeton arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, créez un jeton de créature 5/5 rouge Dragon avec le vol.\\n{1}{R} : Les dragons que vous contrôlez gagnent +1/+0 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : dragon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590544&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0bcbda53-c865-4d51-baad-da6ab6791780\', \'multiverseId\': 590544}, \'multiverseid\': 590544}, {\'name\': \'Lathliss, Regina dei Draghi\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nOgniqualvolta un altro Drago non pedina entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, crea una pedina creatura Drago 5/5 rossa con volare.\\n{1}{R}: I Draghi che controlli prendono +1/+0 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Drago\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590679&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'12e4fd3c-7fa0-4a76-aa32-0df01288bce3\', \'multiverseId\': 590679}, \'multiverseid\': 590679}, {\'name\': \'ドラゴンの女王、ラスリス\', \'text\': \'飛行\\nトークンでもこれでもないドラゴン１体があなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、飛行を持つ赤の５/５のドラゴン・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\\n{1}{R}：ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールしているすべてのドラゴンは＋１/＋０の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — ドラゴン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590814&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dce9e200-58af-472e-ab77-021218929391\', \'multiverseId\': 590814}, \'multiverseid\': 590814}, {\'name\': \'龙后拉黎丝\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n每当另一个非衍生物的龙在你的操控下进战场时，派出一个5/5红色，具飞行异能的龙衍生生物。\\n{1}{R}：由你操控的龙得+1/+0直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～龙\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591219&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f32b0b52-ad79-4b2a-93ea-2c87a0c8f85d\', \'multiverseId\': 591219}, \'multiverseid\': 591219}]', '[{\'name\': \'Lauernde Präzisionsschützin\', \'text\': \'Aufblitzen\\nWenn die Lauernde Präzisionsschützin ins Spiel kommt, zerstöre eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, der in diesem Zug Schaden zugefügt wurde.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Assassine\', \'flavor\': \'„Kein Gebrüll ist so mächtig, dass es nicht zum Schweigen gebracht werden kann."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594094&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4476778f-0b41-453d-9786-e44eb4306856\', \'multiverseId\': 594094}, \'multiverseid\': 594094}, {\'name\': \'Acechadora certera\', \'text\': \'Destello.\\nCuando la Acechadora certera entre al campo de batalla, destruye la criatura objetivo que haya recibido daño este turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Asesino humano\', \'flavor\': \'"No hay rugido tan poderoso que no se pueda silenciar".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594211&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'edeff4f5-8c30-46fd-8847-374057f951fe\', \'multiverseId\': 594211}, \'multiverseid\': 594211}, {\'name\': "Tireuse d\'élite en maraude", \'text\': "Flash\\nQuand la Tireuse d\'élite en maraude arrive sur le champ de bataille, détruisez une créature ciblée qui a subi des blessures ce tour-ci.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et assassin\', \'flavor\': \'« Même les cris les plus puissants peuvent être réduits au silence. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594328&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a268ac28-f665-478c-b679-c30d18ebb265\', \'multiverseId\': 594328}, \'multiverseid\': 594328}, {\'name\': \'Cecchina in Agguato\', \'text\': \'Lampo\\nQuando la Cecchina in Agguato entra nel campo di battaglia, distruggi una creatura bersaglio a cui è stato inflitto danno in questo turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Assassino Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Non esiste ruggito così potente da non poter essere messo a tacere."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594445&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'de3007d2-7bea-4ac7-8a72-20f618111ae2\', \'multiverseId\': 594445}, \'multiverseid\': 594445}, {\'name\': \'隠れ潜む名射手\', \'text\': \'瞬速\\n隠れ潜む名射手が戦場に出たとき、このターンにダメージを受けたクリーチャー１体を対象とする。それを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・暗殺者\', \'flavor\': \'「どんなに力強くとも、静められない咆哮はない。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594562&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'199da60a-ff5a-4f62-a9f8-cd9fe832b566\', \'multiverseId\': 594562}, \'multiverseid\': 594562}, {\'name\': \'伏击神射手\', \'text\': \'闪现\\n当伏击神射手进战场时，消灭目标本回合中受过伤害的生物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／杀手\', \'flavor\': \'「无论咆哮有多宏伟，都能令其噤声。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594913&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bf3b9e5e-0cd7-4ba9-9f64-91038aa743a7\', \'multiverseId\': 594913}, \'multiverseid\': 594913}]', '[{\'name\': \'Lauernder Felidar\', \'text\': \'Wachsamkeit\\nLandung — Immer wenn ein Land unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf den Lauernden Felidar.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Katze, Bestie\', \'flavor\': \'Gelegentlich hinterlassen Felidar fleischige „Geschenke" vor den Zelten von Erforschern, die sie für würdig halten.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591635&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2500aec7-dd35-4870-8973-4fcf1df0dacc\', \'multiverseId\': 591635}, \'multiverseid\': 591635}, {\'name\': \'Felidar merodeador\', \'text\': \'Vigilancia.\\nAterrizaje — Siempre que una tierra entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre el Felidar merodeador.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bestia felino\', \'flavor\': \'A veces, los felidares dejan "regalos" jugosos fuera de las tiendas de los exploradores que consideran dignos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591764&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f2e7cd64-1512-4f33-aa4c-194a5011c766\', \'multiverseId\': 591764}, \'multiverseid\': 591764}, {\'name\': \'Félidar rôdeur\', \'text\': "Vigilance\\nToucheterre — À chaque fois qu\'un terrain arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur le Félidar rôdeur.", \'type\': \'Créature : chat et bête\', \'flavor\': "Les félidars laissent parfois des morceaux de viande en « offrande » devant la tente des explorateurs qu\'ils considèrent comme les plus méritants.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591893&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2b3b02f8-071e-4c0b-b1fc-4db0c6bad64d\', \'multiverseId\': 591893}, \'multiverseid\': 591893}, {\'name\': \'Felidar a Caccia\', \'text\': \'Cautela\\nTerraferma — Ogniqualvolta una terra entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, metti un segnalino +1/+1 sul Felidar a Caccia.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Bestia Felino\', \'flavor\': \'Di tanto in tanto, i felidar lasciano "doni" succulenti fuori dalle tende degli esploratori che considerano degni.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592022&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'052004c8-def0-4127-9511-9d6facd16414\', \'multiverseId\': 592022}, \'multiverseid\': 592022}, {\'name\': \'うろつくフェリダー\', \'text\': \'警戒\\n上陸 ― 土地１つがあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、うろつくフェリダーの上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 猫・ビースト\', \'flavor\': \'ときおりフェリダーは、相応しいと認めた探検家のテントの外に肉の「贈り物」を置いていくことがある。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592151&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9f433e22-3303-4ac0-a2aa-892ef6bf37de\', \'multiverseId\': 592151}, \'multiverseid\': 592151}, {\'name\': \'觅食晶角兽\', \'text\': \'警戒\\n地落～每当一个地在你的操控下进战场时，在觅食晶角兽上放置一个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～猫／野兽\', \'flavor\': \'有时候，晶角兽会在它们认为够格的探险家帐篷外留下丰盛「肉礼」。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592538&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5c3827f5-97d7-4622-80f5-300c1cf70e23\', \'multiverseId\': 592538}, \'multiverseid\': 592538}]', "[{'name': 'Lauernder Serpopard', 'text': 'Dieser Zauberspruch kann nicht neutralisiert werden.\\nKreaturenzauber, die du kontrollierst, können nicht neutralisiert werden.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Katze, Ophis', 'flavor': 'Die Wesire von Rhonas, dem Gott der Stärke, füttern und trainieren die Tiere, die während seiner Prüfung zum Einsatz kommen.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592912&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '69ba967d-d3a4-4658-a1b6-7035730dda82', 'multiverseId': 592912}, 'multiverseid': 592912}, {'name': 'Leopardo de coral emboscado', 'text': 'Este hechizo no puede ser contrarrestado.\\nLos hechizos de criatura que controlas no pueden ser contrarrestados.', 'type': 'Criatura — Víbora felino', 'flavor': 'Los visires que sirven a Rhonas, el dios de la fuerza, cuidan a los diversos animales empleados durante su prueba.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593033&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f0323a57-eeed-4ffc-b6ff-549eae64aed6', 'multiverseId': 593033}, 'multiverseid': 593033}, {'name': 'Serpopard rôdeur', 'text': 'Ce sort ne peut pas être contrecarré.\\nLes sorts de créature que vous contrôlez ne peuvent pas être contrecarrés.', 'type': 'Créature : chat et serpent', 'flavor': 'Les vizirs au service de Rhonas, le dieu de la Force, prennent soin de la ménagerie mise à contribution pendant son épreuve.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593154&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7124f2d2-1a6e-4d55-8cc2-48fd1e67212e', 'multiverseId': 593154}, 'multiverseid': 593154}, {'name': 'Serpopardo in Agguato', 'text': 'Questa magia non può essere neutralizzata.\\nLe magie creatura che controlli non possono essere neutralizzate.', 'type': 'Creatura — Serpente Felino', 'flavor': 'I visir al servizio di Rhonas, il dio della forza, sono addetti alla manutenzione del serraglio che accoglie gli animali da affrontare nella sua ordalia.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593275&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f9457055-bc56-4b81-9fbd-d373cecf1b5f', 'multiverseId': 593275}, 'multiverseid': 593275}, {'name': 'うろつく蛇豹', 'text': 'この呪文は打ち消されない。\\nあなたがコントロールしている各クリーチャー・呪文は打ち消されない。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 猫・蛇', 'flavor': '活力の神ロナスに仕える侍臣は、試練に用いる獣を管理している。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593396&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'aa578d2f-1fc6-4bf0-a5c0-06874ee68a56', 'multiverseId': 593396}, 'multiverseid': 593396}, {'name': '觅食蛇豹', 'text': '此咒语不能被反击。\\n由你操控的生物咒语不能被反击。', 'type': '生物 ～猫／蛇', 'flavor': '侍奉力量之神罗纳斯的维齐尔负责饲养会在祀炼中出现的各类猛兽。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593759&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b42a17ac-5764-4b22-8422-2c51c83af743', 'multiverseId': 593759}, 'multiverseid': 593759}]", '[{\'name\': \'Lavaschlange\', \'text\': \'Eile\\nUmwandlung {2} ({2}, wirf diese Karte ab: Ziehe eine Karte.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elementarwesen, Schlange\', \'flavor\': \'Der brodelnde Graben, der Lavagrund umgibt, ist für die meisten ein Abschreckungsmittel. Für sie ist es ein entspannendes Bad.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590275&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4f89da15-e06f-41b4-b7ab-986144af9ffe\', \'multiverseId\': 590275}, \'multiverseid\': 590275}, {\'name\': \'Serpiente de lava\', \'text\': \'Prisa.\\nCiclo {2}. ({2}, descartar esta carta: Roba una carta.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Serpiente elemental\', \'flavor\': \'El foso hirviente de Bordelava disuade a la mayoría, pero para algunos es un baño relajante.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590410&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'61e2ce79-cc02-4dd3-af8a-433a79ed010e\', \'multiverseId\': 590410}, \'multiverseid\': 590410}, {\'name\': \'Serpent de lave\', \'text\': \'Célérité\\nRecyclage {2} ({2}, défaussez-vous de cette carte : Piochez une carte.)\', \'type\': \'Créature : élémental et grand serpent\', \'flavor\': "Les douves bouillantes de Bourg-sur-Lave repoussent la plupart des créatures, mais l\'une d\'elles y voit un bassin relaxant.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590545&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d0492196-327d-4e51-9ae0-a3df9aa4e9fc\', \'multiverseId\': 590545}, \'multiverseid\': 590545}, {\'name\': \'Serpe della Lava\', \'text\': \'Rapidità\\nCiclo {2} ({2}, Scarta questa carta: Pesca una carta.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Serpe Elementale\', \'flavor\': \'Per chiunque altro, il fossato bollente di Lavariva è un deterrente. Per lui, è un bagno rilassante.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590680&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4e26316d-0faf-405c-8b7f-d6ba6c2d01a6\', \'multiverseId\': 590680}, \'multiverseid\': 590680}, {\'name\': \'溶岩の海蛇\', \'text\': \'速攻\\nサイクリング{2}（{2}, このカードを捨てる：カード１枚を引く。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エレメンタル・海蛇\', \'flavor\': \'ラバブリンクの煮えたぎる濠は、多くにとっては脅威だが、あるものにとっては気持ちの良い風呂である。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590815&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d892e762-3733-4c48-a585-d699642f222f\', \'multiverseId\': 590815}, \'multiverseid\': 590815}, {\'name\': \'熔岩巨蛇\', \'text\': \'敏捷\\n循环{2}（{2}，弃掉此牌：抓一张牌。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～元素／巨蛇\', \'flavor\': \'熔缘城滚热的护城河是许多生物难以逾越的天堑，对其他生物而言却是难得的放松场地。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591220&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'516dcbb8-7151-4650-8f1f-0bc7d0c51d0c\', \'multiverseId\': 591220}, \'multiverseid\': 591220}]', '[{\'name\': \'Lavatritt-Plünderer\', \'text\': \'{2}{R}: Der Lavatritt-Plünderer erhält +2/+0 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Goblin, Krieger\', \'flavor\': \'Goblins entdeckten als Erste das Potenzial der Polyeder im Kampf gegen die Eldrazi. Schließlich haben diese magischen Steine richtig scharfe Ecken und Kanten.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590276&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'43050b19-ced2-4eb9-8cda-cfb492d1b6d4\', \'multiverseId\': 590276}, \'multiverseid\': 590276}, {\'name\': \'Incursor pisalava\', \'text\': \'{2}{R}: El Incursor pisalava obtiene +2/+0 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero trasgo\', \'flavor\': \'Los trasgos fueron los primeros en ver el potencial de los edros en su lucha contra los Eldrazi: las piedras mágicas ya venían con una punta afilada.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590411&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b266dce7-79a6-4a28-a0a7-6674d3373f5f\', \'multiverseId\': 590411}, \'multiverseid\': 590411}, {\'name\': \'Pillard lavemarche\', \'text\': "{2}{R} : Le Pillard lavemarche gagne +2/+0 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : gobelin et guerrier\', \'flavor\': \'Les gobelins furent les premiers à exploiter le potentiel des hèdrons pour lutter contre les Eldrazi, car ces pierres magiques étaient déjà pointues.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590546&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a3b0e795-d0d0-461d-a249-a8a1ed4f2396\', \'multiverseId\': 590546}, \'multiverseid\': 590546}, {\'name\': \'Predone Passo di Lava\', \'text\': \'{2}{R}: Il Predone Passo di Lava prende +2/+0 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Goblin\', \'flavor\': \'I goblin furono i primi a scoprire il potenziale degli edri nella lotta contro gli Eldrazi, poiché le pietre magiche erano già fornite di estremità a punta.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590681&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a952af1b-ae01-45a5-b177-a01892a30d5f\', \'multiverseId\': 590681}, \'multiverseid\': 590681}, {\'name\': \'溶岩足の略奪者\', \'text\': \'{2}{R}：ターン終了時まで、溶岩足の略奪者は＋２/＋０の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ゴブリン・戦士\', \'flavor\': \'エルドラージとの戦いで最初に面晶体の潜在能力に気付いたのはゴブリンであった。たまたま先が尖っていて便利だったのだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590816&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'27feb3d0-9335-4cc2-a100-ee1d48cfc6dd\', \'multiverseId\': 590816}, \'multiverseid\': 590816}, {\'name\': \'熔足突击队\', \'text\': \'{2}{R}：熔足突击队得+2/+0直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～鬼怪／战士\', \'flavor\': \'鬼怪最先发现了晶石可以用于对抗奥札奇，因为这些有魔力的石头是现成的尖锐武器。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591221&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'66337b1a-c736-4c3d-b447-c56a0ed8d7d9\', \'multiverseId\': 591221}, \'multiverseid\': 591221}]', '[{\'name\': \'Lawinenrufer\', \'text\': \'{2}: Ein verschneites Land deiner Wahl, das du kontrollierst, wird bis zum Ende des Zuges zu einer 4/4 Elementarwesen-Kreatur mit Fluchsicherheit und Eile. Es ist immer noch ein Land. (Eine Kreatur mit Fluchsicherheit kann nicht das Ziel von Zaubersprüchen oder Fähigkeiten sein, die deine Gegner kontrollieren.)\', \'type\': \'Verschneite Kreatur — Mensch, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595200&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f84dbac9-9c95-4d9f-acc2-7d675e7dbce7\', \'multiverseId\': 595200}, \'multiverseid\': 595200}, {\'name\': \'Llamaavalanchas\', \'text\': \'{2}: La tierra nevada objetivo que controlas se convierte en una criatura Elemental 4/4 con las habilidades de antimaleficio y prisa hasta el final del turno. Sigue siendo una tierra. (Una criatura con la habilidad de antimaleficio no puede ser objetivo de hechizos o habilidades que controlan tus oponentes.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura nevada — Hechicero humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595308&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4f0f46bf-a063-47d2-8d6a-e64748bdbf55\', \'multiverseId\': 595308}, \'multiverseid\': 595308}, {\'name\': "Meneur d\'avalanche", \'text\': "{2} : Un terrain neigeux ciblé que vous contrôlez devient une créature 4/4 Élémental avec la défense talismanique et la célérité jusqu\'à la fin du tour. C\'est toujours un terrain. (Une créature avec la défense talismanique ne peut pas être la cible de sorts ou de capacités que vos adversaires contrôlent.)", \'type\': \'Créature neigeuse : humain et sorcier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595416&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e6092dd4-a9cf-4d25-b95f-2b934084b174\', \'multiverseId\': 595416}, \'multiverseid\': 595416}, {\'name\': \'Evocatore di Valanghe\', \'text\': \'{2}: Una terra neve bersaglio che controlli diventa una creatura Elementale 4/4 con anti-malocchio e rapidità fino alla fine del turno. È ancora una terra. (Una creatura con anti-malocchio non può essere bersaglio di magie o abilità controllate dai tuoi avversari.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura Neve — Mago Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595524&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'45ff765d-dc0e-443d-8f5d-6b0397ac1f30\', \'multiverseId\': 595524}, \'multiverseid\': 595524}, {\'name\': \'雪崩呼び\', \'text\': \'{2}：あなたがコントロールしている氷雪土地１つを対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは呪禁と速攻を持つ４/４のエレメンタル・クリーチャーになる。それは土地でもある。（呪禁を持つクリーチャーは、対戦相手がコントロールしている呪文や能力の対象にならない。）\', \'type\': \'氷雪クリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595632&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4166d9a2-c228-41eb-b2ac-55b73f0fd7a5\', \'multiverseId\': 595632}, \'multiverseid\': 595632}, {\'name\': \'雪崩唤师\', \'text\': \'{2}：目标由你操控的雪境地成为4/4，具辟邪与敏捷异能的元素生物直到回合结束。它仍然是地。（具辟邪异能的生物不能成为由对手操控之咒语或异能的目标。）\', \'type\': \'雪境生物 ～人类／法术师\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595956&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'46ecfbaf-b86f-4704-84dd-648b52c10dd8\', \'multiverseId\': 595956}, \'multiverseid\': 595956}]', '[{\'name\': \'Lebendig gefressen\', \'text\': \'Opfere eine Kreatur oder bezahle {3}{B} als zusätzliche Kosten, um diesen Zauberspruch zu wirken.\\nSchicke eine Kreatur oder einen Planeswalker deiner Wahl ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Falls ihr ein Stöhnen aus dem Keller hört, ignoriert es. Teilt euch nicht auf. Versperrt einfach die Tür und verbarrikadiert sie."\\n—Emili, Hauptmann der Wache\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594066&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7c821690-0d97-47b2-8541-9ec0bde75558\', \'multiverseId\': 594066}, \'multiverseid\': 594066}, {\'name\': \'Devorado vivo\', \'text\': \'Como coste adicional para lanzar este hechizo, sacrifica una criatura o paga {3}{B}.\\nExilia la criatura o planeswalker objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Si oyen una especie de gruñido en el sótano, no lo investiguen ni se separen. Simplemente, cierren la puerta y bloquéenla".\\n—Emili, capitana de la guardia\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594183&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'856de1f9-8540-4395-863b-2ad76aaf872c\', \'multiverseId\': 594183}, \'multiverseid\': 594183}, {\'name\': \'Dévoré vivant\', \'text\': \'En tant que coût supplémentaire pour lancer ce sort, sacrifiez une créature ou payez {3}{B}.\\nExilez une cible, créature ou planeswalker.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« Si vous entendez un grognement dans la cave, n\'allez pas jeter un œil. Ne vous séparez pas. Verrouillez la porte et barricadez-la. »\\n—Emili, capitaine de la garde", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594300&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e77f0ff6-e8fd-4951-bf41-dcdeffe8d058\', \'multiverseId\': 594300}, \'multiverseid\': 594300}, {\'name\': \'Mangiato Vivo\', \'text\': \'Come costo addizionale per lanciare questa magia, sacrifica una creatura o paga {3}{B}.\\nEsilia una creatura o un planeswalker bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Se sentite un gemito provenire dalla cantina, non indagate. Non vi separate. Bloccate la porta e barricatevi."\\n—Emilia, capitana della guardia\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594417&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'050c124d-dcd4-416a-b20c-4784b0ac4832\', \'multiverseId\': 594417}, \'multiverseid\': 594417}, {\'name\': \'踊り食い\', \'text\': \'この呪文を唱えるための追加コストとして、クリーチャー１体を生け贄に捧げるか{3}{B}を支払う。\\nクリーチャーやプレインズウォーカーのうち１体を対象とする。それを追放する。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「地下室からうめき声が聞こえても、確かめに行ってはだめ。別行動は厳禁。とにかく鍵を閉めて、扉を塞ぐのよ。」\\n――護衛隊長、エミリ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594534&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9facb294-656c-4cdb-8a13-3e6b50d2b911\', \'multiverseId\': 594534}, \'multiverseid\': 594534}, {\'name\': \'生吞活剥\', \'text\': \'牺牲一个生物或支付{3}{B}，以作为施放此咒语的额外费用。\\n放逐目标生物或鹏洛客。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「如果你听见地窖传出呻吟声，不要好奇妄动。不要分头行事。只管闩紧门口，全力顶住。」\\n～守卫队长艾蜜莉\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594885&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8b067f22-59d6-4996-b2c3-8423e3d3fea7\', \'multiverseId\': 594885}, \'multiverseid\': 594885}]', '[{\'name\': \'Lebhafter Begleiter\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Lebhafte Begleiter ins Spiel kommt, ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberungskreatur — Hund\', \'flavor\': \'Sie schloss Freundschaft mit mehreren verspielten Geistern, und bald war „das Rudel" als Quelle für viel Unfug in Eiganjo bekannt.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591654&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1742b8ec-4c29-4363-b488-102c35b4430d\', \'multiverseId\': 591654}, \'multiverseid\': 591654}, {\'name\': \'Compañero con espíritus\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Compañero con espíritus entre al campo de batalla, roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura encantamiento — Perro\', \'flavor\': \'Entabló amistad con varios espíritus juguetones y enseguida "la manada" se convirtió en una fuente de travesuras en Eiganjo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591783&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2af1706a-4b6f-45ea-9cc9-b606c4d6e422\', \'multiverseId\': 591783}, \'multiverseid\': 591783}, {\'name\': \'Compagnon fougueux\', \'text\': \'Quand le Compagnon fougueux arrive sur le champ de bataille, piochez une carte.\', \'type\': \'Créature-enchantement : chien\', \'flavor\': "Il se lia d\'amitié avec plusieurs esprits espiègles, et bientôt, la « meute » fut connue à Eiganjo comme source de bien des plaisanteries.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591912&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'685a321d-f384-41ad-b4cc-0e924b62d4b5\', \'multiverseId\': 591912}, \'multiverseid\': 591912}, {\'name\': \'Compagno Vivace\', \'text\': \'Quando il Compagno Vivace entra nel campo di battaglia, pesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Incantesimo — Canide\', \'flavor\': \'Strinse un rapporto di amicizia con diversi spiriti burloni e presto il "branco" iniziò a combinare dispetti in tutta Eiganjo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592041&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2e7f9e57-c9bb-40c1-8a6d-a28ba193d350\', \'multiverseId\': 592041}, \'multiverseid\': 592041}, {\'name\': \'神憑く相棒\', \'text\': \'神憑く相棒が戦場に出たとき、カード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー・エンチャント — 犬\', \'flavor\': \'いくつかの茶目っ気たっぷりの精霊と友情を築くと、すぐにその「群れ」は永岩城で起きる悪戯の原因として知られるようになった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592170&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'86e610a3-ffa5-4a7f-8a94-8661e2fbe2c5\', \'multiverseId\': 592170}, \'multiverseid\': 592170}, {\'name\': \'灵念伴侣\', \'text\': \'当灵念伴侣进战场时，抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'结界生物 ～狗\', \'flavor\': \'它与几个淘气神灵结下友谊，很快这一「小团体」就成为永岩城内诸多恶戏的根源。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592557&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0c8c08ff-b7fd-47be-aed0-85f58b07bcc6\', \'multiverseId\': 592557}, \'multiverseid\': 592557}]', '[{\'name\': \'Leichen aufwühlen\', \'text\': \'Du millst drei Karten. Dann kannst du eine Kreaturenkarte aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurückbringen. (Um eine Karte zu millen, lege die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek auf deinen Friedhof.)\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Dein Leben ist zu Ende. Nun beginnt dein Dienst."\\n—Kalitas, Ulamogs Knecht\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594046&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fbce7064-636b-4c58-952a-596ac4acfa77\', \'multiverseId\': 594046}, \'multiverseid\': 594046}, {\'name\': \'Agitación cadavérica\', \'text\': \'Muele tres cartas, luego puedes regresar una carta de criatura de tu cementerio a tu mano. (Para moler una carta, pon la primera carta de tu biblioteca en tu cementerio.)\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"La distracción que suponía tu vida ha terminado; ahora comienza tu servicio".\\n—Kalitas, esclavo de Ulamog\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594163&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5fd270b4-4c70-4be6-b272-1159dbaf86ea\', \'multiverseId\': 594163}, \'multiverseid\': 594163}, {\'name\': \'Barratement cadavérique\', \'text\': \'Meulez trois cartes, puis vous pouvez renvoyer une carte de créature depuis votre cimetière dans votre main. (Pour meuler une carte, mettez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque dans votre cimetière.)\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Les distractions de la vie sont terminées pour toi. Ton engagement commence. »\\n—Kalitas, serviteur d\'Ulamog", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594280&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ccc44ee1-9bd0-480a-9de8-9839c0d28939\', \'multiverseId\': 594280}, \'multiverseid\': 594280}, {\'name\': \'Estrazione di Cadaveri\', \'text\': \'Macina tre carte, poi puoi riprendere in mano una carta creatura dal tuo cimitero. (Per macinare una carta, metti nel tuo cimitero la prima carta del tuo grimorio.)\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"La distrazione della vita è terminata. Ora ha inizio il tuo servizio."\\n—Kalitas, schiavo di Ulamog\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594397&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0d406e47-a8f7-4595-9554-525aa55cbe22\', \'multiverseId\': 594397}, \'multiverseid\': 594397}, {\'name\': \'屍体の攪拌\', \'text\': \'カード３枚を切削する。その後、あなたはあなたの墓地にあるクリーチャー・カード１枚をあなたの手札に戻してもよい。（カードを切削するとは、あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカードをあなたの墓地に置くことである。）\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「怠惰な人生は終わった。ここからは本気で働いてもらおうか。」\\n――ウラモグの奴僕、カリタス\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594514&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ada62718-b760-4949-9d37-e98a4372bf41\', \'multiverseId\': 594514}, \'multiverseid\': 594514}, {\'name\': \'尸体翻搅\', \'text\': \'磨三张牌，然后你可以将一张生物牌从你的坟墓场移回你手上。（磨一张牌的流程是将你牌库顶的牌置入你的坟墓场。）\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「你生命已逝，便再无需分神。从现在开始好好为我卖命。」\\n～钨拉莫鬼卒卡力塔\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594865&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4816fa00-c0d5-4751-9e78-db01296a3451\', \'multiverseId\': 594865}, \'multiverseid\': 594865}]', '[{\'name\': \'Leichenschmaus\', \'text\': \'Zu Beginn jedes Versorgungssegments und falls ein Gegner im letzten Zug Lebenspunkte verloren hat, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'Er hielt inne, um zu verschnaufen, nicht wissend, dass es sein letzter Atemzug sein würde.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597097&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c9af2357-d82f-41d4-a60c-6d8fc08b4628\', \'multiverseId\': 597097}, \'multiverseid\': 597097}, {\'name\': \'Devorar a los caídos\', \'text\': \'Al comienzo de cada mantenimiento, si un oponente perdió vidas el turno anterior, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre la criatura objetivo que controlas.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'Solo paró para recuperar el aliento, sin saber que pronto se quedaría sin.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597143&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'59d31a11-6fcb-475b-a12f-90dd87f01f85\', \'multiverseId\': 597143}, \'multiverseid\': 597143}, {\'name\': \'Se repaître des mourants\', \'text\': \'Au début de chaque entretien, si un adversaire a perdu des points de vie au dernier tour, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': "Il ne s\'arrêta que pour reprendre son souffle, sans savoir que ce serait son dernier.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597189&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'609b0cb7-71e3-4821-866d-533902e3bd4c\', \'multiverseId\': 597189}, \'multiverseid\': 597189}, {\'name\': \'Banchetto di Caduti\', \'text\': "All\'inizio di ogni mantenimento, se un avversario ha perso punti vita nell\'ultimo turno, metti un segnalino +1/+1 su una creatura bersaglio che controlli.", \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'Si fermò soltanto per riprendere fiato, senza sapere che quello sarebbe stato il suo ultimo respiro.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597235&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'59bf3ac7-8d42-46e3-abee-28d2db5150ee\', \'multiverseId\': 597235}, \'multiverseid\': 597235}, {\'name\': \'堕ちたる者の饗宴\', \'text\': \'各アップキープの開始時に、直前のターンに対戦相手がライフを失っていた場合、あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。それの上に＋１/ ＋１カウンター１個を置く。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'彼は呼吸を整えるために止まっただけだった。それが最後の一息になるとも知らずに。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597281&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'309bd80d-6a1c-4667-8d08-6624c6cd3723\', \'multiverseId\': 597281}, \'multiverseid\': 597281}, {\'name\': \'饱食死者\', \'text\': \'在每个维持开始时，若有对手上回合中失去过生命，则在目标由你操控的生物上放置一个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'他只是停下来想喘口气，未曾料到这是他的最后一口气。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597419&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2249f9fd-11c9-4324-accc-ac0c7bad873a\', \'multiverseId\': 597419}, \'multiverseid\': 597419}]', '[{\'name\': \'Lenkdrachensegler\', \'text\': \'Die ausgerüstete Kreatur erhält +1/+0 und hat Flugfähigkeit.\\nAusrüsten {2} ({2}: Lege diese Karte an eine Kreatur deiner Wahl an, die du kontrollierst. Spiele Ausrüsten wie eine Hexerei.)\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Ausrüstung\', \'flavor\': \'Lenkdrachen zu segeln ist eine Art zu leben, die ohne Übung schnell tödlich endet.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596285&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1a56267f-086b-4590-818d-a2665cb14c22\', \'multiverseId\': 596285}, \'multiverseid\': 596285}, {\'name\': \'Velacometa\', \'text\': \'La criatura equipada obtiene +1/+0 y tiene la habilidad de volar.\\nEquipar {2}. ({2}: Anexa este Equipo a la criatura objetivo que controlas. Activa la habilidad de equipar como un conjuro.)\', \'type\': \'Artefacto — Equipo\', \'flavor\': \'Volar en velacometa es un estilo de vida, y sin práctica, su final.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596372&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'33e44915-edc0-4775-8c9b-9f3cc8f6dd20\', \'multiverseId\': 596372}, \'multiverseid\': 596372}, {\'name\': \'Voile volante\', \'text\': "La créature équipée gagne +1/+0 et a le vol.\\nÉquipement {2} ({2} : Attachez à une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez. N\'attachez l\'équipement que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.)", \'type\': \'Artefact : équipement\', \'flavor\': "Faire de la voile volante, c\'est un style de vie — qui ne dure pas très longtemps sans entraînement.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596459&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6d65a466-37f7-4501-9733-5b754ccce08f\', \'multiverseId\': 596459}, \'multiverseid\': 596459}, {\'name\': \'Velaliante\', \'text\': \'La creatura equipaggiata prende +1/+0 e ha volare.\\nEquipaggiare {2} ({2}: Assegna a una creatura bersaglio che controlli. Equipaggia solo come una stregoneria.)\', \'type\': \'Artefatto — Equipaggiamento\', \'flavor\': \'Il velaliante è uno stile di vita. E, senza esperienza, anche la fine di essa.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596546&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'08fc258b-d835-40d9-ba95-9f5060bbae7b\', \'multiverseId\': 596546}, \'multiverseid\': 596546}, {\'name\': \'帆凧\', \'text\': \'装備しているクリーチャーは＋１/＋０の修整を受け飛行を持つ。\\n装備{2}（{2}：あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。これをそれにつける。装備はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。）\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 装備品\', \'flavor\': \'帆凧はある意味生き方だ――そして、練習抜きだと、死に方となる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596633&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c07b4127-9f98-4bc1-b0ae-c3c7ba6bf984\', \'multiverseId\': 596633}, \'multiverseid\': 596633}, {\'name\': \'航筝\', \'text\': \'佩带此武具的生物得+1/+0且具有飞行异能。\\n佩带{2}（{2}：贴附在目标由你操控的生物上。只能于法术时机佩带。）\', \'type\': \'神器 ～武具\', \'flavor\': \'驾驭航筝是一种生活方式～没好好练过的话，则是一种结束方式。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596894&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8a7cebd1-202b-41bc-bedf-bc4fa11b068f\', \'multiverseId\': 596894}, \'multiverseid\': 596894}]', "[{'name': 'Leoniden-Kriegsführer', 'text': 'Immer wenn der Leoniden-Kriegsführer angreift, erzeuge zwei getappte und angreifende 1/1 weiße Katze-Kreaturenspielsteine mit Lebensverknüpfung.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Katze, Soldat', 'flavor': 'Wenn ein Leonide auf die Jagd geht, ist sein Rudel gewiss nicht fern.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591614&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3ec96064-5e1d-4b25-9ba7-89c6bef0ddae', 'multiverseId': 591614}, 'multiverseid': 591614}, {'name': 'Líder de guerra leonino', 'text': 'Siempre que el Líder de guerra leonino ataque, crea dos fichas de criatura Felino blancas 1/1 con la habilidad de vínculo vital giradas y atacando.', 'type': 'Criatura — Soldado felino', 'flavor': 'Cuando un leonino sale a cazar, hay muchos más en las cercanías.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591743&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e737d4e6-8b41-4c6a-be01-e59930b3bce6', 'multiverseId': 591743}, 'multiverseid': 591743}, {'name': 'Chef de guerre léonin', 'text': 'À chaque fois que le Chef de guerre léonin attaque, créez deux jetons de créature 1/1 blanche Chat avec le lien de vie, engagés et attaquants.', 'type': 'Créature : chat et soldat', 'flavor': 'Un léonin chasse rarement seul.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591872&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3ef928ce-9e34-4e5f-b624-75d78efa26a6', 'multiverseId': 591872}, 'multiverseid': 591872}, {'name': 'Condottiero Leonid', 'text': 'Ogniqualvolta il Condottiero Leonid attacca, crea due pedine creatura Felino 1/1 bianche con legame vitale TAPpate e attaccanti.', 'type': 'Creatura — Soldato Felino', 'flavor': 'Un leonid non va mai a caccia da solo.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592001&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'eab9c813-4b71-4019-8b3b-274ac3a5c0c7', 'multiverseId': 592001}, 'multiverseid': 592001}, {'name': 'レオニンの戦導者', 'text': 'レオニンの戦導者が攻撃するたび、絆魂を持つ白の１/１の猫・クリーチャー・トークン２体をタップ状態かつ攻撃している状態で生成する。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 猫・兵士', 'flavor': '狩りをするレオニンを一人見かけたら、必ず近くにもっといる。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592130&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e58077b9-809b-4e97-ae16-9c4033c97c96', 'multiverseId': 592130}, 'multiverseid': 592130}, {'name': '领战狮族', 'text': '每当领战狮族攻击时，派出两个1/1白色，具系命异能的猫衍生生物，它们为横置且正进行攻击。', 'type': '生物 ～猫／士兵', 'flavor': '狮族一人狩猎，多人必不远之。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592517&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '84d42e77-5d4a-4f1d-b230-545fc71e92c4', 'multiverseId': 592517}, 'multiverseid': 592517}]", '[{\'name\': \'Leoniden-Schlingenwerfer\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Leoniden-Schlingenwerfer ins Spiel kommt, kannst du eine Kreatur deiner Wahl tappen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Katze, Soldat\', \'flavor\': \'Ehemals unterdrückt durch die Meletiner neigen Leoniden dazu, ihre alten Feinde gelegentlich mit Jagdbeute zu „verwechseln".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591613&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'775829b8-d9d0-4faa-aa65-be4626302315\', \'multiverseId\': 591613}, \'multiverseid\': 591613}, {\'name\': \'Trampero leonino\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Trampero leonino entre al campo de batalla, puedes girar la criatura objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado felino\', \'flavor\': \'Antaño oprimidos por la polis de Meletis, los leoninos en ocasiones "confunden" a sus antiguos enemigos con presas de caza.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591742&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8036d1a2-aea0-4457-921c-b46e290ab057\', \'multiverseId\': 591742}, \'multiverseid\': 591742}, {\'name\': \'Braconnier léonin\', \'text\': \'Quand le Braconnier léonin arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez engager une créature ciblée.\', \'type\': \'Créature : chat et soldat\', \'flavor\': \'Naguère opprimés par la polis de Mélétis, les léonins « confondent » parfois leurs anciens ennemis avec le gibier.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591871&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'27637a28-e29e-4af4-84d5-b4f1cf31c5dd\', \'multiverseId\': 591871}, \'multiverseid\': 591871}, {\'name\': \'Scagliatrappole Leonid\', \'text\': \'Quando lo Scagliatrappole Leonid entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi TAPpare una creatura bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Soldato Felino\', \'flavor\': \'In precedenza oppressi dalla polis di Meletis, i leonid ogni tanto "scambiano" i loro vecchi nemici per prede.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592000&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'701c6c5d-87ba-40ae-a28e-34cf1cf3b57a\', \'multiverseId\': 592000}, \'multiverseid\': 592000}, {\'name\': \'レオニンの投網使い\', \'text\': \'レオニンの投網使いが戦場に出たとき、クリーチャー１体を対象とする。あなたはそれをタップしてもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 猫・兵士\', \'flavor\': \'かつて都市国家メレティスによって抑圧されてきたせいか、レオニンは時に旧敵を獲物と「勘違い」する時がある。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592129&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4969fc82-dcd2-4c49-90cc-3eb1c9891000\', \'multiverseId\': 592129}, \'multiverseid\': 592129}, {\'name\': \'狮族布陷手\', \'text\': \'当狮族布陷手进战场时，你可以横置目标生物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～猫／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'狮族以前曾受迈勒提斯城邦压迫；他们现在偶尔还会「不小心」把昔日死敌当作猎物。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592516&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'954babd0-271c-4330-91b2-f5cee5910d1a\', \'multiverseId\': 592516}, \'multiverseid\': 592516}]', '[{\'name\': \'Leonidenkrummsäbel\', \'text\': \'Die ausgerüstete Kreatur erhält +1/+1.\\nAusrüsten {1} ({1}: Lege diese Karte an eine Kreatur deiner Wahl an, die du kontrollierst. Spiele Ausrüsten wie eine Hexerei.)\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Ausrüstung\', \'flavor\': \'„Jeder Kratzer erzählt eine Geschichte, jede Scharte hat einen Namen. Vier Generationen haben diese Klinge getragen. Enttäusche sie nicht."\\n—Kriegerweihe von Laena, Himmeljägerin\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596286&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ef3be128-efbc-436b-b8e4-4b71a047d1fd\', \'multiverseId\': 596286}, \'multiverseid\': 596286}, {\'name\': \'Cimitarra leonina\', \'text\': \'La criatura equipada obtiene +1/+1.\\nEquipar {1}. ({1}: Anexa este Equipo a la criatura objetivo que controlas. Activa la habilidad de equipar como un conjuro.)\', \'type\': \'Artefacto — Equipo\', \'flavor\': \'"Cada rasguño cuenta una historia, y cada mella tiene un nombre. Cuatro generaciones han usado esta espada. No las decepcionarás".\\n—Iniciación de Laena, cazacielos\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596373&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'30eabbdf-fb58-4a18-8613-70a79d77ca46\', \'multiverseId\': 596373}, \'multiverseid\': 596373}, {\'name\': \'Cimeterre léonin\', \'text\': "La créature équipée gagne +1/+1.\\nÉquipement {1} ({1} : Attachez à une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez. N\'attachez l\'équipement que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.)", \'type\': \'Artefact : équipement\', \'flavor\': \'« Chaque rayure raconte une histoire, et chaque marque a un nom. Cette lame a servi quatre générations. Tu ne les décevras pas. »\\n—Initiation de Laena, chasseciel\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596460&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'816aa0f5-b16f-46f4-af37-e608b5744c4f\', \'multiverseId\': 596460}, \'multiverseid\': 596460}, {\'name\': \'Scimitarra Leonid\', \'text\': \'La creatura equipaggiata prende +1/+1.\\nEquipaggiare {1} ({1}: Assegna a una creatura bersaglio che controlli. Equipaggia solo come una stregoneria.)\', \'type\': \'Artefatto — Equipaggiamento\', \'flavor\': \'"Ogni graffio racconta una storia e ogni tacca ha un nome. Quattro generazioni hanno impugnato questa lama. Tu non le deluderai."\\n—Iniziazione di Laena, solcacielo\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596547&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'89f74da1-ea82-45bf-b208-72ab7f6901f3\', \'multiverseId\': 596547}, \'multiverseid\': 596547}, {\'name\': \'レオニンの円月刀\', \'text\': \'装備しているクリーチャーは＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\\n装備{1}（{1}：あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。これをそれにつける。装備はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。）\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 装備品\', \'flavor\': \'「すべての傷に物語があり、すべての欠けにその名がある。この剣は四世代に渡って用いられた。かつての持ち主を落胆させてはならぬ。」\\n――空騎士リーナの伝授\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596634&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'26ea1f0c-d701-4b6b-965f-bfacf38fbff4\', \'multiverseId\': 596634}, \'multiverseid\': 596634}, {\'name\': \'狮族弯刀\', \'text\': \'佩带此武具的生物得+1/+1。\\n佩带{1}（{1}：贴附在目标由你操控的生物上。只能于法术时机佩带。）\', \'type\': \'神器 ～武具\', \'flavor\': \'「每条刮痕都有故事，每处缺口都有名字。此刀传承四代。勿让先祖蒙羞。」\\n～空猎者雷娜的仪式誓辞\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596895&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8391bfa8-ac2d-4c66-ba7d-1368595c534c\', \'multiverseId\': 596895}, \'multiverseid\': 596895}]', '[{\'name\': \'Licht der Hoffnung\', \'text\': \'Bestimme eines —\\n• Du erhältst 4 Lebenspunkte dazu.\\n• Zerstöre eine Verzauberung deiner Wahl.\\n• Lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf eine Kreatur deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591615&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cd67218d-ee62-41f3-b4a9-a31e74769eca\', \'multiverseId\': 591615}, \'multiverseid\': 591615}, {\'name\': \'Luz de la esperanza\', \'text\': \'Elige uno:\\n• Ganas 4 vidas.\\n• Destruye el encantamiento objetivo.\\n• Pon un contador +1/+1 sobre la criatura objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591744&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8a18b6f0-3692-4aa1-9a37-08090e03bfc4\', \'multiverseId\': 591744}, \'multiverseid\': 591744}, {\'name\': "Lueur d\'espoir", \'text\': "Choisissez l\'un —\\n• Vous gagnez 4 points de vie.\\n• Détruisez un enchantement ciblé.\\n• Mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur une créature ciblée.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591873&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a29ef504-a612-4b3d-818a-534071f55a39\', \'multiverseId\': 591873}, \'multiverseid\': 591873}, {\'name\': \'Luce di Speranza\', \'text\': \'Scegli uno —\\n• Guadagni 4 punti vita.\\n• Distruggi un incantesimo bersaglio.\\n• Metti un segnalino +1/+1 su una creatura bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592002&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cf3c72bd-b04b-4a92-867a-947b48489ccd\', \'multiverseId\': 592002}, \'multiverseid\': 592002}, {\'name\': \'希望の光\', \'text\': \'以下から１つを選ぶ。\\n・あなたは４点のライフを得る。\\n・エンチャント１つを対象とする。それを破壊する。\\n・クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それの上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592131&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'169a7a19-fec7-4396-afa9-b7ec526bd4fc\', \'multiverseId\': 592131}, \'multiverseid\': 592131}, {\'name\': \'希望明光\', \'text\': \'选择一项～\\n•你获得4点生命。\\n•消灭目标结界。\\n•在目标生物上放置一个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592518&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6777ce22-9786-4844-bd15-e3fe7c1b2a8a\', \'multiverseId\': 592518}, \'multiverseid\': 592518}]', '[{\'name\': \'Lichtstute\', \'text\': \'Wenn die Lichtstute ins Spiel kommt, tappe bis zu eine Kreatur deiner Wahl. Du erhältst Lebenspunkte in Höhe der Stärke der Kreatur dazu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Einhorn\', \'flavor\': \'Ein Lichtblick in der dunkelsten Nacht.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591565&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ebbf76fe-38c5-4b69-8ee4-55bdb77ae477\', \'multiverseId\': 591565}, \'multiverseid\': 591565}, {\'name\': \'Yegua radiante\', \'text\': \'Cuando la Yegua radiante entre al campo de batalla, gira hasta una criatura objetivo. Ganas una cantidad de vidas igual a la fuerza de esa criatura.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Unicornio\', \'flavor\': \'Un rayo de esperanza en la noche más oscura.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591694&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'901930e6-1501-4a99-99c3-1d7e1c5b6a88\', \'multiverseId\': 591694}, \'multiverseid\': 591694}, {\'name\': \'Jument de brillance\', \'text\': "Quand la Jument de brillance arrive sur le champ de bataille, engagez jusqu\'à une créature ciblée. Vous gagnez un nombre de points de vie égal à la force de cette créature.", \'type\': \'Créature : licorne\', \'flavor\': "Un rayon d\'espoir éclairant la nuit la plus noire.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591823&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0701179f-840a-4256-a2b9-ea7a9874cc7f\', \'multiverseId\': 591823}, \'multiverseid\': 591823}, {\'name\': \'Splendidestriero\', \'text\': \'Quando lo Splendidestriero entra nel campo di battaglia, TAPpa fino a una creatura bersaglio. Guadagni punti vita pari alla forza di quella creatura.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Unicorno\', \'flavor\': \'Un raggio di speranza nella più buia delle notti.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591952&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'478a60f8-7930-4021-ae01-ae70a1e5464b\', \'multiverseId\': 591952}, \'multiverseid\': 591952}, {\'name\': \'煌々馬\', \'text\': \'煌々馬が戦場に出たとき、クリーチャー最大１体を対象とする。それをタップする。あなたはそのクリーチャーのパワーに等しい点数のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ユニコーン\', \'flavor\': \'闇夜を切裂く、希望の光条。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592081&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5f6e6de6-d5fd-4469-a645-a9e3a25c7a7a\', \'multiverseId\': 592081}, \'multiverseid\': 592081}, {\'name\': \'明驹\', \'text\': \'当明驹进战场时，横置至多一个目标生物。你获得等同于该生物力量的生命。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～独角兽\', \'flavor\': \'至黯黑夜中的希望明光。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592468&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f225bb65-8f96-4db4-adf5-158da8ad96e4\', \'multiverseId\': 592468}, \'multiverseid\': 592468}]', '[{\'name\': \'Lieferantin des Leichenflickers\', \'text\': \'Wenn die Lieferantin des Leichenflickers ins Spiel kommt oder stirbt, millst du drei Karten. (Lege die obersten drei Karten deiner Bibliothek auf deinen Friedhof.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Zombie\', \'flavor\': \'Nichts wird verschwendet.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594129&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4be2b7d4-6b20-4511-9e69-29a8571cbea9\', \'multiverseId\': 594129}, \'multiverseid\': 594129}, {\'name\': \'Proveedora de suturador\', \'text\': \'Cuando la Proveedora de suturador entre al campo de batalla o muera, muele tres cartas. (Pon las tres primeras cartas de tu biblioteca en tu cementerio.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Zombie\', \'flavor\': \'No hay que desperdiciar ningún pedazo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594246&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'497f7958-4dfe-4994-9bed-29263b80026d\', \'multiverseId\': 594246}, \'multiverseid\': 594246}, {\'name\': \'Approvisionneuse du raccommodeur\', \'text\': "Quand l\'Approvisionneuse du raccommodeur arrive sur le champ de bataille ou meurt, meulez trois cartes. (Mettez les trois cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque dans votre cimetière.)", \'type\': \'Créature : zombie\', \'flavor\': \'Rien ne se perd.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594363&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9a71e84a-3ed8-4556-a1ac-9ebdb9637210\', \'multiverseId\': 594363}, \'multiverseid\': 594363}, {\'name\': \'Rifornitrice dei Cucitori\', \'text\': \'Quando la Rifornitrice dei Cucitori entra nel campo di battaglia o muore, macina tre carte. (Metti nel tuo cimitero le prime tre carte del tuo grimorio.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Zombie\', \'flavor\': \'Niente va sprecato.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594480&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'76d65cf5-2855-4acc-88ba-baa6c4e9b1f5\', \'multiverseId\': 594480}, \'multiverseid\': 594480}, {\'name\': \'縫い師への供給者\', \'text\': \'縫い師への供給者が戦場に出るか死亡したとき、カード３枚を切削する。（あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード３枚をあなたの墓地に置く。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ゾンビ\', \'flavor\': \'どんな部位も無駄にはならない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594597&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b69f2d10-97c7-48c6-8370-f4982e10219c\', \'multiverseId\': 594597}, \'multiverseid\': 594597}, {\'name\': \'拼接师备尸\', \'text\': \'当拼接师备尸进战场或死去时，磨三张牌。（将你牌库顶的三张牌置入你的坟墓场。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～灵俑\', \'flavor\': \'一个部位也不浪费。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594948&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'17b039fe-f536-4005-8acf-59f6acde12d7\', \'multiverseId\': 594948}, \'multiverseid\': 594948}]', '[{\'name\': \'Lieferantin des Leichenflickers\', \'text\': \'Wenn die Lieferantin des Leichenflickers ins Spiel kommt oder stirbt, millst du drei Karten. (Lege die obersten drei Karten deiner Bibliothek auf deinen Friedhof.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Zombie\', \'flavor\': \'„Brauchst du eine helfende Hand? Er braucht sie nicht mehr, er ist Linkshänder … und tot."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597102&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'50b8a92a-8627-4fae-b25e-cb5df74dee78\', \'multiverseId\': 597102}, \'multiverseid\': 597102}, {\'name\': \'Proveedora de suturador\', \'text\': \'Cuando la Proveedora de suturador entre al campo de batalla o muera, muele tres cartas.\\n(Pon las tres primeras cartas de tu biblioteca en tu cementerio.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Zombie\', \'flavor\': \'"Deja que te eche una mano. Él no la necesitará, es zurdo... y está muerto".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597148&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c1e86e63-9eb1-43da-9880-16bbeab13b0f\', \'multiverseId\': 597148}, \'multiverseid\': 597148}, {\'name\': \'Approvisionneuse du raccommodeur\', \'text\': "Quand l\'Approvisionneuse du raccommodeur arrive sur le champ de bataille ou meurt, meulez trois cartes. (Mettez les trois cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque dans votre cimetière.)", \'type\': \'Créature : zombie\', \'flavor\': "« Je suis là si tu as besoin d\'un bras droit. Lui, il n\'en aura pas besoin, il est gaucher. Et il est mort. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597194&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c6a2f440-b1ff-40a9-a918-c32cca4185f7\', \'multiverseId\': 597194}, \'multiverseid\': 597194}, {\'name\': \'Rifornitrice dei Cucitori\', \'text\': \'Quando la Rifornitrice dei Cucitori entra nel campo di battaglia o muore, macina tre carte. (Metti nel tuo cimitero le prime tre carte del tuo grimorio.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Zombie\', \'flavor\': \'"Lascia che ti dia una mano. A lui non servirà, è mancino. Ed è anche morto."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597240&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'466dffea-a76a-49e6-a761-6cc1f342a1d5\', \'multiverseId\': 597240}, \'multiverseid\': 597240}, {\'name\': \'縫い師への供給者\', \'text\': \'縫い師への供給者が戦場に出たか死亡したとき、カード３枚を切削する。（あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード３枚をあなたの墓地に置く。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ゾンビ\', \'flavor\': \'「手を貸してあげる。彼には必要ないしね。なにせ彼は左利きだから。あと、死んでる。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597286&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f17a56a4-5ed2-439f-8c15-cfe9028d147c\', \'multiverseId\': 597286}, \'multiverseid\': 597286}, {\'name\': \'拼接师备尸\', \'text\': \'当拼接师备尸进战场或死去时，磨三张牌。（将你牌库顶的三张牌置入你的坟墓场。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～灵俑\', \'flavor\': \'「给你出个手帮忙。他用不上；他是左撇子，而且还死了。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597424&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7d2cbe3a-dc77-4131-b078-f2f4f8cc2ca6\', \'multiverseId\': 597424}, \'multiverseid\': 597424}]', "[{'name': 'Liliana, Regentin des Todes', 'text': '+1: Erzeuge einen 2/2 schwarzen Zombie-Kreaturenspielstein. Du millst zwei Karten.\\n−3: Bringe eine Kreaturenkarte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof ins Spiel zurück. Die Kreatur ist zusätzlich zu ihren anderen Farben und Typen ein schwarzer Zombie.\\n−7: Zerstöre alle Nicht-Zombie-Kreaturen.', 'type': 'Legendärer Planeswalker — Liliana', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594090&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'efc9b385-4b0b-43f6-959e-4a6a6782b9e1', 'multiverseId': 594090}, 'multiverseid': 594090}, {'name': 'Liliana, majestad de la muerte', 'text': '+1: Crea una ficha de criatura Zombie negra 2/2. Muele dos cartas.\\n-3: Regresa la carta de criatura objetivo de tu cementerio al campo de batalla. Esa criatura es un Zombie negro además de sus otros colores y tipos.\\n−7: Destruye todas las criaturas que no sean Zombies.', 'type': 'Planeswalker legendario — Liliana', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594207&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7d4f9105-daf8-4720-a70d-41cc1acb2bef', 'multiverseId': 594207}, 'multiverseid': 594207}, {'name': 'Liliana, majesté de la mort', 'text': '+1 : Créez un jeton de créature 2/2 noire Zombie. Meulez deux cartes.\\n-3: Renvoyez une carte de créature ciblée sur le champ de bataille depuis votre cimetière. Cette créature est un zombie noir en plus de ses autres couleurs et de ses autres types.\\n-7 : Détruisez toutes les créatures non-Zombie.', 'type': 'Planeswalker légendaire : Liliana', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594324&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6fb54d99-a27f-441b-b5fc-c4327350d249', 'multiverseId': 594324}, 'multiverseid': 594324}, {'name': 'Liliana, Maestà della Morte', 'text': '+1: Crea una pedina creatura Zombie 2/2 nera. Macina due carte.\\n−3: Rimetti sul campo di battaglia una carta creatura bersaglio dal tuo cimitero. Quella creatura è uno Zombie nero in aggiunta ai suoi altri tipi e colori.\\n−7: Distruggi tutte le creature non Zombie.', 'type': 'Planeswalker Leggendario — Liliana', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594441&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cb41aded-65e5-427a-becf-fd9659cf3d67', 'multiverseId': 594441}, 'multiverseid': 594441}, {'name': '死の権威、リリアナ', 'text': '+1：黒の２/２のゾンビ・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。カード２枚を切削する。\\n−3：あなたの墓地にあるクリーチャー・カード１枚を対象とする。それを戦場に戻す。それは、それの他の色やタイプに加えて黒のゾンビでもある。\\n−7：ゾンビでないすべてのクリーチャーを破壊する。', 'type': '伝説のプレインズウォーカー — リリアナ', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594558&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '053ee598-6f98-4bdf-88b4-8afe90494347', 'multiverseId': 594558}, 'multiverseid': 594558}, {'name': '亡者女王莉莲娜', 'text': '+1：派出一个2/2黑色灵俑衍生生物。磨两张牌。\\n−3：将目标生物牌从你的坟墓场移回战场。该生物是黑色灵俑，且仍具有原本颜色与类别。\\n−7：消灭所有非灵俑生物。', 'type': '传奇鹏洛客 ～莉莲娜', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594909&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '97339967-e414-4ea8-be23-640fbf50f88f', 'multiverseId': 594909}, 'multiverseid': 594909}]", '[{\'name\': \'Lilianas Elite\', \'text\': \'Lilianas Elite erhält +1/+1 für jede Kreaturenkarte in deinem Friedhof.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Zombie\', \'flavor\': \'„Du musst doch zugeben, Gideon, er macht eine gute Figur."\\n—Liliana Vess\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594091&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0ae2e121-0169-4e61-bfbf-12a1b2fb99fe\', \'multiverseId\': 594091}, \'multiverseid\': 594091}, {\'name\': \'Élite de Liliana\', \'text\': \'La Élite de Liliana obtiene +1/+1 por cada carta de criatura en tu cementerio.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Zombie\', \'flavor\': \'"Admítelo, Gideon: está en plena forma".\\n—Liliana Vess\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594208&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'afc5279c-cb73-4fd0-ad6d-eed506d33b7e\', \'multiverseId\': 594208}, \'multiverseid\': 594208}, {\'name\': \'Élite de Liliana\', \'text\': "L\'Élite de Liliana gagne +1/+1 pour chaque carte de créature dans votre cimetière.", \'type\': \'Créature : zombie\', \'flavor\': "« Tu dois admettre, Gideon, qu\'il est plutôt en forme. »\\n—Liliana Vess", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594325&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e4d57f16-5bd2-4ac0-b2ad-bc1b4cc019b7\', \'multiverseId\': 594325}, \'multiverseid\': 594325}, {\'name\': \'Guardia Scelta di Liliana\', \'text\': \'La Guardia Scelta di Liliana prende +1/+1 per ogni carta creatura nel tuo cimitero.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Zombie\', \'flavor\': \'"Devi ammetterlo, Gideon... non è niente male."\\n—Liliana Vess\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594442&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'83b4ae41-6dff-4593-b1fd-377a18478f5b\', \'multiverseId\': 594442}, \'multiverseid\': 594442}, {\'name\': \'リリアナの精鋭\', \'text\': \'リリアナの精鋭はあなたの墓地にあるクリーチャー・カード１枚につき＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ゾンビ\', \'flavor\': \'「あなたも認めるべきよ、ギデオン。彼の身のこなしは素晴らしいわ。」\\n――リリアナ・ヴェス\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594559&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ba2c1e86-8fdc-4caa-bd0c-bbc7fda3974c\', \'multiverseId\': 594559}, \'multiverseid\': 594559}, {\'name\': \'莉莲娜的精兵\', \'text\': \'你坟墓场中每有一张生物牌，莉莲娜的精兵便得+1/+1。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～灵俑\', \'flavor\': \'「你就承认吧，基定～这家伙很能打。」\\n～莉莲娜维斯\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594910&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'29955c30-c036-40b6-bc6c-fff016828dd7\', \'multiverseId\': 594910}, \'multiverseid\': 594910}]', '[{\'name\': \'Lilianas Regentschaft\', \'text\': \'Zombies, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +1/+1.\\nWenn Lilianas Regentschaft ins Spiel kommt, erzeuge zwei 2/2 schwarze Zombie-Kreaturenspielsteine.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„Es sind so viele … Als hätten sie nur darauf gewartet, jemandem dienen zu dürfen."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594092&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9a410fbc-fc20-47e7-9ec5-449ada39e849\', \'multiverseId\': 594092}, \'multiverseid\': 594092}, {\'name\': \'Dominio de Liliana\', \'text\': \'Los Zombies que controlas obtienen +1/+1.\\nCuando el Dominio de Liliana entre al campo de batalla, crea dos fichas de criatura Zombie negras 2/2.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'"Hay muchísimos. Parece que esperaban a alguien a quien servir".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594209&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f2fdec5f-b945-420c-b38a-b1175a9339b6\', \'multiverseId\': 594209}, \'multiverseid\': 594209}, {\'name\': \'Maîtrise de Liliana\', \'text\': \'Les zombies que vous contrôlez gagnent +1/+1.\\nQuand la Maîtrise de Liliana arrive sur le champ de bataille, créez deux jetons de créature 2/2 noire Zombie.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': "« Il y en a tellement. On croirait qu\'ils attendaient simplement que quelqu\'un les commande. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594326&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ed8c9f72-706d-4db0-b44d-bdc601ed708b\', \'multiverseId\': 594326}, \'multiverseid\': 594326}, {\'name\': \'Maestria di Liliana\', \'text\': \'Gli Zombie che controlli prendono +1/+1.\\nQuando la Maestria di Liliana entra nel campo di battaglia, crea due pedine creatura Zombie 2/2 nere.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'"Ce ne sono così tanti, come se fossero in attesa di qualcuno da servire."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594443&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'de94169a-b5f5-4559-9964-d57598461df5\', \'multiverseId\': 594443}, \'multiverseid\': 594443}, {\'name\': \'リリアナの支配\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしているすべてのゾンビは＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\\nリリアナの支配が戦場に出たとき、黒の２/２のゾンビ・クリーチャー・トークン２体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'「数えきれないほどいるわ。主人たる存在を待っているようね。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594560&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f6861cf5-873a-4112-80e6-775498e07f03\', \'multiverseId\': 594560}, \'multiverseid\': 594560}, {\'name\': \'莉莲娜的掌控\', \'text\': \'由你操控的灵俑得+1/+1。\\n当莉莲娜的掌控进战场时，派出两个2/2黑色灵俑衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'「数量可真多。它们好像正等着服侍人。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594911&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'611f2155-45e8-48a3-9163-9d79f1cd3ae0\', \'multiverseId\': 594911}, \'multiverseid\': 594911}]', '[{\'name\': \'Lilianas Truchsess\', \'text\': \'{T}, opfere Lilianas Truchsess: Ein Gegner deiner Wahl wirft eine Karte ab. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit wie eine Hexerei.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Zombie\', \'flavor\': \'Diener im Herrenhaus Vess werden aufgrund ihrer starken Arbeitsmoral und ihres respektvollen Verhaltens ausgewählt. Am Leben zu sein, ist nicht notwendig.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594093&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'76016c60-3114-48b6-b0dd-812cb6ac4e0f\', \'multiverseId\': 594093}, \'multiverseid\': 594093}, {\'name\': \'Mayordomo de Liliana\', \'text\': \'{T}, sacrificar el Mayordomo de Liliana: El oponente objetivo descarta una carta. Activa esto solo como un conjuro.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Zombie\', \'flavor\': \'Se elige a los sirvientes de la mansión Vess por su gran ética en el trabajo y su educada conducta. Estar vivo no es uno de los requisitos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594210&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9dc56882-8e44-4407-9ecd-db5eca82d4d4\', \'multiverseId\': 594210}, \'multiverseid\': 594210}, {\'name\': \'Intendant de Liliana\', \'text\': "{T}, sacrifiez l\'Intendant de Liliana : Un adversaire ciblé se défausse d\'une carte. N\'activez que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.", \'type\': \'Créature : zombie\', \'flavor\': \'Les serviteurs du manoir Vess sont choisis pour leur éthique professionnelle et leur attitude respectueuse. Être en vie est facultatif.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594327&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7f66c463-f7a4-4526-afd1-6d57fb6e2ed5\', \'multiverseId\': 594327}, \'multiverseid\': 594327}, {\'name\': \'Attendente di Liliana\', \'text\': "{T}, Sacrifica l\'Attendente di Liliana: Un avversario bersaglio scarta una carta. Attiva solo come una stregoneria.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Zombie\', \'flavor\': "La servitù del Maniero Vess viene selezionata per l\'inflessibile etica lavorativa e il contegno rispettoso. Essere vivi non è un requisito fondamentale.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594444&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'766bcd67-d552-4d30-8f1d-8621067c86cd\', \'multiverseId\': 594444}, \'multiverseid\': 594444}, {\'name\': \'リリアナの使用人\', \'text\': \'{T},リリアナの使用人を生け贄に捧げる：対戦相手１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーはカード１枚を捨てる。起動はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ゾンビ\', \'flavor\': \'ヴェスの邸宅では、揺るぎない職務倫理と礼儀正しい振る舞いを重視して使用人を選ぶ。生死は問わない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594561&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'80df8f12-b714-4806-99d2-e2276de15795\', \'multiverseId\': 594561}, \'multiverseid\': 594561}, {\'name\': \'莉莲娜的管家\', \'text\': \'{T}，牺牲莉莲娜的管家：目标对手弃一张牌。只能于法术时机起动。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～灵俑\', \'flavor\': \'维斯宅邸挑选仆从，看重的是敬业态度与得体举止。至于是死是活并不重要。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594912&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f9e0081f-5d02-4497-885e-2918273793d1\', \'multiverseId\': 594912}, \'multiverseid\': 594912}]', '[{\'name\': \'Listiger Bandar\', \'text\': \'{2}{G}: Der Listige Bandar erhält Unzerstörbarkeit bis zum Ende des Zuges. (Schaden und Effekte, die „zerstören", zerstören sie nicht.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Katze, Affe\', \'flavor\': \'Halb Katze, halb Affe und ein vollkommenes Ärgernis.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592938&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a87d2f85-b3d4-418f-82e4-cfa60bbd15fe\', \'multiverseId\': 592938}, \'multiverseid\': 592938}, {\'name\': \'Bandar astuto\', \'text\': \'{2}{G}: El Bandar astuto gana la habilidad de indestructible hasta el final del turno. (El daño y los efectos que dicen "destruir" no la destruyen.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Primate felino\', \'flavor\': \'Parte felino, parte primate, y todo problemas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593059&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'70314139-b8e1-498b-9b7b-4e4f804e0b27\', \'multiverseId\': 593059}, \'multiverseid\': 593059}, {\'name\': \'Bandar rusé\', \'text\': "{2}{G} : Le Bandar rusé acquiert l\'indestructible jusqu\'à la fin du tour. (Les blessures et les effets qui disent « détruisez » ne le détruisent pas.)", \'type\': \'Créature : chat et singe\', \'flavor\': "Mi-félin, mi-primate, source d\'ennuis du museau à la queue.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593180&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0420727c-a53b-4d46-83d5-023422e300a4\', \'multiverseId\': 593180}, \'multiverseid\': 593180}, {\'name\': \'Bandar Astuto\', \'text\': \'{2}{G}: Il Bandar Astuto ha indistruttibile fino alla fine del turno. (Il danno e gli effetti che dicono "distruggi" non lo distruggono.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Scimmia Felino\', \'flavor\': \'50% felino, 50% primate, 100% disastroso.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593301&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'59f2fedf-f58c-4774-985d-73562ed3dab4\', \'multiverseId\': 593301}, \'multiverseid\': 593301}, {\'name\': \'狡猾な猫猿\', \'text\': \'{2}{G}：ターン終了時まで、狡猾な猫猿は破壊不能を得る。（ダメージや「破壊」と書かれた効果では、これは破壊されない。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 猫・猿\', \'flavor\': \'半分が猫、半分が猿、全部が厄介。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593422&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'44ad2e79-2c41-477e-b7c5-055bcfd44b8b\', \'multiverseId\': 593422}, \'multiverseid\': 593422}, {\'name\': \'狡诈猫猴\', \'text\': \'{2}{G}：狡诈猫猴获得不灭异能直到回合结束。（伤害与注明「消灭」的效应不会将它消灭。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～猫／猴\', \'flavor\': \'半猫半猴，麻烦重重。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593785&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c1daea9d-5c3d-4f2b-bded-23729889e85c\', \'multiverseId\': 593785}, \'multiverseid\': 593785}]', '[{\'name\': \'Lita, Maschineningenieurin\', \'text\': \'Wachsamkeit\\nZu Beginn deines Endsegments enttappst du alle anderen Artefaktkreaturen, die du kontrollierst.\\n{3}{W}, {T}: Erzeuge einen 5/5 farblosen Fahrzeug-Artefaktspielstein namens Zeppelin mit Flugfähigkeit und Bemannen 3. (Er hat „Tappe eine beliebige Anzahl an Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst und die zusammen Stärke 3 oder mehr haben: Dieses Fahrzeug wird bis zum Ende des Zuges zu einer Artefaktkreatur.")\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Artefaktkreatur — Handwerker\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589611&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2b5e8abc-b1b9-49ce-b54c-7d7e47749250\', \'multiverseId\': 589611}, \'multiverseid\': 589611}, {\'name\': \'Lita, ingeniera mecánica\', \'text\': \'Vigilancia.\\nAl comienzo de tu paso final, endereza cada otra criatura artefacto que controlas.\\n{3}{W}, {T}: Crea una ficha de artefacto Vehículo incolora 5/5 llamada Zepelín con las habilidades de volar y tripular 3. (Tiene "Girar cualquier cantidad de criaturas que controlas con una fuerza total de 3 o más: Este Vehículo se convierte en una criatura artefacto hasta el final del turno.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto legendaria — Artífice\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589662&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d9632814-5111-4820-b9e4-10893799f33d\', \'multiverseId\': 589662}, \'multiverseid\': 589662}, {\'name\': \'Lita, ingénieure mécanique\', \'text\': "Vigilance\\nAu début de votre étape de fin, dégagez chaque autre créature-artefact que vous contrôlez.\\n{3}{W}, {T} : Créez un jeton d\'artefact 5/5 incolore Véhicule appelé Zeppelin avec le vol et pilotage 3. (Il a « Engagez n\'importe quel nombre de créatures que vous contrôlez dont la force totale est supérieure ou égale à 3 : Ce véhicule devient une créature-artefact jusqu\'à la fin du tour. »)", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact légendaire : artificier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589713&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a5d98b7b-b44e-4231-b874-7d52733b3503\', \'multiverseId\': 589713}, \'multiverseid\': 589713}, {\'name\': \'Lita, Ingegnera Meccanica\', \'text\': \'Cautela\\nAll\\\'inizio della tua sottofase finale, STAPpa ogni altra creatura artefatto che controlli.\\n{3}{W}, {T}: Crea una pedina artefatto Veicolo 5/5 incolore chiamata Zeppelin con volare e manovrare 3. (Ha "TAPpa un qualsiasi numero di creature che controlli con forza totale pari o superiore a 3: Questo Veicolo diventa una creatura artefatto fino alla fine del turno".)\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto Leggendaria — Artefice\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589764&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e876ae95-6590-4db3-a2ba-67780a8777c6\', \'multiverseId\': 589764}, \'multiverseid\': 589764}, {\'name\': \'機械技師、リタ\', \'text\': \'警戒\\nあなたの終了ステップの開始時に、あなたがコントロールしていてこれでないすべてのアーティファクト・クリーチャーをアンタップする。\\n{3}{W},{T}：「ツェッペリン」という名前で飛行と搭乗３を持つ無色の５/５の機体・アーティファクト・トークン１つを生成する。（それは「あなたがコントロールしている望む数のクリーチャーを、パワーの合計が３以上になるように選んでタップする：ターン終了時まで、この機体はアーティファクト・クリーチャーになる。」を持つ。）\', \'type\': \'伝説のアーティファクト・クリーチャー — 工匠\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589815&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6582c6e5-bc6c-4a7b-bade-61dd369371aa\', \'multiverseId\': 589815}, \'multiverseid\': 589815}, {\'name\': \'机械工程师莉塔\', \'text\': \'警戒\\n在你的结束步骤开始时，重置所有由你操控的其他神器生物。\\n{3}{W}，{T}：派出一个5/5无色，名称为飞艇的载具衍生神器，且具有飞行与搭载3。（它具有「横置任意数量由你操控且力量总和等于或大于3的生物：此载具成为神器生物直到回合结束。」）\', \'type\': \'传奇神器生物 ～神器师\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589968&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6eafcce1-37c6-470e-a534-f90dfaf2f0c1\', \'multiverseId\': 589968}, \'multiverseid\': 589968}]', "[{'name': 'Littjara-Sippensucher', 'text': 'Wandelwicht (Diese Karte hat alle Kreaturentypen.)\\nWenn die Littjara-Sippensucher ins Spiel kommen und falls du drei oder mehr Kreaturen kontrollierst, die einen Kreaturentyp gemeinsam haben, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf die Littjara-Sippensucher und wende dann Hellsicht 1 an. (Schaue dir die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek an. Du kannst sie unter deine Bibliothek legen.)', 'type': 'Kreatur — Gestaltwandler', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595241&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '52dd54ad-7873-4bf4-b288-ed6ccaf979ed', 'multiverseId': 595241}, 'multiverseid': 595241}, {'name': 'Buscasemejantes de Littjara', 'text': 'Cambiaformas. (Esta carta es de todos los tipos de criatura.)\\nCuando los Buscasemejantes de Littjara entren al campo de batalla, si controlas tres o más criaturas que comparten un tipo de criatura, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre los Buscasemejantes de Littjara y luego adivina 1. (Mira la primera carta de tu biblioteca. Puedes poner esa carta en el fondo de tu biblioteca.)', 'type': 'Criatura — Metamorfo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595349&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b9fe5bd1-edfc-4a2d-b661-dc54ea41abb9', 'multiverseId': 595349}, 'multiverseid': 595349}, {'name': 'Chercheurs de sang de Littjara', 'text': 'Changelin (Cette carte a tous les types de créature.)\\nQuand les Chercheurs de sang de Littjara arrivent sur le champ de bataille, si vous contrôlez au moins trois créatures qui partagent un type de créature, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur les Chercheurs de sang de Littjara, puis regard 1. (Regardez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Vous pouvez la mettre au-dessous de votre bibliothèque.)', 'type': 'Créature : changeforme', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595457&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a50dfc64-ca76-4314-aa08-323d588fc276', 'multiverseId': 595457}, 'multiverseid': 595457}, {'name': 'Cercasimili di Littjara', 'text': 'Cangiante (Questa carta ha tutti i tipi di creatura.)\\nQuando i Cercasimili di Littjara entrano nel campo di battaglia, se controlli tre o più creature che condividono un tipo di creatura, metti un segnalino +1/+1 sui Cercasimili di Littjara, poi profetizza 1. (Guarda la prima carta del tuo grimorio. Puoi mettere quella carta in fondo al tuo grimorio.)', 'type': 'Creatura — Polimorfo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595565&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'db063975-77ba-4da3-b674-1eba8efa5bd5', 'multiverseId': 595565}, 'multiverseid': 595565}, {'name': 'リトヤラの同族探し', 'text': '多相（このカードはすべてのクリーチャー・タイプである。）\\nリトヤラの同族探しが戦場に出たとき、あなたが共通のクリーチャー・タイプ１つを持つ３体以上のクリーチャーをコントロールしている場合、リトヤラの同族探しの上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置き、その後、占術１を行う。（あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード１枚を見る。あなたはそのカードをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に置いてもよい。）', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 多相の戦士', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595673&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '63b549bd-f233-4e26-bc78-e4066e53eb3b', 'multiverseId': 595673}, 'multiverseid': 595673}, {'name': '利雅拉寻亲人', 'text': '化形（此牌是所有生物类别。）\\n当利雅拉寻亲人进战场时，若你操控三个或更多具共通生物类别的生物，则在利雅拉寻亲人上放置一个+1/+1指示物，然后占卜1。（检视你牌库顶的牌。你可以将该牌置于你的牌库底。）', 'type': '生物 ～变形兽', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595997&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '200b81c9-0a23-46fc-9e9f-3cfeae7a6450', 'multiverseId': 595997}, 'multiverseid': 595997}]", '[{\'name\': \'Locthwain-Gargoyle\', \'text\': \'{4}: Der Locthwain-Gargoyle erhält +2/+0 und Flugfähigkeit bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Gargoyle\', \'flavor\': \'„Als der Verräter über den Hof eilte, sprangen seine Augen auf. Es war Zeit, der Königin einen Besuch abzustatten."\\n—*Jenseits des Großen Steinkreises*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596287&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'134c817f-4f7b-4d34-a558-8954c4fbd461\', \'multiverseId\': 596287}, \'multiverseid\': 596287}, {\'name\': \'Gárgola de Nimboscuro\', \'text\': \'{4}: La Gárgola de Nimboscuro obtiene +2/+0 y gana la habilidad de volar hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Gárgola\', \'flavor\': \'"Mientras el traidor atravesaba corriendo el patio del castillo, los ojos de la gárgola se abrieron. Era hora de ir a ver a la reina".\\n—*Más allá del Gran Crómlech*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596374&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bb0100b1-97b3-46e0-9cfc-9379ff8dd55e\', \'multiverseId\': 596374}, \'multiverseid\': 596374}, {\'name\': \'Gargouille de Locthwain\', \'text\': "{4} : La Gargouille de Locthwain gagne +2/+0 et acquiert le vol jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : gargouille\', \'flavor\': "« Tandis que le traître se hâtait de traverser la cour, ses yeux s\'ouvrirent brusquement. L\'heure était venue de rendre visite à la reine. »\\n—*Au-delà du Grand Cromlech*", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596461&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'70a0b0dd-7646-4903-92b9-ecef3500767e\', \'multiverseId\': 596461}, \'multiverseid\': 596461}, {\'name\': \'Gargoyle di Loctevenna\', \'text\': \'{4}: Il Gargoyle di Loctevenna prende +2/+0 e ha volare fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Gargoyle\', \'flavor\': \'"Mentre il traditore attraversava di corsa il cortile, i suoi occhi si spalancarono. Era ora di far visita alla regina."\\n—*Oltre il Grande Monolito*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596548&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cb6947de-ef5d-4357-812b-47475fb8b81d\', \'multiverseId\': 596548}, \'multiverseid\': 596548}, {\'name\': \'ロークスワインのガーゴイル\', \'text\': \'{4}：ターン終了時まで、ロークスワインのガーゴイルは＋２/＋０の修整を受け飛行を得る。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — ガーゴイル\', \'flavor\': \'「裏切り者が中庭を横切ると、その目が開いた。女王を訪ねる時が来た。」\\n――*グレートヘンジを超えて*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596635&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f8e09003-ae0d-4a86-92ea-8c4b0b6ebea8\', \'multiverseId\': 596635}, \'multiverseid\': 596635}, {\'name\': \'洛司温石像鬼\', \'text\': \'{4}：直到回合结束，洛司温石像鬼得+2/+0且获得飞行异能。\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～石像鬼\', \'flavor\': \'「叛徒慌张地穿过庭院，它的双眼突然睁开。拜访女王的时候到了。」\\n～*《圆石阵奇谭》*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596896&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'259e8ae6-201d-4c1f-9179-65a62ebe4724\', \'multiverseId\': 596896}, \'multiverseid\': 596896}]', '[{\'name\': \'Loxodon-Kriegshammer\', \'text\': \'Die ausgerüstete Kreatur erhält +3/+0, hat Lebensverknüpfung und verursacht Trampelschaden.\\nAusrüsten {3}\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Ausrüstung\', \'flavor\': \'„Ein Schmied muss seine Waffe mit einem Teil seiner Seele erfüllen — dessen sind die Phyrexianer nicht fähig."\\n—Melira, Sylvok-Ausgestoßene\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596288&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'81c88d5b-19cc-4fc0-aa6a-e1bb232c4da9\', \'multiverseId\': 596288}, \'multiverseid\': 596288}, {\'name\': \'Martillo de guerra loxodón\', \'text\': \'La criatura equipada obtiene +3/+0 y tiene las habilidades de arrollar y vínculo vital.\\nEquipar {3}.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto — Equipo\', \'flavor\': \'"Un herrero debe imbuir en su arma parte de su alma... Algo de lo que los pirexianos son incapaces".\\n—Melira, paria sylvok\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596375&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'197647e0-02b3-45dc-8e91-a1fa162273da\', \'multiverseId\': 596375}, \'multiverseid\': 596375}, {\'name\': \'Marteau de guerre loxodon\', \'text\': \'La créature équipée gagne +3/+0 et a le piétinement et le lien de vie.\\nÉquipement {3}\', \'type\': \'Artefact : équipement\', \'flavor\': "« Un façonneur doit imprégner son arme d\'une partie de son âme — ce dont les Phyrexians sont bien incapables. »\\n—Melira, proscrite sylvoke", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596462&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e55447df-7ff7-4b96-b2f5-fcd69702faff\', \'multiverseId\': 596462}, \'multiverseid\': 596462}, {\'name\': \'Martello da Guerra Lossodonte\', \'text\': \'La creatura equipaggiata prende +3/+0 e ha travolgere e legame vitale.\\nEquipaggiare {3}\', \'type\': \'Artefatto — Equipaggiamento\', \'flavor\': \'"Un\\\'artefice deve infondere nella sua arma parte della propria anima: un processo impossibile per gli orrori di Phyrexia."\\n—Melira, reietta Sylvok\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596549&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b9a4a789-0178-43ee-ba8d-84fe9245c251\', \'multiverseId\': 596549}, \'multiverseid\': 596549}, {\'name\': \'ロクソドンの戦槌\', \'text\': \'装備しているクリーチャーは＋３/＋０の修整を受けトランプルと絆魂を持つ。\\n装備{3}\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 装備品\', \'flavor\': \'「造り士は武器に自分の魂の一部を埋め込まなくてはならないの。これはファイレクシア人にはできない芸当だけどね。」\\n――シルヴォクののけ者、メリーラ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596636&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f5070a71-9ab7-4004-a2cc-6c66c93e1193\', \'multiverseId\': 596636}, \'multiverseid\': 596636}, {\'name\': \'象族战锤\', \'text\': \'佩带此武具的生物得+3/+0且具有践踏与系命异能。\\n佩带{3}\', \'type\': \'神器 ～武具\', \'flavor\': \'「巧匠打造武器时必定会将心血甚至灵魂灌注其中～这一点非瑞克西亚人永远没法做到。」\\n～希沃克黜人梅梨莱\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596897&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0f66a0a3-8ff8-4690-9fff-3f41e5abb131\', \'multiverseId\': 596897}, \'multiverseid\': 596897}]', '[{\'name\': \'Luftfahrender Tüftler\', \'text\': \'Der Luftfahrende Tüftler hat Flugfähigkeit, solange du ein Artefakt kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Handwerker\', \'flavor\': \'„Alle Tüftler stecken mit dem Kopf in den Wolken. Damit gebe ich mich nicht zufrieden."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595194&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b68fb75a-eeef-4753-811b-81106c0298a1\', \'multiverseId\': 595194}, \'multiverseid\': 595194}, {\'name\': \'Reparador de aeronaves\', \'text\': \'El Reparador de aeronaves tiene la habilidad de volar mientras controles un artefacto.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Artífice humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Todos los reparadores tienen la cabeza en las nubes. Mi intención es llegar aún más lejos".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595302&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cf2a2507-a462-435f-966e-b0a0e9196e92\', \'multiverseId\': 595302}, \'multiverseid\': 595302}, {\'name\': \'Aéronaute bricoleur\', \'text\': "L\'Aéronaute bricoleur a le vol tant que vous contrôlez un artefact.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et artificier\', \'flavor\': "« Tous les bricoleurs ont la tête dans les nuages. Je ne compte pas m\'arrêter là. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595410&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ea2e3be5-47be-49e0-a826-aff53ea17ebc\', \'multiverseId\': 595410}, \'multiverseid\': 595410}, {\'name\': \'Aeronauta Sperimentatore\', \'text\': "L\'Aeronauta Sperimentatore ha volare fintanto che controlli un artefatto.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Artefice Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Tutti gli inventori hanno la testa fra le nuvole. Io voglio spingermi più in alto."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595518&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ebbde373-23bd-4187-a023-93004ac9a2ed\', \'multiverseId\': 595518}, \'multiverseid\': 595518}, {\'name\': \'飛空士の修繕屋\', \'text\': \'あなたがアーティファクトをコントロールしているかぎり、飛空士の修繕屋は飛行を持つ。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・工匠\', \'flavor\': \'「修繕屋はどいつもこいつも頼りない奴ばかりだ。俺はどんどん上を目指すつもりだ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595626&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3dfbfe2d-b73b-4f6e-92de-66e61ac18fc0\', \'multiverseId\': 595626}, \'multiverseid\': 595626}, {\'name\': \'空行修补匠\', \'text\': \'只要你操控神器，空行修补匠便具有飞行异能。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／神器师\', \'flavor\': \'「所有的修补匠都在异想天开。可我不想只能开天。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595950&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a121361b-37df-4b20-b4d6-d3fff50d56b8\', \'multiverseId\': 595950}, \'multiverseid\': 595950}]', '[{\'name\': \'Luftfahrtpionierin\', \'text\': \'Wenn die Luftfahrtpionierin ins Spiel kommt, erzeuge einen 1/1 farblosen Thopter-Artefaktkreaturenspielstein mit Flugfähigkeit.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Handwerker\', \'flavor\': \'„Sie sagen, Perfektion sei unmöglich, aber das sagten sie auch übers Fliegen."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595201&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9fa2af44-4fdc-42f3-95b6-7b6320af8e1b\', \'multiverseId\': 595201}, \'multiverseid\': 595201}, {\'name\': \'Pionera de la aviación\', \'text\': \'Cuando la Pionera de la aviación entre al campo de batalla, crea una ficha de criatura artefacto Tóptero incolora 1/1 con la habilidad de volar.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Artífice humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Dicen que la perfección es inalcanzable, pero lo mismo decían de volar".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595309&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ced15f28-7b66-4a5e-a543-f42eac3601b7\', \'multiverseId\': 595309}, \'multiverseid\': 595309}, {\'name\': "Pionnière de l\'aviation", \'text\': "Quand la Pionnière de l\'aviation arrive sur le champ de bataille, créez un jeton de créature-artefact 1/1 incolore Mécanoptère avec le vol.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et artificier\', \'flavor\': \'« Ils disent que la perfection est impossible, mais ils disaient la même chose à propos du vol. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595417&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'127d4ca7-cc8b-481c-a37f-558be1edd6f0\', \'multiverseId\': 595417}, \'multiverseid\': 595417}, {\'name\': "Pioniera dell\'Aviazione", \'text\': "Quando la Pioniera dell\'Aviazione entra nel campo di battaglia, crea una pedina creatura artefatto Tottero 1/1 incolore con volare.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Artefice Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Dicono che la perfezione non esiste, così come dicevano che era impossibile volare."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595525&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'db4f3657-26d1-4d93-ac04-56b21200e4f5\', \'multiverseId\': 595525}, \'multiverseid\': 595525}, {\'name\': \'飛行の先駆者\', \'text\': \'飛行の先駆者が戦場に出たとき、飛行を持つ無色の１/１の飛行機械・アーティファクト・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・工匠\', \'flavor\': \'「完璧など不可能だと人は言いますが、飛行もかつてはそう言われていたんです。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595633&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a43079d9-0b10-4106-acdb-d7011de4d99b\', \'multiverseId\': 595633}, \'multiverseid\': 595633}, {\'name\': \'翔空先驱\', \'text\': \'当翔空先驱进战场时，派出一个1/1无色，具飞行异能的振翼机衍生神器生物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／神器师\', \'flavor\': \'「他们口口声声说完美不可及，但他们之前对飞行也是这态度。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595957&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9c31ac65-c50c-492d-ac4b-060a42f1d7cc\', \'multiverseId\': 595957}, \'multiverseid\': 595957}]', '[{\'name\': \'Lumengrid-Wachposten\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nImmer wenn ein Artefakt unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, kannst du eine bleibende Karte deiner Wahl tappen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': \'Als wüssten sie bereits von kommenden Eindringlingen, beauftragen die Vedalken ihre Neurok-Wachposten, über die Ufer der Quecksilbersee zu wachen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595243&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'786423fb-2fe7-40f6-9316-7a799f5d933e\', \'multiverseId\': 595243}, \'multiverseid\': 595243}, {\'name\': \'Centinela de Lúmengrid\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nSiempre que un artefacto entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, puedes girar el permanente objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero humano\', \'flavor\': \'Los vedalken ordenan a sus centinelas néurok que vigilen las costas del Mar de Mercurio, como si supieran de los intrusos que están por llegar.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595351&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2dadd2c5-5b1a-4015-84aa-ba3527b83d4e\', \'multiverseId\': 595351}, \'multiverseid\': 595351}, {\'name\': \'Sentinelle de Lumengrid\', \'text\': "Vol\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'un artefact arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, vous pouvez engager un permanent ciblé.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et sorcier\', \'flavor\': "Les vedalkens ordonnent à leurs sentinelles neurokes de surveiller les côtes de la Mer de Vif-argent, comme s\'ils s\'attendaient à la visite d\'autres intrus.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595459&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'14ac390d-1482-4973-9187-4b013b87f71a\', \'multiverseId\': 595459}, \'multiverseid\': 595459}, {\'name\': \'Sentinella del Lumengrid\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nOgniqualvolta un artefatto entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, puoi TAPpare un permanente bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Mago Umano\', \'flavor\': \'I vedalken ordinano alle proprie sentinelle Neurok di sorvegliare le sponde del Mare di Mercurio, come se già sapessero di intrusi a venire.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595567&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3acbf705-8bb3-410b-b6b4-2d62fa5d0208\', \'multiverseId\': 595567}, \'multiverseid\': 595567}, {\'name\': \'ルーメングリッドの歩哨\', \'text\': \'飛行\\nアーティファクト１つがあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、パーマネント１つを対象とする。あなたはそれをタップしてもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': \'ヴィダルケンは、ニューロックの歩哨に水銀海の海岸を見張るよう命じている。それはまるで侵入者が来るのを知っているかのようだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595675&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1a46863f-5948-4988-96b7-1d7a56b9f422\', \'multiverseId\': 595675}, \'multiverseid\': 595675}, {\'name\': \'博识都哨兵\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n每当一个神器在你的操控下进战场时，你可以横置目标永久物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／法术师\', \'flavor\': \'维多肯族命令纽若克哨兵监视水银海沿岸，好似知晓入侵者终将由此到来。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595999&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'116041db-ef21-4a85-adeb-448a98faa4f6\', \'multiverseId\': 595999}, \'multiverseid\': 595999}]', '[{\'name\': \'Lyra Morgenbringer\', \'text\': \'Fliegend, Erstschlag, Lebensverknüpfung\\nAndere Engel, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +1/+1 und haben Lebensverknüpfung.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Engel\', \'flavor\': \'„Du bist nicht allein. Du warst nie allein."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591616&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d1347ed8-c0cf-47b8-bd3c-1eaa5b9175b1\', \'multiverseId\': 591616}, \'multiverseid\': 591616}, {\'name\': \'Lyra Portaalba\', \'text\': \'Vuela, daña primero, vínculo vital.\\nLos otros Ángeles que controlas obtienen +1/+1 y tienen la habilidad de vínculo vital.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Ángel\', \'flavor\': \'"No estás solo. Nunca lo estuviste".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591745&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c622f5cd-d0df-4b5f-a602-45ecabee056a\', \'multiverseId\': 591745}, \'multiverseid\': 591745}, {\'name\': \'Lyra Aubevenant\', \'text\': \'Vol, initiative, lien de vie\\nLes autres anges que vous contrôlez gagnent +1/+1 et ont le lien de vie.\', \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : ange\', \'flavor\': "« Vous n\'êtes pas seul. Vous ne l\'avez jamais été. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591874&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'823d8258-e8a0-4b10-94d0-7c76c9e39c9e\', \'multiverseId\': 591874}, \'multiverseid\': 591874}, {\'name\': \'Lyra Dawnbringer\', \'text\': \'Volare, attacco improvviso, legame vitale\\nGli altri Angeli che controlli prendono +1/+1 e hanno legame vitale.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Angelo\', \'flavor\': \'"Non sei solo. Non lo sei mai stato."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592003&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'80f20cfe-9889-4eb3-a100-5ce7ab9586c5\', \'multiverseId\': 592003}, \'multiverseid\': 592003}, {\'name\': \'黎明をもたらす者ライラ\', \'text\': \'飛行、先制攻撃、絆魂\\nあなたがコントロールしていてこれでないすべての天使は、＋１/＋１の修整を受け絆魂を持つ。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 天使\', \'flavor\': \'「あなたは独りではないわ。今までもずっと。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592132&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4cc025c1-bae3-4e17-a3ce-69c1703cbc6c\', \'multiverseId\': 592132}, \'multiverseid\': 592132}, {\'name\': \'黎明使者莱拉\', \'text\': \'飞行，先攻，系命\\n由你操控的其他天使得+1/+1且具有系命异能。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～天使\', \'flavor\': \'「你非孤军奋战。我们始终相伴。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592519&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ec7556ff-da56-433e-b460-5688ff6fdb95\', \'multiverseId\': 592519}, \'multiverseid\': 592519}]', "[{'name': 'Lähmende Kälte', 'text': 'Tappe eine Kreatur deiner Wahl. Sie enttappt nicht während des nächsten Enttappsegments ihres Beherrschers.\\nZiehe eine Karte.', 'type': 'Spontanzauber', 'flavor': 'In der Stille des Eises verstummen selbst die Träume.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595210&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '28106639-5b4d-41ab-b7e4-adf4ed00c392', 'multiverseId': 595210}, 'multiverseid': 595210}, {'name': 'Frío mutilador', 'text': 'Gira la criatura objetivo. No se endereza durante el próximo paso de enderezar de su controlador.\\nRoba una carta.', 'type': 'Instantáneo', 'flavor': 'En el silencio del hielo, incluso los sueños permanecen en calma.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595318&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '35872ea0-7be5-4b82-b020-bfe4cdc3be78', 'multiverseId': 595318}, 'multiverseid': 595318}, {'name': 'Refroidissement paralysant', 'text': 'Engagez une créature ciblée. Elle ne se dégage pas pendant la prochaine étape de dégagement de son contrôleur.\\nPiochez une carte.', 'type': 'Éphémère', 'flavor': 'Dans le silence de la glace, même les rêves se figent.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595426&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '86e796fd-a45f-451b-9752-ec8e93958f74', 'multiverseId': 595426}, 'multiverseid': 595426}, {'name': 'Gelo Invalidante', 'text': 'TAPpa una creatura bersaglio. Quella creatura non STAPpa durante il prossimo STAP del suo controllore.\\nPesca una carta.', 'type': 'Istantaneo', 'flavor': 'Nel silenzio del ghiaccio, persino i sogni diventano inerti.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595534&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4ba4f25f-b58f-4981-a490-1371fd9da47f', 'multiverseId': 595534}, 'multiverseid': 595534}, {'name': '悪寒', 'text': 'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それをタップする。それは次のそれのコントローラーのアンタップ・ステップにアンタップしない。\\nカード１枚を引く。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': '氷の沈黙の下では、夢すらも静止する。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595642&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3513bec8-235b-44ee-a71c-8162b9f5e194', 'multiverseId': 595642}, 'multiverseid': 595642}, {'name': '致残冰寒', 'text': '横置目标生物。它于其操控者的下一个重置步骤中不能重置。\\n抓一张牌。', 'type': '瞬间', 'flavor': '寒冰无言，就连梦境也随之静止。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595966&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4379c568-a5a6-43ce-b8a5-684846f64880', 'multiverseId': 595966}, 'multiverseid': 595966}]", '[{\'name\': \'Macht der Seele\', \'text\': \'Lege X +1/+1-Marken auf eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, wobei X gleich der Stärke der Kreatur ist.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Er formt einen Avatar aus Instinkt und Kraft.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592930&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fe83819e-2119-480d-85d7-34fe1268dc7d\', \'multiverseId\': 592930}, \'multiverseid\': 592930}, {\'name\': \'Poder del alma\', \'text\': \'Pon X contadores +1/+1 sobre la criatura objetivo, donde X es la fuerza de esa criatura.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Esculpe un avatar de instinto y fuerza.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593051&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b27bc1ab-2e3e-4dc3-9a3e-adeddfc66642\', \'multiverseId\': 593051}, \'multiverseid\': 593051}, {\'name\': "Puissance de l\'âme", \'text\': \'Mettez X marqueurs +1/+1 sur une créature ciblée, X étant la force de cette créature.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Un avatar qu\'il sculpte avec l\'instinct et la force.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593172&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d37a7838-4fd0-4932-a771-ac98cf08138f\', \'multiverseId\': 593172}, \'multiverseid\': 593172}, {\'name\': "Potenza dell\'Anima", \'text\': \'Metti X segnalini +1/+1 su una creatura bersaglio, dove X è la forza di quella creatura.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'Scolpisce un avatar di forza e istinto.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593293&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7f538b96-0ce4-415b-9f21-28cd01bff10d\', \'multiverseId\': 593293}, \'multiverseid\': 593293}, {\'name\': \'魂の力\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それの上に＋１/＋１カウンターＸ個を置く。Ｘはそのクリーチャーのパワーに等しい。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'本能と力を象った化身。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593414&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a6a9e217-104b-4b11-9b5a-ee24c2a9f088\', \'multiverseId\': 593414}, \'multiverseid\': 593414}, {\'name\': \'灵魂瀚力\', \'text\': \'在目标生物上放置X个+1/+1指示物，X为该生物的力量。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'以直觉与力量塑造的化身。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593777&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b3bf6e9b-05ae-42bd-91a1-5ef304a96b9d\', \'multiverseId\': 593777}, \'multiverseid\': 593777}]', '[{\'name\': \'Magmalenkerin\', \'text\': \'Solange sich vier oder mehr Spontanzauber- und/oder Hexereikarten in deinem Friedhof befinden, erhält die Magmalenkerin +3/+1.\\n{T}, wirf eine Karte ab: Schicke die obersten zwei Karten deiner Bibliothek ins Exil und bestimme dann eine davon. Du kannst sie in diesem Zug spielen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590279&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'234bd747-7444-4bf3-9090-741c1adae50d\', \'multiverseId\': 590279}, \'multiverseid\': 590279}, {\'name\': \'Canalizadora magmática\', \'text\': \'Mientras haya cuatro o más cartas de instantáneo y/o de conjuro en tu cementerio, la Canalizadora magmática obtiene +3/+1.\\n{T}, descartar una carta: Exilia las dos primeras cartas de tu biblioteca, luego elige una de ellas. Puedes jugar esa carta este turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590414&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fa7cdff0-a30c-4516-9828-e29668fe6400\', \'multiverseId\': 590414}, \'multiverseid\': 590414}, {\'name\': \'Canaliseuse magmatique\', \'text\': "Tant qu\'il y a au moins quatre cartes d\'éphémère et/ou de rituel dans votre cimetière, la Canaliseuse magmatique gagne +3/+1.\\n{T}, défaussez-vous d\'une carte : Exilez les deux cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque, puis choisissez l\'une d\'entre elles. Vous pouvez jouer cette carte ce tour-ci.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et sorcier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590549&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0c97903f-b1cc-4892-ad11-1a6917878430\', \'multiverseId\': 590549}, \'multiverseid\': 590549}, {\'name\': \'Incanalatrice Magmatica\', \'text\': "Fintanto che nel tuo cimitero ci sono quattro o più carte istantaneo e/o stregoneria, l\'Incanalatrice Magmatica prende +3/+1.\\n{T}, Scarta una carta: Esilia le prime due carte del tuo grimorio, poi scegli una di esse. Puoi giocare quella carta in questo turno.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Mago Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590684&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2ee5de5a-441b-4c71-9c55-4a9e78aff327\', \'multiverseId\': 590684}, \'multiverseid\': 590684}, {\'name\': \'マグマの媒介者\', \'text\': \'あなたの墓地にありインスタントやソーサリーであるカードが４枚以上であるかぎり、マグマの媒介者は＋３/＋１の修整を受ける。\\n{T}, カード１枚を捨てる：あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード２枚を追放し、その後、そのうち１枚を選ぶ。このターン、あなたはそのカードをプレイしてもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590819&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c7585236-3695-4bec-876e-ee450988f51b\', \'multiverseId\': 590819}, \'multiverseid\': 590819}, {\'name\': \'岩浆联能师\', \'text\': \'只要你坟墓场中有四张或更多瞬间和／或法术牌，岩浆联能师便得+3/+1。\\n{T}，弃一张牌：放逐你牌库顶的两张牌，然后选择其中一张。本回合中，你可以使用该牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／法术师\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591224&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'10f18260-f25f-4599-9fe2-10c2092ce395\', \'multiverseId\': 591224}, \'multiverseid\': 591224}]', '[{\'name\': \'Mahlfeld-Zwillinge\', \'text\': \'Wenn die Mahlfeld-Zwillinge sterben, erzeuge zwei 2/2 schwarze Zombie-Kreaturenspielsteine.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Zombie\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich würde es nie wagen, eine Familie auseinanderzureißen."\\n—Gisa die Ghulruferin\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594095&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fdbf32a8-f7b9-4fad-b7ea-fc40cd575a84\', \'multiverseId\': 594095}, \'multiverseid\': 594095}, {\'name\': \'Gemelos de Maalfeld\', \'text\': \'Cuando los Gemelos de Maalfeld mueran, crea dos fichas de criatura Zombie negras 2/2.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Zombie\', \'flavor\': \'"¿Quién soy yo para separar a una familia?".\\n—Gisa, la llamamuertos\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594212&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ff3686a2-8221-464e-a093-96f9e7f0c1f2\', \'multiverseId\': 594212}, \'multiverseid\': 594212}, {\'name\': \'Jumeaux de Maälfeld\', \'text\': \'Quand les Jumeaux de Maälfeld meurent, créez deux jetons de créature 2/2 noire Zombie.\', \'type\': \'Créature : zombie\', \'flavor\': \'« Pourquoi séparer une famille ? »\\n—Gisa, meneuse de goule\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594329&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d70406f6-8c2e-4c4a-8f7c-c0ab0737c3de\', \'multiverseId\': 594329}, \'multiverseid\': 594329}, {\'name\': \'Gemelli di Maalfeld\', \'text\': \'Quando i Gemelli di Maalfeld muoiono, crea due pedine creatura Zombie 2/2 nere.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Zombie\', \'flavor\': \'"Chi sono io per sfasciare una famiglia?"\\n—Gisa l\\\'evocaghoul\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594446&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'52bba166-fc20-4df6-8dc5-a788e3012e1b\', \'multiverseId\': 594446}, \'multiverseid\': 594446}, {\'name\': \'マルフェルドの双子\', \'text\': \'マルフェルドの双子が死亡したとき、黒の２/２のゾンビ・クリーチャー・トークン２体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ゾンビ\', \'flavor\': \'「あたしに家族をバラバラにする権利なんてないじゃないか。」\\n――グール呼びのギサ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594563&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1b14adb8-cf38-4301-8588-d60d00f50733\', \'multiverseId\': 594563}, \'multiverseid\': 594563}, {\'name\': \'玛费尔双身\', \'text\': \'当玛费尔双身死去时，派出两个2/2黑色灵俑衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～灵俑\', \'flavor\': \'「我凭什么去拆散一个家庭？」\\n～尸鬼牧者基沙\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594914&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cbf0be5f-e4e3-47d2-99dc-2252f2048088\', \'multiverseId\': 594914}, \'multiverseid\': 594914}]', '[{\'name\': \'Mammutspinne\', \'text\': \'Reichweite\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Spinne\', \'flavor\': \'„Wenn ein unachtsamer Elf sich in einem ihrer Netze verfängt, nimmt die Natur ihren Lauf. Nimm einer Spinne nicht übel, eine Spinne zu sein."\\n—Dellin Berting, tolarianische Insektenkundlerin\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592886&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'84f3070b-84c9-4d01-97ca-0e566e46dc53\', \'multiverseId\': 592886}, \'multiverseid\': 592886}, {\'name\': \'Araña mamut\', \'text\': \'Alcance.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Araña\', \'flavor\': \'"Si un elfo despistado acaba atrapado en una telaraña, la naturaleza seguirá su curso. No culpes a la araña por ser una araña".\\n—Dellin Berting, entomóloga tolariana\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593007&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'955b415a-455b-44ca-bfcf-381579eecd69\', \'multiverseId\': 593007}, \'multiverseid\': 593007}, {\'name\': \'Araignée mammouth\', \'text\': \'Portée\', \'type\': \'Créature : araignée\', \'flavor\': "« Si un elfe imprudent est pris dans une toile d\'araignée, la nature doit suivre son cours. Ne reprochons pas à l\'araignée d\'être une araignée. »\\n—Dellin Berting, entomologiste tolariane", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593128&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ce7f41c3-252e-40a2-bd36-bc4d1a440208\', \'multiverseId\': 593128}, \'multiverseid\': 593128}, {\'name\': \'Ragno Mammut\', \'text\': \'Raggiungere\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Ragno\', \'flavor\': \'"Se un elfo imprudente finisce intrappolato in una ragnatela, dobbiamo aspettarci che la natura segua il suo corso. Non incolpiamo il ragno per il fatto di essere tale."\\n—Dellin Berting, entomologo di Tolaria\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593249&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6a692b34-21e1-4ad8-a916-4c2190c3ca94\', \'multiverseId\': 593249}, \'multiverseid\': 593249}, {\'name\': \'マンモスグモ\', \'text\': \'到達\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 蜘蛛\', \'flavor\': \'「愚かなエルフが蜘蛛の巣網にかかったなら、自然の成り行きを想定しなければならない。蜘蛛が蜘蛛であることを責めてはならない。」\\n――トレイリアの昆虫学者、デリン・バーティング\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593370&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a894015a-f97a-4c9c-8892-7df95b9089fd\', \'multiverseId\': 593370}, \'multiverseid\': 593370}, {\'name\': \'庞巨蜘蛛\', \'text\': \'延势\', \'type\': \'生物 ～蜘蛛\', \'flavor\': \'「如果见到粗心妖精误困蛛网，我们只能让他听天由命。切勿怪罪蜘蛛遵从本性。」\\n～陶拉里亚昆虫学家德林博汀\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593733&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'38b90787-17ff-4b0b-8cbc-39325862f7ab\', \'multiverseId\': 593733}, \'multiverseid\': 593733}]', '[{\'name\': \'Manapuppe\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Konstrukt\', \'flavor\': \'„Jede Nacht verstaute die Künstlerin die kleine Puppe in einer versperrten Schublade. Jeden Morgen wachte sie auf und fand sie neben sich mit einem neuen Schmuckstück."\\n—„Der Handwerkerlehrling"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596289&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d7881bf0-1234-4541-a58b-004833bf0457\', \'multiverseId\': 596289}, \'multiverseid\': 596289}, {\'name\': \'Manaquí\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {C}.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Constructo\', \'flavor\': \'"Cada noche, la artífice guardaba la figurita en un cajón bajo llave. Cada mañana, al despertar, la encontraba esperando a su lado con una baratija nueva".\\n—"El aprendiz de la artífice"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596376&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fde45b30-204f-4818-83df-da262589107e\', \'multiverseId\': 596376}, \'multiverseid\': 596376}, {\'name\': \'Mainequin\', \'text\': \'{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\', \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : construction\', \'flavor\': "« Chaque nuit, l\'artificière rangeait la petite poupée dans un tiroir fermé à clef. Chaque matin au réveil, elle la trouvait à côté d\'elle, portant une nouvelle babiole. »\\n—« L\'apprenti de l\'artificière »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596463&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6278246c-42d4-476e-b096-bcfcf3c8b6c2\', \'multiverseId\': 596463}, \'multiverseid\': 596463}, {\'name\': \'Manakin\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Costrutto\', \'flavor\': \'"Ogni notte, l\\\'artefice chiudeva la bambolina in un cassetto. Ogni mattina, al suo risveglio, la ritrovava al suo fianco con qualche nuovo gingillo."\\n—"L\\\'apprendista dell\\\'artefice"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596550&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f14f1751-5227-4cc8-8c17-57e022ab1894\', \'multiverseId\': 596550}, \'multiverseid\': 596550}, {\'name\': \'マナキン人形\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}を加える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 構築物\', \'flavor\': \'「工匠は毎晩、その小さな人形を引き出しに入れて鍵をかけた。毎朝目覚めると、それは安っぽい宝石を手にたたずんでいるのだった。」\\n――「工匠の見習い」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596637&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5dfa1b37-df13-4d3f-973a-4a7d8f61af9b\', \'multiverseId\': 596637}, \'multiverseid\': 596637}, {\'name\': \'魔力人偶\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{C}。\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～组构体\', \'flavor\': \'「每天晚上睡前，神器师都会将这小人偶收进抽屉并上好锁。每天早上醒后，她都会看到它拿着不同的东西等在身边。」\\n～《神器师学徒》\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596898&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'712739c6-ac21-4aca-92a6-dfc27feaf872\', \'multiverseId\': 596898}, \'multiverseid\': 596898}]', '[{\'name\': \'Mantel der Gezeiten\', \'text\': \'Die ausgerüstete Kreatur erhält +1/+2.\\nImmer wenn du deine zweite Karte innerhalb desselben Zuges ziehst, lege den Mantel der Gezeiten an eine Kreatur deiner Wahl an, die du kontrollierst.\\nAusrüsten {3} ({3}: Lege diese Karte an eine Kreatur deiner Wahl an, die du kontrollierst. Spiele Ausrüsten wie eine Hexerei.)\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Ausrüstung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595244&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'befdc711-43c8-4306-81f1-04b2bc315539\', \'multiverseId\': 595244}, \'multiverseid\': 595244}, {\'name\': \'Manto de mareas\', \'text\': \'La criatura equipada obtiene +1/+2.\\nSiempre que robes tu segunda carta cada turno, anexa el Manto de mareas a la criatura objetivo que controlas.\\nEquipar {3}. ({3}: Anexa este Equipo a la criatura objetivo que controlas. Activa la habilidad de equipar como un conjuro.)\', \'type\': \'Artefacto — Equipo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595352&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7e8b39d9-6953-4764-8319-6b808024d4b9\', \'multiverseId\': 595352}, \'multiverseid\': 595352}, {\'name\': \'Manteau des marées\', \'text\': "La créature équipée gagne +1/+2.\\nÀ chaque fois que vous piochez votre deuxième carte à chaque tour, attachez le Manteau des marées à une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez.\\nÉquipement {3} ({3} : Attachez à une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez. N\'attachez l\'équipement que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.)", \'type\': \'Artefact : équipement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595460&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e45035e9-6bc6-4bf8-99e9-60c96110dcb2\', \'multiverseId\': 595460}, \'multiverseid\': 595460}, {\'name\': \'Manto di Flutti\', \'text\': \'La creatura equipaggiata prende +1/+2.\\nOgniqualvolta peschi la tua seconda carta in ogni turno, assegna il Manto di Flutti a una creatura bersaglio che controlli.\\nEquipaggiare {3} ({3}: Assegna a una creatura bersaglio che controlli. Equipaggia solo come una stregoneria.)\', \'type\': \'Artefatto — Equipaggiamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595568&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b9a3093c-6099-4971-8279-d525f50b489c\', \'multiverseId\': 595568}, \'multiverseid\': 595568}, {\'name\': \'潮流のマントル\', \'text\': \'装備しているクリーチャーは＋１/＋２の修整を受ける。\\nあなたが各ターン内のあなたの２枚目のカードを引くたび、あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。潮流のマントルをそれにつける。\\n装備{3}（{3}：あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。これをそれにつける。装備はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。）\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 装備品\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595676&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b614a16c-cbac-4fdb-9a98-6dadaf2be5a5\', \'multiverseId\': 595676}, \'multiverseid\': 595676}, {\'name\': \'浪潮斗篷\', \'text\': \'佩带此武具的生物得+1/+2。\\n每当你抓每回合中你的第二张牌时，将浪潮斗篷贴附在目标由你操控的生物上。\\n佩带{3}（{3}：贴附在目标由你操控的生物上。只能于法术时机佩带。）\', \'type\': \'神器 ～武具\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596000&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'68b087e4-81d5-4fee-aa51-0a8e88f09c15\', \'multiverseId\': 596000}, \'multiverseid\': 596000}]', '[{\'name\': \'Mardu-Herzstecher\', \'text\': \'Überfall — Wenn der Mardu-Herzstecher ins Spiel kommt und falls du in diesem Zug angegriffen hast, fügt der Mardu-Herzstecher einem Ziel deiner Wahl 2 Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Bogenschütze\', \'flavor\': \'„Wer noch nie vor dem Wind geritten ist, kennt die wahren Freuden des Krieges nicht."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590280&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'544a1b62-4049-4e15-9b72-9778ffb9f142\', \'multiverseId\': 590280}, \'multiverseid\': 590280}, {\'name\': \'Perforacorazones mardu\', \'text\': \'Incursión — Cuando la Perforacorazones mardu entre al campo de batalla, si atacaste este turno, la Perforacorazones mardu hace 2 puntos de daño a cualquier objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Arquero humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Aquellos que nunca han cabalgado con el viento a favor no conocen el auténtico placer de la guerra".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590415&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'85da7cc6-0f3f-423f-afc0-a19fbc6246ee\', \'multiverseId\': 590415}, \'multiverseid\': 590415}, {\'name\': \'Perce-cœur marduenne\', \'text\': "Saccage — Quand la Perce-cœur marduenne arrive sur le champ de bataille, si vous avez attaqué ce tour-ci, la Perce-cœur marduenne inflige 2 blessures à n\'importe quelle cible.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et archer\', \'flavor\': "« Ceux qui n\'ont jamais chevauché dans le vent ne connaissent rien des joies de la guerre. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590550&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d8e4389d-3aaf-4a18-b4e1-33dcf46ec5f6\', \'multiverseId\': 590550}, \'multiverseid\': 590550}, {\'name\': \'Trafiggicuore Mardu\', \'text\': \'Incursione — Quando la Trafiggicuore Mardu entra nel campo di battaglia, se hai attaccato in questo turno, la Trafiggicuore Mardu infligge 2 danni a un qualsiasi bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Arciere Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Chi non ha mai cavalcato col vento alle spalle non conosce la vera gioia della guerra."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590685&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d1145223-516f-471a-9555-46ecef20fb12\', \'multiverseId\': 590685}, \'multiverseid\': 590685}, {\'name\': \'マルドゥの心臓貫き\', \'text\': \'強襲 ― マルドゥの心臓貫きが戦場に出たとき、このターンにあなたが攻撃していた場合、クリーチャーやプレインズウォーカーやプレイヤーのうち１つを対象とする。マルドゥの心臓貫きはそれに２点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・射手\', \'flavor\': \'「風を背にして騎乗したことのない者は、戦争の本当の楽しみを知らぬ者だ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590820&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'29b29820-3f80-4ac9-a05c-4e6938ae5a51\', \'multiverseId\': 590820}, \'multiverseid\': 590820}, {\'name\': \'玛尔都穿心客\', \'text\': \'突击～当玛尔都穿心客进战场时，若你本回合中攻击过，则玛尔都穿心客对任意一个目标造成2点伤害。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／弓箭手\', \'flavor\': \'「那些从未顺风骑行的人不会知道战争真正的乐趣。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591225&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'afacb45c-70de-4b7e-a970-acf98a90cca9\', \'multiverseId\': 591225}, \'multiverseid\': 591225}]', '[{\'name\': \'Marit Lages Schlummer\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn Marit Lages Schlummer oder eine andere verschneite bleibende Karte unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, wende Hellsicht 1 an.\\nZu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments und falls du zehn oder mehr verschneite bleibende Karten kontrollierst, opfere Marit Lages Schlummer. Falls du dies tust, erzeuge Marit Lage, einen legendären 20/20 schwarzen Avatar-Kreaturenspielstein mit Flugfähigkeit und Unzerstörbarkeit.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre verschneite Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595245&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cc1b2e53-e67a-4a85-b994-507f78602708\', \'multiverseId\': 595245}, \'multiverseid\': 595245}, {\'name\': \'Sueño de Marit Lage\', \'text\': \'Siempre que el Sueño de Marit Lage u otro permanente nevado entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, adivina 1.\\nAl comienzo de tu mantenimiento, si controlas diez o más permanentes nevados, sacrifica el Sueño de Marit Lage. Si lo haces, crea a Marit Lage, una ficha de criatura legendaria Avatar negra 20/20 con las habilidades de volar e indestructible.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento nevado legendario\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595353&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'09ae5182-025a-4958-9f9d-fdfb54136c3a\', \'multiverseId\': 595353}, \'multiverseid\': 595353}, {\'name\': \'Sommeil de Marit Lage\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que le Sommeil de Marit Lage ou un autre permanent neigeux arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, regard 1.\\nAu début de votre entretien, si vous contrôlez au moins dix permanents neigeux, sacrifiez le Sommeil de Marit Lage. Si vous faites ainsi, créez Marit Lage, un jeton de créature légendaire 20/20 noire Avatar avec le vol et l\'indestructible.", \'type\': \'Enchantement neigeux légendaire\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595461&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'de14aff0-0838-4c1c-9244-0cc8c042d38a\', \'multiverseId\': 595461}, \'multiverseid\': 595461}, {\'name\': \'Sonno di Marit Lage\', \'text\': "Ogniqualvolta il Sonno di Marit Lage o un altro permanente neve entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, profetizza 1.\\nAll\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, se controlli dieci o più permanenti neve, sacrifica il Sonno di Marit Lage. Se lo fai, crea Marit Lage, una pedina creatura leggendaria Avatar 20/20 nera con volare e indistruttibile.", \'type\': \'Incantesimo Neve Leggendario\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595569&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f0876d5f-e739-47da-a9b6-d66581faf9c8\', \'multiverseId\': 595569}, \'multiverseid\': 595569}, {\'name\': \'マリット・レイジのまどろみ\', \'text\': \'マリット・レイジのまどろみやこれでない氷雪パーマネント１つがあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、占術１を行う。\\nあなたのアップキープの開始時に、あなたが10個以上の氷雪パーマネントをコントロールしている場合、マリット・レイジのまどろみを生け贄に捧げる。そうしたなら、「マリット・レイジ」という名前で飛行と破壊不能を持つ黒の20/20の伝説のアバター・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'伝説の氷雪エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595677&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'67b00f4b-f765-4767-b066-5b82cab3a7b7\', \'multiverseId\': 595677}, \'multiverseid\': 595677}, {\'name\': \'玛莉雷基沉眠\', \'text\': \'每当玛莉雷基沉眠或另一个雪境永久物在你的操控下进战场时，占卜1。\\n在你的维持开始时，若你操控十个或更多雪境永久物，则牺牲玛莉雷基沉眠。若你如此作，则派出传奇衍生生物玛莉雷基，其为20/20黑色，具飞行与不灭异能的圣者。\', \'type\': \'传奇雪境结界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596001&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dd822b5f-e952-4c60-8138-00db015c5dc9\', \'multiverseId\': 596001}, \'multiverseid\': 596001}]', '[{\'name\': \'Markov-Kriegsfürst\', \'text\': \'Eile\\nWenn der Markov-Kriegsfürst ins Spiel kommt, können bis zu zwei Kreaturen deiner Wahl in diesem Zug nicht blocken.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vampir, Krieger\', \'flavor\': \'„In den Händen eines Feiglings sind auch ein Pflock und ein heiliges Symbol nutzlos."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590281&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'77d224aa-e5c3-4d1b-b2cb-3c9a7462e819\', \'multiverseId\': 590281}, \'multiverseid\': 590281}, {\'name\': \'Señor de la guerra Markov\', \'text\': \'Prisa.\\nCuando el Señor de la guerra Markov entre al campo de batalla, hasta dos criaturas objetivo no pueden bloquear este turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero vampiro\', \'flavor\': \'"¿De qué sirven una estaca o un símbolo sagrado en las manos de un cobarde?".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590416&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c1973781-afb1-4f28-9ea3-c061cec8f60a\', \'multiverseId\': 590416}, \'multiverseid\': 590416}, {\'name\': \'Seigneur de guerre Markov\', \'text\': "Célérité\\nQuand le Seigneur de guerre Markov arrive sur le champ de bataille, jusqu\'à deux créatures ciblées ne peuvent pas bloquer ce tour-ci.", \'type\': \'Créature : vampire et guerrier\', \'flavor\': "« Quelle peut être l\'utilité d\'un pieu ou d\'un symbole sacré dans les mains d\'un lâche ? »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590551&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e577ffab-9f19-4fa0-80f9-cdf45055a120\', \'multiverseId\': 590551}, \'multiverseid\': 590551}, {\'name\': \'Condottiero Markov\', \'text\': \'Rapidità\\nQuando il Condottiero Markov entra nel campo di battaglia, fino a due creature bersaglio non possono bloccare in questo turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Vampiro\', \'flavor\': \'"A cosa serve un bastone o un simbolo sacro in mano a un codardo?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590686&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'37e17f14-bf80-4031-8074-9567f4deda0b\', \'multiverseId\': 590686}, \'multiverseid\': 590686}, {\'name\': \'マルコフの大将軍\', \'text\': \'速攻\\nマルコフの大将軍が戦場に出たとき、クリーチャー最大２体を対象とする。このターン、それらではブロックできない。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 吸血鬼・戦士\', \'flavor\': \'「臆病者の手の中の杭や聖印が何の役に立つ？」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590821&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'94237547-f7c3-49f8-8550-85aab50b363e\', \'multiverseId\': 590821}, \'multiverseid\': 590821}, {\'name\': \'马可夫军头\', \'text\': \'敏捷\\n当马可夫军头进战场时，至多两个目标生物本回合不能进行阻挡。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～吸血鬼／战士\', \'flavor\': \'「木桩或圣符握在懦夫手上又有何用？」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591226&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7403bf7a-b173-4167-ad5c-cc0eb1e2cf5b\', \'multiverseId\': 591226}, \'multiverseid\': 591226}]', '[{\'name\': \'Marodierende Fäulnispriesterin\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du Lebenspunkte dazuerhältst, verliert jeder Gegner 1 Lebenspunkt.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vampir, Kleriker\', \'flavor\': \'„Wir Vampire hatten noch nie Götter. Wir folgten unseren Bluthäuptlingen. Jetzt sind sie fort. Was bleibt? Zerstörung und Tod, meine Freunde. Das genügt."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594096&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'894dccbb-ebc6-4cb7-8674-6dd280e64f43\', \'multiverseId\': 594096}, \'multiverseid\': 594096}, {\'name\': \'Sacerdotisa de plagas saqueadora\', \'text\': \'Siempre que ganes vidas, cada oponente pierde 1 vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Clérigo vampiro\', \'flavor\': \'"Los vampiros nunca veneramos a dioses. Seguíamos a nuestros jefes de sangre. Pero ahora ya no están. ¿Qué nos queda? Muerte y destrucción, amigos míos. Con eso basta".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594213&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1a25b657-7c40-4f69-9813-326b38bbf70c\', \'multiverseId\': 594213}, \'multiverseid\': 594213}, {\'name\': \'Prêtresse du fléau en maraude\', \'text\': \'À chaque fois que vous gagnez des points de vie, chaque adversaire perd 1 point de vie.\', \'type\': \'Créature : vampire et clerc\', \'flavor\': "« Les vampires n\'ont jamais eu de dieux. Nous suivions nos chefs de sang. Maintenant qu\'ils ne sont plus là, que nous reste-t-il ? La destruction et la mort, mes amis. C\'est tout ce qu\'il nous faut. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594330&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'708cf712-b4b8-4597-9132-0c26f9875c45\', \'multiverseId\': 594330}, \'multiverseid\': 594330}, {\'name\': \'Sacerdotessa della Sventura Razziatrice\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta guadagni punti vita, ogni avversario perde 1 punto vita.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Chierico Vampiro\', \'flavor\': \'"I vampiri non hanno mai avuto dei. Seguivamo i nostri capi sanguinari. Ora che sono scomparsi, cosa ci resta? Distruzione e morte, amici miei. Possono bastare."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594447&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'94760bfc-2844-47d8-82d7-58841806f05f\', \'multiverseId\': 594447}, \'multiverseid\': 594447}, {\'name\': \'略奪する破戒僧\', \'text\': \'あなたがライフを得るたび、各対戦相手はそれぞれ１点のライフを失う。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 吸血鬼・クレリック\', \'flavor\': \'「吸血鬼には神などいない。長年従ってきた血の長は死んだ。残っているのは、馴染み深い破壊と死。それで十分。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594564&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f72faa20-f5c6-4e7f-aa5c-61c2c6c49f79\', \'multiverseId\': 594564}, \'multiverseid\': 594564}, {\'name\': \'劫掠芜土僧\', \'text\': \'每当你获得生命时，每位对手各失去1点生命。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～吸血鬼／僧侣\', \'flavor\': \'「吸血鬼一族从未信奉过神明。我们唯血侯为尊。如今他们也一去不返。你要说还剩下什么？朋友，只要毁灭和死亡还在，这就足够了。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594915&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b538db40-dae0-4638-afcc-d5084697dd39\', \'multiverseId\': 594915}, \'multiverseid\': 594915}]', '[{\'name\': \'Marodierender Knochenmar\', \'text\': \'Der Marodierende Knochenmar kann nicht blocken, es sei denn, du kontrollierst einen anderen Zombie.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Zombie, Minotaurus\', \'flavor\': \'Ohne das Hekma gab es nichts mehr, was die Toten von der Stadt fernhielt. Die Bewohner Naktamuns waren zu Freiwild geworden.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594097&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a47a6488-ea19-46c8-a1b9-e80a113d8280\', \'multiverseId\': 594097}, \'multiverseid\': 594097}, {\'name\': \'Quebrantahuesos merodeador\', \'text\': \'El Quebrantahuesos merodeador no puede bloquear a menos que controles otro Zombie.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Minotauro zombie\', \'flavor\': \'Con la Hekma destruida, nada podía impedir que los muertos errantes que buscaban la forma de entrar en Naktamun destruyeran la ciudad.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594214&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c1d51363-46d7-477e-b56d-c5a3de212a9c\', \'multiverseId\': 594214}, \'multiverseid\': 594214}, {\'name\': "Balafreur d\'os en maraude", \'text\': "Le Balafreur d\'os en maraude ne peut pas bloquer à moins que vous ne contrôliez un autre zombie.", \'type\': \'Créature : zombie et minotaure\', \'flavor\': "L\'Hekma détruite, les morts recherchant un passage vers Naktamon eurent la voie libre pour dévaster la ville.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594331&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dada1f36-f230-4267-a80b-a78091604f2f\', \'multiverseId\': 594331}, \'multiverseid\': 594331}, {\'name\': \'Razziatore Squartaossa\', \'text\': \'Il Razziatore Squartaossa non può bloccare a meno che tu non controlli un altro Zombie.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Minotauro Zombie\', \'flavor\': "Con la distruzione dell\'Hekma, i morti peregrinanti che bramavano di entrare a Naktamun furono liberi di ridurre in rovina la città.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594448&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9354dcc5-86ac-471b-b339-2bfcd274dfb9\', \'multiverseId\': 594448}, \'multiverseid\': 594448}, {\'name\': \'無法の斬骨鬼\', \'text\': \'あなたがこれでないゾンビをコントロールしていないかぎり、無法の斬骨鬼ではブロックできない。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ゾンビ・ミノタウルス\', \'flavor\': \'ヘクマ破壊ののち、ナクタムンへ入る手段を探していた放浪の死者たちは、街をほしいままに荒らした。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594565&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'62c0384c-6482-4ac3-a8c0-c52ee52a6c00\', \'multiverseId\': 594565}, \'multiverseid\': 594565}, {\'name\': \'劫掠碎骨怪\', \'text\': \'除非你操控另一个灵俑，否则劫掠碎骨怪不能进行阻挡。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～灵俑／牛头怪\', \'flavor\': \'避世帘被毁后，曾妄图进入拿塔蒙的漂浪亡者终可肆虐全城。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594916&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'20640b78-23a2-40b9-8d51-47822dd16207\', \'multiverseId\': 594916}, \'multiverseid\': 594916}]', "[{'name': 'Maschinen-Verschlingerin', 'text': 'Dieser Zauberspruch kostet beim Wirken für jedes Artefakt, das du kontrollierst, {1} weniger.\\n{5}{U}: Die Maschinen-Verschlingerin kann in diesem Zug nicht geblockt werden.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Schlange', 'flavor': 'Ihre Sammlung ist riesig und doch hat jedes Schiff einen besonderen Platz in ihrem Herzen.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595228&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e97637fa-2e4e-40c9-bfee-ef05e8671637', 'multiverseId': 595228}, 'multiverseid': 595228}, {'name': 'Serpiente devoraingenios', 'text': 'Te cuesta {1} menos lanzar este hechizo por cada artefacto que controlas.\\n{5}{U}: La Serpiente devoraingenios no puede ser bloqueada este turno.', 'type': 'Criatura — Serpiente', 'flavor': 'Su colección es inmensa, pero cada nave tiene un hueco especial en su corazón.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595336&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '37c43845-a126-4137-bf9e-b57fb6da1331', 'multiverseId': 595336}, 'multiverseid': 595336}, {'name': 'Serpent mécanochercheur', 'text': 'Ce sort coûte {1} de moins à lancer pour chaque artefact que vous contrôlez.\\n{5}{U} : Le Serpent mécanochercheur ne peut pas être bloqué ce tour-ci.', 'type': 'Créature : grand serpent', 'flavor': 'Sa collection est immense, mais chaque vaisseau a une place spéciale dans son cœur.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595444&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9cbe0ac5-e35b-4104-9622-3eb8eaed61f5', 'multiverseId': 595444}, 'multiverseid': 595444}, {'name': 'Serpe Meccanivora', 'text': 'Questa magia costa {1} in meno per essere lanciata per ogni artefatto che controlli.\\n{5}{U}: La Serpe Meccanivora non può essere bloccata in questo turno.', 'type': 'Creatura — Serpe', 'flavor': 'La sua collezione è vasta, ma ogni navicella occupa un posto speciale nel suo cuore.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595552&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cdf59725-0052-4814-b408-ef6182bc62a1', 'multiverseId': 595552}, 'multiverseid': 595552}, {'name': '歯車襲いの海蛇', 'text': 'この呪文を唱えるためのコストは、あなたがコントロールしているアーティファクト１つにつき{1}少なくなる。\\n{5}{U}：このターン、歯車襲いの海蛇はブロックされない。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 海蛇', 'flavor': 'それが有する船のコレクションは莫大だが、個々の船それぞれに思い入れがある。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595660&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3ec435aa-8588-429d-afaa-47d1bf51bb5a', 'multiverseId': 595660}, 'multiverseid': 595660}, {'name': '觅械巨蛇', 'text': '你每操控一个神器，此咒语便减少{1}来施放。\\n{5}{U}：觅械巨蛇本回合不能被阻挡。', 'type': '生物 ～巨蛇', 'flavor': '它的收藏丰富，但每艘船在其心中都占有特殊地位。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595984&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7b03bdfb-8d6e-4d8e-bba1-1ec274bd37f7', 'multiverseId': 595984}, 'multiverseid': 595984}]", '[{\'name\': \'Massakerwurm\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Massakerwurm ins Spiel kommt, erhalten Kreaturen, die deine Gegner kontrollieren, -2/-2 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\\nImmer wenn eine Kreatur, die ein Gegner kontrolliert, stirbt, verliert jener Spieler 2 Lebenspunkte.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Phyrexianer, Wurm\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594098&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'64c53991-a668-4d47-8128-0c05f47b74ab\', \'multiverseId\': 594098}, \'multiverseid\': 594098}, {\'name\': \'Sierpe de la masacre\', \'text\': \'Cuando la Sierpe de la masacre entre al campo de batalla, las criaturas que controlan tus oponentes obtienen -2/-2 hasta el final del turno.\\nSiempre que una criatura que controla un oponente muera, ese jugador pierde 2 vidas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Sierpe pirexiano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594215&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7c2ec352-366a-4d6a-927d-949c6dde81bd\', \'multiverseId\': 594215}, \'multiverseid\': 594215}, {\'name\': \'Guivre du massacre\', \'text\': "Quand la Guivre du massacre arrive sur le champ de bataille, les créatures que vos adversaires contrôlent gagnent -2/-2 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'une créature qu\'un adversaire contrôle meurt, ce joueur perd 2 points de vie.", \'type\': \'Créature : phyrexian et guivre\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594332&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4f6bbdc2-4eca-4a13-871c-8edfa50ee49b\', \'multiverseId\': 594332}, \'multiverseid\': 594332}, {\'name\': \'Wurm della Strage\', \'text\': \'Quando il Wurm della Strage entra nel campo di battaglia, le creature controllate dai tuoi avversari prendono -2/-2 fino alla fine del turno.\\nOgniqualvolta una creatura controllata da un avversario muore, quel giocatore perde 2 punti vita.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Wurm Phyrexiano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594449&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f97004dd-4467-48dd-9431-da860a47e9a9\', \'multiverseId\': 594449}, \'multiverseid\': 594449}, {\'name\': \'虐殺のワーム\', \'text\': \'虐殺のワームが戦場に出たとき、ターン終了時まで、対戦相手がコントロールしているすべてのクリーチャーは－２/－２の修整を受ける。\\n対戦相手がコントロールしているクリーチャー１体が死亡するたび、そのプレイヤーは２点のライフを失う。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ファイレクシアン・ワーム\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594566&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'021614c3-9781-4d94-ab5b-f3d3b1d7542e\', \'multiverseId\': 594566}, \'multiverseid\': 594566}, {\'name\': \'屠戮亚龙\', \'text\': \'当屠戮亚龙进战场时，由对手操控的生物得-2/-2直到回合结束。\\n每当一个由对手操控的生物死去时，该牌手失去2点生命。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～非瑞人／亚龙\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594917&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'277d1da7-d453-469d-9eac-bb8f5969d8fe\', \'multiverseId\': 594917}, \'multiverseid\': 594917}]', '[{\'name\': \'Matschfäule\', \'text\': \'Verzaubert eine Kreatur\\nWenn der verzauberten Kreatur Schaden zugefügt wird, zerstöre sie.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'„Gibt es irgendetwas in Guul Draz, das dir *nicht* das Leben aussaugt?"\\n—Tarsa, Söldnerin aus Seetor\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594099&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4461b5b5-c9d4-4cab-a482-d8e989424e63\', \'multiverseId\': 594099}, \'multiverseid\': 594099}, {\'name\': \'Ruina del cieno\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura.\\nCuando la criatura encantada reciba daño, destrúyela.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'"¿Hay algo en Guul Draz que no te quite la vida?".**\\n—Tarsa, asesina a sueldo de Portal Marítimo\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594216&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1dd53ac4-f78b-4095-bc8c-456b95f0f98a\', \'multiverseId\': 594216}, \'multiverseid\': 594216}, {\'name\': \'Flétrissement des fondrières\', \'text\': \'Enchanter : créature\\nQuand la créature enchantée subit des blessures, détruisez-la.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': "« Existe-t-il quelque chose en Guul Draz qui n\'aspire *pas* les forces vitales ? »\\n—Tarsa, épée à louer de Porte des Mers", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594333&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'551854d0-9dc1-449d-b062-4f68fdda718e\', \'multiverseId\': 594333}, \'multiverseid\': 594333}, {\'name\': \'Deperimento Melmoso\', \'text\': \'Incanta creatura\\nQuando alla creatura incantata viene inflitto danno, distruggila.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'"C\\\'è qualcosa in Guul Draz che *non* ti succhia via la vita?"\\n—Tarsa, prezzolata di Portale Marino\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594450&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6b30bf0c-22e8-4a63-af6e-29bbcd944997\', \'multiverseId\': 594450}, \'multiverseid\': 594450}, {\'name\': \'ぬかるみの荒廃\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\nエンチャントしているクリーチャーがダメージを受けたとき、それを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': \'「生命を吸い出そうと*しない*物が、グール・ドラズにあるっての？」\\n――海門の売剣、タルサ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594567&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'016e8e29-8e6b-4389-8bb5-b5b1a7c67870\', \'multiverseId\': 594567}, \'multiverseid\': 594567}, {\'name\': \'泥沼萎疾\', \'text\': \'结附于生物\\n当所结附的生物受到伤害时，将它消灭。\', \'type\': \'结界 ～灵气\', \'flavor\': \'「古坠兹里面除了会把你生命吸干的东西，还会有*别的*吗？」\\n～海户贷剑客塔莎\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594918&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'027b89eb-5b47-4b33-8e2f-a0e158748c77\', \'multiverseId\': 594918}, \'multiverseid\': 594918}]', '[{\'name\': \'Mausender Bandar\', \'text\': \'Der Mausende Bandar kommt mit zwei +1/+1-Marken ins Spiel.\\nZu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments kannst du eine beliebige Anzahl an +1/+1-Marken vom Mausenden Bandar auf eine andere Kreatur deiner Wahl bewegen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Katze, Affe\', \'flavor\': \'„Vor einer Sekunde war es doch noch da …"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592925&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fdd28bd9-f5dc-44f0-8159-68eca7e6bfa2\', \'multiverseId\': 592925}, \'multiverseid\': 592925}, {\'name\': \'Bandar agenciador\', \'text\': \'El Bandar agenciador entra al campo de batalla con dos contadores +1/+1 sobre él.\\nAl comienzo de tu mantenimiento, puedes mover cualquier cantidad de contadores +1/+1 del Bandar agenciador a otra criatura objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Primate felino\', \'flavor\': \'"Pero si estaba aquí hace un segundo...".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593046&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5c62caf2-017e-45ca-a274-cfb0d5d60cb4\', \'multiverseId\': 593046}, \'multiverseid\': 593046}, {\'name\': \'Bandar fouineur\', \'text\': "Le Bandar fouineur arrive sur le champ de bataille avec deux marqueurs +1/+1 sur lui.\\nAu début de votre entretien, vous pouvez déplacer n\'importe quel nombre de marqueurs +1/+1 du Bandar fouineur sur une autre créature ciblée.", \'type\': \'Créature : chat et singe\', \'flavor\': \'« Il était là il y a une seconde... »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593167&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e27b7caf-fd3b-4f63-8c41-9eea60802815\', \'multiverseId\': 593167}, \'multiverseid\': 593167}, {\'name\': \'Bandar Sgraffignatore\', \'text\': "Il Bandar Sgraffignatore entra nel campo di battaglia con due segnalini +1/+1.\\nAll\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, puoi spostare un qualsiasi numero di segnalini +1/+1 dal Bandar Sgraffignatore a un\'altra creatura bersaglio.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Scimmia Felino\', \'flavor\': \'"Ce l\\\'avevo qui un secondo fa..."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593288&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8d1935d5-e693-49ac-9219-b5984b50390f\', \'multiverseId\': 593288}, \'multiverseid\': 593288}, {\'name\': \'たかり猫猿\', \'text\': \'たかり猫猿は、＋１/＋１カウンター２個が置かれた状態で戦場に出る。\\nあなたのアップキープの開始時に、これでないクリーチャー１体を対象とする。あなたはたかり猫猿の上から望む個数の＋１/＋１カウンターをそれの上に移動してもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 猫・猿\', \'flavor\': \'「ついさっき、ここにいたんだが……」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593409&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6ddb69c3-7496-43eb-ba73-c60dc4f038be\', \'multiverseId\': 593409}, \'multiverseid\': 593409}, {\'name\': \'灵巧猫猴\', \'text\': \'灵巧猫猴进战场时上面有两个+1/+1指示物。\\n在你的维持开始时，你可以将灵巧猫猴上任意数量的+1/+1指示物移至另一个目标生物上。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～猫／猴\', \'flavor\': \'「它刚刚还在这里…」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593772&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'03531d7b-7fb8-4c48-b0b2-b67fdcba348c\', \'multiverseId\': 593772}, \'multiverseid\': 593772}]', '[{\'name\': \'Mausoleumswächterin\', \'text\': \'Wenn die Mausoleumswächterin stirbt, erzeuge zwei 1/1 weiße Geist-Kreaturenspielsteine mit Flugfähigkeit.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Späher\', \'flavor\': \'„Ghulrufer versuchen hereinzukommen, Geister wollen hinaus... der Dienst hier ist nie langweilig."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591619&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'099adc79-558e-4aef-b3f3-e5116968e742\', \'multiverseId\': 591619}, \'multiverseid\': 591619}, {\'name\': \'Guardia del mausoleo\', \'text\': \'Cuando la Guardia del mausoleo muera, crea dos fichas de criatura Espíritu blancas 1/1 con la habilidad de volar.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Explorador humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Llamamuertos que quieren entrar, geist que quieren salir… Este trabajo nunca es aburrido".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591748&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7768ba8f-766d-4820-a79d-5cd8f37bf076\', \'multiverseId\': 591748}, \'multiverseid\': 591748}, {\'name\': \'Garde du mausolée\', \'text\': \'Quand le Garde du mausolée meurt, créez deux jetons de créature 1/1 blanche Esprit avec le vol.\', \'type\': \'Créature : humain et éclaireur\', \'flavor\': "« Entre les meneurs de goule qui essaient d\'entrer et les geists qui veulent sortir . . . On ne s\'ennuie jamais. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591877&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1f594519-9573-455e-af0e-837e713f4cfc\', \'multiverseId\': 591877}, \'multiverseid\': 591877}, {\'name\': \'Guardia del Mausoleo\', \'text\': \'Quando la Guardia del Mausoleo muore, crea due pedine creatura Spirito 1/1 bianche con volare.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Esploratore Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Gli evocaghoul che cercano di entrare, i geist che cercano di uscire… Questo lavoro non è mai noioso."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592006&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'32defe4a-9f36-494f-a026-8f74d50c46d2\', \'multiverseId\': 592006}, \'multiverseid\': 592006}, {\'name\': \'霊廟の護衛\', \'text\': \'霊廟の護衛が死亡したとき、飛行を持つ白の１/１のスピリット・クリーチャー・トークン２体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・スカウト\', \'flavor\': \'「グール呼びは入ろうとし、霊は出ようとする……この仕事は退屈しないよ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592135&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ee1ce812-2a8f-4d4e-8ebf-b1c19b641856\', \'multiverseId\': 592135}, \'multiverseid\': 592135}, {\'name\': \'陵墓守卫\', \'text\': \'当陵墓守卫死去时，派出两个1/1白色，具飞行异能的精怪衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／斥候\', \'flavor\': \'「尸鬼牧者想进来，游魂想出去…这工作绝不无聊。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592522&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'10378ccd-d7b1-438e-b996-3fbce7a287cd\', \'multiverseId\': 592522}, \'multiverseid\': 592522}]', '[{\'name\': \'Maßregelung des Meisters\', \'text\': \'Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst, fügt einer Kreatur oder einem Planeswalker deiner Wahl, die bzw. den du nicht kontrollierst, Schadenspunkte in Höhe ihrer Stärke zu.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Du warst schon immer ein vielversprechender Schüler, aber deine Arroganz übersteigt bei weitem deine Fähigkeiten."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592888&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d1b107cc-a45f-473f-89a8-f4c393e87466\', \'multiverseId\': 592888}, \'multiverseid\': 592888}, {\'name\': \'Reprimenda del maestro\', \'text\': \'La criatura objetivo que controlas hace una cantidad de daño igual a su fuerza a la criatura o planeswalker objetivo que no controlas.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Siempre fuiste un estudiante prometedor, pero tu arrogancia supera con creces tu destreza".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593009&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'47e0efa3-0551-46eb-843e-8e48d6ee2300\', \'multiverseId\': 593009}, \'multiverseid\': 593009}, {\'name\': \'Blâme du maître\', \'text\': \'Une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez inflige un nombre de blessures égal à sa force à une cible, créature ou planeswalker, que vous ne contrôlez pas.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« Tu as toujours été un élève prometteur, mais ton arrogance dépasse de très loin tes prouesses. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593130&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a502b65a-4ef9-42aa-b94b-bc66fd701eae\', \'multiverseId\': 593130}, \'multiverseid\': 593130}, {\'name\': \'Sdegno del Maestro\', \'text\': \'Una creatura bersaglio che controlli infligge danno pari alla sua forza a una creatura o a un planeswalker bersaglio che non controlli.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Sei sempre stato uno studente promettente, ma la tua arroganza supera di gran lunga il tuo talento."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593251&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'79d3a5e2-1e87-4eac-959d-b2e1940d306d\', \'multiverseId\': 593251}, \'multiverseid\': 593251}, {\'name\': \'達人の咎め\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体と、あなたがコントロールしていないクリーチャーやプレインズウォーカーのうち１体を対象とする。その前者はその後者に、自身のパワーに等しい点数のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「有望な生徒ではあったが、その傲慢さは貴様の技量を遥かに凌駕している。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593372&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e2957124-4fad-47f9-a825-88bf8e14e548\', \'multiverseId\': 593372}, \'multiverseid\': 593372}, {\'name\': \'蛇圣拒斥\', \'text\': \'目标由你操控的生物对目标不由你操控的生物或鹏洛客造成伤害，其数量等同于前者的力量。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「为师一直深觉你前途无量，但你孤高倨傲定会自缚手脚。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593735&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'67fa8a32-c88f-4b7a-9b00-77ff535ffba4\', \'multiverseId\': 593735}, \'multiverseid\': 593735}]', '[{\'name\': \'Mechanische Hydra\', \'text\': \'Die Mechanische Hydra kommt mit vier +1/+1-Marken ins Spiel.\\nImmer wenn die Mechanische Hydra angreift oder blockt, entferne eine +1/+1-Marke von ihr. Falls du dies tust, fügt die Mechanische Hydra einem Ziel deiner Wahl 1 Schadenspunkt zu.\\n{T}: Lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf die Mechanische Hydra.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Hydra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597542&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f5cba36f-50a0-4c51-af2c-bc126a78a8a0\', \'multiverseId\': 597542}, \'multiverseid\': 597542}, {\'name\': \'Hidra mecánica\', \'text\': \'La Hidra mecánica entra al campo de batalla con cuatro contadores +1/+1 sobre ella.\\nSiempre que la Hidra mecánica ataque o bloquee, remueve un contador +1/+1 de ella. Si lo haces, la Hidra mecánica hace 1 punto de daño a cualquier objetivo.\\n{T}: Pon un contador +1/+1 sobre la Hidra mecánica.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Hidra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597567&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a2446832-a277-4f8b-87bb-20aebcefdce4\', \'multiverseId\': 597567}, \'multiverseid\': 597567}, {\'name\': \'Hydre mécanique\', \'text\': "L\'Hydre mécanique arrive sur le champ de bataille avec quatre marqueurs +1/+1 sur elle.\\nÀ chaque fois que l\'Hydre mécanique attaque ou bloque, retirez-lui un marqueur +1/+1. Si vous faites ainsi, l\'Hydre mécanique inflige 1 blessure à n\'importe quelle cible.\\n{T} : Mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur l\'Hydre mécanique.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : hydre\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597592&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2645899d-cf0f-4b53-9cac-bd368bd17417\', \'multiverseId\': 597592}, \'multiverseid\': 597592}, {\'name\': \'Idra Meccanica\', \'text\': "L\'Idra Meccanica entra nel campo di battaglia con quattro segnalini +1/+1.\\nOgniqualvolta l\'Idra Meccanica attacca o blocca, rimuovi un segnalino +1/+1 da essa. Se lo fai, l\'Idra Meccanica infligge 1 danno a un qualsiasi bersaglio.\\n{T}: Metti un segnalino +1/+1 sull\'Idra Meccanica.", \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Idra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597617&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'246342e6-909b-4c18-b1f7-62c78ac7d1cf\', \'multiverseId\': 597617}, \'multiverseid\': 597617}, {\'name\': \'機械仕掛けのハイドラ\', \'text\': \'機械仕掛けのハイドラは、＋１/＋１カウンター４個が置かれた状態で戦場に出る。\\n機械仕掛けのハイドラが攻撃かブロックするたび、クリーチャーやプレインズウォーカーやプレイヤーのうち１つを対象とする。これの上から＋１/＋１カウンター１個を取り除く。そうしたなら、機械仕掛けのハイドラはそれに１点のダメージを与える。\\n{T}：機械仕掛けのハイドラの上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — ハイドラ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597642&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'363f3782-1f79-464f-b2db-dc4da85e1678\', \'multiverseId\': 597642}, \'multiverseid\': 597642}, {\'name\': \'发条多头龙\', \'text\': \'发条多头龙进战场时上面有四个+1/+1指示物。\\n每当发条多头龙攻击或阻挡时，从其上移去一个+1/+1指示物。若你如此作，则发条多头龙对任意一个目标造成1点伤害。\\n{T}：在发条多头龙上放置一个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～多头龙\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597717&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'317b5c9c-29bf-4239-b67a-888c3d9b7bf7\', \'multiverseId\': 597717}, \'multiverseid\': 597717}]', '[{\'name\': \'Mechanisierte Produktion\', \'text\': \'Verzaubert ein Artefakt, das du kontrollierst\\nZu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments erzeugst du einen Spielstein, der eine Kopie des verzauberten Artefakts ist. Falls du dann acht oder mehr Artefakte kontrollierst, die untereinander denselben Namen haben, gewinnst du die Partie.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'„Gebt mir acht Schreiter und ich gebe euch die Stadt."\\n—Dovin Baan\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595246&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3314e34c-fa19-41b9-8b34-28a9ea2f5995\', \'multiverseId\': 595246}, \'multiverseid\': 595246}, {\'name\': \'Producción mecanizada\', \'text\': \'Encantar artefacto que controlas.\\nAl comienzo de tu mantenimiento, crea una ficha que es una copia del artefacto encantado. Luego, si controlas ocho artefactos o más con el mismo nombre, ganas el juego.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'"Denme ocho caminantes; yo les daré la ciudad".\\n—Dovin Baan\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595354&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'608b7327-6673-4cc4-9edc-0e5bc06216ac\', \'multiverseId\': 595354}, \'multiverseid\': 595354}, {\'name\': \'Production mécanisée\', \'text\': "Enchanter : un artefact que vous contrôlez\\nAu début de votre entretien, créez un jeton qui est une copie de l\'artefact enchanté. Puis, si vous contrôlez au moins huit artefacts ayant tous le même nom, vous gagnez la partie.", \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': \'« Donnez-moi huit marcheurs, je vous livrerai la ville. »\\n—Dovin Baàn\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595462&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'37c658d9-c0d5-49e6-8b9c-29ab8ac30044\', \'multiverseId\': 595462}, \'multiverseid\': 595462}, {\'name\': \'Produzione Meccanizzata\', \'text\': "Incanta artefatto che controlli\\nAll\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, crea una pedina che è una copia dell\'artefatto incantato. Poi, se controlli otto o più artefatti che condividono lo stesso nome, vinci la partita.", \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'"Datemi otto camminatori e la città sarà vostra."\\n—Dovin Baan\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595570&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a1716035-922d-48ab-8c06-8ab0eccde81e\', \'multiverseId\': 595570}, \'multiverseid\': 595570}, {\'name\': \'機械化製法\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（あなたがコントロールしているアーティファクト）\\nあなたのアップキープの開始時に、エンチャントしているアーティファクトのコピーであるトークン１つを生成する。その後、あなたが互いに同じ名前を持つ８つ以上のアーティファクトをコントロールしているなら、あなたはこのゲームに勝利する。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': \'「歩行機械が八台あれば、市を手に入れて差し上げますよ。」\\n――ドビン・バーン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595678&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'82ca0f09-911a-4a19-8890-050cb3800831\', \'multiverseId\': 595678}, \'multiverseid\': 595678}, {\'name\': \'机械化生产\', \'text\': \'结附于由你操控的神器\\n在你的维持开始时，派出一个衍生物，此衍生物为所结附的神器之复制品。然后如果你操控八个或更多彼此同名的神器，你便赢得这盘游戏。\', \'type\': \'结界 ～灵气\', \'flavor\': \'「给我八台巨像，我就能保全城安宁。」\\n～多温班恩\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596002&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5a52348e-13ce-4aed-b2a6-a861e7d9a896\', \'multiverseId\': 596002}, \'multiverseid\': 596002}]', "[{'name': 'Meditation der Weisen', 'text': 'Verzaubert eine Kreatur\\nWenn die Meditation der Weisen ins Spiel kommt, ziehe für jede Aura, die du kontrollierst und die an eine Kreatur angelegt ist, eine Karte.\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur erhält +1/+1 für jede Aura, die du kontrollierst und die an eine Kreatur angelegt ist.', 'type': 'Verzauberung — Aura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597087&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b5a70e3a-8cd2-44b6-bd94-33951fcba2a3', 'multiverseId': 597087}, 'multiverseid': 597087}, {'name': 'Ensueño de la sabia', 'text': 'Encantar criatura.\\nCuando el Ensueño de la sabia entre al campo de batalla, roba una carta por cada Aura que controlas que esté anexada a una criatura.\\nLa criatura encantada obtiene +1/+1 por cada Aura que controlas que esté anexada a una criatura.', 'type': 'Encantamiento — Aura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597133&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9fb295b9-080b-427c-b704-45e3cfddd989', 'multiverseId': 597133}, 'multiverseid': 597133}, {'name': 'Rêverie du sage', 'text': 'Enchanter : créature\\nQuand la Rêverie du sage arrive sur le champ de bataille, piochez une carte pour chaque aura que vous contrôlez qui est attachée à une créature.\\nLa créature enchantée gagne +1/+1 pour chaque aura que vous contrôlez qui est attachée à une créature.', 'type': 'Enchantement : aura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597179&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f1464e05-c37c-4b1e-a2c6-dfa7faf98592', 'multiverseId': 597179}, 'multiverseid': 597179}, {'name': 'Visione del Saggio', 'text': 'Incanta creatura\\nQuando la Visione del Saggio entra nel campo di battaglia, pesca una carta per ogni Aura che controlli assegnata a una creatura.\\nLa creatura incantata prende +1/+1 per ogni Aura che controlli assegnata a una creatura.', 'type': 'Incantesimo — Aura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597225&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '58e0e9f1-dbef-45e5-a898-ad6195268bf0', 'multiverseId': 597225}, 'multiverseid': 597225}, {'name': '賢人の夢想', 'text': 'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\n賢人の夢想が戦場に出たとき、あなたがコントロールしていてクリーチャーについているオーラ１つにつき１枚のカードを引く。\\nエンチャントしているクリーチャーは、あなたがコントロールしていてクリーチャーについているオーラ１つにつき＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。', 'type': 'エンチャント — オーラ', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597271&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd3c0ad4e-24fb-40e6-97d4-e435ad53a457', 'multiverseId': 597271}, 'multiverseid': 597271}, {'name': '智者妙想', 'text': '结附于生物\\n当智者妙想进战场时，你每操控一个贴附在生物上的灵气，便抓一张牌。\\n你每操控一个贴附在生物上的灵气，所结附的生物便得+1/+1。', 'type': '结界 ～灵气', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597409&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4281bcc9-81fa-4dc3-bb1d-faf189347476', 'multiverseId': 597409}, 'multiverseid': 597409}]", '[{\'name\': \'Meeresgrund-Orakel\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn ein Meervolk, das du kontrollierst, einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Meervolk, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': \'Wo das Meer die zerborstenen Schiffe verschlingt, liegen viele Geheimnisse verborgen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595269&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'286173df-d939-460f-8f70-807b0835b006\', \'multiverseId\': 595269}, \'multiverseid\': 595269}, {\'name\': \'Oráculo del fondo marino\', \'text\': \'Siempre que un Tritón que controlas haga daño de combate a un jugador, roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero tritón\', \'flavor\': \'Allá donde la luz tenue y azulada se posa sobre los barcos hundidos yacen secretos nunca descubiertos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595377&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'29861e40-867f-4c4b-9025-f05fc10e5502\', \'multiverseId\': 595377}, \'multiverseid\': 595377}, {\'name\': \'Oracle des fonds marins\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'un ondin que vous contrôlez inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Créature : ondin et sorcier\', \'flavor\': \'Là où la lumière bleutée caresse à peine les épaves brisées reposent les secrets.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595485&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b79b6767-deb6-47e2-8beb-97b38f03e5f2\', \'multiverseId\': 595485}, \'multiverseid\': 595485}, {\'name\': \'Oracolo del Fondale\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta un Tritone che controlli infligge danno da combattimento a un giocatore, peschi una carta.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Mago Tritone\', \'flavor\': \'Dove solo una luce fievole e azzurrata illumina i relitti, giacciono segreti mai rivendicati.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595593&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cacf6723-6ee7-48ed-87f8-7cc59c99d5db\', \'multiverseId\': 595593}, \'multiverseid\': 595593}, {\'name\': \'海底の神託者\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしているマーフォーク１体がプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、カード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — マーフォーク・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': \'船に届く光が暗く青くなるところには、手つかずの秘密が横たわっている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595701&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'97111704-0b7d-4ad8-a321-ccd408176b77\', \'multiverseId\': 595701}, \'multiverseid\': 595701}, {\'name\': \'海床先知\', \'text\': \'每当一个由你操控的人鱼对任一牌手造成战斗伤害时，抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人鱼／法术师\', \'flavor\': \'沉船散发蓝色幽光之处，所藏秘密永无人知晓。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596025&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'59c4ced9-a8f4-43ee-92cf-1920f09cab13\', \'multiverseId\': 596025}, \'multiverseid\': 596025}]', '[{\'name\': \'Meervolk-Schüler\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Meervolk-Schüler ins Spiel kommt, ziehe eine Karte und wirf dann eine Karte ab.\\n{1}{U}, schicke den Meervolk-Schüler aus deinem Friedhof ins Exil: Ziehe eine Karte und wirf dann eine Karte ab.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Meervolk, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': \'Die Aufrechterhaltung einer Privatsphäre ist sogar noch wichtiger, wenn man Kiemen hat.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589620&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e36ef227-3b37-45ee-94d6-13a432458110\', \'multiverseId\': 589620}, \'multiverseid\': 589620}, {\'name\': \'Pupilo tritón\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Pupilo tritón entre al campo de batalla, roba una carta, luego descarta una carta.\\n{1}{U}, exiliar el Pupilo tritón de tu cementerio: Roba una carta, luego descarta una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero tritón\', \'flavor\': \'Vivir en una burbuja es esencial cuando tienes branquias.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589671&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'273496c5-837b-48e8-af43-49b1555611d2\', \'multiverseId\': 589671}, \'multiverseid\': 589671}, {\'name\': \'Élève ondin\', \'text\': "Quand l\'Élève ondin arrive sur le champ de bataille, piochez une carte, puis défaussez-vous d\'une carte.\\n{1}{U}, exilez l\'Élève ondin depuis votre cimetière : Piochez une carte, puis défaussez-vous d\'une carte.", \'type\': \'Créature : ondin et sorcier\', \'flavor\': "Être dans sa bulle est très important pour se sentir comme un poisson dans l\'eau.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589722&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c446699a-ccb7-4f94-a27e-d2037e85f55f\', \'multiverseId\': 589722}, \'multiverseid\': 589722}, {\'name\': \'Alunno Tritone\', \'text\': "Quando l\'Alunno Tritone entra nel campo di battaglia, pesca una carta, poi scarta una carta.\\n{1}{U}, Esilia l\'Alunno Tritone dal tuo cimitero: Pesca una carta, poi scarta una carta.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Mago Tritone\', \'flavor\': \'Mantenere la propria bolla sociale è ancora più importante per chi ha le branchie.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589773&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f73ce7fb-be7f-42aa-b6e9-93a6c03de5e9\', \'multiverseId\': 589773}, \'multiverseid\': 589773}, {\'name\': \'マーフォークの学徒\', \'text\': \'マーフォークの学徒が戦場に出たとき、カード１枚を引き、その後、カード１枚を捨てる。\\n{1}{U},あなたの墓地にあるマーフォークの学徒を追放する：カード１枚を引き、その後、カード１枚を捨てる。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — マーフォーク・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': \'エラ呼吸だから尚更、個人の空間が大事なのである。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589824&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'17f8f53f-7b5a-42ff-8bfa-a314949ed536\', \'multiverseId\': 589824}, \'multiverseid\': 589824}, {\'name\': \'人鱼学子\', \'text\': \'当人鱼学子进战场时，抓一张牌，然后弃一张牌。\\n{1}{U}，从你的坟墓场放逐人鱼学子：抓一张牌，然后弃一张牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人鱼／法术师\', \'flavor\': \'如果你有鳃，那维持个人气泡就显得尤为重要。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589977&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0bed14a3-e729-4f51-9078-20cb12ac2e97\', \'multiverseId\': 589977}, \'multiverseid\': 589977}]', '[{\'name\': \'Meervolk-Souverän\', \'text\': \'Andere Meervolk-Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +1/+1.\\n{T}: Eine Meervolk-Kreatur deiner Wahl kann in diesem Zug nicht geblockt werden.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Meervolk, Adliger\', \'flavor\': \'„Sei wie das Meer: Fließe um alles herum, was du nicht bewegen kannst, und stürze dich auf alles andere unbarmherzig."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595247&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dfa9bae3-8e5f-4fc6-a23b-23fc9e06582e\', \'multiverseId\': 595247}, \'multiverseid\': 595247}, {\'name\': \'Tritón soberano\', \'text\': \'Las otras criaturas Tritón que controlas obtienen +1/+1.\\n{T}: La criatura Tritón objetivo no puede ser bloqueada este turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Noble tritón\', \'flavor\': \'"Sé como el mar: fluye alrededor de lo que es inamovible, y choca sin descanso contra todo lo demás".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595355&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eddf1d6f-9291-4f2a-b7f6-23eed9c63745\', \'multiverseId\': 595355}, \'multiverseid\': 595355}, {\'name\': \'Souveraine ondine\', \'text\': \'Les autres créatures Ondin que vous contrôlez gagnent +1/+1.\\n{T} : Une créature Ondin ciblée ne peut pas être bloquée ce tour-ci.\', \'type\': \'Créature : ondin et noble\', \'flavor\': \'« Soyez comme la mer : contournez ce qui est immuable. Quant au reste, pulvérisez-le sans hésiter. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595463&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2d6b907c-8536-486b-8b91-2aa10be5c694\', \'multiverseId\': 595463}, \'multiverseid\': 595463}, {\'name\': \'Sovrana dei Tritoni\', \'text\': \'Le altre creature Tritone che controlli prendono +1/+1.\\n{T}: Una creatura Tritone bersaglio non può essere bloccata in questo turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Nobile Tritone\', \'flavor\': \'"Fai come il mare: fluisci intorno a ciò che è inamovibile; per tutto il resto, infrangiti inesorabilmente contro di esso."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595571&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f53afae5-3774-4a40-b17d-401e7dd9ccca\', \'multiverseId\': 595571}, \'multiverseid\': 595571}, {\'name\': \'マーフォークの君主\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしていてこれでないすべてのマーフォーク・クリーチャーは＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\\n{T}：マーフォーク・クリーチャー１体を対象とする。このターン、それはブロックされない。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — マーフォーク・貴族\', \'flavor\': \'「海の如く在れ。動かざるものの周りを流れ、容赦なく他の誰にも襲い掛かれ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595679&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c9db6fbf-880b-4dd0-a229-1146792d4784\', \'multiverseId\': 595679}, \'multiverseid\': 595679}, {\'name\': \'人鱼君王\', \'text\': \'由你操控的其他人鱼生物得+1/+1。\\n{T}：目标人鱼生物本回合不能被阻挡。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人鱼／贵族\', \'flavor\': \'「要效法海洋：在不可移之物旁流动；然后便专心一致、不断地向它冲撞。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596003&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'08c64388-d1b8-4af0-8455-7605dad9307f\', \'multiverseId\': 596003}, \'multiverseid\': 596003}]', '[{\'name\': \'Mehrfachauswahl\', \'text\': \'Falls X gleich 1 ist, wende Hellsicht 1 an und ziehe dann eine Karte.\\nFalls X gleich 2 ist, kannst du einen Spieler bestimmen. Er bringt eine Kreatur, die er kontrolliert, auf die Hand ihres Besitzers zurück.\\nFalls X gleich 3 ist, erzeuge einen 4/4 blauen und roten Elementarwesen-Kreaturenspielstein.\\nFalls X gleich 4 oder mehr ist, führe alle oben genannten Aktionen aus.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595251&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6030bbe5-c089-4585-8f64-767ead238865\', \'multiverseId\': 595251}, \'multiverseid\': 595251}, {\'name\': \'Opción múltiple\', \'text\': \'Si X es 1, adivina 1, luego roba una carta.\\nSi X es 2, puedes elegir un jugador. Ese jugador regresa una criatura que controla a la mano de su propietario.\\nSi X es 3, crea una ficha de criatura Elemental azul y roja 4/4.\\nSi X es 4 o más, haz todo lo anterior.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595359&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'35d22665-fd54-456f-a4f2-c55797ce5b4a\', \'multiverseId\': 595359}, \'multiverseid\': 595359}, {\'name\': \'Choix multiple\', \'text\': "Si X est 1, regard 1, puis piochez une carte.\\nSi X est 2, vous pouvez choisir un joueur. Il renvoie une créature qu\'il contrôle dans la main de son propriétaire.\\nSi X est 3, créez un jeton de créature 4/4 bleue et rouge Élémental.\\nSi X est supérieur ou égal à 4, faites toutes les actions ci-dessus.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595467&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'787cc35b-0592-4671-b238-d0417437f4bd\', \'multiverseId\': 595467}, \'multiverseid\': 595467}, {\'name\': \'Scelta Multipla\', \'text\': \'Se X è pari a 1, profetizza 1, poi pesca una carta.\\nSe X è pari a 2, puoi scegliere un giocatore. Quel giocatore fa tornare una creatura che controlla in mano al suo proprietario.\\nSe X è pari a 3, crea una pedina creatura Elementale 4/4 blu e rossa.\\nSe X è pari o superiore a 4, segui tutte le istruzioni precedenti.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595575&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7b590862-0100-4626-acdf-a16afc1060ff\', \'multiverseId\': 595575}, \'multiverseid\': 595575}, {\'name\': \'複数の選択\', \'text\': \'Ｘが１なら、占術１を行い、その後カード１枚を引く。\\nＸが２なら、あなたはプレイヤー１人を選んでもよい。そのプレイヤーは自分がコントロールしているクリーチャー１体をオーナーの手札に戻す。\\nＸが３なら、青赤の４/４のエレメンタル・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\\nＸが４以上なら、上記すべてを行う。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595683&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a5942580-2c19-4d54-b179-0e317e12c94b\', \'multiverseId\': 595683}, \'multiverseid\': 595683}, {\'name\': \'多重选项\', \'text\': \'如果X为1，则占卜1，然后抓一张牌。\\n如果X为2，则你可以选择一位牌手。他将一个由其操控的生物移回其拥有者手上。\\n如果X为3，则派出一个4/4，蓝红双色的元素衍生生物。\\n如果X等于或大于4，则以上皆作。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596007&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5727fd0e-2f29-49c1-929e-bedbe9b78601\', \'multiverseId\': 596007}, \'multiverseid\': 596007}]', '[{\'name\': \'Merromerit\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn der Merromerit getappt wird, kannst du eine Karte ziehen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Meervolk, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': \'Es heißt, dass die Erinnerungen an längst vergangene Zeiten in die Köpfe der herumfaulenzenden Merromeriten hineinschwimmen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595223&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9bae3d4b-4d6d-4fed-bd2c-040a00299d07\', \'multiverseId\': 595223}, \'multiverseid\': 595223}, {\'name\': \'Sabio durmiente\', \'text\': \'Siempre que el Sabio durmiente se gire, puedes robar una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero tritón\', \'flavor\': \'Se dice que en las mentes de los haraganes sabios durmientes nadan los recuerdos de eras pasadas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595331&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'be340636-32ac-4f5d-b537-ba72dafbfdd4\', \'multiverseId\': 595331}, \'multiverseid\': 595331}, {\'name\': \'Sage des jachères\', \'text\': \'À chaque fois que le Sage des jachères devient engagé, vous pouvez piocher une carte.\', \'type\': \'Créature : ondin et sorcier\', \'flavor\': "On dit que les souvenirs de temps révolus nagent dans l\'esprit des sages des jachères.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595439&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4700aeb2-d74e-47aa-9a4b-a943977a72eb\', \'multiverseId\': 595439}, \'multiverseid\': 595439}, {\'name\': \'Saggio Torpido\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta il Saggio Torpido viene TAPpato, puoi pescare una carta.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Mago Tritone\', \'flavor\': \'Si dice che i ricordi delle ere passate galleggino nelle menti degli oziosi saggi torpidi.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595547&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'05b18df6-adf2-4708-ace2-08f26481055a\', \'multiverseId\': 595547}, \'multiverseid\': 595547}, {\'name\': \'休賢者\', \'text\': \'休賢者がタップ状態になるたび、あなたはカード１枚を引いてもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — マーフォーク・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': \'無気力な休賢者の精神の中に、過ぎた世代の記憶が泳いでいると言う。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595655&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b0676304-8692-4f0b-bdf2-3842075a1acf\', \'multiverseId\': 595655}, \'multiverseid\': 595655}, {\'name\': \'静修贤者\', \'text\': \'每当静修贤者成为横置时，你可以抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人鱼／法术师\', \'flavor\': \'据说在闲散的静修贤者脑海中，陈年记忆仍在流动着。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595979&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8bb61123-82d0-4920-86f9-04ccdb0b8b55\', \'multiverseId\': 595979}, \'multiverseid\': 595979}]', '[{\'name\': \'Merrow-Rittersmann\', \'text\': \'Andere Meervolk-Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +1/+1.\\nImmer wenn du einen Meervolk-Zauberspruch wirkst, kannst du eine bleibende Karte deiner Wahl tappen oder enttappen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Meervolk, Soldat\', \'flavor\': \'„… da hab ich mir einen Menschen geangelt, der war so groß."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597090&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'63749aef-224a-4322-bacf-9129fc5a7080\', \'multiverseId\': 597090}, \'multiverseid\': 597090}, {\'name\': \'Reejerey merrow\', \'text\': \'Las otras criaturas Tritón que controlas obtienen +1/+1.\\nSiempre que lances un hechizo de Tritón, puedes girar o enderezar el permanente objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado tritón\', \'flavor\': \'"... y en ese instante atrapé un humano así de grande".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597136&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'651ecbc5-dfcd-4d41-b0a4-4b8a4eb8e737\', \'multiverseId\': 597136}, \'multiverseid\': 597136}, {\'name\': \'Reejerey suire\', \'text\': "Les autres créatures Ondin que vous contrôlez gagnent +1/+1.\\nÀ chaque fois que vous lancez un sort d\'ondin, vous pouvez engager ou dégager un permanent ciblé.", \'type\': \'Créature : ondin et soldat\', \'flavor\': "« ... et là, j\'ai pêché un humain grand comme ça. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597182&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'74fa53f7-9547-4811-b375-b62306b45e60\', \'multiverseId\': 597182}, \'multiverseid\': 597182}, {\'name\': \'Reejerey Merrow\', \'text\': \'Le altre creature Tritone che controlli prendono +1/+1.\\nOgniqualvolta lanci una magia Tritone, puoi TAPpare o STAPpare un permanente bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Soldato Tritone\', \'flavor\': \'"... e in quel preciso istante un umano grosso così ha abboccato."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597228&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'218dc794-6a33-4042-b2e4-74dd0d64708f\', \'multiverseId\': 597228}, \'multiverseid\': 597228}, {\'name\': \'メロウの騎兵\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしていてこれでないすべてのマーフォーク・クリーチャーは＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\\nあなたがマーフォーク・呪文を唱えるたび、パーマネント１つを対象とする。あなたはそれをタップまたはアンタップしてもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — マーフォーク・兵士\', \'flavor\': \'「……それで、このくらいの大きさの人間を釣り上げたんだ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597274&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7c8f081e-2da3-4b17-83d5-5959884a0747\', \'multiverseId\': 597274}, \'multiverseid\': 597274}, {\'name\': \'美洛理骑士\', \'text\': \'由你操控的其他人鱼生物得+1/+1。\\n每当你施放人鱼咒语时，你可以横置或重置目标永久物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人鱼／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'「…当时我卷起了一个体型有这么大的人类。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597412&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1e8f06f2-ab9c-419f-bf22-399007838136\', \'multiverseId\': 597412}, \'multiverseid\': 597412}]', '[{\'name\': \'Meteorgolem\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Meteorgolem ins Spiel kommt, zerstöre eine bleibende Karte deiner Wahl, die kein Land ist und die ein Gegner kontrolliert.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Golem\', \'flavor\': \'Der Einschlag ließ die Soldaten erzittern — dann erhob sich etwas aus dem Krater.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596290&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'13ada983-f1ca-468e-901b-292e0718f585\', \'multiverseId\': 596290}, \'multiverseid\': 596290}, {\'name\': \'Gólem meteoro\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Gólem meteoro entre al campo de batalla, destruye el permanente objetivo que no sea tierra que controla un oponente.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Gólem\', \'flavor\': \'El impacto dispersó a los soldados y, después, algo emergió del cráter.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596377&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f5f42ef4-1546-4553-93b5-7172b494c59c\', \'multiverseId\': 596377}, \'multiverseid\': 596377}, {\'name\': \'Golem météoritique\', \'text\': "Quand le Golem météoritique arrive sur le champ de bataille, détruisez un permanent non-terrain ciblé qu\'un adversaire contrôle.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : golem\', \'flavor\': "L\'impact dispersa les soldats, puis quelque chose émergea du cratère.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596464&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5341ad63-fc2a-4427-87b6-ba5e05f721be\', \'multiverseId\': 596464}, \'multiverseid\': 596464}, {\'name\': \'Golem Meteora\', \'text\': \'Quando il Golem Meteora entra nel campo di battaglia, distruggi un permanente non terra bersaglio controllato da un avversario.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Golem\', \'flavor\': "L\'impatto disperse i soldati, poi dal cratere emerse qualcosa.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596551&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5fb9d4f7-6614-4f15-b9c5-6fd683460d06\', \'multiverseId\': 596551}, \'multiverseid\': 596551}, {\'name\': \'隕石ゴーレム\', \'text\': \'隕石ゴーレムが戦場に出たとき、対戦相手がコントロールしていて土地でないパーマネント１つを対象とする。それを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — ゴーレム\', \'flavor\': \'その衝撃で兵士たちは散り散りになった。すると、その穴から何かが現れた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596638&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'06251529-8b37-4c87-8ec5-2ebf76566d36\', \'multiverseId\': 596638}, \'multiverseid\': 596638}, {\'name\': \'陨石魔像\', \'text\': \'当陨石魔像进战场时，消灭目标由对手操控的非地永久物。\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～魔像\', \'flavor\': \'冲击将士兵四散震飞～随后坑中有人影起身。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596899&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fb5b60f4-f1ef-4aa9-8d66-03235c1cc2a1\', \'multiverseId\': 596899}, \'multiverseid\': 596899}]', '[{\'name\': \'Meuchler aus Nirkana\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du Lebenspunkte dazuerhältst, erhält der Meuchler aus Nirkana Todesberührung bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vampir, Assassine, Verbündeter\', \'flavor\': \'Meuchler aus Nirkana verwenden ein Gebräu aus Basiliskenmark, Pflanzensaft der Todesweide und Extrakten dutzender anderer Giftpflanzen, gegen das es kein Heilmittel gibt.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594106&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1cce389f-45d3-4cad-8965-f2c547b5a4a0\', \'multiverseId\': 594106}, \'multiverseid\': 594106}, {\'name\': \'Asesino Nirkana\', \'text\': \'Siempre que ganes vidas, el Asesino Nirkana gana la habilidad de toque mortal hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Asesino vampiro aliado\', \'flavor\': \'Los asesinos Nirkana crean unos mejunjes letales mezclando médula de basilisco y savia de sauce mortal con los fluidos de una docena de especies venenosas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594223&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9bf7aa98-cd9c-4aeb-937a-78aea7430515\', \'multiverseId\': 594223}, \'multiverseid\': 594223}, {\'name\': \'Assassin des Nirkana\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que vous gagnez des points de vie, l\'Assassin des Nirkana acquiert le contact mortel jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : vampire et assassin et allié\', \'flavor\': "Les assassins des Nirkana concoctent des poisons incurables en infusant de la moelle de basilic et de la sève de saule tueur dans les fluides vitaux d\'une dizaine d\'autres espèces venimeuses.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594340&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'48f54fd1-cc87-47b8-a73a-7df328c88f56\', \'multiverseId\': 594340}, \'multiverseid\': 594340}, {\'name\': \'Assassino Nirkana\', \'text\': "Ogniqualvolta guadagni punti vita, l\'Assassino Nirkana ha tocco letale fino alla fine del turno.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Alleato Assassino Vampiro\', \'flavor\': \'Gli assassini Nirkana creano tinture letali mischiando midollo di basilisco e linfa di salice mortale con i fluidi vitali di una dozzina di altre specie velenose.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594457&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3a38146f-7178-4e45-a276-d9ab0aedf189\', \'multiverseId\': 594457}, \'multiverseid\': 594457}, {\'name\': \'ニルカーナの暗殺者\', \'text\': \'あなたがライフを得るたび、ターン終了時まで、ニルカーナの暗殺者は接死を得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 吸血鬼・暗殺者・同盟者\', \'flavor\': \'ニルカーナの暗殺者は、バジリスクの髄液とドクヤナギの樹液に十種類以上の有毒生物から採った致死成分を加え、治癒不能な薬物を調製する。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594574&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aebfc880-2f53-4479-9889-01827b988629\', \'multiverseId\': 594574}, \'multiverseid\': 594574}, {\'name\': \'涅卡那杀手\', \'text\': \'每当你获得生命时，涅卡那杀手获得死触异能直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～吸血鬼／杀手／伙伴\', \'flavor\': \'涅卡那杀手将蜥怪骨髓与毒柳树液和其他有毒物种的体液混合，制成了无解的毒药合剂。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594925&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6672652b-561d-454a-907f-d88f425acd19\', \'multiverseId\': 594925}, \'multiverseid\': 594925}]', '[{\'name\': \'Michiko Konda, Wahrheitssucherin\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn dir eine Quelle, die ein Gegner kontrolliert, Schaden zufügt, opfert jener Spieler eine bleibende Karte.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Berater\', \'flavor\': \'„Passt auf meinen Vater auf. Sagt ihm, ich sei in Sicherheit, würde aber nicht nach Hause kommen, bis ich einen Weg gefunden habe, ihn wieder zu Sinnen zu bringen, und Kamigawa den Frieden zurück hat."\\n—Michiko Konda, Brief an General Takeno\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591621&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d22e5fa3-45f6-4239-9ebb-c7accde22b60\', \'multiverseId\': 591621}, \'multiverseid\': 591621}, {\'name\': \'Michiko Konda, busca verdad\', \'text\': \'Siempre que una fuente que controla un oponente te haga daño, ese jugador sacrifica un permanente.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Consejero humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Cuida a mi padre. Dile que estoy a salvo, pero que no volveré a casa hasta que descubra la manera de hacerlo entrar en razones, y Kamigawa esté nuevamente en paz".\\n—Michiko Konda, última carta al General Takeno\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591750&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a03e68f4-c2a5-407e-9857-5f6ff126a5c9\', \'multiverseId\': 591750}, \'multiverseid\': 591750}, {\'name\': \'Michiko Konda, chercheuse de vérité\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'une source qu\'un adversaire contrôle vous inflige des blessures, ce joueur sacrifie un permanent.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et conseiller\', \'flavor\': "« Veillez sur mon père. Dites-lui que je vais bien, mais que je ne reviendrai pas avant d\'avoir trouvé le moyen de lui rendre la raison et de ramener la paix sur Kamigawa. »\\n—Michiko Konda, dernière lettre au général Takeno", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591879&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0d3c6c62-4fd3-4e10-8494-2927d235d841\', \'multiverseId\': 591879}, \'multiverseid\': 591879}, {\'name\': \'Michiko Konda, Cercaverità\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta una fonte controllata da un avversario ti infligge danno, quel giocatore sacrifica un permanente.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Consigliere Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Prenditi cura di mio padre. Digli che sto bene, ma che non tornerò a casa finché non avrò trovato il modo di farlo rinsavire e Kamigawa sarà tornata in pace."\\n—Michiko, lettera al Generale Takeno\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592008&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'15b13ad5-e4fc-402a-868c-ab6f6c5cde56\', \'multiverseId\': 592008}, \'multiverseid\': 592008}, {\'name\': \'真実を求める者、今田魅知子\', \'text\': \'対戦相手がコントロールしている発生源１つがあなたにダメージを与えるたび、そのプレイヤーはパーマネント１つを生け贄に捧げる。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・アドバイザー\', \'flavor\': \'「父を見張っていてください。私の無事をお伝えください。ただ、如何にして父を正気に戻し、神河に再び平和を取り戻すかを知るまでは帰りませぬ。」\\n――今田魅知子より武野御大将に宛てた書簡\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592137&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'82853411-81ca-45ed-a26c-5b13aae6ae6d\', \'multiverseId\': 592137}, \'multiverseid\': 592137}, {\'name\': \'致真者今田魅知子\', \'text\': \'每当任一由对手操控的来源对你造成伤害时，该牌手牺牲一个永久物。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～人类／参谋\', \'flavor\': \'「请您守护父亲大人。转告父亲我一切安好，但在找到令他回复神智、让神河重归和平的方法之前，我不会回来。」\\n～今田魅知子写给武野将军的信\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592524&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9f177da5-a071-41b3-b25f-dcbaa6f86caf\', \'multiverseId\': 592524}, \'multiverseid\': 592524}]', '[{\'name\': \'Militärspionage\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du mit zwei oder mehr Kreaturen angreifst, ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'Das Schlachtfeld zu kennen bedeutet, die Schritte des Feindes vorauszusehen. Den Feind zu kennen bedeutet, den Sieg vorauszusehen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595248&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2721daf5-0cef-43a4-a61d-efbe4e1d6c66\', \'multiverseId\': 595248}, \'multiverseid\': 595248}, {\'name\': \'Inteligencia militar\', \'text\': \'Siempre que ataques con dos o más criaturas, roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'Conocer el campo de batalla es anticiparse al enemigo. Conocer al enemigo es anticipar la victoria.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595356&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7b445dd1-bf5b-41e4-95c5-e852ea979d7a\', \'multiverseId\': 595356}, \'multiverseid\': 595356}, {\'name\': \'Renseignements militaires\', \'text\': \'À chaque fois que vous attaquez avec deux créatures ou plus, piochez une carte.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': "Connaître le champ de bataille, c\'est anticiper l\'ennemi. Connaître l\'ennemi, c\'est anticiper la victoire.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595464&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b4d367fb-e4c9-42d0-9aea-0666cc790a7c\', \'multiverseId\': 595464}, \'multiverseid\': 595464}, {\'name\': \'Strategia Militare\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta attacchi con due o più creature, pesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'Se conosci il campo di battaglia, avrai in pugno il nemico. Se conosci il nemico, avrai in pugno la vittoria.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595572&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6a4c5395-f2a1-4764-aef3-c231e668fe18\', \'multiverseId\': 595572}, \'multiverseid\': 595572}, {\'name\': \'軍事情報\', \'text\': \'あなたが２体以上のクリーチャーで攻撃するたび、カード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'戦場を知ることは、敵を予測することである。敵を知ることは、勝利を予測することである。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595680&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9fb9c344-1ee7-4d5b-b1da-2926ae1ee8ce\', \'multiverseId\': 595680}, \'multiverseid\': 595680}, {\'name\': \'军事情报\', \'text\': \'每当你以两个或更多生物攻击时，抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'了解战场就可料敌先机。了解敌人便能志在必得。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596004&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a2fe816d-1e9b-4a83-a953-ca81bc0e523f\', \'multiverseId\': 596004}, \'multiverseid\': 596004}]', '[{\'name\': \'Mishras Fabrik\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{1}: Mishras Fabrik wird bis zum Ende des Zuges zu einer 2/2 Montagearbeiter-Artefaktkreatur. Sie ist immer noch ein Land.\\n{T}: Eine Montagearbeiter-Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält +1/+1 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596320&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0fc7f0f2-05c5-410f-8d76-a46ef6e57045\', \'multiverseId\': 596320}, \'multiverseid\': 596320}, {\'name\': \'Factoría de Mishra\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {C}.\\n{1}: La Factoría de Mishra se convierte en una criatura artefacto Operario 2/2 hasta el final del turno. Sigue siendo una tierra.\\n{T}: La criatura Operario objetivo obtiene +1/+1 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596407&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'99580c70-635f-4380-9105-de92a9d3e920\', \'multiverseId\': 596407}, \'multiverseid\': 596407}, {\'name\': \'Usine de Mishra\', \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{1} : L\'Usine de Mishra devient une créature-artefact 2/2 Ouvrier spécialisé jusqu\'à la fin du tour. C\'est toujours un terrain.\\n{T} : Une créature Ouvrier spécialisé ciblée gagne +1/+1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596494&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'50fae90e-26a7-4370-9e6e-9041f599385f\', \'multiverseId\': 596494}, \'multiverseid\': 596494}, {\'name\': \'Fabbrica di Mishra\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\n{1}: La Fabbrica di Mishra diventa una creatura artefatto Addetto-al-Montaggio 2/2 fino alla fine del turno. È ancora una terra.\\n{T}: Una creatura Addetto-al-Montaggio bersaglio prende +1/+1 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596581&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'69802277-e444-45e1-a908-e90956250f18\', \'multiverseId\': 596581}, \'multiverseid\': 596581}, {\'name\': \'ミシュラの工廠\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{1}：ターン終了時まで、ミシュラの工廠は２/２の組立作業員・アーティファクト・クリーチャーになる。これは土地でもある。\\n{T}：組立作業員・クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596668&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'946126e5-8c61-4bdd-99a5-877c96b46c8c\', \'multiverseId\': 596668}, \'multiverseid\': 596668}, {\'name\': \'米斯拉的工厂\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{C}。\\n{1}：米斯拉的工厂成为2/2组装工人神器生物直到回合结束。它仍然是地。\\n{T}：目标组装工人生物得+1/+1直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596929&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2220b1e4-edb1-4745-83b5-dd83763c5140\', \'multiverseId\': 596929}, \'multiverseid\': 596929}]', '[{\'name\': \'Mitternachts-Wachposten\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn eine andere Kreatur ins Spiel kommt, enttappe den Mitternachts-Wachposten.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Soldat\', \'flavor\': \'„Wenn du auf Wache bist, ist kein Geräusch harmlos, und kein Schatten darf ignoriert werden."\\n—Olgard vom Schildvolk\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591622&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c055a164-9294-433c-a841-70a971db0cf6\', \'multiverseId\': 591622}, \'multiverseid\': 591622}, {\'name\': \'Guardia de medianoche\', \'text\': \'Siempre que otra criatura entre al campo de batalla, endereza al Guardia de medianoche.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Cuando estás de guardia, ningún sonido es inofensivo y no puedes ignorar ninguna sombra".\\n—Olgard de los skiltfolk\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591751&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5cd99464-e0b9-445e-949c-ee44beb09b87\', \'multiverseId\': 591751}, \'multiverseid\': 591751}, {\'name\': \'Garde de minuit\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'une autre créature arrive sur le champ de bataille, dégagez la Garde de minuit.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et soldat\', \'flavor\': \'« Quand on est de garde, tout bruit est anormal et toute ombre est suspecte. »\\n—Olgard des Skiltfolk\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591880&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9f88a3a2-f1e8-427c-99d3-e0ffadf9fdbb\', \'multiverseId\': 591880}, \'multiverseid\': 591880}, {\'name\': \'Guardia di Mezzanotte\', \'text\': "Ogniqualvolta un\'altra creatura entra nel campo di battaglia, STAPpa la Guardia di Mezzanotte.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Soldato Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Quando sei di guardia, nessun rumore è innocuo e nessuna ombra può essere ignorata."\\n—Olgard degli Skiltfolk\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592009&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5102a13a-b402-4eb2-9f3e-85fbf316c7d4\', \'multiverseId\': 592009}, \'multiverseid\': 592009}, {\'name\': \'深夜の護衛\', \'text\': \'これでないクリーチャー１体が戦場に出るたび、深夜の護衛をアンタップする。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・兵士\', \'flavor\': \'「見張りに立っている時は、無害な音など無いし、無視できる影も無い。」\\n――スキルトの民のオルガード\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592138&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a4382e94-d8d0-4459-9f21-41b6ee639a31\', \'multiverseId\': 592138}, \'multiverseid\': 592138}, {\'name\': \'午夜哨兵\', \'text\': \'每当另一个生物进战场时，重置午夜哨兵。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'「轮你值班的时候，不会有无害的噪音，也没有可以忽略的影子。」\\n～技卫士欧贾得\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592525&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a908ecdf-9956-4591-b99f-16ec2e3d108b\', \'multiverseId\': 592525}, \'multiverseid\': 592525}]', '[{\'name\': \'Mizzix, Duplikatreiterin\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nImmer wenn du einen Zauberspruch von irgendwoher außer deiner Hand wirkst, kannst du {1}{U/R} bezahlen. Falls du dies tust, kopiere den Zauberspruch. Du kannst neue Ziele für die Kopie bestimmen. Falls die Kopie ein Bleibende-Karte-Zauberspruch ist, erhält er Eile und „Zu Beginn deines Endsegments opferst du diese bleibende Karte." (Eine Kopie eines Bleibende-Karte-Zauberspruchs wird zu einem Spielstein.)\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Goblin, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589640&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'90183a06-dead-4b48-90ca-8201e0a625a9\', \'multiverseId\': 589640}, \'multiverseid\': 589640}, {\'name\': \'Mízzix, jinete de réplicas\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nSiempre que lances un hechizo desde cualquier parte excepto desde tu mano, puedes pagar {1}{U/R}. Si lo haces, copia ese hechizo. Puedes elegir nuevos objetivos para la copia. Si la copia es un hechizo de permanente, gana la habilidad de prisa y "Al comienzo de tu paso final, sacrifica este permanente". (Una copia de un hechizo de permanente se convierte en una ficha.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Hechicero trasgo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589691&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'94bce29c-ecea-4443-8dd4-e5c70590d62f\', \'multiverseId\': 589691}, \'multiverseid\': 589691}, {\'name\': \'Mizzix, chevaucheuse de reproduction\', \'text\': "Vol\\nÀ chaque fois que vous lancez un sort depuis autre part que votre main, vous pouvez payer {1}{U/R}. Si vous faites ainsi, copiez ce sort et vous pouvez choisir de nouvelles cibles pour la copie. Si la copie est un sort de permanent, elle acquiert la célérité et « Au début de votre étape de fin, sacrifiez ce permanent. » (Une copie d\'un sort de permanent devient un jeton.)", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : gobelin et sorcier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589742&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9298c348-e97b-4237-97dc-e5aa908efa88\', \'multiverseId\': 589742}, \'multiverseid\': 589742}, {\'name\': \'Mizzix, Cavalcatrice della Replica\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nOgniqualvolta lanci una magia da una zona diversa dalla tua mano, puoi pagare {1}{U/R}. Se lo fai, copia quella magia e puoi scegliere nuovi bersagli per la copia. Se la copia è una magia permanente, ha rapidità e "All\\\'inizio della tua sottofase finale, sacrifica questo permanente". (Una copia di una magia permanente diventa una pedina.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Mago Goblin\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589793&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b922c869-7923-414b-adc3-7c81d3ba4f18\', \'multiverseId\': 589793}, \'multiverseid\': 589793}, {\'name\': \'模造品乗り、ミジックス\', \'text\': \'飛行\\nあなたがあなたの手札以外から呪文を唱えるたび、あなたは{1}{U/R}を支払ってもよい。そうしたなら、その呪文をコピーし、あなたはそのコピーの新しい対象を選んでもよい。そのコピーがパーマネント・呪文であるなら、それは速攻と「あなたの終了ステップの開始時に、このパーマネントを生け贄に捧げる。」を得る。（パーマネント・呪文のコピーはトークンになる。）\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — ゴブリン・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589844&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a56171e2-2047-4793-acac-8bc371e523a6\', \'multiverseId\': 589844}, \'multiverseid\': 589844}, {\'name\': \'摹械骑士米捷兹\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n每当你从你手牌以外的任何区域施放咒语时，你可以支付{1}{U/R}。若你如此作，则复制该咒语，且你可以为该复制品选择新的目标。如果该复制品是永久物咒语，则它获得敏捷与「在你的结束步骤开始时，牺牲此永久物。」（永久物咒语的复制品会成为衍生物。）\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～鬼怪／法术师\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589997&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a5fb4aac-6f59-4629-a216-97586d09525c\', \'multiverseId\': 589997}, \'multiverseid\': 589997}]', "[{'name': 'Modergrab-Tausendfüßer', 'text': 'Wenn der Modergrab-Tausendfüßer ins Spiel kommt, millst du drei Karten und legst dann für jede Kreaturenkarte in deinem Friedhof eine +1/+1-Marke auf den Modergrab-Tausendfüßer. (Um eine Karte zu millen, lege die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek auf deinen Friedhof.)', 'type': 'Kreatur — Insekt, Schrecken', 'flavor': 'Unter Leichenflickern, Kultisten und Plünderern sind Leichen sehr gefragt.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592890&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3fd23876-0042-4365-bebb-c4e640a7b9eb', 'multiverseId': 592890}, 'multiverseid': 592890}, {'name': 'Milpiés de tumbamohosa', 'text': 'Cuando el Milpiés de tumbamohosa entre al campo de batalla, muele tres cartas y luego pon un contador +1/+1 sobre el Milpiés de tumbamohosa por cada carta de criatura en tu cementerio. (Para moler una carta, pon la primera carta de tu biblioteca en tu cementerio.)', 'type': 'Criatura — Horror insecto', 'flavor': 'Entre suturadores, sectarios y saqueadores, hay mucha demanda de cadáveres.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593011&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9473ad25-076d-4924-91ca-8bd9c8b00cd8', 'multiverseId': 593011}, 'multiverseid': 593011}, {'name': 'Diplopode du moldgraf', 'text': 'Quand le Diplopode du moldgraf arrive sur le champ de bataille, meulez trois cartes, puis mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur le Diplopode du moldgraf pour chaque carte de créature dans votre cimetière. (Pour meuler une carte, mettez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque dans votre cimetière.)', 'type': 'Créature : insecte et horreur', 'flavor': 'Entre les raccommodeurs, les cultistes et les charognards, les cadavres sont très demandés.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593132&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9a56172b-cff9-4bed-81d1-2835bcd37ee3', 'multiverseId': 593132}, 'multiverseid': 593132}, {'name': 'Millepiedi Ammuffito', 'text': 'Quando il Millepiedi Ammuffito entra nel campo di battaglia, macina tre carte, poi metti un segnalino +1/+1 sul Millepiedi Ammuffito per ogni carta creatura nel tuo cimitero. (Per macinare una carta, metti nel tuo cimitero la prima carta del tuo grimorio.)', 'type': 'Creatura — Orrore Insetto', 'flavor': 'Tra cucitori, cultisti e saprofaghi, i cadaveri sono molto richiesti.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593253&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f9d50c22-bf11-4a4a-970a-5e880cab41b0', 'multiverseId': 593253}, 'multiverseid': 593253}, {'name': '黴墓のヤスデ', 'text': '黴墓のヤスデが戦場に出たとき、カード３枚を切削する。その後、黴墓のヤスデの上に、あなたの墓地にあるクリーチャー・カード１枚につき１個の＋１/＋１カウンターを置く。（カードを切削するとは、あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカードをあなたの墓地に置くことである。）', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 昆虫・ホラー', 'flavor': '縫い師と狂信者と死肉漁りの間では、死体の需要が高い。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593374&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9cb07c54-870d-4397-af48-db675de1a90f', 'multiverseId': 593374}, 'multiverseid': 593374}, {'name': '苔墓千足虫', 'text': '当苔墓千足虫进战场时，磨三张牌，然后你坟墓场中每有一张生物牌，便在苔墓千足虫上放置一个+1/+1指示物。（磨一张牌的流程是将你牌库顶的牌置入你的坟墓场。）', 'type': '生物 ～昆虫／惊惧兽', 'flavor': '拼接师、教众、食腐兽，在多方争抢下，如今尸体需求旺盛。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593737&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b2def6a6-e1cf-4856-afa1-ffcb2b77546c', 'multiverseId': 593737}, 'multiverseid': 593737}]", '[{\'name\': \'Mondvolk-Knoblerin\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nImmer wenn die Mondvolk-Knoblerin getappt wird, wende Hellsicht 1 an. (Schaue dir die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek an. Du kannst sie unter deine Bibliothek legen.)\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Mondvolk, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': \'„Forschung ist selten der trockene, seriöse Zeitvertreib, als den sie Außenstehende hinstellen."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595250&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'405f609e-60ba-4d54-8845-5575c1014ab2\', \'multiverseId\': 595250}, \'multiverseid\': 595250}, {\'name\': \'Creadora de rompecabezas lunar\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nSiempre que la Creadora de rompecabezas lunar se gire, adivina 1. (Mira la primera carta de tu biblioteca. Puedes poner esa carta en el fondo de tu biblioteca.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Hechicero pueblo-lunar\', \'flavor\': \'"Se suele creer que la investigación es un pasatiempo aburrido y serio, pero no es así".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595358&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1c7cc247-aa6b-4cef-8b31-ea29f7b8b434\', \'multiverseId\': 595358}, \'multiverseid\': 595358}, {\'name\': \'Créatrice de casse-tête lunaréenne\', \'text\': \'Vol\\nÀ chaque fois que la Créatrice de casse-tête lunaréenne devient engagée, regard 1. (Regardez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Vous pouvez la mettre au-dessous de votre bibliothèque.)\', \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : lunaréen et sorcier\', \'flavor\': "« La recherche n\'est pas toujours l\'activité sérieuse et ennuyeuse à laquelle les gens pourraient penser. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595466&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'18789b39-03e3-4ce1-a621-183bc2857853\', \'multiverseId\': 595466}, \'multiverseid\': 595466}, {\'name\': \'Plasmaenigmi Lunantropa\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nOgniqualvolta la Plasmaenigmi Lunantropa viene TAPpata, profetizza 1. (Guarda la prima carta del tuo grimorio. Puoi mettere quella carta in fondo al tuo grimorio.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Mago Lunantropo\', \'flavor\': \'"La ricerca non è seria e noiosa come può sembrare ai profani."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595574&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dd47af3b-a9ee-4a2e-9d25-9e473d850cbb\', \'multiverseId\': 595574}, \'multiverseid\': 595574}, {\'name\': \'ムーンフォークの謎掛け師\', \'text\': \'飛行\\nムーンフォークの謎掛け師がタップ状態になるたび、占術１を行う。（あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード１枚を見る。あなたはそのカードをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に置いてもよい。）\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — ムーンフォーク・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': \'「研究とは、よそ者が思うような味気無くて真面目腐ったものとはほど遠いものです。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595682&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'24d4b881-e64f-4a1f-b736-0247231ff95e\', \'multiverseId\': 595682}, \'multiverseid\': 595682}, {\'name\': \'出谜月人\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n每当出谜月人成为横置时，占卜1。（检视你牌库顶的牌。你可以将该牌置于你的牌库底。）\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～月人／法术师\', \'flavor\': \'「研究从来就不是外人想象中那种枯燥严肃的消遣。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596006&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'85404efd-5289-41c6-8582-96f78c5878f2\', \'multiverseId\': 596006}, \'multiverseid\': 596006}]', '[{\'name\': \'Montagearbeiter\', \'text\': \'{T}: Eine Montagearbeiter-Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält +1/+1 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Montagearbeiter\', \'flavor\': \'Obwohl ihre Fabriken längst zerstört sind, schuften einige von Mishras Schöpfungen immer noch in einsamen Gegenden, wo sie ohne Unterlass ihre vor langer Zeit erhaltenen Aufträge erfüllen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596259&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ac2e49cd-08e0-4654-a4a3-26b36461940c\', \'multiverseId\': 596259}, \'multiverseid\': 596259}, {\'name\': \'Operario\', \'text\': \'{T}: La criatura Operario objetivo obtiene +1/+1 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Operario\', \'flavor\': \'A pesar de que sus factorías fueron destruidas hace mucho tiempo, algunas de las creaciones de Mishra aún trabajan en áreas remotas, realizando una y otra vez la última tarea que les fue encomendada.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596346&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b3bd96a8-d680-4cfb-a891-6f2bcfe77ae4\', \'multiverseId\': 596346}, \'multiverseid\': 596346}, {\'name\': \'Ouvrier spécialisé\', \'text\': "{T} : Une créature Ouvrier spécialisé ciblée gagne +1/+1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : ouvrier spécialisé\', \'flavor\': \'Depuis la destruction de leurs usines, certaines des créations de Mishra travaillaient encore dans des régions isolées, répétant sans cesse leurs dernières instructions.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596433&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'54db5d6b-672a-4881-b1c8-086e8ff0dc3c\', \'multiverseId\': 596433}, \'multiverseid\': 596433}, {\'name\': \'Addetto-al-Montaggio\', \'text\': \'{T}: Una creatura Addetto-al-Montaggio bersaglio prende +1/+1 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Addetto-al-Montaggio\', \'flavor\': "Con le loro fabbriche da tempo distrutte, alcune delle creazioni di Mishra continuano a sgobbare in zone remote, ripetendo all\'infinito gli ultimi ordini ricevuti.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596520&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'812a8adb-8589-4fc8-a3c1-18dd0ac3471d\', \'multiverseId\': 596520}, \'multiverseid\': 596520}, {\'name\': \'組立作業員\', \'text\': \'{T}：組立作業員・クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 組立作業員\', \'flavor\': \'彼らの工廠が長き昔に破壊された結果、ミシュラの創造物のいくつかは、最後に与えられた命令を人里離れた地でひたすら繰り返し続けている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596607&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ae6b2896-61a4-44c7-bd84-c7d060954808\', \'multiverseId\': 596607}, \'multiverseid\': 596607}, {\'name\': \'组装工人\', \'text\': \'{T}：目标组装工人生物得+1/+1直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～组装工人\', \'flavor\': \'即使所属的工厂早已不存，某些米斯拉的作品依旧在偏远地带辛勤工作，不断地执行、查核最后收到的命令。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596868&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'65dee106-df23-4fd6-b559-1bc6b261045c\', \'multiverseId\': 596868}, \'multiverseid\': 596868}]', '[{\'name\': \'Morduntersuchung\', \'text\': \'Verzaubert eine Kreatur, die du kontrollierst\\nWenn die verzauberte Kreatur stirbt, erzeuge X 1/1 weiße Soldat-Kreaturenspielsteine, wobei X gleich ihrer Stärke ist.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'„ Jeder Tod bringt ein Gespinst aus Konsequenzen mit sich. Unsere Aufgabe besteht darin, die Spinne zu finden."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591625&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'38beb5de-e9b0-42d2-a0a3-71b7b201e902\', \'multiverseId\': 591625}, \'multiverseid\': 591625}, {\'name\': \'Investigar el asesinato\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura que controlas.\\nCuando la criatura encantada muera, crea X fichas de criatura Soldado blancas 1/1, donde X es su fuerza.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'"Cada muerte tiene una red de consecuencias. Nuestra tarea es encontrar a la araña".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591754&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'daa2f5a4-7952-498f-885e-8fa706dc33ec\', \'multiverseId\': 591754}, \'multiverseid\': 591754}, {\'name\': \'Enquête pour meurtre\', \'text\': \'Enchanter : une créature que vous contrôlez\\nQuand la créature enchantée meurt, créez X jetons de créature 1/1 blanche Soldat, X étant sa force.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': "« Chaque décès tisse une toile de conséquences. À nous de trouver l\'araignée. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591883&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'612f6ca1-59dd-499d-a649-9471ccd62241\', \'multiverseId\': 591883}, \'multiverseid\': 591883}, {\'name\': \'Indagine per Omicidio\', \'text\': \'Incanta creatura che controlli\\nQuando la creatura incantata muore, crea X pedine creatura Soldato 1/1 bianche, dove X è la sua forza.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'"Ogni morte porta una ragnatela di conseguenze. Il nostro lavoro è trovare il ragno."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592012&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'916a16a3-1bea-4fa9-b00c-d160fb180c8a\', \'multiverseId\': 592012}, \'multiverseid\': 592012}, {\'name\': \'殺人の捜査\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー）\\nエンチャントしているクリーチャーが死亡したとき、白の１/１の兵士・クリーチャー・トークンＸ体を生成する。Ｘはエンチャントしているクリーチャーのパワーに等しい。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': \'「どんな死でも、その影響が蜘蛛の巣のように広がる。その蜘蛛を見つけるのが我々の仕事だ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592141&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'97d10bb2-b4b9-4552-aeaa-5e6df8a0cb47\', \'multiverseId\': 592141}, \'multiverseid\': 592141}, {\'name\': \'调查谋杀\', \'text\': \'结附于由你操控的生物\\n当所结附的生物死去时，派出X个1/1白色士兵衍生生物，X为其力量。\', \'type\': \'结界 ～灵气\', \'flavor\': \'「每次死亡都像一张由后果结成的网。我们的职责就是找出结网的蜘蛛。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592528&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f25f6b3f-f54c-4218-a29c-9981c996b757\', \'multiverseId\': 592528}, \'multiverseid\': 592528}]', '[{\'name\': \'Mordvermittler\', \'text\': \'{T}: Lege eine Kopfgeldmarke auf eine Kreatur oder einen Planeswalker deiner Wahl. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit wie eine Hexerei.\\nImmer wenn einer Kreatur oder einem Planeswalker mit Kopfgeldmarke, die bzw. den ein Gegner kontrolliert, Schaden zugefügt wird, zerstöre sie bzw. ihn.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Assassine\', \'flavor\': \'„Du unterschreibst. Sie sterben. Ganz einfach."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589633&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cffe3da7-82a1-470f-a56c-377890e92101\', \'multiverseId\': 589633}, \'multiverseid\': 589633}, {\'name\': \'Terminador profesional\', \'text\': \'{T}: Pon un contador de recompensa sobre la criatura o planeswalker objetivo. Activa esto solo como un conjuro.\\nSiempre que una criatura o planeswalker que controla un oponente con un contador de recompensa sobre él reciba daño, destrúyelo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Asesino humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Tú firmas y ellos mueren. Así de fácil".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589684&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8e0f5490-cd9d-4cc8-998e-927ad20a7f17\', \'multiverseId\': 589684}, \'multiverseid\': 589684}, {\'name\': \'Facilitateur de résiliation\', \'text\': "{T} : Mettez un marqueur « prime » sur une cible, créature ou planeswalker. N\'activez que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'une créature ou qu\'un planeswalker qu\'un adversaire contrôle avec un marqueur « prime » sur lui subit des blessures, détruisez-le.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et assassin\', \'flavor\': "« Vous signez. Ils meurent. C\'est aussi simple que ça. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589735&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ef911ef6-94fd-4cf1-8557-4b4021d7e511\', \'multiverseId\': 589735}, \'multiverseid\': 589735}, {\'name\': \'Facilitatore di Eliminazioni\', \'text\': \'{T}: Metti un segnalino taglia su una creatura o un planeswalker bersaglio. Attiva solo come una stregoneria.\\nOgniqualvolta viene inflitto danno a una creatura o a un planeswalker con un segnalino taglia controllati da un avversario, distruggi quel permanente.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Assassino Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Tu firmi, loro muoiono. Niente di più semplice."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589786&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ea63ddb7-93fa-4424-99c6-c396cd61fd3f\', \'multiverseId\': 589786}, \'multiverseid\': 589786}, {\'name\': \'終了世話人\', \'text\': \'{T}：クリーチャーやプレインズウォーカーのうち１体を対象とする。それの上に賞金カウンター１個を置く。起動はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。\\nクリーチャーやプレインズウォーカーのうち対戦相手がコントロールしていて賞金カウンターが置かれている１体がダメージを受けるたび、それを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・暗殺者\', \'flavor\': \'「お前が署名をして、そいつが死ぬ。簡単だろう？」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589837&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e428a294-3a38-4535-ac65-0287bd096c18\', \'multiverseId\': 589837}, \'multiverseid\': 589837}, {\'name\': \'终命业者\', \'text\': \'{T}：在目标生物或鹏洛客上放置一个赏金指示物。只能于法术时机起动。\\n每当一个由对手操控且其上有赏金指示物的生物或鹏洛客受到伤害时，将其消灭。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／杀手\', \'flavor\': \'「你签字。他会死。就是这么简单。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589990&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bbf7f66f-9496-49ca-bfc1-8cb9d656452f\', \'multiverseId\': 589990}, \'multiverseid\': 589990}]', '[{\'name\': \'Morgenrot-Engel\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nWenn der Morgenrot-Engel ins Spiel kommt, erhältst du 4 Lebenspunkte dazu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Engel\', \'flavor\': \'„Als die Sonne über der Knochenspitze aufging, erschien ein Engel über den mit Leichen übersäten Feldern und brachte einen Schwall neuer Hoffnung."\\n—Krinnea, *Belagerung der Knochenspitze*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591576&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e067c0f6-ba37-4047-9396-95ed9a6d3e9d\', \'multiverseId\': 591576}, \'multiverseid\': 591576}, {\'name\': \'Ángel de la aurora\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nCuando el Ángel de la aurora entre al campo de batalla, ganas 4 vidas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ángel\', \'flavor\': \'"En cuanto el sol se alzó por detrás de la Aguja Ósea, un ángel apareció sobre los campos sembrados de muerte; consigo traía la luz de una nueva esperanza".\\n—Krinnea, *El asedio de la Aguja Ósea*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591705&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'af700fca-1ea5-4feb-a797-41a8fa3368bc\', \'multiverseId\': 591705}, \'multiverseid\': 591705}, {\'name\': \'Ange naissant\', \'text\': "Vol\\nQuand l\'Ange naissant arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous gagnez 4 points de vie.", \'type\': \'Créature : ange\', \'flavor\': "« Tandis que le soleil s\'élevait derrière la Tour d\'Os, un ange apparut au-dessus des charniers, porteur d\'un nouvel espoir. »\\n—Krinnea, *Siège de la Tour d\'Os*", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591834&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'901d2a3d-4be5-4340-9bc7-d43e09bf018c\', \'multiverseId\': 591834}, \'multiverseid\': 591834}, {\'name\': "Angelo dell\'Aurora", \'text\': "Volare\\nQuando l\'Angelo dell\'Aurora entra nel campo di battaglia, guadagni 4 punti vita.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Angelo\', \'flavor\': \'"Mentre sorgeva il sole dietro la Guglia d\\\'Osso, un angelo comparve sui campi dell\\\'ossario, portando un\\\'ondata di nuova speranza."\\n—Krinnea, *L\\\'Assedio della Guglia d\\\'Osso*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591963&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8c00b169-16d9-451a-9167-5a9491a99910\', \'multiverseId\': 591963}, \'multiverseid\': 591963}, {\'name\': \'夜明けの天使\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n夜明けの天使が戦場に出たとき、あなたは４点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 天使\', \'flavor\': \'「骨塔の背後から太陽が昇り、死が埋め尽くす戦場に天使が降り立つと、新たな希望のうねりをもたらした。」\\n――クリネア著「*骨塔の包囲戦*」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592092&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ede0e131-1fbf-498b-8ad2-204a8b49afbf\', \'multiverseId\': 592092}, \'multiverseid\': 592092}, {\'name\': \'拂晓天使\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n当拂晓天使进战场时，你获得4点生命。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～天使\', \'flavor\': \'「随着骨塔之后天空夜色渐散，天使偕同太阳破晓降临世间，将希望随着光芒洒向这片死气沉沉的大地。」\\n～柯琳娅，*《骨塔围攻纪》*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592479&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1837ac76-308e-455f-aa29-58a6802da614\', \'multiverseId\': 592479}, \'multiverseid\': 592479}]', '[{\'name\': \'Morkrut-Todesfee\', \'text\': \'Morbide — Wenn die Morkrut-Todesfee ins Spiel kommt und falls in diesem Zug eine Kreatur gestorben ist, erhält eine Kreatur deiner Wahl -4/-4 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Geist\', \'flavor\': \'Sie klagt um die Verstorbenen und um jene, die noch sterben werden.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597528&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'85c0f332-9945-4250-8af2-af6bb798c328\', \'multiverseId\': 597528}, \'multiverseid\': 597528}, {\'name\': \'Banshee de Morkrut\', \'text\': \'Necrario — Cuando la Banshee de Morkrut entre al campo de batalla, si una criatura murió este turno, la criatura objetivo obtiene -4/-4 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Espíritu\', \'flavor\': \'Se lamenta por los que están a las puertas de la muerte y por los que ya las atravesaron.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597553&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cfc72aa2-2cdd-490b-a026-f538957f5427\', \'multiverseId\': 597553}, \'multiverseid\': 597553}, {\'name\': \'Banshee de Morkrut\', \'text\': "Morbidité — Quand la Banshee de Morkrut arrive sur le champ de bataille, si une créature est morte ce tour-ci, une créature ciblée gagne -4/-4 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : esprit\', \'flavor\': \'Elle hurle pour ceux qui sont morts, et pour ceux qui sont sur le point de mourir.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597578&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'26c8ef18-2d75-464a-aabf-4bc865c1f56b\', \'multiverseId\': 597578}, \'multiverseid\': 597578}, {\'name\': \'Banshee di Morkrut\', \'text\': \'Morboso — Quando la Banshee di Morkrut entra nel campo di battaglia, se è morta una creatura in questo turno, una creatura bersaglio prende -4/-4 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Spirito\', \'flavor\': \'Il suo lamento è per chi ci ha lasciato e per chi sta per farlo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597603&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'91839a2e-2dda-4076-9a2c-3f391abd8dc1\', \'multiverseId\': 597603}, \'multiverseid\': 597603}, {\'name\': \'モークラットのバンシー\', \'text\': \'陰鬱 ― モークラットのバンシーが戦場に出たとき、このターンにクリーチャーが死亡していた場合、クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは－４/－４の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — スピリット\', \'flavor\': \'彼女は死したもののために慟哭し、これから死すもののために慟哭する。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597628&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4e488ef4-02ca-4b65-a621-8fe5417eb7b9\', \'multiverseId\': 597628}, \'multiverseid\': 597628}, {\'name\': \'穆坎女妖\', \'text\': \'丧心～当穆坎女妖进战场时，若本回合中有生物死去，则目标生物得-4/-4直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～精怪\', \'flavor\': \'她为已逝者痛哭，也为将死者哀嚎。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597703&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2ec8308c-bfbb-49c6-a272-1bffa1ac3102\', \'multiverseId\': 597703}, \'multiverseid\': 597703}]', '[{\'name\': \'Muxus der Goblin-Grande\', \'text\': \'Wenn Muxus der Goblin-Grande ins Spiel kommt, decke die obersten sechs Karten deiner Bibliothek auf. Bringe davon alle Goblin-Kreaturenkarten mit Manabetrag 5 oder weniger ins Spiel und lege den Rest in zufälliger Reihenfolge unter deine Bibliothek.\\nImmer wenn Muxus angreift, erhält er für jeden anderen Goblin, den du kontrollierst, +1/+1 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Goblin, Adliger\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590283&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e294eef8-364a-4319-a601-6966df0380c1\', \'multiverseId\': 590283}, \'multiverseid\': 590283}, {\'name\': \'Muxus, grande de los trasgos\', \'text\': \'Cuando Muxus, grande de los trasgos entre al campo de batalla, muestra las seis primeras cartas de tu biblioteca. Pon en el campo de batalla todas las cartas de criatura Trasgo con valor de maná de 5 o menos de entre ellas y el resto en el fondo de tu biblioteca en un orden aleatorio.\\nSiempre que Muxus ataque, obtiene +1/+1 hasta el final del turno por cada otro Trasgo que controlas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Noble trasgo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590418&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1bfcb3f9-c6a3-4dfc-be94-21918ff8210e\', \'multiverseId\': 590418}, \'multiverseid\': 590418}, {\'name\': \'Muxus, hiérarque gobelin\', \'text\': "Quand Muxus, hiérarque gobelin arrive sur le champ de bataille, révélez les six cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Mettez toutes les cartes de créature Gobelin avec une valeur de mana inférieure ou égale à 5 parmi elles sur le champ de bataille et le reste au-dessous de votre bibliothèque dans un ordre aléatoire.\\nÀ chaque fois que Muxus attaque, il gagne +1/+1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour pour chaque autre gobelin que vous contrôlez.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : gobelin et noble\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590553&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'83084923-7063-40fb-8cb6-631024017ba4\', \'multiverseId\': 590553}, \'multiverseid\': 590553}, {\'name\': \'Muxus, Aristocratico Goblin\', \'text\': \'Quando Muxus, Aristocratico Goblin entra nel campo di battaglia, rivela le prime sei carte del tuo grimorio. Metti sul campo di battaglia tutte le carte creatura Goblin con valore di mana pari o inferiore a 5 scelte tra esse e metti le altre in fondo al tuo grimorio in ordine casuale.\\nOgniqualvolta Muxus attacca, prende +1/+1 fino alla fine del turno per ogni altro Goblin che controlli.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Nobile Goblin\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590688&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f84741d3-a290-4434-a98c-4e3585b89c40\', \'multiverseId\': 590688}, \'multiverseid\': 590688}, {\'name\': \'上流階級のゴブリン、マクサス\', \'text\': \'上流階級のゴブリン、マクサスが戦場に出たとき、あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード６枚を公開する。その中から、マナ総量が５以下であるすべてのゴブリン・クリーチャー・カードを戦場に出し、残りをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に無作為の順番で置く。\\n上流階級のゴブリン、マクサスが攻撃するたび、ターン終了時まで、これはあなたがコントロールしていてこれでないゴブリン１体につき＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — ゴブリン・貴族\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590823&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a2a68ef8-f3aa-4b83-8a12-f1210c9f2166\', \'multiverseId\': 590823}, \'multiverseid\': 590823}, {\'name\': \'鬼怪要人穆克斯\', \'text\': \'当鬼怪要人穆克斯进战场时，展示你牌库顶的六张牌。将其中所有法术力值等于或小于5的鬼怪生物牌放进战场，其余则以随机顺序置于你的牌库底。\\n每当穆克斯攻击时，你每操控一个其他鬼怪，它便得+1/+1直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～鬼怪／贵族\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591228&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f2667ccf-1b6c-4f04-9ed2-cff45b7b8e56\', \'multiverseId\': 591228}, \'multiverseid\': 591228}]', '[{\'name\': \'Mystischer Flugfisch\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du deine zweite Karte innerhalb desselben Zuges ziehst, erhält der Mystische Flugfisch Flugfähigkeit bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Fisch\', \'flavor\': \'Das Problem war nicht, dass Fische Fliegen gelernt hatten. Das Problem war, dass Haie gelernt hatten, ihnen zu folgen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595252&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'409d94c2-33d5-44db-8f35-dcecc8b76301\', \'multiverseId\': 595252}, \'multiverseid\': 595252}, {\'name\': \'Pez volador místico\', \'text\': \'Siempre que robes tu segunda carta cada turno, el Pez volador místico gana la habilidad de volar hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Pez\', \'flavor\': \'El problema no fue que los peces aprendiesen a volar, sino que los tiburones se adaptaron para seguirlos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595360&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'57f705cb-5571-473a-a4cd-153a5764d4bc\', \'multiverseId\': 595360}, \'multiverseid\': 595360}, {\'name\': \'Exocet volant mystique\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que vous piochez votre deuxième carte à chaque tour, l\'Exocet volant mystique acquiert le vol jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : poisson\', \'flavor\': "Le problème n\'était pas que les poissons aient appris à voler, mais que les requins aient évolué pour les suivre.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595468&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3f25996e-2c88-455f-821b-1b9c8888a477\', \'multiverseId\': 595468}, \'multiverseid\': 595468}, {\'name\': \'Pesce Celeste Mistico\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta peschi la tua seconda carta in ogni turno, il Pesce Celeste Mistico ha volare fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Pesce\', \'flavor\': \'Il problema non era che i pesci avessero imparato a volare, ma che gli squali si fossero adattati per seguirli.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595576&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a750a3de-d35f-43b1-b72a-358ca4c94b9e\', \'multiverseId\': 595576}, \'multiverseid\': 595576}, {\'name\': \'神秘の空魚\', \'text\': \'あなたが各ターン内のあなたの２枚目のカードを引くたび、ターン終了時まで、神秘の空魚は飛行を得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 魚\', \'flavor\': \'問題はその魚が空を飛ぶ方法を覚えたことではない。サメがそれについていく方法を覚えたことだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595684&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'929dafef-e6c2-416b-8719-b6b9a3831a99\', \'multiverseId\': 595684}, \'multiverseid\': 595684}, {\'name\': \'神秘飞鱼\', \'text\': \'每当你抓每回合中你的第二张牌时，神秘飞鱼获得飞行异能直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～鱼\', \'flavor\': \'问题不是鱼学会了飞，而是鲨鱼为了追赶上也随之进化。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596008&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'23c63bf5-b4f5-4036-8f7b-fed5501cfde7\', \'multiverseId\': 596008}, \'multiverseid\': 596008}]', '[{\'name\': \'Nachbeben\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre ein Artefakt, eine Kreatur oder ein Land deiner Wahl. Das Nachbeben fügt dir 3 Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Über den Besitz des Hauses durch ein Zaubererduell zu entscheiden, hatte sich damals wie eine brillante Idee angehört.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597536&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2799c959-c64f-48c3-b765-b65cd7895e6a\', \'multiverseId\': 597536}, \'multiverseid\': 597536}, {\'name\': \'Conmoción posterior\', \'text\': \'Destruye el artefacto, criatura o tierra objetivo. La Conmoción posterior te hace 3 puntos de daño.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Decidir quién se quedaba con la casa mediante un duelo de magia pareció una idea brillante en su momento.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597561&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6e297bce-c081-40fe-a3cf-cd4f7f96fb7c\', \'multiverseId\': 597561}, \'multiverseid\': 597561}, {\'name\': \'Réplique sismique\', \'text\': \'Détruisez une cible, artefact, créature ou terrain. La Réplique sismique vous inflige 3 blessures.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'Décider qui possèderait la maison par un duel de sorciers avait semblé être une bonne idée sur le moment.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597586&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f9bb785b-de87-4039-88e5-8c2754553e5a\', \'multiverseId\': 597586}, \'multiverseid\': 597586}, {\'name\': \'Contraccolpo\', \'text\': \'Distruggi un artefatto, una creatura o una terra bersaglio. Il Contraccolpo ti infligge 3 danni.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': "Decidere a chi appartenesse la casa con un duello di magia era sembrata un\'ottima idea, sul momento.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597611&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1774feac-b269-4cb0-9f8f-56cfb81693c6\', \'multiverseId\': 597611}, \'multiverseid\': 597611}, {\'name\': \'余震\', \'text\': \'アーティファクトやクリーチャーや土地のうち１つを対象とする。それを破壊する。余震はあなたに３点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'家の所有権を魔術師同士の決闘で決めることを、当初は名案だと思っていた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597636&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c83e932b-3b8b-48fd-a191-91be41685a60\', \'multiverseId\': 597636}, \'multiverseid\': 597636}, {\'name\': \'余震\', \'text\': \'消灭目标神器，生物或地。余震对你造成3点伤害。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'通过魔法决斗来决定房子的归属，当时听来是个好主意。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597711&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'492a60f3-7d57-4464-95ac-6e14788e8051\', \'multiverseId\': 597711}, \'multiverseid\': 597711}]', '[{\'name\': \'Nachtrudel-Lauerer\', \'text\': \'Aufblitzen\\nAndere Wölfe und Werwölfe, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +1/+1.\\nZu Beginn deines Endsegments und falls du in diesem Zug keinen Zauberspruch gewirkt hast, erzeuge einen 2/2 grünen Wolf-Kreaturenspielstein.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Wolf\', \'flavor\': \'Ein starker Alphawolf führt ein wachsendes Rudel.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592895&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8770838a-8cce-4fc2-b5e8-51b0acd454eb\', \'multiverseId\': 592895}, \'multiverseid\': 592895}, {\'name\': \'Emboscador de manada nocturna\', \'text\': \'Destello.\\nLos otros Lobos y Licántropos que controlas obtienen +1/+1.\\nAl comienzo de tu paso final, si no lanzaste un hechizo este turno, crea una ficha de criatura Lobo verde 2/2.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Lobo\', \'flavor\': \'Un líder fuerte es sinónimo de una manada en crecimiento.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593016&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9fd284e8-b64f-480d-9f0a-e5b67dded756\', \'multiverseId\': 593016}, \'multiverseid\': 593016}, {\'name\': \'Embusqueur de la meute nocturne\', \'text\': "Flash\\nLes autres loups et loups-garous que vous contrôlez gagnent +1/+1.\\nAu début de votre étape de fin, si vous n\'avez pas lancé de sort ce tour-ci, créez un jeton de créature 2/2 verte Loup.", \'type\': \'Créature : loup\', \'flavor\': \'À chef puissant, meute croissante.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593137&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'54100d75-2006-4575-b562-763909d7a0ef\', \'multiverseId\': 593137}, \'multiverseid\': 593137}, {\'name\': \'Assalitore del Branco Notturno\', \'text\': "Lampo\\nGli altri Lupi e Mannari che controlli prendono +1/+1.\\nAll\'inizio della tua sottofase finale, se non hai lanciato una magia in questo turno, crea una pedina creatura Lupo 2/2 verde.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Lupo\', \'flavor\': \'Un capo forte garantisce la crescita del branco.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593258&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'50413f55-2d38-44c8-9edc-1257f55df7cd\', \'multiverseId\': 593258}, \'multiverseid\': 593258}, {\'name\': \'夜群れの伏兵\', \'text\': \'瞬速\\nあなたがコントロールしていてこれでないすべての狼や狼男は＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\\nあなたの終了ステップの開始時に、このターンにあなたが呪文を唱えていなかった場合、緑の２/２の狼・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 狼\', \'flavor\': \'強いリーダーがいると群れは大きくなる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593379&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d8960c79-0c93-4ffa-a31e-ef70286c4c66\', \'multiverseId\': 593379}, \'multiverseid\': 593379}, {\'name\': \'夜群袭狼\', \'text\': \'闪现\\n由你操控的其他狼和狼人得+1/+1。\\n在你的结束步骤开始时，若本回合中你未施放过咒语，则派出一个2/2绿色的狼衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～狼\', \'flavor\': \'头狼凶狠，意味狼群得以壮大。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593742&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'106d7a81-9b54-4815-a035-8dc10472ec2e\', \'multiverseId\': 593742}, \'multiverseid\': 593742}]', '[{\'name\': \'Naga-Vitalistin\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge ein Mana eines beliebigen Typs, das ein Land, das du kontrollierst, produzieren könnte.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Naga, Druide\', \'flavor\': \'„Die Erde selbst ist mit der Essenz des Gott-Pharaos durchzogen."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592892&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'35045e49-8acc-4ef0-a49b-f2e0ac368e36\', \'multiverseId\': 592892}, \'multiverseid\': 592892}, {\'name\': \'Vitalista naga\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega un maná de cualquier tipo que pueda producir una tierra que controlas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Druida naga\', \'flavor\': \'"Las tierras del Dios Faraón están bañadas por su aliento".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593013&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'da1baa3e-032e-4bc1-b42e-2dcefac6d28b\', \'multiverseId\': 593013}, \'multiverseid\': 593013}, {\'name\': \'Vitaliste naga\', \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez un mana de n\'importe quel type qu\'un terrain que vous contrôlez pourrait produire.", \'type\': \'Créature : naga et druide\', \'flavor\': \'« Les terres du Dieu-Pharaon sont empreintes de son souffle. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593134&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'56bef6a2-dc7e-4b51-89e2-c2e2ff934054\', \'multiverseId\': 593134}, \'multiverseid\': 593134}, {\'name\': \'Naga Vitalista\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi tipo che una terra che controlli potrebbe produrre.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Druido Naga\', \'flavor\': \'"Le terre del Dio Faraone sono pervase dal suo respiro."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593255&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'35f78d33-80bc-49cf-83fa-c76ef29a5d2a\', \'multiverseId\': 593255}, \'multiverseid\': 593255}, {\'name\': \'ナーガの生気論者\', \'text\': \'{T}：あなたがコントロールしている土地が生み出すことのできるマナのタイプのうち望むタイプのマナ１点を加える。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ナーガ・ドルイド\', \'flavor\': \'「王神の土地は王神の生気で満ちている。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593376&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9901ebf4-7332-4cb4-89b5-25eaf8d0f371\', \'multiverseId\': 593376}, \'multiverseid\': 593376}, {\'name\': \'活力那伽\', \'text\': \'{T}：加一点法术力，其类别为由你操控的地能产生之任一类别。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～那伽／德鲁伊\', \'flavor\': \'「法老神的土地上也弥漫着法老神的吐息。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593739&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d195285a-c45f-486e-ade8-af8ca6879fdc\', \'multiverseId\': 593739}, \'multiverseid\': 593739}]', '[{\'name\': \'Nantuko-Landwirt\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Nantuko-Landwirt ins Spiel kommt, kannst du eine beliebige Anzahl an Länderkarten abwerfen. Lege entsprechend viele +1/+1-Marken auf den Nantuko-Landwirt und ziehe entsprechend viele Karten.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Insekt, Druide\', \'flavor\': \'„Jeder Samen beweist Stärke und lehrt Geduld."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592893&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ef41c983-0b0d-4a23-8965-d5ef588491cd\', \'multiverseId\': 592893}, \'multiverseid\': 592893}, {\'name\': \'Cultivador nantuko\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Cultivador nantuko entre al campo de batalla, puedes descartar cualquier cantidad de cartas de tierra. Pon esa misma cantidad de contadores +1/+1 sobre el Cultivador nantuko y roba esa misma cantidad de cartas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Druida insecto\', \'flavor\': \'"Todas las semillas albergan fuerza y enseñan paciencia".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593014&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e92cb2a4-5bb5-426c-8552-4959a2196da8\', \'multiverseId\': 593014}, \'multiverseid\': 593014}, {\'name\': \'Cultivateur Nantuko\', \'text\': "Quand le Cultivateur Nantuko arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez vous défausser de n\'importe quel nombre de cartes de terrain. Mettez autant de marqueurs +1/+1 sur le Cultivateur Nantuko et piochez autant de cartes.", \'type\': \'Créature : insecte et druide\', \'flavor\': \'« Chaque graine renferme de la force et enseigne la patience. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593135&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c8cb14ba-f14c-432b-ad3c-47db8810a961\', \'multiverseId\': 593135}, \'multiverseid\': 593135}, {\'name\': \'Cultore Nantuko\', \'text\': \'Quando il Cultore Nantuko entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi scartare un qualsiasi numero di carte terra. Metti altrettanti segnalini +1/+1 sul Cultore Nantuko e pesca altrettante carte.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Druido Insetto\', \'flavor\': \'"Ogni seme racchiude forza e insegna pazienza."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593256&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'53677bc8-4a5b-43be-bb69-f152a0f7e82c\', \'multiverseId\': 593256}, \'multiverseid\': 593256}, {\'name\': \'ナントゥーコの養成者\', \'text\': \'ナントゥーコの養成者が戦場に出たとき、あなたは望む枚数の土地・カードを捨ててもよい。ナントゥーコの養成者の上にそれに等しい個数の＋１/＋１カウンターを置き、それに等しい枚数のカードを引く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 昆虫・ドルイド\', \'flavor\': \'「どの種子にも強さがあり、我慢の大切さを教えてくれる。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593377&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'81287f3b-18c1-4267-8bfd-b0489fcf38a4\', \'multiverseId\': 593377}, \'multiverseid\': 593377}, {\'name\': \'耕耘螳人\', \'text\': \'当耕耘螳人进战场时，你可以弃任意数量的地牌。在耕耘螳人上放置等量的+1/+1指示物且抓等量的牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～昆虫／德鲁伊\', \'flavor\': \'「每颗种子都蕴含力量，教导耐心。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593740&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cdbcc8d6-c23a-4f23-b3ee-fa8e63f49f7c\', \'multiverseId\': 593740}, \'multiverseid\': 593740}]', '[{\'name\': \'Nekrotische Wunde\', \'text\': \'Totenwelt — Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält bis zum Ende des Zuges -X/-X, wobei X gleich der Anzahl an Kreaturenkarten in deinem Friedhof ist. Falls die Kreatur in diesem Zug sterben würde, schicke sie stattdessen ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Die Assassinen der Ochran destillieren Toxine aus den Überresten ihrer vorherigen Opfer.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594104&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1cac5782-7897-4b3b-9b53-10de39c7c0c5\', \'multiverseId\': 594104}, \'multiverseid\': 594104}, {\'name\': \'Herida necrótica\', \'text\': \'Despojos — La criatura objetivo obtiene -X/-X hasta el final del turno, donde X es la cantidad de cartas de criatura en tu cementerio. Si esa criatura fuese a morir este turno, en vez de eso, exíliala.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Los asesinos de los Ochran destilan toxinas que vienen de los restos de sus víctimas anteriores.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594221&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'84bfad4d-8563-4509-bf46-e247e0dc3243\', \'multiverseId\': 594221}, \'multiverseid\': 594221}, {\'name\': \'Blessure nécrotique\', \'text\': "Maquis — Une créature ciblée gagne -X/-X jusqu\'à la fin du tour, X étant le nombre de cartes de créature dans votre cimetière. Si cette créature devait mourir ce tour-ci, exilez-la à la place.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'Les assassins Ochran distillent des toxines dans les corps de leurs précédentes victimes.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594338&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9642469a-29c2-408b-82a9-809fb4531b12\', \'multiverseId\': 594338}, \'multiverseid\': 594338}, {\'name\': \'Ferita Necrotica\', \'text\': \'Crescita sotterranea — Una creatura bersaglio prende -X/-X fino alla fine del turno, dove X è il numero di carte creatura nel tuo cimitero. Se quella creatura sta per morire in questo turno, invece esiliala.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': "Gli assassini dell\'Ochran distillano tossine dai resti delle loro vittime precedenti.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594455&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'534b2e52-904d-4338-b626-aed965c04678\', \'multiverseId\': 594455}, \'multiverseid\': 594455}, {\'name\': \'壊死性の傷\', \'text\': \'宿根 ― クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは－Ｘ/－Ｘの修整を受ける。Ｘはあなたの墓地にあるクリーチャー・カードの枚数に等しい。このターン、そのクリーチャーが死亡するなら、代わりにそれを追放する。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'オクランの暗殺者は、前の犠牲者の死骸から毒物を精製する。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594572&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'54eb395a-a952-44ff-b768-f1d899839483\', \'multiverseId\': 594572}, \'multiverseid\': 594572}, {\'name\': \'溃疽伤\', \'text\': \'朽力～目标生物得-X/-X直到回合结束，X为你坟墓场中的生物牌数量。如果本回合中该生物将死去，则改为将它放逐。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'瓯坎的杀手会从他们之前的杀害对象身上提炼毒素。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594923&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'055b8bcf-59a0-4a67-bc85-9dacc146033c\', \'multiverseId\': 594923}, \'multiverseid\': 594923}]', '[{\'name\': \'Nessischer Atlaskäfer\', \'text\': \'Zu Beginn des Kampfes in deinem Zug und falls du eine andere Kreatur mit Stärke 4 oder mehr kontrollierst, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf den Nessischen Atlaskäfer.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Insekt\', \'flavor\': \'„Die erste Regel der Politik kann man von einem kleinen Atlaskäfer lernen: Es ist klug, mächtige Freunde zu haben."\\n—Pythamon, Weiser von Meletis\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592894&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ddecd127-1918-4d43-8de1-715224702c9f\', \'multiverseId\': 592894}, \'multiverseid\': 592894}, {\'name\': \'Corniescarabajo nessiano\', \'text\': \'Al comienzo del combate en tu turno, si controlas otra criatura con fuerza de 4 o más, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre el Corniescarabajo nessiano.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Insecto\', \'flavor\': \'"La primera regla de la política se puede aprender de un humilde escarabajo: es inteligente contar con amigos poderosos".\\n—Pythamón, sabio de Meletis\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593015&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6e1cc40a-90eb-4e35-a9e8-c7efe68c7625\', \'multiverseId\': 593015}, \'multiverseid\': 593015}, {\'name\': \'Scaracorne nessian\', \'text\': \'Au début du combat pendant votre tour, si vous contrôlez une autre créature de force supérieure ou égale à 4, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur le Scaracorne nessian.\', \'type\': \'Créature : insecte\', \'flavor\': \'« On peut apprendre la première règle en politique en observant un modeste scaracorne : il est avisé de se faire de puissants amis. »\\n—Pythamon, sage de Mélétis\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593136&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f52fbb7a-0e0f-4fc6-b22d-a0c1d8d48467\', \'multiverseId\': 593136}, \'multiverseid\': 593136}, {\'name\': \'Cornoleottero Nessian\', \'text\': "All\'inizio del combattimento nel tuo turno, se controlli un\'altra creatura con forza pari o superiore a 4, metti un segnalino +1/+1 sul Cornoleottero Nessian.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Insetto\', \'flavor\': \'"La prima regola della politica si può apprendere anche da un semplice cornoleottero: è saggio coltivare amicizie potenti."\\n—Pytamon, saggio di Meletis\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593257&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'efeb30be-a07b-433f-a108-34221c3864bc\', \'multiverseId\': 593257}, \'multiverseid\': 593257}, {\'name\': \'ネシアンの角甲虫\', \'text\': \'あなたのターンの戦闘の開始時に、あなたがパワーが４以上でありこれでないクリーチャーをコントロールしている場合、ネシアンの角甲虫の上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 昆虫\', \'flavor\': \'「政治の第一の方策は角甲虫が教えてくれる。力のある友人と親しくしておくのが得策ということだ。」\\n――メレティスの賢者、ピタモン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593378&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'24bf8db7-43ed-4c04-9f43-d06aa09fb43f\', \'multiverseId\': 593378}, \'multiverseid\': 593378}, {\'name\': \'奈西安角虫\', \'text\': \'在你回合的战斗开始时，若你操控另一个力量等于或大于4的生物，则在奈西安角虫上放置一个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～昆虫\', \'flavor\': \'「我们可以从弱小的角虫处领悟到政治学的首要准则：培养一位强力的同伴。」\\n～迈勒提斯智者皮塔摩恩\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593741&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'57dd56dd-1a13-450e-a42e-8407b958f59e\', \'multiverseId\': 593741}, \'multiverseid\': 593741}]', '[{\'name\': \'Nesträuber\', \'text\': \'Eile\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Dinosaurier\', \'flavor\': \'„Diese Eindringlinge an unseren Küsten sind wie Dinosaurier, die Eier aus Nestern rauben. Sie leben vom Tagewerk anderer."\\n—Itzama Knochenhaupt\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590284&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dd06d88e-6544-419b-871c-3d62440e5806\', \'multiverseId\': 590284}, \'multiverseid\': 590284}, {\'name\': \'Ladrón de nidos\', \'text\': \'Prisa.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Dinosaurio\', \'flavor\': \'"Estos marineros en nuestras costas son como los dinosaurios que roban huevos de otros nidos. Viven gracias a los frutos de otros".\\n—Itzama, la Crestada\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590419&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cfb6bbf9-f08b-4e26-a529-81ffa9d1f24a\', \'multiverseId\': 590419}, \'multiverseid\': 590419}, {\'name\': \'Voleur de nid\', \'text\': \'Célérité\', \'type\': \'Créature : dinosaure\', \'flavor\': \'« Ces marins agissent sur nos rivages comme les dinosaures qui volent des œufs dans des nids. Ils vivent au détriment des autres. »\\n—Itzama la crêtée\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590554&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8794f332-0a29-42f6-a5bd-cfcbbe1c2572\', \'multiverseId\': 590554}, \'multiverseid\': 590554}, {\'name\': \'Ladro dei Nidi\', \'text\': \'Rapidità\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Dinosauro\', \'flavor\': \'"Questi naviganti sulle nostre coste sono come i dinosauri che rubano le uova dai nidi: vivono delle fatiche altrui."\\n—Itzama dalla Cresta\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590689&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'be2f52f4-422a-4290-bb16-d624076f35e0\', \'multiverseId\': 590689}, \'multiverseid\': 590689}, {\'name\': \'巣荒らし\', \'text\': \'速攻\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 恐竜\', \'flavor\': \'「あの岸にいる水夫どもは巣から卵を盗む恐竜と同じだ。他者を搾取して生きているのだ。」\\n――冠羽のイザマ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590824&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'46478f4f-9c23-4ab8-935b-ecb1ad848374\', \'multiverseId\': 590824}, \'multiverseid\': 590824}, {\'name\': \'劫巢恐龙\', \'text\': \'敏捷\', \'type\': \'生物 ～恐龙\', \'flavor\': \'「岸上这些水手跟从巢穴中偷蛋的恐龙没有什么分别。都是靠他人的劳动成果为生。」\\n～冠盔伊札玛\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591229&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'92352aba-e5fb-43f0-9f0c-73fe9458577d\', \'multiverseId\': 591229}, \'multiverseid\': 591229}]', '[{\'name\': \'Neuer Anspruch Phyrexias\', \'text\': \'{1}{B}, bezahle 2 Lebenspunkte: Bringe eine Kreaturenkarte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurück.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„Dein Opfer wurde zur Kenntnis genommen und für unzureichend befunden."\\n—Qal-Sha, Priester von Norn\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597531&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4e29d8ec-036a-4ce8-9180-4d31e1b55392\', \'multiverseId\': 597531}, \'multiverseid\': 597531}, {\'name\': \'Recuperación pirexiana\', \'text\': \'{1}{B}, pagar 2 vidas: Regresa la carta de criatura objetivo de tu cementerio a tu mano.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'"Tu sacrificio se registró y se consideró insuficiente".\\n—Qal-Sha, sacerdote de Norn\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597556&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cd5154ae-1740-4146-a270-b2a053cce449\', \'multiverseId\': 597556}, \'multiverseid\': 597556}, {\'name\': \'Défrichement phyrexian\', \'text\': \'{1}{B}, payez 2 points de vie : Renvoyez une carte de créature ciblée depuis votre cimetière dans votre main.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': \'« Ton sacrifice a été noté et a été jugé insuffisant. »\\n—Qal-Sha, prêtre de Norn\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597581&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3873d757-8877-4d35-b858-a8912a333762\', \'multiverseId\': 597581}, \'multiverseid\': 597581}, {\'name\': \'Rivendicazione di Phyrexia\', \'text\': \'{1}{B}, Paga 2 punti vita: Riprendi in mano una carta creatura bersaglio dal tuo cimitero.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'"Il tuo sacrificio è stato riconosciuto e valutato come insufficiente."\\n—Qal-Sha, sacerdote di Norn\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597606&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ee2fd2e6-bf7c-4b42-ba68-5f5dfb6fe117\', \'multiverseId\': 597606}, \'multiverseid\': 597606}, {\'name\': \'ファイレクシア流再利用\', \'text\': \'{1}{B}, ２点のライフを支払う：あなたの墓地にあるクリーチャー・カード１枚を対象とする。それをあなたの手札に戻す。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'「其方の生け贄を審査した結果、不十分と判断された。」\\n――ノーンの僧侶、カル＝シャ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597631&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a3e4aff7-8432-4388-884a-4cefc398b13b\', \'multiverseId\': 597631}, \'multiverseid\': 597631}, {\'name\': \'非瑞克西亚的矫治\', \'text\': \'{1}{B}，支付2点生命：将目标生物牌从你的坟墓场移回你手上。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'「我们会铭记你的牺牲，但仍稍显不足。」\\n～艾蕾侬僧侣刻沙\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597706&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9f8decf3-33db-4235-b425-918bd57ef535\', \'multiverseId\': 597706}, \'multiverseid\': 597706}]', "[{'name': 'Neutralisieren', 'text': 'Neutralisiere einen Zauberspruch deiner Wahl.\\nUmwandlung {2} ({2}, wirf diese Karte ab: Ziehe eine Karte.)', 'type': 'Spontanzauber', 'flavor': 'Auf Ikoria kann reaktive Magie den Unterschied zwischen kaum angekratzt und richtig tot machen.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595253&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5e01a9a1-7110-4d3f-9079-a5a3aa894a53', 'multiverseId': 595253}, 'multiverseid': 595253}, {'name': 'Neutralizar', 'text': 'Contrarresta el hechizo objetivo.\\nCiclo {2}. ({2}, descartar esta carta: Roba una carta.)', 'type': 'Instantáneo', 'flavor': 'En Ikoria, la magia reactiva puede marcar la diferencia entre un pequeño rasguño y una muerte segura.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595361&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ba5cdc2f-d6ae-4d7d-b839-4cd4d9c25711', 'multiverseId': 595361}, 'multiverseid': 595361}, {'name': 'Neutralisation', 'text': 'Contrecarrez un sort ciblé.\\nRecyclage {2} ({2}, défaussez-vous de cette carte : Piochez une carte.)', 'type': 'Éphémère', 'flavor': 'Sur Ikoria, la magie réactive peut faire toute la différence entre une égratignure et une blessure très mortelle.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595469&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '414e8d3a-5ff2-454a-a314-4eafad02df56', 'multiverseId': 595469}, 'multiverseid': 595469}, {'name': 'Neutralizzare', 'text': 'Neutralizza una magia bersaglio.\\nCiclo {2} ({2}, Scarta questa carta: Pesca una carta.)', 'type': 'Istantaneo', 'flavor': 'Su Ikoria, la magia reattiva può fare la differenza tra appena sfiorato e morto stecchito.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595577&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '673c7419-2ab3-4ae1-94d4-2f61cda5ada8', 'multiverseId': 595577}, 'multiverseid': 595577}, {'name': '中和', 'text': '呪文１つを対象とする。それを打ち消す。\\nサイクリング{2}（{2}, このカードを捨てる：カード１枚を引く。）', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': 'イコリアでは、瞬発的な魔法がかすり傷と死の分かれ目になる。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595685&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cd420456-3ea2-43e2-bd88-7efe8cfc2df4', 'multiverseId': 595685}, 'multiverseid': 595685}, {'name': '解除威胁', 'text': '反击目标咒语。\\n循环{2}（{2}，弃掉此牌：抓一张牌。）', 'type': '瞬间', 'flavor': '以魔法快速回应状况的效率，在依克黎结果会是轻微擦伤或一命呜呼的区别。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596009&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'eb5ff735-b5f1-4bb2-b121-7b4c4f21e50f', 'multiverseId': 596009}, 'multiverseid': 596009}]", '[{\'name\': \'Nezumi-Knochenleser\', \'text\': \'{B}, opfere eine Kreatur: Ein Spieler deiner Wahl wirft eine Karte ab. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit wie eine Hexerei.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Ratte, Schamane\', \'flavor\': \'„Die alten Methoden funktionieren immer noch, aber ein wenig technische Unterstützung schadet nie."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597529&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'de28c765-9580-4400-a731-59ab595065b3\', \'multiverseId\': 597529}, \'multiverseid\': 597529}, {\'name\': \'Leehuesos nezumi\', \'text\': \'{B}, sacrificar una criatura: El jugador objetivo descarta una carta. Activa esto solo como un conjuro.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Chamán rata\', \'flavor\': \'"Las técnicas antiguas todavía funcionan, pero las mejoras tecnológicas nunca están de más".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597554&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4f38e3d3-61fd-47f0-908b-2bbfb0251272\', \'multiverseId\': 597554}, \'multiverseid\': 597554}, {\'name\': \'Déchiffre-os nezumi\', \'text\': "{B}, sacrifiez une créature : Un joueur ciblé se défausse d\'une carte. N\'activez que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.", \'type\': \'Créature : rat et shamane\', \'flavor\': \'« Les anciennes méthodes fonctionnent toujours, mais un petit soutien technique ne fait de mal à personne. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597579&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7f5cd4ba-5822-4b6b-9206-28ed19c10e67\', \'multiverseId\': 597579}, \'multiverseid\': 597579}, {\'name\': \'Nezumi Scruta-Ossa\', \'text\': \'{B}, Sacrifica una creatura: Un giocatore bersaglio scarta una carta. Attiva solo come una stregoneria.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Sciamano Ratto\', \'flavor\': \'"Le antiche usanze funzionano ancora, ma un po\\\' di assistenza tecnologica non guasta mai."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597604&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9fc42aa3-0d89-4b00-a06d-cc17aca51a96\', \'multiverseId\': 597604}, \'multiverseid\': 597604}, {\'name\': \'鼠の骨読み\', \'text\': \'{B}, クリーチャー１体を生け贄に捧げる：プレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーはカード１枚を捨てる。起動はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ネズミ・シャーマン\', \'flavor\': \'「伝統的なやり方も通用するが、新しい技術を多少使っても支障はない。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597629&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'37044b25-a1f5-4167-a3c5-599829d3463e\', \'multiverseId\': 597629}, \'multiverseid\': 597629}, {\'name\': \'骨经鼠人\', \'text\': \'{B}，牺牲一个生物：目标牌手弃一张牌。只能于法术时机起动。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～老鼠／祭师\', \'flavor\': \'「老方法还管用，但一些技术支援也无伤大雅。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597704&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bf42017d-f010-48d6-ad34-070bec4d80f6\', \'multiverseId\': 597704}, \'multiverseid\': 597704}]', '[{\'name\': \'Niederreiten\', \'text\': \'Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +2/+2 und verursachen Trampelschaden bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Vorwärts! Und noch viel weiter!"\\n—Khemses, Streitwagenlenkerin\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592900&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ef830d67-2a1b-4566-8d5b-40d66af6ee37\', \'multiverseId\': 592900}, \'multiverseid\': 592900}, {\'name\': \'En pos de la victoria\', \'text\': \'Las criaturas que controlas obtienen +2/+2 y ganan la habilidad de arrollar hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"¡Adelante! ¡Hasta que el horizonte sea nuestro!".\\n—Khemses, auriga\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593021&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'19a7f4fc-5c2a-4a80-a3ac-de3161dcb89d\', \'multiverseId\': 593021}, \'multiverseid\': 593021}, {\'name\': \'Triompher\', \'text\': "Les créatures que vous contrôlez gagnent +2/+2 et acquièrent le piétinement jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« En avant ! Jusqu\'à ce que l\'horizon nous appartienne ! »\\n—Khemses, aurige", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593142&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'18380369-0a9c-4927-a0ff-e2520d741402\', \'multiverseId\': 593142}, \'multiverseid\': 593142}, {\'name\': \'Trionfare\', \'text\': \'Le creature che controlli prendono +2/+2 e hanno travolgere fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Avanti! Finché l\\\'orizzonte non sarà nostro!"\\n—Khemses, auriga\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593263&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5944320f-6099-4a50-b45c-373728a4b205\', \'multiverseId\': 593263}, \'multiverseid\': 593263}, {\'name\': \'超克\', \'text\': \'ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールしているすべてのクリーチャーは＋２/＋２の修整を受けトランプルを得る。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「進め！地平の果てまでも我らのものとするのだ！」\\n――戦車乗り、ケムセス\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593384&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'68ee2c20-8e04-404d-b056-bc462538f29c\', \'multiverseId\': 593384}, \'multiverseid\': 593384}, {\'name\': \'压袭\', \'text\': \'直到回合结束，由你操控的生物得+2/+2且获得践踏异能。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「前进！拿下地平线！」\\n～御夫凯齐兹\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593747&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b293d712-9ee5-4626-8687-c515d7f7a7a3\', \'multiverseId\': 593747}, \'multiverseid\': 593747}]', '[{\'name\': \'Nutze den Sturm\', \'text\': \'Erzeuge einen roten Elementarwesen-Kreaturenspielstein, der Trampelschaden verursacht, mit „Stärke und Widerstandskraft dieser Kreatur sind gleich der Anzahl an Spontanzauber- und Hexereikarten in deinem Friedhof plus der Anzahl an Karten mit Rückblende, die du besitzt und die sich im Exil befinden."\\nRückblende {6}{R} (Du kannst diese Karte aus deinem Friedhof für ihre Rückblendekosten wirken. Schicke sie danach ins Exil.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590306&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f817b068-38b9-49d3-a2bd-5dfea15ae633\', \'multiverseId\': 590306}, \'multiverseid\': 590306}, {\'name\': \'Hacerse con la tormenta\', \'text\': \'Crea una ficha de criatura Elemental roja con la habilidad de arrollar y "Tanto la fuerza como la resistencia de esta criatura son iguales a la cantidad de cartas de instantáneo y de conjuro en tu cementerio más la cantidad de cartas con la habilidad de retrospectiva de las cuales eres propietario en el exilio".\\nRetrospectiva {6}{R}. (Puedes lanzar esta carta desde tu cementerio pagando su coste de retrospectiva. Luego exíliala.)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590441&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'93910c07-cf2f-43c3-9fd5-807513407f0c\', \'multiverseId\': 590441}, \'multiverseid\': 590441}, {\'name\': "S\'emparer de la tempête", \'text\': "Créez un jeton de créature rouge Élémental avec le piétinement et « La force et l\'endurance de cette créature sont chacune égales au nombre de cartes d\'éphémère et de rituel dans votre cimetière plus le nombre de cartes avec le flashback que vous possédez en exil. »\\nFlashback {6}{R} (Vous pouvez lancer cette carte depuis votre cimetière pour son coût de flashback. Exilez-la ensuite.)", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590576&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eeeee21e-5102-4259-9c34-76268bf9db67\', \'multiverseId\': 590576}, \'multiverseid\': 590576}, {\'name\': \'Catturare la Tempesta\', \'text\': \'Crea una pedina creatura Elementale rossa con travolgere e "La forza e la costituzione di questa creatura sono pari al numero di carte istantaneo e stregoneria nel tuo cimitero più il numero di carte con flashback che possiedi in esilio".\\nFlashback {6}{R} (Puoi lanciare questa carta dal tuo cimitero pagando il suo costo di flashback. Poi esiliala.)\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590711&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0e891d12-e1fb-4161-ac04-0f9c0782e312\', \'multiverseId\': 590711}, \'multiverseid\': 590711}, {\'name\': \'嵐の捕縛\', \'text\': \'トランプルと「このクリーチャーのパワーとタフネスはそれぞれ、あなたの墓地にありインスタントやソーサリーであるカードの枚数と追放領域にありあなたがオーナーでありフラッシュバックを持つカードの枚数を足した値に等しい。」を持つ赤のエレメンタル・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\\nフラッシュバック{6}{R}（あなたはあなたの墓地から、このカードをフラッシュバック・コストで唱えてもよい。その後、これを追放する。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590846&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c6bc76b7-50cd-428a-b4e2-70cc685d45eb\', \'multiverseId\': 590846}, \'multiverseid\': 590846}, {\'name\': \'掌握风暴\', \'text\': \'派出一个红色元素衍生生物，且具有践踏与「此生物的力量和防御力各等同于你坟墓场中瞬间与法术牌数量和放逐区中由你拥有且具返照异能的牌数量之总和。」\\n返照{6}{R}（你可以从你坟墓场中施放此牌，并支付其返照费用，然后将它放逐。）\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591251&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2adcd26e-d713-4607-9b04-403e62279c43\', \'multiverseId\': 591251}, \'multiverseid\': 591251}]', '[{\'name\': \'Oashra-Ackerbäuerin\', \'text\': \'{2}{G}, {T}, opfere die Oashra-Ackerbäuerin: Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Standardland-Karte, bringe sie getappt ins Spiel und mische danach.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Druide\', \'flavor\': \'„Wie das Obst im Garten, so werden auch wir aufgelesen werden, wenn die Zeit reif ist."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592896&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b777f0c5-5d49-4290-a9d9-9bc17788639a\', \'multiverseId\': 592896}, \'multiverseid\': 592896}, {\'name\': \'Cultivadora de Oashra\', \'text\': \'{2}{G}, {T}, sacrificar la Cultivadora de Oashra: Busca en tu biblioteca una carta de tierra básica, ponla en el campo de batalla girada y luego baraja.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Druida humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Como los frutos del campo, a nosotros también se nos cosechará llegado el momento".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593017&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5b050fa5-4e8e-4bf3-b6e4-7e2ea38cf2d5\', \'multiverseId\': 593017}, \'multiverseid\': 593017}, {\'name\': "Cultivatrice d\'Oashra", \'text\': "{2}{G}, {T}, sacrifiez la Cultivatrice d\'Oashra : Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte de terrain de base, mettez-la sur le champ de bataille engagée, puis mélangez.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et druide\', \'flavor\': "« Nous serons récoltés quand la saison sera venue, comme les fruits d\'un champ. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593138&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'39691ee7-74e4-4221-b35d-5cd76c7748bb\', \'multiverseId\': 593138}, \'multiverseid\': 593138}, {\'name\': \'Coltivatrice di Oashra\', \'text\': \'{2}{G}, {T}, Sacrifica la Coltivatrice di Oashra: Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta terra base, mettila sul campo di battaglia TAPpata, poi rimescola.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Druido Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Come frutti maturi, verremo colti quando la stagione sarà propizia."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593259&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'69a39d3e-1c8c-4a00-bc0a-8688d39ff5e0\', \'multiverseId\': 593259}, \'multiverseid\': 593259}, {\'name\': \'オアシュラの耕作者\', \'text\': \'{2}{G},{T},オアシュラの耕作者を生け贄に捧げる：あなたのライブラリーから基本土地・カード１枚を探し、タップ状態で戦場に出す。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・ドルイド\', \'flavor\': \'「時期が来れば私たちも果実のように収穫されるのよ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593380&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'41806b2e-9131-4ae8-8200-5e29b6eb7272\', \'multiverseId\': 593380}, \'multiverseid\': 593380}, {\'name\': \'欧夏拉耕者\', \'text\': \'{2}{G}，{T}，牺牲欧夏拉耕者：从你牌库中搜寻一张基本地牌，将之横置放进战场，然后洗牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／德鲁伊\', \'flavor\': \'「我们跟田地里的水果一样，到了收获季节就会被采摘。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593743&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7ce49de8-cd55-4efb-a28b-016c9b8412e1\', \'multiverseId\': 593743}, \'multiverseid\': 593743}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ob Nixilis der Hasserfüllte\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn ein Gegner eine Karte zieht, fügt Ob Nixilis der Hasserfüllte jenem Spieler 1 Schadenspunkt zu.\\n−2: Zerstöre eine Kreatur deiner Wahl. Ihr Beherrscher zieht zwei Karten.\', \'type\': \'Legendärer Planeswalker — Nixilis\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594107&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6d666a3c-deeb-407e-befa-6a92f09458ea\', \'multiverseId\': 594107}, \'multiverseid\': 594107}, {\'name\': \'Ob Nixilis, deformado por el odio\', \'text\': \'Siempre que un oponente robe una carta, Ob Nixilis, deformado por el odio hace 1 punto de daño a ese jugador.\\n−2: Destruye la criatura objetivo. Su controlador roba dos cartas.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker legendario — Nixilis\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594224&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'261fed66-1922-4eb2-9427-c99c9fff5cb5\', \'multiverseId\': 594224}, \'multiverseid\': 594224}, {\'name\': \'Ob Nixilis, perverti par la haine\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'un adversaire pioche une carte, Ob Nixilis, perverti par la haine inflige 1 blessure à ce joueur.\\n-2: Détruisez une créature ciblée. Son contrôleur pioche deux cartes.", \'type\': \'Planeswalker légendaire : Nixilis\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594341&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9bb1949d-8f6a-41ec-84ca-248f4e63a2f1\', \'multiverseId\': 594341}, \'multiverseid\': 594341}, {\'name\': "Ob Nixilis, Corrotto dall\'Odio", \'text\': "Ogniqualvolta un avversario pesca una carta, Ob Nixilis, Corrotto dall\'Odio infligge 1 danno a quel giocatore.\\n−2: Distruggi una creatura bersaglio. Il suo controllore pesca due carte.", \'type\': \'Planeswalker Leggendario — Nixilis\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594458&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'faed7e1c-b484-4507-956f-e46913953608\', \'multiverseId\': 594458}, \'multiverseid\': 594458}, {\'name\': \'憎悪に歪む者、オブ・ニクシリス\', \'text\': \'対戦相手１人がカード１枚を引くたび、憎悪に歪む者、オブ・ニクシリスはそのプレイヤーに１点のダメージを与える。\\n-2：クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それを破壊する。それのコントローラーはカード２枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'伝説のプレインズウォーカー — ニクシリス\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594575&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'36dfbcfe-f71a-42e0-91b4-cbe303614715\', \'multiverseId\': 594575}, \'multiverseid\': 594575}, {\'name\': \'忿恨欧尼希兹\', \'text\': \'每当任一对手抓一张牌时，忿恨欧尼希兹对该牌手造成1点伤害。\\n−2：消灭目标生物。其操控者抓两张牌。\', \'type\': \'传奇鹏洛客 ～尼希兹\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594926&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'873e4a90-4498-47a0-b601-b41df4182ac7\', \'multiverseId\': 594926}, \'multiverseid\': 594926}]', '[{\'name\': \'Oger-Schlachtmagierin\', \'text\': \'Erstschlag\\nImmer wenn die Oger-Schlachtmagierin angreift, kannst du eine Spontanzauber- oder Hexereikarte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof wirken, indem du zusätzlich zu ihren anderen Kosten {R}{R} bezahlst. Falls jener Zauberspruch auf einen Friedhof gelegt würde, schicke ihn stattdessen ins Exil. Wenn du jenen Zauberspruch wirkst, erhält die Oger-Schlachtmagierin bis zum Ende des Zuges +X/+0, wobei X gleich dem Manabetrag des Zauberspruchs ist.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Oger, Schamane\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589641&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'34a684aa-259c-457c-876e-c901ea7cba46\', \'multiverseId\': 589641}, \'multiverseid\': 589641}, {\'name\': \'Ogresa avivabatallas\', \'text\': \'Daña primero.\\nSiempre que la Ogresa avivabatallas ataque, puedes lanzar la carta de instantáneo o de conjuro objetivo desde tu cementerio pagando {R}{R} además de sus otros costes. Si ese hechizo fuera a ir a un cementerio, en vez de eso, exílialo. Cuando lances ese hechizo, la Ogresa avivabatallas obtiene +X/+0 hasta el final del turno, donde X es el valor de maná de ese hechizo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Chamán ogro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589692&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'97884b2f-1ad0-4e35-b510-21aabd07e956\', \'multiverseId\': 589692}, \'multiverseid\': 589692}, {\'name\': \'Lancebataille ogre\', \'text\': "Initiative\\nÀ chaque fois que la Lancebataille ogre attaque, vous pouvez lancer une carte d\'éphémère ou de rituel ciblée depuis votre cimetière en payant {R}{R} en plus de ses autres coûts. Si ce sort devait être mis dans un cimetière, exilez-le à la place. Quand vous lancez ce sort, la Lancebataille ogre gagne +X/+0 jusqu\'à la fin du tour, X étant la valeur de mana de ce sort.", \'type\': \'Créature : ogre et shamane\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589743&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'567b7f37-6c51-4a67-9dc9-ff5e3935254f\', \'multiverseId\': 589743}, \'multiverseid\': 589743}, {\'name\': \'Ogre Maga da Battaglia\', \'text\': "Attacco improvviso\\nOgniqualvolta l\'Ogre Maga da Battaglia attacca, puoi lanciare una carta istantaneo o stregoneria bersaglio dal tuo cimitero pagando {R}{R} oltre ai suoi altri costi. Se quella magia sta per essere messa in un cimitero, invece esiliala. Quando lanci quella magia, l\'Ogre Maga da Battaglia prende +X/+0 fino alla fine del turno, dove X è il valore di mana di quella magia.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Sciamano Ogre\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589794&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ec922db1-c5f1-45b7-aa35-a4d7bcfdcfaa\', \'multiverseId\': 589794}, \'multiverseid\': 589794}, {\'name\': \'オーガの戦争術師\', \'text\': \'先制攻撃\\nオーガの戦争術師が攻撃するたび、あなたの墓地にありインスタントやソーサリーであるカード１枚を対象とする。あなたはそれを、それの他のコストに加えて{R}{R}を支払って唱えてもよい。その呪文が墓地に置かれるなら、代わりにそれを追放する。あなたがその呪文を唱えたとき、ターン終了時まで、オーガの戦争術師は＋Ｘ/＋０の修整を受ける。Ｘはその呪文のマナ総量に等しい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — オーガ・シャーマン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589845&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4299d361-bd90-4265-ab59-eb998854b1de\', \'multiverseId\': 589845}, \'multiverseid\': 589845}, {\'name\': \'战咒食人魔\', \'text\': \'先攻\\n每当战咒食人魔攻击时，你可以从你的坟墓场中施放目标瞬间或法术牌，但在其他费用以外，还须额外支付{R}{R}。若该咒语将进入坟墓场，则改为将它放逐。当你施放该咒语时，战咒食人魔得+X/+0直到回合结束，X为该咒语的法术力值。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～食人魔／祭师\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589998&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cdb44675-6500-4d09-8aa9-267a2d846e6e\', \'multiverseId\': 589998}, \'multiverseid\': 589998}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ogerfürst der Slums\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn eine andere Nichtspielsteinkreatur stirbt, kannst du einen 1/1 schwarzen Ratte-Kreaturenspielstein erzeugen.\\nRatten, die du kontrollierst, haben Todesberührung.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Oger, Räuber\', \'flavor\': \'„‚Rattenverseucht\\\' klingt so negativ. Ich bevorzuge ‚rattenfreundlich\\\'."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597100&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2ecf4bbf-5ad0-455d-81f9-9b5c36f48c9c\', \'multiverseId\': 597100}, \'multiverseid\': 597100}, {\'name\': \'Ogro amo del distrito\', \'text\': \'Siempre que otra criatura que no sea ficha muera, puedes crear una ficha de criatura Rata negra 1/1.\\nLas Ratas que controlas tienen la habilidad de toque mortal.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bribón ogro\', \'flavor\': \'"Usar \\\'rata inmunda\\\' como insulto resulta muy ofensivo para mis amigas roedoras".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597146&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1f5d2716-db1c-4ad9-8d61-6b06372d8761\', \'multiverseId\': 597146}, \'multiverseid\': 597146}, {\'name\': \'Seigneur ogre de quartier insalubre\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'une autre créature non-jeton meurt, vous pouvez créer un jeton de créature 1/1 noire Rat.\\nLes rats que vous contrôlez ont le contact mortel.", \'type\': \'Créature : ogre et gredin\', \'flavor\': \'« "Infesté de rats" est assez péjoratif. Je préfère "accueillant pour les rats". »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597192&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'64d031c6-4894-4aed-9901-4916f08af590\', \'multiverseId\': 597192}, \'multiverseid\': 597192}, {\'name\': \'Ogre Padrone dei Tuguri\', \'text\': "Ogniqualvolta un\'altra creatura non pedina muore, puoi creare una pedina creatura Ratto 1/1 nera.\\nI Ratti che controlli hanno tocco letale.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Farabutto Ogre\', \'flavor\': \'"\\\'Infestato dai ratti\\\' ha un che di negativo. Io preferisco \\\'accogliente per i ratti\\\'."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597238&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'369bbd7e-cb24-4964-a66b-b75804753a0f\', \'multiverseId\': 597238}, \'multiverseid\': 597238}, {\'name\': \'オーガの貧王\', \'text\': \'トークンでもこれでもないクリーチャー１体が死亡するたび、あなたは黒の１/１のネズミ・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成してもよい。\\nあなたがコントロールしているすべてのネズミは接死を持つ。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — オーガ・ならず者\', \'flavor\': \'「『ネズミまで住み着いてる』っていう言葉がよくない。『ネズミ向け物件』の方がいい。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597284&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fde3bf4c-196d-443d-8baf-a6badd1f203d\', \'multiverseId\': 597284}, \'multiverseid\': 597284}, {\'name\': \'贫窟霸食人魔\', \'text\': \'每当另一个非衍生物的生物死去时，你可以派出一个1/1黑色老鼠衍生生物。\\n由你操控的老鼠具有死触异能。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～食人魔／浪客\', \'flavor\': \'「『鼠患』听起来太负面了。我喜欢说『鼠欢』。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597422&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'13271847-fe94-48c5-9091-c028e997f550\', \'multiverseId\': 597422}, \'multiverseid\': 597422}]', '[{\'name\': \'Oktoprophet\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Oktoprophet ins Spiel kommt, wende Hellsicht 2 an. (Schaue dir die obersten zwei Karten deiner Bibliothek an. Du kannst eine beliebige Anzahl davon unter deine Bibliothek legen und den Rest in beliebiger Reihenfolge oben darauf.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Oktopus\', \'flavor\': \'In jeder Verwirbelung des Wassers sieht er die Entstehung der Dinge, die erst noch geschehen werden.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595255&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f2019801-3e38-4a24-a98f-92c6c797ae8d\', \'multiverseId\': 595255}, \'multiverseid\': 595255}, {\'name\': \'Cefaloprofeta\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Cefaloprofeta entre al campo de batalla, adivina 2. (Mira las dos primeras cartas de tu biblioteca, luego pon cualquier cantidad de ellas en el fondo de tu biblioteca y el resto en la parte superior en cualquier orden.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Pulpo\', \'flavor\': \'En cada movimiento de la marea ve el despertar de lo que está por venir.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595363&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'920739c6-6030-4ad5-931c-58a6fc5f0c21\', \'multiverseId\': 595363}, \'multiverseid\': 595363}, {\'name\': \'Céphaloprophète\', \'text\': "Quand le Céphaloprophète arrive sur le champ de bataille, regard 2. (Regardez les deux cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Mettez n\'importe quel nombre d\'entre elles au-dessous de votre bibliothèque et le reste, au-dessus, dans l\'ordre de votre choix.)", \'type\': \'Créature : pieuvre\', \'flavor\': "Il voit dans chaque tourbillon de la marée l\'éveil de ce qui n\'existe pas encore.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595471&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'135a7f7b-c276-4fcc-b9d0-fb6aae779514\', \'multiverseId\': 595471}, \'multiverseid\': 595471}, {\'name\': \'Piovra Profetica\', \'text\': \'Quando la Piovra Profetica entra nel campo di battaglia, profetizza 2. (Guarda le prime due carte del tuo grimorio, poi mettine un qualsiasi numero in fondo al tuo grimorio e le altre in cima in qualsiasi ordine.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Piovra\', \'flavor\': "In ogni vortice della marea, vede affiorare l\'avvenire.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595579&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'68d63a22-a0fd-4382-91d0-fabb2373bacd\', \'multiverseId\': 595579}, \'multiverseid\': 595579}, {\'name\': \'予言ダコ\', \'text\': \'予言ダコが戦場に出たとき、占術２を行う。（あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード２枚を見て、そのうちの望む枚数をあなたのライブラリーの一番下に、残りを一番上に、それぞれ望む順番で置く。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — タコ\', \'flavor\': \'潮流が作る渦一つ一つから来たる目覚めを読み解く。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595687&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6441c1c8-25f8-4fd8-b2ba-d25d5026f18d\', \'multiverseId\': 595687}, \'multiverseid\': 595687}, {\'name\': \'八爪先知\', \'text\': \'当八爪先知进战场时，占卜2。（检视你牌库顶的两张牌，然后将其中任意数量的牌以任意顺序置于你牌库底，其余则以任意顺序置于你牌库顶。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～章鱼\', \'flavor\': \'它从周遭每一道浪潮漩涡当中，看到未来事物逐渐苏醒。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596011&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2c4d1e44-9aee-4c61-b78b-df08968331d9\', \'multiverseId\': 596011}, \'multiverseid\': 596011}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ondu-Riese\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Ondu-Riese ins Spiel kommt, kannst du deine Bibliothek nach einer Standardland-Karte durchsuchen, sie getappt ins Spiel bringen und danach mischen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Riese, Druide\', \'flavor\': \'Manche Druiden lassen Gärten erblühen. Andere ganze Kontinente.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592897&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'79fb9cb2-4e12-4119-a597-b7d0432fbbf9\', \'multiverseId\': 592897}, \'multiverseid\': 592897}, {\'name\': \'Gigante de Ondu\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Gigante de Ondu entre al campo de batalla, puedes buscar en tu biblioteca una carta de tierra básica, ponerla en el campo de batalla girada y luego barajar.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Druida gigante\', \'flavor\': \'Algunos druidas cultivan jardines. Otros cultivan continentes.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593018&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f244e53b-4f07-493f-8c78-8ee23da2e043\', \'multiverseId\': 593018}, \'multiverseid\': 593018}, {\'name\': \'Géant du Ondou\', \'text\': \'Quand le Géant du Ondou arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez chercher dans votre bibliothèque une carte de terrain de base, la mettre sur le champ de bataille engagée, puis mélanger.\', \'type\': \'Créature : géant et druide\', \'flavor\': "Certains druides entretiennent des jardins. D\'autres entretiennent des continents.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593139&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'24a542c2-2806-4333-96a9-deb517288628\', \'multiverseId\': 593139}, \'multiverseid\': 593139}, {\'name\': \'Gigante di Ondu\', \'text\': \'Quando il Gigante di Ondu entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi passare in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta terra base, metterla sul campo di battaglia TAPpata, poi rimescolare.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Druido Gigante\', \'flavor\': \'Alcuni druidi coltivano giardini. Altri interi continenti.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593260&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5cc4decc-e3e7-448e-8f94-51e1f6aed0e9\', \'multiverseId\': 593260}, \'multiverseid\': 593260}, {\'name\': \'オンドゥの巨人\', \'text\': \'オンドゥの巨人が戦場に出たとき、あなたは「あなたのライブラリーから基本土地・カード１枚を探し、タップ状態で戦場に出す。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。」を選んでもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 巨人・ドルイド\', \'flavor\': \'ドルイドは庭を育む。中には大陸を育む者もいる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593381&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a6d012db-7e61-44f7-ad5f-0f6a1fcee2c5\', \'multiverseId\': 593381}, \'multiverseid\': 593381}, {\'name\': \'昂度巨人\', \'text\': \'当昂度巨人进战场时，你可以从你牌库中搜寻一张基本地牌，将之横置放进战场，然后洗牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～巨人／德鲁伊\', \'flavor\': \'有些德鲁伊照料庭园。其他的则照料大陆。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593744&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'70aa1b04-efb9-4ecb-943c-4bdfbe4bc718\', \'multiverseId\': 593744}, \'multiverseid\': 593744}]', '[{\'name\': \'Oneirophage\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nImmer wenn du eine Karte ziehst, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf den Oneirophagen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Kalmar, Illusion\', \'flavor\': \'Er manifestiert sich in magischen Akademien, um die Inspiration junger Talente abzusaugen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595257&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6e01deb4-2454-4aab-89ee-7fc48f45f295\', \'multiverseId\': 595257}, \'multiverseid\': 595257}, {\'name\': \'Onirófago\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nSiempre que robes una carta, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre el Onirófago.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ilusión calamar\', \'flavor\': \'Se manifiesta en las academias de hechicería para fagocitar la inspiración de los jóvenes prodigios.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595365&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'92701117-6365-4785-9fdc-ce84c70e6e70\', \'multiverseId\': 595365}, \'multiverseid\': 595365}, {\'name\': \'Onirophage\', \'text\': "Vol\\nÀ chaque fois que vous piochez une carte, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur l\'Onirophage.", \'type\': \'Créature : calamar et illusion\', \'flavor\': "Il se manifeste dans les académies de sorciers pour siphonner l\'inspiration des jeunes prodiges.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595473&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'78f85949-911a-4700-b411-9570ce388461\', \'multiverseId\': 595473}, \'multiverseid\': 595473}, {\'name\': \'Onirofago\', \'text\': "Volare\\nOgniqualvolta peschi una carta, metti un segnalino +1/+1 sull\'Onirofago.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Illusione Calamaro\', \'flavor\': "Si manifesta nelle accademie di maghi per assorbire l\'ispirazione dai giovani prodigi.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595581&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e06ee986-9e60-4535-a63d-7aacb852e7de\', \'multiverseId\': 595581}, \'multiverseid\': 595581}, {\'name\': \'夢吸いイカ\', \'text\': \'飛行\\nあなたがカード１枚を引くたび、夢吸いイカの上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — イカ・イリュージョン\', \'flavor\': \'魔法学院に現れて、若い天才から発想を吸い上げる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595689&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4029c3a3-64d8-4bc1-ac3e-ce3d5a2da741\', \'multiverseId\': 595689}, \'multiverseid\': 595689}, {\'name\': \'噬梦蛸\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n每当你抓一张牌时，在噬梦蛸上放置一个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～乌贼／虚影\', \'flavor\': \'它常常现身法师学院，汲取青年逸才脑中灵感。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596013&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4af410d4-4ba8-48c5-b739-90395881823d\', \'multiverseId\': 596013}, \'multiverseid\': 596013}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ophiomant\', \'text\': \'Zu Beginn jedes Versorgungssegments und falls du keine Ophis kontrollierst, erzeuge einen 1/1 schwarzen Ophis-Kreaturenspielstein mit Todesberührung.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Schamane\', \'flavor\': \'„Es gibt dunkle, uralte Künste, die sogar mich faszinieren."\\n—Sorin Markov\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594109&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5e1734be-756c-4576-9795-8ef7d3f5ae0c\', \'multiverseId\': 594109}, \'multiverseid\': 594109}, {\'name\': \'Ofidiomante\', \'text\': \'Al comienzo de cada mantenimiento, si no controlas ninguna Víbora, crea una ficha de criatura Víbora negra 1/1 con la habilidad de toque mortal.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Chamán humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Hay artes oscuras y antiguas que me fascinan incluso a mí".\\n—Sorin Markov\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594226&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'487bffb4-ed22-475e-b4b4-33610147e55d\', \'multiverseId\': 594226}, \'multiverseid\': 594226}, {\'name\': \'Ophiomancienne\', \'text\': \'Au début de chaque entretien, si vous ne contrôlez aucun serpent, créez un jeton de créature 1/1 noire Serpent avec le contact mortel.\', \'type\': \'Créature : humain et shamane\', \'flavor\': \'« Il existe des arts anciens et obscurs qui fascinent tout le monde, même moi. »\\n—Sorin Markov\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594343&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5aa14106-8285-4f5d-a779-dc4928ad5754\', \'multiverseId\': 594343}, \'multiverseid\': 594343}, {\'name\': \'Ofiomante\', \'text\': "All\'inizio di ogni mantenimento, se non controlli Serpenti, crea una pedina creatura Serpente 1/1 nera con tocco letale.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Sciamano Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Esistono arti oscure e antiche che affascinano persino me."\\n—Sorin Markov\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594460&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9d135418-e3a1-4ed2-9698-5fd7d57b00bc\', \'multiverseId\': 594460}, \'multiverseid\': 594460}, {\'name\': \'蛇術師\', \'text\': \'各アップキープの開始時に、あなたが蛇をコントロールしていない場合、接死を持つ黒の１/１の蛇・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・シャーマン\', \'flavor\': \'「私ですら魅入られる、古の闇の術がある。」\\n――ソリン・マルコフ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594577&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'439e74af-8333-4018-9c7c-c57c14e68c8c\', \'multiverseId\': 594577}, \'multiverseid\': 594577}, {\'name\': \'舞蛇术士\', \'text\': \'在每个维持开始时，若你未操控蛇，则派出一个1/1黑色，具死触异能的蛇衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／祭师\', \'flavor\': \'「有些黑暗而古老的艺术，甚至连我都会入迷。」\\n～索霖马可夫\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594928&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d99937d6-be92-41b2-b10d-61d8b401ee8b\', \'multiverseId\': 594928}, \'multiverseid\': 594928}]', '[{\'name\': \'Optionen\', \'text\': \'Hellsicht 1. (Schaue dir die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek an. Du kannst sie unter deine Bibliothek legen.)\\nZiehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Manchmal ist die schwierigste Wahl die zwischen zwei Wundern."\\n—Gadwick der Alte\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595258&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c0bd1fd5-d5f8-4b86-b490-007d1246b8cb\', \'multiverseId\': 595258}, \'multiverseid\': 595258}, {\'name\': \'Optar\', \'text\': \'Adivina 1. (Mira la primera carta de tu biblioteca. Puedes poner esa carta en el fondo de tu biblioteca.)\\nRoba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"A veces, lo más difícil es elegir entre dos maravillas".\\n—Gadwick, el Marchito\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595366&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'df262212-0404-4781-9be1-db4c0b82fb34\', \'multiverseId\': 595366}, \'multiverseid\': 595366}, {\'name\': \'Option\', \'text\': \'Regard 1. (Regardez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Vous pouvez la mettre au-dessous de votre bibliothèque.)\\nPiochez une carte.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« Parfois le choix le plus difficile est entre deux merveilles. »\\n—Gadwick, le Brisquard\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595474&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ee752c86-1f5e-4a11-98eb-6b7292f4a886\', \'multiverseId\': 595474}, \'multiverseid\': 595474}, {\'name\': \'Opzione\', \'text\': \'Profetizza 1. (Guarda la prima carta del tuo grimorio. Puoi mettere quella carta in fondo al tuo grimorio.)\\nPesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Talvolta la scelta più difficile è tra due meraviglie."\\n—Gadwick, il Rugoso\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595582&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cf68c5c8-1a6f-421f-be07-ba60749a02ae\', \'multiverseId\': 595582}, \'multiverseid\': 595582}, {\'name\': \'選択\', \'text\': \'占術１を行う。（あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード１枚を見る。あなたはそのカードをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に置いてもよい。）\\nカード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「時に難しい選択がある。二つの驚異から一方を選ぶときだ。」\\n――老いたる者、ガドウィック\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595690&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'adab4c97-3ee6-4f72-8aed-a18ff231f5b1\', \'multiverseId\': 595690}, \'multiverseid\': 595690}, {\'name\': \'抉择\', \'text\': \'占卜1。（检视你牌库顶的牌。你可以将该牌置于你的牌库底。）\\n抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「有时候，在两个奇迹中作选择才最困难。」\\n～老年法师盖威克\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596014&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'071c8066-02a4-4313-ac98-48e2a0c51f00\', \'multiverseId\': 596014}, \'multiverseid\': 596014}]', '[{\'name\': \'Orden der goldenen Grille\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn der Orden der goldenen Grille angreift, kannst du {W} bezahlen. Falls du dies tust, erhält er Flugfähigkeit bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Kithkin, Ritter\', \'flavor\': \'„Solltest du ernsthaft versuchen, auf einem Märzhasen zu reiten, denke immer daran, dass es einfachere Wege gibt, fliegen zu lernen, und schwierigere, sich den Schädel aufzuschlagen."\\n—Lann aus Cloverdell\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591629&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ff30ca78-43e9-4b9b-8782-d1066ed9ae13\', \'multiverseId\': 591629}, \'multiverseid\': 591629}, {\'name\': \'Orden del Grillo Dorado\', \'text\': \'Siempre que la Orden del Grillo Dorado ataque, puedes pagar {W}. Si lo haces, gana la habilidad de volar hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Caballero kithkin\', \'flavor\': \'"Si se te ocurre montar un saltanejo, recuerda: hay maneras más fáciles de volar y maneras más difíciles de romperte la cabeza".\\n—Lann de Cañada del Trébol\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591758&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b5d967e1-03c1-448d-a57e-c50a9cd72026\', \'multiverseId\': 591758}, \'multiverseid\': 591758}, {\'name\': "Ordre du Criquet d\'or", \'text\': "À chaque fois que l\'Ordre du Criquet d\'or attaque, vous pouvez payer {W}. Si vous faites ainsi, il acquiert le vol jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : sangami et chevalier\', \'flavor\': "« S\'il vous venait l\'idée saugrenue de monter un sautelièvre, rappelez-vous : il y a mieux pour voler, et pire pour vous briser le crâne. »\\n—Lann de Trèfleval", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591887&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d73269ca-ee8f-4bd3-92be-887c9b17d6d7\', \'multiverseId\': 591887}, \'multiverseid\': 591887}, {\'name\': \'Ordine del Grillo Dorato\', \'text\': "Ogniqualvolta l\'Ordine del Grillo Dorato attacca, puoi pagare {W}. Se lo fai, ha volare fino alla fine del turno.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Cavaliere Kithkin\', \'flavor\': \'"Se dovesse venirti in mente di cavalcare una pecolepre, ricorda: ci sono modi più semplici per volare, ed espedienti più difficili per spaccarsi la testa."\\n—Lann della Valletta dei Trifogli\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592016&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'44782c88-5d93-4303-ad08-e428a7d3097c\', \'multiverseId\': 592016}, \'multiverseid\': 592016}, {\'name\': \'黄金コオロギの騎士団\', \'text\': \'黄金コオロギの騎士団が攻撃するたび、あなたは{W}を支払ってもよい。そうしたなら、ターン終了時まで、これは飛行を得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — キスキン・騎士\', \'flavor\': \'「スプリングジャックに乗るなら、これだけは覚えておけ。空を飛ぶならもっと簡単な方法があるし、頭の骨を割るならもっと難しいやり方がある。」\\n――クローバーデルのラン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592145&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ff6acd76-9b90-4958-8ffa-58313ba1a3e9\', \'multiverseId\': 592145}, \'multiverseid\': 592145}, {\'name\': \'金蟋蟀骑士团\', \'text\': \'每当金蟋蟀骑士团攻击时，你可以支付{W}。若你如此作，则它获得飞行异能直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～洁英／骑士\', \'flavor\': \'「若动了骑乘兔脚羊的念头，务请记住：有更简单的方式能飞起来，也有更痛的方式来撞破头。」\\n～苜蓿谷的朗恩\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592532&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'41f25f85-6e78-41eb-8c10-927405d0fa46\', \'multiverseId\': 592532}, \'multiverseid\': 592532}]', '[{\'name\': \'Panharmonikon\', \'text\': \'Falls ein Artefakt oder eine Kreatur ins Spiel kommt und dadurch bei einer bleibenden Karte, die du kontrollierst, eine ausgelöste Fähigkeit auslöst, wird die Fähigkeit ein weiteres Mal ausgelöst.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Jeder, der zuhört, vernimmt sein eigenes Lied — eine einzigartige Melodie ganz für ihn alleine.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596292&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8a5cbe99-3169-4d8e-80b4-fe633e31ee27\', \'multiverseId\': 596292}, \'multiverseid\': 596292}, {\'name\': \'Panharmónico\', \'text\': \'Si un artefacto o criatura que entra al campo de batalla hiciera que una habilidad disparada de un permanente que controlas se disparase, esa habilidad se dispara una vez más.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'Todos los que lo escuchan oyen su propia canción, una melodía única que suena solo para ellos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596379&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f624242d-6a4b-4b10-8b1d-acd962aea5cc\', \'multiverseId\': 596379}, \'multiverseid\': 596379}, {\'name\': \'Panharmonicus\', \'text\': "Si l\'arrivée sur le champ de bataille d\'un artefact ou d\'une créature provoque le déclenchement d\'une capacité déclenchée d\'un permanent que vous contrôlez, cette capacité se déclenche une fois de plus.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "Tous ceux qui l\'écoutent entendent une musique différente, une mélodie unique jouée seulement pour eux.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596466&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'22d8b004-27fb-4ee7-9e35-f3b4d0681006\', \'multiverseId\': 596466}, \'multiverseid\': 596466}, {\'name\': \'Panarmonico\', \'text\': "Se un artefatto o una creatura che entra nel campo di battaglia fa innescare l\'abilità innescata di un permanente che controlli, quell\'abilità si innesca una volta in più.", \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'Chiunque lo ascolti sente una canzone diversa, una melodia unica suonata solo per le sue orecchie.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596553&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9ce009c2-d452-4bc1-beda-57bd37b91d25\', \'multiverseId\': 596553}, \'multiverseid\': 596553}, {\'name\': \'パンハモニコン\', \'text\': \'アーティファクトやクリーチャーが戦場に出たことによりあなたがコントロールしているパーマネントの誘発型能力１つが誘発するなら、その能力は追加でもう１回誘発する。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'その音色に耳を傾ける者たちは、自分自身の歌を聴く。自分のためのみに奏でられた独特な旋律を。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596640&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2c5684ae-2aef-4170-b3b0-be40cba91cc1\', \'multiverseId\': 596640}, \'multiverseid\': 596640}, {\'name\': \'万和琴\', \'text\': \'如果某个由你操控之永久物的触发式异能因神器或生物进战场而触发，则该异能额外触发一次。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'听者各闻心中悦音，独特旋律为其特别奏响。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596901&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8e66251b-fdcc-4a9d-a84a-f661492afab0\', \'multiverseId\': 596901}, \'multiverseid\': 596901}]', '[{\'name\': \'Paradiesdruidin\', \'text\': \'Die Paradiesdruidin hat Fluchsicherheit, solange sie ungetappt ist.(Sie kann nicht das Ziel von Zaubersprüchen oder Fähigkeiten sein, die deine Gegner kontrollieren.)\\n{T}: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elf, Druide\', \'flavor\': \'„Es gibt viele Arten von Pflichten. Meine Pflicht besteht darin, unsere Welt wachsen zu sehen."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592903&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'650275af-97ff-46e5-91c5-093de109d606\', \'multiverseId\': 592903}, \'multiverseid\': 592903}, {\'name\': \'Druida del paraíso\', \'text\': \'La Druida del paraíso tiene la habilidad de antimaleficio mientras esté enderezada.(No puede ser objetivo de hechizos o habilidades que controlan tus oponentes.)\\n{T}: Agrega un maná de cualquier color.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Druida elfo\', \'flavor\': \'"Hay muchos tipos de deber, y el mío es ver que nuestro mundo crezca y resista".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593024&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7a1faa6e-64f0-48cb-ad7d-8f653ab72d68\', \'multiverseId\': 593024}, \'multiverseid\': 593024}, {\'name\': \'Druidesse de paradis\', \'text\': "La Druidesse de paradis a la défense talismanique tant qu\'elle est dégagée.(Elle ne peut pas être la cible de sorts ou de capacités que vos adversaires contrôlent.)\\n{T} : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix.", \'type\': \'Créature : elfe et druide\', \'flavor\': "« Il existe une multitude de rôles différents, et le mien consiste à voir notre monde survivre et s\'épanouir. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593145&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'42d40957-062f-49df-b6bb-1a995bd49b44\', \'multiverseId\': 593145}, \'multiverseid\': 593145}, {\'name\': \'Druida del Paradiso\', \'text\': \'La Druida del Paradiso ha anti-malocchio fintanto che è STAPpata.(Non può essere bersaglio di magie o abilità controllate dai tuoi avversari.)\\n{T}: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Druido Elfo\', \'flavor\': \'"Esistono molti tipi di dovere e il mio è osservare il nostro mondo crescere e perdurare."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593266&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e2231478-ade8-4725-8af8-6df2a93ce9df\', \'multiverseId\': 593266}, \'multiverseid\': 593266}, {\'name\': \'楽園のドルイド\', \'text\': \'楽園のドルイドがアンタップ状態であるかぎり、これは呪禁を持つ。（これは対戦相手がコントロールしている呪文や能力の対象にならない。）\\n{T}：好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルフ・ドルイド\', \'flavor\': \'「責務には様々な形があります。私の場合はこの世界が育ち耐える様子を見守ること。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593387&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2aea5258-075b-496b-8272-95b3c1b1dab4\', \'multiverseId\': 593387}, \'multiverseid\': 593387}, {\'name\': \'天堂德鲁伊\', \'text\': \'只要天堂德鲁伊未横置，它便具有辟邪异能。（它不能成为由对手操控之咒语或异能的目标。）\\n{T}：加一点任意颜色的法术力。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～妖精／德鲁伊\', \'flavor\': \'「世上有许多使命，我的使命就是照管世界，令其茁壮长存。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593750&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5a7da1fd-0ac4-4bad-b6b2-2380914e090a\', \'multiverseId\': 593750}, \'multiverseid\': 593750}]', '[{\'name\': \'Patrouille der Nachtwache\', \'text\': \'Erstschlag, Wachsamkeit\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Soldat\', \'flavor\': \'„Die Wojek verteidigen die Gesetze. Wir verteidigen die Leute."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591626&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4fed1dd6-f68e-4b21-b611-1480c9afd096\', \'multiverseId\': 591626}, \'multiverseid\': 591626}, {\'name\': \'Guardia de patrulla nocturna\', \'text\': \'Daña primero, vigilancia.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Los wojek defienden las leyes. Nosotros defendemos a la gente".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591755&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'642c8a83-c648-481b-851a-b60c8e535c57\', \'multiverseId\': 591755}, \'multiverseid\': 591755}, {\'name\': \'Patrouille veillenuit\', \'text\': \'Initiative, vigilance\', \'type\': \'Créature : humain et soldat\', \'flavor\': \'« Les Wojek défendent les lois. Nous défendons le peuple. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591884&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d31cb653-a0f8-4fed-bf45-d9cebd1ee4b5\', \'multiverseId\': 591884}, \'multiverseid\': 591884}, {\'name\': \'Pattuglia Notturna\', \'text\': \'Attacco improvviso, cautela\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Soldato Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"I Wojek difendono la legge. Noi difendiamo la gente."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592013&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a0ae54f3-8ea9-4916-b089-955213cf46db\', \'multiverseId\': 592013}, \'multiverseid\': 592013}, {\'name\': \'夜番の巡回兵\', \'text\': \'先制攻撃、警戒\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・兵士\', \'flavor\': \'「ウォジェクが守るのは法だ。我々が守るのは人々だ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592142&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'55caa99b-0a9a-43ce-9853-cab7fa167fa1\', \'multiverseId\': 592142}, \'multiverseid\': 592142}, {\'name\': \'夜巡守卫\', \'text\': \'先攻，警戒\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'「沃耶克保卫律法。我们则保卫人民。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592529&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7afc09db-fdbc-4bf9-a567-74c02b8b9533\', \'multiverseId\': 592529}, \'multiverseid\': 592529}]', '[{\'name\': \'Patrouille der neunten Brücke\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn eine andere Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, das Spiel verlässt, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf die Patrouille der neunten Brücke.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Zwerg, Soldat\', \'flavor\': \'Das Konsulat führt auf allen elf Brücken Kontrollen durch, um sicherzustellen, dass der Markt ein Ort des Handels bleibt und nicht zu einem Ort der Betrügerei verkommt.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591627&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'20d55849-9cde-40d7-9c85-8287ecf43f4a\', \'multiverseId\': 591627}, \'multiverseid\': 591627}, {\'name\': \'Patrullero del noveno puente\', \'text\': \'Siempre que otra criatura que controlas deje el campo de batalla, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre el Patrullero del noveno puente.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado enano\', \'flavor\': \'El Consulado vigila cada uno de los once puentes para garantizar que el mercado es un sitio seguro para comerciantes, no para estafadores.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591756&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'69931928-b866-4b0b-9228-047c0028753c\', \'multiverseId\': 591756}, \'multiverseid\': 591756}, {\'name\': \'Patrouille du neuvième pont\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'une autre créature que vous contrôlez quitte le champ de bataille, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur la Patrouille du neuvième pont.", \'type\': \'Créature : nain et soldat\', \'flavor\': "Le Consulat surveille chacun des onze ponts pour s\'assurer que le marché reste un havre pour le commerce, pas pour les arnaques.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591885&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cd1d3dfb-6a30-45bf-a8b0-34ef4239b249\', \'multiverseId\': 591885}, \'multiverseid\': 591885}, {\'name\': \'Pattuglia del Nono Ponte\', \'text\': "Ogniqualvolta un\'altra creatura che controlli lascia il campo di battaglia, metti un segnalino +1/+1 sulla Pattuglia del Nono Ponte.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Soldato Nano\', \'flavor\': \'Il Consolato sorveglia tutti gli undici ponti per assicurarsi che il mercato resti un ritrovo di commercianti e non di truffatori.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592014&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d04c22d0-895c-4e57-9fb1-0218dab323f7\', \'multiverseId\': 592014}, \'multiverseid\': 592014}, {\'name\': \'第九橋の巡回員\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしていてこれでないクリーチャー１体が戦場を離れるたび、第九橋の巡回員の上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ドワーフ・兵士\', \'flavor\': \'領事府は十一基ある橋をそれぞれ監視している。商取引の場である市場に詐欺師を横行させないためである。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592143&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1adc5246-2366-46ef-b6e9-d966f3b59601\', \'multiverseId\': 592143}, \'multiverseid\': 592143}, {\'name\': \'九桥巡卫\', \'text\': \'每当另一个由你操控的生物离开战场时，在九桥巡卫上放置一个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～矮人／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'执政院严密监控十一座桥，确保市场的公平交易，防止奸商横行。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592530&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2bd8231a-dc58-4fdf-992c-d05097f17d4f\', \'multiverseId\': 592530}, \'multiverseid\': 592530}]', '[{\'name\': \'Perfektes Timing\', \'text\': \'Perfektes Timing fügt einer angreifenden oder blockenden Kreatur deiner Wahl 3 Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Als Baral seine Falle für Chandra konstruierte, berücksichtigte er nicht die Ankunft eines riesigen, Doppelaxt schwingenden Leoniden.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591601&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7340e5a9-c653-476e-8cea-cc0a011cf489\', \'multiverseId\': 591601}, \'multiverseid\': 591601}, {\'name\': \'Llegada oportuna\', \'text\': \'La Llegada oportuna hace 3 puntos de daño a la criatura atacante o bloqueadora objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Cuando Baral construyó su trampa para Chandra, no previó la llegada de un leonino enorme con un hacha de dos cabezas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591730&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1d4203ee-bbd0-4f91-97bf-386c460dd4ce\', \'multiverseId\': 591730}, \'multiverseid\': 591730}, {\'name\': \'Moment opportun\', \'text\': \'Le Moment opportun inflige 3 blessures à une créature attaquante ou bloqueuse ciblée.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "Quand Baral tendit un piège à Chandra, ce fut sans compter sur l\'arrivée d\'un énorme léonin maniant une hache à double tranchant.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591859&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ac0be39e-b0e1-46e2-9542-8b2b3648f0ae\', \'multiverseId\': 591859}, \'multiverseid\': 591859}, {\'name\': \'Tempismo Impeccabile\', \'text\': \'Il Tempismo Impeccabile infligge 3 danni a una creatura attaccante o bloccante bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': "Durante la progettazione della trappola per Chandra, Baral non considerò l\'eventuale intervento di un leonid gigantesco armato di ascia bipenne.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591988&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'87bbf79c-adb1-407f-b26f-5e7b4b7286f1\', \'multiverseId\': 591988}, \'multiverseid\': 591988}, {\'name\': \'絶妙なタイミング\', \'text\': \'攻撃クリーチャーやブロック・クリーチャーのうち１体を対象とする。絶妙なタイミングはそれに３点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'バラルがチャンドラを捕らえる罠を準備したときには、双頭の斧を持った巨大なレオニンの登場など、想定していなかった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592117&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'94c919f0-5bda-4cae-aa3a-554dd4fa7ad9\', \'multiverseId\': 592117}, \'multiverseid\': 592117}, {\'name\': \'完美时机\', \'text\': \'完美时机对目标进行攻击或阻挡的生物造成3点伤害。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'巴罗在架设捕捉茜卓的陷阱时，未曾料想会有魁梧狮族挥舞着双头斧杀到。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592504&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5e3b0d74-9b1d-40d8-be83-5a33b58555dc\', \'multiverseId\': 592504}, \'multiverseid\': 592504}]', '[{\'name\': \'Pfeilhagelveteran\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Pfeilhagelveteran ins Spiel kommt, fügt er einer Kreatur deiner Wahl, die ein Gegner kontrolliert, so viele Schadenspunkte zu, wie du Goblins kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Goblin, Krieger\', \'flavor\': \'„Füllt die Lüfte mit Zeug!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590327&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9248744b-071e-4556-82c8-bd3cf3db278e\', \'multiverseId\': 590327}, \'multiverseid\': 590327}, {\'name\': \'Veterano de salvas\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Veterano de salvas entre al campo de batalla, hace una cantidad de daño a la criatura objetivo que controla un oponente igual a la cantidad de Trasgos que controlas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero trasgo\', \'flavor\': \'"¡Llenemos los cielos de... cosas!".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590462&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fe9cded1-e688-4328-bc6a-e476d75ad03e\', \'multiverseId\': 590462}, \'multiverseid\': 590462}, {\'name\': \'Vétéran de la volée\', \'text\': "Quand le Vétéran de la volée arrive sur le champ de bataille, il inflige à une créature ciblée qu\'un adversaire contrôle un nombre de blessures égal au nombre de gobelins que vous contrôlez.", \'type\': \'Créature : gobelin et guerrier\', \'flavor\': \'« Mettez des machins plein le ciel ! »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590597&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'72086b8f-e761-4a61-aea7-e8c6533a6621\', \'multiverseId\': 590597}, \'multiverseid\': 590597}, {\'name\': \'Veterano delle Raffiche\', \'text\': \'Quando il Veterano delle Raffiche entra nel campo di battaglia, infligge danno pari al numero di Goblin che controlli a una creatura bersaglio controllata da un avversario.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Goblin\', \'flavor\': \'"Riempite il cielo con quello che trovate!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590732&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fd3865b6-c05f-4920-bc6f-c816cf5ce54e\', \'multiverseId\': 590732}, \'multiverseid\': 590732}, {\'name\': \'斉射の古参兵\', \'text\': \'斉射の古参兵が戦場に出たとき、対戦相手がコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。これはそれに、あなたがコントロールしているゴブリンの数に等しい点数のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ゴブリン・戦士\', \'flavor\': \'「空を埋め尽くせ！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590867&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'96eaa7ee-98cb-4601-8111-9eead115611a\', \'multiverseId\': 590867}, \'multiverseid\': 590867}, {\'name\': \'齐射老手\', \'text\': \'当齐射老手进战场时，它向目标由对手操控的生物造成伤害，其数量等同于由你操控的鬼怪数量。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～鬼怪／战士\', \'flavor\': \'「填满天空，什么都好！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591272&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'52446ac6-752d-48d4-b331-5800b38a7cb4\', \'multiverseId\': 591272}, \'multiverseid\': 591272}]', '[{\'name\': \'Pflichtbewusster Replikator\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Pflichtbewusste Replikator ins Spiel kommt, kannst du {1} bezahlen. Wenn du dies tust, erzeuge einen Spielstein, der eine Kopie eines Spielsteins deiner Wahl ist, den du kontrollierst und dessen Name nicht Pflichtbewusster Replikator ist.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Montagearbeiter\', \'flavor\': \'„Vorsicht. Wenn man ihn zu lange machen lässt, verwandelt er das ganze Gebäude in Engel."\\n—Tawnos\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589653&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'82b76d6b-f098-484c-a965-d40c4eb5629b\', \'multiverseId\': 589653}, \'multiverseid\': 589653}, {\'name\': \'Duplicador diligente\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Duplicador diligente entre al campo de batalla, puedes pagar {1}. Cuando lo hagas, crea una ficha que es una copia de la ficha objetivo que controlas que no se llame Duplicador diligente.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Operario\', \'flavor\': \'"Ten cuidado. Si lo dejas demasiado tiempo encendido, convertirá todo el edificio en ángeles".\\n—Tawnos\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589704&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bd9e6f2f-3e6e-4d6a-9796-909f425ed06e\', \'multiverseId\': 589704}, \'multiverseid\': 589704}, {\'name\': \'Réplicateur consciencieux\', \'text\': "Quand le Réplicateur consciencieux arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez payer {1}. Quand vous faites ainsi, créez un jeton qui est une copie d\'un jeton ciblé que vous contrôlez qui n\'est pas appelé Réplicateur consciencieux.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : ouvrier spécialisé\', \'flavor\': \'« Attention. Si on le laisse en marche trop longtemps, il transformera tout le bâtiment en anges. »\\n—Tavnos\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589755&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f81a0199-d152-44ba-b3de-1e63003e4858\', \'multiverseId\': 589755}, \'multiverseid\': 589755}, {\'name\': \'Replicante Diligente\', \'text\': \'Quando il Replicante Diligente entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi pagare {1}. Quando lo fai, crea una pedina che è una copia di una pedina bersaglio che controlli e che non si chiama Replicante Diligente.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Addetto-al-Montaggio\', \'flavor\': \'"Fai attenzione. Se lo lasci acceso per troppo tempo, trasformerà l\\\'intero edificio in angeli."\\n—Tawnos\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589806&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ab109249-aa7c-456c-829c-677ea260202e\', \'multiverseId\': 589806}, \'multiverseid\': 589806}, {\'name\': \'忠実な複製機\', \'text\': \'忠実な複製機が戦場に出たとき、あなたは{1}を支払ってもよい。そうしたとき、あなたがコントロールしていて「忠実な複製機」という名前でないトークン１つを対象とする。それのコピーであるトークン１つを生成する。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 組立作業員\', \'flavor\': \'「お気を付けください。あまり長く作動させたまま放っておくと建物ごと天使に変えてしまいます。」\\n――タウノス\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589857&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'595597fa-337d-4b27-8034-bf91af635d6e\', \'multiverseId\': 589857}, \'multiverseid\': 589857}, {\'name\': \'尽责摹形械\', \'text\': \'当尽责摹形械进战场时，你可以支付{1}。当你如此作时，派出一个衍生物，此衍生物为目标由你操控且名称不为尽责摹形械之衍生物的复制品。\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～组装工人\', \'flavor\': \'「当心点。如果你放任它自行运作太久，它甚至会把整幢大楼都变成天使。」\\n～达硌士\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590010&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7618f2ac-acbf-4e1f-b801-46f1d8777f92\', \'multiverseId\': 590010}, \'multiverseid\': 590010}]', '[{\'name\': \'Phalanx-Taktik\', \'text\': \'Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst, erhält +2/+1 bis zum Ende des Zuges. Jede andere Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, erhält +1/+1 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Jeder Soldat hat seinen Platz einzunehmen und seine Rolle zu spielen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591630&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'429a3461-740a-462b-abf7-1a116abf25cd\', \'multiverseId\': 591630}, \'multiverseid\': 591630}, {\'name\': \'Tácticas de falange\', \'text\': \'La criatura objetivo que controlas obtiene +2/+1 hasta el final del turno. Cada otra criatura que controlas obtiene +1/+1 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Cada soldado tiene un lugar que defender y un papel que desempeñar.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591759&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8fc7486a-06bc-4f2c-9590-154d6cbcef6d\', \'multiverseId\': 591759}, \'multiverseid\': 591759}, {\'name\': \'Tactiques de phalange\', \'text\': "Une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez gagne +2/+1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour. Chaque autre créature que vous contrôlez gagne +1/+1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'Chaque soldat a une place précise et un rôle à jouer.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591888&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'22888d40-d258-4603-9d5f-bf1415944784\', \'multiverseId\': 591888}, \'multiverseid\': 591888}, {\'name\': \'Tattiche della Falange\', \'text\': \'Una creatura bersaglio che controlli prende +2/+1 fino alla fine del turno. Ogni altra creatura che controlli prende +1/+1 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'Ogni singolo soldato ha un posto da occupare e un ruolo da svolgere.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592017&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c4b3a27a-7265-407e-aea6-1282ed1c4eef\', \'multiverseId\': 592017}, \'multiverseid\': 592017}, {\'name\': \'密集戦術\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは＋２/＋１の修整を受ける。ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールしていてそれでないすべてのクリーチャーは＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'どの兵士にも立ち位置と役割がある。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592146&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'908e98a0-fda1-4116-8871-683d773a3a01\', \'multiverseId\': 592146}, \'multiverseid\': 592146}, {\'name\': \'方阵兵团战法\', \'text\': \'目标由你操控的生物得+2/+1直到回合结束。每个由你操控的其他生物各得+1/+1直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'每个士兵在阵中都有自己的位置和作用。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592533&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3ed19844-d2b1-4ee6-8b00-9dc2914ec394\', \'multiverseId\': 592533}, \'multiverseid\': 592533}]', "[{'name': 'Phantom-Nantuko', 'text': 'Verursacht Trampelschaden\\nDer Phantom-Nantuko kommt mit zwei +1/+1-Marken ins Spiel.\\nFalls dem Phantom-Nantuko Schaden zugefügt würde, verhindere den Schaden. Entferne eine +1/+1-Marke vom Phantom-Nantuko.\\n{T}: Lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf den Phantom-Nantuko.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Insekt, Geist', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592905&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ccad4640-4696-43f0-959f-3caf2b92f506', 'multiverseId': 592905}, 'multiverseid': 592905}, {'name': 'Nantuko fantasma', 'text': 'Arrolla.\\nEl Nantuko fantasma entra al campo de batalla con dos contadores +1/+1 sobre él.\\nSi se le fuera a hacer daño al Nantuko fantasma, prevén ese daño. Remueve un contador +1/+1 del Nantuko fantasma.\\n{T}: Pon un contador +1/+1 sobre el Nantuko fantasma.', 'type': 'Criatura — Espíritu insecto', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593026&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9ad5724b-6f25-4685-b426-32452cf2ee30', 'multiverseId': 593026}, 'multiverseid': 593026}, {'name': 'Nantuko fantomatique', 'text': 'Piétinement\\nLe Nantuko fantomatique arrive sur le champ de bataille avec deux marqueurs +1/+1 sur lui.\\nSi des blessures devaient être infligées au Nantuko fantomatique, prévenez ces blessures. Retirez un marqueur +1/+1 du Nantuko fantomatique.\\n{T} : Mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur le Nantuko fantomatique.', 'type': 'Créature : esprit et insecte', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593147&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9f9cb68a-0e78-4f7b-a175-159c59281f78', 'multiverseId': 593147}, 'multiverseid': 593147}, {'name': 'Nantuko Fantasma', 'text': 'Travolgere\\nIl Nantuko Fantasma entra nel campo di battaglia con due segnalini +1/+1.\\nSe sta per essere inflitto danno al Nantuko Fantasma, previeni quel danno. Rimuovi un segnalino +1/+1 dal Nantuko Fantasma.\\n{T}: Metti un segnalino +1/+1 sul Nantuko Fantasma.', 'type': 'Creatura — Spirito Insetto', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593268&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '773cefac-d6ad-4912-997d-ccaa8d81248d', 'multiverseId': 593268}, 'multiverseid': 593268}, {'name': '幻影のナントゥーコ', 'text': 'トランプル\\n幻影のナントゥーコは、＋１/＋１カウンター２個が置かれた状態で戦場に出る。\\n幻影のナントゥーコがダメージを受けるなら、そのダメージを軽減し、幻影のナントゥーコの上から＋１/＋１カウンター１個を取り除く。\\n{T}：幻影のナントゥーコの上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 昆虫・スピリット', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593389&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '17dc8c00-4d13-439f-a856-d48c12b203eb', 'multiverseId': 593389}, 'multiverseid': 593389}, {'name': '幽魅螳人', 'text': '践踏\\n幽魅螳人进战场时上面有两个+1/+1指示物。\\n如果幽魅螳人将受到伤害，则防止该伤害。从幽魅螳人上移去一个+1/+1指示物。\\n{T}：在幽魅螳人上放置一个+1/+1指示物。', 'type': '生物 ～昆虫／精怪', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593752&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a8218a3c-3cc7-42d5-8edd-5d784663b5b4', 'multiverseId': 593752}, 'multiverseid': 593752}]", '[{\'name\': \'Phiole des Alchemisten\', \'text\': \'Wenn die Phiole des Alchemisten ins Spiel kommt, ziehe eine Karte.\\n{1}, {T}, opfere die Phiole des Alchemisten: Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl kann in diesem Zug nicht angreifen oder blocken.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Eine Waffe für diejenigen mit gutem Augenmaß und ruhigem Händchen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596257&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9edfc72b-1103-4866-b274-6eebc1d56f6f\', \'multiverseId\': 596257}, \'multiverseid\': 596257}, {\'name\': \'Frasco del alquimista\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Frasco del alquimista entre al campo de batalla, roba una carta.\\n{1}, {T}, sacrificar el Frasco del alquimista: La criatura objetivo no puede atacar ni bloquear este turno.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'Un arma especialmente indicada para aquellos con buena puntería y pulso firme.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596344&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'866d6d97-5338-4376-96ea-cbaec8dad21f\', \'multiverseId\': 596344}, \'multiverseid\': 596344}, {\'name\': "Fiole de l\'alchimiste", \'text\': "Quand la Fiole de l\'alchimiste arrive sur le champ de bataille, piochez une carte.\\n{1}, {T}, sacrifiez la Fiole de l\'alchimiste : Une créature ciblée ne peut ni attaquer ni bloquer ce tour-ci.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': \'Une arme pour laquelle il vaut mieux savoir viser et avoir une main assurée.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596431&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'69d8cec7-21bd-40a9-9acc-aaa1b6f745ac\', \'multiverseId\': 596431}, \'multiverseid\': 596431}, {\'name\': "Fiala dell\'Alchimista", \'text\': "Quando la Fiala dell\'Alchimista entra nel campo di battaglia, pesca una carta.\\n{1}, {T}, Sacrifica la Fiala dell\'Alchimista: Una creatura bersaglio non può attaccare o bloccare in questo turno.", \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': "L\'arma più adatta per coloro che hanno una buona mira e una mano ferma.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596518&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7cb26991-e957-4764-8d63-75aba7dace11\', \'multiverseId\': 596518}, \'multiverseid\': 596518}, {\'name\': \'錬金術師の薬瓶\', \'text\': \'錬金術師の薬瓶が戦場に出たとき、カード１枚を引く。\\n{1},{T},錬金術師の薬瓶を生け贄に捧げる：クリーチャー１体を対象とする。このターン、それでは攻撃もブロックもできない。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'狙いが確かで、手が安定している者にとっては最高の武器となる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596605&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'36e78889-13d5-43f8-8645-ee1709805240\', \'multiverseId\': 596605}, \'multiverseid\': 596605}, {\'name\': \'炼金术士药瓶\', \'text\': \'当炼金术士药瓶进战场时，抓一张牌。\\n{1}，{T}，牺牲炼金术士药瓶：目标生物本回合不能进行攻击或阻挡。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'这武器最适合瞄得准、拿得稳的人。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596866&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fce3d4d9-e575-4c4e-be2f-65ea5923f56d\', \'multiverseId\': 596866}, \'multiverseid\': 596866}]', '[{\'name\': \'Phiole mit Drachenfeuer\', \'text\': \'{2}, {T}, opfere die Phiole mit Drachenfeuer: Sie fügt einer Kreatur deiner Wahl 2 Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'„Der Tüftler versicherte mir, die Phiole sei stabil genug für Drachenfeuer. Ich solle sie nur weit genug werfen."\\n—Kunh Mei, letzte Worte\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596309&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ad56bd85-9bf5-4725-94f5-e75ff6ced568\', \'multiverseId\': 596309}, \'multiverseid\': 596309}, {\'name\': \'Frasco de fuegodragón\', \'text\': \'{2}, {T}, sacrificar el Frasco de fuegodragón: Hace 2 puntos de daño a la criatura objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'"El artífice me aseguró que el frasco es lo bastante resistente como para contener el aliento de un dragón. Solo tenemos que asegurarnos de arrojarlo lo suficientemente lejos".\\n—Kunh Mei, últimas palabras\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596396&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d9579f25-b5af-46b0-a042-3d344f5e41b0\', \'multiverseId\': 596396}, \'multiverseid\': 596396}, {\'name\': \'Fiole de feu des dragons\', \'text\': \'{2}, {T}, sacrifiez la Fiole de feu des dragons : Elle inflige 2 blessures à une créature ciblée.\', \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "« L\'artificier m\'a assuré que la fiole était suffisamment solide pour contenir le souffle du dragon. Je n\'ai plus qu\'à la lancer assez loin. »\\n—Kunh Mei, derniers mots", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596483&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'32abecd1-78e8-49be-8f53-efb3870949d8\', \'multiverseId\': 596483}, \'multiverseid\': 596483}, {\'name\': \'Fiala di Fuoco Draconico\', \'text\': \'{2}, {T}, Sacrifica la Fiala di Fuoco Draconico: Infligge 2 danni a una creatura bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'"L\\\'artefice mi ha garantito che la fiala è abbastanza forte da contenere il soffio di un drago. Devo solo assicurarmi di lanciarla abbastanza lontano."\\n—Ultime parole di Kunh Mei\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596570&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a6889469-c99a-403d-8a60-cd027887ba5c\', \'multiverseId\': 596570}, \'multiverseid\': 596570}, {\'name\': \'龍火の薬瓶\', \'text\': \'{2},{T},龍火の薬瓶を生け贄に捧げる：クリーチャー１体を対象とする。これはそれに２点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'「この丈夫な瓶にはドラゴンの息が入ってるんですって。工匠の折り紙つきよ。後は十分遠くに投げればいいの。」\\n――クン・メイの最後の言葉\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596657&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8f881e67-a5c0-4bad-88d8-13e4fdb78f24\', \'multiverseId\': 596657}, \'multiverseid\': 596657}, {\'name\': \'龙炎瓶\', \'text\': \'{2}，{T}，牺牲龙炎瓶：它对目标生物造成2点伤害。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'「神器师向我再三保证，这瓶子足以承受龙炎高温。我只需要扔得够远就行。」\\n～昆梅的遗言\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596918&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c84cb06b-2a1f-4bba-9d77-0f23259fa5df\', \'multiverseId\': 596918}, \'multiverseid\': 596918}]', '[{\'name\': \'Phyrexianischer Eisenfuß\', \'text\': \'Der Phyrexianische Eisenfuß enttappt nicht während deines Enttappsegments.\\n{1}{S}: Enttappe den Phyrexianischen Eisenfuß. ({S} kann mit einem Mana von einer verschneiten Quelle bezahlt werden.)\', \'type\': \'Verschneite Artefaktkreatur — Phyrexianer, Konstrukt\', \'flavor\': \'Die Reifzauberer bemerkten tagelang nicht, dass es ihnen gelungen war, die Kreatur zu aktivieren — sie war einfach nicht interessiert daran, sich zu bewegen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596293&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0b5545c4-6137-4c63-b7be-d1a692e10a4b\', \'multiverseId\': 596293}, \'multiverseid\': 596293}, {\'name\': \'Pie de hierro pirexiano\', \'text\': \'El Pie de hierro pirexiano no se endereza durante tu paso de enderezar.\\n{1}{S}: Endereza el Pie de hierro pirexiano. ({S} puede pagarse con un maná de una fuente nevada.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto nevada — Constructo pirexiano\', \'flavor\': \'Les tomó varios días a los cultistas brisa escarchada darse cuenta de que habían activado la criatura exitosamente; simplemente no quería moverse.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596380&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b74c135f-c156-440d-a4b8-524b16dafd21\', \'multiverseId\': 596380}, \'multiverseid\': 596380}, {\'name\': \'Piédefer phyrexian\', \'text\': "Le Piédefer phyrexian ne se dégage pas pendant votre étape de dégagement.\\n{1}{S} : Dégagez le Piédefer phyrexian. ({S} peut être payé avec un mana d\'une source neigeuse.)", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact neigeuse : phyrexian et construction\', \'flavor\': "Il fallut plusieurs jours aux cultistes de Soufflegivre pour réaliser qu\'ils avaient activé la créature — elle n\'avait aucune envie de bouger.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596467&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1b1657ed-2d4b-463d-9183-433529cd8cf4\', \'multiverseId\': 596467}, \'multiverseid\': 596467}, {\'name\': \'Ferropode di Phyrexia\', \'text\': \'Il Ferropode di Phyrexia non STAPpa durante il tuo STAP.\\n{1}{S}: STAPpa il Ferropode di Phyrexia. ({S} può essere pagato con un mana da una fonte neve.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto Neve — Costrutto Phyrexiano\', \'flavor\': \'Ci vollero giorni prima che i cultisti di Ventogelo capissero di essere riusciti ad attivare la creatura. Solo che non era interessata a muoversi.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596554&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'36ce48a8-a728-4254-8e88-84f2ed212a1f\', \'multiverseId\': 596554}, \'multiverseid\': 596554}, {\'name\': \'ファイレクシアの鉄足\', \'text\': \'ファイレクシアの鉄足はあなたのアンタップ・ステップにアンタップしない。\\n{1}{S}：ファイレクシアの鉄足をアンタップする。（{S}は氷雪である発生源からのマナ１点で支払える。）\', \'type\': \'氷雪アーティファクト・クリーチャー — ファイレクシアン・構築物\', \'flavor\': \'霧氷風の狂信者は、この生物の起動に成功したのに気付くまで数日かかった――単に鉄足に動く気がなかったのだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596641&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'85bf4705-bd66-41e2-b8e7-5980990dc3e6\', \'multiverseId\': 596641}, \'multiverseid\': 596641}, {\'name\': \'非瑞克西亚千斤脚\', \'text\': \'非瑞克西亚千斤脚于你的重置步骤中不能重置。\\n{1}{S}：重置非瑞克西亚千斤脚。（{S}能以产自雪境来源的一点法术力来支付。）\', \'type\': \'雪境神器生物 ～非瑞人／组构体\', \'flavor\': \'霜风会众花了好几天才明白，原来自己早就成功起动这生物～它只是不爱动。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596902&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8ab62fd8-96d5-4a9a-9226-850110e8f97b\', \'multiverseId\': 596902}, \'multiverseid\': 596902}]', '[{\'name\': \'Phyrexianischer Entkräfter\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\n{T}, opfere den Phyrexianischen Entkräfter: Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält -2/-2 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Phyrexianer, Überträger\', \'flavor\': \'„Die zweite Stufe der Krankheit: hohes Fieber, hohe Virulenz."\\n—Phyrexianisches Versuchsprotokoll\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594111&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'15905ccd-f9ce-4fe6-84e5-a0e7cad9abfd\', \'multiverseId\': 594111}, \'multiverseid\': 594111}, {\'name\': \'Envilecedor pirexiano\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\n{T}, sacrificar el Envilecedor pirexiano: La criatura objetivo obtiene -2/-2 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Portador pirexiano\', \'flavor\': \'"La segunda etapa de la enfermedad: fiebre e infección severa".\\n—Notas de progreso pirexianas\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594228&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fd8bb77a-7ce0-41b0-a2ac-d44a16a77bd7\', \'multiverseId\': 594228}, \'multiverseid\': 594228}, {\'name\': \'Viciateur phyrexian\', \'text\': "Vol\\n{T}, sacrifiez le Viciateur phyrexian : Une créature ciblée gagne -2/-2 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : phyrexian et propagateur\', \'flavor\': "« La deuxième phase de la maladie : la fièvre et l\'intense contagiosité. »\\n—Notes médicales phyrexianes", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594345&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3417a5e5-1722-4905-819a-589bc564e740\', \'multiverseId\': 594345}, \'multiverseid\': 594345}, {\'name\': \'Sobillatore di Phyrexia\', \'text\': \'Volare\\n{T}, Sacrifica il Sobillatore di Phyrexia: Una creatura bersaglio prende -2/-2 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Latore Phyrexiano\', \'flavor\': \'"Il secondo stadio della malattia: febbre alta e infezione profonda."\\n—Appunti di sviluppo di Phyrexia\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594462&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4a9f3809-e296-44f7-9e08-7a865e131cdc\', \'multiverseId\': 594462}, \'multiverseid\': 594462}, {\'name\': \'ファイレクシアの堕落者\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n{T},ファイレクシアの堕落者を生け贄に捧げる：クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは－２/－２の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ファイレクシアン・キャリアー\', \'flavor\': \'「この病気の第二段階：高熱と著しい感染力」\\n――ファイレクシア病の進行記録\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594579&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'80b771cb-39a6-4bb6-a87e-d54f4ffb5df6\', \'multiverseId\': 594579}, \'multiverseid\': 594579}, {\'name\': \'非瑞克西亚贬者\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n{T}，牺牲非瑞克西亚贬者：目标生物得-2/-2直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～非瑞人／病媒\', \'flavor\': \'「疾病的第二阶段：高烧和严重感染。」\\n～非瑞克西亚进展纪录\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594930&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3991147b-b296-4a58-a16c-880f6836306c\', \'multiverseId\': 594930}, \'multiverseid\': 594930}]', '[{\'name\': \'Phyrexianischer Seuchenherr\', \'text\': \'{T}, opfere den Phyrexianischen Seuchenherrn: Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält -4/-4 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\\nOpfere eine Kreatur: Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält -1/-1 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Phyrexianer, Überträger\', \'flavor\': \'„Auch nach dem Tod bleibt eine Fülle von brauchbarer Biomasse übrig."\\n—Phyrexianisches Versuchsprotokoll\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597530&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ea3a258b-ea50-450f-8f7f-29e5b37c5711\', \'multiverseId\': 597530}, \'multiverseid\': 597530}, {\'name\': \'Señor de la peste pirexiano\', \'text\': \'{T}, sacrificar el Señor de la peste pirexiano: La criatura objetivo obtiene -4/-4 hasta el final del turno.\\nSacrificar una criatura: La criatura objetivo obtiene -1/-1 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Portador pirexiano\', \'flavor\': \'"Incluso después de la muerte, se conserva una gran cantidad de biomasa útil".\\n—Notas de progreso pirexianas\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597555&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'113efb80-bdd6-4cfe-83ba-5be50b4a8876\', \'multiverseId\': 597555}, \'multiverseid\': 597555}, {\'name\': \'Seigneur de la peste phyrexian\', \'text\': "{T}, sacrifiez le Seigneur de la peste phyrexian : Une créature ciblée gagne -4/-4 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.\\nSacrifiez une créature : Une créature ciblée gagne -1/-1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : phyrexian et propagateur\', \'flavor\': \'« Même après la mort, une tonne de biomasse fonctionnelle subsiste. »\\n—Notes médicales phyrexianes\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597580&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ce80e2fa-ce09-4716-ace5-889250bfd476\', \'multiverseId\': 597580}, \'multiverseid\': 597580}, {\'name\': \'Signore della Peste di Phyrexia\', \'text\': \'{T}, Sacrifica il Signore della Peste di Phyrexia: Una creatura bersaglio prende -4/-4 fino alla fine del turno.\\nSacrifica una creatura: Una creatura bersaglio prende -1/-1 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Latore Phyrexiano\', \'flavor\': \'"Anche dopo la morte, rimane biomassa funzionale in abbondanza."\\n—Appunti di sviluppo di Phyrexia\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597605&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'46074e66-dc4e-460a-8a14-9f901246e142\', \'multiverseId\': 597605}, \'multiverseid\': 597605}, {\'name\': \'ファイレクシアの疫病王\', \'text\': \'{T}, ファイレクシアの疫病王を生け贄に捧げる：クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは－４/－４の修整を受ける。\\nクリーチャー１体を生け贄に捧げる：クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは－１/－１の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ファイレクシアン・キャリアー\', \'flavor\': \'「死してもなお、利用可能なバイオマスが豊富に残る。」\\n――ファイレクシア病の進行記録\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597630&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6040f4b6-cd82-4156-bf3a-f3dbf6954812\', \'multiverseId\': 597630}, \'multiverseid\': 597630}, {\'name\': \'非瑞克西亚疫病王\', \'text\': \'{T}，牺牲非瑞克西亚疫病王：目标生物得-4/-4直到回合结束。\\n牺牲一个生物：目标生物得-1/-1直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～非瑞人／病媒\', \'flavor\': \'「死亡之后仍有大量生物质可加以利用。」\\n～非瑞克西亚进展纪录\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597705&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1dd4c105-9c1f-4688-a2a6-d4ada117e409\', \'multiverseId\': 597705}, \'multiverseid\': 597705}]', "[{'name': 'Pilgerin der Zeitalter', 'text': 'Wenn die Pilgerin der Zeitalter ins Spiel kommt, kannst du deine Bibliothek nach einer Ebene-Standardlandkarte durchsuchen, sie offen vorzeigen, auf deine Hand nehmen und danach mischen.\\n{6}: Bringe die Pilgerin der Zeitalter aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurück.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Geist', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591631&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '35b2c5f1-c488-426a-9f46-b59dffe111cf', 'multiverseId': 591631}, 'multiverseid': 591631}, {'name': 'Peregrina de las eras', 'text': 'Cuando la Peregrina de las eras entre al campo de batalla, puedes buscar en tu biblioteca una carta de Llanura básica, mostrarla, ponerla en tu mano y luego barajar.\\n{6}: Regresa la Peregrina de las eras de tu cementerio a tu mano.', 'type': 'Criatura — Espíritu', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591760&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0ae8ae2e-7895-40ff-b8fa-9e33984d077c', 'multiverseId': 591760}, 'multiverseid': 591760}, {'name': 'Pèlerine des Âges', 'text': 'Quand la Pèlerine des Âges arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez chercher dans votre bibliothèque une carte de plaine de base, la révéler, la mettre dans votre main, puis mélanger.\\n{6} : Renvoyez la Pèlerine des Âges depuis votre cimetière dans votre main.', 'type': 'Créature : esprit', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591889&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '61eabd67-90d7-4eb1-926a-8fecae97ebb7', 'multiverseId': 591889}, 'multiverseid': 591889}, {'name': 'Pellegrina delle Ere', 'text': 'Quando la Pellegrina delle Ere entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi passare in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta Pianura base, rivelarla e aggiungerla alla tua mano, poi rimescolare.\\n{6}: Riprendi in mano la Pellegrina delle Ere dal tuo cimitero.', 'type': 'Creatura — Spirito', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592018&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8587a414-bbf1-4848-8e78-3ffecf05c232', 'multiverseId': 592018}, 'multiverseid': 592018}, {'name': '星霜の巡礼者', 'text': '星霜の巡礼者が戦場に出たとき、あなたは「あなたのライブラリーから基本平地・カード１枚を探し、公開し、あなたの手札に加える。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。」を選んでもよい。\\n{6}：あなたの墓地にある星霜の巡礼者をあなたの手札に戻す。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — スピリット', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592147&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'df9f99de-96cb-4f16-90a8-6cf8b19ff5ca', 'multiverseId': 592147}, 'multiverseid': 592147}, {'name': '岁月朝圣客', 'text': '当岁月朝圣客进战场时，你可以从你牌库中搜寻一张基本的平原牌，展示该牌，将它置于你手上，然后洗牌。\\n{6}：将岁月朝圣客从你的坟墓场移回你手上。', 'type': '生物 ～精怪', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592534&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8e41602e-8f10-4b0a-929e-634a7d6bb836', 'multiverseId': 592534}, 'multiverseid': 592534}]", '[{\'name\': \'Pilzinfektion\', \'text\': \'Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält -1/-1 bis zum Ende des Zuges. Erzeuge einen 1/1 grünen Saproling-Kreaturenspielstein.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Für Thallide ist die ganze Welt nur Mulch, auf dem Saprolinge wachsen können.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594073&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'99e5df7e-0127-460d-92d8-2de4c12edc38\', \'multiverseId\': 594073}, \'multiverseid\': 594073}, {\'name\': \'Infección fúngica\', \'text\': \'La criatura objetivo obtiene -1/-1 hasta el final del turno. Crea una ficha de criatura Saprolín verde 1/1.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Para los tálidos, el mundo entero no es más que un montón de estiércol donde hacer crecer saprolines.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594190&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a0dfaa4d-c7dd-4371-8834-a2df5b3632e6\', \'multiverseId\': 594190}, \'multiverseid\': 594190}, {\'name\': \'Infection fongoïde\', \'text\': "Une créature ciblée gagne -1/-1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour. Créez un jeton de créature 1/1 verte Saprobionte.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "Pour les thallidés, le monde n\'est qu\'un vaste paillis où faire pousser des saprobiontes.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594307&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1afb1a6f-7dd1-438f-92e2-6b865342c5dd\', \'multiverseId\': 594307}, \'multiverseid\': 594307}, {\'name\': \'Infezione Fungina\', \'text\': \'Una creatura bersaglio prende -1/-1 fino alla fine del turno. Crea una pedina creatura Saprolingio 1/1 verde.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'Per i thallid, il mondo intero non è che un mucchio di concime in cui coltivare saprolingi.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594424&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f449aec0-ab04-4332-8c7d-d05b29ed8262\', \'multiverseId\': 594424}, \'multiverseid\': 594424}, {\'name\': \'菌類感染\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは－１/－１の修整を受ける。緑の１/１の苗木・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'サリッドにとって世界とは苗木を育てる根囲いの重なりに過ぎない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594541&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bd3d1933-c9b0-4a19-9922-3e4fbcc9436e\', \'multiverseId\': 594541}, \'multiverseid\': 594541}, {\'name\': \'真菌感染\', \'text\': \'目标生物得-1/-1直到回合结束。派出一个1/1绿色腐生物衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'对散绿菌而言，整个世界都是能培育腐生物的护根壤。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594892&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4e929607-e25b-4a49-bc71-b58e5f03e624\', \'multiverseId\': 594892}, \'multiverseid\': 594892}]', "[{'name': 'Piranhamoor', 'text': 'Das Piranhamoor kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nWenn das Piranhamoor ins Spiel kommt, verliert ein Spieler deiner Wahl 1 Lebenspunkt.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {B}.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596322&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7390f62c-e135-43ea-accf-84b92e96a457', 'multiverseId': 596322}, 'multiverseid': 596322}, {'name': 'Cenagal de pirañas', 'text': 'El Cenagal de pirañas entra al campo de batalla girado.\\nCuando el Cenagal de pirañas entre al campo de batalla, el jugador objetivo pierde 1 vida.\\n{T}: Agrega {B}.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596409&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b5fca489-ee60-418a-b330-5ba1451a91c6', 'multiverseId': 596409}, 'multiverseid': 596409}, {'name': 'Marécage aux piranhas', 'text': 'Le Marécage aux piranhas arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\nQuand le Marécage aux piranhas arrive sur le champ de bataille, un joueur ciblé perd 1 point de vie.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {B}.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596496&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd8cbd0cb-7aab-4e64-be92-c3553982f24d', 'multiverseId': 596496}, 'multiverseid': 596496}, {'name': 'Palude dei Piranha', 'text': 'La Palude dei Piranha entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpata.\\nQuando la Palude dei Piranha entra nel campo di battaglia, un giocatore bersaglio perde 1 punto vita.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {B}.', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596583&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fc936304-8a81-4e9b-8583-1f7b0d446497', 'multiverseId': 596583}, 'multiverseid': 596583}, {'name': 'ピラニアの湿地', 'text': 'ピラニアの湿地はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\nピラニアの湿地が戦場に出たとき、プレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーは１点のライフを失う。\\n{T}：{B}を加える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596670&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1511ca57-5d5f-44b2-a56e-5c0714fd0027', 'multiverseId': 596670}, 'multiverseid': 596670}, {'name': '水虎鱼沼地', 'text': '水虎鱼沼地须横置进战场。\\n当水虎鱼沼地进战场时，目标牌手失去1点生命。\\n{T}：加{B}。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596931&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ee99dd4f-9df0-41cc-9db5-047e4c17fada', 'multiverseId': 596931}, 'multiverseid': 596931}]", '[{\'name\': \'Pirschende Drohne\', \'text\': \'Fahl (Diese Karte hat keine Farbe.)\\n{C}: Die Pirschende Drohne erhält +1/+2 bis zum Ende des Zuges. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit nur einmal pro Zug. ({C} steht für farbloses Mana.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Eldrazi, Drohne\', \'flavor\': \'Als die Eldrazi sich an die Dschungel von Zendikar anpassten, machten sich einige die Taktiken heimischer Raubtiere zu eigen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592932&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2401b140-97cd-430b-b0d8-28e455e3719c\', \'multiverseId\': 592932}, \'multiverseid\': 592932}, {\'name\': \'Zángano acechador\', \'text\': \'Vacío. (Esta carta no tiene ningún color.)\\n{C}: El Zángano acechador obtiene +1/+2 hasta el final del turno. Activa esto solo una vez por turno. ({C} representa maná incoloro.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Zángano eldrazi\', \'flavor\': \'Los Eldrazi se fueron adaptando a las junglas de Zendikar. Algunos adoptaron las tácticas de otros predadores más conocidos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593053&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9bc74eaa-a41e-4216-a41a-4a34ddf8c94c\', \'multiverseId\': 593053}, \'multiverseid\': 593053}, {\'name\': \'Drone en chasse\', \'text\': "Carence (Cette carte n\'a pas de couleur.)\\n{C} : Le Drone en chasse gagne +1/+2 jusqu\'à la fin du tour. N\'activez qu\'une seule fois par tour. ({C} représente un mana incolore.)", \'type\': \'Créature : eldrazi et drone\', \'flavor\': "Tandis que les Eldrazi s\'adaptaient aux jungles de Zendikar, certains adoptèrent les tactiques de prédateurs plus familiers.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593174&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a129bbee-eb23-4601-94d7-5fcec80ade16\', \'multiverseId\': 593174}, \'multiverseid\': 593174}, {\'name\': \'Parassita in Agguato\', \'text\': \'Vacuità (Questa carta non ha colore.)\\n{C}: Il Parassita in Agguato prende +1/+2 fino alla fine del turno. Attiva solo una volta per turno. ({C} rappresenta mana incolore.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Parassita Eldrazi\', \'flavor\': \'Man mano che gli Eldrazi si adattavano alle giungle di Zendikar, alcuni appresero le tattiche di predatori più familiari.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593295&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'df377568-63c6-4f24-961a-fa042ae4642d\', \'multiverseId\': 593295}, \'multiverseid\': 593295}, {\'name\': \'忍び寄りドローン\', \'text\': \'欠色（このカードは無色である。）\\n{C}：ターン終了時まで、忍び寄りドローンは＋１/＋２の修整を受ける。毎ターン１回しか起動できない。（{C}は無色マナを表す。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルドラージ・ドローン\', \'flavor\': \'エルドラージの中には、ゼンディカーのジャングルに適応し、獣の行動を真似るものも現れた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593416&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4df8baa6-2eab-4439-9209-2796649f6edd\', \'multiverseId\': 593416}, \'multiverseid\': 593416}, {\'name\': \'潜行奴兽\', \'text\': \'虚色（此牌没有颜色。）\\n{C}：潜行奴兽得+1/+2直到回合结束。每回合只能起动一次。（{C}代表无色法术力。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～奥札奇／奴兽\', \'flavor\': \'随着对赞迪卡丛林的适应，一部分奥札奇采用了类似掠食者所用的策略。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593779&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5d54e567-9eb5-4a16-baea-5dd15e45f2b8\', \'multiverseId\': 593779}, \'multiverseid\': 593779}]', '[{\'name\': \'Plötzlicher Durchbruch\', \'text\': \'Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält +2/+0 und Erstschlag bis zum Ende des Zuges.\\nErzeuge einen Schatz-Spielstein. (Er ist ein Artefakt mit „{T}, opfere dieses Artefakt: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe.")\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Rootha schuf ständig und mit Leidenschaft Neues, in der Hoffnung, ihre größte Kritikerin zu beeindrucken: sich selbst.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590318&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a6a466fa-0f82-4291-bf3b-24b0922a4817\', \'multiverseId\': 590318}, \'multiverseid\': 590318}, {\'name\': \'Avance repentino\', \'text\': \'La criatura objetivo obtiene +2/+0 y gana la habilidad de dañar primero hasta el final del turno.\\nCrea una ficha de Tesoro. (Es un artefacto con "{T}, sacrificar este artefacto: Agrega un maná de cualquier color".)\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Rootha creaba sin parar y de forma apasionada, con la esperanza de impresionar a su mayor crítica: ella misma.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590453&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9edc6223-1d72-4700-b0c3-69a5ac32aae1\', \'multiverseId\': 590453}, \'multiverseid\': 590453}, {\'name\': \'Découverte soudaine\', \'text\': "Une créature ciblée gagne +2/+0 et acquiert l\'initiative jusqu\'à la fin du tour.\\nCréez un jeton Trésor. (C\'est un artefact avec « {T}, sacrifiez cet artefact : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix. »)", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "Rootha créait sans cesse, avec passion, dans l\'espoir d\'impressionner sa pire critique : elle-même.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590588&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bc528c4d-8989-49b5-bdca-3b214427859e\', \'multiverseId\': 590588}, \'multiverseid\': 590588}, {\'name\': \'Rivelazione Improvvisa\', \'text\': \'Una creatura bersaglio prende +2/+0 e ha attacco improvviso fino alla fine del turno.\\nCrea una pedina Tesoro. (È un artefatto con "{T}, Sacrifica questo artefatto: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore".)\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'Rootha creava costantemente, con passione, sperando di fare una buona impressione al suo critico più severo: se stessa.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590723&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'df436df3-8e49-4045-9de8-c80c6308a05f\', \'multiverseId\': 590723}, \'multiverseid\': 590723}, {\'name\': \'突然のひらめき\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは＋２/＋０の修整を受け先制攻撃を得る。\\n宝物・トークン１つを生成する。（それは、「{T}, このアーティファクトを生け贄に捧げる：好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。」を持つアーティファクトである。）\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'ルーサは常に情熱を持って創作を続けてきた。最大の批評家である自分を納得させることを目指して。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590858&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'969fca02-06e0-408d-9dbc-e9ed50e1b1ff\', \'multiverseId\': 590858}, \'multiverseid\': 590858}, {\'name\': \'突破进展\', \'text\': \'直到回合结束，目标生物得+2/+0且获得先攻异能。\\n派出一个珍宝衍生物。（它是具有「{T}，牺牲此神器：加一点任意颜色的法术力」的神器。）\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'如莎对每次创作都投入十二分的专注和热情，只为能让最挑剔她的批评家满意：她自己。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591263&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e21d4776-4501-4c23-8af6-6f1d3bb6cc79\', \'multiverseId\': 591263}, \'multiverseid\': 591263}]', '[{\'name\': \'Plötzliches Verlangen\', \'text\': \'Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält -2/-2 bis zum Ende des Zuges. Du erhältst 2 Lebenspunkte dazu.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Der Moment der Verdammung steht bevor. Das Zwielicht verschlingt die Welt und ich übergebe euch der ewigen Dunkelheit!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594101&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ad1b093f-798b-40d4-a4bf-e8fae5bb779e\', \'multiverseId\': 594101}, \'multiverseid\': 594101}, {\'name\': \'Momento de antojo\', \'text\': \'La criatura objetivo obtiene -2/-2 hasta el final del turno. Ganas 2 vidas.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Llegó el momento de la condenación. ¡El Crepúsculo invade el mundo y yo te sentencio a la oscuridad eterna!".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594218&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'67b89db0-73aa-4420-8a80-48715f524542\', \'multiverseId\': 594218}, \'multiverseid\': 594218}, {\'name\': "Instant d\'envie", \'text\': "Une créature ciblée gagne -2/-2 jusqu\'à la fin du tour. Vous gagnez 2 points de vie.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« L\'heure de la condamnation est proche. Le crépuscule s\'étend sur le monde, et je vous relègue dans les ténèbres éternelles ! »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594335&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b62c77af-5458-4103-b15c-3428034df4d2\', \'multiverseId\': 594335}, \'multiverseid\': 594335}, {\'name\': \'Momento di Bramosia\', \'text\': \'Una creatura bersaglio prende -2/-2 fino alla fine del turno. Guadagni 2 punti vita.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Il tempo del castigo è prossimo. Il Vespro pervaderà il mondo e sarete condannati all\\\'oscurità eterna!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594452&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'178a7b48-b2a5-4039-b003-ca73d22b570c\', \'multiverseId\': 594452}, \'multiverseid\': 594452}, {\'name\': \'渇望の時\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは－２/－２の修整を受ける。あなたは２点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「糾弾の時は目前。薄暮が世界を浄化する。お前は永遠の闇に落ちるがいい。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594569&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9dd283e6-0c7e-4bad-a74d-ab973ca89b87\', \'multiverseId\': 594569}, \'multiverseid\': 594569}, {\'name\': \'渴血之时\', \'text\': \'选择目标生物。该生物得-2/-2直到回合结束。你获得2点生命。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「惩戒之时就在眼前。暮影盖世，赐汝永眠！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594920&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'567945f6-d2d3-4747-bf45-9d53f5c992e7\', \'multiverseId\': 594920}, \'multiverseid\': 594920}]', '[{\'name\': \'Plündernder Raubdrache\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nWenn der Plündernde Raubdrache ins Spiel kommt, kannst du eine Karte abwerfen. Falls du dies tust, ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Drache\', \'flavor\': \'Du kannst ein hübsches Sümmchen verdienen, wenn du es schaffst, den herabfallenden Schätzen auszuweichen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589642&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b068f760-9d67-4049-9c8a-a4c9a720c012\', \'multiverseId\': 589642}, \'multiverseid\': 589642}, {\'name\': \'Depredador saqueador\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nCuando el Depredador saqueador entre al campo de batalla, puedes descartar una carta. Si lo haces, roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Dragón\', \'flavor\': \'Puedes hacerte con una fortuna considerable si consigues que no te aplasten las riquezas que se precipitan.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589693&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9170408e-eca0-418b-aac8-84e9ff02a8c4\', \'multiverseId\': 589693}, \'multiverseid\': 589693}, {\'name\': \'Prédateur pillard\', \'text\': "Vol\\nQuand le Prédateur pillard arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez vous défausser d\'une carte. Si vous faites ainsi, piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Créature : dragon\', \'flavor\': "Vous pouvez amasser une jolie fortune si vous pouvez éviter d\'être tué par un trésor tombé du ciel.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589744&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2fed65c5-900c-430c-b9d2-db6fa3e23204\', \'multiverseId\': 589744}, \'multiverseid\': 589744}, {\'name\': \'Predatore al Saccheggio\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nQuando il Predatore al Saccheggio entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi scartare una carta. Se lo fai, pesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Drago\', \'flavor\': \'Puoi racimolare un discreto gruzzolo se riesci a evitare di farti schiacciare dai tesori cadenti.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589795&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'791a6fa3-0fb5-43d7-bb69-bf06e207ef5c\', \'multiverseId\': 589795}, \'multiverseid\': 589795}, {\'name\': \'略奪する捕食者\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n略奪する捕食者が戦場に出たとき、あなたはカード１枚を捨ててもよい。そうしたなら、カード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ドラゴン\', \'flavor\': \'落下する宝物の打ちどころが悪くなければ、なかなかの富を手に入れることができる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589846&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1019b92c-6a84-4c0c-948f-5f1db772a228\', \'multiverseId\': 589846}, \'multiverseid\': 589846}, {\'name\': \'劫夺掠龙\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n当劫夺掠龙进战场时，你可以弃一张牌。若你如此作，则抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～龙\', \'flavor\': \'如果你没被落下的宝藏砸扁，或许就能够发上一笔横财。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589999&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4bb0e0f6-d542-4f9f-b6b5-f461a7debb94\', \'multiverseId\': 589999}, \'multiverseid\': 589999}]', '[{\'name\': \'Polyederarchiv\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}{C}.\\n{2}, {T}, opfere das Polyederarchiv: Ziehe zwei Karten.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'„Du beginnst, den wahren Zweck der Polyeder zu verstehen", sagte Ugin. „Die Eldrazi können eingesperrt werden."\\n„Wir wissen ja, wie gut es das letzte Mal funktioniert hat …", antwortete Jace trocken.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596278&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3feac7a8-bb03-4b79-9dc2-a62167a72ae2\', \'multiverseId\': 596278}, \'multiverseid\': 596278}, {\'name\': \'Edro de almacenaje\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {C}{C}.\\n{2}, {T}, sacrificar el Edro de almacenaje: Roba dos cartas.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'"Estás comenzando a entender el verdadero propósito de los edros", dijo Ugin. "Los Eldrazi pueden ser encerrados".\\n"¿Y qué tal funcionó el sistema la última vez?", preguntó Jace.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596365&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'da5229f9-2138-4a29-829b-66cdb34fdffd\', \'multiverseId\': 596365}, \'multiverseid\': 596365}, {\'name\': \'Archive hèdron\', \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez {C}{C}.\\n{2}, {T}, sacrifiez l\'Archive hèdron : Piochez deux cartes.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "« Tu commences à comprendre le véritable rôle des hèdrons, dit Ugin. Les Eldrazi peuvent être emprisonnés. »\\n« Et comment cela s\'est-il fini la dernière fois ? » demanda Jace.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596452&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5ad5bee9-82a6-4c99-80d0-b9ee5dde4300\', \'multiverseId\': 596452}, \'multiverseid\': 596452}, {\'name\': "Archivio nell\'Edro", \'text\': "{T}: Aggiungi {C}{C}.\\n{2}, {T}, Sacrifica l\'Archivio nell\'Edro: Pesca due carte.", \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'"Stai iniziando a comprendere la vera funzione degli edri," disse Ugin. "Gli Eldrazi possono essere imprigionati."\\n"E l\\\'ultima volta ha funzionato?" chiese Jace.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596539&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4a60f792-2c9b-4e9a-8f95-9b2bc828eccc\', \'multiverseId\': 596539}, \'multiverseid\': 596539}, {\'name\': \'面晶体の記録庫\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}{C}を加える。\\n{2},{T},面晶体の記録庫を生け贄に捧げる：カード２枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'ウギンは言った。「おぬしは面晶体の本来の目的を理解し始めておる。エルドラージを封じることができるのだ。」\\n「それで、前回はどうなったのですか？」ジェイスが訊いた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596626&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0ca540d8-5af7-480d-828b-a75e4195c1a4\', \'multiverseId\': 596626}, \'multiverseid\': 596626}, {\'name\': \'晶石档案\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{C}{C}。\\n{2}，{T}，牺牲晶石档案：抓两张牌。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'「你已经开始明白晶石真正的用途了，」乌金说。「我们可以将奥札奇禁锢起来。」\\n「那上一次是怎么做到的？」杰斯问道。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596887&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'68e860b5-31de-4e5f-9dd0-488b1360315b\', \'multiverseId\': 596887}, \'multiverseid\': 596887}]', '[{\'name\': \'Prahlender Korsar\', \'text\': \'Überfall — Der Prahlende Korsar kommt mit einer +1/+1-Marke ins Spiel, falls du in diesem Zug angegriffen hast.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Pirat\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich werde eine Berühmtheit aus dir machen. Von der Goldenen Stadt bis zum Hafen am Ende der Welt werden alle darüber reden, wie schnell du gestorben bist!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590319&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5e755eae-eb15-4cdf-b3a2-48dc9010b0b5\', \'multiverseId\': 590319}, \'multiverseid\': 590319}, {\'name\': \'Corsario bravucón\', \'text\': \'Incursión — El Corsario bravucón entra al campo de batalla con un contador +1/+1 sobre él si atacaste este turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Pirata humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Voy a concederte la fama. Desde la ciudad dorada a Zabordada, ¡todos hablarán de lo rápida que fue tu agonía!".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590454&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eb40ca05-358e-4861-b531-4e9bc556e7eb\', \'multiverseId\': 590454}, \'multiverseid\': 590454}, {\'name\': \'Corsaire bravache\', \'text\': \'Saccage — Le Corsaire bravache arrive sur le champ de bataille avec un marqueur +1/+1 sur lui si vous avez attaqué ce tour-ci.\', \'type\': \'Créature : humain et pirate\', \'flavor\': "« Je vais te rendre célèbre. De la cité d\'or à La Rade, tout le monde parlera de la vitesse à laquelle tu es mort ! »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590589&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b1397fc4-ef5a-42c8-9244-301c50069e52\', \'multiverseId\': 590589}, \'multiverseid\': 590589}, {\'name\': \'Corsaro Sbruffone\', \'text\': \'Incursione — Il Corsaro Sbruffone entra nel campo di battaglia con un segnalino +1/+1 se hai attaccato in questo turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Pirata Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Sto per fare di te una leggenda. Dalla città dorata fino alla Secca, tutti parleranno di quanto sia stata rapida la tua morte!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590724&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'83bdb4e8-10b3-4672-b9b5-ef8d7a64decb\', \'multiverseId\': 590724}, \'multiverseid\': 590724}, {\'name\': \'意気がった海賊\', \'text\': \'強襲 ― このターンにあなたが攻撃していたなら、意気がった海賊は＋１/＋１カウンター１個が置かれた状態で戦場に出る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・海賊\', \'flavor\': \'「お前を有名にしてやるよ。黄金都市でも孤高街でも噂になるぜ。お前がどれほどあっさり死んだかってな。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590859&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f36013f7-55df-4859-90b3-f83cda7bfe49\', \'multiverseId\': 590859}, \'multiverseid\': 590859}, {\'name\': \'神气海盗\', \'text\': \'突击～如果你本回合中攻击过，则神气海盗进战场时上面有一个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／海盗\', \'flavor\': \'「你就要出名了。从黄金城到绝涛城，大家都会津津乐道你倒下的速度！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591264&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2c6a7663-35ab-41b1-95b1-72793148b8ac\', \'multiverseId\': 591264}, \'multiverseid\': 591264}]', '[{\'name\': \'Preston der Verschwinder\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn eine andere Nichtspielsteinkreatur unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, und falls sie nicht gewirkt wurde, erzeuge einen Spielstein, der eine Kopie von ihr ist, außer dass er eine 0/1 weiße Illusion ist.\\n{1}{W}, opfere fünf Illusionen: Schicke eine bleibende Karte deiner Wahl, die kein Land ist, ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Kaninchen, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589613&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0eb15e2a-2c83-4bad-8855-be3d59c2e6d5\', \'multiverseId\': 589613}, \'multiverseid\': 589613}, {\'name\': \'Preston, el Desvanecedor\', \'text\': \'Siempre que otra criatura que no sea ficha entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, si no fue lanzada, crea una ficha que es una copia de esa criatura, excepto que es una Ilusión blanca 0/1.\\n{1}{W}, sacrificar cinco Ilusiones: Exilia el permanente objetivo que no sea tierra.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Hechicero conejo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589664&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'af3f76ce-6f66-4933-83e2-34241fd6e151\', \'multiverseId\': 589664}, \'multiverseid\': 589664}, {\'name\': "Preston, l\'escamoteur", \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'une autre créature non-jeton arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, si elle n\'a pas été lancée, créez un jeton qui en est une copie, excepté que c\'est une illusion 0/1 blanche.\\n{1}{W}, sacrifiez cinq illusions : Exilez un permanent non-terrain ciblé.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : lapin et sorcier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589715&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ba317c83-47a3-4177-b2d1-d6eb56be50d6\', \'multiverseId\': 589715}, \'multiverseid\': 589715}, {\'name\': \'Preston, lo Svanitore\', \'text\': "Ogniqualvolta un\'altra creatura non pedina entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, se non è stata lanciata, crea una pedina che è una copia di quella creatura, tranne che è un\'Illusione 0/1 bianca.\\n{1}{W}, Sacrifica cinque Illusioni: Esilia un permanente non terra bersaglio.", \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Mago Coniglio\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589766&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'da53218e-ba00-4944-ad36-d2ebdbb6391b\', \'multiverseId\': 589766}, \'multiverseid\': 589766}, {\'name\': \'消失師、プレストン\', \'text\': \'トークンでもこれでもないクリーチャー１体があなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、それが唱えられていなかった場合、それが白の０/１のイリュージョンであることを除き、そのクリーチャーのコピーであるトークン１つを生成する。\\n{1}{W},イリュージョン５体を生け贄に捧げる：土地でないパーマネント１つを対象とする。それを追放する。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 兎・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589817&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'53862936-4380-4e22-9501-3103b0ae33d8\', \'multiverseId\': 589817}, \'multiverseid\': 589817}, {\'name\': \'妙手空空摩技\', \'text\': \'每当另一个非衍生物的生物在你操控下进战场时，若它未经施放，则派出一个为该生物复制品的衍生物，但它是0/1白色虚影。\\n{1}{W}，牺牲五个虚影：放逐目标非地永久物。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～兔／法术师\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589970&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f8ec5c92-bc5f-4f2a-b41c-fdf0d62e28d9\', \'multiverseId\': 589970}, \'multiverseid\': 589970}]', '[{\'name\': \'Priester des Blutrituals\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Priester des Blutrituals ins Spiel kommt, erzeuge einen 5/5 schwarzen Dämon-Kreaturenspielstein mit Flugfähigkeit.\\nZu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments verlierst du 2 Lebenspunkte.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Kleriker\', \'flavor\': \'Einige würden alles geben, um nur einmal wahre Macht auszukosten.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594114&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7e61be19-96aa-47f1-b134-5530167316c3\', \'multiverseId\': 594114}, \'multiverseid\': 594114}, {\'name\': \'Sacerdote del rito sangriento\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Sacerdote del rito sangriento entre al campo de batalla, crea una ficha de criatura Demonio negra 5/5 con la habilidad de volar.\\nAl comienzo de tu mantenimiento, pierdes 2 vidas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Clérigo humano\', \'flavor\': \'Algunos lo sacrifican todo por un ínfimo atisbo de poder.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594231&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c438a3af-1710-4769-a15d-4f999ca46eb4\', \'multiverseId\': 594231}, \'multiverseid\': 594231}, {\'name\': \'Prêtre du sacre du sang\', \'text\': \'Quand le Prêtre du sacre du sang arrive sur le champ de bataille, créez un jeton de créature 5/5 noire Démon avec le vol.\\nAu début de votre entretien, vous perdez 2 points de vie.\', \'type\': \'Créature : humain et clerc\', \'flavor\': \'Certains sacrifieraient tout pour un simple avant-goût de puissance.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594348&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0a7a8354-a31a-4132-ad72-ecb3c7a2767b\', \'multiverseId\': 594348}, \'multiverseid\': 594348}, {\'name\': \'Sacerdote del Rito di Sangue\', \'text\': "Quando il Sacerdote del Rito di Sangue entra nel campo di battaglia, crea una pedina creatura Demone 5/5 nera con volare.\\nAll\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, perdi 2 punti vita.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Chierico Umano\', \'flavor\': \'Alcuni sacrificherebbero tutto per un mero assaggio di potere.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594465&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8f9e94bc-c8fe-46f4-b404-d431d1eb9bbb\', \'multiverseId\': 594465}, \'multiverseid\': 594465}, {\'name\': \'血の儀式の司祭\', \'text\': \'血の儀式の司祭が戦場に出たとき、飛行を持つ黒の５/５のデーモン・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\\nあなたのアップキープの開始時に、あなたは２点のライフを失う。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・クレリック\', \'flavor\': \'力を味わうためだけに、すべてを犠牲にする者もいる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594582&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a1371f76-e22c-466e-9213-1b6f7683be75\', \'multiverseId\': 594582}, \'multiverseid\': 594582}, {\'name\': \'血仪僧侣\', \'text\': \'当血仪僧侣进战场时，派出一个5/5黑色，具飞行异能的恶魔衍生生物。\\n在你的维持开始时，你失去2点生命。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／僧侣\', \'flavor\': \'有人愿意舍弃一切，只为品尝力量的滋味。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594933&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8feb786d-9d9c-4899-b129-b1ee131145b2\', \'multiverseId\': 594933}, \'multiverseid\': 594933}]', '[{\'name\': \'Professor für Kampfkunst\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nZu Beginn des Kampfes in deinem Zug erhält eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst, +1/+0 und Wachsamkeit bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vogel, Kleriker\', \'flavor\': \'„Welches Manöver führte Yovus aus, bevor sie an der Prantikelspitze niedergestreckt wurde? Weiß das jemand? Aus der Lektüre?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591573&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3e06ba62-03cd-4b27-9db6-1db150b9766a\', \'multiverseId\': 591573}, \'multiverseid\': 591573}, {\'name\': \'Profesor de combate\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nAl comienzo del combate en tu turno, la criatura objetivo que controlas obtiene +1/+0 y gana la habilidad de vigilancia hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Clérigo ave\', \'flavor\': \'"Antes de que liquidasen a Yovus en la cima del Pránticle, ¿qué movimiento realizó? ¿Alguien lo sabe? Está en el texto".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591702&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c857e74d-4099-4eb5-b7ef-59e9adda419c\', \'multiverseId\': 591702}, \'multiverseid\': 591702}, {\'name\': \'Professeur de combat\', \'text\': "Vol\\nAu début du combat pendant votre tour, une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez gagne +1/+0 et acquiert la vigilance jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : oiseau et clerc\', \'flavor\': "« Avant que Yovus ne soit abattue au Pic de Pranticle, quelle manœuvre a-t-elle effectué ? Personne ? Vous n\'avez pas lu vos manuels ? »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591831&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2d2caf97-bb6c-48cb-9fde-0deeb602290d\', \'multiverseId\': 591831}, \'multiverseid\': 591831}, {\'name\': \'Professore di Combattimento\', \'text\': "Volare\\nAll\'inizio del combattimento nel tuo turno, una creatura bersaglio che controlli prende +1/+0 e ha cautela fino alla fine del turno.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Chierico Uccello\', \'flavor\': \'"Prima di essere abbattuta a Picco Pranico, che mossa ha eseguito Yovus? Nessuno? Dal libro?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591960&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cedaa7ec-6cec-4f7b-bbe9-49e40d70871d\', \'multiverseId\': 591960}, \'multiverseid\': 591960}, {\'name\': \'戦闘学の教授\', \'text\': \'飛行\\nあなたのターンの戦闘の開始時に、あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは＋１/＋０の修整を受け警戒を得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 鳥・クレリック\', \'flavor\': \'「ヨーヴァスが、プランティクル峠で斬られる直前に使った戦型は？誰か分かる者？読んでないのか？」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592089&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'11546316-81d9-430d-94f3-8a61a3a4086c\', \'multiverseId\': 592089}, \'multiverseid\': 592089}, {\'name\': \'战斗教授\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n在你回合的战斗开始时，直到回合结束，目标由你操控的生物得+1/+0且获得警戒异能。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～鸟／僧侣\', \'flavor\': \'「尤娲在潘迪科峰上被砍倒之前，她使出的是哪一招？谁来回答一下？书里写过喔。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592476&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'140d7eee-f32b-4646-aaca-80e9c7ab5727\', \'multiverseId\': 592476}, \'multiverseid\': 592476}]', '[{\'name\': \'Profi-Gesichtsbrecherin\', \'text\': \'Bedrohlich\\nImmer wenn eine oder mehrere Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügen, erzeuge einen Schatz-Spielstein. (Er ist ein Artefakt mit „{T}, opfere dieses Artefakt: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe.")\\nOpfere einen Schatz: Schicke die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek ins Exil. Du kannst sie in diesem Zug spielen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Krieger\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590289&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a07a804b-7e4d-4d54-bcf5-86855d60aed4\', \'multiverseId\': 590289}, \'multiverseid\': 590289}, {\'name\': \'Rompecaras profesional\', \'text\': \'Amenaza.\\nSiempre que una o más criaturas que controlas hagan daño de combate a un jugador, crea una ficha de Tesoro. (Es un artefacto con "{T}, sacrificar este artefacto: Agrega un maná de cualquier color".)\\nSacrificar un Tesoro: Exilia la primera carta de tu biblioteca. Puedes jugar esa carta este turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590424&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'402534b7-2ef7-4ab4-a910-c5b500bfef76\', \'multiverseId\': 590424}, \'multiverseid\': 590424}, {\'name\': \'Casseuse de figure professionnelle\', \'text\': "Menace\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'au moins une créature que vous contrôlez inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, créez un jeton Trésor. (C\'est un artefact avec « {T}, sacrifiez cet artefact : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix. »)\\nSacrifiez un trésor : Exilez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Vous pouvez jouer cette carte ce tour-ci.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et guerrier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590559&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6f5e865e-1116-4fdf-853d-fa7244c64431\', \'multiverseId\': 590559}, \'multiverseid\': 590559}, {\'name\': \'Spaccagrugni Professionista\', \'text\': \'Minacciare\\nOgniqualvolta una o più creature che controlli infliggono danno da combattimento a un giocatore, crei una pedina Tesoro. (È un artefatto con "{T}, Sacrifica questo artefatto: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore".)\\nSacrifica un Tesoro: Esilia la prima carta del tuo grimorio. Puoi giocare quella carta in questo turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590694&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'22b31f63-c916-4c14-9230-92f9f0f6ef8d\', \'multiverseId\': 590694}, \'multiverseid\': 590694}, {\'name\': \'顔壊しのプロ\', \'text\': \'威迫\\nあなたがコントロールしている１体以上のクリーチャーがプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、宝物・トークン１つを生成する。（それは、「{T},このアーティファクトを生け贄に捧げる：好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。」を持つアーティファクトである。）\\n宝物１つを生け贄に捧げる：あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード１枚を追放する。このターン、あなたはそのカードをプレイしてもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・戦士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590829&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2dfcb694-38e6-44e2-b181-f0fa78551c05\', \'multiverseId\': 590829}, \'multiverseid\': 590829}, {\'name\': \'破相好手\', \'text\': \'威慑\\n每当由你操控的一个或数个生物对任一牌手造成战斗伤害时，派出一个珍宝衍生物。（它是具有「{T}，牺牲此神器：加一点任意颜色的法术力」的神器。）\\n牺牲一个珍宝：放逐你的牌库顶牌。本回合中，你可以使用该牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／战士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591234&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a70b8831-236e-4c4f-8af0-89affa2a5a06\', \'multiverseId\': 591234}, \'multiverseid\': 591234}]', '[{\'name\': \'Prophezeiende Fee\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nWenn die Prophezeiende Fee ins Spiel kommt, wende Hellsicht 2 an. (Schaue dir die obersten zwei Karten deiner Bibliothek an. Du kannst eine beliebige Anzahl davon unter deine Bibliothek legen und den Rest in beliebiger Reihenfolge oben darauf.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Feenwesen, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595221&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bfae7471-77a7-4ac4-a46b-b4396156d260\', \'multiverseId\': 595221}, \'multiverseid\': 595221}, {\'name\': \'Vidente hada\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nCuando el Vidente hada entre al campo de batalla, adivina 2. (Mira las dos primeras cartas de tu biblioteca, luego pon cualquier cantidad de ellas en el fondo de tu biblioteca y el resto en la parte superior en cualquier orden.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero hada\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595329&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5f4f9096-e2fe-407c-8390-8d99a727203b\', \'multiverseId\': 595329}, \'multiverseid\': 595329}, {\'name\': \'Voyant faerie\', \'text\': "Vol\\nQuand le Voyant faerie arrive sur le champ de bataille, regard 2. (Regardez les deux cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Mettez n\'importe quel nombre d\'entre elles au-dessous de votre bibliothèque et le reste, au-dessus, dans l\'ordre de votre choix.)", \'type\': \'Créature : peuple fée et sorcier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595437&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'630ecda3-41e4-409f-b8bd-6ad3af6b20a3\', \'multiverseId\': 595437}, \'multiverseid\': 595437}, {\'name\': \'Spiritello Veggente\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nQuando lo Spiritello Veggente entra nel campo di battaglia, profetizza 2. (Guarda le prime due carte del tuo grimorio, poi mettine un qualsiasi numero in fondo al tuo grimorio e le altre in cima in qualsiasi ordine.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Mago Spiritello\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595545&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bf1b0d75-5556-447c-9be5-1aa2fc43149f\', \'multiverseId\': 595545}, \'multiverseid\': 595545}, {\'name\': \'フェアリーの予見者\', \'text\': \'飛行\\nフェアリーの予見者が戦場に出たとき、占術２を行う。（あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード２枚を見て、そのうちの望む枚数をあなたのライブラリーの一番下に、残りを一番上に、それぞれ望む順番で置く。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — フェアリー・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595653&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b93ccd1a-be38-452d-b240-feb5577b92fe\', \'multiverseId\': 595653}, \'multiverseid\': 595653}, {\'name\': \'仙灵预言师\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n当仙灵预言师进战场时，占卜2。（检视你牌库顶的两张牌，然后将其中任意数量的牌以任意顺序置于你牌库底，其余则以任意顺序置于你牌库顶。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～仙灵／法术师\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595977&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9c86d381-c25e-4321-8cb1-24c08727e55b\', \'multiverseId\': 595977}, \'multiverseid\': 595977}]', '[{\'name\': \'Präsenz des Titanen\', \'text\': \'Zeige als zusätzliche Kosten, um diesen Zauberspruch zu wirken, eine farblose Kreaturenkarte aus deiner Hand offen vor.\\nSchicke eine Kreatur deiner Wahl ins Exil, falls ihre Stärke kleiner oder gleich der Stärke der vorgezeigten Karte ist.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Alles, was Ulamog zurücklässt, sind Staub und Erinnerungen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596253&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8650365b-89e8-426a-80de-13b38bfdfd62\', \'multiverseId\': 596253}, \'multiverseid\': 596253}, {\'name\': \'Presencia del titán\', \'text\': \'Como coste adicional para lanzar este hechizo, muestra una carta de criatura incolora de tu mano.\\nExilia la criatura objetivo si su fuerza es menor o igual a la fuerza de la carta mostrada.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Polvo y recuerdos son todo lo que queda al paso de Ulamog.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596340&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b47e655c-6b88-489a-82d3-3164bced02b4\', \'multiverseId\': 596340}, \'multiverseid\': 596340}, {\'name\': \'Présence du titan\', \'text\': \'En tant que coût supplémentaire pour lancer ce sort, révélez une carte de créature incolore de votre main.\\nExilez une créature ciblée si sa force est inférieure ou égale à celle de la carte révélée.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "Seuls la poussière et les souvenirs subsistent après le passage d\'Ulamog.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596427&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'81766379-7a98-4993-8ad2-7811353682e5\', \'multiverseId\': 596427}, \'multiverseid\': 596427}, {\'name\': \'Presenza del Titano\', \'text\': \'Come costo addizionale per lanciare questa magia, rivela una carta creatura incolore dalla tua mano.\\nEsilia una creatura bersaglio se la sua forza è pari o inferiore alla forza della carta rivelata.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'Polvere e ricordi sono le uniche cose che Ulamog lascia al suo passaggio.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596514&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a02f1e77-cdd7-4d1e-9c39-a53d1ff6e068\', \'multiverseId\': 596514}, \'multiverseid\': 596514}, {\'name\': \'タイタンの存在\', \'text\': \'この呪文を唱えるための追加コストとして、あなたの手札にある無色のクリーチャー・カード１枚を公開する。\\nクリーチャー１体を対象とする。それのパワーが公開したカードのパワー以下なら、それを追放する。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'ウラモグの通った跡に残るのは、塵と思い出だけである。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596601&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dd538ec9-1f83-4e3e-b169-c2ad76ea3daf\', \'multiverseId\': 596601}, \'multiverseid\': 596601}, {\'name\': \'巨物现身\', \'text\': \'从你手上展示一张无色生物牌，以作为施放此咒语的额外费用。\\n如果目标生物的力量等于或小于所展示之牌的力量，则放逐该生物。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'钨拉莫沿途只留下了尘土和回忆。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596862&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'54f0029d-b1a8-4c5a-8ace-60f97110660d\', \'multiverseId\': 596862}, \'multiverseid\': 596862}]', '[{\'name\': \'Prüfung der Nylea\', \'text\': \'Verzaubert eine Kreatur\\nImmer wenn die verzauberte Kreatur angreift, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf sie. Falls dann drei oder mehr +1/+1-Marken auf ihr liegen, opfere die Prüfung der Nylea.\\nWenn du die Prüfung der Nylea opferst, durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach bis zu zwei Standardland-Karten, bringe sie getappt ins Spiel und mische danach.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592898&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'21cf1d09-6fc1-49a6-a8dd-9a399648414f\', \'multiverseId\': 592898}, \'multiverseid\': 592898}, {\'name\': \'Ordalía de Nylea\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura.\\nSiempre que la criatura encantada ataque, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre ella. Luego, si tiene tres o más contadores +1/+1 sobre ella, sacrifica la Ordalía de Nylea.\\nCuando sacrifiques la Ordalía de Nylea, busca en tu biblioteca hasta dos cartas de tierra básica, ponlas en el campo de batalla giradas y luego baraja.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593019&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ab6bfd91-f26c-49e4-b95a-162bc6b5fc36\', \'multiverseId\': 593019}, \'multiverseid\': 593019}, {\'name\': \'Épreuve de Nyléa\', \'text\': "Enchanter : créature\\nÀ chaque fois que la créature enchantée attaque, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur elle. Ensuite, si elle a au moins trois marqueurs +1/+1 sur elle, sacrifiez l\'Épreuve de Nyléa.\\nQuand vous sacrifiez l\'Épreuve de Nyléa, cherchez dans votre bibliothèque jusqu\'à deux cartes de terrain de base, mettez-les sur le champ de bataille engagées, puis mélangez.", \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593140&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'42a32f94-f333-465b-8c6c-b3fc37a7826e\', \'multiverseId\': 593140}, \'multiverseid\': 593140}, {\'name\': \'Ordalia di Nylea\', \'text\': "Incanta creatura\\nOgniqualvolta la creatura incantata attacca, metti un segnalino +1/+1 su di essa. Poi, se ha tre o più segnalini +1/+1, sacrifica l\'Ordalia di Nylea.\\nQuando sacrifichi l\'Ordalia di Nylea, passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per trovare fino a due carte terra base, mettile sul campo di battaglia TAPpate, poi rimescola.", \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593261&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e2f7b977-1db3-48b3-934e-b1dc8bbd1b97\', \'multiverseId\': 593261}, \'multiverseid\': 593261}, {\'name\': \'ナイレアの試練\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\nエンチャントしているクリーチャーが攻撃するたび、それの上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。その後、それの上に３個以上の＋１/＋１カウンターが置かれているなら、ナイレアの試練を生け贄に捧げる。\\nあなたがナイレアの試練を生け贄に捧げたとき、あなたのライブラリーから基本土地・カード最大２枚を探し、タップ状態で戦場に出す。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593382&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a4373c38-4384-4f9d-be22-ce198717efd3\', \'multiverseId\': 593382}, \'multiverseid\': 593382}, {\'name\': \'倪勒娅的试炼\', \'text\': \'结附于生物\\n每当所结附的生物攻击时，在其上放置一个+1/+1指示物。然后若其上有三个或更多+1/+1指示物，则牺牲倪勒娅的试炼。\\n当你牺牲倪勒娅的试炼时，从你牌库中搜寻至多两张基本地牌，将它们横置放进战场，然后洗牌。\', \'type\': \'结界 ～灵气\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593745&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f48f5d14-e635-47ae-a4e3-dbd00426ec8b\', \'multiverseId\': 593745}, \'multiverseid\': 593745}]', '[{\'name\': \'Prüfung des Purphoros\', \'text\': \'Verzaubert eine Kreatur\\nImmer wenn die verzauberte Kreatur angreift, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf sie. Falls dann drei oder mehr +1/+1-Marken auf ihr liegen, opfere die Prüfung des Purphoros.\\nWenn du die Prüfung des Purphoros opferst, fügt sie einem Ziel deiner Wahl 3 Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590285&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f7ff7c0e-6ca8-4c01-b148-e3d5478e187f\', \'multiverseId\': 590285}, \'multiverseid\': 590285}, {\'name\': \'Ordalía de Purforos\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura.\\nSiempre que la criatura encantada ataque, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre ella. Luego, si tiene tres o más contadores +1/+1 sobre ella, sacrifica la Ordalía de Purforos.\\nCuando sacrifiques la Ordalía de Purforos, hace 3 puntos de daño a cualquier objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590420&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'487d0ac8-eb2a-48f8-b274-ef4ca00e404c\', \'multiverseId\': 590420}, \'multiverseid\': 590420}, {\'name\': \'Épreuve de Purphoros\', \'text\': "Enchanter : créature\\nÀ chaque fois que la créature enchantée attaque, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur elle. Ensuite, si elle a au moins trois marqueurs +1/+1 sur elle, sacrifiez l\'Épreuve de Purphoros.\\nQuand vous sacrifiez l\'Épreuve de Purphoros, elle inflige 3 blessures à n\'importe quelle cible.", \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590555&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e47768bb-fbb8-4e81-9802-025726357fba\', \'multiverseId\': 590555}, \'multiverseid\': 590555}, {\'name\': \'Ordalia di Purforos\', \'text\': "Incanta creatura\\nOgniqualvolta la creatura incantata attacca, metti un segnalino +1/+1 su di essa. Poi, se ha tre o più segnalini +1/+1, sacrifica l\'Ordalia di Purforos.\\nQuando sacrifichi l\'Ordalia di Purforos, infligge 3 danni a un qualsiasi bersaglio.", \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590690&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'968ab9dd-f476-474b-8f34-2ac77cac345a\', \'multiverseId\': 590690}, \'multiverseid\': 590690}, {\'name\': \'パーフォロスの試練\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\nエンチャントしているクリーチャーが攻撃するたび、それの上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。その後、それの上に３個以上の＋１/＋１カウンターがあるなら、パーフォロスの試練を生け贄に捧げる。\\nあなたがパーフォロスの試練を生け贄に捧げたとき、クリーチャーやプレインズウォーカーやプレイヤーのうち１つを対象とする。これはそれに３点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590825&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9d9eb6ef-c5b1-4615-a4cb-2595b8799b34\', \'multiverseId\': 590825}, \'multiverseid\': 590825}, {\'name\': \'普罗烽斯的试炼\', \'text\': \'结附于生物\\n每当所结附的生物攻击时，在其上放置一个+1/+1指示物。然后如果该生物上有三个或更多+1/+1指示物，则牺牲普罗烽斯的试炼。\\n当你牺牲普罗烽斯的试炼时，它对任意一个目标造成3点伤害。\', \'type\': \'结界 ～灵气\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591230&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c2c62854-25bd-4a5f-b4f8-f166161e913e\', \'multiverseId\': 591230}, \'multiverseid\': 591230}]', '[{\'name\': \'Psychosenkrabbler\', \'text\': \'Stärke und Widerstandskraft des Psychosenkrabblers sind gleich der Anzahl an Karten auf deiner Hand.\\nImmer wenn du eine Karte ziehst, verliert jeder Gegner 1 Lebenspunkt.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Phyrexianer, Schrecken\', \'flavor\': \'„Falls dieses Gehirn nicht das Geheimnis des Serums entschlüsseln kann, dann füge noch mehr Gehirn dazu."\\n—Rhmir, Hand des Augurs\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596296&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'676ceb47-f0db-4e76-9416-c6aefeb4e778\', \'multiverseId\': 596296}, \'multiverseid\': 596296}, {\'name\': \'Rondador de psicosis\', \'text\': \'Tanto la fuerza como la resistencia del Rondador de psicosis son iguales a la cantidad de cartas en tu mano.\\nSiempre que robes una carta, cada oponente pierde 1 vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Horror pirexiano\', \'flavor\': \'"Si ese cerebro no puede descubrir el secreto del suero, entonces agreguen más cerebros".\\n—Rhmir, Mano de los presagios\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596383&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'22accacd-e777-41d3-8062-b8618d834870\', \'multiverseId\': 596383}, \'multiverseid\': 596383}, {\'name\': \'Rampeur psychotique\', \'text\': "La force et l\'endurance du Rampeur psychotique sont chacune égales au nombre de cartes dans votre main.\\nÀ chaque fois que vous piochez une carte, chaque adversaire perd 1 point de vie.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : phyrexian et horreur\', \'flavor\': "« Si ce cerveau est incapable de découvrir le secret du sérum, ajoutez-en quelques-uns de plus. »\\n—Rhmir, Main de l\'Augure", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596470&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5bb25de0-7bd3-47f9-83a0-66d02c560e33\', \'multiverseId\': 596470}, \'multiverseid\': 596470}, {\'name\': \'Psicosi Strisciante\', \'text\': \'La forza e la costituzione della Psicosi Strisciante sono pari al numero di carte nella tua mano.\\nOgniqualvolta peschi una carta, ogni avversario perde 1 punto vita.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Orrore Phyrexiano\', \'flavor\': \'"Se quel cervello non riesce a capire il segreto del siero, allora aggiungi altro cervello."\\n—Rhmir, Mano dell\\\'Augure\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596557&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a67742f8-c58b-4a88-8433-71f6ec3459bf\', \'multiverseId\': 596557}, \'multiverseid\': 596557}, {\'name\': \'精神の病を這うもの\', \'text\': \'精神の病を這うもののパワーとタフネスは、それぞれあなたの手札にあるカードの枚数に等しい。\\nあなたがカード１枚を引くたび、各対戦相手はそれぞれ１点のライフを失う。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — ファイレクシアン・ホラー\', \'flavor\': \'「その脳で血清の秘密が探れぬなら、もっと脳を足してやれ。」\\n――卜占の手、ルミーア\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596644&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'debe34fe-db5f-409a-8980-19c958591cef\', \'multiverseId\': 596644}, \'multiverseid\': 596644}, {\'name\': \'变态爬虫\', \'text\': \'变态爬虫的力量和防御力各等同于你的手牌数量。\\n每当你抓一张牌时，每位对手各失去1点生命。\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～非瑞人／惊惧兽\', \'flavor\': \'「如果那脑子无法理解浆液的秘密，就多加几个脑子。」\\n～卜算手信众卢米\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596905&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6cf50733-df6e-44d1-b3e6-a82a12bebad3\', \'multiverseId\': 596905}, \'multiverseid\': 596905}]', '[{\'name\': \'Quälende Stimme\', \'text\': \'Wirf als zusätzliche Kosten, um diesen Zauberspruch zu wirken, eine Karte ab.\\nZiehe zwei Karten.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Unwillkommene Gedanken drängen sich in meinem Kopf. Sind das die Ausgeburten meines eigenen Wahns oder das Flüstern eines Anderen?"\\n—Sarkhan Vol\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590323&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b960a469-4cf0-4ad8-b3f0-a1b511ffa316\', \'multiverseId\': 590323}, \'multiverseid\': 590323}, {\'name\': \'Voz del tormento\', \'text\': \'Como coste adicional para lanzar este hechizo, descarta una carta.\\nRoba dos cartas.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"En mi mente se agolpan pensamientos no deseados. ¿Son fruto de mi propia locura, o solo son los susurros de la de otro?".\\n—Sarkhan Vol\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590458&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'17509c45-4783-48c5-ab41-1d9e58f63c9b\', \'multiverseId\': 590458}, \'multiverseid\': 590458}, {\'name\': \'Voix lancinante\', \'text\': "En tant que coût supplémentaire pour lancer ce sort, défaussez-vous d\'une carte.\\nPiochez deux cartes.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« Des pensées inopportunes m\'emplissent l\'esprit. Sont-elles le reflet de ma propre folie, ou les murmures d\'une autre ? »\\n—Sarkhan Vol", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590593&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'44dfd2ae-9b72-4268-ab29-283eaaebcce5\', \'multiverseId\': 590593}, \'multiverseid\': 590593}, {\'name\': \'Voce Torturante\', \'text\': \'Come costo addizionale per lanciare questa magia, scarta una carta.\\nPesca due carte.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Pensieri molesti affollano la mia mente. Sono il frutto della mia stessa follia o i sussurri di un estraneo?"\\n—Sarkhan Vol\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590728&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3ab57510-c0cb-46ed-96b5-45e57530f1ff\', \'multiverseId\': 590728}, \'multiverseid\': 590728}, {\'name\': \'苦しめる声\', \'text\': \'この呪文を唱えるための追加コストとして、カード１枚を捨てる。\\nカード２枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「不愉快な思考が私の精神を圧迫する。これは私の狂気によるものなのか、それとも誰か別の者の囁きなのか？」\\n――サルカン・ヴォル\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590863&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'87ece6ec-8fdd-4c61-b92e-a10cc381cab2\', \'multiverseId\': 590863}, \'multiverseid\': 590863}, {\'name\': \'折磨幽声\', \'text\': \'弃一张牌，以作为施放此咒语的额外费用。\\n抓两张牌。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「讨厌的想法在我脑海中挥之不去。这是我自己的疯狂，还是他者的细语？」\\n～萨坎沃\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591268&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e8e484ae-ea43-45ea-bd2e-eebd84288251\', \'multiverseId\': 591268}, \'multiverseid\': 591268}]', '[{\'name\': \'Rankengeflecht\', \'text\': \'Verursacht Trampelschaden\\n{1}{G}: Bis zum Ende des Zuges hat eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst, Basis-Stärke und -Widerstandskraft 5/5 und verursacht Trampelschaden.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Pflanze, Elementarwesen\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich habe die Verwüstung gesehen, als die Juggernauten die Mauern von An Karras zerschmetterten. Das hat mir zu denken gegeben."\\n—Janji, Walddruide\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592842&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f318ca9b-cb9d-4f5b-89f5-ebcaa07bb42c\', \'multiverseId\': 592842}, \'multiverseid\': 592842}, {\'name\': \'Trepador imponente\', \'text\': \'Arrolla.\\n{1}{G}: Hasta el final del turno, la criatura objetivo que controlas tiene una fuerza y resistencia base de 5/5 y gana la habilidad de arrollar.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elemental planta\', \'flavor\': \'"Vi la devastación cuando los destructores derribaron los muros de An Karras. Aquello me hizo pensar".\\n—Janji, druida silvano\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592963&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fe497e7e-99ea-4831-adf6-7870d35d1552\', \'multiverseId\': 592963}, \'multiverseid\': 592963}, {\'name\': \'Exovigne\', \'text\': "Piétinement\\n{1}{G} : Jusqu\'à la fin du tour, une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez a une force et une endurance de base de 5/5 et acquiert le piétinement.", \'type\': \'Créature : plante et élémental\', \'flavor\': "« J\'ai vu la dévastation à l\'œuvre quand les djaggernauts ont défoncé les murailles d\'An Karras. Cela m\'a donné matière à réfléchir. »\\n—Janji, druide sylvestre", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593084&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ecde9fc1-f1bc-4ddf-bdb3-efeeffa92824\', \'multiverseId\': 593084}, \'multiverseid\': 593084}, {\'name\': \'Colosso Rampicante\', \'text\': \'Travolgere\\n{1}{G}: Fino alla fine del turno, una creatura bersaglio che controlli ha forza e costituzione base 5/5 e travolgere.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Elementale Pianta\', \'flavor\': \'"Ho visto la devastazione provocata dai juggernaut che sfondavano le mura di An Karras. È così che mi è venuta l\\\'idea."\\n—Janji, druido silvano\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593205&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b0442d99-31a8-4aba-86de-d4880feb2a2e\', \'multiverseId\': 593205}, \'multiverseid\': 593205}, {\'name\': \'忍び寄る大蔦\', \'text\': \'トランプル\\n{1}{G}：あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは基本のパワーとタフネスが５/５になりトランプルを得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 植物・エレメンタル\', \'flavor\': \'「私は、巨大戦車がアン・カラスの壁を破壊した時にもたらされた荒廃を目の当たりにした。そこでいろいろ考えてみた。」\\n――森のドルイド、ジャンジ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593326&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d82b20d1-fdfb-46ed-bf75-feba411969ca\', \'multiverseId\': 593326}, \'multiverseid\': 593326}, {\'name\': \'匍行巨蔓\', \'text\': \'践踏\\n{1}{G}：直到回合结束，目标由你操控的生物之基础力量与防御力为5/5且获得践踏异能。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～植物／元素\', \'flavor\': \'「我曾亲眼目睹攻城巨车攻破安喀拉城墙的毁灭情景。我不由得开始思考。」\\n～森林德鲁伊晏基\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593689&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1c529723-078f-458f-bae8-ac2c3c960c36\', \'multiverseId\': 593689}, \'multiverseid\': 593689}]', '[{\'name\': \'Rasantes Wachstum\', \'text\': \'Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Standardland-Karte, bringe sie ins Spiel und mische danach. Bis zum Ende des Zuges wird das Land zu einer 4/3 Insekt-Kreatur mit Reichweite und Eile. Es ist immer noch ein Land.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Als sie das Haus auf Ungeziefer untersuchen ließen, dachten sie nicht groß genug.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589648&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'96f5a716-5142-4a0b-ae97-fc1532e29c58\', \'multiverseId\': 589648}, \'multiverseid\': 589648}, {\'name\': \'Crecimiento devastador\', \'text\': \'Busca en tu biblioteca una carta de tierra básica, ponla en el campo de batalla y luego baraja. Hasta el final del turno, esa tierra se convierte en una criatura Insecto 4/3 con las habilidades de alcance y prisa. Sigue siendo una tierra.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Cuando registraron la casa en busca de insectos, no pensaron a lo grande.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589699&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'be3d0b08-8a98-44a9-9130-73427a43004b\', \'multiverseId\': 589699}, \'multiverseid\': 589699}, {\'name\': \'Croissance effrénée\', \'text\': "Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte de terrain de base, mettez-la sur le champ de bataille, puis mélangez. Jusqu\'à la fin du tour, ce terrain devient une créature 4/3 Insecte avec la portée et la célérité. C\'est toujours un terrain.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "Quand ils firent inspecter la maison pour vérifier la présence d\'insectes, ils n\'avaient pas vu assez grand.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589750&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e0458006-86fe-4593-96fd-0fb847740820\', \'multiverseId\': 589750}, \'multiverseid\': 589750}, {\'name\': \'Crescita Scatenata\', \'text\': \'Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta terra base, mettila sul campo di battaglia, poi rimescola. Fino alla fine del turno, quella terra diventa una creatura Insetto 4/3 con raggiungere e rapidità. È ancora una terra.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'Quando controllarono se la casa fosse infestata dagli insetti, non pensarono abbastanza in grande.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589801&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9f7212f2-0886-4e6c-9fbc-d1ebe811f319\', \'multiverseId\': 589801}, \'multiverseid\': 589801}, {\'name\': \'猛り狂う成長\', \'text\': \'あなたのライブラリーから基本土地・カード１枚を探し、戦場に出す。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。ターン終了時まで、その土地は到達と速攻を持つ４/３の昆虫・クリーチャーになる。それは土地でもある。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'害虫駆除で家を点検したときは、事の重大さを過小評価していた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589852&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f03c76e3-8603-4480-9e24-b005bb514741\', \'multiverseId\': 589852}, \'multiverseid\': 589852}, {\'name\': \'莽闯成长\', \'text\': \'从你牌库中搜寻一张基本地牌，将之放进战场，然后洗牌。直到回合结束，该地成为4/3，具延势与敏捷异能的昆虫生物。它仍然是地。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'当他们为房屋除虫时，没想过事情会搞成这么大。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590005&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9d52862f-4a75-4ddc-b465-f197d1675837\', \'multiverseId\': 590005}, \'multiverseid\': 590005}]', '[{\'name\': \'Raubkopie\', \'text\': \'Du kannst die Raubkopie als eine Kopie einer beliebigen Kreatur im Spiel ins Spiel kommen lassen, außer dass sie zusätzlich zu ihren anderen Typen ein Pirat ist und „Immer wenn diese Kreatur oder eine andere Kreatur mit demselben Namen einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, ziehst du eine Karte" hat.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Gestaltwandler, Pirat\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589621&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'10580521-b89e-42ff-a889-f9dc50300e02\', \'multiverseId\': 589621}, \'multiverseid\': 589621}, {\'name\': \'Copia pirata\', \'text\': \'Puedes hacer que la Copia pirata entre al campo de batalla como una copia de cualquier criatura en el campo de batalla, excepto que es un Pirata además de sus otros tipos y tiene "Siempre que esta criatura u otra criatura con el mismo nombre haga daño de combate a un jugador, robas una carta".\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Pirata metamorfo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589672&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f877f9b5-8a67-41e4-acfc-05131897ac81\', \'multiverseId\': 589672}, \'multiverseid\': 589672}, {\'name\': \'Copie pirate\', \'text\': "Vous pouvez faire que la Copie pirate arrive sur le champ de bataille comme une copie de n\'importe quelle créature sur le champ de bataille, excepté que c\'est un pirate en plus de ses autres types et qu\'elle a « À chaque fois que cette créature ou une autre créature du même nom inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, vous piochez une carte. »", \'type\': \'Créature : changeforme et pirate\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589723&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'23accceb-82ff-4f15-93fa-8f23626cb50c\', \'multiverseId\': 589723}, \'multiverseid\': 589723}, {\'name\': \'Copia Pirata\', \'text\': \'Puoi far entrare la Copia Pirata nel campo di battaglia come una copia di qualsiasi creatura sul campo di battaglia, tranne che è un Pirata in aggiunta ai suoi altri tipi e ha "Ogniqualvolta questa creatura o un\\\'altra creatura con lo stesso nome infligge danno da combattimento a un giocatore, peschi una carta".\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Pirata Polimorfo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589774&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9f7b53a9-4a37-4197-8f0d-e975a68f9e9c\', \'multiverseId\': 589774}, \'multiverseid\': 589774}, {\'name\': \'海賊の写し\', \'text\': \'あなたは、海賊の写しを、それの他のタイプに加えて海賊であり「このクリーチャーやこれと同じ名前を持ちこれでないクリーチャー１体がプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、あなたはカード１枚を引く。」を持つことを除き、戦場にあるクリーチャー１体のコピーとして戦場に出してもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 多相の戦士・海賊\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589825&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'277c4b8d-65a0-44d3-b469-11b7bc2c1b57\', \'multiverseId\': 589825}, \'multiverseid\': 589825}, {\'name\': \'剽窃复体\', \'text\': \'你可以使剽窃复体当成战场上任一生物的复制品来进入战场，但它额外具有海盗此类别，且具有「每当此生物或另一个与之同名的生物对任一牌手造成战斗伤害时，你抓一张牌。」\', \'type\': \'生物 ～变形兽／海盗\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589978&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cfe1b3b0-e258-413f-9ab0-270c2ca55106\', \'multiverseId\': 589978}, \'multiverseid\': 589978}]', '[{\'name\': \'Rechtschaffene Walküre\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nImmer wenn ein anderer Engel oder Kleriker unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, erhältst du Lebenspunkte in Höhe der Widerstandskraft jener Kreatur dazu.\\nSolange du mindestens 7 Lebenspunkte mehr als deine Startlebenspunktezahl hast, erhalten Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, +2/+2.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Engel, Kleriker\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591640&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5c558685-2d83-4cd0-a7c7-8bc1d91d6746\', \'multiverseId\': 591640}, \'multiverseid\': 591640}, {\'name\': \'Valkiria justa\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nSiempre que otro Ángel o Clérigo entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, ganas una cantidad de vidas igual a la resistencia de esa criatura.\\nMientras tengas al menos 7 vidas más que tu total de vidas inicial, las criaturas que controlas obtienen +2/+2.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Clérigo ángel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591769&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b0bc93e7-3b5e-48b9-a3dc-86da26c18590\', \'multiverseId\': 591769}, \'multiverseid\': 591769}, {\'name\': \'Valkyrie juste\', \'text\': "Vol\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'un autre ange ou clerc arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, vous gagnez un nombre de points de vie égal à l\'endurance de cette créature.\\nTant que vous avez au moins 7 points de vie de plus que votre total de points de vie de départ, les créatures que vous contrôlez gagnent +2/+2.", \'type\': \'Créature : ange et clerc\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591898&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c2a6568d-6c21-426b-acde-d700052fd49a\', \'multiverseId\': 591898}, \'multiverseid\': 591898}, {\'name\': \'Valchiria Virtuosa\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nOgniqualvolta un altro Angelo o Chierico entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, guadagni punti vita pari alla costituzione di quella creatura.\\nFintanto che hai almeno 7 punti vita in più rispetto ai tuoi punti vita iniziali, le creature che controlli prendono +2/+2.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Chierico Angelo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592027&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'22522edc-0e04-4863-9731-22a6b0ce8e98\', \'multiverseId\': 592027}, \'multiverseid\': 592027}, {\'name\': \'正義の戦乙女\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n天使やクレリックのうちこれでない１体があなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、あなたはそのクリーチャーのタフネスに等しい点数のライフを得る。\\nあなたのライフ総量が初期ライフ総量よりも７点以上多いかぎり、あなたがコントロールしているすべてのクリーチャーは＋２/＋２の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 天使・クレリック\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592156&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'15ccb3e5-0dc2-4e09-a4e8-6990de382f05\', \'multiverseId\': 592156}, \'multiverseid\': 592156}, {\'name\': \'正气女武神\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n每当另一个天使或僧侣在你的操控下进战场时，你获得等同于该生物防御力的生命。\\n只要你的总生命比你的起始总生命至少多7点，由你操控的生物便得+2/+2。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～天使／僧侣\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592543&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cc978263-afd8-47b2-94ea-8bb29d013598\', \'multiverseId\': 592543}, \'multiverseid\': 592543}]', '[{\'name\': \'Rechtschaffenheit\', \'text\': \'Eine blockende Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält +7/+7 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Manchmal ist die Überzeugungskraft die größte Kraft.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591641&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8a279458-710a-4f3e-9e6d-81b425ab2bfb\', \'multiverseId\': 591641}, \'multiverseid\': 591641}, {\'name\': \'Rectitud\', \'text\': \'La criatura bloqueadora objetivo obtiene +7/+7 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'A veces la mayor fuerza es la fuerza de la convicción.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591770&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f818588c-2324-499b-8ea3-05e6d261e5f5\', \'multiverseId\': 591770}, \'multiverseid\': 591770}, {\'name\': \'Droiture\', \'text\': "Une créature bloqueuse ciblée gagne +7/+7 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« Dieu donne à la franchise, à la fidélité, à la droiture un accent qui ne peut être ni contrefait, ni méconnu. »\\n—Joseph, comte de Maistre\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591899&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'33377f55-1e34-4c74-a0f0-e390e4faad9e\', \'multiverseId\': 591899}, \'multiverseid\': 591899}, {\'name\': \'Rettitudine\', \'text\': \'Una creatura bloccante bersaglio prende +7/+7 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'A volte la forza più grande è la forza del convincimento.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592028&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f81bca71-8f80-48e8-a5dc-845233457265\', \'multiverseId\': 592028}, \'multiverseid\': 592028}, {\'name\': \'高潔のあかし\', \'text\': \'ブロック・クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは＋７/＋７の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'信じる力が最も強い力となることもある。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592157&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1c493f28-3bf7-43fe-9734-52bdd32f93db\', \'multiverseId\': 592157}, \'multiverseid\': 592157}, {\'name\': \'正气\', \'text\': \'目标进行阻挡的生物得+7/+7直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'有时候，最强大的力量便是信念之力。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592544&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c01f7dc9-9517-44d3-992d-5502cbf420cc\', \'multiverseId\': 592544}, \'multiverseid\': 592544}]', '[{\'name\': \'Reißende Klauen\', \'text\': \'Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält Doppelschlag bis zum Ende des Zuges.\\nUmwandlung {2} ({2}, wirf diese Karte ab: Ziehe eine Karte.)\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Wie viele Klauen ein Monster hat? Genau eine mehr, als du erwartet hättest."\\n—Alux, Himmelstadt-Verteidiger\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590292&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2f891435-5e24-4adf-afeb-4093fd3a3628\', \'multiverseId\': 590292}, \'multiverseid\': 590292}, {\'name\': \'Zarpas desgarradoras\', \'text\': \'La criatura objetivo gana la habilidad de dañar dos veces hasta el final del turno.\\nCiclo {2}. ({2}, descartar esta carta: Roba una carta.)\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"¿Cuántas garras tiene un monstruo? Exactamente una más de las que has tenido en cuenta".\\n—Álux, defensor de Puertoaéreo\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590427&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'75ee1c1e-88cd-489a-a10b-848099eb060d\', \'multiverseId\': 590427}, \'multiverseid\': 590427}, {\'name\': \'Griffes ratissantes\', \'text\': "Une créature ciblée acquiert la double initiative jusqu\'à la fin du tour.\\nRecyclage {2} ({2}, défaussez-vous de cette carte : Piochez une carte.)", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« Combien de griffes un monstre possède-t-il ? Exactement une de plus que vous ne le pensiez. »\\n—Alux, défenseur de Vogueciel\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590562&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4082a5e2-dbba-4dcb-b973-d264a4badf97\', \'multiverseId\': 590562}, \'multiverseid\': 590562}, {\'name\': \'Artigli Laceranti\', \'text\': \'Una creatura bersaglio ha doppio attacco fino alla fine del turno.\\nCiclo {2} ({2}, Scarta questa carta: Pesca una carta.)\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Quanti artigli ha un mostro? Esattamente uno in più di quanti ne avevi messi in conto."\\n—Alux, difensore della Solcanembi\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590697&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d033c626-c796-425c-90eb-d64e9103b324\', \'multiverseId\': 590697}, \'multiverseid\': 590697}, {\'name\': \'ひっかく鉤爪\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは二段攻撃を得る。\\nサイクリング{2}（{2}, このカードを捨てる：カード１枚を引く。）\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「怪物には鉤爪が何本あるのかって？対処できた数よりもちょうど一本多いのさ。」\\n――スカイセイルの防衛者、アルックス\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590832&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0f26aabc-c4e3-4932-bede-4d10e5779f33\', \'multiverseId\': 590832}, \'multiverseid\': 590832}, {\'name\': \'利爪掠击\', \'text\': \'目标生物获得连击异能直到回合结束。\\n循环{2}（{2}，弃掉此牌：抓一张牌。）\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「怪兽会有几只爪？总比你想的多一只。」\\n～翔空城护卫亚卢斯\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591237&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8c5987be-525d-40fd-8e50-0ae89215a22a\', \'multiverseId\': 591237}, \'multiverseid\': 591237}]', '[{\'name\': \'Rennerin des Kruphix\', \'text\': \'Die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek ist offen.\\nDu kannst Länder oben von deiner Bibliothek spielen.\\nImmer wenn ein Land unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, erhältst du 1 Lebenspunkt dazu.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberungskreatur — Zentaur\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592840&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ea63a561-10c4-4964-8adf-9c740bd019f1\', \'multiverseId\': 592840}, \'multiverseid\': 592840}, {\'name\': \'Cazadora de Krufix\', \'text\': \'Juega mostrando la primera carta de tu biblioteca.\\nPuedes jugar tierras desde la parte superior de tu biblioteca.\\nSiempre que una tierra entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, ganas 1 vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura encantamiento — Centauro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592961&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c6f96283-f271-476c-8f3f-b9876da49d7b\', \'multiverseId\': 592961}, \'multiverseid\': 592961}, {\'name\': \'Coursière de Kruphix\', \'text\': "Jouez avec la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque révélée.\\nVous pouvez jouer les terrains depuis le dessus de votre bibliothèque.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'un terrain arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, vous gagnez 1 point de vie.", \'type\': \'Créature-enchantement : centaure\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593082&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'281b388e-e7ff-4329-be1d-7b6ebb3b5911\', \'multiverseId\': 593082}, \'multiverseid\': 593082}, {\'name\': \'Corsiera di Krufix\', \'text\': \'Gioca con la prima carta del tuo grimorio rivelata.\\nPuoi giocare terre dalla cima del tuo grimorio.\\nOgniqualvolta una terra entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, guadagni 1 punto vita.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Incantesimo — Centauro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593203&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ba6e9035-1e72-4c10-8b3b-c5f080368155\', \'multiverseId\': 593203}, \'multiverseid\': 593203}, {\'name\': \'クルフィックスの狩猟者\', \'text\': \'あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード１枚を公開したままプレイする。\\nあなたはあなたのライブラリーの一番上から土地をプレイしてもよい。\\n土地１つがあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、あなたは１点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー・エンチャント — ケンタウルス\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593324&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dd7cc390-f8df-498b-9831-b39c9dedeaac\', \'multiverseId\': 593324}, \'multiverseid\': 593324}, {\'name\': \'克罗芬斯的骏马\', \'text\': \'你以展示牌库顶牌的方式进行游戏。\\n你可以从你的牌库顶使用地。\\n每当一个地在你的操控下进战场时，你获得1点生命。\', \'type\': \'结界生物 ～半人马\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593687&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c7b333d3-de1e-4d3e-b6d8-0215ed3b9d22\', \'multiverseId\': 593687}, \'multiverseid\': 593687}]', '[{\'name\': \'Reptilische Spiegelung\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du eine Karte umwandelst, kannst du die Reptilische Spiegelung bis zum Ende des Zuges zusätzlich zu ihren anderen Typen zu einer 5/4 Dinosaurier-Kreatur werden lassen, die Eile hat und Trampelschaden verursacht.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'Die Gefahr lauert oft in der Anziehungskraft von Kristallsplittern.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590296&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'904b5404-e2b9-4aeb-a8e1-f12c60d2e8d6\', \'multiverseId\': 590296}, \'multiverseid\': 590296}, {\'name\': \'Reflejo reptiliano\', \'text\': \'Siempre que actives una habilidad de ciclo de una carta, puedes hacer que el Reflejo reptiliano se convierta en una criatura Dinosaurio 5/4 con las habilidades de arrollar y prisa además de sus otros tipos hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'A menudo, el peligro acecha en la fascinación que provocan los fragmentos de cristal.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590431&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'34a4a1eb-942d-4293-ada1-11b51f4a1c73\', \'multiverseId\': 590431}, \'multiverseid\': 590431}, {\'name\': \'Reflet reptilien\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que vous recyclez une carte, vous pouvez faire que le Reflet reptilien devienne une créature 5/4 Dinosaure avec le piétinement et la célérité en plus de ses autres types jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': \'La beauté des éclats de cristaux cache souvent de nombreux dangers.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590566&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fea6a633-3c21-4d40-b706-4a9b3086ed8f\', \'multiverseId\': 590566}, \'multiverseid\': 590566}, {\'name\': \'Riflesso Rettile\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta cicli una carta, puoi far diventare il Riflesso Rettile una creatura Dinosauro 5/4 con travolgere e rapidità in aggiunta ai suoi altri tipi fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'Spesso il pericolo si nasconde nel fascino dei frammenti di cristallo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590701&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eb796a00-0d6b-4604-b32b-4fd3f1fae247\', \'multiverseId\': 590701}, \'multiverseid\': 590701}, {\'name\': \'爬虫類の反射\', \'text\': \'あなたがカードをサイクリングするたび、あなたは「ターン終了時まで、爬虫類の反射は基本のパワーとタフネスが５/４で、トランプルと速攻を持ち、これの他のタイプに加えて恐竜・クリーチャーになる。」を選んでもよい。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'水晶の破片には、しばしば危険が潜んでいる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590836&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'df399a8e-3d5d-46f9-aeac-1ca6f07514fa\', \'multiverseId\': 590836}, \'multiverseid\': 590836}, {\'name\': \'爬虫映影\', \'text\': \'每当你循环一张牌时，你可以使爬虫映影成为5/4，具践踏与敏捷异能的恐龙生物直到回合结束，且仍具有原本类别。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'危险往往就藏在水晶碎片的诱惑之中。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591241&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0a37469b-92bd-4a03-ab47-c47b5b1100f8\', \'multiverseId\': 591241}, \'multiverseid\': 591241}]', '[{\'name\': \'Rhonas der Unbezwingbare\', \'text\': \'Todesberührung, Unzerstörbar\\nRhonas der Unbezwingbare kann nicht angreifen oder blocken, es sei denn, du kontrollierst eine andere Kreatur mit Stärke 4 oder mehr.\\n{2}{G}: Eine andere Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält +2/+0 und verursacht Trampelschaden bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Gott\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592918&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5c804464-b305-4978-b7d7-523e9e79f8ad\', \'multiverseId\': 592918}, \'multiverseid\': 592918}, {\'name\': \'Rhonas, el Indómito\', \'text\': \'Toque mortal, indestructible.\\nRhonas, el Indómito no puede atacar ni bloquear a menos que controles otra criatura con fuerza de 4 o más.\\n{2}{G}: Otra criatura objetivo obtiene +2/+0 y gana la habilidad de arrollar hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Deidad\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593039&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0a82c419-7063-4b2d-8b6f-230d03cc4b3e\', \'multiverseId\': 593039}, \'multiverseid\': 593039}, {\'name\': "Rhonas l\'Indomptable", \'text\': "Contact mortel, indestructible\\nRhonas l\'Indomptable ne peut ni attaquer ni bloquer à moins que vous ne contrôliez une autre créature de force supérieure ou égale à 4.\\n{2}{G} : Une autre créature ciblée gagne +2/+0 et acquiert le piétinement jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : dieu\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593160&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d3c47a26-5322-4350-b865-924e0517d413\', \'multiverseId\': 593160}, \'multiverseid\': 593160}, {\'name\': "Rhonas l\'Indomabile", \'text\': "Tocco letale, indistruttibile\\nRhonas l\'Indomabile non può attaccare o bloccare a meno che tu non controlli un\'altra creatura con forza pari o superiore a 4.\\n{2}{G}: Un\'altra creatura bersaglio prende +2/+0 e ha travolgere fino alla fine del turno.", \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Dio\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593281&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b0f4d908-86ed-4a35-a194-1e886c27e87e\', \'multiverseId\': 593281}, \'multiverseid\': 593281}, {\'name\': \'不屈の神ロナス\', \'text\': \'接死、破壊不能\\nあなたがパワーが４以上でありこれでないクリーチャーをコントロールしていないかぎり、不屈の神ロナスでは攻撃もブロックもできない。\\n{2}{G}：これでないクリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは＋２/＋０の修整を受けトランプルを得る。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 神\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593402&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'55f2ae8b-1fea-4933-a843-a808f3e1b276\', \'multiverseId\': 593402}, \'multiverseid\': 593402}, {\'name\': \'无畏神罗纳斯\', \'text\': \'死触，不灭\\n除非你操控另一个力量等于或大于4的生物，否则无畏神罗纳斯不能进行攻击或阻挡。\\n{2}{G}：直到回合结束，另一个目标生物得+2/+0且获得践踏异能。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～神\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593765&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6e6d251e-93b9-4eb0-866b-81c8e0444c8f\', \'multiverseId\': 593765}, \'multiverseid\': 593765}]', '[{\'name\': \'Rhystisches Studium\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn ein Gegner einen Zauberspruch wirkt, kannst du eine Karte ziehen, es sei denn, jener Spieler bezahlt {1}.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich bringe dir die Leylinien-Paratrigonometrie bei, kein Problem. Aber du musst mir zeigen, wie man dieses feurige, wirbelnde Ding macht."\\n—Zimone, an Rootha\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597521&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'40f4819d-104f-4770-9522-6a46404d2ccc\', \'multiverseId\': 597521}, \'multiverseid\': 597521}, {\'name\': \'Estudio rístico\', \'text\': \'Siempre que un oponente lance un hechizo, puedes robar una carta a menos que ese jugador pague {1}.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'"De acuerdo, te enseñaré paratrigonometría de la línea mística, pero a cambio tienes que mostrarme cómo haces el torbellino de fuego ese".\\n—Zimone, a Rootha\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597546&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'30ee8640-81b3-4036-8d77-bdff18c35b70\', \'multiverseId\': 597546}, \'multiverseid\': 597546}, {\'name\': \'Étude rhystique\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'un adversaire lance un sort, vous pouvez piocher une carte à moins que ce joueur ne paie {1}.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': "« Je peux t\'apprendre la paratrigonométrie des lignes ley, sans problème. Mais en échange, tu devras me montrer comment faire cette espèce de spirale de feu. »\\n—Zimone, à Rootha", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597571&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a42f55c5-b542-4fd9-bcf4-116ade4e51ec\', \'multiverseId\': 597571}, \'multiverseid\': 597571}, {\'name\': \'Studio Ristico\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta un avversario lancia una magia, puoi pescare una carta a meno che quel giocatore non paghi {1}.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'"Ti insegnerò la paratrigonometria delle leyline, certo. Ma tu devi mostrarmi come fare quella cosa turbinante di fuoco."\\n—Zimone a Rootha\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597596&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6ff16cbb-d782-430b-aae9-8b7c453acdd1\', \'multiverseId\': 597596}, \'multiverseid\': 597596}, {\'name\': \'リスティックの研究\', \'text\': \'対戦相手が呪文を唱えるたび、そのプレイヤーが{1}を支払わないかぎり、あなたはカード１枚を引いてもよい。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'「公理的力線錯三角法なら教えてあげる。それは任せて。そのかわり、さっきの炎の渦巻きのやり方を教えてよ。」\\n――ジモーンから、ルーサへ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597621&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'09bc4ab8-510a-4b8d-9526-ab9950aec2e6\', \'multiverseId\': 597621}, \'multiverseid\': 597621}, {\'name\': \'琉晶研究\', \'text\': \'每当任一对手施放咒语时，除非该牌手支付{1}，否则你可以抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'「没问题，我可以教你地脉对三角学。但你得告诉我怎么画出那道火热涡旋。」\\n～琦梦答应如莎\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597696&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'77132caa-e8ab-4007-9936-891458e86f2f\', \'multiverseId\': 597696}, \'multiverseid\': 597696}]', '[{\'name\': \'Riesenmarienkäfer\', \'text\': \'Reichweite\\nWenn der Riesenmarienkäfer ins Spiel kommt, kannst du deine Bibliothek nach einer Standardland-Karte durchsuchen, sie offen vorzeigen, danach mischen und sie oben darauflegen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Insekt\', \'flavor\': \'Es bringt Unglück, auf einen zu treten, aber es bringt noch mehr Unglück, wenn er auf dich tritt.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589644&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'96731615-6152-4244-bb36-65c52f795a66\', \'multiverseId\': 589644}, \'multiverseid\': 589644}, {\'name\': \'Mariquita gigante\', \'text\': \'Alcance.\\nCuando la Mariquita gigante entre al campo de batalla, puedes buscar en tu biblioteca una carta de tierra básica, mostrarla, barajar y poner esa carta en la parte superior.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Insecto\', \'flavor\': \'Pisar una da mala suerte, pero peor suerte da que te pise una a ti.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589695&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6215726d-27c5-40d0-a9f6-96682fd91a96\', \'multiverseId\': 589695}, \'multiverseid\': 589695}, {\'name\': \'Coccinelle géante\', \'text\': \'Portée\\nQuand la Coccinelle géante arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez chercher dans votre bibliothèque une carte de terrain de base, la révéler, puis mélanger et mettre cette carte au-dessus de votre bibliothèque.\', \'type\': \'Créature : insecte\', \'flavor\': "En écraser une porte malheur, mais c\'est encore pire si c\'est elle qui vous écrase.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589746&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6f8b636a-7070-4512-b96d-9edc1c462f61\', \'multiverseId\': 589746}, \'multiverseid\': 589746}, {\'name\': \'Coccinella Gigante\', \'text\': \'Raggiungere\\nQuando la Coccinella Gigante entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi passare in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta terra base, rivelarla, poi rimescolare e mettere quella carta in cima.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Insetto\', \'flavor\': \'Schiacciarne una porta sfortuna, ma è peggio se è lei a schiacciare te.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589797&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2248d3c7-b72b-48cf-8eba-ed2c547af267\', \'multiverseId\': 589797}, \'multiverseid\': 589797}, {\'name\': \'巨大テントウムシ\', \'text\': \'到達\\n巨大テントウムシが戦場に出たとき、あなたは「あなたのライブラリーから基本土地・カード１枚を探し、公開する。その後、ライブラリーを切り直し、そのカードをその一番上に置く。」を選んでもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 昆虫\', \'flavor\': \'それを踏んだら不幸になるが、それに踏まれたらより不幸になる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589848&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2776820f-7635-44e8-9a18-62a10a50fcb7\', \'multiverseId\': 589848}, \'multiverseid\': 589848}, {\'name\': \'巨型瓢虫\', \'text\': \'延势\\n当巨型瓢虫进战场时，你可以从你牌库中搜寻一张基本地牌，展示该牌，然后洗牌，并将该牌置于牌库顶。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～昆虫\', \'flavor\': \'虽然踩到它算倒霉，但它踩到你就更倒霉。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590001&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d985f265-bd16-44c5-9327-bc214d5d70bd\', \'multiverseId\': 590001}, \'multiverseid\': 590001}]', '[{\'name\': \'Riesenochse\', \'text\': \'Der Riesenochse verwendet beim Bemannen von Fahrzeugen seine Widerstandskraft anstatt seiner Stärke.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Ochse\', \'flavor\': \'„Wie stark er ist? Nun, ich habe einmal die Kontrolle über den Pflug verloren, und er hat eine Furche durch mein Haus gezogen! Dabei ist er nicht einmal langsamer geworden."\\n—Guldir, Beskir-Farmer\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591594&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fa79ad2d-3ca4-441e-b1df-e181d1b2317f\', \'multiverseId\': 591594}, \'multiverseid\': 591594}, {\'name\': \'Buey gigantesco\', \'text\': \'El Buey gigantesco tripula Vehículos usando su resistencia en vez de su fuerza.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Buey\', \'flavor\': \'"¿Que cómo es de fuerte? ¡Pues una vez perdí el control del arado e hizo un surco por mi casa! Ni siquiera lo frenó un poco".\\n—Gúldir, granjero beskir\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591723&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'05f1cc07-03b4-4971-b4bb-27d403f0a928\', \'multiverseId\': 591723}, \'multiverseid\': 591723}, {\'name\': \'Buffle géant\', \'text\': \'Le Buffle géant pilote des véhicules en utilisant son endurance à la place de sa force.\', \'type\': \'Créature : bovidé\', \'flavor\': "« Est-ce qu\'il a de la force ? Eh bien, un jour, j\'ai perdu le contrôle de la charrue, et il a creusé un sillon à travers ma maison ! Il n\'a même pas ralenti. »\\n—Guldir, fermier beskir", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591852&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9362febf-5a31-41ce-83d6-feba0113d920\', \'multiverseId\': 591852}, \'multiverseid\': 591852}, {\'name\': \'Bue Gigante\', \'text\': \'Il Bue Gigante manovra Veicoli usando la sua costituzione invece che la sua forza.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Bue\', \'flavor\': \'"Quanto è forte? Beh, una volta persi il controllo dell\\\'aratro e lui scavò un solco attraversando casa mia da parte a parte! Non rallentò nemmeno."\\n—Guldir, agricoltore Beskir\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591981&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'95c855d0-d021-4a36-9400-b4dcca0969b9\', \'multiverseId\': 591981}, \'multiverseid\': 591981}, {\'name\': \'巨大雄牛\', \'text\': \'巨大雄牛は、パワーではなくタフネスを用いて機体に搭乗する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 雄牛\', \'flavor\': \'「どれくらい強いかって？そうさな。耕機をつけたまま抑えられなくなったときは、そのまま家を突き抜けちまった！それでも歩みが遅くなることはなかったよ。」\\n――ベスキールの農夫、ガルディール\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592110&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'542fd334-4013-4788-94ed-604c4e2cfa2b\', \'multiverseId\': 592110}, \'multiverseid\': 592110}, {\'name\': \'巨牛\', \'text\': \'巨牛利用其防御力来搭载载具，而不是力量。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～牛\', \'flavor\': \'「他有多强壮？有一次我没管住犁头，他就硬生生地在我房子中间挖了条沟过去！一点都没有慢下来。」\\n～贝斯奇农夫古迪尔\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592497&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c45da78d-b335-4b8a-bd84-de1b14f6ada5\', \'multiverseId\': 592497}, \'multiverseid\': 592497}]', '[{\'name\': \'Riesenraupe\', \'text\': \'{G}, opfere die Riesenraupe: Erzeuge zu Beginn des nächsten Endsegments einen 1/1 grünen Insekt-Kreaturenspielstein mit Flugfähigkeit namens Schmetterling.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Insekt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592865&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e815735b-a523-46fa-8910-58820499a739\', \'multiverseId\': 592865}, \'multiverseid\': 592865}, {\'name\': \'Oruga gigante\', \'text\': \'{G}, sacrificar la Oruga gigante: Crea una ficha de criatura Insecto verde 1/1 con la habilidad de volar llamada Mariposa al comienzo del próximo paso final.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Insecto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592986&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0d842631-50ca-4e25-922d-d45196734fa4\', \'multiverseId\': 592986}, \'multiverseid\': 592986}, {\'name\': \'Chenille géante\', \'text\': \'{G}, sacrifiez la Chenille géante : Créez un jeton de créature 1/1 verte Insecte avec le vol appelé Papillon au début de la prochaine étape de fin.\', \'type\': \'Créature : insecte\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593107&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8c7e4afe-465b-496a-a9d5-50a72b550bcb\', \'multiverseId\': 593107}, \'multiverseid\': 593107}, {\'name\': \'Bruco Gigante\', \'text\': "{G}, Sacrifica il Bruco Gigante: Crea una pedina creatura Insetto 1/1 verde con volare chiamata Farfalla all\'inizio della prossima sottofase finale.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Insetto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593228&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'df11dbaa-b229-43a1-b89e-9d01b49a7bba\', \'multiverseId\': 593228}, \'multiverseid\': 593228}, {\'name\': \'大イモムシ\', \'text\': \'{G},大イモムシを生け贄に捧げる：次の終了ステップの開始時に、「蝶」という名前で飛行を持つ緑の１/１の昆虫・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 昆虫\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593349&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'db3e53ed-5ce1-4a07-9f89-741777d59514\', \'multiverseId\': 593349}, \'multiverseid\': 593349}, {\'name\': \'巨型毛虫\', \'text\': \'{G}，牺牲巨型毛虫：在下一个结束步骤开始时，派出一个1/1绿色，名称为蝴蝶，具飞行异能的昆虫衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～昆虫\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593712&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'73e93cf3-3b3a-4bdb-95df-2f236536e2af\', \'multiverseId\': 593712}, \'multiverseid\': 593712}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ritterliche Kavallerie\', \'text\': \'Wachsamkeit\\nWenn die Ritterliche Kavallerie ins Spiel kommt, erzeuge einen 2/2 weißen Ritter-Kreaturenspielstein mit Wachsamkeit.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Ritter\', \'flavor\': \'„Unsere Pflicht endet nicht an unseren Grenzen."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591592&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9b798092-7b24-45a9-a29e-9012eedf633c\', \'multiverseId\': 591592}, \'multiverseid\': 591592}, {\'name\': \'Caballería intrépida\', \'text\': \'Vigilancia.\\nCuando la Caballería intrépida entre al campo de batalla, crea una ficha de criatura Caballero blanca 2/2 con la habilidad de vigilancia.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Caballero humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Nuestro deber no se ciñe a lo que está dentro de nuestras fronteras".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591721&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'637b4344-fa72-4eb1-b536-cedea17cd990\', \'multiverseId\': 591721}, \'multiverseid\': 591721}, {\'name\': \'Cavalerie vaillante\', \'text\': \'Vigilance\\nQuand la Cavalerie vaillante arrive sur le champ de bataille, créez un jeton de créature 2/2 blanche Chevalier avec la vigilance.\', \'type\': \'Créature : humain et chevalier\', \'flavor\': "« Notre devoir ne s\'arrête pas à nos frontières. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591850&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e79b962f-3155-4d9d-8997-f588a9d92796\', \'multiverseId\': 591850}, \'multiverseid\': 591850}, {\'name\': \'Cavalleria Intrepida\', \'text\': \'Cautela\\nQuando la Cavalleria Intrepida entra nel campo di battaglia, crea una pedina creatura Cavaliere 2/2 bianca con cautela.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Cavaliere Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"I nostri doveri non conoscono frontiere."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591979&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e9d9da97-389a-4198-92d4-2b232cba797b\', \'multiverseId\': 591979}, \'multiverseid\': 591979}, {\'name\': \'凛々しい騎兵隊\', \'text\': \'警戒\\n凛々しい騎兵隊が戦場に出たとき、警戒を持つ白の２/２の騎士・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・騎士\', \'flavor\': \'「我々の任務は国境で止まらない。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592108&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'881d9ee7-29a7-4311-842c-8aee170d3092\', \'multiverseId\': 592108}, \'multiverseid\': 592108}, {\'name\': \'华铠骑兵\', \'text\': \'警戒\\n当华铠骑兵进战场时，派出一个2/2白色，具警戒异能的骑士衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／骑士\', \'flavor\': \'「我们的职责不只是守卫边境。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592495&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'78f39115-9e5a-446b-a654-7a2d685414d3\', \'multiverseId\': 592495}, \'multiverseid\': 592495}]', '[{\'name\': \'Robuster Spulkäfer\', \'text\': \'{4}{B}: Bringe den Robusten Spulkäfer aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurück.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Insekt\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich habe gesehen, wie sie Lava, Getrampel und das Verdauungssystem eines Molochs überlebt haben. Sie rollen sich einfach wieder auseinander und leben weiter!"\\n—Gannet, Himmelstadt-Zoologe\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594065&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dbd1abc7-bb59-496a-bf08-0105390a08c1\', \'multiverseId\': 594065}, \'multiverseid\': 594065}, {\'name\': \'Bichobola resistente\', \'text\': \'{4}{B}: Regresa el Bichobola resistente de tu cementerio a tu mano.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Insecto\', \'flavor\': \'"Los he visto sobrevivir a la lava, a los pisotones y al sistema digestivo de un moloc. ¡Simplemente, ruedan y siguen con sus vidas!".\\n—Gánet, zoólogo de Puertoaéreo\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594182&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'19730d6e-d8cb-4382-9c4b-4f40cf848100\', \'multiverseId\': 594182}, \'multiverseid\': 594182}, {\'name\': \'Sphérapode durable\', \'text\': \'{4}{B} : Renvoyez le Sphérapode durable depuis votre cimetière dans votre main.\', \'type\': \'Créature : insecte\', \'flavor\': "« Je les ai vus survivre à la lave, aux piétinements et à l\'estomac d\'un diable cornu. Ils en ressortent et continuent comme si de rien n\'était ! »\\n—Gannet, zoologue de Vogueciel", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594299&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'30bc1668-cf22-4735-8d18-149e19fd6a8a\', \'multiverseId\': 594299}, \'multiverseid\': 594299}, {\'name\': \'Appallottero Resistente\', \'text\': "{4}{B}: Riprendi in mano l\'Appallottero Resistente dal tuo cimitero.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Insetto\', \'flavor\': \'"Li ho visti sopravvivere alla lava, a zampe che li calpestavano e al sistema digerente di un moloc. Si srotolano come se niente fosse e vanno avanti con la loro vita!"\\n—Gannet, zoologo della Solcanembi\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594416&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4b357537-2d31-4e98-a0c8-b70f4869493e\', \'multiverseId\': 594416}, \'multiverseid\': 594416}, {\'name\': \'頑丈なダンゴムシ\', \'text\': \'{4}{B}：あなたの墓地にある頑丈なダンゴムシをあなたの手札に戻す。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 昆虫\', \'flavor\': \'「こいつらはたとえ溶岩の中でも、踏みつけられても、モロクの胃に入っても生き残るんだ。ただ転がり出てきて前向きに生きていくのさ！」\\n――スカイセイルの動物学者、ガネット\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594533&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'72198743-30d1-4999-a4a6-c83fcb44292e\', \'multiverseId\': 594533}, \'multiverseid\': 594533}, {\'name\': \'硬壳蜷曲虫\', \'text\': \'{4}{B}：将硬壳蜷曲虫从你的坟墓场移回你手上。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～昆虫\', \'flavor\': \'「我曾见过它们活过熔岩、踩踏，甚至是棘蜥的肠胃。它们就这么滚出来，安然无恙地活下去！」\\n～翔空城动物学家加涅特\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594884&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a7eea8cb-29c1-4d99-b692-68cc7b5f0158\', \'multiverseId\': 594884}, \'multiverseid\': 594884}]', '[{\'name\': \'Rodolf Dämmerbringer\', \'text\': \'Fliegend, Todesberührung, Lebensverknüpfung\\nImmer wenn du Lebenspunkte dazuerhältst, erhält Rodolf Dämmerbringer Unzerstörbarkeit bis zum Ende des Zuges.\\nZu Beginn deines Endsegments kannst du {1}{W/B} bezahlen. Wenn du dies tust, bringe eine Kreaturenkarte deiner Wahl mit Manabetrag X oder weniger aus deinem Friedhof in Spiel zurück, wobei X gleich der Anzahl an Lebenspunkten ist, die du in diesem Zug dazuerhalten hast.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Vampir, Engel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589630&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'76d25650-2a6f-46e9-a0b3-268a8b1afc11\', \'multiverseId\': 589630}, \'multiverseid\': 589630}, {\'name\': \'Ródolf Portaocaso\', \'text\': \'Vuela, toque mortal, vínculo vital.\\nSiempre que ganes vidas, Ródolf Portaocaso gana la habilidad de indestructible hasta el final del turno.\\nAl comienzo de tu paso final, puedes pagar {1}{W/B}. Cuando lo hagas, regresa la carta de criatura objetivo con valor de maná de X o menos de tu cementerio al campo de batalla, donde X es la cantidad de vidas que ganaste este turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Ángel vampiro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589681&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'71eace12-e05c-4d8a-96b3-a7bfa18a1e86\', \'multiverseId\': 589681}, \'multiverseid\': 589681}, {\'name\': \'Rodolf Brunevenant\', \'text\': "Vol, contact mortel, lien de vie\\nÀ chaque fois que vous gagnez des points de vie, Rodolf Brunevenant acquiert l\'indestructible jusqu\'à la fin du tour.\\nAu début de votre étape de fin, vous pouvez payer {1}{W/B}. Quand vous faites ainsi, renvoyez sur le champ de bataille depuis votre cimetière une carte de créature ciblée avec une valeur de mana inférieure ou égale à X, X étant le nombre de points de vie que vous avez gagnés ce tour-ci.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : vampire et ange\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589732&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b8a0214b-5158-4dbe-a059-fc681d28e033\', \'multiverseId\': 589732}, \'multiverseid\': 589732}, {\'name\': \'Rodolf Araldo del Crepuscolo\', \'text\': "Volare, tocco letale, legame vitale\\nOgniqualvolta guadagni punti vita, Rodolf Araldo del Crepuscolo ha indistruttibile fino alla fine del turno.\\nAll\'inizio della tua sottofase finale, puoi pagare {1}{W/B}. Quando lo fai, rimetti sul campo di battaglia dal tuo cimitero una carta creatura bersaglio con valore di mana pari o inferiore a X, dove X sono i punti vita che hai guadagnato in questo turno.", \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Angelo Vampiro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589783&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d2d41198-fef8-4df0-9b3f-15db5d5f8109\', \'multiverseId\': 589783}, \'multiverseid\': 589783}, {\'name\': \'黄昏をもたらす者、ロドルフ\', \'text\': \'飛行、接死、絆魂\\nあなたがライフを得るたび、ターン終了時まで、黄昏をもたらす者、ロドルフは破壊不能を得る。\\nあなたの終了ステップの開始時に、あなたは{1}{W/B}を支払ってもよい。そうしたとき、あなたの墓地にありマナ総量がＸ以下であるクリーチャー・カード１枚を対象とする。それを戦場に戻す。Ｘはこのターンにあなたが得たライフの合計に等しい。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 吸血鬼・天使\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589834&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1666e26a-361a-4955-86a4-2cc8fda12488\', \'multiverseId\': 589834}, \'multiverseid\': 589834}, {\'name\': \'暮光使者朗多夫\', \'text\': \'飞行，死触，系命\\n每当你获得生命时，暮光使者朗多夫获得不灭异能直到回合结束。\\n在你的结束步骤开始时，你可以支付{1}{W/B}。当你如此作时，将目标法术力值等于或小于X的生物牌从你的坟墓场移回战场，X为你本回合中获得过的生命数量。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～吸血鬼／天使\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589987&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e2ee21c1-4134-4acb-91e2-0058a341537f\', \'multiverseId\': 589987}, \'multiverseid\': 589987}]', '[{\'name\': \'Rosendorn-Hellebarde\', \'text\': \'Wenn die Rosendorn-Hellebarde ins Spiel kommt, lege sie an eine Nicht-Mensch-Kreatur deiner Wahl an, die du kontrollierst.\\nDie ausgerüstete Kreatur erhält +2/+1.\\nAusrüsten {5} ({5}: Lege diese Karte an eine Kreatur deiner Wahl an, die du kontrollierst. Spiele Ausrüsten wie eine Hexerei.)\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Ausrüstung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592921&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7f0dc295-d8c7-4db2-aaf6-92ac79aff0cf\', \'multiverseId\': 592921}, \'multiverseid\': 592921}, {\'name\': \'Alabarda de espinas de rosa\', \'text\': \'Cuando la Alabarda de espinas de rosa entre al campo de batalla, anéxala a la criatura objetivo que no sea Humano que controlas.\\nLa criatura equipada obtiene +2/+1.\\nEquipar {5}. ({5}: Anexa este Equipo a la criatura objetivo que controlas. Activa la habilidad de equipar como un conjuro.)\', \'type\': \'Artefacto — Equipo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593042&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c95c3e92-538e-48c7-8017-e24c4bd790d5\', \'multiverseId\': 593042}, \'multiverseid\': 593042}, {\'name\': \'Hallebarde de Rosépine\', \'text\': "Quand la Hallebarde de Rosépine arrive sur le champ de bataille, attachez-la à une créature non-Humain ciblée que vous contrôlez.\\nLa créature équipée gagne +2/+1.\\nÉquipement {5} ({5} : Attachez à une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez. N\'attachez l\'équipement que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.)", \'type\': \'Artefact : équipement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593163&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'42bbca99-24ee-4a26-8b32-d31563575092\', \'multiverseId\': 593163}, \'multiverseid\': 593163}, {\'name\': \'Alabarda di Rosaspino\', \'text\': "Quando l\'Alabarda di Rosaspino entra nel campo di battaglia, assegnala a una creatura non Umano bersaglio che controlli.\\nLa creatura equipaggiata prende +2/+1.\\nEquipaggiare {5} ({5}: Assegna a una creatura bersaglio che controlli. Equipaggia solo come una stregoneria.)", \'type\': \'Artefatto — Equipaggiamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593284&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ebbdee04-238b-448f-911d-5b8e84bf7af3\', \'multiverseId\': 593284}, \'multiverseid\': 593284}, {\'name\': \'薔薇棘の矛槍\', \'text\': \'薔薇棘の矛槍が戦場に出たとき、あなたがコントロールしていて人間でないクリーチャー１体を対象とする。これをそれにつける。\\n装備しているクリーチャーは＋２/＋１の修整を受ける。\\n装備{5}（{5}：あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。これをそれにつける。装備はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。）\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 装備品\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593405&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'76bfc52d-44bf-4077-9b57-ad61dda8adba\', \'multiverseId\': 593405}, \'multiverseid\': 593405}, {\'name\': \'玫茨长戟\', \'text\': \'当玫茨长戟进战场时，将它贴附在目标由你操控的非人类生物上。\\n佩带此武具的生物得+2/+1。\\n佩带{5}（{5}：贴附在目标由你操控的生物上。只能于法术时机佩带。）\', \'type\': \'神器 ～武具\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593768&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a96ec975-c850-4ab0-ac6b-892d535b85ae\', \'multiverseId\': 593768}, \'multiverseid\': 593768}]', '[{\'name\': \'Rudelsang-Welpe\', \'text\': \'Zu Beginn des Kampfes in deinem Zug und falls du einen anderen Wolf oder Werwolf kontrollierst, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf den Rudelsang-Welpen.\\nWenn der Rudelsang-Welpe stirbt, erhältst du Lebenspunkte in Höhe seiner Stärke dazu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Wolf\', \'flavor\': \'Ein Wolfswelpe ist immer gefährlich, denn ein Wolfswelpe ist nie allein.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592902&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'93edaee7-f465-490f-a1e7-1a5aac384b5c\', \'multiverseId\': 592902}, \'multiverseid\': 592902}, {\'name\': \'Lobato del canto de la jauría\', \'text\': \'Al comienzo del combate en tu turno, si controlas otro Lobo o Licántropo, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre el Lobato del canto de la jauría.\\nCuando el Lobato del canto de la jauría muera, ganas una cantidad de vidas igual a su fuerza.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Lobo\', \'flavor\': \'Un lobato siempre es un peligro porque nunca está solo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593023&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'adf0e4b9-7bd0-4574-ba09-436994b91ec2\', \'multiverseId\': 593023}, \'multiverseid\': 593023}, {\'name\': \'Louveteau chantemeute\', \'text\': \'Au début du combat pendant votre tour, si vous contrôlez un autre loup ou loup-garou, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur le Louveteau chantemeute.\\nQuand le Louveteau chantemeute meurt, vous gagnez un nombre de points de vie égal à sa force.\', \'type\': \'Créature : loup\', \'flavor\': \'Les louveteaux sont toujours dangereux, car ils ne sont jamais seuls.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593144&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d0244602-3679-4792-8dd2-640b5c23de3a\', \'multiverseId\': 593144}, \'multiverseid\': 593144}, {\'name\': \'Cucciolo del Canto del Branco\', \'text\': "All\'inizio del combattimento nel tuo turno, se controlli un altro Lupo o Mannaro, metti un segnalino +1/+1 sul Cucciolo del Canto del Branco.\\nQuando il Cucciolo del Canto del Branco muore, guadagni punti vita pari alla sua forza.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Lupo\', \'flavor\': \'Un cucciolo di lupo è sempre pericoloso, perché non è mai solo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593265&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'92756754-c5d1-4bea-8710-ee98b1048d41\', \'multiverseId\': 593265}, \'multiverseid\': 593265}, {\'name\': \'群れ歌の子狼\', \'text\': \'あなたのターンの戦闘の開始時に、あなたがこれでない狼や狼男をコントロールしている場合、群れ歌の子狼の上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。\\n群れ歌の子狼が死亡したとき、あなたはこれのパワーに等しい点数のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 狼\', \'flavor\': \'子狼は常に危険である。何故なら、子狼は常に独りではないからである。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593386&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3273bcd6-f953-4750-857e-047f5abe3961\', \'multiverseId\': 593386}, \'multiverseid\': 593386}, {\'name\': \'唤群幼狼\', \'text\': \'在你回合的战斗开始时，若你操控另一个狼或狼人，则在唤群幼狼上放置一个+1/+1指示物。\\n当唤群幼狼死去时，你获得等同于其力量的生命。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～狼\', \'flavor\': \'单头幼狼是危险讯号，因为幼狼总不落单。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593749&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e84d6757-d9e0-435c-a77b-34f06fc83e69\', \'multiverseId\': 593749}, \'multiverseid\': 593749}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ruhmträgerinnen\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn eine andere Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, angreift, erhält sie +0/+1 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberungskreatur — Mensch, Kleriker\', \'flavor\': \'„Wir sind Trägerinnen des uralten Lichts, Hüterinnen der Segnungen von Heliod dem Sonnengekrönten. Kämpfe, und das Licht wird dich behüten!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591597&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'57a99504-f144-414a-8575-c6289a1b8634\', \'multiverseId\': 591597}, \'multiverseid\': 591597}, {\'name\': \'Portadoras de gloria\', \'text\': \'Siempre que otra criatura que controlas ataque, obtiene +0/+1 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura encantamiento — Clérigo humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Somos las portadoras de la luz arcaica, las guardianas de las bendiciones de Heliod, Corona Solar. ¡Lucha y la luz te protegerá!".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591726&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a1bce4dc-e910-4b45-b91d-b4782493e05b\', \'multiverseId\': 591726}, \'multiverseid\': 591726}, {\'name\': \'Porteuses de gloire\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'une autre créature que vous contrôlez attaque, elle gagne +0/+1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature-enchantement : humain et clerc\', \'flavor\': "« Nous sommes les porteuses de la lumière ancestrale, les gardiennes des bénédictions d\'Héliode, Souverain du soleil. Combattez, et la lumière vous protégera ! »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591855&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8911a17a-6732-467a-8411-e4cf94afb0f9\', \'multiverseId\': 591855}, \'multiverseid\': 591855}, {\'name\': \'Portatrici di Gloria\', \'text\': "Ogniqualvolta un\'altra creatura che controlli attacca, prende +0/+1 fino alla fine del turno.", \'type\': \'Creatura Incantesimo — Chierico Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Siamo portatrici dell\\\'antica luce, custodi delle benedizioni di Eliod dalla corona solare. Combattete e la luce vi proteggerà!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591984&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dd58d921-8cb6-49a9-82bc-2c0bdf655fc0\', \'multiverseId\': 591984}, \'multiverseid\': 591984}, {\'name\': \'栄光を携える者\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしていてこれでないクリーチャー１体が攻撃するたび、ターン終了時まで、それは＋０/＋１の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー・エンチャント — 人間・クレリック\', \'flavor\': \'「私たちは古き光の運び手、太陽冠のヘリオッドの祝福を守る者。戦うのです。光が守ってくれるでしょう！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592113&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8605db3e-6257-4fe1-854f-ce81e04d045c\', \'multiverseId\': 592113}, \'multiverseid\': 592113}, {\'name\': \'荣光护持僧\', \'text\': \'每当另一个由你操控的生物攻击时，它得+0/+1直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'结界生物 ～人类／僧侣\', \'flavor\': \'「吾人乃是远古之光的护持僧、日冠赫利欧德祝福的守护者。勇敢作战吧，明光定会庇护你！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592500&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2bc9f5cd-56fe-4524-9910-1d06be326d47\', \'multiverseId\': 592500}, \'multiverseid\': 592500}]', "[{'name': 'Runadi, Behemothrufer', 'text': 'Immer wenn du einen Kreaturenzauber mit Manabetrag 5 oder mehr wirkst, kommt die Kreatur mit X zusätzlichen +1/+1-Marken ins Spiel, wobei X gleich ihrem Manabetrag minus 4 ist.\\nKreaturen mit drei oder mehr +1/+1-Marken, die du kontrollierst, haben Eile.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {G}.', 'type': 'Legendäre Kreatur — Katze, Schamane', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589649&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'eccfed08-11b1-4327-b1d6-7532f2bbb2f0', 'multiverseId': 589649}, 'multiverseid': 589649}, {'name': 'Runadi, llamabehemots', 'text': 'Siempre que lances un hechizo de criatura con valor de maná de 5 o más, esa criatura entra al campo de batalla con X contadores +1/+1 adicionales sobre ella, donde X es su valor de maná menos 4.\\nLas criaturas que controlas con tres o más contadores +1/+1 sobre ellas tienen la habilidad de prisa.\\n{T}: Agrega {G}.', 'type': 'Criatura legendaria — Chamán felino', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589700&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '17615015-b106-4f5e-a5dd-8888af6acbc2', 'multiverseId': 589700}, 'multiverseid': 589700}, {'name': 'Runadi, meneur de béhémoths', 'text': 'À chaque fois que vous lancez un sort de créature avec une valeur de mana supérieure ou égale à 5, cette créature arrive sur le champ de bataille avec X marqueurs +1/+1 supplémentaires sur elle, X étant sa valeur de mana moins 4.\\nLes créatures que vous contrôlez avec au moins trois marqueurs +1/+1 sur elles ont la célérité.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {G}.', 'type': 'Créature légendaire : chat et shamane', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589751&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '606967f0-cd8c-4047-a29a-a7b25cfc3a6e', 'multiverseId': 589751}, 'multiverseid': 589751}, {'name': 'Runadi, Evocatore di Behemoth', 'text': 'Ogniqualvolta lanci una magia creatura con valore di mana pari o superiore a 5, quella creatura entra nel campo di battaglia con X segnalini +1/+1 addizionali, dove X è il suo valore di mana meno 4.\\nLe creature con tre o più segnalini +1/+1 che controlli hanno rapidità.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {G}.', 'type': 'Creatura Leggendaria — Sciamano Felino', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589802&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6a3c7a1e-8edb-43aa-be61-6316efa080a4', 'multiverseId': 589802}, 'multiverseid': 589802}, {'name': 'ビヒモス呼び、ルナーディ', 'text': 'あなたがマナ総量が５以上であるクリーチャー・呪文を唱えるたび、そのクリーチャーは追加で＋１/＋１カウンターＸ個が置かれた状態で戦場に出る。Ｘはそれのマナ総量から４を引いた値に等しい。\\nあなたがコントロールしていて３個以上の＋１/＋１カウンターが置かれているすべてのクリーチャーは速攻を持つ。\\n{T}：{G}を加える。', 'type': '伝説のクリーチャー — 猫・シャーマン', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589853&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5e78aa1e-212d-44e8-b839-897cf6aebd6a', 'multiverseId': 589853}, 'multiverseid': 589853}, {'name': '巨兽召师卢那迪', 'text': '每当你施放法术力值等于或大于5的生物咒语，该生物进战场时上面额外有X个+1/+1指示物，X为其法术力值减4。\\n由你操控且其上有三个或更多+1/+1指示物的生物具有敏捷异能。\\n{T}：加{G}。', 'type': '传奇生物 ～猫／祭师', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590006&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5418d3ea-4691-4687-b7c3-b1ce8fe6dadd', 'multiverseId': 590006}, 'multiverseid': 590006}]", '[{\'name\': \'Runenbedeckter Diener\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Runenbedeckte Diener stirbt, zieht jeder Spieler eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Konstrukt\', \'flavor\': \'Gelehrte haben über Jahrhunderte hinweg die Ruinen von Tal Terig untersucht. Deren Geheimnisse waren schon immer in einem runenverzierten Kopf versteckt.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596298&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3209f020-b0c2-4ae2-9452-6a95aac9f751\', \'multiverseId\': 596298}, \'multiverseid\': 596298}, {\'name\': \'Servidor rúnico\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Servidor rúnico muera, cada jugador roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Constructo\', \'flavor\': \'Los eruditos estudiaron por siglos las ruinas de Tal Terig. Sus secretos estuvieron siempre dentro de una cabeza tallada con runas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596385&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bfd4dcf7-613b-4c73-b5d4-b2d3abd58890\', \'multiverseId\': 596385}, \'multiverseid\': 596385}, {\'name\': \'Valet serti de runes\', \'text\': \'Quand le Valet serti de runes meurt, chaque joueur pioche une carte.\', \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : construction\', \'flavor\': "Les érudits s\'étaient interrogés durant des siècles sur les ruines de Tal Terig. Ses secrets avaient toujours été cachés dans une tête gravée de runes.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596472&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bf20935d-2b72-499e-8ce0-7e7717d97636\', \'multiverseId\': 596472}, \'multiverseid\': 596472}, {\'name\': \'Servitore Runico\', \'text\': \'Quando il Servitore Runico muore, ogni giocatore pesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Costrutto\', \'flavor\': \'Gli studiosi si sono scervellati per secoli sulle rovine di Tal Terig. I suoi segreti sono sempre vissuti in una testa scolpita di rune.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596559&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'83d98f1a-e270-4d7c-9332-cfcd5f3c1b67\', \'multiverseId\': 596559}, \'multiverseid\': 596559}, {\'name\': \'ルーンの苦役者\', \'text\': \'ルーンの苦役者が死亡したとき、各プレイヤーはそれぞれカード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 構築物\', \'flavor\': \'学者たちは何世紀もの間タル・テリグの遺跡に頭を悩ませてきた。その秘密はルーンの刻まれたその頭の中にずっとあったのに。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596646&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d9fb757b-99c7-4062-b15d-ad067c16664c\', \'multiverseId\': 596646}, \'multiverseid\': 596646}, {\'name\': \'符文随侍\', \'text\': \'当符文随侍死去时，每位牌手各抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～组构体\', \'flavor\': \'塔帖立遗迹让学者思索数百年却找不到解答。其秘密一直就躲在个刻着符文的头里面。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596907&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3912fa96-67e4-478e-9127-dc484f4b22a7\', \'multiverseId\': 596907}, \'multiverseid\': 596907}]', '[{\'name\': \'Rücksichtsloser Feuerweber\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn ein Artefakt unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, fügt der Rücksichtslose Feuerweber jedem Gegner 1 Schadenspunkt zu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Handwerker\', \'flavor\': \'Die vollendete Form der Drachenkörper inspiriert die Architekten, doch die Handwerker finden eher Gefallen am feurigen Atem.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590295&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5e574141-2427-457a-aa05-fe117d9396eb\', \'multiverseId\': 590295}, \'multiverseid\': 590295}, {\'name\': \'Tejellamas temerario\', \'text\': \'Siempre que un artefacto entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, el Tejellamas temerario hace 1 punto de daño a cada oponente.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Artífice humano\', \'flavor\': \'Los arquitectos encuentran inspiración en la belleza de formas del dragón, mientras que el funcionamiento de su fuego atrapa a los artífices.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590430&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dc871f03-9bed-42fb-a2cb-bd19d34713c6\', \'multiverseId\': 590430}, \'multiverseid\': 590430}, {\'name\': \'Tissefeu téméraire\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'un artefact arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, le Tissefeu téméraire inflige 1 blessure à chaque adversaire.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et artificier\', \'flavor\': "Les architectes s\'inspirent de la beauté du dragon, tandis que les artificiers reproduisent ses flammes.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590565&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d86cb171-385d-47e5-bf4d-a3161aef33f8\', \'multiverseId\': 590565}, \'multiverseid\': 590565}, {\'name\': \'Tessifuoco Imprudente\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta un artefatto entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, il Tessifuoco Imprudente infligge 1 danno a ogni avversario.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Artefice Umano\', \'flavor\': "Gli architetti trovano ispirazione nell\'eleganza delle forme dei draghi, mentre è l\'efficacia delle loro fiamme a influenzare gli artefici.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590700&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f0bf9c1c-dd6f-4203-8232-835bffbf0db6\', \'multiverseId\': 590700}, \'multiverseid\': 590700}, {\'name\': \'無謀な炎織り\', \'text\': \'アーティファクト１つがあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、無謀な炎織りは各対戦相手にそれぞれ１点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・工匠\', \'flavor\': \'建築家はドラゴンの形式美から着想を得るが、工匠はその炎の機能からヒントを得る。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590835&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b0e8f450-6417-4736-a13d-41a5d630f10c\', \'multiverseId\': 590835}, \'multiverseid\': 590835}, {\'name\': \'鲁莽织焰匠\', \'text\': \'每当一个神器在你的操控下进战场时，鲁莽织焰匠向每位对手各造成1点伤害。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／神器师\', \'flavor\': \'建筑师从巨龙优美形态中觅求灵感，而神器师则受其喷火能力启发。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591240&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'851b98e8-4756-4cfb-b63b-a3b410a8731a\', \'multiverseId\': 591240}, \'multiverseid\': 591240}]', '[{\'name\': \'Salberin der Tapferen\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nImmer wenn eine Kreatur angreift, kannst du {3} bezahlen. Wenn du dies tust, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf die Kreatur.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Engel\', \'flavor\': \'Licht strahlte vom Himmel herab, und eine Stimme flüsterte dem Soldaten ins Ohr: „Du wirst heute nicht fallen."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591554&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b9698a9a-b325-45ee-8cc0-d9569fb45abc\', \'multiverseId\': 591554}, \'multiverseid\': 591554}, {\'name\': \'Consagradora del valor\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nSiempre que una criatura ataque, puedes pagar {3}. Cuando lo hagas, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre esa criatura.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ángel\', \'flavor\': \'La luz descendió del cielo y una voz susurró al oído del soldado: "Hoy no caerás".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591683&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'675a159e-7438-4449-90fc-0153da9b1225\', \'multiverseId\': 591683}, \'multiverseid\': 591683}, {\'name\': \'Consécratrice du courage\', \'text\': "Vol\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'une créature attaque, vous pouvez payer {3}. Quand vous faites ainsi, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur cette créature.", \'type\': \'Créature : ange\', \'flavor\': "Une lumière descendit des cieux, et une voix chuchota à l\'oreille du soldat : « Ce n\'est pas aujourd\'hui que tu tomberas. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591812&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'130e9846-663c-4b28-8389-baa477ac82cf\', \'multiverseId\': 591812}, \'multiverseid\': 591812}, {\'name\': \'Consacratrice del Valore\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nOgniqualvolta una creatura attacca, puoi pagare {3}. Quando lo fai, metti un segnalino +1/+1 su di essa.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Angelo\', \'flavor\': \'Dai cieli scese una luce e una voce sussurrò al soldato: "Un giorno cadrai... ma non è questo il giorno."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591941&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'95679065-1150-4711-840f-c96d7530458a\', \'multiverseId\': 591941}, \'multiverseid\': 591941}, {\'name\': \'武勇の選定師\', \'text\': \'飛行\\nクリーチャー１体が攻撃するたび、あなたは{3}を支払ってもよい。そうしたとき、そのクリーチャーの上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 天使\', \'flavor\': \'天界より光がほとばしり、ささやきが兵士たちの耳に届いた。「ここでくじけてはなりません。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592070&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b874aaca-5e39-4993-8cf5-5b082c09bc4c\', \'multiverseId\': 592070}, \'multiverseid\': 592070}, {\'name\': \'勇气赐圣使\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n每当一个生物攻击时，你可以支付{3}。当你如此作时，在该生物上放置一个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～天使\', \'flavor\': \'只见一道明光自天而降，士兵耳中传来细语幽声：「你今天不会死。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592457&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3b3aacfe-7309-4253-9364-15696c69c076\', \'multiverseId\': 592457}, \'multiverseid\': 592457}]', '[{\'name\': \'Salzwasser-Getreuer\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn der Salzwasser-Getreue einem Gegner Schaden zufügt, zieht ein Spieler deiner Wahl eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Meervolk, Krieger\', \'flavor\': \'Jeder Angriff stellt deine Verteidigung auf die Probe. Jeder Treffer ist eine Markierung auf der Karte deiner Niederlage.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595268&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f5fdef6d-3266-4470-b576-a2743b81fc27\', \'multiverseId\': 595268}, \'multiverseid\': 595268}, {\'name\': \'Valiente de agua salada\', \'text\': \'Siempre que el Valiente de agua salada haga daño a un oponente, el jugador objetivo roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero tritón\', \'flavor\': \'Con cada ataque pone a prueba tu defensa y, con cada golpe, traza el mapa de tu derrota.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595376&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bebe4267-8957-464a-889c-dd62eed7b91c\', \'multiverseId\': 595376}, \'multiverseid\': 595376}, {\'name\': "Vaillant d\'eau salée", \'text\': "À chaque fois que le Vaillant d\'eau salée inflige des blessures à un adversaire, un joueur ciblé pioche une carte.", \'type\': \'Créature : ondin et guerrier\', \'flavor\': \'Chaque attaque teste vos défenses. Chaque coup marque la carte de votre défaite.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595484&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'49f8e8f7-5ed1-4903-a263-7fa3d6b7f5f2\', \'multiverseId\': 595484}, \'multiverseid\': 595484}, {\'name\': \'Temerario di Acqua Salata\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta il Temerario di Acqua Salata infligge danno a un avversario, un giocatore bersaglio pesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Tritone\', \'flavor\': \'Ogni attacco mette alla prova le tue difese. Ogni colpo a segno traccia la rotta verso la tua sconfitta.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595592&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6b762e42-796c-4ef2-ade2-e5f6273eb923\', \'multiverseId\': 595592}, \'multiverseid\': 595592}, {\'name\': \'塩水の重鎮\', \'text\': \'塩水の重鎮が対戦相手１人にダメージを与えるたび、プレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーはカード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — マーフォーク・戦士\', \'flavor\': \'攻撃が防御の試金石となる。打撃が勝利への道標を刻む。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595700&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d1f03203-31ab-4189-8693-68b2d04943ee\', \'multiverseId\': 595700}, \'multiverseid\': 595700}, {\'name\': \'海生壮汉\', \'text\': \'每当海生壮汉向任一对手造成伤害时，目标牌手抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人鱼／战士\', \'flavor\': \'每次攻势都考验你的防线。每次得手都降低你的胜算。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596024&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6a064dab-4be6-41e3-855c-0baa2c2f44c3\', \'multiverseId\': 596024}, \'multiverseid\': 596024}]', '[{\'name\': \'Sandsteinbrücke\', \'text\': \'Die Sandsteinbrücke kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nWenn die Sandsteinbrücke ins Spiel kommt, erhält eine Kreatur deiner Wahl +1/+1 und Wachsamkeit bis zum Ende des Zuges.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {W}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596323&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'762bfe2e-0c2e-4f84-a78a-8f9e9ff439c9\', \'multiverseId\': 596323}, \'multiverseid\': 596323}, {\'name\': \'Puente de piedra caliza\', \'text\': \'El Puente de piedra caliza entra al campo de batalla girado.\\nCuando el Puente de piedra caliza entre al campo de batalla, la criatura objetivo obtiene +1/+1 y gana la habilidad de vigilancia hasta el final del turno.\\n{T}: Agrega {W}.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596410&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bf593740-5c57-42e1-9775-43b450a2c17e\', \'multiverseId\': 596410}, \'multiverseid\': 596410}, {\'name\': \'Pont de grès\', \'text\': "Le Pont de grès arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\nQuand le Pont de grès arrive sur le champ de bataille, une créature ciblée gagne +1/+1 et acquiert la vigilance jusqu\'à la fin du tour.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {W}.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596497&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'63b2cd81-8d50-45ae-a091-777adc2b0a01\', \'multiverseId\': 596497}, \'multiverseid\': 596497}, {\'name\': \'Ponte di Arenaria\', \'text\': \'Il Ponte di Arenaria entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\nQuando il Ponte di Arenaria entra nel campo di battaglia, una creatura bersaglio prende +1/+1 e ha cautela fino alla fine del turno.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {W}.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596584&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'763a5b70-65e8-47f0-b7b9-1a6806e4d71a\', \'multiverseId\': 596584}, \'multiverseid\': 596584}, {\'name\': \'砂岩の橋\', \'text\': \'砂岩の橋はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n砂岩の橋が戦場に出たとき、クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは＋１/＋１の修整を受け警戒を得る。\\n{T}：{W}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596671&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'55a6edd6-6309-45ab-83aa-9565eea4acaa\', \'multiverseId\': 596671}, \'multiverseid\': 596671}, {\'name\': \'砂岩桥\', \'text\': \'砂岩桥须横置进战场。\\n当砂岩桥进战场时，直到回合结束，目标生物得+1/+1且获得警戒异能。\\n{T}：加{W}。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596932&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'38fd7b47-2dbf-4f29-a4ff-85e3aac8ab8e\', \'multiverseId\': 596932}, \'multiverseid\': 596932}]', '[{\'name\': \'Sanftmütige Bibliothekarin\', \'text\': \'{3}{G}: Die Sanftmütige Bibliothekarin wird zu einem Werwolf. Lege zwei +1/+1-Marken auf sie und ziehe eine Karte. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit nur einmal.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch\', \'flavor\': \'Sie hatte immer an die transformative Kraft großer Literatur geglaubt.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589646&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e5c55979-502b-4295-aaf4-7144de5f0d2c\', \'multiverseId\': 589646}, \'multiverseid\': 589646}, {\'name\': \'Bibliotecaria respetable\', \'text\': \'{3}{G}: La Bibliotecaria respetable se convierte en un Licántropo. Pon dos contadores +1/+1 sobre ella y roba una carta. Activa esto solo una vez.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano\', \'flavor\': \'Siempre había creído en el poder transformador de la buena literatura.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589697&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'facb92e7-cdaa-48d4-80a6-4d023a9a5100\', \'multiverseId\': 589697}, \'multiverseid\': 589697}, {\'name\': \'Bibliothécaire modérée\', \'text\': "{3}{G} : La Bibliothécaire modérée devient un loup-garou. Mettez deux marqueurs +1/+1 sur elle et vous piochez une carte. N\'activez qu\'une seule fois.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain\', \'flavor\': \'Elle avait toujours cru au pouvoir de transformation de la grande littérature.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589748&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9eb18975-d6fe-4af6-8439-8179af40e290\', \'multiverseId\': 589748}, \'multiverseid\': 589748}, {\'name\': \'Bibliotecaria Mite\', \'text\': \'{3}{G}: La Bibliotecaria Mite diventa un Mannaro. Metti due segnalini +1/+1 su di essa e pesca una carta. Attiva solo una volta.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Umano\', \'flavor\': \'Aveva sempre creduto nel potere della letteratura di trasformare le persone.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589799&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8eae4477-9a65-4ec7-8c50-a55fcb9326d5\', \'multiverseId\': 589799}, \'multiverseid\': 589799}, {\'name\': \'温厚な司書\', \'text\': \'{3}{G}：温厚な司書は狼男になる。これの上に＋１/＋１カウンター２個を置き、あなたはカード１枚を引く。１回しか起動できない。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間\', \'flavor\': \'彼女は偉大な書物の物事を変える力を信じ続けていた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589850&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'916f5b5e-bf77-4a82-8ae2-2971a4d5cc0d\', \'multiverseId\': 589850}, \'multiverseid\': 589850}, {\'name\': \'谦恭图书管理员\', \'text\': \'{3}{G}：谦恭图书管理员成为狼人。在其上放置两个+1/+1指示物且你抓一张牌。只能起动一次。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类\', \'flavor\': \'她一直相信文学巨著能够转化人性。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590003&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'86c0c02e-3b68-4b14-81ed-990da1da8f22\', \'multiverseId\': 590003}, \'multiverseid\': 590003}]', '[{\'name\': \'Sarkhan Drachensprecher\', \'text\': \'+1: Bis zum Ende des Zuges wird Sarkhan Drachensprecher zu einer legendären 4/4 roten Drache-Kreatur mit Flugfähigkeit, Unzerstörbarkeit und Eile. (Er verliert keine Loyalität, während er kein Planeswalker ist.)\\n−3: Sarkhan Drachensprecher fügt einer Kreatur deiner Wahl 4 Schadenspunkte zu.\\n−6: Du erhältst ein Emblem mit „Zu Beginn deines Ziehsegments ziehst du zwei zusätzliche Karten" und „Zu Beginn deines Endsegments wirfst du deine Hand ab."\', \'type\': \'Legendärer Planeswalker — Sarkhan\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590301&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'45e1094f-2d57-4887-8423-b1ffdb286d62\', \'multiverseId\': 590301}, \'multiverseid\': 590301}, {\'name\': \'Sarkhan, el dragonhablante\', \'text\': \'+1: Hasta el final del turno, Sarkhan, el dragonhablante se convierte en una criatura legendaria Dragón roja 4/4 con las habilidades de volar, indestructible y prisa. (No pierde lealtad mientras no sea un planeswalker.)\\n—3: Sarkhan, el dragonhablante hace 4 puntos de daño a la criatura objetivo.\\n—6: Obtienes un emblema con "Al comienzo de tu paso de robar, roba dos cartas adicionales" y "Al comienzo de tu paso final, descarta tu mano".\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker legendario — Sarkhan\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590436&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c68502a8-8e75-4077-91fb-e7bba5895bdc\', \'multiverseId\': 590436}, \'multiverseid\': 590436}, {\'name\': \'Sarkhan, le languedragon\', \'text\': "+1: Jusqu\'à la fin du tour, Sarkhan, le languedragon devient une créature légendaire 4/4 rouge Dragon avec le vol, l\'indestructible et la célérité. (Il ne perd pas de loyauté tant qu\'il n\'est pas un planeswalker.)\\n-3: Sarkhan, le languedragon inflige 4 blessures à une créature ciblée.\\n-6: Vous gagnez un emblème avec « Au début de votre étape de pioche, piochez deux cartes supplémentaires » et « Au début de votre étape de fin, défaussez-vous de votre main. »", \'type\': \'Planeswalker légendaire : Sarkhan\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590571&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'10f4f99f-b544-4c49-9e9e-070e367da629\', \'multiverseId\': 590571}, \'multiverseid\': 590571}, {\'name\': \'Sarkhan, il Dracofono\', \'text\': \'+1: Fino alla fine del turno, Sarkhan, il Dracofono diventa una creatura leggendaria Drago 4/4 rossa con volare, indistruttibile e rapidità. (Non perde fedeltà mentre non è un planeswalker.)\\n−3: Sarkhan, il Dracofono infligge 4 danni a una creatura bersaglio.\\n−6: Ottieni un emblema con "All\\\'inizio della tua acquisizione, pesca due carte addizionali" e "All\\\'inizio della tua sottofase finale, scarta la tua mano".\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker Leggendario — Sarkhan\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590706&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'441b55a2-e344-4856-aa9a-9554e37015d5\', \'multiverseId\': 590706}, \'multiverseid\': 590706}, {\'name\': \'龍語りのサルカン\', \'text\': \'＋１：ターン終了時まで、龍語りのサルカンは飛行と破壊不能と速攻を持つ赤の４/４の伝説のドラゴン・クリーチャーになる。（プレインズウォーカーでない間は、これは忠誠度を失わない。）\\n－３：クリーチャー１体を対象とする。龍語りのサルカンはそれに４点のダメージを与える。\\n－６：あなたは「あなたのドロー・ステップの開始時に、追加でカード２枚を引く。」と「あなたの終了ステップの開始時に、あなたの手札を捨てる。」を持つ紋章を得る。\', \'type\': \'伝説のプレインズウォーカー — サルカン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590841&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c34692fe-0f2f-47a8-b70f-ff883ed2637f\', \'multiverseId\': 590841}, \'multiverseid\': 590841}, {\'name\': \'龙语者萨坎\', \'text\': \'+1：直到回合结束，龙语者萨坎成为传奇的4/4红色龙生物，且具有飞行、不灭与敏捷异能。（于其不是鹏洛客期间，他不会失去忠诚。）\\n−3：龙语者萨坎对目标生物造成4点伤害。\\n−6：你获得具有以下异能的徽记～「在你的抓牌步骤开始时，额外抓两张牌」与「在你的结束步骤开始时，弃掉你的手牌。」\', \'type\': \'传奇鹏洛客 ～萨坎\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591246&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6424f147-9750-4c2b-a4fc-58f49d78f7d6\', \'multiverseId\': 591246}, \'multiverseid\': 591246}]', '[{\'name\': \'Sarkhans Drachenwelpe\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nImmer wenn du eine Fähigkeit eines Sarkhan-Planeswalkers aktivierst, fügt Sarkhans Drachenwelpe einem Ziel deiner Wahl 1 Schadenspunkt zu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Drache\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590303&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b550d41b-64ae-4373-9028-1c9004e6de7e\', \'multiverseId\': 590303}, \'multiverseid\': 590303}, {\'name\': \'Cría de Sarkhan\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nSiempre que actives una habilidad de un planeswalker Sarkhan, la Cría de Sarkhan hace 1 punto de daño a cualquier objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Dragón\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590438&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'30e3e9c9-57c2-4202-8397-b2828dad9d50\', \'multiverseId\': 590438}, \'multiverseid\': 590438}, {\'name\': \'Dragonnet de Sarkhan\', \'text\': "Vol\\nÀ chaque fois que vous activez une capacité d\'un planeswalker Sarkhan, le Dragonnet de Sarkhan inflige 1 blessure à n\'importe quelle cible.", \'type\': \'Créature : dragon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590573&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b3981a6e-aebb-4792-9e2a-2c77e02e7a80\', \'multiverseId\': 590573}, \'multiverseid\': 590573}, {\'name\': \'Cucciolo di Sarkhan\', \'text\': "Volare\\nOgniqualvolta attivi un\'abilità di un planeswalker Sarkhan, il Cucciolo di Sarkhan infligge 1 danno a un qualsiasi bersaglio.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Drago\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590708&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'10779d67-9f6e-4917-9254-7972f70d8e0c\', \'multiverseId\': 590708}, \'multiverseid\': 590708}, {\'name\': \'サルカンの仔竜\', \'text\': \'飛行\\nあなたがサルカン・プレインズウォーカーの能力を起動するたび、クリーチャーやプレインズウォーカーやプレイヤーのうち１つを対象とする。サルカンの仔竜はそれに１点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ドラゴン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590843&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0fcb107d-1274-4aa9-b619-3251366ff005\', \'multiverseId\': 590843}, \'multiverseid\': 590843}, {\'name\': \'萨坎的幼龙\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n每当你起动萨坎鹏洛客的异能时，萨坎的幼龙对任意一个目标造成1点伤害。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～龙\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591248&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a7e1e3de-45a0-4db3-80a3-36d52b4afa59\', \'multiverseId\': 591248}, \'multiverseid\': 591248}]', '[{\'name\': \'Sarkhans Zorn\', \'text\': \'Sarkhans Zorn fügt einem Ziel deiner Wahl 5 Schadenspunkte zu. Falls du keinen Drachen kontrollierst, fügt dir Sarkhans Zorn 2 Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Die Völker Tarkirs kennen eine alte Legende über einen Drachenmenschen namens Sarkhan, dem größten aller Khane.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590302&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7d894cf0-201e-432b-a632-5d543c3323bb\', \'multiverseId\': 590302}, \'multiverseid\': 590302}, {\'name\': \'Furia de Sarkhan\', \'text\': \'La Furia de Sarkhan hace 5 puntos de daño a cualquier objetivo. Si no controlas ningún Dragón, la Furia de Sarkhan te hace 2 puntos de daño.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'En Tarkir se cuenta una antigua leyenda sobre un hombre dragón llamado Sarkhan, que fue el más grande de todos los kans.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590437&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'44c81216-8c78-4352-a45d-a4cb124deaf8\', \'multiverseId\': 590437}, \'multiverseid\': 590437}, {\'name\': \'Rage de Sarkhan\', \'text\': "La Rage de Sarkhan inflige 5 blessures à n\'importe quelle cible. Si vous ne contrôlez aucun dragon, la Rage de Sarkhan vous inflige 2 blessures.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "Les habitants de Tarkir racontent une vieille légende, celle d\'un homme-dragon nommé Sarkhan, le plus grand de tous les khans.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590572&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f4a08406-105f-4ca5-8e3d-11f366360bcf\', \'multiverseId\': 590572}, \'multiverseid\': 590572}, {\'name\': \'Furia di Sarkhan\', \'text\': \'La Furia di Sarkhan infligge 5 danni a un qualsiasi bersaglio. Se non controlli Draghi, la Furia di Sarkhan ti infligge 2 danni.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': "Gli abitanti di Tarkir narrano di un\'antica leggenda: un uomo-drago chiamato Sarkhan che era il più grande di tutti i khan.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590707&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'38cc19a9-0b8c-4105-915f-f55b8781eb5d\', \'multiverseId\': 590707}, \'multiverseid\': 590707}, {\'name\': \'サルカンの怒り\', \'text\': \'クリーチャーやプレインズウォーカーやプレイヤーのうち１つを対象とする。サルカンの怒りはそれに５点のダメージを与える。あなたがドラゴンをコントロールしていないなら、サルカンの怒りはあなたに２点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'タルキールの人々の間では、最も偉大なカンであった龍人のサルカンという者を太古の伝説として語り継いでいる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590842&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d8748519-1c2b-485e-8c26-6ec5f976df78\', \'multiverseId\': 590842}, \'multiverseid\': 590842}, {\'name\': \'萨坎之怒\', \'text\': \'萨坎之怒对任意一个目标造成5点伤害。如果你未操控龙，则萨坎之怒对你造成2点伤害。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'一则古老传说辗转流述于鞑契人民之间：有位名为萨坎的龙人，是可汗中的可汗。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591247&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'899c1499-6a40-43a5-a485-c7e163555ec5\', \'multiverseId\': 591247}, \'multiverseid\': 591247}]', '[{\'name\': \'Savannenlöwen\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Katze\', \'flavor\': \'„Einer allein ist furchterregend, einer unter vielen ist unaufhaltsam."\\n—Benalisches Sprichwort\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591643&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fc32e51c-1ead-409a-9d90-7b3f2e4d150e\', \'multiverseId\': 591643}, \'multiverseid\': 591643}, {\'name\': \'Leones de la sabana\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Felino\', \'flavor\': \'"Temibles en soledad, imparables en manada".\\n—Proverbio benalita\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591772&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c37147fe-c8f7-4b87-8054-ffbfa0caf8c0\', \'multiverseId\': 591772}, \'multiverseid\': 591772}, {\'name\': \'Lions des savanes\', \'type\': \'Créature : chat\', \'flavor\': \'« Seul, il est terrifiant ; en groupe, il est inarrêtable. »\\n—Proverbe bénalian\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591901&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8cd3a4ee-c02c-4cb9-a4e7-6126dd1f726b\', \'multiverseId\': 591901}, \'multiverseid\': 591901}, {\'name\': \'Leoni della Savana\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Felino\', \'flavor\': \'"Uno da solo è spaventoso; uno tra molti è inarrestabile."\\n—Proverbio di Benalia\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592030&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'73d25a48-5d6a-4804-aac3-51a51685eb68\', \'multiverseId\': 592030}, \'multiverseid\': 592030}, {\'name\': \'サバンナ・ライオン\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 猫\', \'flavor\': \'「単独の一頭は恐ろしい。群れの一頭は手に負えない。」\\n――ベナリアの諺\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592159&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'423cbf87-ce66-4a82-823b-d25003736bd0\', \'multiverseId\': 592159}, \'multiverseid\': 592159}, {\'name\': \'草原雄狮\', \'type\': \'生物 ～猫\', \'flavor\': \'「雄狮独行威震四方；雄狮成群势不可当。」\\n～宾纳里亚谚语\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592546&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'38287eef-57a5-4416-8db8-d8a38ed1301a\', \'multiverseId\': 592546}, \'multiverseid\': 592546}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schaltkreis-Lötroboter\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Schaltkreis-Lötroboter ins Spiel kommt, erhältst du 2 Lebenspunkte dazu.\\nWenn der Schaltkreis-Lötroboter das Spiel verlässt, ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Insekt\', \'flavor\': \'Inspiriert von fleißigen Seidenraupen, wurde er gefertigt, um die Welt zu reparieren.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596264&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3f021586-e64b-49d4-aac9-78477b6f4cf2\', \'multiverseId\': 596264}, \'multiverseid\': 596264}, {\'name\': \'Reparador de circuitos\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Reparador de circuitos entre al campo de batalla, ganas 2 vidas.\\nCuando el Reparador de circuitos deje el campo de batalla, roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Insecto\', \'flavor\': \'A su creador le inspiraron los diligentes gusanos de seda y lo creó para restaurar las piezas rotas del mundo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596351&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b3f7841e-bba0-47cf-8790-61a87970795e\', \'multiverseId\': 596351}, \'multiverseid\': 596351}, {\'name\': \'Relieur de circuits\', \'text\': \'Quand le Relieur de circuits arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous gagnez 2 points de vie.\\nQuand le Relieur de circuits quitte le champ de bataille, piochez une carte.\', \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : insecte\', \'flavor\': "Inspiré par les vers à soie, son créateur l\'a conçu pour restaurer les pièces brisées du monde.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596438&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e522963d-d0a3-4a9c-8815-aceccebec49e\', \'multiverseId\': 596438}, \'multiverseid\': 596438}, {\'name\': \'Riparatore di Circuiti\', \'text\': \'Quando il Riparatore di Circuiti entra nel campo di battaglia, guadagni 2 punti vita.\\nQuando il Riparatore di Circuiti lascia il campo di battaglia, pesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Insetto\', \'flavor\': \'Ispirandosi agli operosi bachi da seta, il suo creatore lo progettò perché riparasse i frammenti del mondo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596525&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'229aff5a-8324-436e-8258-4f87aa3b5326\', \'multiverseId\': 596525}, \'multiverseid\': 596525}, {\'name\': \'回路の修理屋\', \'text\': \'回路の修理屋が戦場に出たとき、あなたは２点のライフを得る。\\n回路の修理屋が戦場を離れたとき、カード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 昆虫\', \'flavor\': \'働き者の蚕に刺激を受け、それの生みの親は世界の壊れた破片を修復するためにそれを作った。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596612&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7a2c114a-73e8-4de7-b63f-d384db5e8395\', \'multiverseId\': 596612}, \'multiverseid\': 596612}, {\'name\': \'修线机虫\', \'text\': \'当修线机虫进战场时，你获得2点生命。\\n当修线机虫离开战场时，抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～昆虫\', \'flavor\': \'这机械的发明者受勤勉桑蚕启发，因而将它制成这等形状，希冀其能够将世界破片修复一新。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596873&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c6f98141-dc06-4070-8150-b0dec24b55cb\', \'multiverseId\': 596873}, \'multiverseid\': 596873}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schattengeborener Dämon\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nWenn der Schattengeborene Dämon ins Spiel kommt, zerstöre eine Nicht-Dämon-Kreatur deiner Wahl.\\nZu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments und falls sich in deinem Friedhof weniger als sechs Kreaturenkarten befinden, opfere eine Kreatur.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Dämon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594121&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'66dffcbc-717e-455f-ab76-032d68ffe2f2\', \'multiverseId\': 594121}, \'multiverseid\': 594121}, {\'name\': \'Demonio sombrío\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nCuando el Demonio sombrío entre al campo de batalla, destruye la criatura objetivo que no sea Demonio.\\nAl comienzo de tu mantenimiento, si hay menos de seis cartas de criatura en tu cementerio, sacrifica una criatura.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Demonio\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594238&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'906c09ec-8077-49b0-bd3a-c8871bb66a64\', \'multiverseId\': 594238}, \'multiverseid\': 594238}, {\'name\': \'Démon né des ombres\', \'text\': \'Vol\\nQuand le Démon né des ombres arrive sur le champ de bataille, détruisez une créature non-Démon ciblée.\\nAu début de votre entretien, si votre cimetière contient moins de six cartes de créature, sacrifiez une créature.\', \'type\': \'Créature : démon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594355&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'03176e05-7482-4b91-ae78-5af924a0d63f\', \'multiverseId\': 594355}, \'multiverseid\': 594355}, {\'name\': \'Demone delle Tenebre\', \'text\': "Volare\\nQuando il Demone delle Tenebre entra nel campo di battaglia, distruggi una creatura non Demone bersaglio.\\nAll\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, se ci sono meno di sei carte creatura nel tuo cimitero, sacrifica una creatura.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Demone\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594472&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f4962815-1b52-41ef-95e4-5bb66bfe64d5\', \'multiverseId\': 594472}, \'multiverseid\': 594472}, {\'name\': \'影生まれの悪魔\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n影生まれの悪魔が戦場に出たとき、デーモンでないクリーチャー１体を対象とする。それを破壊する。\\nあなたのアップキープの開始時に、あなたの墓地にあるクリーチャー・カードが６枚より少ない場合、クリーチャー１体を生け贄に捧げる。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — デーモン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594589&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'61b15a50-2270-4c98-ae5c-ad8ebfeaec03\', \'multiverseId\': 594589}, \'multiverseid\': 594589}, {\'name\': \'影裔恶魔\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n当影裔恶魔进战场时，消灭目标非恶魔生物。\\n在你的维持开始时，若你坟墓场中的生物牌少于六张，则牺牲一个生物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～恶魔\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594940&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d0b13906-690b-4473-82da-f102feda5f37\', \'multiverseId\': 594940}, \'multiverseid\': 594940}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schatzhortender Drache\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nWenn der Schatzhortende Drache ins Spiel kommt, erzeuge zwei Schatz-Spielsteine. (Sie sind Artefakte mit „{T}, opfere dieses Artefakt: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe.")\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Drache\', \'flavor\': \'Es war nicht das erste Mal, dass der Drachenhort ein kostenloses Mittagessen anlockte.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597109&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a7a118cb-fc33-48e2-8b0d-321abb8e823f\', \'multiverseId\': 597109}, \'multiverseid\': 597109}, {\'name\': \'Dragón avaro\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nCuando el Dragón avaro entre al campo de batalla, crea dos fichas de Tesoro. (Son artefactos con "{T}, sacrificar este artefacto: Agrega un maná de cualquier color".)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Dragón\', \'flavor\': \'No era la primera vez que el tesoro del dragón atraía la comida.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597155&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aef08c84-e0f2-4e7b-af09-bcbb21aa7f9b\', \'multiverseId\': 597155}, \'multiverseid\': 597155}, {\'name\': \'Dragon insatiable\', \'text\': \'Vol\\nQuand le Dragon insatiable arrive sur le champ de bataille, créez deux jetons Trésor. (Ce sont des artefacts avec « {T}, sacrifiez cet artefact : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix. »)\', \'type\': \'Créature : dragon\', \'flavor\': "Ce n\'était pas la première fois que le trésor du dragon attirait un repas gratuit.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597201&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'54e8519c-cf85-4354-8028-b4e534c37364\', \'multiverseId\': 597201}, \'multiverseid\': 597201}, {\'name\': \'Drago Bramoso\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nQuando il Drago Bramoso entra nel campo di battaglia, crea due pedine Tesoro. (Sono artefatti con "{T}, Sacrifica questo artefatto: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore".)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Drago\', \'flavor\': \'Non era la prima volta che il tesoro del drago attirava uno spuntino gratuito.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597247&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'046eedf7-b88f-4d84-ae7e-c1b4a59a9c1a\', \'multiverseId\': 597247}, \'multiverseid\': 597247}, {\'name\': \'多欲なドラゴン\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n多欲なドラゴンが戦場に出たとき、宝物・トークン２つを生成する。（それらは、「{T},このアーティファクトを生け贄に捧げる：好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。」を持つアーティファクトである。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ドラゴン\', \'flavor\': \'ドラゴンの財宝が食い物を引き寄せたのはこれが初めてではない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597293&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5aa0b31a-097b-48e4-b7fd-04d453d19e57\', \'multiverseId\': 597293}, \'multiverseid\': 597293}, {\'name\': \'贪宝巨龙\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n当贪宝巨龙进战场时，派出两个珍宝衍生物。（它们是具有「{T}，牺牲此神器：加一点任意颜色的法术力」的神器。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～龙\', \'flavor\': \'巨龙宝藏会引来免费午餐，这早不是第一次了。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597431&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'01848968-f9a9-401b-b87d-d7dfa35014bf\', \'multiverseId\': 597431}, \'multiverseid\': 597431}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schelme der Elendraschlucht\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nImmer wenn du während des Zuges eines Gegners einen Zauberspruch wirkst, kannst du eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst, auf die Hand ihres Besitzers zurückbringen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Feenwesen, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': \'Unschuldige Leute, die von einem Feenring angezogen wurden, kommen oft meilenweit vom Weg ab.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595231&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'df401ddf-836e-4f6b-aa55-ea770e5797c0\', \'multiverseId\': 595231}, \'multiverseid\': 595231}, {\'name\': \'Bromistas del Valle Elendra\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nSiempre que lances un hechizo durante el turno de un oponente, puedes regresar la criatura objetivo que controlas a la mano de su propietario.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero hada\', \'flavor\': \'Las víctimas que atraviesan un anillo de hadas se encuentran luego muchos kilómetros más lejos de donde estaban.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595339&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e627ef83-127a-4f05-b983-aa5dd64aae2c\', \'multiverseId\': 595339}, \'multiverseid\': 595339}, {\'name\': "Plaisantins du Vallon d\'Elendra", \'text\': "Vol\\nÀ chaque fois que vous lancez un sort pendant le tour d\'un adversaire, vous pouvez renvoyer une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez dans la main de son propriétaire.", \'type\': \'Créature : peuple fée et sorcier\', \'flavor\': "Les victimes d\'un cercle de færies réapparaissent à des lieues de leur point de départ.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595447&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1e1aab1f-8d52-4cf1-8a44-9afd521d7990\', \'multiverseId\': 595447}, \'multiverseid\': 595447}, {\'name\': \'Burloni di Gola Elendra\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nOgniqualvolta lanci una magia durante il turno di un avversario, puoi far tornare una creatura bersaglio che controlli in mano al suo proprietario.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Mago Spiritello\', \'flavor\': \'Le vittime sospinte attraverso un anello di spiritelli si ritrovano abbandonate a chilometri di distanza.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595555&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4357ead7-8aea-4338-9b47-f3ab7752156b\', \'multiverseId\': 595555}, \'multiverseid\': 595555}, {\'name\': \'エレンドラ谷のいたずら者\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n対戦相手のターン中にあなたが呪文を唱えるたび、あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。あなたはそれをオーナーの手札に戻してもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — フェアリー・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': \'妖精の輪の力を浴びた犠牲者は、気づくと数マイル離れた場所をさまよっている羽目になる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595663&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'84fd223a-66ee-4b4e-9fb9-f0bf71ebfa26\', \'multiverseId\': 595663}, \'multiverseid\': 595663}, {\'name\': \'艾蓝卓幽谷恶戏者\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n每当你在对手的回合中施放咒语时，你可以将目标由你操控的生物移回其拥有者手上。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～仙灵／法术师\', \'flavor\': \'被仙灵轮拉走的人，会发现自己孤身在千里之外。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595987&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'553891d4-cdc3-442f-aecc-f45533faa19b\', \'multiverseId\': 595987}, \'multiverseid\': 595987}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schillernder Atlaskäfer\', \'text\': \'Zu Beginn deines Endsegments erzeugst du für jede +1/+1-Marke, die du in diesem Zug auf Kreaturen unter deiner Kontrolle gelegt hast, einen 1/1 grünen Insekt-Kreaturenspielstein.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Insekt\', \'flavor\': \'Die Jungtiere werden die Dschungel von Murasa mit einer glitzernden Flut füllen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592877&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'50e31071-f9ea-4db0-a628-78a6a0fa9724\', \'multiverseId\': 592877}, \'multiverseid\': 592877}, {\'name\': \'Corniescarabajo iridiscente\', \'text\': \'Al comienzo de tu paso final, crea una ficha de criatura Insecto verde 1/1 por cada contador +1/+1 que hayas puesto sobre criaturas bajo tu control este turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Insecto\', \'flavor\': \'Las larvas llenarán las selvas de Murasa como si de una ola de brillo se tratase.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592998&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e36cc37c-c7bf-45b8-a674-cbb3a25e4d35\', \'multiverseId\': 592998}, \'multiverseid\': 592998}, {\'name\': \'Scaraborne iridescent\', \'text\': \'Au début de votre étape de fin, créez un jeton de créature 1/1 verte Insecte pour chaque marqueur +1/+1 que vous avez mis sur des créatures sous votre contrôle ce tour-ci.\', \'type\': \'Créature : insecte\', \'flavor\': "Les larves couvriront les jungles de Murasa d\'une vague scintillante.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593119&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ba82bde4-7405-41a4-9e85-3d37e7045ce0\', \'multiverseId\': 593119}, \'multiverseid\': 593119}, {\'name\': \'Cornoleottero Iridescente\', \'text\': "All\'inizio della tua sottofase finale, crea una pedina creatura Insetto 1/1 verde per ogni segnalino +1/+1 che hai messo sulle creature sotto il tuo controllo in questo turno.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Insetto\', \'flavor\': \'I nuovi nati riempiranno le giungle di Murasa come una marea scintillante.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593240&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9ed3f7a9-6c32-4958-8654-313e1b62184e\', \'multiverseId\': 593240}, \'multiverseid\': 593240}, {\'name\': \'玉虫色の角甲虫\', \'text\': \'あなたの終了ステップの開始時に、あなたがこのターンにあなたのコントロール下のクリーチャーの上に置いた＋１/＋１カウンター１個につき１体の、緑の１/１の昆虫・クリーチャー・トークンを生成する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 昆虫\', \'flavor\': \'その幼虫は輝く津波のようにムラーサのジャングルを埋め尽くす。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593361&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3c184d85-cee2-46ba-83a7-c3b1fcb6ce84\', \'multiverseId\': 593361}, \'multiverseid\': 593361}, {\'name\': \'虹彩角虫\', \'text\': \'在你的结束步骤开始时，你本回合中每在由你操控的生物上放置过一个+1/+1指示物，便派出一个1/1绿色昆虫衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～昆虫\', \'flavor\': \'其幼虫会让整个姆拉撒丛林色彩斑斓。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593724&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ff6f3683-d2db-4f38-881c-5abc4b818aa2\', \'multiverseId\': 593724}, \'multiverseid\': 593724}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schimmernder Drache\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nSolange du vier oder mehr Artefakte kontrollierst, hat der Schimmernde Drache Fluchsicherheit.\\nTappe zwei ungetappte Artefakte, die du kontrollierst: Ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Drache\', \'flavor\': \'Der indigofarbene Drache tauschte gerne einen kleinen Teil seines Horts gegen ewiges Mondlicht.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595273&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c56dee3b-ec32-40b3-b933-890082df81e0\', \'multiverseId\': 595273}, \'multiverseid\': 595273}, {\'name\': \'Dragón centelleante\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nMientras controles cuatro o más artefactos, el Dragón centelleante tiene la habilidad de antimaleficio.\\nGirar dos artefactos enderezados que controlas: Roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Dragón\', \'flavor\': \'El dragón índigo entregó con gusto parte de su tesoro a cambio de bañarse eternamente en la luz de la luna.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595381&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9c633457-a422-4dd1-8962-4f0fefd88334\', \'multiverseId\': 595381}, \'multiverseid\': 595381}, {\'name\': \'Dragon scintillant\', \'text\': \'Vol\\nTant que vous contrôlez au moins quatre artefacts, le Dragon scintillant a la défense talismanique.\\nEngagez deux artefacts dégagés que vous contrôlez : Piochez une carte.\', \'type\': \'Créature : dragon\', \'flavor\': \'Le dragon indigo troqua volontiers une part de son trésor contre un éternel clair de lune.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595489&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c62a8422-78c4-4880-a4e2-5dcbc69a4c27\', \'multiverseId\': 595489}, \'multiverseid\': 595489}, {\'name\': \'Drago Scintillante\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nFintanto che controlli quattro o più artefatti, il Drago Scintillante ha anti-malocchio.\\nTAPpa due artefatti STAPpati che controlli: Pesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Drago\', \'flavor\': "Il drago indaco fu ben lieto di privarsi di un po\' del suo tesoro in cambio di luce lunare eterna.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595597&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5feb1ebb-17e1-45d7-b33b-3f47e7991ad7\', \'multiverseId\': 595597}, \'multiverseid\': 595597}, {\'name\': \'煌めくドラゴン\', \'text\': \'飛行\\nあなたが４つ以上のアーティファクトをコントロールしているかぎり、煌めくドラゴンは呪禁を持つ。\\nあなたがコントロールしているアンタップ状態のアーティファクト２つをタップする：カード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ドラゴン\', \'flavor\': \'この藍色のドラゴンは自分の財産の一部と引き換えに永遠の月明かりを手に入れた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595705&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'580cb7b2-04c5-4462-91c9-6c790cd39cd8\', \'multiverseId\': 595705}, \'multiverseid\': 595705}, {\'name\': \'闪光巨龙\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n只要你操控四个或更多神器，闪光巨龙便具有辟邪异能。\\n横置两个由你操控且未横置的神器：抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～龙\', \'flavor\': \'靛青巨龙高兴地用其一小部分珍藏换来了永恒月光。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596029&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ee67ef1d-d1b7-46fa-b37c-246b96e28512\', \'multiverseId\': 596029}, \'multiverseid\': 596029}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schimmerschnee-Tal\', \'text\': \'Das Schimmerschnee-Tal kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nSowie das Schimmerschnee-Tal ins Spiel kommt, bestimme eine Farbe.\\n{T}: Erzeuge ein Mana der bestimmten Farbe.\', \'type\': \'Verschneites Land\', \'flavor\': \'Spiegelungen vom windgepeitschten Schnee glänzen in allen Farben des Regenbogens.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596325&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ac1c0e0d-42e0-4125-98d7-7a1ad65d5741\', \'multiverseId\': 596325}, \'multiverseid\': 596325}, {\'name\': \'Valle del brillo errante\', \'text\': \'El Valle del brillo errante entra al campo de batalla girado.\\nEn cuanto el Valle del brillo errante entre al campo de batalla, elige un color.\\n{T}: Agrega un maná del color elegido.\', \'type\': \'Tierra nevada\', \'flavor\': \'Los reflejos de la nieve esculpida por el viento brillan con cada color del arcoíris.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596412&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'819de387-3c08-456d-8022-d778cb1fc52b\', \'multiverseId\': 596412}, \'multiverseid\': 596412}, {\'name\': \'Val de la Congère scintillante\', \'text\': \'Le Val de la Congère scintillante arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\nAu moment où le Val de la Congère scintillante arrive sur le champ de bataille, choisissez une couleur.\\n{T} : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur choisie.\', \'type\': \'Terrain neigeux\', \'flavor\': "Les reflets sur la neige sculptée par le vent brillent de toutes les couleurs de l\'arc-en-ciel.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596499&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'99227e5b-8b64-469b-8508-cd9512b95141\', \'multiverseId\': 596499}, \'multiverseid\': 596499}, {\'name\': \'Valle dei Fiocchi Lucenti\', \'text\': \'La Valle dei Fiocchi Lucenti entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpata.\\nMentre la Valle dei Fiocchi Lucenti entra nel campo di battaglia, scegli un colore.\\n{T}: Aggiungi un mana del colore scelto.\', \'type\': \'Terra Neve\', \'flavor\': "I riflessi della neve scolpita dal vento brillano di ogni colore dell\'arcobaleno.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596586&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f3c1e420-b273-4c0a-890a-1b98a4dc2630\', \'multiverseId\': 596586}, \'multiverseid\': 596586}, {\'name\': \'煌積の谷間\', \'text\': \'煌積の谷間はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n煌積の谷間が戦場に出るに際し、色１色を選ぶ。\\n{T}：その選ばれた色のマナ１点を加える。\', \'type\': \'氷雪土地\', \'flavor\': \'風に削られた雪に反射する光が、虹のすべての色に染まっている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596673&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'830fff07-1cf0-4434-bc85-cf950ed09658\', \'multiverseId\': 596673}, \'multiverseid\': 596673}, {\'name\': \'烁迹山谷\', \'text\': \'烁迹山谷须横置进战场。\\n于烁迹山谷进战场时，选择一种颜色。\\n{T}：加一点该色的法术力。\', \'type\': \'雪境地\', \'flavor\': \'寒风塑造的多样积雪折射出彩虹的斑斓光辉。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596934&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'19f112f5-45b0-4b50-804f-7fb5134cf51e\', \'multiverseId\': 596934}, \'multiverseid\': 596934}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schindekäfer\', \'text\': \'Ausplündern {5}{G} ({5}{G}, schicke diese Karte aus deinem Friedhof ins Exil: Lege so viele +1/+1-Marken, wie die Stärke dieser Karte beträgt, auf eine Kreatur deiner Wahl. Spiele Ausplündern wie eine Hexerei.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Insekt\', \'flavor\': \'Der Straßenschwarm ist die Arbeiterklasse, die den endlosen Zyklus von Leben und Tod der Golgari antreibt.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592848&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e13c0cef-8147-44ff-8d30-123940ad4785\', \'multiverseId\': 592848}, \'multiverseid\': 592848}, {\'name\': \'Escarabajo esclavo\', \'text\': \'Carroñar {5}{G}. ({5}{G}, exiliar esta carta de tu cementerio: Pon una cantidad de contadores +1/+1 sobre la criatura objetivo igual a la fuerza de esta carta. Activa la habilidad de carroñar como un conjuro.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Insecto\', \'flavor\': \'El Enjambre callejero es la clase trabajadora que hace funcionar el ciclo eterno de la vida y la muerte de los golgari.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592969&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2c44eb34-c58e-4d16-b341-765de7f84ff6\', \'multiverseId\': 592969}, \'multiverseid\': 592969}, {\'name\': \'Scarabée servile\', \'text\': \'Récupération {5}{G} ({5}{G}, exilez cette carte de votre cimetière : Mettez un nombre de marqueurs +1/+1 égal à la force de cette carte sur une créature ciblée. Ne récupérez que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.)\', \'type\': \'Créature : insecte\', \'flavor\': "L\'Essaim des rues est la classe ouvrière qui perpétue le cycle de vie et de mort des Golgari.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593090&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0b7bd1a3-b133-426c-8159-5cc2cb569e69\', \'multiverseId\': 593090}, \'multiverseid\': 593090}, {\'name\': \'Scarabeo di Fatica\', \'text\': \'Mangiacarogne {5}{G} ({5}{G}, Esilia questa carta dal tuo cimitero: Metti un numero di segnalini +1/+1 pari alla forza di questa carta su una creatura bersaglio. Attiva mangiacarogne solo come una stregoneria.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Insetto\', \'flavor\': \'Lo Sciame Urbano è formato dagli operai che mantengono in funzione il ciclo infinito di vita e di morte dei Golgari.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593211&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9fcb3a27-470c-43ed-9dc1-8452d7271dc1\', \'multiverseId\': 593211}, \'multiverseid\': 593211}, {\'name\': \'蠢く甲虫\', \'text\': \'活用{5}{G} ({5}{G} ,あなたの墓地にあるこのカードを追放する：クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それの上にこのカードのパワーに等しい個数の＋１/＋１カウンターを置く。活用はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 昆虫\', \'flavor\': \'ゴルガリによる絶えることのない生と死の連環を支えている労働者階級、それが街路衆である。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593332&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d79654de-991e-42ba-bf26-05c520c47d3e\', \'multiverseId\': 593332}, \'multiverseid\': 593332}, {\'name\': \'苦力甲虫\', \'text\': \'食腐{5}{G}（{5}{G}，从你的坟墓场放逐此牌：在目标生物上放置若干+1/+1指示物，其数量等同于此牌的力量。只能于法术时机食腐。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～昆虫\', \'flavor\': \'街虫群是葛加理的劳工阶级，推动着永恒的生死循环。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593695&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ce3ec911-c765-49fb-bda4-5899c661c079\', \'multiverseId\': 593695}, \'multiverseid\': 593695}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schlachtfest der Ghule\', \'text\': \'Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält bis zum Ende des Zuges +X/+0, wobei X gleich der Anzahl an Kreaturenkarten in deinem Friedhof ist.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Üppig, sorgfältig fermentiert und mit einem seidigen Augenpüree serviert. Du musst einfach einen Bissen probieren."\\n—Varina, Lichkönigin\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597527&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eab0f9f0-d91f-4ea8-beeb-451828771b15\', \'multiverseId\': 597527}, \'multiverseid\': 597527}, {\'name\': \'Festín del necrófago\', \'text\': \'La criatura objetivo obtiene +X/+0 hasta el final del turno, donde X es la cantidad de cartas de criatura en tu cementerio.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Exquisito, fermentado a la perfección y servido con un suavísimo puré ocular. Tienes que probarlo".\\n—Varina, reina liche\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597552&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1eabd772-8eac-459e-aa4a-ca1085db9f07\', \'multiverseId\': 597552}, \'multiverseid\': 597552}, {\'name\': \'Festin des goules\', \'text\': "Une créature ciblée gagne +X/+0 jusqu\'à la fin du tour, X étant le nombre de cartes de créature dans votre cimetière.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Somptueuse, soigneusement fermentée, et accompagnée d\'une onctueuse purée oculaire. Vous devez absolument goûter. »\\n—Varina, reine liche", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597577&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'524a4630-0181-4436-bdef-c8ac213389a4\', \'multiverseId\': 597577}, \'multiverseid\': 597577}, {\'name\': \'Banchetto del Ghoul\', \'text\': \'Una creatura bersaglio prende +X/+0 fino alla fine del turno, dove X è il numero di carte creatura nel tuo cimitero.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Sontuoso, perfettamente fermentato e servito con una purea oculare vellutata. Devi assolutamente assaggiarlo."\\n—Varina, Regina Lich\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597602&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cc4fbf1e-9ca4-429e-a9fc-9af91197a474\', \'multiverseId\': 597602}, \'multiverseid\': 597602}, {\'name\': \'食屍鬼の饗宴\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは＋Ｘ/＋０の修整を受ける。Ｘはあなたの墓地にあるクリーチャー・カードの枚数に等しい。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「丹念な熟成の末、口当たりの良い眼球ピューレを添えた豪勢な一品だ。一口食べてみるがよい。」\\n――リッチの女王、ヴァリーナ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597627&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ee01e12a-4e9c-4e67-9528-01c576fe394f\', \'multiverseId\': 597627}, \'multiverseid\': 597627}, {\'name\': \'食尸鬼盛宴\', \'text\': \'目标生物得+X/+0直到回合结束，X为你坟墓场中的生物牌数量。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「主菜十分丰盛，经过悉心发酵，且配有丝滑眼泥。你一定要尝一口。」\\n～巫妖女王瓦理娜\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597702&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8aecde87-ffb4-4da3-9cbb-3a836d35e1c7\', \'multiverseId\': 597702}, \'multiverseid\': 597702}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schlammknopf-Fackelläufer\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Schlammknopf-Fackelläufer stirbt, fügt er einem Ziel deiner Wahl 3 Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Goblin, Krieger\', \'flavor\': \'Das Öl schwappt auf seinen Schädel, während er sich seinem Ziel nähert: dem Froschwerfer-Wettbewerb und dem Entzünden des flammenden Boggarts.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590282&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'af7d1ee1-40ef-4c37-a0c9-543968e2c90b\', \'multiverseId\': 590282}, \'multiverseid\': 590282}, {\'name\': \'Antorchero de Botón Fangoso\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Antorchero de Botón Fangoso muera, hace 3 puntos de daño a cualquier objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero trasgo\', \'flavor\': \'El aceite golpea contra su cabeza mientras se acerca a su destino: los juegos de lanzamiento de rana y el encendido del Boggart llameante.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590417&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f41b5f24-8d2a-4005-bf55-83e5fd2a96ad\', \'multiverseId\': 590417}, \'multiverseid\': 590417}, {\'name\': \'Porteur de torche de Baugebouton\', \'text\': "Quand le Porteur de torche de Baugebouton meurt, il inflige 3 blessures à n\'importe quelle cible.", \'type\': \'Créature : gobelin et guerrier\', \'flavor\': "L\'huile coule sur son crâne tandis qu\'il approche de sa destination : l\'ouverture des Jeux de lancer de grenouilles et l\'allumage du Boggart de Feu.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590552&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bdf0d92f-650c-45e5-aa4f-6fd8640f9988\', \'multiverseId\': 590552}, \'multiverseid\': 590552}, {\'name\': \'Tedoforo di Bottone Fangoso\', \'text\': \'Quando il Tedoforo di Bottone Fangoso muore, infligge 3 danni a un qualsiasi bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Goblin\', \'flavor\': "L\'olio gli sciaborda sul cranio mentre si avvicina alla meta: i Giochi del Lancio della Rana e l\'accensione del Boggart Infuocato.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590687&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ff0d78dc-870c-402a-baa8-98d666311314\', \'multiverseId\': 590687}, \'multiverseid\': 590687}, {\'name\': \'泥デコの松明走り\', \'text\': \'泥デコの松明走りが死亡したとき、クリーチャーやプレインズウォーカーやプレイヤーのうち１つを対象とする。これはそれに３点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ゴブリン・戦士\', \'flavor\': \'蛙投げ遊びと燃えボガートの点火という目的地に近づくにつれ、彼の頭の油はさらに波打った。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590822&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c896a8c9-de06-4a86-bb74-f5f071ec75f3\', \'multiverseId\': 590822}, \'multiverseid\': 590822}, {\'name\': \'泥钮炬跑者\', \'text\': \'当泥钮炬跑者死去时，它对任意一个目标造成3点伤害。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～鬼怪／战士\', \'flavor\': \'油一滴滴溅在头颅上，他也逐渐接近最终点：掷蛙比赛与烧波尬火炬。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591227&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6f00e849-0a82-45be-8605-cfeaa6814bbb\', \'multiverseId\': 591227}, \'multiverseid\': 591227}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schleichender Blutsauger\', \'text\': \'Zu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments fügt der Schleichende Blutsauger jedem Gegner 1 Schadenspunkt zu. Du erhältst so viele Lebenspunkte dazu, wie auf diese Weise Schadenspunkte zugefügt wurden.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vampir\', \'flavor\': \'„Wenn dich ein Vampir jede Nacht aussaugen würde, hättest du Bisswunden. Verschwende nicht meine Zeit."\\n—Donya, Dorfheilerin\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589626&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0f7b6444-48f1-4e79-bdd4-9bf15e2de3fe\', \'multiverseId\': 589626}, \'multiverseid\': 589626}, {\'name\': \'Chupasangre insidioso\', \'text\': \'Al comienzo de tu mantenimiento, el Chupasangre insidioso hace 1 punto de daño a cada oponente. Ganas una cantidad de vidas igual al daño hecho de esta manera.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Vampiro\', \'flavor\': \'"Si un vampiro te estuviese chupando la sangre cada noche, ¿acaso no tendrías mordeduras? No me hagas perder más el tiempo".\\n—Donya, curandera del pueblo\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589677&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b326d40f-035a-498d-aa08-92f05b5a0177\', \'multiverseId\': 589677}, \'multiverseid\': 589677}, {\'name\': \'Suceur de sang rampant\', \'text\': \'Au début de votre entretien, le Suceur de sang rampant inflige 1 blessure à chaque adversaire. Vous gagnez autant de points de vie que de blessures infligées de cette manière.\', \'type\': \'Créature : vampire\', \'flavor\': "« Si un vampire se nourrissait de vous chaque nuit, n\'auriez-vous pas des traces de morsures ? Arrêtez de me faire perdre mon temps. »\\n—Donya, guérisseuse du village", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589728&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'57926465-c12b-4f91-a405-2c4fe7154d65\', \'multiverseId\': 589728}, \'multiverseid\': 589728}, {\'name\': \'Intruso Succhiasangue\', \'text\': "All\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, l\'Intruso Succhiasangue infligge 1 danno a ogni avversario. Guadagni punti vita pari ai danni inflitti in questo modo.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Vampiro\', \'flavor\': \'"Se un vampiro ti succhiasse il sangue ogni notte, lascerebbe i segni dei denti, no? Smettila di farmi perdere tempo."\\n—Donya, guaritrice del villaggio\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589779&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7ae9201f-da2d-400d-9984-497f389f925c\', \'multiverseId\': 589779}, \'multiverseid\': 589779}, {\'name\': \'這い寄る吸血者\', \'text\': \'あなたのアップキープの開始時に、這い寄る吸血者は各対戦相手にそれぞれ１点のダメージを与える。あなたはこれにより与えたダメージに等しい点数のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 吸血鬼\', \'flavor\': \'「もし吸血鬼が君の血を毎晩吸っていたら、噛み跡があるはずだろう？くだらない事を言うんじゃないよ。」\\n――村の癒し手、ドーニャ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589830&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3ef8c23e-a022-431f-ad08-454c013421a3\', \'multiverseId\': 589830}, \'multiverseid\': 589830}, {\'name\': \'匍行吸血怪\', \'text\': \'在你的维持开始时，匍行吸血怪向每位对手各造成1点伤害。你获得等同于以此法所造成的伤害之生命。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～吸血鬼\', \'flavor\': \'「如果是吸血鬼每晚都来吸你的血，那你至少会有牙印吧？别再浪费我的时间了。」\\n～村庄治疗师唐娅\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589983&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c8dd2639-a7e1-4a9c-84cd-1c0ded76b12a\', \'multiverseId\': 589983}, \'multiverseid\': 589983}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schleudertrupp-Leutnant\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Schleudertrupp-Leutnant ins Spiel kommt, erzeuge zwei 1/1 rote Goblin-Kreaturenspielsteine.\\nOpfere einen Goblin: Ein Spieler deiner Wahl verliert 1 Lebenspunkt und du erhältst 1 Lebenspunkt dazu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Goblin\', \'flavor\': \'Gerade zum „Weichgeschoss" befördert, brannte Zaz darauf, richtig Eindruck zu hinterlassen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594126&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c514cfbe-a94a-49f3-8a50-b97347b88a03\', \'multiverseId\': 594126}, \'multiverseid\': 594126}, {\'name\': \'Teniente del lanzatrasgos\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Teniente del lanzatrasgos entre al campo de batalla, crea dos fichas de criatura Trasgo rojas 1/1.\\nSacrificar un Trasgo: El jugador objetivo pierde 1 vida y tú ganas 1 vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Trasgo\', \'flavor\': \'Con su reciente ascenso a "primera roca", Zaz estaba deseando causar impacto.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594243&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b437b340-3397-4514-b018-a675679dfcd8\', \'multiverseId\': 594243}, \'multiverseid\': 594243}, {\'name\': \'Lieutenant des catapultants\', \'text\': \'Quand le Lieutenant des catapultants arrive sur le champ de bataille, créez deux jetons de créature 1/1 rouge Gobelin.\\nSacrifiez un gobelin : Un joueur ciblé perd 1 point de vie et vous gagnez 1 point de vie.\', \'type\': \'Créature : gobelin\', \'flavor\': "Récemment promu « première pierre », Zaz était impatient d\'avoir un impact sur les combats.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594360&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a44984a2-074e-4d6f-aa0c-f4a7c7c18000\', \'multiverseId\': 594360}, \'multiverseid\': 594360}, {\'name\': \'Tenente della Squadra della Fionda\', \'text\': \'Quando il Tenente della Squadra della Fionda entra nel campo di battaglia, crea due pedine creatura Goblin 1/1 rosse.\\nSacrifica un Goblin: Un giocatore bersaglio perde 1 punto vita e tu guadagni 1 punto vita.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Goblin\', \'flavor\': \'Appena promosso a "prima pietra", Zaz era ansioso di fare colpo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594477&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ebba4729-2c82-44c8-bc62-aa82e0361a70\', \'multiverseId\': 594477}, \'multiverseid\': 594477}, {\'name\': \'投石攻撃の副官\', \'text\': \'投石攻撃の副官が戦場に出たとき、赤の１/１のゴブリン・クリーチャー・トークン２体を生成する。\\nゴブリン１体を生け贄に捧げる：プレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーは１点のライフを失い、あなたは１点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ゴブリン\', \'flavor\': \'「一等石」に昇進したばかりのザズは、衝撃を与えたくてたまらなかった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594594&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'12d06cf2-7ffb-4cae-a18c-6e2c8ed92eb5\', \'multiverseId\': 594594}, \'multiverseid\': 594594}, {\'name\': \'掷弹指战官\', \'text\': \'当掷弹指战官进战场时，派出两个1/1红色鬼怪衍生生物。\\n牺牲一个鬼怪：目标牌手失去1点生命且你获得1点生命。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～鬼怪\', \'flavor\': \'刚晋升为「尖石」的查仔等不及要有冲击性的表现。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594945&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'94620425-b4a2-4204-aec3-c990f1ac289f\', \'multiverseId\': 594945}, \'multiverseid\': 594945}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schlingender Aasgeier\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nWenn der Schlingende Aasgeier ins Spiel kommt, millst du vier Karten. Du erhältst für jede Kreaturenkarte, die auf diese Weise gemillt wurde, 1 Lebenspunkt dazu. (Um eine Karte zu millen, lege die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek auf deinen Friedhof.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vogel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594077&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f76c9d0d-886c-468f-8f0f-118db033c8e9\', \'multiverseId\': 594077}, \'multiverseid\': 594077}, {\'name\': \'Buitre atiborrándose\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nCuando el Buitre atiborrándose entre al campo de batalla, muele cuatro cartas. Ganas 1 vida por cada carta de criatura molida de esta manera. (Para moler una carta, pon la primera carta de tu biblioteca en tu cementerio.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ave\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594194&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1c5b5272-11b3-4dea-aa29-bb14c43843e8\', \'multiverseId\': 594194}, \'multiverseid\': 594194}, {\'name\': \'Vautour goulu\', \'text\': \'Vol\\nQuand le Vautour goulu arrive sur le champ de bataille, meulez quatre cartes. Vous gagnez 1 point de vie pour chaque carte de créature meulée de cette manière. (Pour meuler une carte, mettez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque dans votre cimetière.)\', \'type\': \'Créature : oiseau\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594311&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'18c610f4-6337-41e7-b333-3968bce67b08\', \'multiverseId\': 594311}, \'multiverseid\': 594311}, {\'name\': \'Avvoltoio Divoratore\', \'text\': "Volare\\nQuando l\'Avvoltoio Divoratore entra nel campo di battaglia, macina quattro carte. Guadagni 1 punto vita per ogni carta creatura macinata in questo modo. (Per macinare una carta, metti nel tuo cimitero la prima carta del tuo grimorio.)", \'type\': \'Creatura — Uccello\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594428&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'29e6344a-2222-4c3b-b0c8-55f97d601cf6\', \'multiverseId\': 594428}, \'multiverseid\': 594428}, {\'name\': \'貪る禿鷹\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n貪る禿鷹が戦場に出たとき、カード４枚を切削する。あなたは、これにより切削されたクリーチャー・カード１枚につき１点のライフを得る。（カードを切削するとは、あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカードをあなたの墓地に置くことである。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 鳥\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594545&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a52f7479-6bde-437d-a343-d019511ff35c\', \'multiverseId\': 594545}, \'multiverseid\': 594545}, {\'name\': \'食尸兀鹰\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n当食尸兀鹰进战场时，磨四张牌。每以此法磨掉一张生物牌，你便获得1点生命。（磨一张牌的流程是将你牌库顶的牌置入你的坟墓场。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～鸟\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594896&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ea530bec-74f5-4b8c-ab47-adf47f02facb\', \'multiverseId\': 594896}, \'multiverseid\': 594896}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schlitterschädel-Würmchen\', \'text\': \'Wenn das Schlitterschädel-Würmchen ins Spiel kommt, wirft jeder Gegner eine Karte ab. Für jeden Gegner, der dies nicht kann, lege zwei +1/+1-Marken auf das Schlitterschädel-Würmchen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Würmchen\', \'flavor\': \'Als Larven graben sie sich in das Gehirn eines Wirts ein, um sich von ihm zu ernähren, bis sie groß genug sind, um auszubrechen und nach größerer Beute zu suchen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589631&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'754c79c8-813f-4b3a-b932-708c8def8d7b\', \'multiverseId\': 589631}, \'multiverseid\': 589631}, {\'name\': \'Gusano profanacalaveras\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Gusano profanacalaveras entre al campo de batalla, cada oponente descarta una carta. Por cada oponente que no pueda hacerlo, pon dos contadores +1/+1 sobre el Gusano profanacalaveras.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Gusano\', \'flavor\': \'Cuando son larvas, se meten en el cerebro de un huésped para alimentarse de él hasta que son lo suficientemente grandes para desgarrarlo desde dentro y buscar una presa mayor.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589682&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f43b9835-6861-488c-bb4e-3d6375b07442\', \'multiverseId\': 589682}, \'multiverseid\': 589682}, {\'name\': \'Ver rampecrâne\', \'text\': "Quand le Ver rampecrâne arrive sur le champ de bataille, chaque adversaire se défausse d\'une carte. Pour chaque adversaire qui ne peut pas faire ainsi, mettez deux marqueurs +1/+1 sur le Ver rampecrâne.", \'type\': \'Créature : ver\', \'flavor\': "Les larves s\'enfouissent dans la cervelle d\'un hôte afin de s\'en nourrir et ressortent lorsqu\'elles sont suffisamment grosses pour partir à la recherche de proies plus grosses.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589733&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cea1b386-b9dc-40db-931e-b9518d07580c\', \'multiverseId\': 589733}, \'multiverseid\': 589733}, {\'name\': \'Verme Strisciacrani\', \'text\': \'Quando il Verme Strisciacrani entra nel campo di battaglia, ogni avversario scarta una carta. Per ogni avversario che non può farlo, metti due segnalini +1/+1 sul Verme Strisciacrani.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Verme\', \'flavor\': \'Allo stadio larvale, si fanno strada nel cervello di un ospite per nutrirsene, poi crescono fino a potersi liberare a forza per cercare una preda più grande.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589784&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7acd6836-9ae5-4fde-a811-6a323864d6c5\', \'multiverseId\': 589784}, \'multiverseid\': 589784}, {\'name\': \'頭蓋滑り蟲\', \'text\': \'頭蓋滑り蟲が戦場に出たとき、各対戦相手はそれぞれカード１枚を捨てる。頭蓋滑り蟲の上に、そうできなかった対戦相手１人につき２個の＋１/＋１カウンターを置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 蟲\', \'flavor\': \'幼虫期は宿主の脳に潜り込んで餌とし、適当な大きさまで成長したら勢いよく突き破ってより大きな獲物を探す。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589835&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'107d4230-ccee-431a-819b-d7b7fce685eb\', \'multiverseId\': 589835}, \'multiverseid\': 589835}, {\'name\': \'滑骨蠕虫\', \'text\': \'当滑骨蠕虫进战场时，每位对手各弃一张牌。每有一位无法如此作的对手，便在滑骨蠕虫上放置两个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～蠕虫\', \'flavor\': \'它们在幼虫时期会潜伏宿主脑中汲取养分，待长到够大之后，就会钻破脑壳去寻找更大的猎物。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589988&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5f1615c3-6937-444f-9dc0-689cfbded4c5\', \'multiverseId\': 589988}, \'multiverseid\': 589988}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schlummerndes Tyrannodon\', \'text\': \'Verteidiger\\nSolange du eine Kreatur mit Stärke 4 oder mehr kontrollierst, kann das Schlummernde Tyrannodon angreifen, als ob es nicht Verteidiger hätte.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Dinosaurier\', \'flavor\': \'Was die Jäger für ein warnendes Knurren hielten, entpuppte sich als nichts weiter als ein monströses Schnarchen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592847&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'396e68e9-3589-4f96-836e-c1a03c36ea39\', \'multiverseId\': 592847}, \'multiverseid\': 592847}, {\'name\': \'Tiranodón soñoliento\', \'text\': \'Defensor.\\nMientras controles una criatura con fuerza de 4 o más, el Tiranodón soñoliento puede atacar como si no tuviera la habilidad de defensor.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Dinosaurio\', \'flavor\': \'Los guardabosques creían que eran gruñidos de advertencia, pero al final resultaron ser solo unos ronquidos monstruosos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592968&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'88644969-71fc-465b-ad5e-42a06200e496\', \'multiverseId\': 592968}, \'multiverseid\': 592968}, {\'name\': \'Tyrannodon somnolant\', \'text\': "Défenseur\\nTant que vous contrôlez une créature de force supérieure ou égale à 4, le Tyrannodon somnolant peut attaquer comme s\'il n\'avait pas le défenseur.", \'type\': \'Créature : dinosaure\', \'flavor\': "Les rangers croyaient qu\'il s\'agissait de grognements d\'avertissement, mais ce n\'était en fait que des ronflements monstrueux.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593089&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9dd8edfc-ee2b-454d-9d02-768af20d0f79\', \'multiverseId\': 593089}, \'multiverseid\': 593089}, {\'name\': \'Tirannodonte Addormentato\', \'text\': \'Difensore\\nFintanto che controlli una creatura con forza pari o superiore a 4, il Tirannodonte Addormentato può attaccare come se non avesse difensore.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Dinosauro\', \'flavor\': \'Quelli che i ranger scambiarono per ruggiti di avvertimento si rivelarono essere un mostruoso russare.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593210&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'74c6e151-b810-45ed-b40a-071367b3953b\', \'multiverseId\': 593210}, \'multiverseid\': 593210}, {\'name\': \'うたた寝するティラノドン\', \'text\': \'防衛\\nあなたがパワーが４以上であるクリーチャーをコントロールしているかぎり、うたた寝するティラノドンは、これが防衛を持たないかのように攻撃できる。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 恐竜\', \'flavor\': \'レインジャーたちが威嚇の唸り声だと考えたものは、単なる大いびきに過ぎなかった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593331&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'02bb69a2-1ab2-48d7-adbd-bb11e90a2e7e\', \'multiverseId\': 593331}, \'multiverseid\': 593331}, {\'name\': \'昏睡暴伟龙\', \'text\': \'守军\\n只要你操控力量等于或大于4的生物，昏睡暴伟龙便能视同不具守军异能地进行攻击。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～恐龙\', \'flavor\': \'原本护林人当作是警告的低沉吼声，后来发现不过是怪兽的熟睡鼾音。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593694&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'834f90bc-272b-415b-81f9-50ff5c3ab07d\', \'multiverseId\': 593694}, \'multiverseid\': 593694}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schlurfender Ghul\', \'text\': \'Der Schlurfende Ghul kommt getappt ins Spiel.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Zombie\', \'flavor\': \'Einmal auferstanden, schlurft er immer weiter.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594122&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e5109447-4036-438e-ab1e-a5a796c3d711\', \'multiverseId\': 594122}, \'multiverseid\': 594122}, {\'name\': \'Necrófago tambaleante\', \'text\': \'El Necrófago tambaleante entra al campo de batalla girado.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Zombie\', \'flavor\': \'Una vez que se pone en marcha, sus pasos tambaleantes continuarán siempre.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594239&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'25604c24-f0e3-499f-9c36-ec313cf21294\', \'multiverseId\': 594239}, \'multiverseid\': 594239}, {\'name\': \'Goule titubante\', \'text\': \'La Goule titubante arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée.\', \'type\': \'Créature : zombie\', \'flavor\': "Une fois debout, elle titube pour l\'éternité.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594356&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f30f730e-019f-463f-bdfe-7271669ecae0\', \'multiverseId\': 594356}, \'multiverseid\': 594356}, {\'name\': \'Ghoul Barcollante\', \'text\': \'Il Ghoul Barcollante entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Zombie\', \'flavor\': \'Una volta che ha iniziato, continuerà a barcollare per sempre.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594473&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c6fac008-f3f4-49f5-81db-4f8b4587388d\', \'multiverseId\': 594473}, \'multiverseid\': 594473}, {\'name\': \'よろめくグール\', \'text\': \'よろめくグールはタップ状態で戦場に出る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ゾンビ\', \'flavor\': \'一度立ち上がって進み始めれば、それは永遠によろめき進む。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594590&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6be5d088-d154-4e35-9a3f-067bef5cf079\', \'multiverseId\': 594590}, \'multiverseid\': 594590}, {\'name\': \'跛行食尸鬼\', \'text\': \'跛行食尸鬼须横置进战场。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～灵俑\', \'flavor\': \'一旦起身向前，便将蹒跚不止。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594941&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'31b6512f-6399-4d4b-abd7-b5588805bb15\', \'multiverseId\': 594941}, \'multiverseid\': 594941}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schlängelndes Ungeziefer\', \'text\': \'{3}{B}{B}: Monstrum 3. (Falls diese Kreatur nicht monströs ist, lege drei +1/+1-Marken auf sie und sie wird monströs.)\\nSolange das Schlängelnde Ungeziefer monströs ist, hat es Bedrohlichkeit. (Es kann nicht geblockt werden, außer von zwei oder mehr Kreaturen.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Ratte, Schrecken\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594123&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6b79cf11-8582-498a-85cb-4dbeaf0921d5\', \'multiverseId\': 594123}, \'multiverseid\': 594123}, {\'name\': \'Plaga sinuosa\', \'text\': \'{3}{B}{B}: Monstruosidad 3. (Si esta criatura no es monstruosa, pon tres contadores +1/+1 sobre ella y se convierte en monstruosa.)\\nMientras la Plaga sinuosa sea monstruosa, tiene la habilidad de amenaza. (No puede ser bloqueada excepto por dos o más criaturas.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Horror rata\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594240&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ef8f2d7e-418a-4796-b647-cd90464c294a\', \'multiverseId\': 594240}, \'multiverseid\': 594240}, {\'name\': \'Vermine sinueuse\', \'text\': "{3}{B}{B} : Monstruosité 3. (Si cette créature n\'est pas monstrueuse, mettez trois marqueurs +1/+1 sur elle et elle devient monstrueuse.)\\nTant que la Vermine sinueuse est monstrueuse, elle a la menace. (Elle ne peut pas être bloquée excepté par deux créatures ou plus.)", \'type\': \'Créature : rat et horreur\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594357&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'27859c2a-2123-4086-9131-b65d1643f7ce\', \'multiverseId\': 594357}, \'multiverseid\': 594357}, {\'name\': \'Parassita Sinuoso\', \'text\': \'{3}{B}{B}: Mostruosità 3. (Se questa creatura non è mostruosa, metti tre segnalini +1/+1 su di essa e diventa mostruosa.)\\nFintanto che il Parassita Sinuoso è mostruoso, ha minacciare. (Non può essere bloccato tranne che da due o più creature.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Orrore Ratto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594474&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'435f5c66-4230-4f3d-b9b0-818544cd04b1\', \'multiverseId\': 594474}, \'multiverseid\': 594474}, {\'name\': \'捻じ曲がった害獣\', \'text\': \'{3}{B}{B}：怪物化３を行う。（このクリーチャーが怪物的でないなら、これの上に＋１/＋１カウンター３個を置く。これは怪物的になる。）\\n捻じ曲がった害獣が怪物的であるかぎり、これは威迫を持つ。（これは２体以上のクリーチャーにしかブロックされない。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ネズミ・ホラー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594591&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8ba79b24-f275-453a-8c5e-ba8fc5895829\', \'multiverseId\': 594591}, \'multiverseid\': 594591}, {\'name\': \'扭曲病媒\', \'text\': \'{3}{B}{B}：蛮化3。（如果此生物未蛮化，则在其上放置三个+1/+1指示物且它已蛮化。）\\n只要扭曲病媒已蛮化，它便具有威慑异能。（它只能被两个或更多生物阻挡。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～老鼠／惊惧兽\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594942&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'716a7666-867c-4591-948e-a6e247ca8d45\', \'multiverseId\': 594942}, \'multiverseid\': 594942}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schnappender Knurrer\', \'text\': \'Landung — Immer wenn ein Land unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, erhält der Schnappende Knurrer +1/+1 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Bestie\', \'flavor\': \'Alle Lebewesen auf Zendikar spüren den Umbruch, der mit den Eldrazi kommt.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592929&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'65c8a47e-689c-44e5-91a7-b2771f36b238\', \'multiverseId\': 592929}, \'multiverseid\': 592929}, {\'name\': \'Gnárlido mordiente\', \'text\': \'Aterrizaje — Siempre que una tierra entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, el Gnárlido mordiente obtiene +1/+1 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bestia\', \'flavor\': \'Todos los seres de Zendikar perciben la agitación que acompaña a los Eldrazi.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593050&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6fe8d534-0fbb-4715-af71-f6942a12bb29\', \'multiverseId\': 593050}, \'multiverseid\': 593050}, {\'name\': \'Gnarlide happeur\', \'text\': "Toucheterre — À chaque fois qu\'un terrain arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, le Gnarlide happeur gagne +1/+1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : bête\', \'flavor\': \'Tous les êtres de Zendikar sentent le bouleversement causé par les Eldrazi.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593171&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c82d88d1-7a51-428b-a819-6cda1729277e\', \'multiverseId\': 593171}, \'multiverseid\': 593171}, {\'name\': \'Gnarlid Azzannatore\', \'text\': \'Terraferma — Ogniqualvolta una terra entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, lo Gnarlid Azzannatore prende +1/+1 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Bestia\', \'flavor\': \'Tutti gli esseri di Zendikar percepiscono il cataclisma che accompagna gli Eldrazi.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593292&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'69ea0b9f-f153-4301-bcb1-71ab5d0f78d9\', \'multiverseId\': 593292}, \'multiverseid\': 593292}, {\'name\': \'噛み付きナーリッド\', \'text\': \'上陸 ― 土地１つがあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、ターン終了時まで、噛み付きナーリッドは＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ビースト\', \'flavor\': \'ゼンディカーに生きる物はみな、エルドラージが引き起こした激変を感じている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593413&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1c69c8be-0b7e-4ff8-8eb0-3b4d25ed0fab\', \'multiverseId\': 593413}, \'multiverseid\': 593413}, {\'name\': \'急攫糙节兽\', \'text\': \'地落～每当一个地在你的操控下进战场时，急攫糙节兽得+1/+1直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～野兽\', \'flavor\': \'赞迪卡的所有生灵都感受到了奥札奇带来的剧变。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593776&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'74074ce8-5afe-45f8-94c5-38f6f4881df8\', \'multiverseId\': 593776}, \'multiverseid\': 593776}]', "[{'name': 'Schnatternde Ratten', 'text': 'Wenn die Schnatternden Ratten ins Spiel kommen, legt ein Gegner deiner Wahl eine Karte aus seiner Hand oben auf seine Bibliothek.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Ratte', 'flavor': 'Auch die niederste Ernährung kann einen ganz nach oben bringen.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594044&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3181c7aa-9ffb-47b8-95ca-eb03680f2042', 'multiverseId': 594044}, 'multiverseid': 594044}, {'name': 'Ratas gorjeantes', 'text': 'Cuando las Ratas gorjeantes entren al campo de batalla, el oponente objetivo pone una carta de su mano en la parte superior de su biblioteca.', 'type': 'Criatura — Rata', 'flavor': 'Los carroñeros del fondo a veces llegan a la cima.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594161&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd80d57c8-ab66-4dd0-81d0-0bfebf181e7f', 'multiverseId': 594161}, 'multiverseid': 594161}, {'name': 'Rats bruyants', 'text': 'Quand les Rats bruyants arrivent sur le champ de bataille, un adversaire ciblé met une carte de sa main au-dessus de sa bibliothèque.', 'type': 'Créature : rat', 'flavor': 'Certains remontent parfois du bas au haut de la chaîne alimentaire.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594278&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '24e8bdcd-c800-476c-961a-9d14f363a77d', 'multiverseId': 594278}, 'multiverseid': 594278}, {'name': 'Ratti Squittenti', 'text': 'Quando i Ratti Squittenti entrano nel campo di battaglia, un avversario bersaglio mette in cima al suo grimorio una carta dalla sua mano.', 'type': 'Creatura — Ratto', 'flavor': 'Anche le creature più abiette possono raggiungere le vette.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594395&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '44212561-1fd1-44f9-9ad5-364905c41c09', 'multiverseId': 594395}, 'multiverseid': 594395}, {'name': '騒がしいネズミ', 'text': '騒がしいネズミが戦場に出たとき、対戦相手１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーは、自分の手札にあるカード１枚を自分のライブラリーの一番上に置く。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ネズミ', 'flavor': '最下層の餌食も、時として頂点に上ることがある。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594512&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a80f26e7-66d0-4bc4-90cf-7ee3d5c105fd', 'multiverseId': 594512}, 'multiverseid': 594512}, {'name': '吱叫老鼠', 'text': '当吱叫老鼠进战场时，目标对手将一张牌从其手上置于其牌库顶。', 'type': '生物 ～老鼠', 'flavor': '坏笋也有冒出头的时候。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594863&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7d1dd49c-46c2-492e-8aac-47c9dfcb43eb', 'multiverseId': 594863}, 'multiverseid': 594863}]", '[{\'name\': \'Schneeraupe\', \'text\': \'{4}{S}{S}: Monstrum 2. (Falls diese Kreatur nicht monströs ist, lege zwei +1/+1-Marken auf sie und sie wird monströs. {S} kann mit einem Mana von einer verschneiten Quelle bezahlt werden.)\\nSolange die Schneeraupe monströs ist, hat sie Flugfähigkeit.\', \'type\': \'Verschneite Kreatur — Insekt\', \'flavor\': \'Aus ihrem Kokon erhebt sich ein Schneegestöber.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595206&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a05e3406-9f90-44f7-aa5d-0c1ee491bc57\', \'multiverseId\': 595206}, \'multiverseid\': 595206}, {\'name\': \'Orugártica\', \'text\': \'{4}{S}{S}: Monstruosidad 2. (Si esta criatura no es monstruosa, pon dos contadores +1/+1 sobre ella y se convierte en monstruosa. {S} puede pagarse con un maná de una fuente nevada.)\\nMientras la Orugártica sea monstruosa, tiene la habilidad de volar.\', \'type\': \'Criatura nevada — Insecto\', \'flavor\': \'Desde la crisálida, una nevisca levanta el vuelo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595314&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5778aad5-deef-49e1-b86a-5b1c204e52c4\', \'multiverseId\': 595314}, \'multiverseid\': 595314}, {\'name\': \'Chenille des neiges\', \'text\': "{4}{S}{S} : Monstruosité 2. (Si cette créature n\'est pas monstrueuse, mettez deux marqueurs +1/+1 sur elle et elle devient monstrueuse. {S} peut être payé avec un mana d\'une source neigeuse.)\\nTant que la Chenille des neiges est monstrueuse, elle a le vol.", \'type\': \'Créature neigeuse : insecte\', \'flavor\': \'De son cocon émerge une bourrasque.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595422&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'737728c8-b982-41e1-ae4e-0eb908600eb8\', \'multiverseId\': 595422}, \'multiverseid\': 595422}, {\'name\': \'Gelobruco\', \'text\': \'{4}{S}{S}: Mostruosità 2. (Se questa creatura non è mostruosa, metti due segnalini +1/+1 su di essa e diventa mostruosa. {S} può essere pagato con un mana da una fonte neve.)\\nFintanto che il Gelobruco è mostruoso, ha volare.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Neve — Insetto\', \'flavor\': \'Dal suo bozzolo prende il volo un turbine.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595530&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'94b40862-97a7-4450-bc4f-45b70a4ce2be\', \'multiverseId\': 595530}, \'multiverseid\': 595530}, {\'name\': \'凍て虫\', \'text\': \'{4}{S}{S}：怪物化２を行う。（このクリーチャーが怪物的でないなら、これの上に＋１/＋１カウンター２個を置く。これは怪物的になる。{S}は氷雪である発生源からのマナ１点で支払える。）\\n凍て虫が怪物的であるかぎり、これは飛行を持つ。\', \'type\': \'氷雪クリーチャー — 昆虫\', \'flavor\': \'その繭からは雪が飛んでいく。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595638&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d9b6cfc9-3ab3-439e-9eea-fb92f08bd2a5\', \'multiverseId\': 595638}, \'multiverseid\': 595638}, {\'name\': \'冰寒毛虫\', \'text\': \'{4}{S}{S}：蛮化2。（如果此生物未蛮化，则在其上放置两个+1/+1指示物且它已蛮化。{S}能以产自雪境来源的一点法术力来支付。）\\n只要冰寒毛虫已蛮化，它便具有飞行异能。\', \'type\': \'雪境生物 ～昆虫\', \'flavor\': \'破茧而出，扑翼扬寒。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595962&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ea2405e2-84cb-41fd-9bd9-113e931210dc\', \'multiverseId\': 595962}, \'multiverseid\': 595962}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schneise der Verwüstung\', \'text\': \'Fahl (Diese Karte hat keine Farbe.)\\nDurchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Standardland-Karte und zeige sie offen vor. Du kannst sie getappt ins Spiel bringen, falls du ein Land namens Ödnis kontrollierst. Nimm sie sonst auf deine Hand. Mische danach.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597539&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'146c3010-dfde-4545-bdfa-60da5be7840d\', \'multiverseId\': 597539}, \'multiverseid\': 597539}, {\'name\': \'Devastación a su paso\', \'text\': \'Vacío. (Esta carta no tiene ningún color.)\\nBusca en tu biblioteca una carta de tierra básica y muéstrala. Puedes poner esa carta en el campo de batalla girada si controlas una tierra llamada Yermos. De lo contrario, pon esa carta en tu mano. Luego, baraja.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597564&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'277ab86c-cc30-4807-9106-ec4fbc41808e\', \'multiverseId\': 597564}, \'multiverseid\': 597564}, {\'name\': \'Suivis par la ruine\', \'text\': "Carence (Cette carte n\'a pas de couleur.)\\nCherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte de terrain de base et révélez-la. Vous pouvez mettre cette carte sur le champ de bataille engagée si vous contrôlez un terrain appelé Lande. Sinon, mettez cette carte dans votre main. Puis mélangez.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597589&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1175239a-287c-4127-9e19-53c7f4444ac9\', \'multiverseId\': 597589}, \'multiverseid\': 597589}, {\'name\': \'Scia di Rovina\', \'text\': \'Vacuità (Questa carta non ha colore.)\\nPassa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta terra base e rivelala. Puoi mettere quella carta sul campo di battaglia TAPpata se controlli una terra chiamata Distesa. Altrimenti, aggiungi quella carta alla tua mano. Poi rimescola.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597614&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2896fa10-6a61-4427-ba40-2e4905557631\', \'multiverseId\': 597614}, \'multiverseid\': 597614}, {\'name\': \'残された廃墟\', \'text\': \'欠色（このカードは無色である。）\\nあなたのライブラリーから基本土地・カード１枚を探し、公開する。あなたが「荒地」という名前の土地をコントロールしているなら、あなたはそのカードをタップ状態で戦場に出してもよい。そうでないなら、そのカードをあなたの手札に加える。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597639&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8bd66257-cff7-4dbf-bd91-1fa9411f92c9\', \'multiverseId\': 597639}, \'multiverseid\': 597639}, {\'name\': \'过境留痕\', \'text\': \'虚色（此牌没有颜色。）\\n从你牌库中搜寻一张基本地牌并展示之。如果你操控名称为荒野的地，则你可以将该牌横置放进战场。若否，则将该牌置于你手上。然后洗牌。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597714&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bb26b5ed-c260-4305-985f-47caa7ab1ac9\', \'multiverseId\': 597714}, \'multiverseid\': 597714}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schnitter aus dem Abgrund\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nMorbide — Zu Beginn jedes Endsegments und falls in diesem Zug eine Kreatur gestorben ist, zerstöre eine Nicht-Dämon-Kreatur deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Dämon\', \'flavor\': \'„Avacyn hat euch verlassen. Ich nehme an ihrer Stelle eure Verehrung an."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594115&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7d3d4faa-b5c6-4bcb-8a79-2f56969a24aa\', \'multiverseId\': 594115}, \'multiverseid\': 594115}, {\'name\': \'Segador del abismo\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nNecrario — Al comienzo de cada paso final, si una criatura murió este turno, destruye la criatura objetivo que no sea Demonio.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Demonio\', \'flavor\': \'"Avacyn te ha abandonado. Yo aceptaré tu devoción en su lugar".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594232&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c8bc6884-c867-487c-b67e-cd75e44da61a\', \'multiverseId\': 594232}, \'multiverseid\': 594232}, {\'name\': "Faucheur de l\'abysse", \'text\': \'Vol\\nMorbidité — Au début de chaque étape de fin, si une créature est morte ce tour-ci, détruisez une créature non-Démon ciblée.\', \'type\': \'Créature : démon\', \'flavor\': "« Avacyn vous a abandonné. J\'accepte votre dévotion pour la remplacer. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594349&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'de019927-ce19-4844-9a87-c4b6a9c46712\', \'multiverseId\': 594349}, \'multiverseid\': 594349}, {\'name\': "Mietitore dell\'Abisso", \'text\': "Volare\\nMorboso — All\'inizio di ogni sottofase finale, se è morta una creatura in questo turno, distruggi una creatura non Demone bersaglio.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Demone\', \'flavor\': \'"Avacyn ti ha abbandonato. Accolgo di buon grado la tua devozione in sua vece."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594466&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f6b0c18a-0295-4e8f-97a0-5135ab0bd1ef\', \'multiverseId\': 594466}, \'multiverseid\': 594466}, {\'name\': \'深淵からの魂刈り\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n陰鬱 ― 各終了ステップの開始時に、このターンにクリーチャーが死亡していた場合、デーモンでないクリーチャー１体を対象とする。それを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — デーモン\', \'flavor\': \'「アヴァシンはお前を見捨てた。彼女の代わりに、私がお前の献身を歓迎しよう。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594583&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6ef82804-4e9e-472f-ba8d-9eb854df8fb3\', \'multiverseId\': 594583}, \'multiverseid\': 594583}, {\'name\': \'深渊刽子手\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n丧心～在每个结束步骤开始时，若本回合中有生物死去，则消灭目标非恶魔生物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～恶魔\', \'flavor\': \'「艾维欣抛弃了你。我欢迎你转而为我奉献。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594934&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'89e4c385-06f8-4b3b-aad7-3955a110cb59\', \'multiverseId\': 594934}, \'multiverseid\': 594934}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schreckensreiter\', \'text\': \'{1}{B}, {T}, schicke eine Kreaturenkarte aus deinem Friedhof ins Exil: Ein Gegner deiner Wahl verliert 3 Lebenspunkte.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Geist, Ritter\', \'flavor\': \'„Was ist das für ein monströser Grabräuber, der die Schätze zurücklässt, aber die Leichen stiehlt?"\\n—Fjall, Beskir-Ältester\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594061&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2b02ddee-c570-46e4-8218-a0c35c8c9445\', \'multiverseId\': 594061}, \'multiverseid\': 594061}, {\'name\': \'Jinete pavoroso\', \'text\': \'{1}{B}, {T}, exiliar una carta de criatura de tu cementerio: El oponente objetivo pierde 3 vidas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Caballero espíritu\', \'flavor\': \'"¿Qué ladrón de tumbas monstruoso deja los tesoros y se lleva los cuerpos?".\\n—Fjall, anciano beskir\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594178&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'78d8596d-1555-4550-b7a4-be342388a051\', \'multiverseId\': 594178}, \'multiverseid\': 594178}, {\'name\': "Cavalier de l\'effroi", \'text\': \'{1}{B}, {T}, exilez une carte de créature depuis votre cimetière : Un adversaire ciblé perd 3 points de vie.\', \'type\': \'Créature : esprit et chevalier\', \'flavor\': "« Quel genre d\'infâme pilleur de tombe laisse les trésors et prend les cadavres ? »\\n—Fjall, ancêtre Beskir", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594295&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'265b4ef8-b07b-472b-a5a9-9b673a33fbcf\', \'multiverseId\': 594295}, \'multiverseid\': 594295}, {\'name\': \'Cavalcante Terrificante\', \'text\': \'{1}{B}, {T}, Esilia una carta creatura dal tuo cimitero: Un avversario bersaglio perde 3 punti vita.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Cavaliere Spirito\', \'flavor\': \'"Che razza di mostruoso ladro di tombe lascia lì i tesori, ma si prende i cadaveri?"\\n—Fjall, anziano Beskir\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594412&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8220e1b2-48d4-474c-bf6f-60e4f30f2f44\', \'multiverseId\': 594412}, \'multiverseid\': 594412}, {\'name\': \'戦慄の乗り手\', \'text\': \'{1}{B},{T},あなたの墓地にあるクリーチャー・カード１枚を追放する：対戦相手１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーは３点のライフを失う。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — スピリット・騎士\', \'flavor\': \'「いったいどんな墓場泥棒なのだ、宝を残して死体を持ち去るとは？」\\n――ベスキールの長老、フィエル\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594529&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c38f640c-d226-4b1b-aee4-6f9b5bf454e5\', \'multiverseId\': 594529}, \'multiverseid\': 594529}, {\'name\': \'恐惧魂骑\', \'text\': \'{1}{B}，{T}，从你的坟墓场放逐一张生物牌：目标对手失去3点生命。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～精怪／骑士\', \'flavor\': \'「哪门子的盗墓贼会把珍宝留下，而把尸体带走？」\\n～贝斯奇长老弗亚尔\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594880&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e0d90e36-fb63-471d-a8e8-e53bba107117\', \'multiverseId\': 594880}, \'multiverseid\': 594880}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schreitende Balliste\', \'text\': \'Die Schreitende Balliste kommt mit X +1/+1-Marken ins Spiel.\\n{4}: Lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf die Schreitende Balliste.\\nEntferne eine +1/+1-Marke von der Schreitenden Balliste: Sie fügt einem Ziel deiner Wahl 1 Schadenspunkt zu.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Konstrukt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596310&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5969b315-6486-4ed0-b57e-51b843ce2018\', \'multiverseId\': 596310}, \'multiverseid\': 596310}, {\'name\': \'Balista andante\', \'text\': \'La Balista andante entra al campo de batalla con X contadores +1/+1 sobre ella.\\n{4}: Pon un contador +1/+1 sobre la Balista andante.\\nRemover un contador +1/+1 de la Balista andante: Hace 1 punto de daño a cualquier objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Constructo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596397&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'be66d268-1546-4107-836f-871e11446815\', \'multiverseId\': 596397}, \'multiverseid\': 596397}, {\'name\': \'Baliste ambulante\', \'text\': "La Baliste ambulante arrive sur le champ de bataille avec X marqueurs +1/+1 sur elle.\\n{4} : Mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur la Baliste ambulante.\\nRetirez un marqueur +1/+1 de la Baliste ambulante : Elle inflige 1 blessure à n\'importe quelle cible.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : construction\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596484&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'00dacbb7-ae0a-46b5-b85d-45ce18493c18\', \'multiverseId\': 596484}, \'multiverseid\': 596484}, {\'name\': \'Balista Mobile\', \'text\': \'La Balista Mobile entra nel campo di battaglia con X segnalini +1/+1.\\n{4}: Metti un segnalino +1/+1 sulla Balista Mobile.\\nRimuovi un segnalino +1/+1 dalla Balista Mobile: Infligge 1 danno a un qualsiasi bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Costrutto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596571&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b183a58a-df7e-4ed3-b783-3f37fc31b0bc\', \'multiverseId\': 596571}, \'multiverseid\': 596571}, {\'name\': \'歩行バリスタ\', \'text\': \'歩行バリスタは、＋１/＋１カウンターＸ個が置かれた状態で戦場に出る。\\n{4}：歩行バリスタの上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。\\n歩行バリスタの上から＋１/＋１カウンター１個を取り除く：クリーチャーやプレインズウォーカーやプレイヤーのうち１つを対象とする。これはそれに１点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 構築物\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596658&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c3cf3c54-0b3b-47cf-9d8d-ddad1dfe4ba0\', \'multiverseId\': 596658}, \'multiverseid\': 596658}, {\'name\': \'自行弩炮\', \'text\': \'自行弩炮进战场时上面有X个+1/+1指示物。\\n{4}：在自行弩炮上放置一个+1/+1指示物。\\n从自行弩炮上移去一个+1/+1指示物：它对任意一个目标造成1点伤害。\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～组构体\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596919&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'382cc813-ea4b-44b0-8e8d-e6ce6d8e2a1a\', \'multiverseId\': 596919}, \'multiverseid\': 596919}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schuppiger Raubreißer\', \'text\': \'Bedrohlich (Diese Kreatur kann nicht geblockt werden, außer von zwei oder mehr Kreaturen.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Dinosaurier\', \'flavor\': \'Dinosaurier verstehen selten den Unterschied zwischen Wildnis und besiedelten Gebieten.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590297&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7c1df5c7-28a8-430e-82f9-c4c382305ece\', \'multiverseId\': 590297}, \'multiverseid\': 590297}, {\'name\': \'Depredador escamarrota\', \'text\': \'Amenaza. (Esta criatura no puede ser bloqueada excepto por dos o más criaturas.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Dinosaurio\', \'flavor\': \'Los dinosaurios pocas veces comprenden las fronteras que separan lo agreste de lo urbano.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590432&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6a1010e2-f330-4beb-a2e2-340e04bd3847\', \'multiverseId\': 590432}, \'multiverseid\': 590432}, {\'name\': \'Prédateur taillécaille\', \'text\': \'Menace (Cette créature ne peut pas être bloquée excepté par deux créatures ou plus.)\', \'type\': \'Créature : dinosaure\', \'flavor\': "Les dinosaures comprennent rarement l\'idée de frontière entre l\'espace urbain et les étendues sauvages.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590567&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f0a9302b-c07f-4752-931f-9a9df5b83ee8\', \'multiverseId\': 590567}, \'multiverseid\': 590567}, {\'name\': \'Predatore Strappascaglia\', \'text\': \'Minacciare (Questa creatura non può essere bloccata tranne che da due o più creature.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Dinosauro\', \'flavor\': "È raro che i dinosauri comprendano l\'idea del confine tra natura selvaggia e paesaggio urbano.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590702&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2ff4873f-bc04-464d-ba97-e84da45be693\', \'multiverseId\': 590702}, \'multiverseid\': 590702}, {\'name\': \'鱗剥ぎの捕食者\', \'text\': \'威迫（このクリーチャーは２体以上のクリーチャーにしかブロックされない。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 恐竜\', \'flavor\': \'恐竜には自然界と都市の境界というものが理解できないようだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590837&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4c013942-3fac-4358-bcb5-91c3b61747b3\', \'multiverseId\': 590837}, \'multiverseid\': 590837}, {\'name\': \'凿鳞掠食者\', \'text\': \'威慑（此生物只能被两个或更多生物阻挡。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～恐龙\', \'flavor\': \'恐龙对荒野与城市间的界限没什么概念。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591242&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'320dcd15-4621-44ca-a99d-f363e0db059f\', \'multiverseId\': 591242}, \'multiverseid\': 591242}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schwarmschlurfer\', \'text\': \'Der Schwarmschlurfer kommt mit einer +1/+1-Marke ins Spiel.\\nImmer wenn eine Kreatur, die du kontrollierst und auf der eine +1/+1-Marke liegt, das Ziel eines Zauberspruchs wird, den ein Gegner kontrolliert, erzeuge einen 1/1 grünen Insekt-Kreaturenspielstein.\\n{1}, {T}: Lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf den Schwarmschlurfer.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Pilzwesen, Bestie\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592933&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dae2623d-afa4-4d8a-9e71-2eb549c52cb1\', \'multiverseId\': 592933}, \'multiverseid\': 592933}, {\'name\': \'Desollador enjambre\', \'text\': \'El Desollador enjambre entra al campo de batalla con un contador +1/+1 sobre él.\\nSiempre que una criatura que controlas con un contador +1/+1 sobre ella sea objetivo de un hechizo que controla un oponente, crea una ficha de criatura Insecto verde 1/1.\\n{1}, {T}: Pon un contador +1/+1 sobre el Desollador enjambre.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bestia hongo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593054&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3dc67342-17ae-4f11-866b-3a162f938509\', \'multiverseId\': 593054}, \'multiverseid\': 593054}, {\'name\': "Escogriffe de l\'essaim", \'text\': "L\'Escogriffe de l\'essaim arrive sur le champ de bataille avec un marqueur +1/+1 sur lui.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'une créature que vous contrôlez avec un marqueur +1/+1 sur elle devient la cible d\'un sort qu\'un adversaire contrôle, créez un jeton de créature 1/1 verte Insecte.\\n{1}, {T} : Mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur l\'Escogriffe de l\'essaim.", \'type\': \'Créature : fongus et bête\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593175&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'72456dc1-6349-421c-a002-fcaa109a81ac\', \'multiverseId\': 593175}, \'multiverseid\': 593175}, {\'name\': \'Errante dello Sciame\', \'text\': "L\'Errante dello Sciame entra nel campo di battaglia con un segnalino +1/+1.\\nOgniqualvolta una creatura con un segnalino +1/+1 che controlli diventa il bersaglio di una magia controllata da un avversario, crea una pedina creatura Insetto 1/1 verde.\\n{1}, {T}: Metti un segnalino +1/+1 sull\'Errante dello Sciame.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Bestia Fungus\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593296&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c76fc60e-8e5d-4ece-a9c9-c16e25b9c038\', \'multiverseId\': 593296}, \'multiverseid\': 593296}, {\'name\': \'群れのシャンブラー\', \'text\': \'群れのシャンブラーは、＋１/＋１カウンター１個が置かれた状態で戦場に出る。\\nあなたがコントロールしていて＋１/＋１カウンターが置かれているクリーチャー１体が、対戦相手がコントロールしている呪文の対象になるたび、緑の１/１の昆虫・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\\n{1},{T}：群れのシャンブラーの上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ファンガス・ビースト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593417&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cad8bd84-4021-4b9d-ad82-8daceefb6677\', \'multiverseId\': 593417}, \'multiverseid\': 593417}, {\'name\': \'跛行菌兽\', \'text\': \'跛行菌兽进战场时上面有一个+1/+1指示物。\\n每当一个由你操控且其上有+1/+1指示物的生物成为由对手操控之咒语的目标时，派出一个1/1绿色昆虫衍生生物。\\n{1}，{T}：在跛行菌兽上放置一个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～真菌／野兽\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593780&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c4b20d2c-23c9-4029-84ed-5984b4f8d945\', \'multiverseId\': 593780}, \'multiverseid\': 593780}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schwarze Katze\', \'text\': \'Wenn die Schwarze Katze stirbt, wirft ein Gegner deiner Wahl eine per Zufall bestimmte Karte ab.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Zombie, Katze\', \'flavor\': \'In ihrem letzten Leben martert sie deine Träume.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594034&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d20d69b9-bce8-4ec5-b485-60362e13e2a8\', \'multiverseId\': 594034}, \'multiverseid\': 594034}, {\'name\': \'Gato negro\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Gato negro muera, el oponente objetivo descarta una carta al azar.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Felino zombie\', \'flavor\': \'Su última vida la pasa atormentando tus sueños.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594151&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'91fb53f8-fdf6-446d-b050-662efa0ff9a9\', \'multiverseId\': 594151}, \'multiverseid\': 594151}, {\'name\': \'Chat noir\', \'text\': "Quand le Chat noir meurt, un adversaire ciblé se défausse d\'une carte au hasard.", \'type\': \'Créature : zombie et chat\', \'flavor\': \'Il passe sa dernière vie à tourmenter vos rêves.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594268&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4dc4f83c-0fa8-4747-b748-d74456269e50\', \'multiverseId\': 594268}, \'multiverseid\': 594268}, {\'name\': \'Gatto Nero\', \'text\': \'Quando il Gatto Nero muore, un avversario bersaglio scarta una carta a caso.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Felino Zombie\', \'flavor\': \'Trascorre la sua ultima vita a tormentare i tuoi sogni.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594385&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'07d46743-b8f9-4d1c-9a81-01d809945dc0\', \'multiverseId\': 594385}, \'multiverseid\': 594385}, {\'name\': \'黒猫\', \'text\': \'黒猫が死亡したとき、対戦相手１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーはカード１枚を無作為に選んで捨てる。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ゾンビ・猫\', \'flavor\': \'最後の命は、お前の夢を苦しめるために費やされる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594502&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'df8ee6e6-8baf-4db6-b761-b7fbef59eaee\', \'multiverseId\': 594502}, \'multiverseid\': 594502}, {\'name\': \'黑猫\', \'text\': \'当黑猫死去时，目标对手随机弃一张牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～灵俑／猫\', \'flavor\': \'它最后的生命都要用来折磨你的梦。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594853&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3449d9c8-ca82-41a3-adce-ce7c5e90e926\', \'multiverseId\': 594853}, \'multiverseid\': 594853}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schweißfunken\', \'text\': \'Die Schweißfunken fügen einer Kreatur deiner Wahl X Schadenspunkte zu, wobei X gleich 3 plus der Anzahl an Artefakten ist, die du kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Das Feuer des Erfindergeistes brennt in jedem von uns. Ich kämpfe für die Freiheit, dieses Feuer zu entfesseln."\\n—Pia Nalaar\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590331&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'086328d2-f915-400a-8524-4492cb5a3f35\', \'multiverseId\': 590331}, \'multiverseid\': 590331}, {\'name\': \'Chispas de soldadura\', \'text\': \'Las Chispas de soldadura hacen X puntos de daño a la criatura objetivo, donde X es 3 más la cantidad de artefactos que controlas.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Los fuegos de la invención arden en todos nosotros. Yo lucho por la libertad de liberar esas llamas".\\n—Pia Nalaar\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590466&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f4298a47-7fc1-489e-9952-73fa67b23561\', \'multiverseId\': 590466}, \'multiverseid\': 590466}, {\'name\': \'Étincelles de soudure\', \'text\': "Les Étincelles de soudure infligent X blessures à une créature ciblée, X étant 3 plus le nombre d\'artefacts que vous contrôlez.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« Le feu de la créativité brûle en chacun de nous. Je me bats pour libérer ces flammes. »\\n—Pia Nalaàr\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590601&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b893293f-70cc-470c-930f-f5712dd0b50c\', \'multiverseId\': 590601}, \'multiverseid\': 590601}, {\'name\': \'Scintille della Saldatura\', \'text\': \'Le Scintille della Saldatura infliggono X danni a una creatura bersaglio, dove X è 3 più il numero di artefatti che controlli.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"La fiamma della creatività arde in ognuno di noi. Io combatto per la libertà di scatenare quel fuoco."\\n—Pia Nalaar\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590736&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'55cb3bcd-6981-411e-9545-775e141bf8ea\', \'multiverseId\': 590736}, \'multiverseid\': 590736}, {\'name\': \'溶接の火花\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。溶接の火花はそれにＸ点のダメージを与える。Ｘはあなたがコントロールしているアーティファクトの数に３を足した値に等しい。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「発明の炎は誰の心にも燃えているわ。その炎を解き放つ自由のために、私は戦っているの。」\\n――ピア・ナラー\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590871&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4dbd364c-8b46-43c4-832e-54e65b23126f\', \'multiverseId\': 590871}, \'multiverseid\': 590871}, {\'name\': \'焊接火花\', \'text\': \'焊接火花对目标生物造成X点伤害，X为由你操控的神器数量加3。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「发明之火在我们所有人的心中燃烧。我为能自由释放这些火焰而战。」\\n～琵雅纳拉\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591276&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'95df2746-3dae-474a-9cd9-f41019c988f8\', \'multiverseId\': 591276}, \'multiverseid\': 591276}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schüler des Dämons\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Schüler des Dämons ins Spiel kommt, opfert jeder Spieler eine Kreatur oder einen Planeswalker.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Kleriker\', \'flavor\': \'Die Kultisten von Taborax sind die jüngsten in einer langen Reihe von Wesen, die Zendikar gerne in Stücke gerissen sehen würden.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594056&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3e6542c8-a26c-4895-adf3-c9c3f454bd3b\', \'multiverseId\': 594056}, \'multiverseid\': 594056}, {\'name\': \'Discípulo del demonio\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Discípulo del demonio entre al campo de batalla, cada jugador sacrifica una criatura o planeswalker.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Clérigo humano\', \'flavor\': \'Los sectarios de Taborax son los más recientes de una larga lista de seres que quieren ver a Zendikar hecha añicos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594173&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'52508541-c855-4e2e-ade5-a14884b42b3a\', \'multiverseId\': 594173}, \'multiverseid\': 594173}, {\'name\': \'Disciple du démon\', \'text\': \'Quand le Disciple du démon arrive sur le champ de bataille, chaque joueur sacrifie une créature ou un planeswalker.\', \'type\': \'Créature : humain et clerc\', \'flavor\': "Les cultistes de Taborax sont les derniers d\'une longue lignée d\'individus souhaitant la destruction de Zendikar.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594290&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'71218c79-1f2f-4153-b67b-a8341f4f1545\', \'multiverseId\': 594290}, \'multiverseid\': 594290}, {\'name\': \'Discepolo del Demone\', \'text\': \'Quando il Discepolo del Demone entra nel campo di battaglia, ogni giocatore sacrifica una creatura o un planeswalker.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Chierico Umano\', \'flavor\': \'I cultisti di Taborax sono gli ultimi di una lunga serie di creature che hanno desiderato vedere Zendikar fatto a pezzi.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594407&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3813105e-bd2c-4a69-90f5-48c6cb5b8d40\', \'multiverseId\': 594407}, \'multiverseid\': 594407}, {\'name\': \'悪魔の信奉者\', \'text\': \'悪魔の信奉者が戦場に出たとき、各プレイヤーはそれぞれ、クリーチャーやプレインズウォーカーのうち１体を生け贄に捧げる。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・クレリック\', \'flavor\': \'タボラックスの狂信者は、ゼンディカーをばらばらに引き裂こうとする者たちの長い歴史の最新作だ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594524&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3115da8e-adf1-4121-9c1c-40289845809d\', \'multiverseId\': 594524}, \'multiverseid\': 594524}, {\'name\': \'恶魔信徒\', \'text\': \'当恶魔信徒进战场时，每位牌手各牺牲一个生物或鹏洛客。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／僧侣\', \'flavor\': \'悠悠历史长河中，曾有无数势力希望眼见赞迪卡彻底毁灭；塔博锐教众是其中最新一支。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594875&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f9ee2642-61ae-4d08-8cf3-26dfa90d717e\', \'multiverseId\': 594875}, \'multiverseid\': 594875}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schülerin der Verdammnis\', \'text\': \'Wenn die Schülerin der Verdammnis stirbt, bestimme eines. Falls du genau 13 Lebenspunkte hast, kannst du beides bestimmen.\\n• Du ziehst eine Karte und verlierst 1 Lebenspunkt.\\n• Schicke den Friedhof eines Gegners deiner Wahl ins Exil. Jener Spieler verliert 1 Lebenspunkt.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Hexenmeister\', \'flavor\': \'„Könntest du etwas von deinem Blut für meinen süßen kleinen Baum erübrigen?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589628&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7f29936e-bbb1-47f2-9ba0-97a3245495ea\', \'multiverseId\': 589628}, \'multiverseid\': 589628}, {\'name\': \'Discípula de la perdición\', \'text\': \'Cuando la Discípula de la perdición muera, elige uno. Si tienes exactamente 13 vidas, puedes elegir ambos.\\n• Robas una carta y pierdes 1 vida.\\n• Exilia el cementerio del oponente objetivo. Ese jugador pierde 1 vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Brujo humano\', \'flavor\': \'"¿Podrías darme un poco de tu sangre para mi querido arbolito?".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589679&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3d3a3e82-a252-4dc9-8438-4aea235e75b5\', \'multiverseId\': 589679}, \'multiverseid\': 589679}, {\'name\': \'Disciple de la perdition\', \'text\': "Quand la Disciple de la perdition meurt, choisissez l\'un. Si vous avez exactement 13 points de vie, vous pouvez choisir les deux.\\n• Vous piochez une carte et vous perdez 1 point de vie.\\n• Exilez le cimetière d\'un adversaire ciblé. Ce joueur perd 1 point de vie.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et psychagogue\', \'flavor\': \'« Vous pourriez me donner un peu de votre sang pour mon précieux petit arbre ? »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589730&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'206ec7a1-ef30-4ef9-898f-34237f401bac\', \'multiverseId\': 589730}, \'multiverseid\': 589730}, {\'name\': \'Discepola della Perdizione\', \'text\': \'Quando la Discepola della Perdizione muore, scegli uno. Se hai esattamente 13 punti vita, puoi scegliere entrambi.\\n• Pesca una carta e perdi 1 punto vita.\\n• Esilia il cimitero di un avversario bersaglio. Quel giocatore perde 1 punto vita.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Warlock Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Non ti avanzerebbe un po\\\' del tuo sangue per il mio prezioso alberello?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589781&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e67ebd46-55a8-4222-b44b-1a01efad86b6\', \'multiverseId\': 589781}, \'multiverseid\': 589781}, {\'name\': \'地獄の信奉者\', \'text\': \'地獄の信奉者が死亡したとき、以下から１つを選ぶ。あなたのライフ総量がちょうど13点なら、あなたは両方を選んでもよい。\\n・あなたはカード１枚を引き、１点のライフを失う。\\n・対戦相手１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーの墓地を追放する。そのプレイヤーは１点のライフを失う。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・邪術師\', \'flavor\': \'「私の大事な木のためにあなたの血を恵んで頂けませんか？」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589832&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cabc17d9-b895-448d-b162-ffb390ac7d62\', \'multiverseId\': 589832}, \'multiverseid\': 589832}, {\'name\': \'坏灭信徒\', \'text\': \'当坏灭信徒死去时，选择一项。如果你的总生命正好为13，则你可以两项都选。\\n•你抓一张牌且失去1点生命。\\n•放逐目标对手的坟墓场。该牌手失去1点生命。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／邪术师\', \'flavor\': \'「您能不能为我的宝贝小树捐点血？」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589985&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'467275b7-fd2f-4dec-a5a9-e87af83e26c9\', \'multiverseId\': 589985}, \'multiverseid\': 589985}]', '[{\'name\': \'Seele des Märtyrers\', \'text\': \'Einberufen (Deine Kreaturen können dir helfen, diesen Zauberspruch zu wirken. Mit jeder Kreatur, die du tappst, während du diesen Zauberspruch wirkst, bezahlst du für {1} oder ein Mana der Farbe jener Kreatur.)\\nWenn die Seele des Märtyrers ins Spiel kommt und falls du keine getappten Länder kontrollierst, lege zwei +1/+1-Marken auf sie.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Geist, Soldat\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591618&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'16ae351c-a1ab-44ea-877b-0e3c6ea657dd\', \'multiverseId\': 591618}, \'multiverseid\': 591618}, {\'name\': \'Alma de mártir\', \'text\': \'Convocar. (Tus criaturas pueden ayudar a lanzar este hechizo. Cada criatura que gires al lanzar este hechizo cuenta como un pago de {1} o de un maná del color de esa criatura.)\\nCuando el Alma de mártir entre al campo de batalla, si no controlas ninguna tierra girada, pon dos contadores +1/+1 sobre él.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado espíritu\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591747&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'08aac0cf-0d51-4c68-a8a6-1e752b67b94f\', \'multiverseId\': 591747}, \'multiverseid\': 591747}, {\'name\': \'Âme du martyr\', \'text\': "Convocation (Vos créatures peuvent aider à lancer ce sort. Chaque créature que vous engagez en lançant ce sort paie {1} ou un mana de la couleur de cette créature.)\\nQuand l\'Âme du martyr arrive sur le champ de bataille, si vous ne contrôlez pas de terrain engagé, mettez deux marqueurs +1/+1 sur elle.", \'type\': \'Créature : esprit et soldat\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591876&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b571858e-8390-4ac9-b318-7055660987a8\', \'multiverseId\': 591876}, \'multiverseid\': 591876}, {\'name\': \'Anima del Martire\', \'text\': "Convocazione (Le tue creature possono aiutarti a lanciare questa magia. Ogni creatura che TAPpi mentre lanci questa magia corrisponde al pagamento di {1} o di un mana del colore di quella creatura.)\\nQuando l\'Anima del Martire entra nel campo di battaglia, se non controlli terre TAPpate, metti due segnalini +1/+1 su di essa.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Soldato Spirito\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592005&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'74118aa6-25e1-49bc-9184-6e6eaade10d7\', \'multiverseId\': 592005}, \'multiverseid\': 592005}, {\'name\': \'殉教者の魂\', \'text\': \'召集（あなたのクリーチャーが、この呪文を唱える助けとなる。この呪文を唱える段階であなたがタップした各クリーチャーはそれぞれ{1}かそのクリーチャーの色のマナ１点を支払う。）\\n殉教者の魂が戦場に出たとき、あなたがタップ状態の土地をコントロールしていない場合、これの上に＋１/＋１カウンター２個を置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — スピリット・兵士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592134&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4cae4545-cad3-4f96-ac37-056414d05010\', \'multiverseId\': 592134}, \'multiverseid\': 592134}, {\'name\': \'烈士英魂\', \'text\': \'召集（此咒语能用你的生物来协助施放。你于施放此咒语时每横置一个生物，就能为此咒语支付{1}或一点该生物颜色之法术力。）\\n当烈士英魂进战场时，若你未操控已横置的地，则在其上放置两个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～精怪／士兵\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592521&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'25d92776-4ea9-42aa-ae41-f904a2ee6344\', \'multiverseId\': 592521}, \'multiverseid\': 592521}]', '[{\'name\': \'Seelenkerker-Unhold\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Seelenkerker-Unhold stirbt, verliert jeder Spieler 3 Lebenspunkte.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Dämon\', \'flavor\': \'Kerstin schwor, die Seelen ihrer Kinder zu befreien, und verfolgte die Peiniger in das grausige Höhlennetzwerk unter Stenzen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594127&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c993e2c3-a8fe-4e06-9fff-0c3efc1ab7ce\', \'multiverseId\': 594127}, \'multiverseid\': 594127}, {\'name\': \'Demonio jaula del alma\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Demonio jaula del alma muera, cada jugador pierde 3 vidas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Demonio\', \'flavor\': \'Habiendo jurado que liberaría las almas de sus hijos, Kastinne siguió a los atormentadores al interior de la horrible red de cuevas bajo Stensia.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594244&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'741e92d0-25ff-4a94-a49e-70f8b491c79b\', \'multiverseId\': 594244}, \'multiverseid\': 594244}, {\'name\': \'Fielleux de la cage aux âmes\', \'text\': \'Quand le Fielleux de la cage aux âmes meurt, chaque joueur perd 3 points de vie.\', \'type\': \'Créature : démon\', \'flavor\': \'Ayant fait vœu de libérer les âmes de ses enfants, Kastinne suivit les persécuteurs dans les méandres effroyables des cavernes situées dans les profondeurs de la Stensie.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594361&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8a239940-88c7-4ef0-bd07-f33b93f95b50\', \'multiverseId\': 594361}, \'multiverseid\': 594361}, {\'name\': \'Immondo Ingabbia-Anime\', \'text\': "Quando l\'Immondo Ingabbia-Anime muore, ogni giocatore perde 3 punti vita.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Demone\', \'flavor\': \'Giurando di liberare le anime dei suoi figli, Kastinne seguì i carnefici nelle spaventose caverne sotto a Stensia.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594478&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a1ee8620-9380-4b2e-b814-b2fd634bd012\', \'multiverseId\': 594478}, \'multiverseid\': 594478}, {\'name\': \'魂獄の悪鬼\', \'text\': \'魂獄の悪鬼が死亡したとき、各プレイヤーはそれぞれ３点のライフを失う。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — デーモン\', \'flavor\': \'愛する子ども達の魂を解放すると心に決めたカスティーンは、拷問者を追ってステンシアの地の底に広がる恐ろしい洞穴の迷路へと踏み込んでいった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594595&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2f9894c6-7d16-4598-8b77-b348e0d69fff\', \'multiverseId\': 594595}, \'multiverseid\': 594595}, {\'name\': \'魂槛邪鬼\', \'text\': \'当魂槛邪鬼死去时，每位牌手各失去3点生命。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～恶魔\', \'flavor\': \'凯思汀发誓要让孩子的灵魂获得自由，跟踪拷问者进入史顿襄地底阴森的洞穴网。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594946&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8131430e-bb66-4e52-984f-d15baf1199cd\', \'multiverseId\': 594946}, \'multiverseid\': 594946}]', '[{\'name\': \'Seelenlesen\', \'text\': \'Bestimme eines —\\n• Neutralisiere einen Zauberspruch deiner Wahl, es sei denn, sein Beherrscher bezahlt {4}.\\n• Ziehe zwei Karten.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Es ist einfach, zwei Schritte voraus zu sein, wenn man jeden ihrer Gedanken sehen kann.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589622&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e32c1c30-a055-4877-8c96-d68dbbe2afc9\', \'multiverseId\': 589622}, \'multiverseid\': 589622}, {\'name\': \'Lectura del alma\', \'text\': \'Elige uno:\\n• Contrarresta el hechizo objetivo a menos que su controlador pague {4}.\\n• Roba dos cartas.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Es fácil ir un paso por delante cuando puedes leerles todos los pensamientos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589673&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'57186dd0-ec92-4caa-9d4d-3cc7fba3f511\', \'multiverseId\': 589673}, \'multiverseid\': 589673}, {\'name\': "Lecture d\'âme", \'text\': "Choisissez l\'un —\\n• Contrecarrez un sort ciblé à moins que son contrôleur ne paie {4}.\\n• Piochez deux cartes.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "Avoir deux coups d\'avance n\'est pas difficile quand on peut voir chacune de leurs pensées.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589724&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e81b17d2-42dc-448e-a712-86b4861d4513\', \'multiverseId\': 589724}, \'multiverseid\': 589724}, {\'name\': "Lettura dell\'Anima", \'text\': \'Scegli uno —\\n• Neutralizza una magia bersaglio a meno che il suo controllore non paghi {4}.\\n• Pesca due carte.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'È facile essere sempre un passo avanti a tutti quando puoi leggere ogni loro pensiero.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589775&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'12d66dad-b8f6-43dc-b5ce-b3fe0cc197fe\', \'multiverseId\': 589775}, \'multiverseid\': 589775}, {\'name\': \'魂読み\', \'text\': \'以下から１つを選ぶ。\\n・呪文１つを対象とする。それのコントローラーが{4}を支払わないかぎり、それを打ち消す。\\n・カード２枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'その者のすべての思考が読めるなら、先手を打つのは容易である。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589826&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'33c59c88-c556-4151-ab5a-e5d7c90b3ba8\', \'multiverseId\': 589826}, \'multiverseid\': 589826}, {\'name\': \'读取魂魄\', \'text\': \'选择一项～\\n•除非目标咒语的操控者支付{4}，否则反击之。\\n•抓两张牌。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'如果你能看清对手每道思绪，那么能预先考虑两步也并非难事。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589979&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3e6622d2-1879-45c0-afaa-91a14e60ae7b\', \'multiverseId\': 589979}, \'multiverseid\': 589979}]', '[{\'name\': \'Seelenraub\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre eine Kreatur deiner Wahl mit Stärke 3 oder weniger.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich war nicht überzeugt davon, dass du eine Seele hast, bis ich sie mit eigenen Augen sah."\\n—Liliana Vess\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594116&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'656a0c11-548a-4e0e-bf3d-a7b9e5edb5b7\', \'multiverseId\': 594116}, \'multiverseid\': 594116}, {\'name\': \'Desgarro espiritual\', \'text\': \'Destruye la criatura objetivo con fuerza de 3 o menos.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"No estaba segura de que tuvieras alma hasta que la vi con mis propios ojos".\\n—Liliana Vess\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594233&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7da34bd3-a7d4-4dc9-a042-ad2e7ad54064\', \'multiverseId\': 594233}, \'multiverseid\': 594233}, {\'name\': "Pillage de l\'âme", \'text\': \'Détruisez une créature ciblée de force inférieure ou égale à 3.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« Je n\'étais pas convaincue que tu avais une âme jusqu\'à ce que je la voie de mes propres yeux. »\\n—Liliana Vess", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594350&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e041df73-3dc2-4de4-a297-20e0f00318a7\', \'multiverseId\': 594350}, \'multiverseid\': 594350}, {\'name\': "Rubare l\'Anima", \'text\': \'Distruggi una creatura bersaglio con forza pari o inferiore a 3.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Non ero convinta che avessi un\\\'anima, finché non l\\\'ho vista con i miei occhi."\\n—Liliana Vess\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594467&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1dcaedd0-166a-4cab-8ec1-1af72e4ca688\', \'multiverseId\': 594467}, \'multiverseid\': 594467}, {\'name\': \'魂裂き\', \'text\': \'パワーが３以下であるクリーチャー１体を対象とする。それを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「この目で実際に見るまでは、お前に魂があるなんて確信が持てなかったのよ。」\\n――リリアナ・ヴェス\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594584&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0bb84723-4145-4a8e-82b1-4ec0a0398e0b\', \'multiverseId\': 594584}, \'multiverseid\': 594584}, {\'name\': \'裂魂术\', \'text\': \'消灭目标力量等于或小于3的生物。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「在我亲眼看到之前，我无法确信你是否有灵魂。」\\n～莉莲娜维斯\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594935&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8c0a0c5e-81f3-42dc-b080-db9e3990dc30\', \'multiverseId\': 594935}, \'multiverseid\': 594935}]', '[{\'name\': \'Seitengassenwürger\', \'text\': \'Bedrohlich (Diese Kreatur kann nicht geblockt werden, außer von zwei oder mehr Kreaturen.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Äthergeborener, Räuber\', \'flavor\': \'„Du weißt nie, welcher Tag dein letzter sein könnte."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594032&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c23c2952-0fce-44b2-b677-0c24e35ed542\', \'multiverseId\': 594032}, \'multiverseid\': 594032}, {\'name\': \'Estrangulador del callejón\', \'text\': \'Amenaza. (Esta criatura no puede ser bloqueada excepto por dos o más criaturas.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bribón etergénito\', \'flavor\': \'"Nunca se sabe cuál de tus días será el último".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594149&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5dd66529-9e94-4d69-b28b-d5c108dcd6cf\', \'multiverseId\': 594149}, \'multiverseid\': 594149}, {\'name\': \'Étrangleur des ruelles\', \'text\': \'Menace (Cette créature ne peut pas être bloquée excepté par deux créatures ou plus.)\', \'type\': \'Créature : éthérien et gredin\', \'flavor\': \'« Tu ne sauras jamais quel jour sera ton dernier. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594266&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1cb995a0-16f4-4422-bb12-397d9488eeec\', \'multiverseId\': 594266}, \'multiverseid\': 594266}, {\'name\': \'Strangolatore dei Vicoli\', \'text\': \'Minacciare (Questa creatura non può essere bloccata tranne che da due o più creature.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Farabutto Eteride\', \'flavor\': \'"Non si può mai sapere quando sarà il tuo ultimo giorno."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594383&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'956eacaf-62af-42c5-afbe-ed6a40329a79\', \'multiverseId\': 594383}, \'multiverseid\': 594383}, {\'name\': \'路地の絞殺者\', \'text\': \'威迫（このクリーチャーは２体以上のクリーチャーにしかブロックされない。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 霊基体・ならず者\', \'flavor\': \'「いつ最期の日を迎えるのか。そんなことはわからない。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594500&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9114c672-a50c-41e5-9a46-85495f395728\', \'multiverseId\': 594500}, \'multiverseid\': 594500}, {\'name\': \'暗巷绞杀客\', \'text\': \'威慑（此生物只能被两个或更多生物阻挡。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～乙太种／浪客\', \'flavor\': \'「你不会知道哪天就是你的死期。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594851&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'be34c554-5a92-4731-9371-d1fdcff68671\', \'multiverseId\': 594851}, \'multiverseid\': 594851}]', '[{\'name\': \'Seizan, Verdreher der Wahrheit\', \'text\': \'Zu Beginn des Versorgungssegments jedes Spielers verliert der Spieler 2 Lebenspunkte und zieht zwei Karten.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Dämon, Geist\', \'flavor\': \'„Willst du die Weisheit der Oni schmecken, sei darauf vorbereitet, sie mit deinem Blut zu würzen."\\n—Kiku, Blume der Nacht\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594120&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'63800288-4b60-4d2c-b1ee-6507bae0b90b\', \'multiverseId\': 594120}, \'multiverseid\': 594120}, {\'name\': \'Seizan, pervertidor de la verdad\', \'text\': \'Al comienzo del mantenimiento de cada jugador, ese jugador pierde 2 vidas y roba dos cartas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Espíritu demonio\', \'flavor\': \'"Si quieres saborear la sabiduría de los oni, prepárate para condimentarla con tu sangre".\\n—Kiku, flor de la noche\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594237&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'911667a1-2399-452f-b3fb-6c7247504424\', \'multiverseId\': 594237}, \'multiverseid\': 594237}, {\'name\': \'Seizan, corrupteur de la Vérité\', \'text\': "Au début de l\'entretien de chaque joueur, ce joueur perd 2 points de vie et pioche deux cartes.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : démon et esprit\', \'flavor\': "« Si vous voulez goûter à la sagesse des oni, préparez-vous à l\'assaisonner avec votre sang. »\\n—Kiku, fleur de la nuit", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594354&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6e6b33df-f5d5-4d30-b3e5-0a2faf009fee\', \'multiverseId\': 594354}, \'multiverseid\': 594354}, {\'name\': \'Seizan, Corruttore della Verità\', \'text\': "All\'inizio del mantenimento di ogni giocatore, quel giocatore perde 2 punti vita e pesca due carte.", \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Spirito Demone\', \'flavor\': \'"Se hai intenzione di assaggiare la saggezza degli oni, preparati a condirla con il tuo stesso sangue."\\n—Kiku, Fiore della Notte\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594471&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b9aeccea-f724-4968-a179-2dd8d7314358\', \'multiverseId\': 594471}, \'multiverseid\': 594471}, {\'name\': \'真実を捻じ曲げるもの、逝斬\', \'text\': \'各プレイヤーのアップキープの開始時に、そのプレイヤーは２点のライフを失い、カード２枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — デーモン・スピリット\', \'flavor\': \'「鬼の知恵を味わうとあらば、その塩の味は己の血。」\\n――夜の華、切苦\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594588&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'db8493d5-63df-4d62-b96d-5ae31567e253\', \'multiverseId\': 594588}, \'multiverseid\': 594588}, {\'name\': \'颠倒黑白的逝斩\', \'text\': \'在每位牌手的维持开始时，该牌手失去2点生命且抓两张牌。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～恶魔／精怪\', \'flavor\': \'「若想尝尝邪鬼的智慧，先准备用自身鲜血来调味。」\\n～幽菊切苦\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594939&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a1cf26ef-3efe-4ac5-8ac9-fc35cbf6f549\', \'multiverseId\': 594939}, \'multiverseid\': 594939}]', '[{\'name\': \'Selbstloser Geist\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nOpfere den Selbstlosen Geist: Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten Unzerstörbarkeit bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Geist, Kleriker\', \'flavor\': \'„Es gibt immer etwas, was man noch geben kann."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591645&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'76bbab8c-b33b-41d3-aa9b-fed18cbb32b8\', \'multiverseId\': 591645}, \'multiverseid\': 591645}, {\'name\': \'Espíritu abnegado\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nSacrificar el Espíritu abnegado: Las criaturas que controlas ganan la habilidad de indestructible hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Clérigo espíritu\', \'flavor\': \'"Siempre se puede dar más".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591774&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9eafe25e-fdd2-4718-9544-bda5276c19ab\', \'multiverseId\': 591774}, \'multiverseid\': 591774}, {\'name\': \'Esprit dévoué\', \'text\': "Vol\\nSacrifiez l\'Esprit dévoué : Les créatures que vous contrôlez acquièrent l\'indestructible jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : esprit et clerc\', \'flavor\': \'« On peut toujours donner davantage. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591903&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'368f7ace-c1e8-4fc1-a828-ae23df9414c5\', \'multiverseId\': 591903}, \'multiverseid\': 591903}, {\'name\': \'Spirito Altruista\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nSacrifica lo Spirito Altruista: Le creature che controlli hanno indistruttibile fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Chierico Spirito\', \'flavor\': \'"C\\\'è sempre qualcosa in più da donare."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592032&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3fe217db-b5b0-4ab6-b3b8-bce16371baa4\', \'multiverseId\': 592032}, \'multiverseid\': 592032}, {\'name\': \'無私の霊魂\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n無私の霊魂を生け贄に捧げる：ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールしているすべてのクリーチャーは破壊不能を得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — スピリット・クレリック\', \'flavor\': \'「どのような時でも、分け与えられるものがまだある。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592161&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c0e093cc-77db-4c80-9ee3-0a28548cadb4\', \'multiverseId\': 592161}, \'multiverseid\': 592161}, {\'name\': \'无私精怪\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n牺牲无私精怪：由你操控的生物获得不灭异能直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～精怪／僧侣\', \'flavor\': \'「奉献永无止境。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592548&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'250b1a5e-4944-4c48-b22c-2133504f0bb2\', \'multiverseId\': 592548}, \'multiverseid\': 592548}]', '[{\'name\': \'Selbstmontierer\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Selbstmontierer ins Spiel kommt, kannst du deine Bibliothek nach einer Montagearbeiter-Kreaturenkarte durchsuchen, sie offen vorzeigen, auf deine Hand nehmen und danach mischen.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Montagearbeiter\', \'flavor\': \'Er sieht sich selbst in all seinen Schöpfungen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596299&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'db096cff-91cf-4155-ac97-fc2e0aeb128a\', \'multiverseId\': 596299}, \'multiverseid\': 596299}, {\'name\': \'Autoensamblador\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Autoensamblador entre al campo de batalla, puedes buscar en tu biblioteca una carta de criatura Operario, mostrarla, ponerla en tu mano y luego barajar.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Operario\', \'flavor\': \'Se ve a sí mismo en todas sus creaciones.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596386&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a028d375-3da5-4154-8d06-23e0a01d2b87\', \'multiverseId\': 596386}, \'multiverseid\': 596386}, {\'name\': \'Auto-assembleur\', \'text\': "Quand l\'Auto-assembleur arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez chercher dans votre bibliothèque une carte de créature Ouvrier spécialisé, la révéler, la mettre dans votre main, puis mélanger.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : ouvrier spécialisé\', \'flavor\': \'Il se retrouve dans toutes ses créations.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596473&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'406ba9b8-1c7f-4c1f-8864-ac31b85a4ada\', \'multiverseId\': 596473}, \'multiverseid\': 596473}, {\'name\': \'Auto-Assemblante\', \'text\': "Quando l\'Auto-Assemblante entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi passare in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta creatura Addetto-al-Montaggio, rivelarla e aggiungerla alla tua mano, poi rimescolare.", \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Addetto-al-Montaggio\', \'flavor\': \'Si rivede in tutte le sue creazioni.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596560&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a6a664d7-253f-42e7-a7e3-e4b8b6b6c135\', \'multiverseId\': 596560}, \'multiverseid\': 596560}, {\'name\': \'自己組立機械\', \'text\': \'自己組立機械が戦場に出たとき、あなたは「あなたのライブラリーから組立作業員・クリーチャー・カード１枚を探し、公開し、あなたの手札に加える。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。」を選んでもよい。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 組立作業員\', \'flavor\': \'それは自分の組立の様子を自分で見ている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596647&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'94a92326-abbf-4a09-9a1a-e8b879cf2c30\', \'multiverseId\': 596647}, \'multiverseid\': 596647}, {\'name\': \'自组工人\', \'text\': \'当自组工人进战场时，你可以从你牌库中搜寻一张组装工人生物牌，展示该牌，将它置于你手上，然后洗牌。\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～组装工人\', \'flavor\': \'它的所有造物中都留有自身影子。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596908&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'34a947e5-dea1-4458-b25b-c7d69d26cb17\', \'multiverseId\': 596908}, \'multiverseid\': 596908}]', '[{\'name\': \'Sengender Speer\', \'text\': \'Der Sengende Speer fügt einem Ziel deiner Wahl 3 Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Manchmal stirbst du einen glorreichen Tod, das Schwert gezückt. Manchmal bist du nur eine Zielscheibe.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590305&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'18c1f683-70d1-430d-b33a-d91ca7086012\', \'multiverseId\': 590305}, \'multiverseid\': 590305}, {\'name\': \'Lanza flamígera\', \'text\': \'La Lanza flamígera hace 3 puntos de daño a cualquier objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Unas veces se muere de forma gloriosa y con la espada en alto. Otras no se es más que un blanco de práctica.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590440&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9b6c9fb6-ad31-406b-9043-fdd860b6bb75\', \'multiverseId\': 590440}, \'multiverseid\': 590440}, {\'name\': \'Lance calcinante\', \'text\': "La Lance calcinante inflige 3 blessures à n\'importe quelle cible.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "Certains meurent dans la gloire, l\'épée au clair. D\'autres finissent comme cible d\'entraînement.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590575&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a163085b-73db-4611-ae66-d575a47c7f29\', \'multiverseId\': 590575}, \'multiverseid\': 590575}, {\'name\': \'Lancia Infuocata\', \'text\': \'La Lancia Infuocata infligge 3 danni a un qualsiasi bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'A volte soccombi a una morte gloriosa con la tua spada levata per colpire. A volte sei solo un bersaglio da esercitazione.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590710&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'26d1ec90-31bb-4feb-8189-1e356b9c3e56\', \'multiverseId\': 590710}, \'multiverseid\': 590710}, {\'name\': \'灼熱の槍\', \'text\': \'クリーチャーやプレインズウォーカーやプレイヤーのうち１つを対象とする。灼熱の槍はそれに３点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'剣を高く掲げて誇り高く死ぬときもある。ただ練習台にされることもある。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590845&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5ddf6cc2-3279-45c1-9897-45bf1553dcf0\', \'multiverseId\': 590845}, \'multiverseid\': 590845}, {\'name\': \'炙热矛\', \'text\': \'炙热矛对任意一个目标造成3点伤害。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'有时你能高举长剑光荣死去。有时你只是练靶对象。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591250&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'27a31127-c1ea-4791-94bc-0b71a37d4415\', \'multiverseId\': 591250}, \'multiverseid\': 591250}]', '[{\'name\': \'Seuchenspeier\', \'text\': \'Zu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments fügt der Seuchenspeier jeder Kreatur und jedem Spieler 1 Schadenspunkt zu.\\nWenn der Seuchenspeier stirbt, fügt er jeder Kreatur und jedem Spieler 1 Schadenspunkt zu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Phyrexianer, Schrecken\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594113&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fc3f8a8e-2dca-4676-bf2b-aaa7c2d52f8b\', \'multiverseId\': 594113}, \'multiverseid\': 594113}, {\'name\': \'Escupidor de peste\', \'text\': \'Al comienzo de tu mantenimiento, el Escupidor de peste hace 1 punto de daño a cada criatura y a cada jugador.\\nCuando el Escupidor de peste muera, hace 1 punto de daño a cada criatura y a cada jugador.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Horror pirexiano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594230&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'810dddf7-230e-4fda-83b0-8189bdbaba73\', \'multiverseId\': 594230}, \'multiverseid\': 594230}, {\'name\': \'Cracheur de peste\', \'text\': \'Au début de votre entretien, le Cracheur de peste inflige 1 blessure à chaque créature et à chaque joueur.\\nQuand le Cracheur de peste meurt, il inflige 1 blessure à chaque créature et à chaque joueur.\', \'type\': \'Créature : phyrexian et horreur\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594347&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'832d11fc-96ca-4042-bb7c-6791366bca53\', \'multiverseId\': 594347}, \'multiverseid\': 594347}, {\'name\': \'Sputapeste\', \'text\': "All\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, lo Sputapeste infligge 1 danno a ogni creatura e a ogni giocatore.\\nQuando lo Sputapeste muore, infligge 1 danno a ogni creatura e a ogni giocatore.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Orrore Phyrexiano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594464&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bdb086f1-6f3a-4e73-8fa3-cd148b3de55b\', \'multiverseId\': 594464}, \'multiverseid\': 594464}, {\'name\': \'疫病吐き\', \'text\': \'あなたのアップキープの開始時に、疫病吐きは各クリーチャーと各プレイヤーにそれぞれ１点のダメージを与える。\\n疫病吐きが死亡したとき、疫病吐きは各クリーチャーと各プレイヤーにそれぞれ１点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ファイレクシアン・ホラー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594581&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d529ff11-22ee-4ef9-95b7-07bdb7396ab6\', \'multiverseId\': 594581}, \'multiverseid\': 594581}, {\'name\': \'瘟疫喷兽\', \'text\': \'在你的维持开始时，瘟疫喷兽对每个生物和每位牌手各造成1点伤害。\\n当瘟疫喷兽死去时，它对每个生物和每位牌手各造成1点伤害。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～非瑞人／惊惧兽\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594932&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1025ed61-7fdb-49ca-9feb-99ae52baca46\', \'multiverseId\': 594932}, \'multiverseid\': 594932}]', '[{\'name\': \'Seuchensäer\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Seuchensäer ins Spiel kommt, opfert jeder Spieler eine Kreatur oder einen Planeswalker. Jeder Spieler, der dies nicht kann, wirft eine Karte ab.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Schamane\', \'flavor\': \'„Sieht aus, als bräuchte ich eine neue Versuchsperson. Meldet sich jemand freiwillig?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597101&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'889b82ca-155d-49d4-a165-482c7971c857\', \'multiverseId\': 597101}, \'multiverseid\': 597101}, {\'name\': \'Difundeplagas\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Difundeplagas entre al campo de batalla, cada jugador sacrifica una criatura o planeswalker. Cada jugador que no pueda hacerlo descarta una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Chamán humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Necesito un nuevo sujeto de pruebas. ¿Algún voluntario?".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597147&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2427aede-4d5a-4792-9504-307da1f0efbb\', \'multiverseId\': 597147}, \'multiverseid\': 597147}, {\'name\': \'Façonneur de peste\', \'text\': "Quand le Façonneur de peste arrive sur le champ de bataille, chaque joueur sacrifie une créature ou un planeswalker. Chaque joueur qui ne peut pas se défausse d\'une carte.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et shamane\', \'flavor\': "« On dirait que j\'ai besoin d\'un nouveau cobaye. Des volontaires ? »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597193&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3d530aa6-e27e-43b7-96c5-00f45bc7439d\', \'multiverseId\': 597193}, \'multiverseid\': 597193}, {\'name\': \'Plasmacontagio\', \'text\': \'Quando il Plasmacontagio entra nel campo di battaglia, ogni giocatore sacrifica una creatura o un planeswalker. Ogni giocatore che non può farlo scarta una carta.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Sciamano Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"A quanto pare mi servirà una nuova cavia. Qualche volontario?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597239&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0ed8cce4-fc12-418d-b56c-4d029c05c64b\', \'multiverseId\': 597239}, \'multiverseid\': 597239}, {\'name\': \'疫病造り師\', \'text\': \'疫病造り師が戦場に出たとき、各プレイヤーはそれぞれクリーチャーやプレインズウォーカーのうち１体を生け贄に捧げる。それができない各プレイヤーはそれぞれカード１枚を捨てる。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・シャーマン\', \'flavor\': \'「新しい被検体が必要だ。志願者はいるかい？」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597285&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cb222fa6-7353-4a11-8a33-f9c00b85f6af\', \'multiverseId\': 597285}, \'multiverseid\': 597285}, {\'name\': \'播疫师\', \'text\': \'当播疫师进战场时，每位牌手各牺牲一个生物或鹏洛客。每位无法如此作的牌手各弃一张牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／祭师\', \'flavor\': \'「看来我需要新的实验对象。有志愿者吗？」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597423&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4263fc0e-c48f-49de-9a1f-a45c8a5ecff4\', \'multiverseId\': 597423}, \'multiverseid\': 597423}]', '[{\'name\': \'Seuchenwolf\', \'text\': \'{2}{G}: Der Seuchenwolf erhält Todesberührung bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Wolf\', \'flavor\': \'Wölfe, die Zombiefleisch fressen und es überleben, verbreiten die üblen Krankheiten der Toten auf ihren Streifzügen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592904&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'00504e6e-1aea-4e6c-ad8d-d7f07f454822\', \'multiverseId\': 592904}, \'multiverseid\': 592904}, {\'name\': \'Lobo pestilente\', \'text\': \'{2}{G}: El Lobo pestilente gana la habilidad de toque mortal hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Lobo\', \'flavor\': \'Los lobos que se alimentan de carne de zombies y logran sobrevivir portan las enfermedades pútridas de los muertos allá donde van.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593025&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d6284047-cbd0-4f37-b5d1-490d47b57515\', \'multiverseId\': 593025}, \'multiverseid\': 593025}, {\'name\': \'Loup pestiféré\', \'text\': "{2}{G} : Le Loup pestiféré acquiert le contact mortel jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : loup\', \'flavor\': \'Les loups qui se nourrissent de la chair de zombie et y survivent portent les maladies abjectes des morts partout où ils vont.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593146&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8fb228c5-bef7-49e9-9493-a80893451439\', \'multiverseId\': 593146}, \'multiverseid\': 593146}, {\'name\': \'Lupo Pestilenziale\', \'text\': \'{2}{G}: Il Lupo Pestilenziale ha tocco letale fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Lupo\', \'flavor\': \'I lupi che si cibano di carne di zombie e sopravvivono portano con sé le terribili malattie dei morti.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593267&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a64e7112-b654-40b2-8d83-ea533bd581a4\', \'multiverseId\': 593267}, \'multiverseid\': 593267}, {\'name\': \'伝染病の狼\', \'text\': \'{2}{G}：ターン終了時まで、伝染病の狼は接死を得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 狼\', \'flavor\': \'ゾンビの肉を喰らって生き延びた狼は死者の不浄な病を徘徊する先々へと運ぶ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593388&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a4f9881a-7928-4473-afb2-5c9d50831adf\', \'multiverseId\': 593388}, \'multiverseid\': 593388}, {\'name\': \'瘟疫狼\', \'text\': \'{2}{G}：瘟疫狼获得死触异能直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～狼\', \'flavor\': \'吃过灵俑而幸存的狼群，会将亡者腐疫播散到它们所经之处。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593751&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d0bb4523-93cd-4ff5-82db-511eb43f131a\', \'multiverseId\': 593751}, \'multiverseid\': 593751}]', '[{\'name\': \'Sich entfaltende Wildnis\', \'text\': \'{T}, opfere die Sich entfaltende Wildnis: Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Standardland-Karte, bringe sie getappt ins Spiel und mische danach.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'„Verbringe zu viel Zeit damit, die Schatten nach dem Bösen abzusuchen, und du wirst nie die Schönheit sehen, die unsere Welt zu bieten hat."\\n—Katilda, Morgenlicht-Oberste\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596317&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f65d58ab-255f-4a2f-a0cb-f66ffb62eacd\', \'multiverseId\': 596317}, \'multiverseid\': 596317}, {\'name\': \'Terrenos expansivos\', \'text\': \'{T}, sacrificar los Terrenos expansivos: Busca en tu biblioteca una carta de tierra básica, ponla en el campo de batalla girada y luego baraja.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'"Si pasas demasiado tiempo buscando sombras del mal, nunca te percatarás de la belleza de nuestro mundo".\\n—Katilda, Gran Cierva del Alba\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596404&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5927affa-1c7c-4e99-ae1f-d7f772b413bd\', \'multiverseId\': 596404}, \'multiverseid\': 596404}, {\'name\': \'Étendues sauvages en évolution\', \'text\': \'{T}, sacrifiez les Étendues sauvages en évolution : Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte de terrain de base, mettez-la sur le champ de bataille engagée, puis mélangez.\', \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "« Si vous passez votre temps à chercher le mal tapi dans l\'ombre, vous ne verrez jamais la beauté que notre monde peut offrir. »\\n—Katilda, Première de Cerf-orient", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596491&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d42b7ade-bcbe-4569-8340-ed427cec294f\', \'multiverseId\': 596491}, \'multiverseid\': 596491}, {\'name\': \'Terre Selvagge in Evoluzione\', \'text\': \'{T}, Sacrifica le Terre Selvagge in Evoluzione: Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta terra base, mettila sul campo di battaglia TAPpata, poi rimescola.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'"Se passi troppo tempo a cercare il male nell\\\'oscurità, non vedrai mai la bellezza che il nostro mondo può offrire."\\n—Katilda, Prima Albacorno\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596578&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c6d703d5-da79-4676-9b0b-25faea25c1a3\', \'multiverseId\': 596578}, \'multiverseid\': 596578}, {\'name\': \'進化する未開地\', \'text\': \'{T},進化する未開地を生け贄に捧げる：あなたのライブラリーから基本土地・カード１枚を探し、タップ状態で戦場に出す。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'「邪悪な者を恐れて影を見張り続けてはこの世界の美しさを見逃すことになるわよ。」\\n――ドーンハルトの主導者、カティルダ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596665&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'42fcbdcc-f971-4337-b8b2-ff34a808afdc\', \'multiverseId\': 596665}, \'multiverseid\': 596665}, {\'name\': \'成形野地\', \'text\': \'{T}，牺牲成形野地：从你牌库中搜寻一张基本地牌，将之横置放进战场，然后洗牌。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'「若你过度聚焦阴影找寻邪恶，便会错过这世界上光明之处的众多美景。」\\n～曙鹿集巫首凯蒂妲\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596926&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'42ba4dc4-aaa2-4916-ab2c-df844845cba6\', \'multiverseId\': 596926}, \'multiverseid\': 596926}]', '[{\'name\': \'Sich verbünden\', \'text\': \'Bis zu zwei Kreaturen deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst, fügen einer anderen Kreatur deiner Wahl jeweils Schadenspunkte in Höhe ihrer Stärke zu.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Wenn Gefahr droht, rückt die Vision, die die Parune der alten Zeit für diese Stadt hatten, wieder ins Blickfeld.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592830&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c300070d-dcfa-45ab-9060-c614bedfdcbc\', \'multiverseId\': 592830}, \'multiverseid\': 592830}, {\'name\': \'Unir fuerzas\', \'text\': \'Hasta dos criaturas objetivo que controlas hacen una cantidad de daño cada una igual a su fuerza a otra criatura objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'En épocas de peligro, la visión que los antiguos paruns tuvieron de su ciudad se hace más real.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592951&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'66ae4aca-e65c-40e0-81f9-5798513e142a\', \'multiverseId\': 592951}, \'multiverseid\': 592951}, {\'name\': \'Regroupement\', \'text\': "Ciblez jusqu\'à deux créatures que vous contrôlez. Chacune inflige un nombre de blessures égal à sa force à une autre créature ciblée.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "Quand l\'heure est grave, la vision que les paruns antiques avaient pour leur cité devient claire.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593072&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'62129f0e-3ec1-402b-9075-1e21ac2423b3\', \'multiverseId\': 593072}, \'multiverseid\': 593072}, {\'name\': \'Unire le Forze\', \'text\': "Fino a due creature bersaglio che controlli infliggono ciascuna danno pari alla propria forza a un\'altra creatura bersaglio.", \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'In tempi di pericolo, la visione che gli antichi parun avevano per la loro città si fa più nitida.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593193&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'13b069fd-2369-4e41-821c-0cc9200bbb6e\', \'multiverseId\': 593193}, \'multiverseid\': 593193}, {\'name\': \'連帯\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー最大２体と、それらでないクリーチャー１体を対象とする。その前者はそれぞれ、その後者に自身のパワーに等しい点数のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'危機が迫ったとき、かつてパルンズが都市を構想した際の先見の明が明らかになった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593314&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e789df1d-1b60-4e55-9d02-b8b8feefc955\', \'multiverseId\': 593314}, \'multiverseid\': 593314}, {\'name\': \'携手出击\', \'text\': \'选择至多两个目标由你操控的生物和另一个目标生物。前者各依其力量对后者造成伤害。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'在危难之时，上古元祖原本对城市的憧憬重回世间。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593677&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'79f1fdb5-38f8-41c1-9a32-cddc4a76ecd3\', \'multiverseId\': 593677}, \'multiverseid\': 593677}]', '[{\'name\': \'Sicherer Tod\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre eine Kreatur deiner Wahl. Ihr Beherrscher verliert 2 Lebenspunkte und du erhältst 2 Lebenspunkte dazu.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Einige Geister heften sich an eine Person und schwelgen in ihrer wachsenden Angst, bis zu einem finalen Moment alles verschlingender Panik.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594043&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6ff76b54-12bb-41c9-8a33-bdfc6ef03854\', \'multiverseId\': 594043}, \'multiverseid\': 594043}, {\'name\': \'Muerte segura\', \'text\': \'Destruye la criatura objetivo. Su controlador pierde 2 vidas y tú ganas 2 vidas.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Algunos espíritus se aferran a alguien y se alimentan del creciente miedo hasta el último momento, en el que el terror lo consume todo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594160&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'858e84d6-21d1-486f-b4ff-0741696c3da8\', \'multiverseId\': 594160}, \'multiverseid\': 594160}, {\'name\': \'Une mort certaine\', \'text\': \'Détruisez une créature ciblée. Son contrôleur perd 2 points de vie et vous gagnez 2 points de vie.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Certains esprits s\'accrochent à une personne, savourant sa peur grandissante jusqu\'à ce qu\'enfin la terreur la consume.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594277&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f1a35326-e5d4-4ebc-8d1c-e5ba940b7da7\', \'multiverseId\': 594277}, \'multiverseid\': 594277}, {\'name\': \'Morte Certa\', \'text\': \'Distruggi una creatura bersaglio. Il suo controllore perde 2 punti vita e tu guadagni 2 punti vita.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'Alcuni spiriti si aggrappano a una persona, banchettando con il suo crescente timore fino a un ultimo istante di terrore divorante.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594394&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4f2ca9d6-574e-4c6a-9d6d-7628fe5d2cf5\', \'multiverseId\': 594394}, \'multiverseid\': 594394}, {\'name\': \'生命の危機\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それを破壊する。それのコントローラーは２点のライフを失い、あなたは２点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'霊の中には一人のみに付きまとうものもいる。恐れが大きくなるのを見て楽しみ、最後の瞬間に恐怖を味わい尽くすのだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594511&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'155019e7-2621-43a6-a12f-ed60d9264eba\', \'multiverseId\': 594511}, \'multiverseid\': 594511}, {\'name\': \'必死无疑\', \'text\': \'消灭目标生物。其操控者失去2点生命且你获得2点生命。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'有些鬼魂会紧缠一人，以其日渐增长的恐惧为食，直到吞噬一切的终极恐怖来临。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594862&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6f1fd96d-2f35-472a-87eb-ad2c45f97f3f\', \'multiverseId\': 594862}, \'multiverseid\': 594862}]', '[{\'name\': \'Siegel des leeren Throns\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du einen Verzauberungszauber wirkst, erzeuge einen 4/4 weißen Engel-Kreaturenspielstein mit Flugfähigkeit.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'Als Asha Bant verließ, stellte sie sicher, dass die Welt auch in ihrer Abwesenheit Schutz und Ordnung haben würde.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591650&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d06ffe25-4cae-40a5-bce0-d6df8f10b3ec\', \'multiverseId\': 591650}, \'multiverseid\': 591650}, {\'name\': \'Sello del trono vacío\', \'text\': \'Siempre que lances un hechizo de encantamiento, crea una ficha de criatura Ángel blanca 4/4 con la habilidad de volar.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'Cuando Asha dejó Bant, se aseguró de que el mundo tuviera protección y orden en su ausencia.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591779&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9f852214-624d-4333-8e34-05195bcd3758\', \'multiverseId\': 591779}, \'multiverseid\': 591779}, {\'name\': \'Sigille du trône vacant\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que vous lancez un sort d\'enchantement, créez un jeton de créature 4/4 blanche Ange avec le vol.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': "Quand Asha quitta Bant, elle s\'assura que le monde connaîtrait ordre et protection en son absence.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591908&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f30af687-e22e-4c1a-bb9c-f69aa0f16de2\', \'multiverseId\': 591908}, \'multiverseid\': 591908}, {\'name\': \'Sigillo del Trono Vuoto\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta lanci una magia incantesimo, crea una pedina creatura Angelo 4/4 bianca con volare.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'Quando Asha lasciò Bant, si assicurò che il mondo potesse beneficiare di ordine e protezione anche durante la sua assenza.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592037&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b56daa2d-4833-4f5e-85ce-0a708b68ea1f\', \'multiverseId\': 592037}, \'multiverseid\': 592037}, {\'name\': \'空位の玉座の印章\', \'text\': \'あなたがエンチャント・呪文を唱えるたび、飛行を持つ白の４/４の天使・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'アーシャはバントを離れる際に、彼女がいない間もこの世界から守護と秩序が失われないようにした。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592166&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'135a577b-1998-4747-8046-f5cbc4b79ab1\', \'multiverseId\': 592166}, \'multiverseid\': 592166}, {\'name\': \'虚位印记\', \'text\': \'每当你施放结界咒语时，派出一个4/4白色，具飞行异能的天使衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'当亚莎离开班特时，她确信即使自己不在，这世界依旧能拥有保护与秩序。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592553&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'698d7a6f-c08c-4bbf-91b8-ed1f2c69f56a\', \'multiverseId\': 592553}, \'multiverseid\': 592553}]', '[{\'name\': \'Silberrücken-Schamane\', \'text\': \'Verursacht Trampelschaden\\nWenn der Silberrücken-Schamane stirbt, ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Menschenaffe, Schamane\', \'flavor\': \'Die Geister ihrer Vorfahren geben den Affen von Yavimaya ihre Stärke.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592927&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'081a3e1f-dff3-4b5f-994a-5884051ff88a\', \'multiverseId\': 592927}, \'multiverseid\': 592927}, {\'name\': \'Chamán lomo plateado\', \'text\': \'Arrolla.\\nCuando el Chamán lomo plateado muera, roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Chamán simio\', \'flavor\': \'Los simios de Yavimaya ganan fuerza de los espíritus de sus ancestros.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593048&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1a17ed60-d34b-42fe-84c2-83f06663c29a\', \'multiverseId\': 593048}, \'multiverseid\': 593048}, {\'name\': \'Shamane à dos argenté\', \'text\': \'Piétinement\\nQuand le Shamane à dos argenté meurt, piochez une carte.\', \'type\': \'Créature : grand singe et shamane\', \'flavor\': "Les singes de la Yavimaya puisent leur force dans l\'esprit de leurs ancêtres.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593169&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'494cd726-b937-4280-ad1e-6d41014abf63\', \'multiverseId\': 593169}, \'multiverseid\': 593169}, {\'name\': \'Sciamano Schienargento\', \'text\': \'Travolgere\\nQuando lo Sciamano Schienargento muore, pesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Sciamano Scimpanzé\', \'flavor\': \'I primati di Yavimaya traggono forza dagli spiriti dei loro antenati.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593290&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'087d57de-54e2-4c6c-9308-d2230ca227d6\', \'multiverseId\': 593290}, \'multiverseid\': 593290}, {\'name\': \'シルバーバックの巫師\', \'text\': \'トランプル\\nシルバーバックの巫師が死亡したとき、カード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 類人猿・シャーマン\', \'flavor\': \'ヤヴィマヤに住むゴリラたちは祖先の霊から強さを引き出す。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593411&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'06a6a605-c7bc-455a-b52d-c88182cd519c\', \'multiverseId\': 593411}, \'multiverseid\': 593411}, {\'name\': \'银背猿祭师\', \'text\': \'践踏\\n当银背猿祭师死去时，抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～猿猴／祭师\', \'flavor\': \'亚维马雅的猿猴从先祖灵魂中汲取力量。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=593774&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a1be3b03-b977-44aa-8e86-7d40fd19d69d\', \'multiverseId\': 593774}, \'multiverseid\': 593774}]', '[{\'name\': \'Singvogelhändlerin\', \'text\': \'Wenn die Singvogelhändlerin ins Spiel kommt, erzeuge einen 1/1 weißen Vogel-Kreaturenspielstein mit Flugfähigkeit.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch\', \'flavor\': \'„Die Zaunkönigin ist die einzige Händlerin in der Schlüssellochtiefe, die niemanden betrügt."\\n—Mirela, Azorius-Husarin\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591646&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c54f524e-b7d8-46e0-b23d-f746d94e3ed9\', \'multiverseId\': 591646}, \'multiverseid\': 591646}, {\'name\': \'Vendedora de aves cantoras\', \'text\': \'Cuando la Vendedora de aves cantoras entre al campo de batalla, crea una ficha de criatura Ave blanca 1/1 con la habilidad de volar.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano\', \'flavor\': \'"La dama Wren es la única comerciante de Bajos de Cerradura que no tima a sus clientes".\\n—Mirela, húsar azoria\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591775&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4e1680ad-4837-4935-9b96-15273089c6e0\', \'multiverseId\': 591775}, \'multiverseid\': 591775}, {\'name\': \'Marchande de passereaux\', \'text\': \'Quand la Marchande de passereaux arrive sur le champ de bataille, créez un jeton de créature 1/1 blanche Oiseau avec le vol.\', \'type\': \'Créature : humain\', \'flavor\': "« Dame Roitelet est la seule marchande des Collines de la Serrure qui n\'arnaque pas trop son monde. »\\n—Mirela, hussarde d\'Azorius", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591904&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9652f2e3-7bf2-476e-839c-a36022a6bb1b\', \'multiverseId\': 591904}, \'multiverseid\': 591904}, {\'name\': \'Venditrice di Uccellini Canori\', \'text\': \'Quando la Venditrice di Uccellini Canori entra nel campo di battaglia, crea una pedina creatura Uccello 1/1 bianca con volare.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Lady Scricciolo è l\\\'unico mercante onesto delle Serrature Sotterranee."\\n—Mirela, ussara Azorius\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592033&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cdda3987-6177-4adf-abb9-192764163fb6\', \'multiverseId\': 592033}, \'multiverseid\': 592033}, {\'name\': \'歌鳥の売り手\', \'text\': \'歌鳥の売り手が戦場に出たとき、飛行を持つ白の１/１の鳥・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間\', \'flavor\': \'「鍵穴市場でインチキ商売をしていないのはレディ・レンただ一人よ。」\\n――アゾリウスの騎兵、ミレーラ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592162&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5d2784ff-349c-4af4-b5ec-bb79825f0ebe\', \'multiverseId\': 592162}, \'multiverseid\': 592162}, {\'name\': \'鸣鸟商贩\', \'text\': \'当鸣鸟商贩进战场时，派出一个1/1白色，具飞行异能的鸟衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类\', \'flavor\': \'「伦夫人是锁眼市集里唯一不使诈的商贩。」\\n～俄佐立轻骑兵米瑞拉\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592549&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1058e2c8-5a0f-4376-bc87-6b35a36d3761\', \'multiverseId\': 592549}, \'multiverseid\': 592549}]', '[{\'name\': \'Sitz der Synode\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {U}.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt, Land\', \'flavor\': \'Lumengrid, Sitz des Wissensvorrats, Quelle der vedalkischen Geheimnisse.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596324&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a280e29b-0f4f-4b4c-921f-6939995a6527\', \'multiverseId\': 596324}, \'multiverseid\': 596324}, {\'name\': \'Sede del sínodo\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {U}.\', \'type\': \'Tierra artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'Lúmengrid, sede del Pozo del conocimiento, fuente del saber vedalken.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596411&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9e31c139-9e47-4127-a320-f6fe4de4f8d8\', \'multiverseId\': 596411}, \'multiverseid\': 596411}, {\'name\': \'Siège du Synode\', \'text\': \'{T} : Ajoutez {U}.\', \'type\': \'Terrain-artefact\', \'flavor\': \'Lumengrid, site du Sauvoir de Connaissance, source arcane des vedalkens.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596498&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'43cc86be-f5f8-4306-b1a1-7602c0fef132\', \'multiverseId\': 596498}, \'multiverseid\': 596498}, {\'name\': \'Sede del Sinodo\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {U}.\', \'type\': \'Terra Artefatto\', \'flavor\': "Lumengrid, sito della Pozza della Conoscenza, la fonte dell\'arcana sapienza dei vedalken.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596585&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'96761510-5f84-4fd6-b155-dfd8972e16a3\', \'multiverseId\': 596585}, \'multiverseid\': 596585}, {\'name\': \'教議会の座席\', \'text\': \'{T}：{U}を加える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・土地\', \'flavor\': \'ルーメングリッド、ヴィダルケンの秘儀の源である、知識槽のある場所。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596672&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ab69853f-0bb2-41b3-84c9-3f24532b217b\', \'multiverseId\': 596672}, \'multiverseid\': 596672}, {\'name\': \'悉诺议会宅邸\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{U}。\', \'type\': \'神器地\', \'flavor\': \'博识都，知识之池静凝之地，维多肯秘密的泉源。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596933&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'91f0d53e-c4cd-4b3c-8a71-dbd3ce412ac0\', \'multiverseId\': 596933}, \'multiverseid\': 596933}]', '[{\'name\': \'Skirsdag-Hohepriester\', \'text\': \'Morbide — {T}, tappe zwei ungetappte Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst: Erzeuge einen 5/5 schwarzen Dämon-Kreaturenspielstein mit Flugfähigkeit. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit nur, falls in diesem Zug eine Kreatur gestorben ist.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Kleriker\', \'flavor\': \'„Thrabens Flehen stößt auf taube Ohren. Unseres nicht."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594124&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0a5abf56-93c8-4290-9f28-bbea75a534de\', \'multiverseId\': 594124}, \'multiverseid\': 594124}, {\'name\': \'Gran sacerdote Skirsdag\', \'text\': \'Necrario — {T}, girar dos criaturas enderezadas que controlas: Crea una ficha de criatura Demonio negra 5/5 con la habilidad de volar. Activa esto solo si una criatura murió este turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Clérigo humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Las súplicas de Thraben caen en oídos sordos. Las nuestras, no".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594241&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f0f0a04f-f8d5-47eb-9078-87cfaa254872\', \'multiverseId\': 594241}, \'multiverseid\': 594241}, {\'name\': \'Grand prêtre de Skirsdag\', \'text\': "Morbidité — {T}, engagez deux créatures dégagées que vous contrôlez : Créez un jeton de créature 5/5 noire Démon avec le vol. N\'activez que si une créature est morte ce tour-ci.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et clerc\', \'flavor\': \'« Les supplications de Thraben sont vaines. Pas les nôtres. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594358&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8c5d70ac-17bc-4d2f-8763-35810197a60c\', \'multiverseId\': 594358}, \'multiverseid\': 594358}, {\'name\': \'Sommo Sacerdote Skirsdag\', \'text\': \'Morboso — {T}, TAPpa due creature STAPpate che controlli: Crea una pedina creatura Demone 5/5 nera con volare. Attiva solo se è morta una creatura in questo turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Chierico Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Le preghiere di Thraben rimangono inascoltate. Ma non le nostre."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594475&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2c8d17df-6c09-427b-b6ce-a29a2072ac02\', \'multiverseId\': 594475}, \'multiverseid\': 594475}, {\'name\': \'スカースダグの高僧\', \'text\': \'陰鬱 ― {T},あなたがコントロールしていてアンタップ状態であるクリーチャー２体をタップする：飛行を持つ黒の５/５のデーモン・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。このターンにクリーチャーが死亡していなければ起動できない。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・クレリック\', \'flavor\': \'「スレイベンの嘆願は、聞こえぬ耳には届かぬ。我々のは届く。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594592&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b2016b54-31f2-41ec-90f0-3ef3201062e5\', \'multiverseId\': 594592}, \'multiverseid\': 594592}, {\'name\': \'史革达高阶僧侣\', \'text\': \'丧心～{T}，横置两个由你操控且未横置的生物：派出一个5/5黑色，具飞行异能的恶魔衍生生物。只能于有生物死去的回合中起动。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／僧侣\', \'flavor\': \'「瑟班的祈祷无人听闻。我们的可不会。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594943&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dfa17bda-2499-43d6-9ff2-69518974e567\', \'multiverseId\': 594943}, \'multiverseid\': 594943}]', '[{\'name\': \'Skirsdag-Supplikantin\', \'text\': \'{B}, {T}, wirf eine Karte ab: Jeder Spieler verliert 2 Lebenspunkte.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Kleriker\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich kann nicht länger zusehen, wie diese Skirsdag-Infiltratoren die Kirche von innen verderben. Selbst der Rat der Lunarchen ist kompromittiert. Was war ich bloß für ein Narr."\\n—Odric\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594125&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'641f31a4-7517-4bbf-bb16-fde876a45008\', \'multiverseId\': 594125}, \'multiverseid\': 594125}, {\'name\': \'Suplicante Skirsdag\', \'text\': \'{B}, {T}, descartar una carta: Cada jugador pierde 2 vidas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Clérigo humano\', \'flavor\': \'"No puedo seguir sentado mientras estos infiltradores Skirsdag corrompen la iglesia desde dentro. Incluso el Concilio lunarca está amenazado. He sido un idiota".\\n—Odric\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594242&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c0b2f69d-30f6-41d0-9c3e-4f2a52f5d020\', \'multiverseId\': 594242}, \'multiverseid\': 594242}, {\'name\': \'Supplicatrice de Skirsdag\', \'text\': "{B}, {T}, défaussez-vous d\'une carte : Chaque joueur perd 2 points de vie.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et clerc\', \'flavor\': "« Je ne peux plus rester passif alors que ces adeptes de Skirsdag infiltrent l\'église pour la pourrir de l\'intérieur. Même le Conseil lunarque a été compromis. Je me suis conduit comme un imbécile. »\\n—Odric", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594359&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a004ddcf-161d-4cb8-ac11-403ba75b8bee\', \'multiverseId\': 594359}, \'multiverseid\': 594359}, {\'name\': \'Supplicante Skirsdag\', \'text\': \'{B}, {T}, Scarta una carta: Ogni giocatore perde 2 punti vita.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Chierico Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Non posso più stare a guardare mentre questi infiltrati Skirsdag corrompono la chiesa dall\\\'interno. Anche il Concilio Lunarca è compromesso. Che sciocco sono stato."\\n—Odric\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594476&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b8669d5c-fa7d-4c7c-ac2b-481ef13b1c47\', \'multiverseId\': 594476}, \'multiverseid\': 594476}, {\'name\': \'スカースダグの嘆願者\', \'text\': \'{B},{T},カード１枚を捨てる：各プレイヤーはそれぞれ２点のライフを失う。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・クレリック\', \'flavor\': \'「スカースダグの潜入者どもが教会を内側から腐らせている。もう傍観していることはできない。月皇評議会すら影響されているとは……。私は愚かだった。」\\n――オドリック\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594593&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7dd3af86-c0c4-4d20-9a7b-0cb793e7aea6\', \'multiverseId\': 594593}, \'multiverseid\': 594593}, {\'name\': \'史革达祈愿僧\', \'text\': \'{B}，{T}，弃一张牌：每位牌手各失去2点生命。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／僧侣\', \'flavor\': \'「我不能再袖手旁观，任由这些史革达潜入者从内部败坏教会。连月主会也已堕落。我居然如此无知。」\\n～欧吉克\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594944&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'809d9c6d-65b0-4536-882a-0622062371dd\', \'multiverseId\': 594944}, \'multiverseid\': 594944}]', '[{\'name\': \'Skrupellose Beseitigung\', \'text\': \'Wirf als zusätzliche Kosten, um diesen Zauberspruch zu wirken, eine Karte ab und opfere eine Kreatur.\\nZwei Kreaturen deiner Wahl erhalten jeweils -13/-13 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Pack mal richtig mit an, Geralf. Es fühlt sich an, als würde ich alles alleine machen."\\n—Gisa die Ghulruferin\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594119&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a1c91ced-09ee-46ba-b201-dcd19c5af431\', \'multiverseId\': 594119}, \'multiverseid\': 594119}, {\'name\': \'Liquidación despiadada\', \'text\': \'Como coste adicional para lanzar este hechizo, descarta una carta y sacrifica una criatura.\\nDos criaturas objetivo obtienen -13/-13 cada una hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Esfuérzate más, Geralf. Parece que tengo que hacerlo yo todo".\\n—Gisa, la llamamuertos\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594236&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'03c903b7-b888-4655-86dd-946801e1a1c8\', \'multiverseId\': 594236}, \'multiverseid\': 594236}, {\'name\': \'Disposition impitoyable\', \'text\': "En tant que coût supplémentaire pour lancer ce sort, défaussez-vous d\'une carte et sacrifiez une créature.\\nDeux créatures ciblées gagnent chacune -13/-13 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« Essaie d\'y mettre un peu du tien, Geralf. J\'ai l\'impression qu\'il n\'y a que moi qui travaille. »\\n—Gisa, meneuse de goule", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594353&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'808ba021-8dec-4fe4-975d-5c05054a33ca\', \'multiverseId\': 594353}, \'multiverseid\': 594353}, {\'name\': \'Eliminazione Spietata\', \'text\': \'Come costo addizionale per lanciare questa magia, scarta una carta e sacrifica una creatura.\\nDue creature bersaglio prendono -13/-13 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Cerca di collaborare, Geralf. Mi sembra di fare tutto da sola."\\n—Gisa l\\\'evocaghoul\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594470&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'11ec3569-7357-49a4-bb84-fa0685085af8\', \'multiverseId\': 594470}, \'multiverseid\': 594470}, {\'name\': \'無情な処分\', \'text\': \'この呪文を唱えるための追加コストとして、カード１枚を捨て、クリーチャー１体を生け贄に捧げる。\\nクリーチャー２体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それらはそれぞれ－13/－13の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「ゲラルフ、貴方もやることはやりなさいな。私が全部やっているような気がするわ。」\\n――グール呼びのギサ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594587&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bfd0b8dd-2157-45d3-b46d-b8733400f258\', \'multiverseId\': 594587}, \'multiverseid\': 594587}, {\'name\': \'无情抛弃\', \'text\': \'弃一张牌并牺牲一个生物，以作为施放此咒语的额外费用。\\n两个目标生物各得-13/-13直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「别想偷懒，基拉夫。怎么全都是我在动手。」\\n～尸鬼牧者基沙\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=594938&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5af9d881-a55b-4e24-b712-9ff0d2a2105d\', \'multiverseId\': 594938}, \'multiverseid\': 594938}]', '[{\'name\': \'So winzig\', \'text\': \'Aufblitzen\\nVerzaubert eine Kreatur\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur erhält -2/-0. Sie erhält stattdessen -6/-0, solange sich sieben oder mehr Karten im Friedhof ihres Beherrschers befinden.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Seine Schwerthiebe gegen das Glas klangen wie ein silbernes Glockenspiel und die Sylphide lachte vor Freude.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595275&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a89ccd02-9ce9-49a5-b2a9-11e85adb785d\', \'multiverseId\': 595275}, \'multiverseid\': 595275}, {\'name\': \'Chiquitín\', \'text\': \'Destello.\\nEncantar criatura.\\nLa criatura encantada obtiene -2/-0. Mientras su controlador tenga siete o más cartas en su cementerio, en vez de eso, obtiene -6/-0.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Su espada sonó como un tintineo argénteo contra el cristal del tarro y la duende sonrió encantada.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595383&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2e2675bb-641b-4bec-8c7f-b2794879022c\', \'multiverseId\': 595383}, \'multiverseid\': 595383}, {\'name\': \'Tout minuscule\', \'text\': \'Flash\\nEnchanter : créature\\nLa créature enchantée gagne -2/-0. Elle gagne -6/-0 à la place tant que son contrôleur a au moins sept cartes dans son cimetière.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': "Son épée tintait comme un carillon d\'argent contre le bocal, et le farfadet riait joyeusement.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595491&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5c8367f8-8cf4-48f5-9815-d1c81f8530f8\', \'multiverseId\': 595491}, \'multiverseid\': 595491}, {\'name\': \'Così Minuscolo\', \'text\': \'Lampo\\nIncanta creatura\\nLa creatura incantata prende -2/-0. Prende invece -6/-0 fintanto che il suo controllore ha sette o più carte nel suo cimitero.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': "La spada suonava come un campanellino d\'argento sul barattolo di vetro e la spiritella rideva divertita.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595599&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'af4a6e7e-499f-4ea3-a894-19773da7785a\', \'multiverseId\': 595599}, \'multiverseid\': 595599}, {\'name\': \'極小\', \'text\': \'瞬速\\nエンチャント（クリーチャー）\\nエンチャントしているクリーチャーは－２/－０の修整を受ける。それのコントローラーの墓地に７枚以上のカードがあるかぎり、代わりにそれは－６/－０の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': \'ガラス瓶に剣が当たるとチャイムのような音がして、スプライトは嬉しそうに笑った。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=595707&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'111c4077-4366-41b9-afa4-667dd2ef9bfd\', \'multiverseId\': 595707}, \'multiverseid\': 595707}, {\'name\': \'小巧精致\', \'text\': \'闪现\\n结附于生物\\n所结附的生物得-2/-0。只要该生物的操控者坟墓场中有七张或更多牌，便改为它得-6/-0。\', \'type\': \'结界 ～灵气\', \'flavor\': \'被关在玻璃瓶中的他不断用长剑敲击瓶壁，发出银铃般清脆声响。见到此景，仙子脸上露出得意笑容。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=596031&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8bc1fa2e-2381-414d-ae0d-5e534bcde86f\', \'multiverseId\': 596031}, \'multiverseid\': 596031}]', '[{\'name\': \'Sokenzan-Schmelzer\', \'text\': \'Zu Beginn des Kampfes in deinem Zug kannst du {1} bezahlen und ein Artefakt opfern. Falls du dies tust, erzeuge einen 3/1 roten Konstrukt-Artefaktkreaturenspielstein mit Eile.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Goblin, Handwerker\', \'flavor\': \'Unter den Handwerkern von Sokenzan-Stadt ist die Wiederverwendung jedes Stückchens Metall eine Sache des Stolzes.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590309&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eb100cf4-a919-4970-893a-622e09ff36ad\', \'multiverseId\': 590309}, \'multiverseid\': 590309}, {\'name\': \'Fundidor de Sokenzan\', \'text\': \'Al comienzo del combate en tu turno, puedes pagar {1} y sacrificar un artefacto. Si lo haces, crea una ficha de criatura artefacto Constructo roja 3/1 con la habilidad de prisa.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Artífice trasgo\', \'flavor\': \'Para los artesanos de la ciudad de Sokenzan, reutilizar cada fragmento de metal es motivo de orgullo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590444&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'286b1c03-b501-462e-8d37-98ef2ea67a2d\', \'multiverseId\': 590444}, \'multiverseid\': 590444}, {\'name\': \'Fondeur du Sokenzan\', \'text\': \'Au début du combat pendant votre tour, vous pouvez payer {1} et sacrifier un artefact. Si vous faites ainsi, créez un jeton de créature-artefact 3/1 rouge Construction avec la célérité.\', \'type\': \'Créature : gobelin et artificier\', \'flavor\': \'Pour les artisans de la ville de Sokenzan, réutiliser le moindre fragment de métal est une question de fierté.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590579&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ae524f14-4f5a-49cf-92f9-e23e85478b59\', \'multiverseId\': 590579}, \'multiverseid\': 590579}, {\'name\': \'Forgiatore di Sokenzan\', \'text\': "All\'inizio del combattimento nel tuo turno, puoi pagare {1} e sacrificare un artefatto. Se lo fai, crea una pedina creatura artefatto Costrutto 3/1 rossa con rapidità.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Artefice Goblin\', \'flavor\': \'Tra gli artigiani della Città di Sokenzan, riutilizzare ogni rottame metallico è motivo di orgoglio.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590714&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cf5701cd-0fc1-4f57-bae9-1621c0359fc9\', \'multiverseId\': 590714}, \'multiverseid\': 590714}, {\'name\': \'霜剣山の製錬者\', \'text\': \'あなたのターンの戦闘の開始時に、あなたは「{1}を支払いアーティファクト１つを生け贄に捧げる。」を選んでもよい。そうしたなら、速攻を持つ赤の３/１の構築物・アーティファクト・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ゴブリン・工匠\', \'flavor\': \'霜剣山市の職工の間で、屑鉄を全て再利用することが美徳とされている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590849&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0c90c906-119a-44bf-8870-de8cef9f47cc\', \'multiverseId\': 590849}, \'multiverseid\': 590849}, {\'name\': \'霜剑山熔铁匠\', \'text\': \'在你回合的战斗开始时，你可以支付{1}并牺牲一个神器。若你如此作，则派出一个3/1红色，具敏捷异能的组构体衍生神器生物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～鬼怪／神器师\', \'flavor\': \'对霜剑山市的工匠来说，重复利用每块废铁是件值得骄傲的事情。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591254&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'977ee001-e9b8-4c63-95a2-43a86671a87c\', \'multiverseId\': 591254}, \'multiverseid\': 591254}]', "[{'name': 'Sonnenstrahls Richtspruch', 'text': 'Zerstöre eine Kreatur deiner Wahl mit Stärke 4 oder mehr.\\nUmwandlung {2} ({2}, wirf diese Karte ab: Ziehe eine Karte.)', 'type': 'Spontanzauber', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591636&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1aac91f4-132b-49ec-9232-244fc5fabbb2', 'multiverseId': 591636}, 'multiverseid': 591636}, {'name': 'Juicio de Radiant', 'text': 'Destruye la criatura objetivo con fuerza de 4 o más.\\nCiclo {2}. ({2}, descartar esta carta: Roba una carta.)', 'type': 'Instantáneo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591765&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3c9f03e4-1fc9-48aa-a1bb-12acea724283', 'multiverseId': 591765}, 'multiverseid': 591765}, {'name': 'Jugement selon Radieuse', 'text': 'Détruisez une créature ciblée de force supérieure ou égale à 4.\\nRecyclage {2} ({2}, défaussez-vous de cette carte : Piochez une carte.)', 'type': 'Éphémère', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=591894&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '197c4556-eff9-4f0a-9de1-1cecf0f61bbf', 'multiverseId': 591894}, 'multiverseid': 591894}, {'name': 'Giudizio di Radiant', 'text': 'Distruggi una creatura bersaglio con forza pari o superiore a 4.\\nCiclo {2} ({2}, Scarta questa carta: Pesca una carta.)', 'type': 'Istantaneo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592023&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e80173a6-547e-4a37-b43a-87417ec81075', 'multiverseId': 592023}, 'multiverseid': 592023}, {'name': 'レイディアントの審判', 'text': 'パワーが４以上であるクリーチャー１体を対象とする。それを破壊する。\\nサイクリング{2}（{2},このカードを捨てる：カード１枚を引く。）', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592152&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '42359132-198b-4fb5-b155-77173ee5087e', 'multiverseId': 592152}, 'multiverseid': 592152}, {'name': '蕾荻安的判决', 'text': '消灭目标力量等于或大于4的生物。\\n循环{2}（{2}，弃掉此牌：抓一张牌。）', 'type': '瞬间', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=592539&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '736f74a9-6e4c-4412-b275-1ec5267df827', 'multiverseId': 592539}, 'multiverseid': 592539}]", '[{\'name\': \'Speerspucker\', \'text\': \'Verteidiger\\n{T}: Der Speerspucker fügt jedem Spieler 1 Schadenspunkt zu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Goblin, Krieger\', \'flavor\': \'„Okay, vielleicht wird der 962. Speer sie erwischen!"\\n—Kreech, Ballista-Schütze\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597111&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eb00ffcd-88ad-465f-bcf1-646e832a03fe\', \'multiverseId\': 597111}, \'multiverseid\': 597111}, {\'name\': \'Ballestero de arpones\', \'text\': \'Defensor.\\n{T}: El Ballestero de arpones hace 1 punto de daño a cada jugador.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero trasgo\', \'flavor\': \'"¡Tal vez el arpón número 962 sí que acierte!".\\n—Krich, operario de la balista\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597157&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'655f8951-da52-4a6d-a7b8-43a5ece266f0\', \'multiverseId\': 597157}, \'multiverseid\': 597157}, {\'name\': \'Cracheur de lances\', \'text\': \'Défenseur\\n{T} : Le Cracheur de lances inflige 1 blessure à chaque joueur.\', \'type\': \'Créature : gobelin et guerrier\', \'flavor\': \'« Allez, peut-être que la 962e lance sera la bonne ! »\\n—Kreetch, opérateur de baliste\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597203&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'20a4d923-313e-451d-997a-3e6f73d71c0a\', \'multiverseId\': 597203}, \'multiverseid\': 597203}, {\'name\': \'Scaglialance\', \'text\': \'Difensore\\n{T}: Lo Scaglialance infligge 1 danno a ogni giocatore.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Goblin\', \'flavor\': \'"E va bene, forse la novecentosessantaduesima lancia sarà quella che andrà a segno!"\\n—Kreech, manovratore della balista\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597249&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'50cfe15d-a927-4e50-b1ae-8485a7396189\', \'multiverseId\': 597249}, \'multiverseid\': 597249}, {\'name\': \'槍播き\', \'text\': \'防衛\\n{T}：槍播きは各プレイヤーにそれぞれ１点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ゴブリン・戦士\', \'flavor\': \'「よし、この九百六十二本目の槍こそ当たる！」\\n――バリスタの操手、クリーチ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597295&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c9839404-9332-4e61-ba6b-85a2b0c22baf\', \'multiverseId\': 597295}, \'multiverseid\': 597295}, {\'name\': \'击矛手\', \'text\': \'守军\\n{T}：击矛手对每位牌手各造成1点伤害。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～鬼怪／战士\', \'flavor\': \'「行吧，也许第962根矛就能射中了！」\\n～巨弩操作员克力奇\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=597433&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c9d1f278-b6fe-42c8-9291-cc0348ab76e1\', \'multiverseId\': 597433}, \'multiverseid\': 597433}]', '[{\'name\': \'Spektraler Jagdrufer\', \'text\': \'{5}{G}: Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +1/+1 und verursachen Trampelschaden bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Wolf, Geist\', \'flavor\': \'Der Nachtgesang beginnt mit einem einsamen Heulen, schwillt aber bald zu einem ohrenbetäubenden Chor an.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589650&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'96e6cea7-8d6a-406a-99c3-0aa1b2fd245e\', \'multiverseId\': 589650}, \'multiverseid\': 589650}, {\'name\': \'Voz de la caza espectral\', \'text\': \'{5}{G}: Las criaturas que controlas obtienen +1/+1 y ganan la habilidad de arrollar hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Espíritu lobo\', \'flavor\': \'El canto nocturno empieza con un aullido solitario, pero rápidamente se acrecienta para convertirse en un coro ensordecedor.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589701&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1e7a802a-f95e-439d-bd9e-8777f67b6385\', \'multiverseId\': 589701}, \'multiverseid\': 589701}, {\'name\': \'Grand veneur spectral\', \'text\': "{5}{G} : Les créatures que vous contrôlez gagnent +1/+1 et acquièrent le piétinement jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : loup et esprit\', \'flavor\': "Le chant nocturne commence par un hurlement solitaire, mais s\'amplifie bientôt en un chœur assourdissant.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589752&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ada57dc2-b72e-4a7b-8a60-af944d022508\', \'multiverseId\': 589752}, \'multiverseid\': 589752}, {\'name\': \'Convocatore di Caccia Spettrale\', \'text\': \'{5}{G}: Le creature che controlli prendono +1/+1 e hanno travolgere fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Spirito Lupo\', \'flavor\': \'Il canto notturno inizia con un ululato solitario, ma presto cresce fino a diventare un coro assordante.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589803&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'332b5c45-e314-469f-8f70-28ca9b97e0e4\', \'multiverseId\': 589803}, \'multiverseid\': 589803}, {\'name\': \'幽体の狩り喚び\', \'text\': \'{5}{G}：ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールしているすべてのクリーチャーは＋１/＋１の修整を受けトランプルを得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 狼・スピリット\', \'flavor\': \'夜の歌は一匹の遠吠えから始まるが、そのうち耳をつんざくような大合唱へと膨れ上がる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=589854&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7165dd9b-52b4-4f35-9b48-1e76a1086ff6\', \'multiverseId\': 589854}, \'multiverseid\': 589854}, {\'name\': \'魂魅召猎灵\', \'text\': \'{5}{G}：直到回合结束，由你操控的生物得+1/+1且获得践踏异能。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～狼／精怪\', \'flavor\': \'夜曲起初仅是独鸣狼嚎，但很快就变成震耳和声。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=590007&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2528c4e2-08c7-4ae9-8c86-7ef52ccf7c14\', \'multiverseId\': 590007}, \'multiverseid\': 590007}]', '[{\'name\': \'Spektraler Seemann\', \'text\': \'Aufblitzen\\nFliegend\\n{3}{U}: Ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Geist, Pirat\