his creature has base power and toughness X/X."', 'You may have Mirror Image enter the battlefield as a copy of a creature you control.', 'You may have Pirated Copy enter the battlefield as a copy of any creature on the battlefield, except it\'s a Pirate in addition to its other types and it has "Whenever this creature or another creature with the same name deals combat damage to a player, you draw a card."', 'You may look at the top card of your library any time.\\nYou may play snow lands and cast snow spells from the top of your library.\\nWhenever another snow permanent enters the battlefield under your control, you may pay {G}, {W}, or {U}. If you do, put a +1/+1 counter on Isu the Abominable.', "You may pay {1}{W} and exile a creature card from your graveyard rather than pay this spell's mana cost.\\nFlying", "You may play lands and cast Insect spells from your graveyard.\\nWhenever another Insect you control dies, put it on the bottom of its owner's library, then mill two cards. (Put the top two cards of your library into your graveyard.)\\n{1}{BG}: Target Insect gets +1/+0 and gains deathtouch until end of turn. ({BG} can be paid with either {B} or {G}.)", "Zombies you control get +1/+1.\\nWhen Liliana's Mastery enters the battlefield, create two 2/2 black Zombie creature tokens.", "Zombies you control have menace. (They can't be blocked except by two or more creatures.)\\n{3}{B}, Exile a creature card from your graveyard: Create a 2/2 black Zombie creature token.", '{1}, Sacrifice Thrashing Brontodon: Destroy target artifact or enchantment.', '{1}, {T}, Exile a creature card from your graveyard: Create a Treasure token. (It\'s an artifact with "{T}, Sacrifice this artifact: Add one mana of any color.")', '{1}, {T}: Blisterspit Gremlin deals 1 damage to each opponent.\\nWhenever you cast a noncreature spell, untap Blisterspit Gremlin.', "{1}, {T}: Pyre-Sledge Arsonist deals X damage to any target, where X is the number of permanents you've sacrificed this turn.", '{1}, {T}: Tap target creature with mana value 2 or greater.', "{1}, {T}: Target creature can't attack this turn. Put a brick counter on Edifice of Authority.\\n{1}, {T}: Until your next turn, target creature can't attack or block and its activated abilities can't be activated. Activate only if there are three or more brick counters on Edifice of Authority.", '{1}{B}, Discard a creature card: Draw a card. If the discarded card was a Zombie card, create a tapped 2/2 black Zombie creature token.', '{1}{B}, Pay 2 life: Return target creature card from your graveyard to your hand.', '{1}{B}, Sacrifice a creature: Target player loses 1 life and you gain 1 life.', '{1}{B}, Sacrifice a creature: You gain 1 life and draw a card.', '{1}{B}, {T}, Exile a creature card from your graveyard: Target opponent loses 3 life.', '{1}{B}, {T}, Sacrifice a creature: You gain 1 life and draw a card.', '{1}{B}: Return Reassembling Skeleton from your graveyard to the battlefield tapped.', '{1}{G}, Sacrifice Caustic Caterpillar: Destroy target artifact or enchantment.', '{1}{R}, Sacrifice a Goblin: Arms Dealer deals 4 damage to target creature.', '{1}{R}: Weaselback Redcap gets +2/+0 until end of turn.', "{1}{S}: Frostpeak Yeti can't be blocked this turn. ({S} can be paid with one mana from a snow source.)", '{1}{U}, {T}: Draw a card, then discard a card.', '{1}{U}, {T}: You may tap or untap target creature.', '{1}{W}: Another target Vehicle you control becomes an artifact creature until end of turn.\\nCrew 4 (Tap any number of creatures you control with total power 4 or more: This Vehicle becomes an artifact creature until end of turn.)', '{2}, {T}, Sacrifice Expedition Map: Search your library for a land card, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle.', '{2}, {T}, Sacrifice Vial of Dragonfire: It deals 2 damage to target creature.', '{2}: Target artifact creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn.\\n{2}: Target artifact creature gains your choice of flying, trample, or haste until end of turn.', "{2}: Target snow land you control becomes a 4/4 Elemental creature with hexproof and haste until end of turn. It's still a land. (A creature with hexproof can't be the target of spells or abilities your opponents control.)", '{2}{G}, {T}, Sacrifice Oashra Cultivator: Search your library for a basic land card, put it onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.', '{2}{G}: Pestilent Wolf gains deathtouch until end of turn.', "{2}{G}: Target creature you control can't be blocked by creatures with power 2 or less this turn.", '{2}{G}: Wily Bandar gains indestructible until end of turn. (Damage and effects that say "destroy" don\'t destroy it.)', '{2}{R}: Coalborn Entity deals 1 damage to target creature token, player, or planeswalker.', '{2}{R}: Lavastep Raider gets +2/+0 until end of turn.', '{3}, Sacrifice a creature or planeswalker: You gain 1 life and draw a card.', '{3}, {T}: Investigate. (Create a Clue token. It\'s an artifact with "{2}, Sacrifice this artifact: Draw a card.")', '{3}, {T}: Put a +1/+1 counter on target creature.', "{3}, {T}: Target player puts the bottom card of their library into their graveyard. If it's a creature card, you create a 2/2 black Zombie creature token.", "{3}: Exile another target creature you control, then return it to the battlefield under its owner's control.\\nWhenever another creature enters the battlefield under your control, you may pay {RW}. If you do, put a +1/+1 counter on it. If it's a Unicorn, put two +1/+1 counters on it instead. ({RW} can be paid with either {G} or {W}.)", "{3}{B}{B}: Monstrosity 3. (If this creature isn't monstrous, put three +1/+1 counters on it and it becomes monstrous.)\\nAs long as Sinuous Vermin is monstrous, it has menace. (It can't be blocked except by two or more creatures.)", '{3}{G}: Mild-Mannered Librarian becomes a Werewolf. Put two +1/+1 counters on it and you draw a card. Activate only once.', '{3}{W}: Put a +1/+1 counter on another target attacking creature you control. If that creature is a Cat, it gains first strike until end of turn.', '{4}, {T}: Create a 1/1 colorless Thopter artifact creature token with flying.', '{4}: Locthwain Gargoyle gets +2/+0 and gains flying until end of turn.', '{4}{B}: Return Durable Coilbug from your graveyard to your hand.', '{4}{B}{B}, Exile Suspicious Shambler from your graveyard: Create two 2/2 black Zombie creature tokens. Activate only as a sorcery.', "{4}{G}: Double Reckless Amplimancer's power and toughness until end of turn.", "{4}{S}{S}: Monstrosity 2. (If this creature isn't monstrous, put two +1/+1 counters on it and it becomes monstrous. {S} can be paid with one mana from a snow source.)\\nAs long as Chillerpillar is monstrous, it has flying.", '{5}{G}: Creatures you control get +1/+1 and gain trample until end of turn.', '{5}{G}: Kraul Warrior gets +3/+3 until end of turn.', '{7}, {T}, Sacrifice Universal Solvent: Destroy target permanent.', "{7}: Create a token that's a copy of target artifact. That token gains haste. Exile it at the beginning of the next end step.", '{B}, Sacrifice a creature: Target player discards a card. Activate only as a sorcery.', '{B}, {T}, Discard a card: Each player loses 2 life.', '{B}, {T}, Pay 1 life: Put a +1/+1 counter on Cruel Sadist.\\n{2}{B}, {T}, Remove X +1/+1 counters from Cruel Sadist: It deals X damage to target creature.', '{G}, Sacrifice Giant Caterpillar: Create a 1/1 green Insect creature token with flying named Butterfly at the beginning of the next end step.', '{S}, {T}: Tap target artifact or creature. ({S} can be paid with one mana from a snow source.)', '{T}, Discard a card: Draw a card.', '{T}, Sacrifice Evolving Wilds: Search your library for a basic land card, put it onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.', "{T}, Sacrifice Liliana's Steward: Target opponent discards a card. Activate only as a sorcery.", '{T}, Sacrifice Phyrexian Plaguelord: Target creature gets -4/-4 until end of turn.\\nSacrifice a creature: Target creature gets -1/-1 until end of turn.', '{T}, Sacrifice an artifact: Barrage Ogre deals 2 damage to any target.', '{T}, Sacrifice another creature: Each opponent loses 2 life and you gain 2 life.', '{T}: Add one mana of any color. If you control a creature with power 4 or greater, add two mana of any one color instead.', '{T}: Add one mana of any type that a land you control could produce.', '{T}: Add two mana of any one color. Spend this mana only to cast artifact spells or activate abilities of artifacts.', '{T}: Add {B}.\\n{1}{B}{B}, {T}, Sacrifice Infernal Idol: You draw two cards and you lose 2 life.', '{T}: Add {C}.', "{T}: Add {C}. If you control an Urza's Mine and an Urza's Power-Plant, add {C}{C}{C} instead.", "{T}: Add {C}. If you control an Urza's Mine and an Urza's Tower, add {C}{C} instead.", "{T}: Add {C}. If you control an Urza's Power-Plant and an Urza's Tower, add {C}{C} instead.", '{T}: Add {C}.\\nBasic landcycling {1} ({1}, Discard this card: Search your library for a basic land card, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle.)', "{T}: Add {C}.\\n{1}: Mishra's Factory becomes a 2/2 Assembly-Worker artifact creature until end of turn. It's still a land.\\n{T}: Target Assembly-Worker creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn.", '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{2}, {T}, Sacrifice Warped Landscape: Search your library for a basic land card, put it onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{3}, {T}: Draw a card. Activate only if you control a creature with power 4 or greater.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{4}, {T}: Investigate. (Create a Clue token. It\'s an artifact with "{2}, Sacrifice this artifact: Draw a card.")', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{4}{B}, {T}, Sacrifice Blighted Fen: Target opponent sacrifices a creature.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{7}, {T}: Create a 2/2 colorless Assembly-Worker artifact creature token.', '{T}: Add {C}{C}. Spend this mana only to cast artifact spells or activate abilities of artifacts.\\n{U}, {T}: Search your library for a card named Heart-Piercer Bow or Vial of Dragonfire, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle.', '{T}: Add {C}{C}.\\n{2}, {T}, Sacrifice Hedron Archive: Draw two cards.', '{T}: Add {U}.', "{T}: Chandra's Magmutt deals 1 damage to target player or planeswalker.", '{T}: Create X 1/1 red Goblin creature tokens, where X is the number of Goblins you control.', '{T}: Each player creates a colorless artifact token named Banana with "{T}, Sacrifice this artifact: Add {R} or {G}. You gain 2 life."\\nWhenever an artifact an opponent controls is put into a graveyard from the battlefield, put a +1/+1 counter on each creature you control that\'s an Ape or a Monkey.\\nWhenever Kibo attacks, defending player sacrifices an artifact.', '{T}: Fireslinger deals 1 damage to any target and 1 damage to you.', '{T}: Goblin Artillery deals 2 damage to any target and 3 damage to you.', '{T}: Put a +1/+1 counter on each artifact creature you control.', '{T}: Put a bounty counter on target creature or planeswalker. Activate only as a sorcery.\\nWhenever a creature or planeswalker an opponent controls with a bounty counter on it is dealt damage, destroy it.', "{T}: Return Wizard Mentor and target creature you control to their owner's hand.", '{T}: Target Assembly-Worker creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn.', '{T}: Target attacking creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn.', '{T}: Target creature gains haste until end of turn.', "{U}, Sacrifice Aether Spellbomb: Return target creature to its owner's hand.\\n{1}, Sacrifice Aether Spellbomb: Draw a card.", '{W}, {T}: Put a +1/+1 counter on target creature with a +1/+1 counter on it.\\n{4}{W}{W}, {T}: Put a +1/+1 counter on target creature.', '{W}, {T}: Tap target creature.', '{X}: Crypt Rats deals X damage to each creature and each player. Spend only black mana on X.', "{X}{G}{G}{G}: Monstrosity X. (If this creature isn't monstrous, put X +1/+1 counters on it and it becomes monstrous.)\\nAs long as Domesticated Hydra is monstrous, it has trample."]
